INSERT INTO `activities` VALUES (9,1,'Research','Pilot Study: Biomagnetic Pair Therapy and Typhoid Fever','A study examined the laboratory responses of patients with documented typhoid fever and were treated with BPT.  With a Widal test, 13 subjects tested positive to typhoid fever. After 2 days of BPT, results most of the 13 subjects retested as negative. Conclusion shows that BPT, demonstrated a clearing of the typhoid fever after the Biomagnetism therapy treatment.\n\nFurther information can be found at https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5653337/','2019-01-01','2019-01-01 18:02:33','2019-01-01 18:02:33'),(10,1,'Magnets','Magnetic Fields Control Heat and Sound','Today, physicists are treating phonons as quasi- particles, having both sound and heat. In the March 23 issue of Nature Materials an experiment proof that sound waves do interact with external magnetic fields. An effect called \"diamagnetism.\" Stated by: Joseph Heremans Professor of Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering at Ohio State University.','2019-01-03','2019-01-05 05:16:15','2019-01-06 20:54:58'),(11,1,'Aura','Bioplasma Fifth State of Matter','Dr. Victor Inyushin at Kazakh University in Russia since 1950s, has done extensive research in the Human Energy Field. He suggest the existence of a \"bioplasmic field\" composed of ions, free protons and free electrons. A state distinct from the four know states of matter. Inyushin suggests that the bioplasmic energy field is a fifth state of matter. With HSP. we have more senses than the normal five senses. Chakras take in bioplasma for energy to charge our four dimensions from the surrounding natural fields of bioplasma, taking in the information the bioplasma contains. Which bioplasma is full of information.  Most people are unaware of the existence of natural bioplasma fields all around us, yet unconsciously respond and react to them as the bioplasma moves through them. One can refer to the Bioplasma as energy consciousness. Energy composed as a signature of who we are. It is us.  \n\nStated by Barbara Brennan in the books  - Core Light Healing and Hands of Light.  She was a research scientist for NASA. M.S. in Atmosphere Physics from the University of Wisconsin','2019-01-04','2019-01-05 08:15:50','2019-01-06 20:54:15'),(12,1,'Alternatives','Biomagnetic Fields influence with Biofield Tuning','Eileen McKusisk, MA developed Biofield Tuning, based on sound and physics principles. The mapping the Human Biofield, she has found how the magnetic fields influence our physical, mental and emotional well being. By researching academic, scientific and esoteric approaches. Sound through Biofield Tuning uses sound to influence the nervous system through the biomagnetic field. How therapeutic sound resonants and the role of electricity and plasma in the universe and our bodies. \n\nTuning the Human Biofield by Eileen McKusick\nVideo -https://youtu.be/topPjxfby50','2019-01-05','2019-01-06 20:33:21','2019-01-06 20:36:07'),(13,1,'Alternatives','Tapping Away Past and Present Hurts','Tapping Therapy stimulates the body\'s ability to release stored pain. By means of stimulating energy pathways in the body. Discovered by Dr. Roger Callahan called Thought Field Therapy. \nThe protocol  first part is closing your eyes, focus on the fear, phobia, anxiety, emotion, pain, or belief you wish to release. Determine the scale of 1-10 how intense the feeling or belief is. Start be firmly tapping the karate chop on the heel of your hand 10 times, repeating aloud the belief or pain.\nAfter the karate chop, begin the EFT tapping. Tapping on the areas 5-7 times affirming the emotion and pain.\n1. Top of Head\n2. Eyebrow\n3. Outside of Eye\n4. Under Eye\n5. Under Nose\n6. Chin\n7. Collarbone\n8, Underarm\n \nFrom the book: The Success Principles, by Jack Canfield\npage 259 - 262.','2019-01-06','2019-01-06 20:53:16','2019-01-06 20:53:16');
