INSERT INTO `audits` VALUES (3515,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',936,'{\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SPIRITUAL\",\"paths\":\"THE INTERFACE BETWEEN THAT WHICH EXISTS OUTSIDE OF THE BODY AND THE HORMONAL AND ELECTRICAL CASCADES THAT ARE EXPERIENCED AS THOUGHT, EMOTION OR SPIRITUAL IN NATURE.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND. PRODUCTION OF MELATONIN AND SEROTONIN. (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL. PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE MELATONINA Y SEROTONINA.)\",\"symptoms\":\"SPIRITUAL. PSYCHIC CENTER. VESTIBULAR DISORDERS, VERTIGO, TINNITUS, BLOOD PRESSURE FLUCTUATIONS, AND SEASONAL AFFECTIVE DISORDER. (ESPIRITUAL. CENTRO PS\\u00cdQUICO. TRASTORNOS VESTIBULARES, V\\u00c9RTIGO, TINNITUS, FLUCTUACIONES DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL Y TRASTORNO AFECTIVO ESTACIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THE INTERFACE BETWEEN THAT WHICH EXISTS OUTSIDE OF THE BODY AND THE HORMONAL AND ELECTRICAL CASCADES THAT ARE EXPERIENCED AS THOUGHT, EMOTION OR SPIRITUAL IN NATURE. (LA INTERFAZ ENTRE LO QUE EXISTE FUERA DEL CUERPO Y LAS CASCADAS HORMONALES Y EL\\u00c9CTRICAS QUE SE EXPERIMENTAN COMO PENSAMIENTO, EMOCI\\u00d3N O DE NATURALEZA ESPIRITUAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA). THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBRAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT REGULATES THE CIRCADIAN RHYTHM AND SERVES AS THE BIOLOGICAL GATEWAY TO HIGHER CONSCIOUSNESS. (CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBRALES. REGULA EL RITMO CIRCADIANO Y SIRVE COMO PUERTA DE ENTRADA BIOL\\u00d3GICA A LA CONCIENCIA SUPERIOR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/936','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 00:07:39','2026-04-24 00:07:39'),(3516,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Mode