ptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BRINGS IN THE SPIRIT  INTO MATTER.PERFECTIONIST, INABILITY TO GET THINGS DONE.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"RIGHT EYE (OJO DERECHO)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"PITUITARY, THALAMUS AND THE HYPOTHALAMUS. (PITUITARIA, T\\u00c1LAMO E HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO.)\",\"symptoms\":\"PROCRASTINATION, EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGE, VISION BLURRINESS DUE TO STRESS, AND PERFECTIONISM. (PROCRASTINATION, EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGE, VISION BLURRINESS DUE TO STRESS, AND PERFECTIONISM. (PROCRASTINACI\\u00d3N, BLOQUEO EMOCIONAL, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA POR ESTR\\u00c9S Y PERFECCIONISMO.)\",\"paths\":\"BRINGS IN THE SPIRIT INTO MATTER. ADDRESSES THE PERFECTIONIST MINDSET AND THE INABILITY TO GET THINGS DONE BY ALIGNING SPIRITUAL INTENT WITH PHYSICAL ACTION. (TRAE EL ESP\\u00cdRITU A LA MATERIA. ABORDA LA MENTALIDAD PERFECCIONISTA Y LA INCAPACIDAD DE HACER LAS COSAS AL ALINEAR LA INTENCI\\u00d3N ESPIRITUAL CON LA ACCI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE OPTIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE SIGHT MINOR CHAKRAS. IT FACILITATES THE EXTERNAL MANIFESTATION OF INTERNAL VISION, CLEARING THE PATH BETWEEN CONCEPTION AND EXECUTION. (CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA \\u00d3PTICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE LA VISTA. FACILITA LA MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N EXTERNA DE LA VISI\\u00d3N INTERNA, LIMPIANDO EL CAMINO ENTRE LA CONCEPCI\\u00d3N Y LA EJECUCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/938','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 00:38:08','2026-04-24 00:38:08'),(3518,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',954,'{\"name\":\"FOOT ARCH\\/FOOT ARCH\",\"radical\":\"BACTERIA\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, HEADACHE, AND MUSCLE PAIN.\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"FOOT ARCH (ARCO DEL PIE) \\/ FOOT ARCH (ARCO DEL PIE)\",\"radical\":\"BACTERIA \\/ DYSFUNCTION. ((BACTERIA \\/ DISFUNCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, HEADACHE, AND MUSCLE PAIN. ALSO RELATES TO FOOT PAIN, DROPPED ARCHES, AND CALLUS FORMATION. (FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y DOLOR MUSCULAR. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE RELACIONA CON DOLOR DE PIE, ARCOS CA\\u00cdDOS Y FORMACI\\u00d3N DE CALLOS.)\",\"paths\":\"GROUNDING STABILIZER. IT CLEARS INTERNAL HEAT AND CALMS THE MIND. THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR RE-ESTABLISHING THE PHYSICAL CONNECTION TO THE EARTH ELEMENT AND STABILIZING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING ACUTE FEBRILE STATES. (ESTABILIZADOR DE ARRAIGO. ELIMINA EL CALOR INTERNO Y CALMA LA MENTE. ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA REESTABLECER LA CONEXI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA CON EL ELEMENTO TIERRA Y ESTABILIZAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE ESTADOS FEBRILES AGUDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA). THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PLANTAR MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE FOOT MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE LOWER VORTICES WITH THE CROWN TO ENSURE ENERGY FLOWS FREELY FROM TOP TO BOTTOM, FLUSHING OUT TOXINS. (CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS PLANTARES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE LOS PIES. ALINEA LOS V\\u00d3RTICES INFERIORES CON LA CORONILLA PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA ENERG\\u00cdA FLUYA LIBREMENTE DE ARRIBA HACIA ABAJO, ELIMINANDO TOXINAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/954','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 00:42:31','2026-04-24 00:42:31'),(3519,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',955,'{\"name\":\"PALM\\/PALM\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BALANCER\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PALM (PALMA) \\/ PALM (PALMA)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"RIGHT HANDED PERSON - POSITIVE. LEFT HANDED PERSON - POSITIVE. (PERSONA DIESTRA - POSITIVO. PERSONA ZURDA - POSITIVO.)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERTENSION, INFANT CONVULSIONS, EPILEPSY, COMA, SHOCK, TIREDNESS, DIZZINESS, HEADACHES, MIGRAINES, AND INSOMNIA. ALSO RELATES TO PLANTAR FASCIITIS AND HAND INFECTIONS. (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, CONVULSIONES INFANTILES, EPILEPSIA, COMA, CHOQUE, CANSANCIO, MAREOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA, MIGRRA\\u00d1AS E INSOMNIO. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE RELACIONA CON FASCITIS PLANTAR E INFECCIONES EN LAS MANOS.)\",\"paths\":\"BALANCER. USED FOR RECOVERY FROM UNCONSCIOUSNESS OR SHOCK. IT CLEARS HEAT FROM THE HEART AND CALMS THE SPIRIT, ACTING AS A STABILIZER FOR THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. (EQUILIBRADOR. UTILIZADO PARA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA INCONSCIENCIA O EL CHOQUE. ELIMINA EL CALOR DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y CALMA EL ESP\\u00cdRITU, ACTUANDO COMO ESTABILIZADOR DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA). THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PALM MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HAND MINOR CHAKRAS. COLOR: VIOLET. VIBRATIONAL RATE: 996,835. IT FACILITATES THE FLOW OF HEALING ENERGY THROUGH THE SECONDARY VORTICES OF THE HANDS. ( CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS DE LAS PALMAS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE LAS MANOS. COLOR: VIOLETA. TASA VIBRATORIA: 996,835. FACILITA EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA CURATIVA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS V\\u00d3RTICES SECUNDARIOS DE LAS MANOS.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/955','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 00:45:24','2026-04-24 00:45:24'),(3520,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',956,'{\"name\":\"PALM\\/PALM\",\"radical\":\"PARASITE\",\"symptoms\":\"MALAISE, FATIGUE, GENERALIZED MUSCLE PAIN, HEADACHE, REOCCURRING FEVERS, CHILLS, COLD FEET, VOMITING, SHOCK, ANEMIA, HYPOGLYCEMIA, JOINT PAIN.\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY A FEMALE ANOPHELES MOSQUITO. MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, ACUTE DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, PULMONARY EDEMA AND ACIDITY. OSTEOARTHRITIS AND ARTHRITIS. FACE PARALYSIS.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CHEEKBONE\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE)\"}','{\"name\":\"PALM (PALMA) \\/ PALM (PALMA)\",\"radical\":\"PARASITE (PAR\\u00c1SITO)\",\"symptoms\":\"MALAISE, FATIGUE, GENERALIZED MUSCLE PAIN, HEADACHE, REOCCURRING FEVERS, CHILLS, COLD FEET, VOMITING, SHOCK, ANEMIA, HYPOGLYCEMIA, JOINT PAIN. (MALESTAR GENERAL, FATIGA, DOLOR MUSCULAR GENERALIZADO, DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRES RECURRENTES, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, PIES FR\\u00cdOS, V\\u00d3MITOS, CHOQUE, ANEMIA, HIPOGLUCEMIA, DOLOR ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY A FEMALE ANOPHELES MOSQUITO. MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, ACUTE DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, PULMONARY EDEMA AND ACIDITY. OSTEOARTHRITIS AND ARTHRITIS. FACE PARALYSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR UN MOSQUITO ANOPHELES HEMBRA. MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS AGUDOS, EDEMA PULMONAR Y ACIDEZ. OSTEOARTRITIS Y ARTRITIS. PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA). THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PALM MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HAND MINOR CHAKRAS. CHECK: CHEEKBONE\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE). IT FACILITATES THE CLEARING OF SYSTEMIC PARASITIC TOXICITY BY STABILIZING THE ENERGETIC FLOW THROUGH THE SECONDARY VORTICES OF THE HANDS. (CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS DE LAS PALMAS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE LAS MANOS. REVISAR: P\\u00d3MULO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (CONTRALATERAL). FACILITA LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA TOXICIDAD PARASITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA AL ESTABILIZAR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS V\\u00d3RTICES SECUNDARIOS DE LAS MANOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/956','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 00:48:15','2026-04-24 00:48:15'),(3521,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',957,'{\"name\":\"PALM\\/FOOT SOLE\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WITCHCRAFT\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PALM (PALMA) \\/ FOOT SOLE (\\/PLANTA DEL PIE)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"ADRENAL MEDULLA AND PINEAL. (M\\u00c9DULA ADRENAL Y PINEAL.)\",\"symptoms\":\"NEGATIVE ENERGY ATTACHMENT, FEELING \\\"DRAINED\\\" OR \\\"WATCHED,\\\" SUDDEN COLDNESS IN EXTREMITIES, AND UNEXPLAINED ANXIETY. (APEGO DE ENERG\\u00cdA NEGATIVA, SENTIMIENTO DE ESTAR \\\"DRENADO\\\" O \\\"VIGILADO\\\", FRIALDAD REPENTINA EN LAS EXTREMIDADES Y ANSIEDAD INEXPLICABLE.)\",\"paths\":\"WITCHCRAFT. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES ENERGETIC INTERFERENCE OR \\\"MAL DE OJO\\\" (EVIL EYE). IT ACTS AS A DISCHARGE CIRCUIT TO PURGE EXTERNAL NEGATIVE INFLUENCES FROM THE BODY\\u2019S BIOMAGNETIC FIELD. (BRUJER\\u00cdA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INTERFERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA O \\\"MAL DE OJO\\\". ACT\\u00daA COMO UN CIRCUITO DE DESCARGA PARA PURGAR LAS INFLUENCIAS NEGATIVAS EXTERNAS DEL CAMPO BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICO DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PALM MICRO CHAKRAS AND PLANTAR MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HAND AND FOOT MINOR CHAKRAS. IT CREATES A POLARITY BRIDGE TO FLUSH OUT LOW-VIBRATIONAL FREQUENCIES THROUGH THE FOUR EXTREMITIES. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS DE LAS PALMAS Y LOS MICRO CHAKRAS PLANTARES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE MANOS Y PIES. CREA UN PUENTE DE POLARIDAD PARA ELIMINAR LAS FRECUENCIAS DE BAJA VIBRACI\\u00d3N A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS CUATRO EXTREMIDADES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/957','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 00:51:38','2026-04-24 00:51:38'),(3522,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',958,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL BRAIN STEM\\/PARIETAL BRAIN STEM\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL BRAIN STEM (TALLO CEREBRAL PARIETAL) \\/ PARIETAL BRAIN STEM (TALLO CEREBRAL PARIETAL)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"BRAINSTEM AND PARIETAL LOBE. (TALLO CEREBRAL Y L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL.)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP-SEATED TRAUMA, REPRESSED EMOTIONS, SENSORY PROCESSING DISORDERS, AND CHRONIC MENTAL FATIGUE. (TRAUMA PROFUNDAMENTE ARRAIGADO, EMOCIONES REPRIMIDAS, TRASTORNOS DEL PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL Y FATIGA MENTAL CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"paths\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE. THIS PAIR FACILITATES THE DISCHARGE OF STORED EMOTIONAL DATA FROM THE SUBCONSCIOUS CENTERS, ALIGNING THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM WITH HIGHER COGNITIVE CENTERS TO RESOLVE REPRESSED PSYCHOLOGICAL STRESS. (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL. ESTE PAR FACILITA LA DESCARGA DE DATOS EMOCIONALES ALMACENADOS DESDE LOS CENTROS SUBCONSCIENTES, ALINEANDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO CON LOS CENTROS COGNITIVOS SUPERIORES PARA RESOLVER EL ESTR\\u00c9S PSICOL\\u00d3GICO REPRIMIDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND AJNA CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BRAINSTEM MICRO CHAKRA AND PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBELLAR MINOR CHAKRAS. IT CLEARS THE ENERGETIC BRIDGE BETWEEN SURVIVAL INSTINCTS AND CONSCIOUS AWARENESS. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y AJNA. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DEL TALLO CEREBRAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PARIETAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBELOSOS. LIMPIA EL PUENTE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LOS INSTINTOS DE SUPERVIVENCIA Y LA CONCIENCIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/958','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 00:54:36','2026-04-24 00:54:36'),(3523,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',959,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL (L) INFERIOR\\/PARIETAL (R) INFERIOR\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"APATHY\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL (L) INFERIOR (PARIETAL INFERIOR IZQUIERDO) \\/ \\/PARIETAL (R) INFERIOR (PARIETAL INFERIOR DERECHO)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"INFERIOR PARIETAL LOBE AND SENSORY CORTEX. (L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL INFERIOR Y CORTEZA SENSORIAL.)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL NUMBNESS, LACK OF MOTIVATION, DISCONNECTION FROM SURROUNDINGS, AND COGNITIVE SLUGGISHNESS. (ADORMECIMIENTO EMOCIONAL, FALTA DE MOTIVACI\\u00d3N, DESCONEXI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO Y LENTITUD COGNITIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"APATHY. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE LOSS OF INTEREST IN DAILY ACTIVITIES AND EMOTIONAL FLATNESS. IT WORKS BY BALANCING THE PARIETAL REGIONS RESPONSIBLE FOR SPATIAL AWARENESS AND SENSORY INTEGRATION TO RESTORE A SENSE OF PURPOSE AND ENGAGEMENT. (APAT\\u00cdA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE INTER\\u00c9S EN LAS ACTIVIDADES DIARIAS Y EL DESAPEG\\u00d3 EMOCIONAL. FUNCIONA EQUILIBRANDO LAS REGIONES PARIETALES RESPONSABLES DE LA CONCIENCIA ESPACIAL Y LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL PARA RESTAURAR EL SENTIDO DE PROP\\u00d3SITO Y COMPROMISO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA AND CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE INFERIOR PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBRAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT CLEARS THE ENERGETIC STAGNATION THAT MANIFESTS AS NEUROLOGICAL INDIFFERENCE. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA Y CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS PARIETALES INFERIORES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBRALES. ELIMINA EL ESTANCAMIENTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO INDIFERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/959','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 00:58:08','2026-04-24 00:58:08'),(3524,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',960,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL (L)\\/DIAPHRAGM\",\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBSTRUCTIVE BRONCHIAL PULMONARY DISEASE.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL - L (PARIETAL IZQUIERDO) \\/ DIAPHRAGM (DIAFRAGMA)\",\"radical\":\"BACTERIA \\/ EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"PARIETAL LOBE AND DIAPHRAGM MUSCLE. (L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y M\\u00daSCULO DIAFRAGMA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SHORTNESS OF BREATH, CHEST TIGHTNESS, CHRONIC COUGH, AND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS. MAY ALSO INVOLVE EMOTIONAL \\\"SUFFOCATION\\\" OR FEELING OVERWHELMED BY EXTERNAL PRESSURES. (DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA Y DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE IMPLICAR \\\"SOFOCACI\\u00d3N\\\" EMOCIONAL O SENTIRSE ABRUMADO POR PRESIONES EXTERNAS.)\",\"paths\":\"OBSTRUCTIVE BRONCHIAL PULMONARY DISEASE. IT RELATES TO THE PHYSIOLOGICAL AND ENERGETIC BLOCKAGE OF THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, LINKING SENSORY PERCEPTION IN THE BRAIN TO THE MECHANICAL ACTION OF BREATHING. (ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR BRONQUIAL OBSTRUCTIVA. SE RELACIONA CON EL BLOQUEO FISIOL\\u00d3GICO Y ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO, VINCULANDO LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL EN EL CEREBRO CON LA ACCI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA DE LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRA AND DIAPHRAGMATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE RESPIRATORY MINOR CHAKRAS. IT CLEARS THE PATHWAY BETWEEN MENTAL CONTROL AND THE RHYTHM OF LIFE (BREATH). (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PARIETAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES RESPIRATORIOS. LIMPIA LA V\\u00cdA ENTRE EL CONTROL MENTAL Y EL RITMO DE LA VIDA (RESPIRACI\\u00d3N).\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/960','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 01:02:04','2026-04-24 01:02:04'),(3525,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',961,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL (R) POSTERIOR\\/PARIETAL (L) POSTERIOR\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TELEPATHY\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL - R  POSTERIOR (PARIETAL POSTERIOR DERECHO) \\/ PARIETAL - L POSTERIOR (PARIETAL POSTERIOR IZQUIERDO)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"POSTERIOR PARIETAL LOBE. (L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL POSTERIOR).\",\"symptoms\":\"SENSORY DISORIENTATION, DIFFICULTY WITH SPATIAL REASONING, MENTAL FATIGUE, AND LACK OF NON-VERBAL UNDERSTANDING. (DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL, DIFICULTAD CON EL RAZONAMIENTO ESPACIAL, FATIGA MENTAL Y FALTA DE COMPRENSI\\u00d3N NO VERBAL).\",\"paths\":\"TELEPATHY. THIS PAIR ENHANCES THE BRAIN\'S ABILITY TO PROCESS SUBTLE ENERGETIC INFORMATION AND NON-VERBAL COMMUNICATION. IT BALANCES THE AREAS RESPONSIBLE FOR INTEGRATING MULTISENSORY INPUT TO FACILITATE DEEPER INTUITION. (TELEPAT\\u00cdA. ESTE PAR MEJORA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CEREBRO PARA PROCESAR INFORMACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA SUTIL Y COMUNICACI\\u00d3N NO VERBAL. EQUILIBRA LAS \\u00c1REAS RESPONSABLES DE INTEGRAR LA ENTRADA MULTISENSORIAL PARA FACILITAR UNA INTUICI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA AND CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE POSTERIOR PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBRAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT OPENS THE \\\"SIGHT BEYOND SIGHT,\\\" BRIDGING PHYSICAL PERCEPTION WITH EXTRA-SENSORY AWARENESS. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA Y CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS PARIETALES POSTERIORES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBRALES. ABRE LA \\\"VISTA M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA VISTA\\\", UNIENDO LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA CON LA CONCIENCIA EXTRASENSORIAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/961','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 01:06:10','2026-04-24 01:06:10'),(3526,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',962,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE)\",\"origins\":\"GOIZ\",\"symptoms\":\"INITIAL SHORTENING OF THE LEG, DUE TO TRAUMA, PHYSICAL OR EMOTIONAL CONFLICT. RENAL CONGESTION, PULMONARY CONGESTION, CHRONIC COUGH, HEADACHE, MIGRAINE, TIREDNESS, DEAFNESS, BALANCE PROBLEMS, IMPAIRED MOBILITY.\",\"paths\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT. Urinary track infection, bronchitis, Asthma, bronchial spasm, psycho emotional problems, insomnia, muscular skeletal problems, behavior disorders.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"- ASSOCIATED WITH -DUODENUM\\/KIDNEY (L); KIDNEY FAILURE                 - BALANCING 1ST ROUTE ; KIDNEY (POSITIVE)\\/PARIETAL (NEGATIVE). OR SWITCHING THE POLARITY IF THIS 1ST PAIR DOES NOT WORK.     - BALANCING 2ND ROUTE; SCIATIC (POSITIVE)   SHORT LEG AND ADDUCTOR (NEGATIVE) SHORT LEG.                         - BALANCING 3RD ROUTE; PARIETAL\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE) - EAR\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE) - PAROTID\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE) - PARATHYROID\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE) PARATHYROID\\/KIDNEY; HYPOCALCEMIA AND MUSCLE WEAKNESS.\"}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL (PARIETAL\\/) \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE. (RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N CONTRALATERAL)\",\"origins\":\"GOIZ. PARIETAL LOBE AND CORRESPONDING KIDNEY. (GOIZ. L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N CORRESPONDIENTE.)\",\"symptoms\":\"INITIAL SHORTENING OF THE LEG, DUE TO TRAUMA, PHYSICAL OR EMOTIONAL CONFLICT. RENAL CONGESTION, PULMONARY CONGESTION, CHRONIC COUGH, HEADACHE, MIGRAINE, TIREDNESS, DEAFNESS, BALANCE PROBLEMS, IMPAIRED MOBILITY. (ACORTAMIENTO INICIAL DE LA PIERNA DEBIDO A TRAUMA, CONFLICTO F\\u00cdSICO O EMOCIONAL. CONGESTI\\u00d3N RENAL, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MIGRRA\\u00d1A, CANSANCIO, SORDERA, PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO Y MOVILIDAD REDUCIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT. URINARY TRACT INFECTION, BRONCHITIS, ASTHMA, BRONCHIAL SPASM, PSYCHO-EMOTIONAL PROBLEMS, INSOMNIA, MUSCULOSKELETAL PROBLEMS, AND BEHAVIOR DISORDERS. (D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N. INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, BRONQUITIS, ASMA, ESPASMO BRONQUIAL, PROBLEMAS PSICOEMOCIONALES, INSOMNIO, PROBLEMAS MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICOS Y TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE KIDNEY MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: DUODENUM\\/KIDNEY (L) FOR KIDNEY FAILURE. POLARITY: IF 1ST ROUTE FAILS, SWITCH TO KIDNEY (+)\\/PARIETAL (-). (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PARIETAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES RENALES. ASOCIACIONES: DUODENO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQ) PARA INSUFICIENCIA RENAL. POLARIDAD: SI LA 1RA RUTA FALLA, CAMBIAR A RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (+)\\/PARIETAL (-).)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/962','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 01:11:35','2026-04-24 01:11:35'),(3527,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',963,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL\\/KIDNEY\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CORRECTS LOWER LIMBS\",\"paths\":\"CONDUCT\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY (RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"PARIETAL LOBE AND IPSILATERAL KIDNEY. (L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IPSILATERAL(\",\"symptoms\":\"CORRECTS LOWER LIMBS. ADDRESSES SHORTENING OF THE LEG, GAIT IMBALANCE, AND PHYSICAL DISORIENTATION. (CORRIGE MIEMBROS INFERIORES. ABORDA EL ACORTAMIENTO DE LA PIERNA, EL DESEQUILIBRIO EN LA MARCHA Y LA DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"paths\":\"CONDUCT. REGULATES NEUROMUSCULAR BEHAVIOR AND THE PHYSICAL MANIFESTATION OF EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY. IT BALANCES THE MOTOR SIGNALS FROM THE BRAIN TO THE LOWER EXTREMITIES. (CONDUCTA. REGULA EL COMPORTAMIENTO NEUROMUSCULAR Y LA MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA DE LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL. EQUILIBRA LAS SE\\u00d1ALES MOTORAS DEL CEREBRO HACIA LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE KIDNEY AND KNEE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ANCHORS MENTAL INTENT INTO THE PHYSICAL PATHWAY OF THE LOWER BODY. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PARIETAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y RODILLA. ANCLA LA INTENCI\\u00d3N MENTAL EN LA V\\u00cdA F\\u00cdSICA DE LA PARTE INFERIOR DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/963','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 09:44:42','2026-04-24 09:44:42'),(3528,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',964,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL\\/MEDULLA OBLONGATA\",\"radical\":\"DYSFUNCTION\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, SPASMS, ANXIETY, VERTIGO, SPEECH PROBLEMS.\",\"paths\":\"EFFECTS ONES SENSE OF BALANCE, ATTENTION SPAN AND MEMORY.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL\\/MEDULLA OBLONGATA (BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO)\",\"radical\":\"DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N)\",\"origins\":\"PARIETAL LOBE AND MEDULLA OBLONGATA. (L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, SPASMS, ANXIETY, VERTIGO, SPEECH PROBLEMS. MAY ALSO INCLUDE DISRUPTION OF SLEEP PATTERNS AND AUTONOMIC IMBALANCE. (DOLORES DE CABEZA, ESPASMOS, ANSIEDAD, V\\u00c9RTIGO, PROBLEMAS DEL HABLA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INCLUIR ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS PATRONES DE SUE\\u00d1O Y DESEQUILIBRIO AUT\\u00d3NOMO.)\",\"paths\":\"EFFECTS ONES SENSE OF BALANCE, ATTENTION SPAN AND MEMORY. IT REGULATES THE VITAL CENTERS FOR CARDIAC AND RESPIRATORY FUNCTION, LINKING SENSORY INTEGRATION TO SURVIVAL MECHANISMS. (AFECTA EL SENTIDO DEL EQUILIBRIO, EL TIEMPO DE ATENCI\\u00d3N Y LA MEMORIA. REGULA LOS CENTROS VITALES PARA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CARDIACA Y RESPIRATORIA, VINCULANDO LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL CON LOS MECANISMOS DE SUPERVIVENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA AND CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRA AND MEDULLARY MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBELLAR MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ASCENDING RETICULAR ACTIVATING SYSTEM (ARAS) TO IMPROVE CONSCIOUSNESS AND FOCUS. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA Y CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PARIETAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA MEDULAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBELOSOS. ESTABILIZA EL SISTEMA ACTIVADOR RETICULAR ASCENDENTE (SARA) PARA MEJORAR LA CONCIENCIA Y EL ENFOQUE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/964','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 09:50:27','2026-04-24 09:50:27'),(3529,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',965,'{\"radical\":\"DYSFUNCTION\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEADACHES\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N)\",\"origins\":\"PARIETAL LOBE AND OCCIPITAL LOBE. (L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"VISUAL DISTURBANCES, PHOTOPHOBIA, DIZZINESS, MENTAL FATIGUE, AND LACK OF FOCUS. MAY ALSO CAUSE SENSORY OVERLOAD AND DIFFICULTY PROCESSING SPATIAL INFORMATION. (DISTURBIOS VISUALES, FOTOFOBIA, MAREOS, FATIGA MENTAL Y FALTA DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CAUSAR SOBRECARGA SENSORIAL Y DIFICULTAD PARA PROCESAR INFORMACI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"HEADACHES. THIS PAIR REGULATES THE INTEGRATION BETWEEN SENSORY PERCEPTION AND VISUAL INTERPRETATION, ADDRESSING CHRONIC TENSION HEADACHES AND MIGRAINES ORIGINATING FROM NEUROLOGICAL OVERSTIMULATION. (DOLORES DE CABEZA. ESTE PAR REGULA LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL Y LA INTERPRETACI\\u00d3N VISUAL, ABORDANDO DOLORES DE CABEZA POR TENSI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA Y MIGRRA\\u00d1AS ORIGINADAS POR SOBREESTIMULACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA AND CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRA AND OCCIPITAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBRAL AND SIGHT MINOR CHAKRAS. IT CLEARS THE ENERGETIC PATHWAY BETWEEN THE CORTICAL SENSORY CENTERS AND THE VISUAL PROCESSING CENTERS. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA Y CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PARIETAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA OCCIPITAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBRALES Y DE LA VISTA. LIMPIA LA V\\u00cdA ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LOS CENTROS SENSORIALES CORTICALES Y LOS CENTROS DE PROCESAMIENTO VISUAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/965','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 09:54:24','2026-04-24 09:54:24'),(3530,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',966,'{\"origins\":\"ENCEPHALITIS\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE BRAIN. MENTAL CONFUSION, STRANGE BEHAVIOR, SEVERE DEPRESSION, PANIC ATTACKS, IRRITABILITY, SPEECH PROBLEMS, SLEEPING SICKNESS, BRAIN FOG, HEADACHES, MIGRAINES, DIZZINESS, FACIAL PAIN, STIFF NECK, ANEURYSM, IMPAIRED VISION, NASAL CONGESTION, WATERY EYES.\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM PERSON-TO-PERSON, BY DOGS OR CATS. CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, PSYCHOLOGICAL AND PS