s\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',968,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL\\/TRANSVERSE COLON\",\"radical\":\"PARASITE\",\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES, EPILEPSY, HEADACHE, LOSS OF BALANCE, BRAIN SWELLING, INTRACRANIAL ABSCESS, BRAIN TUMOR. PSYCHOLOGICAL PROBLEMS AND BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS. VOMITING, NAUSEA, DIARRHEA, WEIGHT LOSS, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, BLOATING, FEVER, CONSTIPATION.\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM PERSON TO PERSON THROUGH FOOD AND WATER CONTAMINATED WITH FECES. MAIN CAUSES OF BRAIN TUMOR PATHOLOGY. INVADES THE LIVER AND LUNG, PRODUCING AMEBIASIS, AMEBIC CYST, AMEBIC DYSENTERY, IN TROPICAL COUNTRIES. HYPERTENSION AND HYPERGLYCEMIA.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CRANIAL, SUBCLAVIAN, SUPRASPINOUS, PYLORUS\\/KIDNEY (L), GLUTEUS, INTRA-ILIAC\\/SACRUM\"}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL\\/TRANSVERSE COLON (COLON TRANSVERSO)\",\"radical\":\"PARASITE (PAR\\u00c1SITO)\",\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES, EPILEPSY, HEADACHE, LOSS OF BALANCE, BRAIN SWELLING, INTRACRANIAL ABSCESS, BRAIN TUMOR. PSYCHOLOGICAL PROBLEMS AND BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS. VOMITING, NAUSEA, DIARRHEA, WEIGHT LOSS, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, BLOATING, FEVER, CONSTIPATION. (CONVULSIONES, EPILEPSIA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL EQUILIBRIO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL, ABSCESO INTRACRANEAL, TUMOR CEREBRAL. PROBLEMAS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS Y TRASTORNOS DEL COMPORTAMIENTO. V\\u00d3MITOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, DIARREA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, FIEBRE, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM PERSON TO PERSON THROUGH FOOD AND WATER CONTAMINATED WITH FECES. MAIN CAUSES OF BRAIN TUMOR PATHOLOGY. INVADES THE LIVER AND LUNG, PRODUCING AMEBIASIS, AMEBIC CYST, AMEBIC DYSENTERY, IN TROPICAL COUNTRIES. HYPERTENSION AND HYPERGLYCEMIA. (TRANSMITIDO DE PERSONA A PERSONA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS Y AGUA CONTAMINADOS CON HECES. CAUSAS PRINCIPALES DE LA PATOLOG\\u00cdA DE TUMOR CEREBRAL. INVADE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL PULM\\u00d3N, PRODUCIENDO AMIBIASIS, QUISTE AMIBIANO, DISENTER\\u00cdA AMIBIANA, EN PA\\u00cdSES TROPICALES. HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N E HIPERGLUCEMIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CRANIAL, SUBCLAVIAN, SUPRASPINOUS, PYLORUS\\/KIDNEY (L), GLUTEUS, INTRA-ILIAC\\/SACRUM MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRA AND TRANSVERSE COLON MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE DIGESTIVE MINOR CHAKRAS. (REVISAR: CRANEAL, SUBCLAVIA, SUPRAESPINOSO, P\\u00cdLORO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQ), GL\\u00daTEO, INTRA-IL\\u00cdACO\\/SACRO. CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PARIETAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA DEL COLON TRANSVERSO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DIGESTIVOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/968','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:04:23','2026-04-24 10:04:23'),(3532,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',969,'{\"name\":\"PARIETAL\\/VAGUS NERVE\",\"radical\":\"PARASITE\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL PROBLEMS\",\"paths\":\"EPILEPSY\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PARIETAL \\/ VAGUS NERVE (NERVIO VAGO)\",\"radical\":\"PARASITE (PAR\\u00c1SITO)\",\"origins\":\"PARIETAL LOBE AND VAGUS NERVE. (L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y NERVIO VAGO)\",\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL PROBLEMS, SEIZURES, DIZZINESS, DIGESTIVE DISRUPTIONS, AND HEART RATE VARIABILITY. MAY ALSO INVOLVE EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY AND VAGAL TONE DYSFUNCTION. (PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, CONVULSIONES, MAREOS, ALTERACIONES DIGESTIVAS Y VARIABILIDAD DE LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE IMPLICAR INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL TONO VAGAL.)\",\"paths\":\"EPILEPSY. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES PARASITIC INTERFERENCE IN THE NEUROLOGICAL PATHWAY, REGULATING THE VAGUS NERVE TO CALM OVERACTIVE ELECTRICAL SIGNALS IN THE BRAIN AND RESTORE AUTONOMIC BALANCE. (EPILEPSIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA EN LA V\\u00cdA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, REGULANDO EL NERVIO VAGO PARA CALMAR LAS SE\\u00d1ALES EL\\u00c9CTRICAS HIPERACTIVAS EN EL CEREBRO Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO AUT\\u00d3NOMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: AJNA AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PARIETAL MICRO CHAKRA AND VAGAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBRAL AND DIGESTIVE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT CLEARS THE ENERGETIC BRIDGE BETWEEN BRAIN PERCEPTION AND THE BODY\'S MAIN PARASYMPATHETIC HIGHWAY. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: AJNA Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PARIETAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA VAGAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBRALES Y DIGESTIVOS. LIMPIA EL PUENTE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL Y LA V\\u00cdA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICA PRINCIPAL DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/969','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:07:48','2026-04-24 10:07:48'),(3533,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',970,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CATALYTIC RNA\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"VIRUS \\/ DYSFUNCTION. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND ADRENAL GLANDS. (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y GL\\u00c1NDULAS ADRENALES)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE, SLEEP DISORDERS (INSOMNIA), SEVERE ANXIETY, STRESS OVERLOAD, AND ADRENAL BURNOUT. MAY ALSO INVOLVE HORMONAL IMBALANCES AND VITALITY LOSS. (FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, TRASTORNOS DEL SUE\\u00d1O (INSOMNIO), ANSIEDAD SEVERA, SOBRECARGA DE ESTR\\u00c9S Y AGOTAMIENTO ADRENAL. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE VITALIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"CATALYTIC RNA. THIS PAIR ACTS AS A REGULATOR FOR THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM, STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN CIRCADIAN RHYTHMS (MELATONIN) AND THE FIGHT-OR-FLIGHT RESPONSE (ADRENALINE\\/CORTISOL). (ARN CATAL\\u00cdTICO. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO REGULADOR DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO, ESTABILIZANDO EL EJE ENTRE LOS RITMOS CIRCADIANOS (MELATONINA) Y LA RESPUESTA DE LUCHA O HUIDA (ADRENALINA\\/CORTISOL).\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND ADRENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ENDOCRINE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT BRIDGES HIGHER CONSCIOUSNESS WITH PHYSICAL VITALITY. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA ADRENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ENDOCRINOS. UNE LA CONCIENCIA SUPERIOR CON LA VITALIDAD F\\u00cdSICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/970','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:12:17','2026-04-24 10:12:17'),(3534,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',971,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/CEREBELLUM\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HAIRLOSS\",\"paths\":\"ALOPECIA\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - TONGUE\"}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ CEREBELLUM (CEREBELO)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND CEREBELLUM. (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y CEREBELO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HAIRLOSS, DIZZINESS, LOSS OF BALANCE, COORDINATION ISSUES, AND MENTAL FATIGUE. (CA\\u00cdDA DEL CABELLO, MAREOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL EQUILIBRIO, PROBLEMAS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N Y FATIGA MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"ALOPECIA. THIS PAIR REGULATES THE ENERGETIC FLOW BETWEEN THE CENTRAL COMMAND OF THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM (PINEAL) AND THE MOTOR CONTROL CENTER (CEREBELLUM). IT ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC IMBALANCES THAT MANIFEST AS SUDDEN HAIR LOSS OR SCALP DYSFUNCTION. (ALOPECIA. ESTE PAR REGULA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL MANDO CENTRAL DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO (PINEAL) Y EL CENTRO DE CONTROL MOTOR (CEREBELO). ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO P\\u00c9RDIDA REPENTINA DEL CABELLO O DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL CUERO CABELLUDO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK: TONGUE. IT STABILIZES THE CRANIAL ENERGETIC VORTICES TO PREVENT TISSUE DEGENERATION. MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND CEREBELLAR MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBELLAR MINOR CHAKRAS. (REVISAR: LENGUA. ESTABILIZA LOS V\\u00d3RTICES ENERG\\u00c9TICOS CRANEALES PARA PREVENIR LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS. CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA CEREBELOSO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBELOSOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/971','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:16:23','2026-04-24 10:16:23'),(3535,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',972,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/DUODENUM\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VITILIGO, SKIN DISCOLORATION.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ DUODENUM (\\/DUODENO)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND DUODENUM. (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y DUODENO)\",\"symptoms\":\"VITILIGO, SKIN DISCOLORATION, DEPIGMENTATION, AND DERMATOLOGICAL DYSFUNCTION. MAY ALSO INVOLVE DIGESTIVE SENSITIVITY AND PIGMENTATION DISORDERS LINKED TO ENDOCRINE IMBALANCE. (VIT\\u00cdLIGO, DECOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL, DESPIGMENTACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR SENSIBILIDAD DIGESTIVA Y TRASTORNOS DE PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N VINCULADOS AL DESEQUILIBRIO ENDOCRINO.)\",\"paths\":\"VITILIGO, SKIN DISCOLORATION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL INTERFERENCE AFFECTING MELANOCYTE PRODUCTION BY STABILIZING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND (WHICH REGULATES PIGMENTATION HORMONES) AND THE DUODENUM. (VIT\\u00cdLIGO, DECOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL QUE AFECTA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE MELANOCITOS AL ESTABILIZAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL (QUE REGULA LAS HORMONAS DE PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N) Y EL DUODENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE DIGESTIVE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT HARMONIZES THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM WITH THE ENTERIC NERVOUS SYSTEM TO RESTORE SKIN INTEGRITY. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DIGESTIVOS. ARMONIZA EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO CON EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO ENT\\u00c9RICO PARA RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA PIEL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/972','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:20:33','2026-04-24 10:20:33'),(3536,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',973,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/HYPOPHYSIS\",\"radical\":\"DYSFUNCTION\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DEPREESION\",\"paths\":\"BIPOLAR, AND HORMONAL DYSFUNCTION.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (HIP\\u00d3FISIS)\",\"radical\":\"DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL E HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA).\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, INSOMNIA, ANXIETY, MOOD SWINGS, AND HORMONAL IMBALANCES. MAY ALSO CAUSE DISRUPTION IN CIRCADIAN RHYTHMS AND ADRENAL STRESS. (DEPRESI\\u00d3N, INSOMNIO, ANSIEDAD, CAMBIOS DE HUMOR Y DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CAUSAR ALTERACIONES EN LOS RITMOS CIRCADIANOS Y ESTR\\u00c9S ADRENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"BIPOLAR, AND HORMONAL DYSFUNCTION. THIS PAIR ACTS AS THE MASTER REGULATOR OF THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM, BALANCING THE PRODUCTION OF SEROTONIN, MELATONIN, AND GROWTH HORMONES TO STABILIZE EMOTIONAL AND PSYCHOLOGICAL STATES. (TRASTORNO BIPOLAR Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO EL REGULADOR MAESTRO DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO, EQUILIBRANDO LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE SEROTONINA, MELATONINA Y HORMONAS DEL CRECIMIENTO PARA ESTABILIZAR LOS ESTADOS EMOCIONALES Y PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND AJNA CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND HYPOPHYSEAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ENDOCRINE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT HARMONIZES THE \\\"COMMAND CENTER\\\" OF THE BRAIN TO RESOLVE DEEP-SEATED EMOTIONAL CRISES. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y AJNA. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA HIPOFIZARIO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ENDOCRINOS. ARMONIZA EL \\\"CENTRO DE MANDO\\\" DEL CEREBRO PARA RESOLVER CRISIS EMOCIONALES PROFUNDAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/973','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:24:04','2026-04-24 10:24:04'),(3537,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',974,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/INSTEP\",\"radical\":\"RESERVIOR\",\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN BARRE\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/INSTEP (EMPEINE)\",\"radical\":\"RESERVOIR (RESERVORIO)\",\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 SYNDROME. (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE WEAKNESS, TINGLING IN EXTREMITIES, LOSS OF REFLEXES, AND POTENTIAL PARALYSIS. MAY ALSO INVOLVE NERVE INFLAMMATION AND AUTONOMIC DYSFUNCTION. (DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, HORMIGUEO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE REFLEJOS Y PAR\\u00c1LISIS POTENCIAL. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NERVIOS Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR PATHOGENS ASSOCIATED WITH NEUROLOGICAL DEGENERATION. BY BALANCING THE PINEAL GLAND WITH THE INSTEP (EMPEINE), IT TARGETS LATENT VIRAL OR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT TRIGGER AUTOIMMUNE RESPONSES IN THE PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. (ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS ASOCIADOS CON LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. AL EQUILIBRAR LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL CON EL EMPEINE, SE DIRIGE A LAS CARGAS VIRALES O BACTERIANAS LATENTES QUE DESENCADENAN RESPUESTAS AUTOINMUNES EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND PEDAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE FOOT MINOR CHAKRAS. IT BRIDGES THE HIGHEST COMMAND CENTER WITH THE LOWEST PHYSICAL ANCHOR TO CLEAR SYSTEMIC PATHOGENS. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PEDAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL PIE. UNE EL CENTRO DE MANDO M\\u00c1S ALTO CON EL ANCLA F\\u00cdSICA M\\u00c1S BAJA PARA ELIMINAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/974','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:27:04','2026-04-24 10:27:04'),(3538,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',975,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/LIVER\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRAUMA, PSYCHOLOGICAL DISORDER AND STRESS.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/LIVER (H\\u00cdGADO)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND LIVER. (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL E H\\u00cdGADO)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC STRESS, EMOTIONAL TOXICITY, ANGER, FRUSTRATION, AND PSYCHOLOGICAL FATIGUE. MAY ALSO INVOLVE METABOLIC DISRUPTIONS LINKED TO PROLONGED EMOTIONAL CRISIS. (ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO, TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL, IRA, FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N Y FATIGA PSICOL\\u00d3GICA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR ALTERACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS VINCULADAS A CRISIS EMOCIONALES PROLONGADAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRAUMA, PSYCHOLOGICAL DISORDER AND STRESS. THIS PAIR FACILITATES THE DETOXIFICATION OF THE LIVER FROM ADRENALINE AND CORTISOL BY-PRODUCTS PRODUCED DURING EMOTIONAL TRAUMA, RE-ESTABLISHING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN HIGHER COGNITION AND METABOLIC BALANCE. (TRAUMA, TRASTORNO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO Y ESTR\\u00c9S. ESTE PAR FACILITA LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DE ADRENALINA Y CORTISOL PRODUCIDOS DURANTE EL TRAUMA EMOCIONAL, REESTABLECIENDO LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA COGNICI\\u00d3N SUPERIOR Y EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND HEPATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER MINOR CHAKRAS. IT CLEARS THE \\\"EMOTIONAL FILTER\\\" OF THE BODY TO RESOLVE REPRESSED ANGER. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA HEP\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO. LIMPIA EL \\\"FILTRO EMOCIONAL\\\" DEL CUERPO PARA RESOLVER LA IRA REPRIMIDA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/975','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:39:58','2026-04-24 10:39:58'),(3539,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',976,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/MEDULLA OBLONGATA\",\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN BARRE\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, MUSCLE WEAKNESS.\",\"paths\":\"AGGRESSIVE AND CONTAGIOUS. SENSITIVITY DISORDERS, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ MEDULLA OBLONGATA (BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO)\",\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN-BARRE (GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, TINGLING IN THE EXTREMITIES, AND LOSS OF REFLEXES. MAY ALSO CAUSE AUTONOMIC DYSFUNCTION AND PROGRESSIVE NEUROLOGICAL DEBILITATION. (MAREOS, FATIGA, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, HORMIGUEO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE REFLEJOS. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CAUSAR DISFUNCI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA Y DEBILITAMIENTO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO PROGRESIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"AGGRESSIVE AND CONTAGIOUS. SENSITIVITY DISORDERS, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS. THIS PAIR TARGETS THE VIRAL LOAD AFFECTING THE BRAINSTEM, REGULATING THE VITAL CENTERS THAT CONTROL BREATHING AND MOTOR COORDINATION. (AGRESIVO Y CONTAGIOSO. TRASTORNOS DE SENSIBILIDAD, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS. ESTE PAR SE DIRIGE A LA CARGA VIRAL QUE AFECTA EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO, REGULANDO LOS CENTROS VITALES QUE CONTROLAN LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND MEDULLARY MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBELLAR MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AXIS TO PREVENT NEUROLOGICAL COLLAPSE. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA MEDULAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBELOSOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL PARA PREVENIR EL COLAPSO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/976','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:42:58','2026-04-24 10:42:58'),(3540,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',977,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/PANCREAS\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LUST\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ PANCREAS (P\\u00c1NCREAS)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND PANCREAS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y P\\u00c1NCREAS)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, OBSESSIVE THOUGHTS, APPETITE DISRUPTIONS, AND HYPERSEXUALITY. MAY ALSO INVOLVE HORMONAL IMBALANCES THAT AFFECT PERSONAL BOUNDARIES AND SELF-CONTROL. (INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, PENSAMIENTOS OBSESIVOS, ALTERACIONES DEL APETITO E HIPERSEXUALIDAD. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES QUE AFECTAN LOS L\\u00cdMITES PERSONALES Y EL AUTOCONTROL.)\",\"paths\":\"LUST. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DISTORTION OF CREATIVE AND VITAL ENERGIES. IT BALANCES THE PINEAL\'S REGULATION OF HIGHER INTENT WITH THE PANCREATIC PRODUCTION OF ENZYMES AND HORMONES TO CALM COMPULSIVE BEHAVIORS AND RESTORE EMOTIONAL MODERATION. (LUJURIA. ESTE PARE ABORDA LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LAS ENERG\\u00cdAS CREATIVAS Y VITALES. EQUILIBRA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTENCI\\u00d3N SUPERIOR DE LA PINEAL CON LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA DE ENZIMAS Y HORMONAS PARA CALMAR LOS COMPORTAMIENTOS COMPULSIVOS Y RESTAURAR LA MODERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND PANCREATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE DIGESTIVE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT REALIGNS THE BODY\'S DESIRE CENTERS WITH THE SPIRITUAL CENTER. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PANCRE\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DIGESTIVOS. REALINEA LOS CENTROS DE DESEO DEL CUERPO CON EL CENTRO ESPIRITUAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/977','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:45:59','2026-04-24 10:45:59'),(3541,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',978,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/PINEAL GLAND\",\"radical\":\"DYSFUNCTION\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PIGMENT DISCOLORING, SEXUAL AND ADRENALS DISFUNCTION. HYPOCHROMIA\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ PINEAL GLAND (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL)\",\"radical\":\"DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"PIGMENT DISCOLORATION, HYPOCHROMIA, VITILIGO, SEXUAL DYSFUNCTION, ADRENAL DYSFUNCTION, AND SLEEP CYCLE INTERRUPTIONS. MAY ALSO INVOLVE HORMONAL IMBALANCES AFFECTING GROWTH AND VITALITY. (DECOLORACI\\u00d3N DE PIGMENTOS, HIPOCROM\\u00cdA, VIT\\u00cdLIGO, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ADRENAL E INTERRUPCIONES DEL CICLO DEL SUE\\u00d1O. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES QUE AFECTAN EL CRECIMIENTO Y LA VITALIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"PIGMENT DISCOLORING, SEXUAL AND ADRENALS DISFUNCTION. HYPOCHROMIA. THIS PAIR ACTS AS A BIO-FEEDBACK LOOP TO RESTORE THE INTERNAL PRODUCTION OF MELATONIN AND SEROTONIN, REGULATING THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM\'S RESPONSE TO LIGHT AND BIOLOGICAL RHYTHMS. (DECOLORACI\\u00d3N DE PIGMENTOS, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL Y ADRENAL. HIPOCROM\\u00cdA. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN BUCLE DE BIO-RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N PARA RESTAURAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N INTERNA DE MELATONINA Y SEROTONINA, REGULANDO LA RESPUESTA DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO A LA LUZ Y LOS RITMOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ENDOCRINE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ANCHORS THE SPIRITUAL INTENT INTO THE BIOLOGICAL CLOCK TO STABILIZE SYSTEMIC PIGMENTATION AND HORMONAL FLOW. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS PINEALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ENDOCRINOS. ANCLA LA INTENCI\\u00d3N ESPIRITUAL EN EL RELOJ BIOL\\u00d3GICO PARA ESTABILIZAR LA PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y EL FLUJO HORMONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/978','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:48:43','2026-04-24 10:48:43'),(3542,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',979,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/PONS\",\"radical\":\"RESERVOIR\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VERTIGO\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ PONS (PUENTE DE VAROLIO)\",\"radical\":\"RESERVOIR (RESERVORIO)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND PONS (PONS VAROLII). (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y PUENTE DE VAROLIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"VERTIGO, DIZZINESS, LOSS OF BALANCE, NAUSEA, AND DISORIENTATION. MAY ALSO INVOLVE SLEEP APNEA, DISRUPTED BREATHING PATTERNS, AND FACIAL SENSATIONS. (V\\u00c9RTIGO, MAREOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL EQUILIBRIO, N\\u00c1USEAS Y DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR APNEA DEL SUE\\u00d1O, PATRONES RESPIRATORIOS ALTERADOS Y SENSACIONES FACIALES.)\",\"paths\":\"VERTIGO. THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR PATHOGENS THAT AFFECT THE VESTIBULAR SYSTEM. IT REGULATES THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM (PINEAL) AND THE BRAINSTEM (PONS) TO STABILIZE MOTOR COORDINATION AND SENSORY INTERPRETATION. (V\\u00c9RTIGO. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTAN EL SISTEMA VESTIBULAR. REGULA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO (PINEAL) Y EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO (PUENTE) PARA ESTABILIZAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA Y LA INTERPRETACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND PONTINE MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBELLAR MINOR CHAKRAS. IT CLEARS THE ENERGETIC CHANNEL RESPONSIBLE FOR EQUILIBRIUM AND AUTONOMIC REGULATION. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PONTINO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBELOSOS. LIMPIA EL CANAL ENERG\\u00c9TICO RESPONSABLE DEL EQUILIBRIO Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/979','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:51:40','2026-04-24 10:51:40'),(3543,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',980,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/PROSTATE\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LUST\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ PROSTATE (PR\\u00d3STATA)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND PROSTATE. (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y PR\\u00d3STATA).\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, OBSESSIVE THOUGHTS, APPETITE DISRUPTIONS, AND HYPERSEXUALITY. MAY ALSO INVOLVE HORMONAL IMBALANCES THAT AFFECT PERSONAL BOUNDARIES AND SELF-CONTROL. (INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, PENSAMIENTOS OBSESIVOS, ALTERACIONES DEL APETITO E HIPERSEXUALIDAD. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES QUE AFECTAN LOS L\\u00cdMITES PERSONALES Y EL AUTOCONTROL.)\",\"paths\":\"LUST. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DISTORTION OF CREATIVE AND VITAL ENERGIES. IT BALANCES THE PINEAL\'S REGULATION OF HIGHER INTENT WITH THE PROSTATIC ENERGETIC CENTER TO CALM COMPULSIVE BEHAVIORS AND RESTORE EMOTIONAL MODERATION. (LUJURIA. ESTE PARE ABORDA LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LAS ENERG\\u00cdAS CREATIVAS Y VITALES. EQUILIBRA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTENCI\\u00d3N SUPERIOR DE LA PINEAL CON EL CENTRO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PROST\\u00c1TICO PARA CALMAR LOS COMPORTAMIENTOS COMPULSIVOS Y RESTAURAR LA MODERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND PROSTATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE REPRODUCTIVE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT REALIGNS THE BODY\'S DESIRE CENTERS WITH THE SPIRITUAL CENTER. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PROST\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES REPRODUCTIVOS. REALINEA LOS CENTROS DE DESEO DEL CUERPO CON EL CENTRO ESPIRITUAL)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/980','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:54:17','2026-04-24 10:54:17'),(3544,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',981,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/PALM (R)\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"MERIDIANS UNBALANCE INDICATOR.\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"BALANCING THE MERIDIANS BY\"}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/PALM - R (PALMA (D)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND RIGHT PALM. (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y PALMA DERECHA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MERIDIANS UNBALANCE INDICATOR. MAY CAUSE ENERGETIC FATIGUE, BLOCKED FLOW ALONG THE ACUPUNCTURE MERIDIANS, AND A SENSE OF BEING DISCONNECTED FROM ENVIRONMENTAL RHYTHMS. (INDICADOR DE DESEQUILIBRIO DE LOS MERIDIANOS. PUEDE CAUSAR FATIGA ENERG\\u00c9TICA, FLUJO BLOQUEADO A LO LARGO DE LOS MERIDIANOS DE ACUPUNTURA Y UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ESTAR DESCONECTADO DE LOS RITMOS AMBIENTALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ACTS AS A DIAGNOSTIC BRIDGE. BALANCING THE MERIDIANS BY ALIGNING THE PINEAL COMMAND CENTER WITH THE PALMAR RADIANT POINT RESTORES THE POLARITY OF THE ENTIRE ENERGETIC NETWORK, ALLOWING FOR THE CORRECT FLOW OF CHI THROUGHOUT THE BODY. (ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN PUENTE DIAGN\\u00d3STICO. EQUILIBRAR LOS MERIDIANOS ALINEANDO EL CENTRO DE MANDO PINEAL CON EL PUNTO RADIANTE PALMAR RESTAURA LA POLARIDAD DE TODA LA RED ENERG\\u00c9TICA, PERMITIENDO EL FLUJO CORRECTO DE CHI EN TODO EL CUERPO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND PALMAR MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HAND MINOR CHAKRAS. IT FUNCTIONS AS A RESET FOR THE BODY\'S ENERGETIC POLARITY. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PALMAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE LA MANO. FUNCIONA COMO UN REINICIO PARA LA POLARIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/981','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 10:58:20','2026-04-24 10:58:20'),(3545,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',982,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/RACHIDIAN BULB\",\"origins\":\"GUILLIAN BARRE\",\"symptoms\":\"DAMAGE TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, DEGENERATION OF THE PINEAL GLAND, DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, BLURRED VISION, DRY MOUTH, ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION.\",\"paths\":\"MENTAL IMBALANCE, HYSTERIA, PARALYSIS, QUADRIPLEGIA, RESPIRATORY FAILURE.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PARIETAL      CHECK - PINEAL\\/INSTEP\"}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ RACHIDIAN BULB (BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO)\",\"origins\":\"GUILLIAN-BARRE (GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"DAMAGE TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, DEGENERATION OF THE PINEAL GLAND, DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, BLURRED VISION, DRY MOUTH, ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION. MAY ALSO CAUSE MUSCLE WEAKNESS AND LOSS OF REFLEXES. (DAMAGE TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, DEGENERATION OF THE PINEAL GLAND, DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, BLURRED VISION, DRY MOUTH, ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION. MAY ALSO CAUSE MUSCLE WEAKNESS AND LOSS OF REFLEXES. (DA\\u00d1O AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL, MAREOS, FATIGA, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA, BOCA SECA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CAUSAR DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE REFLEJOS)\",\"paths\":\"MENTAL IMBALANCE, HYSTERIA, PARALYSIS, QUADRIPLEGIA, RESPIRATORY FAILURE. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL IMPACT ON THE BRAINSTEM (RACHIDIAN BULB), TARGETING THE AUTONOMIC CENTERS RESPONSIBLE FOR VITAL REFLEXES. (DESEQUILIBRIO MENTAL, HISTERIA, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, CUADRIPLEJ\\u00cdA, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL IMPACTO VIRAL EN EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO (BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO), DIRIGI\\u00c9NDOSE A LOS CENTROS AUT\\u00d3NOMOS RESPONSABLES DE LOS REFLEJOS VITALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PARIETAL      CHECK - PINEAL\\/INSTEP MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND BULBAR MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBELLAR MINOR CHAKRAS. (REVISAR: PARIETAL, PINEAL\\/EMPEINE. CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA BULBAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBELOSOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/982','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 11:01:54','2026-04-24 11:01:54'),(3546,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',983,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/SUPRARENAL\",\"origins\":\"RNA\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"REGULATES THE HORMONAL SYSTEM.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ SUPRARENAL (SUPRARRENAL)\",\"origins\":\"RNA VIRUS (VIRUS DE ARN)\",\"symptoms\":\"HORMONAL IMBALANCE, FATIGUE, SLEEP DISORDERS, ANXIETY, AND ALTERED CIRCADIAN RHYTHMS. MAY ALSO INVOLVE METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION AND ADRENAL STRESS. (DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL, FATIGA, TRASTORNOS DEL SUE\\u00d1O, ANSIEDAD Y RITMOS CIRCADIANOS ALTERADOS. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y ESTR\\u00c9S ADRENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"REGULATES THE HORMONAL SYSTEM. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL IMPACT ON THE ENDOCRINE AXIS, STABILIZING THE INTERACTION BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND (MELATONIN) AND THE SUPRARENAL GLANDS (CORTISOL\\/ADRENALINE) TO RESTORE SYSTEMIC HOMEOSTASIS. (REGULA EL SISTEMA HORMONAL. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL IMPACTO VIRAL EN EL EJE ENDOCRINO, ESTABILIZANDO LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL (MELATONINA) Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES (CORTISOL\\/ADRENALINA) PARA RESTAURAR LA HOMEOSTASIS SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND SUPRARENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ENDOCRINE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT BRIDGES THE HIGHER COMMAND CENTER WITH THE BODY\'S VITAL ENERGY PRODUCTION. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA SUPRARRENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ENDOCRINOS. UNE EL CENTRO DE MANDO SUPERIOR CON LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/983','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 11:04:22','2026-04-24 11:04:22'),(3547,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',984,'{\"name\":\"PINEAL\\/THYROID\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ALCOHOLISM\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"PINEAL \\/ THYROID (TIROIDES)\",\"radical\":\"EMOTIONAL (EMOCIONAL)\",\"origins\":\"PINEAL GLAND AND THYROID GLAND (GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES)\",\"symptoms\":\"ADDICTION ISSUES, EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, METABOLIC FLUCTUATIONS, ANXIETY, AND SLEEP DISRUPTIONS. MAY ALSO INVOLVE DIFFICULTY IN EXPRESSING EMOTIONS OR COMMUNICATING PERSONAL NEEDS. (PROBLEMAS DE ADICCI\\u00d3N, INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, FLUCTUACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS, ANSIEDAD Y ALTERACIONES DEL SUE\\u00d1O. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR DIFICULTAD PARA EXPRESAR EMOCIONES O COMUNICAR NECESIDADES PERSONALES.)\",\"paths\":\"ALCOHOLISM. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE IN THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM THAT DRIVES ADDICTIVE BEHAVIORS. IT STABILIZES THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE PINEAL (COMMAND) AND THE THYROID (METABOLISM) TO REDUCE COMPULSIVE URGES AND RESTORE BIOLOGICAL RHYTHMS. (ALCOHOLISMO. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO QUE IMPULSA LOS COMPORTAMIENTOS ADICTIVOS. ESTABILIZA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA PINEAL (MANDO) Y LA TIROIDES (METABOLISMO) PARA REDUCIR LOS IMPULSOS COMPULSIVOS Y RESTAURAR LOS RITMOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND THYROID MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ENDOCRINE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT REALIGNS THE SPIRITUAL WILL WITH PHYSICAL EXPRESSION. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA TIROIDEO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ENDOCRINOS. REALINEA LA VOLUNTAD ESPIRITUAL CON LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/984','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 11:07:00','2026-04-24 11:07:00'),(3548,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1270,'{\"name\":\"SPLEEN\\/SPLEEN (VERTICAL)\",\"origins\":\"CORYNEBACTERIUM\",\"symptoms\":\"SPREAD BY AIRBORNE DROPLETS, CONTAMINATED PERSONAL ITEMS OR TOUCHING AN INFECTED WOUND. SORE THROAT, HOARSENESS, SWOLLEN GLANDS IN NECK, DIFFICULT BREATHING, NASAL DISCHARGE, FEVER, CHILLS, MALAISE.\",\"paths\":\"DIPHTHERIA, BREATHING PROBLEMS, OBSTRUCTED BREATHING, HEART DAMAGE, NERVE DAMAGE PRODUCED FROM THE TOXIN, PARALYZED.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"SPLEEN (BAZO) \\/ SPLEEN (BAZO) - VERTICAL\",\"origins\":\"CORYNEBACTERIUM DIPHTHERIAE\",\"symptoms\":\"SPREAD BY AIRBORNE DROPLETS, CONTAMINATED PERSONAL ITEMS OR TOUCHING AN INFECTED WOUND. SORE THROAT, HOARSENESS, SWOLLEN GLANDS IN NECK, DIFFICULT BREATHING, NASAL DISCHARGE, FEVER, CHILLS, MALAISE. (SE PROPAGA POR GOTITAS EN EL AIRE, OBJETOS PERSONALES CONTAMINADOS O AL TOCAR UNA HERIDA INFECTADA. DOLOR DE GARGANTA, RONQUERA, GL\\u00c1NDULAS HINCHADAS EN EL CUELLO, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, FIEBRE, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, MALESTAR GENERAL.)\",\"paths\":\"DIPHTHERIA, BREATHING PROBLEMS, OBSTRUCTED BREATHING, HEART DAMAGE, NERVE DAMAGE PRODUCED FROM THE TOXIN, PARALYZED. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE TOXEMIA PRODUCED BY THE BACTERIA THAT CAN LEAD TO MYOCARDITIS OR NEUROLOGICAL DEGENERATION. (DIFTERIA, PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, RESPIRACI\\u00d3N OBSTRUIDA, DA\\u00d1O CARD\\u00cdACO, DA\\u00d1O NERVIOSO PRODUCIDO POR LA TOXINA, PAR\\u00c1LISIS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA TOXEMIA PRODUCIDA POR LA BACTERIA QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A MIOCARDITIS O DEGENERACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE SPLENIC AND IMMUNE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT PURIFIES THE BLOOD ENERGETICALLY AND REINFORCES THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AGAINST SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL TOXINS. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS ESPL\\u00c9NICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ESPL\\u00c9NICOS E INMUNITARIOS. PURIFICA LA SANGRE ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE Y REFUERZA LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA CONTRA LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1270','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 11:10:18','2026-04-24 11:10:18'),(3549,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1287,'{\"name\":\"ROOT CHAKRA\",\"radical\":\"IF BALANCED\",\"origins\":\"SKIP TO\\/CHECK \\nSACRAL\",\"symptoms\":\"NO IMBALANEC TO ROOT CHAKRA\"}','{\"name\":\"ROOT CHAKRA (CHAKRA RA\\u00cdZ)\",\"radical\":\"IF BALANCED (SI EST\\u00c1 EQUILIBRADO)\",\"origins\