CKAGE. THE SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) IS THE POWER CENTER. AN IMBALANCE HERE SUGGESTS A DISTRUPTION IN THE \\\"METABOLIC FIRE,\\\" REQUIRING A DEEPER INVESTIGATION INTO THE SPLEEN MERIDIAN AND ASSOCIATED PATHOGENS TO RESTORE PERSONAL VITALITY. (BLOQUEO ENERG\\u00c9TICO. EL PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) ES EL CENTRO DEL PODER. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SUGIERE UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N EN EL \\\"FUEGO METAB\\u00d3LICO\\\", LO QUE REQUIERE UNA INVESTIGACI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA DE LOS MERIDIANOS DEL BAZO Y LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS ASOCIADOS PARA RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD PERSONAL)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1290','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 11:20:50','2026-04-24 11:20:50'),(3554,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1291,'{\"name\":\"HEART\",\"radical\":\"IF BALANCED\",\"origins\":\"SKIP TO\\/CHECK THROAT CHAKRA\",\"paths\":null}','{\"name\":\"HEART (CORAZ\\u00d3N)\",\"radical\":\"IF BALANCED (SI EST\\u00c1 EQUILIBRADO)\",\"origins\":\"SKIP TO\\/CHECK THROAT CHAKRA. (SALTAR A\\/REVISAR CHAKRA DE LA GARGANTA)\",\"paths\":\"EMOTIONAL HARMONY. THE HEART CHAKRA (ANAHATA) IS THE BRIDGE BETWEEN PHYSICAL AND SPIRITUAL CENTERS. IF NO SHORTENING OR POLARITY SHIFT IS DETECTED, THE CAPACITY FOR UNCONDITIONAL LOVE AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY IS INTACT, ALLOWING THE SCAN TO PROCEED TO THE THROAT CHAKRA. (ARMON\\u00cdA EMOCIONAL. EL CHAKRA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) ES EL PUENTE ENTRE LOS CENTROS F\\u00cdSICOS Y ESPIRITUALES. SI NO SE DETECTA ACORTAMIENTO O CAMBIO DE POLARIDAD, LA CAPACIDAD DE AMOR INCONDICIONAL Y ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL EST\\u00c1 INTACTA, LO QUE PERMITE QUE EL ESCANEO CONTIN\\u00daE HACIA EL CHAKRA DE LA GARGANTA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1291','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 11:22:16','2026-04-24 11:22:1