37.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 15:18:33','2026-04-24 15:18:33'),(3560,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\User',1,'[]','[]','https://biomagnetism.app/logout','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 15:19:35','2026-04-24 15:19:35'),(3561,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1095,'{\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (RA\\u00cdZ) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SURVIVAL OVERRIDE MICRO CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ENDOCRINE AND NERVOUS SYSTEM MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ESTABLISHES A DIRECT LINK BETWEEN THE ADRENAL POWER PLANT AND THE BRAINSTEM TO RESOLVE CHRONIC FIGHT-OR-FLIGHT OVERLOAD. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS DE ANULACI\\u00d3N DE SUPERVIVENCIA. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO Y NERVIOSO. ESTABLECE UN V\\u00cdNCULO DIRECTO ENTRE LA PLANTA DE ENERG\\u00cdA ADRENAL Y EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO PARA RESOLVER LA SOBRECARGA CR\\u00d3NICA DE LUCHA O HUIDA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1095','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 19:11:54','2026-04-24 19:11:54'),(3562,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1096,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CHOOSING OF BEHAVIORS. (ELECCI\\u00d3N DE CONDUCTAS.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHOOSING OF BEHAVIORS. THIS POINT REGULATES THE CONSCIOUS SELECTION OF REACTIONS TO EXTERNAL STIMULI AND THE OVERRIDE OF AUTOMATIC RESPONSES. (ELECCI\\u00d3N DE CONDUCTAS. ESTE PUNTO REGULA LA SELECCI\\u00d3N CONSCIENTE DE REACCIONES ANTE EST\\u00cdMULOS EXTERNOS Y LA ANULACI\\u00d3N DE RESPUESTAS AUTOM\\u00c1TICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THE ADRENAL CORTEX ACTS AS THE CHEMICAL PROCESSOR FOR EMOTIONAL DECISION-MAKING. IT TRANSFORMS SPIRITUAL INTENT INTO BIOLOGICAL ACTION BY MANAGING THE RELEASE OF CORTICOSTEROIDS. (LA CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL ACT\\u00daA COMO EL PROCESADOR QU\\u00cdMICO PARA LA TOMA DE DECISIONES EMOCIONALES. TRANSFORMA LA INTENCI\\u00d3N ESPIRITUAL EN ACCI\\u00d3N BIOL\\u00d3GICA MEDIANTE LA GESTI\\u00d3N DE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE CORTICOESTEROIDES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CORTICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND HEPATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE DETOX AND STRESS-RESPONSE MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: LIVER\\/LIVER FOR ENERGETIC CLEARING. POLARITY: IF 1ST ROUTE FAILS, SWITCH TO LIVER (+)\\/ADRENAL CORTEX (-). (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA CORTICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA HEP\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y RESPUESTA AL ESTR\\u00c9S. ASOCIACIONES: H\\u00cdGADO\\/H\\u00cdGADO PARA LIMPIEZA ENERG\\u00c9TICA. POLARIDAD: SI LA 1RA RUTA FALLA, CAMBIAR A H\\u00cdGADO (+)\\/CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL (-).)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1096','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 19:54:31','2026-04-24 19:54:31'),(3563,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1097,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SPINAL COLUMN DAMAGE OCCURS WHEN A SPECIFIC SPIRITUAL TOLERANCE THRESHOLD HAS BEEN BREACHED. (EL DA\\u00d1O EN LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL OCURRE CUANDO SE HA SUPERADO UN UMBRAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICO DE TOLERANCIA ESPIRITUAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THE SPINAL COLUMN IS THE FIRST PLACE IN THE HUMAN BODY TO REACT PHYSICALLY TO OUR THOUGHTS, ATTITUDES AND EMOTIONS. (THE SPINAL COLUMN IS THE FIRST PLACE IN THE HUMAN BODY TO REACT PHYSICALLY TO OUR THOUGHTS, ATTITUDES AND EMOTIONS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SPINAL COLUMN DAMAGE OCURS WHEN A SPECIFIC SPIRITUAL TOLERANCE THRESHOLD HAS BEEN BREACHED. THE SPINAL COLUMN IS THE FIRST PLACE IN THE HUMAN BODY TO REACT PHYSICALLY TO OUR THOUGHTS, ATTITUDES AND EMOTIONS. (EL DA\\u00d1O EN LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL OCURRE CUANDO SE HA SUPERADO UN UMBRAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICO DE TOLERANCIA ESPIRITUAL. LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL ES EL PRIMER LUGAR DEL CUERPO HUMANO EN REACCIONAR F\\u00cdSICAMENTE A NUESTROS PENSAMIENTOS, ACTITUDES Y EMOCIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"THE SPINAL COLUMN ACTS AS THE MASTER DATA HIGHWAY. EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD CREATES A \\\"NEURO-COMPRESSION\\\" THAT BLOCKS THE FLOW OF VITAL INFORMATION. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR, YOU RESTORE THE ELECTRICAL INTEGRITY OF THE ENTIRE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. (LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL ACT\\u00daA COMO LA CARRETERA PRINCIPAL DE DATOS. LA SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL CREA UNA \\\"NEUROCOMPRESI\\u00d3N\\\" QUE BLOQUEA EL FLUJO DE INFORMACI\\u00d3N VITAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR, RESTAURAS LA INTEGRIDAD EL\\u00c9CTRICA DE TODO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: CROWN (SAHASRARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PINEAL MICRO CHAKRA AND BULBAR MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CEREBELLAR MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: KIDNEY\\/KIDNEY FOR STRUCTURAL ALIGNMENT. POLARITY: IF 1ST ROUTE FAILS, SWITCH TO SACRUM (+)\\/SPINAL COLUMN (-). (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORONILLA (SAHASRARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PINEAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA BULBAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CEREBELOSOS. ASOCIACIONES: RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL. POLARIDAD: SI LA 1RA RUTA FALLA, CAMBIAR A SACRO (+)\\/COLUMNA VERTEBRAL (-).)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1097','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:03:57','2026-04-24 20:03:57'),(3564,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1098,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"THE KIDNEYS FILTER HOW WE RELATE TO WHAT WE HOLD ON TO AND WHAT WE LET GO. (LOS RI\\u00d1ONES FILTRAN C\\u00d3MO NOS RELACIONAMOS CON LO QUE NOS AFERRAMOS Y LO QUE DEJAMOS IR.)\",\"paths\":\"THEY ARE SENSITIVE TO ISSUES WITH FAMILIES AND RELATIONSHIPS.  THE BALANCE OF POWER AND OUR SENSE OF EMPOWERMENT IN RELATIONSHIPS. (SON SENSIBLES A LOS PROBLEMAS CON LA FAMILIA Y LAS RELACIONES. EL EQUILIBRIO DE PODER Y NUESTRO SENTIDO DE EMPODERAMIENTO EN LAS RELACIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"THE KIDNEYS FILTER HOW WE RELATE TO WHAT WE HOLD ON TO AND WHAT WE LET GO. THEY ARE SENSITIVE TO ISSUES WITH FAMILIES AND RELATIONSHIPS. (LOS RI\\u00d1ONES FILTRAN C\\u00d3MO NOS RELACIONAMOS CON LO QUE NOS AFERRAMOS Y LO QUE DEJAMOS IR. SON SENSIBLES A LOS PROBLEMAS CON LA FAMILIA Y LAS RELACIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR GOVERNS THE BALANCE OF POWER AND OUR SENSE OF EMPOWERMENT. EMOTIONAL TOXICITY IN RELATIONSHIPS CAUSES PHYSICAL CALCULI OR FILTRATION DYSFUNCTION. (ESTE PAR GOBIERNA EL EQUILIBRIO DE PODER Y NUESTRO SENTIDO DE EMPODERAMIENTO. LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL EN LAS RELACIONES CAUSA C\\u00c1LCULOS F\\u00cdSICOS O DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE RENAL MICRO CHAKRA AND ADRENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE FILTRATION AND ELIMINATION MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: ADRENAL\\/KIDNEY FOR CORTISOL REGULATION. POLARITY: IF 1ST ROUTE FAILS, SWITCH TO KIDNEY (+)\\/KIDNEY (-).(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA SUPRARRENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINACI\\u00d3N. ASOCIACIONES: SUPRARRENAL\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE CORTISOL. POLARIDAD: SI LA 1RA RUTA FALLA, CAMBIAR A RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (+)\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (-).)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1098','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:06:15','2026-04-24 20:06:15'),(3565,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1099,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"RELATE TO THE EMOTIONS OF FEAR AND TRAUMA. (SE RELACIONAN CON LAS EMOCIONES DE MIEDO Y TRAUMA.)\",\"paths\":\"THE BLADDER ORGAN ENERGY SYSTEM (BLADDER SYSTEM) IS THE YANG TO THE KIDNEY\\u2019S YIN. (EL SISTEMA ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL \\u00d3RGANO VEJIGA (SISTEMA DE LA VEJIGA) ES EL YANG DEL YIN DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE EMOTIONS OF FEAR AND TRAUMA. IT IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING DEEP-SEATED ANXIETY AND THE PHYSICAL RETENTION OF STRESS. (SE RELACIONA CON LAS EMOCIONES DE MIEDO Y TRAUMA. ES ESENCIAL PARA LIBERAR LA ANSIEDAD PROFUNDA Y LA RETENCI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA DEL ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"paths\":\"THE BLADDER ORGAN ENERGY SYSTEM (BLADDER SYSTEM) IS THE YANG TO THE KIDNEY\\u2019S YIN. IT ACTS AS THE RESERVOIR FOR EMOTIONAL FLUIDITY; BLOCKAGES HERE CAUSE THE SYSTEM TO \\\"FREEZE\\\" IN FEAR. (EL SISTEMA ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL \\u00d3RGANO VEJIGA ES EL YANG DEL YIN DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. ACT\\u00daA COMO EL RESERVORIO PARA LA FLUIDEZ EMOCIONAL; LOS BLOQUEOS AQU\\u00cd HACEN QUE EL SISTEMA SE \\\"CONGELE\\\" POR EL MIEDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VESICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ELIMINATION AND SURVIVAL MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: KIDNEY\\/KIDNEY FOR YIN\\/YANG BALANCE. POLARITY: IF 1ST ROUTE FAILS, SWITCH TO BLADDER (+)\\/SACRUM (-). (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA VESICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N Y SUPERVIVENCIA. ASOCIACIONES: RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA EL EQUILIBRIO YIN\\/YANG. POLARIDAD: SI LA 1RA RUTA FALLA, CAMBIAR A VEJIGA (+)\\/SACRO (-)).\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1099','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:09:38','2026-04-24 20:09:38'),(3566,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1100,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PRIDE (ORGULLO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"PRIDE. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY AND THE INABILITY TO YIELD OR ADMIT ERROR. (ORGULLO. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL Y LA INCAPACIDAD DE CEDER O ADMITIR ERRORES.)\",\"paths\":\"THE ADRENAL\\/LIVER CIRCUIT IS THE AXIS OF EMOTIONAL PROCESSING. PRIDE CAUSES THE LIVER TO BECOME \\\"CONGESTED\\\" ENERGETICALLY, LEADING TO A CHEMICAL OVERLOAD IN THE ADRENALS. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR RELEASES THE \\\"STIFFNESS\\\" OF THE EGO AND RESTORES BIOLOGICAL HUMILITY. (EL CIRCUITO SUPRARRENAL\\/H\\u00cdGADO ES EL EJE DEL PROCESAMIENTO EMOCIONAL. EL ORGULLO HACE QUE EL H\\u00cdGADO SE \\\"CONGESTIONE\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE, GENERANDO UNA SOBRECARGA QU\\u00cdMICA EN LAS SUPRARRENALES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR LIBERA LA \\\"RIGIDEZ\\\" DEL EGO Y RESTAURA LA HUMILDAD BIOL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"THE ADRENAL\\/LIVER CIRCUIT IS THE AXIS OF EMOTIONAL PROCESSING. PRIDE CAUSES THE LIVER TO BECOME \\\"CONGESTED\\\" ENERGETICALLY, LEADING TO A CHEMICAL OVERLOAD IN THE ADRENALS. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR RELEASES THE \\\"STIFFNESS\\\" OF THE EGO AND RESTORES BIOLOGICAL HUMILITY. (EL CIRCUITO SUPRARRENAL\\/H\\u00cdGADO ES EL EJE DEL PROCESAMIENTO EMOCIONAL. EL ORGULLO HACE QUE EL H\\u00cdGADO SE \\\"CONGESTIONE\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE, GENERANDO UNA SOBRECARGA QU\\u00cdMICA EN LAS SUPRARRENALES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR LIBERA LA \\\"RIGIDEZ\\\" DEL EGO Y RESTAURA LA HUMILDAD BIOL\\u00d3GICA.) (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA CORTICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA HEP\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y RESPUESTA AL ESTR\\u00c9S. ASOCIACIONES: H\\u00cdGADO\\/H\\u00cdGADO PARA LIMPIEZA ENERG\\u00c9TICA. POLARIDAD: SI LA 1RA RUTA FALLA, CAMBIAR A H\\u00cdGADO (+)\\/CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL (-).)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1100','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:11:56','2026-04-24 20:11:56'),(3567,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1101,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EDEMA, ASTHMA, SINUS PAIN, INSOMNIA, DISCOURAGEMENT, ADDISON DISEASE, CHRONIC FATIGUE. (EDEMA, ASMA, DOLOR DE SENOS PARANASALES, INSOMNIO, DESALIENTO, ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"paths\":\"DUE TO A TRAUMA OR INFECTION. ADRENAL GLANDS DO NOT PRODUCE ENOUGH CORTICOSTEROIDS. (DEBIDO A UN TRAUMA O INFECCI\\u00d3N. LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES NO PRODUCEN SUFICIENTES CORTICOSTEROIDES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ADRENAL DYSFUNCTION. THIS PAIR REGULATES THE OVERPRODUCTION OR UNDERPRODUCTION OF ADAPTOGENIC HORMONES, ADDRESSING CHRONIC FATIGUE AND CORTISOL IMBALANCE. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SUPRARRENAL. ESTE PAR REGULA LA SOBREPRODUCCI\\u00d3N O SUBPRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS ADAPT\\u00d3GENAS, ABORDANDO LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA Y EL DESEQUILIBRIO DE CORTISOL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS IS THE MASTER RESET FOR THE BODY\'S STRESS CENTER. WHEN THE ADRENAL GLANDS ARE OVERWORKED BY CONTINUOUS \\\"FIGHT-OR-FLIGHT\\\" SIGNALS, THEY LOSE THEIR BIOLOGICAL RHYTHM. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR REBOOTS THE ADRENAL SYSTEM, CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM AND RESTORING VITAL ENERGY RESERVES. (ESTE ES EL REINICIO MAESTRO PARA EL CENTRO DE ESTR\\u00c9S DEL CUERPO. CUANDO LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES SE SOBRECARGAN POR SE\\u00d1ALES CONTINUAS DE \\\"LUCHA O HUIDA\\\", PIERDEN SU RITMO BIOL\\u00d3GICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR REINICIA EL SISTEMA SUPRARRENAL, CALMANDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y RESTAURANDO LAS RESERVAS DE ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CORTICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND MEDULLARY MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ENDOCRINE AND STRESS-RESPONSE MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: ADRENAL CORTEX\\/KIDNEY FOR HORMONAL ANCHORING. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA CORTICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA MEDULAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ENDOCRINOS Y DE RESPUESTA AL ESTR\\u00c9S. ASOCIACIONES: CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA EL ANCLAJE HORMONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1101','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:15:45','2026-04-24 20:15:45'),(3568,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1102,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIC ASTHMA (ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIC ASTHMA. TARGETS RESPIRATORY CONSTRICTION AND INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE. (ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA. DIRIGIDO A LA CONSTRICTI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR LINKS THE ADRENAL RESPONSE TO THE FRONTAL SENSORY INPUT. BACTERIAL OVERLOAD DISTORTS CORTISOL LEVELS, TRIGGERING HYPER-SENSITIVITY IN THE BRONCHIAL SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR CALMS THE IMMUNE OVERREACTION. (ESTE PAR VINCULA LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL CON LA ENTRADA SENSORIAL FRONTAL. LA SOBRECARGA BACTERIANA DISTORSIONA LOS NIVELES DE CORTISOL, ACTIVANDO HIPERSENSIBILIDAD EN EL SISTEMA BRONQUIAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR CALMA LA SOBREACCI\\u00d3N INMUNE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CORTICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND FRONTAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE SINUS AND RESPIRATORY MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: LUNG\\/LUNG FOR OXYGENATION FLOW. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA CORTICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA FRONTAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES SINUSALES Y RESPIRATORIOS. ASOCIACIONES: PULM\\u00d3N\\/PULM\\u00d3N PARA EL FLUJO DE OXIGENACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1102','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:18:31','2026-04-24 20:18:31'),(3569,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1103,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"METASTASIS\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PLEURA\\/RECTUM (* REVISAR - PLEURA\\/RECTO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY DISTRESS AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. CAN MANIFEST AS PLEURITIS OR SEVERE LUNG CONGESTION. (DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO PLEURITIS O CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR SEVERA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR LINKS THE ADRENAL STRESS RESPONSE TO THE PROTECTIVE LINING OF THE LUNGS. THE BACTERIA TRIGGERS A METASTASIS OF SYMPTOMS THAT CAN SPREAD IF THE ELECTRICAL CHARGE IS NOT NEUTRALIZED. (ESTE PAR VINCULA LA RESPUESTA DE ESTR\\u00c9S SUPRARRENAL CON EL REVESTIMIENTO PROTECTOR DE LOS PULMONES. LA BACTERIA ACTIVA UNA MET\\u00c1STASIS DE S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE PUEDEN PROPAGARSE SI NO SE NEUTRALIZA LA CARGA EL\\u00c9CTRICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CORTICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND PLEURAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR 