ECIA, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, FIEBRE Y FLUCTUACIONES MENTALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED VIA ANIMAL CONTACT. THIS PARASITE DISTORTS THE DIGESTIVE AND RESPIRATORY TRACTS, OFTEN MIMICKING OTHER CONDITIONS LIKE SCABIES OR PSORIASIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR CONTACTO ANIMAL. ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO DISTORSIONA LOS TRACTOS DIGESTIVO Y RESPIRATORIO, A MENUDO IMITANDO OTRAS CONDICIONES COMO SARNA O PSORIASIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CORTICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND ANAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ELIMINATION AND IMMUNE MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: ADRENAL\\/KIDNEY FOR SYSTEMIC FILTRATION. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA CORTICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA ANAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N E INMUNITARIOS. ASOCIACIONES: SUPRARRENAL\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1104','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:22:55','2026-04-24 20:22:55'),(3571,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1105,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HATE (ODIO)\",\"paths\":\"HATE (ODIO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"HATE. TARGETS DEEP-SEATED RESENTMENT AND INTENSE ANGER. (ODIO. DIRIGIDO AL RESENTIMIENTO PROFUNDO Y LA IRA INTENSA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR CONNECTS THE ADRENAL CENTER TO THE BRAIN\'S EMOTIONAL ALARM SYSTEM. HATE TRIGGERS A CONSTANT STATE OF BIOLOGICAL AGGRESSION, OVERLOADING THE AMYGDALA AND EXHAUSTING THE ADRENALS. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR RELEASES THE TOXIC ATTACHMENT TO HATE AND RESTORES INNER PEACE. (ESTE PAR CONECTA EL CENTRO SUPRARRENAL CON EL SISTEMA DE ALARMA EMOCIONAL DEL CEREBRO. EL ODIO ACTIVA UN ESTADO CONSTANTE DE AGRESI\\u00d3N BIOL\\u00d3GICA, SOBRECARGANDO LA AM\\u00cdGDALA Y AGOTANDO LAS SUPRARRENALES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR LIBERA EL APEGO T\\u00d3XICO AL ODIO Y RESTAURA LA PAZ INTERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CORTICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND AMYGDALOID MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIMBIC AND EMOTIONAL-REGULATION MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: HEART\\/HEART FOR EMOTIONAL HEALING. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA CORTICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA AMIGDALINO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES L\\u00cdMBICOS Y DE REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL. ASOCIACIONES: CORAZ\\u00d3N\\/CORAZ\\u00d3N PARA LA SANACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1105','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:24:30','2026-04-24 20:24:30'),(3572,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1106,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, OBESITY, BLOATING, GAS. (DIARREA, OBESIDAD, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, GASES.)\",\"paths\":\"PROBLEMS IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT AND THE PELVIC CAVITY. RECTAL BLEEDING, MUCUS AND LOWER LIMB PROBLEMS. (PROBLEMAS EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO Y LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA. SANGRADO RECTAL, MUCOSIDAD Y PROBLEMAS EN LOS MIEMBROS INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - LUMBAR PLEXUS (REVISAR - PLEXO LUMBAR)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT. TARGETS DIARRHEA, OBESITY, BLOATING, AND GAS. (MALESTAR DIGESTIVO. DIRIGIDO A DIARREA, OBESIDAD, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N Y GASES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR IMPACTS THE DIGESTIVE TRACT AND PELVIC CAVITY. BACTERIAL IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO RECTAL BLEEDING, MUCUS, AND LOWER LIMB ISSUES. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR RESTORES BALANCE TO THE PELVIC REGION. (ESTE PAR IMPACTA EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO Y LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA. EL DESEQUILIBRIO BACTERIANO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE PROVOCAR SANGRADO RECTAL, MUCOSIDAD Y PROBLEMAS EN LOS MIEMBROS INFERIORES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR RESTAURA EL EQUILIBRIO EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VESICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND ANAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ELIMINATION AND PELVIC MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: CHECK - LUMBAR PLEXUS. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA VESICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA ANAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ASOCIACIONES: REVISAR - PLEXO LUMBAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1106','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:26:45','2026-04-24 20:26:45'),(3573,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1107,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"BLADDER DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"BLADDER DYSFUNCTION. TARGETS URINARY FREQUENCY, URGENCY, AND INCONTINENCE ISSUES. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA. DIRIGIDO A LA FRECUENCIA URINARIA, URGENCIA Y PROBLEMAS DE INCONTINENCIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL PAIR REGULATES THE MUSCULAR CONTRACTILITY OF THE BLADDER WALLS. DYSFUNCTION HERE OFTEN STEMS FROM A MISCOMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE URINARY SPHINCTER. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR RESTORES PROPER VOLUNTARY CONTROL AND LIQUID RETENTION. (ESTE PAR ESPECIAL REGULA LA CONTRACTILIDAD MUSCULAR DE LAS PAREDES DE LA VEJIGA. LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N AQU\\u00cd SUELE DEBERSE A UNA MALA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y EL ESF\\u00cdNTER URINARIO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR RESTAURA EL CONTROL VOLUNTARIO ADECUADO Y LA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EN: MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VESICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND PELVIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ELIMINATION AND FLUID-REGULATION MINOR CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATIONS: KIDNEY \\/ BLADDER FOR RENAL SYNERGY.\\n\\nES: CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA VESICAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA P\\u00c9LVICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N Y REGULACI\\u00d3N DE FLUIDOS. ASOCIACIONES: RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ VEJIGA PARA SINERGIA RENAL.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1107','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 20:28:32','2026-04-24 20:28:32'),(3574,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1110,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHTLOSS (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS. ADDRESSES METABOLIC IMBALANCES AND UNEXPLAINED CHANGES IN BODY MASS. (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO. ABORDA DESEQUILIBRIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y CAMBIOS INEXPLICABLES EN LA MASA CORPORAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR IMPACTS THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO REGULATE NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND FLUID ELIMINATION. DYSFUNCTION IN THE BLADDER-KIDNEY CIRCUIT CAN DISRUPT THE METABOLIC RATE, LEADING TO RAPID WEIGHT FLUCTUATIONS. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR HELPS STABILIZE THE BIOLOGICAL PROCESSING OF ENERGY. (ESTE PAR IMPACTA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA REGULAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS. LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N EN EL CIRCUITO VEJIGA-RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PUEDE ALTERAR EL RITMO METAB\\u00d3LICO, PROVOCANDO FLUCTUACIONES R\\u00c1PIDAS DE PESO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR AYUDA A ESTABILIZAR EL PROCESAMIENTO BIOL\\u00d3GICO DE LA ENERG\\u00cdA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EN: MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VESICAL MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE METABOLIC AND EL