. EPILEPTIC SEIZURES, ALOPECIA. (TRANSMITIDO POR MOSQUITO. CONVULSIONES EPIL\\u00c9PTICAS, ALOPECIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND MOTOR DISORDERS. TARGETS ACNE, BOILS, ALOPECIA, AND MOTOR FUNCTION ISSUES. (TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL Y MOTORES. DIRIGIDO A ACN\\u00c9, FOR\\u00daNCULOS, ALOPECIA Y PROBLEMAS DE FUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITO BITES. THIS PARASITE CAN TRIGGER EPILEPTIC SEIZURES AND SYSTEMIC SKIN REACTIONS. NEUTRALIZING THIS PAIR HELPS CLEAR THE BLOODSTREAM OF PARASITIC TOXICITY. (TRANSMITIDO POR PICADURAS DE MOSQUITO. ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO PUEDE DESENCADENAR CONVULSIONES EPIL\\u00c9PTICAS Y REACCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PAR AYUDA A LIMPIAR EL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO DE TOXICIDAD PARASITARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL AND DELTOID REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: BRACHIAL NERVE AND RENAL FILTRATION POINTS. ASSOCIATIONS: CHECK - KIDNEY \\/ LIVER.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES RENAL Y DELTOIDES. MICRO CHAKRA: NERVIO BRAQUIAL Y PUNTOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL. ASOCIACIONES: REVISAR - RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ H\\u00cdGADO.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1121','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 21:22:40','2026-04-24 21:22:40'),(3584,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1122,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"TRUE DIABETES MELLITUS. (DIABETES MELLITUS VERDADERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION;THE DIABETIC PATIENT WHOM TAKES INSULIN, HAS TO BE VERY CAREFUL, IN THAT THE SESSION MAY VARY ONES NEED TO ADJUST THEIR DOSAGE AS NEEDED AFTER A SESSION. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N; EL PACIENTE DIAB\\u00c9TICO QUE TOMA INSULINA DEBE TENER MUCHO CUIDADO, YA QUE LA SESI\\u00d3N PUEDE VARIAR SUS NECESIDADES Y PODR\\u00cdA SER NECESAR