 CHAKRA: RENAL AND FACIAL REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: RENAL FILTRATION AND SINUS MUCOSA. ASSOCIATIONS: CHECK - KIDNEY \\/ LIVER.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES RENAL Y FACIAL. MICRO CHAKRA: FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y MUCOSA SINUSAL. ASOCIACIONES: REVISAR - RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ H\\u00cdGADO.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1123','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 21:26:37','2026-04-24 21:26:37'),(3586,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1125,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"IMMUNE SYSTEM DEFICIENCY (DEFICIENCIA DEL SISTEMA INMUNOL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE SYSTEM AXIS (EJE DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNE DEFICIENCY. TARGETS GENERAL WEAKNESS, FREQUENT INFECTIONS, AND LOW ENERGY LEVELS. (DEFICIENCIA INMUNITARIA. DIRIGIDO A DEBILIDAD GENERAL, INFECCIONES FRECUENTES Y BAJOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES A GENERAL DEFICIENCY IN THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS VERTICAL RESET STRENGTHENS RENAL FILTRATION AND BOOSTS THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSES. (ESTE PAR ABORDA UNA DEFICIENCIA GENERAL EN EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO VERTICAL FORTALECE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y POTENCIA LAS DEFENSAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL AND LYMPHATIC REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: RENAL FILTRATION AND CORTICAL POINTS. ASSOCIATIONS: CHECK - KIDNEY \\/ LIVER.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES RENAL Y LINF\\u00c1TICA. MICRO CHAKRA: PUNTOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y CORTICALES. ASOCIACIONES: REVISAR - RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ H\\u00cdGADO.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1125','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.