u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR THE HIV VIRUS. NEUTRALIZING THIS POINT DOES NOT MEAN AN ACTIVE INFECTION IS PRESENT, BUT IT CLEARS THE \\\"HIDING PLACE\\\" TO PREVENT FUTURE RENAL COMPLICATIONS. (ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO PARA EL VIRUS DEL VIH. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PUNTO NO SIGNIFICA QUE HAYA UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N ACTIVA, SINO QUE LIMPIA EL \\\"ESCONDITE\\\" PARA PREVENIR FUTURAS COMPLICACIONES RENALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1127','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 21:34:12','2026-04-24 21:34:12'),(3589,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1128,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL GAS AND NOISES. (GASES INTESTINALES Y RUIDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FERMENTACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL (INTESTINAL FERMENTATION)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT. TARGETS INTESTINAL GAS, RUMBLING NOISES (BORBORYGMUS), AND ABDOMINAL DISTENSION.\\n\\n(MOLESTIAS DIGESTIVAS. DIRIGIDO A GASES INTESTINALES, RUIDOS (BORBORIGMOS) Y DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE IMBALANCE IN THE RENAL-DIGESTIVE AXIS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET REDUCES EXCESS GAS PRODUCTION AND NORMALIZES INTESTINAL TRANSIT.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO EN EL EJE RENAL-DIGESTIVO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO REDUCE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA DE GASES Y NORMALIZA EL TR\\u00c1NSITO INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL AND SACRAL REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: RENAL FILTRATION AND SACRAL PLEXUS POINTS. ASSOCIATIONS: CHECK - KIDNEY \\/ CAPSULE.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES RENAL Y SACRA. MICRO CHAKRA: PUNTOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y PLEXO SACRO. ASOCIACIONES: REVISAR - RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ C\\u00c1PSULA.\"}','https://api.