026-04-24 21:56:17'),(3595,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1134,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"KIDNEY STONES, RENAL COLIC OF THE UTETER AND URNARY TRACT. (C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, C\\u00d3LICO RENAL DEL UR\\u00c9TER Y DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SUPRASPINATUS AND SCAPULA (REVISAR - SUPRAESPINOSO Y ESC\\u00c1PULA)\"}','{\"origins\":\"URINARY CALCULI AXIS (EJE DE C\\u00c1LCULOS URINARIOS\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES KIDNEY STONES AND RENAL COLIC WITHIN THE URETER AND URINARY TRACT. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS DISLODGE OBSTRUCTIONS AND REDUCE INFLAMMATION IN THE URINARY PATHWAY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES Y EL C\\u00d3LICO RENAL DEL UR\\u00c9TER Y DEL TRACTO URINARIO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A DESALOJAR OBSTRUCCIONES Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LA V\\u00cdA URINARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL AND PELVIC REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: RENAL FILTRATION AND URETERAL SMOOTH MUSCLE. ASSOCIATIONS: CHECK - SUPRASPINATUS AND SCAPULA.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES RENAL Y P\\u00c9LVICA. MICRO CHAKRA: FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y M\\u00daSCULO LISO URETERAL. ASOCIACIONES: REVISAR - SUPRAESPINOSO Y ESC\\u00c1PULA.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1134','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 21:57:42','2026-04-24 21:57:42'),(3596,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1135,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DIALYSIS (DI\\u00c1LISIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RENAL ELIMINATION AXIS (EJE DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"CRITICAL URINARY DYSFUNCTION. TARGETS SEVERE FILTRATION ISSUES, CHRONIC INFLAMMATION, AND THE NEED FOR EXTERNAL RENAL SUPPORT.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N URINARIA CR\\u00cd