IZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BALANCED FLOW BETWEEN RENAL FILTRATION AND LOWER INTESTINAL REGULATION, CLEARING SYMPTOMS OF INTERNAL FERMENTATION.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA DISFUNCIONES COMPLEJAS DENTRO DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO EQUILIBRADO ENTRE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL INFERIOR, ELIMINANDO LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE FERMENTACI\\u00d3N INTERNA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL REGION. MICRO CHAKRA: SUPERIOR AND INFERIOR RENAL CORTEX.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGI\\u00d3N RENAL. MICRO CHAKRA: CORTEZA RENAL SUPERIOR E INFERIOR.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1136','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 22:01:32','2026-04-24 22:01:32'),(3598,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1137,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANGER, AGGRESSIVENESS, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS DUE TO LIVER PROBLEMS. GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS, UROGENITAL DISORDERS. HIV. (IRA, AGRESIVIDAD, TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DEBIDOS A PROBLEMAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS, TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES. VIH)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC AXIS (EJE PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL AND SYSTEMIC IMBALANCE. TARGETS ANGER, AGGRESSIVENESS, AND PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS. (DESEQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICO. DIRIGIDO A LA IRA, LA AGRESIVIDAD Y TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES DISORDERS STEMMING FROM LIVER PROBLEMS THAT MANIFEST AS EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY. IT ALSO IMPACTS GASTROINTESTINAL, RESPIRATORY, AND UROGENITAL SYSTEMS, AND IS ASSOCIATED WITH HIV. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS STABILIZE SYSTEMIC FUNCTIONS AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA TRASTORNOS DERIVADOS DE PROBLEMAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL. TAMBI\\u00c9N IMPACTA LOS SISTEMAS GASTROINTESTINAL, RESPIRATORIO Y UROGENITAL, Y EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO CON EL VIH. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A ESTABILIZAR LAS FUNCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL REGION. MICRO CHAKRA: SUPERIOR AND INFERIOR RENAL CORTEX. ASSOCIATIONS: CHECK - LIVER \\/ KIDNEY.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGI\\u00d3N RENAL. MICRO CHAKRA: CORTEZA RENAL SUPERIOR E INFERIOR. ASOCIACIONES: REVISAR - H\\u00cdGADO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1137','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 22:02:48','2026-04-24 22:02:48'),(3599,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1138,'{\"paths\":\"UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTION, PSYCHOSOMATIC OF THE KIDNEYS DISORDER. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL, TRASTORNO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTION AND PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS OF THE KIDNEYS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES PHYSICAL TENSION IN THE CRANIAL REGION CAUSED BY RENAL IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y LOS TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N CRANEAL CAUSADA POR DESEQUILIBRIOS RENALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL AND TEMPORAL REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: RENAL FILTRATION AND TEMPORAL LOBE SENSORY POINTS.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES REN