ternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"KNEE AXIS (EJE DE LA RODILLA)\",\"symptoms\":\"JOINT DISCOMFORT. TARGETS LOCALIZED KNEE PAIN, STIFFNESS, AND LIMITED MOBILITY.\\n\\n(MOLESTIAS ARTICULARES. DIRIGIDO A DOLOR DE RODILLA LOCALIZADO, RIGIDEZ Y MOVILIDAD LIMITADA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR RELIEVES KNEE PAIN BY NEUTRALIZING LOCALIZED TENSION AND INFLAMMATION WITHIN THE JOINT STRUCTURE. IT IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING FLUIDITY IN MOVEMENT AND STABILIZING THE PHYSICAL FOUNDATION OF THE LOWER LIMBS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ALIVIA EL DOLOR DE RODILLA AL NEUTRALIZAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DE LA ESTRUCTURA ARTICULAR. ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA FLUIDEZ EN EL MOVIMIENTO Y ESTABILIZAR LA BASE F\\u00cdSICA DE LOS MIEMBROS INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: KNEE REGION. MICRO CHAKRA: PATELLAR AND SYNOVIAL FLUID POINTS.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGI\\u00d3N DE LA RODILLA. MICRO CHAKRA: PUNTOS PATELARES Y DEL L\\u00cdQUIDO SINOVIAL.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1140','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 22:29:43','2026-04-24 22:29:43'),(3602,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1141,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FEARS (MIEDOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC AXIS (EJE PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP-SEATED FEARS. TARGETS PHOBIAS, FEELINGS OF INSTABILITY, AND THE INABILITY TO MOVE FORWARD IN LIFE.\\n\\n(MIEDOS PROFUNDOS. DIRIGIDO A FOBIAS, SENTIMIENTOS DE INESTABILIDAD Y LA INCAPACIDAD DE AVANZAR EN LA VIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR IS RELATED TO THE EMOTIONAL MANIFESTATION OF FEARS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS RELEASE PSYCHOSOMATIC TENSION STORED IN THE JOINTS, ENABLING THE INDIVIDUAL TO OVERCOME MENTAL BLOCKAGES AND REGAIN THEIR SENSE OF SECURITY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR EST\\u00c1 RELACIONADO CON LA MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL DE LOS MIEDOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA ALMACENADA EN LAS ARTICULACIONES, PERMITIENDO AL INDIVIDUO SUPERAR BLOQUEOS MENTALES Y RECUPERAR SU SENTIDO DE SEGURIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: KNEE REGION. MICRO CHAKRA: PATELLAR (R\\u00d3TULA) AND SYNOVIAL NERVE POINTS.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) \\u2014 ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGI\\u00d3N DE LA RODILLA. MICRO CHAKRA: PUNTOS PATELARES (R\\u00d3TULA) Y DEL NERVIO SINOVIAL.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1141','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 22:31:18','2026-04-24 22:31:18'),(3603,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1142,'{\"symptoms\":\"AFFECTS BONE MARROW AND PRODUCES ATROPHY. NERVE DISORDERS, BACK PAIN, INFERTILITY. (VIRUS DE LA POLIO\\n\\nAFECTA LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA Y PRODUCE ATROFIA. TRASTORNOS NERVIOSOS, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"MAY BE DUE TO POLIO VACCINE. SCIATIC NEUROPATHY. PARALYSIS. AUTISM. (PUEDE DEBERSE A LA VACUNA DE LA POLIO. NEUROPAT\\u00cdA CI\\u00c1TICA. PAR\\u00c1LISIS. AUTISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"NERVE AND BONE MARROW DISORDERS. TARGETS ATROPHY, BACK PAIN, INFERTILITY, AND SYSTEMIC NERVOUS INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS NERVIOSOS Y DE LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA. DIRIGIDO A ATROFIA, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, INFERTILIDAD E INESTABILIDAD NERVIOSA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE RESIDUAL EFFECTS OF THE POLIO VIRUS OR VACCINE. IT IS LINKED TO SCIATIC NEUROPATHY, PARALYSIS, AND NEURODEVELOPMENTAL ISSUES LIKE AUTISM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS RESTORE NERVE CONDUCTION IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS EFECTOS RESID