"paths\":\"INFECTED BY SEXUAL CONTACT. WOMEN MAYBE INFECTED BY TOILET SEATS WHEN SITTING. PELVIC INFLAMMATION. (INFECTADO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL. LAS MUJERES PUEDEN INFECTARSE POR ASIENTOS DE INODORO AL SENTARSE. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL AND RECTAL SYMPTOMS, HEAVY BLEEDING. SMELLY DISCHARGE, VAGINAL ITCHING, VULVOVAGINITIS, AND URETHRITIS IN MEN. PAINFUL INTERCOURSE AND URINATION. DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, AND FALSE DIABETES.(S\\u00cdNTOMAS VAGINALES Y RECTALES, SANGRADO ABUNDANTE. SECRECI\\u00d3N CON MAL OLOR, PICAZ\\u00d3N VAGINAL, VULVOVAGINITIS Y URETRITIS EN HOMBRES. RELACIONES SEXUALES Y MICCI\\u00d3N DOLOROSAS. TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, GASES Y FALSA DIABETES.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED VIA SEXUAL CONTACT. RISK OF INFECTION FOR WOMEN FROM CONTAMINATED SURFACES SUCH AS TOILET SEATS. ASSOCIATED WITH PELVIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(INFECTADO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL. LAS MUJERES PUEDEN INFECTARSE POR ASIENTOS DE INODORO AL SENTARSE. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1154','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 22:49:57','2026-04-24 22:49:57'),(3615,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1157,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANOREXIA, BIPOLAR, COMPULSIVENESS, MANIAS, PHOBIAS. (ANOREXIA, BIPOLARIDAD, COMPULSIVIDAD, MAN\\u00cdAS, FOBIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DIGESTIVE-PSYCHOLOGICAL AXIS (EJE DIGESTIVO-PSICOL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANOREXIA, BIPOLAR, COMPULSIVENESS, MANIAS, PHOBIAS.\\n\\n(ANOREXIA, BIPOLARIDAD, COMPULSIVIDAD, MAN\\u00cdAS, FOBIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS THAT MANIFEST THROUGH THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS STABILIZE EMOTIONAL COMPULSIVITY AND PSYCHOLOGICAL IMBALANCES THAT AFFECT EATING BEHAVIORS AND MENTAL CLARITY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A ESTABILIZAR LA COMPULSIVIDAD EMOCIONAL Y LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS QUE AFECTAN LAS CONDUCTAS ALIMENTARIAS Y LA CLARIDAD MENTAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) \\u2014 PANCREAS\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: GASTRIC AND ILEOCECAL REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: STOMACH MUCOSA AND ILEOCECAL VALVE SENSORS.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) \\u2014 P\\u00c1NCREAS\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES G\\u00c1STRICA E ILEOCECAL. MICRO CHAKRA: MUCOSA ESTOMACAL Y SENSORES DE LA V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1157','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 22:52:04','2026-04-24 22:52:04'),(3616,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1158,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"REGULATES OVULATION (REGULA LA OVULACI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"OVULATION AXIS (EJE DE OVULACI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"MENSTRUAL IRREGULARITIES. TARGETS DISCOMFORT DURING THE CYCLE AND HORMONAL IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(IRREGULARIDADES MENSTRUALES. DIRIGIDO A MOLESTIAS DURANTE EL CICLO Y DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR REGULATES OVULATION BY STABILIZING THE ENERGETIC COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM AND THE RENAL FILTRATION SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET PROMOTES A BALANCED HORMONAL FLOW AND SUPPORTS REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR REGULA LA OVULACI\\u00d3N AL ESTABILIZAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR Y EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO PROMUEVE UN FLUJO HORMONAL EQUILIBRADO Y APOYA LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARY\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: PELVIC AND RENAL REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: OVARIAN FOLLICLE AND RENAL CORTEX.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARIO\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES P\\u00c9LVICA Y RENAL. MICRO CHAKRA: FOL\\u00cdCULO OV\\u00c1RICO Y CORTEZA RENAL.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1158','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 22:53:13','2026-04-24 22:53:13'),(3617,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1159,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LOSS OF THE LIBIDO, AND FERTILITY PROBLEMS, HEAVY MENSTRUAL CYCLES. (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE LA LIBIDO Y PROBLEMAS DE FERTILIDAD, CICLOS MENSTRUALES ABUNDANTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - STERNUM\\/ADRENALS (VERIFICAR - ESTERN\\u00d3N\\/GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES)\"}','{\"origins\":\"HORMONAL AXIS (EJE HORMONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"LOSS OF LIBIDO, FERTILITY PROBLEMS, AND HEAVY MENSTRUAL CYCLES.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE LA LIBIDO, PROBLEMAS DE FERTILIDAD Y CICLOS MENSTRUALES ABUNDANTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION WITHIN THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS REGULATE OVARIAN FUNCTION, BALANCE ESTROGEN LEVELS, AND RESTORE VITALITY TO THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR DENTRO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A REGULAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA, EQUILIBRAR LOS NIVELES DE ESTR\\u00d3GENO Y RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK: STERNUM \\/ ADRENALS. MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARY\\/ENDOCRINE. MICRO CHAKRA: OVARIAN CORTEX.\\n\\n(REVISAR: ESTERN\\u00d3N \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. CHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARIO\\/ENDOCRINO. MICRO CHAKRA: CORTEZA OV\\u00c1RICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1159','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:23:26','2026-04-24 23:23:26'),(3618,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1160,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ORGANISM THAT LIVES IN ONES WITH CHRONIC DISEASES AND WEAKENED IMMUNE SYSTEMS. (ORGANISM THAT LIVES IN ONES WITH CHRONIC DISEASES AND WEAKENED IMMUNE SYSTEMS. \\u2192 **ORGANISMO QUE VIVE EN PERSONAS CON ENFERMEDADES CR\\u00d3NICAS Y SISTEMAS INMUNOL\\u00d3GICOS DEBILITADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"TARGETS CHRONIC FATIGUE, RECURRENT URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTIs), AND PELVIC DISCOMFORT. OFTEN FOUND IN INDIVIDUALS WITH LONG-TERM ILLNESS OR COMPROMISED IMMUNITY.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO A LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, INFECCIONES RECURRENTES DEL TRACTO URINARIO (ITU) Y MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO. SE ENCUENTRA A MENUDO EN PERSONAS CON ENFERMEDADES A LARGO PLAZO O INMUNIDAD COMPROMETIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL PATHOGEN THRIVES IN WEAKENED IMMUNE ENVIRONMENTS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE OPPORTUNISTIC ORGANISM, REDUCING THE BURDEN ON THE ADRENAL GLANDS AND RESTORING VITALITY TO THE REPRODUCTIVE-RENAL AXIS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO BACTERIANO PROSPERA EN ENTORNOS INMUNITARIOS DEBILITADOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR EL ORGANISMO OPORTUNISTA, REDUCIENDO LA CARGA SOBRE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES Y RESTAURANDO LA VITALIDAD DEL EJE REPRODUCTOR-RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. MICRO CHAKRA: OVARIAN CORTEX AND ADRENAL MEDULLA.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE SACRO (SVADHISTHANA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). MICRO CHAKRA: CORTEZA OV\\u00c1RICA Y M\\u00c9DULA SUPRARRENAL.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1160','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:30:01','2026-04-24 23:30:01'),(3619,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1161,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INDICATES PREGNANCY. (INDICATES PREGNANCY. \\u2192 (INDICA EMBARAZO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION; CAN PRODUCE ABORTION. WHEN APPLIED TO ONE PREGNANT. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N; PUEDE PRODUCIR ABORTO CUANDO SE APLICA A UNA MUJER EMBARAZADA.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"OVARIAN AND UTERINE ENDOMETRIUM (ENDOMETRIO OV\\u00c1RICO Y UTERINO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INDICATES PREGNANCY. USED TO CONFIRM THE GESTATIONAL STATE.\\n\\n(INDICA EMBARAZO. UTILIZADO PARA CONFIRMAR EL ESTADO GESTACIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR DETECTS THE ENERGETIC VIBRATION ASSOCIATED WITH PREGNANCY. IT REFLECTS THE SYNERGY BETWEEN THE OVARIES AND THE UTERUS DURING GESTATION. NEUTRALIZING OR APPLYING MAGNETS HERE REQUIRES EXTREME CAUTION AS IT INTERACTS DIRECTLY WITH THE DEVELOPING REPRODUCTIVE ENVIRONMENT.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR DETECTA LA VIBRACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ASOCIADA CON EL EMBARAZO. REFLEJA LA SINERGIA ENTRE LOS OVARIOS Y EL \\u00daTERO DURANTE LA GESTACI\\u00d3N. NEUTRALIZAR O APLICAR IMANES AQU\\u00cd REQUIERE PRECAUCI\\u00d3N EXTREMA YA QUE INTERACT\\u00daA DIRECTAMENTE CON EL ENTORNO REPRODUCTIVO EN DESARROLLO.).)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE OVARIAN MICRO CHAKRA AND UTERINE MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE PELVIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AXIS TO PREVENT NEUROLOGICAL COLLAPSE. CAUTION: CAN PRODUCE ABORTION WHEN APPLIED TO ONE PREGNANT.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA OVARICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA UTERINO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES P\\u00c9LVICOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL PARA PREVENIR EL COLAPSO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO. PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: PUEDE PRODUCIR ABORTO CUANDO SE APLICA A UNA MUJER EMBARAZADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1161','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:36:43','2026-04-24 23:36:43'),(3620,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1162,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED THROUGH ORAL SEX. ALTERATIONS OF THE SPERMATIC FLUID. CAN HAVE GENETIC DAMAGE THAT EFFECTS THE FETUS. ( TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SEXO ORAL. ALTERACIONES DEL L\\u00cdQUIDO ESPERM\\u00c1TICO. PUEDE TENER DA\\u00d1O GEN\\u00c9TICO QUE AFECTA AL FETO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SUPRASPINATUS         CHECK - CORPUS CALLOSUM (REVISAR - SUPRAESPINOSO         REVISAR - CUERPO CALLOSO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ALTERATIONS IN SPERMATIC FLUID AND POTENTIAL GENETIC IMPACT. TARGETS THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM\\u2019S INTEGRITY AND VIRULENCE OF THE MYCOBACTERIUM.\\n\\n(ALTERACIONES DEL L\\u00cdQUIDO ESPERM\\u00c1TICO E IMPACTO GEN\\u00c9TICO POTENCIAL. SE DIRIGE A LA INTEGRIDAD DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR Y LA VIRULENCIA DE LA MICOBACTERIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED THROUGH ORAL SEX. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES ALTERATIONS OF THE SPERMATIC FLUID THAT CAN LEAD TO GENETIC DAMAGE AFFECTING THE FETUS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS CLEAR THE PATHOGEN FROM THE REPRODUCTIVE DUCTS TO PREVENT LONG-TERM HEREDITARY COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SEXO ORAL. ESTE PAR ABORDA LAS ALTERACIONES DEL L\\u00cdQUIDO ESPERM\\u00c1TICO QUE PUEDEN PROVOCAR DA\\u00d1OS GEN\\u00c9TICOS QUE AFECTAN AL FETO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO DE LOS CONDUCTOS REPRODUCTORES PARA PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES HEREDITARIAS A LARGO PLAZO\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPERMATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE INGUINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE REPRODUCTIVE AXIS. CHECK: SUPRASPINATUS AND CORPUS CALLOSUM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPERM\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES INGUINALES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE REPRODUCTOR. REVISAR: SUPRAESPINOSO Y CUERPO CALLOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1162','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:38:02','2026-04-24 23:38:02'),(3621,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1163,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN HIVES, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA, VOMITING, HEADACHES. (RONCHAS EN LA PIEL, DIARREA, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA.)\",\"paths\":\"SKIN HIVES, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA, VOMITING, HEADACHES. (RONCHAS EN LA PIEL, DIARREA, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN HIVES, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA, VOMITING, AND HEADACHES. MAY ALSO CAUSE ABDOMINAL PAIN AND URTICARIA.\\n\\n(RONCHAS EN LA PIEL, DIARREA, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS Y DOLORES DE CABEZA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CAUSAR DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y URTICARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PRESENCE OF THE ENDOLIMAX NANA PARASITE, WHICH OFTEN COLONIZES THE LARGE INTESTINE BUT CAN TRIGGER SYSTEMIC ALLERGIC REACTIONS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STRENGTHENS THE IMMUNE RESPONSE BY LINKING THE SPLEEN\'S FILTRATION WITH THE BLADDER\'S EXCRETION TO ELIMINATE TOXIC BY-PRODUCTS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA PRESENCIA DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO ENDOLIMAX NANA, QUE A MENUDO COLONIZA EL INTESTINO GRUESO PERO PUEDE DESENCADENAR REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO FORTALECE LA RESPUESTA INMUNE AL VINCULAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO CON LA EXCRECI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA PARA ELIMINAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS T\\u00d3XICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND VESICAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AXIS TO PREVENT NEUROLOGICAL COLLAPSE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA VESICAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ABDOMINALES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL PARA PREVENIR EL COLAPSO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1163','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:39:51','2026-04-24 23:39:51'),(3622,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1164,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"TRUE LEUKEMIA. (LEUCEMIA VERDADERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEMATOPOIETIC SYSTEM AND BONE MARROW (SISTEMA HEMATOPOY\\u00c9TICO Y M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR IS ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"TRUE LEUKEMIA.\\\" IT ADDRESSES THE DYSREGULATION OF THE HEMATOPOIETIC SYSTEM WHERE THE OVERPRODUCTION OF ABNORMAL WHITE BLOOD CELLS OCCURS, LEADING TO IMMUNE FAILURE AND SYSTEMIC DEPLETION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS REGULATE CELLULAR INTEGRITY AND BLOOD PRODUCTION.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA CON LA \\\"LEUCEMIA VERDADERA.\\\" ABORDA LA DESREGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA HEMATOPOY\\u00c9TICO DONDE OCURRE LA SOBREPRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS ANORMALES, LO QUE LLEVA A LA FALLA INMUNOL\\u00d3GICA Y AL AGOTAMIENTO SIST\\u00c9MICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A REGULAR LA INTEGRIDAD CELULAR Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE SANGRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE HEMATOPOIETIC-IMMUNE AXIS TO PREVENT CELLULAR DEGENERATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ABDOMINALES SUPERIORES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE HEMATOPOY\\u00c9TICO-INMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1164','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:49:10','2026-04-24 23:49:10'),(3623,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1165,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SLOTH (PEREZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPLENIC PARENCHYMA AND HYPOTHALAMIC NUCLEI (PAR\\u00c9NQUIMA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y N\\u00daCLEOS HIPOTAL\\u00c1MICOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"SLOTH, LACK OF MOTIVATION, APATHY, AND METABOLIC SLOWNESS. TARGETS INDIVIDUALS STRUGGLING WITH STAGNATION, SLEEPINESS, OR AN INABILITY TO INITIATE ACTION.\\n\\n(PEREZA, FALTA DE MOTIVACI\\u00d3N, APAT\\u00cdA Y LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA. DIRIGIDO A PERSONAS QUE LUCHAN CON EL ESTANCAMIENTO, LA SOMNOLENCIA O LA INCAPACIDAD DE INICIAR LA ACCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"SLOTH (PEREZA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL AND BIOCHEMICAL DRIVERS OF LETHARGY. BY BALANCING THE SPLEEN\\u2019S VITAL BLOOD RESERVES WITH THE HYPOTHALAMUS\'S REGULATORY CONTROL OVER MOTIVATION AND ENERGY EXPENDITURE, IT PURGES MENTAL STAGNATION AND RESTORES PROACTIVE VITALITY.\\n\\n(PEREZA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS MOTORES EMOCIONALES Y BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL LETARGO. AL EQUILIBRAR LAS RESERVAS VITALES DE SANGRE DEL BAZO CON EL CONTROL REGULADOR DEL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO SOBRE LA MOTIVACI\\u00d3N Y EL GASTO DE ENERG\\u00cdA, PURGA EL ESTANCAMIENTO MENTAL Y RESTAURA LA VITALIDAD PROACTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND HYPOTHALAMIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL AND CRANIAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE NEURO-IMMUNE AXIS TO PREVENT EMOTIONAL AND PHYSICAL LETHARGY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA HIPOTAL\\u00c1MICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ABDOMINALES SUPERIORES Y CRANEALES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE NEUROINMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR EL LETARGO EMOCIONAL Y F\\u00cdSICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1165','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:51:08','2026-04-24 23:51:08'),(3624,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1166,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LAZINESS (PEREZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPLENIC PARENCHYMA AND HYPOTHALAMIC NUCLEI (PAR\\u00c9NQUIMA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y N\\u00daCLEOS HIPOTAL\\u00c1MICOS\",\"symptoms\":\"LACK OF VITALITY, MENTAL FOG, PROCRASTINATION, AND LOW METABOLIC DRIVE. TARGETS INDIVIDUALS EXPERIENCING DEEP EMOTIONAL STAGNATION and PHYSICAL FATIGUE.\\n\\n(FALTA DE VITALIDAD, NEBLINA MENTAL, PROCRASTINACI\\u00d3N Y BAJO IMPULSO METAB\\u00d3LICO. DIRIGIDO A PERSONAS QUE EXPERIMENTAN UN PROFUNDO ESTANCAMIENTO EMOCIONAL Y FATIGA F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"paths\":\"LAZINESS (PEREZA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL AND BIOCHEMICAL DRIVERS OF LETHARGY. BY BALANCING THE SPLEEN\\u2019S VITAL BLOOD RESERVES WITH THE HYPOTHALAMUS\'S REGULATORY CONTROL OVER MOTIVATION AND ENERGY EXPENDITURE, IT PURGES MENTAL STAGNATION AND RESTORES PROACTIVE VITALITY.\\n\\n(PEREZA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS MOTORES EMOCIONALES Y BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL LETARGO. AL EQUILIBRAR LAS RESERVAS VITALES DE SANGRE DEL BAZO CON EL CONTROL REGULADOR DEL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO SOBRE LA MOTIVACI\\u00d3N Y EL GASTO DE ENERG\\u00cdA, PURGA EL ESTANCAMIENTO MENTAL Y RESTAURA LA VITALIDAD PROACTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND HYPOTHALAMIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL AND CRANIAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE NEURO-IMMUNE AXIS TO PREVENT EMOTIONAL AND PHYSICAL LETHARGY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA HIPOTAL\\u00c1MICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ABDOMINALES SUPERIORES Y CRANEALES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE NEUROINMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR EL LETARGO EMOCIONAL Y F\\u00cdSICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1166','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:53:16','2026-04-24 23:53:16'),(3625,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1167,'{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY DAIRY PRODUCTS. HEPATITIS L, ANEMIA. DETERIORATED PLATELETS TRAVEL THROUGH THE SPLEEN INTO WHITE BLOOD CELLS, INFERTILITY. (TRANSMITIDO POR PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. HEPATITIS L, ANEMIA. PLAQUETAS DETERIORADAS VIAJAN A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL BAZO HACIA LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY DAIRY PRODUCTS. THIS BACTERIA CAUSES ANEMIA AND HEPATITIS L. AS PLATELETS DETERIORATE, THEY TRAVEL THROUGH THE SPLEEN INTO WHITE BLOOD CELLS, COMPROMISING THE HEMATOPOIETIC SYSTEM AND REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. ESTA BACTERIA CAUSA ANEMIA Y HEPATITIS L. A MEDIDA QUE LAS PLAQUETAS SE DETERIORAN, VIAJAN A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL BAZO HACIA LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, COMPROMETIENDO EL SISTEMA HEMATOPOY\\u00c9TICO Y LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ABDOMINAL AND RENAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE HEMATO-RENAL AXIS TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ABDOMINALES Y RENALES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE HEMATO-RENAL PARA PREVENIR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1167','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:54:40','2026-04-24 23:54:40'),(3626,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1168,'{\"origins\":\"BRUCELLOSIS\",\"symptoms\":\"ASTHMA, FATIGUE, MUSCLE ACHES, JOINT PAIN, SACRAL AND HIP PAIN, ARTHRITIS, CHRONIC BACK PAIN, INSOMNIA, HEADACHES, HIGH FEVER, NIGHT SWEATS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, CONSTIPATION, COLITIS, SEXUAL AND LABOR APATHY. (ASMA, FATIGA, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR ARTICULAR, DOLOR SACRO Y DE CADERA, ARTRITIS, DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO DE ESPALDA, INSOMNIO, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE ALTA, SUDORACIONES NOCTURNAS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, COLITIS, APAT\\u00cdA SEXUAL Y LABORAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED MILK PRODUCTS. MALTA FEVER. AFFECTS THE SPLEEN. CHANGES IN BLOOD CELLS, LEUKOCYTOSIS. LYMPHOMAS. (TRANSMITIDO POR PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS. FIEBRE DE MALTA. AFECTA EL BAZO. CAMBIOS EN LAS C\\u00c9LULAS SANGU\\u00cdNEAS, LEUCOCITOSIS. LINFOMAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BRUCELLOSIS (BRUCELOSIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"ASTHMA, FATIGUE, JOINT AND SACRAL PAIN, ARTHRITIS, AND CHRONIC BACK PAIN. ALSO ADDRESSES INSOMNIA, NIGHT SWEATS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, AND LABOR APATHY.\\n\\n(ASMA, FATIGA, DOLOR ARTICULAR Y SACRO, ARTRITIS Y DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO DE ESPALDA. TAMBI\\u00c9N ABORDA EL INSOMNIO, SUDORACIONES NOCTURNAS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS Y APAT\\u00cdA LABORAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED DAIRY. KNOWN AS MALTA FEVER, THIS PATHOGEN TARGETS THE SPLEEN AND LIVER, TRIGGERING LEUKOCYTOSIS AND POTENTIALLY LEADING TO LYMPHOMAS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS CLEAR THE BLOOD CELLS AND RESTORES HEPATIC-SPLENIC FILTRATION.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS. CONOCIDA COMO FIEBRE DE MALTA, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE DIRIGE AL BAZO Y AL H\\u00cdGADO, DESENCADENANDO LEUCOCITOSIS Y PUDIENDO PROVOCAR LINFOMAS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A DEPURAR LAS C\\u00c9LULAS SANGU\\u00cdNEAS Y RESTAURA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICO-ESPL\\u00c9NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND HEPATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL AND RIGHT HYPOCHONDRIUM MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE HEMATOPOIETIC-IMMUNE AXIS TO PREVENT NEUROLOGICAL COLLAPSE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA HEP\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR Y DEL HIPOCONDRIO DERECHO. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE HEMATOPOY\\u00c9TICO-INMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR EL COLAPSO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1168','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:56:03','2026-04-24 23:56:03'),(3627,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1169,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RECURRENT RESPIRATORY ISSUES, LUNG CONGESTION, AND CHRONIC INFECTIONS. ACTS AS A HIDING PLACE FOR VARIOUS BACTERIAL PATHOGENS THAT TRIGGER SYSTEMIC RELAPSES.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS RECURRENTES, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR E INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS. ACT\\u00daA COMO UN ESCONDITE PARA DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS BACTERIANOS QUE PROVOCAN RECA\\u00cdDAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR PAIR ADDRESSES BACTERIA THAT RETREAT TO THE SPLEEN AND LUNGS TO ESCAPE IMMUNE DETECTION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE TRAPPED PATHOGENS INTO THE BLOODSTREAM WHERE THEY CAN BE PROPERLY FILTERED BY THE SPLEEN AND ELIMINATED, PREVENTING CHRONIC RESPIRATORY CYCLES.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR RESERVORIO ABORDA LAS BACTERIAS QUE SE REFUGIAN EN EL BAZO Y LOS PULMONES PARA EVITAR LA DETECCI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS ATRAPADOS EN EL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO DONDE PUEDEN SER FILTRADOS ADECUADAMENTE POR EL BAZO Y ELIMINADOS, PREVINIENDO CICLOS RESPIRATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND PULMONARY MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND INTERCOSTAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE RESPIRATORY-IMMUNE AXIS TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PULMONAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TOR\\u00c1CICOS E INTERCOSTALES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE RESPIRATORIO-INMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1169','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:57:40','2026-04-24 23:57:40'),(3628,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1170,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WARTS (VERRUGAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPLENIC TISSUE AND PANCREATIC TAIL (TEJIDO ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS)\",\"symptoms\":\"APPEARANCE OF WARTS, SKIN ALTERATIONS, AND POTENTIAL DIGESTIVE IMBALANCES. TARGETS VIRAL LOADS THAT MANIFEST PHYSICALLY ON THE EPIDERMIS.\\n\\n(APARICI\\u00d3N DE VERRUGAS, ALTERACIONES EN LA PIEL Y POSIBLES DESEQUILIBRIOS DIGESTIVOS. SE DIRIGE A CARGAS VIRALES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN F\\u00cdSICAMENTE EN LA EPIDERMIS.)\",\"paths\":\"WARTS (VERRUGAS). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL ROOT CAUSE OF VERRUCOUS GROWTHS. BY LINKING THE IMMUNE FILTRATION OF THE SPLEEN WITH THE ENZYMATIC REACH OF THE PANCREAS TIP, IT NEUTRALIZES THE VIRUS RESPONSIBLE FOR SKIN LESIONS AND RESTORES EPITHELIAL INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(VERRUGAS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA CAUSA VIRAL RA\\u00cdZ DE LOS CRECIMIENTOS VERRUGOSOS. AL VINCULAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA DEL BAZO CON EL ALCANCE ENZIM\\u00c1TICO DE LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, NEUTRALIZA EL VIRUS RESPONSABLE DE LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y RESTAURA LA INTEGRIDAD EPITELIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND PANCREATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AXIS TO PREVENT NEUROLOGICAL COLLAPSE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PANCRE\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL PARA PREVENIR EL COLAPSO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1170','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-24 23:59:36','2026-04-24 23:59:36'),(3629,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1172,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BLOOD DISORDERS, ABNORMAL BLOOD CLOTTING FACTORS. INFLAMMATION OF THE SPLEEN. ANEMIA AND POLYCYTHEMIA. (TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE, FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N ANORMALES. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO. ANEMIA Y POLICITEMIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPLENIC PARENCHYMA AND TRABECULAE (PAR\\u00c9NQUIMA Y TRAB\\u00c9CULAS ESPL\\u00c9NICAS)\",\"symptoms\":\"BLOOD DISORDERS, ABNORMAL BLOOD CLOTTING FACTORS, AND INFLAMMATION OF THE SPLEEN. TARGETS ANEMIA AND POLYCYTHEMIA.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE, FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N ANORMALES E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO. DIRIGIDO A LA ANEMIA Y LA POLICITEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE MECHANICAL DYSFUNCTION OF THE SPLEEN AS THE BODY\'S PRIMARY BLOOD FILTER. IT REGULATES THE PRODUCTION AND RECYCLING OF RED BLOOD CELLS AND CLOTTING FACTORS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET REDUCES SPLENOMEGALY (INFLAMMATION) AND STABILIZES BLOOD VISCOSITY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA DEL BAZO COMO EL FILTRO SANGU\\u00cdNEO PRIMARIO DEL CUERPO. REGULA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N Y EL RECICLAJE DE GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS Y FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO REDUCE LA ESPLENOMEGALIA (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N) Y ESTABILIZA LA VISCOSIDAD SANGU\\u00cdNEA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LEFT HYPOCHONDRIUM MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE HEMATOPOIETIC-IMMUNE AXIS TO PREVENT CELLULAR DEGENERATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL HIPOCONDRIO IZQUIERDO. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE HEMATOPOY\\u00c9TICO-INMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1172','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:01:24','2026-04-25 00:01:24'),(3630,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1173,'{\"paths\":\"ABSORPTION OF NUTRIENTS ARE BLOCKED IN THE SMALL INTESTINE; KILLING THE EPITHELIAL CELLS NEEDED FOR MOTION AND NUTRIENTS. (LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES EST\\u00c1 BLOQUEADA EN EL INTESTINO DELGADO; DESTRUYE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS EPITELIALES NECESARIAS PARA EL MOVIMIENTO Y LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"ABSORPTION OF NUTRIENTS ARE BLOCKED IN THE SMALL INTESTINE; KILLING THE EPITHELIAL CELLS NEEDED FOR MOTION AND NUTRIENTS. THIS VIRAL PATHOGEN TARGETS THE DIGESTIVE LINING, LEADING TO MALABSORPTION AND SYSTEMIC EXHAUSTION.\\n\\n(LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES EST\\u00c1 BLOQUEADA EN EL INTESTINO DELGADO; DESTRUYE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS EPITELIALES NECESARIAS PARA EL MOVIMIENTO Y LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO VIRAL ATACA EL REVESTIMIENTO DIGESTIVO, LO QUE PROVOCA MALABSORCI\\u00d3N Y AGOTAMIENTO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND SUPRARENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ADRENAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AXIS TO PREVENT NEUROLOGICAL COLLAPSE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA SUPRARRENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES SUPRARRENALES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL PARA PREVENIR EL COLAPSO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1173','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:02:21','2026-04-25 00:02:21'),(3631,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1174,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC COUGH, THROAT IRRITATION, AND PERSISTENT RESPIRATORY DISCOMFORT. ACTS AS A LATENT HIDING PLACE FOR VARIOUS BACTERIAL STRAINS THAT CAN TRIGGER RECURRENT INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE GARGANTA Y MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO PERSISTENTE. ACT\\u00daA COMO UN ESCONDITE LATENTE PARA DIVERSAS CEPAS BACTERIANAS QUE PUEDEN DESENCADENAR INFECCIONES RECURRENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR PAIR ADDRESSES BACTERIA THAT HAVE RETREATED INTO THE TRACHEAL TISSUE AND THE SPLEEN. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET, THE PATHOGENS ARE RELEASED FROM THEIR LATENT STATE INTO THE CIRCULATORY SYSTEM WHERE THE SPLEEN CAN EFFECTIVELY FILTER AND ELIMINATE THEM, BREAKING THE CYCLE OF RECURRING RESPIRATORY ILLNESS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR RESERVORIO ABORDA LAS BACTERIAS QUE SE HAN REFUGIADO EN EL TEJIDO TRAQUEAL Y EL BAZO. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO, LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS SE LIBERAN DE SU ESTADO LATENTE AL SISTEMA CIRCULATORIO DONDE EL BAZO PUEDE FILTRARLOS Y ELIMINARLOS EFICAZMENTE, ROMPIENDO EL CICLO DE ENFERMEDADES RESPIRATORIAS RECURRENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA AND TRACHEAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER THORACIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE RESPIRATORY-IMMUNE AXIS TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO Y EL MICRO CHAKRA TRAQUEAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE RESPIRATORIO-INMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1174','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:03:18','2026-04-25 00:03:18'),(3632,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1175,'{\"symptoms\":\"WARTS AND OPEN SORES ON PENIS AND SCROTUMS, VAGINA. (VERRUGAS Y LLAGAS ABIERTAS EN EL PENE Y EL ESCROTO, VAGINA.)\",\"paths\":\"HUMAN PAPILLOMA VIRUS, CYSTS. (VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO, QUISTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WARTS AND OPEN SORES ON PENIS AND SCROTUMS, VAGINA. TARGETS VIRAL MANIFESTATIONS IN THE REPRODUCTIVE AND ANAL AREAS.\\n\\n(VERRUGAS Y LLAGAS ABIERTAS EN EL PENE Y EL ESCROTO, VAGINA. SE DIRIGE A LAS MANIFESTACIONES VIRALES EN LAS \\u00c1REAS REPRODUCTIVAS Y ANALES.)\",\"paths\":\"HUMAN PAPILLOMA VIRUS (HPV), CYSTS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL LOAD RESPONSIBLE FOR CELLULAR ALTERATIONS AND GROWTHS IN THE LOWER PELVIC REGION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE VIRAL PRESENCE AND PREVENTS THE FORMATION OF CYSTS AND WARTS.\\n\\n(VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO (VPH), QUISTES. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA CARGA VIRAL RESPONSABLE DE LAS ALTERACIONES CELULARES Y CRECIMIENTOS EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA INFERIOR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA PRESENCIA VIRAL Y PREVIENE LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE QUISTES Y VERRUGAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE RECTAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE TESTICULAR AND PELVIC FLOOR MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AXIS TO PREVENT NEUROLOGICAL COLLAPSE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA RECTAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TESTICULARES Y DEL SUELO P\\u00c9LVICO. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL PARA PREVENIR EL COLAPSO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1175','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:06:56','2026-04-25 00:06:56'),(3633,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1180,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"RESENTMENT,LOSS OF ENERGY AND ACTS AS A BARRIER TO TRUE HAPPINESS. (RESENTIMIENTO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE ENERG\\u00cdA Y ACT\\u00daA COMO UNA BARRERA PARA LA VERDADERA FELICIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"PRODUCE INSULIN TO REGULATE BLOOD SUGAR. (PRODUCE INSULINA PARA REGULAR EL AZ\\u00daCAR EN LA SANGRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PANCREATIC ISLETS (ISLOTES PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"RESENTMENT, LOSS OF ENERGY, AND ACTS AS A BARRIER TO TRUE HAPPINESS. TARGETS INDIVIDUALS STRUGGLING WITH BITTERNESS OR CHRONIC FATIGUE.\\n\\n(RESENTIMIENTO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE ENERG\\u00cdA Y ACT\\u00daA COMO UNA BARRERA PARA LA VERDADERA FELICIDAD. DIRIGIDO A PERSONAS QUE LUCHAN CON LA AMARGURA O LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR FOCUSES ON THE REGULATION OF INSULIN TO BALANCE BLOOD SUGAR. EMOTIONALLY, IT ADDRESSES REPRESSED RESENTMENT THAT \\\"POISONS\\\" THE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET REMOVES THE EMOTIONAL BARRIER TO HAPPINESS AND RESTORES METABOLIC HARMONY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR SE ENFOCA EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA INSULINA PARA EQUILIBRAR EL AZ\\u00daCAR EN LA SANGRE. EMOCIONALMENTE, ABORDA EL RESENTIMIENTO REPRIMIDO QUE \\\"ENVENENA\\\" EL SISTEMA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ELIMINA LA BARRERA EMOCIONAL HACIA LA FELICIDAD Y RESTAURA LA ARMON\\u00cdA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PANCREATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE DIGESTIVE-ENDOCRINE AXIS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA PANCRE\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DIGESTIVO-ENDOCRINO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1180','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:18:47','2026-04-25 00:18:47'),(3634,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1182,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"RAGE, BITTERNESS, DESPAIR AND JEALOUSY. (IRA, AMARGURA, DESESPERACI\\u00d3N Y CELOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THE LIVER PARTICULARLY RELATES TO ISSUES OF CONTROL AND RESPONSIBILITY. (EL H\\u00cdGADO SE RELACIONA PARTICULARMENTE CON TEMAS DE CONTROL Y RESPONSABILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEPATIC PARENCHYMA (PAR\\u00c9NQUIMA HEP\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"RAGE, BITTERNESS, DESPAIR, AND JEALOUSY. TARGETS INDIVIDUALS STRUGGLING WITH INTENSE NEGATIVE EMOTIONS OR A SENSE OF OVERWHELM REGARDING THEIR CIRCUMSTANCES.\\n\\n(IRA, AMARGURA, DESESPERACI\\u00d3N Y CELOS. DIRIGIDO A PERSONAS QUE LUCHAN CON EMOCIONES NEGATIVAS INTENSAS O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE AGOBIO RESPECTO A SUS CIRCUNSTANCIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THE LIVER PARTICULARLY RELATES TO ISSUES OF CONTROL AND RESPONSIBILITY. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF \\\"TOXIC\\\" EMOTIONS THAT CAN PHYSICALLY MANIFEST AS HEPATIC CONGESTION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES REPRESSED ANGER AND RESTORES THE CAPACITY FOR EMOTIONAL REGULATION AND PERSONAL STEWARDSHIP.\\n\\n(EL H\\u00cdGADO SE RELACIONA PARTICULARMENTE CON TEMAS DE CONTROL Y RESPONSABILIDAD. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE EMOCIONES \\\"T\\u00d3XICAS\\\" QUE PUEDEN MANIFESTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO CONGESTI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA IRA REPRIMIDA Y RESTAURA LA CAPACIDAD DE REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y RESPONSABILIDAD PERSONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER MINOR CHAKRAS LOCATED IN THE RIGHT HYPOCHONDRIUM. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE METABOLIC-EMOTIONAL AXIS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA HEP\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO SITUADOS EN EL HIPOCONDRIO DERECHO. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO-EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1182','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:20:04','2026-04-25 00:20:04'),(3635,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1185,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ANGER, FRUSTRATION, BOTTLED-UP RESENTMENT. (IRA, FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N, RESENTIMIENTO REPRIMIDO.)\",\"paths\":\"TOXIC OVERLOAD OR STRESS INDUCED. (SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA O INDUCIDO POR ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GALLBLADDER WALL AND BILE DUCTS (PARED VESICULAR Y CONDUCTOS BILIARES)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANGER, FRUSTRATION, AND BOTTLED-UP RESENTMENT. TARGETS INDIVIDUALS WHO FEEL \\\"STUCK\\\" OR UNABLE TO DIGEST EMOTIONAL HARDSHIPS.\\n\\n(IRA, FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N Y RESENTIMIENTO REPRIMIDO. DIRIGIDO A PERSONAS QUE SE SIENTEN \\\"ATRAPADAS\\\" O INCAPACES DE DIGERIR LAS DIFICULTADES EMOCIONALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TOXIC OVERLOAD OR STRESS INDUCED. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE SOMATIZATION OF ANGER WITHIN THE BILIARY SYSTEM. WHEN STRESS TRIGGERS A TOXIC EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD, THE GALLBLADDER MAY BECOME \\\"CONGESTED\\\" ENERGETICALLY. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THESE BOTTLED-UP EMOTIONS, PROMOTING A SENSE OF RELIEF AND IMPROVING BOTH EMOTIONAL AND DIGESTIVE FLOW.\\n\\n(SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA O INDUCIDO POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA SOMATIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA IRA DENTRO DEL SISTEMA BILIAR. CUANDO EL ESTR\\u00c9S DESENCADENA UNA SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL T\\u00d3XICA, LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR PUEDE \\\"CONGESTIONARSE\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA ESTAS EMOCIONES REPRIMIDAS, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ALIVIO Y MEJORANDO EL FLUJO TANTO EMOCIONAL COMO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GALLBLADDER MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE HEPATIC-BILIARY AXIS TO PREVENT EMOTIONAL STAGNATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE HEP\\u00c1TICO-BILIAR PARA PREVENIR EL ESTANCAMIENTO EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1185','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:22:24','2026-04-25 00:22:24'),(3636,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1186,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"UNEXPRESSED EMOTIONS, SUCH AS ANGER, WHEN REPRESSED MAY STICK IN YOUR \\\"GUT\\\" AND THE TENSION MAY BECOME STUCK. (EMOCIONES NO EXPRESADAS, COMO LA IRA, CUANDO SE REPRIMEN PUEDEN QUEDAR ATASCADAS EN EL \\u201cINTESTINO\\u201d Y LA TENSI\\u00d3N PUEDE QUEDAR RETENIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"PROBLEMS IN THIS AREA ARE DIFFICULT AND NOT ALWAYS OBVIOUS AS MOST PROBLEMS ARE INTERNAL. (LOS PROBLEMAS EN ESTA \\u00c1REA SON DIF\\u00cdCILES Y NO SIEMPRE OBVIOS, YA QUE LA MAYOR\\u00cdA SON INTERNOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DUODENAL MUCOSA (MUCOSA DUODENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"UNEXPRESSED EMOTIONS, SUCH AS ANGER, WHEN REPRESSED MAY STICK IN YOUR \\\"GUT\\\" AND THE TENSION MAY BECOME STUCK. TARGETS INDIVIDUALS EXPERIENCING INTERNAL TENSION THAT IS NOT ALWAYS OBVIOUS.\\n\\n(EMOCIONES NO EXPRESADAS, COMO LA IRA, CUANDO SE REPRIMEN PUEDEN QUEDAR ATASCADAS EN EL \\\"INTESTINO\\\" Y LA TENSI\\u00d3N PUEDE QUEDAR RETENIDA. DIRIGIDO A PERSONAS QUE EXPERIMENTAN UNA TENSI\\u00d3N INTERNA QUE NO SIEMPRE ES OBVIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES PROBLEMS IN THIS AREA THAT ARE DIFFICULT AND NOT ALWAYS OBVIOUS AS MOST PROBLEMS ARE INTERNAL. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES REPRESSED ANGER AND TENSION HELD WITHIN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, PROMOTING EMOTIONAL RELEASE AND PHYSICAL RELIEF.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA PROBLEMAS EN ESTA \\u00c1REA QUE SON DIFICILES Y NO SIEMPRE OBVIOS, YA QUE LA MAYOR\\u00cdA SON INTERNOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA IRA REPRIMIDA Y LA TENSI\\u00d3N RETENIDA EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, PROMOVIENDO LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y EL ALIVIO F\\u00cdSICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE DIGESTIVE-EMOTIONAL AXIS TO PREVENT INTERNAL STAGNATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DIGESTIVO-EMOCIONAL PARA PREVENIR EL ESTANCAMIENTO INTERNO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1186','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:23:36','2026-04-25 00:23:36'),(3637,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1187,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DISCRIMINATION WITHIN THE BODY. (DISCRIMINACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL CUERPO.)\",\"paths\":\"ISSUES AROUND CONTROL, DEEP ANXIETY, EMOTIONAL GUT REACTIONS, OBSESSIVENESS. (PROBLEMAS RELACIONADOS CON EL CONTROL, ANSIEDAD PROFUNDA, REACCIONES EMOCIONALES VISCERALES, OBSESIVIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"JEJUNAL MUCOSA (MUCOSA YEYUNAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DISCRIMINATION WITHIN THE BODY. TARGETS INDIVIDUALS STRUGGLING WITH THE ABILITY TO PROCESS AND DIFFERENTIATE INTERNALIZED EXPERIENCES.\\n\\n(DISCRIMINACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL CUERPO. DIRIGIDO A PERSONAS QUE LUCHAN CON LA CAPACIDAD DE PROCESAR Y DIFERENCIAR LAS EXPERIENCIAS INTERNALIZADAS.)\",\"paths\":\"ISSUES AROUND CONTROL, DEEP ANXIETY, EMOTIONAL GUT REACTIONS, AND OBSESSIVENESS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC TENSION IN THE MID-SECTION OF THE SMALL INTESTINE WHERE NUTRIENTS AND EMOTIONS ARE \\\"SORTED.\\\" NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELIEVES THE \\\"GUT-WRENCHING\\\" ANXIETY AND HELPS THE INDIVIDUAL RELEASE OBSESSIVE CONTROL PATTERNS.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS RELACIONADOS CON EL CONTROL, ANSIEDAD PROFUNDA, REACCIONES EMOCIONALES VISCERALES Y OBSESIVIDAD. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA TENSI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA EN LA SECCI\\u00d3N MEDIA DEL INTESTINO DELGADO DONDE SE \\\"CLASIFICAN\\\" LOS NUTRIENTES Y LAS EMOCIONES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ALIVIA LA ANSIEDAD VISCERAL Y AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A LIBERAR PATRONES DE CONTROL OBSESIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE JEJUNAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ABDOMINAL AND UMBILICAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE DIGESTIVE-EMOTIONAL AXIS TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC STAGNATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA YEYUNAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ABDOMINALES Y UMBILICALES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DIGESTIVO-EMOCIONAL PARA PREVENIR EL ESTANCAMIENTO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1187','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:24:57','2026-04-25 00:24:57'),(3638,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1188,'{\"origin