SSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE GASTRO-INTESTINAL AXIS TO PREVENT CHRONIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE GASTROINTESTINAL PARA PREVENIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1189','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:29:33','2026-04-25 00:29:33'),(3640,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1190,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, REFLUX SENSATIONS, AND LATENT SKIN OR MUCOID ALTERATIONS. ACTS AS A HIDING PLACE FOR PATHOGENS THAT CAUSE RECURRENT SYSTEMIC ISSUES.\\n\\n(MALESTAR DIGESTIVO CR\\u00d3NICO, SENSACIONES DE REFLUJO Y ALTERACIONES LATENTES EN LA PIEL O MUCOSA. ACT\\u00daA COMO UN ESCONDITE PARA PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE CAUSAN PROBLEMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS RECURRENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR PAIR ADDRESSES THE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE BACTERIA WHEN IT RETREATS INTO THE MUCOSAL LININGS OF THE DUODENUM AND ESOPHAGUS. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET, THE LATENT PATHOGENS ARE RELEASED FROM THEIR PROTECTIVE NICHE, ALLOWING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO RECOGNIZE AND ELIMINATE THEM, THEREBY PREVENTING CHRONIC RELAPSES.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR RESERVORIO ABORDA LA BACTERIA MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE CUANDO SE REFUGIA EN LOS REVESTIMIENTOS MUCOSOS DEL DUODENO Y EL ES\\u00d3FAGO. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO, LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS LATENTES SE LIBERAN DE SU NICHO PROTECTOR, PERMITIENDO QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO LOS RECONOZCA Y ELIMINE, PREVINIENDO AS\\u00cd RECA\\u00cdDAS CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA AND ESOPHAGEAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL AND MEDIASTINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE GASTRO-ESOPHAGEAL AXIS TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC PATHOGENIC RECIRCULATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA ESOF\\u00c1GICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR Y MEDIAST\\u00cdNICOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE GASTROESOF\\u00c1GICO PARA PREVENIR LA RECIRCULACI\\u00d3N PAT\\u00d3GENA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1190','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:31:27','2026-04-25 00:31:27'),(3641,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1191,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, RECTAL BAND RECTAL BLEEDING. BLINDNESS, RETINA DETACHMENT, UTI, ENDOMETRIOSIS, INFERTILITY, GOUT, ANEMIA. (SANGRADO VAGINAL, BANDA RECTAL Y SANGRADO RECTAL. CEGUERA, DESPRENDIMIENTO DE RETINA, ITU, ENDOMETRIOSIS, INFERTILIDAD, GOTA, ANEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"IT ALTERS CLOTTING FACTORS AND PROMOTES ALL TYPES OF BLEEDING AND BLOOD DISORDERS. (ALTERA LOS FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N Y PROMUEVE TODO TIPO DE SANGRADOS Y TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DUODENUM\\/LIVER (REVISAR - DUODENO\\/H\\u00cdGADO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, RECTAL BLEEDING, AND URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI). ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH BLINDNESS, RETINA DETACHMENT, ENDOMETRIOSIS, INFERTILITY, GOUT, AND ANEMIA.\\n\\n(SANGRADO VAGINAL, SANGRADO RECTAL E INFECCIONES DE LAS V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS (ITU). TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA CON CEGUERA, DESPRENDIMIENTO DE RETINA, ENDOMETRIOSIS, INFERTILIDAD, GOTA Y ANEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PATHOGEN ALTERS CLOTTING FACTORS AND PROMOTES VARIOUS TYPES OF BLEEDING AND BLOOD DISORDERS. IT IMPACTS THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM AND CAN LEAD TO SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS IF THE ELECTRICAL IMBALANCE IN THE DUODENAL-RENAL AXIS IS NOT NEUTRALIZED.\\n\\n(ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ALTERA LOS FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N Y PROMUEVE DIVERSOS TIPOS DE HEMORRAGIAS Y TRASTORNOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS. IMPACTA EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR Y PUEDE LLEVAR A COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS SI NO SE NEUTRALIZA EL DESEQUILIBRIO EL\\u00c9CTRICO EN EL EJE DUODENO-RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL AND RENAL MINOR CHAKRAS. CHECK: DUODENUM \\/ LIVER.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR Y RENALES. REVISAR: DUODENO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1191','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:32:41','2026-04-25 00:32:41'),(3642,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1192,'{\"paths\":\"TRUE DIABETES (DIABETES VERDADERA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - NAVAL\\/SACRAL CHECK - NAVAL\\/KIDNEY (L) (REVISAR - NAVEL\\/SACRO REVISAR - NAVEL\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO)\"}','{\"paths\":\"TRUE DIABETES. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITIC INFESTATION THAT IMPACTS METABOLIC PATHWAYS, SPECIFICALLY LEADING TO \\\"TRUE\\\" DIABETES MELLITUS THROUGH NEUROLOGICAL AND GLANDULAR INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(DIABETES VERDADERA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INFESTACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA QUE IMPACTA LAS V\\u00cdAS METAB\\u00d3LICAS, CONDUCIENDO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE A LA DIABETES MELLITUS \\\"VERDADERA\\\" A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA INTERFERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y GLANDULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. CHECK: NAVAL\\/SACRAL AND NAVAL\\/KIDNEY (L).\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL. REVISAR: NAVEL\\/SACRO Y NAVEL\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO).)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1192','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:33:59','2026-04-25 00:33:59'),(3643,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1195,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"BACTERIA\",\"origins\":\"HELICOBACTER PYLORI\",\"symptoms\":\"GASTRITIS, GASTRIC ULCERS, BLOATING, HEARTBURN, AND ABDOMINAL PAIN. MAY ALSO BE ASSOCIATED WITH WEIGHT LOSS OR ANEMIA DUE TO MALABSORPTION.\\n\\n(GASTRITIS, \\u00daLCERAS G\\u00c1STRICAS, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL Y DOLOR ABDOMINAL. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE ASOCIARSE CON P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO O ANEMIA DEBIDO A LA MALABSORCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR TARGETS THE BACTERIA THAT COLONIZES THE MUCOSAL LINING, ALTERING THE PH OF THE STOMACH AND UPPER INTESTINE. IT IS A PRIMARY CAUSE OF CHRONIC INFLAMMATION IN THE PYLORIC VALVE AND THE DUODENAL TRACT. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET BALANCES GASTRIC ACIDITY AND SUPPORTS THE HEALING OF THE MUCOSA.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA QUE COLONIZA EL REVESTIMIENTO DE LA MUCOSA, ALTERANDO EL PH DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL INTESTINO SUPERIOR. ES UNA CAUSA PRIMARIA DE INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA EN LA V\\u00c1LVULA PIL\\u00d3RICA Y EL TRACTO DUODENAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO EQUILIBRA LA ACIDEZ G\\u00c1STRICA Y APOYA LA CICATRIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA AND PYLORIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL AND DIGESTIVE MINOR CHAKRAS. CHECK: STOMACH \\/ LIVER.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PIL\\u00d3RICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR Y DIGESTIVOS. REVISAR: EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1195','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:36:07','2026-04-25 00:36:07'),(3644,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1196,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRUE LEUKEMIA (LEUCEMIA VERDADERA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FATIGUE, IMMUNE SUPPRESSION, AND ANEMIA. TARGETS THE ABNORMAL PRODUCTION OF WHITE BLOOD CELLS AND SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(FATIGA, SUPRESI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y ANEMIA. SE DIRIGE A LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N ANORMAL DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS Y LA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRUE LEUKEMIA. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL INTERFERENCE THAT DISTORTS THE BLOOD-FORMING PROCESS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE SPLEEN\'S ROLE IN FILTERING BLOOD AND THE DUODENUM\'S ROLE IN NUTRIENT ABSORPTION, HELPING TO RESTORE THE INTEGRITY OF THE HEMATOLOGIC SYSTEM.\\n\\n(LEUCEMIA VERDADERA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INTERFERENCIA BACTERIANA QUE DISTORSIONA EL PROCESO DE FORMACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO APOYA EL PAPEL DEL BAZO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE Y EL PAPEL DEL DUODENO EN LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DEL SISTEMA HEMATOL\\u00d3GICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA AND SPLENIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE IMMUNE-DIGESTIVE AXIS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA ESPL\\u00c9NICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE INMUNITARIO-DIGESTIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1196','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:37:41','2026-04-25 00:37:41'),(3645,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1197,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EXTREME OBESITY AND THYROID PROBLEMS. (OBESIDAD EXTREMA Y PROBLEMAS DE TIROIDES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXTREME OBESITY, THYROID DYSFUNCTION, AND METABOLIC SLOWNESS. TARGETS ISSUES WHERE WEIGHT GAIN IS DISPROPORTIONATE TO CALORIC INTAKE.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD EXTREMA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N TIROIDEA Y LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA. SE DIRIGE A PROBLEMAS DONDE EL AUMENTO DE PESO ES DESPROPORCIONADO A LA INGESTA CAL\\u00d3RICA.)\",\"paths\":\"EXTREME OBESITY AND THYROID PROBLEMS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE DIGESTIVE ABSORPTION (DUODENUM) AND THE METABOLIC REGULATION (THYROID). NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS CALIBRATE THE BODY\'S ENERGY EXPENDITURE AND HORMONE PRODUCTION, MITIGATING THE FACTORS THAT LEAD TO EXTREME WEIGHT ACCUMULATION.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD EXTREMA Y PROBLEMAS DE TIROIDES. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA (DUODENO) Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA (TIROIDES). NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A CALIBRAR EL GASTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CUERPO Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL, MITIGANDO LOS FACTORES QUE CONDUCEN A LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N EXTREMA DE PESO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA AND THYROID MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ENDOCRINE AND UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE METABOLIC-GLANDULAR AXIS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL Y EL MICRO CHAKRA TIROIDEO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ENDOCRINOS Y DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO-GLANDULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1197','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:39:16','2026-04-25 00:39:16'),(3646,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1198,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"RESERVOIR (RESERVORIO)\",\"origins\":\"SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION\",\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE STAGNATION, URINARY URGENCY, AND CHRONIC TOXICITY. TARGETS LATENT PATHOGENS THAT HIDE WITHIN THE HOLLOW ORGANS, CAUSING RECURRENT INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ESTANCAMIENTO DIGESTIVO, URGENCIA URINARIA Y TOXICIDAD CR\\u00d3NICA. SE DIRIGE A PAT\\u00d3GENOS LATENTES QUE SE ESCONDEN DENTRO DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS HUECOS, CAUSANDO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RECURRENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR PAIR ADDRESSES PATHOGENS THAT RETREAT INTO THE GALLBLADDER AND URINARY BLADDER TO EVADE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. IT IMPACTS THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO PURGE TOXINS EFFECTIVELY. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THESE LATENT MICROORGANISMS, CLEARING THE \\\"HIDING PLACES\\\" AND RESTORING FLUID DYNAMICS AND DETOXIFICATION PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR RESERVORIO ABORDA PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE SE REFUGIAN EN LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y LA VEJIGA URINARIA PARA EVADIR EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. IMPACTA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA DEPURAR TOXINAS EFICAZMENTE. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA ESTOS MICROORGANISMOS LATENTES, LIMPIDANDO LOS \\\"ESCONDITES\\\" Y RESTAURANDO LA DIN\\u00c1MICA DE FLUIDOS Y LAS V\\u00cdAS DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILIARY MICRO CHAKRA AND VESICAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE ELIMINATION AXIS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA BILIAR Y EL MICRO CHAKRA VESICAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES ABDOMINALES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1198','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:41:29','2026-04-25 00:41:29'),(3647,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1199,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HIV (VIH)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE, IMMUNE VULNERABILITY, AND LATENT VIRAL SYMPTOMS. ACTS AS A PRIMARY STORAGE SITE FOR PATHOGENS THAT DEBILITATE THE BODY OVER TIME.\\n\\n(FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, VULNERABILIDAD INMUNITARIA Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS VIRALES LATENTES. ACT\\u00daA COMO UN SITIO DE ALMACENAMIENTO PRIMARIO PARA PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE DEBILITAN EL CUERPO CON EL TIEMPO.)\",\"paths\":\"HIV (VIH) RESERVOIR. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE GALLBLADDER AS A VERTICAL RESERVOIR WHERE VIRAL PARTICLES CAN REMAIN INACTIVE AND UNDETECTED BY THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE VIRAL LOAD FROM THE BILIARY SYSTEM, ALLOWING FOR SYSTEMIC PURIFICATION AND SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSES.\\n\\n(RESERVORIO DE VIH. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR COMO UN RESERVORIO VERTICAL DONDE LAS PART\\u00cdCULAS VIRALES PUEDEN PERMANECER INACTIVAS Y NO DETECTADAS POR EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA CARGA VIRAL DEL SISTEMA BILIAR, PERMITIENDO UNA PURIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y APOYANDO LAS DEFENSAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILIARY MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE HEPATIC-BILIARY AXIS TO PREVENT VIRAL STAGNATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA BILIAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE HEP\\u00c1TICO-BILIAR PARA PREVENIR EL ESTANCAMIENTO VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1199','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:43:01','2026-04-25 00:43:01'),(3648,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1200,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HIGH CHOLESTRAL AND TRIGLYCERIDES. (COLESTEROL Y TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS ALTOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CHAKRA AXIS\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH CHOLESTEROL AND TRIGLYCERIDES. TARGETS METABOLIC IMBALANCES THAT AFFECT LIPID PROCESSING.\\n\\n(COLESTEROL Y TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS ALTOS. SE DIRIGE A DESEQUILIBRIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS QUE AFECTAN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE L\\u00cdPIDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE DYSFUNCTION BETWEEN BILE PRODUCTION AND THE INITIAL STAGE OF INTESTINAL ABSORPTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE BODY IMPROVES ITS ABILITY TO EMULSIFY FATS AND REGULATE BLOOD LIPID LEVELS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET PROMOTES HEALTHY METABOLISM AND REDUCES ARTERIAL CONGESTION.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE BILIS Y LA ETAPA INICIAL DE LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL CUERPO MEJORA SU CAPACIDAD PARA EMULSIONAR GRASAS Y REGULAR LOS NIVELES DE L\\u00cdPIDOS EN SANGRE. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO PROMUEVE UN METABOLISMO SALUDABLE Y REDUCE LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILIARY MICRO CHAKRA AND DUODENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL AND HEPATIC-DIGESTIVE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE METABOLIC AXIS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA BILIAR Y EL MICRO CHAKRA DUODENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR Y HEP\\u00c1TICO-DIGESTIVOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1200','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:45:31','2026-04-25 00:45:31'),(3649,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1201,'{\"paths\":\"CELIAC DISEASE (CELIAC DISEASE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES SPIRCHEATE (ESPIROQUETA) BACTERIA THAT IMPACTS THE BILIARY AND RENAL SYSTEMS. IT IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO CELIAC DISEASE, WHERE THE ENERGETIC DISTORTION AFFECTS NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND INSULIN EFFICIENCY. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE AXIS BETWEEN FILTRATION AND DIGESTION, SUPPORTING MUCOSAL RECOVERY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA BACTERIA ESPIROQUETA QUE IMPACTA LOS SISTEMAS BILIAR Y RENAL. SE VINCULA FRECUENTEMENTE CON LA ENFERMEDAD CEL\\u00cdACA, DONDE LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA AFECTA LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y LA EFICIENCIA DE LA INSULINA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENTRE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, APOYANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILIARY MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HEPATIC AND RENAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE METABOLIC FLOW TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA BILIAR Y EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y RENALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO METAB\\u00d3LICO PARA PREVENIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1201','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:48:05','2026-04-25 00:48:05'),(3650,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1202,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"COMMON COLD (RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SOLAR-RENAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS (EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS SOLAR-RENAL)\",\"paths\":\"COMMON COLD (RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL RESONANCE THAT AFFECTS THE BODY\'S FILTRATION AND ELIMINATION SYSTEMS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOMAGNETIC INTERACTION BETWEEN THE BILIARY AND RENAL SYSTEMS, CLEARING CONGESTION AND ACCELERATING THE RECOVERY FROM VIRAL SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL QUE AFECTA LOS SISTEMAS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LOS SISTEMAS BILIAR Y RENAL, ELIMINANDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N Y ACELERANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS VIRALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILIARY MICRO CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HEPATIC AND RENAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC VIRAL REPLICATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA BILIAR Y EL MICRO CHAKRA RENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y RENALES. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA PREVENIR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1202','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 00:53:35','2026-04-25 00:53:35'),(3651,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1203,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GALLSTONES (C\\u00c1LCULOS BILIARES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS (EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"PRESENCE OF CALCULI, DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, AND CALCIUM IMBALANCE. TARGETS THE MALFUNCTION OF THE BILIARY SYSTEM IN CONJUNCTION WITH CALCIUM REGULATION.\\n\\n(PRESENCIA DE C\\u00c1LCULOS, MALESTAR DIGESTIVO Y DESEQUILIBRIO DE CALCIO. SE DIRIGE AL MAL FUNCIONAMIENTO DEL SISTEMA BILIAR EN CONJUNTO CON LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL CALCIO.)\",\"paths\":\"GALLSTONES (C\\u00c1LCULOS BILIARES). ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PROMUEVE LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE SEDIMENTOS Y PIEDRAS EN LA VES\\u00cdCULA. AL EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO ENTRE LA PARATIROIDES (REGULADORA DEL CALCIO) Y LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR, SE AYUDA A NORMALIZAR LA COMPOSICI\\u00d3N QU\\u00cdMICA DE LA BILIS Y PREVENIR LA CRISTALIZACI\\u00d3N.\\n\\n(GALLSTONES. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DYSFUNCTION THAT PROMOTES THE FORMATION OF SEDIMENT AND STONES IN THE GALLBLADDER. BY BALANCING THE FLOW BETWEEN THE PARATHYROID (CALCIUM REGULATOR) AND THE GALLBLADDER, IT HELPS NORMALIZE THE CHEMICAL COMPOSITION OF BILE AND PREVENT CRYSTALLIZATION.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA BILIAR Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PARATIROIDEO. ESTABILIZA EL EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO-MINERAL PARA EVITAR LA ESTAGNACI\\u00d3N DE FLUIDOS.\\n\\n(MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILIARY MICRO CHAKRA AND PARATHYROID MICRO CHAKRA. IT STABILIZES THE METABOLIC-MINERAL AXIS TO PREVENT FLUID STAGNATION.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1203','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:05:54','2026-04-25 01:05:54'),(3652,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1205,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL DYSFUNCTIONS. (DISFUNCIONES INTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"MALABSORPTION, ABDOMINAL DISTENSION, AND NUTRIENT DEFICIENCIES. TARGETS THE INABILITY OF THE SMALL INTESTINE TO EXTRACT VITAL ENERGY FROM FOOD.\\n\\n(MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL Y DEFICIENCIAS NUTRICIONALES. SE DIRIGE A LA INCAPACIDAD DEL INTESTINO DELGADO PARA EXTRAER ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL DE LOS ALIMENTOS.)\",\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE MECHANICAL AND ENERGETIC EFFICIENCY OF THE JEJUNUM. IT NEUTRALIZES IMBALANCES THAT CAUSE INFLAMMATION IN THE INTESTINAL WALLS, ENSURING THAT THE BODY CAN PROPERLY ASSIMILATE VITAMINS AND MINERALS WHILE MAINTAINING A BALANCED INTERNAL PH.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA EFICIENCIA MEC\\u00c1NICA Y ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL YEYUNO. NEUTRALIZA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS QUE CAUSAN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS PAREDES INTESTINALES, ASEGURANDO QUE EL CUERPO PUEDA ASIMILAR ADECUADAMENTE VITAMINAS Y MINERALES MIENTRAS MANTIENE UN PH INTERNO EQUILIBRADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE INTESTINAL VORTICES WITHIN THE SOLAR PLEXUS AND SACRAL REGIONS. ASSOCIATED WITH THE MID-ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS, IT ALIGNS THE ABSORPTION AXIS TO PREVENT ENERGETIC LEAKAGE DURING DIGESTION.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES INTESTINALES DENTRO DE LAS REGIONES DEL PLEXO SOLAR Y SACRO. ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN MEDIO, ALINEA EL EJE DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N PARA PREVENIR LA FUGA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DURANTE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1205','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:08:08','2026-04-25 01:08:08'),(3653,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1206,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA (DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY WATER AND FOODS, ESPECIALLY UNCOOKED CHICKEN. INTESTINAL INFECTION. (TRANSMITIDO POR AGUA Y ALIMENTOS, ESPECIALMENTE POLLO CRUDO O POCO COCIDO. INFECCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACUTE DIARRHEA, INTESTINAL CRAMPING, AND DEHYDRATION. TARGETS INFECTIONS TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED WATER OR UNDERCOOKED FOOD.\\n\\n(DIARREA AGUDA, C\\u00d3LICOS INTESTINALES Y DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N. SE DIRIGE A INFECCIONES TRANSMITIDAS A TRAV\\u00c9S DE AGUA CONTAMINADA O ALIMENTOS POCO COCIDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"CAMPYLOBACTER JEJUNI. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION THAT DISRUPTS BOTH THE ABSORPTION IN THE JEJUNUM AND THE FILTRATION IN THE LEFT KIDNEY. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET BALANCES THE MUCOSAL PH, ELIMINATING THE PATHOGEN AND RESTORING PROPER FLUID BALANCE AND DIGESTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(CAMPYLOBACTER JEJUNI. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA QUE ALTERA TANTO LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N EN EL YEYUNO COMO LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EN EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO EQUILIBRA EL PH DE LA MUCOSA, ELIMINANDO EL PAT\\u00d3GENO Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO ADECUADO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y LA SALUD DIGESTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE JEJUNAL AND RENAL VORTICES. ASSOCIATED WITH THE MID-ABDOMINAL AND RENAL MINOR CHAKRAS, IT ALIGNS THE ELIMINATION FLOW TO PURGE SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES YEYUNALES Y RENALES. ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL ABDOMEN MEDIO Y RENALES, ALINEA EL FLUJO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N PARA DEPURAR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1206','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:09:40','2026-04-25 01:09:40'),(3654,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1208,'{\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, PNEUMONIA AND FALSE HIV. (INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y FALSO VIH.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH SCAPULA; KIDNEY STONES           ASSOCIATED WITH CANTHUS; CONJUNCTIVITIS. (ASOCIADO CON ESC\\u00c1PULA; C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES           ASOCIADO CON CANTO; CONJUNTIVITIS)\"}','{\"paths\":\"ADENOVIRUS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS THAT IMPACT THE FILTRATION AND IMMUNE AXIS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOMAGNETIC INTERACTION BETWEEN THE LIVER\'S SUSPENSORY SYSTEM AND THE KIDNEYS, CLEARING TOXICITY FROM THE MUCOSA AND SUPPORTING RECOVERY FROM FEBRILE CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(ADENOVIRUS. ESTE PAR ABORDA INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS QUE IMPACTAN EL EJE DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N E INMUNIDAD. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL SISTEMA SUSPENSORIO DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, DEPURANDO LA TOXICIDAD DE LA MUCOSA Y APOYANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE ESTADOS FEBRILES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC AND RENAL VORTICES. ASSOCIATED WITH THE SCAPULA AND KIDNEY STONES; ALSO LINKED ENERGETICALLY TO CANTHUS AND CONJUNCTIVITIS CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y RENALES. ASOCIADO CON LA ESC\\u00c1PULA Y C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES; TAMBI\\u00c9N VINCULADO ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE CON EL CANTO Y CONDICIONES DE CONJUNTIVITIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1208','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:12:31','2026-04-25 01:12:31'),(3655,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1207,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, BODY ACHES, CONFUSION, WEAKNESS, AND FATIGUE. (FIEBRE, DOLORES CORPORALES, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, DEBILIDAD Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"LYME DISEASE, FIBROMYALGIA, CHRONIC FATIGUE SYNDROME, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (FIEBRE, DOLORES CORPORALES, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, DEBILIDAD Y FATIGA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, BODY ACHES, CONFUSION, WEAKNESS, AND FATIGUE. TARGETS SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION AND NEUROLOGICAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DOLORES CORPORALES, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, DEBILIDAD Y FATIGA. SE DIRIGE A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y EL MALESTAR NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\",\"paths\":\"LYME DISEASE (BORRELIA BURGDORFERI). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE THAT CAUSES FIBROMYALGIA-LIKE PAIN, CHRONIC FATIGUE, AND POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL DISRUPTIONS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC INTEGRITY OF THE LIVER AND THE COASTAL MARGIN, CLEARING THE PATHOGENIC LOAD TO ALLEVIATE SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD DE LYME. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA QUE CAUSA DOLOR SIMILAR A LA FIBROMIALGIA, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA Y POSIBLES ALTERACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA INTEGRIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL MARGEN COSTAL, ELIMINANDO LA CARGA PAT\\u00d3GENA PARA ALIVIAR LA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND COASTAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND RIGHT RIB CAGE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE PROTECTIVE ENERGY FLOW TO PREVENT CHRONIC DEGENERATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y COSTALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DE LA CAJA TOR\\u00c1CICA DERECHA. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PROTECTOR PARA PREVENIR LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1207','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:15:20','2026-04-25 01:15:20'),(3656,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1209,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"LIVER TROPHY (ATROFIA DEL H\\u00cdGADO)\",\"paths\":\"HEP C (HEPATITIS C)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEPATIC-PARIETAL MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS (EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICO-PARCIAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"LIVER ATROPHY, METABOLIC SLOWNESS, AND DECREASED ORGAN VOLUME. TARGETS THE DEGENERATION OF HEPATIC TISSUE AND REDUCED FUNCTIONAL CAPACITY.\\n\\n(ATROFIA DEL H\\u00cdGADO, LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA Y DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DEL VOLUMEN DEL \\u00d3RGANO. SE DIRIGE A LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO HEP\\u00c1TICO Y A LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DE LA CAPACIDAD FUNCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS C. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE CHRONIC VIRAL RESONANCE OR TOXIC LOAD THAT LEADS TO ORGAN ATROPHY. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGY FLOW BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE PARIETAL SYSTEM, HALTING THE DEGRADATION OF TISSUE AND SUPPORTING THE REGENERATIVE CAPACITY OF THE HEPATIC CELLS.\\n\\n(HEPATITIS C. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL CR\\u00d3NICA O LA CARGA T\\u00d3XICA QUE CONDUCE A LA ATROFIA DEL \\u00d3RGANO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL SISTEMA PARCIAL, DETENIENDO LA DEGRADACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO Y APOYANDO LA CAPACIDAD REGENERATIVA DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS HEP\\u00c1TICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE LATERAL PARIETAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER MINOR CHAKRAS AND THE CRANIAL-LATERAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE SYSTEMIC FLOW TO REVERSE ATROPHY AND RESTORE VITALITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y EL MICRO-CHAKRA PARCIAL LATERAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CR\\u00c1NEO-LATERALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO SIST\\u00c9MICO PARA REVERTIR LA ATROFIA Y RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1209','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:29:49','2026-04-25 01:29:49'),(3657,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1211,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEPATIC INFLAMMATION, DIGESTIVE DISRUPTION, AND POTENTIAL JAUNDICE. TARGETS SYSTEMIC TOXICITY AFFECTING THE FILTRATION AND ELIMINATION PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA, ALTERACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y POSIBLE ICTERICIA. SE DIRIGE A LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE AFECTA LAS V\\u00cdAS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS A. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA (PASTEURELLA) QUE IMPACTA DIRECTAMENTE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO, SE ESTABILIZA EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y LA EXCRECI\\u00d3N COL\\u00d3NICA, FACILITANDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS Y PROMOVIENDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO INFLAMADO.\\n\\n(HEPATITIS A. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE (PASTEURELLA) THAT DIRECTLY IMPACTS LIVER FUNCTION. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET, THE ENERGY FLOW AXIS BETWEEN HEPATIC DETOXIFICATION AND COLONIC EXCRETION IS STABILIZED, FACILITATING THE ELIMINATION OF PATHOGENS AND PROMOTING THE RECOVERY OF INFLAMED TISSUE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHAKRA MAYOR: CONEXI\\u00d3N PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y COL\\u00d3NICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL COLON DESCENDENTE. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DEL SISTEMA DE FILTRADO.\\n\\n(MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC AND COLONIC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND DESCENDING COLON MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO RESTORE THE INTEGRITY OF THE FILTRATION SYSTEM.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1211','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:34:02','2026-04-25 01:34:02'),(3658,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1212,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANGER (IRA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEPATIC-CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS (EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICO-CARD\\u00cdACO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTENSE IRRITABILITY, REPRESSED ANGER, AND EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD. MAY PRESENT PHYSICALLY AS CHEST TIGHTNESS OR LIVER TENDENCY DURING MOMENTS OF FRUSTRATION.\\n\\n(IRRITABILIDAD INTENSA, IRA REPRIMIDA Y SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL. PUEDE PRESENTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO O TENSI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA DURANTE MOMENTOS DE FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"ANGER (IRA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL RESONANCE THAT DISRUPTS THE VITAL CONNECTION BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE HEART. IT NEUTRALIZES THE TOXIC ACCUMULATION OF REPRESSED ANGER, RELEASING THE ENERGETIC PRESSURE ON THE CARDIAC SYSTEM AND RESTORING A SENSE OF INNER CALM AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(IRA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL QUE ALTERA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N VITAL ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. NEUTRALIZA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N T\\u00d3XICA DE IRA REPRIMIDA, LIBERANDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA SOBRE EL SISTEMA CARD\\u00cdACO Y RESTAURANDO UN SENTIDO DE CALMA INTERIOR Y EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND CARDIAC MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE EMOTIONAL FLOW TO PREVENT THE ENERGETIC STAGNATION OF FRUSTRATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y CARD\\u00cdACOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. ALINEA EL FLUJO EMOCIONAL PARA PREVENIR EL ESTANCAMIENTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LA FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1212','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:35:32','2026-04-25 01:35:32'),(3659,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1213,'{\"symptoms\":\"PAIN IN LIVER AREA. INFLAMMATION IN THE ABDOMINAL AREA. HIGH FEVER, DIZZINESS, WEAKNESS, MALAISE. (DOLOR EN EL \\u00c1REA DEL H\\u00cdGADO. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL \\u00c1REA ABDOMINAL. FIEBRE ALTA, MAREO, DEBILIDAD, MALESTAR.)\",\"paths\":\"LIVER ABSCESS. FALSE DIABETES. ACNE. (ABSCESO HEP\\u00c1TICO. FALSA DIABETES. ACN\\u00c9.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PAIN IN LIVER AREA, ABDOMINAL INFLAMMATION, AND HIGH FEVER. MAY CAUSE DIZZINESS, GENERAL WEAKNESS, AND MALAISE.\\n\\n(DOLOR EN EL \\u00c1REA DEL H\\u00cdGADO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL Y FIEBRE ALTA. PUEDE CAUSAR MAREOS, DEBILIDAD GENERAL Y MALESTAR.)\",\"paths\":\"ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITIC INFESTATION THAT CAN LEAD TO LIVER ABSCESSES. IT NEUTRALIZES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE THAT MIMICS DIABETES SYMPTOMS OR TRIGGERS ACNE, CLEARING THE PATHOGENIC LOAD TO RESTORE ORGAN VOLUME AND FILTRATION EFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INFESTACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A ABSCESOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. NEUTRALIZA EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE IMITA LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA DIABETES O DESENCADENA EL ACN\\u00c9, ELIMINANDO LA CARGA PAT\\u00d3GENA PARA RESTAURAR EL VOLUMEN DEL \\u00d3RGANO Y LA EFICIENCIA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND LEFT KIDNEY MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE DETOXIFICATION FLOW TO RESOLVE SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y RENALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N PARA RESOLVER LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1213','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:36:45','2026-04-25 01:36:45'),(3660,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1214,'{\"symptoms\":\"UTI, ARTHRITIS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, ARTRITIS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DIARREA, N\\u00c1USEAS.)\",\"paths\":\"LIVER CIRRHOSIS, DESTRUCTION AND FAILURE OF THE LIVER ORGAN.ANOREXIA, BILE PUS AND INFECTION, SEPSIS. LYMES DISEASE. (CIRROSIS HEP\\u00c1TICA, DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N E INSUFICIENCIA DEL H\\u00cdGADO. ANOREXIA, PUS BILIAR E INFECCI\\u00d3N, SEPSIS. ENFERMEDAD DE LYME)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"UTI, ARTHRITIS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, ARTRITIS, TRASTORNOS URINARY TRACT INFECTION, ARTHRITIS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, DIARRHEA, AND NAUSEA. TARGETS SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL COLONIZATION.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, ARTRITIS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DIARREA Y N\\u00c1USEAS. SE DIRIGE A LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"LYME DISEASE (BORRELIA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE THAT CAN LEAD TO LIVER CIRRHOSIS, ORGAN FAILURE, AND BILE INFECTION (PUS). NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGY FLOW TO PREVENT SEPSIS AND RESTORE THE FILTRATION CAPACITY OF BOTH THE LIVER AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD DE LYME (BORRELIA). ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA CIRROSIS HEP\\u00c1TICA, INSUFICIENCIA DEL \\u00d3RGANO E INFECCI\\u00d3N BILIAR (PUS). NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA PREVENIR LA SEPSIS Y RESTAURAR LA CAPACIDAD DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N TANTO DEL H\\u00cdGADO COMO DEL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND RENAL MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND RIGHT RENAL MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE PURIFICATION FLOW TO PROTECT THE TISSUE FROM DEGENERATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y RENALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE PURIFICACI\\u00d3N PARA PROTEGER EL TEJIDO DE LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1214','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:39:26','2026-04-25 01:39:26'),(3661,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1215,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TOXIC X FATS. FROM FOODS. (T\\u00d3XICO POR GRASAS. DE LOS ALIMENTOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"METABOLIC SLOWNESS, HEAVINESS AFTER EATING, AND DISCOMFORT LINKED TO DIETARY FAT INTAKE. TARGETS THE ENERGETIC CONGESTION OF THE HEPATIC TISSUE.\\n\\n(LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA, PESADEZ DESPU\\u00c9S DE COMER Y MALESTAR VINCULADO A LA INGESTA DE GRASAS DIET\\u00c9TICAS. SE DIRIGE A LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL TEJIDO HEP\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"TOXICITY FROM FATS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC OVERLOAD CAUSED BY THE ACCUMULATION OF DIETARY FATS AND LIPIDS FROM FOODS. IT NEUTRALIZES THE TOXIC RESONANCE THAT DISRUPTS HEPATIC FILTRATION, FACILITATING THE BREAKDOWN OF FATTY DEPOSITS AND SUPPORTING THE LIVER\'S CAPACITY TO PROCESS NUTRIENTS WITHOUT CONGESTION.\\n\\n(TOXICIDAD POR GRASAS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA SOBRECARGA ENERG\\u00c9TICA CAUSADA POR LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE GRASAS DIET\\u00c9TICAS Y L\\u00cdPIDOS DE LOS ALIMENTOS. NEUTRALIZA LA RESONANCIA T\\u00d3XICA QUE ALTERA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA, FACILITANDO LA DESCOMPOSICI\\u00d3N DE LOS DEP\\u00d3SITOS DE GRASA Y APOYANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL H\\u00cdGADO PARA PROCESAR NUTRIENTES SIN CONGESTI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VERTICAL ALIGNMENT OF THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HEPATIC AND GALLBLADDER MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO CLEAR SYSTEMIC TOXICITY FROM SATURATED FATS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL ALINEAMIENTO VERTICAL DEL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ELIMINAR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LAS GRASAS SATURADAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1215','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:40:37','2026-04-25 01:40:37'),(3662,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1216,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE, FEVER, JAUNDICE, MUSCLE PAIN, POOR APPETITE, PAIN IN THE ARMS AND LEGS. (CANSANCIO, FATIGA, FIEBRE, ICTERICIA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, POCO APETITO, DOLOR EN LOS BRAZOS Y PIERNAS.)\",\"paths\":\"HEP C, GASTRITIS, CHOLESTEROL AND HIGH TRIGLYCERIDES. IT IS TOXIC, IT IS NEITHER A BACTERIA OR A VIRUS. INFECTED BY INDIGESTION OF FAT LIKE BUTTER, OILS,POORLY WASHED VEGETABLES, FRUITS, SEAFOOD AND INTOXICATION WITH DRUGS. (HEPATITIS C, GASTRITIS, COLESTEROL Y TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS ALTOS. ES T\\u00d3XICO, NO ES NI UNA BACTERIA NI UN VIRUS. INFECTADO POR INDIGESTI\\u00d3N DE GRASAS COMO MANTEQUILLA, ACEITES, VERDURAS MAL LAVADAS, FRUTAS, MARISCOS E INTOXICACI\\u00d3N CON F\\u00c1RMACOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS (EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE, FEVER, AND JAUNDICE. TARGETS MUSCLE PAIN IN THE EXTREMITIES, POOR APPETITE, AND SYSTEMIC TOXICITY FROM VARIOUS EXTERNAL SOURCES.\\n\\n(CANSANCIO, FATIGA, FIEBRE E ICTERICIA. SE DIRIGE AL DOLOR MUSCULAR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, POCO APETITO Y TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA PROVENIENTE DE DIVERSAS FUENTES EXTERNAS.)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATIC TOXICITY. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES A NON-PATHOGENIC TOXIC STATE (NEITHER BACTERIAL NOR VIRAL) TRIGGERED BY THE INGESTION OF SATURATED FATS, OILS, POORLY WASHED PRODUCE, OR DRUG INTOXICATION. IT NEUTRALIZES THE COMPLEX RESONANCE THAT MIMICS HEPATITIS C OR GASTRITIS, CLEARING THE FILTRATION AXIS TO LOWER CHOLESTEROL AND TRIGLYCERIDES.\\n\\n(TOXICIDAD HEP\\u00c1TICA. ESTE PAR ABORDA UN ESTADO T\\u00d3XICO NO PAT\\u00d3GENO (NI BACTERIANO NI VIRAL) DESENCADENADO POR LA INGESTI\\u00d3N DE GRASAS SATURADAS, ACEITES, PRODUCTOS MAL LAVADOS O INTOXICACI\\u00d3N POR F\\u00c1RMACOS. NEUTRALIZA LA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA QUE IMITA LA HEPATITIS C O LA GASTRITIS, DEPURANDO EL EJE DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N PARA BAJAR EL COLESTEROL Y LOS TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT OF THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HEPATIC AND DIGESTIVE MINOR VORTICES. IT STABILIZES THE METABOLIC FLOW TO PURGE ACCUMULATED TOXINS FROM THE BLOODSTREAM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL ALINEAMIENTO HORIZONTAL DEL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y DIGESTIVOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO METAB\\u00d3LICO PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS ACUMULADAS en EL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1216','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:41:57','2026-04-25 01:41:57'),(3663,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1217,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"NAUSEA, VOMITING. (N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS)\",\"paths\":\"POSTERIOR HEADACHES, VERTIGO. (DOLORES DE CABEZA POSTERIORES, V\\u00c9RTIGO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEPATIC-OCCIPITAL MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS (EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICO-OCCIPITAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"NAUSEA, VOMITING, AND INTENSE DIZZINESS. TARGETS THE STORAGE OF PATHOGENS THAT TRIGGER SUDDEN GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET.\\n\\n(N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS Y MAREOS INTENSOS. SE DIRIGE AL ALMACENAMIENTO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE DESENCADENAN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL REPENTINO.)\",\"paths\":\"POSTERIOR HEADACHES AND VERTIGO. THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR VIRAL OR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT IMPACT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND VESTIBULAR BALANCE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET CLEARS THE BIO-MAGNETIC CONGESTION BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE BASE OF THE SKULL, ALLEVIATING CRANIAL PRESSURE AND RESTORING EQUILIBRIUM.\\n\\n(DOLORES DE CABEZA POSTERIORES Y V\\u00c9RTIGO. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO DE CARGAS VIRALES O BACTERIANAS QUE IMPACTAN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y EL EQUILIBRIO VESTIBULAR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ELIMINA LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA BASE DEL CR\\u00c1NEO, ALIVIANDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N CRANEAL Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND BROW (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND OCCIPITAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND BASE-CRANIAL MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGY FLOW TO FLUSH OUT LATENT TOXICITY STORED IN THE CRANIAL RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y ENTRECEJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y OCCIPITALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y BASE-CRANEALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ELIMINAR LA TOXICIDAD LATENTE ALMACENADA EN EL RESERVORIO CRANEAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1217','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:43:19','2026-04-25 01:43:19'),(3664,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1218,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FATIGUE (FATIGA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEPATIC-PANCREATIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS (EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICO-PANCRE\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE, LETHARGY, AND METABOLIC BURNOUT. TARGETS THE LOSS OF VITALITY STEMMING FROM PROLONGED PSYCHOLOGICAL STRESS OR DEEP-SEATED FRUSTRATION.\\n\\n(FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, LETARGO Y AGOTAMIENTO METAB\\u00d3LICO. SE DIRIGE A LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE VITALIDAD DERIVADA DEL ESTR\\u00c9S PSICOL\\u00d3GICO PROLONGADO O LA FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA.)\",\"paths\":\"FATIGUE (FATIGA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DRAIN BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE PANCREAS. IT NEUTRALIZES THE EMOTIONAL STAGNATION THAT HINDERS GLANDULAR FUNCTION, CLEARING THE AXIS TO RESTORE ENERGY LEVELS, STABILIZE SUGAR METABOLISM, AND ALLEVIATE THE SENSATION OF CONSTANT EXHAUSTION.\\n\\n(FATIGA. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL DESGASTE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL P\\u00c1NCREAS. NEUTRALIZA EL ESTANCAMIENTO EMOCIONAL QUE DIFICULTA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR, DEPURANDO EL EJE PARA RESTAURAR LOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA, ESTABILIZAR EL METABOLISMO DEL AZ\\u00daCAR Y ALIVIAR LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE AGOTAMIENTO CONSTANTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND PANCREATIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND PANCREAS MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE METABOLIC FLOW TO RECHARGE THE BODY\'S VITAL RESERVES.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. ALINEA EL FLUJO METAB\\u00d3LICO PARA RECARGAR LAS RESERVAS VITALES DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1218','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:44:43','2026-04-25 01:44:43'),(3665,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1219,'{\"symptoms\":\"DISRUPTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, MUSCLE PAINS, CRAMPS AND GAS, FEVER, AND FATIGUE. (ALTERA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DOLORES MUSCULARES, CALAMBRES Y GASES, FIEBRE Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"BOTULISM, POISONOUS TOXIN, MAY BE CAUSED FROM CANNED INFECTED FOODS. MAY METASTASIS INTO CANCER OR TUMORS. INTESTINAL DISORDERS. (BOTULISMO, TOXINA VENENOSA, PUEDE SER CAUSADO POR ALIMENTOS ENLATADOS INFECTADOS. PUEDE HACER MET\\u00c1STASIS EN C\\u00c1NCER O TUMORES. TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS, MUSCLE PAIN, FEVER, AND DIARRHEA. TARGETS METABOLIC DISRUPTION AND POTENTIAL INFECTION OF THE FETUS DURING PREGNANCY.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FIEBRE Y DIARREA. SE DIRIGE A LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y LA POSIBLE INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL FETO DURANTE EL EMBARAZO.)\",\"paths\":\"ADENOVIRUS 36. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL RESONANCE ASSOCIATED WITH OBESITY AND UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT CHANGES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGY FLOW BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE TIP OF THE PANCREAS, PREVENTING THE VIRUS FROM ALTERING ADIPOSE TISSUE METABOLISM AND PROTECTING SYSTEMIC HEALTH.\\n\\n(ADENOVIRUS 36. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL ASOCIADA CON LA OBESIDAD Y CAMBIOS DE PESO INEXPLICABLES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, EVITANDO QUE EL VIRUS ALTERE EL METABOLISMO DEL TEJIDO ADIPOSO Y PROTEGIENDO LA SALUD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE PANCREATIC TIP MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND PANCREATIC MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE METABOLIC AXIS TO REGULATE WEIGHT AND ENERGY ASSIMILATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y DE LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. ALINEA EL EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO PARA REGULAR EL PESO Y LA ASIMILACI\\u00d3N DE ENERG\\u00cdA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1219','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:46:14','2026-04-25 01:46:14'),(3666,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1220,'{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHTLOSS, MUSCLE PAIN, FEVER, DIARRHEA. (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FIEBRE, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"OBESITY, INFECTION OF FETUS. (OBESIDAD, INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL FETO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS, MUSCLE PAIN, FEVER, AND DIARRHEA. TARGETS METABOLIC DISRUPTION AND POTENTIAL INFECTION OF THE FETUS DURING PREGNANCY.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FIEBRE Y DIARREA. SE DIRIGE A LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y LA POSIBLE INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL FETO DURANTE EL EMBARAZO.)\",\"paths\":\"ADENOVIRUS 36. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL RESONANCE ASSOCIATED WITH OBESITY AND UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT CHANGES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGY FLOW AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE TIP OF THE PANCREAS, PREVENTING THE VIRUS FROM ALTERING ADIPOSE TISSUE METABOLISM AND PROTECTING SYSTEMIC HEALTH.\\n\\n(ADENOVIRUS 36. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL ASOCIADA CON LA OBESIDAD Y CAMBIOS DE PESO INEXPLICABLES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, EVITANDO QUE EL VIRUS ALTERE EL METABOLISMO DEL TEJIDO ADIPOSO Y PROTEGIENDO LA SALUD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE PANCREATIC TIP MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND PANCREATIC MINOR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE METABOLIC AXIS TO REGULATE WEIGHT AND ENERGY ASSIMILATION.\\n\\n(CHAKRA MAYOR: CONEXI\\u00d3N PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y DE LA PUNTA DEL P\\