RUPTS LIPID METABOLISM AND GASTRIC EMPTYING. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS LIVER FUNCTION AND PREVENTS METABOLIC COMPLICATIONS OFTEN MISTAKEN FOR CHRONIC LIVER DISEASE.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR MASCOTAS, ALIMENTOS. DIABETES MELLITUS, INSUFICIENCIA HEP\\u00c1TICA. FALSA CIRROSIS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA QUE ALTERA EL METABOLISMO DE LOS L\\u00cdPIDOS Y EL VACIADO G\\u00c1STRICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO APOYA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y PREVIENE COMPLICACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS QUE A MENUDO SE CONFUNDEN CON ENFERMEDADES HEP\\u00c1TICAS CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND PYLORIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND UPPER GASTROINTESTINAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE DIGESTIVE FLOW TO CLEAR SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL LOADS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y PIL\\u00d3RICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL SISTEMA GASTROINTESTINAL SUPERIOR. ALINEA EL FLUJO DIGESTIVO PARA ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1222','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:50:11','2026-04-25 01:50:11'),(3669,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1223,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PLEURA (L) (REVISAR - PLEURA (L)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"JAUNDICE, ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, AND LETHARGY. TARGETS SYSTEMIC VIRAL STAGNATION AFFECTING THE BLOOD FILTRATION ORGANS.\\n\\n(ICTERICIA, MALESTAR ABDOMINAL Y LETARGO. SE DIRIGE AL ESTANCAMIENTO VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICO QUE AFECTA A LOS \\u00d3RGANOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL RESONANCE OF HEPATITIS B WITHIN THE HEPATIC-SPLENIC AXIS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC INTERACTION BETWEEN THE LIVER AND SPLEEN, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AND PROTECTING THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO PURIFY THE BLOOD AND MANAGE VIRAL LOADS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL DE LA HEPATITIS B DENTRO DEL EJE HEP\\u00c1TICO-ESPL\\u00c9NICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL BAZO, APOYANDO LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA Y PROTEGIENDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PURIFICAR LA SANGRE Y MANEJAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - LEFT PLEURA (REVISAR - PLEURA IZQUIERDA). THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC AND SPLENIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. IT ALIGNS THE RETICULOENDOTHELIAL SYSTEM TO ENSURE PROPER PATHOGEN CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(REVISAR - PLEURA IZQUIERDA. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y ESPL\\u00c9NICOS. ALINEA EL SISTEMA RET\\u00cdCULO-ENDOTELIAL PARA ASEGURAR UNA CORRECTA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1223','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:51:14','2026-04-25 01:51:14'),(3670,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1224,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MIGRAINES. (FIEBRE, MIGRA\\u00d1AS.)\",\"paths\":\"LUNG INFECTIONS. FALSE LEUKEMIA. (INFECCIONES PULMONARES. FALSA LEUCEMIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER AND MIGRAINES. TARGETS SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL INFECTIONS THAT AFFECT BLOOD FILTRATION AND CRANIAL PRESSURE.\\n\\n(FIEBRE Y MIGRA\\u00d1AS. SE DIRIGE A LAS INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE AFECTAN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA Y LA PRESI\\u00d3N CRANEAL.)\",\"paths\":\"LUNG INFECTIONS. FALSE LEUKEMIA. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE THAT CAN CAUSE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS AND ALTERED BLOOD COUNTS THAT MIMIC BONE MARROW DISORDERS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND SPLEEN, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE PATHOGENIC LOAD AND PREVENTING PULMONARY COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES PULMONARES. FALSA LEUCEMIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA QUE PUEDE CAUSAR DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA Y ALTERACIONES EN LOS RECUENTOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS QUE IMITAN TRASTORNOS DE LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL BAZO, APOYANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA ELIMINAR LA CARGA PAT\\u00d3GENA Y PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES PULMONARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC AND SPLENIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND SPLEEN VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE RETICULOENDOTHELIAL FLOW TO ENSURE BLOOD PURIFICATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y ESPL\\u00c9NICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL BAZO. ALINEA EL FLUJO RET\\u00cdCULO-ENDOTELIAL PARA ASEGURAR LA PURIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1224','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:52:17','2026-04-25 01:52:17'),(3671,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1225,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ABDOMINAL DISORDERS, INFLAMMATION IN LYMPH SYTSTEM. (FIEBRE, TRASTORNOS ABDOMINALES, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY DISEASE, TUMORS, CANCER. (ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA, TUMORES, C\\u00c1NCER)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - FALLOPIAN TUBE\\/FALLOPIAN TUBE (REVISAR - TROMPA DE FALOPIO\\/TROMPA DE FALOPIO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ABDOMINAL DISORDERS, AND INFLAMMATION IN THE LYMPH SYSTEM.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, TRASTORNOS ABDOMINALES E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY DISEASE, TUMORS, AND CANCER. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL RESONANCE THAT IMPACTS THE GLANDULAR AND HEPATIC AXIS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGY FLOW BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING CELLULAR DEGENERATION AND MANAGING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA, TUMORES Y C\\u00c1NCER. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL QUE IMPACTA EL EJE GLANDULAR Y HEP\\u00c1TICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES, APOYANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA PREVENCI\\u00d3N DE LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR Y EL MANEJO DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - FALLOPIAN TUBE \\/ FALLOPIAN TUBE. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC AND SUPRARENAL MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. IT ALIGNS THE ENDOCRINE AND FILTRATION SYSTEMS TO ENSURE THE CLEARANCE OF LATENT VIRAL LOADS.\\n\\n(REVISAR - TROMPA DE FALOPIO \\/ TROMPA DE FALOPIO. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y SUPRARRENALES. ALINEA LOS SISTEMAS ENDOCRINO Y DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS VIRALES LATENTES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1225','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:53:23','2026-04-25 01:53:23'),(3672,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1226,'{\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH ACHES, DIARRHEA, HEADACHE, GAS, WEIGHT LOSS, VOMITING. (DOLORES DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, GASES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, V\\u00d3MITOS)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDER. (TRASTORNO GASTROINTESTINAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH ACHES, DIARRHEA, HEADACHE, GAS, WEIGHT LOSS, AND VOMITING. TARGETS INTENSE GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS.\\n\\n(DOLORES DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, GASES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO Y V\\u00d3MITOS. SE DIRIGE A UN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL INTENSO.)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDER (TRASTORNO GASTROINTESTINAL). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF CHOLERA, WHICH CAUSES SEVERE DEHYDRATION AND DIGESTIVE SYSTEM UPSET. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGY FLOW BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE TRANSVERSE COLON, RESTORING THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO ABSORB NUTRIENTS AND ELIMINATE TOXINS PROPERLY.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO GASTROINTESTINAL. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DEL C\\u00d3LERA, QUE CAUSA DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N SEVERA Y ALTERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL COLON TRANSVERSO, RESTAURANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA ABSORBER NUTRIENTES Y ELIMINAR TOXINAS ADECUADAMENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE TRANSVERSE COLONIC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND LOWER ABDOMINAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ELIMINATION FLOW TO CLEAR PATHOGENIC LOADS FROM THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y DEL COLON TRANSVERSO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL ABDOMEN INFERIOR. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N PARA LIMPIAR LAS CARGAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1226','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:54:33','2026-04-25 01:54:33'),(3673,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1227,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PRODUCED BY A TOXIN METAL, AS MERCURY OR LEAD. PANCREATITIS OR RAMSES. PSYCHOTIC STATES. EFFECTS OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. (PRODUCIDO POR UNA TOXINA MET\\u00c1LICA, COMO MERCURIO O PLOMO. PANCREATITIS O RAMSES. ESTADOS PSIC\\u00d3TICOS. EFECTOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METALLIC TOXICITY (TOXICIDAD MET\\u00c1LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"PSYCHOTIC STATES, DISRUPTIONS IN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, AND PANCREATIC INFLAMMATION. TARGETS NEUROLOGICAL AND GLANDULAR DISORDERS.\\n\\n(ESTADOS PSIC\\u00d3TICOS, ALTERACIONES EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA. SE DIRIGE A TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS Y GLANDULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"HEAVY METALS (METALES PESADOS). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES TOXICITY PRODUCED BY METALS SUCH AS MERCURY OR LEAD. IT IS INDICATED FOR CONDITIONS LIKE PANCREATITIS OR RAMSES AND MANIFESTS IN PSYCHOTIC STATES OR EFFECTS ON THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE METABOLIC BURDEN FROM THE PANCREAS TO RESTORE NEUROLOGICAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(METALES PESADOS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA TOXICIDAD PRODUCIDA POR METALES COMO EL MERCURIO O EL PLOMO. EST\\u00c1 INDICADO PARA CONDICIONES COMO PANCREATITIS O RAMSES Y SE MANIFIESTA EN ESTADOS PSIC\\u00d3TICOS O EFECTOS EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA CARGA METAB\\u00d3LICA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS PARA RESTAURAR LA ESTABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE INTERNAL AXIS OF THE PANCREATIC MICRO-CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE GLANDULAR VORTICES RESPONSIBLE FOR INSULIN AND ENZYME REGULATION. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PURGE HEAVY METALS FROM THE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE INTERNO DE LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GLANDULARES RESPONSABLES DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA Y ENZIMAS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR METALES PESADOS DEL SISTEMA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1227','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:55:50','2026-04-25 01:55:50'),(3674,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1228,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBTAINED FROM PICKLE AND BOTTLED FOOD AND MILK PRODUCTS. INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, MUSCULAR PAIN, COLIC AND GAS. (OBTENIDO DE ALIMENTOS ENCURTIDOS Y EMBOTELLADOS Y PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR MUSCULAR, C\\u00d3LICOS Y GASES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, MUSCULAR PAIN, COLIC, AND GAS. TARGETS TOXICITY OFTEN LINKED TO CONTAMINATED FOOD SOURCES.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR MUSCULAR, C\\u00d3LICOS Y GASES. SE DIRIGE A LA TOXICIDAD A MENUDO VINCULADA A FUENTES DE ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"OBTAINED FROM PICKLE AND BOTTLED FOOD AND MILK PRODUCTS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF BOTULISM WHICH TRIGGERS SEVERE DIGESTIVE UPSET AND MUSCLE DISCOMFORT. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE PANCREATIC TAIL AND THE LIVER, PROTECTING THE SYSTEM FROM TOXIC OVERLOAD AND RESTORING INTESTINAL HEALTH.\\n\\n(OBTENIDO DE ALIMENTOS ENCURTIDOS, EMBOTELLADOS Y PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DEL BOTULISMO QUE DESENCADENA MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO Y MOLESTIAS MUSCULARES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL H\\u00cdGADO, PROTEGIENDO AL SISTEMA DE LA SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA Y RESTAURANDO LA SALUD INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PANCREATIC TAIL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE PANCREAS AND LIVER VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE PURIFICATION FLOW TO NEUTRALIZE EXTERNAL PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS DE LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y HEP\\u00c1TICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y DEL H\\u00cdGADO. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE PURIFICACI\\u00d3N PARA NEUTRALIZAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS EXTERNOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1228','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:56:51','2026-04-25 01:56:51'),(3675,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1229,'{\"symptoms\":\"RASH, HIVES, ALLERGIC REACTIONS, EDEMA, ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, NAUSEA, AND VOMITING. (SARPULLIDO, URTICARIA, REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS, EDEMA, C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES, N\\u00c1USEAS Y V\\u00d3MITOS)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RAW FISH. MAY LEAD TO ANAPHTLAXIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR PESCADO CRUDO. PUEDE PROVOCAR ANAFILAXIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RASH, HIVES, ALLERGIC REACTIONS, EDEMA, ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, NAUSEA, AND VOMITING. TARGETS ACUTE GASTROINTESTINAL AND DERMATOLOGICAL RESPONSES.\\n\\n(SARPULLIDO, URTICARIA, REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS, EDEMA, C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES, N\\u00c1USEAS Y V\\u00d3MITOS. SE DIRIGE A RESPUESTAS GASTROINTESTINALES Y DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS AGUDAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RAW FISH. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITIC INFESTATION OF ANISAKIS SIMPLEX, WHICH CAN LEAD TO SEVERE ALLERGIC REACTIONS OR ANAPHYLAXIS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE PANCREAS AND THE DUODENUM, PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM CAUSING INTESTINAL OBSTRUCTIONS OR CHRONIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR PESCADO CRUDO. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INFESTACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA DE ANISAKIS SIMPLEX, QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS GRAVES O ANAFILAXIA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL DUODENO, EVITANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO CAUSE OBSTRUCCIONES INTESTINALES O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PANCREATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND DUODENAL MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER DIGESTIVE AND GLANDULAR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ABSORPTION FLOW TO EXPEL TOXINS DERIVED FROM PARASITIC ACTIVITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS Y DUODENALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GLANDULARES Y DIGESTIVOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N PARA EXPULSAR LAS TOXINAS DERIVADAS DE LA ACTIVIDAD PARASITARIA.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1229','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:57:54','2026-04-25 01:57:54'),(3676,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1230,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE\",\"paths\":\"MORBID OBESITY (FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SOLAR-RENAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS (EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS SOLAR-RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE. TARGETS METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION AND SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA. SE DIRIGE A LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y LA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"MORBID OBESITY (OBESIDAD M\\u00d3RBIDA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE THAT CONTRIBUTES TO SEVERE WEIGHT GAIN AND THE INABILITY TO REGULATE LIPIDS AND SUGARS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE INTERACTION BETWEEN THE PANCREATIC AND HEPATIC SYSTEMS, SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF METABOLIC VITALITY AND CLEARING THE CONGESTION THAT LEADS TO CHRONIC EXHAUSTION.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD M\\u00d3RBIDA. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE CONTRIBUYE AL AUMENTO DE PESO SEVERO Y LA INCAPACIDAD PARA REGULAR L\\u00cdPIDOS Y AZ\\u00daCARES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENTRE LOS SISTEMAS PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y HEP\\u00c1TICO, APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA VITALIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA Y ELIMINANDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N QUE CONDUCE AL AGOTAMIENTO CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC AND PANCREATIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE GLANDULAR AND DIGESTIVE VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC VIRAL REPLICATION AND METABOLIC STAGNATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GLANDULARES Y DIGESTIVOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA PREVENIR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICA Y EL ESTANCAMIENTO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1230','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 01:59:30','2026-04-25 01:59:30'),(3677,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1232,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TAPEWORM. A PARASITE THAT COMMONLY AFFECTS THE LIVER, LUNGS AND KIDNEYS. OCCURRING IN ANY ORGAN; SPLEEN, HEART, BREAST, PANCREAS, MUSCLES, PAROTID, THYROID AND MEDIASTINUM. (TENIA. UN PAR\\u00c1SITO QUE AFECTA COM\\u00daNMENTE EL H\\u00cdGADO, LOS PULMONES Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. PUEDE PRESENTARSE EN CUALQUIER \\u00d3RGANO; BAZO, CORAZ\\u00d3N, MAMA, P\\u00c1NCREAS, M\\u00daSCULOS, PAR\\u00d3TIDA, TIROIDES Y MEDIASTINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, WEIGHT LOSS, AND POTENTIAL ORGAN SPECIFIC DYSFUNCTION. TARGETS THE FORMATION OF HYDATID CYSTS.\\n\\n(MALESTAR ABDOMINAL, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO Y POSIBLE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ESPEC\\u00cdFICA DE \\u00d3RGANOS. SE DIRIGE A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE QUISTES HIDAT\\u00cdDICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TAPEWORM (TENIA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITIC RESONANCE OF ECHINOCOCCUS GRANULOSUS, WHICH COMMONLY AFFECTS THE LIVER, LUNGS, AND KIDNEYS BUT CAN OCCUR IN ANY ORGAN, INCLUDING THE SPLEEN, HEART, BREAST, PANCREAS, AND MUSCLES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE PANCREATIC-SPLENIC AXIS TO PREVENT THE SPREAD OF LARVAL CYSTS AND PROTECT GLANDULAR INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(TENIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA DE ECHINOCOCCUS GRANULOSUS, QUE AFECTA COM\\u00daNMENTE AL H\\u00cdGADO, LOS PULMONES Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, PERO PUEDE PRESENTARSE EN CUALQUIER \\u00d3RGANO, INCLUYENDO EL BAZO, EL CORAZ\\u00d3N, LA MAMA, EL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y LOS M\\u00daSCULOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DEL EJE PANCRE\\u00c1TICO-ESPL\\u00c9NICO PARA PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE QUISTES LARVARIOS Y PROTEGER LA INTEGRIDAD GLANDULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PANCREATIC AND SPLENIC MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE GLANDULAR AND IMMUNE VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE PURIFICATION SYSTEM TO EXPEL PARASITIC LOADS FROM THE ABDOMINAL CAVITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS Y ESPL\\u00c9NICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GLANDULARES E INMUNITARIOS. ALINEA EL SISTEMA DE PURIFICACI\\u00d3N PARA EXPULSAR LAS CARGAS PARASITARIAS DE LA CAVIDAD ABDOMINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1232','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 12:46:05','2026-04-25 12:46:05'),(3678,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1233,'{\"origins\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GOIZ. PANCREAS AND STOMACH. (GOIZ. P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EST\\u00d3MAGO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EN: MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE INSULAR MICRO CHAKRA AND GASTRIC MICRO CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE DIGESTIVE AND ENZYMATIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT RESOLVES ENERGETIC TOXICITY FROM INGESTED SUBSTANCES AND STABILIZES THE METABOLIC FIRE.\\nES: CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA INSULAR Y EL MICRO CHAKRA G\\u00c1STRICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DIGESTIVOS Y ENZIM\\u00c1TICOS. RESUELVE LA TOXICIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE SUSTANCIAS INGERIDAS Y ESTABILIZA EL FUEGO METAB\\u00d3LICO.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1233','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 12:53:58','2026-04-25 12:53:58'),(3679,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1234,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PANCREATITIS, PANCREAS INTOXICATION. OPENS THE CLOGS OF THE PANCREAS, THAT CAN CAUSE DIABETES. (PANCREATITIS, INTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. ABRE LAS OBSTRUCCIONES DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, QUE PUEDEN CAUSAR DIABETES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PLACEMENT; 4 MAGNETS TOGETHER IN HEAD, BODY, TAIL AND TIP OF PANCREAS. ALTERNATING POLARITY. N-P-N-P (COLOCACI\\u00d3N; 4 IMANES JUNTOS EN LA CABEZA, CUERPO, COLA Y PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. POLARIDAD ALTERNADA. N-P-N-P)\"}','{\"origins\":\"PANCREATIC OBSTRUCTION (OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE PANCREAS AND GLANDULAR CONGESTION. TARGETS BIOMAGNETIC BLOCKAGES THAT MAY CONTRIBUTE TO SYSTEMIC IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y CONGESTI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. SE DIRIGE A BLOQUEOS BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICOS QUE PUEDEN CONTRIBUIR A DESEQUILIBRIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"PANCREATITIS, PANCREAS INTOXICATION. OPENS THE CLOGS OF THE PANCREAS THAT CAN CAUSE DIABETES. THIS PAIR ACTS AS A SYSTEMIC DECONGESTANT FOR THE GLANDULAR TISSUE, NEUTRALIZING THE ACCUMULATION OF TOXINS THAT HINDER INSULIN PRODUCTION AND ENZYMATIC FLOW.\\n\\n(PANCREATITIS, INTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. ABRE LAS OBSTRUCCIONES DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS QUE PUEDEN CAUSAR DIABETES. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN DESCONGESTIONANTE SIST\\u00c9MICO PARA EL TEJIDO GLANDULAR, NEUTRALIZANDO LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS QUE DIFICULTAN LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA Y EL FLUJO ENZIM\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PLACEMENT; 4 MAGNETS TOGETHER IN HEAD, BODY, TAIL AND TIP OF PANCREAS. ALTERNATING POLARITY: N-P-N-P. THIS ALIGNMENT COVERS THE ENTIRE PANCREATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS TO ENSURE COMPLETE CLEARANCE OF THE GLANDULAR CHANNEL.\\n\\n(COLOCACI\\u00d3N; 4 IMANES JUNTOS EN LA CABEZA, CUERPO, COLA Y PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. POLARIDAD ALTERNADA: N-P-N-P. ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N CUBRE TODO EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS PARA ASEGURAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DEL CANAL GLANDULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1234','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 12:57:40','2026-04-25 12:57:40'),(3680,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1236,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LEPROSY LEPRA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, METABOLIC DISRUPTION, AND LATENT BACTERIAL OVERLOAD. TARGETS SYSTEMIC TOXICITY THAT MAY AFFECT GLANDULAR AND RENAL FILTRATION.\\n\\n(MALESTAR DIGESTIVO CR\\u00d3NICO, ALTERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y SOBRECARGA BACTERIANA LATENTE. SE DIRIGE A LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE PUEDE AFECTAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y RENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"LEPROSY (LEPRA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE RESONANCE OF MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE WITHIN THE PANCREATIC DUCT AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW BETWEEN THE EXOCRINE SYSTEM AND THE FILTRATION SYSTEM, PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM COMPROMISING INSULIN PRODUCTION OR RENAL CLEARANCE AND SUPPORTING SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION.\\n\\n(LEPRA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA DE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE DENTRO DEL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL SISTEMA EXOCRINO Y EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N, EVITANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO COMPROMETA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA O LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y APOYANDO LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PANCREATIC DUCT MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE RIGHT RENAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE GLANDULAR AND RENAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE PURIFICATION FLOW TO ENSURE PATHOGENIC CLEARANCE FROM THE ABDOMINAL CAVITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS DEL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y DEL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GLANDULARES Y RENALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE PURIFICACI\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE LA CAVIDAD ABDOMINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1236','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 12:59:35','2026-04-25 12:59:35'),(3681,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1237,'{\"symptoms\":\"SORE THROAT, HALITOSIS, HEADACHE, DIZZINESS, FEVER, BODY ACHES, SKIN RASH AND SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES. (DOLOR DE GARGANTA, HALITOSIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MAREO, FIEBRE, DOLORES CORPORALES, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS INFLAMADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY A FLY. LYMPHOCYTIC MENINGITIS, FALSE LEUKEMIA. EXACERBATES OR DISEASES AND SYMPTOMS, ESPECIALLY CANCER. AFFECTS THE CLOTTING FACTOR OF RED AND WHITE BLOOD CELLS. (TRANSMITIDO POR UNA MOSCA. MENINGITIS LINFOC\\u00cdTICA, FALSA LEUCEMIA. EXACERBA ENFERMEDADES Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS, ESPECIALMENTE EL C\\u00c1NCER. AFECTA EL FACTOR DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS Y BLANCOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SORE THROAT, HALITOSIS, HEADACHE, DIZZINESS, FEVER, BODY ACHES, SKIN RASH, AND SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES.(DOLOR DE GARGANTA, HALITOSIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MAREO, FIEBRE, DOLORES CORPORALES, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS INFLAMADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY A FLY. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL RESONANCE THAT CAN LEAD TO LYMPHOCYTIC MENINGITIS OR FALSE LEUKEMIA. IT EXACERBATES EXISTING DISEASES AND SYMPTOMS, ESPECIALLY CANCER, BY AFFECTING THE CLOTTING FACTOR OF RED AND WHITE BLOOD CELLS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS TO PREVENT NEUROLOGICAL IMPACT AND PROTECT BLOOD INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR UNA MOSCA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR MENINGITIS LINFOC\\u00cdTICA O FALSA LEUCEMIA. EXACERBA LAS ENFERMEDADES Y LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS EXISTENTES, ESPECIALMENTE EL C\\u00c1NCER, AL AFECTAR EL FACTOR DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS Y BLANCOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA PREVENIR EL IMPACTO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO Y PROTEGER LA INTEGRIDAD SANGU\\u00cdNEA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PANCREATIC LIGAMENT MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE SPLENIC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE GLANDULAR AND IMMUNE VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE LYMPHATIC FILTRATION SYSTEM TO ENSURE THE DESTRUCTION OF SYSTEMIC VIRAL LOADS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS DEL LIGAMENTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y ESPL\\u00c9NICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GLANDULARES E INMUNITARIOS. ALINEA EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA PARA ASEGURAR LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N DE LAS CARGAS VIRALES SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1237','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:00:59','2026-04-25 13:00:59'),(3682,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1251,'{\"symptoms\":\"RED SWOLLEN ITCHY SPOTS. GASTROINTESTINAL BLEEDING, BLACK STOOLS, SEVERE GASTRITIS. (MANCHAS ROJAS, HINCHADAS Y CON PICAZ\\u00d3N. SANGRADO GASTROINTESTINAL, HECES NEGRAS, GASTRITIS SEVERA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY AIRWAY. MEASLES. ATOPIC DERMATITIS, ULCERS, ARTHRITIS, PANIC ATTACKS, FALSE DIABETES. RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, MACULITIS, AND CONJUNCTIVITIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR V\\u00cdA A\\u00c9REA. SARAMPI\\u00d3N. DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, \\u00daLCERAS, ARTRITIS, ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO, FALSA DIABETES. RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, MACULITIS Y CONJUNTIVITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RED SWOLLEN ITCHY SPOTS. GASTROINTESTINAL BLEEDING, BLACK STOOLS, SEVERE GASTRITIS.(MANCHAS ROJAS, HINCHADAS Y CON PICAZ\\u00d3N. SANGRADO GASTROINTESTINAL, HECES NEGRAS, GASTRITIS SEVERA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY AIRWAY. MEASLES. ATOPIC DERMATITIS, ULCERS, ARTHRITIS, PANIC ATTACKS, FALSE DIABETES. RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, MACULITIS, AND CONJUNCTIVITIS.(TRANSMITIDO POR V\\u00cdA A\\u00c9REA. SARAMPI\\u00d3N. DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, \\u00daLCERAS, ARTRITIS, ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO, FALSA DIABETES. RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, MACULITIS Y CONJUNCTIVITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND ADRENAL MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER DIGESTIVE AND ENDOCRINE VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE METABOLIC RESPONSE TO CLEAR VIRAL LOADS AFFECTING THE MUCOSA AND NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAIR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y SUPRARRENALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DIGESTIVOS SUPERIORES Y ENDOCRINOS. ALINEA LA RESPUESTA METAB\\u00d3LICA PARA DEPURAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE AFECTAN LA MUCOSA Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1251','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:04:16','2026-04-25 13:04:16'),(3683,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1252,'{\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS, DIGESTION DISORDERS, HEADACHES, FEVER. BLOODY AND MUCUS IN STOOL. (TRASTORNOS DEL COMPORTAMIENTO, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE. SANGRE Y MUCOSIDAD EN LAS HECES.)\",\"paths\":\"EPILEPSY, MAY CAUSE BRAIN TUMORS OR CANCER. (EPILEPSIA, PUEDE CAUSAR TUMORES CEREBRALES O C\\u00c1NCER.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS, DIGESTION DISORDERS, HEADACHES, AND FEVER. BLOODY AND MUCUS IN STOOL.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL COMPORTAMIENTO, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA Y FIEBRE. SANGRE Y MUCOSIDAD EN LAS HECES.)\",\"paths\":\"EPILEPSY, MAY CAUSE BRAIN TUMORS OR CANCER. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITIC RESONANCE OF ENTAMEOEBA HISTOLYTICA, WHICH CAN MIGRATE BEYOND THE INTESTINES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE BLADDER, SUPPORTING THE ELIMINATION OF THE PATHOGEN AND PREVENTING POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL OR MALIGNANT COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(EPILEPSIA, PUEDE CAUSAR TUMORES CEREBRALES O C\\u00c1NCER. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA DE ENTAMEOEBA HISTOLYTICA, QUE PUEDE MIGRAR M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS INTESTINOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y LA VEJIGA, APOYANDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO Y PREVINIENDO POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS O MALIGNAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE VESICAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LOWER ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ELIMINATION FLOW TO CLEAR PARASITIC LOADS FROM THE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y VESICALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DEL ABDOMEN INFERIOR Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N PARA LIMPIAR LAS CARGAS PARASITARIAS DEL SISTEMA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1252','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:05:36','2026-04-25 13:05:36'),(3684,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1253,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RECURRING SKIN ERUPTIONS, MUCOSAL IRRITATION, AND PERIODS OF SYSTEMIC FATIGUE. TARGETS LATENT VIRAL LOADS HIDING IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS RECURRENTES, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MUCOSAS Y PERIODOS DE FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA. SE DIRIGE A CARGAS VIRALES LATENTES OCULTAS EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR THE HERPES VIRUS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE DUODENUM, PREVENTING THE VIRUS FROM REMAINING DORMANT AND LATER TRIGGERING OUTBREAKS OR SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. BALANCING THIS VORTEX SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN MAINTAINING VIRAL SUPPRESSION.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO RESERVORIO PARA EL VIRUS DEL HERPES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL DUODENO, EVITANDO QUE EL VIRUS PERMANEZCA LATENTE Y LUEGO DESENCADENE BROTES O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. EQUILIBRAR ESTE V\\u00d3RTICE APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A MANTENER LA SUPRESI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC AND DUODENAL MICRO-CHAKRA ENERGY FLOW AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PURGE VIRAL RESERVOIRS FROM THE GASTROINTESTINAL MUCOSA.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y DUODENALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DEL ABDOMEN INFERIOR. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LOS RESERVORIOS VIRALES DE LA MUCOSA GASTROINTESTINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1253','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:06:57','2026-04-25 13:06:57'),(3685,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1254,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GLUTTONY (GULA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GASTRIC MUCOSA AND CARDIAC PLEXUS (MUCOSA G\\u00c1STRICA Y PLEXO CARD\\u00cdACO)\",\"symptoms\":\"COMPULSIVE EATING, EMOTIONAL HUNGER, AND DIGESTIVE HEAVINESS LINKED TO ANXIETY. TARGETS THE INABILITY TO FEEL SATISFIED OR EMOTIONALLY FULFILLED.\\n\\n(ALIMENTACI\\u00d3N COMPULSIVA, HAMBRE EMOCIONAL Y PESADEZ DIGESTIVA VINCULADA A LA ANSIEDAD. SE DIRIGE A LA INCAPACIDAD DE SENTIRSE SATISFECHO O EMOCIONALMENTE PLENO.)\",\"paths\":\"GLUTTONY (GULA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL DRIVER OF EXCESSIVE CONSUMPTION WHERE FOOD IS USED TO FILL AN EMOTIONAL VOID. BY BALANCING THE STOMACH\\u2019S RECEPTIVITY WITH THE HEART\\u2019S ENERGETIC CENTER, IT PURGES THE IMPULSE FOR OVERINDULGENCE AND RESTORES THE SENSATION OF GENUINE NURTURING AND TEMPERANCE.\\n\\n(GULA. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL MOTOR EMOCIONAL DEL CONSUMO EXCESIVO DONDE LA COMIDA SE UTILIZA PARA LLENAR UN VAC\\u00cdO EMOCIONAL. AL EQUILIBRAR LA RECEPTIVIDAD DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO CON EL CENTRO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N, PURGA EL IMPULSO DE LA SOBREINDULGENCIA Y RESTAURA LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE NUTRICI\\u00d3N GENUINA Y TEMPLANZA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER DIGESTIVE AND THORACIC VORTICES. IT STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO RESOLVE THE ATTACHMENT TO PHYSICAL CONSUMPTION AS A SUBSTITUTE FOR EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y CARD\\u00cdACOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DIGESTIVOS SUPERIORES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS. ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA RESOLVER EL APEGO AL CONSUMO F\\u00cdSICO COMO SUSTITUTO DE LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1254','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:08:18','2026-04-25 13:08:18'),(3686,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1255,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EXCESSIVE EATING (ALIMENTACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GASTRIC-CARDIAC VORTEX (V\\u00d3RTICE G\\u00c1STRICO-CARD\\u00cdACO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE EATING, LACK OF SATIETY, AND EMOTIONAL CONSUMPTION. TARGETS THE COMPULSIVE NEED TO FEED AS A RESPONSE TO INTERNAL IMBALANCE.\\n\\n(ALIMENTACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA, FALTA DE SACIEDAD Y CONSUMO EMOCIONAL. SE DIRIGE A LA NECESIDAD COMPULSIVA DE ALIMENTARSE COMO RESPUESTA A UN DESEQUILIBRIO INTERNO.)\",\"paths\":\"EXCESSIVE EATING (ALIMENTACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BIOMAGNETIC DISRUPTION BETWEEN THE DIGESTIVE RECEPTION AND THE EMOTIONAL CENTER. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS REGULATE THE SENSATION OF FULLNESS AND DISCONNECTS THE HEART\'S EMOTIONAL STRESS FROM THE STOMACH\'S HUNGER SIGNALS, PROMOTING TEMPERANCE AND METABOLIC CONTROL.\\n\\n(ALIMENTACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LA RECEPCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y EL CENTRO EMOCIONAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A REGULAR LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SACIEDAD Y DESCONECTA EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N DE LAS SE\\u00d1ALES DE HAMBRE DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO, PROMOVIENDO LA TEMPLANZA Y EL CONTROL METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER ABDOMINAL AND THORACIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGY FLOW TO RESOLVE NUTRITIONAL ANXIETY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y CARD\\u00cdACOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA PARA RESOLVER LA ANSIEDAD NUTRICIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1255','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:09:35','2026-04-25 13:09:35'),(3687,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1256,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBESITY (OBESIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC VORTEX (V\\u00d3RTICE METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"METABOLIC SLOWDOWN, WEIGHT RETENTION, AND HEPATIC CONGESTION. TARGETS THE BODY\'S DIFFICULTY IN PROCESSING LIPIDS AND MAINTAINING ENERGY BALANCE.\\n\\n(LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE PESO Y CONGESTI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. SE DIRIGE A LA DIFICULTAD DEL CUERPO PARA PROCESAR L\\u00cdPIDOS Y MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"OBESITY (OBESIDAD). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE DYSFUNCTION BETWEEN THE GASTRIC SYSTEM AND THE LIVER\'S FILTRATION AND METABOLIC FUNCTIONS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS RE-ESTABLISH THE CORRECT BIOCHEMICAL SIGNALS FOR FAT BREAKDOWN AND NUTRIENT ASSIMILATION, REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION ASSOCIATED WITH EXCESS WEIGHT.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA G\\u00c1STRICO Y LAS FUNCIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS Y DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A REESTABLECER LAS SE\\u00d1ALES BIOQU\\u00cdMICAS CORRECTAS PARA LA DESCOMPOSICI\\u00d3N DE GRASAS Y LA ASIMILACI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA ASOCIADA CON EL EXCESO DE PESO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND UPPER ABDOMINAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE DIGESTIVE ENERGY TO PREVENT STAGNATION AND PROMOTE THE EFFICIENT ELIMINATION OF TOXINS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y HEP\\u00c1TICOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ALINEA LA ENERG\\u00cdA DIGESTIVA PARA PREVENIR EL ESTANCAMIENTO Y PROMOVER LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EFICIENTE DE TOXINAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1256','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:10:55','2026-04-25 13:10:55'),(3688,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1258,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES (ALERGIAS)\",\"paths\":\"AUTISM. DETOX, REGULATION OF THE HIS