 SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ELIMINAR LA SENSIBILIDAD QU\\u00cdMICA Y MEJORAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES.\\n\\n(MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC AND PANCREAS TAIL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER DIGESTIVE AND GLANDULAR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO CLEAR CHEMICAL SENSITIVITY AND IMPROVE NUTRIENT ABSORPTION.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1259','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:25:29','2026-04-25 13:25:29'),(3690,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1260,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GLUTTONY (GULA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GASTRIC-REPRODUCTIVE AXIS (EJE G\\u00c1STRICO-REPRODUCTIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DESEOS COMPULSIVOS, SENTIMIENTOS DE INSATISFACCI\\u00d3N Y DESEQUILIBRIO EN LA INGESTA NUTRICIONAL. SE DIRIGE A LA NECESIDAD DE LLENAR VAC\\u00cdOS EMOCIONALES A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONSUMO.\\n\\n(COMPULSIVE DESIRES, FEELINGS OF UNSATISFACTION, AND IMBALANCE IN NUTRITIONAL INTAKE. TARGETS THE NEED TO FILL EMOTIONAL VOIDS THROUGH CONSUMPTION.)\",\"paths\":\"(GLUTTONY. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL MANIFESTATION OF GLUTTONY, WHERE THE STOMACH VORTEX CONNECTS WITH THE CENTER OF IDENTITY AND CREATIVITY (PROSTATE OR VAGINA). NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS MODERATE EXCESSIVE CONSUMPTION IMPULSES, RESTORING TEMPERANCE AND BALANCING THE RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN PHYSICAL NEEDS AND EMOTIONAL WELL-BEING.) GULA (GLUTTONY). ESTE PAR ABORDA LA MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL DE LA GULA, DONDE EL V\\u00d3RTICE DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO SE CONECTA CON EL CENTRO DE LA IDENTIDAD Y LA CREATIVIDAD (PR\\u00d3STATA O VAGINA). NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A MODERAR LOS IMPULSOS DE CONSUMO EXCESIVO, RESTAURANDO LA TEMPLANZA Y EQUILIBRANDO LA RELACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LAS NECESIDADES F\\u00cdSICAS Y EL BIENESTAR EMOCIONAL.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"(MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA WITH THE REPRODUCTIVE MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO DISSOLVE CONSUMPTION ANXIETY AND PROMOTE SELF-DISCIPLINE.) CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR RELACIONA EL MICRO-CHAKRA G\\u00c1STRICO CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA REPRODUCTIVO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES ABDOMINALES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DISOLVER LA ANSIEDAD POR EL CONSUMO Y PROMOVER LA AUTODISCIPLINA.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1260','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:27:43','2026-04-25 13:27:43'),(3691,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1261,'{\"symptoms\":\"VOMITING, ULCERS, GAS, DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, INTOLERANCE TO LACTOSE. (V\\u00d3MITOS, \\u00daLCERAS, GASES, DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM CERTAIN FOODS, ESPECIALLY IN CONTAMINATED MILK AND OTHER MEAT THAT IS NOT WILL COOKED. MAJOR DISRUPTION OF DIGESTION. GASTRITIS, COLITIS, GASTROINTESTINAL DISRUPTION, DWARFISM. DISORDERS OF CHARACTER AND BEHAVIOR. CYSTIC FIBROSIS, STOMACH CANCER. (TRANSMITIDO POR CIERTOS ALIMENTOS, ESPECIALMENTE EN LECHE CONTAMINADA Y OTRAS CARNES QUE NO EST\\u00c1N BIEN COCIDAS. ALTERACI\\u00d3N GRAVE DE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N. GASTRITIS, COLITIS, ALTERACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL, ENANISMO. TRASTORNOS DEL CAR\\u00c1CTER Y DEL COMPORTAMIENTO. FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA, C\\u00c1NCER DE EST\\u00d3MAGO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VOMITING, ULCERS, GAS, DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, AND INTOLERANCE TO LACTOSE. TARGETS SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS.\\n\\n(V\\u00d3MITOS, \\u00daLCERAS, GASES, DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL E INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA. SE DIRIGE A UN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM CERTAIN FOODS, ESPECIALLY IN CONTAMINATED MILK AND OTHER MEAT THAT IS NOT WELL COOKED. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES A MAJOR DISRUPTION OF DIGESTION, INCLUDING GASTRITIS, COLITIS, AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISRUPTION. IT IS ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH DWARFISM, DISORDERS OF CHARACTER AND BEHAVIOR, CYSTIC FIBROSIS, AND STOMACH CANCER.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR CIERTOS ALIMENTOS, ESPECIALMENTE EN LECHE CONTAMINADA Y OTRAS CARNES QUE NO EST\\u00c1N BIEN COCIDAS. ESTE PAR ABORDA UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N GRAVE DE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, INCLUYENDO GASTRITIS, COLITIS Y ALTERACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA CON ENANISMO, TRASTORNOS DEL CAR\\u00c1CTER Y DEL COMPORTAMIENTO, FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA Y C\\u00c1NCER DE EST\\u00d3MAGO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE PYLORIC VORTEX AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER AND MIDDLE DIGESTIVE VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGY FLOW TO ELIMINATE BACTERIAL LOADS THAT COMPROMISE THE GASTROINTESTINAL LINING.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y DEL V\\u00d3RTICE PIL\\u00d3RICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DIGESTIVOS SUPERIORES Y MEDIOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE COMPROMETEN EL REVESTIMIENTO GASTROINTESTINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1261','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:28:56','2026-04-25 13:28:56'),(3692,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1262,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBESITY, STROKE. (OBESIDAD, ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC-VASCULAR AXIS (EJE METAB