\\u00d3N. DURANTE UNA CRISIS DE SANACI\\u00d3N, SE PUEDE EXPERIMENTAR UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE DESMAYO. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INTEGRIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL CENTRO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N, ALINEANDO LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA CON LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL PARA RESOLVER ALTERACIONES EN EL RITMO VITAL DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PRIMARY CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND PULMONARY VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO CLEAR EMOTIONAL CONGESTION AND RESTORE THE CAPACITY FOR DIVINE LOVE AND CONNECTION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA CARD\\u00cdACO PRIMARIO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y PULMONARES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y RESTAURAR LA CAPACIDAD DE AMOR DIVINO Y CONEXI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1048','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:39:58','2026-04-25 13:39:58'),(3700,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1049,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"LONELY, BE FRIGID OR RESENTFUL AND SHOW GENERAL DIFFICULTIES TO ACCEPT LOVE OR HAVING RELATIONSHIPS. (SOLEDAD, SER FR\\u00cdGIDO O RESENTIDO Y MOSTRAR DIFICULTADES GENERALES PARA ACEPTAR EL AMOR O TENER RELACIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"IT IS OF MAJOR IMPORTANCE TO LEARN TO LOVE AND TO FORGIVE YOURSELF AND OTHERS IN ORDER TO HEAL IT AND FLOW. (ES DE GRAN IMPORTANCIA APRENDER A AMAR Y PERDONARSE A S\\u00cd MISMO Y A LOS DEM\\u00c1S PARA SANAR Y FLUIR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CARDIAC-VASCULAR SYSTEM (SISTEMA CARDIOVASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"LONELY, BE FRIGID OR RESENTFUL AND SHOW GENERAL DIFFICULTIES TO ACCEPT LOVE OR HAVING RELATIONSHIPS.(SOLEDAD, SER FR\\u00cdGIDO O RESENTIDO Y MOSTRAR DIFICULTADES GENERALES PARA ACEPTAR EL AMOR O TENER RELACIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"IT IS OF MAJOR IMPORTANCE TO LEARN TO LOVE AND TO FORGIVE YOURSELF AND OTHERS IN ORDER TO HEAL IT AND FLOW. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES IN THE CIRCULATORY SYSTEM THAT STEM FROM EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY. BY CLEARING THESE VORTICES, THE PHYSICAL FLOW OF BLOOD ALIGNS WITH THE EMOTIONAL CAPACITY TO GIVE AND RECEIVE AFFECTION, DISSOLVING THE \\\"FRIGIDITY\\\" OF THE HEART.\\n\\n(ES DE GRAN IMPORTANCIA APRENDER A AMAR Y PERDONARSE A S\\u00cd MISMO Y A LOS DEM\\u00c1S PARA SANAR Y FLUIR. ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS EN EL SISTEMA CIRCULATORIO QUE SURGEN DE LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL. AL DEPURAR ESTOS V\\u00d3RTICES, EL FLUJO F\\u00cdSICO DE LA SANGRE SE ALINEA CON LA CAPACIDAD EMOCIONAL DE DAR Y RECIBIR AFECTO, DISOLVIENDO LA \\\"FRIGIDEZ\\\" DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VASCULAR MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE CARDIAC CENTER. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CIRCULATORY VORTICES THROUGHOUT THE ARTERIAL SYSTEM. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC RHYTHM TO RESTORE THE EBB AND FLOW OF EMOTIONAL OPENNESS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS VASCULARES Y EL CENTRO CARD\\u00cdACO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CIRCULATORIOS A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA ARTERIAL. ALINEA EL RITMO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA RESTAURAR EL FLUJO Y REFLUJO DE LA APERTURA EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1049','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:41:12','2026-04-25 13:41:12'),(3701,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1050,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EMPOWERS US TO LIVE AND LOVE WITH HEALTHY BOUNDARIES, NOT GIVING AWAY OUR PERSONAL POWER. (NOS EMPODERA PARA VIVIR Y AMAR CON L\\u00cdMITES SALUDABLES, SIN C