S V\\u00d3RTICES LINF\\u00c1TICOS TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y ABDOMINALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE FLUIDOS VITALES PARA MANTENER LA PUREZA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA RESILIENCIA EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1050','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:42:27','2026-04-25 13:42:27'),(3702,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1051,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"NERVE OF COMPASSION (NERVIO DE LA COMPASI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":\"THE VAGUS NERVE INCREASES IN ACTIVITY DURING POSITIVE EMOTIONS, AND DECREASES IN ACTIVITY DURING NEGATIVE EMOTIONS. (EL NERVIO VAGO AUMENTA SU ACTIVIDAD DURANTE EMOCIONES POSITIVAS Y DISMINUYE SU ACTIVIDAD DURANTE EMOCIONES NEGATIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CRANIAL-AUTONOMIC AXIS (EJE CRANEAL-AUT\\u00d3NOMO)\",\"symptoms\":\"NERVE OF COMPASSION. REGULATES THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO TRANSITION BETWEEN STRESS AND RELAXATION.\\n\\n(NERVIO DE LA COMPASI\\u00d3N. REGULA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PASAR DEL ESTR\\u00c9S A LA RELAJACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THE VAGUS NERVE INCREASES IN ACTIVITY DURING POSITIVE EMOTIONS AND DECREASES IN ACTIVITY DURING NEGATIVE EMOTIONS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC TONE OF THE PARASYMPATHETIC SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ENHANCES EMOTIONAL RESILIENCE, PROMOTING A STATE OF CALM AND COMPASSION WHILE REDUCING THE IMPACT OF NEGATIVE EMOTIONAL TRIGGERS ON THE BODY\'S VITAL ORGANS.\\n\\n(EL NERVIO VAGO AUMENTA SU ACTIVIDAD DURANTE EMOCIONES POSITIVAS Y DISMINUYE SU ACTIVIDAD DURANTE EMOCIONES NEGATIVAS. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL TONO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL SISTEMA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO MEJORA LA RESILIENCIA EMOCIONAL, PROMOVIENDO UN ESTADO DE CALMA Y COMPASI\\u00d3N MIENTRAS SE REDUCE EL IMPACTO DE LOS DESENCADENANTES EMOCIONALES NEGATIVOS EN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VAGAL COMMUNICATION VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE BRAINSTEM AND THORACIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO FACILITATE DEEP EMOTIONAL HEALING AND SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N VAGAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA FACILITAR UNA SANACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL PROFUNDA Y EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1051','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:44:30','2026-04-25 13:44:30'),(3703,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1052,'{\"symptoms\":\"LIVER, KIDNEY, DIGESTIVE FAILURE. LYMES DISEASE, CHRONIC FATIGUE, HEADACHE , JOINT PAIN, FIBROMYALGIA, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, HEPATITIS F, DYSPHASIA, ELEPHANTITIS. (H\\u00cdGADO, RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N, FALLA DIGESTIVA. ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR ARTICULAR, FIBROMIALGIA, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, HEPATITIS F, DISFASIA, ELEFANTIASIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY TICKS, LICE, FLEAS, BUGS AND INSECTS. VERY AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA. CAUSES AUTO IMMUNE DISEASE. (TRANSMITIDO POR GARRAPATAS, PIOJOS, PULGAS, CHINCHES E INSECTOS. BACTERIA MUY AGRESIVA. CAUSA ENFERMEDAD AUTOINMUNE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LIVER, KIDNEY, AND DIGESTIVE FAILURE. LYME\'S DISEASE, CHRONIC FATIGUE, HEADACHE, JOINT PAIN, FIBROMYALGIA, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, HEPATITIS F, DYSPHASIA, AND ELEPHANTIASIS.\\n\\n(FALLA HEP\\u00c1TICA, RENAL Y DIGESTIVA. ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR ARTICULAR, FIBROMIALGIA, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, HEPATITIS F, DISFASIA Y ELEFANTIASIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY TICKS, LICE, FLEAS, BUGS, AND INSECTS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES A VERY AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA THAT CAUSES AUTOIMMUNE DISEASES. IT TARGETS THE PATHOGENIC RESONANCE THAT DISRUPTS SYSTEMIC FILTRATION AND IMMUNE RECOGNITION, LEADING TO SEVERE MULTI-ORGAN DYSFUNCTION IF LEFT UNCHECKED.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR GARRAPATAS, PIOJOS, PULGAS, CHINCHES E INSECTOS. ESTE PAR ABORDA UNA BACTERIA MUY AGRESIVA QUE CAUSA ENFERMEDADES AUTOINMUNES. SE DIRIGE A LA RESONANCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA QUE ALTERA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y EL RECONOCIMIENTO INMUNITARIO, LO QUE CONDUCE A UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MULTIORG\\u00c1NICA GRAVE SI NO SE CONTROLA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE COSTAL RADIATING VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND RIB CAGE MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSE SYSTEM TO PURGE DEEP-SEATED BACTERIAL TOXINS AND RESTORE METABOLIC GOVERNANCE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA HEP\\u00c1TICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE RADIANTE COSTAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA CAJA TOR\\u00c1CICA. ALINEA EL SISTEMA DE DEFENSA ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS PROFUNDAS Y RESTAURAR EL GOBIERNO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1052','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:45:42','2026-04-25 13:45:42'),(3704,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1055,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WITCHCRAFT (BRUJER\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"AUDITORY ENERGETIC VORTEX (EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO AUDITIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"SENSATIONS OF EXTERNAL INFLUENCE, UNEXPLAINED AUDITORY DISTURBANCES, OR A FEELING OF BEING ENERGETICALLY COMPROMISED BY OTHERS\' INTENTIONS.\\n\\n(SENSACIONES DE INFLUENCIA EXTERNA, PERTURBACIONES AUDITIVAS INEXPLICABLES O LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ESTAR ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE COMPROMETIDO POR LAS INTENCIONES DE OTROS.)\",\"paths\":\"WITCHCRAFT (BRUJER\\u00cdA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF NEGATIVE EXTERNAL PROJECTIONS OR \\\"ATTACK CODES\\\" THAT TARGET THE INDIVIDUAL\'S PSYCHIC PERCEPTION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STRENGTHENS THE ENERGETIC SHIELD AROUND THE AUDITORY SYSTEM, CLEARING INTERFERENCE FROM NON-PHYSICAL SOURCES AND RESTORING THE CLARITY OF THE USER\'S OWN INNER VOICE.\\n\\n(BRUJER\\u00cdA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE PROYECCIONES EXTERNAS NEGATIVAS O \\\"C\\u00d3DIGOS DE ATAQUE\\\" QUE SE DIRIGEN A LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N PS\\u00cdQUICA DEL INDIVIDUO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO FORTALECE EL ESCUDO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ALREDEDOR DEL SISTEMA AUDITIVO, DEPURANDO LA INTERFERENCIA DE FUENTES NO F\\u00cdSICAS Y RESTAURANDO LA CLARIDAD DE LA PROPIA VOZ INTERIOR DEL USUARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE AUDITORY MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE TEMPORAL AND AURICULAR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE SENSORY PERCEPTION TO FILTER OUT DISSONANT ENERGIES AND PROTECT THE PSYCHIC FIELD.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS AUDITIVOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TEMPORALES Y AURICULARES. ALINEA LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL PARA FILTRAR ENERG\\u00cdAS DISONANTES Y PROTEGER EL CAMPO PS\\u00cdQUICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1055','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:47:40','2026-04-25 13:47:40'),(3705,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1056,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INTOXICATION AND DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"paths\":\"INTOXICATION AND DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CRANIAL NERVE AXIS (EJE DE NERVIOS CRANEALES)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTOXICATION AND DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. MAY MANIFEST AS DIZZINESS, TINNITUS, OR SENSORY PROCESSING ISSUES.\\n\\n(INTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO MAREOS, TINNITUS O PROBLEMAS DE PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"INTOXICATION AND DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC TOXICITY THAT IMPACTS THE ENTIRE NETWORK OF CRANIAL NERVES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE DETOXIFICATION OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, RESTORING PROPER SIGNAL TRANSMISSION AND BALANCE TO THE SENSORY AND MOTOR FUNCTIONS CONTROLLED BY THE BRAINSTEM.\\n\\n(INTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE IMPACTA TODA LA RED DE NERVIOS CRANEALES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO APOYA LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, RESTAURANDO LA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE SE\\u00d1ALES Y EL EQUILIBRIO DE LAS FUNCIONES SENSORIALES Y MOTORAS CONTROLADAS POR EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE AUDITORY AND CRANIAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE TEMPORAL AND AURICULAR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO CLEAR TOXINS FROM THE NERVE PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS AUDITIVOS Y CRANEALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TEMPORALES Y AURICULARES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS NERVIOSAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1056','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:49:16','2026-04-25 13:49:16'),(3706,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1057,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, BLUURED VISION, VERTIGO, HEARING LOSS, EARACHE AND DEAFNESS, FEVER, HEADACHE, MALAISE, COUGH, MUSCLE PAIN, ITCHY EYES AND THROAT, NIGHT SWEATS. (MAREO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA, V\\u00c9RTIGO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO Y SORDERA, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MALESTAR, TOS, DOLOR MUSCULAR, PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LOS OJOS Y LA GARGANTA, SUDORACIONES NOCTURNAS.)\",\"paths\":\"NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, ENCEPHALITIS, DAMAGE TO THE RETINA AND TO THE MACULA, TINNITUS, MONONUCLEOSIS. IT CAN AFFECT PREGNANCY, CAUSING ABORTION, PREMATURE BIRTH OR SERIOUS CONSEQUENCES TO THE FETUS, AS TORCH SYNDROME. REPEATED CONVULSIONS, CAUSED BY THE TOXOPLASMA GONDII. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, ENCEFALITIS, DA\\u00d1O EN LA RETINA Y EN LA M\\u00c1CULA, TINNITUS, MONONUCLEOSIS. PUEDE AFECTAR EL EMBARAZO, CAUSANDO ABORTO, PARTO PREMATURO O CONSECUENCIAS GRAVES PARA EL FETO, COMO EL S\\u00cdNDROME TORCH. CONVULSIONES REPETIDAS, CAUSADAS POR EL TOXOPLASMA GONDII.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, BLURRED VISION, VERTIGO, HEARING LOSS, EARACHE AND DEAFNESS, FEVER, HEADACHE, MALAISE, COUGH, MUSCLE PAIN, ITCHY EYES AND THROAT, NIGHT SWEATS.(MAREO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA, V\\u00c9RTIGO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO Y SORDERA, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MALESTAR, TOS, DOLOR MUSCULAR, PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LOS OJOS Y LA GARGANTA, SUDORACIONES NOCTURNAS.)\",\"paths\":\"NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, ENCEPHALITIS, DAMAGE TO THE RETINA AND TO THE MACULA, TINNITUS, MONONUCLEOSIS. IT CAN AFFECT PREGNANCY, CAUSING ABORTION, PREMATURE BIRTH OR SERIOUS CONSEQUENCES TO THE FETUS, AS TORCH SYNDROME. REPEATED CONVULSIONS, CAUSED BY THE TOXOPLASMA GONDII.(S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, ENCEFALITIS, DA\\u00d1O EN LA RETINA Y EN LA M\\u00c1CULA, TINNITUS, MONONUCLEOSIS. PUEDE AFECTAR EL EMBARAZO, CAUSANDO ABORTO, PARTO PREMATURO O CONSECUENCIAS GRAVES PARA EL FETO, COMO EL S\\u00cdNDROME TORCH. CONVULSIONES REPETIDAS, CAUSADAS POR EL TOXOPLASMA GONDII.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THIRD EYE (AJNA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE AUDITORY CANAL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CRANIAL AND OPTIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PURGE PARASITIC LOADS THAT IMPACT NEUROLOGICAL CLARITY AND SENSORY INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: TERCER OJO (AJNA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS DEL CANAL AUDITIVO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CRANEALES Y \\u00d3PTICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LAS CARGAS PARASITARIAS QUE IMPACTAN LA CLARIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y LA INTEGRIDAD SENSORIAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1057','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:50:24','2026-04-25 13:50:24'),(3707,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1058,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EAR DISORDERS, FACIAL PARALYSIS, RINGING IN THE EAR, MYOFASCIAL PAIN, UROGENITAL DISORDERS, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS, DISORDER OF THE KIDNEYS AND ANXIETY. (TRASTORNOS DEL O\\u00cdDO, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, ZUMBIDO EN EL O\\u00cdDO, DOLOR MIOFASCIAL, TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES, TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS, TRASTORNOS DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES Y ANSIEDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"BRONCHIAL OBSTRUCTION AND ASTHMATIC. RESONATES IN THE PAROTID OR PARATHYROID GLAND. (OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL Y ASMA. RESUENA EN LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PAR\\u00d3TIDA O PARATIROIDES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PAROTID-RENAL AXIS (EJE PAROT\\u00cdDEO-RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"EAR DISORDERS, FACIAL PARALYSIS, RINGING IN THE EAR, MYOFASCIAL PAIN, UROGENITAL DISORDERS, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS, DISORDER OF THE KIDNEYS AND ANXIETY.(TRASTORNOS DEL O\\u00cdDO, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, ZUMBIDO EN EL O\\u00cdDO, DOLOR MIOFASCIAL, TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES, TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS, TRASTORNOS DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES Y ANSIEDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"BRONCHIAL OBSTRUCTION AND ASTHMATIC. RESONATES IN THE PAROTID OR PARATHYROID GLAND. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE AUDITORY SYSTEM AND RENAL FUNCTION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW THAT REGULATES FLUID BALANCE AND NERVOUS SYSTEM OVEREXCITATION, HELPING TO CLEAR BRONCHIAL PATHWAYS AND CALM SYSTEMIC ANXIETY.\\n\\n(OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL Y ASMA. RESUENA EN LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PAR\\u00d3TIDA O PARATIROIDES. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA AUDITIVO Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE REGULA EL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y LA SOBREEXCITACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, AYUDANDO A DESPEJAR LAS V\\u00cdAS BRONQUIALES Y CALMAR LA ANSIEDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE AUDITORY MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE RENAL VORTEX AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE AURICULAR AND LOWER BACK MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE SENSORY INPUTS AND THE BODY\\u2019S FILTRATION SYSTEM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DEL MICRO-CHAKRA AUDITIVO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE RENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES AURICULARES Y DE LA ZONA LUMBAR. ALINEA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LAS ENTRADAS SENSORIALES Y EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1058','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:51:41','2026-04-25 13:51:41'),(3708,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1059,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"AUDITORY-REPRODUCTIVE AXIS (EJE AUDITIVO-REPRODUCTOR)\",\"symptoms\":\"SENSITIVITY TO EXTERNAL FEEDBACK REGARDING CREATIVITY OR FEMININITY, UNEXPLAINED PELVIC DISCOMFORT LINKED TO AUDITORY STIMULI, AND IMBALANCES IN THE PERCEPTION OF ONE\'S CREATIVE POWER.\\n\\n(SENSIBILIDAD A LOS COMENTARIOS EXTERNOS SOBRE LA CREATIVIDAD O LA FEMINIDAD, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO INEXPLICABLE VINCULADO A EST\\u00cdMULOS AUDITIVOS Y DESEQUILIBRIOS EN LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DEL PROPIO PODER CREATIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE BETWEEN SENSORY INPUT AND THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM. IT IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"LISTENING\\\" TO NEGATIVE NARRATIVES THAT AFFECT THE VITALITY OF THE OVARIES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE CONNECTION BETWEEN WHAT IS HEARD AND HOW IT IS PROCESSED DIGESTIVELY OR CREATIVELY, CLEARING INTERFERENCE THAT MAY LEAD TO FUNCTIONAL IMBALANCES IN THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LA ENTRADA SENSORIAL Y EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR. A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON \\\"ESCUCHAR\\\" NARRATIVAS NEGATIVAS QUE AFECTAN LA VITALIDAD DE LOS OVARIOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LO QUE SE ESCUCHA Y C\\u00d3MO SE PROCESA DIGESTIVA O CREATIVAMENTE, DEPURANDO INTERFERENCIAS QUE PUEDEN LLEVAR A DESEQUILIBRIOS FUNCIONALES EN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE RIGHT AUDITORY MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE RIGHT OVARIAN VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE AURICULAR AND PELVIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE FLOW OF EXPRESSION WITH THE CENTER OF CREATION TO PURGE EMOTIONAL DISTORTIONS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA AUDITIVO DERECHO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE OV\\u00c1RICO DERECHO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES AURICULARES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO DE EXPRESI\\u00d3N CON EL CENTRO DE CREACI\\u00d3N PARA DEPURAR DISTORSIONES EMOCIONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1059','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:53:19','2026-04-25 13:53:19'),(3709,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1060,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TINEA, ATHLETES FEET, RINGWORM, JOCK ITCH, NAIL INFECTIONS, INFECTIONS OF THE SKIN, SCALP AND BEARD. (TI\\u00d1A, PIE DE ATLETA, TI\\u00d1A CORPORAL, TI\\u00d1A INGUINAL, INFECCIONES DE LAS U\\u00d1AS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, CUERO CABELLUDO Y BARBA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ATHLETE\'S FOOT, RINGWORM, JOCK ITCH, SKIN INFECTIONS, LESIONS OF THE SCALP AND BEARD.\\n\\n(PIE DE ATLETA, TI\\u00d1A CORPORAL, TI\\u00d1A CRURAL, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, LESIONES EN EL CUERO CABELLUDO Y LA BARBA.)\",\"paths\":\"TINEA, ATHLETES FEET, RINGWORM, JOCK ITCH, SKIN INFECTIONS, LESIONS OF THE SCALP AND BEARD. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE FUNGAL RESONANCE OF TRICHOPHYTON, WHICH COMMONLY AFFECTS THE KERATINIZED TISSUES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS TO ELIMINATE THE PROLIFERATION OF DERMATOPHYTES, REDUCING INFLAMMATION, ITCHING, AND THE SPREAD OF SKIN LESIONS ACROSS THE BODY.\\n\\n(TI\\u00d1A, PIE DE ATLETA, TI\\u00d1A CORPORAL, TI\\u00d1A CRURAL, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, LESIONES EN EL CUERO CABELLUDO Y LA BARBA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA DE TRICHOPHYTON, QUE AFECTA COM\\u00daNMENTE A LOS TEJIDOS QUERATINIZADOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ELIMINAR LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE DERMATOFITOS, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N, EL PICOR Y LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS POR TODO EL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE AURICULAR LOBE MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CRANIAL AND SENSORY VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSE SYSTEM TO PURGE FUNGAL TOXINS THAT IMPACT SKIN INTEGRITY AND DERMAL HEALTH.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS DEL L\\u00d3BULO AURICULAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CRANEALES Y SENSORIALES. ALINEA EL SISTEMA DE DEFENSA ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS QUE IMPACTAN LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA PIEL Y LA SALUD D\\u00c9RMICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1060','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:54:28','2026-04-25 13:54:28'),(3710,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1061,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EAR INFECTIONS (OTITIS), DIZZINESS, AND SENSORY DISTURBANCES. MAY LEAD TO CHRONIC INFLAMMATION OF THE AUDITORY CANAL AND POTENTIAL DAMAGE TO THE CRANIAL NERVE PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DE O\\u00cdDO (OTITIS), MAREOS Y ALTERACIONES SENSORIALES. PUEDE PROVOCAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DEL CONDUCTO AUDITIVO Y POSIBLE DA\\u00d1O A LAS V\\u00cdAS DE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA, WHICH OFTEN COLONIZES THE EXTERNAL AND MIDDLE EAR. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE SENSORY RECEPTORS AND THE TEMPORAL LOBE, CLEARING THE PATHOGENIC LOAD THAT CAUSES PERSISTENT OTITIS AND RESTORING AUDITORY CLARITY AND EQUILIBRIUM.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA, QUE A MENUDO COLONIZA EL O\\u00cdDO EXTERNO Y MEDIO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LOS RECEPTORES SENSORIALES Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL, ELIMINANDO LA CARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA QUE CAUSA OTITIS PERSISTENTE Y RESTAURANDO LA CLARIDAD AUDITIVA Y EL EQUILIBRIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE AUDITORY MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE TEMPORAL VORTEX AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE AURICULAR AND CRANIAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PURGE BACTERIAL TOXINS THAT AFFECT THE BRAIN\'S SENSORY PROCESSING CENTERS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DEL MICRO-CHAKRA AUDITIVO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE TEMPORAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES AURICULARES Y CRANEALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTAN LOS CENTROS DE PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL DEL CEREBRO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1061','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:55:44','2026-04-25 13:55:44'),(3711,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1062,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CORRECT INFERIOR LIMB. (CORREGIR MIEMBRO INFERIOR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VESTIBULAR-LOCOMOTOR AXIS (EJE VESTIBULAR-LOCOMOTOR)\",\"symptoms\":\"LEG LENGTH DISCREPANCY, BALANCE ISSUES, AND COORDINATION DIFFICULTIES. MAY MANIFEST AS A \\\"SHORT LEG\\\" PERCEPTION DURING PHYSICAL ASSESSMENT.\\n\\n(DISCREPANCIA EN LA LONGITUD DE LAS PIERNAS, PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO Y DIFICULTADES DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DE \\\"PIERNA CORTA\\\" DURANTE LA EVALUACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"paths\":\"CORRECT INFERIOR LIMB. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC MISALIGNMENT BETWEEN THE AUDITORY EQUILIBRIUM CENTERS AND THE CONTRALATERAL TEMPORAL LOBE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RE-ESTABLISHES THE SYMMETRY OF THE BODY\'S BIOMAGNETIC FIELD, ALLOWING FOR THE INSTANT CORRECTION OF FUNCTIONAL SHORTENING IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES AND RESTORING PROPER GAIT.\\n\\n(CORREGIR MIEMBRO INFERIOR. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL DESALINEAMIENTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LOS CENTROS DE EQUILIBRIO AUDITIVO Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL CONTRALATERAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO REESTABLECE LA SIMETR\\u00cdA DEL CAMPO BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICO DEL CUERPO, PERMITIENDO LA CORRECCI\\u00d3N INSTANT\\u00c1NEA DEL ACORTAMIENTO FUNCIONAL EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES Y RESTAURANDO LA MARCHA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VESTIBULAR MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE CONTRALATERAL CRANIAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE AURICULAR AND HIP\\/LIMB MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC GEOMETRY TO ENSURE STRUCTURAL BALANCE FROM HEAD TO TOE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA VESTIBULAR Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE CRANEAL CONTRALATERAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES AURICULARES Y DE LA CADERA\\/MIEMBROS. ALINEA LA GEOMETR\\u00cdA ENERG\\u00c9TICA PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO ESTRUCTURAL DE LA CABEZA A LOS PIES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1062','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:57:09','2026-04-25 13:57:09'),(3712,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1063,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DISORDER OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. (TRASTORNO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"LEFT AUDITORY VORTEX (V\\u00d3RTICE AUDITIVO IZQUIERDO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTERNAL DISSONANCE, FEELING OVERWHELMED BY ENVIRONMENTAL NOISE, OR EMOTIONAL UNSETTLEDNESS LINKED TO COMMUNICATION.\\n\\n(DISONANCIA INTERNA, SENTIRSE ABRUMADO POR EL RUIDO AMBIENTAL O INQUIETUD EMOCIONAL VINCULADA A LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"DISORDER OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCES WITHIN THE LEFT AUDITORY CHANNEL THAT AFFECT THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS CALM NEUROMUSCULAR TENSION AND RESTORES THE BALANCE BETWEEN THE BRAIN\'S RECEPTIVE CENTERS AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION, REDUCING THE IMPACT OF EXTERNAL PSYCHOLOGICAL STRESSORS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS DENTRO DEL CANAL AUDITIVO IZQUIERDO QUE AFECTAN AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N NEUROMUSCULAR Y RESTAURA EL EQUILIBRIO ENTRE LOS CENTROS RECEPTIVOS DEL CEREBRO Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL, REDUCIENDO EL IMPACTO DE LOS ESTRESORES PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS EXTERNOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE LEFT AURICULAR MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE TEMPORAL AND CERVICAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC RECEPTIVITY TO ENSURE THAT EMOTIONAL MESSAGES ARE PROCESSED WITHOUT TRIGGERING NERVOUS SYSTEM OVERDRIVE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA AURICULAR IZQUIERDO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TEMPORALES Y CERVICALES. ALINEA LA RECEPTIVIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS MENSAJES EMOCIONALES SE PROCESEN SIN ACTIVAR UNA SOBRECARGA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1063','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:58:31','2026-04-25 13:58:31'),(3713,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1064,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RESENTMENT (RESENTIMIENTO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CARDIAC-URINARY AXIS (EJE CARDIO-URINARIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"REPRESSED EMOTIONS, DIFFICULTY LETTING GO OF THE PAST, AND PHYSICAL TENSION IN THE CHEST OR PELVIC REGION.\\n\\n(EMOCIONES REPRIMIDAS, DIFICULTAD PARA DEJAR IR EL PASADO Y TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA EN EL PECHO O LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"paths\":\"RESENTMENT (RESENTIMIENTO). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC LINK BETWEEN THE HEART\'S EMOTIONAL PROCESSING AND THE BLADDER\'S ROLE IN ELIMINATION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES ACCUMULATED RESENTMENT THAT \\\"POISONS\\\" THE SYSTEMIC FLOW, ALLOWING THE INDIVIDUAL TO PURGE OLD EMOTIONAL TOXINS AND RESTORE THE CAPACITY FOR FORGIVENESS AND RENEWED VITALITY.\\n\\n(RESENTIMIENTO. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL V\\u00cdNCULO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL PROCESAMIENTO EMOCIONAL DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL PAPEL DE LA VEJIGA EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA EL RESENTIMIENTO ACUMULADO QUE \\\"ENVENENA\\\" EL FLUJO SIST\\u00c9MICO, PERMITIENDO AL INDIVIDUO DEPURAR VIEJAS TOXINAS EMOCIONALES Y RESTAURAR LA CAPACIDAD DE PERD\\u00d3N Y VITALIDAD RENOVADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE VESICAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND LOWER PELVIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ENSURE THAT EMOTIONAL GRIEVANCES ARE NOT STORED WITHIN THE BODY\'S FLUID FILTRATION SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA CARD\\u00cdACO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE VESICAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y P\\u00c9LVICOS INFERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS AGRAVIOS EMOCIONALES NO SE ALMACENEN DENTRO DE LOS SISTEMAS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1064','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 13:59:53','2026-04-25 13:59:53'),(3714,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1065,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN (DOLOR ABDOMINAL)\",\"paths\":\"ASPHYXIATION (ASFIXIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CARDIAC-COSTAL AXIS (EJE CARDIO-COSTAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN, DISCOMFORT IN THE LEFT UPPER QUADRANT, AND SHORTNESS OF BREATH.\\n\\n(DOLOR ABDOMINAL, MALESTAR EN EL CUADRANTE SUPERIOR IZQUIERDO Y DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR.)\",\"paths\":\"ASPHYXIATION (ASFIXIA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE DYSFUNCTION BETWEEN THE CARDIAC RHYTHM AND THE MECHANICAL EXPANSION OF THE LOWER RIB CAGE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE TENSION THAT CAUSES A SENSATION OF SUFFOCATION OR ASPHYXIA, RESTORING THE SYNCHRONIZATION BETWEEN THE HEART CENTER AND THE DIAPHRAGMATIC MOVEMENT TO RELIEVE ABDOMINAL PRESSURE.\\n\\n(ASFIXIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO Y LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA DE LA PARRILLA COSTAL INFERIOR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA TENSI\\u00d3N QUE CAUSA UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SOFOCACI\\u00d3N O ASFIXIA, RESTAURANDO LA SINCRONIZACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CENTRO CARD\\u00cdACO Y EL MOVIMIENTO DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICO PARA ALIVIAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CARDIAC VORTEX AND THE COSTAL MARGIN MICRO-CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LEFT THORACIC AND UPPER GASTRIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC EXPANSION TO PREVENT COMPRESSION OF THE VITAL ORGANS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO Y LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS DEL MARGEN COSTAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS IZQUIERDOS Y G\\u00c1STRICOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA PARA EVITAR LA COMPRESI\\u00d3N DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1065','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:01:11','2026-04-25 14:01:11'),(3715,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1066,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"NEGATIVITY (NEGATIVIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CARDIAC CENTER (CENTRO CARD\\u00cdACO)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEELING OVERWHELMED BY NEGATIVE VIBRATIONS, EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS, AND A LACK OF SPIRITUAL OR EMOTIONAL CLARITY. MAY MANIFEST AS PHYSICAL TENSION IN THE CENTER OF THE CHEST.\\n\\n(SENTIRSE ABRUMADO POR VIBRACIONES NEGATIVAS, PESADEZ EMOCIONAL Y FALTA DE CLARIDAD ESPIRITUAL O EMOCIONAL. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA EN EL CENTRO DEL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"NEGATIVITY (NEGATIVIDAD). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF NEGATIVE ENERGY OR \\\"CLOUDS\\\" WITHIN THE HEART\'S ELECTROMAGNETIC FIELD. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THESE DENSE VIBRATIONS, ALLOWING THE HEART TO RETURN TO ITS NATURAL STATE OF COHERENCE. IT PURIFIES THE CARDIAC VORTEX, PROMOTING A SENSE OF PEACE, OPENNESS, AND PROTECTION AGAINST EXTERNAL EMOTIONAL DISSONANCE.\\n\\n(NEGATIVIDAD. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE ENERG\\u00cdA NEGATIVA O \\\"NUBES\\\" DENTRO DEL CAMPO ELECTROMAGN\\u00c9TICO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA ESTAS VIBRACIONES DENSAS, PERMITIENDO QUE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N VUELVA A SU ESTADO NATURAL DE COHERENCIA. PURIFICA EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PAZ, APERTURA Y PROTECCI\\u00d3N CONTRA LA DISONANCIA EMOCIONAL EXTERNA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PRIMARY CARDIAC VORTEX AND THE THYMUS MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND PERICARDIAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE CENTRAL ENERGETIC AXIS TO ENSURE THE UNINTERRUPTED FLOW OF UNCONDITIONAL LOVE AND SYSTEMIC HARMONY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO PRIMARIO Y EL MICRO-CHAKRA DEL TIMO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y PERIC\\u00c1RDICOS. ALINEA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO CENTRAL PARA ASEGURAR EL FLUJO ININTERRUMPIDO DE AMOR INCONDICIONAL Y ARMON\\u00cdA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1066','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:10:56','2026-04-25 14:10:56'),(3716,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1067,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DISTRESS (ANGUSTIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CARDIAC-RENAL AXIS (EJE CARDIO-RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP FEELINGS OF APPREHENSION, OVERWHELMING WORRY, AND A SENSATION OF PRESSURE IN THE CHEST LINKED TO PHYSICAL VITALITY.\\n\\n(SENTIMIENTOS PROFUNDOS DE APREHENSI\\u00d3N, PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N ABRUMADORA Y UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO VINCULADA A LA VITALIDAD F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"paths\":\"DISTRESS (ANGUSTIA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF ACUTE DISTRESS THAT DISRUPTS THE HEART\'S RHYTHM AND IMPACTS RENAL FILTRATION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE \\\"WEIGHT\\\" OF ANXIETY, STABILIZING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE BODY\\u2019S EMOTIONAL CORE AND ITS VITAL FLUID BALANCE, ALLOWING FOR A RETURN TO CALM AND SYSTEMIC COHERENCE.\\n\\n(ANGUSTIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA ANGUSTIA AGUDA QUE ALTERA EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO E IMPACTA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA EL \\\"PESO\\\" DE LA ANSIEDAD, ESTABILIZANDO LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL N\\u00daCLEO EMOCIONAL DEL CUERPO Y SU EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS VITALES, PERMITIENDO EL REGRESO A LA CALMA Y LA COHERENCIA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE RIGHT RENAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND RIGHT LUMBAR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE EMOTIONAL FIELD TO ENSURE THAT ACUTE STRESS DOES NOT MANIFEST AS PHYSICAL DYSFUNCTION IN THE FILTRATION ORGANS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA CARD\\u00cdACO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE RENAL DERECHO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y LUMBARES DERECHOS. ALINEA EL CAMPO EMOCIONAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL ESTR\\u00c9S AGUDO NO SE MANIFIESTE COMO DISFUNCI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA EN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1067','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:12:18','2026-04-25 14:12:18'),(3717,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1068,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ENVY (ENVIDIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CARDIAC-PANCREATIC AXIS (EJE CARDIO-PANCRE\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"IMBALANCE IN THE PROCESSING OF EMOTIONS RELATED TO OTHERS\' ACHIEVEMENTS, TENSION IN THE CHEST, OR DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT LINKED TO NEGATIVE MOODS.\\n\\n(DESEQUILIBRIO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LAS EMOCIONES RELACIONADAS CON EL LOGRO AJENO, TENSI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO O MALESTAR DIGESTIVO VINCULADO A ESTADOS DE \\u00c1NIMO NEGATIVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"ENVY (ENVIDIA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF ENVY, AN EMOTION THAT CAN \\\"BITTER\\\" THE PANCREATIC FUNCTION AND CLOSE THE HEART\'S ELECTROMAGNETIC FIELD. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ALLOWS FOR THE RELEASE OF THIS DISSONANT VIBRATION, RESTORING SWEETNESS TO LIFE AND THE HEART\'S CAPACITY TO REJOICE IN BOTH SELF AND OTHERS\' WELL-BEING, THUS BALANCING ENERGY PRODUCTION AND CARDIAC RHYTHM.\\n\\n(ENVIDIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA ENVIDIA, UNA EMOCI\\u00d3N QUE PUEDE \\\"AMARGAR\\\" LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y CERRAR EL CAMPO ELECTROMAGN\\u00c9TICO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO PERMITE LIBERAR ESTA VIBRACI\\u00d3N DISONANTE, RESTAURANDO LA DULZURA EN LA VIDA Y LA CAPACIDAD DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N PARA REGOCIJARSE CON EL BIENESTAR PROPIO Y AJENO, EQUILIBRANDO AS\\u00cd LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE PANCREATIC VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND UPPER ABDOMINAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO TRANSFORM EMOTIONAL SCARCITY INTO FULFILLMENT AND SYSTEMIC REGENERATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA CARD\\u00cdACO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE PANCRE\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y ABDOMINALES SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA TRANSFORMAR LA CARENCIA EMOCIONAL EN PLENITUD Y REGENERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1068','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:14:37','2026-04-25 14:14:37'),(3718,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1069,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MUSCLE PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, DIARRHEA. (FIEBRE, DOLOR MUSCULAR, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"DEMYELINATING DISEASE OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN WHICH THE MYELIN SHEATH OF NEURONS IS DAMAGED. (ENFERMEDAD DESMIELINIZANTE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN LA QUE SE DA\\u00d1A LA VAINA DE MIELINA DE LAS NEURONAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MUSCLE PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, AND DIARRHEA. MAY ALSO PRESENT AS RESPIRATORY DISCOMFORT OR CHEST TIGHTNESS DUE TO PLEURAL INVOLVEMENT.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DOLOR MUSCULAR, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS Y DIARREA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE PRESENTARSE COMO MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO O OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO DEBIDO A LA AFECTACI\\u00d3N PLEURAL.)\",\"paths\":\"DEMYELINATING DISEASE OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN WHICH THE MYELIN SHEATH OF NEURONS IS DAMAGED. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES, WHICH CAN CROSS THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE CARDIAC PUMP AND THE PROTECTIVE MEMBRANE OF THE LUNGS, PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM IMPACTING NEUROLOGICAL INTEGRITY AND SYSTEMIC VITALITY.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD DESMIELINIZANTE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN LA QUE SE DA\\u00d1A LA VAINA DE MIELINA DE LAS NEURONAS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES, QUE PUEDE ATRAVESAR LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA BOMBA CARD\\u00cdACA Y LA MEMBRANA PROTECTORA DE LOS PULMONES, EVITANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO IMPACTE LA INTEGRIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CARDIAC VORTEX AND THE LEFT PLEURAL MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND PERICARDIAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC SHIELDING OF THE VITAL ORGANS TO PURGE BACTERIAL TOXINS THAT THREATEN THE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO Y EL MICRO-CHAKRA PLEURAL IZQUIERDO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y PERIC\\u00c1RDICOS. ALINEA EL BLINDAJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS QUE AMENAZAN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1069','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:15:57','2026-04-25 14:15:57'),(3719,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1070,'{\"symptoms\":\"BRONCHITIS, EMPHYSEMA, COLDS. (BRONQUITIS, ENFISEMA, RESFRIADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY TRACT INFECTION, OTITIS, PULMONARY INFECTIONS, COPD (CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE) (INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO, OTITIS, INFECCIONES PULMONARES, EPOC (ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BRONCHITIS, EMPHYSEMA, COLDS. MAY ALSO CAUSE EAR INFECTIONS AND SINUSITIS.\\n\\n(BRONQUITIS, ENFISEMA, RESFRIADOS. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CAUSAR INFECCIONES DE O\\u00cdDO Y SINUSITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY TRACT INFECTION, OTITIS, PULMONARY INFECTIONS, COPD (CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE CARDIAC SYSTEM AND THE UPPER GASTRIC REGION, PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM COMPROMISING RESPIRATORY EFFICIENCY AND REDUCING CHRONIC INFLAMMATION IN THE PULMONARY TRACT.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO, OTITIS, INFECCIONES PULMONARES, EPOC (ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA). ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL SISTEMA CARD\\u00cdACO Y LA REGI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA SUPERIOR, EVITANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO COMPROMETA LA EFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA Y REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA EN EL TRACTO PULMONAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CARDIAC VORTEX AND THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND EPIGASTRIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE BACTERIAL LOADS THAT IMPACT BOTH CIRCULATORY AND RESPIRATORY HARMONY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO Y EL MICRO-CHAKRA G\\u00c1STRICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y EPIG\\u00c1STRICOS. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE IMPACTAN TANTO LA ARMON\\u00cdA CIRCULATORIA COMO LA RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1070','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:17:04','2026-04-25 14:17:04'),(3720,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1204,'{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, FEVER, SORE THROAT, MUSCLE ACHES, HEADACHE, AND SHORTNESS OF BREATH. (TOS, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR.)\",\"paths\":\"BIRD FLU. (GRIPE AVIAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, FEVER, SORE THROAT, MUSCLE ACHES, HEADACHE, AND SHORTNESS OF BREATH.\\n\\n(TOS, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR.)\",\"paths\":\"BIRD FLU (GRIPE AVIAR). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL RESONANCE ASSOCIATED WITH AVIAN INFLUENZA STRAINS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC INTERACTION BETWEEN THE GALLBLADDER\'S FILTRATION ROLE AND THE SPLEEN\'S IMMUNE RESPONSE, HELPING THE BODY TO RECOGNIZE AND ELIMINATE VIRAL LOADS THAT TARGET THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM AND SYSTEMIC VITALITY.\\n\\n(GRIPE AVIAR. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL ASOCIADA CON LAS CEPAS DE INFLUENZA AVIAR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL PAPEL DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA DEL BAZO, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A RECONOCER Y ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE ATACAN EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO Y LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VESICULAR MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE SPLENIC VORTEX AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE HEPATIC AND PANCREATIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE VIRAL TOXINS AND RESTORE METABOLIC HARMONY DURING FEBRILE STATES.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DEL MICRO-CHAKRA VESICULAR Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE ESPL\\u00c9NICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y RESTAURAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA METAB\\u00d3LICA DURANTE ESTADOS FEBRILES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1204','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:18:32','2026-04-25 14:18:32'),(3721,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1072,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"METABOLIC (METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CARDIAC-THYROID AXIS (EJE CARDIO-TIROIDEO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PALPITATIONS, WEIGHT FLUCTUATIONS, TEMPERATURE DYSREGULATION, EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, AND FATIGUE. MAY ALSO RELATE TO SPEECH DIFFICULTIES OR A SENSATION OF TIGHTNESS IN THE UPPER CHEST AND THROAT.\\n\\n(PALPITACIONES, FLUCTUACIONES DE PESO, DISREGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA TEMPERATURA, INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y FATIGA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE RELACIONARSE CON DIFICULTADES EN EL HABLA O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE OPRESI\\u00d3N EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR DEL PECHO Y LA GARGANTA.)\",\"paths\":\"METABOLIC (METAB\\u00d3LICO). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE DYSFUNCTION BETWEEN THE HEART RHYTHM AND THE THYROID GLAND\'S METABOLIC CONTROL. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE EMOTIONAL CORE AND THE SYSTEMIC REGULATOR, OPTIMIZING THE BODY\'S ENERGY EXPENDITURE AND HARMONIZING THE INTERACTION BETWEEN CIRCULATION AND GLANDULAR HORMONE RELEASE.\\n\\n(METAB\\u00d3LICO. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO Y EL CONTROL METAB\\u00d3LICO DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL N\\u00daCLEO EMOCIONAL Y EL REGULADOR SIST\\u00c9MICO, OPTIMIZANDO EL GASTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CUERPO Y ARMONIZANDO LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N Y LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS GLANDULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CARDIAC VORTEX AND THE THYROID MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CERVICAL AND UPPER THORACIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ENSURE THAT METABOLIC COMMANDS ARE IN SYNC WITH THE HEART\\u2019S VITAL RHYTHM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO Y EL EJE DEL MICRO-CHAKRA TIROIDEO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CERVICALES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS COMANDOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS EST\\u00c9N EN SINTON\\u00cdA CON EL RITMO VITAL DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1072','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:20:12','2026-04-25 14:20:12'),(3722,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1073,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"IMPROVES THE WHITE BLOOD CELL PRODUCTION. RAISING THE QUALITY OF LYMPHOCYTES. (MEJORA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS. ELEVA LA CALIDAD DE LOS LINFOCITOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LOW IMMUNE RESPONSE, FREQUENT INFECTIONS, FATIGUE, AND LYMPHATIC CONGESTION. MAY RELATE TO A DECREASE IN THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO DEFEND AGAINST EXTERNAL PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(BAJA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA, INFECCIONES FRECUENTES, FATIGA Y CONGESTI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA. PUEDE RELACIONARSE CON UNA DISMINUCI\\u00d3N EN LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA DEFENDERSE CONTRA PAT\\u00d3GENOS EXTERNOS.)\",\"paths\":\"IMPROVES THE WHITE BLOOD CELL PRODUCTION. RAISING THE QUALITY OF LYMPHOCYTES. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC SYNERGY BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE APPENDIX, WHICH ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR BENEFICIAL BACTERIA AND IMMUNE CELLS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET OPTIMIZES THE MATURATION OF T-CELLS AND STRENGTHENS THE SYSTEMIC IMMUNE BARRIER, ENHANCING THE QUALITY OF THE BLOOD AND LYMPH.\\n\\n(MEJORA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS. ELEVA LA CALIDAD DE LOS LINFOCITOS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA SINERGIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL AP\\u00c9NDICE, QUE ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO DE BACTERIAS BENEFICIOSAS Y C\\u00c9LULAS INMUNITARIAS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO OPTIMIZA LA MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS T Y REFUERZA LA BARRERA INMUNITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA, MEJORANDO LA CALIDAD DE LA SANGRE Y LA LINFA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE APPENDICULAR VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND LOWER INTESTINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO BOOST VITALITY AND ENSURE THE PROPER DISCRIMINATION BETWEEN SELF AND NON-SELF PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE APENDICULAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TOR\\u00c1CICOS E INTESTINALES INFERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA AUMENTAR LA VITALIDAD Y ASEGURAR LA CORRECTA DISCRIMINACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PROPIOS Y AJENOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1073','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:21:38','2026-04-25 14:21:38'),(3723,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1074,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ALLERGIES (ALERGIAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE-LYMPHATIC AXIS (EJE INMUNE-LINF\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE SENSITIVITY TO ENVIRONMENTAL TRIGGERS, SKIN IRRITATIONS, SNEEZING, AND WATERING EYES. MAY MANIFEST AS AN OVERACTIVE IMMUNE RESPONSE TO NON-THREATENING SUBSTANCES.\\n\\n(SENSIBILIDAD EXCESIVA A LOS DESENCADENANTES AMBIENTALES, IRRITACIONES DE LA PIEL, ESTORNUDOS Y LAGRIMEO. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA HIPERACTIVA A SUSTANCIAS NO AMENAZANTES.)\",\"paths\":\"ALLERGIES (ALERGIAS). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC MISCOMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE AXILLARY LYMPH NODES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET CALMS THE BODY\'S HYPERSENSITIVITY, REGULATING THE RELEASE OF HISTAMINES AND REBALANCING THE IMMUNE SHIELD TO PREVENT EXAGGERATED REACTIONS TO ALLERGENS.\\n\\n(ALERGIAS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA FALTA DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS AXILARES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO CALMA LA HIPERSENSIBILIDAD DEL CUERPO, REGULANDO LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE HISTAMINAS Y REEQUILIBRANDO EL ESCUDO INMUNITARIO PARA EVITAR REACCIONES EXAGERADAS A LOS AL\\u00c9RGENOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE AXILLARY LYMPHATIC VORTICES. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ARM AND UPPER THORACIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ENSURE THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM PROCESSES EXTERNAL PARTICLES WITHOUT TRIGGERING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES LINF\\u00c1TICOS AXILARES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL BRAZO Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO PROCESE LAS PART\\u00cdCULAS EXTERNAS SIN ACTIVAR UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1074','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:22:50','2026-04-25 14:22:50'),(3724,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1075,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SPREAD BY CONTAMINATED AIR SUPPLIES. LUNG AND AIRWAY DISORDERS. HEART FAILURE. WEAKENS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. (SE PROPAGA POR SUMINISTROS DE AIRE CONTAMINADOS. TRASTORNOS PULMONARES Y DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS. INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA. DEBILITA EL SISTEMA INMUNOL\\u00d3GICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, FEVER, MUSCLE ACHES, AND HEADACHES. MAY LEAD TO SEVERE LUNG AND AIRWAY DISORDERS AND POTENTIAL HEART FAILURE IN ACUTE CASES.\\n\\n(TOS, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, FIEBRE, DOLORES MUSCULARES Y DOLORES DE CABEZA. PUEDE PROVOCAR TRASTORNOS GRAVES DE LOS PULMONES Y DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS E INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA POTENCIAL EN CASOS AGUDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"SPREAD BY CONTAMINATED AIR SUPPLIES. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF LEGIONELLA, WHICH TARGETS THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM AND WEAKENS THE IMMUNE RESPONSE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE IMMUNE-PRODUCING THYMUS AND THE GASTRIC-RESPIRATORY JUNCTION AT THE CARDIA, PROTECTING THE HEART AND LUNGS FROM PATHOGENIC OVERLOAD.\\n\\n(SE PROPAGA POR SUMINISTROS DE AIRE CONTAMINADOS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE LEGIONELLA, QUE ATACA EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO Y DEBILITA LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL TIMO (PRODUCTOR DE INMUNIDAD) Y LA UNI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA-RESPIRATORIA EN EL CARDIAS, PROTEGIENDO EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y LOS PULMONES DE LA SOBRECARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE CARDIA VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER GASTRIC AND THORACIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE AIRBORNE TOXINS AND RESTORE RESPIRATORY COHERENCE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE DEL CARDIAS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES G\\u00c1STRICOS SUPERIORES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS AEROPORTADAS Y RESTAURAR LA COHERENCIA RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1075','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:24:07','2026-04-25 14:24:07'),(3725,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1076,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EXTREME GREED FOR WEALTH. (CODICIA EXTREMA POR LA RIQUEZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"THYMIC-PITUITARY AXIS (EJE T\\u00cdMICO-HIPOFISARIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INSATIABLE DESIRE FOR MATERIAL ACCUMULATION, ANXIETY REGARDING FINANCIAL STATUS, AND A LACK OF SPIRITUAL SATISFACTION. MAY MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS ENDOCRINE IMBALANCE OR TENSION IN THE UPPER CHEST.\\n\\n(DESEO INSACIABLE DE ACUMULACI\\u00d3N MATERIAL, ANSIEDAD POR EL ESTADO FINANCIERO Y FALTA DE SATISFACCI\\u00d3N ESPIRITUAL. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO DESEQUILIBRIO ENDOCRINO O TENSI\\u00d3N EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR DEL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"EXTREME GREED FOR WEALTH (CODICIA EXTREMA POR LA RIQUEZA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL RESONANCE OF GREED THAT DISRUPTS THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE BODY\'S IMMUNE DEFENSE AND THE MASTER GLAND. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE VIBRATION OF SCARCITY AND ACCUMULATION, RESTORING A BALANCE BETWEEN MATERIAL NEEDS AND SPIRITUAL WELL-BEING, ALLOWING THE INDIVIDUAL TO FIND CONTENTMENT AND FLOW.\\n\\n(CODICIA EXTREMA POR LA RIQUEZA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL DE LA CODICIA QUE ALTERA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA DEFENSA INMUNITARIA DEL CUERPO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA VIBRACI\\u00d3N DE CARENCIA Y ACUMULACI\\u00d3N, RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO ENTRE LAS NECESIDADES MATERIALES Y EL BIENESTAR ESPIRITUAL, PERMITIENDO AL INDIVIDUO ENCONTRAR SATISFACCI\\u00d3N Y FLUJO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE PITUITARY VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER THORACIC AND CRANIAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC AXIS TO ENSURE THAT MATERIAL AMBITION DOES NOT COMPROMISE INNER PEACE OR SYSTEMIC HARMONY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE DE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES Y CRANEALES. ALINEA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA AMBICI\\u00d3N MATERIAL NO COMPROMETA LA PAZ INTERIOR NI LA ARMON\\u00cdA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1076','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:25:18','2026-04-25 14:25:18'),(3726,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1077,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, SEVERE DIARRHEA (OFTEN BLOODY), AND VOMITING. MAY MANIFEST AS FEVER, FATIGUE, AND HEPATIC DISCOMFORT IF THE BACTERIAL LOAD AFFECTS LIVER FUNCTION.\\n\\n(C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES, DIARREA SEVERA (A MENUDO CON SANGRE) Y V\\u00d3MITOS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO FIEBRE, FATIGA Y MALESTAR HEP\\u00c1TICO SI LA CARGA BACTERIANA AFECTA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO.)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF ESCHERICHIA COLI WITHIN THE HEPATIC SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE IMMUNE-MODULATING THYMUS AND THE LIVER\\u2019S FILTRATION SYSTEM, CLEARING THE PATHOGENIC LOAD THAT CAUSES INFLAMMATION AND RESTORING VITAL METABOLIC AND DEFENSIVE BALANCE.\\n\\n(HEPATITIS L. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE ESCHERICHIA COLI DENTRO DEL SISTEMA HEP\\u00c1TICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL TIMO, MODULADOR DE LA INMUNIDAD, Y EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO, ELIMINANDO LA CARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA QUE CAUSA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y DEFENSIVO VITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE HEPATIC VORTEX AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND UPPER ABDOMINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PURGE TOXINS AND REGENERATE LIVER TISSUE DURING BACTERIAL INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DEL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE HEP\\u00c1TICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y DEL ABDOMEN SUPERIOR. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR TOXINAS Y REGENERAR EL TEJIDO HEP\\u00c1TICO DURANTE INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1077','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:26:25','2026-04-25 14:26:25'),(3727,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1080,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AVARICE - EXTREME GREED FOR MONEY AND MATERIAL THINGS. (AVARICIA - CODICIA EXTREMA POR EL DINERO Y LAS COSAS MATERIALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"THYMIC-PITUITARY AXIS (EJE T\\u00cdMICO-HIPOFISARIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY REGARDING MATERIAL SECURITY, PERSISTENT FEELINGS OF SCARCITY, AND AN OVERPOWERING COMPULSION TO ACCUMULATE WEALTH. MAY MANIFEST AS ENDOCRINE DYSREGULATION OR A SENSATION OF TIGHTNESS IN THE UPPER CHEST.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD RESPECTO A LA SEGURIDAD MATERIAL, SENTIMIENTOS PERSISTENTES DE CARENCIA Y UNA COMPULSI\\u00d3N ABRUMADORA POR ACUMULAR RIQUEZA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DESREGULACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE OPRESI\\u00d3N EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR DEL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"AVARICE - EXTREME GREED FOR MONEY AND MATERIAL THINGS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL RESONANCE OF AVARICE THAT DISRUPTS THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE IMMUNE DEFENSE AND THE BRAIN\'S REGULATORY CENTERS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE DENSE VIBRATION OF GREED, RESTORING A SENSE OF SPIRITUAL PLENITUDE AND ALIGNING THE MASTER GLANDS TO PROMOTE GENEROSITY AND INNER BALANCE.\\n\\n(AVARICIA - CODICIA EXTREMA POR EL DINERO Y LAS COSAS MATERIALES. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL DE LA AVARICIA QUE ALTERA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA DEFENSA INMUNITARIA Y LOS CENTROS REGULADORES DEL CEREBRO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA VIBRACI\\u00d3N DENSA DE LA CODICIA, RESTAURANDO UN SENTIDO DE PLENITUD ESPIRITUAL Y ALINEANDO LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS MAESTRAS PARA PROMOVER LA GENEROSIDAD Y EL EQUILIBRIO INTERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE PITUITARY VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER THORACIC AND CRANIAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ENSURE THAT MATERIAL AMBITION DOES NOT OVERPOWER THE BODY\'S VITAL FREQUENCY OR EMOTIONAL HEALTH.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE DE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES Y CRANEALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA AMBICI\\u00d3N MATERIAL NO DOMINE LA FRECUENCIA VITAL DEL CUERPO NI LA SALUD EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1080','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:28:09','2026-04-25 14:28:09'),(3728,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1082,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INPATIENCE (IMPACENCIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"THYMIC-GONADAL AXIS (EJE T\\u00cdMICO-GONADAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SENSATIONS OF URGENCY, IRRITABILITY, AND A CONSTANT NEED FOR IMMEDIATE RESULTS. MAY MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS INCREASED HEART RATE, MUSCLE TENSION, OR HORMONAL FLUCTUATIONS DRIVEN BY STRESS.\\n\\n(SENSACIONES DE URGENCIA, IRRITABILIDAD Y UNA NECESIDAD CONSTANTE DE RESULTADOS INMEDIATOS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO AUMENTO DEL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO, TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR O FLUCTUACIONES HORMONALES IMPULSADAS POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"paths\":\"INPATIENCE (IMPACENCIA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC FRICTION CREATED BY IMPAFIENCE, WHICH CAN OVERSTIMULATE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND DRAIN VITAL ENERGY. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET CALMS THE THYMIC RESPONSE AND STABILIZES THE GONADAL FIELD, ALLOWING THE INDIVIDUAL TO SYNC WITH THE NATURAL RHYTHM OF LIFE, PROMOTING TOLERANCE, PERSISTENCE, AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(IMPACENCIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA FRICCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA CREADA POR LA IMPACIENCIA, QUE PUEDE SOBREESTIMULAR EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y AGOTAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO CALMA LA RESPUESTA T\\u00cdMICA Y ESTABILIZA EL CAMPO GONADAL, PERMITIENDO AL INDIVIDUO SINCRONIZARSE CON EL RITMO NATURAL DE LA VIDA, PROMOVIENDO LA TOLERANCIA, LA PERSISTENCIA Y EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE REPRODUCTIVE VORTICES. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LOWER PELVIC AND UPPER THORACIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ENSURE THAT EMOTIONAL URGENCY DOES NOT DEPLETE THE BODY\'S VITALITY OR ENDOCRINE STABILITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES REPRODUCTIVOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES P\\u00c9LVICOS INFERIORES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA URGENCIA EMOCIONAL NO AGOTE LA VITALIDAD DEL CUERPO NI LA ESTABILIDAD ENDOCRINA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1082','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:29:45','2026-04-25 14:29:45'),(3729,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1083,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE, BRONCHITIS COMMON EMPHYSEMA, RESPIRATORY FAILURE. (ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA, BRONQUITIS COM\\u00daN, ENFISEMA, FALLA RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"IT REGENERATES THE PULMONARY SURFACTANT. (REGENERA EL SURFACTANTE PULMONAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PULMONARY-IMMUNE AXIS (EJE PULMONAR-INMUNE)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE (COPD), BRONCHITIS, COMMON EMPHYSEMA, AND RESPIRATORY FAILURE. MAY MANIFEST AS SEVERE DIFFICULTY BREATHING OR LOW OXYGEN SATURATION.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA (EPOC), BRONQUITIS COM\\u00daN, ENFISEMA Y FALLA RESPIRATORIA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DIFICULTAD GRAVE PARA RESPIRAR O BAJA SATURACI\\u00d3N DE OX\\u00cdGENO.)\",\"paths\":\"IT REGENERATES THE PULMONARY SURFACTANT. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DEFICIENCY IN THE LUNGS BY STIMULATING THE PRODUCTION OF SURFACTANT, THE LIPOPROTEIN COMPLEX ESSENTIAL FOR PREVENTING ALVEOLAR COLLAPSE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET REBALANCES THE INTERACTION BETWEEN THE THYMUS (IMMUNE MODULATION) AND THE SPLEEN (BLOOD FILTRATION), ENHANCING THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO REPAIR LUNG TISSUE AND IMPROVE RESPIRATORY CAPACITY.\\n\\n(REGENERA EL SURFACTANTE PULMONAR. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DEFICIENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA EN LOS PULMONES AL ESTIMULAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE SURFACTANTE, EL COMPLEJO LIPOPROTEICO ESENCIAL PARA PREVENIR EL COLAPSO ALVEOLAR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO REEQUILIBRA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL TIMO (MODULACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA) Y EL BAZO (FILTRACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA), MEJORANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA REPARAR EL TEJIDO PULMONAR Y MEJORAR LA CAPACIDAD RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE SPLENIC VORTEX AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND LEFT HYPOCHONDRIUM MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO SUPPORT DEEP CELLULAR OXYGENATION AND SYSTEMIC VITALITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y EL EJE DEL V\\u00d3RTICE ESPL\\u00c9NICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y DEL HIPOCONDRIO IZQUIERDO. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA APOYAR LA OXIGENACI\\u00d3N CELULAR PROFUNDA Y LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1083','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:30:58','2026-04-25 14:30:58'),(3730,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1084,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE WEAKNESS, HORMONAL DISHARMONY, AND FEVER. (DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, DISARMON\\u00cdA HORMONAL Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"IMMUNODEFICIENCY, SHORTAGE OF CD3 AND CD4 THYMUS HORMONE. (INMUNODEFICIENCIA, FALTA DE HORMONA DEL TIMO CD3 Y CD4.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE REGULATORY CENTER (CENTRO REGULADOR INMUNITARIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE WEAKNESS, HORMONAL DISHARMONY, AND FEVER. MAY MANIFEST AS GENERALIZED FATIGUE AND A VULNERABILITY TO PERSISTENT INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, DISARMON\\u00cdA HORMONAL Y FIEBRE. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO FATIGA GENERALIZADA Y VULNERABILIDAD A INFECCIONES PERSISTENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"IMMUNODEFICIENCY (INMUNODEFICIENCIA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES A SHORTAGE OF CD3 AND CD4 THYMUS HORMONES, WHICH ARE CRITICAL FOR T-CELL MATURATION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STIMULATES THE GLAND\'S CORE FUNCTION, BOOSTING THE PRODUCTION OF VITAL DEFENSE CELLS AND RESTORING THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO RECOGNIZE AND NEUTRALIZE EXTERNAL THREATS.\\n\\n(INMUNODEFICIENCIA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA FALTA DE HORMONAS DEL TIMO CD3 Y CD4, QUE SON CR\\u00cdTICAS PARA LA MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS T. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTIMULA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CENTRAL DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA, AUMENTANDO LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS DE DEFENSA VITALES Y RESTAURANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA RECONOCER Y NEUTRALIZAR AMENAZAS EXTERNAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES DIRECTLY TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA, THE SEAT OF IMMUNE INTELLIGENCE. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER THORACIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC SHIELD TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC VITALITY AND THE PROPER REGULATION OF GROWTH AND DEFENSE HORMONES.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA DIRECTAMENTE CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO, LA SEDE DE LA INTELIGENCIA INMUNITARIA. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL ESCUDO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS HORMONAS DE CRECIMIENTO Y DEFENSA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1084','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:32:19','2026-04-25 14:32:19'),(3731,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1085,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY EATING CONTAMINATED PORK. TRICHINOSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR COMER CERDO CONTAMINADO. TRICONELOSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET, FEVER, CHILLS, AND SORENESS OR SWELLING IN THE MUSCLES. MAY MANIFEST AS DISCOMFORT IN THE JAW OR TONGUE AREA DURING MASTICATION.\\n\\n(MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL, FIEBRE, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS Y DOLOR O HINCHAZ\\u00d3N EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO MOLESTIA EN EL \\u00c1REA DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA O LA LENGUA DURANTE LA MASTICACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"TRICHINOSIS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITIC RESONANCE OF TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS, OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY EATING CONTAMINATED PORK. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE IMMUNE-MODULATING THYMUS AND THE MUSCULAR TISSUE OF THE TONGUE, ASSISTING THE BODY IN PURGING THE PARASITIC LOAD AND REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION CAUSED BY THE LARVAE.\\n\\n(TRICINELOSIS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA DE TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDA POR COMER CERDO CONTAMINADO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL TIMO, MODULADOR DE LA INMUNIDAD, Y EL TEJIDO MUSCULAR DE LA LENGUA, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A DEPURAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA Y REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA CAUSADA POR LAS LARVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE GLOSSAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE MANDIBULAR AND UPPER THORACIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO RECOGNIZE AND ELIMINATE PARASITIC PATHOGENS THAT TARGET MUSCULAR STRUCTURES.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA T\\u00cdMICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE GLOSAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES MANDIBULARES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA RECONOCER Y ELIMINAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS PARASITARIOS QUE ATACAN LAS ESTRUCTURAS MUSCULARES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1085','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:42:19','2026-04-25 14:42:19'),(3732,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1086,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MENTAL RETARDATION, AUTISM, CEREBRAL PALSY, DOWN SYNDROME, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (RETRASO MENTAL, AUTISMO, PAR\\u00c1LISIS CEREBRAL, S\\u00cdNDROME DE DOWN, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"COGNITIVE AND NEUROLOGICAL DELAYS, EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, AND VARIED PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS THAT DO NOT CLEAR WITH STANDARD PAIRS. IT MAY MANIFEST AS A \\\"STUCK\\\" STATE IN HEALING PROGRESS.\\n\\n(RETRASO COGNITIVO Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICO, INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS VARIADOS QUE NO SE ELIMINAN CON PARES EST\\u00c1NDAR. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN ESTADO DE \\\"ESTANCAMIENTO\\\" EN EL PROGRESO DE LA CURACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"MENTAL RETARDATION, AUTISM, DOWN SYNDROME, CEREBRAL PALSY, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. THIS PAIR ACTS AS A UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR THAT CAN HOLD VARIOUS PATHOGENS OR ENERGETIC CODES THAT IMPACT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE VAGUS NERVE\'S REGULATORY FUNCTION OVER THE VITAL ORGANS AND CLEARING THE RENAL AXIS, POTENTIALLY IMPROVING NEUROLOGICAL CONNECTIVITY AND SYSTEMIC RESPONSIVENESS IN COMPLEX SYNDROMES.\\n\\n(RETRASO MENTAL, AUTISMO, S\\u00cdNDROME DE DOWN, PAR\\u00c1LISIS CEREBRAL, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL QUE PUEDE ALBERGAR VARIOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS O C\\u00d3DIGOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE IMPACTAN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N REGULADORA DEL NERVIO VAGO SOBRE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES Y DEPURA EL EJE RENAL, MEJORANDO POTENCIALMENTE LA CONECTIVIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y LA RESPUESTA SIST\\u00c9MICA EN S\\u00cdNDROMES COMPLEJOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THIRD EYE (AJNA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CRANIAL NERVE VORTEX AND THE OPPOSITE RENAL MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CERVICAL AND LUMBAR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC TRANSMISSION ALONG THE SPINAL AXIS TO ENSURE CLEAR COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE BRAIN AND THE LOWER VITAL CENTERS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: TERCER OJO (AJNA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE DEL NERVIO CRANEAL Y EL MICRO-CHAKRA RENAL OPUESTO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CERVICALES Y LUMBARES. ALINEA LA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA A LO LARGO DEL EJE ESPINAL PARA ASEGURAR UNA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N CLARA ENTRE EL CEREBRO Y LOS CENTROS VITALES INFERIORES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1086','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:43:41','2026-04-25 14:43:41'),(3733,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1087,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE, EMOTIONAL EXHAUSTION, AND ADRENAL BURNOUT. MAY MANIFEST AS A \\\"STAGNANT\\\" RECOVERY PROCESS WHERE THE BODY FAILS TO RESPOND TO OTHER TREATMENTS DUE TO DEEP-SEATED PATHOGENIC STORAGE.\\n\\n(FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, AGOTAMIENTO EMOCIONAL Y AGOTAMIENTO ADRENAL. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N \\\"ESTANCADO\\\" DONDE EL CUERPO NO RESPONDE A OTROS TRATAMIENTOS DEBIDO AL ALMACENAMIENTO PATOG\\u00c9NICO PROFUNDO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ACTS AS A UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR, NEUTRALIZING PATHOGENS THAT HIDE IN THE NERVOUS AND ENDOCRINE SYSTEMS. IT STABILIZES THE VAGUS NERVE\'S GOVERNANCE OVER THE PARASYMPATHETIC SYSTEM WHILE BALANCING THE ADRENAL RESPONSE. BY CLEARING THIS AXIS, IT RELEASES SYSTEMIC TENSION AND ALLOWS THE BODY TO REGAIN ITS NATURAL HEALING RHYTHM, ADDRESSING UNDERLYING FACTORS IN AUTOIMMUNE AND DEGENERATIVE CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL, NEUTRALIZANDO PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE SE ESCONDEN EN LOS SISTEMAS NERVIOSO Y ENDOCRINO. ESTABILIZA EL MANDO DEL NERVIO VAGO SOBRE EL SISTEMA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO MIENTRAS EQUILIBRA LA RESPUESTA ADRENAL. AL DEPURAR ESTE EJE, LIBERA LA TENSI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PERMITE QUE EL CUERPO RECUPERE SU RITMO NATURAL DE CURACI\\u00d3N, ABORDANDO FACTORES SUBYACENTES EN CONDICIONES AUTOINMUNES Y DEGENERATIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THIRD EYE (AJNA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CRANIAL NERVE VORTEX AND THE SUPRARENAL MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CERVICAL AND ADRENAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE \\\"REST AND DIGEST\\\" COMMANDS WITH THE BODY\'S STRESS-RESPONSE CENTERS TO ENSURE ADAPTABILITY AND VITALITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: TERCER OJO (AJNA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE DEL NERVIO CRANEAL Y EL MICRO-CHAKRA SUPRARRENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CERVICALES Y ADRENALES. ALINEA LOS COMANDOS DE \\\"DESCANSO Y DIGESTI\\u00d3N\\\" CON LOS CENTROS DE RESPUESTA AL ESTR\\u00c9S DEL CUERPO PARA ASEGURAR LA ADAPTABILIDAD Y LA VITALIDAD.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1087','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:47:50','2026-04-25 14:47:50'),(3734,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1088,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CAROTID\\/CAROTID                   CHECK - TEMPLE\\/TEMPLE CHECK - CORONARY\\/LUNG\"}','{\"origins\":\"AUTONOMIC REGULATORY AXIS (EJE REGULADOR AUT\\u00d3NOMO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, DIZZINESS, TENSION HEADACHES, AND SENSATIONS OF CHEST OPRESI\\u00d3N. MAY MANIFEST AS AN INABILITY TO RELAX OR PERSISTENT PHYSICAL STRESS REACTIONS.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, MAREOS, CEFALEAS TENSIONALES Y SENSACIONES DE OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA INCAPACIDAD PARA RELAJARSE O REACCIONES DE ESTR\\u00c9S F\\u00cdSICO PERSISTENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE WITHIN THE VAGUS NERVE ITSELF, WHICH GOVERNS THE PARASYMPATHETIC NERVOUS SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET CALMS THE CARDIAC RHYTHM AND RELAXES THE ARTERIAL WALLS, HELPING TO LOWER BLOOD PRESSURE NATURALLY BY RESTORING THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO ENTER A STATE OF REST AND RECOVERY.\\n\\n(HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DENTRO DEL PROPIO NERVIO VAGO, QUE GOBIERNA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO CALMA EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO Y RELAJA LAS PAREDES ARTERIALES, AYUDANDO A BAJAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL DE FORMA NATURAL AL RESTAURAR LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA ENTRAR EN UN ESTADO DE DESCANSO Y RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THIRD EYE (AJNA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE CRANIAL NERVE VORTEX AND THE CARDIAC MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CERVICAL AND THORACIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC COMMANDS FOR CIRCULATORY STABILITY. CHECK ALSO: CAROTID\\/CAROTID, TEMPLE\\/TEMPLE, AND CORONARY\\/LUNG.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: TERCER OJO (AJNA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE DEL NERVIO CRANEAL Y EL MICRO-CHAKRA CARD\\u00cdACO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CERVICALES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS. ALINEA LOS COMANDOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS PARA LA ESTABILIDAD CIRCULATORIA. REVISAR TAMBI\\u00c9N: CAR\\u00d3TIDA\\/CAR\\u00d3TIDA, SIEN\\/SIEN Y CORONARIA\\/PULM\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1088','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:49:07','2026-04-25 14:49:07'),(3735,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',987,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"UMBILICAL PAIN, IRRITABLE BOWEL, ILEOCAEAL VALVE DISORDER, ANOREXIA, GASTRITIS, LARGE BOWEL DISORDERS, DEPRESSION, IMPULSIVE EATING, FROZEN SHOULDER, SINUSITIS, CATARRH, CONSTIPATION, CHRONIC DIARRHEA, DIVERTICULITIS. (DOLOR UMBILICAL, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE, TRASTORNO DE LA V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL, ANOREXIA, GASTRITIS, TRASTORNOS DEL INTESTINO GRUESO, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, COMER IMPULSIVO, HOMBRO CONGELADO, SINUSITIS, CATARRO, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA, DIVERTICULITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH: SHOULDER AND THROAT CHAKRAS. COLOR: BLUE SOUND: G PITCH VIBRATIONAL RATE: 114969 HOMEOPATHIC REMEDY: PLUMBUM (ASOCIADO CON: CHAKRAS DEL HOMBRO Y DE LA GARGANTA. COLOR: AZUL SONIDO: TONO G TASA VIBRACIONAL: 114969 REMEDIO HOMEOP\\u00c1TICO: PLUMBUM)\"}','{\"origins\":\"UMBILICAL CENTER (CENTRO UMBILICAL)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES DISORDERS OF THE LARGE BOWEL, ILEOCECAL VALVE, AND DIGESTIVE SYSTEM STEMMING FROM EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD. IT IS INDICATED FOR CONDITIONS SUCH AS DIVERTICULITIS, CONSTIPATION, AND SINUSITIS OR CATARRH. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE ENERGY OF UNFULFILLED AMBITIONS AND \\\"FROZEN\\\" EMOTIONS (LIKE FROZEN SHOULDER), RESTORING METABOLIC FLOW AND CLEARING THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA TRASTORNOS DEL INTESTINO GRUESO, LA V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL Y EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO DERIVADOS DE UNA SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL. EST\\u00c1 INDICADO PARA CONDICIONES COMO DIVERTICULITIS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO Y SINUSITIS O CATARRO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA ENERG\\u00cdA DE AMBICIONES NO CUMPLIDAS Y EMOCIONES \\\"CONGELADAS\\\" (COMO EL HOMBRO CONGELADO), RESTAURANDO EL FLUJO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y DEPURANDO EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH: SHOULDER AND THROAT CHAKRAS. COLOR: BLUE. SOUND: G PITCH. VIBRATIONAL RATE: 114969. HOMEOPATHIC REMEDY: PLUMBUM. IT ALIGNS THE CENTRAL VORTEX TO ENSURE THAT PERSONAL PASSIONS ARE EXPRESSED CONSTRUCTIVELY WITHOUT CAUSING INTERNAL CONGESTION.\\n\\n(ASOCIADO CON: CHAKRAS DEL HOMBRO Y DE LA GARGANTA. COLOR: AZUL. SONIDO: TONO G. TASA VIBRACIONAL: 114969. REMEDIO HOMEOP\\u00c1TICO: PLUMBUM. ALINEA EL V\\u00d3RTICE CENTRAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS PASIONES PERSONALES SE EXPRESEN DE MANERA CONSTRUCTIVA SIN CAUSAR CONGESTI\\u00d3N INTERNA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/987','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:50:56','2026-04-25 14:50:56'),(3736,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',989,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"GRIEF (DOLOR)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY EMOTIONAL CENTER (CENTRO EMOCIONAL RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"GRIEF, SADNESS, AND A SENSE OF SUFFOCATION OR OPPRESSION IN THE CHEST. PHYSICALLY, IT MAY MANIFEST AS A PERSISTENT DRY COUGH, BRONCHIAL SPASMS, OR DIFFICULTY TAKING DEEP BREATHS.\\n\\n(DOLOR\\/DUELO, TRISTEZA Y UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ASFIXIA O OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO. F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO TOS SECA PERSISTENTE, ESPASMOS BRONQUIALES O DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR PROFUNDAMENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"GRIEF (DOLOR). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE SOMATIZATION OF DEEP SADNESS AND LOSS WITHIN THE BRONCHIAL TREE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE \\\"HEAVINESS\\\" OF GRIEF THAT RESTRICTS THE AIRWAYS, RESTORING THE VIBRATIONAL CAPACITY OF THE LUNGS TO EXCHANGE ENERGY FREELY AND ALLOWING THE INDIVIDUAL TO \\\"BREATH IN LIFE\\\" AGAIN AFTER EMOTIONAL TRAUMA.\\n\\n(DOLOR\\/DUELO. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA SOMATIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA TRISTEZA PROFUNDA Y LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DENTRO DEL \\u00c1RBOL BRONQUIAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA \\\"PESADEZ\\\" DEL DUELO QUE RESTRINGE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS, RESTAURANDO LA CAPACIDAD VIBRATORIA DE LOS PULMONES PARA INTERCAMBIAR ENERG\\u00cdA LIBREMENTE Y PERMITIENDO AL INDIVIDUO VOLVER A \\\"RESPIRAR LA VIDA\\\" DESPU\\u00c9S DE UN TRAUMA EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BRONCHIAL MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE THORACIC VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LUNG MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO CLEAR THE \\\"EMOTIONAL CONGESTION\\\" THAT MIMICS RESPIRATORY ILLNESS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS BRONQUIALES Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE TOR\\u00c1CICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE LOS PULMONES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LA \\\"CONGESTI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL\\\" QUE IMITA UNA ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/989','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:52:30','2026-04-25 14:52:30'),(3737,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',990,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"GRIEF (DOLOR)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY VORTEX (V\\u00d3RTICE RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP SADNESS, FEELINGS OF LOSS, AND EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS. PHYSICALLY, IT MAY MANIFEST AS SHORTNESS OF BREATH, CHEST TIGHTNESS, OR A SENSATION OF BEING UNABLE TO \\\"TAKE IN\\\" LIFE.\\n\\n(TRISTEZA PROFUNDA, SENTIMIENTOS DE P\\u00c9RDIDA Y PESADEZ EMOCIONAL. F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE NO PODER \\\"INHALAR\\\" LA VIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"GRIEF (DOLOR). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF UNPROCESSED GRIEF WITHIN THE PULMONARY TISSUE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE DENSE EMOTIONAL ENERGY THAT RESTRICTS THE LUNGS\' EXPANSION, PROMOTING THE RELEASE OF MELANCHOLY AND RESTORING THE VITAL FLOW OF OXYGEN AND ENERGY THROUGHOUT THE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(DOLOR\\/DUELO. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE DUELO NO PROCESADO DENTRO DEL TEJIDO PULMONAR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA ENERG\\u00cdA EMOCIONAL DENSA QUE RESTRINGE LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N DE LOS PULMONES, PROMOVIENDO LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE LA MELANCOL\\u00cdA Y RESTAURANDO EL FLUJO VITAL DE OX\\u00cdGENO Y ENERG\\u00cdA EN TODO EL SISTEMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PULMONARY MICRO-CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE SCAPULAR AND THORACIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO CLEAR THE \\\"SHADOW\\\" OF PAST LOSSES, ALLOWING FOR EMOTIONAL RENEWAL AND RESPIRATORY FREEDOM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS PULMONARES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES ESCAPULARES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LA \\\"SOMBRA\\\" DE P\\u00c9RDIDAS PASADAS, PERMITIENDO LA RENOVACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y LA LIBERTAD RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/990','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:53:42','2026-04-25 14:53:42'),(3738,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',991,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"LYING, DIFFICULT IN EXPRESSING ONES SELF. (MENTIR, DIFICULTAD PARA EXPRESARSE.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"THROAT VORTEX (V\\u00d3RTICE DE LA GARGANTA)\",\"symptoms\":\"LYING, DIFFICULTY IN EXPRESSING ONESELF, OR A SENSATION OF A \\\"LUMP\\\" IN THE THROAT. MAY MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS HOARSENESS, LOSS OF VOICE, OR TENSION IN THE NECK AND JAW AREAS.\\n\\n(MENTIR, DIFICULTAD PARA EXPRESARSE O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE \\\"NUDO\\\" EN LA GARGANTA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO RONQUERA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE LA VOZ O TENSI\\u00d3N EN LAS \\u00c1REAS DEL CUELLO Y LA MAND\\u00cdBULA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES CREATED BY UNTRUTHFULNESS OR THE SUPPRESSION OF ONE\'S AUTHENTIC VOICE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE VIBRATIONAL DISHARMONY CAUSED BY DISHONESTY\\u2014WHETHER TO OTHERS OR ONESELF\\u2014AND RESTORES THE CLEAR FLOW OF COMMUNICATION, ALLOWING THE INDIVIDUAL TO SPEAK THEIR TRUTH WITH CLARITY AND CONFIDENCE.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS CREADOS POR LA FALTA DE VERACIDAD O LA SUPRESI\\u00d3N DE LA VOZ AUT\\u00c9NTICA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA DISARMON\\u00cdA VIBRATORIA CAUSADA POR LA DESHONESTAD, YA SEA HACIA LOS DEM\\u00c1S O HACIA UNO MISMO, Y RESTAURAR EL FLUJO CLARO DE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N, PERMITIENDO AL INDIVIDUO EXPRESAR SU VERDAD CON CLARIDAD Y CONFIANZA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES DIRECTLY TO THE LARYNGEAL MICRO-CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE JAW AND CERVICAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE THE EMOTIONAL TOXICITY OF REPRESSED SPEECH AND PROMOTES THE HARMONIZATION OF THE THYROID AND PARATHYROID CENTERS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA DIRECTAMENTE CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA Y CERVICALES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL DEL HABLA REPRIMIDA Y PROMUEVE LA ARMONIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS CENTROS TIROIDEOS Y PARATIROIDEOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/991','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 14:55:03','2026-04-25 14:55:03'),(3739,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',992,'{\"origins\"