 LUMBAR VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE SACRAL AND LOWER SPINAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW FROM THE BASE OF THE SPINE TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC IMMUNITY AND NEUROLOGICAL COHERENCE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA ANAL Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE LUMBAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES SACROS Y DE LA PARTE INFERIOR DE LA COLUMNA. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DESDE LA BASE DE LA COLUMNA PARA APOYAR LA INMUNIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA COHERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/996','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:00:13','2026-04-25 15:00:13'),(3743,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',997,'{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, DIARRHEA, DEHYDRATION. (PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES GRAVES, DIARREA, DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"HIGHLY PATHOGENIC. SUBCUTANEOUS AND CUTANEOUS ABNORMALITIES. (ALTAMENTE PAT\\u00d3GENO. ANORMALIDADES SUBCUT\\u00c1NEAS Y CUT\\u00c1NEAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, DIARRHEA, AND DEHYDRATION. MAY MANIFEST AS SIGNIFICANT DIGESTIVE DISTRESS AND SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS DUE TO FLUID LOSS.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES GRAVES, DIARREA Y DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SIGNIFICATIVO Y DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA DEBIDO A LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"HIGHLY PATHOGENIC. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE CAUSED BY FUNGAL OVERGROWTH THAT AFFECTS THE GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS ELIMINATE YEAST PATHOGENS THAT CAUSE SUBCUTANEOUS AND CUTANEOUS ABNORMALITIES, RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE INTESTINAL MUCOSA AND STABILIZING THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO ABSORB NUTRIENTS AND WATER.\\n\\n(ALTAMENTE PAT\\u00d3GENO. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO CAUSADO POR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO QUE AFECTA EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE LEVADURA QUE CAUSAN ANORMALIDADES SUBCUT\\u00c1NEAS Y CUT\\u00c1NEAS, RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA MUCOSA INTESTINAL Y ESTABILIZANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA ABSORBER NUTRIENTES Y AGUA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE ANAL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE PYLORIC VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LOWER DIGESTIVE AND PELVIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE SYSTEMIC FUNGAL LOADS AND PROTECT THE SKIN AND SUBCUTANEOUS LAYERS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA ANAL Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE PIL\\u00d3RICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DIGESTIVOS INFERIORES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LAS CARGAS F\\u00daNGICAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS Y PROTEGER LA PIEL Y LAS CAPAS SUBCUT\\u00c1NEAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/997','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:01:18','2026-04-25 15:01:18'),(3744,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',998,'{\"name\":\"ANUS 9ANO) \\/TESTICLE (TEST\\u00cdCULO)\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEMORRHOIDS AND UROGENITAL DISEASE, ASSOCIATED WITH THE SIGMOID COLON AND LEFT VAGUS NERVE. (HEMORROIDES Y ENFERMEDAD UROGENITAL, ASOCIADA CON EL COLON SIGMOIDES Y EL NERVIO VAGO IZQUIERDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"ANUS (ANO) \\/TESTICLE (TEST\\u00cdCULO)\",\"origins\":\"UROGENITAL-REPTILIAN AXIS (EJE UROGENITAL-REPTILIANO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEMORRHOIDS, RECTAL DISCOMFORT, AND UROGENITAL DISEASE. MAY MANIFEST AS INFLAMMATION IN THE LOWER PELVIC REGION, DIFFICULTY WITH ELIMINATION, OR RECURRING URINARY TRACT ISSUES.\\n\\n(HEMORROIDES, MALESTAR RECTAL Y ENFERMEDAD UROGENITAL. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA INFERIOR, DIFICULTAD CON LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N O PROBLEMAS RECURRENTES DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"paths\":\"HEMORRHOIDS, RECTAL DISCOMFORT, AND UROGENITAL DISEASE. MAY MANIFEST AS INFLAMMATION IN THE LOWER PELVIC REGION, DIFFICULTY WITH ELIMINATION, OR RECURRING URINARY TRACT ISSUES.\\n\\n(HEMORROIDES, MALESTAR RECTAL Y ENFERMEDAD UROGENITAL. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA INFERIOR, DIFICULTAD CON LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N O PROBLEMAS RECURRENTES DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) AND SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE ANAL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE GONADAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE SIGMOID AND LOWER PELVIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ENSURE THAT THE VAGUS NERVE\\u2019S REGULATORY POWER PROPERLY REACHES THE ELIMINATION CENTERS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA) Y SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA ANAL Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE GONADAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES SIGMOIDEOS Y P\\u00c9LVICOS INFERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL PODER REGULADOR DEL NERVIO VAGO LLEGUE CORRECTAMENTE A LOS CENTROS DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/998','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:02:42','2026-04-25 15:02:42'),(3745,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',999,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"FEARS (MIEDOS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-RESPIRATORY AXIS (EJE NEURO-RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEARS (MIEDOS). MAY MANIFEST AS PANIC ATTACKS, PHOBIAS, OR A CONSTANT STATE OF APPREHENSION. PHYSICALLY, IT CAN TRIGGER SUDDEN SHORTNESS OF BREATH, DIZZINESS, OR LOSS OF COORDINATION WHEN FACING STRESSFUL SITUATIONS.\\n\\n(MIEDOS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO, FOBIAS O UN ESTADO CONSTANTE DE APREHENSI\\u00d3N. F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, PUEDE DESENCADENAR DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA REPENTINA, MAREOS O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N AL ENFRENTAR SITUACIONES ESTRESANTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE SOMATIZATION OF DEEP-SEATED FEARS THAT RESTRICT THE BRONCHIAL PASSAGES AND DISRUPT THE CEREBELLUM\\u2019S BALANCE REGULATION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE \\\"SUBCONSCIOUS BRAKE\\\" CREATED BY FEAR, RESTORING FLUID BREATHING AND NEUROLOGICAL STABILITY. IT ALLOWS THE INDIVIDUAL TO MOVE THROUGH LIFE WITH GREATER EQUANIMITY AND CONFIDENCE.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA SOMATIZACI\\u00d3N DE MIEDOS PROFUNDOS QUE RESTRINGEN LOS PASAJES BRONQUIALES Y ALTERAN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL EQUILIBRIO DEL CEREBELO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA EL \\\"FRENO SUBCONSCIENTE\\\" CREADO POR EL MIEDO, RESTAURANDO UNA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N FLUIDA Y LA ESTABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. PERMITE AL INDIVIDUO MOVERSE POR LA VIDA CON MAYOR ECANIMIDAD Y CONFIANZA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BRONCHIAL MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE CEREBELLAR VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE OCCIPITAL AND THORACIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ENSURE THAT SURVIVAL INSTINCTS DO NOT OVERWHELM THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS BRONQUIALES Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE CEREBELOSO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES OCCIPITALES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS INSTINTOS DE SUPERVIVENCIA NO ABRUMEN EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/999','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:04:01','2026-04-25 15:04:01'),(3746,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1001,'{\"symptoms\":\"NAUSEA, VOMITING, ABDOMINAL PAIN AND DIARRHEA. (N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD. REPRODUCES IN THE INTESTINAL TRACT. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS. SE REPRODUCE EN EL TRACTO INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"NAUSEA, VOMITING, ABDOMINAL PAIN, AND DIARRHEA. MAY MANIFEST AS A SENSATION OF BLOATING, EXCESSIVE GAS AFTER EATING, OR WEIGHT LOSS DUE TO MALABSORPTION.\\n\\n(N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y DIARREA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, GASES EXCESIVOS DESPU\\u00c9S DE COMER O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO DEBIDO A LA MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF GIARDIA LAMBLIA, A PARASITE TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER THAT REPRODUCES IN THE INTESTINAL TRACT. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET, THE ESOPHAGEAL HIATUS AREA IS STABILIZED, ASSISTING THE BODY IN ELIMINATING THE PATHOGEN AND RESTORING NORMAL DIGESTIVE FUNCTION, REDUCING INFLAMMATION AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA GIARDIA LAMBLIA, UN PAR\\u00c1SITO TRANSMITIDO POR ALIMENTOS O AGUA CONTAMINADOS QUE SE REPRODUCE EN EL TRACTO INTESTINAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO, SE ESTABILIZA EL \\u00c1REA DEL HIATO ESOF\\u00c1GICO, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO Y RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA NORMAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y EL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HIATUS MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE UPPER GASTRIC VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE DIAPHRAGMATIC AND ESOPHAGEAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ENSURE THE GASTRIC BARRIER IS STRONG AGAINST EXTERNAL INVADERS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA DEL HIATO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE G\\u00c1STRICO SUPERIOR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICOS Y ESOF\\u00c1GICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA BARRERA G\\u00c1STRICA SEA FUERTE FRENTE A INVASORES EXTERNOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1001','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:06:26','2026-04-25 15:06:26'),(3747,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1002,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TUBERCULOSIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MYCOBACTERIUM AXIS (EJE MYCOBACTERIUM)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC COUGH, NIGHT SWEATS, AND UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT LOSS. MAY MANIFEST AS PERSISTENT FATIGUE OR WEAKNESS THAT DOES NOT IMPROVE WITH REST, OFTEN HIDING AS A LATENT INFECTION.\\n\\n(TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, SUDORACI\\u00d3N NOCTURNA Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO INEXPLICABLE. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO FATIGA PERSISTENTE O DEBILIDAD QUE NO MEJORA CON EL DESCANSO, A MENUDO OCULT\\u00c1NDOSE COMO UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N LATENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"TUBERCULOSIS. THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR THE BACTERIA RESPONSIBLE FOR TUBERCULOSIS, ALLOWING THE PATHOGEN TO REMAIN DORMANT WITHIN THE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET DEPURATES THE LIVER AND THE DIAPHRAGMATIC AREA, PREVENTING THE BACTERIA FROM REPLICATING AND SPREADING TO THE LUNGS OR OTHER ORGANS. IT IS CRITICAL FOR CLEARING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY LINKED TO CHRONIC BACTERIAL BURDENS.\\n\\n(TUBERCULOSIS. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO PARA LA BACTERIA RESPONSABLE DE LA TUBERCULOSIS, PERMITIENDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PERMANEZCA LATENTE DENTRO DEL SISTEMA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO DEPURA EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL \\u00c1REA DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA, EVITANDO QUE LA BACTERIA SE REPLIQUE Y SE EXTIENDA A LOS PULMONES U OTROS \\u00d3RGANOS. ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ELIMINAR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA VINCULADA A CARGAS BACTERIANAS CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HEPATIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE HIATUS VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER AND LOWER THORACIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO FLUSH OUT DEEP-SEATED PATHOGENS AND RESTORE METABOLIC PURITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA HEP\\u00c1TICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE DEL HIATO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS INFERIORES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA EXPULSAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS PROFUNDOS Y RESTAURAR LA PUREZA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1002','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:08:00','2026-04-25 15:08:00'),(3748,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1003,'{\"symptoms\":\"CARDIAC DISORDERS, PALPITATIONS, STOMACH DISORDERS, BRONCHITIS, HYPERSALIVATION. (TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS, PALPITACIONES, TRASTORNOS ESTOMACALES, BRONQUITIS, HIPERSALIVACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"FACIAL PARALYSIS AND CHRONIC MYOFASCIAL PAIN IN THE FACE. (PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL Y DOLOR MIOFASCIAL CR\\u00d3NICO EN LA CARA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"REFERENCE 243 \\/ REFERENCIA 243\\nNAME \\/ NOMBRE\\nESOPHAGEAL (ESOF\\u00c1GICO) \\/ TONGUE (LENGUA) (REF. GUIADA 232)\\n\\nRADICAL \\/ RADICAL\\nPARASITE (PAR\\u00c1SITO)\\n\\nSTART \\/ ORIGIN \\/ INICIO \\/ ORIGEN\\nTRICHINOSIS (TRIQUINOSIS)\\n\\nLEADS \\/ SYMPTOMS \\/ PISTAS \\/ S\\u00cdNTOMAS\\nCARDIAC DISORDERS, PALPITATIONS, STOMACH DISORDERS, BRONCHITIS, AND HYPERSALIVATION. MAY MANIFEST AS MUSCLE SORENESS OR GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT FOLLOWING THE INGESTION OF CONTAMINATED FOOD.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS, PALPITACIONES, TRASTORNOS ESTOMACALES, BRONQUITIS E HIPERSALIVACI\\u00d3N. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DOLOR MUSCULAR O MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL TRAS LA INGESTA DE ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS, WHICH CAN CAUSE FACIAL PARALYSIS AND CHRONIC MYOFASCIAL PAIN IN THE FACE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD LODGED IN THE MUSCULAR AND MUCOSAL TISSUES, RESTORING PROPER NERVE CONDUCTION TO THE FACIAL REGION AND STABILIZING CARDIAC AND DIGESTIVE RHYTHMS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS, QUE PUEDE CAUSAR PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL Y DOLOR MIOFASCIAL CR\\u00d3NICO EN LA CARA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA ALOJADA EN LOS TEJIDOS MUSCULARES Y MUCOSOS, RESTAURANDO LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA ADECUADA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N FACIAL Y ESTABILIZANDO LOS RITMOS CARD\\u00cdACOS Y DIGESTIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE LINGUAL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE UPPER ESOPHAGEAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE JAW AND CRANIAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE SYSTEMIC PARASITIC LARVAE AND RESOLVE REFERRED PAIN IN THE FACIAL MUSCULATURE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA LINGUAL Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE ESOF\\u00c1GICO SUPERIOR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA Y CRANEALES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LAS LARVAS PARASITARIAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS Y RESOLVER EL DOLOR REFERIDO EN LA MUSCULATURA FACIAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1003','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:09:00','2026-04-25 15:09:00'),(3749,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1004,'{\"symptoms\":\"ULCERS, FEVER, ACID REFLUX, EAR PAIN. (\\u00daLCERAS, FIEBRE, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO, DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO.)\",\"paths\":\"RHEUMATIC FEVER, GASTROINTESTINAL ULCERS, PANCREATIC CANCER, FIBROUS DYSPLASIA OF THE MANDIBLE. (FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, \\u00daLCERAS GASTROINTESTINALES, C\\u00c1NCER DE P\\u00c1NCREAS, DISPLASIA FIBROSA DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ULCERS, FEVER, ACID REFLUX, AND EAR PAIN. MAY MANIFEST AS SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT OR PERSISTENT INFLAMMATION IN THE THROAT AND AUDITORY CANALS.\\n\\n(\\u00daLCERAS, FIEBRE, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO Y DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE EN LA GARGANTA Y LOS CONDUCTOS AUDITIVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES RHEUMATIC FEVER AND GASTROINTESTINAL ULCERS CAUSED BY BACTERIAL COLONIZATION. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN ERADICATING STREPTOCOCCUS, WHICH IF LEFT UNCHECKED, CAN LEAD TO MORE SEVERE CONDITIONS SUCH AS PANCREATIC CANCER OR FIBROUS DYSPLASIA OF THE MANDIBLE. BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGEAL ENTRANCE AND THE ADRENAL RESPONSE, IT REDUCES SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION AND RESTORES MUCOSAL INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA Y LAS \\u00daLCERAS GASTROINTESTINALES CAUSADAS POR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO APOYA AL CUERPO EN LA ERRADICACI\\u00d3N DEL ESTREPTOCOCO, QUE SI NO SE TRATA, PUEDE CONDUCIR A CONDICIONES M\\u00c1S GRAVES COMO EL C\\u00c1NCER DE P\\u00c1NCREAS O LA DISPLASIA FIBROSA DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA. AL ESTABILIZAR EL EJE ENTRE LA ENTRADA ESOF\\u00c1GICA Y LA RESPUESTA ADRENAL, REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RESTAURA LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA MUCOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE ESOPHAGEAL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE ADRENAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE MANDIBULAR AND UPPER GASTRIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE BACTERIAL TOXINS THAT AFFECT BOTH THE HEART VALVES AND THE DIGESTIVE LINING.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA ESOF\\u00c1GICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE SUPRARRENAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES MANDIBULARES Y G\\u00c1STRICOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTAN TANTO LAS V\\u00c1LVULAS CARD\\u00cdACAS COMO EL REVESTIMIENTO DIGESTIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1004','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:12:34','2026-04-25 15:12:34'),(3750,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1005,'{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL FOOD INTOLERANCES, CONSTIPATION, OVER WEIGHT AND VARICOSE VEINS. (INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS GASTROINTESTINALES, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, SOBREPESO Y VARICES.)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL FOOD INTOLERANCES, CONSTIPATION, OVERWEIGHT, AND VARICOSE VEINS. MAY MANIFEST AS ABDOMINAL DISTENSION OR A GENERALIZED SLOWING OF THE DIGESTIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS GASTROINTESTINALES, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, SOBREPESO Y VARICES. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL O UN ENLENTECIMIENTO GENERALIZADO DEL PROCESO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF BARTONELLA, WHICH CAN DISRUPT THE ENERGETIC COHERENCE OF THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE FLOW BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGEAL SPHINCTER AND THE APPENDIX, IMPROVING PERISTALSIS AND THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO PROCESS NUTRIENTS. BY CLEARING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS MITIGATE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES TO FOOD AND SUPPORTS VASCULAR HEALTH, ADDRESSING UNDERLYING FACTORS OF WEIGHT GAIN AND VENOUS CONGESTION.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE BARTONELLA, QUE PUEDE ALTERAR LA COHERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENTRE EL ESF\\u00cdNTER ESOF\\u00c1GICO Y EL AP\\u00c9NDICE, MEJORANDO EL PERISTALTISMO Y LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PROCESAR NUTRIENTES. AL DEPURAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A MITIGAR LAS RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS A LOS ALIMENTOS Y APOYA LA SALUD VASCULAR, ABORDANDO FACTORES SUBYACENTES DEL AUMENTO DE PESO Y LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N VENOSA.).)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE ESOPHAGEAL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE APPENDICULAR VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE INTESTINAL AND PELVIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC \\\"GATES\\\" OF THE DIGESTIVE CANAL TO ENSURE SMOOTH ELIMINATION AND METABOLIC EFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA ESOF\\u00c1GICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE APENDICULAR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES INTESTINALES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ALINEA LAS \\\"PUERTAS\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DEL CANAL DIGESTIVO PARA ASEGURAR UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N FLUIDA Y EFICIENCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1005','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:13:46','2026-04-25 15:13:46'),(3751,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1011,'{\"symptoms\":\"ORAL, VAGINAL, RECTAL, AND OCULAR INFECTIONS. RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, CYSTITIS. (INFECCIONES ORALES, VAGINALES, RECTALES Y OCULARES. INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"IMMUNE DEFICIENCIES. (DEFICIENCIAS INMUNITARIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/RING FINGERS (ASOCIADO CON CODO\\/ANULAR.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ORAL, VAGINAL, RECTAL, AND OCULAR INFECTIONS. MAY MANIFEST AS RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, OR CYSTITIS. OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH SYMPTOMS IN THE ELBOW AND RING FINGERS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES ORALES, VAGINALES, RECTALES Y OCULARES. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS O CISTITIS. A MENUDO ASOCIADO CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS EN EL CODO Y LOS DEDOS ANULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES ENERGETIC IMBALANCES LINKED TO IMMUNE DEFICIENCIES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN MANAGING THE OVERGROWTH OF CANDIDA GLABRATA, WHICH TARGETS VARIOUS MUCOUS MEMBRANES THROUGHOUT THE SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE SECOND DORSAL VERTEBRA, IT STRENGTHENS THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AND CLEARS SYSTEMIC FUNGAL LOADS THAT AFFECT RESPIRATORY AND DIGESTIVE EFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS VINCULADOS A DEFICIENCIAS INMUNITARIAS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A GESTIONAR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO DE CANDIDA GLABRATA, QUE ATACA VARIAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS EN TODO EL SISTEMA. AL ESTABILIZAR EL EJE ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y LA SEGUNDA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL, FORTALECE LA RESPUESTA INMUNE Y DEPURA LAS CARGAS F\\u00daNGICAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE AFECTAN LA EFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA Y DIGESTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE ESOPHAGEAL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE THORACIC VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ELBOW AND FINGER MICRO-VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE FUNGAL TOXICITY FROM THE MUCOSA AND RESTORE VITAL PROTECTIVE BARRIERS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA ESOF\\u00c1GICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE TOR\\u00c1CICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS MICRO-V\\u00d3RTICES DEL CODO Y LOS DEDOS. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR LA TOXICIDAD F\\u00daNGICA DE LA MUCOSA Y RESTAURAR LAS BARRERAS PROTECTORAS VITALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1011','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:15:30','2026-04-25 15:15:30'),(3752,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1012,'{\"paths\":\"VERY AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA. IT MAY PASS TO FETUS. (BACTERIA MUY AGRESIVA. PUEDE PASAR AL FETO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SCAPULA, FEMORAL TRIANGLE, DORSAL 8.     CHECK - SCAPULA\\/SCAPULA (REVISAR: ESC\\u00c1PULA, TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL, DORSAL 8. REVISAR: ESC\\u00c1PULA\\/ESC\\u00c1PULA.)\"}','{\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES A VERY AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA THAT HAS THE POTENTIAL TO PASS TO THE FETUS. IT IS LINKED TO SEVERE DEGENERATIVE PROCESSES IN THE SKIN AND LIMBS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN COMBATING THE DESTRUCTIVE EFFECTS OF MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE, HELPING TO HALT THE PROGRESSION OF TISSUE ATROPHY AND PROTECTING SYSTEMIC INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA UNA BACTERIA MUY AGRESIVA QUE TIENE EL POTENCIAL DE PASAR AL FETO. EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A PROCESOS DEGENERATIVOS SEVEROS EN LA PIEL Y LAS EXTREMIDADES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A COMBATIR LOS EFECTOS DESTRUCTIVOS DE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE, AYUDANDO A DETENER LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE LA ATROFIA TISULAR Y PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. CHECK SCAPULA, FEMORAL TRIANGLE, AND DORSAL 8 FOR RESONANCE. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE DUODENAL AND ESOPHAGEAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO DEPURATE DEEP BACTERIAL BURDENS. ALSO, REVIEW SCAPULA\\/SCAPULA PAIR.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). REVISAR ESC\\u00c1PULA, TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL Y DORSAL 8 PARA RESONANCIA. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DUODENALES Y ESOF\\u00c1GICOS. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS PROFUNDAS. ADEM\\u00c1S, REVISAR EL PAR ESC\\u00c1PULA\\/ESC\\u00c1PULA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1012','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:27:03','2026-04-25 15:27:03'),(3753,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1013,'{\"symptoms\":\"GANGRENE, MYOFASCIAL PAIN, GASTROINTESTINAL PAIN, SPEECH DISORDERS. (GANGRENA, DOLOR MIOFASCIAL, DOLOR GASTROINTESTINAL, TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA.)\",\"paths\":\"TOXINS THAT PRODUCE, SUDDEN APHASIA AND NECROTIC ENTERITIS OR GAS GANGRENE. (TOXINAS QUE PRODUCEN AFASIA S\\u00daBITA Y ENTERITIS NECR\\u00d3TICA O GANGRENA GASEOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GANGRENE, MYOFASCIAL PAIN, GASTROINTESTINAL PAIN, AND SPEECH DISORDERS. MAY MANIFEST AS SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS OR LOCALIZED TISSUE ISSUES.\\n\\n(GANGRENA, DOLOR MIOFASCIAL, DOLOR GASTROINTESTINAL Y TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO O PROBLEMAS TISULARES LOCALIZADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE TOXINS PRODUCED BY CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS, WHICH CAN LEAD TO SUDDEN APHASIA (LOSS OF SPEECH), NECROTIC ENTERITIS, OR GAS GANGRENE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC JUNCTION BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE PYLORIC VALVE, ASSISTING THE BODY IN NEUTRALIZING BACTERIAL TOXINS THAT THREATEN TISSUE VITALITY AND NEUROLOGICAL COMMUNICATION PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LAS TOXINAS PRODUCIDAS POR CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS, QUE PUEDEN CONDUCIR A AFASIA S\\u00daBITA (P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL HABLA), ENTERITIS NECR\\u00d3TICA O GANGRENA GASEOSA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA UNI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y LA V\\u00c1LVULA PIL\\u00d3RICA, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A NEUTRALIZAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS QUE AMENAZAN LA VITALIDAD DE LOS TEJIDOS Y LAS V\\u00cdAS DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PYLORIC MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE ESOPHAGEAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER DIGESTIVE AND GASTRIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PREVENT THE SPREAD OF ANAEROBIC BACTERIAL INFECTIONS THROUGHOUT THE GASTROINTESTINAL MUCOSA.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA PIL\\u00d3RICO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE ESOF\\u00c1GICO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DIGESTIVOS SUPERIORES Y G\\u00c1STRICOS. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS ANAEROBIAS POR TODA LA MUCOSA GASTROINTESTINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1013','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:28:42','2026-04-25 15:28:42'),(3754,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1014,'{\"symptoms\":\"THIS PAIR IS IDENTIFIED AS A GERM RESERVOIR. IT SHOULD BE CHECKED IN CASE OF SUSPECTED CHRONIC OR RECURRING INFECTIONS WITHOUT AN APPARENT CAUSE. (ESTE PAR SE IDENTIFICA COMO UN RESERVORIO DE G\\u00c9RMENES. SE DEBE REVISAR EN CASO DE SOSPECHA DE INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS O RECURRENTES SIN CAUSA APARENTE.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"IDENTIFIED AS A GERM RESERVOIR. THIS PAIR SHOULD BE CHECKED IN CASES OF SUSPECTED CHRONIC OR RECURRING INFECTIONS WITHOUT AN APPARENT CAUSE. MAY MANIFEST AS LINGERING FEVERS, FATIGUE, OR SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(IDENTIFICADO COMO UN RESERVORIO DE G\\u00c9RMENES. ESTE PAR DEBE REVISARSE EN CASO DE SOSPECHA DE INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS O RECURRENTES SIN CAUSA APARENTE. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO FIEBRES PERSISTENTES, FATIGA O DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ACTS AS A HIDING PLACE FOR VARIOUS PATHOGENS, PARTICULARLY THOSE RELATED TO THE PARATYPHOID GROUP. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET DEPURA THE ENERGETIC SPACE BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE SUBCLAVIAN ARTERY, PREVENTING THE RE-INOCULATION OF THE SYSTEM. IT IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING \\\"HIDDEN\\\" LOADS THAT PREVENT FULL RECOVERY FROM PREVIOUS INFECTIONS, ENSURING THE PATHOGEN DOES NOT REMAIN LATENT IN THE CIRCULATORY OR DIGESTIVE INTERFACE.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN LUGAR DE OCULTAMIENTO PARA DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS, PARTICULARMENTE AQUELLOS RELACIONADOS CON EL GRUPO PARAT\\u00cdFICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO DEPURA EL ESPACIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y LA ARTERIA SUBCLAVIA, EVITANDO LA REINOCULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA. ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR CARGAS \\\"OCULTAS\\\" QUE IMPIDEN LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N TOTAL DE INFECCIONES PREVIAS, ASEGURANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO NO PERMANEZCA LATENTE EN LA INTERFAZ CIRCULATORIA O DIGESTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SUBCLAVIAN MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE UPPER THORACIC VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE SHOULDER AND CLAVICULAR MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO FLUSH OUT DORMANT BACTERIAL COLONIES AND PROTECT THE VASCULAR INTEGRITY OF THE UPPER TORSO.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA SUBCLAVIO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE TOR\\u00c1CICO SUPERIOR. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES DEL HOMBRO Y CLAVICULARES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA EXPULSAR COLONIAS BACTERIANAS LATENTES Y PROTEGER LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR DEL TORSO SUPERIOR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1014','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:29:57','2026-04-25 15:29:57'),(3755,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1015,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (REVISAR: CODO\\/CODO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"GENERALIZED FUNGAL INFECTIONS, SKIN IRRITATION, OR DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT. MAY MANIFEST AS COATED TONGUE, HOARSENESS, OR ALTERATIONS IN THE INTESTINAL FLORA.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS GENERALIZADAS, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL O MALESTAR DIGESTIVO. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO LENGUA SABURRAL, RONQUERA O ALTERACIONES EN LA FLORA INTESTINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF SYSTEMIC MYCOSIS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE AXIS BETWEEN THE LARYNX AND THE DUODENUM, ASSISTING THE BODY IN CURBING FUNGAL OVERGROWTH THAT IMPACTS BOTH THE RESPIRATORY AND DIGESTIVE TRACTS. BY RESTORING THE PH BALANCE IN THESE AREAS, IT HELPS CLEAR MUCOSAL TOXICITY AND STRENGTHENS THE BARRIER AGAINST OPPORTUNISTIC PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA MICOSIS SIST\\u00c9MICA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENTRE LA LARINGE Y EL DUODENO, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A FRENAR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO QUE AFECTA TANTO EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO COMO EL DIGESTIVO. AL RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH EN ESTAS \\u00c1REAS, AYUDA A DEPURAR LA TOXICIDAD DE LA MUCOSA Y FORTALECE LA BARRERA CONTRA PAT\\u00d3GENOS OPORTUNISTAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (REVISAR: CODO\\/CODO) FOR RELATED FUNGAL RESONANCE. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE LARYNGEAL AND DUODENAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PURGE SYSTEMIC LOADS AND RESTORE TISSUE VITALITY.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). REVISAR - CODO\\/CODO PARA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA RELACIONADA. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES LAR\\u00cdNGEOS Y DUODENALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR CARGAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS Y RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD TISULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1015','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:31:12','2026-04-25 15:31:12'),(3756,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1016,'{\"symptoms\":\"BREATHING PROBLEMS, LARYNGEAL PROBLEMS, HOARSENESS, WHOOPING COUGH, CHRONIC AND DRY COUGH THAT CAUSES VOMITING. (PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, PROBLEMAS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, RONQUERA, TOS FERINA Y TOS CR\\u00d3NICA Y SECA QUE PROVOCA V\\u00d3MITOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY COUGHING. CYANOSIS.  IT FORMS A HARD TISSUE IN THE TRACHEA. (TRANSMITIDO POR LA TOS. CIANOSIS. FORMA UN TEJIDO DURO EN LA TR\\u00c1QUEA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - COUNTERCECUM (REVISAR: CONTRACIEGO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"WHOOPING COUGH, CHRONIC DRY COUGH THAT MAY INDUCE VOMITING, AND HOARSENESS. MAY MANIFEST AS SIGNIFICANT LARYNGEAL DISCOMFORT OR GENERALIZED BREATHING DIFFICULTIES.\\n\\n(TOS FERINA, TOS SECA CR\\u00d3NICA QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR V\\u00d3MITOS Y RONQUERA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN MALESTAR LAR\\u00cdNGEO SIGNIFICATIVO O DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS GENERALIZADAS.)\",\"paths\":\"HIGHLY CONTAGIOUS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION OF THE UPPER RESPIRATORY TRACT, WHICH CAN LEAD TO CYANOSIS (LACK OF OXYGEN) AND THE FORMATION OF HARDENED TISSUE IN THE TRACHEA. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CLEARING THE BACILLUS PERTUSSIS PATHOGEN, RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE AIRWAYS, AND CALMING THE SPASMODIC COUGH REFLEX.\\n\\n(ALTAMENTE CONTAGIOSO. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR, QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A CIANOSIS (FALTA DE OX\\u00cdGENO) Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO ENDURECIDO EN LA TR\\u00c1QUEA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO BACILLUS PERTUSSIS, RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS Y CALMANDO EL REFLEJO DE TOS ESPASM\\u00d3DICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE LARYNGEAL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE VOCAL VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CERVICAL AND UPPER THORACIC MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE RESPIRATORY PATHOGENS. CHECK - COUNTERCECUM (REVISAR: CONTRACIEGO) FOR RELATED RESONANCE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA LAR\\u00cdNGEO Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE VOCAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES CERVICALES Y TOR\\u00c1CICOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS RESPIRATORIOS. REVISAR: CONTRACIEGO PARA RESONANCIA RELACIONADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1016','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:32:23','2026-04-25 15:32:23'),(3757,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1017,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"THIS PAIR IS ASSOCIATED WITH EMOTIONAL BURDENS AND THE FEELING OF GUILT THAT AFFECT CARDIO-RESPIRATORY FUNCTION. (ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA CON CARGAS EMOCIONALES Y EL SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA QUE AFECTAN LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CARDIO-RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"GUILT (SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL RESONANCE (RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"THIS PAIR IS ASSOCIATED WITH EMOTIONAL BURDENS AND THE FEELING OF GUILT THAT AFFECT CARDIO-RESPIRATORY FUNCTION. MAY MANIFEST AS A HEAVY SENSATION IN THE CHEST, SHALLOW BREATHING, OR PERSISTENT SADNESS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA CON CARGAS EMOCIONALES Y EL SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA QUE AFECTAN LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CARDIO-RESPIRATORIA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PESADEZ EN EL PECHO, RESPIRACI\\u00d3N SUPERFICIAL O TRISTEZA PERSISTENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"GUILT (SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMPACT OF DEEP-SEATED GUILT ON THE VITAL ORGANS OF THE THORAX. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE EMOTIONAL \\\"WEIGHT\\\" HELD WITHIN THE LUNG AND HEART TISSUES, RESTORING THE NATURAL FLOW OF OXYGEN AND CIRCULATORY COHERENCE. IT ALLOWS FOR THE RELEASE OF REPRESSED EMOTIONS THAT RESTRICT PHYSICAL VITALITY.\\n\\n(SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL IMPACTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LA CULPA PROFUNDA EN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES DEL T\\u00d3RAX. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA EL \\\"PESO\\\" EMOCIONAL RETENIDO EN LOS TEJIDOS DEL PULM\\u00d3N Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N, RESTAURANDO EL FLUJO NATURAL DE OX\\u00cdGENO Y LA COHERENCIA CIRCULATORIA. PERMITE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE EMOCIONES REPRIMIDAS QUE RESTRINGEN LA VITALIDAD F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PULMONARY MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE CARDIAC VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND SCAPULAR MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO RESOLVE EMOTIONAL TOXICITY AND RESTORE THE CAPACITY FOR SELF-FORGIVENESS AND OPEN COMMUNICATION.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS PULMONARES Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TOR\\u00c1CICOS Y ESCAPULARES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA RESOLVER LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL Y RESTAURAR LA CAPACIDAD DE PERD\\u00d3N A UNO MISMO Y COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ABIERTA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1017','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:33:37','2026-04-25 15:33:37'),(3758,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1018,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SADNESS (SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA \\/ TRISTEZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"THORACIC EMOTIONAL AXIS (EJE EMOCIONAL TOR\\u00c1CICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"SADNESS, DEEP GRIEF, AND A SENSATION OF OPPRESSION IN THE CHEST. MAY MANIFEST AS SHALLOW BREATHING, FATIGUE, OR A FEELING OF HEAVINESS SURROUNDING THE HEART CENTER.\\n\\n(TRISTEZA, DOLOR PROFUNDO Y UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO RESPIRACI\\u00d3N SUPERFICIAL, FATIGA O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PESADEZ QUE RODEA EL CENTRO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"SADNESS (SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA \\/ TRISTEZA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF REPRESSED SORROW AND GUILT THAT CONGESTS THE CARDIOPULMONARY SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE VIBRATIONAL FREQUENCY OF SADNESS HELD WITHIN THE TISSUES, RESTORING THE NATURAL EXPANSION OF THE LUNGS AND THE RHYTHMIC COHERENCE OF THE HEART. IT ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN PROCESSING EMOTIONAL TRAUMA, TURNING \\\"HEAVY\\\" EMOTIONS INTO A FLOW OF VITAL AIR.\\n\\n(TRISTEZA \\/ SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL PESAR REPRIMIDO Y LA CULPA QUE CONGESTIONA EL SISTEMA CARDIOPULMONAR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA FRECUENCIA VIBRATORIA DE LA TRISTEZA RETENIDA EN LOS TEJIDOS, RESTAURANDO LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N NATURAL DE LOS PULMONES Y LA COHERENCIA R\\u00cdTMICA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N. AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A PROCESAR EL TRAUMA EMOCIONAL, TRANSFORMANDO LAS EMOCIONES \\\"PESADAS\\\" EN UN FLUJO DE AIRE VITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PULMONARY MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE CARDIAC VORTEX. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND INTERCOSTAL MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO CLEAR EMOTIONAL CLOUDING AND SUPPORT THE CAPACITY FOR COMPASSION AND SELF-HEALING.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS PULMONARES Y EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES TOR\\u00c1CICOS E INTERCOSTALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR EL NUBLADO EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR LA CAPACIDAD DE COMPASI\\u00d3N Y AUTOSANACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1018','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:34:54','2026-04-25 15:34:54'),(3759,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1019,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"LUNG DYSFUNCTION. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR), TRISTEZA (SADNESS).\",\"paths\":\"CULPABILITY (CULPABILIDAD \\/ SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY EMOTIONAL AXIS (EJE EMOCIONAL RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"LUNG DYSFUNCTION AND SADNESS. MAY MANIFEST AS A FEELING OF HEAVINESS IN THE CHEST, CHRONIC FATIGUE, OR A DIMINISHED CAPACITY FOR DEEP BREATHING LINKED TO PROLONGED STATES OF SORROW.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y TRISTEZA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PESADEZ EN EL PECHO, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA O UNA CAPACIDAD DISMINUIDA PARA RESPIRAR PROFUNDAMENTE VINCULADA A ESTADOS PROLONGADOS DE PESAR.)\",\"paths\":\"CULPABILITY (CULPABILIDAD \\/ SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMPACT OF GUILT THAT SETTLES IN THE PULMONARY TISSUES, RESTRICTING LIFE FORCE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET RELEASES THE FREQUENCY OF SELF-BLAME, ALLOWING THE LUNGS TO REGAIN THEIR FULL VITAL CAPACITY AND ENABLING THE INDIVIDUAL TO \\\"BREATH IN\\\" LIFE WITHOUT THE BURDEN OF THE PAST.\\n\\n(CULPABILIDAD \\/ SENTIMIENTO DE CULPA. ESTE PAR ABORDA EL IMPACTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LA CULPA QUE SE ASIENTA EN LOS TEJIDOS PULMONARES, RESTRINGIENDO LA FUERZA VITAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA FRECUENCIA DEL AUTOREPROCHE, PERMITIENDO QUE LOS PULMONES RECUPEREN SU TOTAL CAPACIDAD VITAL Y CAPACITANDO AL INDIVIDUO PARA \\\"INHALAR\\\" LA VIDA SIN LA CARGA DEL PASADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILATERAL LUNG MICRO-CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND INTERCOSTAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FIELD TO FLUSH OUT REPRESSED EMOTIONS AND RESTORE THE NATURAL BALANCE OF THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS PULMONARES BILATERALES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS E INTERCOSTALES. ALINEA EL CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR LAS EMOCIONES REPRIMIDAS Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO NATURAL DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1019','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:37:02','2026-04-25 15:37:02'),(3760,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1020,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PULMONARY DISFUNCTION. PAIR HELPS TO BRING OXYGEN TO THE PASSAGES. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR. ESTE PAR AYUDA A LLEVAR OX\\u00cdGENO A LAS V\\u00cdAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY FLOW AXIS (EJE DE FLUJO RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"SHORTNESS OF BREATH, FATIGUE, AND REDUCED RESPIRATORY CAPACITY. MAY MANIFEST AS A SENSATION OF CONSTRICTION IN THE CHEST OR DIFFICULTY INHALING DEEPLY DURING PHYSICAL EXERTION.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, FATIGA Y CAPACIDAD RESPIRATORIA REDUCIDA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO O DIFICULTAD PARA INHALAR PROFUNDAMENTE DURANTE EL ESFUERZO F\\u00cdSICO.)\",\"paths\":\"PULMONARY DYSFUNCTION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES WITHIN THE BRONCHIAL TREE AND ALVEOLI. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS TO BRING OXYGEN TO THE PASSAGES BY RESTORING THE MAGNETIC POLARITY OF THE LUNG TISSUE. IT ENHANCES GAS EXCHANGE EFFICIENCY AND SUPPORTS THE OVERALL VITALITY OF THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, CLEARING CONGESTION THAT HINDERS PROPER AIRFLOW.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR. ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS DENTRO DEL \\u00c1RBOL BRONQUIAL Y LOS ALV\\u00c9OLOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A LLEVAR OX\\u00cdGENO A LAS V\\u00cdAS AL RESTAURAR LA POLARIDAD MAGN\\u00c9TICA DEL TEJIDO PULMONAR. MEJORA LA EFICIENCIA DEL INTERCAMBIO GASEOSO Y APOYA LA VITALIDAD GENERAL DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO, ELIMINANDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N QUE DIFICULTA EL FLUJO DE AIRE ADECUADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE HORIZONTAL EXPANSION OF THE PULMONARY MICRO-CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE THORACIC AND INTERCOSTAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC SHIELD OF THE CHEST TO ENSURE THAT THE LUNGS CAN FULLY EXPAND AND CONTRACT, OPTIMIZING THE UPTAKE OF PRANA (LIFE FORCE) THROUGH THE BREATH.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL DE LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS PULMONARES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES TOR\\u00c1CICOS E INTERCOSTALES. ALINEA EL ESCUDO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL PECHO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS PULMONES PUEDAN EXPANDIRSE Y CONTRAERSE POR COMPLETO, OPTIMIZANDO LA CAPTACI\\u00d3N DE PRANA (FUERZA VITAL) A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1020','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:38:23','2026-04-25 15:38:23'),(3761,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1021,'{\"symptoms\":\"HIGH FEVER, CHILLS, HEADACHES, CHEST PAIN, RAPID BREATHING, SEVERE SHORTNESS OF BREATH AND COUGH IT MIGHT BRING UP BLOOD. ((FIEBRE ALTA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR EN EL PECHO, RESPIRACI\\u00d3N R\\u00c1PIDA, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR GRAVE Y TOS QUE PUEDE PRESENTAR SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RODENT FLEA. PULMONARY SYNDROME. BLACK PLAGUE. ((TRANSMITIDO POR LA PULGA DE LOS ROEDORES. S\\u00cdNDROME PULMONAR. PESTE NEGRA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HIGH FEVER, CHILLS, HEADACHES, CHEST PAIN, RAPID BREATHING, SEVERE SHORTNESS OF BREATH, AND COUGH THAT MIGHT BRING UP BLOOD.\\n\\n(FIEBRE ALTA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR EN EL PECHO, RESPIRACI\\u00d3N R\\u00c1PIDA, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR GRAVE Y TOS QUE PUEDE PRESENTAR SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"BLACK PLAGUE \\/ PULMONARY SYNDROME. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF YERSINIA PESTIS, WHICH IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY RODENT FLEAS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN MANAGING ACUTE PULMONARY DISTRESS AND PREVENTING THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THIS AGGRESSIVE PATHOGEN, RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE LUNG TISSUE AND PROTECTING RESPIRATORY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(PESTE NEGRA \\/ S\\u00cdNDROME PULMONAR. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA YERSINIA PESTIS, QUE NORMALMENTE SE TRANSMITE POR LAS PULGAS DE LOS ROEDORES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO APOYA AL CUERPO EN EL MANEJO DE LA DIFICULTAD PULMONAR AGUDA Y PREVIENE LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO AGRESIVO, RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DEL TEJIDO PULMONAR Y PROTEGIENDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE VERTICAL ALIGNMENT OF THE PULMONARY MICRO-CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER AND LOWER LOBE VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PURGE DEEP BACTERIAL LOADS AND RESTORE THE VITALITY OF THE ENTIRE RESPIRATORY COLUMN.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL DE LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS PULMONARES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DE LOS L\\u00d3BULOS SUPERIOR E INFERIOR. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS PROFUNDAS Y RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD DE TODA LA COLUMNA RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1021','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:39:36','2026-04-25 15:39:36'),(3762,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1022,'{\"symptoms\":\"This is a reservoir for bacteria (Treponema pallidum). Check if the pathogen does not respond to regular pairs or to ensure it is fully cleared. (Reservorio de la bacteria (Treponema pallidum). Revisar si el pat\\u00f3geno no responde a los pares regulares o para asegurar su eliminaci\\u00f3n total.)\",\"paths\":\"SYPHILIS (S\\u00cdFILIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"The Spleen is a vital energy center. This pair balances the Heart Chakra and Solar Plexus to boost the immune system and clear bacterial reservoirs. (El Bazo es un centro de energ\\u00eda vital. Este par equilibra el Chakra del Coraz\\u00f3n y el Plexo Solar para fortalecer el sistema inmunol\\u00f3gico y limpiar los reservorios bacterianos.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"THIS IS A RESERVOIR FOR BACTERIA (TREPONEMA PALLIDUM). CHECK IF THE PATHOGEN DOES NOT RESPOND TO REGULAR PAIRS OR TO ENSURE IT IS FULLY CLEARED.(RESERVORIO DE LA BACTERIA (TREPONEMA PALLIDUM). REVISAR SI EL PAT\\u00d3GENO NO RESPONDE A LOS PARES REGULARES O PARA ASEGURAR SU ELIMINACI\\u00d3N TOTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"SYPHILIS (S\\u00cdFILIS). THIS PAIR ACTS AS A HIDING PLACE FOR THE BACTERIA RESPONSIBLE FOR SYPHILIS, ALLOWING THE PATHOGEN TO PERSIST IN THE SYSTEM EVEN AFTER TREATMENT OF ACTIVE SITES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET DEPURA THE SPLEEN AND LUNG INTERFACE, ENSURING THAT LATENT BACTERIAL COLONIES ARE ELIMINATED AND PREVENTING RECURRENCE OR SYSTEMIC SPREAD.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdFILIS. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN LUGAR DE OCULTAMIENTO PARA LA BACTERIA RESPONSABLE DE LA S\\u00cdFILIS, PERMITIENDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PERSISTA EN EL SISTEMA INCLUSO DESPU\\u00c9S DEL TRATAMIENTO DE LOS SITIOS ACTIVOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO DEPURA LA INTERFAZ DEL BAZO Y EL PULM\\u00d3N, ASEGURANDO QUE LAS COLONIAS BACTERIANAS LATENTES SEAN ELIMINADAS Y PREVINIENDO LA RECURRENCIA O PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THE SPLEEN IS A VITAL ENERGY CENTER. THIS PAIR BALANCES THE HEART CHAKRA AND SOLAR PLEXUS TO BOOST THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND CLEAR BACTERIAL RESERVOIRS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). EL BAZO ES UN CENTRO DE ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL. ESTE PAR EQUILIBRA EL CHAKRA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL PLEXO SOLAR PARA FORTALECER EL SISTEMA INMUNOL\\u00d3GICO Y LIMPIAR LOS RESERVORIOS BACTERIANOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1022','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:40:50','2026-04-25 15:40:50'),(3763,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1023,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ALLERGIES. (FIEBRE, ALERGIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"ASTHMA, RHEUMATIC FEVER. (ASMA, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"Minor Chakra connection. This pair links the Heart Chakra (Lungs) with the Solar Plexus (Suprarenals), balancing the body\'s stress response and respiratory capacity. (Conexi\\u00f3n de Chakra Menor. Este par vincula el Chakra del Coraz\\u00f3n (Pulmones) con el Plexo Solar (Suprarrenales), equilibrando la respuesta del cuerpo al estr\\u00e9s y la capacidad respiratoria.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY-ADRENAL AXIS (EJE RESPIRATORIO-SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ALLERGIES, AND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS. MAY MANIFEST AS DIFFICULTY BREATHING UNDER STRESS OR SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, ALERGIAS Y DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR BAJO ESTR\\u00c9S O RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"ASTHMA AND RHEUMATIC FEVER. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE COMPLEX INTERACTION BETWEEN THE LUNGS AND THE ADRENAL RESPONSE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BODY\'S REACTION TO EXTERNAL ALLERGENS AND INTERNAL STRESSORS, HELPING TO MITIGATE ASTHMATIC SPASMS AND THE SYSTEMIC EFFECTS OF RHEUMATIC FEVER. IT SUPPORTS THE REGULATION OF CORTISOL AND ADRENALINE TO REDUCE BRONCHIAL INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ASMA Y FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N COMPLEJA ENTRE LOS PULMONES Y LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA REACCI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO A LOS AL\\u00c9RGENOS EXTERNOS Y LOS ESTRESORES INTERNOS, AYUDANDO A MITIGAR LOS ESPASMOS ASM\\u00c1TICOS Y LOS EFECTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS DE LA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA. APOYA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL CORTISOL Y LA ADRENALINA PARA REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MINOR CHAKRA CONNECTION. THIS PAIR LINKS THE HEART CHAKRA (LUNGS) WITH THE SOLAR PLEXUS (SUPRARENALS), BALANCING THE BODY\'S STRESS RESPONSE AND RESPIRATORY CAPACITY. IT ALIGNS THE VORTICES TO ENSURE THAT EMOTIONAL TENSION DOES NOT RESTRICT THE PHYSICAL VITALITY OF THE BREATH.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MENOR. ESTE PAR VINCULA EL CHAKRA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N (PULMONES) CON EL PLEXO SOLAR (SUPRARRENALES), EQUILIBRANDO LA RESPUESTA DEL CUERPO AL ESTR\\u00c9S Y LA CAPACIDAD RESPIRATORIA. ALINEA LOS V\\u00d3RTICES PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL NO RESTRINJA LA VITALIDAD F\\u00cdSICA DE LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1023','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:42:51','2026-04-25 15:42:51'),(3764,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1024,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, BREATHING DIFFICULTY, LOW DEFENSES. (TOS, DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA, DEFENSAS BAJAS.)\",\"paths\":\"PULMONARY DYSFUNCTION AND IMMUNE REGULATION. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNOL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"Heart Chakra (Anahata). This pair connects the respiratory system (Lungs) with the primary gland of the immune system (Thymus), both governed by the Heart Chakra to promote emotional and physical protection. (Chakra del Coraz\\u00f3n (Anahata). Este par conecta el sistema respiratorio (Pulmones) con la gl\\u00e1ndula principal del sistema inmunol\\u00f3gico (Timo), ambos gobernados por el Chakra del Coraz\\u00f3n para promover la protecci\\u00f3n emocional y f\\u00edsica.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE-RESPIRATORY AXIS (EJE INMUNO-RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, BREATHING DIFFICULTY, AND LOW DEFENSES. MAY MANIFEST AS A SUSCEPTIBILITY TO RECURRENT INFECTIONS OR A LACK OF VITAL ENERGY IN THE LUNGS.\\n\\n(TOS, DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA Y DEFENSAS BAJAS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA SUSCEPTIBILIDAD A INFECCIONES RECURRENTES O UNA FALTA DE ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL EN LOS PULMONES.)\",\"paths\":\"PULMONARY DYSFUNCTION AND IMMUNE REGULATION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC CONNECTION BETWEEN THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM AND THE PRIMARY GLAND OF THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STRENGTHENS THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSES, ASSISTING IN THE REGULATION OF T-CELL PRODUCTION AND IMPROVING THE OXIGENATION OF TISSUES. IT IS ESSENTIAL FOR RECOVERING FROM PROLONGED RESPIRATORY ILLNESSES BY REBOOTING THE IMMUNE RESPONSE WITHIN THE THORACIC CAVITY.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNOL\\u00d3GICA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PRINCIPAL DEL SISTEMA INMUNOL\\u00d3GICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO FORTALECE LAS DEFENSAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO, AYUDANDO EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS T Y MEJORANDO LA OXIGENACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS. ES ESENCIAL PARA RECUPERARSE DE ENFERMEDADES RESPIRATORIAS PROLONGADAS AL REINICIAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNE DENTRO DE LA CAVIDAD TOR\\u00c1CICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR GOVERNS THE HEART CENTER TO PROMOTE BOTH EMOTIONAL AND PHYSICAL PROTECTION. IT ALIGNS THE RESPIRATORY VORTICES WITH THE THYMIC GLAND TO ENSURE A ROBUST ENERGY SHIELD AGAINST EXTERNAL PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CHAKRA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA). ESTE PAR GOBIERNA EL CENTRO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N PARA PROMOVER LA PROTECCI\\u00d3N TANTO EMOCIONAL COMO F\\u00cdSICA. ALINEA LOS V\\u00d3RTICES RESPIRATORIOS CON LA GL\\u00c1NDULA T\\u00cdMICA PARA ASEGURAR UN ESCUDO DE ENERG\\u00cdA ROBUSTO CONTRA PAT\\u00d3GENOS EXTERNOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1024','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:44:19','2026-04-25 15:44:19'),(3765,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1025,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CLOTTING PROBLEMS, BRUISES EASILY, (PROBLEMAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N, MORETONES CON FACILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THROMBOSIS (TROMBOSIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MINOR CHAKRA \\/ NAVEL CHAKRA. ENERGY DISTRIBUTION CENTER. (CHAKRA MENOR \\/ CHAKRA DEL OMBLIGO. CENTRO DE DISTRIBUCI\\u00d3N DE ENERG\\u00cdA.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"UMBILICAL ENERGY AXIS (EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO UMBILICAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"CLOTTING PROBLEMS, BRUISES EASILY, AND THROMBOSIS. MAY MANIFEST AS CIRCULATORY DISORDERS OR A TENDENCY TOWARD VASCULAR CONGESTION.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N, MORETONES CON FACILIDAD Y TROMBOSIS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO TRASTORNOS CIRCULATORIOS O UNA TENDENCIA A LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N VASCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THROMBOSIS (TROMBOSIS). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC REGULATION OF BLOOD VISCOSITY AND COAGULATION PROCESSES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE UMBILICAL REGION, WHICH ACTS AS A VITAL DISTRIBUTION POINT FOR SYSTEMIC FLOW. BY CLEARING THIS AXIS, IT ASSISTS THE BODY IN PREVENTING THE FORMATION OF CLOTS AND ENHANCES THE OVERALL EFFICIENCY OF THE CIRCULATORY NETWORK, REDUCING THE RISK OF VASCULAR BLOCKAGES.\\n\\n(TROMBOSIS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA VISCOSIDAD SANGU\\u00cdNEA Y LOS PROCESOS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA REGI\\u00d3N UMBILICAL, QUE ACT\\u00daA COMO UN PUNTO DE DISTRIBUCI\\u00d3N VITAL PARA EL FLUJO SIST\\u00c9MICO. AL DEPURAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA AL CUERPO A PREVENIR LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE CO\\u00c1GULOS Y MEJORA LA EFICIENCIA GENERAL DE LA RED CIRCULATORIA, REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE OBSTRUCCIONES VASCULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MINOR CHAKRA \\/ NAVAL CHAKRA. ENERGY DISTRIBUTION CENTER. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE UMBILICAL VORTEX AND ITS CONNECTION TO THE SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) FLOW. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ABDOMINAL AND MESENTERIC MICRO-VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC GATES TO ENSURE FLUID DYNAMICS ARE BALANCED THROUGOUT THE LOWER TORSO.\\n\\n(CHAKRA MENOR \\/ CHAKRA DEL OMBLIGO. CENTRO DE DISTRIBUCI\\u00d3N DE ENERG\\u00cdA. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE UMBILICAL Y SU CONEXI\\u00d3N CON EL FLUJO SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS MICRO-V\\u00d3RTICES ABDOMINALES Y MESENT\\u00c9RICOS. ALINEA LAS PUERTAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA DIN\\u00c1MICA DE FLUIDOS EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADA EN TODO EL TORSO INFERIOR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1025','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:45:37','2026-04-25 15:45:37'),(3766,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1026,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL ATTACHMENT ISSUES, LACK OF AUTONOMY, OR REPRODUCIVE SYSTEM IMBALANCE. (PROBLEMAS DE APEGO EMOCIONAL, FALTA DE AUTONOM\\u00cdA O DESEQUILIBRIO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"paths\":\"FATHER DEPENDENCY (DEPENDENCIA AL PADRE)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SACRAL CHAKRA (SVADHISTHANA). THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SACRAL CENTER, GOVERNING EMOTIONAL BONDS, CREATIVITY, AND THE RELATIONSHIP WITH PATERNAL FIGURES. BALANCING THIS POINT HELPS RESOLVE ATTACHMENT TO THE FATHER FIGURE AND PROMOTES PERSONAL INDEPENDENCE. (CHAKRA SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL CENTRO SACRO, QUE GOBIERNA LOS V\\u00cdNCULOS EMOCIONALES, LA CREATIVIDAD Y LA RELACI\\u00d3N CON LAS FIGURAS PATERNAS. EQUILIBRAR ESTE PUNTO AYUDA A RESOLVER EL APEGO A LA FIGURA PATERNA Y PROMUEVE LA INDEPENDENCIA PERSONAL.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"PATERNAL BOND AXIS (EJE DE V\\u00cdNCULO PATERNO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL ATTACHMENT ISSUES, LACK OF AUTONOMY, OR REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM IMBALANCE. MAY MANIFEST AS DIFFICULTY ESTABLISHING BOUNDARIES OR A SENSE OF INDECISION.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE APEGO EMOCIONAL, FALTA DE AUTONOM\\u00cdA O DESEQUILIBRIO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DIFICULTAD PARA ESTABLECER L\\u00cdMITES O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE INDECISI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"FATHER DEPENDENCY (DEPENDENCIA AL PADRE). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC TIES AND EMOTIONAL PATTERNS LINKED TO THE PATERNAL FIGURE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RESOLVING UNHEALTHY ATTACHMENTS OR DEPENDENCIES, FOSTERING PERSONAL INDEPENDENCE AND EMOTIONAL MATURITY. IT HELPS CLEAR REPRESSED EMOTIONS HELD WITHIN THE SACRAL REGION THAT MAY AFFECT BOTH PSYCHOLOGICAL AUTONOMY AND REPRODUCTIVE VITALITY.\\n\\n(DEPENDENCIA AL PADRE. ESTE PAR ABORDA LOS V\\u00cdNCULOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS Y LOS PATRONES EMOCIONALES VINCULADOS A LA FIGURA PATERNA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A RESOLVER APEGOS O DEPENDENCIAS POCO SALUDABLES, FOMENTANDO LA INDEPENDENCIA PERSONAL Y LA MADUREZ EMOCIONAL. AYUDA A DEPURAR EMOCIONES REPRIMIDAS RETENIDAS EN LA REGI\\u00d3N SACRA QUE PUEDEN AFECTAR TANTO LA AUTONOM\\u00cdA PSICOL\\u00d3GICA COMO LA VITALIDAD REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SACRAL CENTER, GOVERNING EMOTIONAL BONDS, CREATIVITY, AND THE RELATIONSHIP WITH PATERNAL FIGURES. BALANCING THIS POINT HELPS RESOLVE ATTACHMENT TO THE FATHER FIGURE AND PROMOTES PERSONAL INDEPENDENCE. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE GONADAL AND UMBILICAL MICRO-VORTICES.(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CHAKRA SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL CENTRO SACRO, QUE GOBIERNA LOS V\\u00cdNCULOS EMOCIONALES, LA CREATIVIDAD Y LA RELACI\\u00d3N CON LAS FIGURAS PATERNAS. EQUILIBRAR ESTE PUNTO AYUDA A RESOLVER EL APEGO A LA FIGURA PATERNA Y PROMUEVE LA INDEPENDENCIA PERSONAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS MICRO-V\\u00d3RTICES GONADALES Y UMBILICALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1026','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:47:10','2026-04-25 15:47:10'),(3767,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1027,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL ATTACHMENT ISSUES, DIFFICULTY ESTABLISHING BOUNDARIES, OR REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM IMBALANCE. (PROBLEMAS DE APEGO EMOCIONAL, DIFICULTAD PARA ESTABLECER L\\u00cdMITES O DESEQUILIBRIO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"paths\":\"MOTHER DEPENDENCY (DEPENDENCIA A LA MADRE)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SACRAL CHAKRA (SVADHISTHANA). THIS PAIR IS DEEPLY CONNECTED TO THE SACRAL CENTER, WHICH GOVERNS THE MATERNAL BOND, CREATIVITY, AND EMOTIONAL SECURITY. BALANCING THIS POINT HELPS RESOLVE UNHEALTHY DEPENDENCY ON THE MOTHER FIGURE AND PROMOTES EMOTIONAL MATURITY. (CHAKRA SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR EST\\u00c1 PROFUNDAMENTE CONECTADO CON EL CENTRO SACRO, QUE GOBIERNA EL V\\u00cdNCULO MATERNO, LA CREATIVIDAD Y LA SEGURIDAD EMOCIONAL. EQUILIBRAR ESTE PUNTO AYUDA A RESOLVER LA DEPENDENCIA COMPULSIVA DE LA FIGURA MATERNA Y PROMUEVE LA MADUREZ EMOCIONAL.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"MATERNAL BOND AXIS (EJE DE V\\u00cdNCULO MATERNO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL ATTACHMENT ISSUES, DIFFICULTY ESTABLISHING BOUNDARIES, OR REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM IMBALANCE.(PROBLEMAS DE APEGO EMOCIONAL, DIFICULTAD PARA ESTABLECER L\\u00cdMITES O DESEQUILIBRIO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"paths\":\"MOTHER DEPENDENCY (DEPENDENCIA A LA MADRE). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF UNRESOLVED ATTACHMENTS TO THE MATERNAL FIGURE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN BREAKING CYCLES OF COMPULSIVE DEPENDENCY, FOSTERING EMOTIONAL MATURITY AND THE ABILITY TO DEFINE ONE\'S OWN SPACE. IT HELPS CLEAR ENERGETIC \\\"CORDS\\\" HELD WITHIN THE UMBILICAL AND UTERINE INTERFACE THAT MAY HINDER PERSONAL GROWTH.\\n\\n(DEPENDENCIA A LA MADRE. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE APEGOS NO RESUELTOS CON LA FIGURA MATERNA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A ROMPER CICLOS DE DEPENDENCIA COMPULSIVA, FOMENTANDO LA MADUREZ EMOCIONAL Y LA CAPACIDAD DE DEFINIR EL ESPACIO PROPIO. AYUDA A DEPURAR LOS \\\"CORDONES\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICOS RETENIDOS EN LA INTERFAZ UMBILICAL Y UTERINA QUE PUEDEN DIFICULTAR EL CRECIMIENTO PERSONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR IS DEEPLY CONNECTED TO THE SACRAL CENTER, WHICH GOVERNS THE MATERNAL BOND, CREATIVITY, AND EMOTIONAL SECURITY. BALANCING THIS POINT HELPS RESOLVE UNHEALTHY DEPENDENCY ON THE MOTHER FIGURE AND PROMOTES EMOTIONAL MATURITY. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UTERINE AND UMBILICAL MICRO-VORTICES.(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CHAKRA SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR EST\\u00c1 PROFUNDAMENTE CONECTADO CON EL CENTRO SACRO, QUE GOBIERNA EL V\\u00cdNCULO MATERNO, LA CREATIVIDAD Y LA SEGURIDAD EMOCIONAL. EQUILIBRAR ESTE PUNTO AYUDA A RESOLVER LA DEPENDENCIA COMPULSIVA DE LA FIGURA MATERNA Y PROMUEVE LA MADUREZ EMOCIONAL. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS MICRO-V\\u00d3RTICES UTERINOS Y UMBILICALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1027','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:48:27','2026-04-25 15:48:27'),(3768,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1034,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, LOSS OF BALANCE, ALTERED BLOOD PRESSURE, OR GASTRIC DISCOMFORT. (MAREOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTERADA O MALESTAR G\\u00c1STRICO.)\",\"paths\":\"STROKE (DERRAME CEREBRAL \\/ INFARTO CEREBRAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SOLAR PLEXUS AND THIRD EYE CONNECTION. THIS PAIR LINKS THE DIGESTIVE CENTER (SOLAR PLEXUS) WITH THE BRAINSTEM (ROOT OF THE THIRD EYE AREA), WHICH REGULATES VITAL AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS. IT HELPS BALANCE THE ENERGY FLOW BETWEEN THE GUT AND THE NERVOUS SYSTEM TO PREVENT VASCULAR ISSUES. (CONEXI\\u00d3N DEL PLEXO SOLAR Y EL TERCER OJO. ESTE PAR VINCULA EL CENTRO DIGESTIVO (PLEXO SOLAR) CON EL TALLO CEREBRAL (RA\\u00cdZ DEL \\u00c1REA DEL TERCER OJO), QUE REGULA LAS FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS VITALES. AYUDA A EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA ENTRE EL INTESTINO Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARA PREVENIR PROBLEMAS VASCULARES.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"GASTRIC-NEUROLOGICAL AXIS (EJE G\\u00c1STRICO-NEUROL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, LOSS OF BALANCE, ALTERED BLOOD PRESSURE, OR GASTRIC DISCOMFORT. MAY MANIFEST AS A DISCONNECTION BETWEEN DIGESTION AND THE BODY\'S AUTONOMIC CONTROL.\\n\\n(MAREOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTERADA O MALESTAR G\\u00c1STRICO. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA DESCONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y EL CONTROL AUT\\u00d3NOMO DEL CUERPO.)\",\"paths\":\"STROKE (DERRAME CEREBRAL \\/ INFARTO CEREBRAL). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DYSFUNCTION THAT MAY PRECEDE OR RESULT FROM CEREBRAL VASCULAR ISSUES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA, ASSISTING THE BODY IN REGULATING VITAL FUNCTIONS THAT HAVE BEEN COMPROMISED, SUPPORTING THE RECOVERY OF BLOOD PRESSURE AND SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PUEDE PRECEDER O RESULTAR DE PROBLEMAS VASCULARES CEREBRALES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A REGULAR LAS FUNCIONES VITALES QUE SE HAN VISTO COMPROMETIDAS, APOYANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL Y EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THIRD EYE (AJNA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR LINKS THE DIGESTIVE CENTER WITH THE BRAINSTEM (ROOT OF THE THIRD EYE AREA), WHICH REGULATES VITAL AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS. IT HELPS BALANCE THE ENERGY FLOW BETWEEN THE GUT AND THE NERVOUS SYSTEM TO PREVENT VASCULAR ISSUES. MICRO-CHAKRAS: ASSOCIATED WITH THE GASTRIC VORTEX AND THE BULBAR NUCLEUS.(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y EL TERCER OJO (AJNA). ESTE PAR VINCULA EL CENTRO DIGESTIVO CON EL TALLO CEREBRAL (RA\\u00cdZ DEL \\u00c1REA DEL TERCER OJO), QUE REGULA LAS FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS VITALES. AYUDA A EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA ENTRE EL INTESTINO Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARA PREVENIR PROBLEMAS VASCULARES. MICRO-CHAKRAS: ASOCIADO CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE G\\u00c1STRICO Y EL N\\u00daCLEO BULBAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1034','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:50:53','2026-04-25 15:50:53'),(3769,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1095,'{\"origins\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL CORTEX (CORTEZA SUPRARRENAL)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1095','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 15:58:54','2026-04-25 15:58:54'),(3770,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1113,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"URIC ACID AND GOUT. (\\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO Y GOTA.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC BALANCE AXIS (EJE DE EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"URIC ACID AND GOUT. MAY MANIFEST AS JOINT PAIN, INFLAMMATION IN THE EXTREMITIES (SPECIFICALLY THE BIG TOE), AND STIFFNESS IN THE LOWER BACK OR NECK REGION.\\n\\n(\\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO Y GOTA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DOLOR ARTICULAR, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS EXTREMIDADES (ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE EN EL DEDO GORDO DEL PIE) Y RIGIDEZ EN LA REGI\\u00d3N LUMBAR O DEL CUELLO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF URIC ACID WITHIN THE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW BETWEEN THE BASE OF THE SPINE (COCCYX) AND THE NERVE NETWORK OF THE NECK (CERVICAL PLEXUS). IT ASSISTS THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC WASTE MORE EFFECTIVELY, REDUCING THE CRYSTALLIZATION THAT LEADS TO GOUT AND PROMOTING VASCULAR AND NERVOUS SYSTEM COHERENCE.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO DENTRO DEL SISTEMA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA BASE DE LA COLUMNA (COXIS) Y LA RED NERVIOSA DEL CUELLO (PLEXO CERVICAL). AYUDA AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE MANERA M\\u00c1S EFECTIVA, REDUCIENDO LA CRISTALIZACI\\u00d3N QUE CONDUCE A LA GOTA Y PROMOVIENDO LA COHERENCIA DEL SISTEMA VASCULAR Y NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE COCCYGEAL MICRO-CHAKRA AND THE UPPER CERVICAL VORTICES. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE RENAL AND ARTICULAR MINOR CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO RESOLVE SYSTEMIC ACIDITY AND RESTORE STRUCTURAL ALIGNMENT.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA COCC\\u00cdGEO Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CERVICALES SUPERIORES. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS CHAKRAS MENORES RENALES Y ARTICULARES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA RESOLVER LA ACIDEZ SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RESTAURAR LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1113','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:00:11','2026-04-25 16:00:11'),(3771,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1124,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE STIFFNESS, TREMORS, SPASMS, JERKING, TWITCHING, MENTAL CONFUSION, FEVER, WEAKNESS, COLD EXTREMITIES, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, ACUTE COLD, BACK PAIN, RAPID HEARTBEAT, RINGING IN THE EARS, URINE IN BLOOD. (RIGIDEZ MUSCULAR, TEMBLORES, ESPASMOS, SACUDIDAS, TICS, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FIEBRE, DEBILIDAD, EXTREMIDADES FR\\u00cdAS, INFECCIONES DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, RESFRIADO AGUDO, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, LATIDO CARD\\u00cdACO R\\u00c1PIDO, ZUMBIDO EN LOS O\\u00cdDOS, SANGRE EN LA ORINA.)\",\"paths\":\"SPREAD BY OPEN WOUNDS FROM CONTAMINATED METAL OXIDES. TETANUS, EDEMA, KIDNEY DISEASE, AND NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. METASTASIS. (SE PROPAGA POR HERIDAS ABIERTAS A PARTIR DE \\u00d3XIDOS MET\\u00c1LICOS CONTAMINADOS. T\\u00c9TANOS, EDEMA, ENFERMEDAD RENAL Y S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. MET\\u00c1STASIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH A BITE; (KIDNEY=ADRENAL=CEREBELLUM AT THE SAME TIME.     ASSOCIATED WITH SCAPULA; GANGRENE ASSOCIATED WITH URETER; STIMULATES A HERNIATED DISC. ASSOCIATED WITH CEREBELLUM; FALSE PARKINSON\'S AND EPILEPSY. (ASOCIADO CON UNA MORDEDURA; (RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N = SUPRARRENAL = CEREBELO AL MISMO TIEMPO). ASOCIADO CON LA ESC\\u00c1PULA; GANGRENA. ASOCIADO CON EL UR\\u00c9TER; ESTIMULA UNA HERNIACI\\u00d3N DE DISCO. ASOCIADO CON EL CEREBELO; FALSO PARKINSON Y EPILEPSIA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE STIFFNESS, TREMORS, SPASMS, AND TWITCHING. MAY MANIFEST AS MENTAL CONFUSION, FEVER, WEAKNESS, COLD EXTREMITIES, OR URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS. ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH BACK PAIN, RAPID HEARTBEAT, RINGING IN THE EARS, AND URINE IN BLOOD.\\n\\n(RIGIDEZ MUSCULAR, TEMBLORES, ESPASMOS Y TICS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FIEBRE, DEBILIDAD, EXTREMIDADES FR\\u00cdAS O INFECCIONES DE LAS V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA CON DOLOR DE ESPALDA, LATIDO CARD\\u00cdACO R\\u00c1PIDO, ZUMBIDO EN LOS O\\u00cdDOS Y SANGRE EN LA ORINA.)\",\"paths\":\"TETANUS (T\\u00c9TANOS). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF CLOSTRIDIUM TETANI, OFTEN SPREAD BY OPEN WOUNDS FROM CONTAMINATED METAL OXIDES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CLEARING THE PATHOGEN THAT CAUSES EDEMA, KIDNEY DISEASE, AND NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. IT SUPPORTS THE PREVENTION OF METASTASIS AND RESTORES THE BALANCE OF RENAL FILTRATION.\\n\\n(T\\u00c9TANOS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE CLOSTRIDIUM TETANI, A MENUDO PROPAGADO POR HERIDAS ABIERTAS DE \\u00d3XIDOS MET\\u00c1LICOS CONTAMINADOS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO QUE CAUSA EDEMA, ENFERMEDAD RENAL Y S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. APOYA LA PREVENCI\\u00d3N DE MET\\u00c1STASIS Y RESTAURA EL EQUILIBRIO DE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR IS PRIMARILY CONNECTED TO THE ROOT CHAKRA (ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINE SYSTEM). MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL REGION. IT MAY BE ASSOCIATED WITH A BITE OR SCAPULA RESONANCE (GANGRENE). ALSO CHECK CEREBELLUM FOR FALSE PARKINSON\'S OR EPILEPSY SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR EST\\u00c1 CONECTADO PRINCIPALMENTE AL CHAKRA RA\\u00cdZ (SISTEMA ADRENAL\\/ENDOCRINO). CHAKRA MENOR: REGI\\u00d3N RENAL. PUEDE ESTAR ASOCIADO CON UNA MORDEDURA O RESONANCIA EN LA ESC\\u00c1PULA (GANGRENA). TAMBI\\u00c9N REVISAR EL CEREBELO PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE FALSO PARKINSON O EPILEPSIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1124','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:01:24','2026-04-25 16:01:24'),(3772,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1127,'{\"symptoms\":\"RENAL DYSFUNCTION. TARGETS POTENTIAL VIRAL STORAGE THAT CAN AFFECT KIDNEY EFFICIENCY AND SYSTEMIC IMMUNITY. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL. DIRIGIDO AL POSIBLE ALMACENAMIENTO VIRAL QUE PUEDE AFECTAR LA EFICIENCIA RENAL Y LA INMUNIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR THE HIV VIRUS. NEUTRALIZING THIS POINT DOES NOT MEAN AN ACTIVE INFECTION IS PRESENT, BUT IT CLEARS THE \\\"HIDING PLACE\\\" TO PREVENT FUTURE RENAL COMPLICATIONS. (ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO PARA EL VIRUS DEL VIH. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE PUNTO NO SIGNIFICA QUE HAYA UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N ACTIVA, SINO QUE LIMPIA EL \\\"ESCONDITE\\\" PARA PREVENIR FUTURAS COMPLICACIONES RENALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THYMUS\\/RECTUM             CHECK - INDEX FINGERS (REVISAR - TIMO\\/RECTO             REVISAR - DEDOS \\u00cdNDICE)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RENAL DYSFUNCTION. TARGETS POTENTIAL LATENT PATHOGENS THAT MAY NOT BE DETECTED IN ACTIVE STAGES. MAY MANIFEST AS GENERALIZED FATIGUE, FREQUENT INFECTIONS, AND LOW ENERGY LEVELS.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL. DIRIGIDO A POSIBLES PAT\\u00d3GENOS LATENTES QUE PUEDEN NO SER DETECTADOS EN ETAPAS ACTIVAS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO FATIGA GENERALIZADA, INFECCIONES FRECUENTES Y BAJOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR THE HIV VIRUS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET DOES NOT SIGNIFY THAT AN ACTIVE INFECTION IS PRESENT, BUT RATHER CLEARS THE ENERGETIC \\\"HIDING PLACE\\\" TO PREVENT FUTURE RENAL COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAIR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO PARA EL VIRUS DEL VIH. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO NO SIGNIFICA QUE HAYA UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N ACTIVA, SINO QUE DEPURA EL \\\"LUGAR DE OCULTAMIENTO\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA PREVENIR FUTURAS COMPLICACIONES RENALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO RENAL FILTRATION AND CORTICAL MICRO-CHAKRAS. MINOR CHAKRA: RENAL AND LYMPHATIC REGIONS. CHECK - THYMUS\\/RECTUM AND INDEX FINGERS FOR RELATED RESONANCES.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAIR SE RELACIONA CON LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS CORTICALES. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES RENAL Y LINF\\u00c1TICA. REVISAR - TIMO\\/RECTO Y DEDOS \\u00cdNDICE PARA RESONANCIAS RELACIONADAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1127','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:02:38','2026-04-25 16:02:38'),(3773,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1144,'{\"alternative_routes\":\"AJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARY\\/TESTIS\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: PELVIC AND APPENDICULAR REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: PERITONEAL FASCIA AND APPENDIX TISSUE.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARIO\\/TEST\\u00cdCULO\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES P\\u00c9LVICA Y APENDICULAR. MICRO CHAKRA: FASCIA PERITONEAL Y TEJIDO DEL AP\\u00c9NDICE.\"}','{\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARY\\/TESTIS\\/ENDOCRINE. MINOR CHAKRA: PELVIC AND APPENDICULAR REGIONS. MICRO CHAKRA: PERITONEAL FASCIA AND APPENDIX TISSUE.\\n\\nCHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARIO\\/TEST\\u00cdCULO\\/ENDOCRINO. CHAKRA MENOR: REGIONES P\\u00c9LVICA Y APENDICULAR. MICRO CHAKRA: FASCIA PERITONEAL Y TEJIDO DEL AP\\u00c9NDICE.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1144','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:03:00','2026-04-25 16:03:00'),(3774,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1154,'{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED VIA SEXUAL CONTACT. RISK OF INFECTION FOR WOMEN FROM CONTAMINATED SURFACES SUCH AS TOILET SEATS. ASSOCIATED WITH PELVIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(INFECTADO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL. LAS MUJERES PUEDEN INFECTARSE POR ASIENTOS DE INODORO AL SENTARSE. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THE PATIENTS PARTNER.                CHECK - CECUM\\/KIDNEY (R) (REVISAR - LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE.                REVISAR - CIEGO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO)\"}','{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED VIA SEXUAL CONTACT. RISK OF INFECTION FOR WOMEN FROM CONTAMINATED SURFACES SUCH AS TOILET SEATS. ASSOCIATED WITH PELVIC INFLAMMATION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITE\'S COLONIZATION IN THE UROGENITAL AND INTESTINAL TRACT, HELPING TO NEUTRALIZE PH AND ELIMINATE THE PARASITIC LOAD TO RESTORE NORMAL TISSUE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(INFECTADO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL. LAS MUJERES PUEDEN INFECTARSE POR ASIENTOS DE INODORO AL SENTARSE. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO EN EL TRACTO UROGENITAL E INTESTINAL, AYUDANDO A NEUTRALIZAR EL PH Y ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA PARA RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NORMAL DEL TEJIDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THE PATIENT\'S PARTNER. CHECK - CECUM\\/KIDNEY (R). THIS PAIR CONNECTS WITH THE INTESTINAL MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE RENAL FILTRATION REGION TO CLEAR THE SYSTEM OF SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(REVISAR - LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE. REVISAR - CIEGO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO). ESTE PAR SE CONECTA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS INTESTINALES Y LA REGI\\u00d3N DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL PARA DEPURAR EL SISTEMA DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1154','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:04:43','2026-04-25 16:04:43'),(3775,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1154,'{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED VIA SEXUAL CONTACT. RISK OF INFECTION FOR WOMEN FROM CONTAMINATED SURFACES SUCH AS TOILET SEATS. ASSOCIATED WITH PELVIC INFLAMMATION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITE\'S COLONIZATION IN THE UROGENITAL AND INTESTINAL TRACT, HELPING TO NEUTRALIZE PH AND ELIMINATE THE PARASITIC LOAD TO RESTORE NORMAL TISSUE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(INFECTADO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL. LAS MUJERES PUEDEN INFECTARSE POR ASIENTOS DE INODORO AL SENTARSE. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO EN EL TRACTO UROGENITAL E INTESTINAL, AYUDANDO A NEUTRALIZAR EL PH Y ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA PARA RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NORMAL DEL TEJIDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THE PATIENT\'S PARTNER. CHECK - CECUM\\/KIDNEY (R). THIS PAIR CONNECTS WITH THE INTESTINAL MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE RENAL FILTRATION REGION TO CLEAR THE SYSTEM OF SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(REVISAR - LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE. REVISAR - CIEGO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO). ESTE PAR SE CONECTA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS INTESTINALES Y LA REGI\\u00d3N DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL PARA DEPURAR EL SISTEMA DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL.)\"}','{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED VIA SEXUAL CONTACT. RISK OF INFECTION FOR WOMEN FROM CONTAMINATED SURFACES SUCH AS TOILET SEATS. ASSOCIATED WITH PELVIC INFLAMMATION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE PARASITE\'S COLONIZATION IN THE UROGENITAL AND INTESTINAL TRACT, HELPING TO NEUTRALIZE PH AND ELIMINATE THE PARASITIC LOAD TO RESTORE NORMAL TISSUE FUNCTION.(INFECTADO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL. LAS MUJERES PUEDEN INFECTARSE POR ASIENTOS DE INODORO AL SENTARSE. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO EN EL TRACTO UROGENITAL E INTESTINAL, AYUDANDO A NEUTRALIZAR EL PH Y ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA PARA RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NORMAL DEL TEJIDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THE PATIENT\'S PARTNER. CHECK - CECUM\\/KIDNEY (R). THIS PAIR CONNECTS WITH THE INTESTINAL MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE RENAL FILTRATION REGION TO CLEAR THE SYSTEM OF SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED PATHOGENS.(REVISAR - LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE. REVISAR - CIEGO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO). ESTE PAR SE CONECTA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS INTESTINALES Y LA REGI\\u00d3N DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL PARA DEPURAR EL SISTEMA DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1154','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:06:04','2026-04-25 16:06:04'),(3776,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1155,'{\"paths\":\"VAGINITIS, PRURITUS, DIGESTIVE DISORDER. (VAGINITIS, PRURITO, TRASTORNO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CECUM\\/CECUM; AUTISM (REVISAR - CIEGO\\/CIEGO; AUTISMO)\"}','{\"paths\":\"VAGINITIS, PRURITUS, DIGESTIVE DISORDER. THIS PAIR ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR THE TRICHOMONAS PARASITE, ALLOWING IT TO PERSIST IN THE SYSTEM BY HIDING IN THE INTERFACE BETWEEN THE INTESTINAL VALVE AND THE RENAL FILTRATION SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ENSURES THAT LATENT PARASITIC CARGO IS ELIMINATED, PREVENTING RECURRING VAGINAL ITCHING AND CHRONIC DIGESTIVE INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(VAGINITIS, PRURITO, TRASTORNO DIGESTIVO. ESTE PAR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO PARA EL PAR\\u00c1SITO TRICHOMONAS, PERMITI\\u00c9NDOLE PERSISTIR EN EL SISTEMA AL OCULTARSE EN LA INTERFAZ ENTRE LA V\\u00c1LVULA INTESTINAL Y EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ASEGURA QUE LA CARGA PARASITARIA LATENTE SEA ELIMINADA, PREVINIENDO EL PRURITO VAGINAL RECURRENTE Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CECUM\\/CECUM; AUTISM. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE INTESTINAL MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE RENAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO PURGE DEEP PARASITIC LOADS THAT MAY AFFECT BOTH THE UROGENITAL HEALTH AND SYSTEMIC ALLERGIC RESPONSES.\\n\\n(REVISAR - CIEGO\\/CIEGO; AUTISMO. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS INTESTINALES Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES RENALES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR CARGAS PARASITARIAS PROFUNDAS QUE PUEDEN AFECTAR TANTO LA SALUD UROGENITAL COMO LAS RESPUESTAS AL\\u00c9RGICAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1155','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:07:26','2026-04-25 16:07:26'),(3777,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1159,'{\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION WITHIN THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS REGULATE OVARIAN FUNCTION, BALANCE ESTROGEN LEVELS, AND RESTORE VITALITY TO THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR DENTRO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A REGULAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA, EQUILIBRAR LOS NIVELES DE ESTR\\u00d3GENO Y RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK: STERNUM \\/ ADRENALS. MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARY\\/ENDOCRINE. MICRO CHAKRA: OVARIAN CORTEX.\\n\\n(REVISAR: ESTERN\\u00d3N \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. CHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARIO\\/ENDOCRINO. MICRO CHAKRA: CORTEZA OV\\u00c1RICA.)\"}','{\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR ADDRESSES GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION WITHIN THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET HELPS REGULATE OVARIAN FUNCTION, BALANCE ESTROGEN LEVELS, AND RESTORE VITALITY TO THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS.(ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR DENTRO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A REGULAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA, EQUILIBRAR LOS NIVELES DE ESTR\\u00d3GENO Y RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK: STERNUM \\/ ADRENALS. MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARY\\/ENDOCRINE. MICRO CHAKRA: OVARIAN CORTEX.(REVISAR: ESTERN\\u00d3N \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. CHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA) \\u2014 OVARIO\\/ENDOCRINO. MICRO CHAKRA: CORTEZA OV\\u00c1RICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1159','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:08:29','2026-04-25 16:08:29'),(3778,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1171,'{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS, COUGHING, AND ANIMALS SUCH AS RODENTS, DOGS AND FLEAS. CONTAGIOUS LARYNGEAL COUGHING AND BRONCHITIS. PELVIC DISORDERS, FALSE DIABETES, FALSE TESTICULAR TUBERCULOSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TOS Y ANIMALES COMO ROEDORES, PERROS Y PULGAS. TOS LAR\\u00cdNGEA CONTAGIOSA Y BRONQUITIS. TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, FALSA DIABETES, FALSA TUBERCULOSIS TESTICULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - TESTICLE CHECK - VAGINA (REVISAR - TEST\\u00cdCULO REVISAR - VAGINA)\"}','{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS, COUGHING, AND ANIMALS SUCH AS RODENTS, DOGS, AND FLEAS. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES CONTAGIOUS LARYNGEAL COUGHING AND BRONCHITIS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ASSISTS IN RESOLVING PELVIC DISORDERS, FALSE DIABETES, AND FALSE TESTICULAR TUBERCULOSIS BY ELIMINATING THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF THE PATHOGEN WITHIN THE SPLENIC TISSUE.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TOS Y ANIMALES COMO ROEDORES, PERROS Y PULGAS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA TOS LAR\\u00cdNGEA CONTAGIOSA Y LA BRONQUITIS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A RESOLVER TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, FALSA DIABETES Y FALSA TUBERCULOSIS TESTICULAR AL ELIMINAR LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO DENTRO DEL TEJIDO ESPL\\u00c9NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - TESTICLE; CHECK - VAGINA. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE SPLENIC MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE FILTRATION VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO CLEAR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT MAY CAUSE REPRODUCTIVE OR SYSTEMIC RESPIRATORY DISRUPTION.\\n\\n(REVISAR - TEST\\u00cdCULO; REVISAR - VAGINA. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS ESPL\\u00c9NICOS Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE PUEDEN CAUSAR ALTERACIONES REPRODUCTIVAS O RESPIRATORIAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1171','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:09:36','2026-04-25 16:09:36'),(3779,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1176,'{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS AND RODENTS, DOGS AND FLEAS. BUBONIC PLAGUE. TESTICULAR TUBERCULOSIS,AZOOSPERMIA, ALTERS THE PRODUCTION OF TESTOSTERONE AND SPERMATOGENESIS. IMPOTENCE. (TRANSMITIDO POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS Y ROEDORES, PERROS Y PULGAS. PESTE BUB\\u00d3NICA. TUBERCULOSIS TESTICULAR, AZOOSPERMIA, ALTERA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE TESTOSTERONA Y LA ESPERMATOG\\u00c9NESIS. IMPOTENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SPLEEN    CHECK - VAGINA (REVISAR - BAZO    REVISAR - VAGINA)\"}','{\"paths\":\"BUBONIC PLAGUE (PESTE BUB\\u00d3NICA). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE RESONANCE OF YERSINIA PESTIS, WHICH CAN BE TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS OR THROUGH VECTORS LIKE RODENTS, DOGS, AND FLEAS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN MANAGING TESTICULAR TUBERCULOSIS AND AZOOSPERMIA. IT IS CRITICAL FOR BALANCING THE PRODUCTION OF TESTOSTERONE AND SPERMATOGENESIS, ADDRESSING ISSUES OF IMPOTENCE CAUSED BY PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(PESTE BUB\\u00d3NICA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA DE YERSINIA PESTIS, QUE PUEDE TRANSMITIRSE POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS O A TRAV\\u00c9S DE VECTORES COMO ROEDORES, PERROS Y PULGAS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO APOYA AL CUERPO EN EL MANEJO DE LA TUBERCULOSIS TESTICULAR Y LA AZOOSPERMIA. ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA EQUILIBRAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE TESTOSTERONA Y LA ESPERMATOG\\u00c9NESIS, ABORDANDO PROBLEMAS DE IMPOTENCIA CAUSADOS POR INTERFERENCIA PAT\\u00d3GENA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SPLEEN; CHECK - VAGINA. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GONADAL MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE LOWER VORTICES OF THE SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CENTER. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO CLEAR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT IMPACT REPRODUCTIVE VITALITY AND SYSTEMIC RESPIRATORY HEALTH.\\n\\n(REVISAR - BAZO; REVISAR - VAGINA. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS GONADALES Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES INFERIORES DEL CENTRO SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTAN LA VITALIDAD REPRODUCTIVA Y LA SALUD RESPIRATORIA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1176','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:10:39','2026-04-25 16:10:39'),(3780,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1193,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND LUNG INFECTIONS. (INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL Y LOS PULMONES.)\",\"paths\":\"SKIN INFECTIONS DUE TO INHALATION OF THE FUNGAL SPORES. (INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL DEBIDAS A LA INHALACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS F\\u00daNGICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (REVISAR - CODO\\/CODO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND LUNG INFECTIONS. MAY MANIFEST AS DERMATOLOGICAL IRRITATION OR RESPIRATORY DISCOMFORT LINKED TO FUNGAL COLONIZATION.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL Y LOS PULMONES. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO IRRITACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA O MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO VINCULADO A LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA.)\",\"paths\":\"SKIN INFECTIONS DUE TO INHALATION OF THE FUNGAL SPORES. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE OF MYCOSIS THAT ENTERS THROUGH THE RESPIRATORY TRACT AND IMPACTS SYSTEMIC HEALTH. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN CLEARING PATHOGENIC SPORES, PROTECTING THE INTEGRITY OF BOTH THE LUNGS AND THE DERMAL LAYERS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL DEBIDAS A LA INHALACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS F\\u00daNGICAS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA MICOSIS QUE INGRESA POR EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO E IMPACTA LA SALUD SIST\\u00c9MICA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LAS ESPORAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD TANTO DE LOS PULMONES COMO DE LAS CAPAS D\\u00c9RMICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL VORTEX AND THE LARYNGEAL MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE RESPIRATORY AND UPPER DIGESTIVE VORTICES. CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW FOR RELATED RESONANCES.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE DUODENAL Y EL MICRO-CHAKRA LAR\\u00cdNGEO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES RESPIRATORIOS Y DIGESTIVOS SUPERIORES. REVISAR - CODO\\/CODO PARA RESONANCIAS RELACIONADAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1193','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:33:14','2026-04-25 16:33:14'),(3781,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1194,'{\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE GASTRITIS, SEXUAL RELUCTANCE, INSOMNIA, FEVER, JAUNDICE, MUSCLE PAIN, POOR APPETITE, PAIN IN (ARMS, LEGS AND KNEES) HIGH CHOLESTEROL. (CANSANCIO, FATIGA, GASTRITIS, RESISTENCIA SEXUAL, INSOMNIO, FIEBRE, ICTERICIA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, POCO APETITO, DOLOR EN (BRAZOS, PIERNAS Y RODILLAS), COLESTEROL ALTO.)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS D, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINATION, GOUT, AND STERILITY IN WOMEN. (HEPATITIS D, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINACI\\u00d3N, GOTA Y ESTERILIDAD EN MUJERES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DUODENUM\\/KIDNEY (L) (REVISAR - DUODENO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE, GASTRITIS, SEXUAL RELUCTANCE, INSOMNIA, FEVER, JAUNDICE, MUSCLE PAIN, POOR APPETITE, PAIN IN (ARMS, LEGS AND KNEES), AND HIGH CHOLESTEROL.\\n\\n(CANSANCIO, FATIGA, GASTRITIS, RESISTENCIA SEXUAL, INSOMNIO, FIEBRE, ICTERICIA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, POCO APETITO, DOLOR EN (BRAZOS, PIERNAS Y RODILLAS), COLESTEROL ALTO.)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS D, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINATION, GOUT, AND STERILITY IN WOMEN. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS THAT IMPACTS BOTH THE DIGESTIVE AND HEPATIC SYSTEMS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN RESOLVING CHRONIC FATIGUE AND METABOLIC IMBALANCES THAT LEAD TO JOINT PAIN AND SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(HEPATITIS D, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINACI\\u00d3N, GOTA Y ESTERILIDAD EN MUJERES. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS QUE IMPACTA TANTO EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO COMO EL HEP\\u00c1TICO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESOLVER LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA Y LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS QUE CONDUCEN AL DOLOR ARTICULAR Y LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DUODENUM\\/KIDNEY (L). THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE DUODENAL VORTEX AND THE HEPATIC FILTRATION MICRO-CHAKRAS. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO CLEAR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT MAY HINDER REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH AND EMOTIONAL MOTIVATION.\\n\\n(REVISAR - DUODENO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL V\\u00d3RTICE DUODENAL Y LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DEPURAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE PUEDEN DIFICULTAR LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA Y LA MOTIVACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1194','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:34:28','2026-04-25 16:34:28'),(3782,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1203,'{\"alternative_routes\":\"CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA BILIAR Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PARATIROIDEO. ESTABILIZA EL EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO-MINERAL PARA EVITAR LA ESTAGNACI\\u00d3N DE FLUIDOS.\\n\\n(MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILIARY MICRO CHAKRA AND PARATHYROID MICRO CHAKRA. IT STABILIZES THE METABOLIC-MINERAL AXIS TO PREVENT FLUID STAGNATION.)\"}','{\"alternative_routes\":\"MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y GARGANTA (VISHUDDHA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL MICRO CHAKRA BILIAR Y EL MICRO CHAKRA PARATIROIDEO. ESTABILIZA EL EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO-MINERAL PARA EVITAR LA ESTAGNACI\\u00d3N DE FLUIDOS.\\n\\n(MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND THROAT (VISHUDDHA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE BILIARY MICRO CHAKRA AND PARATHYROID MICRO CHAKRA. IT STABILIZES THE METABOLIC-MINERAL AXIS TO PREVENT FLUID STAGNATION.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1203','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:35:17','2026-04-25 16:35:17'),(3783,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1235,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, FEVER AND GAS. INTOLERANCE TO LACTOSE, MEAT, EGGS COMMENT ETC. (PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, FIEBRE Y GASES. INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA, CARNE, HUEVOS, ETC.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY THE BITE OF A TICK OR MITES. LIVER DISORDER, JAUNDICE, OBESITY, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME, INFLAMMATION OF THE PANCREAS DUCT AND POOR QUALITY OF BILE. (TRANSMITIDO POR LA PICADURA DE UNA GARRAPATA O \\u00c1CAROS. TRASTORNO HEP\\u00c1TICO, ICTERICIA, OBESIDAD, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y MALA CALIDAD DE LA BILIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH KIDNEY; NEPHROTIC SYNDROME.            CHECK - BILE DUCT\\/KIDNEY (R)               CHECK - CLITORIS\\/PELVIS  CHECK - CLITORIS\\/SACRUM                         CHECK - URETHRA\\/SACRUM (ASOCIADO CON RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N; S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. REVISAR - CONDUCTO BILIAR\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (R) REVISAR - CL\\u00cdTORIS\\/PELVIS REVISAR - CL\\u00cdTORIS\\/SACRO REVISAR - URETRA\\/SACRO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, FEVER, AND GAS. INTOLERANCE TO LACTOSE, MEAT, EGGS, ETC.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, FIEBRE Y GASES. INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA, CARNE, HUEVOS, ETC.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY THE BITE OF A TICK OR MITES. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES LIVER DISORDERS, JAUNDICE, OBESITY, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME (IBS), INFLAMMATION OF THE PANCREATIC DUCT, AND POOR QUALITY OF BILE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN CLEARING THE SPIROCHETE PATHOGEN, WHICH FREQUENTLY INTERFERES WITH ENZYMATIC FLOW AND FAT METABOLISM.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR LA PICADURA DE UNA GARRAPATA O \\u00c1CAROS. ESTE PAR ABORDA TRASTORNOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS, ICTERICIA, OBESIDAD, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y MALA CALIDAD DE LA BILIS. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO ESPIROQUETA, QUE CON FRECUENCIA INTERFIERE CON EL FLUJO ENZIM\\u00c1TICO Y EL METABOLISMO DE LAS GRASAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH KIDNEY; NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. CHECK - BILE DUCT\\/KIDNEY (R); CHECK - CLITORIS\\/PELVIS; CHECK - CLITORIS\\/SACRUM; CHECK - URETHRA\\/SACRUM.(ASOCIADO CON RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N; S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. REVISAR - CONDUCTO BILIAR\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO); REVISAR - CL\\u00cdTORIS\\/PELVIS; REVISAR - CL\\u00cdTORIS\\/SACRO; REVISAR - URETRA\\/SACRO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1235','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:36:42','2026-04-25 16:36:42'),(3784,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1238,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, FEVER, MUSCLE ACHES, JOINT PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, LOSS OF APPETITE, DIZZINESS, NOSEBLEEDS. (DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR ARTICULAR, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO, MAREO, SANGRADO NASAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY UNPASTEURIZED MILK. YELLOW FEVER, JAUNDICE. (TRANSMITIDO POR LECHE NO PASTEURIZADA. FIEBRE AMARILLA, ICTERICIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/LIVER                 CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/KIDNEY (R) (REVISAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/H\\u00cdGADO REVISAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (R))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, FEVER, MUSCLE ACHES, JOINT PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, LOSS OF APPETITE, DIZZINESS, AND NOSEBLEEDS.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR ARTICULAR, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, P\\u00c9RIDDA DE APETITO, MAREO Y SANGRADO NASAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY UNPASTEURIZED MILK. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF PASTEURELLA, WHICH IS OFTEN LINKED TO YELLOW FEVER AND JAUNDICE. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN RESOLVING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION AND PROTECTING LIVER AND PANCREATIC FUNCTION FROM PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(TRANSMITIDO POR LECHE NO PASTEURIZADA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE PASTEURELLA, QUE A MENUDO SE RELACIONA CON LA FIEBRE AMARILLA Y LA ICTERICIA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESOLVER LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PROTEGER LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y PANCRE\\u00c1TICA DE LA INTERFERENCIA PAT\\u00d3GENA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/LIVER; CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/KIDNEY (R). THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE PANCREATIC AND INTESTINAL MICRO-CHAKRAS, ALIGNING THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO CLEAR BACTERIAL LOADS AFFECTING METABOLIC AND DIGESTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(REVISAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/H\\u00cdGADO; REVISAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS E INTESTINALES, ALINEANDO LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA DEPURAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTAN LA SALUD METAB\\u00d3LICA Y DIGESTIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1238','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:37:54','2026-04-25 16:37:54'),(3785,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1259,'{\"symptoms\":\"INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS, DIARREA Y GASTRITIS. SE DIRIGE A LA INCAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PROCESAR CIERTOS NUTRIENTES DE MANERA EFICIENTE.\\n\\n(FOOD INTOLERANCES, DIARRHEA, AND GASTRITIS. TARGETS THE BODY\'S INABILITY TO PROCESS CERTAIN NUTRIENTS EFFICIENTLY.)\",\"paths\":\"NEUTRALIZADOR DE ALIMENTOS (FOOD NEUTRALIZER). ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PROVOCA REACCIONES ADVERSAS A LOS ALIMENTOS. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE RELACIONA CON TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS Y DISNEA (DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR) CUANDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA AFECTA EL \\u00c1REA TOR\\u00c1CICA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y ALIVIA LA CARGA SOBRE EL SISTEMA CARDIOVASCULAR.\\n\\n(FOOD NEUTRALIZER. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DYSFUNCTION THAT TRIGGERS ADVERSE REACTIONS TO FOOD. IT IS ALSO LINKED TO HEART DISORDERS AND DYSPNEA WHEN GASTRIC PRESSURE AFFECTS THE THORACIC AREA. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES DIGESTIVE FUNCTION AND RELIEVES THE BURDEN ON THE CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y DE LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GLANDULARES Y DIGESTIVOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ELIMINAR LA SENSIBILIDAD QU\\u00cdMICA Y MEJORAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES.\\n\\n(MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC AND PANCREAS TAIL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER DIGESTIVE AND GLANDULAR VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO CLEAR CHEMICAL SENSITIVITY AND IMPROVE NUTRIENT ABSORPTION.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FOOD INTOLERANCES, DIARRHEA, AND GASTRITIS. TARGETS THE BODY\'S INABILITY TO PROCESS CERTAIN NUTRIENTS EFFICIENTLY.\\n\\n(INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS, DIARREA Y GASTRITIS. SE DIRIGE A LA INCAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PROCESAR CIERTOS NUTRIENTES DE MANERA EFICIENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"FOOD NEUTRALIZER (NEUTRALIZADOR DE ALIMENTOS). THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DYSFUNCTION THAT TRIGGERS ADVERSE REACTIONS TO FOOD. IT IS ALSO LINKED TO HEART DISORDERS AND DYSPNEA WHEN GASTRIC PRESSURE AFFECTS THE THORACIC AREA. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES DIGESTIVE FUNCTION AND RELIEVES THE BURDEN ON THE CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM.(NEUTRALIZADOR DE ALIMENTOS. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PROVOCA REACCIONES ADVERSAS A LOS ALIMENTOS. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE RELACIONA CON TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdCOS Y DISNEA CUANDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA AFECTA EL \\u00c1REA TOR\\u00c1CICA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y ALIVIA LA CARGA SOBRE EL SISTEMA CARDIOVASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE GASTRIC AND PANCREAS TAIL MICRO-CHAKRA AXIS. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE UPPER DIGESTIVE AND GLANDULAR VORTICES. ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO ELIMINATE CHEMICAL SENSITIVITY AND IMPROVE NUTRIENT ABSORPTION.(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON EL EJE DE MICRO-CHAKRAS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y DE LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GLANDULARES Y DIGESTIVOS SUPERIORES. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA ELIMINAR LA SENSIBILIDAD QU\\u00cdMICA Y MEJORAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1259','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:39:16','2026-04-25 16:39:16'),(3786,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1260,'{\"alternative_routes\":\"(MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA WITH THE REPRODUCTIVE MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO DISSOLVE CONSUMPTION ANXIETY AND PROMOTE SELF-DISCIPLINE.) CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR RELACIONA EL MICRO-CHAKRA G\\u00c1STRICO CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA REPRODUCTIVO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES ABDOMINALES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DISOLVER LA ANSIEDAD POR EL CONSUMO Y PROMOVER LA AUTODISCIPLINA.\"}','{\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SOLAR PLEXUS (MANIPURA) AND SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES THE GASTRIC MICRO-CHAKRA WITH THE REPRODUCTIVE MICRO-CHAKRA. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO DISSOLVE CONSUMPTION ANXIETY AND PROMOTE SELF-DISCIPLINE.) CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: PLEXO SOLAR (MANIPURA) Y SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR RELACIONA EL MICRO-CHAKRA G\\u00c1STRICO CON EL MICRO-CHAKRA REPRODUCTIVO. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES ABDOMINALES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. ALINEA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA DISOLVER LA ANSIEDAD POR EL CONSUMO Y PROMOVER LA AUTODISCIPLINA.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1260','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:39:33','2026-04-25 16:39:33'),(3787,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1053,'{\"symptoms\":\"PLEURISY, SEPSIS, BRONCHITIS, PNEUMONIA. (PLEURES\\u00cdA, SEPSIS, BRONQUITIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"SPREAD BY THE FECES OF BATS, BIRDS ECT. AFFECTS THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, IN WAYS SUCH AS PULMONARY & BRONCHIAL INFECTIONS. (SE PROPAGA POR LAS HECES DE MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS, AVES, ETC. AFECTA EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO, COMO INFECCIONES PULMONARES Y BRONQUIALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RENAL CAPSULE CHECK - MEDIASTINUM  CHECK - SACRUM           CHECK  - FIBULA (REVISAR - C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL REVISAR - MEDIASTINO REVISAR - SACRO REVISAR - F\\u00cdBULA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"PLEURISY, SEPSIS, BRONCHITIS, AND PNEUMONIA. MAY MANIFEST AS SHARP CHEST PAIN DURING RESPIRATION AND SIGNIFICANT INFLAMMATION OF THE LUNG LINING.\\n\\n(PLEURES\\u00cdA, SEPSIS, BRONQUITIS Y NEUMON\\u00cdA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DOLOR TOR\\u00c1CICO AGUDO DURANTE LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA DEL REVESTIMIENTO PULMONAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN SPREAD BY THE FECES OF BATS, BIRDS, AND OTHER ANIMALS. IT PRIMARILY AFFECTS THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, LEADING TO SEVERE PULMONARY AND BRONCHIAL INFECTIONS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD FROM THE COSTAL REGION, REDUCING FLUID ACCUMULATION AND RESTORING CLEAR AIRWAY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO A MENUDO SE PROPAGA POR LAS HECES DE MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS, AVES Y OTROS ANIMALES. AFECTA PRINCIPALMENTE AL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO, PROVOCANDO INFECCIONES PULMONARES Y BRONQUIALES GRAVES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA DE LA REGI\\u00d3N COSTAL, REDUCIENDO LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDO Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CLARA DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RENAL CAPSULE; CHECK - MEDIASTINUM; CHECK - SACRUM; CHECK - FIBULA. THIS PAIR ALIGNS THE COSTAL MICRO-CHAKRAS TO FORTIFY THE BODY\'S DEFENSES AGAINST PROTEUS-RELATED RESPIRATORY DISTRESS.\\n\\n(REVISAR - C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL; REVISAR - MEDIASTINO; REVISAR - SACRO; REVISAR - F\\u00cdBULA. ESTE PAR ALINEA LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS COSTALES PARA FORTALECER LAS DEFENSAS DEL CUERPO CONTRA EL MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO RELACIONADO CON PROTEUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1053','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:40:40','2026-04-25 16:40:40'),(3788,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1071,'{\"symptoms\":\"FROZEN SHOULDER, MOTOR DISORDERS , MUCUS MEMBRANE INFECTIONS. (HOMBRO CONGELADO, TRASTORNOS MOTORES, INFECCIONES DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"paths\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH IUD IMPLANT IN WOMEN, ORAL, PULMONARY AND GASTROINTESTINAL ABSCESSES. (ASOCIADO CON IMPLANTE DE DIU EN MUJERES, ABSCESOS ORALES, PULMONARES Y GASTROINTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - LUNG\\/CORONARY              CHECK - PERICARDIUM\\/PERICARDIUM. (REVISAR - PULM\\u00d3N\\/CORONARIA REVISAR - PERICARDIO\\/PERICARDIO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FROZEN SHOULDER, MOTOR DISORDERS, AND MUCUS MEMBRANE INFECTIONS. MAY PRESENT AS RIGIDITY IN THE UPPER EXTREMITIES AND PERSISTENT INFLAMMATION OF THE LININGS IN VARIOUS BODY CAVITIES.\\n\\n(HOMBRO CONGELADO, TRASTORNOS MOTORES E INFECCIONES DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS. PUEDE PRESENTARSE COMO RIGIDEZ EN LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE DE LOS REVESTIMIENTOS EN DIVERSAS CAVIDADES CORPORALES.))\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH IUD IMPLANTS IN WOMEN. IT ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL RESONANCE OF ACTINOMYCES, WHICH CAN LEAD TO THE FORMATION OF ORAL, PULMONARY, AND GASTROINTESTINAL ABSCESSES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN CLEARING THESE DEEP-SEATED INFECTIONS AND RESTORING PROPER MOTOR FUNCTION BY RESOLVING THE SYSTEMIC IMPACT OF THE PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON IMPLANTES DE DIU EN MUJERES. ABORDA LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA DE ACTINOMYCES, QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE ABSCESOS ORALES, PULMONARES Y GASTROINTESTINALES. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR ESTAS INFECCIONES PROFUNDAS Y RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA ADECUADA AL RESOLVER EL IMPACTO SIST\\u00c9MICO DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - LUNG\\/CORONARY; CHECK - PERICARDIUM\\/PERICARDIUM. THIS PAIR ALIGNS THE CARDIAC VORTEX WITH THE LOWER EXTREMITY MICRO-CHAKRAS TO ENSURE ENERGETIC COHERENCE AND CLEARANCE OF BACTERIAL LOADS AFFECTING THE MUCUS MEMBRANES.\\n\\n(REVISAR - PULM\\u00d3N\\/CORONARIA; REVISAR - PERICARDIO\\/PERICARDIO. ESTE PAR ALINEA EL V\\u00d3RTICE CARD\\u00cdACO CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES PARA ASEGURAR LA COHERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTAN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1071','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:41:49','2026-04-25 16:41:49'),(3789,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1078,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, MALAISE, SKIN RASHES, ALLERGIES, ECZEMA, MOTOR AND SPEECH PROBLEMS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, DISORIENTATION, SLEEP DISTURBANCES, INSOMNIA, DIZZINESS, HEADACHES, FEVER, SEVERE EYE PROBLEMS, CATARACTS,CONJUNCTIVITIS, MACULITIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, RETINAL DETACHMENT. (DOLOR DE CABEZA, MALESTAR, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, ALERGIAS, ECCEMA, PROBLEMAS MOTORES Y DEL HABLA, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N, ALTERACIONES DEL SUE\\u00d1O, INSOMNIO, MAREO, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, PROBLEMAS OCULARES GRAVES, CATARATAS, CONJUNTIVITIS, MACULITIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, DESPRENDIMIENTO DE RETINA.)\",\"paths\":\"GERMAN MEASLES, CAN CAUSE FETAL DAMAGE, ABORTION AND CONGENITAL DEFORMITIES. (RUB\\u00c9OLA, PUEDE CAUSAR DA\\u00d1OS FETALES, ABORTO Y DEFORMIDADES CONG\\u00c9NITAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH IT ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS; GLAUCOMA. (ASOCIADO CON \\u00c9L, ASOCIADO CON UN HONGO; GLAUCOMA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, MALAISE, SKIN RASHES, ALLERGIES, AND ECZEMA. MOTOR AND SPEECH PROBLEMS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, DISORIENTATION, SLEEP DISTURBANCES, INSOMNIA, AND DIZZINESS. SEVERE EYE PROBLEMS INCLUDING CATARACTS, CONJUNCTIVITIS, MACULITIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, AND RETINAL DETACHMENT.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE CABEZA, MALESTAR, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, ALERGIAS Y ECCEMA. PROBLEMAS MOTORES Y DEL HABLA, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N, ALTERACIONES DEL SUE\\u00d1O, INSOMNIO Y MAREO. PROBLEMAS OCULARES GRAVES COMO CATARATAS, CONJUNTIVITIS, MACULITIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA Y DESPRENDIMIENTO DE RETINA.)\",\"paths\":\"GERMAN MEASLES. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE VIRAL RESONANCE OF RUBELLA, WHICH CAN CAUSE FETAL DAMAGE, ABORTION, AND CONGENITAL DEFORMITIES IF ACTIVE DURING PREGNANCY. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC CONNECTION BETWEEN THE IMMUNE SYSTEM (THYMUS) AND THE BRAIN\'S SENSORY PROCESSING CENTER (PARIETAL), PROTECTING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM AND VISION FROM VIRAL DEGENERATION.\\n\\n(RUB\\u00c9OLA. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA RESONANCIA VIRAL DE LA RUB\\u00c9OLA, QUE PUEDE CAUSAR DA\\u00d1O FETAL, ABORTO Y DEFORMIDADES CONG\\u00c9NITAS SI EST\\u00c1 ACTIVA DURANTE EL EMBARAZO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO (TIMO) Y EL CENTRO DE PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL DEL CEREBRO (PARIETAL), PROTEGIENDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y LA VISI\\u00d3N DE LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH GLAUCOMA; MAY BE ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE CRANIAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS THE ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO RESOLVE DISORIENTATION AND RESTORE NEUROLOGICAL CLARITY.\\n\\n(ASOCIADO CON GLAUCOMA; PUEDE ESTAR ASOCIADO CON UN HONGO. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS T\\u00cdMICOS Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CRANEALES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA RESOLVER LA DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURAR LA CLARIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1078','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:42:59','2026-04-25 16:42:59'),(3790,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1079,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"IMPOTENCE (IMPOTENCIA)\",\"paths\":\"HELPS IMPROVE ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION. (AYUDA A MEJORAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ATLAS       CHECK - PINEAL       CHECK - SACRUM (REVISAR - ATLANTE REVISAR - PINEAL REVISAR - SACRO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"REPRODUCTIVE VITALITY AXIS (EJE DE VITALIDAD REPRODUCTIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"IMPOTENCE (IMPOTENCIA). MAY MANIFEST AS A DECREASE IN SEXUAL VIGOR OR DIFFICULTY MAINTAINING ERECTILE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(IMPOTENCIA. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DEL VIGOR SEXUAL O DIFICULTAD PARA MANTENER LA FUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL.)\",\"paths\":\"HELPS IMPROVE ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC SYNERGY BETWEEN THE IMMUNE REGULATOR (THYMUS) AND THE MALE REPRODUCTIVE ORGAN. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF PROPER BLOOD FLOW AND NERVOUS SYSTEM COORDINATION NECESSARY FOR HEALTHY SEXUAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(AYUDA A MEJORAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA SINERGIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL REGULADOR INMUNITARIO (TIMO) Y EL \\u00d3RGANO REPRODUCTOR MASCULINO. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DEL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO ADECUADO Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO NECESARIA PARA UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL SALUDABLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: SACRAL (SVADHISTHANA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC MICRO-CHAKRAS AND THE REPRODUCTIVE VORTICES. MINOR CHAKRA: ASSOCIATED WITH THE GONADAL AND PELVIC VORTICES. CHECK - ATLAS, CHECK - PINEAL, CHECK - SACRUM.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: SACRO (SVADHISTHANA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS T\\u00cdMICOS Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES REPRODUCTIVOS. CHAKRA MENOR: ASOCIADO CON LOS V\\u00d3RTICES GONADALES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS. REVISAR - ATLANTE, REVISAR - PINEAL, REVISAR - SACRO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1079','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:44:34','2026-04-25 16:44:34'),(3791,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1081,'{\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNODEFICIENCY, ALTERATIONS IN THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM SUCH AS, DIARRHEA, FLATULENCY, GASTRITIS AND COLITIS, HEMORRHOIDS, RECTUM IRRITATION, JAW PAIN, ELBOW AND KNEE PAIN. (INMUNODEFICIENCIA, ALTERACIONES EN EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO COMO DIARREA, FLATULENCIA, GASTRITIS Y COLITIS, HEMORROIDES, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL RECTO, DOLOR EN LA MAND\\u00cdBULA, DOLOR EN EL CODO Y EN LAS RODILLAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY SEX,MATERNAL\\u2013 FETAL, SYRINGES, BLOOD TRANSFUSIONS, SURGERIES,DENTIST,HOSPITAL CLOTHING AND BEDDING. AFFECTS PRODUCTION OF THYMUS HORMONES CD3, CD4 AND THE T4 LYMPHOCYTES. THE BACTERIA THAT RESONATES WITH HIV IS FOUND IN THE THYMUS DESTROYING IT AND CAUSING IMMUNODEFICIENCY. (TRANSMITIDO POR SEXO, MATERNO-FETAL, JERINGAS, TRANSFUSIONES DE SANGRE, CIRUG\\u00cdAS, DENTISTAS, ROPA HOSPITALARIA Y ROPA DE CAMA. AFECTA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS DEL TIMO CD3, CD4 Y LOS LINFOCITOS T4. LA BACTERIA QUE RESUENA CON EL VIH SE ENCUENTRA EN EL TIMO, DESTRUY\\u00c9NDOLO Y CAUSANDO INMUNODEFICIENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED VIRUS THAT RESONATES WITH THE BACTERIA IN THE THYMUS OR NEAR IT: IMMUNODEFICIENCY AND FALSE AIDS. ASSOCIATED WITH A PARASITE: DESTRUCTION OF THYMUS IS GREATER AND THE DEVELOPMENT OF IMMUNODEFICIENCY FASTER.                           HIV RESERVOIRS: GALLBLADDER, KIDNEY\\/RENAL CAPSULE. (VIRUS ASOCIADO QUE RESUENA CON LA BACTERIA EN EL TIMO O CERCA DE \\u00c9L: INMUNODEFICIENCIA Y FALSO SIDA. ASOCIADO CON UN PAR\\u00c1SITO: LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL TIMO ES MAYOR Y EL DESARROLLO DE LA INMUNODEFICIENCIA M\\u00c1S R\\u00c1PIDO. RESERVORIOS DEL VIH: VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR, RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N\\/C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNODEFICIENCY, ALTERATIONS IN THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM SUCH AS DIARRHEA, FLATULENCY, GASTRITIS, AND COLITIS. ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH HEMORRHOIDS, RECTUM IRRITATION, JAW PAIN, AND PAIN IN THE ELBOWS AND KNEES.(INMUNODEFICIENCIA, ALTERACIONES EN EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO COMO DIARREA, FLATULENCIA, GASTRITIS Y COLITIS, HEMORROIDES, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL RECTO, DOLOR EN LA MAND\\u00cdBULA, DOLOR EN EL CODO Y EN LAS RODILLAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY SEX, MATERNAL\\u2013FETAL, SYRINGES, BLOOD TRANSFUSIONS, SURGERIES, DENTIST, AND CONTAMINATED HOSPITAL CLOTHING OR BEDDING. THIS PAIR AFFECTS THE PRODUCTION OF THYMUS HORMONES (CD3, CD4) AND T4 LYMPHOCYTES. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET PROTECTS THE THYMUS FROM BACTERIA THAT RESONATE WITH THE VIRUS, PREVENTING THE DESTRUCTION OF THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND THE DEVELOPMENT OF IMMUNODEFICIENCY.(TRANSMITIDO POR SEXO, MATERNO-FETAL, JERINGAS, TRANSFUSIONES DE SANGRE, CIRUG\\u00cdAS, DENTISTAS, ROPA HOSPITALARIA Y ROPA DE CAMA. AFECTA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS DEL TIMO CD3, CD4 Y LOS LINFOCITOS T4. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO PROTEGE AL TIMO DE LA BACTERIA QUE RESUENA CON EL VIH, EVITANDO LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y EL DESARROLLO DE INMUNODEFICIENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MAJOR CHAKRA: HEART (ANAHATA) AND ROOT (MULADHARA) CONNECTION. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE THYMIC AND RECTAL MICRO-CHAKRAS. ASSOCIATED VIRUS MAY RESONATE WITH BACTERIA NEAR THE THYMUS, CAUSING FALSE AIDS. IF ASSOCIATED WITH A PARASITE, IMMUNODEFICIENCY MAY DEVELOP FASTER. CHECK HIV RESERVOIRS: GALLBLADDER AND KIDNEY\\/RENAL CAPSULE.\\n\\n(CONEXI\\u00d3N DE CHAKRA MAYOR: CORAZ\\u00d3N (ANAHATA) Y RA\\u00cdZ (MULADHARA). ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS T\\u00cdMICOS Y RECTALES. EL VIRUS ASOCIADO PUEDE RESONAR CON BACTERIAS CERCA DEL TIMO, CAUSANDO FALSO SIDA. SI SE ASOCIA CON UN PAR\\u00c1SITO, LA INMUNODEFICIENCIA PUEDE DESARROLLARSE M\\u00c1S R\\u00c1PIDO. REVISAR RESERVORIOS DE VIH: VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N\\/C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1081','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:45:52','2026-04-25 16:45:52'),(3792,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1000,'{\"symptoms\":\"COLD SORES, INFLAMED GUMS, DRY MUCOUS MEMBRANES, FACIAL PARALYSIS, NEURALGIA, ENCEPHALITIS, HEADACHE, VOMITING, FEVER. (AFTAS, ENC\\u00cdAS INFLAMADAS, MUCOSAS SECAS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, NEURALGIA, ENCEFALITIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, V\\u00d3MITOS, FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"ORAL ISSUES, BLISTERS, ULCERS, COLD SORES AND INFLAMED GUMS. FRONTAL LOBE INVOLVEMENT WITH BEHAVIOR DISORDERS. (PROBLEMAS ORALES, AMPOLLAS, \\u00daLCERAS, AFTAS Y ENC\\u00cdAS INFLAMADAS. AFECTACI\\u00d3N DEL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL CON TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH CANDIDA; ESOPHAGITIS HERPERTICA (ASOCIADO CON CANDIDA; ESOFAGITIS HERP\\u00c9TICA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"COLD SORES, INFLAMED GUMS, DRY MUCOUS MEMBRANES, FACIAL PARALYSIS, NEURALGIA, ENCEPHALITIS, HEADACHE, VOMITING, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(AFTAS, ENC\\u00cdAS INFLAMADAS, MUCOSAS SECAS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, NEURALGIA, ENCEFALITIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, V\\u00d3MITOS, FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"ORAL ISSUES, BLISTERS, ULCERS, COLD SORES, AND INFLAMED GUMS. THIS PAIR ALSO ADDRESSES FRONTAL LOBE INVOLVEMENT WHICH MAY BE LINKED TO BEHAVIOR DISORDERS. NEUTRALIZING THIS RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CLEARING THE VIRAL LOAD FROM THE ORAL COMMISSURES AND STABILIZING NEUROLOGICAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS ORALES, AMPOLLAS, \\u00daLCERAS, AFTAS Y ENC\\u00cdAS INFLAMADAS. ESTE PAR TAMBI\\u00c9N ABORDA LA AFECTACI\\u00d3N DEL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL QUE PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADA A TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA. NEUTRALIZAR ESTE REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL DE LAS COMISURAS ORALES Y ESTABILIZAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH CANDIDA; ESOPHAGITIS HERPETICA. THIS PAIR RELATES TO THE FACIAL MICRO-CHAKRAS AND CRANIAL VORTICES. IT ALIGNS ENERGETIC DEFENSES TO PROTECT THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES AND NERVE PATHWAYS OF THE FACE.\\n\\n(ASOCIADO CON CANDIDA; ESOFAGITIS HERP\\u00c9TICA. ESTE PAR SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO-CHAKRAS FACIALES Y LOS V\\u00d3RTICES CRANEALES. ALINEA LAS DEFENSAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS PARA PROTEGER LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS Y LAS V\\u00cdAS NERVIOSAS DE LA CARA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1000','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:47:07','2026-04-25 16:47:07'),(3793,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',881,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE: NECK, ANTERIOR AND POSTERIOR. (VERTEBRA C1,2,3) (M\\u00daSCULO: CUELLO, ANTERIOR Y POSTERIOR. (V\\u00c9RTEBRA C1,2,3).\",\"paths\":\"LINKED TO THE SUPERIOR CERVICAL GANGLION. (VINCULADO AL GANGLIO CERVICAL SUPERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VINCULADO AL GANGLIO CERVICAL SUPERIOR. (ESPIRITUAL: INTUICI\\u00d3N E INTELECTO. CONEXI\\u00d3N DE MICRO CHAKRA: SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS SENSORIALES DE LOS O\\u00cdDOS Y OJOS, EQUILIBRANDO EL FLUJO ENTRE EL CEREBRO INFERIOR Y LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE: NECK, ANTERIOR AND POSTERIOR. (VERTEBRA C1, 2, 3).\\n\\n(M\\u00daSCULO: CUELLO, ANTERIOR Y POSTERIOR. (V\\u00c9RTEBRA C1, 2, 3).)\",\"paths\":\"LINKED TO THE SUPERIOR CERVICAL GANGLION. THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC REGULATION OF THE SENSORY PATHWAYS AND THE LOWER BRAIN STRUCTURES, ENSURING PROPER COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE CRANIAL NERVES AND THE NECK REGION.\\n\\n(VINCULADO AL GANGLIO CERVICAL SUPERIOR. ESTE PAR ABORDA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LAS V\\u00cdAS SENSORIALES Y LAS ESTRUCTURAS DEL CEREBRO INFERIOR, ASEGURANDO UNA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA ENTRE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES Y LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CUELLO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SPIRITUAL: INTUITION AND INTELLECT. MICRO CHAKRA CONNECTION: RELATES TO THE SENSORY MICRO CHAKRAS OF THE EARS AND EYES, BALANCING THE FLOW BETWEEN THE LOWER BRAIN AND THE CRANIAL NERVES.(ESPIRITUAL: INTUICI\\u00d3N E INTELECTO. CONEXI\\u00d3N DE MICRO CHAKRA: SE RELACIONA CON LOS MICRO CHAKRAS SENSORIALES DE LOS O\\u00cdDOS Y OJOS, EQUILIBRANDO EL FLUJO ENTRE EL CEREBRO INFERIOR Y LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/881','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:49:01','2026-04-25 16:49:01'),(3794,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1293,'{\"name\":\"STOMACH\",\"radical\":\"CHECK 102-117 PAIRS\"}','{\"name\":\"STOMACH (EST\\u00d3MAGO)\",\"radical\":\"CHECK 102-117 PAIRS (REVISAR PARES 102-117)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1293','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:50:41','2026-04-25 16:50:41'),(3795,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1295,'{\"name\":\"EAR\",\"radical\":\"CHECK 161-165\"}','{\"name\":\"EAR (O\\u00cdDO)\",\"radical\":\"CHECK 161-165 (REVISAR PARES 161-165)\"}','https://api.bioma