d','App\\Models\\Pair',1301,'{\"radical\":\"CHECK 279-293\"}','{\"radical\":\"CHECK 279-293 (REVISAR PARES 279-293)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1301','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 16:57:49','2026-04-25 16:57:49'),(3801,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, ABDOMINAL PAIN IN NAVAL AREA, PAIN IN LOW BACK, FLATULENCE, SEVERE HEADACHES, FEVER, SEVERE FLU, FAINTNESS, MALAISE, LETHARGY, MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION.\\n(DIARREA, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, DOLOR ABDOMINAL EN EL \\u00c1REA DEL OMBLIGO, DOLOR EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA, FLATULENCIA, DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS, FIEBRE, GRIPE SEVERA, DESMAYO, MALESTAR, LETARGO, INFARTO DE MIOCARDIO)\",\"paths\":\"SPREAD THROUGH CONTAMINATED WATER, BY FOODS, VEGETABLES, CONTACT WITH FECES, AND FROM PERSON TO PERSON. INVASION OF THE INTESTINAL MUCOSA. MAY CAUSE DISCOMFORT, DIARRHEA, BLOOD AND MUCUS STOOL, AND AFFECTS MOBILITY.\\n(SE PROPAGA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE AGUA CONTAMINADA, POR ALIMENTOS, VEGETALES, CONTACTO CON HECES, Y DE PERSONA A PERSONA, INVASI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA INTESTINAL. PUEDE CAUSAR MALESTAR, DIARREA, HECES CON SANGRE Y MUCOSIDAD, Y AFECTA LA MOVILIDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN\\/DISTENTION, LOW BACK PAIN, HEADACHES, FEVER, MALAISE.\\n(DIARREA, DOLOR\\/DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, DOLOR LUMBAR, CEFALEA, FIEBRE, MALESTAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS SHIGELLA BY NEUTRALIZING THE ACIDIC\\/ALKALINE IMBALANCE IN THE INTESTINAL MUCOSA. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD AND RESTORES PROPER MAGNETIC POLARITY TO CLEAR THE BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO A SHIGELLA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL DESEQUILIBRIO DE PH EN LA MUCOSA INTESTINAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO Y RESTAURA LA POLARIDAD MAGN\\u00c9TICA PARA ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN SIGMOID COLON AND RECTUM TO FULLY COLLAPSE THE PATHOGENIC CIRCUIT.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR COLON SIGMOIDES Y RECTO PARA COLAPSAR EL CIRCUITO PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:22:59','2026-04-25 17:22:59'),(3802,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',2,'{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS, SEVERE DIARRHEA, URINARY AND INTESTINAL INFECTIONS, SEPSIS, PNEUMONIA (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DIARREA SEVERA, INFECCIONES URINARIAS E INTESTINALES, SEPSIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L OR M - INFECTS THE URINARY AND INTESTINES. MAY CAUSE SEPSIS. (HEPATITIS L \\/ M - INFECTA EL SISTEMA URINARIO Y LOS INTESTINOS. PUEDE CAUSAR SEPSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS, SEVERE DIARRHEA, URINARY AND INTESTINAL INFECTIONS, SEPSIS, PNEUMONIA.\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DIARREA SEVERA, INFECCIONES URINARIAS E INTESTINALES, SEPSIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS E. COLI BY NEUTRALIZING ALKALINE IMBALANCES IN THE URINARY AND INTESTINAL TRACTS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC SPREAD AND SEPSIS.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO A E. COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE DESEQUILIBRIOS ALCALINOS EN LOS TRACTOS URINARIO E INTESTINAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA SEPSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN LIVER AND URINARY BLADDER TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PATHOGENIC BIOFIELD IS CLEAR.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR H\\u00cdGADO Y VEJIGA URINARIA PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL BIOCAMPO PAT\\u00d3GENO EST\\u00c9 LIMPIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/2','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:24:20','2026-04-25 17:24:20'),(3803,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',3,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MALASSEZIA FURFUR\",\"symptoms\":\"DANDRUFF, SKIN DISCOLORATION (TINEA VERSICOLOR), ITCHING, DERMATITIS, AND SCALP IRRITATION. MAY ALSO INVOLVE JOINT STIFFNESS IN THE SHOULDER REGION.\\n\\n(CASPA, DECOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL (TI\\u00d1A VERSICOLOR), PICAZ\\u00d3N, DERMATITIS E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERO CABELLUDO. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE INVOLUCRAR RIGIDEZ ARTICULAR EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL HOMBRO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS FUNGAL OVERGROWTH BY NEUTRALIZING ACIDIC POCKETS IN THE SHOULDER INTERFACE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO INHIBIT SPORE REPLICATION AND RESTORE SKIN INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO AL CRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE BOLSAS \\u00c1CIDAS EN LA INTERFAZ DEL HOMBRO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA INHIBIR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS Y RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA PIEL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN TIBIA AND SCAPULA TO CLEAR SYSTEMIC FUNGAL RESERVOIRS.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR TIBIA Y ESC\\u00c1PULA PARA LIMPIAR RESERVORIOS F\\u00daNGICOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/3','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:25:35','2026-04-25 17:25:35'),(3804,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',4,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"FRUSTRATION (FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BIOFIELD CONGESTION (CONGESTI\\u00d3N DEL BIOCAMPO)\",\"symptoms\":\"FRUSTRATION, IRRITABILITY, GROIN TENSION, AND STICKY OR RESTRICTED MOVEMENT IN THE LOWER LIMBS.\\n(FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N, IRRITABILIDAD, TENSI\\u00d3N EN LA INGLE Y MOVIMIENTO PEGAJOSO O RESTRINGIDO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\",\"paths\":\"ACTS AS AN EMOTIONAL RESERVOIR. TARGETS REPRESSED FRUSTRATION BY NEUTRALIZING THE MAGNETIC PULL DISTORTIONS IN THE INNER THIGH. THIS RESET RELEASES STORED EMOTIONAL TENSION FROM THE BIOFIELD AND RESTORES THE POLARITY NECESSARY FOR FLUID MOVEMENT.\\n\\n(ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO EMOCIONAL. SE DIRIGE A LA FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N REPRIMIDA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE LA ATRACCI\\u00d3N MAGN\\u00c9TICA EN la PARTE INTERNA DEL MUSLO. ESTE REINICIO LIBERA LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL ALMACENADA DEL BIOCAMPO Y RESTAURA LA POLARIDAD NECESARIA PARA EL MOVIMIENTO FLUIDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE ADDUCTOR (REF 89) TO RULE OUT VIRAL LOADS (HIV-2) THAT MAY BE HIDING WITHIN THE EMOTIONAL DISTORTION.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL ADUCTOR (REF 89) PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS VIRALES (VIH-2) QUE PUEDAN ESTAR OCULTAS DENTRO DE LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/4','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:26:54','2026-04-25 17:26:54'),(3805,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',5,'{\"symptoms\":\"FALSE DIABETES, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS,DISTENDED ABDOMEN, RECTAL AND VAGINAL BLEEDING, MYCOSIS, DIARRHEA (DIABETES FALSA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, ABDOMEN DISTENDIDO, SANGRADO RECTAL Y VAGINAL, MICOSIS, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"HIV-2 DOES NOT CAUSE IMMUNODEFICIENCY. DISORDERS OF THE URETHRA, VAGINA, AND SEXUAL REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS. PRODUCES ITCHING IN THE GROIN, VAGINAL OR PENIS AREA AND RECTAL, IRRITABILITY. (EL VIH-2 NO CAUSA INMUNODEFICIENCIA. TRASTORNOS DE LA URETRA, VAGINA Y \\u00d3RGANOS SEXUALES REPRODUCTIVOS. PRODUCE PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LA INGLE, \\u00c1REA VAGINAL O DEL PENE Y RECTAL, IRRITABILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DISCARD TOOTHBRUSH (DESCARTAR CEPILLO DE DIENTES)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FALSE DIABETES, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, RECTAL\\/VAGINAL BLEEDING, MYCOSIS, ITCHING IN THE GROIN OR GENITAL AREA, IRRITABILITY.\\n\\n(DIABETES FALSA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, SANGRADO RECTAL\\/VAGINAL, MICOSIS, PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LA INGLE O \\u00c1REA GENITAL, IRRITABILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS HIV-2 BY NEUTRALIZING THE ALKALINE ENVIRONMENT IN THE URETHRA AND REPRODUCTIVE TRACT. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ELIMINATE VIRAL RESONANCE WITHOUT THE VIRUS CAUSING IMMUNODEFICIENCY.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO AL VIH-2 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO ALCALINO EN LA URETRA Y EL TRACTO REPRODUCTOR. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ELIMINAR LA RESONANCIA VIRAL SIN QUE EL VIRUS CAUSE INMUNODEFICIENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BIOFIELD HYGIENE: DISCARD TOOTHBRUSH TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION. SCAN ADDUCTOR MINIMUS (REF 4) IF EMOTIONAL FRUSTRATION IS PRESENT.\\n\\n(HIGIENE DEL BIOCAMPO: DESECHAR EL CEPILLO DE DIENTES PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N. ESCANEAR EL ADUCTOR MENOR (REF 4) SI HAY FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/5','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:28:13','2026-04-25 17:28:13'),(3806,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',6,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HORMONAL DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS HORMONALES)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLANDULAR AXIS (EJE GLANDULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"HORMONAL DISORDERS, GROWTH ISSUES, AND METABOLIC IMBALANCE.\\n(TRASTORNOS HORMONALES, PROBLEMAS DE CRECIMIENTO Y DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE PITUITARY-RENAL AXIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE ANTERIOR LOBE OF THE HYPOPHYSIS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO REGULATE HORMONE PRODUCTION AND IMPROVE RENAL FILTRATION POLARITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL EJE PITUITARIO-RENAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL L\\u00d3BULO ANTERIOR DE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA REGULAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL Y MEJORAR LA POLARIDAD DE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE THYROID AND ADRENALS TO COMPLETE THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM STABILIZATION.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA TIROIDES Y LAS SUPRARRENALES PARA COMPLETAR LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/6','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:29:35','2026-04-25 17:29:35'),(3807,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',7,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"TOXIC ALLERGIES, ADENOIDS HYPERTROPHY (ALERGIAS T\\u00d3XICAS, HIPERTROFIA DE ADENOIDES)\",\"paths\":\"HELPS TO NORMALIZE THE RED BLOOD CELLS AND INCREASE PLATELET COUNTS. (AYUDA A NORMALIZAR LOS GLOBULOS ROJOS Y A AUMENTAR EL RECUENTO DE PLAQUETAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEMATOLOGICAL RESET (REINICIO HEMATOL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"TOXIC ALLERGIES, ADENOID HYPERTROPHY, LOW PLATELETS, AND ANEMIA.\\n(ALERGIAS T\\u00d3XICAS, HIPERTROFIA DE ADENOIDES, PLAQUETAS BAJAS Y ANEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE LYMPHATIC AND HEMATOLOGICAL SYSTEMS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE ADENOID TISSUE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO NORMALIZE RED BLOOD CELL PRODUCTION AND INCREASE PLATELET COUNTS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LOS SISTEMAS LINF\\u00c1TICO Y HEMATOL\\u00d3GICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL TEJIDO ADENOIDEO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA NORMALIZAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS Y AUMENTAR EL RECUENTO DE PLAQUETAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE SPLEEN AND BONE MARROW TO REINFORCE PLATELET STABILIZATION.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL BAZO Y LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS PLAQUETAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/7','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:30:46','2026-04-25 17:30:46'),(3808,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',8,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MINIMIZES TUMOR GROWTH (MINIMIZA EL CRECIMIENTO TUMORAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CELLULAR REGENERATION AXIS (EJE DE REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"ABNORMAL TISSUE GROWTH, TUMOR FORMATION, AND CELLULAR DISORGANIZATION.\\n(CRECIMIENTO ANORMAL DE TEJIDOS, FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TUMORES Y DESORGANIZACI\\u00d3N CELULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"MINIMIZES TUMOR GROWTH BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS IN ADJACENT TISSUES. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE LOCAL PH TO INHIBIT CELLULAR MALFORMATION AND RESTORES THE BODY\'S NATURAL MAGNETIC DEFENSES AGAINST ABNORMAL GROWTH.\\n\\n(MINIMIZA EL CRECIMIENTO TUMORAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO EN LOS TEJIDOS ADYACENTES. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH LOCAL PARA INHIBIR LA MALFORMACI\\u00d3N CELULAR Y RESTAURA LAS DEFENSAS MAGN\\u00c9TICAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO CONTRA EL CRECIMIENTO ANORMAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN SCAPULA AND AXILLA TO ENSURE LYMPHATIC CLEARANCE AROUND THE ADJACENT AREA.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR ESC\\u00c1PULA Y AXILA PARA ASEGURAR LA LIMPIEZA LINF\\u00c1TICA ALREDEDOR DEL \\u00c1REA ADYACENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/8','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:31:57','2026-04-25 17:31:57'),(3809,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',9,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER (TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-CARDIAC AXIS (EJE NEURO-CARD\\u00cdACO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER, HYPERACTIVITY, CONCENTRATION ISSUES, AND EMOTIONAL IMPULSIVITY.\\n(TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N, HIPERACTIVIDAD, PROBLEMAS DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N E IMPULSIVIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE MAGNETIC COHERENCE BETWEEN THE HEART AND THE BRAIN. THIS RESET NEUTRALIZES BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS THAT INTERFERE WITH FOCUS AND ATTENTION, STABILIZING THE POLARITY OF THE NEURO-CARDIAC FEEDBACK LOOP TO CALM THE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA COHERENCIA MAGN\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL CEREBRO. ESTE REINICIO NEUTRALIZA LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO QUE INTERFIEREN CON EL ENFOQUE Y LA ATENCI\\u00d3N, ESTABILIZANDO LA POLARIDAD DEL CIRCUITO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N NEURO-CARD\\u00cdACA PARA CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.))\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE PINEAL AND TEMPORAL LOBES TO ENSURE FULL NEUROLOGICAL ALIGNMENT WITH THE HEART\'S BIOFIELD.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA PINEAL Y LOS L\\u00d3BULOS TEMPORALES PARA ASEGURAR UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA COMPLETA CON EL BIOCAMPO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/9','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:33:31','2026-04-25 17:33:31'),(3810,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',10,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EDEMA, ASTHMA, SINUS PAIN, INSOMNIA, DISCOURAGEMENT, ADDISON DISEASE, CHRONIC FATIGUE (EDEMA, ASMA, DOLOR DE SENOS PARANASALES, INSOMNIO, DESALIENTO, ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA)\",\"paths\":\"DUE TO A TRAUMA OR INFECTION. ADRENAL GLANDS DO NOT PRODUCE ENOUGH CORTICOSTEROIDS. (DEBIDO A UN TRAUMA O INFECCI\\u00d3N, LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES NO PRODUCEN SUFICIENTES CORTICOSTEROIDES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENDOCRINE RESET (REINICIO ENDOCRINO)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE, ASTHMA, EDEMA, INSOMNIA, SINUS PAIN, ADDISON\'S DISEASE, AND EMOTIONAL DISCOURAGEMENT.\\n(FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, ASMA, EDEMA, INSOMNIO, DOLOR DE SENOS PARANASALES, ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON Y DESALIENTO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS GLANDULAR HYPOFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS CAUSED BY TRAUMA OR INFECTION. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO RESTORE CORTICOSTEROID PRODUCTION AND BALANCE THE BODY\'S RESPONSE TO STRESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA HIPOFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH CAUSADAS POR TRAUMA O INFECCI\\u00d3N. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA RESTAURAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE CORTICOESTEROIDES Y EQUILIBRAR LA RESPUESTA DEL CUERPO AL ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE PITUITARY AND KIDNEY TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE HORMONAL FEEDBACK LOOP IS STABILIZED.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA PITUITARIA Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL CIRCUITO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL EST\\u00c9 ESTABILIZADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/10','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:34:46','2026-04-25 17:34:46'),(3811,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',11,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HATE (ODIO)\",\"paths\":\"HATE (ODIO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENALINE-LIMBIC AXIS (EJE ADRENALINA-L\\u00cdMBICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HATE, INTENSE ANGER, EMOTIONAL VOLATILITY, AND AGGRESSION.\\n(ODIO, IRA INTENSA, VOLATILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y AGRESIVIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EMOTIONAL BIOFIELD BY NEUTRALIZING THE MAGNETIC PULL BETWEEN THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM AND THE BRAIN\'S EMOTIONAL CENTER. THIS RESET CALMS THE AMYGDALA\'S OVERACTIVITY AND BALANCES ADRENAL POLARITY TO RESOLVE STORED EMOTIONAL DISTORTIONS OF HATE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL BIOCAMPO EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA ATRACCI\\u00d3N MAGN\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO Y EL CENTRO EMOCIONAL DEL CEREBRO. ESTE REINICIO CALMA LA SOBREACTIVIDAD DE LA AM\\u00cdGDALA Y EQUILIBRA LA POLARIDAD ADRENAL PARA RESOLVER LAS DISTORSIONES EMOCIONALES ALMACENADAS DE ODIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE HYPOTHALAMUS AND HEART TO ENSURE FULL INTEGRATION OF THE EMOTIONAL RELEASE.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/11','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:36:06','2026-04-25 17:36:06'),(3812,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',12,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIC ASTHMA (ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GREEN STREPTOCOCCUS (ESTREPTOCOCO VIRIDANS)\",\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIC ASTHMA, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, WHEEZING, AND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS.\\n(ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, SIBILANCIAS Y DISTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS GREEN STREPTOCOCCUS BY NEUTRALIZING THE ALKALINE ENVIRONMENT IN THE RESPIRATORY TRACT. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO REDUCE THE HYPER-RESPONSIVE ALLERGIC REACTION AND RESTORES THE POLARITY OF THE ADRENAL-FRONTAL AXIS.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO AL ESTREPTOCOCO VIRIDANS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO ALCALINO EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA REDUCIR LA REACCI\\u00d3N AL\\u00c9RGICA HIPERREACTIVA Y RESTAURA LA POLARIDAD DEL EJE ADRENAL-FRONTAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE BRONCHIA AND LUNGS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PATHOGENIC CIRCUIT IS COLLAPSED.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR BRONQUIOS Y PULMONES PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL CIRCUITO PAT\\u00d3GENO EST\\u00c9 COLAPSADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/12','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:38:41','2026-04-25 17:38:41'),(3813,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',13,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PRIDE (ORGULLO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLYCOGENIC AXIS (EJE GLUCOG\\u00c9NICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"FATIGUE, WEIGHT ISSUES, SLUGGISH METABOLISM, AND BLOOD SUGAR IMBALANCE.\\n(FATIGA, PROBLEMAS DE PESO, METABOLISMO LENTO Y DESEQUILIBRIO DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH IN THE HEPATIC-ADRENAL INTERFACE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO REGULATE CORTISOL LEVELS AND OPTIMIZE THE LIVER\'S GLYCOGEN STORAGE POLARITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL PH EN LA INTERFAZ HEP\\u00c1TICO-SUPRARRENAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA REGULAR LOS NIVELES DE CORTISOL Y OPTIMIZAR LA POLARIDAD DEL ALMACENAMIENTO DE GLUC\\u00d3GENO EN EL H\\u00cdGADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN PANCREAS AND DUODENUM TO ENSURE FULL METABOLIC ALIGNMENT.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR P\\u00c1NCREAS Y DUODENO PARA ASEGURAR UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA COMPLETA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/13','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:40:13','2026-04-25 17:40:13'),(3814,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',14,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"METASTASIS (MET\\u00c1STASIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"- CHECK- PLEURA\\/RECUM (REVISION- PLEURA\\/RECOSTADO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, PLEURITIS, COUGH, AND POTENTIAL SYSTEMIC SPREAD.\\n(FIEBRE, DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA, PLEURITIS, TOS Y POSIBLE PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA BY NEUTRALIZING THE ALKALINE IMBALANCE WITHIN THE PLEURAL CAVITY. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO PREVENT BACTERIAL COLONIZATION AND INHIBITS THE MECHANISMS OF PATHOGENIC METASTASIS.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO A PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL DESEQUILIBRIO ALCALINO EN LA CAVIDAD PLEURAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA PREVENIR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA E INHIBE LOS MECANISMOS DE MET\\u00c1STASIS PATOG\\u00c9NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN PLEURA\\/RECUM (PLEURA\\/RECOSTADO) TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE LUNG LINING.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: REVISAR PLEURA\\/RECOSTADO PARA ASEGURAR LA LIMPIEZA COMPLETA DEL REVESTIMIENTO PULMONAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/14','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:41:51','2026-04-25 17:41:51'),(3815,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',15,'{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL GAS, ALOPECIA, FALSE PSORIASIS, SKIN AND CHEEK RASHES, FEVER, NAUSEA, VOMITING, HEADACHE, CONJUNCTIVITIS, MENTAL PROBLEMS (AS BIPOLAR), KIDNEY PROBLEMS, LIVER PROBLEMS, MENINGITIS, STIFF NECK, BURNING THROAT, LOWER BACK PAIN, GASTROINTESTINAL SORES, GOUT, HIGH CHOLESTEROL (GASES INTESTINALES, ALOPECIA, FALSA PSORIASIS, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y EN LAS MEJILLAS, FIEBRE, NAUSEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, CONJUNTIVITIS, PROBLEMAS MENTALES (COMO BIPOLARIDAD), PROBLEMAS RENALES, PROBLEMAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS, MENINGITIS, RIGIDEZ EN EL CUELLO, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DOLOR LUMBAR, \\u00daLCERAS GASTROINTESTINALES, GOTa, COLESTEROL ALTO)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY DOMESTIC ANIMALS, RATS, COCKROACHES, ECT. THRU URINE. PROBLEMS IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, AIRWAY, LUNGS AND MUCUS MEMBRANES. SIMILAR TO SCABIES. WEILL SYNDROME. MIMICS BIPOLAR BEHAVIOR. (TRANSMITIDO POR ANIMALES DOM\\u00c9STICOS, RATAS, CUCARACHAS, ETC. A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA ORINA. PROBLEMAS EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS, PULMONES Y MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS. SIMILAR A LA SARNA. S\\u00cdNDROME DE WEILL. IMITA EL COMPORTAMIENTO BIPOLAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL GAS, ALOPECIA, FALSE PSORIASIS, RASHES, FEVER, NAUSEA, BIPOLAR-LIKE BEHAVIOR, KIDNEY\\/LIVER ISSUES, AND LOWER BACK PAIN.\\n\\n(GASES INTESTINALES, ALOPECIA, FALSA PSORIASIS, ERUPCIONES, FIEBRE, N\\u00c1USEAS, COMPORTAMIENTO TIPO BIPOLAR, PROBLEMAS RENALES\\/HEP\\u00c1TICOS Y DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS LEPTOSPIRA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE DIGESTIVE AND RENAL AXIS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO CLEAR PATHOGENS TRANSMITTED VIA ANIMAL URINE, PREVENTING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY IN THE LUNGS AND MUCUS MEMBRANES.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO A LEPTOSPIRA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DIGESTIVO Y RENAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ELIMINAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS TRANSMITIDOS POR LA ORINA ANIMAL, PREVINIENDO LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA EN LOS PULMONES Y LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE LIVER AND KIDNEYS TO RULE OUT WEILL SYNDROME AND PROTECT GLANDULAR RESERVOIRS.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES PARA DESCARTAR EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE WEILL Y PROTEGER LOS RESERVORIOS GLANDULARES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/15','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:43:28','2026-04-25 17:43:28'),(3816,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',16,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"USE NEGATIVE FOR INFLAMMATION AND INFECTION. POSITIVE FOR HEALING WOUND AND BONE. CHAIN OF 4-6 MAGNETS. (USAR NEGATIVO PARA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N E INFECCI\\u00d3N. POSITIVO PARA LA CURACI\\u00d3N DE HERIDAS Y HUESO. CADENA DE 4-6 IMANES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"POST-SURGICAL RECOVERY (RECUPERACI\\u00d3N POSTQUIR\\u00daRGICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION, INFECTION RISK, SLOW WOUND HEALING, AND BONE REGENERATION DELAYS.\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N, RIESGO DE INFECCI\\u00d3N, CICATRIZACI\\u00d3N LENTA DE HERIDAS Y RETRASOS EN LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N \\u00d3SEA.)\",\"paths\":\"STABILIZES THE SURGICAL SITE BY APPLYING A SPECIFIC POLARITY SEQUENCE. USE NEGATIVE POLARITY TO REDUCE INFLAMMATION AND NEUTRALIZE INFECTION RISKS. USE POSITIVE POLARITY TO STIMULATE THE BIOFIELD FOR WOUND HEALING AND BONE RECOVERY.\\n\\n(ESTABILIZA EL SITIO QUIR\\u00daRGICO MEDIANTE LA APLICACI\\u00d3N DE UNA SECUENCIA DE POLARIDAD ESPEC\\u00cdFICA. UTILICE LA POLARIDAD NEGATIVA PARA REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y NEUTRALIZAR LOS RIESGOS DE INFECCI\\u00d3N. UTILICE LA POLARIDAD POSITIVA PARA ESTIMULAR EL BIOCAMPO PARA LA CICATRIZACI\\u00d3N DE HERIDAS Y LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N \\u00d3SEA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PLACEMENT STRATEGY: APPLY A CHAIN OF 4-6 MAGNETS AROUND THE AFFECTED AREA TO CREATE A UNIFORM REGENERATIVE FIELD.\\n(ESTRATEGIA DE COLOCACI\\u00d3N: APLICAR UNA CADENA DE 4-6 IMANES ALREDEDOR DEL \\u00c1REA AFECTADA PARA CREAR UN CAMPO REGENERATIVO UNIFORME.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/16','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:44:57','2026-04-25 17:44:57'),(3817,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',17,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HATE (ODIO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HATE (ODIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTENSE ANGER, RESENTMENT, EMOTIONAL VOLATILITY, AND AGGRESSION.\\n(IRA INTENSA, RESENTIMIENTO, VOLATILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y AGRESIVIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EMOTIONAL BIOFIELD BY NEUTRALIZING THE MAGNETIC RESONANCE BETWEEN THE BRAIN\'S EMOTIONAL CENTER AND THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM. THIS RESET CALMS THE AMYGDALA TO RELEASE STORED FREQUENCIES OF HATE AND STABILIZES ADRENAL POLARITY TO LOWER SYSTEMIC CORTISOL.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL BIOCAMPO EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA RESONANCIA MAGN\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL CENTRO EMOCIONAL DEL CEREBRO Y EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO. ESTE REINICIO CALMA LA AM\\u00cdGDALA PARA LIBERAR LAS FRECUENCIAS ALMACENADAS DE ODIO Y ESTABILIZA LA POLARIDAD ADRENAL PARA DISMINUIR EL CORTISOL SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE HEART AND THYMUS TO RE-ESTABLISH EMOTIONAL COHERENCE AND COMPASSION WITHIN THE BIOFIELD.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL TIMO PARA REESTABLECER LA COHERENCIA EMOCIONAL Y LA COMPASI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL BIOCAMPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/17','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:46:21','2026-04-25 17:46:21'),(3818,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',18,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"FORMAL HATRED (ODIO FORMAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL RESONANCE (RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CORE EMOTIONAL AXIS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BRAIN\'S EMOTIONAL CENTER AND THE IMMUNE REGULATOR. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE POLARITY OF THE THYMUS TO DISSIPATE STORED FREQUENCIES OF FORMAL HATRED, RESTORING A STATE OF INNER CALM AND IMMUNOLOGICAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL EJE EMOCIONAL CENTRAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL CENTRO EMOCIONAL DEL CEREBRO Y EL REGULADOR INMUNITARIO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LA POLARIDAD DEL TIMO PARA DISIPAR LAS FRECUENCIAS ALMACENADAS DE ODIO FORMAL, RESTAURANDO UN ESTADO DE CALMA INTERIOR Y EQUILIBRIO INMUNOL\\u00d3GICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE HEART AND PINEAL GLAND TO ENHANCE THE INTEGRATION OF EMOTIONAL RELEASE AND PROMOTE BIOFIELD COHERENCE.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL PARA MEJORAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y PROMOVER LA COHERENCIA DEL BIOCAMPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/18','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:47:49','2026-04-25 17:47:49'),(3819,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',19,'{\"symptoms\":\"HERPES SIMPLEX, PARALYSIS, MILKWEED IN THE MOUTH, GENITAL WARTS AND DISORDERS. (HERPES SIMPLEX, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, ASCLEPIAS EN LA BOCA, VERRUGAS GENITALES Y TRASTORNOS.)\",\"paths\":\"DNA VIRUS (VIRUS DE ADN)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HERPES SIMPLEX, PARALYSIS, MILKWEED IN THE MOUTH, GENITAL WARTS AND DISORDERS.\\n\\n(HERPES SIMPLEX, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, ASCLEPIAS EN LA BOCA, VERRUGAS GENITALES Y TRASTORNOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE DNA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING THE BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE OROPHARYNGEAL AND GENITAL AXIS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE PH TO INHIBIT VIRAL REPLICATION, ADDRESSING BOTH LOCAL LESIONS AND SYSTEMIC NEUROLOGICAL INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE ADN MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO EN EL EJE OROFAR\\u00cdNGEO Y GENITAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH PARA INHIBIR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL, ABORDANDO TANTO LAS LESIONES LOCALES COMO LA INTERFERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE NERVE ROOTS AND SACRUM TO CLEAR VIRAL RESERVOIRS COMMONLY ASSOCIATED WITH HERPES STRAINS.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LAS RA\\u00cdCES NERVIOSAS Y EL SACRO PARA ELIMINAR LOS RESERVORIOS VIRALES COM\\u00daNMENTE ASOCIADOS CON LAS CEPAS DE HERPES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/19','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:49:03','2026-04-25 17:49:03'),(3820,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',20,'{\"symptoms\":\"DRY MOUTH, SORE GUMS\\/BLEEDING\\/SORE, LOOSE TEETH, RUNNY NOSE, RHINITIS, LARYNGITIS, OTITIS AND EPISTAXIS. (BOCA SECA, ENC\\u00cdAS DOLORIDAS\\/SANGRANTES\\/DOLIENTES, DIENTES SUELTOS, SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, RINITIS, LARINGITIS, OTITIS Y EPISTAXIS.)\",\"paths\":\"SPREAD FORM PERSON TO PERSON. MANIFEST IN THE MOUTH AS GINGIVITIS AND PERIODONTAL DISEASE. EAR, NOSE AND THROAT IRRITATIONS. (SE PROPAGA DE PERSONA A PERSONA. SE MANIFIESTA EN LA BOCA COMO GINGIVITIS Y ENFERMEDAD PERIODONTAL. IRRITACIONES EN O\\u00cdDO, NARIZ Y GARGANTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DRY MOUTH, SORE GUMS\\/BLEEDING\\/SORE, LOOSE TEETH, RUNNY NOSE, RHINITIS, LARYNGITIS, OTITIS AND EPISTAXIS.(BOCA SECA, ENC\\u00cdAS DOLORIDAS\\/SANGRANTES\\/DOLIENTES, DIENTES SUELTOS, SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, RINITIS, LARINGITIS, OTITIS Y EPISTAXIS.)\",\"paths\":\"ARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS FRAGILIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE ORAL AND RESPIRATORY CAVITIES. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ELIMINATE GINGIVITIS AND PERIODONTAL DISEASE WHILE REDUCING IRRITATION IN THE EAR, NOSE, AND THROAT.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO AL STREPTOCOCCUS FR\\u00c1GILIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS CAVIDADES ORAL Y RESPIRATORIA. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ELIMINAR LA GINGIVITIS Y LA ENFERMEDAD PERIODONTAL, MIENTRAS REDUCE LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N EN EL O\\u00cdDO, LA NARIZ Y LA GARGANTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TRANSMISSION CHECK: SPREADS FROM PERSON TO PERSON. MONITOR CONTACTS FOR SIMILAR RESPIRATORY OR ORAL SYMPTOMS TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N: SE PROPAGA DE PERSONA A PERSONA. MONITOREAR CONTACTOS PARA DETECTAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS U ORALES SIMILARES PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/20','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 17:50:35','2026-04-25 17:50:35'),(3821,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',21,'{\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY DIFFICULTIES, WITH COUGHING AND NOT BEING ABLE TO PUSH AIR IN AND OUT; TO INFLATE THE LUNGS. (DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS, CON TOS Y NO PODER INTRODUCIR NI EXPULSAR AIRE; PARA INFLAR LOS PULMONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS BLASTOMYCOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES THAT RESONATE WITH THE PULMONARY SYSTEM. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO RESOLVE RESPIRATORY DIFFICULTIES, SUCH AS THE INABILITY TO PROPERLY INFLATE THE LUNGS OR PUSH AIR IN AND OUT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BLASTOMICOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES QUE RESONAN CON EL SISTEMA PULMONAR. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA RESOLVER DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS, COMO LA INCAPACIDAD DE INFLAR CORRECTAMENTE LOS PULMONES O INTRODUCIR Y EXPULSAR AIRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE LUNGS AND BRONCHIA TO ENSURE THE RESPIRATORY PATHWAY IS FULLY CLEARED OF FUNGAL INTERFERENCE.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LOS PULMONES Y BRONQUIOS PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA V\\u00cdA RESPIRATORIA EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE LIBRE DE INTERFERENCIA F\\u00daNGICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/21','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 21:31:35','2026-04-25 21:31:35'),(3822,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',22,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL CRAMPS, ITCHING, DRYNESS, OVARIAN CYST, ANAL FISTULAS (C\\u00d3LICOS VAGINALES, PICOR, SEQUEDAD, QUISTE OV\\u00c1RICO, F\\u00cdSTULAS ANALES)\",\"paths\":\"USUALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH SEXUAL CONTACT. MOST COMMON IN WOMEN. MANIFESTS IN THE FEMALE ORGANS AND VAGINAL CANAL. IRRITANT TO URETHRA. IT CAN BE CONFUSED WITH THE PAPILLOMA VIRUS. (USUALMENTE SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO SEXUAL. M\\u00c1S COM\\u00daN EN MUJERES. SE MANIFIESTA EN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS FEMENINOS Y EL CANAL VAGINAL. IRRITANTE PARA LA URETRA. PUEDE CONFUNDIRSE CON EL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL CRAMPS, ITCHING, DRYNESS, OVARIAN CYST, AND ANAL FISTULAS.\\n(C\\u00d3LICOS VAGINALES, PICOR, SEQUEDAD, QUISTE OV\\u00c1RICO Y F\\u00cdSTULAS ANALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REPRODUCTIVE AND EXCRETORY JUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE VAGINAL CANAL AND FEMALE ORGANS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ELIMINATE URETHRAL IRRITATION AND RESOLVE RESONANCE THAT CAN BE CONFUSED WITH THE PAPILLOMA VIRUS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA UNI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA Y EXCRETORA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL CANAL VAGINAL Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS FEMENINOS. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ELIMINAR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N URETRAL Y RESOLVER LA RESONANCIA QUE PUEDE CONFUNDIRSE CON EL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA.).)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TRANSMISSION CHECK: USUALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH SEXUAL CONTACT; MOST COMMON IN WOMEN. SCAN THE URETHRA AND OVARY POINTS TO ENSURE FULL SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N: USUALMENTE SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO SEXUAL; M\\u00c1S COM\\u00daN EN MUJERES. ESCANEAR LOS PUNTOS DE LA URETRA Y EL OVARIO PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO COMPLETO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/22','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 21:36:29','2026-04-25 21:36:29'),(3823,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',23,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"TONSIL INFLAMMATION (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS)\",\"paths\":\"A CONNECTION THROUGH ENERGETIC CHANNELING. REDUCES TONSIL SWELLING. (UNA CONEXI\\u00d3N A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CANAL ENERG\\u00c9TICO. REDUCE LA HINCHAZ\\u00d3N DE LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENERGETIC CHANNEL (CANAL ENERG\\u00c9TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"TONSIL INFLAMMATION, SWELLING OF THE THROAT, AND ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES IN THE UPPER RESPIRATORY TRACK.\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N DE LA GARGANTA Y BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE BUNDLE BY ESTABLISHING A CONNECTION THROUGH ENERGETIC CHANNELING. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO REDUCE TONSIL SWELLING AND CLEARS THE PATHWAY FOR IMPROVED LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE IN THE NECK REGION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAQUETE ESTABLECIENDO UNA CONEXI\\u00d3N A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA CANALIZACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA REDUCIR LA HINCHAZ\\u00d3N DE LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS Y DESPEJA LA V\\u00cdA PARA MEJORAR EL DRENAJE LINF\\u00c1TICO EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CUELLO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE TONSILS DIRECTLY AND THE BRACHIAL PLEXUS TO ENSURE NO LINGERING INFLAMATORY RESONANCE IN THE UPPER TORSO.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS DIRECTAMENTE Y EL PLEXO BRAQUIAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA RESONANCIA INFLAMATORIA REMANENTE EN EL TORSO SUPERIOR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/23','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 21:38:36','2026-04-25 21:38:36'),(3824,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',24,'{\"symptoms\":\"UTI, RESPIRATORY INFECTION, SKIN INFECTION, ABDOMINAL INFECTION, NERVOUS SYSTEM INFECTION, EYE INFECTIONS (ITU, INFECCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL, INFECCI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, INFECCIONES OCULARES)\",\"paths\":\"SIMULATES ENCEPHALITIS, NOSOCOMIAL PATHOGENS. LOWER RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, SKIN SOFT- TISSUE, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS. INTRA-ABDOMINAL, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, OPHTHALMIC INFECTIONS (SIMULA ENCEFALITIS, PAT\\u00d3GENOS NOSOCOMIALES. INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO INFERIOR, TEJIDOS BLANDOS DE LA PIEL, INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO. INTRA-ABDOMINALES, SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, INFECCIONES OFT\\u00c1LMICAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"UTI, RESPIRATORY INFECTION, SKIN INFECTION, ABDOMINAL INFECTION, NERVOUS SYSTEM INFECTION, AND EYE INFECTIONS.\\n(ITU, INFECCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL, INFECCI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO E INFECCIONES OCULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS AEROBACTER AEROGENUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND SOFT TISSUES. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO COUNTERACT NOSOCOMIAL PATHOGENS, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE RESPIRATORY AND URINARY TRACTS WHILE PREVENTING THE SIMULATION OF ENCEPHALITIS.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO AL AEROBACTER AEROGENUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y LOS TEJIDOS BLANDOS. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA CONTRARRESTAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS NOSOCOMIALES, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LOS TRACTOS RESPIRATORIO Y URINARIO, MIENTRAS PREVIENE LA SIMULACI\\u00d3N DE ENCEFALITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE BLADDER AND LUNGS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PATHOGENIC CIRCUIT IS NEUTRALIZED ACROSS DIFFERENT SYSTEMS.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA VEJIGA Y LOS PULMONES PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL CIRCUITO PAT\\u00d3GENO EST\\u00c9 NEUTRALIZADO EN LOS DIFERENTES SISTEMAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/24','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 21:39:47','2026-04-25 21:39:47'),(3825,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',25,'{\"symptoms\":\"BLISTERS, WARTS, CYST, POLYPS, ULCERS, PROSTATITIS. (AMPOLLAS, VERRUGAS, QUISTE, P\\u00d3LIPOS, \\u00daLCERAS, PROSTATITIS)\",\"paths\":\"ACQUIRED BY SEXUAL CONTACT, GENITAL FLUIDS AND BLOOD TRANSFUSIONS. CUTANEOUS BLISTERS AND WARTS ON AND AROUND THE GENITAL. CALLUS AND FISHEYE ON THE SOLE OF THE FOOT. WHEN THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES ARE AFFECTED , IT PRODUCES CONDYLOMA. (ADQUIRIDO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL, FLUIDOS GENITALES Y TRANSFUSIONES DE SANGRE. AMPOLLAS CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y VERRUGAS EN Y ALREDEDOR DEL GENITAL. CALLO Y PUNTO CENTRADO EN LA PLANTA DEL PIE. CUANDO SE VEN AFECTADAS LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, PRODUCE CONDILOMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"- IF ASSOCIATED WITH LEPROSY - IT PRODUCES MYOMAS.                 - IF ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER PATHOGENS IT CONTRIBUTES TO CERVICAL CANCER.                   - CHECK - PROSTATE\\/RECTUM (SI SE ASOCIA CON LA LEPRA, PRODUCE MIOMAS. - SI SE ASOCIA CON OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS, CONTRIBUYE AL C\\u00c1NCER DE CUELLO UTERINO. - COMPROBACI\\u00d3N - PR\\u00d3STATA\\/RECTO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"REFERENCE 27 \\/ REFERENCIA 27\\nNAME \\/ NOMBRE\\nANUS (ANO) \\/ ANUS (ANO) (REF. GUIDED 31)\\n\\nRADICAL\\nVIRUS\\n\\nSTART \\/ ORIGIN\\nHUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS (VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO)\\n\\nSYMPTOMS \\/ S\\u00cdNTOMAS\\nBLISTERS, WARTS, CYSTS, POLYPS, ULCERS, AND PROSTATITIS.\\n(AMPOLLAS, VERRUGAS, QUISTE, P\\u00d3LIPOS, \\u00daLCERAS Y PROSTATITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACQUIRED THROUGH SEXUAL CONTACT OR FLUID EXCHANGE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS CUTANEOUS WARTS AROUND THE GENITALS, CONDYLOMAS ON MUCOUS MEMBRANES, AND FISHEYE CALLUSES ON THE SOLE OF THE FOOT.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ADQUIRIDAS POR CONTACTO SEXUAL O INTERCAMBIO DE FLUIDOS. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR VERRUGAS CUT\\u00c1NEAS ALREDEDOR DE LOS GENITALES, CONDILOMAS EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS Y OJOS DE PESCADO EN LA PLANTA DEL PIE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: IF ASSOCIATED WITH LEPROSY, IT MAY PRODUCE MYOMAS. CHECK THE PROSTATE\\/RECTUM AXIS AND MONITOR FOR PATHOGENIC SYNERGY THAT CONTRIBUTES TO CERVICAL CANCER.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: SI SE ASOCIA CON LA LEPRA, PUEDE PRODUCIR MIOMAS. COMPROBAR EL EJE PR\\u00d3STATA\\/RECTO Y MONITOREAR LA SINERGIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA QUE CONTRIBUYE AL C\\u00c1NCER DE CUELLO UTERINO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/25','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 21:40:52','2026-04-25 21:40:52'),(38