gnetism.app/v1/pairs/26','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 21:42:02','2026-04-25 21:42:02'),(3827,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',27,'{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, DIARRHEA, DEHYDRATION. (PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES SEVEROS, DIARREA, DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"HIGHLY PATHOGENIC. SUBCUTANEOUS AND CUTANEOUS ABNORMALITIES. (ALTAMENTE PAT\\u00d3GENO. ANORMALIDADES SUBCUT\\u00c1NEAS Y CUT\\u00c1NEAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, DIARRHEA, DEHYDRATION, AND DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT.\\n(PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES SEVEROS, DIARREA, DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PATHOGENIC YEAST BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ELIMINATE SUBCUTANEOUS AND CUTANEOUS ABNORMALITIES CAUSED BY FUNGAL OVERGROWTH.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO A LA LEVADURA PAT\\u00d3GENA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ELIMINAR LAS ANORMALIDADES SUBCUT\\u00c1NEAS Y CUT\\u00c1NEAS CAUSADAS POR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE SMALL INTESTINE AND COLON TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE MYCOTIC LOAD.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL INTESTINO DELGADO Y EL COLON PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA MIC\\u00d3TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/27','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 21:43:32','2026-04-25 21:43:32'),(3828,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',28,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL & UROGENITAL SYSTEM (SISTEMA INTESTINAL Y UROGENITAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEMORRHOIDS 