RAR UNA REGULACI\\u00d3N LIP\\u00cdDICA COMPLETA Y PREVENIR LA REACUMULACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL SISTEMA VASCULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/30','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-25 21:48:39','2026-04-25 21:48:39'),(3832,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',21,'{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, FEVER, COUGH, SKIN BOILS. (NEUMON\\u00cdA, FIEBRE, TOS, FOR\\u00daNCULOS EN LA PIEL)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS BLASTOMYCOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES THAT RESONATE WITH THE PULMONARY SYSTEM. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO RESOLVE RESPIRATORY DIFFICULTIES, SUCH AS THE INABILITY TO PROPERLY INFLATE THE LUNGS OR PUSH AIR IN AND OUT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BLASTOMICOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES QUE RESONAN CON EL SISTEMA PULMONAR. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA RESOLVER DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS, COMO LA INCAPACIDAD DE INFLAR CORRECTAMENTE LOS PULMONES O INTRODUCIR Y EXPULSAR AIRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE LUNGS AND BRONCHIA TO ENSURE THE RESPIRATORY PATHWAY IS FULLY CLEARED OF FUNGAL INTERFERENCE.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LOS PULMONES Y BRONQUIOS PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA V\\u00cdA RESPIRATORIA EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE LIBRE DE INTERFERENCIA F\\u00daNGICA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, FEVER, COUGH, AND SKIN BOILS.\\n\\n(NEUMON\\u00cdA, FIEBRE, TOS Y FOR\\u00daNCULOS EN LA PIEL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS BLASTOMYCOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES THAT RESONATE WITH THE PULMONARY SYSTEM. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO RESOLVE RESPIRATORY DIFFICULTIES, SUCH AS THE INABILITY TO PROPERLY INFLATE THE LUNGS OR PUSH AIR IN AND OUT.(SE DIRIGE A LA BLASTOMICOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES QUE RESONAN CON EL SISTEMA PULMONAR. 