EART AND THE ADJACENT NERVE BUNDLES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL HERPES Z\\u00d3STER MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL ARCO A\\u00d3RTICO Y EL SACO PERIC\\u00c1RDICO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH PARA PREVENIR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL QUE PUEDE AFECTAR EL REVESTIMIENTO PROTECTOR DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y LOS PAQUETES NERVIOSOS ADYACENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE INTERCOSTAL NERVES AND THE SPINE TO ADDRESS THE LATENT PATHWAY OF THE VIRUS AND REDUCE POST-HERPETIC PAIN.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LOS NERVIOS INTERCOSTALES Y LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL PARA ABORDAR LA V\\u00cdA LATENTE DEL VIRUS Y REDUCIR EL DOLOR POST-HERP\\u00c9TICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/31','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:20:32','2026-04-26 20:20:32'),(3835,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',32,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND SOFT TISSUE INFECTION, PNEUMONIA, STLES, SIALADENITIS, SEPSIS, TOXIC SHOCK, GASTROENTERITIS, OSTEITIS, ENDOCARDITIS, ARTHRITIS, LOCALIZED ABSCESSES. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL Y TEJIDOS BLANDOS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, STLES, SIALADENITIS, SEPSIS, CHOQUE T\\u00d3XICO, GASTROENTERITIS, OSTE\\u00cdTIS, ENDOCARDITIS, ARTRITIS, ABSCESOS LOCALIZADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"DISEASE DUE TO TOXINS. (ENFERMEDAD DEBIDO A TOXINAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - APPENDIX\\/PLEURA                    CHECK - PERICARDIUM         CHECK - VAGINA\\/THROAT (COMPROBAR - AP\\u00c9NDICE\\/PLEURA COMPROBAR - PERICARDIO COMPROBAR - VAGINA\\/GARGANTA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND SOFT TISSUE INFECTION, PNEUMONIA, STYES, SIALADENITIS, SEPSIS, TOXIC SHOCK, GASTROENTERITIS, OSTEITIS, ENDOCARDITIS, ARTHRITIS, AND LOCALIZED ABSCESSES.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL Y TEJIDOS BLANDOS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, PERRILLAS, SIALADENITIS, SEPSIS, CHOQUE T\\u00d3XICO, GASTROENTERITIS, OSTE\\u00cdTIS, ENDOCARDITIS, ARTRITIS Y ABSCESOS LOCALIZADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE APPENDICULAR REGION. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO COUNTERACT DISEASES DRIVEN BY BACTERIAL TOXINS, PREVENTING SYSTEMIC SPREAD TO THE SKIN, LUNGS, AND JOINTS.\\n\\n(DIRIGIDO AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N APENDICULAR. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA CONTRARRESTAR LAS ENFERMEDADES IMPULSADAS POR TOXINAS BACTERIANAS, PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA A LA PIEL, LOS PULMONES Y LAS ARTICULACIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: CHECK APPENDIX\\/PLEURA, PERICARDIUM, AND VAGINA\\/THROAT TO ENSURE THE STAPHYLOCOCCAL LOAD IS COMPLETELY NEUTRALIZED ACROSS ALL POTENTIAL RESERVOIRS.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: COMPROBAR AP\\u00c9NDICE\\/PLEURA, PERICARDIO Y VAGINA\\/GARGANTA PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA CARGA DE ESTAFILOCOCO EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE NEUTRALIZADA EN TODOS LOS RESERVORIOS POTENCIALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/32','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:22:06','2026-04-26 20:22:06'),(3836,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',33,'{\"origins\":\"BACTERIOPHAGE (Bacteri\\u00f3fago)\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BACTERIA THAT ATTACK BACTERIA. PHAGES ARE VIRUSES THAT INFECT ONLY BACTERIA.TAKING ADVANTAGE OF THE BACTERIA TO MULTIPLE. DIVERSE POPULATIONS FOUND IN SOIL, INTESTINAL FLORA OF ANIMALS AND IN SEAWATER. (BACTERIAS QUE ATACAN BACTERIAS. LOS FAGOS SON VIRUS QUE INFECTAN SOLO A BACTERIAS, APROVECHANDOSE DE LAS BACTERIAS PARA MULTIPLICARSE. POBLACIONES DIVERSAS QUE SE ENCUENTRAN EN EL SUELO, LA FLORA INTESTINAL DE LOS ANIMALES Y EL AGUA DE MAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BACTERIOPHAGE (BACTERI\\u00d3FAGO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE IMBALANCE, ALTERED INTESTINAL FLORA, AND POTENTIAL URINARY DISCOMFORT.\\n(DESEQUILIBRIO DIGESTIVO, ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FLORA INTESTINAL Y POSIBLES MOLESTIAS URINARIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS BACTERIOPHAGES\\u2014VIRUSES THAT INFECT BACTERIA\\u2014BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE APPENDICULAR-VESICAL JUNCTION. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO REGULATE THE MICROBIOME IN THE INTESTINAL FLORA AND PREVENTS VIRUSES FROM EXPLOITING BACTERIAL POPULATIONS FOR REPLICATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LOS BACTERI\\u00d3FAGOS (VIRUS QUE INFECTAN A LAS BACTERIAS) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH EN LA UNI\\u00d3N APENDICULAR-VESICAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA REGULAR EL MICROBIOMA EN LA FLORA INTESTINAL Y EVITA QUE LOS VIRUS APROVECHEN LAS POBLACIONES BACTERIANAS PARA REPLICARSE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ECOLOGICAL CHECK: PHAGES ARE DIVERSE AND FOUND IN SOIL AND SEAWATER. SCAN THE SMALL INTESTINE AND COLON TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC BALANCE OF THE INTERNAL ECOSYSTEM.\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ECOL\\u00d3GICA: LOS FAGOS SON DIVERSOS Y SE ENCUENTRAN EN EL SUELO Y EL AGUA DE MAR. ESCANEAR EL INTESTINO DELGADO Y EL COLON PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DEL ECOSISTEMA INTERNO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/33','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:23:46','2026-04-26 20:23:46'),(3837,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',34,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"NERVE PAIN, BURNING SENSATIONS, SKIN RASHES OR BLISTERS IN THE ABDOMINAL AREA, AND DIGESTIVE IRRITATION.\\n(DOLOR NERVIOSO, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ARDOR, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O AMPOLLAS EN EL \\u00c1REA ABDOMINAL E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HERPES ZOSTER VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE JUNCTION OF THE LARGE AND SMALL INTESTINES. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS VIRAL REPLICATION WITHIN THE NERVE ENDINGS OF THE LOWER RIGHT QUADRANT, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN BOTH THE APPENDIX AND THE CECUM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL HERPES Z\\u00d3STER MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA UNI\\u00d3N DE LOS INTESTINOS GRUESO Y DELGADO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL DENTRO DE LAS TERMINACIONES NERVIOSAS DEL CUADRANTE INFERIOR DERECHO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N TANTO EN EL AP\\u00c9NDICE COMO EN EL CIEGO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE GENITOFEMORAL NERVE AND THE LUMBAR SPINE TO ENSURE THE VIRAL PATHWAY IS FULLY CLEARED FROM THE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL NERVIO GENITOFEMORAL Y LA COLUMNA LUMBAR PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA V\\u00cdA VIRAL EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE ELIMINADA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/34','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:24:44','2026-04-26 20:24:44'),(3838,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',35,'{\"symptoms\":\"RASH ILLNESS, SEVERE ACUTE RESPIRATORY SYNDROME. (ENFERMEDAD CON ERUPCI\\u00d3N, S\\u00cdNDROME RESPIRATORIO AGUDO SEVERO)\",\"paths\":\"SPREADS THROUGH TOUCHING THE PLACE OF SMALLPOX VACCINE. RASH AND HIVES WITH FEVER. SIMILAR TO ATOPIC DERMATITIS . (SE PROPAGA AL TOCAR EL LUGAR DE LA VACUNA CONTRA LA VIRUELA. ERUPCI\\u00d3N Y URTICARIA CON FIEBRE. SIMILAR A LA DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IF ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS, IT CAUSES SARS.   CHECK - APPENDIX\\/TESTICLE (R) OR VAGINA. (SI SE ASOCIA CON UN HONGO, CAUSA SARS. REVISIONAR - AP\\u00c9NDICE\\/TEST\\u00cdCULO (D) O VAGINA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RASH ILLNESS, SEVERE ACUTE RESPIRATORY SYNDROME (SARS), HIVES, AND FEVER.\\n(ENFERMEDAD CON ERUPCI\\u00d3N, S\\u00cdNDROME RESPIRATORIO AGUDO SEVERO (SRAS), URTICARIA Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE VACCINIA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE APPENDICULAR AND CIRCULATORY JUNCTION. THIS RESET ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC REACTIONS OFTEN TRIGGERED BY TOUCHING THE SITE OF A SMALLPOX VACCINE, RESOLVING RASHES AND FEBRILE CONDITIONS THAT MAY MIMIC ATOPIC DERMATITIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA VACUNIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA UNI\\u00d3N APENDICULAR Y CIRCULATORIA. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS REACCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS A MENUDO DESENCADENADAS POR TOCAR EL SITIO DE UNA VACUNA CONTRA LA VIRUELA, RESOLVIENDO ERUPCIONES Y ESTADOS FEBRILES QUE PUEDEN IMITAR LA DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYNERGY ALERT: IF ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS, IT MAY LEAD TO SARS. CHECK THE APPENDIX \\/ TESTICLE (RIGHT) OR VAGINA AXIS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PATHOGENIC LOAD IS CLEARED.\\n(ALERTA DE SINERGIA: SI SE ASOCIA CON UN HONGO, PUEDE CAUSAR SRAS. REVISAR EL EJE AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO (DERECHO) O VAGINA PARA ASEGURAR QUE SE ELIMINE TODA LA CARGA PAT\\u00d3GENA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/35','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:26:10','2026-04-26 20:26:10'),(3839,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',36,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER (FIEBRE)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY DISEASE (ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, RESPIRATORY ISSUES, AND POTENTIAL URINARY TRACT DISCOMFORT.\\n(FIEBRE, PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS Y POSIBLES MOLESTIAS EN EL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE BK VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE APPENDIX AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS VIRAL RESONANCE THAT CAN LEAD TO RESPIRATORY DISEASE AND RENAL IRRITATION, PROMOTING SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS BK MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL AP\\u00c9NDICE Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR LA RESONANCIA VIRAL QUE PUEDE DERIVAR EN ENFERMEDADES RESPIRATORIAS E IRRITACI\\u00d3N RENAL, PROMOVIENDO LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE URETERS AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY TO ENSURE THE VIRAL LOAD IS NOT CAUSING SECONDARY IMBALANCES IN THE EXCRETORY SYSTEM.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LOS UR\\u00c9TERES Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA CARGA VIRAL NO EST\\u00c9 CAUSANDO DESEQUILIBRIOS SECUNDARIOS EN EL SISTEMA EXCRETOR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/36','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:27:13','2026-04-26 20:27:13'),(3840,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',37,'{\"symptoms\":\"APPENDICITIS, PLEURISY, PLEURAL EFFUSION, RESPIRATORY PROBLEM, PNEUMONIA, DEPRESSION, SEPTIS, DIABETES, FALSE RHEUMATISM, RETINAPATHY, CONJUNCTIVITIS, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (APENDICITIS, PLEURES\\u00cdA, DERRAME PLEURAL, PROBLEMA RESPIRATORIO, NEUMON\\u00cdA, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, SEPSIS, DIABETES, REUMATISMO FALSO, RETINOPAT\\u00cdA, CONJUNTIVITIS, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE.)\",\"paths\":\"MAIN CAUSE OF APPENDICITIS WHEN INFECTED. (CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE LA APENDICITIS CUANDO EST\\u00c1 INFECTADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IF ASSOCIATED WITH THE PERICARDIUM; MAY CAUSE HEART DISEASE, PERICARDITIS, ARRHYTHMIA, HEART INFLAMMATION, INFARCTION, AND TACHYCARDIA.     CHECK - PERICARDIUM, VAGINA\\/THROAT, CERVIAL 5, CORONARY\\/PECTORAL TENDON. (SI SE ASOCIA CON EL PERICARDIO; PUEDE CAUSAR ENFERMEDAD CARDIACA, PERICARDITIS, ARRITMIA, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CARDIACA, INFARTO Y TAQUICARDIA. REVISAR - PERICARDIO, VAGINA\\/GARGANTA, CERVICAL 5, TEND\\u00d3N CORONARIO\\/PECTORAL.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"APPENDICITIS, PLEURISY, PLEURAL EFFUSION, RESPIRATORY PROBLEMS, PNEUMONIA, DEPRESSION, SEPSIS, DIABETES, FALSE RHEUMATISM, RETINOPATHY, CONJUNCTIVITIS, AND MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS.\\n\\n(APENDICITIS, PLEURES\\u00cdA, DERRAME PLEURAL, PROBLEMA RESPIRATORIO, NEUMON\\u00cdA, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, SEPSIS, DIABETES, REUMATISMO FALSO, RETINOPAT\\u00cdA, CONJUNTIVITIS Y ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE.)\",\"paths\":\"IDENTIFIED AS THE MAIN CAUSE OF APPENDICITIS WHEN INFECTED. THIS RESET NEUTRALIZES THE BACTERIAL LOAD IN THE PLEURAL AND APPENDICULAR CAVITIES TO PREVENT SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION AND POTENTIAL COMPLICATIONS IN THE LUNGS AND JOINTS.\\n\\n(IDENTIFICADO COMO LA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE LA APENDICITIS CUANDO EST\\u00c1 INFECTADA. ESTE REINICIO NEUTRALIZA LA CARGA BACTERIANA EN LAS CAVIDADES PLEURAL Y APENDICULAR PARA PREVENIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES EN LOS PULMONES Y LAS ARTICULACIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIAC CHECK: IF ASSOCIATED WITH THE PERICARDIUM, IT MAY CAUSE HEART DISEASE, PERICARDITIS, ARRHYTHMIA, OR INFARCTION. SCAN PERICARDIUM, VAGINA\\/THROAT, CERVICAL 5, AND CORONARY\\/PECTORAL TENDON.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA: SI SE ASOCIA CON EL PERICARDIO, PUEDE CAUSAR ENFERMEDAD CARD\\u00cdACA, PERICARDITIS, ARRITMIA O INFARTO. REVISAR PERICARDIO, VAGINA\\/GARGANTA, CERVICAL 5 Y TEND\\u00d3N CORONARIO\\/PECTORAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/37','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:28:48','2026-04-26 20:28:48'),(3841,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',38,'{\"symptoms\":\"SARS, PNEUMONIA, FEVER, RESPIRATORY PROBLEMS, IMMUNOINCOMPETENT. (SARS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, FIEBRE, PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, INMUNOCOMPROMETIDO.)\",\"paths\":\"REACTIONS TO SMALLPOX VACCINE, AND INABILITY OF THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO DEVELOP A RESPONSE TO THE CHALLENGE OF ANTIGENS. (REACCIONES A LA VACUNA CONTRA LA VIRUELA Y LA INCAPACIDAD DEL SISTEMA INMUNE PARA DESARROLLAR UNA RESPUESTA AL DESAF\\u00cdO DE LOS ANT\\u00cdGENOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SARS, PNEUMONIA, FEVER, RESPIRATORY PROBLEMS, AND IMMUNOINCOMPETENCE.\\n\\n(SRAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, FIEBRE, PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS E INMUNOINCOMPETENCIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EXANTHEMATOUS VACCINIA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE APPENDICULAR AND LEFT TESTICULAR AXIS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES REACTIONS TO THE SMALLPOX VACCINE AND STRENGTHENS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\'S ABILITY TO DEVELOP AN EFFECTIVE RESPONSE TO ANTIGENS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA VACUNA EXANTEM\\u00c1TICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE APENDICULAR Y TESTICULAR IZQUIERDO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS REACCIONES A LA VACUNA CONTRA LA VIRUELA Y FORTALECE LA CAPACIDAD DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA DESARROLLAR UNA RESPUESTA EFICAZ A LOS ANT\\u00cdGENOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE LUNGS AND ADRENAL GLANDS TO MONITOR FOR SYSTEMIC SARS PROGRESSION AND TO SUPPORT IMMUNE RECOVERY.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LOS PULMONES Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES PARA MONITOREAR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL SRAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/38','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:30:32','2026-04-26 20:30:32'),(3842,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',39,'{\"paths\":\"SPREADS THROUGH TOUCHING THE PLACE OF SMALLPOX VACCINE. RASH AND HIVES WITH FEVER. SIMILAR TO ATOPIC DERMATITIS . (SE PROPAGA AL TOCAR EL LUGAR DE LA VACUNA CONTRA LA VIRUELA. ERUPCI\\u00d3N Y URTICARIA CON FIEBRE. SIMILAR A LA DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IF ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS, IT CAUSES SARS.   CHECK - APPENDIX\\/TESTICLE (R) OR VAGINA. (SI SE ASOCIA CON UN HONGO, CAUSA SARS. REVISIONAR - AP\\u00c9NDICE\\/TEST\\u00cdCULO (D) O VAGINA)\"}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE VACCINIA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE APPENDICULAR AND RIGHT TESTICULAR AXIS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC REACTIONS OFTEN TRIGGERED BY CONTACT WITH THE SMALLPOX VACCINATION SITE, RESOLVING DERMATOLOGICAL IRRITATIONS AND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA VACUNIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE APENDICULAR Y TESTICULAR DERECHO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS REACCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS A MENUDO DESENCADENADAS POR EL CONTACTO CON EL SITIO DE LA VACUNA CONTRA LA VIRUELA, RESOLVIENDO IRRITACIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS Y DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYNERGY ALERT: IF ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS, IT MAY LEAD TO SARS. SCAN THE APPENDIX\\/TESTICLE (R) OR VAGINA POINTS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PATHOGENIC LOAD IS NEUTRALIZED.\\n\\n(ALERTA DE SINERGIA: SI SE ASOCIA CON UN HONGO, PUEDE CAUSAR SRAS. ESCANEAR LOS PUNTOS DE AP\\u00c9NDICE\\/TEST\\u00cdCULO (D) O VAGINA PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA CARGA PAT\\u00d3GENA EST\\u00c9 NEUTRALIZADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/39','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:32:11','2026-04-26 20:32:11'),(3843,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',40,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNE BOOSTER (REFUERZO INMUNITARIO)\",\"paths\":\"IT PRODUCES WHITE BLOOD CELLS TO IMPROVE THE QUALITY OF THE WHITE BLOOD CELLS, LYMPHOCYTES AND HORMONAL COORDINATION. (PRODUCE GLOBULOS BLANCOS PARA MEJORAR LA CALIDAD DE LOS GLOBULOS BLANCOS, LOS LINFOCITOS Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE SYSTEM DYNAMICS (DIN\\u00c1MICA DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNE BOOSTER, LOW WHITE BLOOD CELL COUNT, AND HORMONAL IMBALANCE.\\n(REFUERZO INMUNITARIO, BAJO CONTEO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS Y DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE PRODUCTION AND QUALITY OF THE BODY\'S DEFENSE CELLS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE APPENDIX AND THE THYMUS GLAND. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE PH TO IMPROVE THE MATURATION OF LYMPHOCYTES AND ENHANCE OVERALL HORMONAL COORDINATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N Y CALIDAD DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS DE DEFENSA DEL CUERPO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL AP\\u00c9NDICE Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIMO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH PARA MEJORAR LA MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS LINFOCITOS Y OPTIMIZAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE BONE MARROW AND SPLEEN TO SUPPORT MAXIMUM HEMATOLOGIC QUALITY AND IMMUNE SYSTEM RESILIENCE.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA Y EL BAZO PARA APOYAR LA M\\u00c1XIMA CALIDAD HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA Y LA RESILIENCIA DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/40','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:33:35','2026-04-26 20:33:35'),(3844,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',41,'{\"symptoms\":\"SMALLPOX, ATOPIC DERMATITIS, COLD SORES, PLANTAR WARTS, HERPES, URETHRITIS, VAGINITIS, PENILE DISORDERS, FALSE ACNE. (VIRUELA, DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, HERPES LABIAL, VERUCAS PLANTARES, HERPES, URETRITIS, VAGINITIS, TRASTORNOS PENALES, FALSA ACN\\u00c9)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY PUBLIC USES OF WATER, SWIMMING POOLS, BATHES AND SHARED SHOES. (TRANSMITIDO POR USOS P\\u00daBLICOS DEL AGUA, PISCINAS, BA\\u00d1OS Y ZAPATOS COMPARTIDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH ASCENDING COLON\\/DESCENDING COLON, IT PRODUCES DIGESTIVE DISORDERS.        ASSOCIATED WITH A BACTERIA - FLAT WARTS. (ASOCIADO CON EL COLON ASCENDENTE\\/DESCENDENTE, PRODUCE TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS. ASOCIADO CON UNA BACTERIA - VERUCAS PLANAS.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SMALLPOX, ATOPIC DERMATITIS, COLD SORES, PLANTAR WARTS, HERPES, URETHRITIS, VAGINITIS, PENILE DISORDERS, AND FALSE ACNE.\\n\\n(VIRUELA, DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, HERPES LABIAL, VERRUGAS PLANTARES, HERPES, URETRITIS, VAGINITIS, TRASTORNOS PENEALES Y FALSA ACN\\u00c9.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EXANTHEMATOUS VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE APPENDIX AND THE OPPOSITE SIDE OF THE TONGUE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES PATHOGENS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH PUBLIC WATER USES, SWIMMING POOLS, BATHS, AND SHARED FOOTWEAR, CLEARING DERMATOLOGICAL AND MUCOSAL IRRITATIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS EXANTEM\\u00c1TICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL AP\\u00c9NDICE Y EL LADO OPUESTO DE LA LENGUA. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE A MENUDO SE TRANSMITEN A TRAV\\u00c9S DE USOS P\\u00daBLICOS DEL AGUA, PISCINAS, BA\\u00d1OS Y CALZADO COMPARTIDO, ELIMINANDO LAS IRRITACIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS Y MUCOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYNERGY ALERT: IF ASSOCIATED WITH THE ASCENDING\\/DESCENDING COLON, IT PRODUCES DIGESTIVE DISORDERS. IF ASSOCIATED WITH BACTERIA, IT MAY PRESENT AS FLAT WARTS. SCAN THE COLON AXIS TO ENSURE FULL SYSTEMIC CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(ALERTA DE SINERGIA: SI SE ASOCIA CON EL COLON ASCENDENTE\\/DESCENDENTE, PRODUCE TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS. SI SE ASOCIA CON BACTERIAS, PUEDE PRESENTARSE COMO VERRUGAS PLANAS. ESCANEAR EL EJE DEL COLON PARA ASEGURAR UNA LIMPIEZA SIST\\u00c9MICA COMPLETA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/41','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:35:00','2026-04-26 20:35:00'),(3845,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',42,'{\"symptoms\":\"SARS, PNEUMONIA, FEVER, RESPIRATORY PROBLEMS, IMMUNOINCOMPETENT. (SARS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, FIEBRE, PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, INMUNOCOMPROMETIDO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SARS, PNEUMONIA, FEVER, RESPIRATORY PROBLEMS, AND IMMUNOINCOMPETENCE.\\n(SRAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, FIEBRE, PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS E INMUNOINCOMPETENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE LUNGS AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS TO MONITOR FOR SYSTEMIC SARS PROGRESSION AND TO SUPPORT IMMUNE SYSTEM RECOVERY.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LOS PULMONES Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES PARA MONITOREAR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL SRAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/42','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:36:10','2026-04-26 20:36:10'),(3846,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',43,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"OBESITY (OBESIDAD)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC DYNAMICS (DIN\\u00c1MICA METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"OBESITY, SLOW METABOLISM, AND DIGESTIVE EFFICIENCY ISSUES.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD, METABOLISMO LENTO Y PROBLEMAS DE EFICIENCIA DIGESTIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE METABOLIC SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE APPENDIX AND THE LOWER TIP OF THE STERNUM (XIPHOID PROCESS). THIS RESET STABILIZES THE PH TO OPTIMIZE THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO PROCESS LIPIDS AND REGULATE WEIGHT, IMPROVING THE OVERALL ENERGY BALANCE OF THE GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL SISTEMA METAB\\u00d3LICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL AP\\u00c9NDICE Y LA PUNTA INFERIOR DEL ESTERN\\u00d3N (AP\\u00c9NDICE XIFOIDES). ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH PARA OPTIMIZAR LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PROCESAR L\\u00cdPIDOS Y REGULAR EL PESO, MEJORANDO EL EQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO GENERAL DEL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE THYROID AND THE PANCREAS TO ADDRESS SECONDARY GLANDULAR CAUSES OF WEIGHT GAIN AND TO SUPPORT A COMPREHENSIVE METABOLIC RECOVERY.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA TIROIDES Y EL P\\u00c1NCREAS PARA ABORDAR CAUSAS GLANDULARES SECUNDARIAS DEL AUMENTO DE PESO Y APOYAR UNA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA INTEGRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/43','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:37:59','2026-04-26 20:37:59'),(3847,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',44,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT MANAGEMENT (CONTROL DE PESO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT MANAGEMENT ISSUES, SLOW METABOLISM, AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(CONTROL DE PESO, METABOLISMO LENTO Y MOLESTIAS GASTROINTESTINALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE BODY\'S METABOLIC EFFICIENCY BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE APPENDIX AND THE XIPHOID PROCESS IN A HORIZONTAL ORIENTATION. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE PH TO OPTIMIZE ENERGY EXPENDITURE, SUPPORT WEIGHT MANAGEMENT, AND ENHANCE THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM\'S ABILITY TO PROCESS NUTRIENTS EFFECTIVELY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA EFICIENCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA DEL CUERPO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL AP\\u00c9NDICE Y EL PROCESO XIFOIDES EN UNA ORIENTACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH PARA OPTIMIZAR EL GASTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO, APOYAR EL CONTROL DE PESO Y MEJORAR LA CAPACIDAD DEL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO PARA PROCESAR LOS NUTRIENTES DE MANERA EFECTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR CHECK: SCAN THE THYROID AND PITUITARY GLANDS TO ENSURE THERE ARE NO SECONDARY HORMONAL BLOCKAGES CONTRIBUTING TO WEIGHT RETENTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR: ESCANEAR LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS TIROIDES E HIP\\u00d3FISIS PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA BLOQUEOS HORMONALES SECUNDARIOS QUE CONTRIBUYAN A LA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE PESO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/44','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:51:09','2026-04-26 20:51:09'),(3848,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',45,'{\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EBOLA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE PLANTAR ARCHES. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC VIRAL REPLICATION THAT AFFECTS BLOOD COAGULATION AND VASCULAR INTEGRITY, HELPING TO REDUCE INTERNAL INFLAMMATION AND MUSCULAR DEBILITATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL \\u00c9BOLA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS ARCOS PLANTARES. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE AFECTA LA COAGULACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA Y LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR, AYUDANDO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTERNA Y EL DEBILITAMIENTO MUSCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE SPLEEN AND LIVER TO MONITOR FOR HEMORRHAGIC TENDENCIES AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY\'S FILTRATION SYSTEM DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL BAZO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO PARA MONITOREAR TENDENCIAS HEMORR\\u00c1GICAS Y APOYAR EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/45','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:52:18','2026-04-26 20:52:18'),(3849,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',46,'{\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS ALBUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE ARCUATE LINE OF THE PELVIS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ELIMINATE DERMATOLOGICAL IMPURITIES AND ADDRESSES METABOLIC INTERFERENCES THAT CAN BE MISINTERPRETED AS DIABETIC SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL STAFILOCOCO ALBO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LA L\\u00cdNEA ARQUEADA DE LA PELVIS. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ELIMINAR IMPUREZAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS Y ABORDA INTERFERENCIAS METAB\\u00d3LICAS QUE PUEDEN SER MALINTERPRETADAS COMO S\\u00cdNTOMAS DIAB\\u00c9TICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE LIVER AND KIDNEYS TO ENSURE THAT TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE OF STAPHYLOCOCCUS ARE PROPERLY FILTERED AND THAT BLOOD SUGAR READINGS STABILIZE.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL ESTAFILOCOCO SEAN FILTRADAS CORRECTAMENTE Y QUE LAS LECTURAS DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE SE ESTABILICEN.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/46','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:53:21','2026-04-26 20:53:21'),(3850,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',47,'{\"symptoms\":\"OTITIS, SINUSITIS, CENTAL NERVOUS SYSTEM PROBLEMS, IRRITABILITY, AND ASTHMA. (OTITIS, SINUSITIS, PROBLEMAS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, IRRITABILIDAD Y ASMA.)\",\"paths\":\"LARYNGEAL SYMPTOMOLOGY, DISCHARGE IN THE THYROID, PARATHYROID AND PAROTID. (SINTOMATOLOG\\u00cdA LAR\\u00cdNGEA, SECRECI\\u00d3N EN LA TIROIDES, PARATIROIDES Y PAR\\u00d3TIDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RECOMMEND CLIENT TO USE; NEW TOOTHBRUSH AND HAIR BRUSH. (RECOMENDAR AL CLIENTE USAR; CEPILLO DE DIENTES NUEVO Y CEPILLO PARA EL CABELLO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"OTITIS, SINUSITIS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM PROBLEMS, IRRITABILITY, AND ASTHMA.\\n\\n(OTITIS, SINUSITIS, PROBLEMAS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, IRRITABILIDAD Y ASMA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RABIES VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE AXILLARY REGION. THIS RESET ADDRESSES LARYNGEAL SYMPTOMOLOGY AND REGULATES DISCHARGES IN THE THYROID, PARATHYROID, AND PAROTID GLANDS, STABILIZING THE BIOFIELD TO REDUCE RESPIRATORY AND NERVOUS SYSTEM IRRITATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA RABIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N AXILAR. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA SINTOMATOLOG\\u00cdA LAR\\u00cdNGEA Y REGULA LAS SECRECIONES EN LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS TIROIDES, PARATIROIDES Y PAR\\u00d3TIDA, ESTABILIZANDO EL BIOCAMPO PARA REDUCIR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HYGIENE PROTOCOL: RECOMMEND THE CLIENT USE A NEW TOOTHBRUSH AND HAIRBRUSH TO PREVENT RE-INOCULATION. SCAN THE LARYNX AND BRACHIAL PLEXUS TO ENSURE NO RESIDUAL VIRAL RESONANCE REMAINS.\\n\\n(PROTOCOLO DE HIGIENE: RECOMENDAR AL CLIENTE USAR UN CEPILLO DE DIENTES Y UN CEPILLO PARA EL CABELLO NUEVOS PARA EVITAR LA REINOCULACI\\u00d3N. ESCANEAR LA LARINGE Y EL PLEXO BRAQUIAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO QUEDE RESONANCIA VIRAL RESIDUAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/47','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:54:50','2026-04-26 20:54:50'),(3851,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',48,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES (ALERGIAS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE MODULATION (MODULACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES, SKIN IRRITATION, AND RESPIRATORY SENSITIVITY.\\n(ALERGIAS, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL Y SENSIBILIDAD RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE INTERACTION BETWEEN THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM AND THE MASTER IMMUNE GLAND BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE AXILLARY AND THYMUS REGIONS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO REGULATE EXAGGERATED IMMUNE RESPONSES (ALLERGIES) AND PROMOTES THE PROPER MATURATION OF T-CELLS TO DISTINGUISH BETWEEN PATHOGENS AND HARMLESS SUBSTANCES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA INMUNITARIA MAESTRA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS REGIONES AXILAR Y DEL TIMO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA REGULAR LAS RESPUESTAS INMUNITARIAS EXAGERADAS (ALERGIAS) Y PROMUEVE LA MADURACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS T PARA DISTINGUIR ENTRE PAT\\u00d3GENOS Y SUSTANCIAS INOFENSIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ALLERGY CHECK: SCAN THE LIVER AND ADRENAL GLANDS TO REDUCE SYSTEMIC HISTAMINE LEVELS AND SUPPORT THE BODY\'S ANTI-INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE.\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ALERGIAS: ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES PARA REDUCIR LOS NIVELES SIST\\u00c9MICOS DE HISTAMINA Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA ANTIINFLAMATORIA DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/48','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:55:56','2026-04-26 20:55:56'),(3852,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',49,'{\"origins\":\"LISTERIAII\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"LISTERIA (LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, CHILLS, MUSCLE ACHES, NAUSEA, DIARRHEA, AND POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS IF IT SPREADS TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n(FIEBRE, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, DOLORES MUSCULARES, N\\u00c1USEAS, DIARREA Y POSIBLES S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS SI SE EXTIENDE AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS LISTERIA BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE ASCENDING COLON. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ELIMINATE FOODBORNE PATHOGENS THAT CAN CAUSE INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION AND PREVENTS THE SPREAD OF THE INFECTION TO OTHER SYSTEMIC ORGANS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA LISTERIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL COLON ASCENDENTE. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ELIMINAR LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE ORIGEN ALIMENTARIO QUE PUEDEN CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y PREVIENE LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N A OTROS \\u00d3RGANOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ECOLOGICAL CHECK: SCAN THE LIVER AND CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM (MEDULLA OBLONGATA) TO ENSURE THE BACTERIAL LOAD IS NOT CAUSING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY OR MENINGEAL IRRITATION.\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ECOL\\u00d3GICA: ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL (BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA CARGA BACTERIANA NO EST\\u00c9 CAUSANDO TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA O IRRITACI\\u00d3N MEN\\u00cdNGEA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/49','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:57:17','2026-04-26 20:57:17'),(3853,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',50,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DYSFUNCTION OF THE ASCENDING COLON (DISFUNCION DEL COLON ASCENDENTE)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL MOTILITY (MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DYSFUNCTION OF THE ASCENDING COLON, CONSTIPATION, GAS, AND DIGESTIVE SLUGGISHNESS.\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL COLON ASCENDENTE, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, GASES Y LENTITUD DIGESTIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE MECHANICAL AND ABSORPTIVE FUNCTIONS OF THE FIRST SEGMENT OF THE LARGE INTESTINE. BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS IN THE ASCENDING COLON (PLACED HORIZONTALLY), THIS RESET STABILIZES THE PH TO IMPROVE PERISTALSIS, OPTIMIZE WATER REABSORPTION, AND RESOLVE CHRONIC DYSFUNCTION WITHOUT THE PRESENCE OF A SPECIFIC PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LAS FUNCIONES MEC\\u00c1NICAS Y DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N DEL PRIMER SEGMENTO DEL INTESTINO GRUESO. MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO EN EL COLON ASCENDENTE (COLOCADO HORIZONTALMENTE), ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH PARA MEJORAR EL PERISTALTISMO, OPTIMIZAR LA REABSORCI\\u00d3N DE AGUA Y RESOLVER LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA SIN LA PRESENCIA DE UN PAT\\u00d3GENO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE DESCENDING COLON AND SIGMOID COLON TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE ELIMINATION ROUTE IS CLEAR AND FUNCTIONING HARMONIOUSLY.\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL COLON DESCENDENTE Y EL COLON SIGMOIDES PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA RUTA DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9 DESPEJADA Y FUNCIONANDO ARMONIOSAMENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/50','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 20:58:28','2026-04-26 20:58:28'),(3854,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',51,'{\"name\":\"ASCENDING COLON (Colon ascendente)\\/DESCENDING COLON (Colon descendente)\",\"origins\":\"VARICELA - ZOSTER (Varicela \\u2013 Z\\u00f3ster)\",\"symptoms\":\"SHINGLE, HEMORRHOIDS, ULCERS \\/ (Herpes z\\u00f3ster, Hemorroides, \\u00dalceras)\",\"paths\":\"PAINFUL VESICULAR RASH IN THE SKIN AREAS OF THE SENSORY NERVES, USUALLY IN THE CHEST AREA (KNOWN AS THE QUEENS\'S GIRDLE OR SHINGLES) AND TO A LESSER EXTENT IN THE CRANIAL AREA. \\/ (Erupci\\u00f3n vesicular dolorosa en las \\u00e1reas cut\\u00e1neas de los nervios sensitivos, generalmente en la zona del pecho (conocida como cintur\\u00f3n de la reina o herpes z\\u00f3ster) y en menor medida en la regi\\u00f3n craneal.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK URETER   CHECK - STOMACH\\/DUODENUM (RESERVOIR) \\/(Revisar ur\\u00e9ter) Revisar \\u2013 Est\\u00f3mago\\/Duodeno (Reservorio)\"}','{\"name\":\"ASCENDING COLON (COLON ASCENDENTE) \\/ DESCENDING COLON (COLON DESCENDENTE)\",\"origins\":\"VARICELLA-ZOSTER (VARICELA-Z\\u00d3STER)\",\"symptoms\":\"SHINGLES, PAINFUL VESICULAR RASH, HEMORRHOIDS, AND ULCERS.\\n(HERPES Z\\u00d3STER, ERUPCI\\u00d3N VESICULAR DOLOROSA, HEMORROIDES Y \\u00daLCERAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE VARICELLA-ZOSTER VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE ASCENDING AND DESCENDING COLON AXIS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE VIRUS RESPONSIBLE FOR SHINGLES, WHICH OFTEN MANIFESTS AS A PAINFUL RASH ALONG SENSORY NERVES IN THE CHEST (QUEEN\'S GIRDLE) OR CRANIAL REGIONS, WHILE ALSO RESOLVING SECONDARY INFLAMMATION IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA VARICELA-Z\\u00d3STER MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DEL COLON ASCENDENTE Y DESCENDENTE. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA EL VIRUS RESPONSABLE DEL HERPES Z\\u00d3STER, QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO UNA ERUPCI\\u00d3N DOLOROSA A LO LARGO DE LOS NERVIOS SENSITIVOS EN EL PECHO (CINTUR\\u00d3N DE LA REINA) O LAS REGIONES CRANEALES, AL TIEMPO QUE RESUELVE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SECUNDARIA EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR CHECK: SCAN THE URETER AND THE STOMACH\\/DUODENUM AXIS TO IDENTIFY POTENTIAL VIRAL RESERVOIRS THAT MAY CAUSE RECURRENCE.\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO: ESCANEAR EL UR\\u00c9TER Y EL EJE EST\\u00d3MAGO\\/DUODENO PARA IDENTIFICAR POSIBLES RESERVORIOS VIRALES QUE PUEDAN CAUSAR RECURRENCIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/51','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:00:01','2026-04-26 21:00:01'),(3855,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',52,'{\"symptoms\":\"JAUNDICE, CHRONIC FATIGUE, DIARRHEA, MYOPATHY, YELLOW FEVER, PULMONARY DISEASE (ICTERICIA, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, DIARREA, MIOPAT\\u00cdA, FIEBRE AMARILLA, ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY ANIMALS. HEPATITIS A, JAUNDICE MUSCLE PAIN, LACK OF APPETITE. WEIGHT LOSS DUE FROM. DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, PROTEIN DEFICIENCY. (TRANSMITIDO POR ANIMALES. HEPATITIS A, ICTERICIA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FALTA DE APETITO. P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO DEBIDO A TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DEFICIENCIA DE PROTE\\u00cdNAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"JAUNDICE, CHRONIC FATIGUE, DIARRHEA, MYOPATHY, YELLOW FEVER, AND PULMONARY DISEASE.\\n(ICTERICIA, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, DIARREA, MIOPAT\\u00cdA, FIEBRE AMARILLA Y ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE PASTEURELLA PICORNAVIRIDAE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ASCENDING COLON AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. THIS RESET ADDRESSES PATHOGENS OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY ANIMALS (HEPATITIS A), STABILIZING THE BIOFIELD TO RESOLVE MUSCLE PAIN, LACK OF APPETITE, AND WEIGHT LOSS STEMMING FROM DIGESTIVE DISORDERS AND PROTEIN DEFICIENCY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS PASTEURELLA PICORNAVIRIDAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON ASCENDENTE Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA PAT\\u00d3GENOS A MENUDO TRANSMITIDOS POR ANIMALES (HEPATITIS A), ESTABILIZANDO EL BIOCAMPO PARA RESOLVER EL DOLOR MUSCULAR, LA FALTA DE APETITO Y LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO DERIVADA DE TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS Y DEFICIENCIA DE PROTE\\u00cdNAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC CHECK: SCAN THE LIVER AND BILE DUCTS TO ENSURE THERE IS NO RESIDUAL JAUNDICE OR BILE STASIS CONTRIBUTING TO CHRONIC FATIGUE.\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA: ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LAS V\\u00cdAS BILIARES PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA ICTERICIA RESIDUAL O ESTASIS BILIAR QUE CONTRIBUYA A LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/52','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:01:14','2026-04-26 21:01:14'),(3856,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',53,'{\"paths\":\"MANIFESTATIONS IN THE LUNG, PRODUCING MUCUS WITHIN. BLEEDING AND INFLAMMATION, STIMULATES THE FLU. WHEN THESE BACTERIA RESONATE, IT CAN BE CONSIDERED A OPPORTUNISTIC PATHOGEN AND LEAD TO SEPSIS. TRANSMITTED BY EXPELLED DROPLETS FORM SNEEZING AND COUGHING. (MANIFESTACIONES EN EL PULM\\u00d3N, PRODUCIENDO MUCOSIDAD. HEMORRAGIA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N, ESTIMULA LA GRIPE. CUANDO ESTAS BACTERIAS RESUENAN, PUEDE CONSIDERARSE UN PAT\\u00d3GENO OPORTUNISTA Y LLEVAR A SEPSIS. SE TRANSMITE POR GOT\\u00cdCULAS EXPULSADAS AL ESTORNUDAR Y TOSER.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ASCENDING COLON COLON\\/LIVER           CHECK - UPPER MAXILLA (REVISAR \\u2013 COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ H\\u00cdGADO\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 MAXILAR SUPERIOR)\"}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ASCENDING COLON AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. THIS RESET ADDRESSES MANIFESTATIONS IN THE LUNGS, SUCH AS EXCESSIVE MUCUS, BLEEDING, AND INFLAMMATION. IT PREVENTS THE BACTERIA FROM ACTING AS AN OPPORTUNISTIC PATHOGEN THAT COULD LEAD TO SEPSIS, ESPECIALLY WHEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH RESPIRATORY DROPLETS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON ASCENDENTE Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS MANIFESTACIONES EN LOS PULMONES, COMO EL EXCESO DE MUCOSIDAD, HEMORRAGIA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N. EVITA QUE LA BACTERIA ACT\\u00daE EN CALIDAD DE PAT\\u00d3GENO OPORTUNISTA QUE PODR\\u00cdA LLEVAR A UNA SEPSIS, ESPECIALMENTE CUANDO SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE GOT\\u00cdCULAS RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ECOLOGICAL CHECK: SCAN THE ASCENDING COLON \\/ LIVER AXIS AND THE UPPER MAXILLA TO ENSURE COMPREHENSIVE CLEARANCE OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND TO SUPPORT RESPIRATORY RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ECOL\\u00d3GICA: ESCANEAR EL EJE COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ H\\u00cdGADO Y EL MAXILAR SUPERIOR PARA ASEGURAR UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/53','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:02:25','2026-04-26 21:02:25'),(3857,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',54,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEPATITIS E, GASTRITIS, INSOMNIA, LUNG ABCESS, FALSE PNEUMONIA, HEADACHE, UTI ANS GESTATIONAL DIABETES. (HEPATITIS E, GASTRITIS, INSOMNIO, ABSCESO PULMONAR, NEUMON\\u00cdA FALSA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, INFECCI\\u00d3N URINARIA Y DIABETES GESTACIONAL)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS E, ONES SHOW SIGNS OF TIREDNESS AND FATIGUE. SEXUAL RELUCTANCE AND CHILD BIRTH LABOR. INSOMNIA, DROWSINESS AND DIARRHEA IN INFANTS.IN THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM IT, LUNG ABSCESSES, PLEURAL PAIN, AND FALSE PNEUMONIA. MAY ASSOCIATE AND PRODUCE URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS. (HEPATITIS E, SE PRESENTAN SIGNOS DE CANSANCIO Y FATIGA. RECHAZO SEXUAL Y TRABAJO DE PARTO. INSOMNIO, SOMNOLENCIA Y DIARREA EN LACTANTES. EN EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO, ABSCESOS PULMONARES, DOLOR PLEURAL Y NEUMON\\u00cdA FALSA. PUEDE ASOCIARSE Y PRODUCIR INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK -ASCENDING COLON\\/KIDNEY (R) CHECK - UPPER MAXILLA (REVISAR \\u2013 COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 MAXILAR SUPERIOR)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEPATITIS E, GASTRITIS, INSOMNIA, LUNG ABSCESS, FALSE PNEUMONIA, HEADACHE, UTI, AND GESTATIONAL DIABETES.\\n\\n(HEPATITIS E, GASTRITIS, INSOMNIO, ABSCESO PULMONAR, NEUMON\\u00cdA FALSA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, INFECCI\\u00d3N URINARIA Y DIABETES GESTACIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS KLEBSIELLA PNEUMONIAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ASCENDING COLON AND THE LIVER. THIS RESET ADDRESSES HEPATITIS E MANIFESTATIONS\\u2014SUCH AS EXTREME FATIGUE AND TIREDNESS\\u2014AND RESOLVES RESPIRATORY COMPLICATIONS LIKE LUNG ABSCESSES OR PLEURAL PAIN. IT IS ALSO CRITICAL FOR STABILIZING METABOLIC DISRUPTIONS LIKE GESTATIONAL DIABETES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA KLEBSIELLA PNEUMONIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON ASCENDENTE Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS MANIFESTACIONES DE LA HEPATITIS E \\u2014COMO FATIGA Y CANSANCIO EXTREMO\\u2014 Y RESUELVE COMPLICACIONES RESPIRATORIAS COMO ABSCESOS PULMONARES O DOLOR PLEURAL. TAMBI\\u00c9N ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ESTABILIZAR ALTERACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS COMO LA DIABETES GESTACIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ECOLOGICAL CHECK: SCAN THE ASCENDING COLON \\/ KIDNEY (R) AND THE UPPER MAXILLA TO ENSURE COMPLETE NEUTRALIZATION OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND TO SUPPORT FULL RESPIRATORY AND DIGESTIVE RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ECOL\\u00d3GICA: ESCANEAR EL EJE COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) Y EL MAXILAR SUPERIOR PARA ASEGURAR LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y APOYAR UNA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y DIGESTIVA INTEGRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/54','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:03:37','2026-04-26 21:03:37'),(3858,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',55,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"COUGH (TOS)\",\"paths\":\"TRACH, BRONCHIAL DISORDERS, WITH A CHRONIC COUGH. (TRASTORNOS TRAQUEALES Y BRONQUIALES, CON TOS CR\\u00d3NICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY AXIS (EJE RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC COUGH, TRACHEAL DISORDERS, AND BRONCHIAL IRRITATION.\\n\\n(TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, TRASTORNOS TRAQUEALES E IRRITACI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS RESPIRATORY SYSTEM EFFICIENCY BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ASCENDING COLON AND THE PYLORUS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE PH TO RESOLVE REFLEXIVE COUGHS AND BRONCHIAL DISORDERS THAT STEM FROM AN IMBALANCE IN THE DIGESTIVE-RESPIRATORY FEEDBACK LOOP.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA EFICIENCIA DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL COLON ASCENDENTE Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH PARA RESOLVER LA TOS REFLEJA Y LOS TRASTORNOS BRONQUIALES QUE SURGEN DE UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN EL CIRCUITO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVO-RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE TRACHEA AND BRONCHI DIRECTLY TO ADDRESS LOCAL INFLAMMATION, AND CHECK THE ESOPHAGUS TO RULE OUT REFLUX-INDUCED RESPIRATORY IRRITATION.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA TR\\u00c1QUEA Y LOS BRONQUIOS DIRECTAMENTE PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL, Y REVISAR EL ES\\u00d3FAGO PARA DESCARTAR IRRITACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA INDUCIDA POR REFLUJO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/55','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:05:16','2026-04-26 21:05:16'),(3859,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',56,'{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, CPD, CYSTIC FIBROSIS (NEUMON\\u00cdA, EPOC, FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA)\",\"paths\":\"PNEUMONIA, WITH DEBILITATING PULMONARY DISEASE OR IMMUNE DEPRESSED DISEASE. (NEUMON\\u00cdA, CON ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR DEBILITANTE O ENFERMEDAD INMUNODEPRIMIDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, COPD, CYSTIC FIBROSIS, AND DEBILITATING PULMONARY DISEASE.\\n\\n(NEUMON\\u00cdA, EPOC, FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA Y ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR DEBILITANTE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE BURKHOLDERIA CEPACIA COMPLEX BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ASCENDING COLON AND THE SACRUM. THIS RESET IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SEVERE RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS IN IMMUNE-DEPRESSED PATIENTS, HELPING TO CLEAR PULMONARY PATHOGENS THAT OFTEN COMPLICATE CHRONIC CONDITIONS LIKE CYSTIC FIBROSIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL COMPLEJO BURKHOLDERIA CEPACIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON ASCENDENTE Y EL SACRO. ESTE REINICIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS GRAVES EN PACIENTES INMUNODEPRIMIDOS, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS PULMONARES QUE A MENUDO COMPLICAN CONDICIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS COMO LA FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE SUPPORT: SCAN THE THYMUS AND SPLEEN TO STRENGTHEN THE BODY\'S DEFENSE AGAINST SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL SPREAD, AND MONITOR THE LUNGS DIRECTLY FOR RESIDUAL CONGESTION.\\n\\n(APOYO INMUNITARIO: ESCANEAR EL TIMO Y EL BAZO PARA FORTALECER LA DEFENSA DEL CUERPO CONTRA LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA SIST\\u00c9MICA, Y MONITOREAR LOS PULMONES DIRECTAMENTE PARA DETECTAR CONGESTI\\u00d3N RESIDUAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/56','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:06:19','2026-04-26 21:06:19'),(3860,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',57,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"JEALOUSY (CELOS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC RESONANCE (RESONANCIA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"JEALOUSY, INSECURITY, AND EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(CELOS, INSEGURIDAD E INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EMOTIONAL BIOFIELD BY NEUTRALIZING DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT ATLAS (FIRST CERVICAL VERTEBRA) AND THE UTERUS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC AXIS TO RELEASE ACCUMULATED TENSIONS RELATED TO JEALOUSY AND POSSESSIVENESS, PROMOTING A SENSE OF INTERNAL SECURITY AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL BIOCAMPO EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES ENTRE EL ATLAS IZQUIERDO (PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL) Y EL \\u00daTERO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO PARA LIBERAR TENSIONES ACUMULADAS RELACIONADAS CON LOS CELOS Y LA POSESIVIDAD, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SEGURIDAD INTERNA Y EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: SCAN THE HEART AND AMYGDALA TO ADDRESS SECONDARY EMOTIONAL TRIGGERS AND SUPPORT THE INTEGRATION OF A SECURE ATTACHMENT RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: ESCANEAR EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y LA AM\\u00cdGDALA PARA ABORDAR DESENCADENANTES EMOCIONALES SECUNDARIOS Y APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE UNA RESPUESTA DE APEGO SEGURO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/57','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:07:32','2026-04-26 21:07:32'),(3861,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',58,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"NYMPHOMANIA, SEXUAL DISORDERS (NINFOMAN\\u00cdA, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES)\",\"paths\":\"IT REGULATES WOMEN SEXUAL INTEREST. THIS CAN BE IN AN EXCESS OR DEFECT, AS FRIGID AND LACK OF DESIRE. (REGULA EL INTER\\u00c9S SEXUAL DE LA MUJER. ESTE PUEDE PRESENTARSE EN EXCESO O DEFECTO, COMO FRIGIDEZ Y FALTA DE DESEO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SEXUAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N SEXUAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"NYMPHOMANIA, SEXUAL DISORDERS, FRIGIDITY, AND LACK OF DESIRE.\\n\\n(NINFOMAN\\u00cdA, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES, FRIGIDEZ Y FALTA DE DESEO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF SEXUAL INTEREST BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN BOTH ATLAS VERTEBRAE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE PH TO BALANCE LIBIDO, ADDRESSING BOTH EXCESSIVE SEXUAL COMPULSION AND DEFICITS IN DESIRE OR SEXUAL RESPONSIVENESS IN WOMEN.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL INTER\\u00c9S SEXUAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE AMBAS V\\u00c9RTEBRAS ATLAS. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL PH PARA EQUILIBRAR LA LIBIDO, ABORDANDO TANTO LA COMPULSI\\u00d3N SEXUAL EXCESIVA COMO LOS D\\u00c9FICIT EN EL DESEO O LA RESPUESTA SEXUAL EN LAS MUJERES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HORMONAL AXIS: SCAN THE PITUITARY GLAND AND THE OVARIES TO ENSURE THAT ENDOCRINE FUNCTION IS SUPPORTING HEALTHY SEXUAL DRIVE AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(EJE HORMONAL: ESCANEAR LA GL\\u00c1NDULA HIP\\u00d3FISIS Y LOS OVARIOS PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA EST\\u00c9 APOYANDO UN IMPULSO SEXUAL SALUDABLE Y LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/58','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:09:27','2026-04-26 21:09:27'),(3862,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',59,'{\"name\":\"ATLAS (ATLAS)\\/PYLORUS (P\\u00edloro)\",\"symptoms\":\"MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA (Malaria, Fibromialgia)\",\"paths\":\"EXTREME JOINT PAIN AND FATIGUE. (Dolor articular extremo y fatiga)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CERVICAL 1\\/PYLORUS (Revisar \\u2013 Cervical 1 \\/ P\\u00edloro)\"}','{\"name\":\"ATLAS (ATLAS) \\/ PYLORUS (P\\u00cdLORO)\",\"symptoms\":\"MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, EXTREME JOINT PAIN, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, DOLOR ARTICULAR EXTREMO Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE PLASMODIUM FALCIPARUM PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ATLAS VERTEBRA AND THE PYLORUS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC TOXICITY THAT MANIFESTS AS SEVERE JOINT PAIN AND CHRONIC EXHAUSTION, OFTEN MISTAKEN FOR FIBROMYALGIA OR RHEUMATIC CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO PLASMODIUM FALCIPARUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA V\\u00c9RTEBRA ATLAS Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLOR ARTICULAR INTENSO Y AGOTAMIENTO CR\\u00d3NICO, A MENUDO CONFUNDIDO CON FIBROMIALGIA O CONDICIONES REUM\\u00c1TICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: CHECK CERVICAL 1 \\/ PYLORUS TO ENSURE FULL NEUTRALIZATION. SCAN THE LIVER AND SPLEEN TO MONITOR FOR PARASITIC LOAD AND SUPPORT THE RECOVERY OF RED BLOOD CELLS.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: REVISAR CERVICAL 1 \\/ P\\u00cdLORO PARA ASEGURAR UNA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA. ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL BAZO PARA MONITOREAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/59','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:10:50','2026-04-26 21:10:50'),(3863,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',60,'{\"name\":\"ATLAS (Atlas) \\/ UTERUS (\\u00datero)\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VAGINAL INFECTIONS (Infecciones vaginales)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"ATLAS (ATLAS) \\/ UTERUS (\\u00daTERO)\",\"origins\":\"GYNECOLOGICAL HEALTH (SALUD GINECOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL INFECTIONS, DISCHARGE, AND PELVIC DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES VAGINALES, FLUJO Y MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS VAGINAL INFECTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ATLAS VERTEBRA AND THE UTERUS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO REGULATE LOCAL FLORA AND ADDRESS INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES IN THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT, PROMOTING A BALANCED ENVIRONMENT THAT DISCOURAGES THE OVERGROWTH OF OPPORTUNISTIC PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LAS INFECCIONES VAGINALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA V\\u00c9RTEBRA ATLAS Y EL \\u00daTERO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA REGULAR LA FLORA LOCAL Y ABORDAR LAS RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS EN EL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO, PROMOVIENDO UN AMBIENTE EQUILIBRADO QUE DESALIENTA EL CRECIMIENTO EXCESIVO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS OPORTUNISTAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ECOLOGICAL CHECK: SCAN THE VAGINA AND ADNEXA TO ENSURE NO RESIDUAL BACTERIAL OR FUNGAL RESONANCE REMAINS, AND CHECK THE SACRUM TO SUPPORT PELVIC NERVE STABILITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ECOL\\u00d3GICA: ESCANEAR LA VAGINA Y LOS ANEXOS PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO QUEDE RESONANCIA BACTERIANA O F\\u00daNGICA RESIDUAL, Y REVISAR EL SACRO PARA APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD DE LOS NERVIOS P\\u00c9LVICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/60','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:12:07','2026-04-26 21:12:07'),(3864,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',61,'{\"symptoms\":\"ARRHYTHMIAS, TACHYCARDIA, GERMAN MEASLES. (ARRITMIAS, TAQUICARDIA, RUB\\u00c9OLA)\",\"paths\":\"HEART DISEASE (ENFERMEDAD CARD\\u00cdACA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ARRHYTHMIAS, TACHYCARDIA, AND GERMAN MEASLES.\\n\\n(ARRITMIAS, TAQUICARDIA Y RUB\\u00c9OLA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RUBELLA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ATRIOVENTRICULAR NODE OF THE HEART AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO CORRECT ELECTRICAL CONDUCTION ISSUES IN THE HEART, SUCH AS TACHYCARDIA OR IRREGULAR HEARTBEATS, WHILE ADDRESSING THE SYSTEMIC VIRAL INFECTION RESPONSIBLE FOR GERMAN MEASLES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA RUB\\u00c9OLA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL NODO AURICULOVENTRICULAR DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA CORREGIR PROBLEMAS DE CONDUCCI\\u00d3N EL\\u00c9CTRICA EN EL CORAZ\\u00d3N, COMO TAQUICARDIA O LATIDOS IRREGULARES, MIENTRAS ABORDA LA INFECCI\\u00d3N VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICA RESPONSABLE DE LA RUB\\u00c9OLA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIAC CHECK: SCAN THE THYMUS AND THE PERICARDIUM TO ENSURE NO ADDITIONAL INFLAMMATION IS AFFECTING HEART FUNCTION. MONITOR THE SPLEEN TO SUPPORT THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AGAINST THE VIRAL LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA: ESCANEAR EL TIMO Y EL PERICARDIO PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ADICIONAL AFECTANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA. MONITOREAR EL BAZO PARA APOYAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA CONTRA LA CARGA VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/61','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:13:27','2026-04-26 21:13:27'),(3865,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',62,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"FEAR OF LOSING MIND. (MIEDO A PERDER LA MENTE)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC AXIS (EJE PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEAR OF LOSING ONE\'S MIND.\\n(MIEDO A PERDER LA MENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EMOTIONAL BIOFIELD BY NEUTRALIZING DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ATRIOVENTRICULAR SINUS INTERCOSTAL SPACE AND THE AREA ABOVE THE CEREBELLUM. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE PSYCHOSOMATIC AXIS TO ALLEVIATE DEEP ANXIETY AND THE OBSESSIVE FEAR OF LOSING MENTAL CONTROL OR SANITY, PROMOTING A SENSE OF CLARITY AND PSYCHOLOGICAL SECURITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL BIOCAMPO EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES ENTRE EL ESPACIO INTERCOSTAL DEL SENO AURICULOVENTRICULAR Y LA REGI\\u00d3N SOBRE EL CEREBELO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO PARA ALIVIAR LA ANGUSTIA PROFUNDA Y EL TEMOR OBSESIVO A LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL CONTROL MENTAL O LA LOCURA, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CLARIDAD Y SEGURIDAD PSICOL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE AXIS: SCAN THE AMYGDALA AND TEMPORAL LOBE TO ADDRESS THE SURVIVAL RESPONSE (FIGHT OR FLIGHT) AND CHECK THE ATRIOVENTRICULAR NODE TO ENSURE THE HEART RHYTHM IS SYNCHRONIZED WITH A STATE OF MENTAL CALM.\\n\\n(EJE DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA AM\\u00cdGDALA Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL PARA ABORDAR LA RESPUESTA DE SUPERVIVENCIA (LUCHA O HUIDA) Y REVISAR EL NODO AURICULOVENTRICULAR PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO EST\\u00c9 SINCRONIZADO CON UN ESTADO DE CALMA MENTAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/62','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:20:49','2026-04-26 21:20:49'),(3866,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',63,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CHOLESTEROL, LIPIDS, TRIGLYCERIDES BALANCING. (EQUILIBRIO DE COLESTEROL, L\\u00cdPIDOS Y TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH CHOLESTEROL, TRIGLYCERIDE IMBALANCE, AND LIPID DISORDERS.\\n(COLESTEROL ALTO, DESEQUILIBRIO DE TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS Y TRASTORNOS DE L\\u00cdPIDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SYSTEMIC MANAGEMENT OF FATS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ATRIOVENTRICULAR SINUS AND THE HEART. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO BALANCE CHOLESTEROL, LIPIDS, AND TRIGLYCERIDES, PREVENTING VASCULAR ACCUMULATION AND PROMOTING HEALTHY CIRCULATORY FUNCTION THROUGH THE HARMONIZATION OF CARDIAC METABOLISM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL MANEJO SIST\\u00c9MICO DE LAS GRASAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SENO AURICULOVENTRICULAR Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA EQUILIBRAR EL COLESTEROL, LOS L\\u00cdPIDOS Y LOS TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS, PREVINIENDO LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y PROMOVIENDO UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N CIRCULATORIA SALUDABLE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA ARMONIZACI\\u00d3N DEL METABOLISMO CARD\\u00cdACO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC CHECK: SCAN THE LIVER AND PANCREAS TO ENSURE PROPER ENZYMATIC PROCESSING OF FATS, AND CHECK THE ATRIOVENTRICULAR NODE TO MONITOR ELECTRICAL COORDINATION.\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA: ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL P\\u00c1NCREAS PARA ASEGURAR EL PROCESAMIENTO ENZIM\\u00c1TICO ADECUADO DE LAS GRASAS, Y REVISAR EL NODO AURICULOVENTRICULAR PARA MONITOREAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N EL\\u00c9CTRICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/63','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:21:57','2026-04-26 21:21:57'),(3867,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',64,'{\"symptoms\":\"EAR INFECTION, SINUS, ASTHMA, PHOTOPHOBIA, PSYCHO-EMOTIONAL, PIGMENTOSAS, RETINITIS, KYPHOSIS, THYROTROPIN, MOTION SICKNESS, RHINITIS, MACULOPATHTY, KERATOCONUS, CYSTIC FIBROSIS, FASE LYMPHOMA, OSREOSARCOMA. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE O\\u00cdDO, SENOS PARANASALES, ASMA, FOTOFOBIA, PSICOEMOCIONAL, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, RETINITIS, CIFOSIS, TIROTROPINA, MAREO POR MOVIMIENTO, RINITIS, MACULOPAT\\u00cdA, QUERATOCONO, FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA, LINFOMA DE HODGKIN, OSTEOSARCOMA)\",\"paths\":\"LARYNGEAL DISORDERS, RESPIRATORY  DISORDERS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM PROBLEMS AND DISORDERS. IMPAIRED THYROID AND PARATHYROID. SKIN PROBLEMS AND ALLERGIES, ESPECIALLY FROM THE WAIST UP. ECZEMA, AND ROSACEA ON THE FACE. FALSE PNEUMONIA, LUPUS AND ALZHEIMER\'S. TRASTORNOS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS, PROBLEMAS Y TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LA TIROIDES Y PARATIROIDES. PROBLEMAS DE LA PIEL Y ALERGIAS, ESPECIALMENTE DE LA CINTURA HACIA ARRIBA. ECCEMA Y ROS\\u00c1CEA EN EL ROSTRO. NEUMON\\u00cdA FALSA, LUPUS Y ALZHEIMER.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CARINA. CAN PRODUCE SJOGREN SYNDROME            RECOMMEND TO\\n THROW AWAY TOOTHBRUSHES, LIPSTICK, AND OTHER CONTAGIOUS OBJECTS.\\n(REVISAR \\u2013 CARINA. PUEDE PRODUCIR S\\u00cdNDROME DE SJ\\u00d6GREN. SE RECOMIENDA DESECHAR CEPILLOS DE DIENTES, L\\u00c1PIZ LABIAL Y OTROS OBJETOS CONTAGIOSOS.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"EAR INFECTION, SINUSITIS, ASTHMA, PHOTOPHOBIA, PSYCHO-EMOTIONAL DISORDERS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, KYPHOSIS, MOTION SICKNESS, RHINITIS, MACULOPATHY, KERATOCONUS, CYSTIC FIBROSIS, HODGKIN\'S LYMPHOMA, AND OSTEOSARCOMA.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DE O\\u00cdDO, SENOS PARANASALES, ASMA, FOTOFOBIA, TRASTORNOS PSICOEMOCIONALES, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, CIFOSIS, MAREO POR MOVIMIENTO, RINITIS, MACULOPAT\\u00cdA, QUERATOCONO, FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA, LINFOMA DE HODGKIN Y OSTEOSARCOMA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RABIES VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE AXILLARY REGIONS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS LARYNGEAL AND RESPIRATORY DISORDERS, AS WELL AS CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IMBALANCES. IT IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING SKIN ISSUES AND ALLERGIES FROM THE WAIST UP (SUCH AS ROSACEA OR ECZEMA) AND REGULATING THYROID AND PARATHYROID DYSFUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA RABIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS REGIONES AXILARES. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR TRASTORNOS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS Y RESPIRATORIOS, AS\\u00cd COMO DESEQUILIBRIOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESOLVER PROBLEMAS DE LA PIEL Y ALERGIAS DE LA CINTURA HACIA ARRIBA (COMO ROS\\u00c1CEA O ECCEMA) Y REGULAR LAS DISFUNCIONES DE LA TIROIDES Y PARATIROIDES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: SCAN THE CARINA TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL SJ\\u00d6GREN SYNDROME COMPLICATIONS. IT IS RECOMMENDED TO DISCARD CONTAGIOUS OBJECTS SUCH AS TOOTHBRUSHES OR LIPSTICKS TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: REVISAR LA CARINA PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES DEL S\\u00cdNDROME DE SJ\\u00d6GREN. SE RECOMIENDA DESECHAR OBJETOS CONTAGIOSOS COMO CEPILLOS DE DIENTES O L\\u00c1PICES LABIALES PARA PREVENIR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/64','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:23:39','2026-04-26 21:23:39'),(3868,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',65,'{\"symptoms\":\"PSORIASIS, RENAL DISORDER, ENURESIS, SCARLET FEVER. PSORIASIS, TRASTORNO RENAL, ENURESIS, ESCARLATINA)\",\"paths\":\"SKIN DISORDER, BLADDER INFLAMMATION, CAUSING FREQUENT URINATION. NOCTURIA IN CHILDREN AND INCOTINENCE FOR ADULTS. SEVERE LOW BACK. (TRASTORNO DE LA PIEL, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA, CAUSANDO MICCI\\u00d3N FRECUENTE. NOCTURIA EN NI\\u00d1OS E INCONTINENCIA EN ADULTOS. DOLOR LUMBAR SEVERO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PSORIASIS, RENAL DISORDER, ENURESIS, AND SCARLET FEVER. PSORIASIS, TRASTORNO RENAL, ENURESIS, ESCARLATINA)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS G BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE AXILLARY ARTERIES. THIS RESET ADDRESSES SKIN DISORDERS AND BLADDER INFLAMMATION THAT LEADS TO URINARY DYSFUNCTION. IT IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING FREQUENT URINATION, NOCTURIA IN CHILDREN, AND INCONTINENCE IN ADULTS, WHILE ALSO ALLEVIATING SEVERE LOW BACK PAIN ASSOCIATED WITH RENAL STRESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA STREPTOCOCCUS G MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LAS ARTERIAS AXILARES. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA QUE DERIVAN EN DISFUNCI\\u00d3N URINARIA. ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESOLVER LA MICCI\\u00d3N FRECUENTE, LA NOCTURIA EN NI\\u00d1OS Y LA INCONTINENCIA EN ADULTOS, AL TIEMPO QUE ALIVIA EL DOLOR LUMBAR SEVERO ASOCIADO CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"URINARY CHECK: SCAN THE BLADDER AND KIDNEYS TO ENSURE THE ELIMINATION OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD IN THE EXCRETORY SYSTEM. CHECK THE SKIN RESPONSE TO MONITOR THE RESOLUTION OF PSORIASIS PATCHES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N URINARIA: ESCANEAR LA VEJIGA Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA EN EL SISTEMA EXCRETOR. REVISAR LA RESPUESTA CUT\\u00c1NEA PARA MONITOREAR LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LAS PLACAS DE PSORIASIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/65','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:25:10','2026-04-26 21:25:10'),(3869,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',66,'{\"symptoms\":\"FISHEYE ON SOLE OF FOOT, CONDYLOMAS AND WARTS ON PENIS, SCROTUM AND VAGINA. (OJO DE PESCADO EN LA PLANTA DEL PIE, CONDILOMAS Y VERRUGAS EN EL PENE, ESCROTO Y VAGINA.)\",\"paths\":\"HUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS (VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH LEPRAE - CAUSE OF CYST AND MYOMAS. (ASOCIADO CON LEPRAE \\u2013 CAUSA DE QUISTES Y MIOMAS)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FISHEYE ON SOLE OF FOOT, CONDYLOMAS AND WARTS ON PENIS, SCROTUM AND VAGINA.\\n\\n(OJO DE PESCADO EN LA PLANTA DEL PIE, CONDILOMAS Y VERRUGAS EN EL PENE, ESCROTO Y VAGINA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS (HPV) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE AXILLARY PLEXUS RESONANCE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE VIRAL ROOT CAUSE OF DERMATOLOGICAL AND MUCOSAL MANIFESTATIONS, SUCH AS WARTS OR CONDYLOMAS, PROMOTING THE NATURAL CLEARANCE OF THE VIRUS FROM THE EPITHELIAL TISSUES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO (VPH) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA RESONANCIA DEL PLEXO AXILAR. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA CAUSA VIRAL DE LAS MANIFESTACIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS Y MUCOSAS, COMO VERRUGAS O CONDILOMAS, PROMOVIENDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N NATURAL DEL VIRUS DE LOS TEJIDOS EPITELIALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH LEPRAE\\u2014CAN BE A CONTRIBUTING FACTOR IN THE FORMATION OF CYSTS AND MYOMAS. SCAN THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS TO RULE OUT COMPLICATIONS AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC VIRAL NEUTRALIZATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ASOCIADO CON LEPRAE \\u2014PUEDE SER UN FACTOR CONTRIBUYENTE EN LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE QUISTES Y MIOMAS. ESCANEAR LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES PARA DESCARTAR COMPLICACIONES Y ASEGURAR LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/66','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:42:14','2026-04-26 21:42:14'),(3870,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',67,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DOUBT (DUDA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC RESONANCE (RESONANCIA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DOUBT, INDECISION, AND LACK OF CONFIDENCE.\\n\\n(DUDA, INDECISI\\u00d3N Y FALTA DE CONFIANZA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EMOTIONAL BIOFIELD BY NEUTRALIZING DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BACKS OF BOTH HANDS. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE ENERGETIC FLOW RELATED TO EXTERNAL EXPRESSION AND ACTION, HELPING TO CLEAR REPETITIVE THOUGHTS OF DOUBT AND STRENGTHENING THE INDIVIDUAL\\u2019S CAPACITY TO MAKE DECISIONS WITH CLARITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL BIOCAMPO EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES ENTRE LOS DORSOS DE AMBAS MANOS. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO RELACIONADO CON LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N EXTERNA Y LA ACCI\\u00d3N, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR PENSAMIENTOS REPETITIVOS DE DUDA Y FORTALECIENDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL INDIVIDUO PARA TOMAR DECISIONES CON CLARIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: SCAN THE CEREBRAL CORTEX AND THE PINEAL GLAND TO ADDRESS MENTAL CLARITY AND REDUCE THE COGNITIVE LOAD OF UNCERTAINTY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: ESCANEAR EL CORTEX CEREBRAL Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL PARA ABORDAR LA CLARIDAD MENTAL Y REDUCIR LA CARGA COGNITIVA DE LA INCERTIDUMBRE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/67','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:45:47','2026-04-26 21:45:47'),(3871,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',68,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PARKINSON\'S DISEASE (ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON)\",\"paths\":\"TRUE PARKINSON\'S DISEASE (ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON VERDADERA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL AXIS (EJE NEUROL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PARKINSON\'S DISEASE, TREMORS, MOTOR COORDINATION ISSUES, AND RIGIDITY.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON, TEMBLORES, PROBLEMAS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA Y RIGIDEZ.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUROLOGICAL FEEDBACK LOOP BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BASAL NUCLEUS AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). THIS RESET ADDRESSES \\\"TRUE PARKINSON\'S\\\" BY STABILIZING THE PH IN THE BRAINSTEM AND DEEP CEREBRAL STRUCTURES, PROMOTING THE PROPER REGULATION OF DOPAMINE AND REFINING INVOLUNTARY MOTOR MOVEMENTS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL CIRCUITO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL N\\u00daCLEO BASAL Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA EL \\\"PARKINSON VERDADERO\\\" AL ESTABILIZAR EL PH EN EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO Y LAS ESTRUCTURAS CEREBRALES PROFUNDAS, PROMOVIENDO LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LA DOPAMINA Y REFINANDO LOS MOVIMIENTOS MOTORES INVOLUNTARIOS.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: SCAN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE SUBSTANTIA NIGRA TO ENSURE COMPREHENSIVE NEUROLOGICAL SUPPORT. ALSO, CHECK THE FRONTAL LOBE TO RULE OUT COGNITIVE FATIGUE ASSOCIATED WITH MOTOR DEGENERATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL CEREBELO Y LA SUSTANCIA NEGRA PARA ASEGURAR UN APOYO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO INTEGRAL. ADEM\\u00c1S, REVISAR EL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL PARA DESCARTAR FATIGA COGNITIVA ASOCIADA CON LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N MOTORA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/68','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 21:48:51','2026-04-26 21:48:51'),(3872,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',69,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HYPERACTIVE (HIPERACTIVO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC AXIS (EJE PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERACTIVITY, ANXIETY, AND RESTLESSNESS.\\n\\n(HIPERACTIVIDAD, ANSIEDAD E INQUIETUD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE BASE OF THE SKULL. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO CALM HYPERACTIVE STATES, REDUCING MENTAL ACCELERATION AND PROMOTING A STATE OF RELAXATION AND COGNITIVE BALANCE BY HARMONIZING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE BRAINSTEM AND THE BODY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA BASE DEL CR\\u00c1NEO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA CALMAR ESTADOS HIPERACTIVOS, REDUCIENDO LA ACELERACI\\u00d3N MENTAL Y PROMOVIENDO UN ESTADO DE RELAJACI\\u00d3N Y EQUILIBRIO COGNITIVO AL ARMONIZAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO Y EL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: SCAN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE POST-PINEAL REGION TO ADDRESS RESIDUAL VISUAL OR COGNITIVE OVERSTIMULATION. CHECK THE ATLAS TO ENSURE PROPER NERVE CONDUCTION AND ALIGNMENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: ESCANEAR EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y LA REGI\\u00d3N POST-PINEAL PARA ABORDAR LA SOBREESTIMULACI\\u00d3N VISUAL O COGNITIVA RESIDUAL. REVISAR EL ATLAS PARA ASEGURAR UNA CORRECTA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N Y ALINEACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/69','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:18:02','2026-04-26 22:18:02'),(3873,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',70,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DYSLEXIA, AUTISM (DISLEXIA, AUTISMO)\",\"paths\":\"REGULATES THE POISONING FROM DRUGS, INSECTICIDES, CHEMOTHERAPY (REGULA LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N POR MEDICAMENTOS, INSECTICIDAS Y QUIMIOTERAPIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"TOXIC NEURO-STIMULATION (NEUROESTIMULACI\\u00d3N T\\u00d3XICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DYSLEXIA, AUTISM, AND COGNITIVE CLOUDING.\\n\\n(DISLEXIA, AUTISMO Y NUBLADO COGNITIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF TOXICITY FROM EXTERNAL AGENTS BY BALANCING THE BIOFIELD AT THE BICEPS. THIS RESET REGULATES THE ADVERSE EFFECTS OF ACCUMULATED DRUGS, INSECTICIDES, OR CHEMOTHERAPY RESIDUES THAT MAY INTERFERE WITH NEUROLOGICAL PROCESSING, HELPING TO ALLEVIATE SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH DYSLEXIA OR AUTISTIC SPECTRUM DISORDERS LINKED TO SYSTEMIC POISONING.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA TOXICIDAD POR AGENTES EXTERNOS MEDIANTE EL EQUILIBRIO DEL BIOCAMPO EN LOS B\\u00cdCEPS. ESTE REINICIO REGULA LOS EFECTOS ADVERSOS DE MEDICAMENTOS ACUMULADOS, INSECTICIDAS O RESIDUOS DE QUIMIOTERAPIA QUE PUEDEN INTERFERIR CON EL PROCESAMIENTO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO, AYUDANDO A ALIVIAR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON LA DISLEXIA O LOS TRASTORNOS DEL ESPECTRO AUTISTA VINCULADOS A LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DETOX AXIS: SCAN THE LIVER AND THE KIDNEYS TO ENHANCE THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS. CHECK THE PARIETAL LOBE TO ADDRESS SPECIFIC COGNITIVE OR SPEECH PROCESSING CHALLENGES.\\n\\n(EJE DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N: ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES PARA POTENCIAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS. REVISAR EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL PARA ABORDAR DESAF\\u00cdOS ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS DEL PROCESAMIENTO COGNITIVO O DEL HABLA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/70','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:19:18','2026-04-26 22:19:18'),(3874,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',71,'{\"origins\":\"TRICHOPHYTON\\nTRICOFITO\",\"symptoms\":\"MYCOSIS, ALOPECIA, FOOT FUNGUS (MICOSIS, ALOPECIA, HONGOS EN LOS PIES)\",\"paths\":\"MYCOSIS OF THE NAILS AND HANDS. ATHLETE FOOT AND FOOT FUNGUS. (MICOSIS DE LAS U\\u00d1AS Y MANOS. PIE DE ATLETA Y HONGOS EN LOS PIES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CAVA CHECK - RIB 1 (REVISAR \\u2013 VENA CAVA\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 COSTILLA\"}','{\"origins\":\"TRICHOPHYTON (TRICOFITO)\",\"symptoms\":\"MYCOSIS, ALOPECIA, AND FOOT FUNGUS.\\n\\n(MICOSIS, ALOPECIA Y HONGOS EN LOS PIES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRICHOPHYTON FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE BIG TOES. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO RESOLVE MYCOSIS OF THE NAILS AND HANDS, AS WELL AS ATHLETE\'S FOOT. BY BALANCING THE LOCAL MAGNETIC POLARITY, IT DISRUPTS THE ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS FUNGAL OVERGROWTH, ADDRESSING BOTH SKIN IRRITATION AND RELATED ALOPECIA.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO TRICOFITO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS DEDOS GORDOS DEL PIE. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA RESOLVER LA MICOSIS DE LAS U\\u00d1AS Y LAS MANOS, AS\\u00cd COMO EL PIE DE ATLETA. AL EQUILIBRAR LA POLARIDAD MAGN\\u00c9TICA LOCAL, INTERRUMPE EL AMBIENTE QUE PERMITE EL CRECIMIENTO EXCESIVO DE HONGOS, ABORDANDO TANTO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL COMO LA ALOPECIA RELACIONADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: SCAN THE VENA CAVA AND RIB 1 TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC CLEARANCE OF FUNGAL SPORES. MONITOR THE DIGESTIVE TRACT TO PREVENT RE-INOCULATION FROM THE INTERNAL MICROBIOME.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA VENA CAVA Y LA 1\\u00aa COSTILLA PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LAS ESPORAS F\\u00daNGICAS. MONITOREAR EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO PARA PREVENIR LA REINOCULACI\\u00d3N DESDE EL MICROBIOMA INTERNO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/71','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:20:34','2026-04-26 22:20:34'),(3875,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',72,'{\"symptoms\":\"LYMES DISEASE, FALSE DIABETES, LIVER DISORDER, JAUNDICE, FALSE RHEUMATISM, OBESITY, IRRITABLE BOWEL (ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, FALSA DIABETES, TRASTORNO HEP\\u00c1TICO, ICTERICIA, FALSO REUMATISMO, OBESIDAD, INTESTINO IRRITABLE)\",\"paths\":\"SERIOUS NUTRITIONAL PROBLEMS AND INTOLERANCES. LIVER DISORDER. (PROBLEMAS NUTRICIONALES GRAVES E INTOLERANCIAS. TRASTORNO HEP\\u00c1TICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH KIDNEY; IT CAUSES NEPHROTIC SYNDROME.  CHECK - PANCREATIC DUCT\\/KIDNEY (L) CHECK - CLITORIS\\/PELVIS CLITORIS\\/SACRUM     CHECK - URETHRA\\/SACRUM (ASOCIADO CON EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N; CAUSA S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. REVISAR \\u2013 CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I)\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ PELVIS\\u2003CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ SACRO\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 URETRA \\/ SACRO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"LYME DISEASE, FALSE DIABETES, LIVER DISORDER, JAUNDICE, FALSE RHEUMATISM, OBESITY, AND IRRITABLE BOWEL.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, FALSA DIABETES, TRASTORNO HEP\\u00c1TICO, ICTERICIA, FALSO REUMATISMO, OBESIDAD E INTESTINO IRRITABLE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SPIROCHETE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BILE DUCT AND THE KIDNEY (RIGHT OR LEFT). THIS RESET ADDRESSES SERIOUS NUTRITIONAL PROBLEMS AND INTOLERANCES BY STABILIZING LIVER FUNCTION AND CORRECTING SYSTEMIC IMBALANCES OFTEN MISTAKEN FOR CHRONIC RHEUMATISM OR DIABETES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESPIROQUETA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CONDUCTO BILIAR Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO O IZQUIERDO). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA PROBLEMAS NUTRICIONALES GRAVES E INTOLERANCIAS AL ESTABILIZAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y CORREGIR DESEQUILIBRIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS QUE A MENUDO SE CONFUNDEN CON REUMATISMO CR\\u00d3NICO O DIABETES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH THE KIDNEY, THIS RESONANCE CAN CAUSE NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. CHECK THE PANCREATIC DUCT \\/ LEFT KIDNEY. SCAN THE CLITORIS \\/ PELVIS, CLITORIS \\/ SACRUM, AND URETHRA \\/ SACRUM TO ENSURE FULL NEUTRALIZATION.\\n\\n(ASOCIADO CON EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N; PUEDE CAUSAR S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. REVISAR CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ESCANEAR CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ PELVIS, CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ SACRO Y URETRA \\/ SACRO PARA ASEGURAR LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/72','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:21:38','2026-04-26 22:21:38'),(3876,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',73,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PATHOGEN STORAGE (ALMACENAMIENTO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"RECURRING INFECTIONS, PERSISTENT SYMPTOMS, AND ASYMPTOMATIC CARRIER STATE.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES RECURRENTES, S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTENTES Y ESTADO DE PORTADOR ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF PATHOGENIC RESERVOIRS BY BALANCING THE PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SITE OF A BITE (ANIMAL, INSECT, OR HUMAN) AND THE AXILLA ON THE SAME SIDE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ELIMINATE LATENT VIRUSES, BACTERIA, OR PARASITES THAT MAY BE HIDING IN THE LYMPHATIC NODES OR TISSUES, PREVENTING FUTURE RE-INFECTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS RESERVORIOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS MEDIANTE EL EQUILIBRIO DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LUGAR DE UNA MORDIDA (ANIMAL, INSECTO O HUMANA) Y LA AXILA DEL MISMO LADO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ELIMINAR VIRUS, BACTERIAS O PAR\\u00c1SITOS LATENTES QUE PUEDAN ESTAR OCULTOS EN LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS O TEJIDOS, PREVINIENDO FUTURAS REINFECCIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC CHECK: SCAN THE ENTIRE AXILLARY PLEXUS AND THE SPLEEN TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC CLEARANCE. IF THE BITE WAS FROM AN ANIMAL, SCAN FOR THE RABIES VIRUS (AXILLA \\/ AXILLA) AS A PRECAUTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA: ESCANEAR TODO EL PLEXO AXILAR Y EL BAZO PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. SI LA MORDIDA FUE DE UN ANIMAL, ESCANEAR EL VIRUS DE LA RABIA (AXILA \\/ AXILA) COMO PRECAUCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/73','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:22:48','2026-04-26 22:22:48'),(3877,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',74,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, OBESITY, BLOATING, GAS. (DIARREA, OBESIDAD, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, GASES)\",\"paths\":\"PROBLEMS IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT AND THE PELVIC CAVITY. RECTAL BLEEDING, MUCUS AND LOWER LIMB PROBLEMS. (PROBLEMAS EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO Y LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA. SANGRADO RECTAL, MUCOSIDAD Y PROBLEMAS EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - LUMBAR PLEXUS (REVISAR \\u2013 PLEXO LUMBAR)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, OBESITY, BLOATING, GAS, RECTAL BLEEDING, AND MUCUS.\\n\\n(DIARREA, OBESIDAD, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, GASES, SANGRADO RECTAL Y MUCOSIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS ENTEROCOCCUS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BLADDER AND THE ANUS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES DYSFUNCTION WITHIN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT AND THE PELVIC CAVITY, RESOLVING ISSUES SUCH AS LOWER LIMB DISCOMFORT, RECTAL INFLAMMATION, AND METABOLIC IMBALANCES THAT CONTRIBUTE TO WEIGHT GAIN AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ENTEROCOCO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VEJIGA Y EL ANO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO Y LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA, RESOLVIENDO PROBLEMAS COMO EL MALESTAR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RECTAL Y LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS QUE CONTRIBUYEN AL AUMENTO DE PESO Y AL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NERVE CHECK: SCAN THE LUMBAR PLEXUS TO ENSURE NEURAL COMMANDS TO THE PELVIC ORGANS ARE STABILIZED. MONITOR THE COLON TO ENSURE THE FULL ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL OVERGROWTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA: ESCANEAR EL PLEXO LUMBAR PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS COMANDOS NEURALES A LOS \\u00d3RGANOS P\\u00c9LVICOS EST\\u00c9N ESTABILIZADOS. MONITOREAR EL COLON PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DEL CRECIMIENTO BACTERIANO EXCESIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/74','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:23:59','2026-04-26 22:23:59'),(3878,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',75,'{\"symptoms\":\"DERMATITIS, CYSTITIS, PROTEINURIA, HEMATURIA, MENORRHAGIA, COLIURIA, DYSURIA, PLEURA PAIN. (DERMATITIS, CISTITIS, PROTEINURIA, HEMATURIA, MENORRAGIA, COLIURIA, DISURIA, DOLOR PLEURAL)\",\"paths\":\"MANIFEST IN THE SKIN AS DERMATITIS, WITH REDDISH SPOTS ON THE SKIN. CAUSE OF NOCTURNAL ENURESIS IN CHILDREN AND INCONTINENCE IN ADULTS. KIDNEY PROBLEMS. (SE MANIFIESTA EN LA PIEL COMO DERMATITIS, CON MANCHAS ROJIZAS EN LA PIEL. CAUSA DE ENURESIS NOCTURNA EN NI\\u00d1OS E INCONTINENCIA EN ADULTOS. PROBLEMAS RENALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH STREPTOCOCCUS A; TRUE PSORIASIS     CHECK - AUXILLIARY ARTERY (R)\\/ARTERY (L) (ASOCIADO CON ESTREPTOCOCO A; PSORIASIS VERDADERA\\u2003\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 ARTERIA AXILAR (D) \\/ ARTERIA (I))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DERMATITIS, CYSTITIS, PROTEINURIA, HEMATURIA, MENORRHAGIA, COLIURIA, DYSURIA, AND PLEURA PAIN.\\n\\n(DERMATITIS, CISTITIS, PROTEINURIA, HEMATURIA, MENORRAGIA, COLIURIA, DISURIA Y DOLOR PLEURAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS G BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE BLADDER. THIS RESET ADDRESSES MANIFESTATIONS IN THE SKIN, SUCH AS DERMATITIS WITH REDDISH SPOTS, AND IS A PRIMARY FACTOR IN RESOLVING NOCTURNAL ENURESIS IN CHILDREN AND INCONTINENCE IN ADULTS. IT ALSO SUPPORTS THE CORRECTION OF RENAL DYSFUNCTIONS AND URINARY TRACT INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO G MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA VEJIGA. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS MANIFESTACIONES EN LA PIEL, COMO LA DERMATITIS CON MANCHAS ROJIZAS, Y ES UN FACTOR PRIMARIO PARA RESOLVER LA ENURESIS NOCTURNA EN NI\\u00d1OS Y LA INCONTINENCIA EN ADULTOS. TAMBI\\u00c9N APOYA LA CORRECCI\\u00d3N DE DISFUNCIONES RENALES E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH STREPTOCOCCUS A; FOR TRUE PSORIASIS, SCAN THE AXILLARY ARTERY (R) \\/ AXILLARY ARTERY (L). MONITOR THE KIDNEY REGION TO ENSURE THE SYSTEMIC ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ASOCIADO CON ESTREPTOCOCO A; PARA PSORIASIS VERDADERA, ESCANEAR LA ARTERIA AXILAR (D) \\/ ARTERIA AXILAR (I). MONITOREAR LA REGI\\u00d3N RENAL PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/75','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:25:10','2026-04-26 22:25:10'),(3879,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',76,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"BLADDER DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ORGAN DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ORG\\u00c1NICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"BLADDER DYSFUNCTION, URINARY URGENCY, AND PELVIC DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA, URGENCIA URINARIA Y MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE FUNCTIONAL REGULATION OF THE URINARY SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MAIN BLADDER BODY AND ITS LATERAL ASPECT (SIDE). THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS NON-PATHOGENIC DYSFUNCTIONS, HELPING TO RESTORE PROPER CONTRACTILITY, REDUCE IRRITATION, AND NORMALIZE THE URINATION REFLEX.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N FUNCIONAL DEL SISTEMA URINARIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES ENTRE EL CUERPO PRINCIPAL DE LA VEJIGA Y SU ASPECTO LATERAL. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR DISFUNCIONES NO PATOG\\u00c9NICAS, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR LA CONTRACTILIDAD ADECUADA, REDUCIR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N Y NORMALIZAR EL REFLEJO DE MICCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: SCAN THE URETHRA AND THE SACRUM TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PELVIC FLOOR IS BALANCED. IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, CHECK FOR STREPTOCOCCUS G (BLADDER \\/ BLADDER) TO RULE OUT A BACTERIAL CAUSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR LA URETRA Y EL SACRO PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL SUELO P\\u00c9LVICO EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, REVISAR EL ESTREPTOCOCO G (VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA) PARA DESCARTAR UNA CAUSA BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/76','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:26:18','2026-04-26 22:26:18'),(3880,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',77,'{\"symptoms\":\"MENINGITIS, RHEUMATISM, SPINA BIFIDA, AUTISM, POLYARTICULAR ARTHRITIS. (MENINGITIS, REUMATISMO, ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA, AUTISMO, ARTRITIS POLIARTICULAR)\",\"paths\":\"SIMILAR TO SCLEROSIS. WHEN IN THE MEDULLARY CANAL IT PRODUCES SPINA BIFIDA. AN ENTRY WAY TO THE CYSTICERCUS IN THE BRAIN. IF ENTERS PREGNANT WOMENS VAGINA, THE INFANT WILL PROBABLY DEVELOP SPINA BIFIDA. (SIMILAR A LA ESCLEROSIS. CUANDO SE ENCUENTRA EN EL CANAL MEDULAR PRODUCE ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA. ES UNA V\\u00cdA DE ENTRADA PARA EL CISTICERCO EN EL CEREBRO. SI ENTRA EN LA VAGINA DE UNA MUJER EMBARAZADA, EL INFANTE PROBABLEMENTE DESARROLLAR\\u00c1 ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH GONOCOCCUS, DEFORMING RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS. (ASOCIADO CON GONOCOCO; ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE DEFORMANTE)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MENINGITIS, RHEUMATISM, SPINA BIFIDA, AUTISM, AND POLYARTICULAR ARTHRITIS.\\n\\n(MENINGITIS, REUMATISMO, ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA, AUTISMO Y ARTRITIS POLIARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE MENINGOCOCCUS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BLADDER AND THE HIP. THIS RESET ADDRESSES PATHOGENS THAT CAN INFILTRATE THE MEDULLARY CANAL, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO STRUCTURAL ISSUES LIKE SPINA BIFIDA OR NEUROLOGICAL CONDITIONS SIMILAR TO SCLEROSIS. IT IS ALSO AN ENTRYWAY FOR OTHER PATHOGENS TO REACH THE BRAIN, MAKING IT CRITICAL FOR STABILIZING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM AND JOINT HEALTH.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA MENINGOCOCO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VEJIGA Y LA CADERA. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE PUEDEN INFILTRARSE EN EL CANAL MEDULAR, LLEVANDO POTENCIALMENTE A PROBLEMAS ESTRUCTURALES COMO LA ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA O CONDICIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS SIMILARES A LA ESCLEROSIS. TAMBI\\u00c9N ES UNA V\\u00cdA DE ENTRADA PARA QUE OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS LLEGUEN AL CEREBRO, LO QUE LO HACE CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ESTABILIZAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y LA SALUD ARTICULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH GONOCOCCUS AND DEFORMING RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS. SCAN THE SACRUM AND THE PELVIS TO ENSURE NO LATENT INFECTION REMAINS IN THE MEDULLARY AREA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ASOCIADO CON GONOCOCO Y ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE DEFORMANTE. ESCANEAR EL SACRO Y LA PELVIS PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO QUEDE NINGUNA INFECCI\\u00d3N LATENTE EN EL \\u00c1REA MEDULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/77','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:27:18','2026-04-26 22:27:18'),(3881,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',78,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHTLOSS (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS AND ELIMINATION OF TOXIC LIQUIDS.\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO Y ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS T\\u00d3XICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF THE URINARY AND EXCRETORY SYSTEMS BY NEUTRALIZING DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BLADDER AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS ORGAN DYSFUNCTION, FACILITATING THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF TOXIC FLUIDS AND SUPPORTING METABOLIC PROCESSES RELATED TO WEIGHT MANAGEMENT AND SYSTEMIC PURIFICATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SISTEMAS URINARIO Y EXCRETOR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORTIONES ENTRE LA VEJIGA Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ORG\\u00c1NICA, FACILITANDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS T\\u00d3XICOS Y APOYANDO LOS PROCESOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS RELACIONADOS CON EL CONTROL DE PESO Y LA PURIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: SCAN THE RIGHT KIDNEY TO ENSURE BILATERAL RENAL HARMONY. IF EDEMA IS PRESENT, CHECK THE VENA CAVA AND HEART TO MONITOR CIRCULATORY EFFICIENCY IN FLUID DRAINAGE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO PARA ASEGURAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA RENAL BILATERAL. SI HAY EDEMA, REVISAR LA VENA CAVA Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N PARA MONITOREAR LA EFICIENCIA CIRCULATORIA EN EL DRENAJE DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/78','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:28:28','2026-04-26 22:28:28'),(3882,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',79,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GENITAL HERPES, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, AND UROGENITAL IRRITATION.\\n(HERPES GENITAL, FLUJO VAGINAL E IRRITACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HUMAN HERPESVIRUS 7 (HHV-7) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BLADDER AND THE SACRUM. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS VIRAL REPLICATION IN THE PELVIC REGION, HELPING TO ALLEVIATE SYMPTOMS OF UROGENITAL INFECTIONS, NERVE IRRITATION IN THE LOWER BACK, AND DERMATOLOGICAL MANIFESTATIONS IN THE SACRAL AREA.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL HERPES HUMANO 7 (HHV-7) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VEJIGA Y EL SACRO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, AYUDANDO A ALIVIAR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE INFECCIONES UROGENITALES, IRRITACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA Y MANIFESTACIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS EN EL \\u00c1REA SACRA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: SCAN THE SACRAL PLEXUS AND THE PELVIS TO ENSURE THE NERVE PATHWAYS ARE CLEAR. MONITOR THE URETHRA AND EXTERNAL GENITALIA TO RULE OUT CO-INFECTIONS WITH OTHER HERPES VARIANTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ESCANEAR EL PLEXO SACRO Y LA PELVIS PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS V\\u00cdAS NERVIOSAS EST\\u00c9N DESPEJADAS. MONITOREAR LA URETRA Y LOS GENITALES EXTERNOS PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES CON OTRAS VARIANTES DE HERPES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/79','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:33:31','2026-04-26 22:33:31'),(3883,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',80,'{\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH ACHE, DIARRHEA, HEADACHES, CYSTITIS, GAS, WEIGHT LOSS, VOMITING. (DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, DIARREA, DOLORES DE CABEZA, CISTITIS, GASES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, V\\u00d3MITOS)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS G CHOLERA. SYMPTOMS CAN BE NEUTRALIZED BUT CAN PERSIST FOR SOME TIME. (HEPATITIS G, C\\u00d3LERA. LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PUEDEN SER NEUTRALIZADOS, PERO PUEDEN PERSISTIR DURANTE ALG\\u00daN TIEMPO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH ACHE, DIARRHEA, HEADACHES, CYSTITIS, GAS, WEIGHT LOSS, AND VOMITING.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, DIARREA, DOLORES DE CABEZA, CISTITIS, GASES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO Y V\\u00d3MITOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS VIBRIO CHOLERAE (CHOLERA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BLADDER AND THE TRANSVERSE COLON. THIS RESET ADDRESSES HEPATITIS G AND ACUTE GASTROINTESTINAL INFLAMMATION. WHILE THE MAGNETIC BALANCE NEUTRALIZES THE PATHOGEN, SYMPTOMS MAY PERSIST FOR A SHORT PERIOD AS THE DIGESTIVE AND URINARY SYSTEMS RECOVER THEIR FUNCTIONAL EQUILIBRIUM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA VIBRIO CHOLERAE (C\\u00d3LERA) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VEJIGA Y EL COLON TRANSVERSO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA HEPATITIS G Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL AGUDA. SI BIEN EL EQUILIBRIO MAGN\\u00c9TICO NEUTRALIZA AL PAT\\u00d3GENO, LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PUEDEN PERSISTIR POR UN CORTO PER\\u00cdODO MIENTRAS LOS SISTEMAS DIGESTIVO Y URINARIO RECUPERAN SU EQUILIBRIO FUNCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ECOLOGICAL CHECK: SCAN THE ENTIRE COLON AND LIVER TO MONITOR FOR RESIDUAL TOXICITY. ENSURE PROPER HYDRATION AS THE BODY ELIMINATES THE BACTERIAL LOAD. CHECK THE KIDNEY REGION IF CYSTITIS SYMPTOMS ARE SEVERE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ECOL\\u00d3GICA: ESCANEAR TODO EL COLON Y EL H\\u00cdGADO PARA MONITOREAR LA TOXICIDAD RESIDUAL. ASEGURAR UNA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA MIENTRAS EL CUERPO ELIMINA LA CARGA BACTERIANA. REVISAR LA REGI\\u00d3N RENAL SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE CISTITIS SON SEVEROS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/80','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:35:34','2026-04-26 22:35:34'),(3884,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',81,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING (SANGRADO VAGINAL)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, PELVIC PAIN, AND UROGENITAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(SANGRADO VAGINAL, DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO Y MALESTAR UROGENITAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF THE VASCULAR AND REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BLADDER AND THE VAGINA. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS ABNORMAL VAGINAL BLEEDING NOT CAUSED BY ACTIVE PATHOGENS, HELPING TO HARMONIZE LOCAL CIRCULATION AND RESTORE THE ENERGETIC INTEGRITY OF THE PELVIC FLOOR.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA VASCULAR Y REPRODUCTOR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VEJIGA Y LA VAGINA. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR EL SANGRADO VAGINAL ANORMAL NO CAUSADO POR PAT\\u00d3GENOS ACTIVOS, AYUDANDO A ARMONIZAR LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N LOCAL Y RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL SUELO P\\u00c9LVICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"REPRODUCTIVE CHECK: SCAN THE UTERUS AND OVARIES TO RULE OUT STRUCTURAL IMBALANCES. IF INFECTION IS SUSPECTED, CHECK FOR HERPES HHV-7 (BLADDER \\/ SACRUM) OR BACTERIAL VAGINOSIS (VAGINA \\/ VAGINA) TO ENSURE COMPREHENSIVE CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA: ESCANEAR EL \\u00daTERO Y LOS OVARIOS PARA DESCARTAR DESEQUILIBRIOS ESTRUCTURALES. SI SE SOSPECHA INFECCI\\u00d3N, REVISAR HERPES HHV-7 (VEJIGA \\/ SACRO) O VAGINOSIS BACTERIANA (VAGINA \\/ VAGINA) PARA ASEGURAR UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/81','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:44:05','2026-04-26 22:44:05'),(3885,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',82,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DIABETES MELLITUS\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLANDS AXIS (EJE GLANDULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIABETES MELLITUS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, AND INSULIN IRREGULARITY.\\n\\n(DIABETES MELLITUS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS E IRREGULARIDAD DE LA INSULINA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ENDOCRINE REGULATION OF THE PANCREAS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BODY OF THE PANCREAS AND THE GLUTEUS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION TO NORMALIZE INSULIN PRODUCTION AND GLUCOSE METABOLISM, HELPING TO STABILIZE PATIENTS WITH DIABETES MELLITUS AND IMPROVING THE OVERALL ENERGETIC SUPPORT FOR DIGESTIVE ENZYMES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL CUERPO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL GL\\u00daTEO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR PARA NORMALIZAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA Y EL METABOLISMO DE LA GLUCOSA, AYUDANDO A ESTABILIZAR A LOS PACIENTES CON DIABETES MELLITUS Y MEJORANDO EL SOPORTE ENERG\\u00c9TICO GENERAL PARA LAS ENZIMAS DIGESTIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: SCAN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE TAIL OF THE PANCREAS TO ENSURE FULL ORGAN HARMONY. CHECK THE LIVER AND DUODENUM TO MONITOR THE COMPLEMENTARY METABOLIC FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: ESCANEAR LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS PARA ASEGURAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA TOTAL DEL \\u00d3RGANO. REVISAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL DUODENO PARA MONITOREAR LAS FUNCIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS COMPLEMENTARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/82','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:45:39','2026-04-26 22:45:39'),(3886,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',83,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES (ALERGIAS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC AXIS (EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES, DIGESTIVE SENSITIVITY, AND FOOD INTOLERANCE.\\n\\n(ALERGIAS, SENSIBILIDAD DIGESTIVA E INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ENERGETIC REGULATION OF THE METABOLIC SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BODY OF THE PANCREAS AND THE HEART. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS PSYCHOSOMATIC OR METABOLIC ALLERGIES, HELPING THE BODY TO RECOGNIZE AND PROCESS SUBSTANCES WITHOUT TRIGGERING AN EXAGGERATED IMMUNE RESPONSE, WHILE HARMONIZING THE CIRCULATORY FLOW ASSOCIATED WITH GLANDULAR FUNCTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL SISTEMA METAB\\u00d3LICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES ENTRE EL CUERPO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR ALERGIAS DE TIPO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO O METAB\\u00d3LICO, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A RECONOCER Y PROCESAR SUSTANCIAS SIN ACTIVAR UNA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA EXAGERADA, AL TIEMPO QUE ARMONIZA EL FLUJO CIRCULATORIO ASOCIADO A LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ALLERGY CHECK: SCAN THE LIVER AND THE SUPRARENAL GLANDS TO ENHANCE THE ANTI-HISTAMINE RESPONSE. IF THE ALLERGY IS RESPIRATORY, CHECK THE LUNG (FRONT) \\/ SUPRARENAL RESONANCE TO CLEAR THE AIRWAYS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ALERGIAS: ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES PARA POTENCIAR LA RESPUESTA ANTIHISTAM\\u00cdNICA. SI LA ALERGIA ES RESPIRATORIA, REVISAR LA RESONANCIA PULM\\u00d3N (ANTERIOR) \\/ SUPRARRENAL PARA DESPEJAR LAS V\\u00cdAS A\\u00c9REAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/83','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:47:11','2026-04-26 22:47:11'),(3887,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',84,'{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, WEIGHT LOSS, SEPSIS, DIARRHEA. (NEUMON\\u00cdA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, SEPSIS, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L OR M. INFECTIONS OF THE INTESTINAL AND URINARY SYSTEM. (HEPATITIS L O M. INFECCIONES DEL SISTEMA INTESTINAL Y URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, WEIGHT LOSS, SEPSIS, AND DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(NEUMON\\u00cdA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, SEPSIS Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS ESCHERICHIA COLI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BODY OF THE PANCREAS AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. THIS RESET ADDRESSES HEPATITIS L OR M AND IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING INFECTIONS WITHIN THE INTESTINAL AND URINARY SYSTEMS. IT HELPS PREVENT THE SPREAD OF THE BACTERIA TO THE LUNGS (AVOIDING PNEUMONIA) AND STABILIZES THE BODY AGAINST SEPSIS AND CHRONIC DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESCHERICHIA COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CUERPO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA HEPATITIS L O M Y ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESOLVER INFECCIONES EN LOS SISTEMAS INTESTINAL Y URINARIO. AYUDA A PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA BACTERIA A LOS PULMONES (EVITANDO LA NEUMON\\u00cdA) Y ESTABILIZA EL CUERPO CONTRA LA SEPSIS Y LA DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: SCAN THE LEFT KIDNEY AND THE DESCENDING COLON TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD. IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE LIVER AND RIGHT LUNG TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY RESONANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: ESCANEAR EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO Y EL COLON DESCENDENTE PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA. SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL PULM\\u00d3N DERECHO PARA ABORDAR RESONANCIAS COMPLEMENTARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/84','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:49:09','2026-04-26 22:49:09'),(3888,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',85,'{\"origins\":\"ESCHERICHIA COLI\",\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, WEIGHT LOSS, SEPSIS, DIARRHEA. (NEUMON\\u00cdA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, SEPSIS, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L OR M. INFECTIONS OF THE INTESTINAL AND URINARY SYSTEM. (HEPATITIS L O M. INFECCIONES DEL SISTEMA INTESTINAL Y URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ESCHERICHIA COLI (E. COLI)\",\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, WEIGHT LOSS, SEPSIS, AND DIARRHEA.\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS ESCHERICHIA COLI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BODY OF THE PANCREAS AND THE LIVER. THIS RESET ADDRESSES HEPATITIS L OR M AND IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING INFECTIONS WITHIN THE INTESTINAL AND URINARY SYSTEMS. IT HELPS PREVENT THE SPREAD OF THE BACTERIA TO THE LUNGS AND STABILIZES THE BODY AGAINST SYSTEMIC SEPSIS AND CHRONIC DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESCHERICHIA COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CUERPO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA HEPATITIS L O M Y ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESOLVER INFECCIONES EN LOS SISTEMAS INTESTINAL Y URINARIO. AYUDA A PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA BACTERIA A LOS PULMONES Y ESTABILIZA EL CUERPO CONTRA LA SEPSIS SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: SCAN THE KIDNEYS AND THE DESCENDING COLON TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD. MONITOR LIVER FUNCTION TO SUPPORT DETOXIFICATION PROCESSES DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THE PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: ESCANEAR LOS RI\\u00d1ONES Y EL COLON DESCENDENTE PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA. MONITOREAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA PARA APOYAR LOS PROCESOS DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/85','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:51:07','2026-04-26 22:51:07'),(3889,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',86,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"TOXIC, DIABETES, CHRONIC FATIGUE SYNDROME, PANCREATITIS. (T\\u00d3XICO, DIABETES, S\\u00cdNDROME DE FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, PANCREATITIS)\",\"paths\":\"PANCREAS POISONING AND HEAVY METALS DUE TO EXCESSIVE OF MEDICATIONS, FOOD POISONING; SEAFOOD, SUSHI ETC. FOOD INTOLERANCE. CAN ALSO DAMAGE THE BRAIN AND CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. CAUSING PSYCHOTIC STATES OR ATYPICAL BEHAVIOR, TRANSIENT PSYCHOSIS, PARANOIA, SCHIZOPHRENIA, HYPERKINESIS OR HYPERACTIVITY. (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y METALES PESADOS DEBIDO AL USO EXCESIVO DE MEDICAMENTOS, INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA (MARISCOS, SUSHI, ETC.). INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE DA\\u00d1AR EL CEREBRO Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, CAUSANDO ESTADOS PSIC\\u00d3TICOS O COMPORTAMIENTO AT\\u00cdPICO, PSICOSIS TRANSITORIA, PARANOIA, ESQUIZOFRENIA, HIPERCINESIA O HIPERACTIVIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH ESOPHAGUS - LIVER FLUKE. (ASOCIADO CON EL ES\\u00d3FAGO \\u2013 DUELA HEP\\u00c1TICA)\"}','{\"origins\":\"INTOXICACI\\u00d3N MET\\u00c1LICA Y ALIMENTARIA (METALLIC AND FOOD POISONING)\",\"symptoms\":\"TOXICITY, DIABETES, CHRONIC FATIGUE SYNDROME, PANCREATITIS, PSYCHOTIC STATES, AND HYPERACTIVITY.\\n\\n(TOXICIDAD, DIABETES, S\\u00cdNDROME DE FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, PANCREATITIS, ESTADOS PSIC\\u00d3TICOS E HIPERACTIVIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF HEAVY METALS AND TOXINS ACCUMULATED IN THE PANCREAS DUE TO EXCESSIVE MEDICATION OR FOOD POISONING (SUCH AS SEAFOOD OR SUSHI). THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO PREVENT DAMAGE TO THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, WHICH CAN MANIFEST AS ATYPICAL BEHAVIOR, TRANSIENT PSYCHOSIS, PARANOIA, OR SCHIZOPHRENIA. IT ALSO ADDRESSES FOOD INTOLERANCES AND METABOLIC FATIGUE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE METALES PESADOS Y TOXINAS ACUMULADAS EN EL P\\u00c1NCREAS DEBIDO AL EXCESO DE MEDICAMENTOS O INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA (COMO MARISCOS O SUSHI). ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA PREVENIR DA\\u00d1OS AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, QUE PUEDEN MANIFESTARSE COMO COMPORTAMIENTO AT\\u00cdPICO, PSICOSIS TRANSITORIA, PARANOIA O ESQUIZOFRENIA. TAMBI\\u00c9N ABORDA LAS INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS Y LA FATIGA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ESOPHAGUS (LIVER FLUKE). SCAN THE LIVER AND BRAIN STEM TO MONITOR NEUROLOGICAL IMPACT AND PARASITIC CO-INFECTIONS. CHECK THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS FOR COMPLEMENTARY GLANDULAR SUPPORT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ASOCIADO CON EL ES\\u00d3FAGO (DUELA HEP\\u00c1TICA). ESCANEAR EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL TALLO CEREBRAL PARA MONITOREAR EL IMPACTO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO Y COINFECCIONES PARASITARIAS. REVISAR LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS PARA SOPORTE GLANDULAR COMPLEMENTARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/86','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:54:02','2026-04-26 22:54:02'),(3890,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',87,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"TRAUMATIC MEMORY (MEMORIA TRAUM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL AND TRAUMATIC LOADS STORED IN THE CELLULAR MEMORY OF THE REPRODUCTIVE AND GLANDULAR SYSTEMS. THIS RESET SEEKS TO STABILIZE THE BIOFIELD AFTER EXPERIENCES OF ABUSE OR RAPE, HELPING TO UNBLOCK STAGNANT ENERGY IN THE UTERUS AND HARMONIZE THE ENDOCRINE RESPONSE OF THE PANCREAS, FACILITATING A COMPREHENSIVE HEALING PROCESS OF PSYCHOSOMATIC TRAUMA.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS EMOCIONALES Y TRAUM\\u00c1TICAS ALMACENADAS EN LA MEMORIA CELULAR DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR Y GLANDULAR. ESTE REINICIO BUSCA ESTABILIZAR EL BIOCAMPO TRAS EXPERIENCIAS DE ABUSO O VIOLACI\\u00d3N, AYUDANDO A DESBLOQUEAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA ESTANCADA EN EL \\u00daTERO Y ARMONIZAR LA RESPUESTA ENDOCRINA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, FACILITANDO UN PROCESO DE SANACI\\u00d3N INTEGRAL DEL TRAUMATISMO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL AXIS: SCAN THE THYMUS AND SOLAR PLEXUS TO REINFORCE SELF-ESTEEM AND ENERGETIC PROTECTION. CHECK INTEGRATION WITH THE LIMBIC SYSTEM (CEREBRAL AMYGDALA) TO PROCESS DEEP EMOTIONAL IMPACT.\\n\\n(EJE EMOCIONAL: ESCANEAR EL TIMO Y EL PLEXO SOLAR PARA REFORZAR LA AUTOESTIMA Y LA PROTECCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA. REVISAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N CON EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO (AM\\u00cdGDALA CEREBRAL) PARA PROCESAR EL IMPACTO EMOCIONAL PROFUNDO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/87','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:57:33','2026-04-26 22:57:33'),(3891,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',88,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"IT ELIMINATES ENERGY AND EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGE. IMPROVES COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE THERAPIST BRAIN AND THE ARM. UNBLOCKS THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. (ELIMINA BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS Y EMOCIONALES. MEJORA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CEREBRO DEL TERAPEUTA Y EL BRAZO. DESBLOQUEA LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENERGETIC FLOW (FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"UPPER LIMB BLOCKAGES, COMMUNICATION ISSUES BETWEEN BRAIN AND ARM, AND CRANIAL NERVE STAGNATION.\\n\\n(BLOQUEOS EN LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES, PROBLEMAS DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CEREBRO Y EL BRAZO, Y ESTANCAMIENTO DE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REMOVAL OF ENERGY AND EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGES BY NEUTRALIZING DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE BRACHIAL PLEXUS. THIS RESET IMPROVES THE VITAL COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE THERAPIST\'S BRAIN AND THE ARM, FACILITATING BETTER KINESIOLOGICAL RESPONSES. ADDITIONALLY, IT WORKS TO UNBLOCK THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES, RESTORING OPTIMAL NERVOUS SYSTEM CONDUCTIVITY AND UPPER BODY MOBILITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS Y EMOCIONALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DENTRO DEL PLEXO BRAQUIAL. ESTE REINICIO MEJORA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N VITAL ENTRE EL CEREBRO DEL TERAPEUTA Y EL BRAZO, FACILITANDO MEJORES RESPUESTAS KINESIOL\\u00d3GICAS. ADEM\\u00c1S, TRABAJA PARA DESBLOQUEAR LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES, RESTAURANDO LA CONDUCTIVIDAD \\u00d3PTIMA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y LA MOVILIDAD DE LA PARTE SUPERIOR DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: SCAN THE BRAIN STEM AND THE ATLAS TO ENSURE ALL CRANIAL NERVE PATHWAYS ARE CLEAR. IF THERE IS LOCALIZED PAIN IN THE ELBOW FOLD, CHECK FOR STREPTOCOCCUS A (BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL) TO RULE OUT A BACTERIAL COMPONENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: ESCANEAR EL TALLO CEREBRAL Y EL ATLAS PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODAS LAS V\\u00cdAS DE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES EST\\u00c9N DESPEJADAS. SI HAY DOLOR LOCALIZADO EN EL PLIEGUE DEL CODO, REVISAR EL ESTREPTOCOCO A (BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL) PARA DESCARTAR UN COMPONENTE BACTERIANO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/88','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 22:59:14','2026-04-26 22:59:14'),(3892,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',89,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LATENT BACTERIAL LOADS, POTENTIAL NERVE IRRITATION, AND JOINT STIFFNESS.\\n\\n(CARGAS BACTERIANAS LATENTES, POSIBLE IRRITACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y RIGIDEZ ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"ACTS AS A BACTERIAL RESERVOIR. TARGETS THE SEQUESTERED LOADS OF MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE (LEPROSY) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BRACHIAL REGION AND THE ELBOW ON THE SAME SIDE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO PREVENT THE RE-EMERGENCE OR SPREAD OF THE BACTERIA TO THE PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND SKIN, ENSURING THAT THE PATHOGEN DOES NOT FIND REFUGE WITHIN THE JOINT FOLDS.\\n\\n(ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO BACTERIANO. SE DIRIGE A LAS CARGAS SECUESTRADAS DE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE (LEPRA) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N BRAQUIAL Y EL CODO DEL MISMO LADO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA EVITAR LA REAPARICI\\u00d3N O PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA BACTERIA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO Y LA PIEL, ASEGURANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO NO ENCUENTRE REFUGIO DENTRO DE LOS PLIEGUES ARTICULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: SCAN THE OPPOSITE ELBOW AND THE BRACHIAL PLEXUS TO ENSURE NO CROSS-RESONANCE EXISTS. IF DERMATOLOGICAL SYMPTOMS ARE ACTIVE, SCAN THE BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL (REF 88) PAIR TO ADDRESS ACTIVE STREPTOCOCCUS A.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESCANEAR EL CODO OPUESTO Y EL PLEXO BRAQUIAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO EXISTA RESONANCIA CRUZADA. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS EST\\u00c1N ACTIVOS, ESCANEAR EL PAR BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL (REF 88) PARA ABORDAR EL ESTREPTOCOCO A ACTIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/89','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:00:42','2026-04-26 23:00:42'),(3893,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',90,'{\"symptoms\":\"DERMATITIS, THROAT INFECTIONS, PHARYNGITIS. DERMATITIS, INFECCIONES DE GARGANTA, FARINGITIS)\",\"paths\":\"PROBLEMS IN THE SKIN AND MUCUS MEMBRANE. (PROBLEMAS EN LA PIEL Y LA MEMBRANA MUCOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH STREPT A & G; TRUE PSORIASIS   ASSOCIATED WITH STREPT A & G & LAPRAE; MELANOMA           CHECK - CORONARY\\/LUNG (L). (ASOCIADO CON ESTREPTOCOCO A Y G; PSORIASIS VERDADERA\\u2003\\u2003ASOCIADO CON ESTREPTOCOCO A Y G Y LEPRAE; MELANOMA\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 CORONARIO \\/ PULM\\u00d3N (I))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DERMATITIS, THROAT INFECTIONS, AND PHARYNGITIS.\\n\\n(DERMATITIS, INFECCIONES DE GARGANTA Y FARINGITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS ALFA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE BRACHIAL REGION. THIS RESET ADDRESSES MANIFESTATIONS IN THE SKIN AND MUCUS MEMBRANES, HELPING TO CLEAR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CAUSE IRRITATION IN THE THROAT AND PHARYNX, AS WELL AS DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO ALFA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N BRAQUIAL. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS MANIFESTACIONES EN LA PIEL Y LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE CAUSAN IRRITACI\\u00d3N EN LA GARGANTA Y LA FARINGE, AS\\u00cd COMO PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESONANCE CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH STREPTOCOCCUS A & G FOR CASES OF TRUE PSORIASIS. ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH STREPT A, G, AND LEPRAE IN RELATION TO MELANOMA. CHECK CORONARY \\/ LUNG (L) TO ENSURE FULL SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESONANCIA: ASOCIADO CON ESTREPTOCOCO A Y G PARA CASOS DE PSORIASIS VERDADERA. TAMBI\\u00c9N ASOCIADO CON ESTREPTOCOCO A, G Y LEPRAE EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON EL MELANOMA. REVISAR CORONARIO \\/ PULM\\u00d3N (I) PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO COMPLETO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/90','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:02:21','2026-04-26 23:02:21'),(3894,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',91,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"BACTERIA\",\"origins\":\"LEGIONELLA (LEGIONELA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE COUGH, FEVER, SHORTNESS OF BREATH (DYSPNEA), AND CHEST DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(TOS SEVERA, FIEBRE, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR (DISNEA) Y MALESTAR EN EL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS LEGIONELLA BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BRACHIAL REGION AND THE SECOND DORSAL VERTEBRA (D2). THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN ORIGINATE FROM CONTAMINATED WATER SYSTEMS OR AIR CONDITIONING, HELPING TO CLEAR LUNG INFLAMMATION AND RESTORE NORMAL OXYGEN EXCHANGE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA LEGIONELA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N BRAQUIAL Y LA SEGUNDA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL (D2). ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS QUE A MENUDO SE ORIGINAN EN SISTEMAS DE AGUA CONTAMINADOS O AIRE ACONDICIONADO, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y RESTAURAR EL INTERCAMBIO NORMAL DE OX\\u00cdGENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: SCAN THE LUNGS AND CARINA TO RULE OUT COMPLEMENTARY VIRAL OR BACTERIAL ACTIVITY. IF FEVER PERSISTS, CHECK THE SUPRARENAL GLANDS TO MONITOR THE BODY\'S INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: ESCANEAR LOS PULMONES Y LA CARINA PARA DESCARTAR ACTIVIDAD VIRAL O BACTERIANA COMPLEMENTARIA. SI LA FIEBRE PERSISTE, REVISAR LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES PARA MONITOREAR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/91','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:04:31','2026-04-26 23:04:31'),(3895,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',92,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SYPHILIS (S\\u00cdFILIS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SYPHILIS (S\\u00cdFILIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"LATENT BACTERIAL LOADS, SYSTEMIC SEEDING OF PATHOGENS, AND CHRONIC JOINT OR NERVE DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(CARGAS BACTERIANAS LATENTES, SIEMBRA SIST\\u00c9MICA DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS Y MALESTAR CR\\u00d3NICO EN ARTICULACIONES O NERVIOS.)\",\"paths\":\"ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR TREPONEMA PALLIDUM (SYPHILIS). TARGETS THE SEQUESTERED BACTERIAL LOADS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BRACHIAL REGION AND THE ELBOW ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO PREVENT THE PATHOGEN FROM REMAINING HIDDEN IN THE SYSTEM, WHICH COULD OTHERWISE CAUSE RECURRING INFECTIONS OR PERSISTENT SYMPTOMS IN THE PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND SKIN.\\n\\n(ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO PARA TREPONEMA PALLIDUM (S\\u00cdFILIS). SE DIRIGE A LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS SECUESTRADAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N BRAQUIAL Y EL CODO DEL LADO OPUESTO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA EVITAR QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PERMANEZCA OCULTO EN EL SISTEMA, LO QUE DE OTRO MODO PODR\\u00cdA CAUSAR INFECCIONES RECURRENTES O S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTENTES EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO Y LA PIEL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: SCAN THE DELTOID \\/ DELTOID AND THE TESTICLE (OR OVARY) \\/ COLON DESCENDING TO RULE OUT ACTIVE SYPHILIS MANIFESTATIONS. IF DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES ARE PRESENT, CHECK FOR STREPTOCOCCUS A (BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL) TO ENSURE NO BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESCANEAR DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES Y TEST\\u00cdCULO (O OVARIO) \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE PARA DESCARTAR MANIFESTACIONES ACTIVAS DE S\\u00cdFILIS. SI HAY PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS, REVISAR EL ESTREPTOCOCO A (BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/92','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:06:07','2026-04-26 23:06:07'),(3896,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',93,'{\"symptoms\":\"LEPROSY (LEPRA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LEPROSY-LIKE MANIFESTATIONS, SKIN LESIONS, AND NERVOUS SYSTEM IRRITATION.\\n\\n(MANIFESTACIONES TIPO LEPRA, LESIONES EN LA PIEL E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS B HAEMOLYTIC BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BRACHIAL REGION AND THE SUB-DELTOID MUSCLE ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CAN CAUSE SEVERE DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES OR SIMULATE THE SYMPTOMS OF LEPROSY, HELPING TO RESTORE THE INTEGRITY OF THE SKIN AND PERIPHERAL NERVES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO B HEMOL\\u00cdTICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N BRAQUIAL Y EL M\\u00daSCULO SUBDELTOIDEO DEL LADO OPUESTO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE PUEDEN CAUSAR PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS SEVEROS O SIMULAR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA LEPRA, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA PIEL Y LOS NERVIOS PERIF\\u00c9RICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: SCAN THE BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL (REF 90) TO RULE OUT OTHER STREPTOCOCCAL RESONANCES. IF NERVOUS SYSTEM SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, CHECK THE BRACHIAL PLEXUS TO ENSURE CLEAR SIGNAL TRANSMISSION TO THE UPPER LIMBS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESCANEAR BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL (REF 90) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS RESONANCIAS ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICAS. SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, REVISAR EL PLEXO BRAQUIAL PARA ASEGURAR UNA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N DE SE\\u00d1AL CLARA A LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/93','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:32:24','2026-04-26 23:32:24'),(3897,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',95,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PARALYSIS (PAR\\u00c1LISIS)\",\"paths\":\"LOOK FOR ACTIVE SPOT. (BUSCAR PUNTO ACTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL RESET (REINICIO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PARALYSIS AND MOTOR DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(PAR\\u00c1LISIS Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RESTORATION OF NEUROLOGICAL COMMUNICATION BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BRAIN AND THE KIDNEY ON THE SAME SIDE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES VARIOUS FORMS OF PARALYSIS BY SEEKING THE \\\"ACTIVE SPOT\\\" WITHIN THE BRAIN TISSUE THAT RESONATES WITH THE RENAL SYSTEM, HELPING TO RE-ESTABLISH THE ENERGETIC FLOW NECESSARY FOR MOTOR CONTROL AND MUSCULAR RESPONSE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORTIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL CEREBRO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL MISMO LADO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA VARIAS FORMAS DE PARALIZACI\\u00d3N BUSCANDO EL \\\"PUNTO ACTIVO\\\" DENTRO DEL TEJIDO CEREBRAL QUE RESONAN CON EL SISTEMA RENAL, AYUDANDO A REESTABLECER EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO NECESARIO PARA EL CONTROL MOTOR Y LA RESPUESTA MUSCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-MOTOR CHECK: SCAN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE BRAIN STEM TO MONITOR COORDINATION PATHWAYS. IT IS CRITICAL TO \\\"LOOK FOR THE ACTIVE SPOT\\\" ON THE PARIETAL OR FRONTAL LOBE THAT TRIGGERS THE KINESIOLOGICAL RESPONSE WHEN PAIRED WITH THE KIDNEY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROMOTORA: ESCANEAR EL CEREBELO Y EL TALLO CEREBRAL PARA MONITOREAR LAS V\\u00cdAS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N. ES CR\\u00cdTICO \\\"BUSCAR EL PUNTO ACTIVO\\\" EN EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL O FRONTAL QUE ACTIVA LA RESPUESTA KINESIOL\\u00d3GICA AL SER EMPAREJADO CON EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/95','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:34:11','2026-04-26 23:34:11'),(3898,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',96,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INSECURITY, LACK OF CONFIDENCE\\n(INSEGURIDAD, FALTA DE CONFIANZA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC AXIS (EJE PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INSECURITY AND LACK OF CONFIDENCE.\\n\\n(INSEGURIDAD Y FALTA DE CONFIANZA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF EMOTIONAL STABILITY BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BRAINSTEM AND THE CEREBELLUM. THIS RESET ADDRESSES DEEP-SEATED FEELINGS OF INSECURITY AND SELF-DOUBT BY HARMONIZING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE PRIMAL SURVIVAL INSTINCTS OF THE BRAINSTEM AND THE COORDINATION CENTERS OF THE CEREBELLUM, FOSTERING A SENSE OF GROUNDED CONFIDENCE AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO Y EL CEREBELO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA SENTIMIENTOS PROFUNDOS DE INSEGURIDAD Y FALTA DE CONFIANZA AL ARMONIZAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LOS INSTINTOS PRIMARIOS DE SUPERVIVENCIA DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO Y LOS CENTROS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBELO, FOMENTANDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CONFIANZA FIRME Y EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: SCAN THE THYMUS TO REINFORCE THE FEELING OF SECURITY. IF ANXIETY IS PRESENT, CHECK THE AMYGDALA (CEREBRAL) \\/ THYMUS RESONANCE TO CALM THE NERVOUS SYSTEM\'S FEAR RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: ESCANEAR EL TIMO PARA REFORZAR EL SENTIMIENTO DE SEGURIDAD. SI HAY ANSIEDAD, REVISAR LA RESONANCIA AM\\u00cdGDALA (CEREBRAL) \\/ TIMO PARA CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DE TEMOR DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/96','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:35:59','2026-04-26 23:35:59'),(3899,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',97,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"FEARS (MIEDOS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FEARS (MIEDOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"GENERALIZED ANXIETY, PHOBIAS, AND RESPIRATORY TENSION.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD GENERALIZADA, FOBIAS Y TENSI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RELEASE OF SOMATIZED FEARS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BRONCHIOLES AND THE CEREBELLUM. THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE PHYSICAL MANIFESTATION OF FEAR, WHICH OFTEN CONSTRICTS THE AIRWAYS, HELPING TO HARMONIZE THE BREATHING PATTERN WITH THE COORDINATION CENTERS OF THE BRAIN TO RESTORE A SENSE OF CALM AND EMOTIONAL SECURITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE MIEDOS SOMATIZADOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LOS BRONQUIOLOS Y EL CEREBELO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA DEL MIEDO, QUE A MENUDO CONSTRI\\u00d1E LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS, AYUDANDO A ARMONIZAR EL PATR\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIO CON LOS CENTROS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBRO PARA RESTAURAR UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA Y SEGURIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: SCAN THE THYMUS AND THE AMYGDALA (CEREBRAL) TO DEEPEN THE RELEASE OF PANIC OR ANXIETY. IF THERE IS PHYSICAL DIFFICULTY BREATHING, CHECK FOR BLASTOMYCOSIS (ANKLE \\/ ANKLE) TO RULE OUT FUNGAL INTERFERENCE IN THE LUNGS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: ESCANEAR EL TIMO Y LA AM\\u00cdGDALA (CEREBRAL) PARA PROFUNDIZAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE P\\u00c1NICO O ANSIEDAD. SI HAY DIFICULTAD F\\u00cdSICA PARA RESPIRAR, REVISAR LA BLASTOMICOSIS (TOBILLO \\/ TOBILLO) PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA F\\u00daNGICA EN LOS PULMONES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/97','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:37:21','2026-04-26 23:37:21'),(3900,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',98,'{\"symptoms\":\"SHOULDER STIFFNESS, BURSITIS, ARMPIT ODOR, NECK PAIN, SORE THROAT, BRONCHIAL PROBLEMS. (RIGIDEZ DE HOMBRO, BURSITIS, OLOR AXILAR, DOLOR DE CUELLO, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, PROBLEMAS BRONQUIALES)\",\"paths\":\"DISRUPTION TO THE SHOULDER GIRDLE. (ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LA CINTURA ESCAPULAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SHOULDER STIFFNESS, BURSITIS, ARMPIT ODOR, NECK PAIN, SORE THROAT, AND BRONCHIAL PROBLEMS.\\n\\n(RIGIDEZ DE HOMBRO, BURSITIS, OLOR AXILAR, DOLOR DE CUELLO, DOLOR DE GARGANTA Y PROBLEMAS BRONQUIALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ACTINOMYCES BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE BURSA OF THE SHOULDER. THIS RESET ADDRESSES DISRUPTIONS TO THE SHOULDER GIRDLE, HELPING TO ALLEVIATE LOCAL INFLAMMATION (BURSITIS) AND PREVENT THE SPREAD OF THE BACTERIA TO THE RESPIRATORY TRACT OR LYMPHATIC NODES IN THE AXILLARY REGION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ACTINOMYCES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA BURSA DEL HOMBRO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS ALTERACIONES DE LA CINTURA ESCAPULAR, AYUDANDO A ALIVIAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL (BURSITIS) Y PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA BACTERIA HACIA EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO O LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS EN LA REGI\\u00d3N AXILAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT CHECK: SCAN THE ARMPIT (AXILA) AND THE SUBCLAVIAN REGION TO ENSURE NO LINGERING BACTERIAL ACTIVITY AFFECTING THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM. IF SORE THROAT PERSISTS, SCAN THE BRACHIAL PLEXUS FOR NEURO-IMMUNE COORDINATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR: ESCANEAR LA AXILA Y LA REGI\\u00d3N SUBCLAVIA PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA ACTIVIDAD BACTERIANA REMANENTE AFECTANDO EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO. SI EL DOLOR DE GARGANTA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL PLEXO BRAQUIAL PARA LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N NEUROINMUNE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/98','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:38:36','2026-04-26 23:38:36'),(3901,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',99,'{\"symptoms\":\"SCARLET FEVER (ESCARLATINA)\",\"paths\":\"MANIFESTATION IN THE SKIN, JOINT PAIN AND RHEUMATIC FEVER. (MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N EN LA PIEL, DOLOR ARTICULAR Y FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - WRIST (REVISAR \\u2013 MU\\u00d1ECA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SCARLET FEVER, SKIN MANIFESTATIONS, JOINT PAIN, AND RHEUMATIC FEVER.\\n\\n(ESCARLATINA, MANIFESTACIONES EN LA PIEL, DOLOR ARTICULAR Y FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS B HEMOLYTIC BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BURSA OF THE SHOULDER AND THE ELBOW ON THE SAME SIDE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL INFECTIONS THAT MANIFEST AS SCARLET FEVER OR RHEUMATIC CONDITIONS, HELPING TO REDUCE JOINT INFLAMMATION AND PREVENT THE PATHOGEN FROM DAMAGING DERMATOLOGICAL TISSUES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO B HEMOL\\u00cdTICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA BURSA DEL HOMBRO Y EL CODO DEL MISMO LADO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO ESCARLATINA O CONDICIONES REUM\\u00c1TICAS, AYUDANDO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y EVITAR QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO DA\\u00d1E LOS TEJIDOS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT MONITORING: SCAN THE WRIST (MU\\u00d1ECA) TO ENSURE THE BACTERIAL LOAD HAS NOT MIGRATED FURTHER DOWN THE LIMB. IF RHEUMATIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST, CHECK THE BRACHIAL \\/ SUB-DELTOID (REF 93) FOR COMPLEMENTARY STREPTOCOCCAL RESONANCES.\\n\\n(MONITOREO ARTICULAR: ESCANEAR LA MU\\u00d1ECA PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA CARGA BACTERIANA NO HAYA MIGRADO M\\u00c1S ABAJO EN LA EXTREMIDAD. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS REUM\\u00c1TICOS PERSISTEN, REVISAR EL PAR BRAQUIAL \\/ SUBDELTOIDEO (REF 93) PARA RESONANCIAS ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICAS COMPLEMENTARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/99','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:39:38','2026-04-26 23:39:38'),(3902,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',100,'{\"symptoms\":\"FATIGUE, WEAKNESS, SPOTTED FEVER. (FATIGA, DEBILIDAD, FIEBRE MANCHADA)\",\"paths\":\"EXTREME WEAKNESS AND FATIGUE. LOWER LIMB DISORDER, WEAK MUSCLES, JOINTS OR LEGS AND LOWER BACK PAIN.PARALYSIS IN EXTREME CASES. (DEBILIDAD EXTREMA Y FATIGA. TRASTORNO DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, M\\u00daSCULOS, ARTICULACIONES O PIERNAS D\\u00c9BILES Y DOLOR LUMBAR. PAR\\u00c1LISIS EN CASOS EXTREMOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH WRIST; ALZHEIMERS     CHECK - WRIST. (ASOCIADO CON LA MU\\u00d1ECA; ALZHEIMER\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 MU\\u00d1ECA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FATIGUE, WEAKNESS, SPOTTED FEVER.\\n\\n(FATIGA, DEBILIDAD, FIEBRE MANCHADA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS RICKETTSIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE CALCANEUS (HEEL). THIS RESET ADDRESSES EXTREME WEAKNESS AND FATIGUE, AS WELL AS LOWER LIMB DISORDERS. IT IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING WEAKNESS IN THE MUSCLES, JOINTS, OR LEGS, AND ALLEVIATING LOWER BACK PAIN. IN EXTREME CASES, IT HELPS PREVENT OR ADDRESS BACTERIAL-RELATED PARALYSIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RICKETTSIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL CALC\\u00c1NEO (TAL\\u00d3N). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA DEBILIDAD EXTREMA Y LA FATIGA, AS\\u00cd COMO LOS TRASTORNOS DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESOLVER LA DEBILIDAD EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS, ARTICULACIONES O PIERNAS, Y ALIVIAR EL DOLOR LUMBAR. EN CASOS EXTREMOS, AYUDA A PREVENIR O ABORDAR LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS RELACIONADA CON BACTERIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH THE WRIST. SCAN THE WRIST TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE, ESPECIALLY IN CASES RELATED TO ALZHEIMER\'S SYMPTOMS OR NEUROLOGICAL WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: ASOCIADO CON LA MU\\u00d1ECA. ESCANEAR LA MU\\u00d1ECA PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA, ESPECIALMENTE EN CASOS RELACIONADOS CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE ALZHEIMER O DEBILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/100','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:41:09','2026-04-26 23:41:09'),(3903,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',101,'{\"symptoms\":\"PSORIASIS, SKIN INFECTIONS, RHEUMATIC FEVER, INFECTION OF THE PHARYNX AND TONSILS. (PSORIASIS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA FARINGE Y AM\\u00cdGDALAS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PSORIASIS, SKIN INFECTIONS, RHEUMATIC FEVER, AND INFECTION OF THE PHARYNX AND TONSILS.\\n\\n(PSORIASIS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA E INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA FARINGE Y AM\\u00cdGDALAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS A PYOGENES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE CALF MUSCLES (GASTROCNEMIUS). THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO ADDRESS SEVERE DERMATOLOGICAL CONDITIONS LIKE PSORIASIS AND PREVENT SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS RHEUMATIC FEVER. IT IS CRITICAL FOR CLEARING BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CAUSE RECURRING THROAT AND SKIN INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO A PYOGENES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS DE LA PANTORRILLA (GASTROCNEMIO). ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA ABORDAR CONDICIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS SEVERAS COMO LA PSORIASIS Y PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMO LA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA. ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE CAUSAN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RECURRENTE EN LA GARGANTA Y LA PIEL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMAL AXIS: SCAN THE BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL (REF 90) TO ADDRESS STREPTOCOCCUS ALFA CO-INFECTIONS. CHECK THE BLADDER AND POPLITEAL FOSSA TO ENSURE FULL SYSTEMIC CLEARANCE OF STREPTOCIDAL RESONANCES THROUGHOUT THE BODY.\\n\\n(EJE DERMAL: ESCANEAR BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL (REF 90) PARA ABORDAR COINFECCIONES DE ESTREPTOCOCO ALFA. REVISAR LA VEJIGA Y LA FOSA POPL\\u00cdTEA PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA COMPLETA DE LAS RESONANCIAS ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICAS EN TODO EL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/101','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:42:26','2026-04-26 23:42:26'),(3904,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',102,'{\"symptoms\":\"CONJUNCTIVITIS, GLAUCOMA, FUNGAL INFECTIONS. (CONJUNTIVITIS, GLAUCOMA, INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS)\",\"paths\":\"NUMBER OF VARIOUS EYE PROBLEMS. FUNGAL INFECTION OF THE SCALP. GENERATES ALFATOXIN B TO THE BODY, WHICH IS CARCINOGENIC. (N\\u00daMERO DE DIVERSOS PROBLEMAS OCULARES. INFECCI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA DEL CUERO CABELLUDO. GENERA AFLATOXINA B EN EL CUERPO, QUE ES CARCINOG\\u00c9NICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH STOMACH\\/ADRENALS, EYE CLOUDINESS, AND LENS OPACITY. ASSOCIATED WITH LIVER LIGAMENT\\/KIDNEY; PRODUCES CONJUNCTIVITIS, VIRAL GLAUCOMA. ASSOCIATED WITH DORSAL 2, KERATOCONUS. (ASOCIADO CON EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ SUPRARRENALES; OPACIDAD OCULAR Y DEL CRISTALINO. ASOCIADO CON LIGAMENTO HEP\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N; PRODUCE CONJUNTIVITIS, GLAUCOMA VIRAL. ASOCIADO CON DORSAL 2; QUERATOCONO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"CONJUNCTIVITIS, GLAUCOMA, AND FUNGAL INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(CONJUNTIVITIS, GLAUCOMA E INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ASPERGILLUS FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE CANTHUS (CORNER OF THE EYE). THIS RESET ADDRESSES VARIOUS EYE PROBLEMS AND FUNGAL INFECTIONS OF THE SCALP. IT IS PARTICULARLY CRITICAL BECAUSE THIS PATHOGEN GENERATES AFLATOXIN B IN THE BODY, WHICH IS KNOWN TO BE CARCINOGENIC. STABILIZING THIS PAIR HELPS PROTECT OCULAR HEALTH AND REDUCE SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO ASPERGILLUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL CANTO (COMISURA DEL OJO). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA DIVERSOS PROBLEMAS OCULARES E INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS DEL CUERO CABELLUDO. ES PARTICULARMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO GENERA AFLATOXINA B EN EL CUERPO, LA CUAL ES CONOCIDA POR SER CARCINOG\\u00c9NICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE PAR AYUDA A PROTEGER LA SALUD OCULAR Y REDUCIR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"OCULAR AXIS: ASSOCIATED WITH STOMACH \\/ ADRENALS FOR EYE CLOUDINESS AND LENS OPACITY. CHECK LIVER LIGAMENT \\/ KIDNEY FOR VIRAL GLAUCOMA OR CONJUNCTIVITIS. SCAN DORSAL 2 TO ADDRESS KERATOCONUS.\\n\\n(EJE OCULAR: ASOCIADO CON EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ SUPRARRENALES PARA LA OPACIDAD OCULAR Y DEL CRISTALINO. REVISAR LIGAMENTO HEP\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA CASOS DE GLAUCOMA VIRAL O CONJUNTIVITIS. ESCANEAR DORSAL 2 PARA ABORDAR EL QUERATOCONO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/102','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:43:32','2026-04-26 23:43:32'),(3905,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',103,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"RINGWORM (TI\\u00d1A)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"TINEA CAPITIS (TI\\u00d1A CAPITIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"RINGWORM, SCALP IRRITATION, HAIR LOSS IN PATCHES, AND ITCHING.\\n\\n(TI\\u00d1A, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERO CABELLUDO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO EN PARCHES Y PICAZ\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TINEA CAPITIS FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE SCALP (CAPITIS). THIS RESET ADDRESSES FUNGAL COLONIZATION OF THE HAIR SHAFTS AND SKIN, HELPING TO ELIMINATE THE \\\"RINGWORM\\\" EFFECT. BY STABILIZING THE BIOFIELD IN THIS REGION, IT PROMOTES THE RECOVERY OF THE SCALP EPITHELIUM AND REDUCES THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE THAT LEADS TO ITCHING AND LOCALIZED ALOPECIA.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO TI\\u00d1A CAPITIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL CUERO CABELLUDO (CAPITIS). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA DE LOS TALLOS PILOSOS Y LA PIEL, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR EL EFECTO DE LA \\\"TI\\u00d1A\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR EL BIOCAMPO EN ESTA REGI\\u00d3N, PROMUEVE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL EPITELIO DEL CUERO CABELLUDO Y REDUCE LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA QUE PROVOCA PICAZ\\u00d3N Y ALOPECIA LOCALIZADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL CHECK: SCAN THE CANTHUS \\/ CANTHUS (REF 102) TO RULE OUT ASPERGILLUS CROSS-CONTAMINATION. IF DANDRUFF IS PRESENT IN OTHER AREAS, CHECK THE MEDIAL KNEE LIGAMENT \\/ MALLEOLUS (REF 520) FOR MICROSPORUM RESONANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA: ESCANEAR EL CANTO \\/ CANTO (REF 102) PARA DESCARTAR CONTAMINACI\\u00d3N CRUZADA POR ASPERGILLUS. SI HAY CASPA EN OTRAS \\u00c1REAS, REVISAR EL LIGAMENTO MEDIAL DE LA RODILLA \\/ MAL\\u00c9OLO (REF 520) PARA DETECTAR RESONANCIAS DE MICROSPORUM.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/103','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:44:36','2026-04-26 23:44:36'),(3906,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',104,'{\"symptoms\":\"ESOPHAGUS - CANCER, BARRETTES, REFLUX, OBSTRUCTION, POLYPS, ULCERS. DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, HERNIAS, COLITIS, RHEUMATIC FEVER, SCARLET FEVER. (ES\\u00d3FAGO \\u2013 C\\u00c1NCER, BARRETT, REFLUJO, OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N, P\\u00d3LIPOS, \\u00daLCERAS. PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, HERNIAS, COLITIS, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, ESCARLATINA)\",\"paths\":\"ESOPHAGEAL VARICES. JOINT PAIN. FALSE DIABETES, ABNORMALITIES IN CARDIA, ESOPHAGUS, DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, IN TRACHEA TONSILS, BRONCHIAL JOINT AND BONE PAIN. (V\\u00c1RICES ESOF\\u00c1GICAS. DOLOR ARTICULAR. FALSA DIABETES, ANOMAL\\u00cdAS EN EL CARDIAS, ES\\u00d3FAGO, PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, EN LA TR\\u00c1QUEA, AM\\u00cdGDALAS, BRONQUIOS, DOLOR ARTICULAR Y \\u00d3SEO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH DORSAL 2; PRODUCES LARGE AMOUNTS OF MUCUS.                         CHECK - BURSA\\/ELBOW (ASOCIADO CON DORSAL 2; PRODUCE GRANDES CANTIDADES DE MUCOSIDAD.\\u2003\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 BURSA \\/ CODO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ESOPHAGUS ISSUES - CANCER, BARRETT\'S, REFLUX, OBSTRUCTION, POLYPS, ULCERS. DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, HERNIAS, COLITIS, RHEUMATIC FEVER, AND SCARLET FEVER.\\n\\n(ES\\u00d3FAGO \\u2013 C\\u00c1NCER, BARRETT, REFLUJO, OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N, P\\u00d3LIPOS, \\u00daLCERAS. PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, HERNIAS, COLITIS, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, ESCARLATINA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS BETA HEMOLYTIC TO ADDRESS ALTERATIONS IN THE CARDIA AND ESOPHAGUS, INCLUDING ESOPHAGEAL VARICES. THIS RESET HELPS CORRECT \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" AND ALLEVIATES JOINT AND BONE PAIN, AS WELL AS DISCOMFORT IN THE TRACHEA, TONSILS, AND BRONCHI RELATED TO THIS BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO BETA HEMOL\\u00cdTICO PARA TRATAR ALTERACIONES EN EL CARDIAS Y EL ES\\u00d3FAGO, INCLUYENDO V\\u00c1RICES ESOF\\u00c1GICAS. ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A CORREGIR LA \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\" Y ALIVIA EL DOLOR ARTICULAR Y \\u00d3SEO, AS\\u00cd COMO MOLESTIAS EN LA TR\\u00c1QUEA, AM\\u00cdGDALAS Y BRONQUIOS RELACIONADAS CON ESTA CARGA BACTERIANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH DORSAL 2: THIS COMBINATION OFTEN PRODUCES LARGE AMOUNTS OF MUCUS. IT IS RECOMMENDED TO CHECK THE BURSA \\/ ELBOW (REF 99) PAIR TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF STREPTOCOCCAL RESONANCES.\\n\\n(ASOCIADO CON DORSAL 2; PRODUCE GRANDES CANTIDADES DE MUCOSIDAD. SE RECOMIENDA REVISAR EL PAR BURSA \\/ CODO PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LAS RESONANCIAS ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/104','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:46:29','2026-04-26 23:46:29'),(3907,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',105,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LATENT PARASITIC LOADS, LYMPHATIC CONGESTION, AND POTENTIAL DIGESTIVE OR RESPIRATORY DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(CARGAS PARASITARIAS LATENTES, CONGESTI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y POSIBLES MOLESTIAS DIGESTIVAS O RESPIRATORIAS.\",\"paths\":\"ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR THE FILARIA PARASITE. TARGETS SEQUESTERED PARASITIC LOADS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CARDIA (UPPER STOMACH OPENING) AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS ON THE SAME SIDE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BIOFIELD TO PREVENT THE PARASITE FROM FINDING REFUGE IN THE SYSTEM, WHICH CAN OTHERWISE LEAD TO LYMPHATIC BLOCKAGES OR INTERFERE WITH THE NORMAL FUNCTIONING OF THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO PARA EL PAR\\u00c1SITO FILARIA. SE DIRIGE A LAS CARGAS PARASITARIAS SECUESTRADAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CARDIAS (ABERTURA SUPERIOR DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO) Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DEL MISMO LADO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL BIOCAMPO PARA EVITAR QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO ENCUENTRE REFUGIO EN EL SISTEMA, LO QUE DE OTRO MODO PODR\\u00cdA PROVOCAR BLOQUEOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS O INTERFERIR CON EL FUNCIONAMIENTO NORMAL DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARASITIC CHECK: SCAN THE MASTOID \\/ MASTOID TO RULE OUT FILARIA MANIFESTATIONS AFFECTING THE EQUILIBRIUM OR INNER EAR. IF LYMPHATIC SWELLING IS PRESENT, CHECK THE AXILLA \\/ AXILLA TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC DRAINAGE IS OPTIMAL.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA: ESCANEAR MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES PARA DESCARTAR MANIFESTACIONES DE FILARIA QUE AFECTEN EL EQUILIBRIO O EL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO. SI HAY HINCHAZ\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA, REVISAR AXILA \\/ AXILA PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL DRENAJE SIST\\u00c9MICO SEA \\u00d3PTIMO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/105','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:47:29','2026-04-26 23:47:29'),(3908,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',106,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DISORDERS OF THE LUNG, STOMACH, CARDIAC. RESPIRATORY CONGESTION. (TRASTORNOS DEL PULM\\u00d3N, EST\\u00d3MAGO Y CARD\\u00cdACOS. CONGESTI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"INFANTS BREAST FED - VOMITING. (LACTANTES AMAMANTADOS \\u2013 V\\u00d3MITO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"GASTRO-RESPIRATORY IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO GASTRO-RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"LUNG, STOMACH, AND CARDIAC DISORDERS. RESPIRATORY CONGESTION.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL PULM\\u00d3N, EST\\u00d3MAGO Y CARD\\u00cdACOS. CONGESTI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF THE VALVE BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND STOMACH BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS IN THE CARDIA REGION. THIS RESET ADDRESSES PHYSICAL DYSFUNCTIONS THAT CAUSE RESPIRATORY CONGESTION AND GASTRIC DISORDERS, HELPING TO RESTORE THE CORRECT FLOW OF DIGESTIVE ACIDS AND CLEARING THE CONGESTION THAT AFFECTS BOTH THE CARDIAC AND PULMONARY SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA V\\u00c1LVULA ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y EL EST\\u00d3MAGO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CARDIAS. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS DISFUNCIONES F\\u00cdSICAS QUE CAUSAN CONGESTI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR EL FLUJO CORRECTO DE LOS \\u00c1CIDOS DIGESTIVOS Y ELIMINANDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N QUE AFECTA TANTO AL SISTEMA CARD\\u00cdACO COMO AL PULMONAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PEDIATRIC CHECK: FREQUENTLY INDICATED FOR BREASTFED INFANTS EXPERIENCING PERSISTENT VOMITING. SCAN THE HIATUS ESOPHAGEAL AREA TO RULE OUT STRUCTURAL HERNIAS OR MECHANICAL BLOCKAGES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PEDI\\u00c1TRICA: INDICADO FRECUENTEMENTE PARA LACTANTES AMAMANTADOS QUE EXPERIMENTAN V\\u00d3MITOS PERSISTENTES. ESCANEAR EL \\u00c1REA DEL HIATO ESOF\\u00c1GICO PARA DESCARTAR HERNIAS ESTRUCTURALES O BLOQUEOS MEC\\u00c1NICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/106','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:48:40','2026-04-26 23:48:40'),(3909,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',107,'{\"symptoms\":\"HYPERTENSION, SCARLET FEVER, ESOPHAGEAL TUMORS AND CANCER, RHEUMATIC FEVER. (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, ESCARLATINA, TUMORES ESOF\\u00c1GICOS Y C\\u00c1NCER, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"paths\":\"AGGRESSIVE.  MANIFEST IN THE AIRWAY. CAN CAUSE HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, ESOPHAGEAL, CARDIA, HEMOPHILIA DISORDERS. (AGRESIVO. SE MANIFIESTA EN LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS. PUEDE CAUSAR HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNOS DEL ES\\u00d3FAGO, CARDIAS Y HEMOFILIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HYPERTENSION, SCARLET FEVER, ESOPHAGEAL TUMORS AND CANCER, RHEUMATIC FEVER.\\n\\n(HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, ESCARLATINA, TUMORES ESOF\\u00c1GICOS Y C\\u00c1NCER, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS AN AGGRESSIVE STRAIN OF STREPTOCOCCUS BETA HEMOLYTIC BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE AIRWAY AXIS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC MANIFESTATIONS SUCH AS HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE AND DISORDERS OF THE ESOPHAGUS AND CARDIA. IT IS CRITICAL FOR STABILIZING THE BIOFIELD AGAINST PATHOGENS THAT CAN LEAD TO HEMOPHILIA-LIKE DISORDERS OR MALIGNANT GROWTHS IN THE UPPER DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A UNA CEPA AGRESIVA DE ESTREPTOCOCO BETA HEMOL\\u00cdTICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA MANIFESTACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMO LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA Y TRASTORNOS DEL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y EL CARDIAS. ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ESTABILIZAR EL BIOCAMPO CONTRA PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE PUEDEN PROVOCAR TRASTORNOS TIPO HEMOFILIA O CRECIMIENTOS MALIGNOS EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO SUPERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION IS PERSISTENT, SCAN THE CAROTID \\/ CAROTID RESONANCE. FOR RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CARDIA \\/ ADRENALS (REF 104\\/105) AXIS TO ENSURE NO LINGERING STREPTOCOCCAL OR PARASITIC LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N ES PERSISTENTE, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ CAR\\u00d3TIDA. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CARDIAS \\/ SUPRARRENALES (REF 104\\/105) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA CARGAS ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICAS O PARASITARIAS REMANENTES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/107','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:49:41','2026-04-26 23:49:41'),(3910,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',108,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"MEMORY DISEASES, BIPOLAR, AUTISM. (ENFERMEDADES DE LA MEMORIA, BIPOLARIDAD, AUTISMO)\",\"paths\":\"TOXINS FROM MASSIVE VACCINATION. (TOXINAS POR VACUNACI\\u00d3N MASIVA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PERICARDIUM\\/TEMPORAL - R. REVISAR \\u2013 PERICARDIO \\/ TEMPORAL (D)\"}','{\"origins\":\"TOXIC ACCUMULATION (ACUMULACI\\u00d3N T\\u00d3XICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MEMORY DISEASES, BIPOLAR DISORDER, AND AUTISM.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDADES DE LA MEMORIA, BIPOLARIDAD Y AUTISMO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF PRIONS AND TOXINS BY ADDRESSING THE BIOFIELD AXIS BETWEEN THE CARDIA AND THE RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE. THIS RESET IS INDICATED FOR NEUROLOGICAL AND COGNITIVE ALTERATIONS THAT MAY BE LINKED TO TOXINS FROM MASSIVE VACCINATION, HELPING TO CLEAR INTERFERENCE THAT AFFECTS MEMORY, EMOTIONAL REGULATION, AND COGNITIVE PROCESSING.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE PRIONES Y TOXINAS MEDIANTE EL ABORDAJE DEL EJE DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL CARDIAS Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO. ESTE REINICIO EST\\u00c1 INDICADO PARA ALTERACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS Y COGNITIVAS QUE PUEDEN ESTAR VINCULADAS A TOXINAS POR VACUNACI\\u00d3N MASIVA, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR LA INTERFERENCIA QUE AFECTA LA MEMORIA, LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y EL PROCESAMIENTO COGNITIVO.)VA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: REVISAR \\u2013 PERICARDIUM \\/ TEMPORAL - R. (PERICARDIO \\/ TEMPORAL (D)) TO FURTHER STABILIZE EMOTIONAL AND MEMORY PATHWAYS. IF COGNITIVE DYSFUNCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER PRION-RELATED RESONANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: REVISAR \\u2013 PERICARDIO \\/ TEMPORAL (D) PARA ESTABILIZAR A\\u00daN M\\u00c1S LAS V\\u00cdAS EMOCIONALES Y DE LA MEMORIA. SI LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS RESONANCIAS RELACIONADAS CON PRIONES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/108','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:50:44','2026-04-26 23:50:44'),(3911,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',109,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"UROGENITAL DISEASES, STOMACH DISORDERS, CARDIAC DISORDERS, PULMONARY CONGESTION, UTERUS ABCESS. (ENFERMEDADES UROGENITALES, TRASTORNOS DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO, TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR, ABSCESO UTERINO)\",\"paths\":\"UROGENITAL DISEASES. ALTERS THE SPERM PRODUCTION IN MEN. (ENFERMEDADES UROGENITALES. ALTERA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE ESPERMA EN LOS HOMBRES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"UROGENITAL AXIS (EJE UROGENITAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"UROGENITAL DISEASES, STOMACH DISORDERS, CARDIAC DISORDERS, PULMONARY CONGESTION, AND UTERUS ABSCESS.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDADES UROGENITALES, TRASTORNOS DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO, TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y ABSCESO UTERINO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CARDIA AND THE RIGHT TESTICLE OR LABIA. THIS RESET ADDRESSES DYSFUNCTIONS THAT ALTER SPERM PRODUCTION IN MEN AND CAN LEAD TO VARIOUS UROGENITAL DISEASES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT ALSO HELPS CLEAR SECONDARY SYMPTOMS SUCH AS PULMONARY CONGESTION AND GASTRIC IMBALANCES LINKED TO THIS ENERGETIC CIRCUIT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL CARDIAS Y EL TEST\\u00cdCULO O LABIO DERECHO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA DISFUNCIONES QUE ALTERAN LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE ESPERMA EN LOS HOMBRES Y PUEDEN CONDUCIR A DIVERSAS ENFERMEDADES UROGENITALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, TAMBI\\u00c9N AYUDA A ELIMINAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS SECUNDARIOS COMO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS G\\u00c1STRICOS VINCULADOS A ESTE CIRCUITO ENERG\\u00c9TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR CHECK: IF UROGENITAL ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE PITUITARY GLAND TO ENSURE HORMONAL BALANCE. FOR UTERINE CONCERNS IN WOMEN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL \\/ UTERUS (REF 155) TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VAGINAL INFECTIONS OR ABSCESSES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR: SI LOS PROBLEMAS UROGENITALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO HORMONAL. PARA PROBLEMAS UTERINOS EN MUJERES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL PAR CERVICAL \\/ \\u00daTERO (REF 155) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES INFECCIONES VAGINALES O ABSCESOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/109','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:51:54','2026-04-26 23:51:54'),(3912,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',112,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HEART PROBLEMS (PROBLEMAS CARD\\u00cdACOS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CARDIAC STABILITY (ESTABILIDAD CARD\\u00cdACA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEART PROBLEMS, CIRCULATORY DYSFUNCTION, AND BLOOD PRESSURE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS CARD\\u00cdACOS, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N CIRCULATORIA Y DESEQUILIBRIOS DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE OPTIMIZATION OF CARDIOVASCULAR FLOW BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CAROTID ARTERY AND THE AORTA. THIS RESET ADDRESSES MECHANICAL AND ENERGETIC IMBALANCES WITHIN THE PRIMARY ARTERIAL HIGHWAYS, HELPING TO REGULATE BLOOD PRESSURE AND SUPPORT THE OVERALL EFFICIENCY OF THE HEART\'S PUMPING MECHANISM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA OPTIMIZACI\\u00d3N DEL FLUJO CARDIOVASCULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LA ARTERIA CAR\\u00d3TIDA Y LA AORTA. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS MEC\\u00c1NICOS Y ENERG\\u00c9TICOS DENTRO DE LAS PRINCIPALES V\\u00cdAS ARTERIALES, AYUDANDO A REGULAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL Y A APOYAR LA EFICIENCIA GENERAL DEL MECANISMO DE BOMBEO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION IS PRESENT, SCAN THE CAROTID \\/ CAROTID AXIS. FOR DEEPER CARDIAC REGULATION, CHECK THE PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE ENERGETIC PROTECTION OF THE HEART IS INTACT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI HAY HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ CAR\\u00d3TIDA. PARA UNA REGULACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA, REVISAR LA RESONANCIA PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA PROTECCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9 INTACTA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/112','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:53:30','2026-04-26 23:53:30'),(3913,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',113,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":\"BLOOD PRESSURE ABOVE 120\\/80 (SYSTOLIC\\/DIASTOLIC). (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL POR ENCIMA DE 120\\/80 (SIST\\u00d3LICA\\/DIAST\\u00d3LICA))\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK: KIDNEY\\/KIDNEY (REVISAR \\u2013 RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N)\"}','{\"origins\":\"ARTERIAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERTENSION (BLOOD PRESSURE ABOVE 120\\/80).\\n\\n(HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL POR ENCIMA DE 120\\/80).)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SYSTEMIC REGULATION OF BLOOD PRESSURE BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE CAROTID ARTERIES. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE BARORECEPTORS RESPONSIBLE FOR MONITORING ARTERIAL TENSION, HELPING THE BODY TO NATURALLY LOWER HYPERTENSION AND RESTORE BALANCED CIRCULATORY FORCE THROUGHOUT THE VASCULAR SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO EN LAS ARTERIAS CAR\\u00d3TIDAS. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA LOS BARORRECEPTORES RESPONSABLES DE MONITOREAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A BAJAR NATURALMENTE LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURAR UNA FUERZA CIRCULATORIA EQUILIBRADA EN TODO EL SISTEMA VASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: SCAN THE KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY RESONANCE TO RULE OUT RENAL-INDUCED HYPERTENSION. IF CIRCULATORY ISSUES PERSIST, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CAROTID \\/ AORTA (REF 112) TO OPTIMIZE PRIMARY ARTERIAL FLOW.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA DESCARTAR HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N INDUCIDA POR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL. SI LOS PROBLEMAS CIRCULATORIOS PERSISTEN, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ AORTA (REF 112) PARA OPTIMIZAR EL FLUJO ARTERIAL PRIMARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/113','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-26 23:54:35','2026-04-26 23:54:35'),(3914,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',114,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CAROTIDITIS\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CAROTIDITIS (CAROTIDITIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE CAROTID ARTERY, SENSITIVITY IN THE NECK, AND POTENTIAL CIRCULATORY DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA ARTERIA CAR\\u00d3TIDA, SENSIBILIDAD EN EL CUELLO Y POSIBLES MOLESTIAS CIRCULATORIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE VIRAL LOAD CAUSING CAROTIDITIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CAROTID ARTERY AND THE PUDENDAL NERVE. THIS RESET STABILIZES THE VASCULAR AND NEUROLOGICAL AXIS, HELPING TO REDUCE INFLAMMATION IN THE NECK REGION AND ADDRESSING THE VIRAL ROOT THAT MAY BE AFFECTING ARTERIAL INTEGRITY OR NERVE SIGNALING.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA CARGA VIRAL QUE CAUSA CAROTIDITIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA ARTERIA CAR\\u00d3TIDA Y EL NERVIO PUDENDO. ESTE REINICIO ESTABILIZA EL EJE VASCULAR Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICO, AYUDANDO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CUELLO Y ABORDANDO LA RA\\u00cdZ VIRAL QUE PUEDE ESTAR AFECTANDO LA INTEGRIDAD ARTERIAL O LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NERVE CHECK: SCAN THE PUDENDAL \\/ PUDENDAL (REF 658) TO RULE OUT THE MUMPS VIRUS (PAPERAS), WHICH OFTEN RESONATES IN THIS REGION. IF NECK PAIN PERSISTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CAROTID \\/ CAROTID (REF 113) AXIS TO ENSURE VASCULAR TENSION IS FULLY REGULATED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA: ESCANEAR EL PUDENDO \\/ PUDENDO (REF 658) PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DE LAS PAPERAS, QUE A MENUDO RESONAN EN ESTA REGI\\u00d3N. SI EL DOLOR DE CUELLO PERSISTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ CAR\\u00d3TIDA (REF 113) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE REGULADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/114','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 00:10:09','2026-04-27 00:10:09'),(3915,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',115,'{\"symptoms\":\"ATHLETES FEET, VAGINAL INFECTION, RINGWORM, BACK PAIN, ANXIETY AND PARANOIA. (PIE DE ATLETA, INFECCI\\u00d3N VAGINAL, TI\\u00d1A, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, ANSIEDAD Y PARANOIA)\",\"paths\":\"POSSIBLE TO CONTRACT STEPPING ON WET \\/DAMP SURFACES. LEADING PRODUCER OF FUNGAL INFECTIONS. (POSIBLE DE CONTRAER AL PISAR SUPERFICIES H\\u00daMEDAS \\/ MOJADAS. PRINCIPAL CAUSANTE DE INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH SCIATIC; CAUSES SERIOUS FUNGAL INFECTIONS.                         SCAN FOR THE VIRUS THAT SUPPORTS IT!                   CHECK - RIB 1 AND BIG TOE. (ASOCIADO CON EL CI\\u00c1TICO; CAUSA INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS GRAVES. \\u00a1ESCANEAR EL VIRUS QUE LO APOYA! REVISAR \\u2013 COSTILLA 1 Y DEDO GORDO DEL PIE.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ATHLETE\'S FOOT, VAGINAL INFECTION, RINGWORM, BACK PAIN, ANXIETY, AND PARANOIA.\\n\\n(PIE DE ATLETA, INFECCI\\u00d3N VAGINAL, TI\\u00d1A, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, ANSIEDAD Y PARANOIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRICHOPHYTON FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE VENA CAVA AXIS. THIS RESET IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING FUNGAL INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN RESULT FROM STEPPING ON WET OR DAMP SURFACES. BY STABILIZING THIS BIOFIELD, IT ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC FUNGAL SPREAD THAT CAN MANIFEST AS DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES OR EMOTIONAL DISTURBANCES LIKE ANXIETY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO TRICOFITO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DE LA VENA CAVA. ESTE REINICIO ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LAS INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS QUE A MENUDO RESULTAN DE PISAR SUPERFICIES H\\u00daMEDAS O MOJADAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE BIOCAMPO, ABORDA LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS O ALTERACIONES EMOCIONALES COMO LA ANSIEDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC SUPPORT: ASSOCIATED WITH THE SCIATIC NERVE; OFTEN CAUSES SERIOUS FUNGAL INFECTIONS. SCAN FOR THE SUPPORTING VIRUS! CHECK \\u2013 RIB 1 AND THE BIG TOE (DEDO GORDO DEL PIE) TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE FUNGAL CIRCUIT.\\n\\n(APOYO PAT\\u00d3GENO: ASOCIADO CON EL NERVIO CI\\u00c1TICO; A MENUDO CAUSA INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS GRAVES. \\u00a1ESCANEAR EL VIRUS QUE LO APOYA! REVISAR \\u2013 COSTILLA 1 Y EL DEDO GORDO DEL PIE PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DEL CIRCUITO F\\u00daNGICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/115','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 00:11:36','2026-04-27 00:11:36'),(3916,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',116,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"URIC ACID, GOUT. (\\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO, GOTA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - KIDNEYS AND INTESTINES\\/WITH MAGNETS ON BOTH KNEES. (REVISAR \\u2013 RI\\u00d1ONES E INTESTINOS \\/ CON IMANES EN AMBAS RODILLAS)\"}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"URIC ACID ACCUMULATION AND GOUT.\\n\\n(ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO Y GOTA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF URIC ACID LEVELS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VENA CAVA AND THE CERVICAL PLEXUS ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES METABOLIC DYSFUNCTIONS THAT LEAD TO THE CRYSTALLIZATION OF URIC ACID IN THE JOINTS (GOUT), HELPING TO REDUCE LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION AND PROMOTING THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF NITROGENOUS WASTE THROUGH THE VASCULAR AND NERVOUS SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NIVELES DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LA VENA CAVA Y EL PLEXO CERVICAL DEL LADO OPUESTO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS DISFUNCIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS QUE CONDUCEN A LA CRISTALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO EN LAS ARTICULACIONES (GOTA), AYUDANDO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA Y PROMOVIENDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS DESECHOS NITROGENADOS A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS SISTEMAS VASCULAR Y NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ELIMINATION CHECK: SCAN THE KIDNEYS (RI\\u00d1ONES) AND INTESTINES TO ENSURE OPTIMAL EXCRETION OF TOXINS. AS A COMPLEMENTARY ACTION, PLACE MAGNETS ON BOTH KNEES (AMBAS RODILLAS) TO ASSIST IN REDUCING JOINT CRYSTALLIZATION AND PAIN.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N: ESCANEAR LOS RI\\u00d1ONES E INTESTINOS PARA ASEGURAR UNA EXCRECI\\u00d3N \\u00d3PTIMA DE TOXINAS. COMO ACCI\\u00d3N COMPLEMENTARIA, COLOCAR IMANES EN AMBAS RODILLAS PARA AYUDAR A REDUCIR LA CRISTALIZACI\\u00d3N Y EL DOLOR ARTICULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/116','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 00:12:51','2026-04-27 00:12:51'),(3917,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',117,'{\"symptoms\":\"HIP AND FEMORAL HEAD ARTHRITIS, WHOOPING COUGH, AUTISM. (ARTRITIS DE CADERA Y CABEZA FEMORAL, TOS FERINA, AUTISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WHOOPING COUGH, HIP AND FEMORAL HEAD ARTHRITIS, AND POTENTIAL NEURODEVELOPMENTAL LINKS SUCH AS AUTISM.\\n\\n(TOS FERINA, ARTRITIS DE CADERA Y DE LA CABEZA FEMORAL, Y POSIBLES V\\u00cdNCULOS DEL NEURODESARROLLO COMO EL AUTISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TARGETS BORDETELLA PERTUSSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE CECUM. THIS RESET ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT CAN MIGRATE FROM THE DIGESTIVE TRACT TO THE SKELETAL SYSTEM, SPECIFICALLY AFFECTING THE HIP JOINTS. STABILIZING THIS AXIS IS ALSO CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING RESPIRATORY PATHOLOGY (WHOOPING COUGH) AND MANAGING ENERGETIC INTERFERENCES THAT MAY IMPACT GLANDULAR FUNCTION AND COGNITIVE DEVELOPMENT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BORDETELLA PERTUSSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL CIEGO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE PUEDE MIGRAR DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO AL SISTEMA ESQUEL\\u00c9TICO, AFECTANDO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE LAS ARTICULACIONES DE LA CADERA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE TAMBI\\u00c9N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR LA PATOLOG\\u00cdA RESPIRATORIA (TOS FERINA) Y MANEJAR LAS INTERFERENCIAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE PUEDEN IMPACTAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y EL DESARROLLO COGNITIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/117','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 00:14:05','2026-04-27 00:14:05'),(3918,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',118,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, URETHRITIS, PELVIC INFLAMMATION, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, FALSE DIABETES. PELVIC INFLAMMATION, DIGESTIVE DISORDER, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, FALSE DIABETES. (SANGRADO VAGINAL, URETRITIS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, GASES, FALSA DIABETES.)\",\"paths\":\"IN WOMEN, VAGINAL SYMPTOMS. SUCH AS, HEAVY BLEEDING (VAGINAL OR RECTAL). PRODUCING YELLOW-GREEN AND BAD ODOR DISCHARGES. VULVO AND PELVIC AREA ITCHING. URETHRITIS IN MEN, AND DISCHARGE FROM PENIS, PAINFUL URINATION. PAIN DURING INTERCOURSE AND URINATING. LOWER EXTREMITY PAIN. (EN MUJERES, S\\u00cdNTOMAS VAGINALES COMO SANGRADO ABUNDANTE (VAGINAL O RECTAL), SECRECI\\u00d3N AMARILLO-VERDOSA CON MAL OLOR Y PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LA VULVA Y \\u00c1REA P\\u00c9LVICA. URETRITIS EN HOMBRES, SECRECI\\u00d3N DEL PENE Y DOLOR AL ORINAR. DOLOR DURANTE LAS RELACIONES SEXUALES Y AL ORINAR. DOLOR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THE PATIENTS PARNER.                                  FIND THE BACTERIA THAT NOURISHES IT.                       CHECK - CECUM\\/KIDNEY (R) CHECK - ILEOCECAL VALVE\\/KIDNEY (R). (REVISAR \\u2013 LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE. ENCONTRAR LA BACTERIA QUE LO NUTRE. REVISAR \\u2013 CIEGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)\\u2003\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, URETHRITIS, PELVIC INFLAMMATION, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, AND FALSE DIABETES.\\n\\n(SANGRADO VAGINAL, URETRITIS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, GASES Y FALSA DIABETES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS TRICHOMONAS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE CECUM ON THE SAME SIDE. IN WOMEN, THIS RESET ADDRESSES VAGINAL SYMPTOMS SUCH AS HEAVY BLEEDING (VAGINAL OR RECTAL), YELLOW-GREEN DISCHARGE WITH BAD ODOR, AND PELVIC ITCHING. IN MEN, IT ADDRESSES URETHRITIS, PAINFUL URINATION, AND PENILE DISCHARGE. IT IS ALSO CRITICAL FOR ALLEVIATING LOWER EXTREMITY PAIN LINKED TO PELVIC CONGESTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LAS TRICOMONAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL CIEGO DEL MISMO LADO. EN MUJERES, ESTE REINICIO ABORDA S\\u00cdNTOMAS VAGINALES COMO SANGRADO ABUNDANTE (VAGINAL O RECTAL), SECRECI\\u00d3N AMARILLO-VERDOSA CON MAL OLOR Y PICAZ\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. EN HOMBRES, ABORDA LA URETRITIS, EL DOLOR AL ORINAR Y LA SECRECI\\u00d3N DEL PENE. TAMBI\\u00c9N ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ALIVIAR EL DOLOR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES VINCULADO A LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARTNER CHECK: IT IS STRONGLY RECOMMENDED TO CHECK THE PATIENT\'S PARTNER TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION. FIND THE BACTERIA THAT NOURISHES THE PARASITE. SCAN THE CECUM \\/ KIDNEY (R) AND THE ILEOCECAL VALVE \\/ KIDNEY (R) TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE PARASITIC CIRCUIT.\\n\\n(REVISAR PAREJA: SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE REVISAR A LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N. ENCONTRAR LA BACTERIA QUE NUTRE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO. ESCANEAR CIEGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) Y V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DEL CIRCUITO PARASITARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/118','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 00:15:10','2026-04-27 00:15:10'),(3919,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',119,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, URETHRITIS, PELVIC INFLAMMATION, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, FALSE DIABETES. PELVIC INFLAMMATION, DIGESTIVE DISORDER, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, FALSE DIABETES. (SANGRADO VAGINAL, URETRITIS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, GASES, FALSA DIABETES.)\",\"paths\":\"IN WOMEN, VAGINAL SYMPTOMS. SUCH AS, HEAVY BLEEDING (VAGINAL OR RECTAL). PRODUCING YELLOW-GREEN AND BAD ODOR DISCHARGES. VULVO AND PELVIC AREA ITCHING. URETHRITIS IN MEN,  AND DISCHARGE FROM PENIS, PAINFUL URINATION. PAIN DURING INTERCOURSE AND URINATING. LOWER EXTREMITY PAIN. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS VAGINALES EN MUJERES, COMO SANGRADO ABUNDANTE (VAGINAL O RECTAL), SECRECI\\u00d3N AMARILLO-VERDOSA CON MAL OLOR Y PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LA VULVA Y EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00c9LVICA. URETRITIS EN HOMBRES, SECRECI\\u00d3N DEL PENE Y DOLOR AL ORINAR. DOLOR DURANTE LAS RELACIONES SEXUALES Y AL ORINAR. DOLOR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THE PATIENTS PARNER.                                  FIND THE BACTERIA THAT NOURISHES IT.                       CHECK - CECUM\\/KIDNEY (R) CHECK - ILEOCECAL VALVE\\/KIDNEY (R) (REVISAR \\u2013 LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE. ENCONTRAR LA BACTERIA QUE LO NUTRE. REVISAR \\u2013 CIEGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)\\u2003REVISAR \\u2013 V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, URETHRITIS, PELVIC INFLAMMATION, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, AND FALSE DIABETES.\\n\\n(SANGRADO VAGINAL, URETRITIS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, GASES Y FALSA DIABETES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS TRICHOMONAS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CECUM AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. IN WOMEN, THIS RESET ADDRESSES VAGINAL SYMPTOMS SUCH AS HEAVY BLEEDING (VAGINAL OR RECTAL), YELLOW-GREEN DISCHARGE WITH BAD ODOR, AND ITCHING IN THE VULVAR AND PELVIC AREAS. IN MEN, IT ADDRESSES URETHRITIS, PENILE DISCHARGE, AND PAINFUL URINATION. IT ALSO ALLEVIATES PAIN DURING INTERCOURSE AND DISCOMFORT IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LAS TRICOMONAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CIEGO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. EN MUJERES, ESTE REINICIO ABORDA S\\u00cdNTOMAS VAGINALES COMO SANGRADO ABUNDANTE (VAGINAL O RECTAL), SECRECI\\u00d3N AMARILLO-VERDOSA CON MAL OLOR Y PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LA VULVA Y EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00c9LVICA. EN HOMBRES, ABORDA LA URETRITIS, SECRECI\\u00d3N DEL PENE Y DOLOR AL ORINAR. TAMBI\\u00c9N ALIVIA EL DOLOR DURANTE LAS RELACIONES SEXUALES Y LAS MOLESTIAS EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARTNER CHECK: STRONGLY RECOMMENDED TO CHECK THE PATIENT\'S PARTNER TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION. FIND THE BACTERIA THAT NOURISHES THE PARASITE. CROSS-REFERENCE WITH: CECUM \\/ KIDNEY (R) AND ILEOCECAL VALVE \\/ KIDNEY (R).\\n\\n(REVISAR PAREJA: SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE REVISAR A LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N. ENCONTRAR LA BACTERIA QUE LO NUTRE. REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON: CIEGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) Y V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D).)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/119','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 00:16:18','2026-04-27 00:16:18'),(3920,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',120,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EPILEPSY, SEIZURES, AND CEREBELLUM TOXICITY. (EPILEPSIA, CONVULSIONES Y TOXICIDAD DEL CEREBELO)\",\"paths\":\"HELPS TO CONTROL SEIZERS AND EPILEPSY. HELPS REGULATE THE LINBIC SYSTEM. (AYUDA A CONTROLAR LAS CONVULSIONES Y LA EPILEPSIA. AYUDA A REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EPILEPSY, SEIZURES, AND CEREBELLUM TOXICITY.\\n\\n(EPILEPSIA, CONVULSIONES Y TOXICIDAD DEL CEREBELO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE STABILIZATION OF THE CEREBELLUM BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE LEFT HEMISPHERE. THIS RESET HELPS TO CONTROL SEIZURES AND EPILEPTIC EPISODES BY REGULATING THE LIMBIC SYSTEM AND ADDRESSING TOXICITY THAT MAY BE INTERFERING WITH MOTOR CONTROL AND COORDINATION. BY HARMONIZING THIS REGION, IT SUPPORTS THE BRAIN\'S NATURAL ABILITY TO MANAGE ELECTRICAL DISCHARGES AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBELO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO DENTRO DEL HEMISFERIO IZQUIERDO. ESTE REINICIO AYUDA A CONTROLAR LAS CONVULSIONES Y LOS EPISODIOS EPIL\\u00c9PTICOS AL REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO Y ABORDAR LA TOXICIDAD QUE PUEDE ESTAR INTERFIRIENDO CON EL CONTROL MOTOR Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N. AL ARMONIZAR ESTA REGI\\u00d3N, APOYA LA CAPACIDAD NATURAL DEL CEREBRO PARA MANEJAR LAS DESCARGAS EL\\u00c9CTRICAS Y EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TOXICITY CHECK: IF SEIZURES PERSIST, SCAN THE OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL AXIS TO RULE OUT DEEPER NEUROLOGICAL INTERFERENCE. FOR EMOTIONAL STABILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE LIMBIC SYSTEM IS FULLY CALIBRATED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TOXICIDAD: SI LAS CONVULSIONES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS M\\u00c1S PROFUNDAS. PARA LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE CALIBRADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/120','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 00:17:31','2026-04-27 00:17:31'),(3921,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',121,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CONCENTRATION (CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COGNITIVE BLOCKAGE (BLOQUEO COGNITIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"LACK OF CONCENTRATION, MENTAL FOG, AND DIFFICULTY FOCUSING ON TASKS.\\n\\n(FALTA DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N, NEBLINA MENTAL Y DIFICULTAD PARA ENFOCARSE EN LAS TAREAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RESTORATION OF MENTAL FOCUS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE LOWER SPINE (HORSETAIL\\/CODA EQUINA). THIS RESET ADDRESSES EMOTIONAL AND ENERGETIC INTERFERENCES THAT DISRUPT THE SIGNALING BETWEEN THE COORDINATION CENTER OF THE BRAIN AND THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT PROMOTES BETTER COGNITIVE FLOW, ENHANCED CONCENTRATION, AND THE CLEARING OF \\\"MENTAL NOISE\\\" THAT PREVENTS PERSISTENT ATTENTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DEL ENFOQUE MENTAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL CEREBELO Y LA PARTE BAJA DE LA COLUMNA (COLA DE CABALLO). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS INTERFERENCIAS EMOCIONALES Y ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE INTERRUMPEN LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CENTRO DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBRO Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, PROMUEVE UN MEJOR FLUJO COGNITIVO, MEJORA LA CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINA EL \\\"RUIDO MENTAL\\\" QUE IMPIDE LA ATENCI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CONCENTRATION CHECK: SCAN THE PINEAL GLAND \\/ PINEAL GLAND TO ENSURE OPTIMAL NEUROTRANSMITTER BALANCE. IF THE LACK OF FOCUS IS ACCOMPANIED BY FATIGUE, CHECK THE ADRENAL GLANDS \\/ KIDNEY AXIS TO RULE OUT SYSTEMIC EXHAUSTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N: ESCANEAR GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL PARA ASEGURAR UN EQUILIBRIO \\u00d3PTIMO DE NEUROTRANSMISORES. SI LA FALTA DE ENFOQUE VA ACOMPA\\u00d1ADA DE FATIGA, REVISAR EL EJE GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA DESCARTAR AGOTAMIENTO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/121','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:27:52','2026-04-27 10:27:52'),(3922,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',122,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"MEMORY (MEMORIA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COGNITIVE ENCODING (CODIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MEMORY LOSS, DIFFICULTY RETRIEVING INFORMATION, AND MENTAL FATIGUE.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA, DIFICULTAD PARA RECUPERAR INFORMACI\\u00d3N Y FATIGA MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE OPTIMIZATION OF MEMORY FUNCTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). THIS RESET ADDRESSES EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGES THAT INTERFERE WITH THE STORAGE AND RETRIEVAL OF DATA WITHIN THE BRAIN. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HARMONIZES THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE BODY\'S COORDINATION CENTER AND THE MASTER GLAND, PROMOTING CLARITY OF THOUGHT AND THE RESTORATION OF COGNITIVE MEMORY PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA OPTIMIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES DE LA MEMORIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL CEREBELO Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LOS BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES QUE INTERFIEREN CON EL ALMACENAMIENTO Y LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE DATOS DENTRO DEL CEREBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, ARMONIZA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CENTRO DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA, PROMOVIENDO LA CLARIDAD DE PENSAMIENTO Y LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS DE LA MEMORIA COGNITIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR CHECK: SCAN THE PINEAL GLAND \\/ PINEAL GLAND TO ENHANCE OVERALL COGNITIVE FOCUS. IF MEMORY ISSUES ARE LINKED TO SEVERE STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CEREBELLUM \\/ HORSETAIL (REF 121) AXIS TO CLEAR SYSTEMIC NERVOUS INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR: ESCANEAR GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL PARA MEJORAR EL ENFOQUE COGNITIVO GENERAL. SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE MEMORIA EST\\u00c1N VINCULADOS A ESTR\\u00c9S SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CEREBELO \\/ COLA DE CABALLO (REF 121) PARA ELIMINAR LA INTERFERENCIA NERVIOSA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/122','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:30:27','2026-04-27 10:30:27'),(3923,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',123,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"RELEASES NEGATIVE ENERGY. (LIBERA ENERG\\u00cdA NEGATIVA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENERGETIC RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"RELEASES NEGATIVE ENERGY. EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS OR ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES.\\n\\n(LIBERA ENERG\\u00cdA NEGATIVA. PESADEZ EMOCIONAL O BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SYSTEMIC RELEASE OF NEGATIVE ENERGETIC LOADS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE JEJUNUM (MIDDLE PART OF THE SMALL INTESTINE). THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC CONNECTION BETWEEN THE BRAIN\'S COORDINATION CENTER AND THE ENTERIC NERVOUS SYSTEM, HELPING TO PURGE \\\"EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES\\\" OR CRISES THAT MANIFEST PHYSICALLY IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT FACILITATES THE CLEARING OF EMOTIONAL TOXICITY THAT MAY BE IMPACTING OVERALL WELLNESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE CARGAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS NEGATIVAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL CEREBELO Y EL YEYUNO (PARTE MEDIA DEL INTESTINO DELGADO). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL CENTRO DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBRO Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO ENT\\u00c9RICO, AYUDANDO A DEPURAR \\\"C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS\\\" O CRISIS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN F\\u00cdSICAMENTE EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, FACILITA LA LIMPIEZA DE LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL QUE PUEDE ESTAR AFECTANDO EL BIENESTAR GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: SCAN THE AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA TO ENSURE EMOTIONAL PROCESSING IS UNBLOCKED. IF DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT REMAINS AFTER THE ENERGY RELEASE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CECUM \\/ CECUM (REF 117\\/118) TO RULE OUT REMAINING PATHOGENIC RESONANCES IN THE INTESTINAL TRACK.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: ESCANEAR AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL PROCESAMIENTO EMOCIONAL EST\\u00c9 DESBLOQUEADO. SI PERSISTEN LAS MOLESTIAS DIGESTIVAS DESPU\\u00c9S DE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE ENERG\\u00cdA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON CECO \\/ CECO (REF 117\\/118) PARA DESCARTAR RESONANCIAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS REMANENTES EN EL TRACTO INTESTINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/123','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:31:42','2026-04-27 10:31:42'),(3924,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',124,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, EQUILIBRIUM PROBLEMS, AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR, AND MUSCLE COORDINATION. (MAREO, PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO, COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO Y COORDINACI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR)\",\"paths\":\"EQUILIBRIUM PROBLEMS, SUCH AS STAGGERING AND MUSCLE COORDINATIONS. (PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO, COMO INESTABILIDAD AL CAMINAR Y COORDINACI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, EQUILIBRIUM PROBLEMS, AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR, AND MUSCLE COORDINATION.\\n\\n(MAREO, PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO, COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO Y COORDINACI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEWCASTLE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). THIS RESET IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING NEUROLOGICAL DISRUPTIONS THAT AFFECT PHYSICAL STABILITY, SUCH AS STAGGERING OR INABILITY TO MAINTAIN BALANCE. BY HARMONIZING THIS AXIS, IT ALSO HELPS REGULATE EMOTIONAL IMPULSES AND IMPROVES OVERALL MOTOR CONTROL AND MUSCLE SYNERGY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS NEWCASTLE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CEREBELO Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. ESTE REINICIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LAS ALTERACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS QUE AFECTAN LA ESTABILIDAD F\\u00cdSICA, COMO EL TAMBALEO O LA INCAPACIDAD PARA MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO. AL ARMONIZAR ESTE EJE, TAMBI\\u00c9N AYUDA A REGULAR LOS IMPULSOS EMOCIONALES Y MEJORA EL CONTROL MOTOR GENERAL Y LA SINERGIA MUSCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF DIZZINESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE EAR \\/ EAR RESONANCE TO RULE OUT INNER EAR PATHOGENS. FOR AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA AXIS TO ENSURE THE EMOTIONAL CENTER IS STABILIZED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI EL MAREO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA O\\u00cdDO \\/ O\\u00cdDO PARA DESCARTAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS EN EL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO. PARA EL COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CENTRO EMOCIONAL EST\\u00c9 ESTABILIZADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/124','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:33:05','2026-04-27 10:33:05'),(3925,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',125,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, FIBROMYALGIA, EPILEPSY, MIGRAINE. (FIEBRE, FIBROMIALGIA, EPILEPSIA, MIGRA\\u00d1A)\",\"paths\":\"CAUSED FROM MOSQUITOS. (CAUSADO POR MOSQUITOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, FIBROMYALGIA, EPILEPSY, AND MIGRAINE.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, FIBROMIALGIA, EPILEPSIA Y MIGRA\\u00d1A.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EQUINE ENCEPHALITIS VIRUS, OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITOES, BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID MUSCLE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES DEEP NEUROLOGICAL INFLAMMATION THAT MANIFESTS AS SEVERE HEADACHES (MIGRAINES) AND SYSTEMIC MUSCLE PAIN. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS REGULATE THE BRAIN\'S ELECTRICAL ACTIVITY TO REDUCE THE FREQUENCY OF EPILEPTIC EPISODES AND ALLEVIATE CHRONIC PAIN SYNDROMES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA ENCEFALITIS EQUINA, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO POR MOSQUITOS, MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CEREBELO Y EL M\\u00daSCULO ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA PROFUNDA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLORES DE CABEZA INTENSOS (MIGRA\\u00d1AS) Y DOLOR MUSCULAR SIST\\u00c9MICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A REGULAR LA ACTIVIDAD EL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL CEREBRO PARA REDUCIR LA FRECUENCIA DE LOS EPISODIOS EPIL\\u00c9PTICOS Y ALIVIAR LOS S\\u00cdNDROMES DE DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF EPILEPTIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE CEREBELLUM \\/ CEREBELLUM (REF 120) TO FURTHER STABILIZE THE HEMISPHERES. FOR CHRONIC MUSCLE PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER VIRAL RESONANCES AFFECTING THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS EPIL\\u00c9PTICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR CEREBELO \\/ CEREBELO (REF 120) PARA ESTABILIZAR A\\u00daN M\\u00c1S LOS HEMISFERIOS. PARA EL DOLOR MUSCULAR CR\\u00d3NICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS RESONANCIAS VIRALES QUE AFECTEN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/125','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:34:15','2026-04-27 10:34:15'),(3926,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',126,'{\"origins\":\"MORAXELLA CATARRHALIA\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS\",\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, OTITIS MEDIA (EAR INFECTION), SINUSITIS, AND BRONCHITIS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, OTITIS MEDIA (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE O\\u00cdDO), SINUSITIS Y BRONQUITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE SUPRASPINATUS MUSCLE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES BACTERIAL LOADS THAT COMMONLY COLONIZE THE UPPER RESPIRATORY TRACT, HELPING TO CLEAR PERSISTENT CONGESTION IN THE SINUSES AND PREVENTING THE SPREAD OF INFECTION TO THE MIDDLE EAR OR LOWER AIRWAYS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CEREBELO Y EL M\\u00daSCULO SUPRAESPINOSO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE COM\\u00daNMENTE COLONIZAN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE EN LOS SENOS PARANASALES Y PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N HACIA EL O\\u00cdDO MEDIO O LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF SINUS PRESSURE PERSISTS, SCAN THE FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL AXIS. FOR EAR-RELATED SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE EAR \\/ EAR RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE AUDITORY CANAL IS FREE OF SECONDARY PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LA PRESI\\u00d3N SINUSAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS RELACIONADOS CON EL O\\u00cdDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA O\\u00cdDO \\/ O\\u00cdDO PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CONDUCTO AUDITIVO EST\\u00c9 LIBRE DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS SECUNDARIOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/126','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:35:42','2026-04-27 10:35:42'),(3927,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',127,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CONSCIENCE (CONCIENCIA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EXPANSION OF CONSCIOUSNESS (EXPANSI\\u00d3N DE LA CONCIENCIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"CONSCIENCE, SPIRITUAL AWAKENING, AND MENTAL CLARITY.\\n\\n(CONCIENCIA, DESPERTAR ESPIRITUAL Y CLARIDAD MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ENHANCEMENT OF HIGHER COGNITIVE AND SPIRITUAL FUNCTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBRAL CORTEX AND THE LEFT SIDE OF THE BRAIN-HYPOPHYSIS AXIS. THIS RESET IS INDICATED FOR INDIVIDUALS SEEKING GREATER SELF-AWARENESS AND A DEEPER CONNECTION TO THEIR CONSCIENCE. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS TO CLEAR EMOTIONAL \\\"FOG\\\" AND ALIGNS THE ANALYTICAL BRAIN WITH THE MASTER GLAND TO FACILITATE THE INTEGRATION OF NEW KNOWLEDGE AND ELEVATED STATES OF PERCEPTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA MEJORA DE LAS FUNCIONES COGNITIVAS Y ESPIRITUALES SUPERIORES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LA CORTEZA CEREBRAL Y EL EJE CEREBRO-HIP\\u00d3FISIS DEL LADO IZQUIERDO. ESTE REINICIO EST\\u00c1 INDICADO PARA PERSONAS QUE BUSCAN UNA MAYOR AUTOCONCIENCIA Y UNA CONEXI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA CON SU CONCIENCIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA \\\"NIEBLA\\\" EMOCIONAL Y ALINEA EL CEREBRO ANAL\\u00cdTICO CON LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA PARA FACILITAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE NUEVOS CONOCIMIENTOS Y ESTADOS ELEVADOS DE PERCEPCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TARGETS THE ENHANCEMENT OF HIGHER COGNITIVE AND SPIRITUAL FUNCTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBRAL CORTEX AND THE LEFT SIDE OF THE BRAIN-HYPOPHYSIS AXIS. THIS RESET IS INDICATED FOR INDIVIDUALS SEEKING GREATER SELF-AWARENESS AND A DEEPER CONNECTION TO THEIR CONSCIENCE. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS TO CLEAR EMOTIONAL \\\"FOG\\\" AND ALIGNS THE ANALYTICAL BRAIN WITH THE MASTER GLAND TO FACILITATE THE INTEGRATION OF NEW KNOWLEDGE AND ELEVATED STATES OF PERCEPTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA MEJORA DE LAS FUNCIONES COGNITIVAS Y ESPIRITUALES SUPERIORES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LA CORTEZA CEREBRAL Y EL EJE CEREBRO-HIP\\u00d3FISIS DEL LADO IZQUIERDO. ESTE REINICIO EST\\u00c1 INDICADO PARA PERSONAS QUE BUSCAN UNA MAYOR AUTOCONCIENCIA Y UNA CONEXI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA CON SU CONCIENCIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA \\\"NIEBLA\\\" EMOCIONAL Y ALINEA EL CEREBRO ANAL\\u00cdTICO CON LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA PARA FACILITAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE NUEVOS CONOCIMIENTOS Y ESTADOS ELEVADOS DE PERCEPCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/127','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:37:14','2026-04-27 10:37:14'),(3928,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',128,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEART FAILURE, LUNG DISEASE, ASTHMA, EPILEPSY, THORAX CANCER. (INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA, ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR, ASMA, EPILEPSIA, C\\u00c1NCER DE T\\u00d3RAX)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY PORK AND DIARY FOODS. CAUSES SHOULDER PAIN AND HAND TREMORS. (TRANSMITIDO POR CARNE DE CERDO Y PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. CAUSA DOLOR DE HOMBRO Y TEMBLORES EN LAS MANOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH CERVICAL 3\\/SUPRASPINATUS, TYPHOID. (ASOCIADO CON CERVICAL 3 \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO; TIFOIDEA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEART FAILURE, LUNG DISEASE, ASTHMA, EPILEPSY, AND THORAX CANCER.\\n\\n(INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA, ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR, ASMA, EPILEPSIA Y C\\u00c1NCER DE T\\u00d3RAX.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS BALANTIDIUM COLI AND TYPHOID PATHOGENS, WHICH ARE OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH PORK AND DAIRY PRODUCTS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS THAT MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS SHOULDER PAIN AND HAND TREMORS. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH IN THIS AXIS, IT HELPS PREVENT SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS THAT CAN AFFECT THE RESPIRATORY AND CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS BALANTIDIUM COLI Y TIFOIDEA, QUE A MENUDO SE TRANSMITEN A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA CARNE DE CERDO Y LOS PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO QUE SE MANIFIESTAN F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO DOLOR DE HOMBRO Y TEMBLORES EN LAS MANOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR EL PH EN ESTE EJE, AYUDA A PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE PUEDEN AFECTAR LOS SISTEMAS RESPIRATORIO Y CARDIOVASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH THE CERVICAL 3 \\/ SUPRASPINATUS AXIS. IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN FOR TYPHOID RESONANCES TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE BACTERIAL AND PARASITIC LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA: ASOCIADO CON EL EJE CERVICAL 3 \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR RESONANCIAS DE TIFOIDEA PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/128','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:38:24','2026-04-27 10:38:24'),(3929,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',129,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PINCHED NERVE (NERVIO PINZADO)\",\"paths\":\"RADICULOPATHY (RADICULOPAT\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NERVOUS SYSTEM COMPRESSION (COMPRESI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PINCHED NERVE, LOCALIZED PAIN, NUMBNESS, OR TINGLING IN THE NECK AND UPPER EXTREMITIES.\\n\\n(NERVIO PINZADO, DOLOR LOCALIZADO, ENTUMECIMIENTO O HORMIGUEO EN EL CUELLO Y LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS RADICULOPATHY BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS ALONG THE ENTIRE CERVICAL SPINE (C1 THROUGH C7). THIS RESET ADDRESSES NERVE COMPRESSION AND INFLAMMATION THAT OFTEN RESULTS IN \\\"PINCHED\\\" SENSATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT PROMOTES THE PROPER FLOW OF NERVE IMPULSES FROM THE BRAIN STEM THROUGH THE CERVICAL VERTEBRAE, HELPING TO ALLEVIATE RADIATING PAIN AND RESTORE MOBILITY TO THE NECK AND SHOULDERS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RADICULOPAT\\u00cdA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO A LO LARGO DE TODA LA COLUMNA CERVICAL (C1 A C7). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA COMPRESI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N QUE A MENUDO RESULTA EN SENSACIONES DE \\\"NERVIO PINZADO\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, PROMUEVE EL FLUJO ADECUADO DE LOS IMPULSOS NERVIOSOS DESDE EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS V\\u00c9RTEBRAS CERVICALES, AYUDANDO A ALIVIAR EL DOLOR RADIANTE Y RESTAURAR LA MOVILIDAD EN EL CUELLO Y LOS HOMBROS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF PAIN PERSISTS IN THE ARMS OR HANDS, SCAN THE CERVICAL 1 OR 3 \\/ DELTOID (REF 128) TO RULE OUT PARASITIC INTERFERENCE. FOR GENERAL NECK STIFFNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRAPEZIUS \\/ TRAPEZIUS AXIS TO ENSURE MUSCULAR TENSION IS FULLY RELEASED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL DOLOR PERSISTE EN LOS BRAZOS O LAS MANOS, ESCANEAR CERVICAL 1 O 3 \\/ DELTOIDES (REF 128) PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA. PARA LA RIGIDEZ GENERAL DEL CUELLO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE TRAPECIO \\/ TRAPECIO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR SE LIBERE COMPLETAMENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/129','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:39:42','2026-04-27 10:39:42'),(3930,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',130,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"PARASITE (PAR\\u00c1SITO)\",\"origins\":\"CHAGAS DISEASE (MAL DE CHAGAS) \\/ TRYPANOSOMA CRUZI\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MALAISE, SWELLING AROUND THE EYES, AND POTENTIAL LONG-TERM CARDIAC OR DIGESTIVE COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, MALESTAR GENERAL, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ALREDEDOR DE LOS OJOS Y POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES CARDIACAS O DIGESTIVAS A LARGO PLAZO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRYPANOSOMA CRUZI PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FIRST CERVICAL VERTEBRA AND THE KIDNEY (LEFT OR RIGHT). THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THE PATHOGEN, WHICH IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY INSECTS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS TO PREVENT THE CHRONIC INFLAMMATION OF THE HEART MUSCLE (MYOCARDITIS) AND THE ENLARGEMENT OF DIGESTIVE ORGANS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THIS CONDITION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO TRYPANOSOMA CRUZI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO O DERECHO). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO, QUE A MENUDO ES TRANSMITIDO POR INSECTOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A PREVENIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DEL M\\u00daSCULO CARD\\u00cdACO (MIOCARDITIS) Y EL AGRANDAMIENTO DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS DIGESTIVOS A MENUDO ASOCIADOS CON ESTA CONDICI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIAC CHECK: IF HEART PALPITATIONS OR CHEST DISCOMFORT ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE HEART \\/ HEART AXIS. AS A COMPLEMENTARY ACTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM TO ENSURE THE MEMBRANE SURROUNDING THE HEART IS FREE OF PATHOGENIC RESONANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA: SI SE PRESENTAN PALPITACIONES O MOLESTIAS EN EL PECHO, ESCANEAR EL EJE CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N. COMO ACCI\\u00d3N COMPLEMENTARIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA MEMBRANA QUE RODEA EL CORAZ\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9 LIBRE DE RESONANCIAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/130','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:41:05','2026-04-27 10:41:05'),(3931,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',131,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"TENNIS ELBOW, NECK PAIN (EPICONDILITIS (CODO DE TENISTA), DOLOR DE CUELLO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NERVOUS SYSTEM REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO)\",\"symptoms\":\"TENNIS ELBOW (EPICONDYLITIS) AND NECK PAIN.\\n\\n(EPICONDILITIS (CODO DE TENISTA) Y DOLOR DE CUELLO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE DYSFUNCTION OF THE FIRST CERVICAL VERTEBRA (ATLAS) BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE C1 REGION. THIS RESET ADDRESSES LOCALIZED NECK STIFFNESS AND REFERRED PAIN THAT RADIATES DOWN THE ARM, SPECIFICALLY TARGETING THE LATERAL EPICONDYLE (TENNIS ELBOW). BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT RESTORES PROPER NERVE SIGNALING AND VASCULAR FLOW TO THE UPPER EXTREMITIES, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN BOTH THE CERVICAL SPINE AND THE ELBOW JOINT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL (ATLAS) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO EN LA REGI\\u00d3N C1. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA RIGIDEZ LOCALIZADA DEL CUELLO Y EL DOLOR REFERIDO QUE IRRADIA HACIA EL BRAZO, DIRIGI\\u00c9NDOSE ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE AL EPIC\\u00d3NDILO LATERAL (CODO DE TENISTA). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, RESTAURA LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y EL FLUJO VASCULAR ADECUADOS HACIA LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N TANTO EN LA COLUMNA CERVICAL COMO EN LA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N DEL CODO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL ALIGNMENT: SCAN THE CERVICAL 1-7 \\/ CERVICAL 1-7 (REF 129) AXIS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE CERVICAL CHAIN IS ALIGNED. IF ELBOW PAIN PERSISTS WITHOUT NECK IMPROVEMENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE BRACHIAL PLEXUS RESONANCE TO RULE OUT LOCAL NERVE ENTRAPMENT.\\n\\n(ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL 1-7 \\/ CERVICAL 1-7 (REF 129) PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA CADENA CERVICAL EST\\u00c9 ALINEADA. SI EL DOLOR DE CODO PERSISTE SIN MEJOR\\u00cdA EN EL CUELLO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA DEL PLEXO BRAQUIAL PARA DESCARTAR UN ATRAPAMIENTO NERVIOSO LOCAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/131','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:42:22','2026-04-27 10:42:22'),(3932,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',132,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"SPINAL ALIGNMENT (ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESPINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SCOLIOSIS, BACK PAIN, PELVIC INSTABILITY, AND DISRUPTION OF CEREBROSPINAL FLUID FLOW.\\n\\n(ESCOLIOSIS, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, INESTABILIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA Y ALTERACI\\u00d3N DEL FLUJO DE L\\u00cdQUIDO CEFALORRAQU\\u00cdDEO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY OF THE ENTIRE SPINAL COLUMN BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FIRST CERVICAL VERTEBRA (ATLAS) AND THE COCCYX (TAILBONE). THIS RESET ADDRESSES COMPENSATORY CURVATURES IN THE SPINE, SUCH AS SCOLIOSIS, AND PROMOTES THE ENERGETIC BALANCE OF THE DURAL TUBE. BY STABILIZING THIS TOP-TO-BOTTOM AXIS, IT FACILITATES BETTER NERVOUS SYSTEM COMMUNICATION AND ALLEVIATES CHRONIC TENSION IN THE SACRAL AND CERVICAL REGIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA INTEGRIDAD ESTRUCTURAL DE TODA LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL (ATLAS) Y EL C\\u00d3CCIX. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CURVATURAS COMPENSATORIAS EN LA COLUMNA, COMO LA ESCOLIOSIS, Y PROMUEVE EL EQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL TUBO DURAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE DE ARRIBA HACIA ABAJO, FACILITA UNA MEJOR COMUNICACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y ALIVIA LA TENSI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA EN LAS REGIONES SACRA Y CERVICAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF LOWER BACK PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE CERVICAL 1-7 \\/ CERVICAL 1-7 (REF 129) TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE CHAIN IS CLEAR. FOR PELVIC ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SACRUM \\/ SACRUM AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCAL SACROILIAC DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL DOLOR DE ESPALDA BAJA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR CERVICAL 1-7 \\/ CERVICAL 1-7 (REF 129) PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA CADENA EST\\u00c9 LIMPIA. PARA PROBLEMAS P\\u00c9LVICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SACRO \\/ SACRO PARA DESCARTAR UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SACROIL\\u00cdACA LOCAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/132','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:43:42','2026-04-27 10:43:42'),(3933,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',133,'{\"symptoms\":\"MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, FALSE CYSTICERCUS, VOMITING, AND FEVER. (MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, CISTICERCO FALSO, V\\u00d3MITOS Y FIEBRE)\",\"paths\":\"MALARIA, WHICH DAMAGES THE BRAIN. IF IT INVADES THE RED BLOOD CELLS, IT CAN BECOME DANGEROUSLY DEADLY. (MALARIA, QUE DA\\u00d1A EL CEREBRO. SI INVADE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS, PUEDE VOLVERSE PELIGROSAMENTE MORTAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ATLAS\\/PYLORUS (REVISAR \\u2013 ATLAS \\/ P\\u00cdLORO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, FALSE CYSTICERCUS, VOMITING, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, CISTICERCO FALSO, V\\u00d3MITOS Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PLASMODIUM FALCIPARUM, THE PATHOGEN RESPONSIBLE FOR MALARIA, BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FIRST CERVICAL VERTEBRA (ATLAS) AND THE PYLORUS. THIS RESET IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THIS PARASITE CAN DAMAGE BRAIN TISSUE AND INVADE RED BLOOD CELLS, POTENTIALLY BECOMING DEADLY. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC TOXICITY THAT OFTEN MANIFESTS AS CHRONIC MUSCLE PAIN (FIBROMYALGIA) AND SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PLASMODIUM FALCIPARUM, EL PAT\\u00d3GENO RESPONSABLE DE LA MALARIA, MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL (ATLAS) Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. ESTE REINICIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO PUEDE DA\\u00d1AR EL TEJIDO CEREBRAL E INVADIR LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS, VOLVI\\u00c9NDOSE POTENCIALMENTE MORTAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, ABORDA LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLOR MUSCULAR CR\\u00d3NICO (FIBROMIALGIA) Y MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SEVERO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: SINCE THIS PATHOGEN AFFECTS RED BLOOD CELLS, SCAN THE SPLEEN (BAZO) AND LIVER (H\\u00cdGADO) TO ENSURE THE FILTRATION SYSTEM IS CLEAR. CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE ATLAS \\/ PYLORUS AXIS TO CONFIRM THE RESONANCE IS FULLY NEUTRALIZED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: DADO QUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO AFECTA LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS, ESCANEAR EL BAZO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9 LIMPIO. REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE ATLAS \\/ P\\u00cdLORO PARA CONFIRMAR QUE LA RESONANCIA EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE NEUTRALIZADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/133','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:44:54','2026-04-27 10:44:54'),(3934,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',134,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CARDIO, VASCULAR, GENITAL, DEFICIENCIES. (DEFICIENCIAS CARDIOVASCULARES Y GENITALES)\",\"paths\":\"REGULATES THE PARA SYMPATHETIC SYSTEM. (REGULA EL SISTEMA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"PARASYMPATHETIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N PARASIMP\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"CARDIOVASCULAR DEFICIENCIES, GENITAL DYSFUNCTIONS, AND CHRONIC STRESS.\\n\\n(DEFICIENCIAS CARDIOVASCULARES, DISFUNCIONES GENITALES Y ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FIRST CERVICAL VERTEBRA (ATLAS) AND THE SACRUM. THIS RESET IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR REGULATING THE PARASYMPATHETIC SYSTEM, WHICH GOVERNS THE \\\"REST AND DIGEST\\\" FUNCTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS TOP-TO-BOTTOM SPINAL AXIS, IT IMPROVES VASCULAR TONE, SUPPORTS REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH, AND HELPS THE BODY RECOVER FROM THE PHYSIOLOGICAL IMPACTS OF PROLONGED ADRENALINE AND STRESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL (ATLAS) Y EL SACRO. ESTE REINICIO ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO, QUE RIGE LAS FUNCIONES DE \\\"DESCANSO Y DIGESTI\\u00d3N\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE ESPINAL DE EXTREMO A EXTREMO, MEJORA EL TONO VASCULAR, APOYA LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA Y AYUDA AL CUERPO A RECUPERARSE DE LOS IMPACTOS FISIOL\\u00d3GICOS DE LA ADRENALINA Y EL ESTR\\u00c9S PROLONGADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"AUTONOMIC CHECK: IF CARDIOVASCULAR ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL 1 \\/ COCCYX (REF 132) TO ENSURE FULL SPINAL ALIGNMENT. FOR GENITAL CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SACRUM \\/ SACRUM AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCAL NERVE INTERFERENCE IN THE PELVIC REGION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS CARDIOVASCULARES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL 1 \\/ C\\u00d3CCIX (REF 132) PARA ASEGURAR UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESPINAL COMPLETA. PARA PREOCUPACIONES GENITALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SACRO \\/ SACRO PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIAS NERVIOSAS LOCALES EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/134','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:46:15','2026-04-27 10:46:15'),(3935,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',135,'{\"symptoms\":\"FLU (GRIPE)\",\"paths\":\"FLU (GRIPE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FLU, COUGH, CONGESTION, AND COMMON COLD SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(GRIPE, TOS, CONGESTI\\u00d3N Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE INFLUENZA VIRUS (FLU 135) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FIRST CERVICAL VERTEBRA (ATLAS) AND THE STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID PROCESS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES VIRAL LOADS THAT AFFECT THE UPPER RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, HELPING TO REDUCE INFLAMMATION IN THE THROAT AND NASAL PASSAGES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE BODY\'S IMMUNE RESPONSE TO RESOLVE FLU-LIKE SYMPTOMS AND PREVENT THE VIRUS FROM SETTLING INTO DEEPER RESPIRATORY TISSUES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA INFLUENZA (GRIPE 135) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL (ATLAS) Y EL PROCESO ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE AFECTAN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR, AYUDANDO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LA GARGANTA Y LAS FOSAS NASALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, APOYA LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA DEL CUERPO PARA RESOLVER LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS GRIPALES Y EVITAR QUE EL VIRUS SE ASIENTE EN TEJIDOS RESPIRATORIOS M\\u00c1S PROFUNDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF CONGESTION IS SEVERE, SCAN THE CEREBELLUM \\/ SUPRASPINATUS (REF 126) TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR SYSTEMIC FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL 1 \\/ PYLORUS (REF 133) AXIS TO ENSURE NO PARASITIC INTERFERENCE IS WEAKENING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N ES SEVERA, ESCANEAR CEREBELO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO (REF 126) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS. PARA FIEBRE SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CERVICAL 1 \\/ P\\u00cdLORO (REF 133) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NINGUNA INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA EST\\u00c9 DEBILITANDO EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/135','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:47:49','2026-04-27 10:47:49'),(3936,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',136,'{\"symptoms\":\"UTI, LUNG INFECTIONS. (INFECCI\\u00d3N URINARIA, INFECCIONES PULMONARES)\",\"paths\":\"LEGIONELLIOSIS (LEGIONELOSIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI), LUNG INFECTIONS, AND LEGIONELLOSIS.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N URINARIA, INFECCIONES PULMONARES Y LEGIONELOSIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS D BOVIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE LEVEL OF THE SECOND CERVICAL VERTEBRA (AXIS). THIS RESET ADDRESSES BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CAN CAUSE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, PARTICULARLY IMPACTING THE RESPIRATORY TRACT AND THE URINARY SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS REGION, IT HELPS THE BODY RESOLVE PERSISTENT COUGHS OR URINARY DISCOMFORT LINKED TO THIS SPECIFIC PATHOGENIC RESONANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO D BOVIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A NIVEL DE LA SEGUNDA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL (AXIS). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE PUEDEN CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, AFECTANDO PARTICULARMENTE EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO Y EL SISTEMA URINARIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA REGI\\u00d3N, AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESOLVER LA TOS PERSISTENTE O LAS MOLESTIAS URINARIAS VINCULADAS A ESTA RESONANCIA PAT\\u00d3GENA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF LUNG SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL 1 \\/ STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID PROCESS (REF 135) TO RULE OUT VIRAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR URINARY CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY AXIS TO ENSURE THE RENAL FILTRATION SYSTEM IS FULLY BALANCED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PULMONARES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR CERVICAL 1 \\/ PROCESO ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO (REF 135) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES VIRALES. PARA PROBLEMAS URINARIOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE EQUILIBRADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/136','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:48:58','2026-04-27 10:48:58'),(3937,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',137,'{\"symptoms\":\"FLUID RETENTION, RESPIRATORY FAILURE, SEIZURES, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, CERVICAL SPONDYLOSIS, CALCIFICATION OF LIGAMENTS. (RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA, CONVULSIONES, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, ESPONDILOSIS CERVICAL, CALCIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LIGAMENTOS)\",\"paths\":\"TOXIC CRISIS. PROBLEMS OF ORAL INFECTIONS, COLITIS TO SEVERE DYSENTERY. (CRISIS T\\u00d3XICA. PROBLEMAS DE INFECCIONES ORALES, COLITIS HASTA DISENTER\\u00cdA SEVERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CERVICAL 3\\/DELTOID (REVISAR \\u2013 CERVICAL 3 \\/ DELTOIDES)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FLUID RETENTION, RESPIRATORY FAILURE, SEIZURES, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, CERVICAL SPONDYLOSIS, AND CALCIFICATION OF LIGAMENTS.\\n\\n(RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA, CONVULSIONES, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, ESPONDILOSIS CERVICAL Y CALCIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LIGAMENTOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS A TOXIC CRISIS CAUSED BY BALANTIDIUM OR TYPHOID PATHOGENS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THIRD CERVICAL VERTEBRA AND THE SUPRASPINATUS MUSCLE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES A WIDE SPECTRUM OF ISSUES RANGING FROM ORAL INFECTIONS TO SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS LIKE COLITIS AND DYSENTERY. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS PREVENT THE CALCIFICATION OF CERVICAL LIGAMENTS AND SUPPORTS THE CLEARANCE OF TOXINS THAT MAY BE TRIGGERING NEUROLOGICAL INTERFERENCE OR RESPIRATORY DISRUPTIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A UNA CRISIS T\\u00d3XICA CAUSADA POR LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS BALANTIDIUM O TIFO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL Y EL M\\u00daSCULO SUPRAESPINOSO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA UN AMPLIO ESPECTRO DE PROBLEMAS QUE VAN DESDE INFECCIONES ORALES HASTA MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO COMO COLITIS Y DISENTER\\u00cdA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A PREVENIR LA CALCIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LOS LIGAMENTOS CERVICALES Y APOYA LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS QUE PUEDEN ESTAR DESENCADENANDO INTERFERENCIAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS O ALTERACIONES RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC CHECK: STRONGLY RECOMMENDED TO CHECK CERVICAL 3 \\/ DELTOID TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE PARASITIC LOAD. IF RESPIRATORY FAILURE IS PRESENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL 1 OR 3 \\/ DELTOID (REF 128) AXIS TO RULE OUT DEEPER PULMONARY RESONANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA: SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE REVISAR CERVICAL 3 \\/ DELTOIDES PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA PARASITARIA. SI HAY INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CERVICAL 1 O 3 \\/ DELTOIDES (REF 128) PARA DESCARTAR RESONANCIAS PULMONARES M\\u00c1S PROFUNDAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/137','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:50:20','2026-04-27 10:50:20'),(3938,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',138,'{\"symptoms\":\"STREP THROAT, SCARLET FEVER, PNEUMONIA AND MENINGITIS.\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"STREP THROAT, SCARLET FEVER, PNEUMONIA, AND MENINGITIS.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE GARGANTA POR ESTREPTOCOCO, FIEBRE ESCARLATINA, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y MENINGITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS B AGALACTIAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE LEVEL OF THE THIRD CERVICAL VERTEBRA. THIS RESET ADDRESSES AGGRESSIVE BACTERIAL LOADS THAT OFTEN AFFECT THE THROAT AND RESPIRATORY SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS PREVENT THE BACTERIA FROM MIGRATING TO THE MENINGES OR DEEP LUNG TISSUE, REDUCING THE RISK OF SEVERE SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS AND INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL STREPTOCOCCUS B AGALACTIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A NIVEL DE LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS AGRESIVAS QUE A MENUDO AFECTAN LA GARGANTA Y EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A EVITAR QUE LA BACTERIA MIGRE A LAS MENINGES O AL TEJIDO PULMONAR PROFUNDO, REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS GRAVES E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INFECTION CHECK: IF THROAT SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL 3 \\/ SUPRASPINATUS (REF 137) TO RULE OUT PARASITIC CO-INFECTIONS. FOR FEVER AND SYSTEMIC RASH, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE APPENDIX \\/ TONGUE (REF 906) AXIS TO ENSURE VIRAL RESONANCES ARE ALSO ADDRESSED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCI\\u00d3N: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA GARGANTA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR CERVICAL 3 \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO (REF 137) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES PARASITARIAS. PARA FIEBRE Y ERUPCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ LENGUA (REF 906) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS RESONANCIAS VIRALES TAMBI\\u00c9N SEAN ABORDADAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/138','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:52:07','2026-04-27 10:52:07'),(3939,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',139,'{\"origins\":\"PARASYMPATHIC NERVOUS SYSTEM DISFUNCTION.  (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERHIDROSIS. POOR VASCULAR, PALPITATIONS, IRRITABLE BOWEL, SEXUAL DISFUNCTIONS, HEADACHES OR MIGRAINES. (HIPERHIDROSIS, DEFICIENCIA VASCULAR, PALPITACIONES, INTESTINO IRRITABLE, DISFUNCIONES SEXUALES, DOLORES DE CABEZA O MIGRA\\u00d1AS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PARASYMPATHETIC NERVOUS SYSTEM DISFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERHIDROSIS, POOR VASCULAR CIRCULATION, PALPITATIONS, IRRITABLE BOWEL, SEXUAL DYSFUNCTIONS, HEADACHES, OR MIGRAINES.\\n\\n(HIPERHIDROSIS, DEFICIENCIA VASCULAR, PALPITACIONES, INTESTINO IRRITABLE, DISFUNCIONES SEXUALES, DOLORES DE CABEZA O MIGRA\\u00d1AS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF PALPITATIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL 1 \\/ SACRUM (REF 134) TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PARASYMPATHETIC CHAIN IS CALIBRATED. FOR DIGESTIVE ISSUES LIKE IRRITABLE BOWEL, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGUS NERVE RESONANCE TO RULE OUT DEEPER CRANIAL NERVE INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI LAS PALPITACIONES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL 1 \\/ SACRO (REF 134) PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA CADENA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICA EST\\u00c9 CALIBRADA. PARA PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS COMO EL INTESTINO IRRITABLE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA DEL NERVIO VAGO PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIAS M\\u00c1S PROFUNDAS DE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/139','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:54:01','2026-04-27 10:54:01'),(3940,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',140,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BACTERIA FOUND IN SOIL AND WATER. (BACTERIA QUE SE ENCUENTRA EN EL SUELO Y EL AGUA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"UPPER RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, PNEUMONIA, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI), AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES, NEUMON\\u00cdA, INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO (ITU) E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA, A VERSATILE BACTERIUM OFTEN FOUND IN SOIL AND WATER, BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE LEVEL OF THE FOURTH CERVICAL VERTEBRA. THIS RESET ADDRESSES OPPORTUNISTIC INFECTIONS THAT CAN SETTLE IN THE LUNGS OR URINARY TRACT, ESPECIALLY IN INDIVIDUALS WITH WEAKENED BARRIERS. BY STABILIZING THIS REGION, IT SUPPORTS THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSES IN ELIMINATING BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO PERSISTENT INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA, UNA BACTERIA VERS\\u00c1TIL QUE A MENUDO SE ENCUENTRA EN EL SUELO Y EL AGUA, MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A NIVEL DE LA CUARTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS INFECCIONES OPORTUNISTAS QUE PUEDEN ASENTARSE EN LOS PULMONES O EL TRACTO URINARIO, ESPECIALMENTE EN PERSONAS CON BARRERAS DEBILITADAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA REGI\\u00d3N, APOYA LAS DEFENSAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO PARA ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS PERSISTENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INFECTION CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS ARE DOMINANT, SCAN THE CERVICAL 2 \\/ CERVICAL 2 (REF 136) AXIS. FOR CHRONIC RESPIRATORY ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER BACTERIAL AGENTS LIKE PASTEURELLA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCI\\u00d3N: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS SON DOMINANTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL 2 \\/ CERVICAL 2 (REF 136). PARA PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO PARA DESCARTAR OTROS AGENTES BACTERIANOS COMO PASTEURELLA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/140','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:55:10','2026-04-27 10:55:10'),(3941,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',141,'{\"symptoms\":\"STAPH INFECTION (INFECCI\\u00d3N POR ESTAFILOCOCO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"STAPH INFECTION, SKIN LESIONS, BOILS, AND POTENTIAL RESPIRATORY OR URINARY DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N POR ESTAFILOCOCO, LESIONES EN LA PIEL, FOR\\u00daNCULOS Y POSIBLES MOLESTIAS RESPIRATORIAS O URINARIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE LEVEL OF THE FIFTH CERVICAL VERTEBRA. THIS RESET ADDRESSES ONE OF THE MOST COMMON BACTERIAL PATHOGENS, WHICH CAN CAUSE A VARIETY OF INFECTIONS RANGING FROM MINOR SKIN IRRITATIONS TO MORE SERIOUS CONDITIONS IF IT ENTERS THE BLOODSTREAM. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO CONTAIN THE BACTERIA AND REDUCE LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION IN THE NECK AND UPPER BACK REGIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A NIVEL DE LA QUINTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA UNO DE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS BACTERIANOS M\\u00c1S COMUNES, QUE PUEDE CAUSAR UNA VARIEDAD DE INFECCIONES QUE VAN DESDE IRRITACIONES MENORES DE LA PIEL HASTA CONDICIONES M\\u00c1S GRAVES SI INGRESA AL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, APOYA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA CONTENER LA BACTERIA Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA EN LAS REGIONES DEL CUELLO Y LA PARTE SUPERIOR DE LA ESPALDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INFECTION CHECK: IF SKIN ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL 4 \\/ CERVICAL 4 (REF 140) TO RULE OUT PSEUDOMONAS. FOR SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM AXIS TO ENSURE THE BACTERIA HAS NOT IMPACTED CARDIAC PROTECTIVE MEMBRANES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCI\\u00d3N: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE LA PIEL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL 4 \\/ CERVICAL 4 (REF 140) PARA DESCARTAR PSEUDOMONAS. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA BACTERIA NO HAYA AFECTADO LAS MEMBRANAS PROTECTORAS CARD\\u00cdACAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/141','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:56:23','2026-04-27 10:56:23'),(3942,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',142,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DENTAL ABSCESSES, GUM INFLAMMATION, ENDOCARDITIS, AND URINARY TRACT DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ABSCESOS DENTALES, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ENC\\u00cdAS, ENDOCARDITIS Y MOLESTIAS EN EL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS VIRIDANS by neutralizing PH distortions between the fifth cervical vertebra and the first lumbar vertebra. This bacteria is a common inhabitant of the mouth, but when it enters the bloodstream\\u2014often through dental procedures or gum disease\\u2014it can settle on the heart valves. This reset addresses the bacterial load to prevent \\\"false\\\" cardiovascular issues and supports the body in clearing infections that may have migrated from the oral cavity to other systemic regions.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO VIRIDANS mediante la neutralizaci\\u00f3n de las distorsiones de PH entre la quinta v\\u00e9rtebra cervical y la primera v\\u00e9rtebra lumbar. Esta bacteria es un habitante com\\u00fan de la boca, pero cuando ingresa al torrente sangu\\u00edneo, a menudo a trav\\u00e9s de procedimientos dentales o enfermedades de las enc\\u00edas, puede asentarse en las v\\u00e1lvulas card\\u00edacas. Este reinicio aborda la carga bacteriana para prevenir \\\"falsos\\\" problemas cardiovasculares y apoya al cuerpo en la eliminaci\\u00f3n de infecciones que pueden haber migrado desde la cavidad oral hacia otras regiones sist\\u00e9micas.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ORAL CHECK: IF GUM INFLAMMATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE AXIS. FOR CARDIAC CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE HEART PROTECTIVE TISSUE IS FREE OF BACTERIAL COLONIZATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ORAL: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ENC\\u00cdAS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA. PARA PREOCUPACIONES CARD\\u00cdACAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL TEJIDO PROTECTOR DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9 LIBRE DE COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/142','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:57:44','2026-04-27 10:57:44'),(3943,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',143,'{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, BRONCHITIS (NEUMON\\u00cdA, BRONQUITIS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, BRONCHITIS, PERSISTENT COUGH, AND INFLAMMATION OF THE AIRWAYS.\\n\\n(NEUMON\\u00cdA, BRONQUITIS, TOS PERSISTENTE E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS CHLAMYDIA PNEUMONIAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE LEVEL OF THE SIXTH CERVICAL VERTEBRA. THIS RESET ADDRESSES BACTERIAL LOADS THAT SPECIFICALLY ATTACK THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, OFTEN LEADING TO CHRONIC BRONCHIAL CONGESTION OR ATYPICAL PNEUMONIA. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE LUNGS IN CLEARING THE INFECTION AND REDUCES THE INFLAMMATORY BURDEN ON THE UPPER AND LOWER RESPIRATORY TRACTS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA CHLAMYDIA PNEUMONIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A NIVEL DE LA SEXTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE ATACAN ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A UNA CONGESTI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL CR\\u00d3NICA O NEUMON\\u00cdA AT\\u00cdPICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, APOYA A LOS PULMONES EN ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y REDUCE LA CARGA INFLAMATORIA EN LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES E INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF BRONCHITIS SYMPTOMS ARE SEVERE, SCAN THE CERVICAL 4 \\/ CERVICAL 4 (REF 140) TO RULE OUT PSEUDOMONAS CO-INFECTION. FOR CHRONIC COUGH, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS AXIS TO ENSURE OTHER RESPIRATORY BACTERIA ARE NOT PRESENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE BRONQUITIS SON SEVEROS, ESCANEAR CERVICAL 4 \\/ CERVICAL 4 (REF 140) PARA DESCARTAR UNA COINFECCI\\u00d3N POR PSEUDOMONAS. PARA LA TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA OTRAS BACTERIAS RESPIRATORIAS PRESENTES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/143','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 10:58:45','2026-04-27 10:58:45'),(3944,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',144,'{\"symptoms\":\"BLOCKAGE (BLOQUEO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LOCALIZED PAIN, STIFFNESS IN THE BASE OF THE NECK, POTENTIAL SKIN ISSUES ON THE SCALP, AND EMOTIONAL STAGNATION.\\n\\n(DOLOR LOCALIZADO, RIGIDEZ EN LA BASE DEL CUELLO, POSIBLES PROBLEMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS EN EL CUERO CABELLUDO Y ESTANCAMIENTO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS CAPITIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE LEVEL OF THE SEVENTH CERVICAL VERTEBRA (THE PROMINENT BONE AT THE BASE OF THE NECK). THIS RESET ADDRESSES BACTERIAL COLONIZATION THAT CAN AFFECT THE SCALP AND UPPER SKIN LAYERS. ADDITIONALLY, THIS AXIS ACTS AS A RELEASE POINT FOR EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGES THAT MANIFEST AS PHYSICAL TENSION IN THE SHOULDERS AND CERVICAL-THORACIC JUNCTION, PROMOTING A SENSE OF ENERGETIC FLOW AND STRUCTURAL RELIEF.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS CAPITIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A NIVEL DE LA S\\u00c9PTIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL (EL HUESO PROMINENTE EN LA BASE DEL CUELLO). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA QUE PUEDE AFECTAR EL CUERO CABELLUDO Y LAS CAPAS SUPERIORES DE LA PIEL. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE EJE ACT\\u00daA COMO UN PUNTO DE LIBERACI\\u00d3N PARA LOS BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA EN LOS HOMBROS Y LA UNI\\u00d3N CERVICO-TOR\\u00c1CICA, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO Y ALIVIO ESTRUCTURAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL CHECK: SCAN THE CERVICAL 1-7 \\/ CERVICAL 1-7 (REF 129) TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE CERVICAL CHAIN IS BALANCED. IF EMOTIONAL TENSION PERSISTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ THYMUS AXIS TO SUPPORT THE RELEASE OF ACCUMULATED STRESS AND STRENGTHEN THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AGAINST BACTERIAL LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL 1-7 \\/ CERVICAL 1-7 (REF 129) PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA CADENA CERVICAL EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADA. SI LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE TIMO \\/ TIMO PARA APOYAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DEL ESTR\\u00c9S ACUMULADO Y FORTALECER LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA CONTRA LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/144','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:00:09','2026-04-27 11:00:09'),(3945,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',145,'{\"symptoms\":\"ARM, NECK, AND SHOULDER PAIN.CARPAL TUNNEL, LARYNGEAL PROBLEMS. NAUSEA, GINGIVITIS, BURSITIS. (DOLOR EN BRAZO, CUELLO Y HOMBRO. T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO, PROBLEMAS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, GINGIVITIS, BURSITIS)\",\"paths\":\"TENNIS ELBOW. EXTREME PAIN AND NERVE PAIN TO THE ARM EXTREMITIES. ORAL, BRONCHIAL, AND LARYNGEAL PROBLEMS. POOR DIGESTION, BELCHING AND GAS. FALSE AIDS. (EPICONDILITIS (CODO DE TENISTA). DOLOR EXTREMO Y DOLOR NERVIOSO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES DEL BRAZO. PROBLEMAS ORALES, BRONQUIALES Y LAR\\u00cdNGEOS. MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, ERUCTOS Y GASES. FALSO SIDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ARM, NECK, AND SHOULDER PAIN. CARPAL TUNNEL, LARYNGEAL PROBLEMS, NAUSEA, GINGIVITIS, AND BURSITIS.\\n\\n(DOLOR EN BRAZO, CUELLO Y HOMBRO. T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO, PROBLEMAS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, GINGIVITIS Y BURSITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE FAECALIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE JUNCTION OF THE SEVENTH CERVICAL AND FIRST DORSAL (THORACIC) VERTEBRAE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES SEVERE NERVE PAIN RADIATING TO THE ARMS AND HANDS, OFTEN MISDIAGNOSED AS CARPAL TUNNEL OR TENNIS ELBOW. BY STABILIZING THIS CRITICAL STRUCTURAL AXIS, IT ALLEVIATES INFLAMMATION IN THE BRONCHIAL AND LARYNGEAL AREAS, IMPROVES DIGESTION BY REDUCING GAS AND BELCHING, AND HELPS CLEAR SYSTEMIC INTERFERENCE SOMETIMES REFERRED TO AS \\\"FALSE AIDS.\\\"\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA FAECALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA UNI\\u00d3N DE LA S\\u00c9PTIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA CERVICAL Y LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL (TOR\\u00c1CICA). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA EL DOLOR NERVIOSO SEVERO QUE IRRADIA HACIA LOS BRAZOS Y LAS MANOS, A MENUDO DIAGNOSTICADO ERR\\u00d3NEAMENTE COMO T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO O CODO DE TENISTA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE ESTRUCTURAL CR\\u00cdTICO, ALIVIA LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS \\u00c1REAS BRONQUIAL Y LAR\\u00cdNGEA, MEJORA LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N AL REDUCIR LOS GASES Y ERUCTOS, Y AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA INTERFERENCIA SIST\\u00c9MICA A VECES DENOMINADA \\\"FALSO SIDA\\\".)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ORAL CHECK: IF GINGIVITIS OR ORAL PROBLEMS PERSIST, SCAN THE MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE AXIS. FOR DIGESTIVE ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS (REF 665) TO ENSURE DRUG-INDUCED INTOXICATION OR DYSFUNCTION IS NOT CONTRIBUTING TO THE SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ORAL: SI LA GINGIVITIS O LOS PROBLEMAS ORALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA. PARA PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO (REF 665) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N POR MEDICAMENTOS O LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N NO EST\\u00c9N CONTRIBUYENDO A LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/145','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:01:17','2026-04-27 11:01:17'),(3946,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',146,'{\"symptoms\":\"FALSE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS\\n(ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE FALSA)\",\"paths\":\"BACTERIA IS FOUND IN FOOD CANS, OLIVE OIL AND WINE NOT PROPERLY STORED. UNLOCKS PATIENTS WHO ARE THERAPY RESISTANT. (LA BACTERIA SE ENCUENTRA EN LATAS DE ALIMENTOS, ACEITE DE OLIVA Y VINO MAL ALMACENADOS. DESBLOQUEA A PACIENTES QUE SON RESISTENTES A LA TERAPIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FALSE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, THERAPY RESISTANCE, AND NEUROLOGICAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE FALSA, RESISTENCIA A LA TERAPIA Y MALESTAR NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS FECALIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT AND LEFT CERVICAL PLEXUS. THIS BACTERIA IS OFTEN INTRODUCED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD CANS, OLIVE OIL, OR IMPROPERLY STORED WINE. THIS SPECIFIC RESONANCE IS CRITICAL BECAUSE IT CAN \\\"LOCK\\\" THE BODY\\u2019S ENERGETIC SYSTEM, MAKING THE PATIENT RESISTANT TO OTHER TREATMENTS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT CLEARS THE PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE THAT MIMICS THE SYMPTOMS OF MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, ALLOWING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM TO RESPOND TO THERAPY ONCE AGAIN.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO FECALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PLEXO CERVICAL DERECHO E IZQUIERDO. ESTA BACTERIA A MENUDO SE INTRODUCE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LATAS DE ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADAS, ACEITE DE OLIVA O VINO MAL ALMACENADO. ESTA RESONANCIA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA ES CR\\u00cdTICA PORQUE PUEDE \\\"BLOQUEAR\\\" EL SISTEMA ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CUERPO, HACIENDO QUE EL PACIENTE SEA RESISTENTE A OTROS TRATAMIENTOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, SE ELIMINA LA INTERFERENCIA PAT\\u00d3GENA QUE IMITA LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, PERMITIENDO QUE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO RESPONDA NUEVAMENTE A LA TERAPIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL 7 \\/ DORSAL 1 (REF 145) TO RULE OUT OTHER FAECALIS RESONANCES. FOR SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE LIVER \\/ LIVER AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING TOXINS FROM SPOILED OILS OR FERMENTED PRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR CERVICAL 7 \\/ DORSAL 1 (REF 145) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS RESONANCIAS DE FAECALIS. PARA LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS DE ACEITES EN MAL ESTADO O PRODUCTOS FERMENTADOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/146','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:02:33','2026-04-27 11:02:33'),(3947,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',147,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"URIC ACID, GOUT. (\\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO, GOTA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - KIDNEYS AND INTESTINES WITH MAGNETS ON BOTH SIDES. (REVISAR \\u2013 RI\\u00d1ONES E INTESTINOS CON IMANES EN AMBOS LADOS)\"}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH URIC ACID, GOUT, JOINT PAIN, AND INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(\\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO ELEVADO, GOTA, DOLOR ARTICULAR E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF URIC ACID LEVELS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS AND THE VENA CAVA ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE BODY\'S INABILITY TO PROPERLY PROCESS OR ELIMINATE PURINES, WHICH CAN LEAD TO THE CRYSTALLIZATION OF URIC ACID IN THE JOINTS (GOUT). BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE VASCULAR AND NERVOUS SYSTEMS IN REDUCING SYSTEMIC ACIDITY AND ALLEVIATING THE INTENSE PAIN ASSOCIATED WITH METABOLIC CRYSTALLIZATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NIVELES DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL PLEXO CERVICAL Y LA VENA CAVA DEL LADO OPUESTO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA INCAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PROCESAR O ELIMINAR CORRECTAMENTE LAS PURINAS, LO QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA CRISTALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO EN LAS ARTICULACIONES (GOTA). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, APOYA A LOS SISTEMAS VASCULAR Y NERVIOSO PARA REDUCIR LA ACIDEZ SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ALIVIAR EL DOLOR INTENSO ASOCIADO CON LA CRISTALIZACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: MANDATORY TO SCAN THE KIDNEYS (RI\\u00d1ONES) AND INTESTINES (INTESTINOS) WITH MAGNETS ON BOTH SIDES TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION AND ELIMINATION OF TOXINS. IF JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE PANCREATIC DUCT \\/ LEFT KIDNEY (REF 72) TO RULE OUT SPIROCHETE INTERFERENCE THAT MAY MIMIC RHEUMATIC SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: ES OBLIGATORIO REVISAR LOS RI\\u00d1ONES E INTESTINOS CON IMANES EN AMBOS LADOS PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS. SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO (REF 72) PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIAS DE ESPIROQUETAS QUE PUEDAN IMITAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS REUM\\u00c1TICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/147','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:03:55','2026-04-27 11:03:55'),(3948,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',148,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PANIC (P\\u00c1NICO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PANIC (P\\u00c1NICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"SUDDEN TERROR, PALPITATIONS, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, AND FEELINGS OF OVERWHELM.\\n\\n(TERROR S\\u00daBITO, PALPITACIONES, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR Y SENTIMIENTOS DE AGOBIO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ENERGETIC CLEARANCE OF PANIC BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS NETWORK. THIS RESET FOCUSES ON RELEASING EMBEDDED NEGATIVE MEMORIES OR EMOTIONAL CODES THAT TRIGGER ACUTE ANXIETY RESPONSES. BY STABILIZING THE NERVE BRANCHES IN THE NECK AREA, IT HELPS CALM THE FIGHT-OR-FLIGHT RESPONSE, PROMOTING A SENSE OF SAFETY AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL P\\u00c1NICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO DENTRO DE LA RED DEL PLEXO CERVICAL. ESTE REINICIO SE CENTRA EN LIBERAR MEMORIAS NEGATIVAS INCRUSTADAS O C\\u00d3DIGOS EMOCIONALES QUE DESENCADENAN RESPUESTAS DE ANSIEDAD AGUDA. AL ESTABILIZAR LAS RAMAS NERVIOSAS EN EL \\u00c1REA DEL CUELLO, AYUDA A CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DE LUCHA O HUIDA, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SEGURIDAD Y ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL EN TODO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF PANIC PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ CERVICAL PLEXUS (REF 146) TO ENSURE NO BACTERIAL INTERFERENCE FROM STREPTOCOCCUS FECALIS IS COMPROMISING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. FOR PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS LIKE PALPITATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL 3 \\/ SACRUM (REF 139) TO REGULATE THE PARASYMPATHETIC SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI EL P\\u00c1NICO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ PLEXO CERVICAL (REF 146) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NINGUNA INTERFERENCIA BACTERIANA DE ESTREPTOCOCO FECALIS EST\\u00c9 COMPROMETIENDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS COMO PALPITACIONES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CERVICAL 3 \\/ SACRO (REF 139) PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/148','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:05:08','2026-04-27 11:05:08'),(3949,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',149,'{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS (S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS)\",\"paths\":\"FOUND IN WATER. (SE ENCUENTRA EN EL AGUA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, COUGH, AND POTENTIAL URINARY OR SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, TOS Y POSIBLES INFECCIONES URINARIAS O SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS SERRATIA FONTICOLA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA. THIS BACTERIA IS COMMONLY FOUND IN WATER AND SOIL AND CAN BECOME AN OPPORTUNISTIC PATHOGEN. THIS RESET ADDRESSES VIRAL-LIKE RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS AND HELPS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM REGAIN CONTROL OVER AUTOMATIC FUNCTIONS GOVERNED BY THE MEDULLA, SUCH AS BREATHING RHYTHMS, WHICH MAY BE COMPROMISED BY BACTERIAL INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA SERRATIA FONTICOLA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PLEXO CERVICAL Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. ESTA BACTERIA SE ENCUENTRA COM\\u00daNMENTE EN EL AGUA Y EL SUELO Y PUEDE CONVERTIRSE EN UN PAT\\u00d3GENO OPORTUNISTA. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS SIMILARES A LOS VIRALES Y AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A RECUPERAR EL CONTROL SOBRE LAS FUNCIONES AUTOM\\u00c1TICAS REGIDAS POR EL BULBO, COMO LOS RITMOS RESPIRATORIOS, QUE PUEDEN VERSE COMPROMETIDOS POR LA INTERFERENCIA BACTERIANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL 6 \\/ CERVICAL 6 (REF 143) TO RULE OUT CHLAMYDIA PNEUMONIAE. FOR NERVOUS SYSTEM OVERLOAD, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ CERVICAL PLEXUS (REF 148) AXIS TO ENSURE NO EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGES ARE EXACERBATING THE PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL 6 \\/ CERVICAL 6 (REF 143) PARA DESCARTAR CHLAMYDIA PNEUMONIAE. PARA LA SOBRECARGA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ PLEXO CERVICAL (REF 148) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES EXACERBANDO LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/149','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:06:09','2026-04-27 11:06:09'),(3950,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',150,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"GOUT, URIC ACID (GOTA, \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"GOUT, HIGH URIC ACID, JOINT INFLAMMATION, AND POTENTIAL RENAL STRESS.\\n\\n(GOTA, \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO ELEVADO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y POSIBLE ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SYSTEMIC REGULATION OF URIC ACID BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS AND THE SACRUM. THIS RESET IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING METABOLIC DYSFUNCTIONS THAT LEAD TO GOUT AND THE ACCUMULATION OF CRYSTALS IN THE JOINTS. BY STABILIZING THIS TOP-TO-BOTTOM AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN MANAGING INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES AND ASSISTS THE VASCULAR PATHWAYS IN THE TRANSPORT AND EVENTUAL ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL PLEXO CERVICAL Y EL SACRO. ESTE REINICIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LAS DISFUNCIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS QUE CONDUCEN A LA GOTA Y LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE CRISTALES EN LAS ARTICULACIONES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE DE EXTREMO A EXTREMO, APOYA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN EL MANEJO DE LAS RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS Y AYUDA A LAS V\\u00cdAS VASCULARES EN EL TRANSPORTE Y EVENTUAL ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ CAVA (OPPOSITE SIDE) (REF 147) TO FURTHER BALANCE URIC ACID PROCESSING. FOR GENERAL TOXICITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE LIVER \\/ LIVER (REF 462) AXIS TO ENSURE THE BODY IS EFFECTIVELY FILTERING FATS AND TOXINS THAT MAY EXACERBATE ACIDITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ CAVA (LADO OPUESTO) (REF 147) PARA EQUILIBRAR M\\u00c1S EL PROCESAMIENTO DEL \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO. PARA LA TOXICIDAD GENERAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO (REF 462) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CUERPO EST\\u00c9 FILTRANDO EFICAZMENTE LAS GRASAS Y TOXINAS QUE PUEDEN EXACERBAR LA ACIDEZ.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/150','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:07:20','2026-04-27 11:07:20'),(3951,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',151,'{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY ILLNESS (ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY ILLNESS, CHRONIC COUGH, FATIGUE, AND POTENTIAL WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, FATIGA Y POSIBLE P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS MYCOBACTERIUM AVIUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS AND THE SUPRASPINATUS MUSCLE. THIS PATHOGEN IS PART OF A GROUP OF BACTERIA RELATED TO TUBERCULOSIS BUT IS OFTEN FOUND IN WATER AND SOIL. THIS RESET ADDRESSES RESPIRATORY LOADS THAT CAUSE PERSISTENT INFLAMMATION IN THE LUNGS AND BRONCHIAL TUBES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING OPPORTUNISTIC INFECTIONS THAT CAN LEAD TO LONG-TERM PULMONARY DISCOMFORT AND SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL MYCOBACTERIUM AVIUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PLEXO CERVICAL Y EL M\\u00daSCULO SUPRAESPINOSO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO FORMA PARTE DE UN GRUPO DE BACTERIAS RELACIONADAS CON LA TUBERCULOSIS, PERO A MENUDO SE ENCUENTRA EN EL AGUA Y EL SUELO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS RESPIRATORIAS QUE CAUSAN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE EN LOS PULMONES Y LOS BRONQUIOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES OPORTUNISTAS QUE PUEDEN PROVOCAR MALESTAR PULMONAR A LARGO PLAZO Y DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF LUNG SYMPTOMS ARE PERSISTENT, SCAN THE CERVICAL 6 \\/ CERVICAL 6 (REF 143) TO RULE OUT CHLAMYDIA PNEUMONIAE. FOR GENERAL IMMUNE SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS AXIS TO ENSURE OTHER MYCOBACTERIUM RESONANCES ARE BALANCED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PULMONARES SON PERSISTENTES, ESCANEAR CERVICAL 6 \\/ CERVICAL 6 (REF 143) PARA DESCARTAR CHLAMYDIA PNEUMONIAE. PARA APOYO INMUNITARIO GENERAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO PARA ASEGURAR QUE OTRAS RESONANCIAS DE MYCOBACTERIUM EST\\u00c9N EQUILIBRADAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/151','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:18:15','2026-04-27 11:18:15'),(3952,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',152,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL INFECTIONS (INFECCIONES VAGINALES)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PELVIC ENERGETIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA P\\u00c9LVICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL INFECTIONS, PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND ENERGETIC IMBALANCES IN THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES VAGINALES, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO Y DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS EN EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RESONANCE BETWEEN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS AND THE UTERUS TO ADDRESS VAGINAL INFECTIONS AND INFLAMMATORY CONDITIONS OF THE FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT. THIS RESET WORKS BY BALANCING THE ENERGETIC COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE CRANIAL-CERVICAL NERVE NETWORK AND THE PELVIC ORGANS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE BODY IN CLEARING PATHOGENIC LOADS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO CHRONIC INFECTIONS, PROMOTING LOCALIZED HEALING AND RESTORING THE NATURAL PROTECTIVE BARRIERS OF THE UTERINE ENVIRONMENT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RESONANCIA ENTRE EL PLEXO CERVICAL Y EL \\u00daTERO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES VAGINALES Y CONDICIONES INFLAMATORIAS DEL TRACTO REPRODUCTOR FEMENINO. ESTE REINICIO FUNCIONA EQUILIBRANDO LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LA RED NERVIOSA CR\\u00c1NEO-CERVICAL Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS P\\u00c9LVICOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE ESTE EJE, APOYA AL CUERPO EN ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A LAS INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS, PROMOVIENDO LA SANACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA Y RESTAURANDO LAS BARRERAS PROTECTORAS NATURALES DEL ENTORNO UTERINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GYNECOLOGICAL CHECK: IF INFECTIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ VAGINA AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED BACTERIAL OR FUNGAL RESONANCES (LIKE YERSINIA PESTIS). FOR HORMONAL HEADACHES CONNECTED TO PELVIC DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL 3 \\/ SACRUM (REF 139) TO REGULATE THE PARASYMPATHETIC RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GINECOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LAS INFECCIONES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE VAGINA \\/ VAGINA PARA DESCARTAR RESONANCIAS BACTERIANAS O F\\u00daNGICAS LOCALIZADAS (COMO YERSINIA PESTIS). PARA DOLORES DE CABEZA HORMONALES RELACIONADOS CON MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CERVICAL 3 \\/ SACRO (REF 139) PARA REGULAR LA RESPUESTA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/152','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:19:30','2026-04-27 11:19:30'),(3953,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',153,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NERVOUS SYSTEM OVERLOAD (SOBRECARGA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RESET OF SLEEP CYCLES BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE CERVICAL SPINE REGION. THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL STIMULI AND MENTAL CHATTER THAT PREVENT THE NERVOUS SYSTEM FROM TRANSITIONING INTO A DEEP REST STATE. BY BALANCING THE ENERGY FLOW ACROSS THE CERVICAL VERTEBRAE, IT HELPS CALM THE BRAIN\'S HYPER-VIGILANCE, ALLOWING FOR THE NATURAL RELEASE OF SLEEP-REGULATING NEUROTRANSMITTERS AND RESTORING A PEACEFUL NIGHT\'S REST.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL REINICIO DE LOS CICLOS DE SUE\\u00d1O MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DEL BIOCAMPO DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N DE LA COLUMNA CERVICAL. ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LOS EST\\u00cdMULOS EMOCIONALES Y EL RUIDO MENTAL QUE IMPIDEN QUE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO TRANSICIONE A UN ESTADO DE REPOSO PROFUNDO. AL EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS V\\u00c9RTEBRAS CERVICALES, AYUDA A CALMAR LA HIPERVIGILANCIA DEL CEREBRO, PERMITIENDO LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N NATURAL DE NEUROTRANSMISORES REGULADORES DEL SUE\\u00d1O Y RESTAURANDO UN DESCANSO NOCTURNO TRANQUILO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SLEEP CHECK: IF INSOMNIA PERSISTS, SCAN THE CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ CERVICAL PLEXUS (REF 148) TO ADDRESS ACUTE PANIC OR ANXIETY. FOR CHRONIC FATIGUE ACCOMPANYING SLEEP ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE PINEAL GLAND \\/ PINEAL GLAND RESONANCE TO ENSURE MELATONIN PRODUCTION IS OPTIMIZED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DEL SUE\\u00d1O: SI EL INSOMNIO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ PLEXO CERVICAL (REF 148) PARA ABORDAR EL P\\u00c1NICO O LA ANSIEDAD AGUDA. PARA LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA QUE ACOMPA\\u00d1A A LOS PROBLEMAS DE SUE\\u00d1O, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE MELATONINA EST\\u00c9 OPTIMIZADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/153','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:20:48','2026-04-27 11:20:48'),(3954,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',154,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"RELAX (REL\\u00c1JATE)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RELAXATION RESPONSE (RESPUESTA DE RELAJACI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"RELAX, MUSCULAR TENSION, STRESS, AND PHYSICAL FATIGUE.\\n\\n(REL\\u00c1JATE, TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR, ESTR\\u00c9S Y FATIGA F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ENTIRE SPINAL AXIS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CERVICAL AND LUMBAR REGIONS. THIS RESET IS DESIGNED TO INDUCE A DEEP STATE OF RELAXATION BY CALMING THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. BY BALANCING THE ENERGY FLOW FROM THE BASE OF THE SKULL TO THE LOWER BACK, IT RELEASES ACCUMULATED PHYSICAL STRESS AND EMOTIONAL TENSION, HELPING THE BODY TO RECOVER FROM STATES OF HYPER-VIGILANCE AND PROMOTING SYSTEMIC ALIGNMENT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A TODO EL EJE ESPINAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LAS REGIONES CERVICAL Y LUMBAR. ESTE REINICIO EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADO PARA INDUCIR UN ESTADO PROFUNDO DE RELAJACI\\u00d3N AL CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. AL EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA DESDE LA BASE DEL CR\\u00c1NEO HASTA LA PARTE INFERIOR DE LA ESPALDA, LIBERA EL ESTR\\u00c9S F\\u00cdSICO ACUMULADO Y LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A RECUPERARSE DE ESTADOS DE HIPERVIGILANCIA Y PROMOVIENDO LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RELAXATION CHECK: IF INSOMNIA IS PRESENT, SCAN THE CERVICAL \\/ CERVICAL (REF 153) AXIS TO RESET SLEEP CYCLES. FOR SEVERE LOWER BACK TENSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE LUMBAR \\/ SACRUM RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE LOWER POSTERIOR CHAIN IS BALANCED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RELAJACI\\u00d3N: SI HAY INSOMNIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL \\/ CERVICAL (REF 153) PARA REINICIAR LOS CICLOS DE SUE\\u00d1O. PARA UNA TENSI\\u00d3N LUMBAR SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA LUMBAR \\/ SACRO PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA CADENA POSTERIOR INFERIOR EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/154','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:22:01','2026-04-27 11:22:01'),(3955,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',155,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL INFECTION (INFECCI\\u00d3N VAGINAL)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PELVIC ENERGETIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA P\\u00c9LVICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL INFECTION, PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL UTERINE ABSCESS.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N VAGINAL, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO Y POSIBLE ABSCESO UTERINO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RESONANCE BETWEEN THE CERVICAL REGION AND THE UTERUS TO ADDRESS PATHOGENIC LOADS AFFECTING THE FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT. THIS RESET NEUTRALIZES PH DISTORTIONS THAT ALLOW BACTERIA OR FUNGI TO THRIVE IN THE VAGINAL ENVIRONMENT. BY BALANCING THIS ENERGETIC AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE CLEARANCE OF INFECTIONS AND REDUCES INFLAMMATION WITHIN THE PELVIC CAVITY, RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE UTERINE TISSUE AND PROTECTIVE BARRIERS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RESONANCIA ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N CERVICAL Y EL \\u00daTERO PARA ABORDAR LAS CARGAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS QUE AFECTAN EL TRACTO REPRODUCTOR FEMENINO. ESTE REINICIO NEUTRALIZA LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH QUE PERMITEN QUE LAS BACTERIAS O HONGOS PROLIFEREN EN EL ENTORNO VAGINAL. AL EQUILIBRAR ESTE EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO, APOYA LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES Y REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DE LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA, RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DEL TEJIDO UTERINO Y LAS BARRERAS PROTECTORAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE CARDIA \\/ TESTICLE-LABIA (R) (REF 109) TO ADDRESS BROADER UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTIONS. FOR LOCALIZED VAGINAL ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGINA \\/ VAGINA RESONANCE TO RULE OUT SPECIFIC BACTERIAL AGENTS LIKE YERSINIA PESTIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CARDIAS \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO-LABIO (D) (REF 109) PARA ABORDAR DISFUNCIONES UROGENITALES M\\u00c1S AMPLIAS. PARA PROBLEMAS VAGINALES LOCALIZADOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA VAGINA \\/ VAGINA PARA DESCARTAR AGENTES BACTERIANOS ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS COMO YERSINIA PESTIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/155','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:23:14','2026-04-27 11:23:14'),(3956,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',156,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS (VPH)\",\"symptoms\":\"WARTS (VERRUCOUS LESIONS), IRRITATION IN THE ORAL CAVITY, AND POTENTIAL IMPACT ON THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES.\\n\\n(VERRUGAS (LESIONES VERRUCOSAS), IRRITACI\\u00d3N EN LA CAVIDAD ORAL Y POSIBLE IMPACTO EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE MAXILLARY AND BUCCAL REGIONS. THIS RESET ADDRESSES VIRAL LOADS THAT MANIFEST AS WARTS OR CELLULAR ALTERATIONS IN THE SKIN AND MUCOSA. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN RECOGNIZING VIRAL REPLICATION AND HELPS PREVENT THE SPREAD OF LESIONS WITHIN THE FACIAL AND ORAL AREAS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS REGIONES MAXILAR Y BUCAL. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO VERRUGAS O ALTERACIONES CELULARES EN LA PIEL Y LA MUCOSA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN EL RECONOCIMIENTO DE LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL Y AYUDA A PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LESIONES EN LAS \\u00c1REAS FACIALES Y ORALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: IF LESIONS ARE PERSISTENT IN THE PELVIC AREA, SCAN THE [URETHRA \\/ URETHRA] OR [ANUS \\/ ANUS] TO ENSURE THE VIRAL RESONANCE IS NOT ESTABLISHED IN OTHER MUCOUS MEMBRANES. FOR GENERAL SKIN IMMUNITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO RULE OUT ASSOCIATED VIRAL CO-FACTORS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: SI LAS LESIONES SON PERSISTENTES EN EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00c9LVICA, ESCANEAR EL EJE URETRA \\/ URETRA O ANO \\/ ANO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA RESONANCIA VIRAL NO EST\\u00c9 ESTABLECIDA EN OTRAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS. PARA LA INMUNIDAD GENERAL DE LA PIEL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA PARA DESCARTAR COFACTORES VIRALES ASOCIADOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/156','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:24:28','2026-04-27 11:24:28'),(3957,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',157,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC (WHILE IN RESERVOIR), POTENTIAL RECURRENCE OF PREVIOUS BACTERIAL INFECTIONS, OR CHRONIC FATIGUE.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO (MIENTRAS EST\\u00c1 EN EL RESERVORIO), POSIBLE RECURRENCIA DE INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS PREVIAS O FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS A SPECIFIC BACTERIAL RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT CHEEKBONE (ZYGOMATIC BONE) AND THE THYROID GLAND. RESERVOIRS ARE AREAS WHERE PATHOGENS CAN HIDE IN A DORMANT STATE, PROTECTED FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND PREVIOUS TREATMENTS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT FORCES THE HIDDEN BACTERIAL LOAD INTO THE BLOODSTREAM WHERE THE BODY CAN EFFECTIVELY IDENTIFY AND ELIMINATE IT, PREVENTING FUTURE RE-INFECTIONS AND SUPPORTING METABOLIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A UN RESERVORIO BACTERIANO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00d3MULO IZQUIERDO (HUESO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO) Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES. LOS RESERVORIOS SON \\u00c1REAS DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN ESCONDERSE EN ESTADO LATENTE, PROTEGIDOS DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y DE TRATAMIENTOS PREVIOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, SE OBLIGA A LA CARGA BACTERIANA OCULTA A PASAR AL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO, DONDE EL CUERPO PUEDE IDENTIFICARLA Y ELIMINARLA EFICAZMENTE, PREVINIENDO FUTURAS REINFECCIONES Y APOYANDO EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF A SPECIFIC BACTERIA PERSIST AFTER CLEARING THE PRIMARY PAIR, SCAN OTHER KNOWN RESERVOIRS SUCH AS THE [CHEEKBONE \\/ CHEEKBONE] OR [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN]. FOR GLANDULAR SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM IS NOT COMPROMISED BY RESIDUAL TOXICITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE UNA BACTERIA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA PERSISTEN DESPU\\u00c9S DE LIMPIAR EL PAR PRIMARIO, ESCANEAR OTROS RESERVORIOS CONOCIDOS COMO P\\u00d3MULO \\/ P\\u00d3MULO O BAZO \\/ BAZO. PARA APOYO GLANDULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO NO EST\\u00c9 COMPROMETIDO POR TOXICIDAD RESIDUAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/157','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:25:31','2026-04-27 11:25:31'),(3958,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',158,'{\"symptoms\":\"MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, FATIGUE, MUSCLE PAIN, HEADACHES, ANEMIA, HYPOGLYCEMIA, SHOCK, ACIDITY, PULMONARY EDEMA, SEVERE DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS. (MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, FATIGA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, DOLORES DE CABEZA, ANEMIA, HIPOGLUCEMIA, CHOQUE, ACIDEZ, EDEMA PULMONAR, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS GRAVES)\",\"paths\":\"FALSE SALMONELLOSIS. CAN BE CONFUSED WITH ARTHRITIS OR RHEUMATISM. (SALMONELOSIS FALSA. PUEDE CONFUNDIRSE CON ARTRITIS O REUMATISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH DORSO\\/LUMBAR, TRUE ARTHRITIS. CHECK - PALM. (ASOCIADO CON DORSAL \\/ LUMBAR; ARTRITIS VERDADERA. REVISAR \\u2013 PALMA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, FATIGUE, MUSCLE PAIN, HEADACHES, ANEMIA, HYPOGLYCEMIA, SHOCK, ACIDITY, PULMONARY EDEMA, AND SEVERE DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS.\\n\\n(MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, FATIGA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, DOLORES DE CABEZA, ANEMIA, HIPOGLUCEMIA, CHOQUE, ACIDEZ, EDEMA PULMONAR Y TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS GRAVES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PLASMODIUM VIVAX BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CHEEKBONE (ZYGOMATIC BONE) AND THE KIDNEY ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. THIS PARASITE IS THE PRIMARY CAUSE OF \\\"FALSE SALMONELLOSIS\\\" AND CAN FREQUENTLY BE MISDIAGNOSED AS ARTHRITIS OR RHEUMATISM DUE TO THE SEVERE JOINT AND MUSCLE PAIN IT INDUCES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT ADDRESSES THE SYSTEMIC ACIDITY AND PATHOGENIC LOAD THAT CONTRIBUTES TO CHRONIC FATIGUE AND FIBROMYALGIA-LIKE SYMPTOMS, SUPPORTING THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING BLOOD AND RESTORING METABOLIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PLASMODIUM VIVAX MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00d3MULO (HUESO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO) Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL LADO OPUESTO. ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO ES LA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE LA \\\"SALMONELOSIS FALSA\\\" Y CON FRECUENCIA PUEDE SER MAL DIAGNOSTICADO COMO ARTRITIS O REUMATISMO DEBIDO AL DOLOR ARTICULAR Y MUSCULAR SEVERO QUE INDUCE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, ABORDA LA ACIDEZ SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA CARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA QUE CONTRIBUYE A LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA Y A LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES A LA FIBROMIALGIA, APOYANDO AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH THE DORSO\\/LUMBAR AXIS. IF JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE PALM \\/ PALM RESONANCE TO RULE OUT TRUE ARTHRITIS. FOR SEVERE DIGESTIVE UPSET, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS TO ENSURE NO OTHER PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE IS PRESENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: ASOCIADO CON EL EJE DORSAL \\/ LUMBAR. SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTE, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA PALMA \\/ PALMA PARA DESCARTAR ARTRITIS VERDADERA. PARA TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS GRAVES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA OTRA INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA PRESENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/158','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:26:43','2026-04-27 11:26:43'),(3959,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',159,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SPREAD BY BIRD FEATHERS. AFFECTS THE LUNGS AND BRAIN. (SE PROPAGA POR PLUMAS DE AVES. AFECTA LOS PULMONES Y EL CEREBRO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - TEMPORAL\\/OCCIPITAL (REVISAR \\u2013 TEMPORAL \\/ OCCIPITAL)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CHRONIC COUGH, LUNG CONGESTION, AND POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL IMPACTS.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y POSIBLES IMPACTOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS MYCOPLASMA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE CHEST REGION. THIS BACTERIUM IS OFTEN SPREAD THROUGH CONTACT WITH BIRD FEATHERS AND IS UNIQUE BECAUSE IT LACKS A CELL WALL, MAKING IT RESISTANT TO MANY COMMON ANTIBIOTICS. THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGEN\'S TENDENCY TO AFFECT BOTH THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM (LUNGS) AND THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM (BRAIN), HELPING TO CLEAR PERSISTENT PULMONARY INFECTIONS AND PREVENT SYSTEMIC SPREAD.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL MYCOPLASMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL PECHO. ESTA BACTERIA A MENUDO SE PROPAGA POR EL CONTACTO CON PLUMAS DE AVES Y ES \\u00daNICA PORQUE CARECE DE PARED CELULAR, LO QUE LA HACE RESISTENTE A MUCHOS ANTIBI\\u00d3TICOS COMUNES. ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA TENDENCIA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO A AFECTAR TANTO EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO (PULMONES) COMO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL (CEREBRO), AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR INFECCIONES PULMONARES PERSISTENTES Y PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF MENTAL FOG OR HEADACHES PERSIST ALONG WITH RESPIRATORY ISSUES, SCAN THE TEMPORAL \\/ OCCIPITAL AXIS TO ENSURE THE BACTERIA IS NOT ESTABLISHED IN THE CRANIAL REGION. FOR BIRDS-RELATED EXPOSURE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS (REF 151) TO RULE OUT OTHER MYCOBACTERIUM STRAINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA NIEBLA MENTAL O LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA PERSISTEN JUNTO CON LOS PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE TEMPORAL \\/ OCCIPITAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA BACTERIA NO EST\\u00c9 ESTABLECIDA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N CRANEAL. PARA LA EXPOSICI\\u00d3N RELACIONADA CON AVES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO (REF 151) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CEPAS DE MYCOBACTERIUM.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/159','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:27:53','2026-04-27 11:27:53'),(3960,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',160,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EDEMA, FLUID RETENTION, EDEMA (EDEMA, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS, EDEMA)\",\"paths\":\"REGULATES AND PROMOTES THE FLOW OF THE LYMPH SYSTEM THROUGHOUT THE BODY, RAISING THE DEFENSE. THE LYMPH SYSTEM MAYBE ALTERED BY ITSELF OR AS A RESULT OF A DRAMIC EVENT OR INFECTIOUS DISEASE. LOWER LIMBS USUALLY RETAIN FLUIDS. (REGULA Y PROMUEVE EL FLUJO DEL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO EN TODO EL CUERPO, ELEVANDO LAS DEFENSAS. EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO PUEDE ALTERARSE POR S\\u00cd MISMO O COMO RESULTADO DE UN EVENTO DRAM\\u00c1TICO O UNA ENFERMEDAD INFECCIOSA. LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES SUELEN RETENER L\\u00cdQUIDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"LYMPHATIC FLOW (FLUJO LINF\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EDEMA, FLUID RETENTION, AND LOWERED IMMUNE DEFENSES.\\n\\n(EDEMA, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y DEFENSAS INMUNITARIAS BAJAS.)\",\"paths\":\"REGULATES AND PROMOTES THE FLOW OF THE LYMPH SYSTEM THROUGHOUT THE BODY, RAISING THE DEFENSES. THE LYMPH SYSTEM MAY BE ALTERED BY ITSELF OR AS A RESULT OF A DRAMATIC EVENT OR INFECTIOUS DISEASE. THIS RESET IS PARTICULARLY EFFECTIVE WHEN THE LOWER LIMBS RETAIN FLUIDS, AS IT HELPS RE-ESTABLISH THE PROPER DRAINAGE AND ENERGETIC CONDUCTIVITY OF THE LYMPHATIC NETWORK.(REGULA Y PROMUEVE EL FLUJO DEL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO EN TODO EL CUERPO, ELEVANDO LAS DEFENSAS. EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO PUEDE ALTERARSE POR S\\u00cd MISMO O COMO RESULTADO DE UN EVENTO DRAM\\u00c1TICO O UNA ENFERMEDAD INFECCIOSA. ESTE REINICIO ES PARTICULARMENTE EFICAZ CUANDO LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES RETIENEN L\\u00cdQUIDOS, YA QUE AYUDA A REESTABLECER EL DRENAJE ADECUADO Y LA CONDUCTIVIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA RED LINF\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CIRCULATORY CHECK: IF FLUID RETENTION PERSISTS IN THE LEGS, SCAN THE [INTERNAL INGUINAL \\/ INTERNAL INGUINAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED LYMPHATIC BLOCKAGES. FOR IMMUNE SYSTEM SUPPORT DURING AN ACTIVE INFECTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE TO ENHANCE THE FILTRATION OF PATHOGENS FROM THE BLOOD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CIRCULATORIA: SI LA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS PERSISTE EN LAS PIERNAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE INGUINAL INTERNO \\/ INGUINAL INTERNO PARA ABORDAR BLOQUEOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS LOCALIZADOS. PARA EL APOYO DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO DURANTE UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N ACTIVA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA BAZO \\/ BAZO PARA MEJORAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE LA SANGRE.)\\n\\n!\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/160','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:29:06','2026-04-27 11:29:06'),(3961,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',162,'{\"symptoms\":\"TOOTHACHE, RASH, NEURALGIA, FACIAL PARALYSIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, IRRITABILITY. (DOLOR DE MUELAS, ERUPCI\\u00d3N, NEURALGIA, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, IRRITABILIDAD)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"TOOTHACHE, RASH, NEURALGIA, FACIAL PARALYSIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, AND IRRITABILITY.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE MUELAS, ERUPCI\\u00d3N, NEURALGIA, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA E IRRITABILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HERPES ZOSTER VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE MANDIBULAR REGION. THIS RESET ADDRESSES VIRAL LOADS THAT TEND TO INFLAME THE NERVE ENDINGS OF THE FACE, OFTEN LEADING TO SEVERE NEURALGIA OR TEMPORARY FACIAL PARALYSIS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN DEACTIVATING THE VIRUS, REDUCING THE PAIN ASSOCIATED WITH SENSITIVE TEETH OR GUMS, AND PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF OCULAR COMPLICATIONS LIKE RETINITIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL HERPES Z\\u00d3STER MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N MANDIBULAR. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE TIENDEN A INFLAMAR LAS TERMINACIONES NERVIOSAS DE LA CARA, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A UNA NEURALGIA SEVERA O PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL TEMPORAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, APOYA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN LA DESACTIVACI\\u00d3N DEL VIRUS, REDUCIENDO EL DOLOR ASOCIADO CON DIENTES O ENC\\u00cdAS SENSIBLES Y PREVINIENDO LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE COMPLICACIONES OCULARES COMO LA RETINITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NERVE CHECK: IF FACIAL PARALYSIS IS PRESENT, SCAN THE CHEEK \\/ CHEEK (REF 156) TO RULE OUT HUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS CO-FACTORS. FOR ACUTE NERVE PAIN IN THE JAW, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE AXIS TO ENSURE LOCALIZED BACTERIAL INFECTIONS ARE NOT EXACERBATING THE NEURALGIA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA: SI HAY PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE MEJILLA \\/ MEJILLA (REF 156) PARA DESCARTAR COFACTORES DEL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO. PARA EL DOLOR NERVIOSO AGUDO EN LA MAND\\u00cdBULA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS LOCALIZADAS NO EST\\u00c9N EXACERBANDO LA NEURALGIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/162','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:30:18','2026-04-27 11:30:18'),(3962,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',163,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUCUS, COUGH, RESTLESSNESS, CHRONIC BRONCHITIS, PULMONARY FIBROSIS, DIARRHEA, GENERAL EDEMA. (MUCOSIDAD, TOS, INQUIETUD, BRONQUITIS CR\\u00d3NICA, FIBROSIS PULMONAR, DIARREA, EDEMA GENERAL)\",\"paths\":\"SPREADS FROM SPORES, AIR, WATER, POLLUTION AND FOOD. AFFECTS THE LUNGS. THIS FUNGUS IS An OPPORTUNIST WHEN THE PATIENT HAS HIV. (SE PROPAGA POR ESPORAS, AIRE, AGUA, CONTAMINACI\\u00d3N Y ALIMENTOS. AFECTA LOS PULMONES. ESTE HONGO ES UN OPORTUNISTA CUANDO EL PACIENTE TIENE VIH.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LOOK FOR THE VIRUS THAT IS SUSTAINING IT.      ASSOCIATED WITH NORWALK VIRUS, IT CAUSES SARS (SEVERE ACUTE RESPIRATORY SYNDROME) CHECK - CARINA             CHECK - DORSAL 3\\/DORSAL 7 CHECK AXILLA                  CHECK - MANUBRIUM      CHECK - PLEURA\\/LIVER CHECK - TONSIL               CHECK - NASAL SINUS. (BUSCAR EL VIRUS QUE LO SOSTIENE. ASOCIADO CON EL VIRUS NORWALK, CAUSA SARS (S\\u00cdNDROME RESPIRATORIO AGUDO SEVERO). VERIFICAR - CARINA. VERIFICAR - DORSAL 3\\/DORSAL 7. VERIFICAR AXILA. VERIFICAR - MANUBRIO. VERIFICAR - PLEURA\\/H\\u00cdGADO. VERIFICAR - AM\\u00cdGDALA. VERIFICAR - SENO NASAL.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUCUS, COUGH, RESTLESSNESS, CHRONIC BRONCHITIS, PULMONARY FIBROSIS, DIARRHEA, AND GENERAL EDEMA.\\n\\n(MUCOSIDAD, TOS, INQUIETUD, BRONQUITIS CR\\u00d3NICA, FIBROSIS PULMONAR, DIARREA Y EDEMA GENERAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PNEUMOCYSTIS CARINII BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE CHONDRAL (CARTILAGE) REGION OF THE RIBCAGE. THIS FUNGUS IS AN OPPORTUNISTIC PATHOGEN THAT SPREADS THROUGH SPORES IN THE AIR, WATER, AND FOOD, PRIMARILY ATTACKING THE LUNGS. THIS RESET IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF PULMONARY FIBROSIS AND MANAGING SEVERE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, ESPECIALLY IN IMMUNOCOMPROMISED STATES WHERE THE PATHOGEN CAN THRIVE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PNEUMOCYSTIS CARINII MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N CONDRO (CART\\u00cdLAGO) DE LA CAJA TOR\\u00c1CICA. ESTE HONGO ES UN PAT\\u00d3GENO OPORTUNISTA QUE SE PROPAGA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ESPORAS EN EL AIRE, EL AGUA Y LOS ALIMENTOS, ATACANDO PRINCIPALMENTE LOS PULMONES. ESTE REINICIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE LA FIBROSIS PULMONAR Y MANEJAR LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA SEVERA, ESPECIALMENTE EN ESTADOS DE INMUNODEFICIENCIA DONDE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE PROLIFERAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: SEARCH FOR THE UNDERLYING VIRUS SUSTAINING THE FUNGAL LOAD. IF ASSOCIATED WITH THE NORWALK VIRUS, IT MAY CAUSE SARS (SEVERE ACUTE RESPIRATORY SYNDROME). MANDATORY TO CHECK THE FOLLOWING POINTS: CARINA, DORSAL 3 \\/ DORSAL 7, AXILLA, MANUBRIUM, PLEURA \\/ LIVER, TONSIL, AND NASAL SINUS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: BUSCAR EL VIRUS SUBYACENTE QUE SOSTIENE LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA. SI SE ASOCIA CON EL VIRUS NORWALK, PUEDE CAUSAR SARS (S\\u00cdNDROME RESPIRATORIO AGUDO SEVERO). ES OBLIGATORIO REVISAR LOS SIGUIENTES PUNTOS: CARINA, DORSAL 3 \\/ DORSAL 7, AXILA, MANUBRIO, PLEURA \\/ H\\u00cdGADO, AM\\u00cdGDALA Y SENO NASAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/163','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:31:33','2026-04-27 11:31:33'),(3963,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',164,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EXTREME AGGRESSION (AGRESI\\u00d3N EXTREMA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HYPER-AGGRESSION (HIPERAGRESI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXTREME AGGRESSION, IRRITABILITY, IMPULSIVENESS, AND LOSS OF EMOTIONAL CONTROL.\\n\\n(AGRESI\\u00d3N EXTREMA, IRRITABILIDAD, IMPULSIVIDAD Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CONTROL EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF EXTREME AGGRESSIVE IMPULSES BY STABILIZING THE BIOFIELD AROUND THE CIRCLE OF WILLIS, THE CRITICAL ARTERIAL CIRCLE AT THE BASE OF THE BRAIN. THIS RESET FOCUSES ON RELEASING EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES OR MEMORIES THAT TRIGGER EXPLOSIVE EMOTIONAL RESPONSES. BY BALANCING THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO THE BRAIN\'S VASCULAR NETWORK, IT HELPS CALM THE LIMBIC SYSTEM\'S OVERREACTION, PROMOTING MENTAL CLARITY, EMOTIONAL STABILITY, AND A PEACEFUL STATE OF MIND.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS IMPULSOS AGRESIVOS EXTREMOS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL BIOCAMPO ALREDEDOR DEL C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS, EL C\\u00cdRCULO ARTERIAL CR\\u00cdTICO EN LA BASE DEL CEREBRO. ESTE REINICIO SE CENTRA EN LIBERAR C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS O MEMORIAS QUE DESENCADENAN RESPUESTAS EMOCIONALES EXPLOSIVAS. AL EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO HACIA LA RED VASCULAR DEL CEREBRO, AYUDA A CALMAR LA REACCI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA DEL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO, PROMOVIENDO LA CLARIDAD MENTAL, LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y UN ESTADO MENTAL DE PAZ.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF AGGRESSION IS COUPLED WITH SADNESS OR DEPRESSION, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS. FOR ANXIETY-DRIVEN IMPULSIVENESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ CERVICAL PLEXUS (REF 148) TO ENSURE THE PANIC RESPONSE IS NOT EXACERBATING THE AGGRESSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL: SI LA AGRESI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c1 ACOMPA\\u00d1ADA DE TRISTEZA O DEPRESI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES. PARA LA IMPULSIVIDAD IMPULSADA POR LA ANSIEDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ PLEXO CERVICAL (REF 148) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA RESPUESTA DE P\\u00c1NICO NO EST\\u00c9 EXACERBANDO LA AGRESI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/164','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:32:41','2026-04-27 11:32:41'),(3964,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',165,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUCUS, PHLEGM, GAS, DIARRHEA, FEMORAL NECROSIS, ARTHRITIS HIP, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, WHOOPING COUGH, AUTISM\",\"paths\":\"MUCUS AND PHLEGM IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. LACTOSE INTOLERANT, IT CAN AFFECT THE THYMUS, THYROID GLAND AND PARATHYROID GLAND. CHRONIC COUGHING WHILE THE INVASION STARTS WITH BACILLUS.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUCUS, PHLEGM, GAS, DIARRHEA, FEMORAL NECROSIS, ARTHRITIS OF THE HIP, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, WHOOPING COUGH, AND POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL IMPACTS (AUTISM-LIKE SYMPTOMS).\\n\\n(MUCOSIDAD, FLEMA, GASES, DIARREA, NECROSIS FEMORAL, ARTRITIS DE CADERA, FLUJO VAGINAL, TOS FERINA E IMPACTOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS POTENCIALES (S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES AL AUTISMO).)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS BORDETELLA PERTUSSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDIAL CLAVICLE AND THE SUBMANDIBULAR REGION ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF MUCUS AND PHLEGM THROUGHOUT THE DIGESTIVE TRACT AND RESPIRATORY SYSTEM. IT IS PARTICULARLY SIGNIFICANT FOR THOSE WITH LACTOSE INTOLERANCE, AS THE PATHOGEN CAN AFFECT THE THYMUS, THYROID, AND PARATHYROID GLANDS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS CURB CHRONIC COUGHING FITS AND PREVENTS THE BACTERIA FROM CAUSING COMPLICATIONS IN THE HIP JOINTS OR REPRODUCTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BORDETELLA PERTUSSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA CLAV\\u00cdCULA MEDIAL Y LA REGI\\u00d3N SUBMANDIBULAR DEL LADO OPUESTO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE MUCOSIDAD Y FLEMA EN TODO EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO Y EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO. ES PARTICULARMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO PARA LAS PERSONAS CON INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA, YA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE AFECTAR EL TIMO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS TIROIDES Y PARATIROIDES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A FRENAR LOS ATAQUES DE TOS CR\\u00d3NICA Y PREVIENE QUE LA BACTERIA CAUSE COMPLICACIONES EN LAS ARTICULACIONES DE LA CADERA O EL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR CHECK: IF METABOLIC OR RESPIRATORY ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM IS NOT COMPROMISED. FOR HIP PAIN OR JOINT STIFFNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ILIAC CREST \\/ ILIAC CREST] AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER BACTERIAL RESONANCES AFFECTING THE PELVIC GIRDLE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR: SI PERSISTEN LOS PROBLEMAS METAB\\u00d3LICOS O RESPIRATORIOS, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO NO EST\\u00c9 COMPROMETIDO. PARA EL DOLOR DE CADERA O LA RIGIDEZ ARTICULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA \\/ CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS RESONANCIAS BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTEN LA CINTURA P\\u00c9LVICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/165','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:33:55','2026-04-27 11:33:55'),(3965,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',166,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ARROGANCE (ARROGANCIA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ARROGANCE (ARROGANCIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEELINGS OF SUPERIORITY, LACK OF EMPATHY, RIGIDITY IN THINKING, AND DIFFICULTY CONNECTING WITH OTHERS ON AN EQUAL LEVEL.\\n\\n(SENTIMIENTOS DE SUPERIORIDAD, FALTA DE EMPAT\\u00cdA, RIGIDEZ EN EL PENSAMIENTO Y DIFICULTAD PARA CONECTAR CON LOS DEM\\u00c1S A UN NIVEL DE IGUALDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF ARROGANCE BY STABILIZING THE BIOFIELD ALONG THE MIDLINE OF THE CRANIUM (THE CLEFT MIDDLE). THIS RESET FOCUSES ON RELEASING EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES OR MENTAL CONSTRUCTS THAT PERPETUATE AN INFLATED SENSE OF SELF OR A SUPERIORITY COMPLEX. BY BALANCING THE ENERGETIC VORTEX IN THIS CENTRAL REGION, IT PROMOTES HUMILITY, OPENNESS, AND A MORE BALANCED PERCEPTION OF ONESELF IN RELATION TO THE WORLD, HELPING TO DISSOLVE THE ENERGETIC BARRIERS CREATED BY EGOCENTRIC VIBRATIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA ARROGANCIA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL BIOCAMPO A LO LARGO DE LA L\\u00cdNEA MEDIA DEL CR\\u00c1NEO (LA HENDIDURA MEDIA). ESTE REINICIO SE CENTRA EN LIBERAR C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS O CONSTRUCTOS MENTALES QUE PERPET\\u00daAN UN SENTIDO INFLADO DEL YO O UN COMPLEJO DE SUPERIORIDAD. AL EQUILIBRAR EL V\\u00d3RTICE ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN ESTA REGI\\u00d3N CENTRAL, PROMUEVE LA HUMILDAD, LA APERTURA Y UNA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S EQUILIBRADA DE UNO MISMO EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON EL MUNDO, AYUDANDO A DISOLVER LAS BARRERAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS CREADAS POR VIBRACIONES EGOC\\u00c9NTRICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF ARROGANCE IS COUPLED WITH ANGER, SCAN THE CIRCLE OF WILLIS \\/ CIRCLE OF WILLIS (REF 164) TO ADDRESS HYPER-AGGRESSION. FOR RIGIDITY LINKED TO FEAR, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CROWN \\/ CROWN] AXIS TO ENSURE THE HIGHER ENERGETIC CENTERS ARE NOT BLOCKED BY DEFENSIVE CODES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL: SI LA ARROGANCIA EST\\u00c1 ACOMPA\\u00d1ADA DE IRA, ESCANEAR EL EJE C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS \\/ C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS (REF 164) PARA ABORDAR LA HIPERAGRESI\\u00d3N. PARA LA RIGIDEZ VINCULADA AL MIEDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CORONA \\/ CORONA PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS CENTROS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS SUPERIORES NO EST\\u00c9N BLOQUEADOS POR C\\u00d3DIGOS DEFENSIVOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/166','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:35:11','2026-04-27 11:35:11'),(3966,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',167,'{\"symptoms\":\"THRUSH, RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, CYSTITIS, VAGINAL INFECTION. (CANDIDIASIS ORAL, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, CISTITIS, INFECCI\\u00d3N VAGINAL)\",\"paths\":\"FUNGUS WILL FOLLOW THE ROUTE OF THE VIRUS SUSTAINING IT. (EL HONGO SEGUIR\\u00c1 LA RUTA DEL VIRUS QUE LO SOSTIENE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MUST FIND WHERE THE VIRUS IS LOCATED AT.                CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW CHECK - RING FINGER\\/RING FINGER. (SE DEBE ENCONTRAR D\\u00d3NDE SE ENCUENTRA EL VIRUS. VERIFICAR - CODO\\/CODO. VERIFICAR - DEDO ANULAR\\/DEDO ANULAR.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"THRUSH, RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, CYSTITIS, AND VAGINAL INFECTION.\\n\\n(CANDIDIASIS ORAL, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, CISTITIS E INFECCI\\u00d3N VAGINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS CANDIDA ALBICANS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CLITORIS AND THE ANUS. THIS FUNGUS IS AN OPPORTUNISTIC PATHOGEN THAT OFTEN PROLIFERATES WHEN THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IS WEAKENED OR THE INTERNAL MICROBIOME IS IMBALANCED. THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE SPREAD OF CANDIDA THROUGHOUT THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES, HELPING TO CLEAR UROGENITAL DISCOMFORT AND RESPIRATORY LOADS. THE FUNGUS TYPICALLY FOLLOWS THE ROUTE OF A SUSTAINING VIRUS; THEREFORE, NEUTRALIZING THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL TO BREAK THE SYMBIOTIC RELATIONSHIP ALLOWING THE FUNGAL OVERGROWTH.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA C\\u00c1NDIDA ALBICANS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CL\\u00cdTORIS Y EL ANO. ESTE HONGO ES UN PAT\\u00d3GENO OPORTUNISTA QUE A MENUDO PROLIFERA CUANDO EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EST\\u00c1 DEBILITADO O EL MICROBIOMA INTERNO EST\\u00c1 DESEQUILIBRADO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA C\\u00c1NDIDA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR EL MALESTAR UROGENITAL Y LAS CARGAS RESPIRATORIAS. EL HONGO GENERALMENTE SIGUE LA RUTA DE UN VIRUS QUE LO SOSTIENE; POR LO TANTO, NEUTRALIZAR ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ROMPER LA RELACI\\u00d3N SIMBI\\u00d3TICA QUE PERMITE EL CRECIMIENTO EXCESIVO DE HONGOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL SEARCH: IT IS MANDATORY TO FIND THE SUSTAINING VIRUS. SCAN THE ELBOW \\/ ELBOW OR RING FINGER \\/ RING FINGER AXES TO LOCATE THE PRIMARY VIRAL RESONANCE. FOR PERSISTENT UROGENITAL SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL \\/ UTERUS (REF 152\\/155) TO ENSURE NO OTHER PATHOGENIC LOADS ARE COMPROMISING THE PELVIC REGION.\\n\\n(B\\u00daSQUEDA VIRAL: ES OBLIGATORIO ENCONTRAR EL VIRUS QUE LO SOSTIENE. ESCANEAR LOS EJES CODO \\/ CODO O DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR PARA LOCALIZAR LA RESONANCIA VIRAL PRIMARIA. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS UROGENITALES PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CERVICAL \\/ \\u00daTERO (REF 152\\/155) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA OTRAS CARGAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS COMPROMETIENDO LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/167','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:37:18','2026-04-27 11:37:18'),(3967,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',168,'{\"symptoms\":\"RECTAL IRRITATION, URINARY PROBLEMS, PELVIC DISORDERS, GENITAL INFLAMMATION, DIARRHEA, SKIN INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS. INFERTILITY. (IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL, PROBLEMAS URINARIOS, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GENITAL, DIARREA, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS. INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"PELVIC DISORDERS IN THE VAGINA, CLITORIS, AND URETHRA. DISCHARGES FROM THE DISORDER. FALSE DIABETES. (TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS EN LA VAGINA, CL\\u00cdTORIS Y URETRA. SECRECIONES DEL TRASTORNO. DIABETES FALSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - BILE DUCT\\/KIDNEY (R) CHECK - PANCREATIC DUCT\\/KIDNEY (L)                                 CHECK - URETHRA\\/SACRUM (VERIFICAR - CONDUCTO BILIAR\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) VERIFICAR - CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) VERIFICAR - URETRA\\/SACRO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RECTAL IRRITATION, URINARY PROBLEMS, PELVIC DISORDERS, GENITAL INFLAMMATION, DIARRHEA, SKIN INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, AND INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL, PROBLEMAS URINARIOS, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GENITAL, DIARREA, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS E INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SPIROCHAETE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE CLITORAL REGION. THIS RESET ADDRESSES VARIOUS PELVIC DISORDERS AFFECTING THE VAGINA, CLITORIS, AND URETHRA, OFTEN MANIFESTING AS UNUSUAL DISCHARGES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS CORRECT \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" SYMPTOMS\\u2014WHERE THE BODY MIMICS DIABETIC CONDITIONS DUE TO PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE\\u2014AND SUPPORTS THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM IN CLEARING INFECTIONS THAT MAY CONTRIBUTE TO INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESPIROQUETA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CL\\u00cdTORIS. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA VARIOS TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS QUE AFECTAN LA VAGINA, EL CL\\u00cdTORIS Y LA URETRA, QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTAN COMO SECRECIONES INUSUALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A CORREGIR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE \\\"DIABETES FALSA\\\", DONDE EL CUERPO IMITA LAS CONDICIONES DIAB\\u00c9TICAS DEBIDO A LA INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA, Y APOYA AL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES QUE PUEDEN CONTRIBUIR A LA INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF DIABETES OR DIGESTIVE ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE BILE DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (R) OR PANCREATIC DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (L) TO ENSURE GLUCOSE PROCESSING IS BALANCED. FOR CHRONIC URINARY DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETHRA \\/ SACRUM AXIS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PELVIC FLOOR IS CLEAR OF PATHOGENIC RESONANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DIABETES O PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE CONDUCTO BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) O CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA GLUCOSA EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO. PARA EL MALESTAR URINARIO CR\\u00d3NICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE URETRA \\/ SACRO PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL SUELO P\\u00c9LVICO EST\\u00c9 LIBRE DE RESONANCIAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/168','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:38:36','2026-04-27 11:38:36'),(3968,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',169,'{\"symptoms\":\"RECTAL IRRITATION, URINARY PROBLEMS, PELVIC DISORDERS, GENITAL INFLAMMATION, DIARRHEA, SKIN INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS. INFERTILITY. (IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL, PROBLEMAS URINARIOS, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GENITAL, DIARREA, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS. INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"PELVIC DISORDERS IN THE VAGINA, CLITORIS, AND URETHRA. DISCHARGES FROM THE DISORDER. FALSE DIABETES. (TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS EN LA VAGINA, CL\\u00cdTORIS Y URETRA. SECRECIONES DEL TRASTORNO. DIABETES FALSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - BILE DUCT\\/KIDNEY (R) CHECK - PANCREATIC DUCT\\/KIDNEY (L)                                 CHECK - URETHRA\\/SACRUM (ERIFICAR - CONDUCTO BILIAR\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) VERIFICAR - CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) VERIFICAR - URETRA\\/SACRO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RECTAL IRRITATION, URINARY PROBLEMS, PELVIC DISORDERS, GENITAL INFLAMMATION, DIARRHEA, SKIN INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, AND INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL, PROBLEMAS URINARIOS, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GENITAL, DIARREA, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS E INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SPIROCHAETE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CLITORIS AND THE PELVIC REGION. THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES COMPLEX PELVIC DISORDERS AFFECTING THE VAGINA, CLITORIS, AND URETHRA, WHICH OFTEN MANIFEST AS UNUSUAL DISCHARGES OR IRRITATION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS CORRECT \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" SYMPTOMS\\u2014WHERE PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE MIMICS DIABETIC CONDITIONS\\u2014AND SUPPORTS THE BODY IN CLEARING INFECTIONS THAT CAN IMPACT SYSTEMIC HEALTH, FROM THE RESPIRATORY TRACT TO REPRODUCTIVE FERTILITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESPIROQUETA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CL\\u00cdTORIS Y LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS COMPLEJOS QUE AFECTAN LA VAGINA, EL CL\\u00cdTORIS Y LA URETRA, QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTAN COMO SECRECIONES INUSUALES O IRRITACI\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A CORREGIR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE \\\"DIABETES FALSA\\\", DONDE LA INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA IMITA LAS CONDICIONES DIAB\\u00c9TICAS, Y APOYA AL CUERPO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES QUE PUEDEN AFECTAR LA SALUD SIST\\u00c9MICA, DESDE EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO HASTA LA FERTILIDAD REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF DIABETES OR DIGESTIVE ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE BILE DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (R) OR PANCREATIC DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (L) TO ENSURE GLUCOSE PROCESSING IS BALANCED. FOR CHRONIC URINARY DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETHRA \\/ SACRUM AXIS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PELVIC FLOOR IS CLEAR OF PATHOGENIC RESONANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DIABETES O PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE CONDUCTO BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) O CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA GLUCOSA EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO. PARA EL MALESTAR URINARIO CR\\u00d3NICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE URETRA \\/ SACRO PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL SUELO P\\u00c9LVICO EST\\u00c9 LIBRE DE RESONANCIAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/169','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:39:43','2026-04-27 11:39:43'),(3969,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',170,'{\"symptoms\":\"RECTAL IRRITATION, URINARY PROBLEMS, PELVIC DISORDERS, GENITAL INFLAMMATION, DIARRHEA, SKIN INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS. INFERTILITY. (IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL, PROBLEMAS URINARIOS, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GENITAL, DIARREA, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS. INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"PELVIC DISORDERS IN THE VAGINA, CLITORIS, AND URETHRA. DISCHARGES FROM THE DISORDER. FALSE DIABETES. (TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS EN LA VAGINA, CL\\u00cdTORIS Y URETRA. SECRECIONES DEL TRASTORNO. DIABETES FALSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - BILE DUCT\\/KIDNEY (R) CHECK - PANCREATIC DUCT\\/KIDNEY (L)                                 CHECK - URETHRA\\/SACRUM. (VERIFICAR - CONDUCTO BILIAR\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) VERIFICAR - CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) VERIFICAR - URETRA\\/SACRO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RECTAL IRRITATION, URINARY PROBLEMS, PELVIC DISORDERS, GENITAL INFLAMMATION, DIARRHEA, SKIN INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, AND INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL, PROBLEMAS URINARIOS, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GENITAL, DIARREA, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS E INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SPIROCHAETE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CLITORIS AND THE SACRUM. THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING DEEP PELVIC DISORDERS WITHIN THE VAGINA, CLITORIS, AND URETHRA, WHICH FREQUENTLY MANIFEST AS CHRONIC DISCHARGES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT ALSO HELPS CORRECT \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" SYMPTOMS\\u2014WHERE PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE DISRUPTS METABOLIC SIGNALS\\u2014AND SUPPORTS THE ENTIRE PELVIC GIRDLE IN RECOVERING FROM SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL LOADS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESPIROQUETA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH ENTRE EL CL\\u00cdTORIS Y EL SACRO. ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS PROFUNDOS EN LA VAGINA, EL CL\\u00cdTORIS Y LA URETRA, QUE CON FRECUENCIA SE MANIFIESTAN COMO SECRECIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, TAMBI\\u00c9N AYUDA A CORREGIR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE \\\"DIABETES FALSA\\\", DONDE LA INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA ALTERA LAS SE\\u00d1ALES METAB\\u00d3LICAS, Y APOYA A TODA LA CINTURA P\\u00c9LVICA A RECUPERARSE DE LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF DIABETES OR DIGESTIVE ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE BILE DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (R) OR PANCREATIC DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (L) TO ENSURE GLUCOSE PROCESSING IS BALANCED. FOR CHRONIC URINARY DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETHRA \\/ SACRUM AXIS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PELVIC FLOOR IS CLEAR OF PATHOGENIC RESONANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DIABETES O PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE CONDUCTO BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) O CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA GLUCOSA EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO. PARA EL MALESTAR URINARIO CR\\u00d3NICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE URETRA \\/ SACRO PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL SUELO P\\u00c9LVICO EST\\u00c9 LIBRE DE RESONANCIAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/170','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:40:54','2026-04-27 11:40:54'),(3970,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',171,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE REGULATION OF URIC ACID LEVELS BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE COCCYX AND THE CERVICAL PLEXUS. THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE METABOLIC IMBALANCE THAT LEADS TO THE ACCUMULATION OF URIC ACID CRYSTALS IN THE JOINTS, COMMONLY KNOWN AS GOUT. BY BALANCING THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE BASE OF THE SPINE AND THE NERVE NETWORK IN THE NECK, IT SUPPORTS THE BODY\'S NATURAL FILTRATION AND ELIMINATION PROCESSES, REDUCING INFLAMMATION, JOINT PAIN, AND THE FORMATION OF TOPHI.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NIVELES DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE EL C\\u00d3CCIX Y EL PLEXO CERVICAL. ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO QUE CONDUCE A LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE CRISTALES DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO EN LAS ARTICULACIONES, COM\\u00daNMENTE CONOCIDA COMO GOTA. AL EQUILIBRAR EL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA BASE DE LA COLUMNA Y LA RED NERVIOSA DEL CUELLO, APOYA LOS PROCESOS NATURALES DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N, EL DOLOR ARTICULAR Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TOFOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RENAL CHECK: IF URIC ACID LEVELS REMAIN HIGH, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE OPTIMAL RENAL FILTRATION. FOR ACUTE JOINT PAIN IN THE EXTREMITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KNEE \\/ KNEE] OR [METATARSAL \\/ METATARSAL] RESONANCES TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED CRYSTAL DEPOSITS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RENAL: SI LOS NIVELES DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO SIGUEN SIENDO ALTOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL \\u00d3PTIMA. PARA EL DOLOR ARTICULAR AGUDO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS RODILLA \\/ RODILLA O METATARSO \\/ METATARSO PARA ABORDAR LOS DEP\\u00d3SITOS DE CRISTALES LOCALIZADOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/171','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:42:12','2026-04-27 11:42:12'),(3971,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',172,'{\"symptoms\":\"HIP PAIN, PELVIC DISORDERS, SCIATICA PAIN, DIARRHEA, PAIN IN THE GROOVE CLEFT, COLITIS, RECTAL BLEEDING. HEMORROIDS. (DOLOR DE CADERA, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, DOLOR CI\\u00c1TICO, DIARREA, DOLOR EN LA HENDIDURA DEL SURCO, COLITIS, SANGRADO RECTAL. HEMORROIDES.)\",\"paths\":\"PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE. LACTOSE INTOLERANT. (ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA P\\u00c9LVICA. INTOLERANTE A LA LACTOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HIP PAIN, PELVIC DISORDERS, SCIATICA PAIN, DIARRHEA, PAIN IN THE GROOVE CLEFT, COLITIS, RECTAL BLEEDING, AND HEMORRHOIDS.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE CADERA, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, DOLOR CI\\u00c1TICO, DIARREA, DOLOR EN LA HENDIDURA DEL SURCO, COLITIS, SANGRADO RECTAL Y HEMORROIDES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ROTAVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE COCCYX REGION. THIS VIRAL LOAD IS A PRIMARY TRIGGER FOR PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE AND SIGNIFICANT DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, OFTEN RENDERING THE INDIVIDUAL LACTOSE INTOLERANT DURING THE ACTIVE INFECTION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESONANCE REDUCES INFLAMMATION IN THE LOWER GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT AND THE NERVE ROOTS OF THE SACRAL PLEXUS, ALLEVIATING CHRONIC SCIATICA AND RECTAL DISCOMFORT WHILE RESTORING PROPER NUTRIENT ABSORPTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ROTAVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL C\\u00d3CCIX. ESTA CARGA VIRAL ES UN DESENCADENANTE PRIMARIO DE LA ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA P\\u00c9LVICA Y DE UN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SIGNIFICATIVO, QUE A MENUDO VUELVE AL INDIVIDUO INTOLERANTE A LA LACTOSA DURANTE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N ACTIVA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, LA RESONANCIA REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL INFERIOR Y LAS RA\\u00cdCES NERVIOSAS DEL PLEXO SACRO, ALIVIANDO LA CI\\u00c1TICA CR\\u00d3NICA Y EL MALESTAR RECTAL MIENTRAS RESTAURA LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE NUTRIENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR COLITIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT OVERLAPPING BACTERIAL INFECTIONS. FOR SEVERE SCIATIC PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE COCCYX \\/ CERVICAL PLEXUS (REF 171) TO ENSURE METABOLIC FACTORS LIKE URIC ACID ARE NOT CONTRIBUTING TO THE INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI LA DIARREA O LA COLITIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE PARA DESCARTAR INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS SUPERPUESTAS. PARA EL DOLOR CI\\u00c1TICO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE C\\u00d3CCIX \\/ PLEXO CERVICAL (REF 171) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS FACTORES METAB\\u00d3LICOS COMO EL \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO NO EST\\u00c9N CONTRIBUYENDO A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/172','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:43:16','2026-04-27 11:43:16'),(3972,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',173,'{\"symptoms\":\"COLD SORES, INFLAMED GUMS, DRY MUCOUS MEMBRANES, FACIAL PARALYSIS, NEURALGIA, ENCEPHALITIS, HEADACHE, VOMITING, FEVER. (HERPES LABIAL, ENC\\u00cdAS INFLAMADAS, MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS SECAS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, NEURALGIA, ENCEFALITIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, V\\u00d3MITO, FIEBRE)\",\"paths\":\"ORAL ISSUES, BLISTERS, ULCERS, COLD SORES AND INFLAMED GUMS. FRONTAL LOBE INVOLVEMENT WITH BEHAVIOR DISORDERS. (PROBLEMAS ORALES, AMPOLLAS, \\u00daLCERAS, HERPES LABIAL Y ENC\\u00cdAS INFLAMADAS. COMPROMISO DEL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL CON TRASTORNOS DEL COMPORTAMIENTO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH CANDIDA; ESOPHAGITIS HERPERTICA. (ASOCIADO CON C\\u00c1NDIDA; ESOFAGITIS HERP\\u00c9TICA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"COLD SORES, INFLAMED GUMS, DRY MUCOUS MEMBRANES, FACIAL PARALYSIS, NEURALGIA, ENCEPHALITIS, HEADACHE, VOMITING, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(HERPES LABIAL, ENC\\u00cdAS INFLAMADAS, MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS SECAS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, NEURALGIA, ENCEFALITIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, V\\u00d3MITO Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HERPES 4 VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE CORNERS OF THE MOUTH (COMMISSURES). THIS RESET ADDRESSES ORAL PATHOLOGIES SUCH AS BLISTERS, ULCERS, AND CHRONIC GINGIVITIS. BEYOND LOCAL SYMPTOMS, THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING FRONTAL LOBE INVOLVEMENT, WHICH CAN MANIFEST AS BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS OR COGNITIVE IRRITABILITY. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS CLEAR VIRAL LOADS FROM THE FACIAL NERVES AND THE CRANIAL MUCOSA.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL HERPES 4 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS COMISURAS DE LA BOCA. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA PATOLOG\\u00cdAS ORALES COMO AMPOLLAS, \\u00daLCERAS Y GINGIVITIS CR\\u00d3NICA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS LOCALES, ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR LA AFECTACI\\u00d3N DEL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL, QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO TRASTORNOS DEL COMPORTAMIENTO O IRRITABILIDAD COGNITIVA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES DE LOS NERVIOS FACIALES Y LA MUCOSA CRANEAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL CHECK: THIS VIRUS IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH CANDIDA; SCAN THE CLITORIS \\/ ANUS (REF 167) OR [ISCHIUM \\/ ISCHIUM] TO ENSURE SYMBIOTIC LOADS ARE CLEARED. FOR SEVERE THROAT IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE ESOPHAGUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS AXIS TO RULE OUT HERPETIC ESOPHAGITIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA: ESTE VIRUS SE ASOCIA CON FRECUENCIA CON LA C\\u00c1NDIDA; ESCANEAR EL EJE CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ ANO (REF 167) O ISQUI\\u00d3N \\/ ISQUI\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE SE ELIMINEN LAS CARGAS SIMBI\\u00d3TICAS. PARA LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DE GARGANTA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO PARA DESCARTAR ESOFAGITIS HERP\\u00c9TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/173','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:44:28','2026-04-27 11:44:28'),(3973,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',174,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DEPRESSION (DEPRESI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DEPRESSION (DEPRESI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP SADNESS, LACK OF MOTIVATION, FEELINGS OF HOPELESSNESS, LOW VITAL ENERGY, AND EMOTIONAL IMBALANCE.\\n\\n(TRISTEZA PROFUNDA, FALTA DE MOTIVACI\\u00d3N, SENTIMIENTOS DE DESESPERANZA, BAJA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL Y DESEQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF DEPRESSIVE STATES BY BALANCING THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE CROWN (CORONA) AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). THIS RESET ADDRESSES THE Glandular-EMOTIONAL CONNECTION, HELPING TO REGULATE THE MASTER GLAND RESPONSIBLE FOR HORMONAL OUTPUT. BY CLEARING NEGATIVE MEMORIES OR EMBEDDED CODES IN THIS HIGHER RESONANCE PATHWAY, IT PROMOTES THE RESTORATION OF SEROTONIN AND DOPAMINE BALANCE, LIFTING THE EMOTIONAL WEIGHT AND RECONNECTING THE INDIVIDUAL WITH A SENSE OF PURPOSE AND JOY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS ESTADOS DEPRESIVOS MEDIANTE EL EQUILIBRIO DEL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA CORONA Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR-EMOCIONAL, AYUDANDO A REGULAR LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA RESPONSABLE DE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL. AL ELIMINAR MEMORIAS NEGATIVAS O C\\u00d3DIGOS INCRUSTADOS EN ESTA V\\u00cdA DE RESONANCIA SUPERIOR, PROMUEVE LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DEL EQUILIBRIO DE SEROTONINA Y DOPAMINA, ALIVIANDO EL PESO EMOCIONAL Y RECONECTANDO AL INDIVIDUO CON UN SENTIDO DE PROP\\u00d3SITO Y ALEGR\\u00cdA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HORMONE CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL FATIGUE IS ACCOMPANIED BY PHYSICAL SLUGGISHNESS, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE TO ENSURE METABOLIC SUPPORT. FOR ANXIETY-DRIVEN DEPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ CERVICAL PLEXUS (REF 148) TO STABILIZE THE NERVOUS SYSTEM RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL: SI LA FATIGA EMOCIONAL VA ACOMPA\\u00d1ADA DE LENTITUD F\\u00cdSICA, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES PARA ASEGURAR EL APOYO METAB\\u00d3LICO. PARA LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N IMPULSADA POR LA ANSIEDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ PLEXO CERVICAL (REF 148) PARA ESTABILIZAR LA RESPUESTA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/174','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:45:56','2026-04-27 11:45:56'),(3974,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',175,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"VASCULAR CIRCULATION AND OBSTRUCTION OF THE BLOOD FLOW. (CIRCULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR OBSTRUCTION (OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"VASCULAR CIRCULATION ISSUES, OBSTRUCTION OF BLOOD FLOW, AND POTENTIAL CHEST DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE CIRCULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR, OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO Y POSIBLE MALESTAR TOR\\u00c1CICO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE IMPROVEMENT OF SYSTEMIC CIRCULATION BY NEUTRALIZING BIOFIELD DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CORONARY ARTERY AND THE CARDIA (THE UPPER OPENING OF THE STOMACH). THIS RESET ADDRESSES PHYSICAL OR ENERGETIC OBSTRUCTIONS THAT MAY IMPEDE THE SMOOTH FLOW OF BLOOD THROUGH THE VASCULAR SYSTEM. BY BALANCING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS CARDIAC EFFICIENCY AND REDUCES THE PRESSURE CREATED BY VASCULAR BLOCKAGES, PROMOTING BETTER OXYGENATION AND NUTRIENT DELIVERY TO THE TISSUES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA MEJORA DE LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DEL BIOCAMPO ENTRE LA ARTERIA CORONARIA Y EL CARDIA (LA ABERTURA SUPERIOR DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS OBSTRUCCIONES F\\u00cdSICAS O ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE PUEDEN IMPEDIR EL FLUJO FLUIDO DE SANGRE A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA VASCULAR. AL EQUILIBRAR ESTE EJE, APOYA LA EFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y REDUCE LA PRESI\\u00d3N CREADA POR LOS BLOQUEOS VASCULARES, PROMOVIENDO UNA MEJOR OXIGENACI\\u00d3N Y ENTREGA DE NUTRIENTES A LOS TEJIDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIAC CHECK: IF CIRCULATORY DISTRESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE ATRIOVENTRICULAR NODE \\/ KIDNEY - L (REF 61) TO RULE OUT VIRAL LOADS AFFECTING HEART RHYTHM. FOR DIGESTIVE PRESSURE MIMICKING HEART PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] AXIS TO ENSURE HIATAL HERNIA OR ACID REFLUX IS NOT EXACERBATING THE VASCULAR SENSATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA: SI EL MALESTAR CIRCULATORIO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE NODO AURICULOVENTRICULAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - I (REF 61) PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS VIRALES QUE AFECTEN EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO. PARA LA PRESI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA QUE IMITA EL DOLOR CARD\\u00cdACO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO PARA ASEGURAR QUE UNA HERNIA DE HIATO O EL REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO NO EST\\u00c9N EXACERBANDO LA SENSACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/175','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:47:09','2026-04-27 11:47:09'),(3975,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',176,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEART DISEASE, ARRHYTHMIAS, CORONARY DISEASE, RHEUMATIC FEVER, SCARLET FEVER, ACUTE TONSILLITIS, IMPETIGO, MENINGITIS, NEPHRITIS, OTITIS, PNEUMONIA, EMBOLISM, THROMBOSIS, ANEURYSMS, HYPERTENSION, DYSPNEA, FATIGUE, IMPETIGO EAR - NOSE - THROAT INFECTIONS. (ENFERMEDAD CARD\\u00cdACA, ARRITMIAS, ENFERMEDAD CORONARIA, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, ESCARLATINA, AMIGDALITIS AGUDA, IMP\\u00c9TIGO, MENINGITIS, NEFRITIS, OTITIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, EMBOLIA, TROMBOSIS, ANEURISMAS, HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, DISNEA, FATIGA, IMP\\u00c9TIGO, INFECCIONES DE O\\u00cdDO - NARIZ - GARGANTA.)\",\"paths\":\"MAIN CAUSE OF HEART PROBLEMS, PULMONARY AND CORONARY. (CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE PROBLEMAS CARD\\u00cdACOS, PULMONARES Y CORONARIOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH STREPTOCOCCUS A IS COMBINED WITH G; TRUE PSORIASIS.                              CHECK - TEMPLE                CHECK - CAROTID             CHECK - PERICARDIUM CHECK - BRACHIAL -STREPTOCOCCUS ALFA. (ASOCIADO CON ESTREPTOCOCO A SE COMBINA CON G; PSORIASIS VERDADERA. VERIFICAR - TEMPLO. VERIFICAR - CAR\\u00d3TIDA. VERIFICAR - PERICARDIO. VERIFICAR - BRAQUIAL (ESTREPTOCOCO ALFA).\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEART DISEASE, ARRHYTHMIAS, CORONARY DISEASE, RHEUMATIC FEVER, SCARLET FEVER, ACUTE TONSILLITIS, IMPETIGO, MENINGITIS, NEPHRITIS, OTITIS, PNEUMONIA, EMBOLISM, THROMBOSIS, ANEURYSMS, HYPERTENSION, DYSPNEA, FATIGUE, AND EAR-NOSE-THROAT INFECTIONS.(ENFERMEDAD CARD\\u00cdACA, ARRITMIAS, ENFERMEDAD CORONARIA, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, ESCARLATINA, AMIGDALITIS AGUDA, IMP\\u00c9TIGO, MENINGITIS, NEFRITIS, OTITIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, EMBOLIA, TROMBOSIS, ANEURISMAS, HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, DISNEA, FATIGA E INFECCIONES DE O\\u00cdDO, NARIZ Y GARGANTA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS PYOGENES BETA HA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CORONARY ARTERY AND THE LEFT LUNG. THIS BACTERIUM IS A PRIMARY CAUSE OF SEVERE CARDIOVASCULAR AND PULMONARY COMPLICATIONS, OFTEN TRIGGERING RHEUMATIC FEVER THAT CAN DAMAGE HEART VALVES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESONANCE HELPS PREVENT VASCULAR OBSTRUCTIONS LIKE THROMBOSIS OR EMBOLISMS AND REDUCES THE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT LEADS TO CHRONIC FATIGUE AND HYPERTENSION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO PYOGENES BETA HA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA ARTERIA CORONARIA Y EL PULM\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ESTA BACTERIA ES UNA CAUSA PRIMARIA DE COMPLICACIONES CARDIOVASCULARES Y PULMONARES GRAVES, QUE A MENUDO DESENCADENA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA QUE PUEDE DA\\u00d1AR LAS V\\u00c1LVULAS CARD\\u00cdACAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, LA RESONANCIA AYUDA A PREVENIR OBSTRUCCIONES VASCULARES COMO TROMBOSIS O EMBOLIAS Y REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE CONDUCE A LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA Y LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COMPLEX BACTERIAL CHECK: OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH STREPTOCOCCUS G; MAY PRESENT AS \\\"TRUE PSORIASIS\\\" WHEN COMBINED. MANDATORY TO CHECK THE FOLLOWING POINTS: TEMPLE, CAROTID, PERICARDIUM, AND BRACHIAL (TO RULE OUT STREPTOCOCCUS ALFA).\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA COMPLEJA: A MENUDO ASOCIADO CON EL ESTREPTOCOCO G; PUEDE PRESENTARSE COMO \\\"PSORIASIS VERDADERA\\\" CUANDO SE COMBINAN. ES OBLIGATORIO REVISAR LOS SIGUIENTES PUNTOS: SIEN, CAR\\u00d3TIDA, PERICARDIO Y BRAQUIAL (PARA DESCARTAR EL ESTREPTOCOCO ALFA).)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/176','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:48:16','2026-04-27 11:48:16'),(3976,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',177,'{\"symptoms\":\"ARRHYTHMIAS, PERICARDITIS, CARDIOMEGALY, BIPOLAR, DEPRESSION, FEAR, ANXIETY, FIBRIN CLOTS, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, THROAT DISORDERS. (ARRITMIAS, PERICARDITIS, CARDIOMEGALIA, BIPOLARIDAD, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, MIEDO, ANSIEDAD, CO\\u00c1GULOS DE FIBRINA, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, TRASTORNOS DE LA GARGANTA)\",\"paths\":\"IT FIRST MANIFEST IN THE THROAT. (PRIMERO SE MANIFIESTA EN LA GARGANTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - KNEE CAP\\/KNEECAP CHECK - PERICARDIUM\\/PERICARDIUM                  CHECK - APPENDIX\\/PLEURA CHECK - CERVICAL 5\\/CERVICAL 5 (BIPOLAR) (VERIFICAR - R\\u00d3TULA\\/R\\u00d3TULA. VERIFICAR - PERICARDIO\\/PERICARDIO. VERIFICAR - AP\\u00c9NDICE\\/PLEURA. VERIFICAR - CERVICAL 5\\/CERVICAL 5 (BIPOLAR).)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ARRHYTHMIAS, PERICARDITIS, CARDIOMEGALY, BIPOLAR DISORDER, DEPRESSION, FEAR, ANXIETY, FIBRIN CLOTS, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, AND THROAT DISORDERS.\\n\\n(ARRITMIAS, PERICARDITIS, CARDIOMEGALIA, TRASTORNO BIPOLAR, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, MIEDO, ANSIEDAD, CO\\u00c1GULOS DE FIBRINA, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE Y TRASTORNOS DE LA GARGANTA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAG+ BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CORONARY ARTERY AND THE PECTORAL TENDON. THIS PATHOGEN IS PARTICULARLY AGGRESSIVE AS IT OFTEN MANIFESTS FIRST IN THE THROAT BEFORE SPREADING SYSTEMICALLY. IT IS ASSOCIATED WITH SIGNIFICANT CARDIAC INFLAMMATION (PERICARDITIS) AND THE FORMATION OF FIBRIN CLOTS. BEYOND PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS, THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES NEUROLOGICAL AND EMOTIONAL DISTORTIONS, INCLUDING EXTREME FEAR AND ANXIETY, WHICH MAY BE LINKED TO THE BACTERIA\'S IMPACT ON THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTAFILOCOCO AUREUS COAG+ MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA ARTERIA CORONARIA Y EL TEND\\u00d3N PECTORAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES PARTICULARMENTE AGRESIVO, YA QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA PRIMERO EN LA GARGANTA ANTES DE PROPAGARSE SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE. SE ASOCIA CON UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA SIGNIFICATIVA (PERICARDITIS) Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE CO\\u00c1GULOS DE FIBRINA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS, ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA DISTORSIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS Y EMOCIONALES, INCLUYENDO MIEDO EXTREMO Y ANSIEDAD, QUE PUEDEN ESTAR VINCULADOS AL IMPACTO DE LA BACTERIA EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF BIPOLAR SYMPTOMS OR DEEP DEPRESSION PERSIST, SCAN THE CERVICAL 5 \\/ CERVICAL 5 AXIS. FOR PERSISTENT CARDIAC IRREGULARITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] RESONANCE. IT IS ALSO MANDATORY TO CHECK THE KNEE CAP \\/ KNEE CAP AND APPENDIX \\/ PLEURA AXES TO ENSURE THE BACTERIAL LOAD IS FULLY NEUTRALIZED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y EMOCIONAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE BIPOLARIDAD O DEPRESI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA, ESCANEAR EL EJE CERVICAL 5 \\/ CERVICAL 5. PARA IRREGULARIDADES CARD\\u00cdACAS PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO. TAMBI\\u00c9N ES OBLIGATORIO REVISAR LOS EJES R\\u00d3TULA \\/ R\\u00d3TULA Y AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ PLEURA PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA CARGA BACTERIANA EST\\u00c9 TOTALMENTE NEUTRALIZADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/177','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:49:25','2026-04-27 11:49:25'),(3977,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',178,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, HEADACHE, KNEE PAIN (DEPRESI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE RODILLA)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTERHEMISPHERIC INTEGRATION (INTEGRACI\\u00d3N INTERHEMISF\\u00c9RICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, HEADACHE, KNEE PAIN, DIZZINESS, AND LACK OF COORDINATION.\\n\\n(DEPRESI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE RODILLA, MAREOS Y FALTA DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SYNCHRONIZATION BETWEEN THE CORPUS CALLOSUM\\u2014THE PRIMARY COMMUNICATION BRIDGE BETWEEN THE BRAIN HEMISPHERES\\u2014AND THE CEREBELLUM, WHICH REGULATES MOTOR CONTROL AND BALANCE. THIS RESET ADDRESSES ENERGETIC DISCONNECTS THAT MANIFEST AS DEPRESSIVE STATES OR PERSISTENT CEPHALALGIA (HEADACHES). BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT IMPROVES THE COMMUNICATION BETWEEN COGNITIVE INTENT AND PHYSICAL EXECUTION, OFTEN ALLEVIATING REFERRED PAIN IN THE KNEES AND RESTORING OVERALL EQUILIBRIUM TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA SINCRONIZACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CUERPO CALLOSO \\u2014EL PUENTE DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N PRIMARIO ENTRE LOS HEMISFERIOS CEREBRALES\\u2014 Y EL CEREBELO, QUE REGULA EL CONTROL MOTOR Y EL EQUILIBRIO. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS DESCONEXIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO ESTADOS DEPRESIVOS O CEFALALGIA PERSISTENTE (DOLORES DE CABEZA). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, MEJORA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA INTENCI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA Y LA EJECUCI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA, ALIVIANDO A MENUDO EL DOLOR REFERIDO EN LAS RODILLAS Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO GENERAL DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF KNEE PAIN PERSISTS WITHOUT MOTOR IMBALANCE, SCAN THE [KNEE \\/ KNEE] AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED PATHOGENS. FOR DEEP EMOTIONAL DISTRESS OR PERSISTENT DEPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CORONA \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (REF 174) TO ENSURE THE GLANDULAR MASTER SYSTEM IS BALANCED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL DOLOR DE RODILLA PERSISTE SIN DESEQUILIBRIO MOTOR, ESCANEAR EL EJE RODILLA \\/ RODILLA PARA DESCARTAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS LOCALIZADOS. PARA UN MALESTAR EMOCIONAL PROFUNDO O DEPRESI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CORONA \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS (REF 174) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA MAESTRO GLANDULAR EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/178','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:50:33','2026-04-27 11:50:33'),(3978,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',179,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT CAN TRIGGER RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CHRONIC COUGH, FATIGUE, AND SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS IF THE PATHOGEN ACTIVATES AND MIGRATES.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE DESENCADENAR DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, FATIGA Y DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA SI EL PAT\\u00d3GENO SE ACTIVA Y MIGRA.)\",\"paths\":\"ACTS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR FOR MICROBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS WITHIN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM\\u2019S COMMUNICATION BRIDGE. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH DISTORTIONS IN THE CORPUS CALLOSUM USING A VERTICAL POLARITY ALIGNMENT, THIS RESET PREVENTS THE BACTERIA FROM HIDING IN THE CRANIAL TISSUES. CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR IS ESSENTIAL TO ENSURE THAT ACTIVE INFECTIONS IN THE LUNGS OR OTHER ORGANS DO NOT RECUR, AS IT ELIMINATES THE HIDDEN ENERGETIC \\\"NEST\\\" WHERE THE PATHOGEN PERSISTS IN A DORMANT STATE.\\n\\n(ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA LA MICROBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS DENTRO DEL PUENTE DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL CUERPO CALLOSO MEDIANTE UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N DE POLARIDAD VERTICAL, ESTE REINICIO EVITA QUE LA BACTERIA SE ESCONDA EN LOS TEJIDOS CRANEALES. LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO ES ESENCIAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS INFECCIONES ACTIVAS EN LOS PULMONES U OTROS \\u00d3RGANOS NO RECURRAN, YA QUE ELIMINA EL \\\"NIDO\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICO OCULTO DONDE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PERSISTE EN ESTADO LATENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF TUBERCULOSIS SYMPTOMS ARE ACTIVE (COUGH, NIGHT SWEATS), SCAN THE [SUPRARENAL \\/ LUNG] OR [POPLITEAL \\/ POPLITEAL] AXES TO LOCATE THE ACTIVE BACTERIAL RESONANCE. FOR PERSISTENT NEUROLOGICAL FOG, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CORPUS CALLOSUM \\/ CEREBELLUM (REF 178) TO ENSURE PROPER INTERHEMISPHERIC COMMUNICATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE TUBERCULOSIS EST\\u00c1N ACTIVOS (TOS, SUDORES NOCTURNOS), ESCANEAR LOS EJES SUPRARRENAL \\/ PULM\\u00d3N O POPL\\u00cdTEO \\/ POPL\\u00cdTEO PARA LOCALIZAR LA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA ACTIVA. PARA LA NIEBLA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CUERPO CALLOSO \\/ CEREBELO (REF 178) PARA ASEGURAR UNA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N INTERHEMISF\\u00c9RICA ADECUADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/179','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:51:43','2026-04-27 11:51:43'),(3979,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',180,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ADDICTIONS (ADICCIONES)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-PSYCHOLOGICAL INTEGRATION (INTEGRACI\\u00d3N NEUROPSICOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ADDICTIONS, COMPULSIVE BEHAVIORS, EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, AND COGNITIVE DISSONANCE.\\n\\n(ADICCIONES, COMPORTAMIENTOS COMPULSIVOS, INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y DISONANCIA COGNITIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF ADDICTIVE PATTERNS BY STABILIZING THE HORIZONTAL BIOFIELD ALONG THE CORPUS CALLOSUM. THIS RESET FOCUSES ON REBALANCING THE TRANSVERSE COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE BRAIN\'S HEMISPHERES, HELPING TO BREAK THE ENERGETIC LOOPS ASSOCIATED WITH COMPULSIVE REPETITION AND DEPENDENCY. BY ALIGNING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE FRONTAL LOBE IN REGAINING CONTROL OVER IMPULSIVE RESPONSES, PROMOTING MENTAL CLARITY, SELF-REGULATION, AND THE DISSOLUTION OF EMBEDDED CODES THAT FUEL ADDICTIVE TENDENCIES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE PATRONES ADICTIVOS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL BIOCAMPO HORIZONTAL A LO LARGO DEL CUERPO CALLOSO. ESTE REINICIO SE CENTRA EN REEQUILIBRAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N TRANSVERSAL ENTRE LOS HEMISFERIOS CEREBRALES, AYUDANDO A ROMPER LOS BUCLES ENERG\\u00c9TICOS ASOCIADOS CON LA REPETICI\\u00d3N COMPULSIVA Y LA DEPENDENCIA. AL ALINEAR ESTE EJE, APOYA AL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL A RECUPERAR EL CONTROL SOBRE LAS RESPUESTAS IMPULSIVAS, PROMOVIENDO LA CLARIDAD MENTAL, LA AUTORREGULACI\\u00d3N Y LA DISOLUCI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00d3DIGOS INCRUSTADOS QUE ALIMENTAN LAS TENDENCIAS ADICTIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF ADDICTIONS ARE COUPLED WITH AGGRESSION, SCAN THE CIRCLE OF WILLIS \\/ CIRCLE OF WILLIS (REF 164). FOR EMOTIONAL VOIDS OR DEEP SADNESS DRIVING THE ADDICTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CORONA \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (REF 174) TO ENSURE THE GLANDULAR REWARD SYSTEM IS BALANCED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL: SI LAS ADICCIONES EST\\u00c1N ACOMPA\\u00d1ADAS DE AGRESI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS \\/ C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS (REF 164). PARA VAC\\u00cdOS EMOCIONALES O TRISTEZA PROFUNDA QUE IMPULSAN LA ADICCI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CORONA \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS (REF 174) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA GLANDULAR DE RECOMPENSA EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/180','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 11:52:58','2026-04-27 11:52:58'),(3980,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',181,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PRIAPISM, UTERINE ABCESS, CYSTITIS, SPERMATORRHOEA, IMPOTENCE. (PRIAPISMO, ABSCESO UTERINO, CISTITIS, ESPERMATORREA, IMPOTENCIA)\",\"paths\":\"DISORDERS IN THE PENIS AND TESTICLES. UROLOGY DISORDERS, UTERINE ABSCESS. (TRASTORNOS EN EL PENE Y LOS TEST\\u00cdCULOS. TRASTORNOS UROL\\u00d3GICOS, ABSCESO UTERINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"UROLOGICAL DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N UROL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"PRIAPISM, UTERINE ABSCESS, CYSTITIS, SPERMATORRHOEA, AND IMPOTENCE.\\n\\n(PRIAPISMO, ABSCESO UTERINO, CISTITIS, ESPERMATORREA E IMPOTENCIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF DYSFUNCTIONS IN THE ERECTILE TISSUE OF THE CORPUS CAVERNOSUM BY BALANCING THE BIOFIELD IN THE PELVIC REGION. THIS RESET ADDRESSES UROLOGICAL DISORDERS IN BOTH MALE AND FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEMS, INCLUDING ERECTION ISSUES (PRIAPISM OR IMPOTENCE) AND UTERINE COMPLICATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT PROMOTES THE RECOVERY OF LOCAL GLANDULAR AND VASCULAR FUNCTION, HELPING TO DISSOLVE INFLAMMATORY PROCESSES SUCH AS ABSCESSES OR CHRONIC CYSTITIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISFUNCIONES EN EL TEJIDO ER\\u00c9CTIL DEL CUERPO CAVERNOSO MEDIANTE EL EQUILIBRIO DEL BIOCAMPO EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. ESTE REINICIO ABORDA TRASTORNOS UROL\\u00d3GICOS TANTO EN EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR MASCULINO COMO EN EL FEMENINO, INCLUYENDO PROBLEMAS DE ERECCI\\u00d3N (PRIAPISMO O IMPOTENCIA) Y COMPLICACIONES EN EL \\u00daTERO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, SE PROMUEVE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y VASCULAR LOCAL, AYUDANDO A DISOLVER PROCESOS INFLAMATORIOS COMO ABSCESOS O CISTITIS CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BACTERIAL CHECK: IF CYSTITIS SYMPTOMS OR VAGINAL DISCHARGE PERSIST, SCAN THE CLITORIS \\/ SACRUM (REF 170) TO RULE OUT SPIROCHAETE LOADS. FOR IMPOTENCE ISSUES LINKED TO STRESS OR EMOTIONAL FACTORS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CORPUS CALLOSUM \\/ CORPUS CALLOSUM (HORIZONTAL) (REF 180) TO ENSURE PROPER NEURO-PSYCHOLOGICAL INTEGRATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE CISTITIS O FLUJO VAGINAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ SACRO (REF 170) PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS DE ESPIROQUETAS. PARA PROBLEMAS DE IMPOTENCIA VINCULADOS A ESTR\\u00c9S O FACTORES EMOCIONALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CUERPO CALLOSO \\/ CUERPO CALLOSO (HORIZONTAL) (REF 180) PARA ASEGURAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N NEUROPSICOL\\u00d3GICA ADECUADA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/181','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:02:10','2026-04-27 12:02:10'),(3981,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',182,'{\"origins\":\"BORRELIOSIS\",\"symptoms\":\"LIVER, KIDNEY, DIGESTIVE FAILURE. LYMES DISEASE, CHRONIC FATIGUE, HEADACHE , JOINT PAIN, FIBROMYALGIA, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, HEPATITIS F, DYSPHASIA, ELEPHANTITIS. (H\\u00cdGADO, RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N, FALLA DIGESTIVA. ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR ARTICULAR, FIBROMIALGIA, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, HEPATITIS F, DISFASIA, ELEFANTIASIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY TICKS, LICE, FLEAS, BUGS AND INSECTS. VERY AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA. CAUSES AUTO IMMUNE DISEASE. (TRANSMITIDO POR GARRAPATAS, PIOJOS, PULGAS, CHINCHES E INSECTOS. BACTERIA MUY AGRESIVA. CAUSA ENFERMEDAD AUTOINMUNE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BORRELIOSIS (BORRELIA BURGDORFERI)\",\"symptoms\":\"LYME DISEASE, CHRONIC FATIGUE, HEADACHE, JOINT PAIN, FIBROMYALGIA, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, HEPATITIS F, LIVER AND KIDNEY FAILURE, DIGESTIVE FAILURE, DYSPHASIA, AND ELEPHANTIASIS.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR ARTICULAR, FIBROMIALGIA, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, HEPATITIS F, FALLA HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RENAL, FALLA DIGESTIVA, DISFASIA Y ELEFANTIASIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS BORRELIA BURGDORFERI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE COSTAL MARGIN AND THE LIVER. THIS BACTERIA IS EXTREMELY AGGRESSIVE AND IS PRIMARILY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE BITES OF TICKS, LICE, FLEAS, AND OTHER INSECTS. THIS RESET IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING AUTOIMMUNE MANIFESTATIONS WHERE THE PATHOGEN TRIGGERS SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AFFECTING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, JOINTS, AND VITAL ORGANS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS THE BODY ELIMINATE THE BACTERIAL LOAD THAT OFTEN MIMICS OTHER CHRONIC DEGENERATIVE DISEASES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BORRELIA BURGDORFERI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL MARGEN COSTAL Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. ESTA BACTERIA ES EXTREMADAMENTE AGRESIVA Y SE TRANSMITE PRINCIPALMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE PICADURAS DE GARRAPATAS, PIOJOS, PULGAS Y OTROS INSECTOS. ESTE REINICIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LAS MANIFESTACIONES AUTOINMUNES DONDE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO DESENCADENA UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, AFECTANDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, LAS ARTICULACIONES Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA QUE A MENUDO IMITA OTRAS ENFERMEDADES CR\\u00d3NICAS DEGENERATIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN OR NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE DETOXIFICATION PATHWAYS ARE OPEN. FOR CHRONIC FATIGUE ASSOCIATED WITH LIVER DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] OR [PLEURA (R) \\/ LIVER] (REF 629) RESONANCES TO RULE OUT VIRAL CO-INFECTIONS LIKE HEPATITIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI PERSISTEN EL DOLOR ARTICULAR O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS V\\u00cdAS DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9N ABIERTAS. PARA LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA ASOCIADA CON MALESTAR HEP\\u00c1TICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO O PLEURA (D) \\/ H\\u00cdGADO (REF 629) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES VIRALES COMO LA HEPATITIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/182','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:03:37','2026-04-27 12:03:37'),(3982,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',183,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"VIRUS\",\"origins\":\"HEPATITIS K\",\"symptoms\":\"LIVER INFLAMMATION, DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, FATIGUE, AND METABOLIC DISTURBANCES.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO, MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, FATIGA Y DISTURBIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF THE HEPATITIS K VIRUS BY STABILIZING THE PH ALONG THE COSTAL-HEPATIC MARGIN. THIS RESET FOCUSES ON THE ANATOMICAL JUNCTION WHERE THE RIBS OVERLAP THE LIVER, ADDRESSING LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION AND SUPPORTING THE RECOVERY OF HEPATIC TISSUES. BY CLEARING THIS VIRAL LOAD, THE RESONANCE IMPROVES LIVER FUNCTION, ENHANCES THE DETOXIFICATION PROCESS, AND ALLEVIATES THE SYSTEMIC FATIGUE OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC VIRAL HEPATITIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL VIRUS DE LA HEPATITIS K MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL PH A LO LARGO DEL MARGEN COSTAL-HEP\\u00c1TICO. ESTE REINICIO SE CENTRA EN LA UNI\\u00d3N ANAT\\u00d3MICA DONDE LAS COSTILLAS SE SUPERPONEN AL H\\u00cdGADO, ABORDANDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA Y APOYANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. AL ELIMINAR ESTA CARGA VIRAL, LA RESONANCIA MEJORA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA, POTENCIA EL PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y ALIVIA LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA A MENUDO ASOCIADA CON LA HEPATITIS VIRAL CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC CHECK: IF LIVER DISCOMFORT PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] OR [PLEURA (R) \\/ LIVER] (REF 629) AXES TO RULE OUT OTHER VIRAL STRAINS. FOR DIGESTIVE ISSUES LINKED TO BILE PRODUCTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE BILE DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (R) TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE BILIARY SYSTEM IS BALANCED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA: SI PERSISTE EL MALESTAR HEP\\u00c1TICO, ESCANEAR LOS EJES H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO O PLEURA (D) \\/ H\\u00cdGADO (REF 629) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CEPAS VIRALES. PARA PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS VINCULADOS A LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE BILIS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL CONDUCTO BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODO EL SISTEMA BILIAR EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/183','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:04:59','2026-04-27 12:04:59'),(3983,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',184,'{\"symptoms\":\"PLEURISY, SEPSIS, BRONCHITIS, PNEUMONIA. (PLEURES\\u00cdA, SEPSIS, BRONQUITIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"SPREAD BY THE FECES OF BATS, BIRDS ECT. AFFECTS THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, IN WAYS SUCH AS PULMONARY & BRONCHIAL INFECTIONS. (SE PROPAGA POR LAS HECES DE MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS, AVES, ETC. AFECTA EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO, EN FORMAS COMO INFECCIONES PULMONARES Y BRONQUIALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RENAL CAPSULE CHECK - MEDIASTINUM CHECK - SACRUM           CHECK - FIBULA. (VERIFICAR - C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL. VERIFICAR - MEDIASTINO. VERIFICAR - SACRO. VERIFICAR - F\\u00cdBULA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"PLEURISY, SEPSIS, BRONCHITIS, AND PNEUMONIA.\\n\\n(PLEURES\\u00cdA, SEPSIS, BRONQUITIS Y NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE PROTEUS MIRABILIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE COSTAL (RIB) REGION. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN SPREAD THROUGH THE FECES OF BATS, BIRDS, AND OTHER ANIMALS. IT PRIMARILY IMPACTS THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, CAUSING SIGNIFICANT INFLAMMATION IN THE LUNGS AND BRONCHIAL PASSAGES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESONANCE HELPS THE BODY CLEAR PULMONARY INFECTIONS AND PREVENTS THE SPREAD OF BACTERIA INTO THE BLOODSTREAM, WHICH CAN LEAD TO SYSTEMIC SEPSIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA PROTEUS MIRABILIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N COSTAL (COSTILLAS). ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO A MENUDO SE PROPAGA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS HECES DE MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS, AVES Y OTROS ANIMALES. AFECTA PRINCIPALMENTE AL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO, CAUSANDO UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA EN LOS PULMONES Y LAS V\\u00cdAS BRONQUIALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, LA RESONANCIA AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LAS INFECCIONES PULMONARES Y PREVIENE LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE BACTERIAS AL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO, LO QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR SEPSIS SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY DISTRESS PERSISTS, PERFORM A RENAL CAPSULE CHECK TO ENSURE THE BACTERIA IS NOT HARBORING IN THE EXCRETORY SYSTEM. IT IS ALSO RECOMMENDED TO SCAN THE MEDIASTINUM, SACRUM, AND FIBULA AXES TO FULLY NEUTRALIZE PROTEUS MIRABILIS RESONANCES THROUGHOUT THE BODY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI PERSISTE LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA, REALIZAR UNA VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LA C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA BACTERIA NO SE EST\\u00c9 ALBERGANDO EN EL SISTEMA EXCRETOR. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE RECOMIENDA ESCANEAR LOS EJES DEL MEDIASTINO, EL SACRO Y LA F\\u00cdBULA PARA NEUTRALIZAR COMPLETAMENTE LAS RESONANCIAS DE PROTEUS MIRABILIS EN TODO EL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/184','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:06:00','2026-04-27 12:06:00'),(3984,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',185,'{\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE PERICARDIA CAVITY, OXYGEN INSUFFICIENCY, FALSE DIABETES. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA CAVIDAD PERIC\\u00c1RDICA, INSUFICIENCIA DE OX\\u00cdGENO, DIABETES FALSA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY FECES OF INSECTS, AND BLOOD. (TRANSMITIDO POR HECES DE INSECTOS Y POR LA SANGRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE PERICARDIAL CAVITY, OXYGEN INSUFFICIENCY, \\\"FALSE DIABETES,\\\" HEART FAILURE, AND DIGESTIVE ISSUES.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA CAVIDAD PERIC\\u00c1RDICA, INSUFICIENCIA DE OX\\u00cdGENO, \\\"DIABETES FALSA\\\", INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRYPANOSOMA CRUZI PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE COSTODIAPHRAGMATIC JUNCTION. THIS PATHOGEN, OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE FECES OF INSECTS (SUCH AS THE KISSING BUG) OR BLOOD TRANSFUSIONS, HAS A PARTICULAR AFFINITY FOR THE MUSCLE TISSUES OF THE HEART AND THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. BY BALANCING THIS AXIS, THE RESONANCE REDUCES INFLAMMATION IN THE PERICARDIAL SAC AND IMPROVES OXYGEN EXCHANGE EFFICIENCY. IT IS ALSO INSTRUMENTAL IN RESOLVING \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" SYMPTOMS WHERE PARASITIC INTERFERENCE MIMICS GLUCOSE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO TRYPANOSOMA CRUZI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA UNI\\u00d3N COSTODIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS HECES DE INSECTOS (COMO LA CHINCHE BESUCONA) O TRANSFUSIONES DE SANGRE, TIENE UNA AFINIDAD PARTICULAR POR LOS TEJIDOS MUSCULARES DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. AL EQUILIBRAR ESTE EJE, LA RESONANCIA REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SACO PERIC\\u00c1RDICO Y MEJORA LA EFICIENCIA DEL INTERCAMBIO DE OX\\u00cdGENO. TAMBI\\u00c9N ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA RESOLVER LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE \\\"DIABETES FALSA\\\" DONDE LA INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA IMITA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE GLUCOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIAC CHECK: IF HEART RHYTHM ISSUES OR CHEST PRESSURE PERSIST, SCAN THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT OVERLAPPING BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR METABOLIC DISTURBANCES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE BILE DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (R) TO ENSURE THE PANCREATIC AND BILIARY SYSTEMS ARE NOT UNDER SECONDARY STRESS FROM THE PARASITE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA: SI PERSISTEN LOS PROBLEMAS DE RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO O LA PRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, ESCANEAR EL EJE PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS SUPERPUESTAS. PARA DISTURBIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL CONDUCTO BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS SISTEMAS PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y BILIAR NO EST\\u00c9N BAJO ESTR\\u00c9S SECUNDARIO POR EL PAR\\u00c1SITO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/185','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:07:02','2026-04-27 12:07:02'),(3985,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',186,'{\"symptoms\":\"DEGENERATIVE HIP AND FEMORAL HEAD, PHLEBITIS OF LOWER LIMBS, LEG SWELLING, VARICOSE VEINS, VASCULAR AND LYMPH DISORDERS, VAGINAL INFECTIONS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, PHLEGM, GAS, DIARRHEA, BLOATING. (CADERA DEGENERATIVA Y CABEZA FEMORAL, FLEBITIS DE MIEMBROS INFERIORES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N DE PIERNAS, V\\u00c1RICES, TRASTORNOS VASCULARES Y LINF\\u00c1TICOS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, FLEMA, GASES, DIARREA, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"SPREADS THROUGH BODY FLUIDS. VASCULAR AND LYMPH SYSTEM DRAINAGE AND OBSTRUCTION. (SE PROPAGA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS FLUIDOS CORPORALES. DRENAJE Y OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA VASCULAR Y LINF\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH ANUS; HEMORRHOIDS                CHECK - CECUM\\/KIDNEY (R) CHECK - ILEOCECAL VALVE\\/KIDNEY (R) IF ASSOCIATED WITH ONE OR MORE OF THE PAIRS ABOVE; CERVICAL UTERINE CANCER. CAN ALSO CONTRIBUTE TO BLADDER AND RECTUM CANCER. (ASOCIADO CON EL ANO; HEMORROIDES. VERIFICAR - CIEGO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D). VERIFICAR - V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D). SI EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO CON UNO O M\\u00c1S DE LOS PARES ANTERIORES; C\\u00c1NCER CERVICOUTERINO. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CONTRIBUIR AL C\\u00c1NCER DE VEJIGA Y RECTO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DEGENERATIVE HIP AND FEMORAL HEAD, PHLEBITIS OF LOWER LIMBS, LEG SWELLING, VARICOSE VEINS, VASCULAR AND LYMPH DISORDERS, VAGINAL INFECTIONS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, PHLEGM, GAS, DIARRHEA, AND BLOATING.(CADERA DEGENERATIVA Y CABEZA FEMORAL, FLEBITIS DE MIEMBROS INFERIORES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N DE PIERNAS, V\\u00c1RICES, TRASTORNOS VASCULARES Y LINF\\u00c1TICOS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, FLEMA, GASES, DIARREA E HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS BORDETELLA PERTUSSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE COUNTERCECUM REGION THROUGH VERTICAL POLARITY. THIS BACTERIA SPREADS THROUGH BODY FLUIDS AND SIGNIFICANTLY IMPACTS THE VASCULAR AND LYMPHATIC SYSTEMS, OFTEN LEADING TO DRAINAGE OBSTRUCTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESONANCE ALLEVIATES CIRCULATORY ISSUES IN THE LOWER LIMBS AND SUPPORTS THE INTEGRITY OF THE HIP JOINT, PREVENTING FURTHER DEGENERATION CAUSED BY CHRONIC PATHOGENIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BORDETELLA PERTUSSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CONTRACECO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA POLARIDAD VERTICAL. ESTA BACTERIA SE PROPAGA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS FLUIDOS CORPORALES E IMPACTA SIGNIFICATIVAMENTE LOS SISTEMAS VASCULAR Y LINF\\u00c1TICO, LO QUE A MENUDO PROVOCA OBSTRUCCIONES EN EL DRENAJE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, LA RESONANCIA ALIVIA LOS PROBLEMAS CIRCULATORIOS EN LOS MIEMBROS INFERIORES Y APOYA LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N DE LA CADERA, PREVINIENDO UNA MAYOR DEGENERACI\\u00d3N CAUSADA POR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR & RECTAL CHECK: ASSOCIATED WITH THE ANUS AND HEMORRHOIDS. SCAN THE CECUM \\/ KIDNEY (R) OR ILEOCECAL VALVE \\/ KIDNEY (R) AXES; IF ASSOCIATED WITH ONE OR MORE OF THESE PAIRS, IT MAY LINK TO CERVICAL UTERINE CANCER OR CONTRIBUTE TO BLADDER AND RECTUM ISSUES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y RECTAL: ASOCIADO CON EL ANO Y LAS HEMORROIDES. ESCANEAR LOS EJES CIEGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) O V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D); SI EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO CON UNO O M\\u00c1S DE ESTOS PARES, PUEDE VINCULARSE AL C\\u00c1NCER CERVICOUTERINO O CONTRIBUIR A PROBLEMAS DE VEJIGA Y RECTO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/186','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:08:06','2026-04-27 12:08:06'),(3986,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',187,'{\"symptoms\":\"NOSE - POLYPS, BLEEDING, LARYNGITIS, OTITIS, STYES, POOR VISION, CONJUNCTIVITIS, PHOTOPHOBIA, AMENORRHEA. (NARIZ - P\\u00d3LIPOS, SANGRADO, LARINGITIS, OTITIS, ORZUELOS, MALA VISI\\u00d3N, CONJUNTIVITIS, FOTOFOBIA, AMENORREA)\",\"paths\":\"USUALLY TRANSMITTED THRU CATTLE, WOOL OR RAW COTTON. DISORDERS OF THE EAR, NOSE AND THROAT. (GENERALMENTE TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL GANADO, LA LANA O EL ALGOD\\u00d3N CRUDO. TRASTORNOS DEL O\\u00cdDO, NARIZ Y GARGANTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER PATHOGENS; PITUITARY ADENOMA               ASSOCIATED WITH A VIRUS; PITUITARY CYST, POLYP, PITUITARY ABSCESS.  ASSOCIATED WITH BACTERIA, PITUITARY TUMOR. (ASOCIADO CON OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS; ADENOMA HIPOFISARIO. ASOCIADO CON UN VIRUS; QUISTE HIPOFISARIO, P\\u00d3LIPO, ABSCESO HIPOFISARIO. ASOCIADO CON BACTERIAS; TUMOR HIPOFISARIO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"NOSE - POLYPS, BLEEDING, LARYNGITIS, OTITIS, STYES, POOR VISION, CONJUNCTIVITIS, PHOTOPHOBIA, AND AMENORRHEA.\\n\\n(NARIZ - P\\u00d3LIPOS, SANGRADO, LARINGITIS, OTITIS, ORZUELOS, MALA VISI\\u00d3N, CONJUNTIVITIS, FOTOFOBIA Y AMENORREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ANTHRAX BACILLUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE CRANIAL REGION. THIS BACTERIA IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH INFECTED CATTLE, WOOL, OR RAW COTTON. THE RESONANCE PRIMARILY ADDRESSES DISORDERS OF THE EAR, NOSE, AND THROAT, AS WELL AS OCULAR COMPLICATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT HELPS CLEAR VIRAL OR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT IMPACT THE UPPER RESPIRATORY TRACT AND MUCOUS MEMBRANES, PREVENTING THE FORMATION OF POLYPS AND LOCALIZED INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL BACILO DEL \\u00c1NTRAX MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN TODA LA REGI\\u00d3N CRANEAL. ESTA BACTERIA SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO POR EL CONTACTO CON GANADO INFECTADO, LANA O ALGOD\\u00d3N CRUDO. LA RESONANCIA ABORDA PRINCIPALMENTE LOS TRASTORNOS DE O\\u00cdDO, NARIZ Y GARGANTA, AS\\u00cd COMO LAS COMPLICACIONES OCULARES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, AYUDA A ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES O BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTAN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR Y LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, PREVINIENDO LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE P\\u00d3LIPOS E INFECCIONES LOCALIZADAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN FOR PITUITARY INVOLVEMENT. THIS PAIR MAY BE ASSOCIATED WITH PITUITARY ADENOMAS WHEN COMBINED WITH OTHER PATHOGENS, OR PITUITARY CYSTS, POLYPS, OR ABSCESSES WHEN ASSOCIATED WITH VIRUSES. IF BACTERIAL LOADS REMAIN HIGH, CROSS-REFERENCE TO RULE OUT PITUITARY TUMORS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA AFECTACI\\u00d3N DE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS. ESTE PAR PUEDE ESTAR ASOCIADO CON ADENOMAS HIPOFISARIOS CUANDO SE COMBINA CON OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS, O QUISTES, P\\u00d3LIPOS O ABSCESOS HIPOFISARIOS CUANDO SE ASOCIA CON VIRUS. SI LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS SIGUEN SIENDO ALTAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA PARA DESCARTAR TUMORES HIPOFISARIOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/187','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:09:09','2026-04-27 12:09:09'),(3987,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',188,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPIRITUAL ALIGNMENT (ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESPIRITUAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"LACK OF INTEGRITY, FEELING DISCONNECTED FROM ONESELF, ETHICAL CONFUSION, AND LOSS OF HIGHER PURPOSE.\\n\\n(FALTA DE INTEGRIDAD, SENTIMIENTO DE DESCONEXI\\u00d3N CON UNO MISMO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N \\u00c9TICA Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE UN PROP\\u00d3SITO SUPERIOR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RESTORATION OF PERSONAL INTEGRITY BY NEUTRALIZING ENERGETIC DISTORTIONS AT THE HIGHEST POINT OF THE CRANIUM. THIS RESONANCE FOCUSES ON THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE INDIVIDUAL\'S CONSCIOUSNESS AND THEIR CORE VALUES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS DISSOLVE \\\"EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES\\\" OR CONFLICTS THAT PREVENT A PERSON FROM ACTING IN ALIGNMENT WITH THEIR TRUE SELF. IT PROMOTES A SENSE OF WHOLENESS, MORAL CLARITY, AND THE RE-ESTABLISHMENT OF THE VORTEX SPIN NECESSARY FOR SPIRITUAL AND EMOTIONAL COHERENCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD PERSONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS EN EL PUNTO M\\u00c1S ALTO DEL CR\\u00c1NEO. ESTA RESONANCIA SE CENTRA EN LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA CONCIENCIA DEL INDIVIDUO Y SUS VALORES FUNDAMENTALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DISOLVER \\\"C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS\\\" O CONFLICTOS QUE IMPIDEN QUE UNA PERSONA ACT\\u00daE EN ALINEACI\\u00d3N CON SU SER REAL. PROMUEVE UN SENTIDO DE PLENITUD, CLARIDAD MORAL Y EL REESTABLECIMIENTO DEL GIRO DEL V\\u00d3RTICE NECESARIO PARA LA COHERENCIA ESPIRITUAL Y EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF THE LACK OF INTEGRITY IS LINKED TO DEEP SADNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CORONA \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (REF 174) TO BALANCE THE GLANDULAR AXIS. FOR THOSE STRUGGLING WITH MENTAL FOG OR ADDICTIVE LOOPS INTERFERING WITH THEIR PRINCIPLES, SCAN THE CORPUS CALLOSUM \\/ CORPUS CALLOSUM (HORIZONTAL) (REF 180) TO ENSURE COGNITIVE INTEGRATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA FALTA DE INTEGRIDAD EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A UNA TRISTEZA PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE CORONA \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS (REF 174) PARA EQUILIBRAR EL EJE GLANDULAR. PARA QUIENES LUCHAN CON NIEBLA MENTAL O BUCLES ADICTIVOS QUE INTERFIEREN CON SUS PRINCIPIOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE CUERPO CALLOSO \\/ CUERPO CALLOSO (HORIZONTAL) (REF 180) PARA ASEGURAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/188','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:10:15','2026-04-27 12:10:15'),(3988,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',189,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL LESIONS, MENTAL CONFUSION, FATIGUE, SKIN ERUPTIONS (IN ACTIVE PHASES), AND POTENTIAL GLANDULAR DISRUPTION.\\n\\n(LESIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FATIGA, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS (EN FASES ACTIVAS) Y POSIBLE ALTERACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF THE HERPES VIRUS BY STABILIZING THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE CROWN AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). THIS RESET ADDRESSES VIRAL LOADS THAT TEND TO LODGE IN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, OFTEN CAUSING HIDDEN NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS OR CHRONIC INFLAMMATION OF THE MASTER GLAND. BY CLEARING THE VIRAL RESONANCE IN THIS HIGHER PATHWAY, IT SUPPORTS PROPER HORMONAL REGULATION AND PROTECTS THE BRAIN\'S COMMUNICATION NETWORKS FROM VIRAL INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL VIRUS DEL HERPES MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA CORONA Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). ESTE REINICIO ABORDA LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE TIENDEN A ALOJARSE EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, CAUSANDO A MENUDO S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS OCULTOS O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA. AL ELIMINAR LA RESONANCIA VIRAL EN ESTA V\\u00cdA SUPERIOR, APOYA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL ADECUADA Y PROTEGE LAS REDES DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBRO DE LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: IF SKIN LESIONS OR NERVE PAIN PERSIST, SCAN THE [TRIGEMINAL \\/ TRIGEMINAL] OR [THORACIC 1 \\/ THORACIC 1] AXES TO LOCATE OTHER HERPES STRAINS. FOR GLANDULAR IMBALANCES ACCOMPANIED BY EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CORONA \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (REF 174) EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE DEPRESSIVE COMPONENT IS ALSO ADDRESSED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: SI PERSISTEN LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O EL DOLOR NERVIOSO, ESCANEAR LOS EJES TRIG\\u00c9MINO \\/ TRIG\\u00c9MINO O TOR\\u00c1CICA 1 \\/ TOR\\u00c1CICA 1 PARA LOCALIZAR OTRAS CEPAS DE HERPES. PARA DESEQUILIBRIOS GLANDULARES ACOMPA\\u00d1ADOS DE MALESTAR EMOCIONAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL CORONA \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS (REF 174) PARA ASEGURAR QUE TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ABORDE EL COMPONENTE DEPRESIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/189','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:11:12','2026-04-27 12:11:12'),(3989,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',190,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTENSE FEELINGS OF HOPELESSNESS, EMOTIONAL STAGNATION, DISCONNECTION FROM THE ENVIRONMENT, SLEEP DISTURBANCES, AND LOSS OF INTEREST IN LIFE.\\n\\n(SENTIMIENTOS INTENSOS DE DESESPERANZA, ESTANCAMIENTO EMOCIONAL, DESCONEXI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO, DISTURBIOS DEL SUE\\u00d1O Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE INTER\\u00c9S EN LA VIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEUTRALIZATION OF DEEP DEPRESSIVE STATES BY BALANCING THE ENERGETIC AXIS BETWEEN THE CROWN AND THE HYPOTHALAMUS. AS THE HYPOTHALAMUS SERVES AS THE BRAIN\'S CONTROL CENTER FOR THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM, THIS RESET FOCUSES ON RESTORING THE BODY\'S EMOTIONAL HOMEOSTASIS. BY CLEARING ENERGETIC DISTORTIONS IN THIS PATHWAY, IT ASSISTS IN REGULATING VITAL FUNCTIONS LIKE SLEEP, APPETITE, AND MOOD, HELPING TO RECONNECT THE INDIVIDUAL WITH THEIR INTERNAL DRIVE AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTADOS DEPRESIVOS PROFUNDOS MEDIANTE EL EQUILIBRIO DEL EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE LA CORONA Y EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO. DADO QUE EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO FUNCIONA COMO EL CENTRO DE CONTROL DEL CEREBRO PARA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO Y EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO, ESTE REINICIO SE CENTRA EN RESTAURAR LA HOMEOSTASIS EMOCIONAL DEL CUERPO. AL ELIMINAR LAS DISTORSIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS EN ESTA V\\u00cdA, AYUDA A REGULAR FUNCIONES VITALES COMO EL SUE\\u00d1O, EL APETITO Y EL ESTADO DE \\u00c1NIMO, AYUDANDO A RECONECTAR AL INDIVIDUO CON SU IMPULSO INTERNO Y EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLAUNDULAR CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE CORONA \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (REF 174) TO ENSURE THE PITUITARY MASTER AXIS IS ALSO BALANCED. FOR THOSE EXPERIENCING ACUTE PANIC OR ANXIETY ALONGSIDE DEPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ CERVICAL PLEXUS (REF 148) TO CALM THE NERVOUS SYSTEM RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR: SI LA PESADEZ EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE CORONA \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS (REF 174) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL EJE MAESTRO PITUITARIO TAMBI\\u00c9N EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO. PARA QUIENES EXPERIMENTAN P\\u00c1NICO AGUDO O ANSIEDAD JUNTO CON LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ PLEXO CERVICAL (REF 148) PARA CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/190','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:12:25','2026-04-27 12:12:25'),(3990,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',191,'{\"origins\":\"TREPONEMA PALLIUM\",\"symptoms\":\"SYPHILIS, CARPAL TUNNEL, FROZEN SHOULDER, LOSS OF SENSATION IN ARM EXTREMITIES, HIP AND KNEE ARTHRITIS, JOINT DEFORMITY, OSTEOARTHRITIS, BACK PAIN AND STIFFNESS. (S\\u00cdFILIS, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO, HOMBRO CONGELADO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE SENSACI\\u00d3N EN LAS EXTREMIDADES DEL BRAZO, ARTRITIS DE CADERA Y RODILLA, DEFORMIDAD ARTICULAR, OSTEOARTRITIS, DOLOR DE ESPALDA Y RIGIDEZ)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED VAGINALLY, OR URETHRAL DISCHARGE. CAN CROSS OVER TO THE PLACENTA, INFECTING THE FETUS. RESULTING IN THE FEUS HAVING CONGENITAL SYPHILIS. ANKYLOSING SPONDYLITIS DISEASE SPONDYLARTHROSIS AND HIP AND KNEE OSTEOARTHRITIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR V\\u00cdA VAGINAL O POR SECRECI\\u00d3N URETRAL. PUEDE ATRAVESAR LA PLACENTA, INFECTANDO AL FETO. RESULTANDO EN S\\u00cdFILIS CONG\\u00c9NITA EN EL FETO. ESPONDILITIS ANQUILOSANTE, ESPONDILARTROSIS Y OSTEOARTRITIS DE CADERA Y RODILLA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH THE BACTERIA LOCATED IN ALL 4 PLACES; PRODUCES THALASSEMIA OR MEDITERRANEAN SEA ANEMIA. A SEVERE BLOOD DISORDER. ASSOCIATED WITH QUADRATUS; PRODUCES DIGESTIVE DISORDERS.                               CHECK - QUADRATUS. (ASOCIADO CON LA BACTERIA LOCALIZADA EN LOS 4 LUGARES; PRODUCE TALASEMIA O ANEMIA DEL MEDITERR\\u00c1NEO. UN TRASTORNO SANGU\\u00cdNEO GRAVE. ASOCIADO CON CUADRADO LUMBAR; PRODUCE TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS. VERIFICAR - CUADRADO LUMBAR.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"TREPONEMA PALLIDUM (S\\u00cdFILIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"SYPHILIS, CARPAL TUNNEL, FROZEN SHOULDER, LOSS OF SENSATION IN ARM EXTREMITIES, HIP AND KNEE ARTHRITIS, JOINT DEFORMITY, OSTEOARTHRITIS, BACK PAIN, AND STIFFNESS.(S\\u00cdFILIS, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO, HOMBRO CONGELADO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE SENSACI\\u00d3N EN LAS EXTREMIDADES DEL BRAZO, ARTRITIS DE CADERA Y RODILLA, DEFORMIDAD ARTICULAR, OSTEOARTRITIS, DOLOR DE ESPALDA Y RIGIDEZ.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS TREPONEMA PALLIDUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE DELTOID MUSCLE REGION. THIS BACTERIA IS PRIMARILY TRANSMITTED VAGINALLY OR THROUGH URETHRAL DISCHARGE AND HAS THE ABILITY TO CROSS THE PLACENTA, POTENTIALLY INFECTING THE FETUS (CONGENITAL SYPHILIS). BEYOND ITS REPRODUCTIVE IMPACT, THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES SEVERE MUSCULOSKELETAL ISSUES SUCH AS ANKYLOSING SPONDYLITIS, SPONDYLARTHROSIS, AND DEGENERATIVE OSTEOARTHRITIS IN THE HIPS AND KNEES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS RESTORE MOBILITY TO THE SHOULDERS AND ARMS WHILE CLEARING SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL LOADS THAT DEGRADE JOINT INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA TREPONEMA PALLIDUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL M\\u00daSCULO DELTOIDES. ESTA BACTERIA SE TRANSMITE PRINCIPALMENTE POR V\\u00cdA VAGINAL O POR SECRECI\\u00d3N URETRAL Y TIENE LA CAPACIDAD DE ATRAVESAR LA PLACENTA, INFECTANDO POTENCIALMENTE AL FETO (S\\u00cdFILIS CONG\\u00c9NITA). M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE SU IMPACTO REPRODUCTIVO, ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA PROBLEMAS MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICOS GRAVES COMO LA ESPONDILITIS ANQUILOSANTE, LA ESPONDILARTROSIS Y LA OSTEOARTRITIS DEGENERATIVA EN CADERAS Y RODILLAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR LA MOVILIDAD EN LOS HOMBROS Y BRAZOS MIENTRAS ELIMINA LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE DEGRADAN LA INTEGRIDAD ARTICULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BLOOD & DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF BACTERIA IS LOCATED IN ALL FOUR DELTOID POINTS (BILATERAL), IT MAY PRODUCE THALASSEMIA (MEDITERRANEAN SEA ANEMIA), A SEVERE BLOOD DISORDER. IF ASSOCIATED WITH THE [QUADRATUS LUMBORUM \\/ QUADRATUS LUMBORUM] AXIS, IT OFTEN PRODUCES SIGNIFICANT DIGESTIVE DISORDERS. MANDATORY TO SCAN BOTH FOR FULL NEUTRALIZATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA Y DIGESTIVA: SI LA BACTERIA SE LOCALIZA EN LOS CUATRO PUNTOS DELTOIDES (BILATERAL), PUEDE PRODUCIR TALASEMIA (ANEMIA DEL MEDITERR\\u00c1NEO), UN TRASTORNO SANGU\\u00cdNEO GRAVE. SI SE ASOCIA CON EL EJE CUADRADO LUMBAR \\/ CUADRADO LUMBAR, A MENUDO PRODUCE TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS SIGNIFICATIVOS. ES OBLIGATORIO ESCANEAR AMBOS PARA UNA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/191','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:13:47','2026-04-27 12:13:47'),(3991,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',192,'{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE, FURUNCULOSIS, ULCERS IN THE NOSE , MOUTH AND THROAT. FEVER, URIC ACID, MYELOMA. MOTOR EPILEPSY. (ACN\\u00c9, FORUNCULOSIS, \\u00daLCERAS EN LA NARIZ, BOCA Y GARGANTA. FIEBRE, \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO, MIELOMA. EPILEPSIA MOTORA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY THE MOSQUITOS AND BLOOD TRANSFUSIONS. SKIN ERUPTIONS, AFFECTING THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. (TRANSMITIDO POR MOSQUITOS Y TRANSFUSIONES DE SANGRE. ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, AFECTANDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - OTHER SIDE DELTOID AND KIDNEY - RIGHT. (VERIFICAR - DELTOIDES DEL OTRO LADO Y RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE, FURUNCULOSIS, ULCERS IN THE NOSE, MOUTH, AND THROAT, EPIDERMAL DAMAGE, ANEMIA, WEIGHT LOSS, AND POTENTIAL LIVER OR SPLEEN ENLARGEMENT.\\n\\n(ACN\\u00c9, FORUNCULOSIS, \\u00daLCERAS EN LA NARIZ, BOCA Y GARGANTA, DA\\u00d1O EPID\\u00c9RMICO, ANEMIA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO Y POSIBLE AGRANDAMIENTO DEL H\\u00cdGADO O EL BAZO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE LEISHMANIA PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DELTOID MUSCLE AND THE KIDNEY ON THE SAME SIDE OF THE BODY. THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY THE BITE OF INFECTED PHLEBOTOMINE SANDFLIES AND CAN AFFECT THE SKIN, MUCOUS MEMBRANES, AND INTERNAL ORGANS. THE RESONANCE WORKS TO STABILIZE THE BIOFIELD AFFECTING THE RETICULOENDOTHELIAL SYSTEM, HELPING THE BODY CLEAR PARASITIC LOADS THAT CAUSE CUTANEOUS LESIONS OR SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS. BY BALANCING THIS AXIS, IT SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE SPREAD OF THE PARASITE TO THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM OR VITAL FILTRATION ORGANS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO LEISHMANIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL M\\u00daSCULO DELTOIDES Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL MISMO LADO DEL CUERPO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR LA PICADURA DE FLEB\\u00d3TOMOS INFECTADOS Y PUEDE AFECTAR LA PIEL, LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS INTERNOS. LA RESONANCIA TRABAJA PARA ESTABILIZAR EL BIOCAMPO QUE AFECTA AL SISTEMA RETICULOENDOTELIAL, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS PARASITARIAS QUE CAUSAN LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL EQUILIBRAR ESTE EJE, APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL O A LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COMPLEX CHECK: IF SKIN SYMPTOMS ARE AGGRESSIVE, SCAN THE [DELTOID \\/ DELTOID] (REF 191) AXIS TO RULE OUT CO-INFECTION WITH SYPHILIS (TREPONEMA PALLIDUM). IT IS MANDATORY TO CHECK THE OTHER SIDE (DELTOID AND KIDNEY - OPPOSITE) TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE. FOR CHRONIC LIVER OR SPLEEN DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] OR [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COMPLEJA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS SON AGRESIVOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES (REF 191) PARA DESCARTAR UNA COINFECCI\\u00d3N CON S\\u00cdFILIS (TREPONEMA PALLIDUM). ES OBLIGATORIO REVISAR EL OTRO LADO (DELTOIDES Y RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - LADO OPUESTO) PARA ASEGURAR UNA LIMPIEZA COMPLETA. PARA MALESTAR CR\\u00d3NICO DEL H\\u00cdGADO O EL BAZO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO O BAZO \\/ BAZO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/192','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:14:57','2026-04-27 12:14:57'),(3992,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',193,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT CAN BE THE SOURCE OF RECURRING INFECTIONS, TOOTH SENSITIVITY, JAW PAIN, AND UNEXPLAINED RENAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE SER LA FUENTE DE INFECCIONES RECURRENTES, SENSIBILIDAD DENTAL, DOLOR DE MAND\\u00cdBULA Y MALESTAR RENAL INEXPLICABLE.)\",\"paths\":\"ACTS AS A UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR WHERE VARIOUS PATHOGENS\\u2014BACTERIA, VIRUSES, OR PARASITES\\u2014HIDE WITHIN THE ENERGETIC CONNECTION BETWEEN THE DENTAL PIECES AND THE KIDNEY FILTRATION SYSTEM. THIS RESET IS CRUCIAL FOR ADDRESSING \\\"FOCAL INFECTIONS\\\" THAT ORIGINATE IN THE MOUTH BUT IMPACT THE ENTIRE BODY. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS AXIS ON THE SAME SIDE, IT PREVENTS THE RE-INOCULATION OF PATHOGENS THAT HAVE BEEN PREVIOUSLY TREATED ELSEWHERE, ENSURING THAT THE BODY\'S FILTRATION SYSTEM IS NOT CONSTANTLY RE-INFECTED BY HIDDEN DENTAL NIDUS.\\n\\n(ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL DONDE DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS \\u2014BACTERIAS, VIRUS O PAR\\u00c1SITOS\\u2014 SE ESCONDEN DENTRO DE LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LAS PIEZAS DENTALES Y EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL. ESTE REINICIO ES CRUCIAL PARA ABORDAR LAS \\\"INFECCIONES FOCALES\\\" QUE SE ORIGINAN EN LA BOCA PERO IMPACTAN EN TODO EL CUERPO. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTE EJE EN EL MISMO LADO, SE EVITA LA REINOCULACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE HAN SIDO TRATADOS PREVIAMENTE EN OTROS LUGARES, ASEGURANDO QUE EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO NO SE REINFECTE CONSTANTEMENTE POR NIDOS DENTALES OCULTOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FOCAL CHECK: IF DENTAL ISSUES PERSIST OR ARE LINKED TO SPECIFIC TEETH, SCAN THE [DENTAL \\/ DENTAL] AXIS. FOR RECURRING URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS THAT DO NOT CLEAR WITH OTHER PAIRS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PRIMARY FILTRATION ORGANS ARE FULLY STABILIZED. ALWAYS CHECK BOTH SIDES (RIGHT DENTAL\\/RIGHT KIDNEY AND LEFT DENTAL\\/LEFT KIDNEY) TO LOCATE THE ACTIVE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N FOCAL: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DENTALES PERSISTEN O EST\\u00c1N VINCULADOS A DIENTES ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE DENTAL \\/ DENTAL. PARA INFECCIONES RECURRENTES DEL TRACTO URINARIO QUE NO SE ELIMINAN CON OTROS PARES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N PRIMARIOS EST\\u00c9N COMPLETAMENTE ESTABILIZADOS. SIEMPRE REVISAR AMBOS LADOS (DENTAL DERECHO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO Y DENTAL IZQUIERDO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO) PARA LOCALIZAR EL RESERVORIO ACTIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/193','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:16:01','2026-04-27 12:16:01'),(3993,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',194,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE JOINT PAIN (ARTHRALGIA), HIGH FEVER, HEADACHE, MUSCLE PAIN, JOINT SWELLING, RASH, AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO (ARTRALGIA), FIEBRE ALTA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N DE LAS ARTICULACIONES, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CHIKUNGUNYA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LOWER SECTION OF THE LARGE INTESTINE AND THE TERMINAL END OF THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. THIS VIRAL PATHOGEN, TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY AEDES AEGYPTI AND AEDES ALBOPICTUS MOSQUITOES, TENDS TO PROVOKE DEBILITATING JOINT INFLAMATION THAT CAN PERSIST FOR MONTHS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESONANCE HELPS REDUCE THE ACUTE VIRAL LOAD, ALLEVIATING SYSTEMIC FEVER AND THE CRIPPLING SENSATION IN THE EXTREMITIES OFTEN DESCRIBED AS \\\"THAT WHICH BENDS UP\\\" DUE TO THE INTENSE PAIN.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS CHIKUNGUNYA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA SECCI\\u00d3N INFERIOR DEL INTESTINO GRUESO Y EL FINAL DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO VIRAL, TRANSMITIDO T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR LOS MOSQUITOS AEDES AEGYPTI Y AEDES ALBOPICTUS, TIENDE A PROVOCAR UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR DEBILITANTE QUE PUEDE PERSISTIR DURANTE MESES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, LA RESONANCIA AYUDA A REDUCIR LA CARGA VIRAL AGUDA, ALIVIANDO LA FIEBRE SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE INCAPACIDAD EN LAS EXTREMIDADES A MENUDO DESCRITA COMO \\\"AQUEL QUE SE DOBLA\\\" DEBIDO AL INTENSO DOLOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CROSS-CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN IS ACCOMPANIED BY SIGNIFICANT EYE PAIN OR HEMORRHAGIC TENDENCIES, SCAN THE [HIND-BRAIN \\/ HIND-BRAIN] AXIS TO RULE OUT DENGUE. FOR SYMPTOMS PRESENTING AS CHRONIC ARTHRITIS AFTER THE FEVER SUBSIDES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DELTOID \\/ DELTOID] (REF 191) AXIS TO ENSURE NO BACTERIAL CO-INFECTION IS SUSTAINING THE INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE DOLOR OCULAR SIGNIFICATIVO O TENDENCIAS HEMORR\\u00c1GICAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO PARA DESCARTAR EL DENGUE. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE SE PRESENTAN COMO ARTRITIS CR\\u00d3NICA DESPU\\u00c9S DE QUE LA FIEBRE DESAPARECE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES (REF 191) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NINGUNA COINFECCI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA EST\\u00c9 MANTENIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/194','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:16:59','2026-04-27 12:16:59');
INSERT INTO `audits` VALUES (3994,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',195,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT CAN BE THE SOURCE OF RECURRING GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET, CHRONIC URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, AND PERSISTENT PELVIC DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE SER LA FUENTE DE MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL RECURRENTE, INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS DEL TRACTO URINARIO Y MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO PERSISTENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"ACTS AS A UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR FOR VARIOUS PATHOGENS THAT TEND TO CONGREGATE IN THE LOWER ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC CAVITIES. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DESCENDING COLON AND THE BLADDER, THIS RESET ELIMINATES THE ENERGETIC \\\"NICHES\\\" WHERE BACTERIA, VIRUSES, OR PARASITES MAY HIDE TO EVADE TREATMENT. CLEARING THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR BREAKING THE CYCLE OF RECURRING INFECTIONS IN THE EXCRETORY AND DIGESTIVE SYSTEMS, ENSURING THAT PATHOGENS DO NOT RE-COLONIZE AFTER BEING CLEARED FROM OTHER PRIMARY SITES.\\n\\n(ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL PARA DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE TIENDEN A CONGREGARSE EN LAS CAVIDADES ABDOMINAL INFERIOR Y P\\u00c9LVICA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON DESCENDENTE Y LA VEJIGA, ESTE REINICIO ELIMINA LOS \\\"NICHOS\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICOS DONDE LAS BACTERIAS, VIRUS O PAR\\u00c1SITOS PUEDEN ESCONDERSE PARA EVADIR EL TRATAMIENTO. LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ROMPER EL CICLO DE INFECCIONES RECURRENTES EN LOS SISTEMAS EXCRETOR Y DIGESTIVO, ASEGURANDO QUE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS NO VUELVAN A COLONIZAR DESPU\\u00c9S DE HABER SIDO ELIMINADOS DE OTROS SITIOS PRIMARIOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PELVIC CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED STREPTOCOCCUS. FOR DIGESTIVE ISSUES LINKED TO CHRONIC JOINT PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ ANUS (REF 194) TO RULE OUT CHIKUNGUNYA. ALWAYS SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA PARA DESCARTAR ESTREPTOCOCO LOCALIZADO. PARA PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS VINCULADOS A DOLOR ARTICULAR CR\\u00d3NICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ ANO (REF 194) PARA DESCARTAR CHIKUNGUNYA. SIEMPRE ESCANEAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/195','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:18:01','2026-04-27 12:18:01'),(3995,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',196,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL AND RECTAL BLEEDING. DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, DIARRHEA, COLITIS, MALABSORPTION, WORMS, VAGINITIS, DUODENUM AND COLON DISORDERS. HEMORRHOIDS, VARICOSE VEINS, BLADDER PROLAPSE. COLON AND UTERINE CANCER (FALSE AND TRUE). FOOD INTOLERANCE. UTI. SANGRADO VAGINAL Y RECTAL. PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, DIARREA, COLITIS, MALABSORCI\\u00d3N, PAR\\u00c1SITOS, VAGINITIS, TRASTORNOS DEL DUODENO Y COLON. HEMORROIDES, V\\u00c1RICES, PROLAPSO DE VEJIGA. C\\u00c1NCER DE COLON Y UTERINO (FALSO Y VERDADERO). INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA. INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY ANIMALS MUCUS. LEADING PRODUCER OF VAGINAL BLEEDING AND RECTAL BLEEDING IN MEN. DISTENDS THE DESCENDING COLON AND ROUTES IT ALONG TO OTHER PLACES IN THE ABDOMEN. (TRANSMITIDO POR MUCOSIDAD DE ANIMALES. PRINCIPAL CAUSANTE DE SANGRADO VAGINAL Y SANGRADO RECTAL EN HOMBRES. DISTIENDE EL COLON DESCENDENTE Y LO DESV\\u00cdA HACIA OTROS LUGARES EN EL ABDOMEN.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS IT IS VERY DANGEROUS. (ASOCIADO CON CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS, ES MUY PELIGROSO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL AND RECTAL BLEEDING, DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, DIARRHEA, COLITIS, MALABSORPTION, WORMS, VAGINITIS, DUODENUM AND COLON DISORDERS, HEMORRHOIDS, VARICOSE VEINS, BLADDER PROLAPSE, COLON AND UTERINE CANCER (FALSE AND TRUE), FOOD INTOLERANCE, AND URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI).(SANGRADO VAGINAL Y RECTAL, PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, DIARREA, COLITIS, MALABSORCI\\u00d3N, PAR\\u00c1SITOS, VAGINITIS, TRASTORNOS DEL DUODENO Y COLON, HEMORROIDES, V\\u00c1RICES, PROLAPSO DE VEJIGA, C\\u00c1NCER DE COLON Y UTERINO (FALSO Y VERDADERO), INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA E INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS ENTEROBACTER CLOACAE, A PATHOGEN OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH ANIMAL MUCUS, BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE DESCENDING COLON USING A VERTICAL POLARITY ALIGNMENT. THIS BACTERIA IS A LEADING CAUSE OF VAGINAL BLEEDING IN WOMEN AND RECTAL BLEEDING IN MEN. THE RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DISTENSION OF THE DESCENDING COLON AND PREVENTS THE PATHOGEN FROM ROUTING TO OTHER AREAS OF THE ABDOMEN, HELPING TO RESTORE PROPER DIGESTIVE FUNCTION AND TISSUE INTEGRITY IN THE LOWER GASTROINTESTINAL AND REPRODUCTIVE TRACTS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA ENTEROBACTER CLOACAE, UN PAT\\u00d3GENO A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO POR MUCOSIDAD DE ANIMALES, MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DEL COLON DESCENDENTE UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N DE POLARIDAD VERTICAL. ESTA BACTERIA ES UNA DE LAS PRINCIPALES CAUSAS DE SANGRADO VAGINAL EN MUJERES Y SANGRADO RECTAL EN HOMBRES. LA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISTENSI\\u00d3N DEL COLON DESCENDENTE Y EVITA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO SE DESV\\u00cdE HACIA OTRAS \\u00c1REAS DEL ABDOMEN, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA ADECUADA Y LA INTEGRIDAD DE LOS TEJIDOS EN LOS TRACTOS GASTROINTESTINAL INFERIOR Y REPRODUCTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: THIS BACTERIA IS HIGHLY DANGEROUS WHEN ASSOCIATED WITH CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS. SCAN THE DUODENUM \\/ KIDNEY (R) OR [URETHRA \\/ URETHRA] AXES TO RULE OUT CO-INFECTION. FOR CHRONIC BLEEDING OR SUSPECTED MALIGNANCY FACTORS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SUPRASPINOUS \\/ SUPRASPINOUS (REF 755) AXIS TO MONITOR SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESTA BACTERIA ES MUY PELIGROSA CUANDO SE ASOCIA CON CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS. ESCANEAR LOS EJES DUODENO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) O URETRA \\/ URETRA PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCI\\u00d3N. PARA SANGRADO CR\\u00d3NICO O FACTORES DE MALIGNIDAD SOSPECHADOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO (REF 755) PARA MONITOREAR LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/196','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:19:14','2026-04-27 12:19:14'),(3996,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',197,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE AND BOWEL DISORDERS. BLOATING, GAS, LOSS OF PROTEIN. (TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS E INTESTINALES. HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, GASES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PROTE\\u00cdNA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD, VEGETABLES FRUIT AND WATER. HEPATITIS A, OSTEOARTHRITIS, MUSCULAR ATROPHY OF THE EYES. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALIMENTOS, VEGETALES, FRUTAS Y AGUA CONTAMINADOS. HEPATITIS A, OSTEOARTRITIS, ATROFIA MUSCULAR DE LOS OJOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/LIVER                                             CHECK - PANCREATIC LIGAMENT\\/DESCENDING COLON ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER BACTERIA TO PRODUCE HEMORRHOIDS, VAGINITIS AND BLEEDING. (VERIFICAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/H\\u00cdGADO. VERIFICAR - LIGAMENTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO\\/COLON DESCENDENTE. ASOCIADO CON OTRAS BACTERIAS PARA PRODUCIR HEMORROIDES, VAGINITIS Y SANGRADO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE AND BOWEL DISORDERS, BLOATING, GAS, AND LOSS OF PROTEIN. MAY BE ASSOCIATED WITH HEPATITIS A, OSTEOARTHRITIS, AND MUSCULAR ATROPHY OF THE EYES.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS E INTESTINALES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, GASES Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PROTE\\u00cdNA. PUEDE ESTAR ASOCIADO CON HEPATITIS A, OSTEOARTRITIS Y ATROFIA MUSCULAR DE LOS OJOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PASTEURELLA BACTERIA, WHICH IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD, VEGETABLES, FRUIT, AND WATER. THIS RESONANCE NEUTRALIZES PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DESCENDING COLON AND THE LEFT KIDNEY TO RESOLVE INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION AND PROTEIN MALABSORPTION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, IT PREVENTS THE PATHOGEN FROM CONTRIBUTING TO HEPATIC STRESS OR DEGENERATIVE ISSUES IN THE JOINTS AND OCULAR MUSCLES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA PASTEURELLA, QUE SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS, VEGETALES, FRUTAS Y AGUA CONTAMINADOS. ESTA RESONANCIA NEUTRALIZA LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON DESCENDENTE Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO PARA RESOLVER LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y LA MALABSORCI\\u00d3N DE PROTE\\u00cdNAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EVITA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO CONTRIBUYA AL ESTR\\u00c9S HEP\\u00c1TICO O A PROBLEMAS DEGENERATIVOS EN LAS ARTICULACIONES Y LOS M\\u00daSCULOS OCULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & GLANDULAR CHECK: SCAN THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ LIVER AXIS TO ADDRESS CO-INFECTIONS IMPACTING FILTRATION. ALSO, CHECK THE PANCREATIC LIGAMENT \\/ DESCENDING COLON RESONANCE, AS PASTEURELLA CAN ASSOCIATE WITH OTHER BACTERIA TO PRODUCE HEMORRHOIDS, VAGINITIS, AND BLEEDING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y GLANDULAR: ESCANEAR EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA ABORDAR COINFECCIONES QUE AFECTAN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N. TAMBI\\u00c9N, REVISAR LA RESONANCIA LIGAMENTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE, YA QUE LA PASTEURELLA PUEDE ASOCIARSE CON OTRAS BACTERIAS PARA PRODUCIR HEMORROIDES, VAGINITIS Y SANGRADO.)O.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/197','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:20:21','2026-04-27 12:20:21'),(3997,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',198,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEPATITIS A, FATIGUE, SEXUAL DISORDERS, LACK OF APPETITE, MUSCLE PAIN, FEVER, TINGLING IN EXTREMITIES, JAUNDICE, GOUT, FOOD INTOLERANCE. (HEPATITIS A, FATIGA, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES, FALTA DE APETITO, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FIEBRE, HORMIGUEO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, ICTERICIA, GOTA, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD, VEGETABLES, FRUIT AND WATER. HEPATITIS A. HIGH CHOLESTEROL, AND JAUNDICE. YELLOWING OF THE SKIN. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALIMENTOS, VEGETALES, FRUTAS Y AGUA CONTAMINADOS. HEPATITIS A. COLESTEROL ALTO E ICTERICIA. AMARILLAMIENTO DE LA PIEL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/KIDNEY (L)                                       CHECK - PANCREATIC LIGAMENT DESCENDING COLON (VERIFICAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I). VERIFICAR - LIGAMENTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO\\/COLON DESCENDENTE.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEPATITIS A, FATIGUE, SEXUAL DISORDERS, LACK OF APPETITE, MUSCLE PAIN, FEVER, TINGLING IN EXTREMITIES, JAUNDICE, GOUT, AND FOOD INTOLERANCE.\\n\\n(HEPATITIS A, FATIGA, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES, FALTA DE APETITO, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FIEBRE, HORMIGUEO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, ICTERICIA, GOTA E INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PASTEURELLA BACTERIA, TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD, VEGETABLES, FRUIT, AND WATER. THIS SPECIFIC RESET ADDRESSES HEPATITIS A, HIGH CHOLESTEROL, AND JAUNDICE (YELLOWING OF THE SKIN). BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DESCENDING COLON AND THE LIVER, THE RESONANCE SUPPORTS HEPATIC DETOXIFICATION AND HELPS CLEAR THE BACTERIAL LOAD AFFECTING METABOLISM AND THE BODY\'S FILTRATION FUNCTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA PASTEURELLA, TRANSMITIDA POR ALIMENTOS, VEGETALES, FRUTAS Y AGUA CONTAMINADOS. ESTE REINICIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO ABORDA LA HEPATITIS A, EL COLESTEROL ALTO Y LA ICTERICIA (AMARILLAMIENTO DE LA PIEL). AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON DESCENDENTE Y EL H\\u00cdGADO, LA RESONANCIA APOYA LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA QUE AFECTA EL METABOLISMO Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & RENAL CHECK: SCAN THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ KIDNEY (L) AXIS (REF 197) TO ENSURE PASTEURELLA IS NOT AFFECTING PROTEIN ABSORPTION. IT IS ALSO RECOMMENDED TO CHECK THE PANCREATIC LIGAMENT \\/ DESCENDING COLON RESONANCE TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL ASSOCIATIONS THAT MAY CAUSE HEMORRHOIDS OR VAGINITIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RENAL: ESCANEAR EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) (REF 197) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA PASTEURELLA NO EST\\u00c9 AFECTANDO LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE PROTE\\u00cdNAS. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE RECOMIENDA REVISAR LA RESONANCIA LIGAMENTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE PARA DESCARTAR ASOCIACIONES BACTERIANAS QUE PUEDAN PROVOCAR HEMORROIDES O VAGINITIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/198','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:33:54','2026-04-27 12:33:54'),(3998,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',199,'{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG AND LIVER DISORDERS. ABDOMINAL PAIN, BLOOD FROM URINATION AND STOOL. ALLERGIC REACTIONS, FEVER, LIVER FIBROSIS. (TRASTORNOS DEL PULM\\u00d3N Y DEL H\\u00cdGADO. DOLOR ABDOMINAL, SANGRE EN LA ORINA Y EN LAS HECES. REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS, FIEBRE, FIBROSIS HEP\\u00c1TICA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY FISH, SHELLFISH, AND TAPEWORMS FROM DOGS. VERY AGGRESSIVE.  TUMORS IN THE GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT. (TRANSMITIDO POR PESCADO, MARISCOS Y TENIAS DE PERROS. MUY AGRESIVO. TUMORES EN EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SEARCH FOR THE BACTERIA THAT IS FEEDING OFF OF AND SUSTAINING FROM. (BUSCAR LA BACTERIA DE LA QUE SE ALIMENTA Y DE LA QUE SE SOSTIENE.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG AND LIVER DISORDERS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, BLOOD IN URINE AND STOOL, ALLERGIC REACTIONS, FEVER, AND LIVER FIBROSIS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL PULM\\u00d3N Y DEL H\\u00cdGADO, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, SANGRE EN LA ORINA Y EN LAS HECES, REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS, FIEBRE Y FIBROSIS HEP\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SCHISTOSOMA PARASITE, AN AGGRESSIVE PATHOGEN OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FISH, SHELLFISH, OR THROUGH CONTACT WITH TAPEWORMS FROM DOGS. THIS RESONANCE NEUTRALIZES PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DESCENDING COLON AND THE LEFT QUADRICEPS TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC PARASITIC INFECTION. IF LEFT UNTREATED, THIS PATHOGEN CAN CAUSE SEVERE TISSUE DAMAGE, INCLUDING THE FORMATION OF TUMORS IN THE GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT AND FIBROSIS IN THE LIVER. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE PARASITE\'S LIFE CYCLE AND SUPPORTS THE RECOVERY OF THE FILTRATION AND DIGESTIVE ORGANS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO SCHISTOSOMA, UN PAT\\u00d3GENO AGRESIVO A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO POR PESCADO O MARISCOS CONTAMINADOS, O A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO CON TENIAS DE PERROS. ESTA RESONANCIA NEUTRALIZA LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON DESCENDENTE Y EL CU\\u00c1DRICEPS IZQUIERDO PARA ABORDAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA. SI NO SE TRATA, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE CAUSAR DA\\u00d1OS GRAVES EN LOS TEJIDOS, INCLUYENDO LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TUMORES EN EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL Y FIBROSIS EN EL H\\u00cdGADO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL CICLO DE VIDA DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO Y APOYA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y DIGESTI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN SYMBIOSIS: SCHISTOSOMA OFTEN SUSTAINS ITSELF THROUGH SYNERGY WITH SPECIFIC BACTERIA. SCAN THE SYSTEM TO IDENTIFY AND NEUTRALIZE THE BACTERIA THAT IS FEEDING AND SUSTAINING THE PARASITE. FOR PERSISTENT LIVER DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ LIVER (REF 198) AXIS TO FULLY CLEAR HEPATIC LOADS.\\n\\n(SIMBIOSIS DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: EL ESQUISTOSOMA A MENUDO SE SOSTIENE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA SINERGIA CON BACTERIAS ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS. ESCANEAR EL SISTEMA PARA IDENTIFICAR Y NEUTRALIZAR LA BACTERIA DE LA QUE SE ALIMENTA Y SE SOSTIENE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO. PARA MALESTAR HEP\\u00c1TICO PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ H\\u00cdGADO (REF 198) PARA LIMPIAR COMPLETAMENTE LAS CARGAS HEP\\u00c1TICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/199','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:35:21','2026-04-27 12:35:21'),(3999,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',200,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL OBSTRUCTION AND CONSTIPATION. (OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ILIAC (VERIFICAR - IL\\u00cdACO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL PERISTALSIS (PERISTALTISMO INTESTINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL OBSTRUCTION, SEVERE CONSTIPATION, SLOW DIGESTION, AND PELVIC HEAVINESS.\\n\\n(OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO SEVERO, DIGESTI\\u00d3N LENTA Y PESADEZ P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS IS A SPECIAL RESONANCE DESIGNED TO RESTORE THE NATURAL MOVEMENT OF THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT. INSTEAD OF TARGETING A SPECIFIC PATHOGEN, IT ADDRESSES MECHANICAL DYSFUNCTION WITHIN THE COLON AND THE RECTAL TERMINUS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THIS AXIS, THE RESET STIMULATES THE PERISTALTIC WAVES NECESSARY FOR EVACUATION. IT IS PARTICULARLY EFFECTIVE FOR CLEARING PHYSICAL OBSTRUCTIONS CAUSED BY ENERGETIC \\\"LOCKS\\\" OR CHRONIC STASIS, SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO ELIMINATE WASTE EFFICIENTLY.\\n\\n(ESTA ES UNA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL DISE\\u00d1ADA PARA RESTAURAR EL MOVIMIENTO NATURAL DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR. EN LUGAR DE DIRIGIRSE A UN PAT\\u00d3GENO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO, ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA DENTRO DEL COLON Y EL TERMINAL RECTAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO ESTIMULA LAS ONDAS PERIST\\u00c1LTICAS NECESARIAS PARA LA EVACUACI\\u00d3N. ES PARTICULARMENTE EFICAZ PARA ELIMINAR OBSTRUCCIONES F\\u00cdSICAS CAUSADAS POR \\\"BLOQUEOS\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICOS O ESTASIS CR\\u00d3NICA, APOYANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA ELIMINAR DESECHOS DE MANERA EFICIENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ILIAC CHECK: IF THE OBSTRUCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [ILIAC \\/ ILIAC] AXIS TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE PELVIC GIRDLE AND LOWER INTESTINAL JUNCTIONS ARE BALANCED. FOR CHRONIC CONSTIPATION LINKED TO VIRAL LOADS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ ANUS (REF 194) TO RULE OUT CHIKUNGUNYA-RELATED INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N IL\\u00cdACA: SI LA OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE IL\\u00cdACO \\/ IL\\u00cdACO PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA CINTURA P\\u00c9LVICA Y LAS UNIONES INTESTINALES INFERIORES EST\\u00c9N EQUILIBRADAS. PARA EL ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO CR\\u00d3NICO VINCULADO A CARGAS VIRALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ ANO (REF 194) PARA DESCARTAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RELACIONADA CON EL CHIKUNGUNYA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/200','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:36:40','2026-04-27 12:36:40'),(4000,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',201,'{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, MALABSORPTION OF FOOD. (DOLOR ABDOMINAL, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, MALABSORCI\\u00d3N DE ALIMENTOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY EATING CONTAMINATED RAW OR UNDERCOOKED FISH. INFLAMES THE DIGESTIVE TRACT AND DISRUPTS THE DIGESTIVE PROCESS. FASLE APPENDICITIS OR PERITONITIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR CONSUMIR PESCADO CRUDO O POCO COCIDO CONTAMINADO. INFLAMA EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO Y ALTERA EL PROCESO DIGESTIVO. FALSA APENDICITIS O PERITONITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, AND MALABSORPTION OF FOOD. MAY PRESENT AS FALSE APPENDICITIS OR PERITONITIS.\\n\\n(DOLOR ABDOMINAL, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS Y MALABSORCI\\u00d3N DE ALIMENTOS. PUEDE PRESENTARSE COMO FALSA APENDICITIS O PERITONITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ANISAKIS PATHOGEN, WHICH IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY CONSUMING CONTAMINATED RAW OR UNDERCOOKED FISH. THIS RESONANCE NEUTRALIZES PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT AND THE PANCREATIC TERMINUS TO REDUCE INFLAMMATION THROUGHOUT THE GASTROINTESTINAL SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE PATHOGEN\'S ABILITY TO ALTER DIGESTIVE PROCESSES, ALLEVIATING ACUTE ABDOMINAL DISTRESS AND PREVENTING COMPLICATIONS THAT MIMIC SURGICAL EMERGENCIES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAT\\u00d3GENO ANISAKIS, QUE SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR EL CONSUMO DE PESCADO CRUDO O POCO COCIDO CONTAMINADO. ESTA RESONANCIA NEUTRALIZA LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR Y EL TERMINAL PANCRE\\u00c1TICO PARA REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN TODO EL SISTEMA GASTROINTESTINAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA CAPACIDAD DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO PARA ALTERAR LOS PROCESOS DIGESTIVOS, ALIVIANDO EL MALESTAR ABDOMINAL AGUDO Y PREVINIENDO COMPLICACIONES QUE IMITAN EMERGENCIAS QUIR\\u00daRGICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF MALABSORPTION PERSIST, SCAN THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ KIDNEY (L) (REF 197) AXIS TO RULE OUT PASTEURELLA. FOR SEVERE ABDOMINAL INFLAMMATION LINKED TO OTHER PARASITIC LOADS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ QUADRICEPS (L) (REF 199) TO ENSURE SCHISTOSOMA IS NOT PRESENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE MALABSORCI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) (REF 197) PARA DESCARTAR PASTEURELLA. PARA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL SEVERA VINCULADA A OTRAS CARGAS PARASITARIAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ CU\\u00c1DRICEPS (I) (REF 199) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL ESQUISTOSOMA NO EST\\u00c9 PRESENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/201','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:37:59','2026-04-27 12:37:59'),(4001,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',202,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL INFECTION, THRUSH, VULVOVAGINITIS, HEADACHE, BREAST PAIN, FATIGUE, ALLERGIES, RASH, WHITE PATCHES ON TONGUE, ULCERS, NAUSEA, HAIR LOSS, DEPRESSION, GASTRIC AND RESPIRATORY DISEASE. (INFECCI\\u00d3N VAGINAL, CANDIDIASIS ORAL, VULVOVAGINITIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MAMARIO, FATIGA, ALERGIAS, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, MANCHAS BLANCAS EN LA LENGUA, \\u00daLCERAS, N\\u00c1USEAS, CA\\u00cdDA DEL CABELLO, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, ENFERMEDAD G\\u00c1STRICA Y RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"LEADS TO IMMUNODEFIENCY. (CONDUCE A INMUNODEFICIENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LOOK FOR THE VIRUS THAT SUSTAINS IT.                           CHECK - CARINA                               CHECK - THYMUS\\/RECTUM (HIV) (BUSCAR EL VIRUS QUE LO SOSTIENE. VERIFICAR - CARINA. VERIFICAR - TIMO\\/RECTO (VIH).)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL INFECTION, THRUSH (ORAL CANDIDIASIS), VULVOVAGINITIS, HEADACHE, BREAST PAIN, FATIGUE, ALLERGIES, RASH, WHITE PATCHES ON THE TONGUE, ULCERS, NAUSEA, HAIR LOSS, DEPRESSION, AND GASTRIC OR RESPIRATORY DISEASES.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N VAGINAL, CANDIDIASIS ORAL, VULVOVAGINITIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MAMARIO, FATIGA, ALERGIAS, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, MANCHAS BLANCAS EN LA LENGUA, \\u00daLCERAS, N\\u00c1USEAS, CA\\u00cdDA DEL CABELLO, DEPRESI\\u00d3N Y ENFERMEDADES G\\u00c1STRICAS O RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CANDIDA ALBICANS FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE DIAPHRAGM MUSCLE USING A HORIZONTAL MAGNETIC ALIGNMENT. THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY OPPORTUNISTIC AND THRIVES IN ACIDIC ENVIRONMENTS, OFTEN LEADING TO SIGNIFICANT IMMUNODEFICIENCY IF LEFT UNCHECKED. THE RESET FOCUSES ON STABILIZING THE BARRIER BETWEEN THE THORACIC AND ABDOMINAL CAVIDIES, PREVENTING THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THE FUNGUS AND REDUCING THE TOXIC LOAD THAT CONTRIBUTES TO CHRONIC FATIGUE AND VARIOUS MUCOSAL INFLAMMATIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO C\\u00c1NDIDA ALBICANS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL M\\u00daSCULO DIAFRAGMA UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N MAGN\\u00c9TICA HORIZONTAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE OPORTUNISTA Y PROSPERA EN AMBIENTES \\u00c1CIDOS, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A UNA INMUNODEFICIENCIA SIGNIFICATIVA SI NO SE CONTROLA. EL REINICIO SE CENTRA EN ESTABILIZAR LA BARRERA ENTRE LAS CAVIDADES TOR\\u00c1CICA Y ABDOMINAL, PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL HONGO Y REDUCIENDO LA CARGA T\\u00d3XICA QUE CONTRIBUYE A LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA Y A DIVERSAS INFLAMACIONES DE LAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL SUPPORT CHECK: ALWAYS LOOK FOR THE VIRUS THAT SUSTAINS THE FUNGAL GROWTH, AS THEY OFTEN OPERATE IN SYNERGY. CHECK THE [CARINA \\/ CARINA] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IMMUNODEFICIENCY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ RECTUM] (REF. HIV) AXIS TO ENSURE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\'S CORE IS PROTECTED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE SOPORTE VIRAL: BUSCAR SIEMPRE EL VIRUS QUE SOSTIENE EL CRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO, YA QUE A MENUDO OPERAN EN SINERGIA. VERIFICAR LA RESONANCIA CARINA \\/ CARINA PARA ABORDAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INMUNODEFICIENCIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE TIMO \\/ RECTO (REF. VIH) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL N\\u00daCLEO DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EST\\u00c9 PROTEGIDO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/202','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:39:05','2026-04-27 12:39:05'),(4002,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',203,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, WEAKNESS, BACK PAIN, CHILLS, UTI, MALAISE, FATIGUE, WEIGHT LOSS. (FIEBRE, DEBILIDAD, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, MALESTAR, FATIGA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY THE INGESTION OF CONTAMINATED MILK BY PRODUCTS. PROBLEMS ARISE FROM THE SPLEEN AND LIVER, TO THE DIGESTIVE AND LYMPH SYSTEM. ARTHRITIS AFFECTING THE JOINTS AND SPINE. (TRANSMITIDO POR LA INGESTI\\u00d3N DE PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS. LOS PROBLEMAS SURGEN DEL BAZO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO, AFECTANDO EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO Y LINF\\u00c1TICO. ARTRITIS QUE AFECTA LAS ARTICULACIONES Y LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PROBLEMS MAY ARISE WITH PREGNANCY AND CAUSE THE FETUS TO ABORT. (LOS PROBLEMAS PUEDEN SURGIR DURANTE EL EMBARAZO Y CAUSAR EL ABORTO DEL FETO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, WEAKNESS, BACK PAIN, CHILLS, URINARY TRACT INFECTION (UTI), MALAISE, FATIGUE, AND WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DEBILIDAD, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, MALESTAR, FATIGA Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE BRUCELLA BACTERIA, OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE INGESTION OF CONTAMINATED UNPASTEURIZED DAIRY PRODUCTS. THIS RESONANCE NEUTRALIZES PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DIAPHRAGM AND THE KIDNEY ON THE SAME SIDE TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC SPREAD THROUGH THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM. THE PATHOGEN IMPACTS THE SPLEEN, LIVER, AND DIGESTIVE TRACT, FREQUENTLY CAUSING CHRONIC ARTHRITIS THAT AFFECTS THE JOINTS AND THE SPINE. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE BACTERIAL LOAD SUSTAINING RECURRING FEVERS AND MUSCULOSKELETAL PAIN.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA BRUCELLA, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDA POR LA INGESTI\\u00d3N DE PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS NO PASTEURIZADOS. ESTA RESONANCIA NEUTRALIZA LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL DIAFRAGMA Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL MISMO LADO PARA ABORDAR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO. EL PAT\\u00d3GENO IMPACTA EL BAZO, EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, CAUSANDO CON FRECUENCIA ARTRITIS CR\\u00d3NICA QUE AFECTA LAS ARTICULACIONES Y LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA QUE MANTIENE LAS FIEBRES RECURRENTES Y EL DOLOR MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PREGNANCY CHECK: BRUCELLOSIS IS HIGHLY CRITICAL DURING PREGNANCY AS IT CAN LEAD TO GESTATIONAL COMPLICATIONS OR FETAL LOSS; IMMEDIATE NEUTRALIZATION IS MANDATORY IF SUSPECTED. FOR CHRONIC BACK PAIN LINKED TO BACTERIAL LOADS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DELTOID \\/ DELTOID (REF 191) AXIS TO RULE OUT CO-INFECTION WITH TREPONEMA PALLIDUM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE EMBARAZO: LA BRUCELOSIS ES ALTAMENTE CR\\u00cdTICA DURANTE EL EMBARAZO, YA QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR COMPLICACIONES GESTACIONALES O LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL FETO; LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N INMEDIATA ES OBLIGATORIA SI SE SOSPECHA. PARA EL DOLOR DE ESPALDA CR\\u00d3NICO VINCULADO A CARGAS BACTERIANAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES (REF 191) PARA DESCARTAR UNA COINFECCI\\u00d3N CON TREPONEMA PALLIDUM.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/203','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:40:13','2026-04-27 12:40:13'),(4003,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',204,'{\"symptoms\":\"ACID REFLUX AND LACTOSE INTOLERANT. (REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO E INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY PETS. (TRANSMITIDO POR MASCOTAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACID REFLUX, LACTOSE INTOLERANCE, ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, BLOATING, WATERY DIARRHEA, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO, INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA, CALAMBRES ABDOMINALES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, DIARREA ACUOSA Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE GIARDIA LAMBLIA PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE LEFT DIAPHRAGMATIC HIATUS. THIS PATHOGEN IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED BY PETS OR THROUGH CONTAMINATED WATER AND FOOD. ONCE INGESTED, THE PARASITE SETTLES IN THE SMALL INTESTINE, OFTEN INTERFERING WITH THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO ABSORB FATS AND CARBOHYDRATES, WHICH LEADS TO SYMPTOMS FREQUENTLY MISDIAGNOSED AS SIMPLE FOOD INTOLERANCES. BY STABILIZING THIS ENERGETIC POINT, THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE PARASITE, REDUCING GASTRIC REFLUX AND RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE DIGESTIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO GIARDIA LAMBLIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL HIATO DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICO IZQUIERDO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE POR MASCOTAS O A TRAV\\u00c9S DE AGUA Y ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS. UNA VEZ INGERIDO, EL PAR\\u00c1SITO SE ASENTA EN EL INTESTINO DELGADO, INTERFIRIENDO A MENUDO CON LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA ABSORBER GRASAS Y CARBOHIDRATOS, LO QUE CONDUCE A S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE FRECUENTEMENTE SE DIAGNOSTICAN ERR\\u00d3NEAMENTE COMO SIMPLES INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE PUNTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR EL PAR\\u00c1SITO, REDUCIENDO EL REFLUJO G\\u00c1STRICO Y RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DEL PROCESO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CROSS-CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL PAIN IS ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE NAUSEA, SCAN THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ TAIL OF PANCREAS (REF 201) TO RULE OUT ANISAKIS. FOR CASES OF PERSISTENT GAS AND BLOATING AFTER TREATMENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ KIDNEY (L) (REF 197) TO ENSURE PASTEURELLA BACTERIA IS NOT CONTRIBUTING TO THE INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI EL DOLOR ABDOMINAL SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE N\\u00c1USEAS SEVERAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS (REF 201) PARA DESCARTAR ANISAKIS. PARA CASOS DE GASES Y HINCHAZ\\u00d3N PERSISTENTES DESPU\\u00c9S DEL TRATAMIENTO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) (REF 197) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA BACTERIA PASTEURELLA NO EST\\u00c9 CONTRIBUYENDO A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/204','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:41:17','2026-04-27 12:41:17'),(4004,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',205,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEMATOLOGIC DISORDER, ANEMIA, HEART DISEASE, SEPTIC PERICARDITIS, KIDNEY FAILURE, LIVER FAILURE. (TRASTORNO HEMATOL\\u00d3GICO, ANEMIA, ENFERMEDAD CARD\\u00cdACA, PERICARDITIS S\\u00c9PTICA, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, INSUFICIENCIA HEP\\u00c1TICA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY INSECT BITES. TRUE DIABETES. (TRANSMITIDO POR PICADURAS DE INSECTOS. DIABETES VERDADERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEMATOLOGIC DISORDER, ANEMIA, HEART DISEASE, SEPTIC PERICARDITIS, KIDNEY FAILURE, AND LIVER FAILURE.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO HEMATOL\\u00d3GICO, ANEMIA, ENFERMEDAD CARD\\u00cdACA, PERICARDITIS S\\u00c9PTICA, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL E INSUFICIENCIA HEP\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRYPANOSOMA CRUZI PARASITE, WHICH IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY INSECT BITES (SUCH AS THE TRIATOMINE OR \\\"KISSING BUG\\\"). THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC DISTORTIONS ALONG THE DIAPHRAGMATIC RIM USING A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. IT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING \\\"TRUE DIABETES\\\" WHEN THE PATHOGEN IMPACTS INSULIN PRODUCTION OR GLUCOSE METABOLISM. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET PROTECTS VITAL ORGANS FROM PARASITIC INFILTRATION, HELPING TO PREVENT SEVERE CARDIOVASCULAR COMPLICATIONS AND SYSTEMIC ORGAN FAILURE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO TRYPANOSOMA CRUZI, TRANSMITIDO T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR PICADURAS DE INSECTOS. ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LAS DISTORSIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS A LO LARGO DEL BORDE DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICO UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. ES CRUCIAL PARA EL MANEJO DE LA \\\"DIABETES VERDADERA\\\" CUANDO EL PAT\\u00d3GENO AFECTA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA O EL METABOLISMO DE LA GLUCOSA. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO PROTEGE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES DE LA INFILTRACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA, AYUDANDO A PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES CARDIOVASCULARES GRAVES E INSUFICIENCIA ORG\\u00c1NICA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIAC CHECK: IF HEART PALPITATIONS OR PERICARDITIS SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT DIRECT VIRAL OR BACTERIAL STRAIN ON THE HEART. FOR PATIENTS WITH DIABETIC SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE GLANDULAR FUNCTION IS FULLY SUPPORTED. ALWAYS SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO MONITOR FILTRATION DURING PARASITIC CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA: SI SE PRESENTAN PALPITACIONES O S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE PERICARDITIS, ESCANEAR EL EJE PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO PARA DESCARTAR TENSI\\u00d3N VIRAL O BACTERIANA DIRECTA EN EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. PARA PACIENTES CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS DIAB\\u00c9TICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE APOYADA. SIEMPRE ESCANEAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA MONITOREAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/205','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:42:28','2026-04-27 12:42:28'),(4005,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',206,'{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROENTERITIS, ITCHY ANUS, RESPIRATORY SYNDROME. (GASTROENTERITIS, ANO CON PICAZ\\u00d3N, S\\u00cdNDROME RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROENTERITIS, ITCHY ANUS, RESPIRATORY SYNDROME, DIARRHEA, AND ABDOMINAL CRAMPS.\\n\\n(GASTROENTERITIS, ANO CON PICAZ\\u00d3N, S\\u00cdNDROME RESPIRATORIO, DIARREA Y C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NORWALK VIRUS (NOROVIRUS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE THORACOLUMBAR JUNCTION, SPECIFICALLY BETWEEN THE TWELFTH DORSAL VERTEBRA AND THE FIRST LUMBAR VERTEBRA. THIS VIRUS IS A LEADING CAUSE OF ACUTE GASTROENTERITIS AND IS HIGHLY CONTAGIOUS, OFTEN SPREADING THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER. THE RESONANCE WORKS TO STABILIZE THE ENERGETIC FLOW AT THIS CRITICAL SPINAL JUNCTION, WHICH OVERSEES THE NERVE SUPPLY TO THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT. BY CLEARING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS ALLEVIATE INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION AND PREVENTS THE VIRUS FROM TRIGGERING SECONDARY RESPIRATORY DISTRESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE NORWALK (NOROVIRUS) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA UNI\\u00d3N TORACOLUMBAR, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE ENTRE LA DUOD\\u00c9CIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL Y LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR. ESTE VIRUS ES UNA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE GASTROENTERITIS AGUDA Y ES ALTAMENTE CONTAGIOSO, PROPAG\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS O AGUA CONTAMINADOS. LA RESONANCIA TRABAJA PARA ESTABILIZAR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN ESTA UNI\\u00d3N ESPINAL CR\\u00cdTICA, QUE SUPERVISA EL SUMINISTRO NERVIOSO AL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR. AL LIMPIAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ALIVIAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y EVITA QUE EL VIRUS DESENCADENE MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO SECUNDARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF ANAL ITCHING OR INTESTINAL DISTENSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ DESCENDING COLON (VERTICAL) (REF 196) TO RULE OUT ENTEROBACTER CLOACAE. FOR SYMPTOMS PRESENTING WITH SEVERE JOINT PAIN ALONGSIDE GASTROENTERITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DESCENDING COLON \\/ ANUS (REF 194) TO ENSURE NO VIRAL SYNERGY WITH CHIKUNGUNYA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI PERSISTE EL PICOR ANAL O LA DISTENSI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE (VERTICAL) (REF 196) PARA DESCARTAR ENTEROBACTER CLOACAE. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE SE PRESENTEN CON DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO JUNTO CON GASTROENTERITIS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ ANO (REF 194) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA SINERGIA VIRAL CON EL CHIKUNGUNYA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/206','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:43:33','2026-04-27 12:43:33'),(4006,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',207,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AFTOSE FEVER (FIEBRE AFTOSA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT CAN BE LINKED TO RECURRING FEVERS, SKIN RASHES, VESICLES IN THE MOUTH OR ON THE HANDS AND FEET, AND GENERALIZED FATIGUE.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A FIEBRES RECURRENTES, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, VES\\u00cdCULAS EN LA BOCA O EN LAS MANOS Y PIES, Y FATIGA GENERALIZADA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE FOOT-AND-MOUTH DISEASE (AFTOSE FEVER) VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE FOURTH DORSAL VERTEBRA USING A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. AS A RESERVOIR, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR IDENTIFYING VIRAL LOADS THAT REMAIN LATENT IN THE BODY, OFTEN EVADING DETECTION WHILE CAUSING PERIODIC OUTBREAKS OF SMALL, PAINFUL SORES OR BLISTERS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ELIMINATES THE HIDDEN NIDUS OF THE VIRUS, PREVENTING IT FROM RE-EMERGING AND COMPROMISING THE RECOVERY OF THE MUCOSAL AND EPITHELIAL TISSUES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA FIEBRE AFTOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA CUARTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. COMO RESERVORIO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA IDENTIFICAR CARGAS VIRALES QUE PERMANECEN LATENTES EN EL CUERPO, A MENUDO EVADIENDO LA DETECCI\\u00d3N MIENTRAS CAUSAN BROTES PERI\\u00d3DICOS DE PEQUE\\u00d1AS LLAGAS DOLOROSAS O AMPOLLAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO ELIMINA EL NIDO OCULTO DEL VIRUS, EVITANDO QUE REAPAREZCA Y COMPROMETA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS MUCOSOS Y EPITELIALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MUCOSAL CHECK: IF MOUTH SORES OR BLISTERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [COMMISSURE \\/ COMMISSURE] AXIS TO RULE OUT HERPES VIRUS. FOR SYSTEMIC FEVERS THAT DO NOT CLEAR, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) TO RULE OUT NORWALK VIRUS SYNERGY. ALWAYS CHECK THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE VITAL FILTRATION DURING THE VIRAL CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE MUCOSAS: SI LAS LLAGAS O AMPOLLAS EN LA BOCA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE COMISURA \\/ COMISURA PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DEL HERPES. PARA FIEBRES SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE NO SE ELIMINAN, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) PARA DESCARTAR LA SINERGIA CON EL VIRUS DE NORWALK. SIEMPRE REVISAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N VITAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/207','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:44:46','2026-04-27 12:44:46'),(4007,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',208,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SPINAL NERVE ROOT DISORDER. (TRASTORNO DE LA RA\\u00cdZ DEL NERVIO ESPINAL)\",\"paths\":\"WHEN MORE THAN ONE SPINAL NERVE IS DAMAGED OR AFFECTED. (CUANDO M\\u00c1S DE UN NERVIO ESPINAL EST\\u00c1 DA\\u00d1ADO O AFECTADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPINAL NERVE ROOT (RA\\u00cdZ DEL NERVIO ESPINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SPINAL NERVE ROOT DISORDER, BACK PAIN, RADIATING PAIN TO THE RIBS OR LIMBS, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, AND SENSORY CHANGES ALONG THE THORACIC SPINE.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO DE LA RA\\u00cdZ DEL NERVIO ESPINAL, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, DOLOR IRRADIADO A LAS COSTILLAS O EXTREMIDADES, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR Y CAMBIOS SENSORIALES A LO LARGO DE LA COLUMNA DORSAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS APPLIED WHEN MORE THAN ONE SPINAL NERVE IN THE THORACIC REGION IS DAMAGED OR AFFECTED. BY PLACING MAGNETS ALONG THE ENTIRE DORSAL TRACK (FROM D1 TO D12), THIS RESET WORKS TO NEUTRALIZE ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES AND PH DISTORTIONS THAT COMPROMISE NERVE CONDUCTIVITY. IT IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING MULTIPLE NERVE COMPRESSIONS OR INFLAMMATION THAT IMPACTS THE CORRESPONDING DERMATOMES, HELPING TO RESTORE THE INTEGRITY OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM\\u2019S COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE SPINE AND THE VITAL ORGANS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE APLICA CUANDO M\\u00c1S DE UN NERVIO ESPINAL EN LA REGI\\u00d3N TOR\\u00c1CICA EST\\u00c1 DA\\u00d1ADO O AFECTADO. AL COLOCAR IMANES A LO LARGO DE TODO EL TRACTO DORSAL (DE D1 A D12), ESTE REINICIO TRABAJA PARA NEUTRALIZAR LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS Y LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH QUE COMPROMETEN LA CONDUCTIVIDAD NERVIOSA. ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR COMPRESIONES NERVIOSAS M\\u00daLTIPLES O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N QUE AFECTA LOS DERMATOMAS CORRESPONDIENTES, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO ENTRE LA COLUMNA Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NERVE CROSS-CHECK: IF PAIN RADIATES SPECIFICALLY TO THE LOWER BACK OR DIGESTIVE SYSTEM, SCAN THE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) AXIS. FOR CHRONIC BACK PAIN THAT MAY HAVE A VIRAL ORIGIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 4 \\/ DORSAL 4 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 207) TO RULE OUT LATENT RESERVOIRS. ALWAYS ENSURE THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS IS STABILIZED TO REDUCE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA: SI EL DOLOR SE IRRADIA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE A LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA O AL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206). PARA EL DOLOR DE ESPALDA CR\\u00d3NICO QUE PUEDA TENER UN ORIGEN VIRAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 4 \\/ DORSAL 4 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 207) PARA DESCARTAR RESERVORIOS LATENTES. SIEMPRE ASEGURAR QUE EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9 ESTABILIZADO PARA REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/208','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:46:01','2026-04-27 12:46:01'),(4008,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',209,'{\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES (CONVULSIONES)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - NECK (VERIFICAR - CUELLO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES (CONVULSIONES), DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, BLOATING, FATIGUE, AND ANAL ITCHING.\\n\\n(CONVULSIONES, DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, FATIGA Y PICAZ\\u00d3N ANAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE FIRST DORSAL VERTEBRA USING A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. ALTHOUGH OFTEN FOUND IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, THIS PATHOGEN CAN RELEASE TOXINS THAT IMPACT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, POTENTIALLY TRIGGERING CONVULSIVE EPISODES OR SEIZURES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS AT THE BASE OF THE NECK AND TOP OF THE THORACIC SPINE, THE RESET HELPS DISRUPT THE PARASITE\'S ENERGETIC NIDUS, REDUCING BOTH GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS AND NEUROLOGICAL HYPER-EXCITABILITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. AUNQUE A MENUDO SE ENCUENTRA EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE LIBERAR TOXINAS QUE AFECTAN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DESENCADENANDO POTENCIALMENTE EPISODIOS CONVULSIVOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE EN LA BASE DEL CUELLO Y LA PARTE SUPERIOR DE LA COLUMNA TOR\\u00c1CICA, EL REINICIO AYUDA A INTERRUMPIR EL NIDO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO, REDUCIENDO TANTO EL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL COMO LA HIPEREXCITABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CERVICAL CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS OR SEIZURES PERSIST, SCAN THE NECK REGION (CERVICAL VERTEBRAE) TO RULE OUT ADDITIONAL NERVE COMPRESSION OR PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE. FOR PERSISTENT DIARRHEA OR ANAL ITCHING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) TO ENSURE NO VIRAL SYNERGY WITH NORWALK.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CERVICAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O LAS CONVULSIONES, ESCANEAR LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CUELLO (V\\u00c9RTEBRAS CERVICALES) PARA DESCARTAR COMPRESI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA ADICIONAL O INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA. PARA DIARREA PERSISTENTE O PICAZ\\u00d3N ANAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA SINERGIA VIRAL CON EL NORWALK.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/209','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:47:13','2026-04-27 12:47:13'),(4009,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',210,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AFFECTS ONES, LIVING IN LONG TERM HEALTHCARE SETTINGS AND ONES WITH COMPROMISED IMMUNE SYSTEMS. FERMENTS GLUCOSE, SUROSE, AND AMYGDALIN, BUT IS NOT CAPABLE TO FERMENT LACTOSE OR MANNITOL. (AFECTA A PERSONAS QUE VIVEN EN ENTORNOS DE ATENCI\\u00d3N M\\u00c9DICA A LARGO PLAZO Y A PERSONAS CON SISTEMAS INMUNOL\\u00d3GICOS COMPROMETIDOS. FERMENTA GLUCOSA, SACAROSA Y AMIGDALINA, PERO NO ES CAPAZ DE FERMENTAR LACTOSA NI MANITOL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI), KIDNEY STONES, BURNING DURING URINATION, ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION IN COMPROMISED IMMUNE SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO (ITU), C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, ARDOR AL ORINAR, MALESTAR ABDOMINAL E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA EN SISTEMAS INMUNOL\\u00d3GICOS COMPROMETIDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PROTEUS VULGARIS, A BACTERIUM FREQUENTLY ENCOUNTERED IN LONG-TERM HEALTHCARE SETTINGS, BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE FIRST DORSAL VERTEBRA USING A VERTICAL POLARITY ALIGNMENT. THIS PATHOGEN IS KNOWN FOR ITS ABILITY TO FERMENT GLUCOSE AND SUCROSE, OFTEN LEADING TO AN INCREASE IN URINARY ALKALINITY WHICH CAN PRECIPITATE THE FORMATION OF KIDNEY STONES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIA\'S METABOLIC ENVIRONMENT, SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S NATURAL FILTRATION PROCESSES AND REDUCING THE RISK OF PERSISTENT RENAL OR URINARY INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA PROTEUS VULGARIS, QUE SE ENCUENTRA CON FRECUENCIA EN ENTORNOS DE ATENCI\\u00d3N M\\u00c9DICA A LARGO PLAZO, MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N DE POLARIDAD VERTICAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES CONOCIDO POR SU CAPACIDAD PARA FERMENTAR GLUCOSA Y SACAROSA, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A UN AUMENTO DE LA ALCALINIDAD URINARIA QUE PUEDE PRECIPITAR LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL AMBIENTE METAB\\u00d3LICO DE LA BACTERIA, APOYANDO LOS PROCESOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N NATURAL DEL CUERPO Y REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE INFECCIONES RENALES O URINARIAS PERSISTENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RENAL CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS PERSIST OR KIDNEY STONES ARE SUSPECTED, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PRIMARY FILTRATION ORGANS ARE BALANCED. FOR NEUROLOGICAL OR CONVULSIVE SYMPTOMS LINKED TO THIS AREA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 209) TO RULE OUT BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RENAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS O SE SOSPECHA DE C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, ESCANEAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N PRIMARIOS EST\\u00c9N EQUILIBRADOS. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O CONVULSIVOS VINCULADOS A ESTA \\u00c1REA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 209) PARA DESCARTAR BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/210','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:48:21','2026-04-27 12:48:21'),(4010,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',211,'{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, SINUSITIS, RHINITIS, PHARYNGITIS. (NEUMON\\u00cdA, SINUSITIS, RINITIS, FARINGITIS)\",\"paths\":\"PRODUCES NASAL HEMORRHAGE. COLD AND FLU. (PRODUCE HEMORRAGIA NASAL. RESFRIADO Y GRIPE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, SINUSITIS, RHINITIS, PHARYNGITIS, FLU-LIKE SYMPTOMS, AND NASAL HEMORRHAGE (NOSEBLEEDS).\\n\\n(NEUMON\\u00cdA, SINUSITIS, RINITIS, FARINGITIS, S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GRIPE Y HEMORRAGIA NASAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE TENTH DORSAL VERTEBRA. THIS BACTERIA PRIMARILY IMPACTS THE RESPIRATORY TRACT AND IS A COMMON CAUSE OF SECONDARY INFECTIONS FOLLOWING A VIRAL COLD OR FLU. THE RESONANCE AT THIS SPINAL LEVEL HELPS RESOLVE INFLAMMATION IN THE MUCOSAL MEMBRANES OF THE NOSE AND THROAT, ADDRESSING THE ROOT CAUSE OF SPONTANEOUS NASAL HEMORRHAGES AND PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM DESCENDING INTO THE LUNGS TO CAUSE MORE SEVERE COMPLICATIONS LIKE PNEUMONIA.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA D\\u00c9CIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. ESTA BACTERIA IMPACTA PRINCIPALMENTE EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO Y ES UNA CAUSA COM\\u00daN DE INFECCIONES SECUNDARIAS DESPU\\u00c9S DE UN RESFRIADO O GRIPE VIRAL. LA RESONANCIA EN ESTE NIVEL ESPINAL AYUDA A RESOLVER LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS DE LA NARIZ Y LA GARGANTA, ABORDANDO LA CAUSA RA\\u00cdZ DE LAS HEMORRAGIAS NASALES ESPONT\\u00c1NEAS Y EVITANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO DESCIENDA HACIA LOS PULMONES PARA CAUSAR COMPLICACIONES M\\u00c1S GRAVES COMO LA NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF THROAT INFLAMMATION IS SEVERE, SCAN THE VOCAL CORD \\/ VOCAL CORD (REF 864) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL HYPERTROPHY. FOR PERSISTENT SINUSITIS OR NASAL CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 4 \\/ DORSAL 4 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 207) TO RULE OUT LATENT VIRAL RESERVOIRS THAT MAY BE WEAKENING THE MUCOSA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA GARGANTA ES SEVERA, ESCANEAR EL EJE CUERDA VOCAL \\/ CUERDA VOCAL (REF 864) PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE HIPERTROFIA. PARA SINUSITIS O CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 4 \\/ DORSAL 4 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 207) PARA DESCARTAR RESERVORIOS VIRALES LATENTES QUE PUEDAN ESTAR DEBILITANDO LA MUCOSA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/211','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:49:21','2026-04-27 12:49:21'),(4011,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',212,'{\"symptoms\":\"STREP THROAT, SCARLET FEVER, PNEUMONIA, MENINGITIS, INSOMNIA. (FARINGITIS ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICA, ESCARLATINA, NEUMON\\u00cdA, MENINGITIS, INSOMNIO)\",\"paths\":\"JOINT DISORDERS. ABORTION, AND ABDOMINAL DISTENTION IN MEN. (TRASTORNOS ARTICULARES. ABORTO Y DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL EN HOMBRES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"STREP THROAT, SCARLET FEVER, PNEUMONIA, MENINGITIS, AND INSOMNIA.\\n\\n(FARINGITIS ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICA, ESCARLATINA, NEUMON\\u00cdA, MENINGITIS E INSOMNIO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS BETA HAEMOLYTIC STREPTOCOCCUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE ELEVENTH DORSAL VERTEBRA. THIS PAIR OFTEN FUNCTIONS AS A RESERVOIR, HARBORING BACTERIA THAT CAN TRIGGER SYSTEMIC ISSUES SUCH AS JOINT DISORDERS OR ABDOMINAL DISTENTION (SPECIFICALLY IN MEN). IN CRITICAL CASES, THIS PATHOGEN IS ASSOCIATED WITH PREGNANCY COMPLICATIONS, INCLUDING ABORTION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE BACTERIAL LOAD THAT CONTRIBUTES TO CHRONIC INFLAMMATION IN THE JOINTS AND THE RESPIRATORY TRACT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO BETA HEMOL\\u00cdTICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA UND\\u00c9CIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. ESTE PAR A MENUDO FUNCIONA COMO UN RESERVORIO, ALBERGANDO BACTERIAS QUE PUEDEN DESENCADENAR PROBLEMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMO TRASTORNOS ARTICULARES O DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL (ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE EN HOMBRES). EN CASOS CR\\u00cdTICOS, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE ASOCIA CON COMPLICACIONES DEL EMBARAZO, INCLUIDO EL ABORTO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA QUE CONTRIBUYE A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA EN LAS ARTICULACIONES Y EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT AND ABDOMINAL CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL DISTENTION OR JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE DORSAL 10 \\/ DORSAL 10 (REF 211) TO RULE OUT HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE SYNERGY. FOR NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS OR INSOMNIA LINKED TO THIS AREA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 209) TO ENSURE NO PARASITIC INTERFERENCE FROM BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y ABDOMINAL: SI PERSISTE LA DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL O EL DOLOR ARTICULAR, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 10 \\/ DORSAL 10 (REF 211) PARA DESCARTAR LA SINERGIA CON HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O INSOMNIO VINCULADOS A ESTA \\u00c1REA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 209) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA DE BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/212','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:50:58','2026-04-27 12:50:58'),(4012,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',213,'{\"symptoms\":\"EAR INFECTIONS AND PNEUMONIA. (INFECCIONES DE O\\u00cdDO Y NEUMON\\u00cdA)\",\"paths\":\"FIRST IS DETECTED IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. SECRETION FROM THE LUNGS THAT PASSES THE PELVIS CAVITY AND BECOMES PNEUMONIA. (PRIMERO SE DETECTA EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. SECRECI\\u00d3N DE LOS PULMONES QUE PASA A LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA Y SE CONVIERTE EN NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EAR INFECTIONS (OTITIS), PNEUMONIA, COUGH, FEVER, AND CHEST DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DE O\\u00cdDO, NEUMON\\u00cdA, TOS, FIEBRE Y MALESTAR EN EL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE STREPTOCOCCUS PNEUMONIAE BACTERIA by NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE TWELFTH DORSAL VERTEBRA. WHILE COMMONLY ASSOCIATED WITH RESPIRATORY ISSUES, THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN FIRST DETECTED IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. THE RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHWAY WHERE SECRETIONS FROM THE LUNGS PASS TOWARD THE PELVIC CAVITY, WHICH CAN LEAD TO SYSTEMIC SPREAD OR THE DEVELOPMENT OF FULL-SCALE PNEUMONIA. BY STABILIZING THIS JUNCTION, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION IN BOTH THE GASTROINTESTINAL AND RESPIRATORY SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA STREPTOCOCCUS PNEUMONIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA DUOD\\u00c9CIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. AUNQUE SE ASOCIA COM\\u00daNMENTE CON PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO A MENUDO SE DETECTA PRIMERO EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. LA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA V\\u00cdA DONDE LAS SECRECIONES DE LOS PULMONES PASAN HACIA LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA, LO QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A UNA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA O AL DESARROLLO DE UNA NEUMON\\u00cdA COMPLETA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA UNI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA TANTO EN EL SISTEMA GASTROINTESTINAL COMO EN EL RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CO-FACTOR CHECK: IF GASTROINTESTINAL SYMPTOMS ARE SEVERE, SCAN THE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) AXIS TO RULE OUT NORWALK VIRUS SYNERGY. FOR PERSISTENT EAR PAIN OR OTITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CRANIAL \\/ CRANIAL] RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION IS FULLY CLEARED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE COFACTORES VIRALES: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES SON SEVEROS, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) PARA DESCARTAR LA SINERGIA CON EL VIRUS DE NORWALK. PARA DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO PERSISTENTE O OTITIS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CRANEAL \\/ CRANEAL PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA SE ELIMINE POR COMPLETO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/213','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:52:05','2026-04-27 12:52:05'),(4013,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',214,'{\"symptoms\":\"BRONCHI AND LUNG ABSCESS. (BRONQUIOS Y ABSCESO PULMONAR)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED THROUGH AIR-CONDITIONING. LOWERS ONES WHITE BLOOD CELL COUNT. COMPRESSES THE SPINAL CORD. PARALYSIS. (TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL AIRE ACONDICIONADO. DISMINUYE EL RECUENTO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS. COMPRIME LA M\\u00c9DULA ESPINAL. PAR\\u00c1LISIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BRONCHI AND LUNG ABSCESS, COUGH, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, FEVER, AND MUSCLE ACHES.\\n\\n(BRONQUIOS Y ABSCESO PULMONAR, TOS, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, FIEBRE Y DOLORES MUSCULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE LEGIONELLA BACTERIA, WHICH IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED AIR-CONDITIONING SYSTEMS, MISTING MACHINES, OR WATER COOLING TOWERS. THIS RESONANCE NEUTRALIZES PH DISTORTIONS AT THE SECOND DORSAL VERTEBRA. THE PATHOGEN IS KNOWN TO LOWER THE WHITE BLOOD CELL COUNT, WEAKENING THE IMMUNE RESPONSE. IN SEVERE CASES, THE INFLAMMATION CAN COMPRESS THE SPINAL CORD, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO PARALYSIS OR SIGNIFICANT NEUROLOGICAL IMPAIRMENT. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS BACTERIAL COLONIZATION IN THE RESPIRATORY TRACT AND PROTECTS THE INTEGRITY OF THE SPINAL COLUMN.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA LEGIONELLA, QUE SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE SISTEMAS DE AIRE ACONDICIONADO, M\\u00c1QUINAS DE NEBULIZACI\\u00d3N O TORRES DE ENFRIAMIENTO DE AGUA CONTAMINADOS. ESTA RESONANCIA NEUTRALIZA LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA SEGUNDA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. SE SABE QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO DISMINUYE EL RECUENTO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, DEBILITANDO LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. EN CASOS GRAVES, LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PUEDE COMPRIMIR LA M\\u00c9DULA ESPINAL, LO QUE PODR\\u00cdA PROVOCAR PAR\\u00c1LISIS O UN DETERIORO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO SIGNIFICATIVO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO Y PROTEGE LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE SYSTEM CHECK: SINCE LEGIONELLA LOWERS WHITE BLOOD CELLS, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO SUPPORT IMMUNE CELL PRODUCTION. FOR PERSISTENT LUNG ISSUES OR ABSCESSES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 10 \\/ DORSAL 10 (REF 211) TO RULE OUT HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE. ALWAYS CHECK THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO MONITOR FILTRATION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO: DADO QUE LA LEGIONELLA DISMINUYE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE BAZO \\/ BAZO PARA APOYAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS INMUNITARIAS. PARA PROBLEMAS PULMONARES O ABSCESOS PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 10 \\/ DORSAL 10 (REF 211) PARA DESCARTAR HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE. SIEMPRE REVISAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA MONITOREAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/214','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:53:11','2026-04-27 12:53:11'),(4014,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',215,'{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, RESPIRATORY FAILURE, PHLEGM, COUCH, SORE THROAT, RUNNY NOSE, RHINITIS, OTITIS, FATIGUE, FEVER, HEADACHE, MUSCLE PAIN, LETHARGY, KIDNEY FAILURE, GASTROINTESTINAL SYMPTOMS, DIARRHEA. (NEUMON\\u00cdA, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA, FLEMA, TOS, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, RINITIS, OTITIS, FATIGA, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, LETARGO, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, S\\u00cdNTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY AIR CONDITIONERS. STIMULATES THE FLU, HERNIATED DISC, HIATAL HERNIA, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. COMMON IN IMMUNOSUPPRESSED PATIENTS, SMOKER AND ALCOHOLICS. (TRANSMITIDO POR ACONDICIONADORES DE AIRE. ESTIMULA LA GRIPE, HERNIA DISCAL, HERNIA HIATAL, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE. COM\\u00daN EN PACIENTES INMUNOSUPRIMIDOS, FUMADORES Y ALCOH\\u00d3LICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THYMUS\\/CARDIA ASSOCIATED WITH LEPROSY; CAUSES MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (VERIFICAR - TIMO\\/CARDIA. ASOCIADO CON LEPRA; CAUSA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, RESPIRATORY FAILURE, PHLEGM, COUGH, SORE THROAT, RUNNY NOSE, RHINITIS, OTITIS, FATIGUE, FEVER, HEADACHE, MUSCLE PAIN, LETHARGY, KIDNEY FAILURE, GASTROINTESTINAL SYMPTOMS, AND DIARRHEA.(NEUMON\\u00cdA, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA, FLEMA, TOS, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, RINITIS, OTITIS, FATIGA, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, LETARGO, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, S\\u00cdNTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE LEGIONELLA BACTERIA, COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED AIR CONDITIONING SYSTEMS. THIS RESONANCE NEUTRALIZES PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE SECOND DORSAL VERTEBRA USING A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. THE PATHOGEN CAN STIMULATE SYMPTOMS THAT MIMIC THE FLU, HIATAL HERNIA, OR EVEN MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. IT IS PARTICULARLY COMMON IN IMMUNOSUPPRESSED PATIENTS, SMOKERS, AND ALCOHOLICS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS BACTERIAL COLONIZATION IN THE RESPIRATORY TRACT AND HELPS PREVENT SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS AFFECTING THE KIDNEYS AND NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA LEGIONELLA, TRANSMITIDA COM\\u00daNMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE SISTEMAS DE AIRE ACONDICIONADO CONTAMINADOS. ESTA RESONANCIA NEUTRALIZA LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA SEGUNDA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE ESTIMULAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE IMITAN LA GRIPE, LA HERNIA HIATAL O INCLUSO LA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE. ES PARTICULARMENTE COM\\u00daN EN PACIENTES INMUNOSUPRIMIDOS, FUMADORES Y ALCOH\\u00d3LICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO Y AYUDA A PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE AFECTAN A LOS RI\\u00d1ONES Y AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LEPROSY & SCLEROSIS CHECK: SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ CARDIA] RESONANCE, AS IT IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH LEPROSY AND CAN BE A CONTRIBUTING FACTOR TO MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS SYMPTOMS. FOR PERSISTENT LUNG ABSCESSES OR RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2 (VERTICAL) (REF 214) TO ENSURE FULL CLEARANCE OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LEPRA Y ESCLEROSIS: ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA TIMO \\/ CARDIA, YA QUE A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON LA LEPRA Y PUEDE SER UN FACTOR QUE CONTRIBUYE A LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE. PARA ABSCESOS PULMONARES PERSISTENTES O DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2 (VERTICAL) (REF 214) PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/215','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:54:53','2026-04-27 12:54:53'),(4015,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',216,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FOOT AND MOUTH DISEASE. (ENFERMEDAD DE MANOS, PIES Y BOCA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FOOT AND MOUTH DISEASE (FIEBRE AFTOSA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT CAN BE LINKED TO RECURRING FEVERS, SKIN RASHES, VESICLES IN THE MOUTH OR ON THE HANDS AND FEET, AND GENERALIZED FATIGUE.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A FIEBRES RECURRENTES, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, VES\\u00cdCULAS EN LA BOCA O EN LAS MANOS Y PIES, Y FATIGA GENERALIZADA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE FOOT-AND-MOUTH DISEASE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE THIRD DORSAL VERTEBRA USING A VERTICAL POLARITY ALIGNMENT. SIMILAR TO ITS HORIZONTAL COUNTERPART, THIS RESONANCE OFTEN ACTS AS A RESERVOIR FOR VIRAL LOADS THAT AFFECT THE MUCOSAL MEMBRANES AND SKIN. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS IN THE UPPER THORACIC REGION, THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE VIRAL NIDUS, SUPPORTING THE CLEARANCE OF PERIODIC MOUTH SORES, BLISTERS, AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT COMPROMISES EPITHELIAL HEALTH.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA FIEBRE AFTOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N DE POLARIDAD VERTICAL. AL IGUAL QUE SU HOM\\u00d3LOGO HORIZONTAL, ESTA RESONANCIA A MENUDO ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO PARA CARGAS VIRALES QUE AFECTAN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS Y LA PIEL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE EN LA REGI\\u00d3N TOR\\u00c1CICA SUPERIOR, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR EL NIDO VIRAL, APOYANDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LLAGAS BUCALES PERI\\u00d3DICAS, AMPOLLAS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE COMPROMETE LA SALUD EPITELIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL RESERVOIR CHECK: SCAN THE DORSAL 4 \\/ DORSAL 4 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 207) TO ENSURE NO OTHER LATENT FOOT-AND-MOUTH VIRAL LOADS REMAIN. IF MOUTH SORES ARE PERSISTENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [COMMISSURE \\/ COMMISSURE] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE EFFICIENT TOXIN ELIMINATION DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO VIRAL: ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 4 \\/ DORSAL 4 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 207) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO PERMANEZCAN OTRAS CARGAS VIRALES LATENTES DE FIEBRE AFTOSA. SI LAS LLAGAS EN LA BOCA SON PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE COMISURA \\/ COMISURA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EFICIENTE DE TOXINAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE LIMPIEZA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/216','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:56:04','2026-04-27 12:56:04'),(4016,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',217,'{\"symptoms\":\"INTRACRANIAL BLEEDING, TREMORS. (HEMORRAGIA INTRACRANEAL, TEMBLORES)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM FEATHERS. AFFECTS THE BASA NUCLEI IN THE BRAIN AND THE THYROID. (TRANSMITIDO POR PLUMAS. AFECTA LOS N\\u00daCLEOS BASALES EN EL CEREBRO Y LA TIROIDES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTRACRANIAL BLEEDING, TREMORS, COUGH, FEVER, AND WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(HEMORRAGIA INTRACRANEAL, TEMBLORES, TOS, FIEBRE Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS AVIUM BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE THIRD DORSAL VERTEBRA USING A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH BIRD FEATHERS OR DROPPINGS. ONCE IN THE SYSTEM, IT CAN IMPACT THE BASAL NUCLEI IN THE BRAIN AND THE THYROID GLAND. THE RESONANCE WORKS TO STABILIZE THE UPPER THORACIC SPINE, PREVENTING THE BACTERIA FROM TRIGGERING NEUROLOGICAL DISRUPTIONS SUCH AS TREMORS OR MORE SEVERE VASCULAR COMPLICATIONS LIKE INTRACRANIAL HEMORRHAGE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS AVIUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR EL CONTACTO CON PLUMAS O EXCREMENTOS DE AVES. UNA VEZ EN EL SISTEMA, PUEDE AFECTAR LOS N\\u00daCLEOS BASALES DEL CEREBRO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES. LA RESONANCIA TRABAJA PARA ESTABILIZAR LA COLUMNA TOR\\u00c1CICA SUPERIOR, EVITANDO QUE LA BACTERIA DESENCADENE ALTERACIONES NEUROLOG\\u00cdCAS COMO TEMBLORES O COMPLICACIONES VASCULARES M\\u00c1S GRAVES COMO LA HEMORRAGIA INTRACRANEAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF TREMORS OR SEIZURES ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 209) TO RULE OUT BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS. FOR SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL LOADS AFFECTING THE LUNGS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 215) TO RULE OUT LEGIONELLA. ALWAYS ENSURE THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS IS BALANCED IF METABOLIC OR HORMONE DISRUPTIONS ARE SUSPECTED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI SE PRESENTAN TEMBLORES O CONVULSIONES, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 209) PARA DESCARTAR BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS. PARA CARGAS BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE AFECTEN LOS PULMONES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 215) PARA DESCARTAR LEGIONELLA. SIEMPRE ASEGURAR QUE EL EJE TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO SI SE SOSPECHAN ALTERACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS O HORMONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/217','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:57:13','2026-04-27 12:57:13'),(4017,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',218,'{\"origins\":\"FMD TYPE 2 (FMD TIPO 2)\",\"symptoms\":\"BLISTERS, CANKER SORES, LOSS OF APPETITE. (AMPOLLAS, AFTAS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO,)\",\"paths\":\"ATTACKS YOUNG CHILDREN AND TODDLERS, BUT MAY OCCUR AT ANY AGE. OCCURS MOSTLY SUMMER AND EARLY FALL. MAY CAUSE BIRTH DEFECTS TO UNBORN CHILDREN IF MOTHERS ARE EXPOSED. (ATACA A NI\\u00d1OS PEQUE\\u00d1OS Y BEB\\u00c9S, PERO PUEDE OCURRIR A CUALQUIER EDAD. OCURRE PRINCIPALMENTE EN VERANO Y A PRINCIPIOS DE OTO\\u00d1O. PUEDE CAUSAR DEFECTOS DE NACIMIENTO EN LOS BEB\\u00c9S NO NACIDOS SI LAS MADRES SON EXPUESTAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FOOT AND MOUTH DISEASE TYPE 2 (FIEBRE AFTOSA TIPO 2)\",\"symptoms\":\"BLISTERS, CANKER SORES, LOSS OF APPETITE, AND POTENTIAL BIRTH DEFECTS IN UNBORN CHILDREN IF MOTHERS ARE EXPOSED.\\n\\n(AMPOLLAS, AFTAS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO Y POSIBLES DEFECTOS DE NACIMIENTO EN NI\\u00d1OS NO NACIDOS SI LAS MADRES EST\\u00c1N EXPUESTAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE FOOT-AND-MOUTH DISEASE (FMD) TYPE 2 VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THIRD AND SEVENTH DORSAL VERTEBRAE. THIS SPECIFIC STRAIN PRIMARILY ATTACKS YOUNG CHILDREN AND TODDLERS, THOUGH IT CAN OCCUR AT ANY AGE, WITH PEAK TRANSMISSION OFTEN OCCURRING IN THE SUMMER AND EARLY FALL. BY STABILIZING THIS SPINAL SEGMENT, THE RESET INTERRUPTS THE VIRAL REPLICATION THAT CAUSES PAINFUL ORAL LESIONS AND SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS, PROTECTING THE MUCOSA AND PREVENTING THE VIRUS FROM IMPACTING GESTATIONAL DEVELOPMENT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA FIEBRE AFTOSA TIPO 2 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA TERCERA Y LA S\\u00c9PTIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. ESTA CEPA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA ATACA PRINCIPALMENTE A NI\\u00d1OS PEQUE\\u00d1OS Y BEB\\u00c9S, AUNQUE PUEDE OCURRIR A CUALQUIER EDAD, CON UN PICO DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N QUE SUELE DARSE EN VERANO Y PRINCIPIOS DE OTO\\u00d1O. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE SEGMENTO ESPINAL, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL QUE CAUSA LESIONES ORALES DOLOROSAS Y DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA, PROTEGIENDO LA MUCOSA Y EVITANDO QUE EL VIRUS AFECTE EL DESARROLLO GESTACIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ORAL PATHOLOGY CHECK: IF CANKER SORES OR BLISTERS PERSIST IN THE MOUTH, SCAN THE COMMISSURE \\/ COMMISSURE (REF 173) TO RULE OUT HERPES 4. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FEVER OR RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 3 \\/ DORSAL 3 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 217) TO ENSURE NO BACTERIAL SYNERGY WITH MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS AVIUM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PATOLOG\\u00cdA ORAL: SI PERSISTEN LAS AFTAS O AMPOLLAS EN LA BOCA, ESCANEAR EL EJE COMISURA \\/ COMISURA (REF 173) PARA DESCARTAR HERPES 4. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE SEVERA O DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 3 \\/ DORSAL 3 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 217) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA SINERGIA BACTERIANA CON MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS AVIUM.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/218','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:58:34','2026-04-27 12:58:34'),(4018,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',219,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER (FIEBRE)\",\"paths\":\"LOW WHITE CELL COUNT. (RECUENTO BAJO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MOUTH SORES, BLISTERS, AND GENERALIZED MALAISE.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, AFTAS BUCALES, AMPOLLAS Y MALESTAR GENERAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE APHTHOUS VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THIRD AND SEVENTH DORSAL VERTEBRAE. THIS PATHOGEN IS KNOWN TO SIGNIFICANTLY LOWER THE WHITE BLOOD CELL COUNT, WEAKENING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\'S ABILITY TO DEFEND AGAINST SECONDARY INFECTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS THORACIC AXIS, THE RESET HELPS RESTORE THE BODY\'S HEMATOLOGIC BALANCE AND ACCELERATES THE HEALING OF PAINFUL MUCOSAL LESIONS IN THE MOUTH AND THROAT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS AFTOSO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA TERCERA Y LA S\\u00c9PTIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES CONOCIDO POR DISMINUIR SIGNIFICATIVAMENTE EL RECUENTO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, DEBILITANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA DEFENDERSE CONTRA INFECCIONES SECUNDARIAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE TOR\\u00c1CICO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO HEMATOL\\u00d3GICO DEL CUERPO Y ACELERA LA CURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS LESIONES DOLOROSAS DE LAS MUCOSAS EN LA BOCA Y LA GARGANTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE SUPPORT CHECK: SINCE THIS VIRUS IMPACTS WHITE BLOOD CELLS, ALWAYS SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE IMMUNE RESPONSE. IF SINUSITIS SYMPTOMS ACCOMPANY THE FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE NASAL CAVITY \\/ NASAL CAVITY (REF 535) RESONANCE. FOR PERSISTENT ORAL BLISTERS, SCAN THE [COMMISSURE \\/ COMMISSURE] AXIS TO RULE OUT HERPES VIRUS SYNERGY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE SOPORTE INMUNITARIO: DADO QUE ESTE VIRUS AFECTA LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, SIEMPRE ESCANEAR EL EJE BAZO \\/ BAZO PARA REFORZAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE SINUSITIS ACOMPA\\u00d1AN A LA FIEBRE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CAVIDAD NASAL \\/ CAVIDAD NASAL (REF 535). PARA AMPOLLAS ORALES PERSISTENTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE COMISURA \\/ COMISURA PARA DESCARTAR LA SINERGIA CON EL VIRUS DEL HERPES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/219','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 12:59:50','2026-04-27 12:59:50'),(4019,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',220,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER. (TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER (ADD\\/ADHD), DIFFICULTY CONCENTRATING, HYPERACTIVITY, IMPULSIVITY, AND COGNITIVE FATIGUE.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N (TDAH), DIFICULTAD PARA CONCENTRARSE, HIPERACTIVIDAD, IMPULSIVIDAD Y FATIGA COGNITIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE UPPER THORACIC SPINE (DORSAL 3) AND THE BASE OF THE LOWER BACK (LUMBAR 5). THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR BALANCING THE FLOW OF INFORMATION WITHIN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM THAT REGULATES FOCUS AND COGNITIVE CONTROL. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THESE TWO POINTS, THE RESET HELPS TO CALM NEUROLOGICAL HYPER-EXCITABILITY AND IMPROVE THE SYNERGY BETWEEN THE BRAIN\'S COMMAND CENTERS AND THE BODY\'S PHYSICAL RESPONSES, REDUCING THE SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH ATTENTION DISORDERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LA COLUMNA TOR\\u00c1CICA SUPERIOR (DORSAL 3) Y LA BASE DE LA PARTE INFERIOR DE LA ESPALDA (LUMBAR 5). ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO DE INFORMACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL QUE REGULA EL ENFOQUE Y EL CONTROL COGNITIVO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTOS DOS PUNTOS, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA HIPEREXCITABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y MEJORAR LA SINERGIA ENTRE LOS CENTROS DE MANDO DEL CEREBRO Y LAS RESPUESTAS F\\u00cdSICAS DEL CUERPO, REDUCIENDO LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON LOS TRASTORNOS DE LA ATENCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL SCAN: IF HYPERACTIVITY IS ACCOMPANIED BY SEIZURES OR SEVERE TREMORS, SCAN THE DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 209) TO RULE OUT BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS. FOR EMOTIONAL STABILITY CONCERNS LINKED TO FOCUS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SUPERCILLIARY \\/ RACHIDIAN BULB (REF 749) AXIS. ALWAYS CHECK THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT GENERAL SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA HIPERACTIVIDAD SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE CONVULSIONES O TEMBLORES SEVEROS, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 209) PARA DESCARTAR BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS. PARA PROBLEMAS DE ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL VINCULADOS AL ENFOQUE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SUPERCILIAR \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO (REF 749). SIEMPRE REVISAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO GENERAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/220','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:01:15','2026-04-27 13:01:15'),(4020,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',221,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MENINGITIS, SPINA BIFIA. (MENINGITIS, ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, SEVERE HEADACHE, STIFF NECK, NAUSEA, VOMITING, CONFUSION, AND SENSITIVITY TO LIGHT. IN CHRONIC OR CONGENITAL CONTEXTS, IT MAY BE LINKED TO SPINA BIFIDA COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA INTENSO, RIGIDEZ EN EL CUELLO, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, CONFUSI\\u00d3N Y SENSIBILIDAD A LA LUZ. EN CONTEXTOS CR\\u00d3NICOS O CONG\\u00c9NITOS, PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A COMPLICACIONES DE ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FOURTH DORSAL VERTEBRA AND THE FIRST LUMBAR VERTEBRA. THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY DANGEROUS AS IT CAN CAUSE INFLAMMATION OF THE PROTECTIVE MEMBRANES COVERING THE BRAIN AND SPINAL CORD (MENINGITIS). THE RESONANCE WORKS TO STABILIZE THE ENERGETIC FLOW ALONG THE SPINAL COLUMN, PREVENTING THE BACTERIA FROM CROSSING THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER AND CAUSING SYSTEMIC SEPTICEMIA OR SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL DAMAGE. BY CLEARING THIS AXIS, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE INTEGRITY OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA CUARTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL Y LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE PELIGROSO, YA QUE PUEDE CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MEMBRANAS PROTECTORAS QUE RECUBREN EL CEREBRO Y LA M\\u00c9DULA ESPINAL (MENINGITIS). LA RESONANCIA TRABAJA PARA ESTABILIZAR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LO LARGO DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL, EVITANDO QUE LA BACTERIA CRUCE LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA Y CAUSE SEPTICEMIA SIST\\u00c9MICA O DA\\u00d1O NEUROL\\u00d3GICO GRAVE. AL LIMPIAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO APOYA LA INTEGRIDAD DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MENINGEAL CHECK: IF RIGIDITY IN THE NECK IS PRESENT, SCAN THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER VIRAL OR BACTERIAL STRAINS AFFECTING THE CEREBROSPINAL FLUID. FOR CASES PRESENTING WITH SEVERE GASTROENTERITIS SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) TO RULE OUT NORWALK VIRUS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE TOXIN FILTRATION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N MEN\\u00cdNGEA: SI HAY RIGIDEZ EN EL CUELLO, ESCANEAR EL EJE OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CEPAS VIRALES O BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTEN EL L\\u00cdQUIDO CEFALORRAQU\\u00cdDEO. PARA CASOS QUE SE PRESENTEN CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GASTROENTERITIS SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DE NORWALK. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/221','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:31:55','2026-04-27 13:31:55'),(4021,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',222,'{\"symptoms\":\"TRACHEA AND BRONCHIAL DISORDERS. COUGH, DIARRHEA, EDEMA, AUTISM. (TRASTORNOS DE LA TR\\u00c1QUEA Y LOS BRONQUIOS. TOS, DIARREA, EDEMA, AUTISMO)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY DAIRY PRODUCTS AND POSSIBLE THE VACCINE FOR DIPHTHERIA. MENINGITIS, SPINA BIFIA. (TRANSMITIDO POR PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS Y POSIBLEMENTE POR LA VACUNA CONTRA LA DIFTERIA. MENINGITIS, ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"TRACHEA AND BRONCHIAL DISORDERS, COUGH, DIARRHEA, EDEMA, AND SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH AUTISM.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DE LA TR\\u00c1QUEA Y LOS BRONQUIOS, TOS, DIARREA, EDEMA Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON EL AUTISMO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FOURTH DORSAL VERTEBRA AND THE THIRD LUMBAR VERTEBRA. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED DAIRY PRODUCTS OR MAY BE LINKED TO REACTIONS FROM CERTAIN VACCINATIONS. BEYOND ITS ASSOCIATION WITH MENINGITIS AND SPINA BIFIDA, THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL LOAD THAT IMPACTS THE RESPIRATORY TRACT AND DIGESTIVE SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS ALLEVIATE INFLAMMATION IN THE BRONCHI AND SUPPORTS NEUROLOGICAL CLARITY BY REDUCING TOXICITY THAT CAN EXACERBATE COGNITIVE OR BEHAVIORAL SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA CUARTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL Y LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO A MENUDO SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS O PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A REACCIONES DE CIERTAS VACUNACIONES. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE SU ASOCIACI\\u00d3N CON LA MENINGITIS Y LA ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA, ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA CARGA BACTERIANA QUE AFECTA EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO Y EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ALIVIAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LOS BRONQUIOS Y APOYA LA CLARIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA AL REDUCIR LA TOXICIDAD QUE PUEDE EXACERBAR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS COGNITIVOS O CONDUCTUALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & DAIRY CHECK: IF COUGH OR BRONCHIAL DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 215) TO RULE OUT LEGIONELLA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET OR EDEMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE VITAL FILTRATION. IF MENINGEAL RIGIDITY IS SUSPECTED, SCAN THE DORSAL 4 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 221) TO ADDRESS ALTERNATE MENINGOCOCCAL STRAINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y L\\u00c1CTEOS: SI LA TOS O LOS TRASTORNOS BRONQUIALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 215) PARA DESCARTAR LEGIONELLA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SEVERO O EDEMA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N VITAL. SI SE SOSPECHA RIGIDEZ MEN\\u00cdNGEA, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 4 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 221) PARA ABORDAR CEPAS MENINGOC\\u00d3CICAS ALTERNAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/222','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:33:01','2026-04-27 13:33:01'),(4022,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',223,'{\"symptoms\":\"ACUTE RHEUMATISM, BACK PAIN, SCOLIOSIS, SPINA BIFIA, HEADACHES, FEVER, SEIZURES, STIFF NECK VOMITING, COMA, PETACHIAE, SEPTIC. (REUMATISMO AGUDO, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, ESCOLIOSIS, ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, CONVULSIONES, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, V\\u00d3MITO, COMA, PETEQUIAS, S\\u00c9PTICO)\",\"paths\":\"INFECTION IN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND DISORDERS OF THE SPINE. (INFECCI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y TRASTORNOS DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACUTE RHEUMATISM, BACK PAIN, SCOLIOSIS, SPINA BIFIDA, HEADACHES, FEVER, SEIZURES, STIFF NECK, VOMITING, COMA, PETECHIAE, AND SEPTICEMIA.\\n\\n(REUMATISMO AGUDO, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, ESCOLIOSIS, ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, CONVULSIONES, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, V\\u00d3MITO, COMA, PETEQUIAS Y SEPTICEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS (TYPE B) BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FIFTH DORSAL VERTEBRA AND THE SECOND LUMBAR VERTEBRA. THIS PATHOGEN IS A MAJOR CAUSE OF BACTERIAL MENINGITIS AND CAN LEAD TO SEVERE INFECTIONS IN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. THE RESONANCE ADDRESSES DISORDERS OF THE SPINE AND HELP PREVENT THE PROGRESSION OF INFLAMMATION THAT CAN CAUSE PERMANENT NEUROLOGICAL DAMAGE OR SYSTEMIC TOXICITY (SEPTICEMIA). BY STABILIZING THIS SPINAL AXIS, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY\'S DEFENSE AGAINST PATHOGENS THAT THREATEN CEREBROSPINAL INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS (TIPO B) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA QUINTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL Y LA SEGUNDA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES UNA DE LAS PRINCIPALES CAUSAS DE MENINGITIS BACTERIANA Y PUEDE PROVOCAR INFECCIONES GRAVES EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. LA RESONANCIA ABORDA LOS TRASTORNOS DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL Y AYUDA A PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N QUE PUEDE CAUSAR DA\\u00d1O NEUROL\\u00d3GICO PERMANENTE O TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA (SEPTICEMIA). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE ESPINAL, EL REINICIO APOYA LA DEFENSA DEL CUERPO CONTRA LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AMENAZAN LA INTEGRIDAD CEFALORRAQU\\u00cdDEA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/223','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:34:22','2026-04-27 13:34:22'),(4023,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',224,'{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS, SEVERE DIARRHEA, MENINGITIS, PERITONITIS, MASTITIS, SEPSIS, AND PNEUMONIA. (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DIARREA SEVERA, MENINGITIS, PERITONITIS, MASTITIS, SEPSIS Y NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L & M. INTESTINAL INFECTIONS, URINARY SYSTEM INFECTIONS. (HEPATITIS L Y M. INFECCIONES INTESTINALES, INFECCIONES DEL SISTEMA URINARIO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS, SEVERE DIARRHEA, MENINGITIS, PERITONITIS, MASTITIS, SEPSIS, AND PNEUMONIA.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DIARREA SEVERA, MENINGITIS, PERITONITIS, MASTITIS, SEPSIS Y NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS ESCHERICHIA COLI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE FIFTH DORSAL VERTEBRA. WHILE E. COLI IS A COMMON RESIDENT OF THE INTESTINAL TRACT, CERTAIN STRAINS CAN BECOME PATHOGENIC, LEADING TO SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL INFECTIONS OR SPREADING TO THE URINARY SYSTEM. THIS RESONANCE IS ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH HEPATITIS L AND M. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIA\'S ABILITY TO COLONIZE OUTSIDE THE GUT, REDUCING THE RISK OF SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS PERITONITIS OR SEPSIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA ESCHERICHIA COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA QUINTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. SI BIEN LA E. COLI ES UN RESIDENTE COM\\u00daN DEL TRACTO INTESTINAL, CIERTAS CEPAS PUEDEN VOLVERSE PAT\\u00d3GENAS, LO QUE PROVOCA INFECCIONES GASTROINTESTINALES SEVERAS O SE PROPAGA AL SISTEMA URINARIO. ESTA RESONANCIA TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA CON LA HEPATITIS L Y M. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA CAPACIDAD DE LA BACTERIA PARA COLONIZAR FUERA DEL INTESTINO, REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMO PERITONITIS O SEPSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC CHECK: IF LIVER INFLAMMATION OR HEPATITIS SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT DETOXIFICATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIARRHEA OR INTESTINAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) TO RULE OUT NORWALK VIRUS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE THE URINARY SYSTEM IS CLEAR OF ASCENDING INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA: SI HAY INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO O S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE HEPATITIS, ESCANEAR EL EJE H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIARREA SEVERA O MALESTAR INTESTINAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 12 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 206) PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DE NORWALK. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA URINARIO EST\\u00c9 LIBRE DE INFECCIONES ASCENDENTES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/224','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:35:24','2026-04-27 13:35:24'),(4024,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',225,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VALLEY FEVER (FIEBRE DEL VALLE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VALLEY FEVER (FIEBRE DEL VALLE), COUGH, FEVER, CHEST PAIN, HEADACHE, FATIGUE, CHILLS, AND IN SOME CASES, JOINT PAIN OR A RED RASH ON THE LOWER LEGS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE DEL VALLE, TOS, FIEBRE, DOLOR EN EL PECHO, DOLOR DE CABEZA, FATIGA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS Y, EN ALGUNOS CASOS, DOLOR ARTICULAR O UNA ERUPCI\\u00d3N ROJA EN LA PARTE INFERIOR DE LAS PIERNAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE COCCIDIOIDES FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE SIXTH DORSAL VERTEBRA. THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY CONTRACTED BY INHALING SPORES FOUND IN THE SOIL, OFTEN IN ARID REGIONS. THE RESULTING INFECTION, KNOWN AS COCCIDIOIDOMYCOSIS OR \\\"VALLEY FEVER,\\\" PRIMARILY AFFECTS THE LUNGS AND CAN LEAD TO CHRONIC RESPIRATORY ISSUES IF NOT ADDRESSED. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS IN THE MID-THORACIC SPINE, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC NIDUS OF THE FUNGUS, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE INFECTION AND PREVENTING IT FROM SPREADING TO THE BONES, JOINTS, OR CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO COCCIDIOIDES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA SEXTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE CONTRAE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE AL INHALAR ESPORAS QUE SE ENCUENTRAN EN EL SUELO, A MENUDO EN REGIONES \\u00c1RIDAS. LA INFECCI\\u00d3N RESULTANTE, CONOCIDA COMO COCCIDIOIDOMICOSIS O \\\"FIEBRE DEL VALLE\\\", AFECTA PRINCIPALMENTE A LOS PULMONES Y PUEDE PROVOCAR PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS SI NO SE ABORDA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE EN LA COLUMNA TOR\\u00c1CICA MEDIA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL NIDO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL HONGO, APOYANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y EVITAR QUE SE EXTIENDA A LOS HUESOS, LAS ARTICULACIONES O EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF COUGH OR CHEST PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 215) TO RULE OUT LEGIONELLA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FATIGUE OR SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO REINFORCE IMMUNE RESPONSE. ALWAYS CHECK THE NASAL SINUS \\/ NASAL SINUS (REF 537) TO RULE OUT VIRAL SINUSITIS SYNERGY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LA TOS O EL DOLOR EN EL PECHO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2 (HORIZONTAL) (REF 215) PARA DESCARTAR LEGIONELLA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA SEVERA O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE BAZO \\/ BAZO PARA REFORZAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. SIEMPRE REVISAR EL EJE SENO NASAL \\/ SENO NASAL (REF 537) PARA DESCARTAR LA SINERGIA CON LA SINITIS VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/225','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:36:25','2026-04-27 13:36:25'),(4025,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',226,'{\"symptoms\":\"LOWER RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, UTI, SKIN AND SOFT TISSUE INFECTIONS, INTRA - ABDOMINAL INFECTIONS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM INFECTIONS, OPHTHALMIC INFECTIONS ENTEROBACTER CLOACAE. (INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO INFERIOR, INFECCIONES DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL Y TEJIDOS BLANDOS, INFECCIONES INTRAABDOMINALES, INFECCIONES DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, INFECCIONES OFT\\u00c1LMICAS. ENTEROBACTER CLOACAE)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LOWER RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI), SKIN AND SOFT TISSUE INFECTIONS, INTRA-ABDOMINAL INFECTIONS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM INFECTIONS, AND OPHTHALMIC (EYE) INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO INFERIOR, INFECCIONES DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL Y TEJIDOS BLANDOS, INFECCIONES INTRAABDOMINALES, INFECCIONES DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL E INFECCIONES OFT\\u00c1LMICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE AT THE SEVENTH DORSAL VERTEBRA FUNCTIONS PRIMARILY AS A BACTERIAL RESERVOIR. IT OFTEN HARBORS VIBRIO PARAHEMOLYTICUS (FREQUENTLY LINKED TO CONTAMINATED SEAFOOD) OR ENTEROBACTER CLOACAE, A VERSATILE PATHOGEN CAPABLE OF AFFECTING MULTIPLE SYSTEMS. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH DISTORTION AT THIS MID-THORACIC POINT, THE RESET ELIMINATES THE HIDDEN BACTERIAL LOAD THAT MAY BE SUSTAINING PERSISTENT INFECTIONS IN THE ABDOMEN, EYES, OR URINARY TRACT, PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM RE-EMERGING AND COMPROMISING SYSTEMIC RECOVERY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EN LA S\\u00c9PTIMA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL FUNCIONA PRINCIPALMENTE COMO UN RESERVORIO BACTERIANO. A MENUDO ALBERGA VIBRIO PARAHEMOLYTICUS (VINCULADO FRECUENTEMENTE CON MARISCOS CONTAMINADOS) O ENTEROBACTER CLOACAE, UN PAT\\u00d3GENO VERS\\u00c1TIL CAPAZ DE AFECTAR M\\u00daLTIPLES SISTEMAS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N DE PH EN ESTE PUNTO MEDIO TOR\\u00c1CICO, EL REINICIO ELIMINA LA CARGA BACTERIANA OCULTA QUE PUEDE ESTAR MANTENIENDO INFECCIONES PERSISTENTES EN EL ABDOMEN, LOS OJOS O EL TRACTO URINARIO, EVITANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO REAPAREZCA Y COMPROMETA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL INFECTIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE DORSAL 5 \\/ DORSAL 5 (REF 224) TO RULE OUT E. COLI SYNERGY. FOR OPHTHALMIC OR EYE-RELATED ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE ETHMOID SINUS \\/ ETHMOID SINUS (REF 272) AXIS. ALWAYS ENSURE THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE IS STABILIZED TO ASSIST IN CLEARING THE SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL: SI PERSISTEN LAS INFECCIONES ABDOMINALES, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 5 \\/ DORSAL 5 (REF 224) PARA DESCARTAR LA SINERGIA CON E. COLI. PARA PROBLEMAS OFT\\u00c1LMICOS O RELACIONADOS CON LOS OJOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SENO ETMOIDAL \\/ SENO ETMOIDAL (REF 272). SIEMPRE ASEGURAR QUE LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9 ESTABILIZADA PARA AYUDAR A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/226','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:37:37','2026-04-27 13:37:37'),(4026,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',227,'{\"symptoms\":\"DESTROYS SKIN, BLINDNESS, ASTHMA, CATARACTS, HEMORRHOIDS. (DESTRUYE LA PIEL, CEGUERA, ASMA, CATARATAS, HEMORROIDES)\",\"paths\":\"HANSEN\'S DISEASE. VERY AGGRESSIVE. TRUE CANCER. PRODUCES LIMOSINA TOXIN. ATROPHY IN THE LIMBS, FROM THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. CAN PASS THRU THE PLACENTA TO THE FETUS. (ENFERMEDAD DE HANSEN. MUY AGRESIVA. C\\u00c1NCER VERDADERO. PRODUCE TOXINA LIMOSINA. ATROFIA EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, DESDE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. PUEDE PASAR A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA PLACENTA AL FETO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - UTERUS   ASSOCIATED WTH UTERUS; MYOMAS                                CHECK - LUNG         ASSOCIATED WITH LUNG; EMPHYSEMA                        CHECK - ESOPHAGUS             ASSOCIATED WITH ESOPHAGUS; VENOUS ULCERS CHECK - RECTUM   ASSOCIATED WITH RECTUM; HEMORRHOIDS.                       CHECK - ANKLE              ASSOCIATED WITH ANKLE; VARICOSE ULCERS              CHECK - SCAPULA, FEMORAL, DORSAL 8, SCAPULA. (VERIFICAR - \\u00daTERO. ASOCIADO CON \\u00daTERO; MIOMAS. VERIFICAR - PULM\\u00d3N. ASOCIADO CON PULM\\u00d3N; ENFISEMA. VERIFICAR - ES\\u00d3FAGO. ASOCIADO CON ES\\u00d3FAGO; \\u00daLCERAS VENOSAS. VERIFICAR - RECTO. ASOCIADO CON RECTO; HEMORROIDES. VERIFICAR - TOBILLO. ASOCIADO CON TOBILLO; \\u00daLCERAS VARICOSAS. VERIFICAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA, FEMORAL, DORSAL 8, ESC\\u00c1PULA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DESTRUCTIVE SKIN LESIONS, BLINDNESS, ASTHMA, CATARACTS, AND HEMORRHOIDS.\\n\\n(DESTRUYE LA PIEL, CEGUERA, ASMA, CATARATAS Y HEMORROIDES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE (HANSEN\'S DISEASE) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE EIGHTH DORSAL VERTEBRA. THIS IS AN EXTREMELY AGGRESSIVE PATHOGEN THAT PRODUCES THE LIMOSINA TOXIN, WHICH CAN LEAD TO NERVOUS SYSTEM DEGENERATION AND ATROPHY IN THE LIMBS. IT IS CONSIDERED A \\\"TRUE CANCER\\\" FACTOR IN BIOMAGNETISM DUE TO ITS DESTRUCTIVE NATURE. THE RESONANCE AT THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL AS THE PATHOGEN CAN CROSS THE PLACENTA TO THE FETUS; STABILIZING THIS POINT HELPS HALT THE BACTERIAL ATTACK ON THE SKIN AND NERVOUS TISSUES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE (ENFERMEDAD DE HANSEN) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA OCTAVA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. ESTE ES UN PAT\\u00d3GENO EXTREMADAMENTE AGRESIVO QUE PRODUCE LA TOXINA LIMOSINA, LA CUAL PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y ATROFIA EN LAS EXTREMIDADES. SE CONSIDERA UN FACTOR DE \\\"C\\u00c1NCER VERDADERO\\\" EN BIOMAGNETISMO DEBIDO A SU NATURALEZA DESTRUCTIVA. LA RESONANCIA EN ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICA YA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE PASAR A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA PLACENTA AL FETO; ESTABILIZAR ESTE PUNTO AYUDA A DETENER EL ATAQUE BACTERIANO EN LA PIEL Y LOS TEJIDOS NERVIOSOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COMPLEX SYSTEM CHECK: IF MYOMAS ARE SUSPECTED, SCAN THE [UTERUS \\/ UTERUS] AXIS. FOR RESPIRATORY DISTRESS OR EMPHYSEMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS. IF VENOUS ULCERS OR HEMORRHOIDS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] OR [RECTUM \\/ RECTUM] RESPECTIVELY. FOR VARICOSE ULCERS, CHECK THE [ANKLE \\/ ANKLE] RESONANCE. ADDITIONAL SUPPORT POINTS INCLUDE THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AND [FEMORAL \\/ FEMORAL] AXES TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL SPREAD TO THE EXTREMITIES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE SISTEMA COMPLEJO: SI SE SOSPECHAN MIOMAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE \\u00daTERO \\/ \\u00daTERO. PARA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA O ENFISEMA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N. SI HAY \\u00daLCERAS VENOSAS O HEMORROIDES, ESCANEAR EL ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO O RECTO \\/ RECTO RESPECTIVAMENTE. PARA \\u00daLCERAS VARICOSAS, REVISAR LA RESONANCIA TOB\\u00cdLLO \\/ TOB\\u00cdLLO. LOS PUNTOS DE APOYO ADICIONALES INCLUYEN LOS EJES ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA Y FEMORAL \\/ FEMORAL PARA DESCARTAR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA A LAS EXTREMIDADES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/227','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:39:00','2026-04-27 13:39:00'),(4027,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',228,'{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, COLD AND FLU. (NEUMON\\u00cdA, RESFRIADO Y GRIPE.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, COLD, FLU, SINUSITIS, AND EPIGLOTTITIS.\\n\\n(NEUMON\\u00cdA, RESFRIADO, GRIPE, SINUSITIS Y EPIGLOTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE NINTH DORSAL VERTEBRA. THIS PATHOGEN IS A FREQUENT CAUSE OF LOWER RESPIRATORY TRACT INFECTIONS AND CAN TRIGGER SIGNIFICANT INFLAMMATION IN THE BRONCHIAL TUBES. BY STABILIZING THIS THORACIC AXIS, THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION THAT LEADS TO PERSISTENT COUGHS, FEVER, AND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS. IT IS OFTEN FOUND IN SYNERGY WITH OTHER RESPIRATORY PATHOGENS, MAKING THIS POINT CRUCIAL FOR CLEARING CHRONIC \\\"FLU-LIKE\\\" SYMPTOMS THAT DO NOT RESPOND TO STANDARD VIRAL TREATMENTS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA NOVENA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES UNA CAUSA FRECUENTE DE INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO INFERIOR Y PUEDE DESENCADENAR UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA EN LOS BRONQUIOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE TOR\\u00c1CICO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA QUE PROVOCA TOS PERSISTENTE, FIEBRE Y DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA. A MENUDO SE ENCUENTRA EN SINERGIA CON OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS RESPIRATORIOS, LO QUE HACE QUE ESTE PUNTO SEA CRUCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS CR\\u00d3NICOS \\\"SIMILARES A LA GRIPE\\\" QUE NO RESPONDEN A LOS TRATAMIENTOS VIRALES EST\\u00c1NDAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY SYNERGY CHECK: IF PNEUMONIA SYMPTOMS ARE SEVERE, SCAN THE DORSAL 10 \\/ DORSAL 10 (REF 211) TO ADDRESS ADDITIONAL HAEMOPHILUS STRAINS. FOR PERSISTENT SINUS CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE NASAL SINUS \\/ NASAL SINUS (REF 537) AXIS. ALWAYS CHECK THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE SINERGIA RESPIRATORIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE NEUMON\\u00cdA SON SEVEROS, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 10 \\/ DORSAL 10 (REF 211) PARA ABORDAR CEPAS ADICIONALES DE HAEMOPHILUS. PARA LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N SINUSAL PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE SENO NASAL \\/ SENO NASAL (REF 537). SIEMPRE REVISAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/228','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:40:01','2026-04-27 13:40:01'),(4028,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',229,'{\"symptoms\":\"SORE THROAT, DIARRHEA, PINK EYE, FEVER, BLADDER INFLAMMATION OR INFECTION, PNEUMONIA, BRONCHITIS. (DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DIARREA, CONJUNTIVITIS, FIEBRE, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N O INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA, NEUMON\\u00cdA, BRONQUITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"COMMON COLD. (RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SORE THROAT, DIARRHEA, PINK EYE (CONJUNCTIVITIS), FEVER, BLADDER INFLAMMATION OR INFECTION (CYSTITIS), PNEUMONIA, AND BRONCHITIS.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DIARREA, CONJUNTIVITIS, FIEBRE, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N O INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA, NEUMON\\u00cdA, BRONQUITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ADENOVIRUS, A GROUP OF VIRUSES THAT COMMONLY CAUSE THE \\\"COMMON COLD\\\" OR UPPER RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE DORSAL PLEXUS, THE RESET HELPS CONTROL VIRAL REPLICATION THAT CAN AFFECT MULTIPLE SYSTEMS, RANGING FROM THE RESPIRATORY TRACT TO THE GASTROINTESTINAL AND URINARY TRACTS. THIS POINT IS CRITICAL FOR SITUATIONS WHERE FLU-LIKE SYMPTOMS ARE PROLONGED OR COMPLICATED BY EYE IRRITATION OR DIGESTIVE UPSET.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ADENOVIRUS, UN GRUPO DE VIRUS QUE NORMALMENTE CAUSAN EL \\\"RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN\\\" O INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL PLEXO DORSAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CONTROLAR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL QUE PUEDE AFECTAR A DIVERSOS SISTEMAS, DESDE EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO HASTA EL GASTROINTESTINAL Y EL URINARIO. ESTE PUNTO ES CLAVE PARA SITUACIONES DONDE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GRIPE SE ALARGAN O SE COMPLICAN CON IRRITACI\\u00d3N OCULAR O MALESTAR DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR CHECK: IF BACTERIAL SYMPTOMS RECUR FREQUENTLY, SCAN THE CHEEKBONE - L \\/ THYROID (REF 157) TO ADDRESS HIDDEN BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR SEVERE JOINT PAIN OR FIBROMYALGIA-LIKE SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CHEEKBONE \\/ KIDNEY (OPPOSITE SIDE) (REF 158) TO RULE OUT PLASMODIUM VIVAX INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS BACTERIANOS RECURREN CON FRECUENCIA, ESCANEAR EL EJE P\\u00d3MULO (I) \\/ TIROIDES (REF 157) PARA ABORDAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS OCULTAS. PARA DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO O S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES A LA FIBROMIALGIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE P\\u00d3MULO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (LADO OPUESTO) (REF 158) PARA DESCARTAR LA INTERFERENCIA DE PLASMODIUM VIVAX.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/229','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:41:28','2026-04-27 13:41:28'),(4029,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',230,'{\"symptoms\":\"RHEUMATISM, BACK PAIN, FEVER, CNS INFECTION, SEIZURES, STIFF NECK, VOMITING, COMA. (REUMATISMO, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, FIEBRE, INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, CONVULSIONES, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, V\\u00d3MITO, COMA.)\",\"paths\":\"DISORDERS IN THE SPINE. (TRASTORNOS EN LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - MANDIBLE   ASSOCIATED WITH NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE, CRIPPLING RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS. (VERIFICAR - MAND\\u00cdBULA. ASOCIADO CON NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE; ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE DEFORMANTE.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RHEUMATISM, BACK PAIN, FEVER, CNS INFECTION, SEIZURES, STIFF NECK, VOMITING, AND COMA.\\n\\n(REUMATISMO, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, FIEBRE, INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, CONVULSIONES, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, V\\u00d3MITO, COMA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE MENINGOCOCCUS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DORSAL PLEXUS AND THE LUMBOSACRAL REGION. THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY LINKED TO DISORDERS WITHIN THE SPINE AND THE PROTECTIVE LAYERS OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET HELPS PREVENT THE PROGRESSION OF INFLAMMATORY CONDITIONS THAT LEAD TO DEBILITATING BACK PAIN OR SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL COMPLICATIONS. IT IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT THREATEN THE STRUCTURAL AND ENERGETIC INTEGRITY OF THE SPINAL COLUMN.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA MENINGOCOCO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PLEXO DORSAL Y LA REGI\\u00d3N LUMBOSACRA. ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE A TRASTORNOS DENTRO DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL Y LAS CAPAS PROTECTORAS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE CONDICIONES INFLAMATORIAS QUE PROVOCAN DOLOR DE ESPALDA DEBILITANTE O COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS GRAVES. ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AMENAZAN LA INTEGRIDAD ESTRUCTURAL Y ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT AND MANDIBLE CHECK: IF RHEUMATISM PERSISTS OR BECOMES DEFORMING, SCAN THE MANDIBLE (MAND\\u00cdBULA) REGION TO RULE OUT SYNERGY WITH NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE, WHICH IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH CRIPPLING RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FEVER OR MENINGEAL RIGIDITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 4 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 221) AXIS TO ENSURE ALL MENINGOCOCCAL STRAINS ARE CLEARED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y MANDIBULAR: SI EL REUMATISMO PERSISTE O SE VUELVE DEFORMANTE, ESCANEAR LA REGI\\u00d3N DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA PARA DESCARTAR LA SINERGIA CON NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE, QUE A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON LA ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE DEFORMANTE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE SEVERA O RIGIDEZ MEN\\u00cdNGEA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 4 \\/ LUMBAR 1 (REF 221) PARA ASEGURAR QUE SE ELIMINEN TODAS LAS CEPAS DE MENINGOCOCO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/230','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:42:36','2026-04-27 13:42:36'),(4030,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',231,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"COLITIS, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME, DUODENUM ULCERS, DIARRHEA, CONSTIPATION, LACK OF APPETITE, VOMITING AND NAUSEA. (COLITIS, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE, \\u00daLCERAS DEL DUODENO, DIARREA, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, FALTA DE APETITO, V\\u00d3MITOS Y N\\u00c1USEAS.)\",\"paths\":\"DUODENUM INFLAMMATION, ULCERS, BLOATING. METALLIC TASTE SENSATIONS ON THE TONGUE. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL DUODENO, \\u00daLCERAS, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL. SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SABOR MET\\u00c1LICO EN LA LENGUA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL SYSTEM BALANCE\",\"symptoms\":\"COLITIS, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME, DUODENAL ULCERS, DIARRHEA, CONSTIPATION, LACK OF APPETITE, VOMITING, AND NAUSEA.\\n\\n(COLITIS, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE, \\u00daLCERAS DEL DUODENO, DIARREA, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, FALTA DE APETITO, V\\u00d3MITOS Y N\\u00c1USEAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DYSFUNCTION OF THE DUODENUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE FIRST SECTION OF THE SMALL INTESTINE USING A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. IT IS SPECIFICALLY INDICATED FOR INFLAMMATORY CONDITIONS AND MUCOSAL EROSIONS (ULCERS) THAT CAUSE ABDOMINAL BLOATING AND PAIN. A CHARACTERISTIC SIGN OF THIS IMBALANCE IS THE SENSATION OF A METALLIC TASTE ON THE TONGUE. BY STABILIZING THIS AREA, THE RESET RESTORES PROPER DIGESTIVE FUNCTION, IMPROVES NUTRIENT ABSORPTION, AND CALMS THE OVERACTIVITY OF THE LOWER GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL DUODENO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA PRIMERA SECCI\\u00d3N DEL INTESTINO DELGADO UTILIZANDO UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. EST\\u00c1 ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE INDICADA PARA CONDICIONES INFLAMATORIAS Y EROSIONES DE LA MUCOSA (\\u00daLCERAS) QUE CAUSAN HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL Y DOLOR. UN SIGNO CARACTER\\u00cdSTICO DE ESTE DESEQUILIBRIO ES LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SABOR MET\\u00c1LICO EN LA LENGUA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO RESTAURA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA ADECUADA, MEJORA LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y CALMA LA HIPERACTIVIDAD DEL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL INFERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE SYNERGY CHECK: IF CHRONIC DIARRHEA OR SEVERE MALABSORPTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE DORSAL 5 \\/ DORSAL 5 (REF 224) TO RULE OUT E. COLI. FOR CASES INVOLVING UPPER ABDOMINAL PAIN AND NAUSEA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO RULE OUT PINWORM (ENTEROBIUS VERMICULARIS). ALWAYS ENSURE THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE IS CHECKED TO ASSIST IN CLEARING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATORY BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE SINERGIA DIGESTIVA: SI LA DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA O LA MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N SEVERA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 5 \\/ DORSAL 5 (REF 224) PARA DESCARTAR E. COLI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ABDOMINAL SUPERIOR Y N\\u00c1USEAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA DESCARTAR OX\\u00cdUROS. SIEMPRE ASEGURAR QUE SE REVISE LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR A ELIMINAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS INFLAMATORIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/231','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:45:08','2026-04-27 13:45:08'),(4031,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',232,'{\"origins\":\"LEPROSY (LEPRA)\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"LEPROSY (LEPRA) - MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE\",\"symptoms\":\"OFTEN ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT CAN SUSTAIN CHRONIC SKIN LESIONS, NERVOUS SYSTEM ISSUES, OR RESPIRATORY DISCOMFORT BY HARBORING THE PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(A MENUDO ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE MANTENER LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS CR\\u00d3NICAS, PROBLEMAS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO O MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO AL ALBERGAR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PAIR FUNCTIONS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR FOR MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE, NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DUODENUM AND THE ESOPHAGUS. BY TARGETING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ELIMINATES THE \\\"HIDING PLACE\\\" OF THE BACTERIA, PREVENTING IT FROM RE-INFECTING THE SYSTEM OR SYNERGIZING WITH OTHER PATHOGENS. CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR CASES WHERE SYMPTOMS OF HANSEN\'S DISEASE OR SEVERE SYSTEMIC TOXICITY PERSIST DESPITE TARGETING PRIMARY SPINAL POINTS.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR FUNCIONA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE, NEUTRALIZANDO LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL DUODENO Y EL ES\\u00d3FAGO. AL DIRIGIRSE A ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO ELIMINA EL \\\"ESCONDITE\\\" DE LA BACTERIA, EVITANDO QUE REINFECTE EL SISTEMA O HAGA SINERGIA CON OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS. LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO ES ESENCIAL PARA CASOS DONDE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA ENFERMEDAD DE HANSEN O LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA SEVERA PERSISTEN A PESAR DE HABER TRATADO LOS PUNTOS ESPINALES PRIMARIOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PRIMARY PATHOGEN CHECK: IF ACTIVE LESIONS OR NERVE DEGENERATION ARE PRESENT, ALWAYS SCAN THE DORSAL 8 \\/ DORSAL 8 (REF 227) AXIS TO DIRECTLY IMPACT THE BACTERIAL LOAD. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE OR ESOPHAGEAL IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ DUODENUM] REVERSED PAIR OR THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 231) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT LOCAL DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO PRIMARIO: SI HAY LESIONES ACTIVAS O DEGENERACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA, SIEMPRE ESCANEAR EL EJE DORSAL 8 \\/ DORSAL 8 (REF 227) PARA IMPACTAR DIRECTAMENTE LA CARGA BACTERIANA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA O ESOF\\u00c1GICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL PAR INVERSO ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ DUODENO O LA RESONANCIA DUODENO \\/ DUODENO (REF 231) PARA DESCARTAR DISFUNCI\\u00d3N LOCAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/232','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:46:19','2026-04-27 13:46:19'),(4032,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',233,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, RECTAL BAND RECTAL BLEEDING. BLINDNESS, RETINA DETACHMENT, UTI, ENDOMETRIOSIS, INFERTILITY, GOUT, ANEMIA. (SANGRADO VAGINAL, BANDA RECTAL Y SANGRADO RECTAL. CEGUERA, DESPRENDIMIENTO DE RETINA, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, ENDOMETRIOSIS, INFERTILIDAD, GOTA, ANEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"IT ALTERS CLOTTING FACTORS AND PROMOTES ALL TYPES OF BLEEDING AND BLOOD DISORDERS. (ALTERA LOS FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N Y PROMUEVE TODO TIPO DE SANGRADO Y TRASTORNOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DUODENUM\\/LIVER (VERIFICAR - DUODENO\\/H\\u00cdGADO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING, RECTAL BLEEDING, BLINDNESS, RETINAL DETACHMENT, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI), ENDOMETRIOSIS, INFERTILITY, GOUT, AND ANEMIA.\\n\\n(SANGRADO VAGINAL, SANGRADO RECTAL, CEGUERA, DESPRENDIMIENTO DE RETINA, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, ENDOMETRIOSIS, INFERTILIDAD, GOTA Y ANEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DUODENUM AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. THIS PATHOGEN IS PARTICULARLY PERNICIOUS AS IT ALTERS CLOTTING FACTORS IN THE HOST, PROMOTING VARIOUS TYPES OF INTERNAL BLEEDING AND BLOOD DISORDERS. BEYOND REPRODUCTIVE IMPACTS LIKE ENDOMETRIOSIS OR INFERTILITY, THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING SEVERE OPHTHALMIC COMPLICATIONS, INCLUDING IRREVERSIBLE DAMAGE TO THE RETINA AND POTENTIAL BLINDNESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL DUODENO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES PARTICULARMENTE PERNICIOSO YA QUE ALTERA LOS FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N EN EL HU\\u00c9SPED, PROMOVIENDO VARIOS TIPOS DE HEMORRAGIAS INTERNAS Y TRASTORNOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS IMPACTOS REPRODUCTIVOS COMO LA ENDOMETRIOSIS O LA INFERTILIDAD, ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES OFT\\u00c1LMICAS GRAVES, INCLUYENDO EL DA\\u00d1O IRREVERSIBLE A LA RETINA Y LA POSIBLE CEGUERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC CHECK: IF BLEEDING DISORDERS OR DIGESTIVE ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO RULE OUT ADDITIONAL PATHOGENIC SYNERGY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE UROGENITAL INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [URETHRA \\/ URETHRA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT GENERAL FILTRATION AND STABILIZE THE RENAL SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS TRASTORNOS HEMORR\\u00c1GICOS O LOS PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE DUODENO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS ADICIONALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA URETRA \\/ URETRA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N GENERAL Y ESTABILIZAR EL SISTEMA RENAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/233','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:47:31','2026-04-27 13:47:31'),(4033,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',234,'{\"origins\":\"TAENIA SOLIUM CYSTICERCUS -DIABETES MELLITUS. (TAENIA SOLIUM CISTICERCO - DIABETES MELLITUS)\",\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISFUNCTION, (CONVULSIONES, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TRUE DIABETES (DIABETES VERDADERA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - NAVAL\\/SACRAL CHECK - NAVAL\\/KIDNEY (L). (VERIFICAR - OMBLIGO\\/SACRO. VERIFICAR - OMBLIGO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I).)\"}','{\"origins\":\"TAENIA SOLIUM CYSTICERCUS - DIABETES MELLITUS (TAENIA SOLIUM CISTICERCO - DIABETES MELLITUS)\",\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DYSFUNCTION, AND SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"TRUE\\\" DIABETES.\\n\\n(CONVULSIONES, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON LA \\\"DIABETES VERDADERA\\\".)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CYSTICERCUS LARVAE OF THE TAENIA SOLIUM PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DUODENUM AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. THIS RESONANCE IS ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"TRUE DIABETES\\\" BECAUSE THE PARASITE CAN INTERFERE WITH PANCREATIC FUNCTION OR METABOLIC REGULATION. BEYOND METABOLIC IMPACTS, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING NEUROCYSTICERCOSIS, WHERE PARASITIC LARVAE AFFECT THE BRAIN AND NERVOUS SYSTEM, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO SEIZURES OR COGNITIVE ALTERATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC NIDUS OF THE PARASITE, SUPPORTING THE BODY IN CLEARING THE INFECTION AND RESTORING SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LAS LARVAS DE CISTICERCO DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO TAENIA SOLIUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL DUODENO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA CON LA \\\"DIABETES VERDADERA\\\" PORQUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO PUEDE INTERFERIR CON LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA O LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS IMPACTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA NEUROCISTICERCOSIS, DONDE LAS LARVAS PARASITARIAS AFECTAN EL CEREBRO Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, PROVOCANDO POTENCIALMENTE CONVULSIONES O ALTERACIONES COGNITIVAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL NIDO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO, APOYANDO AL CUERPO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & NERVOUS CHECK: IF SEIZURES OR CNS SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [NAVAL \\/ SACRAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS DEEPER PARASITIC FOCHI. FOR REFINING METABOLIC STABILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NAVAL \\/ KIDNEY - L.] TO RULE OUT ADDITIONAL SYNERGIES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ASSIST IN CLEARING PARASITIC WASTE AND TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y NERVIOSA: SI PERSISTEN LAS CONVULSIONES O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DEL SNC, ESCANEAR EL EJE OMBLIGO \\/ SACRO PARA ABORDAR FOCOS PARASITARIOS M\\u00c1S PROFUNDOS. PARA REFINAR LA ESTABILIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE OMBLIGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS ADICIONALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR A ELIMINAR LOS DESECHOS PARASITARIOS Y LAS TOXINAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/234','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:49:37','2026-04-27 13:49:37'),(4034,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',235,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND LUNG INFECTIONS. (INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL Y DE LOS PULMONES.)\",\"paths\":\"SKIN INFECTIONS DUE TO INHALATION OF THE FUNGAL SPORES. (INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL DEBIDAS A LA INHALACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS F\\u00daNGICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (VERIFICAR - CODO\\/CODO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND LUNG INFECTIONS, RASHES, PERSISTENT COUGH, AND RESPIRATORY IRRITATION.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL Y DE LOS PULMONES, ERUPCIONES, TOS PERSISTENTE E IRRITACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS GENERAL MYCOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DUODENUM AND THE LARYNX. THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES FUNGAL INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN ENTER THE SYSTEM THROUGH THE INHALATION OF SPORES. ONCE ESTABLISHED, THESE PATHOGENS CAN MANIFEST AS DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES OR SETTLE IN THE RESPIRATORY TRACT, CAUSING CHRONIC INFLAMMATION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT NECESSARY FOR FUNGAL GROWTH, ASSISTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING SPORES FROM BOTH THE DIGESTIVE ENTRY POINT AND THE UPPER AIRWAYS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA MICOSIS GENERAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL DUODENO Y LA LARINGE. ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LAS INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS QUE A MENUDO ENTRAN AL SISTEMA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA INHALACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS. UNA VEZ ESTABLECIDOS, ESTOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN MANIFESTARSE COMO PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS O ASENTARSE EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO, CAUSANDO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL AMBIENTE ENERG\\u00c9TICO NECESARIO PARA EL CRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LAS ESPORAS TANTO DEL PUNTO DE ENTRADA DIGESTIVO COMO DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EXTREMITY CHECK: IF SKIN LESIONS OR FUNGAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST IN THE LIMBS, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] (VERIFICAR - CODO \\/ CODO) AXIS TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC SPREAD. FOR CHRONIC LUNG ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE DORSAL 6 \\/ DORSAL 6 (REF 225) TO RULE OUT COCCIDIOIDES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ASSURE THE FILTRATION OF FUNGAL METABOLITES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE EXTREMIDADES: SI LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00daNGICOS PERSISTEN EN LOS MIEMBROS, ESCANEAR EL EJE CODO \\/ CODO PARA ABORDAR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA PROBLEMAS PULMONARES CR\\u00d3NICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE DORSAL 6 \\/ DORSAL 6 (REF 225) PARA DESCARTAR COCCIDIOIDES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE METABOLITOS F\\u00daNGICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/235','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:51:22','2026-04-27 13:51:22'),(4035,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',236,'{\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE GASTRITIS, SEXUAL RELUCTANCE, INSOMNIA, FEVER, JAUNDICE, MUSCLE PAIN, POOR APPETITE, PAIN IN (ARMS, LEGS AND KNEES) HIGH CHOLESTEROL. (CANSANCIO, FATIGA, GASTRITIS, RECHAZO SEXUAL, INSOMNIO, FIEBRE, ICTERICIA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FALTA DE APETITO, DOLOR EN (BRAZOS, PIERNAS Y RODILLAS), COLESTEROL ALTO.)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS D, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINATION, GOUT, AND STERILITY IN WOMEN. (HEPATITIS D, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINATION, GOUT, AND STERILITY IN WOMEN.) (HEPATITIS D, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINACI\\u00d3N, GOTA Y ESTERILIDAD EN MUJERES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DUODENUM\\/KIDNEY (L) (VERIFICAR - DUODENO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I).\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE, GASTRITIS, SEXUAL RELUCTANCE, INSOMNIA, FEVER, JAUNDICE, MUSCLE PAIN, POOR APPETITE, PAIN IN ARMS, LEGS, AND KNEES, AND HIGH CHOLESTEROL.\\n\\n(CANSANCIO, FATIGA, GASTRITIS, RECHAZO SEXUAL, INSOMNIO, FIEBRE, ICTERICIA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FALTA DE APETITO, DOLOR EN BRAZOS, PIERNAS Y RODILLAS, Y COLESTEROL ALTO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DUODENUM AND THE LIVER. THIS RESONANCE IS ASSOCIATED WITH HEPATITIS D AND CAN CAUSE SIGNIFICANT METABOLIC AND DIGESTIVE DISRUPTION, INCLUDING GASTRITIS AND GOUT. BEYOND PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS, THIS PAIR IS LINKED TO \\\"PROCRASTINATION\\\" DUE TO THE SYSTEMIC FATIGUE AND LIVER CONGESTION IT INDUCES. IN WOMEN, PERSISTENT INFECTION ALONG THIS AXIS MAY LEAD TO STERILITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET SUPPORTS LIVER DETOXIFICATION, IMPROVES ENERGY LEVELS, AND ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL LOAD AFFECTING REPRODUCTIVE AND DIGESTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL DUODENO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA CON LA HEPATITIS D Y PUEDE CAUSAR UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y DIGESTIVA SIGNIFICATIVA, INCLUYENDO GASTRITIS Y GOTA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS, ESTE PAR EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA \\\"PROCRASTINACI\\u00d3N\\\" DEBIDO A LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA QUE INDUCE. EN LAS MUJERES, LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE A LO LARGO DE ESTE EJE PUEDE PROVOCAR ESTERILIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO APOYA LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO, MEJORA LOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA Y ABORDA LA CARGA BACTERIANA QUE AFECTA LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA Y DIGESTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BLOEDING AND RENAL CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF ENDOMETRIOSIS OR INTERNAL BLEEDING ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE DUODENUM \\/ KIDNEY - L. (REF 233) TO RULE OUT ADDITIONAL CHLAMYDIA IMPACTS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FATIGUE OR JAUNDICE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO REINFORCE HEPATIC FILTRATION. ALWAYS CHECK THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ASSIST IN THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA Y RENAL: SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE ENDOMETRIOSIS O HEMORRAGIA INTERNA, ESCANEAR EL EJE DUODENO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) (REF 233) PARA DESCARTAR IMPACTOS ADICIONALES DE CHLAMYDIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA SEVERA O ICTERICIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA REFORZAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. SIEMPRE REVISAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/236','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:53:26','2026-04-27 13:53:26'),(4036,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',237,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"BACTERIA\",\"origins\":\"CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS\",\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL OR RECTAL BLEEDING, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI), INFERTILITY, PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE, AND POTENTIAL EYE COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(SANGRADO VAGINAL O RECTAL, INFECCIONES DE LAS V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, INFERTILIDAD, ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA P\\u00c9LVICA Y POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES OCULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DUODENUM AND THE PYLORUS. THIS RESONANCE IS OFTEN LINKED TO INFECTIONS THAT AFFECT THE MUCOSA OF THE REPRODUCTIVE AND DIGESTIVE TRACTS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE PATHOGEN CAN REMAIN LATENT, CONTRIBUTING TO CHRONIC INFLAMMATION, SCARRING OF THE FALLOPIAN TUBES, OR INTERFERING WITH NUTRIENT ABSORPTION. BY STABILIZING THIS GASTRO-INTESTINAL JUNCTION, THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION THAT LEADS TO SYSTEMIC TOXICITY AND UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA CHLAMYDIA TRACHOMATIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL DUODENO Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. ESTA RESONANCIA A MENUDO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A INFECCIONES QUE AFECTAN LA MUCOSA DE LOS TRACTOS REPRODUCTIVO Y DIGESTIVO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE PERMANECER LATENTE, CONTRIBUYENDO A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA, LA CICATRIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS TROMPAS DE FALOPIO O INTERFIRIENDO CON LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA UNI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA QUE CONDUCE A LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & RENAL CHECK: IF INFERTILITY OR BLEEDING ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE DUODENUM \\/ LIVER (REF 236) OR DUODENUM \\/ KIDNEY - L. (REF 233) TO RULE OUT OTHER CHLAMYDIAL STRAINS. FOR UPPER DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS LOCAL DYSFUNCTION. ALWAYS CHECK THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF PATHOGENIC BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RENAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS PROBLEMAS DE INFERTILIDAD O SANGRADO, ESCANEAR EL EJE DUODENO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO (REF 236) O DUODENO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I) (REF 233) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CEPAS DE CHLAMYDIA. PARA MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SUPERIOR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N LOCAL. SIEMPRE REVISAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/237','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:54:48','2026-04-27 13:54:48'),(4037,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',238,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRUE LEUKEMIA (LEUCEMIA VERDADERA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ANEMIA, CHRONIC FATIGUE, WEIGHT LOSS, SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES, FREQUENT INFECTIONS, AND EASY BRUISING OR BLEEDING.\\n\\n(ANEMIA, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS INFLAMADOS, INFECCIONES FRECUENTES Y FACILIDAD PARA TENER HEMATOMAS O SANGRADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"TRUE LEUKEMIA\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE DUODENUM AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE SPLEEN IS A PRIMARY SITE FOR BLOOD FILTRATION AND IMMUNE CELL MATURATION. WHEN THIS PATHWAY IS COMPROMISED BY BACTERIAL LOADS, IT CAN DISRUPT THE PRODUCTION AND QUALITY OF WHITE BLOOD CELLS. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE HEMATOPOIETIC SYSTEM, ENHANCING THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO PURIFY THE BLOOD AND REINFORCE THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AGAINST SYSTEMIC PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ASOCIADO CON LA \\\"LEUCEMIA VERDADERA\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL DUODENO Y EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL BAZO ES UN SITIO PRIMARIO PARA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE Y LA MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS INMUNITARIAS. CUANDO ESTA V\\u00cdA SE VE COMPROMETIDA POR CARGAS BACTERIANAS, PUEDE ALTERAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N Y LA CALIDAD DE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO APOYA AL SISTEMA HEMATOPOY\\u00c9TICO, MEJORANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PURIFICAR LA SANGRE Y REFORZAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA CONTRA PAT\\u00d3GENOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BLOOD & IMMUNE CHECK: IF ANEMIA OR FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO REINFORCE DIRECT IMMUNE FUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 231) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST IN THE FILTRATION OF TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT THE STABILITY OF THE CIRCULATORY ENVIRONMENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA E INMUNITARIA: SI LA ANEMIA O LA FATIGA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE BAZO \\/ BAZO PARA REFORZAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA DUODENO \\/ DUODENO (REF 231). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS Y APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL ENTORNO CIRCULATORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/238','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:56:02','2026-04-27 13:56:02'),(4038,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',239,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGULATION\",\"symptoms\":\"EXTREME OBESITY, THYROID DYSFUNCTION, SLOW METABOLISM, AND FLUID RETENTION.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD EXTREMA, PROBLEMAS DE LA TIROIDES, METABOLISMO LENTO Y RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC & CIRCULATORY CHECK: IF FLUID RETENTION OR EDEMA ACCOMPANIES THE WEIGHT GAIN, SCAN THE CHIASM \\/ CHIASM (REF 160) TO ENSURE PROPER LYMPHATIC FLOW. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HORMONAL IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO REINFORCE GLANDULAR STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ASSIST IN THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE PRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y CIRCULATORIA: SI LA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS O EL EDEMA ACOMPA\\u00d1AN EL AUMENTO DE PESO, ESCANEAR EL EJE QUIASMA \\/ QUIASMA (REF 160) PARA ASEGURAR UN FLUJO LINF\\u00c1TICO ADECUADO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIDAD GLANDULAR. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PRODUCTOS DE DESECHO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/239','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:57:20','2026-04-27 13:57:20'),(4039,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',240,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DISORDER OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. (TRASTORNO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NERVOUS SYSTEM EQUILIBRIUM\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, TINNITUS, VERTIGO, NERVOUSNESS, AND EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(MAREOS, TINNITUS, V\\u00c9RTIGO, NERVIOSISMO E INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES EMOTIONAL DISORDERS AND NERVOUS SYSTEM IMBALANCES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS SPECIFICALLY IN THE LEFT EAR REGION. IT IS INDICATED FOR INDIVIDUALS EXPERIENCING SYSTEMIC NERVOUS TENSION OR EMOTIONAL CRISES THAT MANIFEST PHYSICALLY THROUGH THE AUDITORY OR VESTIBULAR SYSTEMS. BY STABILIZING THIS LOCALIZED BIOFIELD, THE RESET CALMS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM\'S RESPONSE TO STRESS, HELPING TO RESTORE CLARITY AND INTERNAL CALM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LOS TRASTORNOS EMOCIONALES Y LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL O\\u00cdDO IZQUIERDO. EST\\u00c1 INDICADA PARA PERSONAS QUE EXPERIMENTAN TENSI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA SIST\\u00c9MICA O CRISIS EMOCIONALES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN F\\u00cdSICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS SISTEMAS AUDITIVO O VESTIBULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE BIOCAMPO LOCALIZADO, EL REINICIO CALMA LA RESPUESTA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AL ESTR\\u00c9S, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR LA CLARIDAD Y LA CALMA INTERNA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC CHECK: IF VERTIGO OR DIZZINESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS TO RULE OUT PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE FROM MICROORGANISMS. FOR SEVERE EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT GLOBAL ENDOCRINE AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE BODY IS PROCESSING THE ENERGETIC RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA: SI EL V\\u00c9RTIGO O LOS MAREOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES PARA DESCARTAR LA INTERFERENCIA PAT\\u00d3GENA DE MICROORGANISMOS. PARA UN MALESTAR EMOCIONAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PINEAL \\/ PINEAL PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA Y EMOCIONAL GLOBAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CUERPO EST\\u00c9 PROCESANDO LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE TOXINAS EMOCIONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/240','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:58:33','2026-04-27 13:58:33'),(4040,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',241,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WITCHCRAFT (BRUJER\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEGATIVE ENERGY CODES \\/ CODIFICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA NEGATIVA\",\"symptoms\":\"AUDITORY DISTURBANCES, SLEEP INTERRUPTIONS, UNEXPLAINED ANXIETY, AND FEELINGS OF EXTERNAL INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(DISTURBIOS AUDITIVOS, INTERRUPCIONES DEL SUE\\u00d1O, ANSIEDAD INEXPLICABLE Y SENSACI\\u00d3N DE INTERFERENCIA EXTERNA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCES CREATED BY EXTERNAL NEGATIVE INFLUENCES OR \\\"EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES,\\\" HISTORICALLY REFERRED TO IN TRADITIONAL BIOMAGNETISM AS WITCHCRAFT (BRUJER\\u00cdA). BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE RIGHT EAR, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIBRATIONAL ALIGNMENT NECESSARY FOR THESE EXTERNAL CODES TO PERSIST. THIS POINT IS CRITICAL FOR INDIVIDUALS WHO FEEL \\\"ENERGETICALLY ATTACKED\\\" OR WHO EXPERIENCE PERSISTENT NEGATIVE THOUGHT PATTERNS THAT DO NOT ORIGINATE FROM WITHIN. STABILIZING THIS AXIS RESTORES THE INTEGRITY OF THE PERSONAL BIOFIELD AND PROTECTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM FROM NON-PHYSICAL INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS CREADOS POR INFLUENCIAS NEGATIVAS EXTERNAS O \\\"C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS\\\", HIST\\u00d3RICAMENTE REFERIDOS EN EL BIOMAGNETISMO TRADICIONAL COMO BRUJER\\u00cdA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL O\\u00cdDO DERECHO, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N VIBRATORIA NECESARIA PARA QUE ESTOS C\\u00d3DIGOS EXTERNOS PERSISTAN. ESTE PUNTO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA PERSONAS QUE SE SIENTEN \\\"ATACADAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE\\\" O QUE EXPERIMENTAN PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO NEGATIVOS PERSISTENTES QUE NO SE ORIGINAN DESDE DENTRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE SE RESTAURA LA INTEGRIDAD DEL BIOCAMPO PERSONAL Y SE PROTEGE AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DE INTERFERENCIAS NO F\\u00cdSICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLOBAL PROTECTION CHECK: IF FEELINGS OF INSECURITY OR NEGATIVE INFLUENCE PERSIST, SCAN THE EAR - L. \\/ EAR - L. (REF 240) TO STABILIZE EMOTIONAL EQUILIBRIUM. FOR CLEARING EMBEDDED MEMORIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE BODY IS EFFECTIVELY RELEASING THE ENERGETIC TOXINS ASSOCIATED WITH THE CLEARANCE OF NEGATIVE CODES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PROTECCI\\u00d3N GLOBAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS SENTIMIENTOS DE INSEGURIDAD O INFLUENCIA NEGATIVA, ESCANEAR EL EJE O\\u00cdDO (I) \\/ O\\u00cdDO (I) (REF 240) PARA ESTABILIZAR EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL. PARA LIMPIAR MEMORIAS INCRUSTADAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PINEAL \\/ PINEAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CUERPO EST\\u00c9 LIBERANDO EFECTIVAMENTE LAS TOXINAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS ASOCIADAS CON LA LIMPIEZA DE C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/241','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 13:59:57','2026-04-27 13:59:57'),(4041,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',242,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CONFLICT OF FEAR OR GRIEF \\/ CONFLICTO DE MIEDO O DUELO\",\"symptoms\":\"MENSTRUAL IRREGULARITIES, OVARIAN CYSTS, ANXIETY, AUDITORY SENSITIVITY, AND EMOTIONAL DISTRESS LINKED TO FEMININITY OR MOTHERHOOD.\\n\\n(IRREGULARIDADES MENSTRUALES, QUISTES OV\\u00c1RICOS, ANSIEDAD, SENSIBILIDAD AUDITIVA Y MALESTAR EMOCIONAL VINCULADO A LA FEMINIDAD O LA MATERNIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL CONNECTION BETWEEN PERCEPTION AND REPRODUCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT EAR AND THE RIGHT OVARY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE RIGHT SIDE IS OFTEN LINKED TO RATIONALITY AND EXTERNAL CONFLICTS. THIS SPECIFIC AXIS FREQUENTLY RESONATES WHEN AN INDIVIDUAL HAS \\\"HEARD\\\" SOMETHING TRAUMATIC OR DISTURBING THAT IMPACTS THEIR SENSE OF SECURITY OR THEIR REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH. BY STABILIZING THIS BIOFIELD, THE RESET HELPS RELEASE SOMATIZED EMOTIONS THAT MAY BE MANIFESTING AS PHYSICAL TENSION OR DYSFUNCTION IN THE OVARIAN SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL ENTRE LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N Y LA REPRODUCCI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL O\\u00cdDO DERECHO Y EL OVARIO DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL LADO DERECHO A MENUDO SE VINCULA CON LA RACIONALIDAD Y LOS CONFLICTOS EXTERNOS. ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO SUELE RESONAR CUANDO UN INDIVIDUO HA \\\"O\\u00cdDO\\\" ALGO TRAUM\\u00c1TICO O PERTURBADOR QUE IMPACTA SU SENTIDO DE SEGURIDAD O SU SALUD REPRODUCTIVA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE BIOCAMPO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR EMOCIONES SOMATIZADAS QUE PUEDEN ESTAR MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA O DISFUNCI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA OV\\u00c1RICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF OVARIAN CYSTS OR HORMONAL IMBALANCES ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ OVARY] AXIS TO ADDRESS ENDOCRINE REGULATION. FOR CLEARING EXTERNAL ENERGETIC INTERFERENCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE EAR - R \\/ EAR - R (REF 241) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE ENERGETIC RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y EMOCIONAL: SI HAY QUISTES OV\\u00c1RICOS O DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES, ESCANEAR EL EJE HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ OVARIO PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA. PARA LIMPIAR LA INTERFERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA EXTERNA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA O\\u00cdDO (D) \\/ O\\u00cdDO (D) (REF 241). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE TOXINAS EMOCIONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/242','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:10:43','2026-04-27 14:10:43'),(4042,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',243,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, BLUURED VISION, VERTIGO, HEARING LOSS, EARACHE AND DEAFNESS, FEVER, HEADACHE, MALAISE, COUGH, MUSCLE PAIN, ITCHY EYES AND THROAT, NIGHT SWEATS. (MAREO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA, V\\u00c9RTIGO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO Y SORDERA, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MALESTAR, TOS, DOLOR MUSCULAR, PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LOS OJOS Y LA GARGANTA, SUDORACIONES NOCTURNAS.)\",\"paths\":\"NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, ENCEPHALITIS, DAMAGE TO THE RETINA AND TO THE MACULA, TINNITUS, MONONUCLEOSIS. IT CAN AFFECT PREGNANCY, CAUSING ABORTION, PREMATURE BIRTH OR SERIOUS CONSEQUENCES TO THE FETUS, AS TORCH SYNDROME. REPEATED CONVULSIONS, CAUSED BY THE TOXOPLASMA GONDII. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, ENCEFALITIS, DA\\u00d1O A LA RETINA Y A LA M\\u00c1CULA, TINNITUS, MONONUCLEOSIS. PUEDE AFECTAR EL EMBARAZO, CAUSANDO ABORTO, PARTO PREMATURO O CONSECUENCIAS GRAVES PARA EL FETO, COMO EL S\\u00cdNDROME TORCH. CONVULSIONES REPETIDAS, CAUSADAS POR EL TOXOPLASMA GONDII.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, BLURRED VISION, VERTIGO, HEARING LOSS, EARACHE AND DEAFNESS, FEVER, HEADACHE, MALAISE, COUGH, MUSCLE PAIN, ITCHY EYES AND THROAT, AND NIGHT SWEATS.(MAREO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA, V\\u00c9RTIGO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO Y SORDERA, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MALESTAR, TOS, DOLOR MUSCULAR, PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LOS OJOS Y LA GARGANTA, SUDORACIONES NOCTURNAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TOXOPLASMA GONDII PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE AUDITORY CANALS. THIS PATHOGEN IS CAPABLE OF CROSSING THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER, LEADING TO NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, ENCEPHALITIS, AND REPEATED CONVULSIONS. IT HAS A NOTABLE AFFINITY FOR OCULAR TISSUES, POTENTIALLY CAUSING IRREVERSIBLE DAMAGE TO THE RETINA AND MACULA. ADDITIONALLY, THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL DURING PREGNANCY AS THE PARASITE IS A COMPONENT OF THE TORCH SYNDROME, WHICH CAN LEAD TO SEVERE FETAL CONSEQUENCES OR PREMATURE BIRTH. STABILIZING THIS AXIS HELPS PROTECT THE SENSORY ORGANS AND THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM FROM PARASITIC INVASION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO TOXOPLASMA GONDII MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LOS CONDUCTOS AUDITIVOS. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES CAPAZ DE CRUZAR LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA, LO QUE PROVOCA S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, ENCEFALITIS Y CONVULSIONES REPETIDAS. TIENE UNA AFINIDAD NOTABLE POR LOS TEJIDOS OCULARES, CAUSANDO POTENCIALMENTE DA\\u00d1OS IRREVERSIBLES EN LA RETINA Y LA M\\u00c1CULA. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA DURANTE EL EMBARAZO YA QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO ES UN COMPONENTE DEL S\\u00cdNDROME TORCH, QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A CONSECUENCIAS FETALES GRAVES O PARTO PREMATURO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE AYUDA A PROTEGER LOS \\u00d3RGANOS SENSORIALES Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DE LA INVASI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"OCULAR & NERVOUS CHECK: IF VISION LOSS OR TINNITUS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] AXIS TO RULE OUT DEEPER NEUROLOGICAL INVOLVEMENT. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC FATIGUE OR LYMPH NODE INFLAMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT MONONUCLEOSIS SYNERGY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN FILTERING PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N OCULAR Y NERVIOSA: SI LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE VISI\\u00d3N O EL TINNITUS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL PARA DESCARTAR UNA AFECTACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA DESCARTAR LA SINERGIA CON MONONUCLEOSIS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A FILTRAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/243','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:11:55','2026-04-27 14:11:55'),(4043,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',244,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TINEA, ATHLETES FEET, RINGWORM, JOCK ITCH, NAIL INFECTIONS, INFECTIONS OF THE SKIN, SCALP AND BEARD. (TI\\u00d1A, PIE DE ATLETA, TI\\u00d1A CORPORAL, TI\\u00d1A INGUINAL, INFECCIONES DE LAS U\\u00d1AS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, CUERO CABELLUDO Y BARBA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"TINEA, ATHLETE\'S FOOT, RINGWORM, JOCK ITCH, NAIL INFECTIONS (ONYCHOMYCOSIS), AND INFECTIONS OF THE SKIN, SCALP, AND BEARD.\\n\\n(TI\\u00d1A, PIE DE ATLETA, TI\\u00d1A CORPORAL, TI\\u00d1A INGUINAL, INFECCIONES DE LAS U\\u00d1AS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, CUERO CABELLUDO Y BARBA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRICHOPHYTON FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE EAR LOBES. THIS PATHOGEN IS THE PRIMARY CAUSE OF DERMATOPHYTOSIS, AFFECTING KERATINIZED TISSUES SUCH AS SKIN, HAIR, AND NAILS. THE RESONANCE ADDRESSES VARIOUS FORMS OF TINEA, INCLUDING TINEA PEDIS (ATHLETE\'S FOOT) AND TINEA CAPITIS (SCALP RINGWORM), WHICH CHARACTERISTICALLY CAUSE ITCHING, REDNESS, AND CIRCULAR RASHES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIBRATIONAL ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS THE FUNGUS TO PROLIFERATE, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE INFECTION FROM THE DERMAL LAYERS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO TRICHOPHYTON MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS L\\u00d3BULOS DE LAS OREJAS. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES LA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE LA DERMATOFITOSIS, QUE AFECTA A LOS TEJIDOS QUERATINIZADOS COMO LA PIEL, EL CABELLO Y LAS U\\u00d1AS. LA RESONANCIA ABORDA VARIAS FORMAS DE TI\\u00d1A, INCLUYENDO LA TINEA PEDIS (PIE DE ATLETA) Y LA TINEA CAPITIS (TI\\u00d1A DEL CUERO CABELLUDO), QUE SE CARACTERIZAN POR CAUSAR PICAZ\\u00d3N, ENROJECIMIENTO Y ERUPCIONES CIRCULARES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL AMBIENTE VIBRATORIO QUE PERMITE QUE EL HONGO PROLIFERE, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LAS CAPAS D\\u00c9RMICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC FUNGAL CHECK: IF SKIN LESIONS OR NAIL ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE DUODENUM \\/ LARYNX (REF 235) AXIS TO ADDRESS GENERAL MYCOSIS. FOR INFECTIONS CONCENTRATED ON THE FEET OR EXTREMITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT SYSTEMIC SPREAD. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF FUNGAL METABOLITES AND WASTE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O LOS PROBLEMAS EN LAS U\\u00d1AS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE DUODENO \\/ LARINGE (REF 235) PARA ABORDAR LA MICOSIS GENERAL. PARA INFECCIONES CONCENTRADAS EN LOS PIES O EXTREMIDADES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CODO \\/ CODO PARA DESCARTAR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE METABOLITOS Y DESECHOS F\\u00daNGICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/244','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:13:20','2026-04-27 14:13:20'),(4044,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',245,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INTOXICATION AND DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"paths\":\"INTOXICATION AND DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CRANIAL NERVE SYSTEM BALANCE\",\"symptoms\":\"INTOXICATION AND DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES, NEUROLOGICAL CONFUSION, SENSORY IMPAIRMENT, AND SYSTEMIC DISORIENTATION.\\n\\n(INTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES, CONFUSI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, DETERIORO SENSORIAL Y DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE FUNCTIONAL INTEGRITY OF THE CRANIAL NERVE NETWORK BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE AUDITORY AXIS. UNLIKE PATHOGEN-SPECIFIC PAIRS, THIS CONNECTION FOCUSES ON CLEARING TOXICITY OR ENERGETIC \\\"NOISE\\\" THAT INTERFERES WITH THE TWELVE PAIRS OF NERVES EMERGING DIRECTLY FROM THE BRAIN. BY STABILIZING THIS REGION, THE RESET SUPPORTS SENSORY TRANSMISSION (SIGHT, SMEAR, HEARING), FACIAL MOVEMENT, AND VITAL AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS REGULATED BY THE VAGUS NERVE. IT IS ESSENTIAL FOR CASES WHERE NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS ARE PERSISTENT BUT DO NOT MAP TO A SINGLE PATHOGENIC CAUSE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA INTEGRIDAD FUNCIONAL DE LA RED DE NERVIOS CRANEALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE AUDITIVO. A DIFERENCIA DE LOS PARES ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS PARA PAT\\u00d3GENOS, ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N SE CENTRA EN ELIMINAR LA TOXICIDAD O EL \\\"RUIDO\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE INTERFIERE CON LOS DOCE PARES DE NERVIOS QUE EMERGEN DIRECTAMENTE DEL CEREBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA REGI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO APOYA LA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL (VISTA, OLFATO, AUDICI\\u00d3N), EL MOVIMIENTO FACIAL Y LAS FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS VITALES REGULADAS POR EL NERVIO VAGO. ES ESENCIAL PARA CASOS DONDE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS SON PERSISTENTES PERO NO SE ASOCIAN A UNA \\u00daNICA CAUSA PAT\\u00d3GENA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL SYNERGY CHECK: IF SENSORY DYSFUNCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS TO RULE OUT MICROBIAL INTERFERENCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIZZINESS OR EMOTIONAL IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE EAR - L. \\/ EAR - L. (REF 240) OR EAR - R. \\/ EAR - R. (REF 241) RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST IN THE FILTRATION OF SYSTEMIC TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE NEUROLOGICAL CLEARING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE SINERGIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA MICROBIANA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MAREOS SEVEROS O DESEQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS O\\u00cdDO (I) \\/ O\\u00cdDO (I) (REF 240) O O\\u00cdDO (D) \\/ O\\u00cdDO (D) (REF 241). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/245','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:14:47','2026-04-27 14:14:47'),(4045,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',246,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EAR DISORDERS, FACIAL PARALYSIS, RINGING IN THE EAR, MYOFASCIAL PAIN, UROGENITAL DISORDERS, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS, DISORDER OF THE KIDNEYS AND ANXIETY. (TRASTORNOS DEL O\\u00cdDO, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, ZUMBIDO EN EL O\\u00cdDO, DOLOR MIOFASCIAL, TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES, TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS, TRASTORNOS DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES Y ANSIEDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"BRONCHIAL OBSTRUCTION AND ASTHMATIC. RESONATES IN THE PAROTID OR PARATHYROID GLAND. (OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL Y ASMA. RESUENA EN LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PAR\\u00d3TIDA O PARATIROIDES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SYSTEMIC RESONANCE \\/ RESONANCIA SIST\\u00c9MICA\",\"symptoms\":\"EAR DISORDERS, FACIAL PARALYSIS, RINGING IN THE EAR (TINNITUS), MYOFASCIAL PAIN, UROGENITAL DISORDERS, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS, KIDNEY DYSFUNCTION, AND ANXIETY.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL O\\u00cdDO, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, ZUMBIDO EN EL O\\u00cdDO, DOLOR MIOFASCIAL, TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES, TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS, TRASTORNOS DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES Y ANSIEDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC LINK BETWEEN THE AUDITORY SYSTEM AND THE RENAL SYSTEM ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE OF THE BODY. IT IS SPECIFICALLY INDICATED FOR ADDRESSING BRONCHIAL OBSTRUCTION AND ASTHMATIC CONDITIONS, OFTEN RESONATING IN THE PAROTID OR PARATHYROID GLANDS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THIS DIAGONAL AXIS, THE RESET HELPS ALLEVIATE PRESSURE ON THE CRANIAL NERVES\\u2014PARTICULARLY THOSE INVOLVED IN FACIAL MOVEMENT\\u2014WHILE SIMULTANEOUSLY CALMING PSYCHOSOMATIC ANXIETY AND SUPPORTING UROGENITAL STABILITY. IT SERVES AS A BRIDGE BETWEEN RESPIRATORY CLEARANCE AND RENAL FILTRATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA ABORDA EL V\\u00cdNCULO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL SISTEMA AUDITIVO Y EL SISTEMA RENAL EN EL LADO OPUESTO DEL CUERPO. EST\\u00c1 ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE INDICADA PARA ABORDAR LA OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL Y LAS CONDICIONES ASM\\u00c1TICAS, RESONANDO A MENUDO EN LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS PAR\\u00d3TIDAS O PARATIROIDES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ESTE EJE DIAGONAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ALIVIAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N SOBRE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES, PARTICULARMENTE AQUELLOS INVOLUCRADOS EN EL MOVIMIENTO FACIAL, MIENTRAS CALMA SIMULT\\u00c1NEAMENTE LA ANSIEDAD PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA Y APOYA LA ESTABILIDAD UROGENITAL. SIRVE COMO UN PUENTE ENTRE EL DESPEJE RESPIRATORIO Y LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CRANIAL & RENAL CHECK: IF FACIAL PARALYSIS OR TINNITUS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [EAR \\/ EAR] (REF 245) AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT CRANIAL NERVE TOXICITY. FOR CHRONIC RESPIRATORY ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CONCH \\/ CONCH] RESONANCE TO REINFORCE BRONCHIAL HEALTH. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ASSURE GLOBAL FILTRATION AND ENERGETIC GROUNDING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CRANEAL Y RENAL: SI LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL O EL TINNITUS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE O\\u00cdDO \\/ O\\u00cdDO (REF 245) PARA ABORDAR LA TOXICIDAD DIRECTA DE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES. PARA PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CONCHA \\/ CONCHA PARA REFORZAR LA SALUD BRONQUIAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N GLOBAL Y EL ARRAIGO ENERG\\u00c9TICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/246','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:16:28','2026-04-27 14:16:28'),(4046,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',247,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EAR INFECTIONS (OTITIS EXTERNA), URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, PNEUMONIA, SKIN RASHES, EYE INFECTIONS, AND SYSTEMIC SEPSIS IN IMMUNOCOMPROMISED INDIVIDUALS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DE O\\u00cdDO (OTITIS EXTERNA), INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, NEUMON\\u00cdA, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, INFECCIONES OCULARES Y SEPSIS SIST\\u00c9MICA EN PERSONAS INMUNODEPRIMIDAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE EAR AND THE TEMPORAL BONE. THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY ADAPTABLE AND OFTEN RESISTANT TO ANTIBIOTICS, FREQUENTLY CAUSING \\\"SWIMMER\'S EAR\\\" OR CHRONIC INFECTIONS IN THE AUDITORY CANAL. BEYOND THE EAR, IT CAN SPREAD TO THE LUNGS OR URINARY TRACT, PROMOTING INFLAMMATION AND TISSUE DAMAGE. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIA\'S COLONIZATION SITES NEAR THE CRANIAL STRUCTURES, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE LOAD AND PREVENTING NEUROLOGICAL OR RESPIRATORY COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL O\\u00cdDO Y EL HUESO TEMPORAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE ADAPTABLE Y A MENUDO RESISTENTE A LOS ANTIBI\\u00d3TICOS, CAUSANDO FRECUENTEMENTE \\\"O\\u00cdDO DE NADADOR\\\" O INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS EN EL CONDUCTO AUDITIVO. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL O\\u00cdDO, PUEDE EXTENDERSE A LOS PULMONES O AL TRACTO URINARIO, PROMOVIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y EL DA\\u00d1O TISULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LOS SITIOS DE COLONIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA BACTERIA CERCA DE LAS ESTRUCTURAS CRANEALES, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA Y PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS O RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CRANIAL & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF LUNG DISORDERS OR PNEUMONIA SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE MAXILLA \\/ MAXILLA (REF 518) TO RULE OUT KLEBSIELLA PNEUMONIAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIZZINESS OR HEARING LOSS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [EAR \\/ EAR] (REF 245) AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT CRANIAL NERVE TOXICITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ASSIST IN THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL ENDOTOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CRANEAL Y RESPIRATORIA: SI HAY TRASTORNOS PULMONARES O S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE NEUMON\\u00cdA, ESCANEAR EL EJE MAXILAR \\/ MAXILAR (REF 518) PARA DESCARTAR KLEBSIELLA PNEUMONIAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MAREOS SEVEROS O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE O\\u00cdDO \\/ O\\u00cdDO (REF 245) PARA ABORDAR LA TOXICIDAD DIRECTA DE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE ENDOTOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/247','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:17:44','2026-04-27 14:17:44'),(4047,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',248,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CORRECTS INFERIOR LIMB. (CORREGIR MIEMBRO INFERIOR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"STRUCTURAL ALIGNMENT (ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"LEG LENGTH DISCREPANCY, HIP IMBALANCE, GAIT ISSUES, AND RELATED MUSCULOSKELETAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(DISCREPANCIA EN LA LONGITUD DE LAS PIERNAS, DESEQUILIBRIO DE LA CADERA, PROBLEMAS EN LA MARCHA Y MALESTAR MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICO RELACIONADO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES PHYSICAL ASYMMETRY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE EAR AND THE TEMPORAL BONE ON THE OPPOSITE (CONTRALATERAL) SIDE. IT IS A FUNDAMENTAL PAIR IN BIOMAGNETISM USED TO CORRECT THE \\\"SHORT LEG\\\" PHENOMENON (HEMI-BODY CONTRACTION) OFTEN OBSERVED DURING THE INITIAL KINESIOLOGICAL ASSESSMENT. BY STABILIZING THIS DIAGONAL CRANIAL AXIS, THE RESET RELEASES MUSCULAR TENSION AND NERVOUS SYSTEM SIGNALING ERRORS THAT CAUSE THE ILIAC CREST TO TILTING, EFFECTIVELY LEVELING THE INFERIOR LIMBS AND RESTORING STRUCTURAL SYMMETRY TO THE ENTIRE BODY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ASIMETR\\u00cdA F\\u00cdSICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL O\\u00cdDO Y EL HUESO TEMPORAL EN EL LADO OPUESTO (CONTRALATERAL). ES UN PAR FUNDAMENTAL EN BIOMAGNETISMO UTILIZADO PARA CORREGIR EL FEN\\u00d3MENO DE LA \\\"PIERNA CORTA\\\" (CONTRACCI\\u00d3N DEL HEMICUERPO) QUE A MENUDO SE OBSERVA DURANTE LA EVALUACI\\u00d3N KINESIOL\\u00d3GICA INICIAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE CRANEAL DIAGONAL, EL REINICIO LIBERA LA TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR Y LOS ERRORES DE SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO QUE CAUSAN LA INCLINACI\\u00d3N DE LA CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA, NIVELANDO EFECTIVAMENTE LOS MIEMBROS INFERIORES Y RESTAURANDO LA ASIMETR\\u00cdA ESTRUCTURAL EN TODO EL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL SYNERGY CHECK: IF THE IMBALANCE PERSISTS AFTER THE CRANIAL RESET, SCAN THE PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE (REF 365) TO ADDRESS DEEPER ENERGETIC ANCHORS. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC LOWER BACK PAIN OR SCIATICA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSURE THE BODY IS GROUNDED AND PROPERLY FILTERING SYSTEMIC TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE SINERGIA ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL DESEQUILIBRIO PERSISTE DESPU\\u00c9S DEL REINICIO CRANEAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (OPUESTO) (REF 365) PARA ABORDAR ANCLAJES ENERG\\u00c9TICOS M\\u00c1S PROFUNDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR LUMBAR CR\\u00d3NICO O CI\\u00c1TICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CUERPO EST\\u00c9 ENRAIZADO Y FILTRANDO ADECUADAMENTE LAS TOXINAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/248','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:18:56','2026-04-27 14:18:56'),(4048,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',244,'{\"symptoms\":\"TINEA, ATHLETE\'S FOOT, RINGWORM, JOCK ITCH, NAIL INFECTIONS (ONYCHOMYCOSIS), AND INFECTIONS OF THE SKIN, SCALP, AND BEARD.\\n\\n(TI\\u00d1A, PIE DE ATLETA, TI\\u00d1A CORPORAL, TI\\u00d1A INGUINAL, INFECCIONES DE LAS U\\u00d1AS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, CUERO CABELLUDO Y BARBA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRICHOPHYTON FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE EAR LOBES. THIS PATHOGEN IS THE PRIMARY CAUSE OF DERMATOPHYTOSIS, AFFECTING KERATINIZED TISSUES SUCH AS SKIN, HAIR, AND NAILS. THE RESONANCE ADDRESSES VARIOUS FORMS OF TINEA, INCLUDING TINEA PEDIS (ATHLETE\'S FOOT) AND TINEA CAPITIS (SCALP RINGWORM), WHICH CHARACTERISTICALLY CAUSE ITCHING, REDNESS, AND CIRCULAR RASHES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIBRATIONAL ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS THE FUNGUS TO PROLIFERATE, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE INFECTION FROM THE DERMAL LAYERS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO TRICHOPHYTON MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS L\\u00d3BULOS DE LAS OREJAS. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES LA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE LA DERMATOFITOSIS, QUE AFECTA A LOS TEJIDOS QUERATINIZADOS COMO LA PIEL, EL CABELLO Y LAS U\\u00d1AS. LA RESONANCIA ABORDA VARIAS FORMAS DE TI\\u00d1A, INCLUYENDO LA TINEA PEDIS (PIE DE ATLETA) Y LA TINEA CAPITIS (TI\\u00d1A DEL CUERO CABELLUDO), QUE SE CARACTERIZAN POR CAUSAR PICAZ\\u00d3N, ENROJECIMIENTO Y ERUPCIONES CIRCULARES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL AMBIENTE VIBRATORIO QUE PERMITE QUE EL HONGO PROLIFERE, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LAS CAPAS D\\u00c9RMICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC FUNGAL CHECK: IF SKIN LESIONS OR NAIL ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE DUODENUM \\/ LARYNX (REF 235) AXIS TO ADDRESS GENERAL MYCOSIS. FOR INFECTIONS CONCENTRATED ON THE FEET OR EXTREMITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT SYSTEMIC SPREAD. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF FUNGAL METABOLITES AND WASTE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O LOS PROBLEMAS EN LAS U\\u00d1AS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE DUODENO \\/ LARINGE (REF 235) PARA ABORDAR LA MICOSIS GENERAL. PARA INFECCIONES CONCENTRADAS EN LOS PIES O EXTREMIDADES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CODO \\/ CODO PARA DESCARTAR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE METABOLITOS Y DESECHOS F\\u00daNGICOS.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"TINEA, ATHLETE\'S FOOT, RINGWORM, JOCK ITCH, NAIL INFECTIONS (ONYCHOMYCOSIS), AND INFECTIONS OF THE SKIN, SCALP, AND BEARD.(TI\\u00d1A, PIE DE ATLETA, TI\\u00d1A CORPORAL, TI\\u00d1A INGUINAL, INFECCIONES DE LAS U\\u00d1AS, INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, CUERO CABELLUDO Y BARBA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRICHOPHYTON FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE EAR LOBES. THIS PATHOGEN IS THE PRIMARY CAUSE OF DERMATOPHYTOSIS, AFFECTING KERATINIZED TISSUES SUCH AS SKIN, HAIR, AND NAILS. THE RESONANCE ADDRESSES VARIOUS FORMS OF TINEA, INCLUDING TINEA PEDIS (ATHLETE\'S FOOT) AND TINEA CAPITIS (SCALP RINGWORM), WHICH CHARACTERISTICALLY CAUSE ITCHING, REDNESS, AND CIRCULAR RASHES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIBRATIONAL ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS THE FUNGUS TO PROLIFERATE, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE INFECTION FROM THE DERMAL LAYERS.(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO TRICHOPHYTON MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS L\\u00d3BULOS DE LAS OREJAS. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES LA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE LA DERMATOFITOSIS, QUE AFECTA A LOS TEJIDOS QUERATINIZADOS COMO LA PIEL, EL CABELLO Y LAS U\\u00d1AS. LA RESONANCIA ABORDA VARIAS FORMAS DE TI\\u00d1A, INCLUYENDO LA TINEA PEDIS (PIE DE ATLETA) Y LA TINEA CAPITIS (TI\\u00d1A DEL CUERO CABELLUDO), QUE SE CARACTERIZAN POR CAUSAR PICAZ\\u00d3N, ENROJECIMIENTO Y ERUPCIONES CIRCULARES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL AMBIENTE VIBRATORIO QUE PERMITE QUE EL HONGO PROLIFERE, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LAS CAPAS D\\u00c9RMICAS.))\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC FUNGAL CHECK: IF SKIN LESIONS OR NAIL ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE DUODENUM \\/ LARYNX (REF 235) AXIS TO ADDRESS GENERAL MYCOSIS. FOR INFECTIONS CONCENTRATED ON THE FEET OR EXTREMITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT SYSTEMIC SPREAD. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF FUNGAL METABOLITES AND WASTE.(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O LOS PROBLEMAS EN LAS U\\u00d1AS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE DUODENO \\/ LARINGE (REF 235) PARA ABORDAR LA MICOSIS GENERAL. PARA INFECCIONES CONCENTRADAS EN LOS PIES O EXTREMIDADES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CODO \\/ CODO PARA DESCARTAR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE METABOLITOS Y DESECHOS F\\u00daNGICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/244','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:20:34','2026-04-27 14:20:34'),(4049,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',249,'{\"symptoms\":\"TRUE CANCER OR TUMOR, DESTROYS SKIN, LIMB ATROPHY, BLINDNESS, ASTHMA, CATARACTS, HEMORRHOIDS. (C\\u00c1NCER VERDADERO O TUMOR, DESTRUYE LA PIEL, ATROFIA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES, CEGUERA, ASMA, CATARATAS, HEMORROIDES)\",\"paths\":\"VERY AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA. IT MAY PASS TO FETUS. (BACTERIA MUY AGRESIVA. PUEDE PASAR AL FETO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SCAPULA, FEMORAL TRIANGLE, DORSAL 8.     CHECK - SCAPULA\\/SCAPULA (VERIFICAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA, TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL, DORSAL 8. VERIFICAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA\\/ESC\\u00c1PULA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"TRUE CANCER OR TUMOR, DESTROYS SKIN, LIMB ATROPHY, BLINDNESS, ASTHMA, CATARACTS, AND HEMORRHOIDS.\\n\\n(C\\u00c1NCER VERDADERO O TUMOR, DESTRUYE LA PIEL, ATROFIA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES, CEGUERA, ASMA, CATARATAS Y HEMORROIDES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HIGHLY AGGRESSIVE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE BACTERIA by neutralizing pH distortions between the elbow and the brachial region on the opposite side of the body. This pathogen is known for its impact on dermal tissues and the peripheral nervous system, potentially leading to significant structural and sensory changes if left unaddressed. Notably, this bacterial load has the capacity to be transmitted to the fetus during pregnancy, making its identification and clearance critical for long-term systemic health. By stabilizing this diagonal axis, the reset disrupts the energetic environment required for the bacteria to thrive, supporting the body in preventing tissue destruction and limb atrophy.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ALTAMENTE AGRESIVA MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE mediante la neutralizaci\\u00f3n de las distorsiones de pH entre el codo y la regi\\u00f3n braquial en el lado opuesto del cuerpo. Este pat\\u00f3geno es conocido por su impacto en los tejidos d\\u00e9rmicos y el sistema nervioso perif\\u00e9rico, lo que puede provocar cambios estructurales y sensoriales significativos si no se aborda. Cabe destacar que esta carga bacteriana tiene la capacidad de transmitirse al feto durante el embarazo, lo que hace que su identificaci\\u00f3n y eliminaci\\u00f3n sean fundamentales para la salud sist\\u00e9mica a largo plazo. Al estabilizar este eje diagonal, el reinicio interrumpe el entorno energ\\u00e9tico necesario para que la bacteria prospere, ayudando al cuerpo a prevenir la destrucci\\u00f3n de tejidos y la atrofia de las extremidades.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & RESPIRATORY CHECK: If dermatological symptoms or asthma persist, scan the [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] (VERIFICAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA) axis to reinforce the clearance of Mycobacterium. For cases involving significant musculoskeletal or limb issues, cross-reference with the [FEMORAL TRIANGLE] (TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL) or [DORSAL 8] (DORSAL 8) resonances. Always monitor the [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N) axis to ensure the effective filtration of aggressive bacterial toxins.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RESPIRATORIA: Si los s\\u00edntomas dermatol\\u00f3gicos o el asma persisten, escanear el eje ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA para reforzar la eliminaci\\u00f3n de Mycobacterium. Para casos que involucren problemas musculoesquel\\u00e9ticos o de las extremidades significativos, realizar una referencia cruzada con las resonancias del TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL o DORSAL 8. Siempre monitorear el eje RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N para asegurar la filtraci\\u00f3n efectiva de toxinas bacterianas agresivas.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/249','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:22:18','2026-04-27 14:22:18'),(4050,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',250,'{\"symptoms\":\"CARPAL TUNNEL, STIFF SHOULDER, FROZEN ELBOW, HEARING LOSS, DORSO LUMBAR PAIN, STIFFNESS IN THE HIP AND KNEES. (S\\u00cdNDROME DEL T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO, HOMBRO R\\u00cdGIDO, CODO CONGELADO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DORSOLUMBAR, RIGIDEZ EN LA CADERA Y LAS RODILLAS.)\",\"paths\":\"SYPHILIS, OSTEOARTHRITIS, FIBROMYALGIA, LYME AND MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (S\\u00cdFILIS, OSTEOARTRITIS, FIBROMIALGIA, ENFERMEDAD DE LYME Y ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CARPAL TUNNEL, STIFF SHOULDER, FROZEN ELBOW, HEARING LOSS, DORSO LUMBAR PAIN, AND STIFFNESS IN THE HIP AND KNEES.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNDROME DEL T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO, HOMBRO R\\u00cdGIDO, CODO CONGELADO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DORSOLUMBAR Y RIGIDEZ EN LA CADERA Y LAS RODILLAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TREPONEMA PALLIDUM SPIROCHETE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ELBOW AND THE BRACHIAL PLEXUS. THIS RESONANCE IS ASSOCIATED WITH SYSTEMIC CONDITIONS SUCH AS SYPHILIS, OSTEOARTHRITIS, AND FIBROMYALGIA. THE BACTERIA OFTEN IMPACTS THE CONNECTIVE TISSUES AND NERVE PATHWAYS, LEADING TO WIDESPREAD MUSCULOSKELETAL RIGIDITY AND PAIN THAT CAN MIMICK SYMPTOMS OF LYME DISEASE OR MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. BY STABILIZING THIS BRACHIAL AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE SPIROCHETE\'S ABILITY TO COMPROMISE NERVE SIGNALING AND JOINT MOBILITY, SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF FLEXIBILITY AND NEUROLOGICAL FUNCTION THROUGHOUT THE UPPER EXTREMITIES AND SPINE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA ESPIROQUETA TREPONEMA PALLIDUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CODO Y EL PLEXO BRAQUIAL. ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA CON CONDICIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMO LA S\\u00cdFILIS, LA OSTEOARTRITIS Y LA FIBROMIALGIA. LA BACTERIA A MENUDO AFECTA LOS TEJIDOS CONECTIVOS Y LAS V\\u00cdAS NERVIOSAS, LO QUE PROVOCA UNA RIGIDEZ MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICA GENERALIZADA Y DOLOR QUE PUEDE IMITAR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA ENFERMEDAD DE LYME O LA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE BRAQUIAL, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA CAPACIDAD DE LA ESPIROQUETA PARA COMPROMETER LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y LA MOVILIDAD ARTICULAR, APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA FLEXIBILIDAD Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA EN TODAS LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES Y LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NERVOUS & ARTICULAR CHECK: IF CARPAL TUNNEL OR SHOULDER STIFFNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DELTOID \\/ DELTOID] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCAL MUSCULAR TENSION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DORSO LUMBAR PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT DESCENDING SYNERGIES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST IN THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED FROM THE CONNECTIVE TISSUES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y ARTICULAR: SI PERSISTE EL T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO O LA RIGIDEZ DEL HOMBRO, ESCANEAR EL EJE DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES PARA ABORDAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR LOCAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR DORSOLUMBAR SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS DESCENDENTES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DE LOS TEJIDOS CONECTIVOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/250','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:23:47','2026-04-27 14:23:47'),(4051,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',251,'{\"symptoms\":\"CARPAL TUNNEL, STIFF SHOULDER, FROZEN ELBOW, HEARING LOSS, DORSO LUMBAR PAIN, STIFFNESS IN THE HIP AND KNEES. (S\\u00cdNDROME DEL T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO, HOMBRO R\\u00cdGIDO, CODO CONGELADO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DORSOLUMBAR, RIGIDEZ EN LA CADERA Y LAS RODILLAS)\",\"paths\":\"SYPHILIS, OSTEOARTHRITIS, FIBROMYALGIA, LYME AND MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (S\\u00cdFILIS, OSTEOARTRITIS, FIBROMIALGIA, ENFERMEDAD DE LYME Y ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CARPAL TUNNEL, STIFF SHOULDER, FROZEN ELBOW, HEARING LOSS, DORSO LUMBAR PAIN, STIFFNESS IN THE HIP AND KNEES.(S\\u00cdNDROME DEL T\\u00daNEL CARPIANO, HOMBRO R\\u00cdGIDO, CODO CONGELADO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DORSOLUMBAR, RIGIDEZ EN LA CADERA Y LAS RODILLAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TREPONEMA PALLIDUM SPIROCHETE by neutralizing pH distortions between the elbow and the brachial plexus on the same side of the body. This pathogen is associated with systemic conditions such as Syphilis and can manifest as clinical symptoms mimicking Osteoarthritis, Fibromyalgia, Lyme disease, or Multiple Sclerosis. The infection typically affects connective tissues and nerve pathways, leading to localized stiffness and radiating pain. By stabilizing this ipsilateral axis, the reset disrupts the spirochete\'s ability to compromise joint mobility and nerve signaling, supporting the restoration of flexibility and neurological balance in the upper extremities.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA ESPIROQUETA TREPONEMA PALLIDUM mediante la neutralizaci\\u00f3n de las distorsiones de pH entre el codo y el plexo braquial en el mismo lado del cuerpo. Este pat\\u00f3geno se asocia con condiciones sist\\u00e9micas como la s\\u00edfilis y puede manifestarse con s\\u00edntomas cl\\u00ednicos que imitan la osteoartritis, la fibromialgia, la enfermedad de Lyme o la esclerosis m\\u00faltiple. La infecci\\u00f3n afecta t\\u00edpicamente a los tejidos conectivos y las v\\u00edas nerviosas, lo que provoca rigidez localizada y dolor irradiado. Al estabilizar este eje ipsilateral, el reinicio interrumpe la capacidad de la espiroqueta para comprometer la movilidad articular y la se\\u00f1alizaci\\u00f3n nerviosa, apoyando la restauraci\\u00f3n de la flexibilidad y el equilibrio neurol\\u00f3gico en las extremidades superiores.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NERVOUS & ARTICULAR CHECK: If carpal tunnel or shoulder stiffness persists, scan the [DELTOID \\/ DELTOID] axis to address local muscular tension. For cases of generalized rigidity, cross-reference with the ELBOW \\/ BRACHIAL PLEXUS - OPPOSITE SIDE (REF 250) to rule out crossed synergies. Always monitor the [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N) axis to ensure the effective filtration of bacterial toxins released from the connective tissues.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y ARTICULAR: Si el t\\u00fanel carpiano o la rigidez del hombro persisten, escanear el eje DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES para abordar la tensi\\u00f3n muscular local. Para casos de rigidez generalizada, realizar una referencia cruzada con el eje CODO \\/ PLEXO BRAQUIAL - LADO OPUESTO (REF 250) para descartar sinergias cruzadas. Siempre monitorear el eje RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N para asegurar la filtraci\\u00f3n efectiva de toxinas bacterianas liberadas de los tejidos conectivos.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/251','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:25:35','2026-04-27 14:25:35'),(4052,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',252,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"OCULAR DISFUNCTION AND DISORDERS OF THE MYOPIA AND HYEROPIA. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N OCULAR Y TRASTORNOS DE LA MIOP\\u00cdA Y LA HIPERMETROP\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"ASTIGMATISM. PRESBYOPIA, REFRACTION AND OTHER EYE DISORDERS. (ASTIGMATISMO. PRESBICIA, REFRACCI\\u00d3N Y OTROS TRASTORNOS OCULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"OCULAR AXIS REGULATION\",\"symptoms\":\"OCULAR DYSFUNCTION, MYOPIA, HYPEROPIA, AND VISUAL DISORIENTATION.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N OCULAR, MIOP\\u00cdA, HIPERMETROP\\u00cdA Y DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N VISUAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES REFRACTIVE ERRORS AND VISUAL DYSFUNCTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE BILATERAL ELBOW AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS POINT IS RECOGNIZED FOR ITS INFLUENCE ON THE CILIARY MUSCLES AND THE SHAPE OF THE LENS, MAKING IT A CRITICAL RESET FOR CONDITIONS SUCH AS ASTIGMATISM AND PRESBYOPIA. BY STABILIZING THIS BIOFIELD, THE RESET HELPS CORRECT THE FOCUSING MECHANISMS OF THE EYE, IMPROVING VISION CLARITY AND REDUCING THE STRAIN ASSOCIATED WITH LONG-TERM REFRACTIVE DISORDERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LOS ERRORES DE REFRACCI\\u00d3N Y LAS DISFUNCIONES VISUALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE BILATERAL DEL CODO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PUNTO ES RECONOCIDO POR SU INFLUENCIA EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS CILIARES Y LA FORMA DEL CRISTALINO, LO QUE LO CONVIERTE EN UN REINICIO CR\\u00cdTICO PARA CONDICIONES COMO EL ASTIGMATISMO Y LA PRESBICIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE BIOCAMPO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CORREGIR LOS MECANISMOS DE ENFOQUE DEL OJO, MEJORANDO LA CLARIDAD DE LA VISI\\u00d3N Y REDUCIENDO EL ESFUERZO ASOCIADO CON LOS TRASTORNOS REFRACTIVOS A LARGO PLAZO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VISUAL & NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF VISION LOSS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [CRANIAL \\/ CRANIAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS OPTIC NERVE INTEGRITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING HEADACHES LINKED TO EYE STRAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING ENERGETIC ADJUSTMENTS TO THE SENSORY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VISUAL Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE VISI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE CRANEAL \\/ CRANEAL PARA ABORDAR LA INTEGRIDAD DEL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR DE CABEZA VINCULADO A LA FATIGA OCULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS AJUSTES ENERG\\u00c9TICOS EN EL SISTEMA SENSORIAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/252','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:27:09','2026-04-27 14:27:09'),(4053,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',253,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LEPROSY (LEPRA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - BRACHIAL\\/SUB-DELTOID BURSA (VERIFICAR - BRAQUIAL\\/BURSA SUBDELTOIDEA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT PAIN, INFLAMMATION OF THE BURSA, LIMITED SHOULDER MOBILITY, SKIN LESIONS, AND POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS.\\n\\n(DOLOR ARTICULAR, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA BURSA, MOVILIDAD LIMITADA DEL HOMBRO, LESIONES EN LA PIEL Y POSIBLES TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE STREPTOCOCCUS B HAEMOLYTIC BACTERIA by neutralizing pH distortions between the elbow and the sub-deltoid bursa on the opposite side of the body. This pathogen is known for its aggressive nature and its historical association with conditions like leprosy (lepra) when in synergy with other microorganisms. It frequently causes inflammation in the synovial bursa and connective tissues, leading to significant pain and restricted movement in the upper extremities. By stabilizing this diagonal axis, the reset disrupts the bacterial colonization in the joints and soft tissues, supporting the immune system in preventing tissue degradation and systemic spread.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESTREPTOCOCO B HEMOL\\u00cdTICO mediante la neutralizaci\\u00f3n de las distorsiones de pH entre el codo y la bursa subdeltoidea en el lado opuesto del cuerpo. Este pat\\u00f3geno es conocido por su naturaleza agresiva y su asociaci\\u00f3n hist\\u00f3rica con condiciones como la lepra cuando est\\u00e1 en sinergia con otros microorganismos. Frecuentemente causa inflamaci\\u00f3n en la bursa sinovial y los tejidos conectivos, lo que provoca un dolor significativo y restricci\\u00f3n del movimiento en las extremidades superiores. Al estabilizar este eje diagonal, el reinicio interrumpe la colonizaci\\u00f3n bacteriana en las articulaciones y los tejidos blandos, ayudando al sistema inmunitario a prevenir la degradaci\\u00f3n de los tejidos y la propagaci\\u00f3n sist\\u00e9mica.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT & DERMAL CHECK: If shoulder pain or skin inflammation persists, scan the [BRACHIAL \\/ SUB-DELTOID BURSA] (VERIFICAR - BRAQUIAL \\/ BURSA SUBDELTOIDEA) axis to address localized bacterial clusters. For cases involving severe musculoskeletal decay, cross-reference with the [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] resonance to rule out Mycobacterium synergy. Always monitor the [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N) axis to ensure the effective filtration of toxins released during the bacterial clearance.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y D\\u00c9RMICA: Si el dolor de hombro o la inflamaci\\u00f3n cut\\u00e1nea persisten, escanear el eje BRAQUIAL \\/ BURSA SUBDELTOIDEA para abordar c\\u00famulos bacterianos localizados. Para casos que involucren un deterioro musculoesquel\\u00e9tico severo, realizar una referencia cruzada con la resonancia ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA para descartar la sinergia con Mycobacterium. Siempre monitorear el eje RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N para asegurar la filtraci\\u00f3n efectiva de toxinas liberadas durante la eliminaci\\u00f3n bacteriana.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/253','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:28:17','2026-04-27 14:28:17'),(4054,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',254,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, WEIGHT LOSS, NAUSEA, VOMITING, COUGH AND ABDOMINAL PAIN. (DIARREA, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, TOS Y DOLOR ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD. POOR INTESTINAL ABSORPTION. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS. MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, WEIGHT LOSS, NAUSEA, VOMITING, COUGH, AND ABDOMINAL PAIN.\\n\\n(DIARREA, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, TOS Y DOLOR ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE GIARDIA LAMBLIA PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE EPIGASTRIUM REGION. THIS PROTOZOAN IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER AND COLONIZES THE SMALL INTESTINE, LEADING TO MALABSORPTION OF NUTRIENTS AND SIGNIFICANT GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT NECESSARY FOR THE PARASITE TO ADHERE TO THE INTESTINAL WALL, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE INFECTION AND RESTORING PROPER DIGESTIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO GIARDIA LAMBLIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL EPIGASTRIO. ESTE PROTOZOO SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS O AGUA CONTAMINADOS Y COLONIZA EL INTESTINO DELGADO, LO QUE PROVOCA UNA MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y UN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SIGNIFICATIVO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO NECESARIO PARA QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO SE ADHIERA A LA PARED INTESTINAL, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INTESTINAL & ABSORPTION CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR WEIGHT LOSS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS FURTHER INTESTINAL IMBALANCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE NAUSEA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT SYNERGISTIC PATHOGENS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN FILTERING TOXIC BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THE PARASITE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N: SI LA DIARREA O LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE DUODENO \\/ DUODENO PARA ABORDAR OTROS DESEQUILIBRIOS INTESTINALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN N\\u00c1USEAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA DESCARTAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS SIN\\u00c9RGICOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A FILTRAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS T\\u00d3XICOS LIBERADOS DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/254','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:29:42','2026-04-27 14:29:42'),(4055,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',255,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SNORING. (RONQUIDO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY PASSAGE REGULATION\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC SNORING, SLEEP APNEA, DIFFICULTY SWALLOWING, AND THROAT IRRITATION.\\n\\n(RONQUIDO CR\\u00d3NICO, APNEA DEL SUE\\u00d1O, DIFICULTAD PARA TRAGAR E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE GARGANTA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DYSFUNCTION OF THE EPIGLOTTIS, THE CRITICAL CARTILAGINOUS FLAP THAT PREVENTS FOOD FROM ENTERING THE TRACHEA. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THIS LOCALIZED POINT, THE RESET HELPS RESTORE THE TONE AND ELASTICITY OF THE EPIGLOTTIC TISSUE. THIS IS PARTICULARLY EFFECTIVE FOR REDUCING OR ELIMINATING SNORING CAUSED BY THE RELAXATION OF THROAT STRUCTURES DURING SLEEP. STABILIZING THIS AXIS IMPROVES AIRFLOW DYNAMICS AND ENSURES THE PROPER MECHANICAL FUNCTION OF THE UPPER AIRWAY DURING BOTH RESPIRATION AND DEGLUTITION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA EPIGLOTIS, EL COLGAJO CARTILAGINOSO CR\\u00cdTICO QUE EVITA QUE LOS ALIMENTOS ENTREN EN LA TR\\u00c1QUEA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE PUNTO LOCALIZADO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR EL TONO Y LA ELASTICIDAD DEL TEJIDO EPIGL\\u00d3TICO. ESTO ES PARTICULARMENTE EFECTIVO PARA REDUCIR O ELIMINAR LOS RONQUIDOS CAUSADOS POR LA RELAJACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ESTRUCTURAS DE LA GARGANTA DURANTE EL SUE\\u00d1O. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, SE MEJORAN LAS DIN\\u00c1MICAS DEL FLUJO DE AIRE Y SE ASEGURA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA ADECUADA DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES TANTO DURANTE LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N COMO DURANTE LA DEGLUCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"AIRWAY & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF SNORING IS ACCOMPANIED BY CONGESTION, SCAN THE [NASAL BONE \\/ NASAL BONE] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC THROAT DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LARYNX \\/ LARYNX] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT VOCAL CORD HEALTH. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE ENERGETIC RELEASE OF METABOLIC WASTE FROM THE RESPIRATORY TISSUES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS Y GLANDULAR: SI EL RONQUIDO EST\\u00c1 ACOMPA\\u00d1ADO DE CONGESTI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE HUESO NASAL \\/ HUESO NASAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MOLESTIAS CR\\u00d3NICAS EN LA GARGANTA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA LARINGE \\/ LARINGE PARA APOYAR LA SALUD DE LAS CUERDAS VOCALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE LOS TEJIDOS RESPIRATORIOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/255','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:31:09','2026-04-27 14:31:09'),(4056,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',257,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ACNE VULGARS. FALSE DIABETES. (ACN\\u00c9 VULGAR. DIABETES FALSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE VULGARIS, FALSE DIABETES, SKIN ERUPTIONS, AND METABOLIC DISTURBANCES.\\n\\n(ACN\\u00c9 VULGAR, DIABETES FALSA, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y DISTURBIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE STAPHYLOCOCCUS ALBUS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE EPIPLOON (OMENTUM). THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES SUCH AS ACNE VULGARIS, BUT ITS PRESENCE IN THE ABDOMINAL REGION CAN INTERFERE WITH INSULIN RECEPTION OR PANCREATIC FUNCTION, LEADING TO \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\"\\u2014A CONDITION WHERE BLOOD SUGAR LEVELS APPEAR ELEVATED WITHOUT ORGANIC DAMAGE TO THE PANCREAS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION IN THE PERITONEAL FOLDS, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING SKIN LESIONS AND RESTORING NORMAL GLUCOSE METABOLISM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA STAPHYLOCOCCUS ALBUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL EPIPL\\u00d3N (OMENTO). ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS COMO EL ACN\\u00c9 VULGAR, PERO SU PRESENCIA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL PUEDE INTERFERIR CON LA RECEPCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA O LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA, LO QUE CONDUCE A UNA \\\"DIABETES FALSA\\\", UNA CONDICI\\u00d3N DONDE LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE PARECEN ELEVADOS SIN DA\\u00d1O ORG\\u00c1NICO EN EL P\\u00c1NCREAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA EN LOS PLIEGUES PERITONEALES, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y RESTAURAR EL METABOLISMO NORMAL DE LA GLUCOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & SKIN CHECK: IF BLOOD SUGAR LEVELS REMAIN UNSTABLE, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO RULE OUT FURTHER BACTERIAL INTERFERENCE. FOR PERSISTENT ACNE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] (REF 252) RESONANCE TO ASSESS GENERAL SYSTEMIC TOXICITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST IN THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND WASTE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y DE LA PIEL: SI LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE PERMANECEN INESTABLES, ESCANEAR EL EJE DUODENO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA DESCARTAR OTRA INTERFERENCIA BACTERIANA. PARA EL ACN\\u00c9 PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CODO \\/ CODO (REF 252) PARA EVALUAR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA GENERAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS Y DESECHOS BACTERIANOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/257','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:32:43','2026-04-27 14:32:43'),(4057,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',258,'{\"symptoms\":\"NAUSEA, VOMITING, ABDOMINAL PAIN AND DIARRHEA. (N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD. REPRODUCES IN THE INTESTINAL TRACT. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS. SE REPRODUCE EN EL TRACTO INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"NAUSEA, VOMITING, ABDOMINAL PAIN, AND DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE GIARDIA LAMBLIA PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE ESOPHAGEAL HIATUS. THIS PROTOZOAN IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER AND REPRODUCES WITHIN THE INTESTINAL TRACT, OFTEN CAUSING SIGNIFICANT GASTROINTESTINAL DISRUPTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS SPECIFIC ANATOMICAL POINT\\u2014WHERE THE ESOPHAGUS PASSES THROUGH THE DIAPHRAGM\\u2014THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE THAT ALLOWS THE PARASITE TO PERSIST, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE INFECTION AND REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE UPPER DIGESTIVE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO GIARDIA LAMBLIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL HIATO ESOF\\u00c1GICO. ESTE PROTOZOO SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS O AGUA CONTAMINADOS Y SE REPRODUCE DENTRO DEL TRACTO INTESTINAL, CAUSANDO A MENUDO INTERRUPCIONES GASTROINTESTINALES SIGNIFICATIVAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE PUNTO ANAT\\u00d3MICO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO \\u2014DONDE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO PASA A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL DIAFRAGMA\\u2014 EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PERMITE QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO PERSISTA, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO SUPERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR ABDOMINAL PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE EPIGASTRIUM \\/ EPIGASTRIUM (REF 254) AXIS TO ADDRESS THE CORE COLONIZATION OF GIARDIA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VOMITING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE PARASITIC CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL: SI LA DIARREA O EL DOLOR ABDOMINAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE EPIGASTRIO \\/ EPIGASTRIO (REF 254) PARA ABORDAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N CENTRAL DE GIARDIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN V\\u00d3MITOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/258','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:33:59','2026-04-27 14:33:59'),(4058,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',259,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TUBERCULOSIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BACTERIAL STORAGE (ALMACENAMIENTO BACTERIANO)\",\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR VARIOUS SYSTEMIC ILLNESSES, AS IT ACTS AS A HIDING PLACE FOR PATHOGENS, SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH TUBERCULOSIS.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL PARA DIVERSAS ENFERMEDADES SIST\\u00c9MICAS, YA QUE ACT\\u00daA COMO UN ESCONDITE PARA PAT\\u00d3GENOS, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE ASOCIADO CON LA TUBERCULOSIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE FUNCTIONS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGEAL HIATUS AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, A RESERVOIR IS A LOCATION WHERE PATHOGENS CAN REMAIN DORMANT OR \\\"HIDDEN\\\" FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM, ONLY TO RE-EMERGE AND RE-INFECT THE BODY LATER. THIS PARTICULAR PAIR IS CLOSELY LINKED TO TUBERCULOSIS BACTERIA. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ELIMINATES THE PROTECTIVE ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS THESE MICROORGANISMS TO PERSIST, ENSURING A MORE COMPLETE CLEARANCE DURING SYSTEMIC THERAPY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA FUNCIONA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORTIONES DE PH ENTRE EL HIATO ESOF\\u00c1GICO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, UN RESERVORIO ES UN LUGAR DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES O \\\"OCULTOS\\\" DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO, PARA LUEGO REAPARECER Y REINFECTAR EL CUERPO M\\u00c1S TARDE. ESTE PAR EN PARTICULAR EST\\u00c1 ESTRECHAMENTE VINCULADO A LA BACTERIA DE LA TUBERCULOSIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO ELIMINA EL ENTORNO PROTECTOR QUE PERMITE QUE ESTOS MICROORGANISMOS PERSISTAN, ASEGURANDO UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S COMPLETA DURANTE LA TERAPIA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CLEARANCE CHECK: IF TUBERCULOSIS SYMPTOMS OR CHRONIC COUGH PERSIST, SCAN THE [SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE ACTIVE BACTERIAL LOAD. FOR GENERAL LIVER SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE TO ENHANCE DETOXIFICATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FILTRATION OF PATHOGENS RELEASED FROM THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE TUBERCULOSIS O LA TOS CR\\u00d3NICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO PARA ABORDAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA ACTIVA. PARA EL APOYO HEP\\u00c1TICO GENERAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA MEJORAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS LIBERADOS DE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/259','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:35:10','2026-04-27 14:35:10'),(4059,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',260,'{\"symptoms\":\"ULCERS, FEVER, ACID REFLUX, EAR PAIN. (\\u00daLCERAS, FIEBRE, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO, DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO.)\",\"paths\":\"RHEUMATIC FEVER, GASTROINTESTINAL ULCERS, PANCREATIC CANCER, FIBROUS DYSPLASIA OF THE MANDIBLE. (FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, \\u00daLCERAS GASTROINTESTINALES, C\\u00c1NCER DE P\\u00c1NCREAS, DISPLASIA FIBROSA DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ULCERS, FEVER, ACID REFLUX, AND EAR PAIN.\\n\\n(\\u00daLCERAS, FIEBRE, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO Y DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE STREPTOCOCCUS BETA HEMOLYTIC BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGEAL SPHINCTER AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS. THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY AGGRESSIVE AND IS ASSOCIATED WITH RHEUMATIC FEVER AND THE FORMATION OF GASTROINTESTINAL ULCERS. BEYOND DIGESTIVE ISSUES, ITS RESONANCE CAN INFLUENCE COMPLEX CONDITIONS SUCH AS PANCREATIC CANCER OR FIBROUS DYSPLASIA OF THE MANDIBLE. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ENVIRONMENT, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION AND SUPPORTING THE REPAIR OF MUCOSAL TISSUES IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESTREPTOCOCO BETA HEMOL\\u00cdTICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ESF\\u00cdNTER ESOF\\u00c1GICO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE AGRESIVO Y SE ASOCIA CON LA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00daLCERAS GASTROINTESTINALES. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, SU RESONANCIA PUEDE INFLUIR EN CONDICIONES COMPLEJAS COMO EL C\\u00c1NCER DE P\\u00c1NCREAS O LA DISPLASIA FIBROSA DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL AMBIENTE BACTERIANO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y APOYANDO LA REPARACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS DE LA MUCOSA EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & FEVER CHECK: IF ACID REFLUX OR ULCERS PERSIST, SCAN THE ESOPHAGEAL HIATUS \\/ ESOPHAGEAL HIATUS (REF 258) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING MANDIBULAR PAIN OR DYSPLASIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y DE FIEBRE: SI EL REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO O LAS \\u00daLCERAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE HIATO ESOF\\u00c1GICO \\/ HIATO ESOF\\u00c1GICO (REF 258). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR MANDIBULAR O DISPLASIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/260','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:36:13','2026-04-27 14:36:13'),(4060,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',261,'{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL FOOD INTOLERANCES, CONSTIPATION, OVERWEIGHT AND VARICOSE VEINS. (INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS GASTROINTESTINALES, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, SOBREPESO Y V\\u00c1RICES.)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL FOOD INTOLERANCES, CONSTIPATION, OVERWEIGHT, AND VARICOSE VEINS.\\n\\n(INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS GASTROINTESTINALES, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, SOBREPESO Y V\\u00c1RICES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE BARTONELLA BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGEAL SPHINCTER AND THE APPENDIX. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"CAT SCRATCH DISEASE\\\" BUT IN A BIOMAGNETIC CONTEXT, IT FREQUENTLY CAUSES GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION. THE PRESENCE OF THIS BACTERIA CAN LEAD TO ALTERED DIGESTIVE PERMEABILITY, TRIGGERING FOOD INTOLERANCES AND SLOWING METABOLIC PROCESSES, WHICH MAY MANIFEST AS UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT GAIN OR CHRONIC CONSTIPATION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF PROPER ELIMINATION AND VASCULAR TONE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA BARTONELLA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ESF\\u00cdNTER ESOF\\u00c1GICO Y EL AP\\u00c9NDICE. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON LA \\\"ENFERMEDAD POR ARA\\u00d1AZO DE GATO\\\", PERO EN UN CONTEXTO BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICO, CAUSA FRECUENTEMENTE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL. LA PRESENCIA DE ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE PROVOCAR UNA PERMEABILIDAD DIGESTIVA ALTERADA, DESENCADENANDO INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS Y RALENTIZANDO LOS PROCESOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS, LO QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN AUMENTO DE PESO INEXPLICABLE O ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO CR\\u00d3NICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA Y EL TONO VASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & VASCULAR CHECK: IF FOOD INTOLERANCES OR VARICOSE VEINS PERSIST, SCAN THE [APPENDIX \\/ THYMUS] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AGAINST BARTONELLA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CONSTIPATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL METABOLITES RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y VASCULAR: SI LAS INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS O LAS V\\u00c1RICES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ TIMO PARA REFORZAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA CONTRA BARTONELLA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LOS METABOLITOS BACTERIANOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/261','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:37:28','2026-04-27 14:37:28'),(4061,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',262,'{\"symptoms\":\"CARDIAC DISORDERS, PALPITATIONS, STOMACH DISORDERS, BRONCHITIS, HYPERSALIVATION. (TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS, PALPITACIONES, TRASTORNOS DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO, BRONQUITIS, HIPERSALIVACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"FACIAL PARALYSIS AND CHRONIC MYOFASCIAL PAIN IN THE FACE. (PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL Y DOLOR MIOFASCIAL CR\\u00d3NICO EN LA CARA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CARDIAC DISORDERS, PALPITATIONS, STOMACH DISORDERS, BRONCHITIS, AND HYPERSALIVATION.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS, PALPITACIONES, TRASTORNOS DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO, BRONQUITIS E HIPERSALIVACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE TONGUE. THIS PARASITE IS TYPICALLY ACQUIRED THROUGH THE CONSUMPTION OF UNDERCOOKED MEAT CONTAINING CYSTS. ONCE INGESTED, THE LARVAE MIGRATE THROUGH THE BODY, OFTEN LODGING IN MUSCLE TISSUE. IN A BIOMAGNETIC CONTEXT, THIS RESONANCE IS ASSOCIATED WITH NEUROLOGICAL AND NEUROMUSCULAR DISRUPTIONS, INCLUDING FACIAL PARALYSIS AND CHRONIC MYOFASCIAL PAIN IN THE FACE. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT THE PARASITE REQUIRES, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE LARVAE AND REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE CRANIAL AND DIGESTIVE REGIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y LA LENGUA. ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO SE ADQUIERE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR EL CONSUMO DE CARNE POCO COCIDA QUE CONTIENE QUISTES. UNA VEZ INGERIDAS, LAS LARVAS MIGRAN POR EL CUERPO, ALOJ\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO EN EL TEJIDO MUSCULAR. EN UN CONTEXTO BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICO, ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA CON ALTERACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS Y NEUROMUSCULARES, INCLUYENDO LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL Y EL DOLOR MIOFASCIAL CR\\u00d3NICO EN LA CARA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO REQUIERE, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LAS LARVAS Y REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS REGIONES CRANEAL Y DIGESTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROMUSCULAR & CARDIAC CHECK: IF FACIAL PARALYSIS OR PALPITATIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE [OUTER EAR \\/ OUTER EAR] (REF 555) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CRANIAL NERVE DYSFUNCTION. FOR MUSCLE PAIN IN OTHER AREAS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST IN THE FILTRATION OF PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROMUSCULAR Y CARD\\u00cdACA: SI LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL O LAS PALPITACIONES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE O\\u00cdDO EXTERNO \\/ O\\u00cdDO EXTERNO (REF 555) PARA ABORDAR LA POSIBLE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES. PARA EL DOLOR MUSCULAR EN OTRAS \\u00c1REAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/262','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:38:34','2026-04-27 14:38:34'),(4062,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',263,'{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG INFECTION, DIFFICULT BREATHING, HOARSENESS, BLOODY COUGH AND PNEUMONIA. PLEURISY.  (INFECCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, RONQUERA, TOS CON SANGRE Y NEUMON\\u00cdA. PLEURES\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"HISTOPLASMOSIS, BLADDER AND DIGESTIVE DISORDERS. ATROPHY OF THE SPLEEN. (HISTOPLASMOSIS, TRASTORNOS DE LA VEJIGA Y DIGESTIVOS. ATROFIA DEL BAZO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG INFECTION, DIFFICULT BREATHING, HOARSENESS, BLOODY COUGH, PNEUMONIA, AND PLEURISY.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, RONQUERA, TOS CON SANGRE, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y PLEURES\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HISTOPLASMA CAPSULATUM FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE BLADDER. THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY CONTRACTED BY INHALING SPORES FOUND IN SOIL CONTAMINATED WITH BIRD OR BAT DROPPINGS. WHILE IT PRIMARILY AFFECTS THE LUNGS\\u2014LEADING TO RESPIRATORY DISTRESS AND POTENTIAL PLEURISY\\u2014THE RESONANCE ALSO ADDRESSES DESCENDING DISORDERS IN THE BLADDER AND DIGESTIVE SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIBRATIONAL ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS THE FUNGUS TO COLONIZE, PREVENTING ATROPHY OF THE SPLEEN AND SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE SYSTEMIC INFECTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO HISTOPLASMA CAPSULATUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y LA VEJIGA. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE CONTRAE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR LA INHALACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS QUE SE ENCUENTRAN EN EL SUELO CONTAMINADO CON EXCREMENTOS DE AVES O MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS. SI BIEN AFECTA PRINCIPALMENTE A LOS PULMONES, PROVOCANDO DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA Y POSIBLE PLEURES\\u00cdA, LA RESONANCIA TAMBI\\u00c9N ABORDA TRASTORNOS DESCENDENTES EN LA VEJIGA Y EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO VIBRATORIO QUE PERMITE AL HONGO COLONIZAR, PREVINIENDO LA ATROFIA DEL BAZO Y AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & IMMUNE CHECK: IF LUNG INFECTION OR BLOODY COUGH PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO REINFORCE PULMONARY CLEARANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SIGNIFICANT SPLENIC ATROPHY OR WEAKNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF FUNGAL METABOLITES RELEASED INTO THE BLOODSTREAM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA E INMUNITARIA: SI LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR O LA TOS CON SANGRE PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N PARA REFORZAR LA LIMPIEZA PULMONAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ATROFIA O DEBILIDAD ESPL\\u00c9NICA SIGNIFICATIVA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA BAZO \\/ BAZO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS METABOLITOS F\\u00daNGICOS LIBERADOS EN EL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/263','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:39:37','2026-04-27 14:39:37'),(4063,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',264,'{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS PULMONARES)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY BATS. AFFECTS THE LUNGS AND PULMONARY SYSTEM. (TRANSMITIDO POR MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS. AFECTA LOS PULMONES Y EL SISTEMA PULMONAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG DISORDERS, DRY COUGH, FEVER, CHEST PAIN, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS PULMONARES, TOS SECA, FIEBRE, DOLOR EN EL PECHO Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HISTOPLASMA CAPSULATUM FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE LEFT SIDE OF THE BLADDER. THIS PATHOGEN IS PRIMARILY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE INHALATION OF SPORES OFTEN FOUND IN BIRD OR BAT DROPPINGS. ONCE INHALED, IT IMPACTS THE PULMONARY SYSTEM, POTENTIALLY CAUSING INFLAMMATION IN THE LUNGS AND LYMPH NODES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE THAT ALLOWS THE FUNGUS TO COLONIZE, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING SYSTEMIC SPREAD AND RESTORING RESPIRATORY INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO HISTOPLASMA CAPSULATUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y EL LADO IZQUIERDO DE LA VEJIGA. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE PRINCIPALMENTE POR LA INHALACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS QUE SE ENCUENTRAN A MENUDO EN LOS EXCREMENTOS DE AVES O MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS. UNA VEZ INHALADO, AFECTA EL SISTEMA PULMONAR, CAUSANDO POTENCIALMENTE INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LOS PULMONES Y LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PERMITE AL HONGO COLONIZAR, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PULMONARY & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF LUNG DISORDERS OR COUGH PERSIST, SCAN THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ BLADDER] (REF 263) AXIS TO ADDRESS GENERAL HISTOPLASMA COLONIZATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF FUNGAL METABOLITES RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS TRASTORNOS PULMONARES O LA TOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ VEJIGA (REF 263) PARA ABORDAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DE HISTOPLASMA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS METABOLITOS F\\u00daNGICOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/264','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:40:42','2026-04-27 14:40:42'),(4064,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',265,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CEREBRAL MICROHEMORRHAGE. (MICROHEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CEREBRAL MICROHEMORRHAGE, PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE, URETHRITIS, AND POTENTIAL REPRODUCTIVE TRACT INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(MICROHEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL, ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA P\\u00c9LVICA, URETRITIS Y POSIBLES INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE MYCOPLASMA HOMINIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE DESCENDING COLON. ALTHOUGH TYPICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH UROGENITAL INFECTIONS, IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING VASCULAR FRAGILITY IN THE BRAIN, SPECIFICALLY CEREBRAL MICROHEMORRHAGES. BY STABILIZING THIS LONGITUDINAL AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC CONDITIONS THAT ALLOW THE BACTERIA TO COMPROMISE VASCULAR INTEGRITY AND MUCOSAL HEALTH, SUPPORTING THE BODY IN PREVENTING NEUROLOGICAL COMPLICATIONS AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA MYCOPLASMA HOMINIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y EL COLON DESCENDENTE. AUNQUE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE SE ASOCIA CON INFECCIONES UROGENITALES, EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR LA FRAGILIDAD VASCULAR EN EL CEREBRO, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE LAS MICROHEMORRAGIAS CEREBRALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE LONGITUDINAL, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LAS CONDICIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE PERMITEN QUE LA BACTERIA COMPROMETA LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR Y LA SALUD DE LA MUCOSA, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR & UROGENITAL CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS OR PELVIC DISCOMFORT PERSIST, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO RULE OUT RENAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING CEREBRAL VASCULAR ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT CRANIAL CIRCULATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED FROM THE UROGENITAL TRACT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y UROGENITAL: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O EL MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS RENALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS VASCULARES CEREBRALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL PARA APOYAR LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N CRANEAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DEL TRACTO UROGENITAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/265','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:41:46','2026-04-27 14:41:46'),(4065,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',266,'{\"symptoms\":\"ORAL, VAGINAL, RECTAL, AND OCULAR INFECTIONS. RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, CYSTITIS. (INFECCIONES ORALES, VAGINALES, RECTALES Y OCULARES. INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"IMMUNE DEFICIENCIES. (DEFICIENCIAS INMUNOL\\u00d3GICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/RING FINGERS (VERIFICAR - CODO\\/DEDOS ANULARES)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ORAL, VAGINAL, RECTAL, AND OCULAR INFECTIONS. RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, CYSTITIS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES ORALES, VAGINALES, RECTALES Y OCULARES. INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CANDIDA GLABRATA FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE FIRST DORSAL VERTEBRA (D1). UNLIKE COMMON CANDIDA ALBIFANS, THIS SPECIES IS OFTEN MORE RESISTANT TO TRADITIONAL TREATMENTS AND IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH UNDERLYING IMMUNE DEFICIENCIES. THE RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE COLONIZATION OF MUCOSAL SURFACES THROUGHOUT THE BODY, FROM THE DIGESTIVE TRACT TO THE REPRODUCTIVE AND RESPIRATORY SYSTEMS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT REQUIRED FOR FUNGAL OVERGROWTH, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REGAINING CONTROL OVER SYSTEMIC MICROBIAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO C\\u00c1NDIDA GLABRATA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL (D1). A DIFERENCIA DE LA C\\u00c1NDIDA ALBICANS COM\\u00daN, ESTA ESPECIE SUELE SER M\\u00c1S RESISTENTE A LOS TRATAMIENTOS TRADICIONALES Y SE ASOCIA CON FRECUENCIA A DEFICIENCIAS INMUNOL\\u00d3GICAS SUBYACENTES. LA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS SUPERFICIES MUCOSAS EN TODO EL CUERPO, DESDE EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO HASTA LOS SISTEMAS REPRODUCTOR Y RESPIRATORIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO REQUERIDO PARA EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RECUPERAR EL CONTROL SOBRE EL EQUILIBRIO MICROBIANO SIST\\u00c9MICO.))\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF MUCOSAL INFECTIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ RING FINGER] (VERIFICAR - CODO \\/ DEDOS ANULARES) AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CLEARANCE OF FUNGAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTRIC DISORDERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ DESCENDING COLON] (REF 265) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE FILTRATION OF FUNGAL METABOLITES RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LAS INFECCIONES DE LA MUCOSA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CODO \\/ DEDOS ANULARES PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS F\\u00daNGICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE (REF 265). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LOS METABOLITOS F\\u00daNGICOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/266','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:43:43','2026-04-27 14:43:43'),(4066,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',267,'{\"origins\":\"CANDIDA ALGABRATA\",\"symptoms\":\"ORAL, VAGINAL, RECTAL, AND OCULAR INFECTIONS. RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, CYSTITIS. (ORAL, VAGINAL, RECTAL, AND OCULAR INFECTIONS. RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, CYSTITIS. (INFECCIONES ORALES, VAGINALES, RECTALES Y OCULARES. INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"IMMUNE DEFICIENCIES. (DEFICIENCIAS INMUNOL\\u00d3GICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/RING FINGERS (VERIFICAR - CODO\\/DEDOS ANULARES)\"}','{\"origins\":\"CANDIDA GLABRATA (C\\u00c1NDIDA GLABRATA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ORAL, VAGINAL, RECTAL, AND OCULAR INFECTIONS. RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, CYSTITIS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES ORALES, VAGINALES, RECTALES Y OCULARES. INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CANDIDA GLABRATA FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE SECOND DORSAL VERTEBRA (D2). THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN CHARACTERIZED BY ITS RESISTANCE TO STANDARD ANTIFUNGAL TREATMENTS AND FREQUENTLY PROLIFERATES IN INDIVIDUALS WITH UNDERLYING IMMUNE DEFICIENCIES. BY STABILIZING THIS SPECIFIC AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE THAT ALLOWS THE FUNGUS TO COLONIZE THE MUCOSAL LININGS OF THE DIGESTIVE, RESPIRATORY, AND REPRODUCTIVE TRACTS, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN RESTORING MICROBIAL BALANCE AND PREVENTING RECURRENT INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO C\\u00c1NDIDA GLABRATA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y LA SEGUNDA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL (D2). ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE CARACTERIZA A MENUDO POR SU RESISTENCIA A LOS TRATAMIENTOS ANTIF\\u00daNGICOS EST\\u00c1NDAR Y PROLIFERA FRECUENTEMENTE EN PERSONAS CON DEFICIENCIAS INMUNOL\\u00d3GICAS SUBYACENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PERMITE AL HONGO COLONIZAR LOS REVESTIMIENTOS MUCOSOS DE LOS TRACTOS DIGESTIVO, RESPIRATORIO Y REPRODUCTOR, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO MICROBIANO Y PREVENIR INFECCIONES RECURRENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE & MUCOSAL CHECK: IF INFECTIONS PERSIST IN THE MUCOSA OR EYES, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ RING FINGER] (VERIFICAR - CODO \\/ DEDOS ANULARES) AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CLEARANCE OF FUNGAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IMMUNE COMPROMISE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ DORSAL 1] (REF 266) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF FUNGAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y MUCOSA: SI LAS INFECCIONES PERSISTEN EN LA MUCOSA O LOS OJOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE CODO \\/ DEDOS ANULARES PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS F\\u00daNGICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN COMPROMISO INMUNITARIO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ DORSAL 1 (REF 266). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/267','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:45:14','2026-04-27 14:45:14'),(4067,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',268,'{\"symptoms\":\"TRUE CANCER OR TUMOR, DESTROYS SKIN, LIMB ATROPHY, BLINDNESS, ASTHMA, CATARACTS, HEMORRHOIDS. (C\\u00c1NCER VERDADERO O TUMOR, DESTRUYE LA PIEL, ATROFIA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES, CEGUERA, ASMA, CATARATAS, HEMORROIDES)\",\"paths\":\"VERY AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA. IT MAY PASS TO FETUS. (BACTERIA MUY AGRESIVA. PUEDE PASAR AL FETO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SCAPULA, FEMORAL TRIANGLE, DORSAL 8.     CHECK - SCAPULA\\/SCAPULA. (VERIFICAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA, TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL, DORSAL 8. VERIFICAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA\\/ESC\\u00c1PULA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"TRUE CANCER OR TUMOR, DESTROYS SKIN, LIMB ATROPHY, BLINDNESS, ASTHMA, CATARACTS, AND HEMORRHOIDS.\\n\\n(C\\u00c1NCER VERDADERO O TUMOR, DESTRUYE LA PIEL, ATROFIA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES, CEGUERA, ASMA, CATARATAS Y HEMORROIDES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE DUODENUM. THIS PATHOGEN IS EXTREMELY AGGRESSIVE AND IS ASSOCIATED WITH SEVERE TISSUE DEGRADATION AND THE FORMATION OF TRUE NEOPLASMS (CANCER). IT HAS THE CAPACITY TO BE TRANSMITTED FROM MOTHER TO FETUS AND OFTEN IMPACTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, LEADING TO ATROPHY OR LOSS OF SENSORY FUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION IN THE DIGESTIVE AND SYSTEMIC PATHWAYS, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ARRESTING TISSUE DESTRUCTION AND PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF CHRONIC DEGENERATIVE CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y EL DUODENO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES EXTREMADAMENTE AGRESIVO Y SE ASOCIA CON LA DEGRADACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DE LOS TEJIDOS Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE NEOPLASIAS VERDADERAS (C\\u00c1NCER). TIENE LA CAPACIDAD DE TRANSMITIRSE DE MADRE A FETO Y A MENUDO AFECTA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, LO QUE PROVOCA ATROFIA O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA EN LAS V\\u00cdAS DIGESTIVAS Y SIST\\u00c9MICAS, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A DETENER LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS Y PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE CONDICIONES DEGENERATIVAS CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & TISSUE CHECK: IF SKIN DESTRUCTION OR LIMB ATROPHY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE CORE RESONANCE OF MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CHRONIC ILLNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FEMORAL TRIANGLE \\/ FEMORAL TRIANGLE] OR [DORSAL 8 \\/ DORSAL 8] RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE FILTRATION OF AGGRESSIVE BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y DE TEJIDOS: SI LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL O LA ATROFIA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA PARA ABORDAR LA RESONANCIA CENTRAL DE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ENFERMEDADES CR\\u00d3NICAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL \\/ TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL O DORSAL 8 \\/ DORSAL 8. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LAS AGRESIVAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/268','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:46:29','2026-04-27 14:46:29'),(4068,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',269,'{\"symptoms\":\"BILIARY PAIN, JAUNDICE, FOOD INTOLERANCE, DIGESTION PROBLEMS, HEART PROBLEMS. (DOLOR BILIAR, ICTERICIA, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, PROBLEMAS CARD\\u00cdACOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY LETTUCE, WATERCRESS, ETC... SEVERE HEPATIC IMPAIRMENT, LIVER ABSCESS, CIRRHOSIS, HEPATITIS. ALTERS THE HEART ELECTRICAL CONDUCTION. MAIN CAUSE OF ARRHYTHMIAS AND SEIZURES. (TRANSMITIDO POR LECHUGA, BERRO, ETC... DETERIORO HEP\\u00c1TICO SEVERO, ABSCESO HEP\\u00c1TICO, CIRROSIS, HEPATITIS. ALTERA LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N EL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N. PRINCIPAL CAUSA DE ARRITMIAS Y CONVULSIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BILIARY PAIN, JAUNDICE, FOOD INTOLERANCE, DIGESTION PROBLEMS, HEART PROBLEMS.\\n\\n(DOLOR BILIAR, ICTERICIA, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, PROBLEMAS CARD\\u00cdACOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE FASCIOLOPSIS BUSKI PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE VERTICAL AXIS OF THE ESOPHAGUS. THIS TREMATODE (FLUKE) IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE CONSUMPTION OF CONTAMINATED AQUATIC PLANTS LIKE LETTUCE OR WATERCRESS. ONCE ESTABLISHED, IT CAN CAUSE SEVERE HEPATIC IMPAIRMENT, LIVER ABSCESSES, CIRRHOSIS, AND HEPATITIS. CRITICALLY, THIS PATHOGEN ALTERS THE HEART\'S ELECTRICAL CONDUCTION, ACTING AS A MAIN CAUSE OF ARRHYTHMIAS AND SEIZURES. BY STABILIZING THIS VERTICAL AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE PARASITE\'S ENERGETIC HOLD, SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF LIVER HEALTH AND STABILIZING CARDIAC RHYTHMS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO FASCIOLOPSIS BUSKI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DEL EJE VERTICAL DEL ES\\u00d3FAGO. ESTE TREMATODO SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONSUMO DE PLANTAS ACU\\u00c1TICAS CONTAMINADAS COMO LA LECHUGA O EL BERRO. UNA VEZ ESTABLECIDO, PUEDE CAUSAR UN DETERIORO HEP\\u00c1TICO SEVERO, ABSCESOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS, CIRROSIS Y HEPATITIS. FUNDAMENTALMENTE, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ALTERA LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N EL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N, ACTUANDO COMO UNA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE ARRITMIAS Y CONVULSIONES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE VERTICAL, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL DOMINIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO, APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA SALUD HEP\\u00c1TICA Y ESTABILIZANDO LOS RITMOS CARD\\u00cdACOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & CARDIAC CHECK: IF ARRHYTHMIAS OR BILIARY PAIN PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT TISSUE DAMAGE FROM THE PARASITE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEIZURES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO STABILIZE CRANIAL ELECTRICAL ACTIVITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THIS LARGE INTESTINAL FLUKE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y CARD\\u00cdACA: SI LAS ARRITMIAS O EL DOLOR BILIAR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA ABORDAR EL DA\\u00d1O TISULAR DIRECTO DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONVULSIONES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL PARA ESTABILIZAR LA ACTIVIDAD EL\\u00c9CTRICA CRANEAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE GRAN TREMATODO INTESTINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/269','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:47:33','2026-04-27 14:47:33'),(4069,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',270,'{\"symptoms\":\"GANGRENE, MYOFASCIAL PAIN, GASTROINTESTINAL PAIN, SPEECH DISORDERS. (GANGRENA, DOLOR MIOFASCIAL, DOLOR GASTROINTESTINAL, TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA,)\",\"paths\":\"TOXINS THAT PRODUCE, SUDDEN APHASIA AND NECROTIC ENTERITIS OR GAS GANGRENE. (TOXINAS QUE PRODUCEN AFASIA S\\u00daBITA Y ENTERITIS NECR\\u00d3TICA O GANGRENA GASEOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GANGRENE, MYOFASCIAL PAIN, GASTROINTESTINAL PAIN, AND SPEECH DISORDERS.\\n\\n(GANGRENA, DOLOR MIOFASCIAL, DOLOR GASTROINTESTINAL Y TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ESOPHAGUS AND THE PYLORUS. THIS ANAEROBIC PATHOGEN IS KNOWN FOR PRODUCING POTENT TOXINS THAT CAN LEAD TO NECROTIC ENTERITIS OR GAS GANGRENE. CLINICALLY, THE RESONANCE IS SIGNIFICANT FOR ADDRESSING SUDDEN APHASIA (LOSS OF SPEECH) AND SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE TOXIC ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS THE BACTERIA TO COMPROMISE TISSUE INTEGRITY AND NEUROLOGICAL SIGNALING, SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF PROPER DIGESTION AND COMMUNICATION FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ES\\u00d3FAGO Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ANAEROBIO ES CONOCIDO POR PRODUCIR TOXINAS POTENTES QUE PUEDEN CONDUCIR A ENTERITIS NECR\\u00d3TICA O GANGRENA GASEOSA. CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE, LA RESONANCIA ES SIGNIFICATIVA PARA ABORDAR LA AFASIA S\\u00daBITA (P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL HABLA) Y EL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SEVERO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO T\\u00d3XICO QUE PERMITE QUE LA BACTERIA COMPROMETA LA INTEGRIDAD DE LOS TEJIDOS Y LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES DIGESTIVAS Y DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ADECUADAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & SPEECH CHECK: IF SUDDEN APHASIA OR GASTROINTESTINAL PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO RULE OUT NEUROLOGICAL INTERFERENCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MUSCLE PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y DEL HABLA: SI LA AFASIA S\\u00daBITA O EL DOLOR GASTROINTESTINAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR MUSCULAR SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/270','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 14:48:49','2026-04-27 14:48:49'),(4070,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',271,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR SYSTEMIC FEVER, GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT, AND RECURRENT INFECTIONS DUE TO PATHOGEN STORAGE.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL PARA FIEBRE SIST\\u00c9MICA, MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL E INFECCIONES RECURRENTES DEBIDO AL ALMACENAMIENTO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS.)\",\"paths\":\"POTENTIAL FOR SYSTEMIC FEVER, GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT, AND RECURRENT INFECTIONS DUE TO PATHOGEN STORAGE.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL PARA FIEBRE SIST\\u00c9MICA, MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL E INFECCIONES RECURRENTES DEBIDO AL ALMACENAMIENTO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CLEARANCE CHECK: IF FEVER OR DIGESTIVE ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [TROCHANTER MINOR \\/ TROCHANTER MINOR] AXIS TO ADDRESS OTHER POTENTIAL PARATYPHIC RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACTIVE INFECTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PERI-PANCREATIC \\/ PERI-PANCREATIC] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL LOADS RELEASED FROM THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA FIEBRE O LOS PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE TROC\\u00c1NTER MENOR \\/ TROC\\u00c1NTER MENOR PARA ABORDAR OTROS POSIBLES RESERVORIOS PARAT\\u00cdFICOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCI\\u00d3N ACTIVA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PERIPANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ PERIPANCRE\\u00c1TICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/271','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:22:45','2026-04-27 18:22:45'),(4071,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',272,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SINUSITIS\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - FRONTAL SINUS\\/PARANASAL SINUS (VERIFICAR - SENO FRONTAL \\/ SENOS PARANASALES)\"}','{\"radical\":\"VIRUS\",\"origins\":\"ETHMOIDAL VIRUS (VIRUS ETMOIDAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SINUSITIS, FRONTAL HEADACHE, NASAL CONGESTION, HYPOSMIA (REDUCED SMELL), AND OCULAR INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(SINUSITIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA FRONTAL, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL, HIPOSMIA (REDUCCI\\u00d3N DEL OLFATO) E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N OCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ETHMOIDAL VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE ETHMOIDAL SINUSES, LOCATED BETWEEN THE EYES. THIS RESONANCE IS THE PRIMARY PAIR FOR ADDRESSING VIRAL SINUSITIS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET REDUCES INFLAMMATION IN THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES, FACILITATING THE DRAINAGE OF ACCUMULATED FLUIDS AND RELIEVING PRESSURE IN THE CRANIOFACIAL REGION. IT IS ALSO ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING SECONDARY EFFECTS ON THE EYES AND RESTORING THE PROPER FUNCTION OF THE OLFACTORY NERVES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS ETMOIDAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LOS SENOS ETMOIDALES, UBICADOS ENTRE LOS OJOS. ESTA RESONANCIA ES EL PAR PRIMARIO PARA ABORDAR LA SINUSITIS VIRAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, FACILITANDO EL DRENAJE DE LOS L\\u00cdQUIDOS ACUMULADOS Y ALIVIANDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N EN LA REGI\\u00d3N CRANEOFACIAL. TAMBI\\u00c9N ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LOS EFECTOS SECUNDARIOS EN LOS OJOS Y RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS NERVIOS OLFATIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF SINUS PRESSURE OR CONGESTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [FRONTAL SINUS \\/ PARANASAL SINUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS BROADER RESPIRATORY COLONIZATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING EYE INFECTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DORSAL 7 \\/ DORSAL 7] (REF 226) RESONANCE TO CLEAR BACTERIAL RESERVOIRS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LA PRESI\\u00d3N SINUSAL O LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE SENO FRONTAL \\/ SENO PARANASAL PARA ABORDAR UNA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA M\\u00c1S AMPLIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES OCULARES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA DORSAL 7 \\/ DORSAL 7 (REF 226) PARA ELIMINAR LOS RESERVORIOS BACTERIANOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES LIBERADOS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/272','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:25:18','2026-04-27 18:25:18'),(4072,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',273,'{\"paths\":\"CONGENITAL MALFORMATIONS. CEREBRAL PALSY. (MALFORMACIONES CONG\\u00c9NITAS. PAR\\u00c1LISIS CEREBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE EXTERIOR KNEE LIGAMENT AND THE QUADRATUS LUMBORUM MUSCLE. THIS PATHOGEN IS PARTICULARLY CRITICAL IN THE CONTEXT OF DEVELOPMENT, AS IT IS ASSOCIATED WITH CONGENITAL MALFORMATIONS AND CEREBRAL PALSY IF PRESENT DURING EARLY STAGES OF LIFE. IN ADULTS OR SCHOOL-AGED CHILDREN, ITS RESONANCE MAY MANIFEST AS HEARING IMPAIRMENTS OR COGNITIVE DIFFICULTIES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL INFLUENCE ON THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, SUPPORTING AUDITORY CLARITY AND COGNITIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LIGAMENTO EXTERNO DE LA RODILLA Y EL M\\u00daSCULO CUADRADO LUMBAR. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES PARTICULARMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO EN EL CONTEXTO DEL DESARROLLO, YA QUE SE ASOCIA CON MALFORMACIONES CONG\\u00c9NITAS Y PAR\\u00c1LISIS CEREBRAL SI SE PRESENTA DURANTE ETAPAS TEMPRANAS DE LA VIDA. EN ADULTOS O NI\\u00d1OS EN EDAD ESCOLAR, SU RESONANCIA PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DEFICIENCIAS AUDITIVAS O DIFICULTADES COGNITIVAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA INFLUENCIA BACTERIANA SOBRE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, APOYANDO LA CLARIDAD AUDITIVA Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & AUDITORY CHECK: IF DEAFNESS OR LEARNING DISABILITIES PERSIST, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT BACTERIAL LOAD IN THE AUDITORY AREA. FOR CASES INVOLVING MOTOR DEVELOPMENT DISORDERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FEMORAL NERVE \\/ FEMORAL NERVE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y AUDITIVA: SI LA SORDERA O LAS DIFICULTADES DE APRENDIZAJE PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES PARA ABORDAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA DIRECTA EN EL \\u00c1REA AUDITIVA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TRASTORNOS DEL DESARROLLO MOTOR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA NERVIO FEMORAL \\/ NERVIO FEMORAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/273','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:27:02','2026-04-27 18:27:02'),(4073,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',274,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"REDUCES THE SWELLING IN THE OPTIC NERVE IN ONE WITH DIABETES. (REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO EN PERSONAS CON DIABETES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - EYE (R)\\/CEREBELLUM (R)                                   CHECK - EYE (L)\\/CEREBELLUM (L) (VERIFICAR - OJO (D) \\/ CEREBELO (D)\\nVERIFICAR - OJO (I) \\/ CEREBELO (I))\"}','{\"origins\":\"OPTIC NERVE REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS DESIGNED TO REDUCE SWELLING IN THE OPTIC NERVE, PARTICULARLY IN INDIVIDUALS WITH DIABETES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE EYE AND THE CEREBELLUM, THE RESET SUPPORTS VASCULAR INTEGRITY AND REDUCES INFLAMMATORY PRESSURE ON THE NERVE FIBERS RESPONSIBLE FOR TRANSMITTING VISUAL INFORMATION TO THE BRAIN. STABILIZING THIS AXIS HELPS PROTECT THE RETINA FROM DEGENERATIVE CHANGES AND IMPROVES THE OVERALL COORDINATION OF VISUAL PERCEPTION PROCESSED BY THE CEREBELLUM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA PARA REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO, PARTICULARMENTE EN PERSONAS CON DIABETES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL OJO Y EL CEREBELO, EL REINICIO APOYA LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR Y REDUCE LA PRESI\\u00d3N INFLAMATORIA EN LAS FIBRAS NERVIOSAS RESPONSABLES DE TRANSMITIR LA INFORMACI\\u00d3N VISUAL AL CEREBRO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE AYUDA A PROTEGER LA RETINA DE CAMBIOS DEGENERATIVOS Y MEJORA LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DE LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N VISUAL PROCESADA POR EL CEREBELO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VISUAL & METABOLIC CHECK: IF OPTIC SWELLING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [EYE (R) \\/ CEREBELLUM (R)] AND [EYE (L) \\/ CEREBELLUM (L)] AXES TO ADDRESS UNILATERAL DISTORTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING HIGH BLOOD SUGAR, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [EPIPLOON \\/ EPIPLOON] (REF 257) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS \\\"FALSE DIABETES.\\\" ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF INFLAMMATORY BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VISUAL Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N \\u00d3PTICA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR LOS EJES OJO (D) \\/ CEREBELO (D) Y OJO (I) \\/ CEREBELO (I) PARA ABORDAR LAS DISTORSIONES UNILATERALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN NIVELES ALTOS DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA EPIPL\\u00d3N \\/ EPIPL\\u00d3N (REF 257) PARA ABORDAR LA \\\"DIABETES FALSA\\\". SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS INFLAMATORIOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/274','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:28:18','2026-04-27 18:28:18'),(4074,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',275,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR GASTRIC ULCERS, GASTRITIS, AND PERSISTENT DIGESTIVE INFLAMMATION DUE TO PATHOGEN STORAGE.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL PARA \\u00daLCERAS G\\u00c1STRICAS, GASTRITIS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA PERSISTENTE DEBIDO AL ALMACENAMIENTO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE FUNCTIONS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE EYE AND THE ESOPHAGUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS RECOGNIZED AS A \\\"HIDING PLACE\\\" FOR HELICOBACTER PYLORI. WHILE THIS BACTERIA IS FAMOUS FOR CAUSING GASTRITIS AND PEPTIC ULCERS IN THE STOMACH, IT CAN REMAIN LATENT IN THIS ENERGETIC AXIS, EVADING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND CAUSING RECURRENT INFECTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS PATHWAY, THE RESET ELIMINATES THE PROTECTIVE ENVIRONMENT FOR THE BACTERIA, ENSURING THAT SYSTEMIC THERAPY CAN FULLY CLEAR THE PATHOGEN FROM THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA FUNCIONA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL OJO Y EL ES\\u00d3FAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR SE RECONOCE COMO UN \\\"ESCONDITE\\\" PARA EL HELICOBACTER PYLORI. SI BIEN ESTA BACTERIA ES FAMOSA POR CAUSAR GASTRITIS Y \\u00daLCERAS P\\u00c9PTICAS EN EL EST\\u00d3MAGO, PUEDE PERMANECER LATENTE EN ESTE EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO, EVADIENDO EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y CAUSANDO INFECCIONES RECURRENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA V\\u00cdA, EL REINICIO ELIMINA EL ENTORNO PROTECTOR DE LA BACTERIA, ASEGURANDO QUE LA TERAPIA SIST\\u00c9MICA PUEDA ELIMINAR COMPLETAMENTE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CLEARANCE CHECK: IF GASTRIC BURNING OR ULCER SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [HIATUS \\/ TESTIS] OR [HIATUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE ACTIVE COLONIZATION OF HELICOBACTER PYLORI. FOR GENERAL DIGESTIVE SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL METABOLITES RELEASED FROM THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL ARDOR G\\u00c1STRICO O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE \\u00daLCERA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE HIATO \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO O HIATO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO PARA ABORDAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N ACTIVA DE HELICOBACTER PYLORI. PARA EL APOYO DIGESTIVO GENERAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LOS METABOLITOS BACTERIANOS LIBERADOS DE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/275','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:29:24','2026-04-27 18:29:24'),(4075,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',276,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE WEAKNESS, PARALYSIS, MENTAL RETARDATION, , CENTRAL NERVOUS DISORDERS, EYE PROBLEMS. (DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, DISCAPACIDAD INTELECTUAL, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, PROBLEMAS OCULARES)\",\"paths\":\"LARGEST PRODUCER OF TRUE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. IT ATTACKS THE MEDULLA. (MAYOR PRODUCTOR DE ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE VERDADERA. ATACA EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH FUNGUS; GLAUCOMA.               ASSOCIATED WITH BACTERIA; BLEEDING FORM THE OPTIC NERVE.                                         CHECK - CANTHUS,RIB1, AND OTHER FUNGI, TONGUE, DORSAL2, SCAPULA, NECK, CERVICAL 3, AND DELTOID. (ASOCIADO CON HONGOS; GLAUCOMA. ASOCIADO CON BACTERIAS; SANGRADO DEL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO. VERIFICAR - CANTO, COSTILLA 1, Y OTROS HONGOS, LENGUA, DORSAL 2, ESC\\u00c1PULA, CUELLO, CERVICAL 3 Y DELTOIDES)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE WEAKNESS, PARALYSIS, MENTAL RETARDATION, CENTRAL NERVOUS DISORDERS, AND EYE PROBLEMS.\\n\\n(DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, DISCAPACIDAD INTELECTUAL, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y PROBLEMAS OCULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CYTOMEGALOVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE OCULAR AXIS. THIS PATHOGEN IS RECOGNIZED AS THE LARGEST PRODUCER OF \\\"TRUE\\\" MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, AS IT ATTACKS THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA (BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO). BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIRAL RESONANCE THAT COMPROMISES THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, HELPING TO PREVENT DEGENERATIVE DAMAGE TO THE MYELIN SHEATH AND SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF NEUROLOGICAL AND VISUAL FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL CITOMEGALOVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE OCULAR. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES RECONOCIDO COMO EL MAYOR PRODUCTOR DE ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE \\\"VERDADERA\\\" EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, YA QUE ATACA EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA RESONANCIA VIRAL QUE COMPROMETE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, AYUDANDO A PREVENIR EL DA\\u00d1O DEGENERATIVO EN LA VAINA DE MIELINA Y APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS Y VISUALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF MUSCLE WEAKNESS OR NERVOUS DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [CANTHUS \\/ CANTHUS] OR [NECK \\/ NECK] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING GLAUCOMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH FUNGAL RESONANCES SUCH AS [RIB 1 \\/ RIB 1]. IF BLEEDING FROM THE OPTIC NERVE OCCURS, CHECK FOR BACTERIAL SYNERGIES IN THE [TONGUE \\/ TONGUE] OR [DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2] REGIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR O LOS TRASTORNOS NERVIOSOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CANTO \\/ CANTO O CUELLO \\/ CUELLO PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN GLAUCOMA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON RESONANCIAS F\\u00daNGICAS COMO COSTILLA 1 \\/ COSTILLA 1. SI SE PRODUCE SANGRADO DEL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO, BUSCAR SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS EN LAS REGIONES LENGUA \\/ LENGUA O DORSAL 2 \\/ DORSAL 2. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/276','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:30:45','2026-04-27 18:30:45'),(4076,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',277,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CATARACTS AND EYE DISEASES. SHOULDER AND NECK PARALYSIS. LACTATION DISORDERS. (CATARATAS Y ENFERMEDADES OCULARES. PAR\\u00c1LISIS DE HOMBRO Y CUELLO. TRASTORNOS DE LA LACTANCIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EYE & SHOULDER AXIS (EJE OCULAR Y DEL HOMBRO)\",\"symptoms\":\"CATARACTS, EYE DISEASES, SHOULDER AND NECK PARALYSIS, AND LACTATION DISORDERS.\\n\\n(CATARATAS Y ENFERMEDADES OCULARES, PAR\\u00c1LISIS DE HOMBRO Y CUELLO, Y TRASTORNOS DE LA LACTANCIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE BETWEEN THE EYE AND THE SCAPULA ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE OF THE BODY. UNLIKE PATHOGENIC PAIRS, THIS RESET FOCUSES ON RESTORING THE PROPER FUNCTION OF THE BIOCONTROL SYSTEMS GOVERNING VISION AND UPPER BODY MOBILITY. IT IS PARTICULARLY EFFECTIVE FOR CLEARING ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES ASSOCIATED WITH CATARACTS AND OTHER DEGENERATIVE EYE CONDITIONS. ADDITIONALLY, BY STABILIZING THIS CROSS-BODY AXIS, IT RELIEVES NEUROMUSCULAR TENSION THAT CAN LEAD TO PARALYSIS OR RIGIDITY IN THE SHOULDER AND NECK, WHILE ALSO HARMONIZING GLANDULAR PROCESSES RELATED TO LACTATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ENTRE EL OJO Y LA ESC\\u00c1PULA DEL LADO OPUESTO DEL CUERPO. A DIFERENCIA DE LOS PARES PAT\\u00d3GENOS, ESTE REINICIO SE CENTRA EN RESTAURAR EL FUNCIONAMIENTO ADECUADO DE LOS SISTEMAS DE BIOCONTROL QUE RIGEN LA VISI\\u00d3N Y LA MOVILIDAD DE LA PARTE SUPERIOR DEL CUERPO. ES PARTICULARMENTE EFICAZ PARA ELIMINAR LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS ASOCIADOS CON LAS CATARATAS Y OTRAS CONDICIONES OCULARES DEGENERATIVAS. ADEM\\u00c1S, AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE CRUZADO, ALIVIA LA TENSI\\u00d3N NEUROMUSCULAR QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR PAR\\u00c1LISIS O RIGIDEZ EN EL HOMBRO Y EL CUELLO, AL TIEMPO QUE ARMONIZA LOS PROCESOS GLANDULARES RELACIONADOS CON LA LACTANCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VISUAL & MOBILITY CHECK: IF EYE SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [EYE \\/ EYE] (REF 276) AXIS TO RULE OUT VIRAL INTERFERENCE FROM CYTOMEGALOVIRUS. FOR PERSISTENT SHOULDER RIGIDITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL BACTERIAL LOADS. IF LACTATION ISSUES ARE THE PRIMARY CONCERN, ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PITUITARY \\/ PITUITARY] AXIS TO ENSURE HORMONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VISUAL Y DE MOVILIDAD: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS OCULARES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE OJO \\/ OJO (REF 276) PARA DESCARTAR LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL DEL CITOMEGALOVIRUS. PARA LA RIGIDEZ PERSISTENTE DEL HOMBRO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES CARGAS BACTERIANAS. SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE LACTANCIA SON LA PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N PRINCIPAL, SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE PITUITARIA \\/ PITUITARIA PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO HORMONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/277','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:44:04','2026-04-27 18:44:04'),(4077,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',278,'{\"origins\":\"SYNCYTIAL (SINCITIAL\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMED LUNGS, RESPIRATORY FAILURE SHORTNESS OF BREATH, TACHYPNEA, BLUISH SKIN COLOR, WHEEZING, CONGESTION, COUGHING, RHINITIS, PHARYNGITIS, LARYNGITIS AND FVER. (PULMONES INFLAMADOS, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA, FALTA DE AIRE, TAQUIPNEA, COLOR AZULADO DE LA PIEL, SIBILANCIAS, CONGESTI\\u00d3N, TOS, RINITIS, FARINGITIS, LARINGITIS Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRUS AFFECTS CHILDREN SEVERELY. (ESTE VIRUS AFECTA GRAVEMENTE A LOS NI\\u00d1OS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY SYNCYTIAL VIRUS (VIRUS SINCITIAL RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMED LUNGS, RESPIRATORY FAILURE, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, TACHYPNEA, BLUISH SKIN COLOR, WHEEZING, CONGESTION, COUGHING, RHINITIS, PHARYNGITIS, LARYNGITIS, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(PULMONES INFLAMADOS, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA, FALTA DE AIRE, TAQUIPNEA, COLOR AZULADO DE LA PIEL, SIBILANCIAS, CONGESTI\\u00d3N, TOS, RINITIS, FARINGITIS, LARINGITIS Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE RESPIRATORY SYNCYTIAL VIRUS (RSV) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE EYEBROW AXIS. THIS VIRUS IS A MAJOR CAUSE OF LOWER RESPIRATORY TRACT INFECTIONS, PARTICULARLY IN CHILDREN AND INFANTS, OFTEN LEADING TO BRONCHIOLITIS AND PNEUMONIA. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIRAL RESONANCE THAT TRIGGERS SEVERE INFLAMMATION IN THE LUNGS AND AIRWAYS. THIS INTERVENTION SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE INFECTION, REDUCING RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, AND RESTORING PROPER OXYGENATION LEVELS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS SINCITIAL RESPIRATORIO (VSR) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE DE LAS CEJAS. ESTE VIRUS ES UNA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO INFERIOR, PARTICULARMENTE EN NI\\u00d1OS Y LACTANTES, QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A BRONQUIOLITIS Y NEUMON\\u00cdA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA RESONANCIA VIRAL QUE DESENCADENA UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA EN LOS PULMONES Y LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS. ESTA INTERVENCI\\u00d3N AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N, REDUCIENDO LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA Y RESTAURANDO LOS NIVELES ADECUADOS DE OXIGENACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & PEDIATRIC CHECK: IF SEVERE WHEEZING OR RESPIRATORY FAILURE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED PULMONARY INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING HIGH FEVER AND RHINITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [EYE \\/ EYE] (REF 276) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER VIRAL SYNERGIES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y PEDI\\u00c1TRICA: SI LAS SIBILANCIAS SEVERAS O LA INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR LOCALIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE ALTA Y RINITIS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA OJO \\/ OJO (REF 276) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS SINERGIAS VIRALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LAS TOXINAS VIRALES LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE LIMPIEZA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/278','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:45:50','2026-04-27 18:45:50'),(4078,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',279,'{\"symptoms\":\"RUNNY NOSE, NASAL CONGESTION, EPISTAXIS, FLU, LARYNGITIS, PHARYNGITIS, CONJUNCTIVITIS. (SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL, EPISTAXIS, GRIPE, LARINGITIS, FARINGITIS, CONJUNTIVITIS.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH NEISSERIA GONORRHEA, LOSS OF TEETH, GINGIVITIS AND OTITIS.   CHECK - MANDIBLE, GALLBLADDER\\/KIDNEY (R), CEREBELLUM\\/SUPRASPINATUS. (ASOCIADO CON NEISSERIA GONORRHEAE; P\\u00c9RDIDA DE DIENTES, GINGIVITIS Y OTITIS. VERIFICAR - MAND\\u00cdBULA, VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D), CEREBELO\\/SUPRAESPINOSO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RUNNY NOSE, NASAL CONGESTION, EPISTAXIS, FLU, LARYNGITIS, PHARYNGITIS, AND CONJUNCTIVITIS.\\n\\n(SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL, EPISTAXIS, GRIPE, LARINGITIS, FARINGITIS Y CONJUNTIVITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE EYELID AXIS. THIS PATHOGEN IS A COMMON CAUSE OF RESPIRATORY TRACT INFECTIONS AND IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH INFLAMMATION OF THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES IN THE EYES AND UPPER AIRWAYS. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION THAT LEADS TO CONGESTION AND TISSUE IRRITATION, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN MIMIC THE COMMON FLU OR CHRONIC SINUSITIS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE DE LOS P\\u00c1RPADOS. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES UNA CAUSA COM\\u00daN DE INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO Y SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS EN LOS OJOS Y LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA QUE CONDUCE A LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N Y LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR INFECCIONES QUE A MENUDO IMITAN LA GRIPE COM\\u00daN O LA SINUSITIS CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ORAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: THIS PAIR IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE, WHICH MAY CAUSE GINGIVITIS, LOSS OF TEETH, OR OTITIS. IF THESE SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE] AXIS. FOR RECURRENT INFECTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [GALLBLADDER \\/ KIDNEY (R)] OR [CEREBELLUM \\/ SUPRASPINATUS] RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ORAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE, QUE PUEDE CAUSAR GINGIVITIS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE DIENTES U OTITIS. SI ESTOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS EST\\u00c1N PRESENTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA. PARA INFECCIONES RECURRENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D) O CEREBELO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/279','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:47:04','2026-04-27 18:47:04'),(4079,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',280,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"STROKE OR DEAFNESS. (ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR O SORDERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL STABILITY (ESTABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"STROKE OR DEAFNESS.\\n\\n(ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR O SORDERA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON THE SEVENTH CRANIAL NERVE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN BOTH FACIAL NERVES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING VASCULAR AND NEUROLOGICAL DISRUPTIONS THAT MAY LEAD TO STROKE-LIKE SYMPTOMS OR SUDDEN HEARING LOSS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE REGENERATION OF NERVE TISSUE AND IMPROVES BLOOD FLOW TO THE CRANIAL REGION, HELPING TO RESTORE FACIAL MOBILITY AND AUDITORY CLARITY WHILE REDUCING THE RISK OF SYSTEMIC VASCULAR ACCIDENTS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN EL S\\u00c9PTIMO PAR CRANEAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE AMBOS NERVIOS FACIALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LAS ALTERACIONES VASCULARES Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS QUE PUEDEN CONDUCIR A S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES A LOS DE UN ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR O A UNA P\\u00c9RDIDA AUDITIVA REPENTINA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO APOYA LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO NERVIOSO Y MEJORA EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO A LA REGI\\u00d3N CRANEAL, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR LA MOVILIDAD FACIAL Y LA CLARIDAD AUDITIVA, AL TIEMPO QUE REDUCE EL RIESGO DE ACCIDENTES VASCULARES SIST\\u00c9MICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & AUDITORY CHECK: IF FACIAL WEAKNESS OR DEAFNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL INTERFERENCE FROM STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VASCULAR CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CAROTID \\/ CAROTID] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT ARTERIAL HEALTH. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y AUDITIVA: SI LA DEBILIDAD FACIAL O LA SORDERA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES PARA DESCARTAR LA INTERFERENCIA BACTERIANA DE STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS VASCULARES SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ CAR\\u00d3TIDA PARA APOYAR LA SALUD ARTERIAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/280','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:48:34','2026-04-27 18:48:34'),(4080,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',281,'{\"symptoms\":\"UPPER RESPIRATORY INFECTION, SORE THROAT, SWOLLEN LYMPH GLANDS, PNEUMONIA, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, COLITIS, GASTRIS, DIARRHEA. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, GL\\u00c1NDULAS LINF\\u00c1TICAS INFLAMADAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"IT CAN BE CONFUSED WITH A COMMON COLD. FALSE HIV. (PUEDE CONFUNDIRSE CON UN RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN. FALSO VIH.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH SCAPULA; KIDNEY STONES      ASSOCIATED WITH; CANTHUS; CONJUNCTIVITIS. (ASOCIADO CON ESC\\u00c1PULA; C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES ASOCIADO CON CANTO; CONJUNTIVITIS)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"UPPER RESPIRATORY INFECTION, SORE THROAT, SWOLLEN LYMPH GLANDS, PNEUMONIA, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, AND DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, GL\\u00c1NDULAS LINF\\u00c1TICAS INFLAMADAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, COLITIS, GASTRITIS Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE ADENOVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FALCIFORM LIGAMENT OF THE LIVER AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. CLINICALLY, THIS VIRAL LOAD IS OFTEN CONFUSED WITH A COMMON COLD DUE TO ITS RESPIRATORY MANIFESTATIONS, BUT IT CAN ALSO CAUSE SIGNIFICANT GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS AND ABDOMINAL SWELLING. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS PAIR IS SOMETIMES ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"FALSE HIV\\\" SYMPTOMATOLOGY DUE TO THE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION IT TRIGGERS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIRAL RESONANCE, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE INFECTION AND RESTORING BALANCE TO BOTH THE RESPIRATORY AND DIGESTIVE TRACTS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL ADENOVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LIGAMENTO FALCIFORME DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE, ESTA CARGA VIRAL A MENUDO SE CONFUNDE CON UN RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN DEBIDO A SUS MANIFESTACIONES RESPIRATORIAS, PERO TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CAUSAR UN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SIGNIFICATIVO Y DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTE PAR A VECES SE ASOCIA CON LA SINTOMATOLOG\\u00cdA DE \\\"FALSO VIH\\\" DEBIDO A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE DESENCADENA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA RESONANCIA VIRAL, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO TANTO EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO COMO EN EL DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF SORE THROAT OR SWOLLEN GLANDS PERSIST, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING KIDNEY STONES OR PERSISTENT CONJUNCTIVITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CANTHUS \\/ CANTHUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL DOLOR DE GARGANTA O LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS INFLAMADAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES O CONJUNTIVITIS PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CANTO \\/ CANTO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS VIRALES LIBERADAS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/281','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:50:04','2026-04-27 18:50:04'),(4081,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',282,'{\"symptoms\":\"INFERTILITY, DYSMENORRHEA, AMENORRHEA, VAGINAL DISCHARGE (ODOR), ENDOMETRIOSIS, LOW BACK PAIN, FLU, JUVENILE DIABETES, SPONTANEOUS ABORTION, BLADDER AND PROSTATE PROBLEMS. (INFERTILIDAD, DISMENORREA, AMENORREA, SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL (OLOR), ENDOMETRIOSIS, DOLOR LUMBAR, GRIPE, DIABETES JUVENIL, ABORTO ESPONT\\u00c1NEO, PROBLEMAS DE VEJIGA Y PR\\u00d3STATA.)\",\"paths\":\"LEADING CAUSE FOR INFERTILITY. TRANSMITTED BY DOMESTIC ANIMALS AND PETS. (PRINCIPAL CAUSA DE INFERTILIDAD. TRANSMITIDO POR ANIMALES DOM\\u00c9STICOS Y MASCOTAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH; STREPTOCOCCUS G OR OTHER BACTERIA; OVARIAN CYST. (ASOCIADO CON STREPTOCOCCUS G U OTRAS BACTERIAS; QUISTE OV\\u00c1RICO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"INFERTILITY, DYSMENORRHEA, AMENORRHEA, VAGINAL DISCHARGE (ODOR), ENDOMETRIOSIS, LOW BACK PAIN, FLU, JUVENILE DIABETES, SPONTANEOUS ABORTION, BLADDER AND PROSTATE PROBLEMS.(INFERTILIDAD, DISMENORREA, AMENORREA, SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL (OLOR), ENDOMETRIOSIS, DOLOR LUMBAR, GRIPE, DIABETES JUVENIL, ABORTO ESPONT\\u00c1NEO, PROBLEMAS DE VEJIGA Y PR\\u00d3STATA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE PARVOVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE FALLOPIAN TUBES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS RECOGNIZED AS A LEADING CAUSE OF INFERTILITY AND VARIOUS REPRODUCTIVE DISORDERS. THE VIRUS IS FREQUENTLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH DOMESTIC ANIMALS AND PETS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIRAL ENVIRONMENT THAT CAUSES INFLAMMATION IN THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN RESTORING FERTILITY AND REGULATING MENSTRUAL CYCLES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL PARVOVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS TROMPAS DE FALOPIO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES RECONOCIDO COMO UNA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE INFERTILIDAD Y DIVERSOS TRASTORNOS REPRODUCTIVOS. EL VIRUS SE TRANSMITE CON FRECUENCIA A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO CON ANIMALES DOM\\u00c9STICOS Y MASCOTAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO VIRAL QUE CAUSA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL TRACTO REPRODUCTOR, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RESTAURAR LA FERTILIDAD Y REGULAR LOS CICLOS MENSTRUALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"REPRODUCTIVE & BACTERIAL CHECK: IF INFERTILITY OR VAGINAL DISCHARGE PERSISTS, SCAN FOR ASSOCIATED BACTERIA SUCH AS STREPTOCOCCUS G. FOR CASES INVOLVING ABDOMINAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OVARIAN \\/ OVARIAN] AXIS TO RULE OUT OVARIAN CYSTS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL LOADS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA Y BACTERIANA: SI LA INFERTILIDAD O LA SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR BACTERIAS ASOCIADAS COMO EL STREPTOCOCCUS G. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ABDOMINAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE OVARIO \\/ OVARIO PARA DESCARTAR QUISTES OV\\u00c1RICOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS CARGAS VIRALES LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE LIMPIEZA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/282','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:51:14','2026-04-27 18:51:14'),(4082,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',283,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"PLACE ONLY ONE MAGNET IN THIS AREA AT A TIME, NOT THE COMPLETE PAIR. MAY CAUSE ABORTION. (COLOCAR SOLO UN IM\\u00c1N EN ESTA \\u00c1REA A LA VEZ, NO EL PAR COMPLETO. PUEDE CAUSAR ABORTO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FERTILITY REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA FERTILIDAD)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS USED TO ADDRESS ENERGETIC IMBALANCES WITHIN THE FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM, SPECIFICALLY CONCERNING THE PATHWAY BETWEEN THE FALLOPIAN TUBE AND THE OVARY. IN BIOMAGNETIC PRACTICE, THIS AREA IS SENSITIVE TO MAGNET PLACEMENT DUE TO ITS DIRECT IMPACT ON REPRODUCTIVE PROCESSES. STABILIZING THIS AXIS SUPPORTS THE PROPER MOVEMENT AND IMPLANTATION OF THE OVUM. HOWEVER, EXTREME CAUTION IS REQUIRED: TO PROTECT THE INTEGRITY OF A POTENTIAL PREGNANCY, PLACE ONLY ONE MAGNET IN THIS AREA AT A TIME RATHER THAN THE COMPLETE PAIR, AS FULL STIMULATION MAY TRIGGER A SYSTEMIC RESPONSE THAT COULD LEAD TO AN ABORTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE UTILIZA PARA ABORDAR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS DENTRO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR FEMENINO, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON LA V\\u00cdA ENTRE LA TROMPA DE FALOPIO Y EL OVARIO. EN LA PR\\u00c1CTICA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTA \\u00c1REA ES SENSIBLE A LA COLOCACI\\u00d3N DE IMANES DEBIDO A SU IMPACTO DIRECTO EN LOS PROCESOS REPRODUCTIVOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE APOYA EL MOVIMIENTO Y LA IMPLANTACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DEL \\u00d3VULO. SIN EMBARGO, SE REQUIERE EXTREMA PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: PARA PROTEGER LA INTEGRIDAD DE UN POSIBLE EMBARAZO, SE DEBE COLOCAR SOLO UN IM\\u00c1N EN ESTA \\u00c1REA A LA VEZ EN LUGAR DEL PAR COMPLETO, YA QUE LA ESTIMULACI\\u00d3N TOTAL PUEDE DESENCADENAR UNA RESPUESTA SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE PODR\\u00cdA PROVOCAR UN ABORTO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PRECAUTIONARY CHECK: IF PREGNANCY IS SUSPECTED OR AN ECTOPIC PREGNANCY IS A CONCERN, PRIORITIZE NON-STIMULATORY SCANNING OF THE [UTERUS \\/ UTERUS] AXIS. FOR GENERAL HORMONAL REGULATION WITHOUT DIRECT REPRODUCTIVE INTERFERENCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PITUITARY \\/ PITUITARY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO MAINTAIN OVERALL SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: SI SE SOSPECHA UN EMBARAZO O EXISTE PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N POR UN EMBARAZO ECT\\u00d3PICO, PRIORIZAR EL ESCANEO NO ESTIMULANTE DEL EJE \\u00daTERO \\/ \\u00daTERO. PARA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL GENERAL SIN INTERFERENCIA REPRODUCTIVA DIRECTA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PITUITARIA \\/ PITUITARIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO GENERAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/283','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:52:28','2026-04-27 18:52:28'),(4083,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',284,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CONVULSIONS, DERMATITIS (CONVULSIONES, DERMATITIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW CHECK - RING FINGER\\/RING FINGER (VERIFICAR - CODO \\/ CODO\\nVERIFICAR - DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR)\"}','{\"origins\":\"NERVOUS SYSTEM PARASITOSIS (PARASITOSIS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO)\",\"symptoms\":\"CONVULSIONS, DERMATITIS, MOTOR DISORDERS, AND LOCALIZED PAIN.\\n\\n(CONVULSIONES, DERMATITIS, TRASTORNOS MOTORES Y DOLOR LOCALIZADO.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS PARASITIC INFESTATIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE AXIS OF THE FEMORAL HEAD NECKS. THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT IMPACT THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, OFTEN MANIFESTING AS UNEXPLAINED CONVULSIONS OR SEVERE SKIN IRRITATIONS (DERMATITIS). BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC CONDITIONS THAT ALLOW THESE PARASITES TO INTERFERE WITH NEUROLOGICAL SIGNALING AND TISSUE HEALTH, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE LOAD AND REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LAS INFESTACIONES PARASITARIAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DE LOS CUELLOS DE LA CABEZA FEMORAL. ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTAN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO COMO CONVULSIONES INEXPLICABLES O IRRITACIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS SEVERAS (DERMATITIS). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LAS CONDICIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE PERMITEN QUE ESTOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS INTERFIERAN CON LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y LA SALUD DE LOS TEJIDOS, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & SKIN CHECK: IF CONVULSIONS OR DERMATITIS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] OR [RING FINGER \\/ RING FINGER] AXES TO CLEAR REMAINING PARASITIC RESONANCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MOTOR ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ISCHIUM \\/ ISCHIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE PARASITIC CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y CUT\\u00c1NEA: SI LAS CONVULSIONES O LA DERMATITIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES CODO \\/ CODO O DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR PARA ELIMINAR LAS RESONANCIAS PARASITARIAS RESTANTES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS MOTORES SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA ISQUI\\u00d3N \\/ ISQUI\\u00d3N. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/284','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:53:44','2026-04-27 18:53:44'),(4084,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',285,'{\"symptoms\":\"THRUSH, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, CYSTITIS. (CANDIDIASIS ORAL, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS, CISTITIS)\",\"paths\":\"VAGINAL AND RECTAL INFECTIONS. THRUSH IN THE MOUTH AND MUCUS MEMBRANE. (INFECCIONES VAGINALES Y RECTALES. CANDIDIASIS ORAL EN LA BOCA Y LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW   CHECK - RING FINGER\\/ RING FINGER (VERIFICAR - CODO \\/ CODO\\nVERIFICAR - DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"THRUSH, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS, GASTRIC DISORDERS, CYSTITIS, VAGINAL AND RECTAL INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(CANDIDIASIS ORAL, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS, CISTITIS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES Y RECTALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CANDIDA GLABRATA FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FEMORAL NECK AND THE CALCANEUS (HEEL BONE). THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN CHARACTERIZED BY ITS PRESENCE IN THE MUCUS MEMBRANES, PARTICULARLY IN THE MOUTH (THRUSH) AND THE VAGINAL OR RECTAL TRACTS. BY STABILIZING THIS SPECIFIC AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC RESONANCE THAT ALLOWS THE FUNGUS TO COLONIZE MUCOSAL LININGS, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN RESTORING MICROBIAL BALANCE AND RELIEVING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION IN THE DIGESTIVE AND REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL HONGO C\\u00c1NDIDA GLABRATA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CUELLO FEMORAL Y EL CALC\\u00c1NEO (HUESO DEL TAL\\u00d3N). ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE CARACTERIZA A MENUDO POR SU PRESENCIA EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, PARTICULARMENTE EN LA BOCA (CANDIDIASIS) Y LOS TRACTOS VAGINAL O RECTAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA RESONANCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PERMITE AL HONGO COLONIZAR LOS REVESTIMIENTOS MUCOSOS, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO MICROBIANO Y ALIVIAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA EN LOS SISTEMAS DIGESTIVO Y REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MUCOSAL & FUNGAL CHECK: IF INFECTIONS PERSIST IN THE MOUTH OR MUCOSA, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] OR [RING FINGER \\/ RING FINGER] AXES TO REINFORCE THE CLEARANCE OF FUNGAL LOADS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N MUCOSA Y F\\u00daNGICA: SI LAS INFECCIONES PERSISTEN EN LA BOCA O LAS MUCOSAS, ESCANEAR LOS EJES CODO \\/ CODO O DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LAS CARGAS F\\u00daNGICAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/285','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:54:51','2026-04-27 18:54:51'),(4085,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',286,'{\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - STOMACH\\/DUODENUM (VERIFICAR - EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ DUODENO)\"}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE HERPES 6 VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE FEMORAL NERVE AXIS. THIS PATHOGEN IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH LOCALIZED SKIN IRRITATIONS AND ALLERGIC REACTIONS MANIFESTING IN THE LOWER ABDOMINAL AND INGUINAL REGIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL RESONANCE, THE RESET INTERRUPTS THE VIRAL ACTIVITY THAT TRIGGERS NERVE IRRITATION AND DERMATOLOGICAL SENSITIVITY, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION AND CLEARING THE VIRAL LOAD FROM THE PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS HERPES 6 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DEL NERVIO FEMORAL. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON IRRITACIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS LOCALIZADAS Y REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN EN LAS REGIONES ABDOMINAL INFERIOR E INGUINAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA BILATERAL, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL QUE DESENCADENA LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y LA SENSIBILIDAD DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF GROIN ITCHING OR ALLERGIES PERSIST, SCAN THE [STOMACH \\/ DUODENUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CO-INFECTIONS OR DIGESTIVE TRIGGERS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DERMATITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FEMORAL HEAD NECK \\/ FEMORAL HEAD NECK] (REF 284) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT PARASITIC INTERFERENCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA PICAZ\\u00d3N EN LA INGLE O LAS ALERGIAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ DUODENO PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES O DESENCADENANTES DIGESTIVOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DERMATITIS SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA CUELLO DE LA CABEZA FEMORAL \\/ CUELLO DE LA CABEZA FEMORAL (REF 284) PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/286','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:56:41','2026-04-27 18:56:41'),(4086,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',287,'{\"paths\":\"LACTIC ACID FERMENTATION BUILD UP. (ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE FERMENTACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDO L\\u00c1CTICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE LACTIS AEROGENES BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE LOWER FEMUR AXIS. THIS PATHOGEN IS STRONGLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE DISRUPTION OF LOCAL METABOLISM, SPECIFICALLY TRIGGERING THE ACCUMULATION OF LACTIC ACID WITHIN THE MUSCLE TISSUE. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET INTERRUPTS THE FERMENTATION PROCESSES THAT LEAD TO EXCESSIVE ACID BUILD-UP, THEREBY REDUCING MUSCULAR PAIN, HEAVINESS, AND EXHAUSTION. RESTORING BALANCE TO THIS AREA ENABLES THE BODY TO EFFICIENTLY PROCESS METABOLIC WASTE AND RECOVER PHYSICAL ENDURANCE.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA LACTIS AEROGENES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DEL F\\u00c9MUR INFERIOR. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO EST\\u00c1 FUERTEMENTE ASOCIADO CON LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N DEL METABOLISMO LOCAL, DESENCADENANDO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDO L\\u00c1CTICO DENTRO DEL TEJIDO MUSCULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LOS PROCESOS DE FERMENTACI\\u00d3N QUE CONDUCEN A LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA DE \\u00c1CIDO, REDUCIENDO AS\\u00cd EL DOLOR MUSCULAR, LA PESADEZ Y EL AGOTAMIENTO. RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN ESTA \\u00c1REA PERMITE AL CUERPO PROCESAR EFICIENTEMENTE LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y RECUPERAR LA RESISTENCIA F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & RECOVERY CHECK: IF MUSCLE FATIGUE OR CRAMPING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [POPLITEAL FOSSA \\/ POPLITEAL FOSSA] AXIS TO ADDRESS CIRCULATORY CONGESTION IN THE LOWER LIMBS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC LETHARGY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENAL \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT GENERAL ENERGY LEVELS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO FACILITATE THE CLEARANCE OF LACTIC ACID AND BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS FROM THE BLOODSTREAM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N: SI LA FATIGA MUSCULAR O LOS CALAMBRES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE HUECO POPL\\u00cdTEO \\/ HUECO POPL\\u00cdTEO PARA ABORDAR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N CIRCULATORIA EN LOS MIEMBROS INFERIORES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN LETARGO SIST\\u00c9MICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA GENERALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL \\u00c1CIDO L\\u00c1CTICO Y LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS DEL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/287','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:57:45','2026-04-27 18:57:45'),(4087,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',289,'{\"symptoms\":\"ABSCESS, BURSITIS, ARMPIT ODOR, NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS. (ABSCESO, BURSITIS, OLOR AXILAR, TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS)\",\"paths\":\"ORAL ENTERIC INFECTIONS.MOTOR, AURICULAR AND NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS. (INFECCIONES ENT\\u00c9RICAS ORALES. TRASTORNOS MOTORES, AURICULARES Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED TO; IUD OR INTRAUTERINE DEVICE.   CHECK - CORONARY\\/LUNG CHECK - PERICARDIUM\\/PERICARDIUM (ASOCIADO A; DIU O DISPOSITIVO INTRAUTERINO. VERIFICAR - CORONARIA\\/PULM\\u00d3N VERIFICAR - PERICARDIO\\/PERICARDIO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ABSCESS, BURSITIS, ARMPIT ODOR, AND NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS.\\n\\n(ABSCESO, BURSITIS, OLOR AXILAR Y TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE VIBRIO PARAHEMOLITICUS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE POSTERIOR FEMUR AXIS. WHILE OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH ORAL ENTERIC INFECTIONS FROM CONTAMINATED SEAFOOD, THIS PATHOGEN RESONATES IN THIS SPECIFIC REGION TO TRIGGER SYSTEMIC ISSUES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ADDRESSES MOTOR, AURICULAR (HEARING), AND NEUROLOGICAL DISRUPTIONS CAUSED BY BACTERIAL TOXINS. IT IS ALSO EFFECTIVE IN REDUCING LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION SUCH AS BURSITIS AND CLEARING THE UNDERLYING CAUSE OF UNUSUAL BODY ODORS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA VIBRIO PARAHEMOLITICUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DEL EJE DEL F\\u00c9MUR POSTERIOR. SI BIEN SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON INFECCIONES ENT\\u00c9RICAS ORALES POR MARISCOS CONTAMINADOS, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO RESUENA EN ESTA REGI\\u00d3N ESPEC\\u00cdFICA PARA DESENCADENAR PROBLEMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO ABORDA LAS ALTERACIONES MOTORAS, AURICULARES (AUDICI\\u00d3N) Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS CAUSADAS POR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS. TAMBI\\u00c9N ES EFICAZ PARA REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA, COMO LA BURSITIS, Y ELIMINAR LA CAUSA SUBYACENTE DE OLORES CORPORALES INUSUALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & DEVICE CHECK: THIS RESONANCE IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE USE OF AN IUD (INTRAUTERINE DEVICE). IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [CORONARY \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS VASCULAR CO-INFECTIONS OR THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] RESONANCE TO CLEAR CARDIAC PRESSURE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y DE DISPOSITIVOS: ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL USO DE UN DIU (DISPOSITIVO INTRAUTERINO). SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CORONARIA \\/ PULM\\u00d3N PARA ABORDAR COINFECCIONES VASCULARES O LA RESONANCIA PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO PARA ELIMINAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/289','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 18:59:04','2026-04-27 18:59:04'),(4088,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',290,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MYCOSIS AND OSTEOPOROSIS (MICOSIS Y OSTEOPOROSIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"UNIVERSAL PATHOGEN RESERVOIR (RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"MYCOSIS, OSTEOPOROSIS, AND CHRONIC JOINT PAIN.\\n\\n(MICOSIS, OSTEOPOROSIS Y DOLOR ARTICULAR CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A MAJOR RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE FEMUR AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE LARGE BONES SERVE AS HIDING PLACES FOR VARIOUS PATHOGENS, PARTICULARLY FUNGI (MYCOSIS). BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS FUNGI TO PERSIST, WHICH IS OFTEN THE UNDERLYING CAUSE OF BONE DENSITY LOSS OR OSTEOPOROSIS. CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR IS ESSENTIAL TO PREVENT RECURRANT INFECTIONS THAT SPREAD TO THE SKIN OR OTHER JOINT STRUCTURES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO IMPORTANTE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL EJE DEL F\\u00c9MUR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS HUESOS LARGOS SIRVEN COMO ESCONDITES PARA DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS, PARTICULARMENTE HONGOS (MICOSIS). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE PERMITE LA PERSISTENCIA DE LOS HONGOS, QUE A MENUDO ES LA CAUSA SUBYACENTE DE LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE DENSIDAD \\u00d3SEA O LA OSTEOPOROSIS. LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO ES ESENCIAL PARA PREVENIR INFECCIONES RECURRENTES QUE SE EXTIENDEN A LA PIEL U OTRAS ESTRUCTURAS ARTICULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL & BONE CHECK: IF OSTEOPOROSIS OR MYCOSIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TIERRA \\/ TIERRA] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY FUNGAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SKIN LESIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MOLE \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 534) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT VIRAL INTERFERENCE FROM HANTAVIRUS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED FROM THE BONE MARROW.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA Y \\u00d3SEA: SI LA OSTEOPOROSIS O LA MICOSIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE TIERRA \\/ TIERRA PARA ABORDAR RESERVORIOS F\\u00daNGICOS COMPLEMENTARIOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA LUNAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (REF 534) PARA DESCARTAR LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL DEL HANTAVIRUS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS LIBERADAS DE LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/290','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:00:15','2026-04-27 19:00:15'),(4089,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',291,'{\"origins\":\"TUBERCULOSIS\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RESERVOIR (RESERVORIO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"TUBERCULOSIS (MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR CHRONIC COUGH, NIGHT SWEATS, WEIGHT LOSS, AND FATIGUE. OFTEN LATENT WHEN FOUND IN THIS SPECIFIC AXIS.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL DE TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, SUDORES NOCTURNOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO Y FATIGA. A MENUDO LATENTE CUANDO SE ENCUENTRA EN ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE HEAD OF THE FIBULA BONES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS RECOGNIZED AS A \\\"HIDING PLACE\\\" FOR MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS. WHILE THE BACTERIA IS TRADITIONALLY ASSOCIATED WITH PULMONARY ISSUES, IT CAN REMAIN DORMANT IN THIS ENERGETIC AXIS, EVADING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND CAUSING RECURRENT SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS PATHWAY, THE RESET ELIMINATES THE PROTECTIVE ENVIRONMENT FOR THE BACTERIA, ENSURING THAT THE PATHOGEN IS EXPOSED AND CAN BE FULLY CLEARED FROM THE BODY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA CABEZA DE LOS HUESOS PERON\\u00c9. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR SE RECONOCE COMO UN \\\"ESCONDITE\\\" PARA LA MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS. SI BIEN LA BACTERIA SE ASOCIA TRADICIONALMENTE CON PROBLEMAS PULMONARES, PUEDE PERMANECER LATENTE EN ESTE EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO, EVADIENDO EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y CAUSANDO UNA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA RECURRENTE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA V\\u00cdA, EL REINICIO ELIMINA EL ENTORNO PROTECTOR DE LA BACTERIA, ASEGURANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO QUEDE EXPUESTO Y PUEDA SER ELIMINADO COMPLETAMENTE DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CLEARANCE CHECK: IF PULMONARY SYMPTOMS OR CHRONIC FATIGUE PERSIST, SCAN THE [SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE ACTIVE COLONIZATION OF TUBERCULOSIS. FOR GENERAL RESPIRATORY SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [POPLITEAL FOSSA \\/ POPLITEAL FOSSA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL METABOLITES RELEASED FROM THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PULMONARES O LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO PARA ABORDAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N ACTIVA DE TUBERCULOSIS. PARA EL APOYO RESPIRATORIO GENERAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA HUECO POPL\\u00cdTEO \\/ HUECO POPL\\u00cdTEO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LOS METABOLITOS BACTERIANOS LIBERADOS DE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/291','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:02:28','2026-04-27 19:02:28'),(4090,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',292,'{\"paths\":\"SYMPTOMS IN THE LOWER LIMBS AND UTI\'S. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES E INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (VERIFICAR - CODO \\/ CODO)\"}','{\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE PROTEUS MIRABILIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE FIBULA AXIS. THIS PATHOGEN IS WELL-KNOWN FOR CAUSING URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTIS) AND CAN LEAD TO SIGNIFICANT DISCOMFORT IN THE LOWER LIMBS, OFTEN MANIFESTING AS RADIATING PAIN IN THE LEGS AND LOWER BACK. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION THAT TRIGGERS INFLAMMATION IN THE URINARY SYSTEM AND PERIPHERAL NERVE PATHWAYS, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE INFECTION AND RELIEVING ASSOCIATED HEADACHES AND MUSCULOSKELETAL PAIN.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA PROTEUS MIRABILIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE DEL PERON\\u00c9. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES BIEN CONOCIDO POR CAUSAR INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO (ITU) Y PUEDE PROVOCAR UN MALESTAR SIGNIFICATIVO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLOR IRRADIANTE EN LAS PIERNAS Y LA ESPALDA BAJA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA QUE DESENCADENA LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA URINARIO Y LAS V\\u00cdAS NERVIOSAS PERIF\\u00c9RICAS, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y ALIVIAR LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA Y EL DOLOR MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICO ASOCIADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"URINARY & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF UTI SYMPTOMS OR BACK PAIN PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL RESONANCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LEG WEAKNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FEMUR LOWER \\/ FEMUR LOWER] (REF 287) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT RENAL HEALTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N URINARIA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE ITU O EL DOLOR DE ESPALDA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE CODO \\/ CODO PARA ABORDAR RESONANCIAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEBILIDAD SEVERA EN LAS PIERNAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA F\\u00c9MUR INFERIOR \\/ F\\u00c9MUR INFERIOR (REF 287). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y APOYAR LA SALUD RENAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/292','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:03:26','2026-04-27 19:03:26'),(4091,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',293,'{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL DISORDERS, DIARRHEA, GAS. (TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, DIARREA, GASES)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED DRINKING WATER OR PORK. SEVERE DIGESTION PROBLEMS AND DISORDERS. (TRANSMITIDO POR AGUA POTABLE CONTAMINADA O CARNE DE CERDO. PROBLEMAS Y TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS GRAVES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL DISORDERS, DIARRHEA, GAS, AND SEVERE DIGESTION PROBLEMS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, DIARREA, GASES Y PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS GRAVES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE YERSINIA INTESTINAL BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE FLANK AXIS. THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED DRINKING WATER OR THE CONSUMPTION OF UNDERCOOKED PORK PRODUCTS. IN THE BODY, IT TRIGGERS SIGNIFICANT INFLAMMATION OF THE INTESTINAL TRACT, OFTEN LEADING TO ACUTE GASTROENTERITIS OR SYMPTOMS THAT CAN MIMIC APPENDICITIS. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL COLONIZATION, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN RESTORING DIGESTIVE FUNCTION AND ELIMINATING GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA YERSINIA INTESTINAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE DEL FLANCO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE AGUA POTABLE CONTAMINADA O EL CONSUMO DE PRODUCTOS DE CERDO POCO COCIDOS. EN EL CUERPO, DESENCADENA UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA DEL TRACTO INTESTINAL, QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A GASTROENTERITIS AGUDA O S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE PUEDEN IMITAR UNA APENDICITIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y ELIMINAR EL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR GAS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [STOMACH \\/ DUODENUM] AXES TO ADDRESS CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LOWER ABDOMINAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [APPENDIX \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT INFLAMMATORY SYNERGIES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA DIARREA O LOS GASES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ DUODENO PARA ABORDAR COINFECCIONES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ABDOMINAL INFERIOR SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ TIMO PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS INFLAMATORIAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/293','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:04:39','2026-04-27 19:04:39'),(4092,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',294,'{\"symptoms\":\"PANCREATIC DISORDERS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, AND DIARRHEA. (TRASTORNOS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS Y DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"MAY BE DUE TO EXCESS OF ANTIBIOTICS AND DISRUPTION OF THE INTESTINAL FLORA. (PUEDE DEBERSE AL EXCESO DE ANTIBI\\u00d3TICOS Y A LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FLORA INTESTINAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PANCREATIC DISORDERS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, AND DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE FLEXOR LONGUS AXIS. THIS PATHOGEN OFTEN COLONIZES THE INTESTINAL TRACT FOLLOWING THE EXCESSIVE USE OF ANTIBIOTICS, WHICH DISRUPTS THE NATURAL BALANCE OF THE INTESTINAL FLORA. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET INTERRUPTS THE BACTERIAL OVERGROWTH THAT TRIGGERS SEVERE INFLAMMATION OF THE COLON (COLITIS) AND DIGESTIVE DISTRESS. RESTORING BALANCE TO THIS PATHWAY SUPPORTS THE RECOVERY OF THE MICROBIOME AND HELPS NORMALIZE PANCREATIC AND DIGESTIVE FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DEL FLEXOR LARGO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO A MENUDO COLONIZA EL TRACTO INTESTINAL TRAS EL USO EXCESIVO DE ANTIBI\\u00d3TICOS, LO QUE ALTERA EL EQUILIBRIO NATURAL DE LA FLORA INTESTINAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO BACTERIANO QUE DESENCADENA UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DEL COLON (COLITIS) Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO. RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN ESTA V\\u00cdA APOYA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL MICROBIOMA Y AYUDA A NORMALIZAR LAS FUNCIONES PANCRE\\u00c1TICAS Y DIGESTIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FLORA & DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR COLITIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] OR [COLON ASCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXES TO REINFORCE THE ELIMINATION OF ENTERIC PATHOGENS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PANCREATIC ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE REGENERATION OF THE INTESTINAL ENVIRONMENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE FLORA Y DIGESTI\\u00d3N: SI LA DIARREA O LA COLITIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO O COL\\u00d3N ASCENDENTE \\/ COL\\u00d3N DESCENDENTE PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS ENT\\u00c9RICOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO INTESTINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/294','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:05:48','2026-04-27 19:05:48'),(4093,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',295,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, HEADACHE, AND MUSCLE PAIN. (FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y DOLOR MUSCULAR)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, HEADACHE, AND MUSCLE PAIN.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y DOLOR MUSCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE EBOLA VIRAL RESONANCE (RECORDS OR BIOMAGNETIC SHADOWS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE ARCHES OF THE FEET. ALTHOUGH EBOLA IS CLINICALLY CHARACTERIZED BY SEVERE HEMORRHAGIC FEVER, IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS PAIR OFTEN ADDRESSES THE RESIDUAL ENERGETIC IMPACT OR \\\"TRUE\\\" VIBRATIONAL FREQUENCY OF THE PATHOGEN. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS FOR HIGH FEVERS AND DEBILITATING MUSCULAR ACHES, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING TOXICITY AND RESTORING SYSTEMIC STABILITY.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RESONANCIA VIRAL DEL \\u00c9BOLA (REGISTROS O SOMBRAS BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICAS) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS ARCOS DE LOS PIES. AUNQUE EL \\u00c9BOLA SE CARACTERIZA CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE POR UNA FIEBRE HEMORR\\u00c1GICA GRAVE, EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTE PAR A MENUDO ABORDA EL IMPACTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO RESIDUAL O LA FRECUENCIA VIBRATORIA \\\"REAL\\\" DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO QUE PERMITE FIEBRES ALTAS Y DOLORES MUSCULARES DEBILITANTES, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA TOXICIDAD Y RESTAURAR LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL & CIRCULATORY CHECK: IF HIGH FEVER PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC FILTRATION. FOR SEVERE HEADACHES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER VIRAL SYNERGIES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE SESSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL Y CIRCULATORIA: SI LA FIEBRE ALTA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA ABORDAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA DOLORES DE CABEZA INTENSOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS SINERGIAS VIRALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES LIBERADOS DURANTE LA SESI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/295','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:06:52','2026-04-27 19:06:52'),(4094,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',296,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SINUSITIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FRONTAL SINUS RESONANCE (RESONANCIA DEL SENO FRONTAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SINUSITIS, FRONTAL HEADACHE, NASAL CONGESTION, AND UPPER AIRWAY INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(SINUSITIS, CEFALEA FRONTAL, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS VIRAL RESONANCES WITHIN THE FRONTAL SINUSES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE FOREHEAD CAVITY AXIS. THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING ACUTE OR CHRONIC SINUSITIS, AS IT DISRUPTS THE ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS VIRUSES TO REPLICATE IN THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET REDUCES TISSUE INFLAMMATION, FACILITATES THE DRAINAGE OF ACCUMULATED MUCUS, AND RELIEVES THE PRESSURE-RELATED HEADACHES OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH RESPIRATORY CONGESTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LAS RESONANCIAS VIRALES DENTRO DE LOS SENOS FRONTALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE DE LA CAVIDAD FRONTAL. ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR LA SINURITIS AGUDA O CR\\u00d3NICA, YA QUE INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO QUE PERMITE QUE LOS VIRUS SE REPLIQUEN EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS, FACILITA EL DRENAJE DE LA MUCOSIDAD ACUMULADA Y ALIVIA LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA RELACIONADOS CON LA PRESI\\u00d3N QUE A MENUDO SE ASOCIAN CON LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & BACTERIAL CHECK: IF SINUS CONGESTION PERSISTS WITH PURULENT DISCHARGE, SCAN THE [EYELID \\/ EYELID] (REF 279) AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS LIKE MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FRONTAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SUPRACILIARY \\/ SUPRACILIARY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y BACTERIANA: SI LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N SINUSAL PERSISTE CON SECRECI\\u00d3N PURULENTA, ESCANEAR EL EJE P\\u00c1RPADO \\/ P\\u00c1RPADO (REF 279) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS COMO MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR FRONTAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA SUPRACILIAR \\/ SUPRACILIAR. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES LIBERADOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE LIMPIEZA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/296','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:08:14','2026-04-27 19:08:14'),(4095,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',297,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CONSTRUCTIVE ANGER (IRA CONSTRUCTIVA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC RESONANCE (RESONANCIA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"REPRESSED ANGER, FRUSTRATION, EMOTIONAL STAGNATION, AND POTENTIAL URINARY URGENCY TRIGGERED BY STRESS.\\n\\n(IRA REPRIMIDA, FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N, ESTANCAMIENTO EMOCIONAL Y POSIBLE URGENCIA URINARIA DESENCADENADA POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL AXIS TARGETS \\\"CONSTRUCTIVE ANGER\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT FRONTAL LOBE AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THE FRONTAL LOBE GOVERNS EXECUTIVE FUNCTION AND EMOTIONAL CONTROL, WHILE THE BLADDER OFTEN HOLDS TENSIONS RELATED TO FEAR OR TERRITORIAL ANGER. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET HELPS THE INDIVIDUAL PROCESS REPRESSED EMOTIONS, TRANSFORMING DESTRUCTIVE ANGER INTO A CONSTRUCTIVE FORCE FOR CHANGE AND DECISION-MAKING. IT RELEASES THE SOMATIC LOAD HELD IN THE PELVIC REGION, RESTORING ENERGETIC FLOW TO THE NERVOUS AND EXCRETORY SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTE EJE EMOCIONAL SE DIRIGE A LA \\\"IRA CONSTRUCTIVA\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL IZQUIERDO Y LA VEJIGA. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, EL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL GOBIERNA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA Y EL CONTROL EMOCIONAL, MIENTRAS QUE LA VEJIGA A MENUDO RETIENE TENSIONES RELACIONADAS CON EL MIEDO O LA IRA TERRITORIAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A PROCESAR EMOCIONES REPRIMIDAS, TRANSFORMANDO LA IRA DESTRUCTIVA EN UNA FUERZA CONSTRUCTIVA PARA EL CAMBIO Y LA TOMA DE DECISIONES. LIBERA LA CARGA SOM\\u00c1TICA RETENIDA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, RESTAURANDO EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN LOS SISTEMAS NERVIOSO Y EXCRETOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF FRUSTRATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS TRADITIONAL ANGER STORAGE. FOR PHYSICAL URINARY SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL COLONIZATION BY STREPTOCOCCUS G. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL TOXICITY THROUGH THE RENAL SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA ABORDAR EL ALMACENAMIENTO TRADICIONAL DE LA IRA. PARA S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS F\\u00cdSICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA PARA DESCARTAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA POR STREPTOCOCCUS G. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA RENAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/297','143.105.23.170','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:09:33','2026-04-27 19:09:33'),(4096,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',298,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WELLNESS (BIENESTAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"WELLNESS (BIENESTAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"MENTAL FATIGUE, LACK OF FOCUS, EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, AND DIFFICULTY IN DECISION-MAKING.\\n\\n(FATIGA MENTAL, FALTA DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N, INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y DIFICULTAD PARA TOMAR DECISIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE RIGHT FRONTAL LOBE BILATERALLY TO PROMOTE COGNITIVE WELLNESS AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE RIGHT FRONTAL REGION IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE PROCESSING OF NEGATIVE EMOTIONS AND THE REGULATION OF VIGILANCE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS CALM AN OVERACTIVE MIND, REDUCING FEELINGS OF STRESS AND ANXIETY. STABILIZING THIS AREA SUPPORTS EXECUTIVE FUNCTION, CLEARER THINKING, AND A GENERAL SENSE OF PSYCHOLOGICAL WELL-BEING, ALLOWING THE INDIVIDUAL TO APPROACH CHALLENGES WITH GREATER EQUANIMITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL DERECHO BILATERALMENTE PARA PROMOVER EL BIENESTAR COGNITIVO Y EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA REGI\\u00d3N FRONTAL DERECHA SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON EL PROCESAMIENTO DE EMOCIONES NEGATIVAS Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA VIGILANCIA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR UNA MENTE HIPERACTIVA, REDUCIENDO LOS SENTIMIENTOS DE ESTR\\u00c9S Y ANSIEDAD. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA \\u00c1REA APOYA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA, UN PENSAMIENTO M\\u00c1S CLARO Y UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DE BIENESTAR PSICOL\\u00d3GICO, LO QUE PERMITE AL INDIVIDUO ENFRENTAR LOS DESAF\\u00cdOS CON MAYOR ECANIMIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF MENTAL FOG PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT MELATONIN REGULATION AND CIRCADIAN RHYTHMS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP-SEATED ANGER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL (L) \\/ BLADDER] (REF 306) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF CORTISOL AND OTHER STRESS-RELATED METABOLITES RELEASED DURING THE SESSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA Y EMOCIONAL: SI LA NIEBLA MENTAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE PINEAL \\/ PINEAL PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA MELATONINA Y LOS RITMOS CIRCADIANOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA IRA PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA FRONTAL (IZQ) \\/ VEJIGA (REF 306). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DEL CORTISOL Y OTROS METABOLITOS RELACIONADOS CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S LIBERADOS DURANTE LA SESI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/298','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:25:52','2026-04-27 19:25:52'),(4097,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',299,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SERENITY (SERENIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SERENITY (SERENIDAD)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY, MENTAL DISQUIET, INSOMNIA, EMOTIONAL AGITATION, AND DIFFICULTY FINDING INTERNAL PEACE.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD, INQUIETUD MENTAL, INSOMNIO, AGITACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y DIFICULTAD PARA ENCONTRAR LA PAZ INTERIOR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE LEFT FRONTAL LOBE BILATERALLY TO INDUCE A STATE OF DEEP SERENITY. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THE LEFT FRONTAL REGION IS CLOSELY LINKED TO POSITIVE AFFECT AND EXECUTIVE REGULATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS TO QUIET \\\"MENTAL NOISE\\\" AND HARMONIZE THE BRAIN\'S RESPONSE TO EXTERNAL STRESSORS. STABILIZING THIS AREA SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF EMOTIONAL EQUILIBRIUM, PROMOTING A SENSE OF CALM, CLARITY, AND INTERNAL STILLNESS THAT ALLOWS FOR BETTER RECOVERY FROM PSYCHOLOGICAL FATIGUE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL IZQUIERDO BILATERALMENTE PARA INDUCIR UN ESTADO DE SERENIDAD PROFUNDA. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, LA REGI\\u00d3N FRONTAL IZQUIERDA EST\\u00c1 ESTRECHAMENTE VINCULADA AL AFECTO POSITIVO Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL \\\"RUIDO MENTAL\\\" Y ARMONIZAR LA RESPUESTA DEL CEREBRO A LOS ESTRESORES EXTERNOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA \\u00c1REA APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DEL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA, CLARIDAD Y QUIETUD INTERNA QUE PERMITE UNA MEJOR RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FATIGA PSICOL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL STABILITY CHECK: IF AGITATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [FRONTAL - R (D) \\/ FRONTAL - R (D)] (REF 307) AXIS TO COMPLETE THE FRONTAL LOBE HARMONIZATION. FOR DEEP RELAXATION AND SLEEP SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO FACILITATE THE SYSTEMIC ELIMINATION OF CORTISOL AND OTHER BIOCHEMICAL MARKERS OF STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL: SI LA AGITACI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE FRONTAL - D (R) \\/ FRONTAL - D (R) (REF 307) PARA COMPLETAR LA ARMONIZACI\\u00d3N DEL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL. PARA UNA RELAJACI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA Y APOYO AL SUE\\u00d1O, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PINEAL \\/ PINEAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL CORTISOL Y OTROS MARCADORES BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/299','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:27:16','2026-04-27 19:27:16'),(4098,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',300,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CONCENTRATION AND GOOD TO USE ON STROKE VICTIMS. (CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N Y BUENO PARA USAR EN V\\u00cdCTIMAS DE DERRAME CEREBRAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COGNITIVE RECOVERY (RECUPERACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"POOR CONCENTRATION, MENTAL FATIGUE, AND MOTOR OR COGNITIVE SEQUELAE FROM CEREBROVASCULAR EVENTS.\\n\\n(POCA CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N, FATIGA MENTAL Y SECUELAS MOTORAS O COGNITIVAS DE EVENTOS CEREBROVASCULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE BILATERAL FRONTAL LOBES TO ENHANCE CONCENTRATION AND SUPPORT NEUROLOGICAL REHABILITATION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY VALUED FOR ITS ROLE IN ASSISTING STROKE VICTIMS, AS IT HELPS NEUTRALIZE PH DISTORTIONS THAT MAY HINDER NEURONAL PLASTICITY AND SIGNAL TRANSMISSION. BY STABILIZING THIS AREA, THE RESET PROMOTES BETTER EXECUTIVE FUNCTION, IMPROVED FOCUS, AND THE RESTORATION OF COGNITIVE PATHWAYS NECESSARY FOR MENTAL CLARITY AND MOTOR CONTROL RECOVERY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LOS L\\u00d3BULOS FRONTALES BILATERALMENTE PARA MEJORAR LA CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N Y APOYAR LA REHABILITACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY VALORADO POR SU PAPEL EN LA ASISTENCIA A V\\u00cdCTIMAS DE DERRAME CEREBRAL, YA QUE AYUDA A NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH QUE PUEDEN DIFICULTAR LA PLASTICIDAD NEURONAL Y LA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N DE SE\\u00d1ALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO PROMUEVE UNA MEJOR FUNCI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA, UN MEJOR ENFOQUE Y LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS COGNITIVAS NECESARIAS PARA LA CLARIDAD MENTAL Y LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL CONTROL MOTOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL RECOVERY CHECK: IF MOTOR DISRUPTION PERSISTS AFTER A STROKE, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT SENSORY-MOTOR INTEGRATION. FOR IMPROVING MEMORY AND SPEECH, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS AS BRAIN TISSUE RECOVERS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N MOTORA PERSISTE DESPU\\u00c9S DE UN DERRAME CEREBRAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL PARA APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL-MOTORA. PARA MEJORAR LA MEMORIA Y EL HABLA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS MIENTRAS EL TEJIDO CEREBRAL SE RECUPERA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/300','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:28:52','2026-04-27 19:28:52'),(4099,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',301,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HYPERACTIVITY (HIPERACTIVIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BEHAVIORAL BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO CONDUCTUAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERACTIVITY, ATTENTION DEFICIT, RESTLESSNESS, AND DIFFICULTY WITH IMPULSE CONTROL.\\n\\n(HIPERACTIVIDAD, D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N, INQUIETUD Y DIFICULTAD CON EL CONTROL DE IMPULSOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES HYPERACTIVITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FRONTAL-PARIETAL JUNCTION AND THE TEMPORAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS AXIS CONNECTS THE BRAIN\'S EXECUTIVE PLANNING CENTERS WITH THE AREAS RESPONSIBLE FOR SENSORY PROCESSING AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS TO CALM EXCESSIVE NEURONAL FIRING, REDUCING AGITATION AND PROMOTING A MORE ORGANIZED COGNITIVE STATE. IT IS FREQUENTLY USED TO SUPPORT INDIVIDUALS STRUGGLING WITH PERSISTENT RESTLESSNESS OR AN INABILITY TO FOCUS ON SPECIFIC TASKS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA HIPERACTIVIDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA UNI\\u00d3N FRONTAL-PARIETAL Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTE EJE CONECTA LOS CENTROS DE PLANIFICACI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA DEL CEREBRO CON LAS \\u00c1REAS RESPONSABLES DEL PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL DISPARO NEURONAL EXCESIVO, REDUCIENDO LA AGITACI\\u00d3N Y PROMOVIENDO UN ESTADO COGNITIVO M\\u00c1S ORGANIZADO. SE UTILIZA CON FRECUENCIA PARA APOYAR A PERSONAS QUE LUCHAN CON UNA INQUIETUD PERSISTENTE O UNA INCAPACIDAD PARA CONCENTRARSE EN TAREAS ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE & FOCUS CHECK: IF HYPERACTIVITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [FRONTAL LOBE \\/ FRONTAL LOBE] (REF 309) AXIS TO REINFORCE EXECUTIVE CONTROL. FOR CASES INVOLVING AUDITORY SENSITIVITY OR SPEECH AGITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BIOCHEMICAL MARKERS ASSOCIATED WITH OVERSTIMULATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA Y DE ENFOQUE: SI LA HIPERACTIVIDAD PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL \\/ L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL (REF 309) PARA REFORZAR EL CONTROL EJECUTIVO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN SENSIBILIDAD AUDITIVA O AGITACI\\u00d3N EN EL HABLA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS MARCADORES BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS ASOCIADOS CON LA SOBREESTIMULACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/301','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:32:09','2026-04-27 19:32:09'),(4100,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',302,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, SORE THROAT, CHILLS, RHINITIS, NASAL CONGESTION, WATERY EYES. (DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, RINITIS, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL, OJOS LLOROSOS)\",\"paths\":\"INFECTION OF THE UPPER AIRWAYS. CHRONIC SINUS PROBLEMS. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES. PROBLEMAS CR\\u00d3NICOS DE LOS SENOS PARANASALES.(\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - NASAL SINUS (REVISAR - SENO NASAL)\"}','{\"origins\":\"UPPER AIRWAY PATHOGEN (PAT\\u00d3GENO DE V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, SORE THROAT, CHILLS, RHINITIS, NASAL CONGESTION, AND WATERY EYES.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, RINITIS, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL Y OJOS LLOROSOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS VIRAL COLONIZATION WITHIN THE FRONTAL SINUSES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE UPPER FACIAL AXIS. THIS RESONANCE IS SPECIFICALLY LINKED TO ACUTE AND CHRONIC INFECTIONS OF THE UPPER AIRWAYS. BY STABILIZING THIS AREA, THE RESET INTERRUPTS VIRAL REPLICATION WITHIN THE SINUS CAVITIES, REDUCING THE INFLAMMATION THAT CAUSES CONGESTION AND PRESSURE-BASED HEADACHES. IT FACILITATES THE CLEARANCE OF MUCUS AND SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS OF COMMON RESPIRATORY VIRUSES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N VIRAL DENTRO DE LOS SENOS FRONTALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE FACIAL SUPERIOR. ESTA RESONANCIA EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON INFECCIONES AGUDAS Y CR\\u00d3NICAS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL DENTRO DE LAS CAVIDADES SINUSALES, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N QUE CAUSA CONGESTI\\u00d3N Y DOLORES DE CABEZA POR PRESI\\u00d3N. FACILITA LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE MUCOSIDAD Y APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS DE LOS VIRUS RESPIRATORIOS COMUNES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SINUS & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF CONGESTION OR CHILLS PERSIST, SCAN THE [NASAL SINUS \\/ NASAL SINUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SORE THROAT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LARYNX \\/ LARYNX] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THE AIRWAYS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SINUSAL Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N O LOS ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE SENO NASAL \\/ SENO NASAL PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR DE GARGANTA SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA LARINGE \\/ LARINGE. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES LIBERADOS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/302','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:33:35','2026-04-27 19:33:35'),(4101,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',303,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"MENTAL RIGIDITY, DIFFICULTY PROCESSING EXTERNAL INFORMATION, EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGES, AND PSYCHOSOMATIC HEADACHES.\\n\\n(RIGIDEZ MENTAL, DIFICULTAD PARA PROCESAR INFORMACI\\u00d3N EXTERNA, BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES Y CEFALEAS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE INTEGRATION BETWEEN SENSORY INPUT AND EMOTIONAL INTERPRETATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FRONTAL SINUS AND THE CONTRALATERAL TEMPORAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS CROSS-LATERAL AXIS HELPS RELEASE DEEP-SEATED EMOTIONAL TENSIONS THAT MANIFEST AS PHYSICAL CONGESTION OR FRONTAL PRESSURE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET PROMOTES A GREATER OPENNESS TO NEW PERSPECTIVES AND FACILITATES THE RELEASE OF STAGNANT EMOTIONAL ENERGY, HARMONIZING THE CONNECTION PARA-SYMPATHETICALLY BETWEEN THE FACIAL STRUCTURES AND THE BRAIN\'S AUDITORY AND INTERPRETATIVE CENTERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA ENTRADA SENSORIAL Y LA INTERPRETACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SENO FRONTAL Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL CONTRALATERAL. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTE EJE CROSSLATERAL AYUDA A LIBERAR TENSIONES EMOCIONALES PROFUNDAS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO CONGESTI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA O PRESI\\u00d3N FRONTAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO PROMUEVE UNA MAYOR APERTURA A NUEVAS PERSPECTIVAS Y FACILITA LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE ENERG\\u00cdA EMOCIONAL ESTANCADA, ARMONIZANDO LA CONEXI\\u00d3N PARASIMP\\u00c1TICAMENTE ENTRE LAS ESTRUCTURAS FACIALES Y LOS CENTROS AUDITIVOS E INTERPRETATIVOS DEL CEREBRO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & SINUS CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL AGITATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [FRONTAL (L) \\/ BLADDER] (REF 306) AXIS FOR REPRESSED ANGER. FOR PHYSICAL SINUS CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL SINUS \\/ FRONTAL SINUS] (REF 311) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS VIRAL COLONIZATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE SYSTEMIC CLEARANCE OF BIOCHEMICAL STRESS MARKERS RELEASED DURING THE SESSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y SINUSAL: SI LA AGITACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE FRONTAL (IZQ) \\/ VEJIGA (REF 306) PARA LA IRA REPRIMIDA. PARA LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N SINUSAL F\\u00cdSICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA SENO FRONTAL \\/ SENO FRONTAL (REF 311) PARA ABORDAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N VIRAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LOS MARCADORES DE ESTR\\u00c9S BIOQU\\u00cdMICO LIBERADOS DURANTE LA SESI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/303','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:34:47','2026-04-27 19:34:47'),(4102,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',304,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ENURESIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-UROLOGICAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N NEURO-UROL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ENURESIS (INVOLUNTARY URINATION).\\n\\n(ENURESIS \\/ MICCI\\u00d3N INVOLUNTARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ENURESIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE FRONTOPOLAR CORTEX AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AREA OF THE PREFRONTAL CORTEX IS LINKED TO THE HIGHER-ORDER REGULATION OF BLADDER CONTROL AND THE INHIBITION OF THE VOIDING REFLEX. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL RESONANCE, THE RESET HELPS TO RE-ESTABLISH THE NEUROLOGICAL COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE BRAIN\'S EXECUTIVE CENTERS AND THE URINARY SYSTEM, SUPPORTING THE INDIVIDUAL\\u2014PARTICULARLY IN PEDIATRIC CASES\\u2014IN GAINING BETTER VOLUNTARY CONTROL OVER NOCTURNAL OR DAYTIME URINATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA ENURESIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DE LA CORTEZA FRONTOPOLAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA \\u00c1REA DE LA CORTEZA PREFRONTAL EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA CON LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE ORDEN SUPERIOR DEL CONTROL DE LA VEJIGA Y LA INHIBICI\\u00d3N DEL REFLEJO DE MICCI\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REESTABLECER LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA ENTRE LOS CENTROS EJECUTIVOS DEL CEREBRO Y EL SISTEMA URINARIO, AYUDANDO AL INDIVIDUO \\u2014PARTICULARMENTE EN CASOS PEDI\\u00c1TRICOS\\u2014 A LOGRAR UN MEJOR CONTROL VOLUNTARIO SOBRE LA MICCI\\u00d3N NOCTURNA O DIURNA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROLOGICAL & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF ENURESIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL IRRITATION FROM STREPTOCOCCUS G. FOR CASES LINKED TO DEEP EMOTIONAL STRESS OR FEAR, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL (L) \\/ BLADDER] (REF 306) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER RENAL FUNCTION AND ENERGETIC BALANCE IN THE URINARY TRACT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROL\\u00d3GICA Y EMOCIONAL: SI LA ENURESIS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA PARA DESCARTAR IRRITACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA POR STREPTOCOCCUS G. PARA CASOS VINCULADOS CON ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL PROFUNDO O MIEDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA FRONTAL (IZQ) \\/ VEJIGA (REF 306). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL ADECUADA Y EL EQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN EL TRACTO URINARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/304','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:35:54','2026-04-27 19:35:54'),(4103,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',305,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"VIRUS\",\"origins\":\"RESERVORIO (RESERVOIR)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE ISSUES, URINARY DISORDERS, AND CHRONIC FATIGUE.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, TRASTORNOS URINARIOS Y FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A VIRAL RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GALLBLADDER AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS KNOWN TO \\\"STORE\\\" VARIOUS VIRUSES THAT MAY REMAIN LATENT, EVADING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET EXPOSES THESE HIDDEN PATHOGENS, PREVENTING THEM FROM TRIGGERING RECURRENT INFLAMMATION IN THE DIGESTIVE OR URINARY TRACTS. CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR SUPPORTS SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION AND HELPS RESTORE OVERALL VITALITY BY REMOVING THE ENERGETIC BURDEN OF PERSISTENT VIRAL ACTIVITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO VIRAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, SE SABE QUE ESTE EJE \\\"ALMACENA\\\" DIVERSOS VIRUS QUE PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES, EVADIENDO EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO EXPONE ESTOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS OCULTOS, EVITANDO QUE DESENCADENEN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RECURRENTE EN LOS TRACTOS DIGESTIVO O URINARIO. LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO APOYA LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y AYUDA A RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD GENERAL AL ELIMINAR LA CARGA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL PERSISTENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE OR URINARY SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [VAGUS NERVE \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED FROM THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DIGESTIVOS O URINARIOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE NERVIO VAGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ABORDAR RESERVORIOS COMPLEMENTARIOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/305','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:37:27','2026-04-27 19:37:27'),(4104,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',306,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HIGH CHOLESTRAL AND TRIGLYCERIDES. (COLESTEROL Y TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS ALTOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"METABOLIC (METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"origins\":\"LIPID DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdPIDOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH CHOLESTEROL AND TRIGLYCERIDES.\\n\\n(COLESTEROL Y TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS ALTOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS LIVER AND BILIARY DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GALLBLADDER AND THE DUODENUM. THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE EMULSIFICATION OF FATS AND THE PROPER RELEASE OF BILE INTO THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET IMPROVES THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO PROCESS LIPIDS, REDUCING THE ACCUMULATION OF CHOLESTEROL AND TRIGLYCERIDES IN THE BLOODSTREAM. IT SUPPORTS THE ENZYMATIC TRANSITIONS NECESSARY FOR HEALTHY DIGESTION AND PREVENTS THE FORMATION OF BILIARY SLUDGE OR STONES.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y BILIAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y EL DUODENO. ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA REGULAR LA EMULSIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LAS GRASAS Y LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE BILIS EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO MEJORA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PROCESAR L\\u00cdPIDOS, REDUCIENDO LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE COLESTEROL Y TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS EN EL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO. APOYA LAS TRANSICIONES ENZIM\\u00c1TICAS NECESARIAS PARA UNA DIGESTI\\u00d3N SALUDABLE Y PREVIENE LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE BARRO O C\\u00c1LCULOS BILIARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & LIPID CHECK: IF CHOLESTEROL LEVELS REMAIN HIGH, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS OVERALL HEPATIC FUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT AFTER FATTY MEALS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE TO ENSURE LIPASE PRODUCTION IS OPTIMAL. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE SYSTEMIC FILTRATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y DE L\\u00cdPIDOS: SI LOS NIVELES DE COLESTEROL PERMANECEN ALTOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO PARA ABORDAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO DESPU\\u00c9S DE COMIDAS GRASAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE LIPASA SEA \\u00d3PTIMA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/306','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:38:53','2026-04-27 19:38:53'),(4105,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',307,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HIV (VIH)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"OFTEN ASYMPTOMATIC OR ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC IMMUNE SUPPRESSION AND VULNERABILITY TO OPPORTUNISTIC INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(A MENUDO ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO O ASOCIADO CON INMUNOSUPRESI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA Y VULNERABILIDAD A INFECCIONES OPORTUNISTAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A SPECIFIC VIRAL RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE GALLBLADDER AXIS PLACED VERTICALLY. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR IDENTIFYING AND NEUTRALIZING LATENT VIRAL LOADS, PARTICULARLY THOSE ASSOCIATED WITH COMPLEX PATHOGENS LIKE HIV (VIH). BY STABILIZING THIS VERTICAL RESONANCE, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC HIDING PLACES OF THE VIRUS, PREVENTING IT FROM REPLICATING OR TRIGGERING SYSTEMIC IMMUNE DYSFUNCTION. CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR IS VITAL FOR RESTORING THE BODY\'S DEFENSES AND ENSURING THAT SUBSEQUENT THERAPEUTIC STEPS ARE NOT UNDERMINED BY HIDDEN PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO VIRAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR COLOCADO VERTICALMENTE. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA IDENTIFICAR Y NEUTRALIZAR CARGAS VIRALES LATENTES, PARTICULARMENTE AQUELLAS ASOCIADAS CON PAT\\u00d3GENOS COMPLEJOS COMO EL VIH. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA VERTICAL, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LOS LUGARES DE OCULTACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL VIRUS, EVITANDO QUE SE REPLIQUE O DESENCADENE UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA. LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO ES VITAL PARA RESTAURAR LAS DEFENSAS DEL CUERPO Y ASEGURAR QUE LOS PASOS TERAP\\u00c9UTICOS POSTERIORES NO SE VEAN SOCAVADOS POR LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA OCULTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR & IMMUNE CHECK: IF IMMUNE WEAKNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO REINFORCE LYMPHOCYTE PRODUCTION. FOR CASES SUSPECTING MULTIPLE VIRAL REFUGEES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [VAGUS NERVE \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL FRAGMENTS AND TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO E INMUNIDAD: SI LA DEBILIDAD INMUNITARIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE TIMO \\/ BAZO PARA REFORZAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE LINFOCITOS. PARA CASOS EN LOS QUE SE SOSPECHE DE M\\u00daLTIPLES REFUGIOS VIRALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA NERVIO VAGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE FRAGMENTOS VIRALES Y TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/307','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:39:54','2026-04-27 19:39:54'),(4106,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',308,'{\"origins\":\"SPIROCHAETE (SPIROUETA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DECREASED INSULIN \\n(DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA)\",\"paths\":\"CELIAC DISEASE (ENFERMEDAD CEL\\u00cdACA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPIROCHAETE (ESPIROQUETA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DECREASED INSULIN, DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA, MALESTAR DIGESTIVO Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE SPIROCHAETE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GALLBLADDER AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS RESONANCE IS OFTEN LINKED TO CELIAC DISEASE AND INTERFERENCE WITH PANCREATIC FUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ACTIVITY THAT CAN LEAD TO A DECREASE IN INSULIN PRODUCTION AND INFLAMMATION OF THE INTESTINAL LINING. RESTORING BALANCE TO THIS PATHWAY SUPPORTS BETTER GLUCOSE REGULATION AND HELPS MITIGATE AUTOIMMUNE-LIKE RESPONSES IN THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM, ENHANCING NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND OVERALL METABOLIC HEALTH.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ESPIROQUETA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTA RESONANCIA SE VINCULA A MENUDO CON LA ENFERMEDAD CEL\\u00cdACA Y LA INTERFERENCIA CON LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LA ACTIVIDAD BACTERIANA QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A UNA DISMINUCI\\u00d3N EN LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL REVESTIMIENTO INTESTINAL. RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN ESTA V\\u00cdA APOYA UNA MEJOR REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA GLUCOSA Y AYUDA A MITIGAR LAS RESPUESTAS DE TIPO AUTOINMUNE EN EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO, MEJORANDO LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y LA SALUD METAB\\u00d3LICA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF INSULIN ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] AXIS TO DIRECTLY ADDRESS GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GLUTEN SENSITIVITY OR COLITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y DIGESTIVA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE INSULINA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS PARA ABORDAR DIRECTAMENTE LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN SENSIBILIDAD SEVERA AL GLUTEN O COLITIS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/308','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:41:05','2026-04-27 19:41:05'),(4107,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',309,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CONGESTED AIRWAYS, ABUNDANT NASAL SECRETIONS. (V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS CONGESTIONADAS, SECRECIONES NASALES ABUNDANTES)\",\"paths\":\"COMMON COLD\\n (RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COMMON COLD (RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN)\",\"symptoms\":\"CONGESTED AIRWAYS, ABUNDANT NASAL SECRETIONS, SNEEZING, AND MILD MALAISE.\\n\\n(V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS CONGESTIONADAS, SECRECIONES NASALES ABUNDANTES, ESTORNUDOS Y MALESTAR GENERAL LEVE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE VIRAL RESONANCE OF THE COMMON COLD BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GALLBLADDER AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH RESPIRATORY VIRUSES THAT COLONIZE THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES OF THE UPPER AIRWAYS. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET REDUCES THE INFLAMMATION OF THE NASAL PASSAGES AND BRONCHIAL TUBES, HELPING TO CLEAR EXCESS MUCUS AND SHORTENING THE DURATION OF COLD SYMPTOMS. IT REINFORCES THE IMMUNE RESPONSE IN THE UPPER RESPIRATORY TRACT, RESTORING FLUID BALANCE AND BREATHING COMFORT.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RESONANCIA VIRAL DEL RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE ASOCIA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON VIRUS RESPIRATORIOS QUE COLONIZAN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FOSAS NASALES Y LOS BRONQUIOS, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR EL EXCESO DE MUCOSIDAD Y ACORTANDO LA DURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DEL RESFRIADO. REFUERZA LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR, RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y LA COMODIDAD AL RESPIRAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF NASAL CONGESTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [FRONTAL SINUS \\/ FRONTAL SINUS] (REF 311) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SORE THROAT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LARYNX \\/ LARYNX] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE EFFECTIVE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY\'S OVERALL FILTRATION DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE SENO FRONTAL \\/ SENO FRONTAL (REF 311) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES SINERGIAS VIRALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR DE GARGANTA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA LARINGE \\/ LARINGE. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DEL CUERPO DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/309','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:42:20','2026-04-27 19:42:20'),(4108,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',310,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GALLSTONES (C\\u00c1LCULOS BILIARES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CALCIUM METABOLISM DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL METABOLISMO DEL CALCIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"FORMATION OF GALLSTONES, DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL CALCIUM IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS BILIARES, MALESTAR DIGESTIVO Y POSIBLES DESEQUILIBRIOS DE CALCIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE FORMATION OF GALLSTONES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GALLBLADDER AND THE PARATHYROID GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PARATHYROIDS REGULATE CALCIUM LEVELS IN THE BLOOD; WHEN DYSFUNCTIONAL, THEY CAN CONTRIBUTE TO THE PRECIPITATION OF CALCIUM SALTS AND CHOLESTEROL WITHIN THE GALLBLADDER. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS NORMALIZE BILIARY COMPOSITION AND CALCIUM METABOLISM, PREVENTING THE GROWTH OF EXISTING STONES AND DISCOURAGING THE FORMATION OF NEW ONES. RESTORING THIS BALANCE IS CRITICAL FOR MAINTAINING CLEAR BILIARY DUCTS AND OPTIMAL DIGESTIVE FILTRATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS BILIARES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS PARATIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LAS PARATIROIDES REGULAN LOS NIVELES DE CALCIO EN LA SANGRE; CUANDO EST\\u00c1N EN DISFUNCI\\u00d3N, PUEDEN CONTRIBUIR A LA PRECIPITACI\\u00d3N DE SALES DE CALCIO Y COLESTEROL DENTRO DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A NORMALIZAR LA COMPOSICI\\u00d3N BILIAR Y EL METABOLISMO DEL CALCIO, EVITANDO EL CRECIMIENTO DE C\\u00c1LCULOS EXISTENTES Y DESALENTANDO LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE NUEVOS. RESTAURAR ESTE EQUILIBRIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANTENER LOS CONDUCTOS BILIARES DESPEJADOS Y UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA \\u00d3PTIMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BILIARY & ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [GALLBLADDER \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 315) AXIS TO ADDRESS LIPID METABOLISM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC CALCIUM ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARATHYROID \\/ PARATHYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC SEDIMENTS AND TO SUPPORT RENAL HEALTH DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N BILIAR Y ENDOCRINA: SI EL DOLOR DIGESTIVO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR \\/ DUODENO (REF 315) PARA ABORDAR EL METABOLISMO DE LOS L\\u00cdPIDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS DE CALCIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PARATIROIDES \\/ PARATIROIDES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE SEDIMENTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA SALUD RENAL DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/310','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:43:37','2026-04-27 19:43:37'),(4109,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',311,'{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, FEVER, SORE THROAT, MUSCLE ACHES, HEADACHE, AND SHORTNESS OF BREATH. (TOS, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y FALTA DE AIRE)\",\"paths\":\"BIRD FLU. (GRIPE AVIAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, FEVER, SORE THROAT, MUSCLE ACHES, HEADACHE, AND SHORTNESS OF BREATH.\\n\\n(TOS, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y FALTA DE AIRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE AVIAN INFLUENZA (BIRD FLU) VIRAL RESONANCE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GALLBLADDER AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT CAUSE SEVERE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE VIRAL ENVIRONMENT, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING PULMONARY CONGESTION AND ALLEVIATING THE DEBILITATING MUSCLE PAIN AND FEVER ASSOCIATED WITH THIS STRAIN. HARMONIZING THESE POINTS REINFORCES THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSES AGAINST HIGH-VIRULENCE RESPIRATORY PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA RESONANCIA VIRAL DE LA INFLUENZA AVIAR (GRIPE AVIAR) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y EL BAZO. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE CAUSAN DISTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO SEVERO E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO VIRAL, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REDUCIR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y ALIVIAR EL DOLOR MUSCULAR DEBILITANTE Y LA FIEBRE ASOCIADOS CON ESTA CEPA. LA ARMONIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTOS PUNTOS REFUERZA LAS DEFENSAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO CONTRA PAT\\u00d3GENOS RESPIRATORIOS DE ALTA VIRULENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & IMMUNE CHECK: IF SHORTNESS OF BREATH PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO DIRECTLY ADDRESS PULMONARY INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES WITH SEVERE SORE THROAT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LARYNX \\/ LARYNX] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE ACUTE PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA E INMUNITARIA: SI LA FALTA DE AIRE PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N PARA ABORDAR DIRECTAMENTE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR. PARA CASOS CON DOLOR DE GARGANTA SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA LARINGE \\/ LARINGE. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA FASE AGUDA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/311','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:45:07','2026-04-27 19:45:07'),(4110,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',312,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"REGENERATES THE ORGAN. (REGENERA EL \\u00d3RGANO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEED TO DO A COMPLETE SCAN AND BALANCE ALL ACTIVE PAIRS BEFORE APPLYING THE PAIR. (ES NECESARIO REALIZAR UN ESCANEO COMPLETO Y EQUILIBRAR TODOS LOS PARES ACTIVOS ANTES DE APLICAR EL PAR)\"}','{\"origins\":\"CELLULAR REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"ORGAN DEGENERATION, TISSUE DAMAGE, ATROPHY, OR LOSS OF FUNCTION IN A SPECIFIC AREA OF THE BODY.\\n\\n(DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00d3RGANOS, DA\\u00d1O TISULAR, ATROFIA O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE FUNCI\\u00d3N EN UNA ZONA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA DEL CUERPO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL PAIR AIMS TO STIMULATE THE REGENERATION OF ORGANS AND TISSUES BY ESTABLISHING A RESONANCE BETWEEN THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON) AND THE AREA EXHIBITING PATHOLOGY OR DAMAGE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CONNECTION IS BELIEVED TO ACTIVATE ENERGETIC POTENTIALS LINKED TO CELLULAR MEMORY AND SYSTEMIC VITALITY, ASSISTING THE BODY IN RESTORING THE STRUCTURE AND FUNCTION OF THE AFFECTED ORGAN. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THIS AXIS, THE RESET FACILITATES AN OPTIMAL BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT FOR THE BODY\'S NATURAL REPAIR PROCESSES TO OPERATE MORE EFFECTIVELY.\\n\\n(ESTE PAR ESPECIAL TIENE COMO OBJETIVO LA ESTIMULACI\\u00d3N DE LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00d3RGANOS Y TEJIDOS MEDIANTE EL ESTABLECIMIENTO DE UNA RESONANCIA ENTRE EL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO) Y EL \\u00c1REA QUE PRESENTA LA PATOLOG\\u00cdA O EL DA\\u00d1O. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, SE CONSIDERA QUE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ACTIVA POTENCIALES ENERG\\u00c9TICOS VINCULADOS a LA MEMORIA CELULAR Y LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A RESTAURAR LA ESTRUCTURA Y FUNCI\\u00d3N DEL \\u00d3RGANO AFECTADO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO FACILITA UN ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO \\u00d3PTIMO PARA QUE LOS PROCESOS NATURALES DE REPARACI\\u00d3N DEL ORGANISMO ACT\\u00daEN CON MAYOR EFICACIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"REGENERATION CHECK: IT IS ABSOLUTELY NECESSARY TO PERFORM A COMPLETE SCAN AND BALANCE ALL ACTIVE PAIRS (PATHOGENIC AND DYSFUNCTIONAL) BEFORE APPLYING THIS PAIR. IF DEGENERATION IS LINKED TO POOR CIRCULATION, MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ HEART] AXIS. ALWAYS CHECK THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE FILTRATION SYSTEM IS PREPARED TO MANAGE THE BYPRODUCTS OF THE TISSUE RECONSTRUCTION PROCESS.\\n\\n(CONTROL DE REGENERACI\\u00d3N: ES ABSOLUTAMENTE NECESARIO REALIZAR UN ESCANEO COMPLETO Y EQUILIBRAR TODOS LOS PARES ACTIVOS (PAT\\u00d3GENOS Y DISFUNCIONALES) ANTES DE APLICAR ESTE PAR. SI LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A UNA MALA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N, MONITOREAR EL EJE [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE VERIFICAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c9 PREPARADO PARA GESTIONAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DEL PROCESO DE RECONSTRUCCI\\u00d3N TISULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/312','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:55:15','2026-04-27 19:55:15'),(4111,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',313,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CHEST TUMOR (TUMOR DE PECHO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CELLULAR REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHEST TUMOR, TISSUE DEGENERATION, OR ABNORMAL GROWTH IN THE MAMMARY OR AXILLARY REGION.\\n\\n(TUMOR DE PECHO, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO O CRECIMIENTO ANORMAL EN LA REGI\\u00d3N MAMARIA O AXILAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS CELLULAR REGENERATION AND THE NEUTRALIZATION OF ABNORMAL TISSUE GROWTH BY CONNECTING THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON) WITH THE ARMPIT. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THE ARMPIT REGION IS A CRITICAL NODE FOR LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE AND GLANDULAR HEALTH. BY STABILIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THIS AXIS, THE RESET STIMULATES THE BODY\'S NATURAL REPAIR MECHANISMS TO ADDRESS CHEST TUMORS OR OTHER DEGENERATIVE PROCESSES. IT ASSISTS IN RESTORING THE BIOELECTRICAL INTEGRITY OF THE AFFECTED AREA, PROMOTING SYSTEMIC VITALITY AND HEALTHY CELLULAR TURNOVER.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR Y LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL CRECIMIENTO TISULAR ANORMAL MEDIANTE LA CONEXI\\u00d3N DEL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO) CON LA AXILA. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, LA REGI\\u00d3N DE LA AXILA ES UN NODO CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL DRENAJE LINF\\u00c1TICO Y LA SALUD GLANDULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO ESTIMULA LOS MECANISMOS NATURALES DE REPARACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO PARA ABORDAR TUMORES DE PECHO U OTROS PROCESOS DEGENERATIVOS. AYUDA A RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL \\u00c1REA AFECTADA, PROMOVIENDO LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y UNA RENOVACI\\u00d3N CELULAR SALUDABLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC & TUMOR CHECK: IF AXILLARY SWELLING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL BACTERIAL LOAD (MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE). FOR CASES INVOLVING GLANDULAR DISRUPTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ AXILLA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE REGENERATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y TUMORAL: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N AXILAR PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE CARGA BACTERIANA (MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ALTERACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA TIMO \\/ AXILA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REGENERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/313','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:56:28','2026-04-27 19:56:28'),(4112,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',314,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CHEST TUMOR (TUMOR DE PECHO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CELLULAR REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHEST TUMOR, TISSUE DEGENERATION, OR ABNORMAL GROWTH IN THE MAMMARY OR PELVIC REGIONS.\\n\\n(TUMOR DE PECHO, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO O CRECIMIENTO ANORMAL EN LAS REGIONES MAMARIA O P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS CELLULAR REGENERATION AND THE NEUTRALIZATION OF ABNORMAL TISSUE GROWTH BY CONNECTING THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON) WITH THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THE BLADDER OFTEN RESONATES WITH EMOTIONAL AND SOMATIC LOADS THAT CAN INFLUENCE TISSUE HEALTH IN THE TORSO. BY STABILIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THIS AXIS, THE RESET STIMULATES THE BODY\'S NATURAL REPAIR MECHANISMS TO ADDRESS TUMORS OR DEGENERATIVE PROCESSES. IT ASSISTS IN RESTORING THE BIOELECTRICAL INTEGRITY OF THE AFFECTED REGION, PROMOTING SYSTEMIC VITALITY AND HEALTHY CELLULAR TURNOVER.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR Y LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL CRECIMIENTO TISULAR ANORMAL MEDIANTE LA CONEXI\\u00d3N DEL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO) CON LA VEJIGA. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, LA VEJIGA A MENUDO RESON\\u00d3 CON CARGAS EMOCIONALES Y SOM\\u00c1TICAS QUE PUEDEN INFLUIR EN LA SALUD DE LOS TEJIDOS DEL TORSO. AL ESTABILIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO ESTIMULA LOS MECANISMOS NATURALES DE REPARACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO PARA ABORDAR TUMORES O PROCESOS DEGENERATIVOS. AYUDA A RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DE LA REGI\\u00d3N AFECTADA, PROMOVIENDO LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y UNA RENOVACI\\u00d3N CELULAR SALUDABLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TUMOR & REGENERATION CHECK: IF CHEST TENSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [GENE (GEN) \\/ ARMPIT] (REF 322) AXIS TO ADDRESS LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE. FOR CASES INVOLVING POTENTIAL BACTERIAL SYNERGIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE REGENERATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TUMOR Y REGENERACI\\u00d3N: SI LA TENSI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [GEN (OMBLIGO) \\/ AXILA] (REF 322) PARA ABORDAR EL DRENAJE LINF\\u00c1TICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN POSIBLES SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REGENERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/314','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 19:58:43','2026-04-27 19:58:43'),(4113,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',315,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DIABETES 2 (DIABETES TIPO 2)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"TYPE 2 DIABETES, INSULIN RESISTANCE, DIGESTIVE DYSFUNCTION, AND ELEVATED BLOOD GLUCOSE LEVELS.\\n\\n(DIABETES TIPO 2, RESISTENCIA A LA INSULINA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y NIVELES ELEVADOS DE GLUCOSA EN SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE REGENERATION OF PANCREATIC TISSUE BY ESTABLISHING A BIOELECTRICAL BRIDGE BETWEEN THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON) AND THE BODY OF THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING TYPE 2 DIABETES, AS IT STIMULATES THE RECOVERY OF BETA CELLS AND IMPROVES THE GLAND\'S ABILITY TO PRODUCE AND REGULATE INSULIN. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AREA, THE RESET FACILITATES THE REPAIR OF METABOLIC PATHWAYS, ENHANCING GLUCOSE UPTAKE AND SUPPORTING THE SYSTEMIC RESTORATION OF PANCREATIC FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO MEDIANTE EL ESTABLECIMIENTO DE UN PUENTE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO) Y EL CUERPO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA DIABETES TIPO 2, YA QUE ESTIMULA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS BETA Y MEJORA LA CAPACIDAD DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PARA PRODUCIR Y REGULAR LA INSULINA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO FACILITA LA REPARACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS METAB\\u00d3LICAS, MEJORANDO LA CAPTACI\\u00d3N DE GLUCOSA Y APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLUCOSE & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF BLOOD SUGAR LEVELS REMAIN UNSTABLE, SCAN THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] AXIS TO ADDRESS OVERALL GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING POTENTIAL PARASITIC INTERFERENCE (SUCH AS ASCARIS), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [GLUTEUS \\/ GLUTEUS] (REF 333) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT RENAL HEALTH DURING THE REGENERATIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE GLUCOSA Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE PERMANECEN INESTABLES, ESCANEAR EL EJE PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN POSIBLE INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA (COMO ASCARIS), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA GL\\u00daTEO \\/ GL\\u00daTEO (REF 333). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA SALUD RENAL DURANTE EL PROCESO REGENERATIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/315','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:00:12','2026-04-27 20:00:12'),(4114,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',316,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DIABETES INSIPIDUS (DIABETES INS\\u00cdPIDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENDOCRINE REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIABETES INSIPIDUS, EXCESSIVE THIRST (POLYDIPSIA), FREQUENT URINATION (POLYURIA), AND DEHYDRATION.\\n\\n(DIABETES INS\\u00cdPIDA, SED EXCESIVA (POLIDIPSIA), MICCI\\u00d3N FRECUENTE (POLIURIA) Y DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE BALANCE OF WATER RETENTION AND HORMONE REGULATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON) AND THE DUODENUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH DIABETES INSIPIDUS, A CONDITION OFTEN LINKED TO A DEFICIENCY IN ANTIDIURETIC HORMONE (ADH). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY IN REGULATING FLUID LEVELS AND OSMOTIC PRESSURE. IT ACTS AS A RESERVOIR POINT THAT, WHEN BALANCED, ASSISTS IN RE-ESTABLISHING THE ENERGETIC COMMUNICATION NECESSARY FOR PROPER RENAL CONCENTRATION OF URINE AND SYSTEMIC HYDRATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL EQUILIBRIO DE LA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE AGUA Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO) Y EL DUODENO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE ASOCIA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON LA DIABETES INS\\u00cdPIDA, UNA CONDICI\\u00d3N A MENUDO VINCULADA CON UNA DEFICIENCIA DE LA HORMONA ANTIDIUR\\u00c9TICA (ADH). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REGULAR LOS NIVELES DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y LA PRESI\\u00d3N OSM\\u00d3TICA. ACT\\u00daA COMO UN PUNTO DE RESERVORIO QUE, AL ESTAR EQUILIBRADO, AYUDA A REESTABLECER LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA NECESARIA PARA UNA CORRECTA CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE LA ORINA Y LA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE & FLUID CHECK: IF THIRST PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PITUITARY \\/ PITUITARY] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE PRODUCTION OF ADH. FOR CASES INVOLVING METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [GENE (GEN) \\/ BODY OF PANCREAS] (REF 324) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION SYSTEM AND ENSURE THE BODY IS PROCESSING FLUIDS EFFICIENTLY DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA Y DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS: SI LA SED PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS PARA ABORDAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE ADH. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GEN (OMBLIGO) \\/ CUERPO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 324). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y ASEGURAR QUE EL CUERPO EST\\u00c9 PROCESANDO LOS L\\u00cdQUIDOS DE MANERA EFICIENTE DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/316','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:01:41','2026-04-27 20:01:41'),(4115,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',317,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WRINKLES (ARRUGAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DENTAL AND DERMATOLOGICAL REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N DENTAL Y DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"WRINKLES, TISSUE DEGENERATION, DENTAL DECAY, AND LOSS OF SKIN ELASTICITY.\\n\\n(ARRUGAS, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO, DETERIORO DENTAL Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE ELASTICIDAD EN LA PIEL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE REJUVENATION OF TISSUE AND THE REGENERATION OF DENTAL STRUCTURES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON) AND THE PINEAL GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PINEAL GLAND ACTS AS A MASTER REGULATOR OF ENDOCRINE RHYTHMS AND MELATONIN PRODUCTION, WHICH ARE CRITICAL FOR CELLULAR REPAIR AND ANTI-AGING PROCESSES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET STIMULATES THE RECOVERY OF COLLAGEN AND ELASTIN, ADDRESSING THE ROOT CAUSES OF WRINKLES AND SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S INNATE ABILITY TO REPAIR CALCIFIED TISSUES, SUCH AS TEETH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE DIRIGE AL REJUVENECIMIENTO DEL TEJIDO Y LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ESTRUCTURAS DENTALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO) Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL ACT\\u00daA COMO UN REGULADOR MAESTRO DE LOS RITMOS ENDOCRINOS Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE MELATONINA, LOS CUALES SON CR\\u00cdTICOS PARA LA REPARACI\\u00d3N CELULAR Y LOS PROCESOS ANTIENVEJECIMIENTO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO ESTIMULA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE COL\\u00c1GENO Y ELASTINA, ABORDANDO LAS CAUSAS RA\\u00cdZ DE LAS ARRUGAS Y APOYANDO LA CAPACIDAD INNATA DEL CUERPO PARA REPARAR TEJIDOS CALCIFICADOS, COMO LOS DIENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE & TISSUE CHECK: IF SKIN ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO ADDRESS METABOLIC REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DENTAL ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PRE-PINEAL \\/ BLADDER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF SYSTEMIC TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT THE VITALITY NECESSARY FOR DERMATOLOGICAL REGENERATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA Y TISULAR: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE LA PIEL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DENTALES SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PREPINEAL \\/ VEJIGA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS Y APOYAR LA VITALIDAD NECESARIA PARA LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/317','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:03:01','2026-04-27 20:03:01'),(4116,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',318,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PROSTATE CANCER (C\\u00c1NCER DE PR\\u00d3STATA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CELLULAR REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"PROSTATE DYSFUNCTION, TISSUE DEGENERATION, OR ABNORMAL GROWTH WITHIN THE PROSTATE GLAND.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA PR\\u00d3STATA, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO O CRECIMIENTO ANORMAL DENTRO DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PROST\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE REGENERATION OF PROSTATE TISSUE AND THE NEUTRALIZATION OF MALIGNANT OR DEGENERATIVE PROCESSES BY CONNECTING THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON) WITH THE PROSTATE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO ADDRESS PROSTATE CANCER OR SEVERE HYPERTROPHY BY STIMULATING THE BODY\'S INNATE REPAIR MECHANISMS. BY STABILIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET PROMOTES THE RESTORATION OF CELLULAR INTEGRITY, SUPPORTS GLANDULAR HEALTH, AND ASSISTS IN BALANCING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT NECESSARY TO HALT ABNORMAL TISSUE PROLIFERATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO PROST\\u00c1TICO Y LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE PROCESOS MALIGNOS O DEGENERATIVOS MEDIANTE LA CONEXI\\u00d3N DEL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO) CON LA PR\\u00d3STATA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA ABORDAR EL C\\u00c1NCER DE PR\\u00d3STATA O LA HIPERTROFIA SEVERA ESTIMULANDO LOS MECANISMOS DE REPARACI\\u00d3N INNATOS DEL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO PROMUEVE LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD CELULAR, APOYA LA SALUD GLANDULAR Y AYUDA A EQUILIBRAR EL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO NECESARIO PARA DETENER LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N TISULAR ANORMAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & TUMOR CHECK: IF URINARY OBSTRUCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PROSTATE \\/ RECTUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL LOADS (PAPILLOMA). FOR CASES INVOLVING BACTERIAL SYNERGIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PROSTATE \\/ PROSTATE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE REGENERATIVE PROCESS AND TO SUPPORT OVERALL URINARY HEALTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y TUMORAL: SI LA OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N URINARIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE PR\\u00d3STATA \\/ RECTO PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES CARGAS VIRALES (PAPILOMA). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PR\\u00d3STATA \\/ PR\\u00d3STATA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO REGENERATIVO Y APOYAR LA SALUD URINARIA GENERAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/318','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:04:17','2026-04-27 20:04:17'),(4117,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',319,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DIALYSIS (DI\\u00c1LISIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RENAL REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"RENAL FAILURE, ACCUMULATION OF TOXINS, FLUID RETENTION, AND DECREASED KIDNEY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS DESIGNED TO SUPPORT PATIENTS UNDERGOING DIALYSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON) AND THE SUPRARENAL\\/KIDNEY AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT AIMS TO STIMULATE THE REGENERATION OF RENAL TISSUE AND IMPROVE THE ENERGETIC VITALITY OF THE ADRENAL GLANDS. BY STABILIZING THIS PATHWAY, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC WASTE MORE EFFICIENTLY, POTENTIALLY REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC BURDEN ON THE KIDNEYS AND ENHANCING THE RECOVERY OF FILTRATION CAPACITIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA PARA APOYAR A PACIENTES EN DI\\u00c1LISIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO) Y EL EJE SUPRARRENAL\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO TIENE COMO OBJETIVO ESTIMULAR LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO RENAL Y MEJORAR LA VITALIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA V\\u00cdA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE MANERA M\\u00c1S EFICIENTE, REDUCIENDO POTENCIALMENTE LA CARGA SIST\\u00c9MICA SOBRE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES Y MEJORANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS CAPACIDADES DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RENAL & FILTRATION CHECK: IF RENAL STRESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO DIRECTLY ADDRESS SYSTEMIC FILTRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE RELATED TO KIDNEY ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SUPRARENAL \\/ SUPRARENAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [URETER \\/ URETER] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FLOW AND ELIMINATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE REGENERATIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N: SI EL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ABORDAR DIRECTAMENTE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA RELACIONADA CON PROBLEMAS RENALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA SUPRARRENAL \\/ SUPRARRENAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER PARA ASEGURAR EL FLUJO CORRECTO Y LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO REGENERATIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/319','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:06:06','2026-04-27 20:06:06'),(4118,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',320,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INSOMNIA, NERVOUSNESS, TACHYCARDIA. (INSOMNIO, NERVIOSISMO, TAQUICARDIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENDOCRINE REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INSOMNIA, NERVOUSNESS, TACHYCARDIA, AND METABOLIC IMBALANCE.\\n\\n(INSOMNIO, NERVIOSISMO, TAQUICARDIA Y DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE REGULATION AND REGENERATION OF THE THYROID GLAND BY ESTABLISHING A BIOELECTRICAL CONNECTION WITH THE \\\"GEN\\\" POINT (BELLY BUTTON). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO CALM AN OVERACTIVE SYSTEM, ADDRESSING SYMPTOMS OF HYPERTHYROIDISM SUCH AS ANXIETY AND ACCELERATED HEART RATE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET STIMULATES CELLULAR REPAIR WITHIN THE GLANDULAR TISSUE, SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF STABLE HORMONE PRODUCTION AND PROMOTING A SENSE OF SYSTEMIC CALM AND METABOLIC EFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N Y REGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES MEDIANTE EL ESTABLECIMIENTO DE UNA CONEXI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA CON EL PUNTO \\\"GEN\\\" (OMBLIGO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA CALMAR UN SISTEMA SOBREACTIVADO, ABORDANDO S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE HIPERTIROIDISMO COMO LA ANSIEDAD Y LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA ACELERADA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO ESTIMULA LA REPARACI\\u00d3N CELULAR DENTRO DEL TEJIDO GLANDULAR, APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE UNA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL ESTABLE Y PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y EFICIENCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE & NERVOUS CHECK: IF TACHYCARDIA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO DIRECTLY ADDRESS GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY OR INSOMNIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT MELATONIN REGULATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT ADRENAL STABILITY DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA Y NERVIOSA: SI LA TAQUICARDIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES PARA ABORDAR DIRECTAMENTE LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA O INSOMNIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PINEAL \\/ PINEAL PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA MELATONINA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD ADRENAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/320','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:07:14','2026-04-27 20:07:14'),(4119,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',321,'{\"origins\":\"LISTERIA\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MUSCLE ACHES, NAUSEA, DIARRHEA, HEADACHE, STIFF NECK, CONFUSION HA HA LOSS BALANCE, CONVULSIONS. (FIEBRE, DOLORES MUSCULARES, N\\u00c1USEAS, DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, CONVULSIONES)\",\"paths\":\"INFECTED PREGNANT WOMEN MAY RESULTS IN MISCARRIAGE, PREMATURE DELIVERY, SERIOUS INFECTION OF THE NEWBORN. (FIEBRE, DOLORES MUSCULARES, N\\u00c1USEAS, DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, CONVULSIONES\\n\\nINFECTED PREGNANT WOMEN MAY RESULTS IN MISCARRIAGE, PREMATURE DELIVERY, SERIOUS INFECTION OF THE NEWBORN.\\n\\nLAS MUJERES EMBARAZADAS INFECTADAS PUEDEN RESULTAR EN ABORTO ESPONT\\u00c1NEO, PARTO PREMATURO O INFECCI\\u00d3N GRAVE DEL RECI\\u00c9N NACIDO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"LISTERIA (LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MUSCLE ACHES, NAUSEA, DIARRHEA, HEADACHE, STIFF NECK, CONFUSION, LOSS OF BALANCE, AND CONVULSIONS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DOLORES MUSCULARES, N\\u00c1USEAS, DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO Y CONVULSIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE LISTERIA BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GLISSON CAPSULE (THE FIBROUS COATING OF THE HEPATIC SYSTEM) AND THE PYLORUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL AS LISTERIA CAN CROSS THE INTESTINAL BARRIER AND SPREAD TO THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM OR PLACENTA. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ENVIRONMENT, PREVENTING FURTHER SYSTEMIC DISSEMINATION. IN INFECTED PREGNANT WOMEN, CLEARING THIS RESONANCE IS VITAL TO PREVENT SEVERE COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS MISCARRIAGE, PREMATURE DELIVERY, OR NEONATAL INFECTION.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA LISTERIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA C\\u00c1PSULA DE GLISSON (EL REVESTIMIENTO FIBROSO DEL SISTEMA HEP\\u00c1TICO) Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA YA QUE LA LISTERIA PUEDE ATRAVESAR LA BARRERA INTESTINAL Y EXTENDERSE AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL O LA PLACENTA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO BACTERIANO, EVITANDO UNA MAYOR DISEMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. EN MUJERES EMBARAZADAS INFECTADAS, LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTA RESONANCIA ES VITAL PARA PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES GRAVES COMO ABORTO ESPONT\\u00c1NEO, PARTO PREMATURO O INFECCI\\u00d3N NEONATAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & NEURO CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE INTESTINAL BARRIER. FOR CASES INVOLVING NERVOUS SYSTEM INFLAMMATION (MENINGITIS), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO PARA REFORZAR LA BARRERA INTESTINAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO (MENINGITIS), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/321','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:08:35','2026-04-27 20:08:35'),(4120,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',322,'{\"symptoms\":\"URETHRAL INFLAMMATION AND VAGINAL. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N URETRAL Y VAGINAL)\",\"paths\":\"INFERTILITY, ABORTION, PREMATURE BIRTH, PNEUMONIA, MENINGITIS DURING PRENATAL PERIOD. (INFERTILIDAD, ABORTO, PARTO PREMATURO, NEUMON\\u00cdA, MENINGITIS DURANTE EL PER\\u00cdODO PRENATAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"URETHRAL AND VAGINAL INFLAMMATION, PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL REPRODUCTIVE COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N URETRAL Y VAGINAL, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO Y POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES REPRODUCTIVAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TARGETS THE UREAPLASMA UREALYTICUM BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GLUTEUS MINIMUS AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS RESONANCE IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INFECTIONS THAT IMPACT THE GENITOURINARY TRACT. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ENVIRONMENT THAT CAN LEAD TO INFERTILITY, MISCARRIAGE, OR PREMATURE BIRTH. FURTHERMORE, CLEARING THIS RESONANCE HELPS PREVENT SYSTEMIC SPREAD TO THE NEWBORN, REDUCING THE RISK OF NEONATAL PNEUMONIA OR MENINGITIS DURING THE PRENATAL PERIOD. RESTORING BALANCE TO THIS REGION SUPPORTS MUCOSAL INTEGRITY AND REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA UREAPLASMA UREALYTICUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL GL\\u00daTEO MENOR Y EL SACRO. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTA RESONANCIA ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES QUE AFECTAN EL TRACTO GENITOURINARIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO BACTERIANO QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA INFERTILIDAD, EL ABORTO ESPONT\\u00c1NEO O EL PARTO PREMATURO. ADEM\\u00c1S, LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTA RESONANCIA AYUDA A PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA AL RECI\\u00c9N NACIDO, REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE NEUMON\\u00cdA NEONATAL O MENINGITIS DURANTE EL PER\\u00cdODO PRENATAL. RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN ESTA REGI\\u00d3N APOYA LA INTEGRIDAD DE LAS MUCOSAS Y LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & PRENATAL CHECK: IF PELVIC INFLAMMATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] OR [TESTICLE \\/ TESTICLE] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC URETHRITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THIS INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y PRENATAL: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE VAGINA \\/ VAGINA O TEST\\u00cdCULO \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO PARA ABORDAR LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA LOCALIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN URETRITIS CR\\u00d3NICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/322','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:10:44','2026-04-27 20:10:44'),(4121,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',323,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ARTHRITIS, PERSISTENT SWEATS, HAIR LOSS, BLEEDING HEMORRHOIDS, JOINT PAIN, HEAD AND NECK PAIN. (ARTRITIS, SUDORACI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO, HEMORROIDES SANGRANTES, DOLOR ARTICULAR, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y CUELLO)\",\"paths\":\"ARTHRITIS, LOWER LIMB AND ACHILLES TENDON PAIN. (ARTRITIS, DOLOR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES Y EN EL TEND\\u00d3N DE AQUILES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR (RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ARTHRITIS, PERSISTENT SWEATS, HAIR LOSS, BLEEDING HEMORRHOIDS, JOINT PAIN, AND HEAD AND NECK PAIN.\\n\\n(ARTRITIS, SUDORACI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO, HEMORROIDES SANGRANTES, DOLOR ARTICULAR Y DOLOR DE CABEZA Y CUELLO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A POWERFUL UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GLUTEUS AND THE ACHILLES TENDON. IN BIOMAGNETIC THEORY, THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR IDENTIFYING HIDDEN PATHOGENS THAT CAUSE CHRONIC INFLAMMATION IN THE LOWER LIMBS AND JOINTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE ENERGETIC HIDING PLACES OF VARIOUS MICROORGANISMS, HELPING TO ALLEVIATE PERSISTENT ARTHRITIC PAIN AND SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS LIKE HAIR LOSS OR EXCESSIVE SWEATING. CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR ENSURES THAT THE IMMUNE SYSTEM CAN ADDRESS LATENT VULNERABILITIES THAT OFTEN ESCAPE STANDARD SCANNING PROTOCOLS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN PODEROSO RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL GL\\u00daTEO Y EL TEND\\u00d3N DE AQUILES. EN LA TEOR\\u00cdA BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICA, ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA IDENTIFICAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS OCULTOS QUE CAUSAN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES Y LAS ARTICULACIONES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE LOS LUGARES DE OCULTACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE DIVERSOS MICROORGANISMOS, AYUDANDO A ALIVIAR EL DOLOR ARTR\\u00cdTICO PERSISTENTE Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMO LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO O LA SUDORACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA. LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO ASEGURA QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PUEDA ABORDAR VULNERABILIDADES LATENTES QUE A MENUDO ESCAPAN A LOS PROTOCOLOS DE ESCANEO EST\\u00c1NDAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KNEE \\/ KNEE] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEMORRHOIDS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AORTA \\/ ILIAC ARTERY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THIS RESERVOIR AND TO SUPPORT GENERAL SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE RODILLA \\/ RODILLA PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN HEMORROIDES SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA AORTA \\/ ARTERIA IL\\u00cdACA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO GENERAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/323','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:12:00','2026-04-27 20:12:00'),(4122,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',324,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE TRACT DISORDER. STOMACH AND ABDOMINAL PAIN. HEADACHE, BLOATING, ANOREXIA, ANAL ITCHING, COUGH, FEVER. (TRASTORNO DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO Y ABDOMINAL. DOLOR DE CABEZA, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, ANOREXIA, PICAZ\\u00d3N ANAL, TOS, FIEBRE)\",\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL PARASITES COMMON ESPECIALLY LARGE ONES AS ASCARIS AND TAPEWORM. TRANSMITTED FROM FECAL TO ORAL.BRAIN SEIZURES IN CHILDREN. FALSE DIABETES. (PAR\\u00c1SITOS INTESTINALES COMUNES, ESPECIALMENTE LOS GRANDES COMO ASCARIS Y TENIA. TRANSMITIDOS DE V\\u00cdA FECAL-ORAL. CONVULSIONES CEREBRALES EN NI\\u00d1OS. FALSA DIABETES)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PYLORUS\\/KIDNEY - LEFT. (REVISAR - P\\u00cdLORO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE TRACT DISORDER, STOMACH AND ABDOMINAL PAIN, HEADACHE, BLOATING, ANOREXIA, ANAL ITCHING, COUGH, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO Y ABDOMINAL, DOLOR DE CABEZA, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, ANOREXIA, PICAZ\\u00d3N ANAL, TOS Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS COMMON INTESTINAL PARASITES, PARTICULARLY LARGE HELMINTHS SUCH AS ASCARIS LUMBRICOIDES AND TAPEWORMS (TENIA). THESE PATHOGENS ARE TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED VIA THE FECAL-ORAL ROUTE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE PARASITIC INFESTATIONS CAN MIMIC OTHER CONDITIONS, SUCH AS \\\"FALSE DIABETES,\\\" BY INTERFERING WITH NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND GLANDULAR FUNCTION. IN CHILDREN, THESE PARASITES MAY ALSO BE LINKED TO BRAIN SEIZURES OR SEVERE NERVOUS SYSTEM IRRITABILITY. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE GLUTEAL REGION, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE PARASITIC ENVIRONMENT, SUPPORTING THE ELIMINATION OF THESE ORGANISMS AND THE RESTORATION OF DIGESTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A PAR\\u00c1SITOS INTESTINALES COMUNES, PARTICULARMENTE GRANDES HELMINTOS COMO ASCARIS LUMBRICOIDES Y TENIAS. ESTOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS SE TRANSMITEN T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR V\\u00cdA FECAL-ORAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LAS INFESTACIONES PARASITARIAS PUEDEN IMITAR OTRAS CONDICIONES, COMO LA \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\", AL INTERFERIR CON LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. EN NI\\u00d1OS, ESTOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDEN ESTAR VINCULADOS A CONVULSIONES CEREBRALES O IRRITABILIDAD SEVERA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N GL\\u00daTEA, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO PARASITARIO, APOYANDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE ESTOS ORGANISMOS Y LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA SALUD DIGESTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARASITIC & METABOLIC CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL BLOATING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ LEFT KIDNEY] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY. FOR CASES PRESENTING WITH SUDDEN GLUCOSE IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [GENE (GEN) \\/ BODY OF PANCREAS] (REF 324) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF TOXINS AND BIOLOGICAL WASTE RELEASED DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THE PARASITIC LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LA HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO] PARA ABORDAR LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA COMPLEMENTARIA. PARA CASOS QUE PRESENTEN UN DESEQUILIBRIO REPENTINO DE GLUCOSA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GEN (OMBLIGO) \\/ CUERPO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 324). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS Y DESECHOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS LIBERADOS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE LA CARGA PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/324','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:13:58','2026-04-27 20:13:58'),(4123,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',325,'{\"symptoms\":\"INDIGESTION, GAS, BLOATING, FOOD INTOLERANCE, DIARRHEA, DEHYDRATION, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, COLITIS, ABDOMINAL PAIN. (INDIGESTI\\u00d3N, GASES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, DIARREA, DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N, FLUJO VAGINAL, COLITIS, DOLOR ABDOMINAL)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY VEGETABLES, FRUIT AND ICE CREAM. DIGESTIVE DISORDERS. GINGIVITIS AND DENTAL PLAQUE. (TRANSMITIDO POR VERDURAS, FRUTAS Y HELADO. TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS. GINGIVITIS Y PLACA DENTAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INDIGESTION, GAS, BLOATING, FOOD INTOLERANCE, DIARRHEA, DEHYDRATION, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, COLITIS, AND ABDOMINAL PAIN.\\n\\n(INDIGESTI\\u00d3N, GASES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, DIARREA, DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N, FLUJO VAGINAL, COLITIS Y DOLOR ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE VEILLONELLA ALCALESCENS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GLUTEUS AND THE PYLORUS. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOODS SUCH AS VEGETABLES, FRUITS, AND ICE CREAM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING CHRONIC DIGESTIVE DISORDERS AND ORAL HEALTH ISSUES, AS THE BACTERIA IS ALSO LINKED TO GINGIVITIS AND THE FORMATION OF DENTAL PLAQUE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ENVIRONMENT, ALLEVIATING GASTROINTESTINAL INFLAMMATION AND SUPPORTING THE SYSTEMIC RESTORATION OF MUCOSAL HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA VEILLONELLA ALCALESCENS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL GL\\u00daTEO Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS COMO VERDURAS, FRUTAS Y HELADOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS CR\\u00d3NICOS Y PROBLEMAS DE SALUD ORAL, YA QUE LA BACTERIA TAMBI\\u00c9N EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A LA GINGIVITIS Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE PLACA DENTAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO BACTERIANO, ALIVIANDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LA SALUD DE LAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & DENTAL CHECK: IF INDIGESTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE INTESTINAL GATEWAY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GINGIVITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT HYDRATION LEVELS DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THIS INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y DENTAL: SI LA INDIGESTI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO PARA REFORZAR LA PUERTA DE ENTRADA INTESTINAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN GINGIVITIS SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y APOYAR LOS NIVELES DE HIDRATACI\\u00d3N DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/325','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:15:04','2026-04-27 20:15:04'),(4124,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',326,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, VOMITING, NAUSEA, HEADACHE, MUSCLE AND JOINT PAIN, FEVER, WEAKNESS, FATIGUE, LOSS OF APPETITE, WEIGHT LOSS, JAUNDICE. (PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, V\\u00d3MITOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MUSCULAR Y ARTICULAR, FIEBRE, DEBILIDAD, FATIGA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, ICTERICIA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY EATING FISH, TUNA,SHELLFISH AND SEAFOOD,EVEN WHEN PASTEURIZED. CANCER CAUSING ABSCESSES.. IT AFFECTS LIVER, SPLEEN AND THE KIDNEYS. THE PARASITE CAN GO TO THE BRAIN, LUNG, AND OTHER ORGANS. HEMOLYTIC ANEMIA AND LOW BLOOD PRESSURE.(TRANSMITIDO POR EL CONSUMO DE PESCADO, AT\\u00daN, MARISCOS Y PRODUCTOS DEL MAR, INCLUSO CUANDO EST\\u00c1N PASTEURIZADOS. PROVOCA ABSCESOS CANCER\\u00cdGENOS. AFECTA EL H\\u00cdGADO, EL BAZO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. EL PAR\\u00c1SITO PUEDE LLEGAR AL CEREBRO, PULM\\u00d3N Y OTROS \\u00d3RGANOS. ANEMIA HEMOL\\u00cdTICA Y PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL BAJA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ALWAYS CHECK THE PAIR IN CASE OF BREAST CANCER. (SIEMPRE REVISAR EL PAR EN CASO DE C\\u00c1NCER DE MAMA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, VOMITING, NAUSEA, HEADACHE, MUSCLE AND JOINT PAIN, FEVER, WEAKNESS, FATIGUE, LOSS OF APPETITE, WEIGHT LOSS, AND JAUNDICE.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, V\\u00d3MITOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MUSCULAR Y ARTICULAR, FIEBRE, DEBILIDAD, FATIGA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO E ICTERICIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE BABESIA PARASITE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GLUTEUS AND THE FEMORAL VEIN ON THE SAME SIDE. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE CONSUMPTION OF CONTAMINATED FISH, TUNA, SHELLFISH, AND SEAFOOD, EVEN WHEN PASTEURIZED. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL AS BABESIA CAN CAUSE CANCER-RELATED ABSCESSES AND SIGNIFICANTLY IMPACT THE LIVER, SPLEEN, AND KIDNEYS. THE PARASITE HAS THE POTENTIAL TO MIGRATE TO THE BRAIN, LUNGS, AND OTHER VITAL ORGANS, OFTEN RESULTING IN HEMOLYTIC ANEMIA AND LOW BLOOD PRESSURE. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT DISRUPTS THE PARASITIC ENVIRONMENT AND SUPPORTS SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL PAR\\u00c1SITO BABESIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL GL\\u00daTEO Y LA VENA FEMORAL DEL MISMO LADO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO POR EL CONSUMO DE PESCADO, AT\\u00daN, MARISCOS Y PRODUCTOS DEL MAR CONTAMINADOS, INCLUSO CUANDO EST\\u00c1N PASTEURIZADOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE LA BABESIA PUEDE PROVOCAR ABSCESOS VINCULADOS AL C\\u00c1NCER Y AFECTAR SIGNIFICATIVAMENTE AL H\\u00cdGADO, EL BAZO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. EL PAR\\u00c1SITO TIENE EL POTENCIAL DE MIGRAR AL CEREBRO, LOS PULMONES Y OTROS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES, RESULTANDO A MENUDO EN ANEMIA HEMOL\\u00cdTICA Y PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL BAJA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO PARASITARIO Y APOYA LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ONCOLOGICAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IT IS ESSENTIAL TO ALWAYS CHECK THIS PAIR IN CASES OF BREAST CANCER TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL PARASITIC CO-FACTORS. IF ANEMIA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS IRON ABSORPTION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS AND TO MANAGE THE LOAD ON THE RENAL SYSTEM DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THIS INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ONCOL\\u00d3GICA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: ES ESENCIAL REVISAR SIEMPRE ESTE PAR EN CASOS DE C\\u00c1NCER DE MAMA PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COFACTORES PARASITARIOS. SI LA ANEMIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DUODENO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE HIERRO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS Y GESTIONAR LA CARGA EN EL SISTEMA RENAL DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/326','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:16:11','2026-04-27 20:16:11'),(4125,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',327,'{\"symptoms\":\"GAS, BLOATING, CHRONIC DIARRHEA, ANOREXIA, NAUSEA, VOMITING, FEVER, HEADACHE, SUNKEN IN AND DARK EYES, WEAKNESS, MALAISE, LUMBAR BACK PAIN. (GASES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA, ANOREXIA, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, OJOS HUNDIDOS Y OSCUROS, DEBILIDAD, MALESTAR, DOLOR LUMBAR)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD,SUCH AS VEGETABLES AND FRUITS OR EGGS. HelloMANIFEST IN THE GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT. CHRONIC DIARRHEA. KIDNEY AND URETHRAL DISORDERS. RECTAL AND INTESTINAL BLEEDING. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS, COMO VERDURAS, FRUTAS O HUEVOS. SE MANIFIESTA EN EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL. DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA. TRASTORNOS RENALES Y URETRALES. SANGRADO RECTAL E INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GAS, BLOATING, CHRONIC DIARRHEA, ANOREXIA, NAUSEA, VOMITING, FEVER, HEADACHE, SUNKEN IN AND DARK EYES, WEAKNESS, MALAISE, AND LUMBAR BACK PAIN.\\n\\n(GASES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA, ANOREXIA, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, OJOS HUNDIDOS Y OSCUROS, DEBILIDAD, MALESTAR Y DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE SALMONELLA TYPHI BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN BOTH GREATER TROCHANTERS. THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER, SUCH AS UNWASHED VEGETABLES, FRUITS, OR EGGS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL AS THE INFECTION MANIFESTS PRIMARILY IN THE GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT, OFTEN CAUSING SEVERE CHRONIC DIARRHEA AND POTENTIAL RECTAL OR INTESTINAL BLEEDING. IF LEFT UNADDRESSED, THE BACTERIA CAN IMPACT THE URINARY SYSTEM, LEADING TO KIDNEY AND URETHRAL DISORDERS. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ENVIRONMENT, ALLEVIATING SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS AND RESTORING DIGESTIVE AND RENAL INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA SALMONELLA TYPHI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE AMBOS TROC\\u00c1NTERES MAYORES. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE AGUA O ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS, COMO VERDURAS, FRUTAS O HUEVOS SIN LAVAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N SE MANIFIESTA PRINCIPALMENTE EN EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL, CAUSANDO A MENUDO DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA SEVERA Y POSIBLE SANGRADO RECTAL O INTESTINAL. SI NO SE ABORDA, LA BACTERIA PUEDE AFECTAR EL SISTEMA URINARIO, PROVOCANDO TRASTORNOS RENALES Y URETRALES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO BACTERIANO, ALIVIANDO LA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DIGESTIVA Y RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & RENAL CHECK: IF DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TROCHANTER MINOR \\/ TROCHANTER MINOR] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SIGNIFICANT DEHYDRATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT RENAL FILTRATION AND FLUID BALANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] AXIS TO ENSURE THE INTESTINAL BARRIER IS FUNCTIONING CORRECTLY DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THIS INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y RENAL: SI LA DIARREA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TROC\\u00c1NTER MENOR \\/ TROC\\u00c1NTER MENOR] PARA ABORDAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y EL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA BARRERA INTESTINAL EST\\u00c9 FUNCIONANDO CORRECTAMENTE DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/327','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:17:13','2026-04-27 20:17:13'),(4126,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',328,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY (ANSIEDAD)\",\"paths\":\"PELVIS AND HIP PAIN, PARALYSIS AND PAIN IN LEGS. UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTIONS. PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS OF THE KIDNEYS. (DOLOR EN LA PELVIS Y LA CADERA, PAR\\u00c1LISIS Y DOLOR EN LAS PIERNAS. DISFUNCIONES UROGENITALES. TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC RENAL IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO RENAL PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY, PELVIC AND HIP PAIN, PARALYSIS OR PAIN IN THE LEGS, AND UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD, DOLOR EN LA PELVIS Y LA CADERA, PAR\\u00c1LISIS O DOLOR EN LAS PIERNAS Y DISFUNCIONES UROGENITALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL AND SOMATIC CONNECTION BETWEEN THE HIP REGION AND RENAL FUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GREATER TROCHANTER AND THE OPPOSITE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS OFTEN LINKED TO PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS WHERE ANXIETY MANIFESTS PHYSICALLY AS PAIN OR RESTRICTED MOBILITY IN THE LOWER LIMBS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET STIMULATES THE PROPER BIOELECTRICAL FLOW TO THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM, ALIEVIATING PELVIC TENSION AND SUPPORTING THE KIDNEY IN OVERCOMING ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES THAT AFFECT SYSTEMIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y SOM\\u00c1TICA ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N DE LA CADERA Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE VINCULA A MENUDO CON TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DONDE LA ANSIEDAD SE MANIFIESTA F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO DOLOR O MOVILIDAD RESTRINGIDA EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO ESTIMULA EL FLUJO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO CORRECTO HACIA EL SISTEMA UROGENITAL, ALIVIANDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y APOYANDO AL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA SUPERAR BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE AFECTAN EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF ANXIETY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ADDRESS STRESS HORMONE REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HIP PAIN WITHOUT EMOTIONAL FACTORS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [GREATER TROCHANTER \\/ GREATER TROCHANTER] (REF 336) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION AND TO BALANCE THE PSYCHOSOMATIC ENERGY OF THE RENAL SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y EMOCIONAL: SI LA ANSIEDAD PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS HORMONAS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR SEVERO DE CADERA SIN FACTORES EMOCIONALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR \\/ TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR] (REF 336). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA Y EQUILIBRAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA DEL SISTEMA RENAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/328','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:18:48','2026-04-27 20:18:48'),(4127,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',329,'{\"origins\":\"BACILLUS PARATIFIC (BACILLUS PARATYPHI)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, RECTAL BLEEDING, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS. (FIEBRE, SANGRADO RECTAL, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS)\",\"paths\":\"DIGESTIVE TRACT DISORDERS. TYPHOID FEVER. CONTRIBUTE TO PRODUCE CARCINOMA OF THE SPINE. (FIEBRE, SANGRADO RECTAL, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS.\\nTRASTORNOS DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. FIEBRE TIFOIDEA. CONTRIBUYE A PRODUCIR CARCINOMA DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL. (TRASTORNOS DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. FIEBRE TIFOIDEA. CONTRIBUYE A PRODUCIR CARCINOMA DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PERI - HEPATIC CHECK - CERVICAL 3\\/DELTOID                CHECK - CERVICAL 3\\/SUPRASPINATUS   CHECK - GREATER TROCHANTER       CHECK - TEMPORAL (R)\\/TEMPORAL (L) (REVISAR - PERIHEP\\u00c1TICO\\nREVISAR - CERVICAL 3\\/DELTOIDES\\nREVISAR - CERVICAL 3\\/SUPRAESPINOSO\\nREVISAR - TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR\\nREVISAR - TEMPORAL (D)\\/TEMPORAL (I))\"}','{\"origins\":\"BACILLUS PARATYPHI (BACILO PARAT\\u00cdFICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, RECTAL BLEEDING, AND DIGESTIVE DISORDERS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, SANGRADO RECTAL Y TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE PRESENCE OF THE BACILLUS PARATYPHI PATHOGEN BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN THE GREATER TROCHANTER AND THE IPSILATERAL KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS LINKED TO TYPHOID FEVER AND SIGNIFICANT GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE BODY IS SUPPORTED IN ELIMINATING BACTERIAL OVERGROWTH THAT CAN CAUSE INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION AND RECTAL BLEEDING. IN CHRONIC CASES, STABILIZING THIS PAIN POINT PREVENTS THE PATHOGEN FROM CONTRIBUTING TO DEGENERATIVE PROCESSES IN THE SPINE, SUCH AS CARCINOMAS, BY RESTORING LOCAL TISSUE INTEGRITY AND IMMUNE VIGILANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA PRESENCIA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO BACILLUS PARATYPHI MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA RELACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE EL TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL MISMO LADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS VINCULADAS A LA FIEBRE TIFOIDEA Y MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SIGNIFICATIVO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, SE APOYA AL CUERPO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL CRECIMIENTO BACTERIANO QUE PUEDE CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y SANGRADO RECTAL. EN CASOS CR\\u00d3NICOS, LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE PUNTO EVITA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO CONTRIBUYA A PROCESOS DEGENERATIVOS EN LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL, COMO CARCINOMAS, AL RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DEL TEJIDO LOCAL Y LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INFECTIOUS & STRUCTURAL CHECK: TO ENSURE TOTAL ELIMINATION OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD, SCAN THE [PERI-HEPATIC] REGION AND THE [CERVICAL 3 \\/ DELTOID] RESONANCE. IF SPINAL SENSITIVITY IS PRESENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CERVICAL 3 \\/ SUPRASPINATUS] AXIS. ALWAYS VERIFY THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] CIRCUIT TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CORRELATIONS WITH TYPHOID SYMPTOMATOLOGY AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INFECCIOSA Y ESTRUCTURAL: PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N TOTAL DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ESCANEAR LA REGI\\u00d3N [PERIHEP\\u00c1TICA] Y LA RESONANCIA [CERVICAL 3 \\/ DELTOIDES]. SI HAY SENSIBILIDAD EN LA COLUMNA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [CERVICAL 3 \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO]. SIEMPRE VERIFICAR EL CIRCUITO [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES CORRELACIONES CON LA SINTOMATOLOG\\u00cdA TIFOIDEA Y ASEGURAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/329','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:24:49','2026-04-27 20:24:49'),(4128,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',330,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DOUBT (DUDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC UNCERTAINTY (INCERTIDUMBRE PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HESITATION, LACK OF CONFIDENCE, MENTAL FOG REGARDING DECISION-MAKING, AND INSECURITY.\\n\\n(VACILACI\\u00d3N, FALTA DE CONFIANZA, NIEBLA MENTAL RESPECTO A LA TOMA DE DECISIONES E INSEGURIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE IS SPECIFICALLY DESIGNED TO NEUTRALIZE THE ENERGETIC DISTORTIONS ASSOCIATED WITH THE EMOTION OF DOUBT. BY PLACING MAGNETS ON THE DORSUM (BACK) OF BOTH HANDS, THE PRACTITIONER ADDRESSES THE SOMATIC REPRESENTATION OF THE ABILITY TO \\\"ACT\\\" OR \\\"GRASP\\\" ONE\'S REALITY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT HELPS TO CLEAR THE PSYCHIC WEIGHT OF INDECISION THAT OFTEN MANIFESTS AS TENSION IN THE UPPER EXTREMITIES OR A GENERALIZED FEELING OF BEING STUCK. STABILIZING THIS AXIS PROMOTES MENTAL CLARITY AND RESTORES THE INDIVIDUAL\'S INTERNAL SENSE OF CERTAINTY, ALLOWING FOR MORE DECISIVE ACTION AND REDUCING THE ANXIETY STEMMING FROM PERSISTENT UNCERTAINTY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE PARA NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS ASOCIADAS CON LA EMOCI\\u00d3N DE LA DUDA. AL COLOCAR IMANES EN EL DORSO DE AMBAS MANOS, EL TERAPEUTA ABORDA LA REPRESENTACI\\u00d3N SOM\\u00c1TICA DE LA CAPACIDAD DE \\\"ACTUAR\\\" O \\\"TOMAR LAS RIENDAS\\\" DE LA PROPIA REALIDAD. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO AYUDA A LIMPIAR EL PESO PS\\u00cdQUICO DE LA INDECISI\\u00d3N QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO TENSI\\u00d3N EN LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N GENERALIZADA DE ESTAR ESTANCADO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE PROMUEVE LA CLARIDAD MENTAL Y RESTAURA EL SENTIDO INTERNO DE CERTEZA DEL INDIVIDUO, PERMITIENDO UNA ACCI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S DECISIVA Y REDUCIENDO LA ANSIEDAD DERIVADA DE LA INCERTIDUMBRE PERSISTENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & COGNITIVE CHECK: IF INDECISION IS ACCOMPANIED BY FEAR, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE DOUBT IS LINKED TO A LACK OF PERSONAL POWER OR EXTERNAL INFLUENCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ PINEAL GLAND] RESONANCE TO RE-ESTABLISH INTUITION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE THAT DECISIONS ARE ALIGNED WITH THE INDIVIDUAL\'S EMOTIONAL COHERENCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y COGNITIVA: SI LA INDECISI\\u00d3N VA ACOMPA\\u00d1ADA DE MIEDO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. PARA CASOS DONDE LA DUDA EST\\u00c9 VINCULADA A UNA FALTA DE PODER PERSONAL O INFLUENCIA EXTERNA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL] PARA REESTABLECER LA INTUICI\\u00d3N. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS DECISIONES EST\\u00c9N ALINEADAS CON LA COHERENCIA EMOCIONAL DEL INDIVIDUO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/330','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:25:54','2026-04-27 20:25:54'),(4129,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',331,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ADDICTION (ADICCI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADDICTIVE PSYCHOSOMATIC IMPULSE (IMPULSO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO ADICTIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"COMPULSIVE BEHAVIORS, PHYSICAL DEPENDENCY TENSIONS, EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY, AND ANXIETY LINKED TO WITHDRAWAL OR CRAVINGS.\\n\\n(CONDUCTAS COMPULSIVAS, TENSIONES POR DEPENDENCIA F\\u00cdSICA, RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL Y ANSIEDAD VINCULADA A LA ABSTINENCIA O ANHELOS INTENSOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE IS DESIGNED TO ADDRESS THE BIOELECTRICAL PATTERNS ASSOCIATED WITH ADDICTION AND COMPULSIVE DISORDERS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE HARDBODY CIRCUIT, THE THERAPY TARGETS THE SOMATIC \\\"ARMORING\\\" OR RIGIDITY THAT OFTEN ACCOMPANIES ADDICTIVE STATES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS HELPS TO DISRUPT THE REINFORCEMENT LOOPS OF DEPENDENCY BY STABILIZING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM\'S RESPONSE TO CRAVINGS. THE RESET PROMOTES A STATE OF PHYSICAL RELAXATION AND EMOTIONAL FLUIDITY, ASSISTING THE INDIVIDUAL IN BREAKING THE PSYCHOSOMATIC \\\"HARDNESS\\\" THAT LOCKS ADDICTIVE PATTERNS INTO THE PHYSIOLOGY, THEREBY SUPPORTING SYSTEMIC RECOVERY AND BIOENERGETIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA PARA ABORDAR LOS PATRONES BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICOS ASOCIADOS CON LA ADICCI\\u00d3N Y LOS TRASTORNOS COMPULSIVOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORISIONES DE PH EN EL CIRCUITO \\\"HARDBODY\\\", LA TERAPIA SE DIRIGE AL \\\"ACORAZAMIENTO\\\" SOM\\u00c1TICO O RIGIDEZ QUE A MENUDO ACOMPA\\u00d1A A LOS ESTADOS ADICTIVOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE AYUDA A INTERRUMPIR LOS CICLOS DE REFUERZO DE LA DEPENDENCIA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA RESPUESTA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A LOS DESEOS COMPULSIVOS. EL REINICIO PROMUEVE UN ESTADO DE RELAJACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA Y FLUIDEZ EMOCIONAL, AYUDANDO AL INDIVIDUO A ROMPER LA \\\"DUREZA\\\" PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA QUE BLOQUEA LOS PATRONES ADICTIVOS EN LA FISIOLOG\\u00cdA, APOYANDO AS\\u00cd LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y EL EQUILIBRIO BIOENERG\\u00c9TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ADDICTION & NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF COMPULSIVE IMPULSES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] AXIS TO BALANCE NEUROENDOCRINE FUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP EMOTIONAL VOIDS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEART \\/ HEART] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE DETOXIFICATION PROCESSES NECESSARY FOR RECOVERING FROM CHEMICAL OR METABOLIC DEPENDENCIES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ADICCI\\u00d3N Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS IMPULSOS COMPULSIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] PARA EQUILIBRAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROENDOCRINA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN VAC\\u00cdOS EMOCIONALES PROFUNDOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LOS PROCESOS DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N NECESARIOS PARA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE DEPENDENCIAS QU\\u00cdMICAS O METAB\\u00d3LICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/331','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:27:08','2026-04-27 20:27:08'),(4130,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',332,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS, PULMONARY AND RENAL DYSFUNCTION, FATIGUE, STRESS, EMOTIONAL TRAUMA, HEARING LOSS, MOTOR FUNCTION DISORDER. (TRASTORNOS DE LA CONDUCTA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y RENAL, FATIGA, ESTR\\u00c9S, TRAUMA EMOCIONAL, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNO DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA)\",\"paths\":\"ASTHMATIC AND BRONCHITIS. RENAL CONGESTION, EMOTIONAL TRAUMA; SOMETHING IS WRONG\\/ WARNING SIGN. NEPHRITIC SYNDROME. (ASM\\u00c1TICO Y BRONQUITIS. CONGESTI\\u00d3N RENAL, TRAUMA EMOCIONAL; ALGO EST\\u00c1 MAL\\/ SE\\u00d1AL DE ADVERTENCIA. S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00cdTICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SYSTEMIC CONGESTION & EMOTIONAL WARNING (CONGESTI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y SE\\u00d1AL DE ADVERTENCIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS, PULMONARY AND RENAL DYSFUNCTION, FATIGUE, STRESS, EMOTIONAL TRAUMA, HEARING LOSS, AND MOTOR FUNCTION DISORDERS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DE LA CONDUCTA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y RENAL, FATIGA, ESTR\\u00c9S, TRAUMA EMOCIONAL, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N Y TRASTORNOS DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES A COMPLEX INTERACTION BETWEEN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE RENAL SYSTEM. BY APPLYING MAGNETS BILATERALLY TO THE HEAD AND THE KIDNEYS, THE THERAPY TARGETS DEEP-SEATED EMOTIONAL TRAUMA AND SYSTEMIC CONGESTION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT ACTS AS A CRITICAL \\\"WARNING SIGN\\\" INDICATING THAT SOMETHING IS FUNDAMENTALLY IMBALANCED WITHIN THE BODY\'S ENERGETIC ARCHITECTURE. THE RESET HELPS TO ALLEVIATE NEPHRITIC SYNDROMES AND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS (SUCH AS ASTHMA OR BRONCHITIS) BY CLEARING THE TOXIC OR EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD THAT LINKS RENAL FUNCTION TO COGNITIVE AND BEHAVIORAL STABILITY, THEREBY RESTORING MOTOR COORDINATION AND VITAL ENERGY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA UNA INTERACCI\\u00d3N COMPLEJA ENTRE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y EL SISTEMA RENAL. AL APLICAR IMANES DE FORMA BILATERAL EN LA CABEZA Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, LA TERAPIA SE DIRIGE A TRAUMAS EMOCIONALES PROFUNDOS Y A LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ACT\\u00daA COMO UNA \\\"SE\\u00d1AL DE ADVERTENCIA\\\" CR\\u00cdTICA QUE INDICA QUE ALGO EST\\u00c1 FUNDAMENTALMENTE DESEQUILIBRADO DENTRO DE LA ARQUITECTURA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL CUERPO. EL REINICIO AYUDA A ALIVIAR LOS S\\u00cdNDROMES NEFR\\u00cdTICOS Y EL MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO (COMO EL ASMA O LA BRONQUITIS) AL LIMPIAR LA SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA O EMOCIONAL QUE VINCULA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL CON LA ESTABILIDAD COGNITIVA Y CONDUCTUAL, RESTAURANDO AS\\u00cd LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA Y LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & RENAL CHECK: FOR CASES PRESENTING WITH SEVERE BRONCHIAL SYMPTOMS, SCAN THE [CONDYLE \\/ CONDYLE] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL OVERLAP. IF EMOTIONAL TRAUMA IS THE PRIMARY DRIVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [POST-PINEAL \\/ POST-PINEAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT PSYCHIC INTEGRATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] CIRCUIT TO RESOLVE LOCAL CONGESTION AND ENSURE EFFICIENT FILTRATION DURING THE RECOVERY PERIOD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y RENAL: PARA CASOS QUE PRESENTEN S\\u00cdNTOMAS BRONQUIALES SEVEROS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [C\\u00d3NDILO \\/ C\\u00d3NDILO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES SOLAPAMIENTOS VIRALES. SI EL TRAUMA EMOCIONAL ES EL MOTOR PRINCIPAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [POST-PINEAL \\/ POST-PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N PS\\u00cdQUICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA RESOLVER LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N LOCAL Y ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFICIENTE DURANTE EL PERIODO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/332','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:30:00','2026-04-27 20:30:00'),(4131,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',333,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SWOLLEN LEGS\",\"paths\":\"TUBERCULOSIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR AND LYMPHATIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y LINF\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SWOLLEN LEGS, EDEMA, HEAVINESS IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES, AND CIRCULATORY INSUFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(PIERNAS HINCHADAS, EDEMA, PESADEZ EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES E INSUFICIENCIA CIRCULATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL DYSFUNCTION OF THE LOWER LIMBS BY STABILIZING THE PH BETWEEN THE HEADS OF THE FIBULA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING LOCAL CIRCULATION AND LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE. BY NEUTRALIZING DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET STIMULATES THE PROPER FLOW OF FLUIDS, REDUCING THE CONGESTION THAT LEADS TO SWOLLEN LEGS. FURTHERMORE, THIS PAIR IS CLINICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S DEFENSE MECHANISMS AGAINST COMPLEX PATHOLOGICAL PROCESSES SUCH AS TUBERCULOSIS, AS IT HELPS TO RESTORE TISSUE INTEGRITY AND IMPROVE SYSTEMIC FILTRATION IN THE LOWER SEGMENTS OF THE BODY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DE LOS MIEMBROS INFERIORES MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL PH ENTRE LAS CABEZAS DEL PERON\\u00c9. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N LOCAL Y EL DRENAJE LINF\\u00c1TICO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO ESTIMULA EL FLUJO ADECUADO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS, REDUCIENDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N QUE PROVOCA EL HINCHAZ\\u00d3N DE LAS PIERNAS. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON EL APOYO A LOS MECANISMOS DE DEFENSA DEL CUERPO CONTRA PROCESOS PATOL\\u00d3GICOS COMPLEJOS COMO LA TUBERCULOSIS, YA QUE AYUDA A RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DEL TEJIDO Y MEJORAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA EN LOS SEGMENTOS INFERIORES DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CIRCULATORY & PATHOGENIC CHECK: IF SWELLING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [POPLITEAL \\/ POPLITEAL] AXIS TO IMPROVE VENOUS RETURN. FOR CASES WHERE TUBERCULOSIS IS SUSPECTED OR RELATED TO RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE EFFICIENT ELIMINATION OF RETAINED FLUIDS AND OVERALL METABOLIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CIRCULATORIA Y PATOG\\u00c9NICA: SI LA HINCHAZ\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [POPL\\u00cdTEO \\/ POPL\\u00cdTEO] PARA MEJORAR EL RETORNO VENOSO. PARA CASOS DONDE SE SOSPECHE TUBERCULOSIS O EST\\u00c9 RELACIONADO CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EFICIENTE DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS RETENIDOS Y EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO GENERAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/333','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:31:43','2026-04-27 20:31:43'),(4132,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',334,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS K\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - HEAD OF PANCREAS\\/ADRENALS CHECK - LUMBAR 5 (REVISAR - CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS\\/SUPRARRENALES\\nREVISAR - LUMBAR 5)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT, INFLAMMATION OF THE LIVER, METABOLIC IMBALANCE, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO, DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING THE PRESENCE OF COAGULASE-NEGATIVE STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS, WHICH TARGETS THE GLANDULAR AND HEPATIC CONNECTION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CLINICALLY RECOGNIZED AS \\\"HEPATITIS K,\\\" REPRESENTING A SPECIFIC PATHOGENIC DISTORTION THAT AFFECTS ENZYMATIC PRODUCTION AND BILE FLOW. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH BETWEEN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE LIVER, THE RESET FACILITATES THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS THAT CAUSE HEPATIC CONGESTION. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT SUPPORTS OPTIMAL DIGESTION AND PREVENTS CHRONIC INFLAMMATORY STATES WITHIN THE ABDOMINAL CAVITY, THEREBY RESTORING SYSTEMIC VITALITY AND METABOLIC EFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR LA PRESENCIA DE STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA NEGATIVO, QUE AFECTA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y HEP\\u00c1TICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES RECONOCIDO CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE COMO \\\"HEPATITIS K\\\", REPRESENTANDO UNA DISTORSI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA QUE AFECTA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N ENZIM\\u00c1TICA Y EL FLUJO BILIAR. AL NEUTRALIZAR EL PH ENTRE LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL H\\u00cdGADO, EL REINICIO FACILITA LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS QUE CAUSAN CONGESTI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO APOYA UNA DIGESTI\\u00d3N \\u00d3PTIMA Y PREVIENE ESTADOS INFLAMATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS DENTRO DE LA CAVIDAD ABDOMINAL, RESTAURANDO AS\\u00cd LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA EFICIENCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & GLANDULAR CHECK: TO ENSURE COMPLETE CLEARANCE OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD, SCAN THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ ADRENALS] AXIS. IF LUMBAR DISCOMFORT OR REFERRED PAIN IS PRESENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR 5 \\/ LUMBAR 5] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER DETOXIFICATION AND TO RESOLVE ANY REMAINING HEPATIC CONGESTION ASSOCIATED WITH THE PATHOGENIC LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y GLANDULAR: PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ SUPRARRENALES]. SI HAY MALESTAR LUMBAR O DOLOR REFERIDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR 5 \\/ LUMBAR 5]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR UNA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA Y RESOLVER CUALQUIER CONGESTI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA REMANENTE ASOCIADA CON LA CARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/334','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:32:51','2026-04-27 20:32:51'),(4133,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',335,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"GASTROENTERITIS, DIARRHEA, GAS AND PAINFUL ABDOMINAL PRESSURE. (GASTROENTERITIS, DIARREA, GASES Y PRESI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL DOLOROSA)\",\"paths\":\"HEAVY METAL POISONING. TRANSMITTED BY INGESTION, SKIN ABSORPTION AND INHALATION OF TOXIC HEAVY METALS. CHRONIC ABDOMINAL DYSFUNCTION. (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N POR METALES PESADOS. TRANSMITIDO POR INGESTI\\u00d3N, ABSORCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA E INHALACI\\u00d3N DE METALES PESADOS T\\u00d3XICOS. DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL CR\\u00d3NICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEAVY METAL TOXICITY (TOXICIDAD POR METALES PESADOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"GASTROENTERITIS, DIARRHEA, GAS, AND PAINFUL ABDOMINAL PRESSURE.\\n\\n(GASTROENTERITIS, DIARREA, GASES Y PRESI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL DOLOROSA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE IS SPECIFICALLY ALIGNED TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC IMBALANCES CAUSED BY HEAVY METAL POISONING. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE PANCREATIC BODY, THE THERAPY TARGETS THE BIOELECTRICAL DISRUPTION OFTEN TRIGGERED BY THE INGESTION, INHALATION, OR ABSORPTION OF TOXIC METALS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REVERSING CHRONIC ABDOMINAL DYSFUNCTION, AS THE ACCUMULATION OF METALS CAN IMPAIR ENZYMATIC SECRETION AND GLANDULAR EFFICIENCY. THE RESET STIMULATES THE RECOVERY OF THE PANCREATIC TISSUE, ALLEVIATING INFLAMMATORY GASTROINTESTINAL RESPONSES AND SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S NATURAL DETOXIFICATION PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EST\\u00c1 ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE ALINEADA PARA ABORDAR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS CAUSADOS POR LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N CON METALES PESADOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL CUERPO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO, LA TERAPIA SE DIRIGE A LA DISRUPCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA A MENUDO DESENCADENADA POR LA INGESTI\\u00d3N, INHALACI\\u00d3N O ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE METALES T\\u00d3XICOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REVERTIR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL CR\\u00d3NICA, YA QUE LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE METALES PUEDE AFECTAR LA SECRECI\\u00d3N ENZIM\\u00c1TICA Y LA EFICIENCIA GLANDULAR. EL REINICIO ESTIMULA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO, ALIVIANDO LAS RESPUESTAS GASTROINTESTINALES INFLAMATORIAS Y APOYANDO LAS V\\u00cdAS NATURALES DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TOXICITY & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL PRESSURE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ASSIST IN METABOLIC CLEARANCE OF TOXINS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ LIVER] (REF 343) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL OVERLAP. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER RENAL FILTRATION OF HEAVY METALS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TOXICIDAD Y GLANDULAR: SI LA PRESI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA DE TOXINAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 343) PARA DESCARTAR SOLAPAMIENTOS BACTERIANOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL ADECUADA DE METALES PESADOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/335','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:33:57','2026-04-27 20:33:57'),(4134,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',336,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN RASH, LOSS OF COLOR, PEELING, AND SMALL BUMPS. VAGINAL ITCHING AND DISCHARGE. (ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE COLOR, DESCAMACI\\u00d3N Y PEQUE\\u00d1OS BULTOS. PICAZ\\u00d3N VAGINAL Y FLUJO)\",\"paths\":\"LUNG INFECTION AND VAGINAL INFECTIONS. (INFECCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR E INFECCIONES VAGINALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (REVISAR - CODO\\/CODO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN RASH, LOSS OF COLOR, PEELING, SMALL BUMPS, VAGINAL ITCHING, AND DISCHARGE.\\n\\n(ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE COLOR, DESCAMACI\\u00d3N, PEQUE\\u00d1OS BULTOS, PICAZ\\u00d3N VAGINAL Y FLUJO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PROLIFERATION OF FUNGAL PATHOGENS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE PLEURAL CAVITY (LEFT OR RIGHT). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS OFTEN LINKED TO SYSTEMIC MYCOSIS WHERE THE PH DISTORTION ALLOWS FUNGI TO AFFECT BOTH THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM AND THE DERMATOLOGICAL OR UROGENITAL TRACTS. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING INFECTIONS THAT MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS SKIN LESIONS OR VAGINAL IMBALANCES. STABILIZING THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING LUNG INFECTIONS AND ENSURING THAT THE GLANDULAR RESPONSE SUPPORTS THE BODY\'S NATURAL ANTIFUNGAL DEFENSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS F\\u00daNGICOS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y LA CAVIDAD PLEURAL (IZQUIERDA O DERECHA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO SE VINCULA A MENUDO CON MICOSIS SIST\\u00c9MICAS DONDE LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N DEL PH PERMITE QUE LOS HONGOS AFECTEN TANTO AL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO COMO A LOS TRACTOS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS O UROGENITALES. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O DESEQUILIBRIOS VAGINALES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA PREVENIR INFECCIONES PULMONARES Y ASEGURAR QUE LA RESPUESTA GLANDULAR APOYE LAS DEFENSAS ANTIF\\u00daNGICAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF DERMATOLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CROSS-RESONANCE WITH OTHER MYCOSES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LUNG CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER METABOLIC FILTRATION OF FUNGAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PERIOD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [CODO \\/ CODO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES RESONANCIAS CRUZADAS CON OTRAS MICOSIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS DURANTE EL PERIODO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/336','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:35:03','2026-04-27 20:35:03'),(4135,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',337,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DIABETES AND METASTASIS. (DIABETES Y MET\\u00c1STASIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SUPRAHEPATIC (REVISAR - SUPRAHEP\\u00c1TICO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, FEVER, AND METABOLIC DISRUPTION.\\n\\n(DIARREA SEVERA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, FIEBRE Y DISRUPCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE PYLORUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE PRESENCE OF THIS BACTERIA CAN DISTORT GLANDULAR FUNCTION, LEADING TO FALSE POSITIVES OR SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH DIABETES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH IMBALANCES IN THIS JUNCTION, THE RESET HELPS TO CURB INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION AND PREVENT THE BACTERIAL OVERGROWTH FROM CONTRIBUTING TO SYSTEMIC DETERIORATION OR SYNERGIES THAT FACILITATE METASTASIS IN DEGENERATIVE CONTEXTS. STABILIZING THIS AXIS RESTORES DIGESTIVE INTEGRITY AND SUPPORTS THE PANCREAS IN REGULATING GLUCOSE LEVELS WITHOUT PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA PRESENCIA DE ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE DISTORSIONAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR, GENERANDO FALSOS POSITIVOS O S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON LA DIABETES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE PH EN ESTA UNI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A FRENAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y EVITA QUE EL CRECIMIENTO BACTERIANO CONTRIBUYA AL DETERIORO SIST\\u00c9MICO O A SINERGIAS QUE FACILITAN LA MET\\u00c1STASIS EN CONTEXTOS DEGENERATIVOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE RESTAURA LA INTEGRIDAD DIGESTIVA Y APOYA AL P\\u00c1NCREAS EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NIVELES DE GLUCOSA SIN INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & BACTERIAL CHECK: IF METABOLIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [SUPRAHEPATIC] REGION TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL TOXIC OVERLOAD IN THE LIVER. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER ENTEROBACTERIA. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y BACTERIANA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS METAB\\u00d3LICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA REGI\\u00d3N [SUPRAHEP\\u00c1TICA] PARA ABORDAR LA POSIBLE SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA EN EL H\\u00cdGADO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS ENTEROBACTERIAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/337','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:36:11','2026-04-27 20:36:11'),(4136,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',338,'{\"symptoms\":\"ACID REFLUX, GASTRITIS, GASTRIC OBSTRUCTION, INTOLERANCE TO DAIRY AND GLUTEN, DIGESTIVE ALLERGIES, CHRONIC ULCERATIVE COLITIS, HIATAL HERNIA, FALSE PNEUMONIA, AND HALITOSIS. (REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO, GASTRITIS, OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA, INTOLERANCIA A L\\u00c1CTEOS Y GLUTEN, ALERGIAS DIGESTIVAS, COLITIS ULCEROSA CR\\u00d3NICA, HERNIA HIATAL, FALSA NEUMON\\u00cdA Y HALITOSIS)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED THROUGH SALIVA FROM PERSON-TO-PERSON,KISSING,TALKING OR SNEEZING NEAR.PANCREATIC HEAD CANCER. DIGESTIVE ALLERGIES. ALTERATION IN THE PRODUCTION OF GASTRIC JUICES.(TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA SALIVA DE PERSONA A PERSONA, BESOS, HABLAR O ESTORNUDAR CERCA. C\\u00c1NCER DE CABEZA DE P\\u00c1NCREAS. ALERGIAS DIGESTIVAS. ALTERACI\\u00d3N EN LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE JUGOS G\\u00c1STRICOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - HEAD OF PANCREAS\\/LIVER CHECK - LUMBAR 5 (REVISAR - CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS\\/H\\u00cdGADO\\nREVISAR - LUMBAR 5)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACID REFLUX, GASTRITIS, GASTRIC OBSTRUCTION, INTOLERANCE TO DAIRY AND GLUTEN, DIGESTIVE ALLERGIES, CHRONIC ULCERATIVE COLITIS, HIATAL HERNIA, FALSE PNEUMONIA, AND HALITOSIS.(REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO, GASTRITIS, OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA, INTOLERANCIA A L\\u00c1CTEOS Y GLUTEN, ALERGIAS DIGESTIVAS, COLITIS ULCEROSA CR\\u00d3NICA, HERNIA HIATAL, FALSA NEUMON\\u00cdA Y HALITOSIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF COAGULASE-NEGATIVE STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS, WHICH IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH SALIVA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE PRODUCTION OF GASTRIC JUICES AND MAINTAINING THE INTEGRITY OF THE UPPER DIGESTIVE TRACT. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS, THE RESET ALLEVIATES INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES THAT LEAD TO HIATAL HERNIA AND SEVERE DIGESTIVE ALLERGIES. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT PREVENTS THE PATHOGEN FROM CAUSING GLANDULAR DETERIORATION AND REDUCES THE RISK OF PANCREATIC HEAD CANCER BY RESTORING PROPER BIOELECTRICAL COMMUNICATION AND METABOLIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA NEGATIVO, QUE SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA SALIVA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE JUGOS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y MANTENER LA INTEGRIDAD DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO SUPERIOR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES, EL REINICIO ALIVIA LAS RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS QUE DERIVAN EN HERNIA HIATAL Y ALERGIAS DIGESTIVAS SEVERAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO EVITA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO CAUSE DETERIORO GLANDULAR Y REDUCE EL RIESGO DE C\\u00c1NCER DE CABEZA DE P\\u00c1NCREAS AL RESTAURAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ADECUADA Y EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTRIC & HEPATIC CHECK: TO ENSURE COMPLETE CLEARANCE OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD, SCAN THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ LIVER] (REF 343) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL HEPATIC CONGESTION. IF LOWER BACK PAIN OR REFERRED RENAL DISCOMFORT IS PRESENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR 5 \\/ LUMBAR 5] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER VALVE FUNCTION AND TO PREVENT FURTHER GASTROINTESTINAL REFLUX DURING THE RECOVERY PERIOD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA Y HEP\\u00c1TICA: PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 343) PARA ABORDAR LA POSIBLE CONGESTI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. SI HAY DOLOR LUMBAR O MALESTAR RENAL REFERIDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [LUMBAR 5 \\/ LUMBAR 5]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] PARA ASEGURAR EL FUNCIONAMIENTO ADECUADO DE LA V\\u00c1LVULA Y PREVENIR M\\u00c1S REFLUJO GASTROINTESTINAL DURANTE EL PERIODO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/338','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:37:58','2026-04-27 20:37:58'),(4137,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',339,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SPEECH DISORDERS. (TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-GLANDULAR SPEECH COORDINATION (COORDINACI\\u00d3N NEUROGLANDULAR DEL HABLA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SPEECH DISORDERS, STUTTERING, DIFFICULTY IN WORD ARTICULATION, AND GLANDULAR IMBALANCE.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA, TARTAMUDEZ, DIFICULTAD EN LA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N DE PALABRAS Y DESEQUILIBRIO GLANDULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL DISRUPTION BETWEEN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE LEFT SIDE OF THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CLINICALLY LINKED TO SPEECH DISORDERS, AS THE ENERGETIC DISTORTION BETWEEN THESE TWO POINTS INTERFERES WITH THE NEUROLOGICAL SIGNALS RESPONSIBLE FOR PHONATION AND VERBAL CLARITY. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET STIMULATES PROPER COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE GLANDULAR SYSTEM AND THE NERVES GOVERNING SPEECH. THIS PAIR HELPS TO RELEASE TENSION IN THE VOCAL MECHANISM AND SUPPORTS THE RECOVERY OF FLUID ARTICULATION, ENSURING THAT THE BODY\'S METABOLIC AND ENERGETIC FLOWS DO NOT OBSTRUCT COGNITIVE EXPRESSION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISRUPCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL LADO IZQUIERDO DE LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON LOS TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA, YA QUE LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE ESTOS DOS PUNTOS INTERFIERE CON LAS SE\\u00d1ALES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS RESPONSABLES DE LA FONACI\\u00d3N Y LA CLARIDAD VERBAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR EL PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO ESTIMULA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA ENTRE EL SISTEMA GLANDULAR Y LOS NERVIOS QUE RIGEN EL HABLA. ESTE PAR AYUDA A LIBERAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N EN EL MECANISMO VOCAL Y APOYA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE UNA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N FLUIDA, ASEGURANDO QUE LOS FLUJOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y ENERG\\u00c9TICOS DEL CUERPO NO OBSTRUYAN LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF SPEECH DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM COORDINATION. FOR CASES WHERE STUTTERING IS LINKED TO ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ ADRENALS] (REF 347) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE GENERAL SYSTEMIC BALANCE AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF ANY METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS THAT MAY AFFECT NEUROTRANSMISSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA ABORDAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. PARA CASOS DONDE LA TARTAMUDEZ EST\\u00c9 VINCULADA A LA ANSIEDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ SUPRARRENALES] (REF 347). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO GENERAL Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CUALQUIER SUBPRODUCTO METAB\\u00d3LICO QUE PUEDA AFECTAR LA NEUROTRANSMISI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/339','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:39:07','2026-04-27 20:39:07'),(4138,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',340,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY DAIRY, DELI AND RAW FOODS. Central NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS, AND CARDIO DISORDERS. (TRANSMITIDO POR L\\u00c1CTEOS, EMBUTIDOS Y ALIMENTOS CRUDOS. TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES Y TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS, CARDIO DISORDERS, AND MUSCLE PAIN.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES, TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS Y DOLOR MUSCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES, WHICH IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED DAIRY, DELI MEATS, AND RAW FOODS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE BACTERIA CAN CROSS THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER, LEADING TO SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL COMPLICATIONS. THE RESONANCE BETWEEN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE LEFT CERVICAL PLEXUS ADDRESSES THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THE PATHOGEN, WHICH MAY MANIFEST AS SYMPTOMS MIMICKING MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS OR OTHER DEMYELINATING DISEASES. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET STOPS THE BACTERIAL ATTACK ON THE NERVOUS AND CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEMS, PROTECTING THE MYELIN SHEATH AND RESTORING PROPER GLANDULAR COORDINATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES, QUE SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS, EMBUTIDOS Y ALIMENTOS CRUDOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE ATRAVESAR LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA, LO QUE PROVOCA COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS GRAVES. LA RESONANCIA ENTRE LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL PLEXO CERVICAL IZQUIERDO ABORDA LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO, QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE IMITAN LA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE U OTRAS ENFERMEDADES DESMIELINIZANTES. AL NEUTRALIZAR EL PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO DETIENE EL ATAQUE BACTERIANO A LOS SISTEMAS NERVIOSO Y CARDIOVASCULAR, PROTEGIENDO LA VAINA DE MIELINA Y RESTAURANDO LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & PATHOGENIC CHECK: TO ENSURE COMPLETE CLEARANCE OF LISTERIA, SCAN THE [HEART \\/ PLEURA - L] (REF 358) AXIS, AS THIS IS A KNOWN CROSS-RESONANCE FOR THIS BACTERIA. IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS ARE PREDOMINANT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE BODY IN FILTERING TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THE PATHOGENIC LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y PATOG\\u00c9NICA: PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LISTERIA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ PLEURA - I] (REF 358), YA QUE ES UNA RESONANCIA CRUZADA CONOCIDA PARA ESTA BACTERIA. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS SON PREDOMINANTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/340','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:40:09','2026-04-27 20:40:09'),(4139,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',341,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ALLERGIES\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENZYMATIC AND DIGESTIVE REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N ENZIM\\u00c1TICA Y DIGESTIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FOOD ALLERGIES, DIGESTIVE INTOLERANCES, INFLAMMATION, AND METABOLIC ALTERATIONS.\\n\\n(ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS, INTOLERANCIAS DIGESTIVAS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y ALTERACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE IS DESIGNED TO ADDRESS THE BIOELECTRICAL DYSFUNCTION BETWEEN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS AND THE STOMACH. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR CORRECTING PH DISTORTIONS THAT INTERFERE WITH THE PROPER SECRETION OF DIGESTIVE ENZYMES AND GASTRIC ACIDS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS TO NEUTRALIZE SYSTEMIC ALLERGIC RESPONSES TRIGGERED BY AN OVERREACTIVE OR UNDERPERFORMING DIGESTIVE SYSTEM. THE THERAPY SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF GLANDULAR BALANCE, ALLEVIATING THE INFLAMMATORY CASCADE OFTEN MISTAKEN FOR EXTERNAL ALLERGIES, AND PROMOTING EFFICIENT NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND METABOLIC COHERENCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL EST\\u00d3MAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA CORREGIR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH QUE INTERFIEREN CON LA SECRECI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE ENZIMAS DIGESTIVAS Y \\u00c1CIDOS G\\u00c1STRICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A NEUTRALIZAR LAS RESPUESTAS AL\\u00c9RGICAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS DESENCADENADAS POR UN SISTEMA DIGESTIVO HIPERACTIVO O DE BAJO RENDIMIENTO. LA TERAPIA APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DEL EQUILIBRIO GLANDULAR, ALIVIANDO LA CASCADA INFLAMATORIA QUE A MENUDO SE CONFUNDE CON ALERGIAS EXTERNAS, Y PROMOVIENDO UNA ABSORCI\\u00d3N EFICIENTE DE NUTRIENTES Y COHERENCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ALLERGY & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE INTOLERANCES PERSIST, SCAN THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ ADRENALS] (REF 347) AXIS TO ADDRESS STAPHYLOCOCCUS OVERLAP. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTRIC REFLUX, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER DETOXIFICATION AND TO RESOLVE ANY REMAINING METABOLIC CONGESTION THAT MAY BE EXACERBATING THE ALLERGIC RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ALERGIAS Y GLANDULAR: SI LAS INTOLERANCIAS DIGESTIVAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ SUPRARRENALES] (REF 347) PARA ABORDAR EL SOLAPAMIENTO POR ESTAFILOCOCO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN REFLUJO G\\u00c1STRICO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR UNA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA Y RESOLVER CUALQUIER CONGESTI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA REMANENTE QUE PUEDA ESTAR EXACERBANDO LA RESPUESTA AL\\u00c9RGICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/341','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:41:14','2026-04-27 20:41:14'),(4140,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',342,'{\"origins\":\"STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASE NEGATIVE\",\"symptoms\":\"GERD, ACID REFLUX PYLORUS OBSTRUCTION.\",\"paths\":\"CANCER IN HEAD OF PANCREAS, URINARY TRACT ABSCESS, HEPATITIS K OR H.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASE NEGATIVE (STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA NEGATIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"GERD, ACID REFLUX, PYLORUS OBSTRUCTION, AND DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ERGE, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO, OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL P\\u00cdLORO Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENIC PRESENCE OF COAGULASE-NEGATIVE STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS WITHIN THE GLANDULAR CIRCUIT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING BIOELECTRICAL DISTORTIONS THAT CAN LEAD TO SERIOUS COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS CANCER IN THE HEAD OF THE PANCREAS OR URINARY TRACT ABSCESSES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH IMBALANCES BETWEEN THE PANCREAS AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS, THE RESET HELPS RESOLVE CONDITIONS OFTEN REFERRED TO AS \\\"HEPATITIS K\\\" OR \\\"HEPATITIS H.\\\" STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION ALLEVIATES CHRONIC INFLAMMATION IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, PREVENTING VALVE OBSTRUCTIONS AND RESTORING SYSTEMIC METABOLIC SYNERGY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA PRESENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA NEGATIVO DENTRO DEL CIRCUITO GLANDULAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LAS DISTORSIONES BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA QUE PUEDEN DERIVAR EN COMPLICACIONES GRAVES COMO EL C\\u00c1NCER EN LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS O ABSCESOS EN EL TRACTO URINARIO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESOLVER CONDICIONES A MENUDO DENOMINADAS \\\"HEPATITIS K\\\" O \\\"HEPATITIS H\\\". LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ALIVIA LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, PREVINIENDO OBSTRUCCIONES VALVULARES Y RESTAURANDO LA SINERGIA METAB\\u00d3LICA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & RENAL CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL HEPATITIS CORRELATIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING URINARY DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ BLADDER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER VALVE FUNCTION AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AFFECTING THE PANCREATIC HEAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RENAL: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES CORRELACIONES CON HEPATITIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR URINARIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ VEJIGA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] PARA ASEGURAR EL FUNCIONAMIENTO ADECUADO DE LA V\\u00c1LVULA Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTAN LA CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/342','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:52:37','2026-04-27 20:52:37'),(4141,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',343,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"UNIVERSAL PATHOGEN RESERVOIR (RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"SYSTEMIC IMBALANCE, RECURRING INFECTIONS, CHRONIC FATIGUE, AND METABOLIC INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(DESEQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO, INFECCIONES RECURRENTES, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA E INESTABILIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE FUNCTIONS AS A CRITICAL RESERVOIR PAIR WITHIN THE GLANDULAR SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HEAD AND THE TAIL OF THE PANCREAS, THE THERAPY TARGETS VARIOUS PATHOGENS\\u2014INCLUDING VIRUSES, BACTERIA, AND PARASITES\\u2014THAT \\\"HIDE\\\" IN THIS CIRCUIT TO AVOID IMMUNE DETECTION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, STABILIZING THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR BREAKING THE CYCLE OF RECURRING ILLNESSES, AS IT FORCES LATENT PATHOGENS INTO THE BLOODSTREAM WHERE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM CAN IDENTIFY AND ELIMINATE THEM. THE RESET RESTORES THE TOTAL BIOELECTRICAL INTEGRITY OF THE PANCREAS, SUPPORTING CONSISTENT ENZYMATIC PRODUCTION AND PREVENTING THE GLAND FROM ACTING AS A SAFE HAVEN FOR SYSTEMIC INFECTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA FUNCIONA COMO UN PAR RESERVORIO CR\\u00cdTICO DENTRO DEL SISTEMA GLANDULAR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA CABEZA Y LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, LA TERAPIA SE DIRIGE A DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS \\u2014INCLUYENDO VIRUS, BACTERIAS Y PAR\\u00c1SITOS\\u2014 QUE SE \\\"ESCONDEN\\\" EN ESTE CIRCUITO PARA EVITAR LA DETECCI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ROMPER EL CICLO DE ENFERMEDADES RECURRENTES, YA QUE OBLIGA A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS LATENTES A SALIR AL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO DONDE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PUEDE IDENTIFICARLOS Y ELIMINARLOS. EL REINICIO RESTAURA LA INTEGRIDAD BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA TOTAL DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, APOYANDO UNA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N ENZIM\\u00c1TICA CONSTANTE Y EVITANDO QUE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA ACT\\u00daE COMO UN REFUGIO SEGURO PARA LA INFECCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST AFTER CLEARING THIS PAIR, SCAN THE [VAGUS NERVE \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL HIDING PLACES. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT DIGESTIVE ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE THE BODY CAN EFFICIENTLY PROCESS THE TOXIC LOAD RELEASED FROM THE PANCREATIC RESERVOIR DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN DESPU\\u00c9S DE LIMPIAR ESTE PAR, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [NERVIO VAGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES LUGARES DE OCULTAMIENTO VIRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CUERPO PUEDA PROCESAR EFICIENTEMENTE LA CARGA T\\u00d3XICA LIBERADA DEL RESERVORIO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/343','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:53:54','2026-04-27 20:53:54'),(4142,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',344,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RESENTMENT (RESENTIMIENTO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"RESENTMENT, EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY, PALPITATIONS, AND UROGENITAL TENSION.\\n\\n(RESENTIMIENTO, RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL, PALPITACIONES Y TENSI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DEEP PSYCHOSOMATIC LINK BETWEEN THE HEART AND THE BLADDER, SPECIFICALLY FOCUSING ON THE EMOTION OF RESENTMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, RESENTMENT IS VIEWED AS AN ENERGETIC BURDEN THAT AFFECTS BOTH CIRCULATORY COHERENCE AND RENAL-URINARY ELIMINATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET FACILITATES THE RELEASE OF ACCUMULATED EMOTIONAL TOXICITY THAT MAY MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS CARDIAC SENSITIVITY OR URINARY RETENTION. STABILIZING THIS AXIS PROMOTES EMOTIONAL FLUIDITY AND RESTORES THE BALANCE BETWEEN THE INDIVIDUAL\'S AFFECTIVE CENTER AND THEIR CAPACITY TO \\\"LET GO\\\" OF PAST GRIEVANCES, SUPPORTING OVERALL BIOENERGETIC HARMONY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL V\\u00cdNCULO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO PROFUNDO ENTRE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y LA VEJIGA, CENTR\\u00c1NDOSE ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE EN LA EMOCI\\u00d3N DEL RESENTIMIENTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL RESENTIMIENTO SE CONSIDERA UNA CARGA ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE AFECTA TANTO LA COHERENCIA CIRCULATORIA COMO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL-URINARIA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO FACILITA LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL ACUMULADA QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO SENSIBILIDAD CARD\\u00cdACA O RETENCI\\u00d3N URINARIA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE PROMUEVE LA FLUIDEZ EMOCIONAL Y RESTAURA EL EQUILIBRIO ENTRE EL CENTRO AFECTIVO DEL INDIVIDUO Y SU CAPACIDAD DE \\\"SOLTAR\\\" AGRAVIOS PASADOS, APOYANDO LA ARMON\\u00cdA BIOENERG\\u00c9TICA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF RESENTMENT PERSISTS, SCAN THE [HEART \\/ HEART] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT EMOTIONAL TRAUMA. FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL STRESS IMPACTS URINARY FUNCTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ BLADDER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER INTEGRATION OF EMOTIONAL RELEASE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY FROM CHRONIC STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL RESENTIMIENTO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR TRAUMAS EMOCIONALES DIRECTOS. PARA CASOS DONDE EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL IMPACTE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N URINARIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ VEJIGA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/344','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:55:00','2026-04-27 20:55:00'),(4143,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',345,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN (DOLOR ABDOMINAL)\",\"paths\":\"ASPHYXIATION (\\nASFIXIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY AND ABDOMINAL COORDINATION (COORDINACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y ABDOMINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN, SENSATION OF ASPHYXIATION, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, AND CHEST TIGHTNESS.\\n\\n(DOLOR ABDOMINAL, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ASFIXIA, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR Y OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL DYSFUNCTION BETWEEN THE CARDIAC REGION AND THE LEFT LOWER RIB CAGE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING PSYCHOSOMATIC OR MECHANICAL INTERFERENCES THAT CAUSE A SENSATION OF ASPHYXIATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ALLEVIATES THE TENSION IN THE DIAPHRAGM AND ABDOMINAL WALL THAT OFTEN SIMULATES CARDIAC DISTRESS OR SEVERE BREATHING DIFFICULTIES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION RESTORES PROPER THORACIC EXPANSION AND ABDOMINAL COHERENCE, PREVENTING THE \\\"AIR HUNGER\\\" THAT CAN TRIGGER PANIC OR ACUTE PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA Y LA PARTE INFERIOR DE LA CAJA TOR\\u00c1CICA IZQUIERDA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESOLVER INTERFERENCIAS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICAS O MEC\\u00c1NICAS QUE CAUSAN UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ASFIXIA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO ALIVIA LA TENSI\\u00d3N EN EL DIAFRAGMA Y LA PARED ABDOMINAL QUE A MENUDO SIMULA UN MALESTAR CARD\\u00cdACO O DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS GRAVES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N RESTAURA LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N TOR\\u00c1CICA ADECUADA Y LA COHERENCIA ABDOMINAL, PREVINIENDO EL \\\"HAMBRE DE AIRE\\\" QUE PUEDE DESENCADENAR P\\u00c1NICO O MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO AGUDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF THE SENSATION OF ASPHYXIATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DIAFRAGM \\/ DIAFRAGM] AXIS TO IMPROVE MECHANICAL VENTILATION. FOR CASES WHERE CHEST PAIN IS LINKED TO ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEART \\/ BLADDER] (REF 353) RESONANCE TO RELEASE ACCUMULATED EMOTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER OXYGENATION AND TO RULE OUT ANY OBSTRUCTIVE PATHOGENIC LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y EMOCIONAL: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ASFIXIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DIAFRAGMA \\/ DIAFRAGMA] PARA MEJORAR LA VENTILACI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA. PARA CASOS DONDE EL DOLOR TOR\\u00c1CICO EST\\u00c9 VINCULADO A LA ANSIEDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 353) PARA LIBERAR EMOCIONES ACUMULADAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA OXIGENACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA Y DESCARTAR CUALQUIER CARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA OBSTRUCTIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/345','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:56:02','2026-04-27 20:56:02'),(4144,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',346,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"NEGATIVITY (NEGATIVIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC NEGATIVITY (NEGATIVIDAD PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"PESSIMISM, NEGATIVE THOUGHT PATTERNS, EMOTIONAL FATIGUE, AND FEELINGS OF DEJECTION.\\n\\n(PESIMISMO, PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO NEGATIVOS, FATIGA EMOCIONAL Y SENTIMIENTOS DE ABATIMIENTO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE IS SPECIFICALLY DESIGNED TO ADDRESS THE ACCUMULATION OF NEGATIVITY WITHIN THE INDIVIDUAL\'S EMOTIONAL CORE. BY PLACING MAGNETS DIRECTLY OVER THE HEART REGION, THE THERAPY TARGETS THE BIOELECTRICAL FREQUENCIES ASSOCIATED WITH PESSIMISTIC OUTLOOKS AND EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS HELPS TO PURGE THE SYSTEM OF RECURRING NEGATIVE THOUGHT LOOPS THAT CAN LEAD TO PHYSICAL EXHAUSTION OR CARDIAC SENSITIVITY. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT PROMOTES A REBALANCING OF THE HEART\'S ENERGETIC FIELD, ENCOURAGING A SHIFT TOWARD POSITIVE EMOTIONAL COHERENCE AND RESTORING THE VITALITY NEEDED TO OVERCOME PSYCHOSOMATIC STAGNATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE PARA ABORDAR LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE NEGATIVIDAD DENTRO DEL N\\u00daCLEO EMOCIONAL DEL INDIVIDUO. AL COLOCAR IMANES DIRECTAMENTE SOBRE LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N, LA TERAPIA SE DIRIGE A LAS FRECUENCIAS BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICAS ASOCIADAS CON PERSPECTIVAS PESIMISTAS Y PESADEZ EMOCIONAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE AYUDA A PURGAR EL SISTEMA DE CICLOS RECURRENTES DE PENSAMIENTO NEGATIVO QUE PUEDEN DERIVAR EN AGOTAMIENTO F\\u00cdSICO O SENSIBILIDAD CARD\\u00cdACA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO PROMUEVE UN REEQUILIBRIO DEL CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N, FOMENTANDO UN CAMBIO HACIA LA COHERENCIA EMOCIONAL POSITIVA Y RESTAURANDO LA VITALIDAD NECESARIA PARA SUPERAR EL ESTANCAMIENTO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & VASCULAR CHECK: IF NEGATIVITY IS LINKED TO DEEP-SEATED GRIEF, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL STRESS AFFECTS SLEEP OR INTUITION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ HEART] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ BLADDER] (REF 353) CIRCUIT TO RELEASE ANY UNDERLYING RESENTMENT THAT MAY BE FUELING THE PERSISTENT NEGATIVE STATE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y VASCULAR: SI LA NEGATIVIDAD EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A UN DUELO PROFUNDO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. PARA CASOS DONDE EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL AFECTE EL SUE\\u00d1O O LA INTUICI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 353) PARA LIBERAR CUALQUIER RESENTIMIENTO SUBYACENTE QUE PUEDA ESTAR ALIMENTANDO EL ESTADO NEGATIVO PERSISTENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/346','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:57:14','2026-04-27 20:57:14'),(4145,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',347,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DISTRESS (ANGUSTIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DISTRESS (ANGUSTIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ACUTE ANXIETY, FEELINGS OF HELPLESSNESS, CHEST TIGHTNESS, AND RENAL TENSION.\\n\\n(ANGUSTIA AGUDA, SENTIMIENTOS DE DESAMPARO, OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO Y TENSI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PROFOUND BIOENERGETIC CONNECTION BETWEEN CARDIAC COHERENCE AND RENAL VITALITY, SPECIFICALLY TARGETING THE EMOTIONAL STATE OF DISTRESS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, DISTRESS IS VIEWED AS A DYSFUNCTION THAT UNBALANCES THE \\\"FIRE\\\" ELEMENT OF THE HEART AND THE \\\"WATER\\\" ELEMENT OF THE KIDNEYS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HEART AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY, THE RESET HELPS TO DISSIPATE THE OVERWHELMING SENSATION OF ANXIETY OR HELPLESSNESS THAT CAN MANIFEST AS PHYSICAL TIGHTNESS. STABILIZING THIS AXIS RESTORES A SENSE OF SECURITY AND CALM, ALLOWING THE BODY TO PROCESS EMOTIONAL TURBULENCE WITHOUT COMPROMISING VASCULAR OR RENAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA PROFUNDA CONEXI\\u00d3N BIOENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE LA COHERENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y LA VITALIDAD RENAL, DIRIGI\\u00c9NDOSE ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE AL ESTADO EMOCIONAL DE ANGUSTIA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA ANGUSTIA SE CONSIDERA UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N QUE DESEQUILIBRA EL ELEMENTO \\\"FUEGO\\\" DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL ELEMENTO \\\"AGUA\\\" DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DISIPAR LA SENSACI\\u00d3N ABRUMADORA DE ANSIEDAD O DESAMPARO QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO RIGIDEZ F\\u00cdSICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE RESTAURA UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SEGURIDAD Y CALMA, PERMITIENDO QUE EL CUERPO PROCESE LA TURBULENCIA EMOCIONAL SIN COMPROMETER LA FUNCI\\u00d3N VASCULAR O RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & VITALITY CHECK: IF THE SENSATION OF DISTRESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [HEART \\/ HEART] (REF 355) AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT EMOTIONAL NEGATIVITY. FOR CASES WHERE DISTRESS IS LINKED TO FEAR, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO REINFORCE SYSTEMIC VITALITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE INTEGRATION OF EMOTIONAL PEACE AND TO BALANCE THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y DE VITALIDAD: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ANGUSTIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 355) PARA ABORDAR LA NEGATIVIDAD EMOCIONAL DIRECTA. PARA CASOS DONDE LA ANGUSTIA EST\\u00c9 VINCULADA AL MIEDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA REFORZAR LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE LA PAZ EMOCIONAL Y EQUILIBRAR LA RESPUESTA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/347','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 20:58:24','2026-04-27 20:58:24'),(4146,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',348,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ENVY (ENVIDIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENVY (ENVIDIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, FEELINGS OF INSECURITY, DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, AND HEART PALPITATIONS LINKED TO EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, SENTIMIENTOS DE INSEGURIDAD, MALESTAR DIGESTIVO Y PALPITACIONES CARD\\u00cdACAS VINCULADAS AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PSYCHOSOMATIC INTERACTION BETWEEN THE HEART AND THE PANCREAS, SPECIFICALLY TARGETING THE EMOTIONAL FREQUENCY OF ENVY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, ENVY IS RECOGNIZED AS A VIBRATIONAL DISTORTION THAT CAN AFFECT BOTH CARDIAC RHYTHM AND GLANDULAR SECRETION. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH IN THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS TO DISSIPATE THE TOXIC EMOTIONAL ENERGY THAT INTERFERES WITH METABOLIC BALANCE AND EMOTIONAL COHERENCE. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT PROMOTES A SENSE OF INNER CONTENTMENT AND SUPPORTS THE PANCREAS IN ITS ENZYMATIC FUNCTIONS BY REMOVING THE ENERGETIC \\\"WEIGHT\\\" OF NEGATIVE COMPARISON OR RESENTMENT TOWARD OTHERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA ENTRE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL P\\u00c1NCREAS, DIRIGI\\u00c9NDOSE ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE A LA FRECUENCIA EMOCIONAL DE LA ENVIDIA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA ENVIDIA SE RECONOCE COMO UNA DISTORSI\\u00d3N VIBRATORIA QUE PUEDE AFECTAR TANTO EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO COMO LA SECRECI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. AL NEUTRALIZAR EL PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DISIPAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA EMOCIONAL T\\u00d3XICA QUE INTERFIERE CON EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y LA COHERENCIA EMOCIONAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO PROMUEVE UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SATISFACCI\\u00d3N INTERIOR Y APOYA AL P\\u00c1NCREAS EN SUS FUNCIONES ENZIM\\u00c1TICAS AL ELIMINAR EL \\\"PESO\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LA COMPARACI\\u00d3N NEGATIVA O EL RESENTIMIENTO HACIA LOS DEM\\u00c1S.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF FEELINGS OF INSECURITY PERSIST, SCAN THE [HEART \\/ HEART] (REF 355) AXIS TO CLEAR DIRECT NEGATIVITY. FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL STRESS IMPACTS BLOOD SUGAR LEVELS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ TAIL OF PANCREAS] (REF 352) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ BLADDER] (REF 353) CIRCUIT TO ENSURE THE RELEASE OF ANY UNDERLYING RESENTMENT THAT MAY BE COUPLING WITH THE ENVY FREQUENCY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS SENTIMIENTOS DE INSEGURIDAD PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 355) PARA LIMPIAR LA NEGATIVIDAD DIRECTA. PARA CASOS DONDE EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL IMPACTE LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 352). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 353) PARA ASEGURAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE CUALQUIER RESENTIMIENTO SUBYACENTE QUE PUEDA ESTAR ACOPL\\u00c1NDOSE A LA FRECUENCIA DE LA ENVIDIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/348','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:02:01','2026-04-27 21:02:01'),(4147,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',349,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MUSCLE PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, DIARRHEA. (FIEBRE, DOLOR MUSCULAR, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"DEMYELINATING DISEASE OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN WHICH THE MYELIN SHEATH OF NEURONS IS DAMAGED. (ENFERMEDAD DESMIELINIZANTE DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN LA QUE LA VAINA DE MIELINA DE LAS NEURONAS EST\\u00c1 DA\\u00d1ADA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MUSCLE PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, DIARRHEA, AND POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL IMPAIRMENT.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DOLOR MUSCULAR, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA Y POSIBLE DETERIORO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE IS A PRIMARY AXIS FOR NEUTRALIZING LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES, A PATHOGEN KNOWN FOR ITS ABILITY TO CAUSE DEMYELINATING EFFECTS WITHIN THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR ADDRESSES THE BACTERIA\'S IMPACT ON THE MYELIN SHEATH OF NEURONS, WHICH CAN LEAD TO COORDINATION ISSUES OR SYMPTOMS RESEMBLING AUTOIMMUNE CONDITIONS. BY STABILIZING THE PH BETWEEN THE HEART AND THE LEFT PLEURA, THE RESET PROTECTS THE CARDIOVASCULAR AND NEUROLOGICAL INTEGRITY OF THE BODY. THE CLEARANCE OF THIS PATHOGEN IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESOLVING CHRONIC FEVERS AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS, ENSURING THAT THE BACTERIAL LOAD DOES NOT PROGRESS TO MORE SEVERE SYSTEMIC OR CEREBRAL COMPLICATIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ES UN EJE PRIMARIO PARA NEUTRALIZAR LA LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES, UN PAT\\u00d3GENO CONOCIDO POR SU CAPACIDAD DE CAUSAR EFECTOS DESMIELINIZANTES DENTRO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ABORDA EL IMPACTO DE LA BACTERIA EN LA VAINA DE MIELINA DE LAS NEURONAS, LO QUE PUEDE DERIVAR EN PROBLEMAS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N O S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE SE ASEMEJAN A CONDICIONES AUTOINMUNES. AL ESTABILIZAR EL PH ENTRE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y LA PLEURA IZQUIERDA, EL REINICIO PROTEGE LA INTEGRIDAD CARDIOVASCULAR Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA DEL CUERPO. LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ESENCIAL PARA RESOLVER FIEBRES CR\\u00d3NICAS Y MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL, ASEGURANDO QUE LA CARGA BACTERIANA NO PROGRESE HACIA COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS O CEREBRALES M\\u00c1S GRAVES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-GLANDULAR CHECK: TO FULLY ERADICATE THE BACTERIAL LOAD, SCAN THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ CERVICAL PLEXUS - L] (REF 349) AXIS, AS THIS IS A FREQUENT CROSS-RESONANCE FOR LISTERIA. IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS OR MUSCLE WEAKNESS PERSIST, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM RECOVERY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE TOXIC BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE TREATMENT OF THIS BACTERIAL INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROGLANDULAR: PARA ERRADICAR COMPLETAMENTE LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ PLEXO CERVICAL - I] (REF 349), YA QUE ES UNA RESONANCIA CRUZADA FRECUENTE PARA LA LISTERIA. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O LA DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR PERSISTEN, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS T\\u00d3XICOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/349','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:03:35','2026-04-27 21:03:35'),(4148,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',350,'{\"symptoms\":\"BRONCHITIS, EMPHYSEMA, COLDS. (BRONQUITIS, ENFISEMA, RESFRIADOS)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY TRACT INFECTION, OTITIS, PULMONARY INFECTIONS, COPD (CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE) (INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO, OTITIS, INFECCIONES PULMONARES, EPOC (ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA))\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BRONCHITIS, EMPHYSEMA, AND COLDS.\\n\\n(BRONQUITIS, ENFISEMA Y RESFRIADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE HEART AND THE STOMACH. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CLINICALLY LINKED TO RESPIRATORY TRACT INFECTIONS, OTITIS, AND PULMONARY COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS COPD (CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE). BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS JUNCTION, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CAUSE LUNG CONGESTION AND CHRONIC INFLAMMATION. STABILIZING THIS AXIS RESTORES PROPER RESPIRATORY FUNCTION AND PREVENTS THE PROGRESSION OF INFECTIOUS STATES WITHIN THE BRONCHIAL TREE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL EST\\u00d3MAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO, OTITIS Y COMPLICACIONES PULMONARES COMO LA EPOC (ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA). AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA UNI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE CAUSAN CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE RESTAURA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA ADECUADA Y PREVIENE LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE ESTADOS INFECCIOSOS DENTRO DEL \\u00c1RBOL BRONQUIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & PULMONARY CHECK: IF BRONCHIAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT PULMONARY CONGESTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE OTITIS OR EAR DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CRANIAL \\/ CRANIAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RECOVERY PERIOD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y PULMONAR: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS BRONQUIALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN OTITIS SEVERA O MALESTAR EN EL O\\u00cdDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CRANEAL \\/ CRANEAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PERIODO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/350','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:04:43','2026-04-27 21:04:43'),(4149,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',351,'{\"symptoms\":\"FROZEN SHOULDER, MOTOR DISORDERS , MUCUS MEMBRANE INFECTIONS. (HOMBRO CONGELADO, TRASTORNOS MOTORES, INFECCIONES DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS)\",\"paths\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH IUD IMPLANT IN WOMEN, ORAL, PULMONARY AND GASTROINTESTINAL ABSCESSES. (ASOCIADO CON EL IMPLANTE DE DIU EN MUJERES, ABSCESOS ORALES, PULMONARES Y GASTROINTESTINALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - LUNG\\/CORONARY              CHECK - PERICARDIUM\\/PERICARDIUM (REVISAR - PULM\\u00d3N\\/CORONARIA\\nREVISAR - PERICARDIO\\/PERICARDIO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FROZEN SHOULDER, MOTOR DISORDERS, AND MUCUS MEMBRANE INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(HOMBRO CONGELADO, TRASTORNOS MOTORES E INFECCIONES DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF ACTINOMYCES, A BACTERIA OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE PRESENCE OF INTRAUTERINE DEVICES (IUDS) IN WOMEN, BUT WHICH CAN ALSO AFFECT ANY INDIVIDUAL BY CAUSING ABSCESSES IN VARIOUS AREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING DEEP INFECTIONS IN THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES AND SOFT TEGUMENTS, FREQUENTLY MANIFESTING AS ORAL, PULMONARY, OR GASTROINTESTINAL ABSCESSES. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH BETWEEN THE HEART AND THE LEFT SUPRA-POPLITEAL POINT, THE RESET HELPS TO STOP THE BACTERIAL PROGRESSION, ALLEVIATING THE CHARACTERISTIC RIGIDITY OF \\\"FROZEN SHOULDER\\\" AND RESTORING MOTOR COORDINATION AFFECTED BY BACTERIAL TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE ACTINOMYCES, UNA BACTERIA QUE A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON LA PRESENCIA DE DISPOSITIVOS INTRAUTERINOS (DIU) EN MUJERES, PERO QUE TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE AFECTAR A CUALQUIER INDIVIDUO PROVOCANDO ABSCESOS EN DIVERSAS \\u00c1REAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES PROFUNDAS EN LAS MUCOSAS Y TEJIDOS BLANDOS, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE FRECUENTEMENTE COMO ABSCESOS ORALES, PULMONARES O GASTROINTESTINALES. AL NEUTRALIZAR EL PH ENTRE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y EL PUNTO SUPRAPOPL\\u00cdTEO IZQUIERDO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DETENER LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE LA BACTERIA, ALIVIANDO LA RIGIDEZ CARACTER\\u00cdSTICA DEL \\\"HOMBRO CONGELADO\\\" Y RESTAURANDO LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA AFECTADA POR LA TOXICIDAD BACTERIANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PULMONARY & PERICARDIAL CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS OR SHOULDER PAIN PERSIST, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ CORONARY] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VASCULAR COMPLICATIONS. FOR CASES WITH SEVERE THORACIC INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER DRAINAGE OF ABSCESSES DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y PERIC\\u00c1RDICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS O EL DOLOR EN EL HOMBRO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ CORONARIA] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES VASCULARES. PARA CASOS CON INFLAMACI\\u00d3N TOR\\u00c1CICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO DEL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO PARA ASEGURAR EL DRENAJE ADECUADO DE LOS ABSCESOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/351','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:06:26','2026-04-27 21:06:26'),(4150,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',352,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"METABOLIC (METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"TACHYCARDIA, HEART PALPITATIONS, EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, AND METABOLIC DISTURBANCES.\\n\\n(TAQUICARDIA, PALPITACIONES CARD\\u00cdACAS, INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y DISTURBIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL DYSFUNCTION BETWEEN THE HEART AND THE THYROID GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR STABILIZING THE METABOLIC RATE AND THE CARDIAC RESPONSE TO HORMONAL FLUCTUATIONS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS TO CALM AN OVERACTIVE CARDIAC RHYTHM OFTEN TRIGGERED BY THYROID IMBALANCES. THE THERAPY PROMOTES SYSTEMIC COHERENCE, REDUCING THE PHYSICAL MANIFESTATIONS OF STRESS AND ENSURING THAT THE GLANDULAR SYSTEM DOES NOT OVERSTIMULATE VASCULAR FUNCTION, THEREBY RESTORING BOTH EMOTIONAL AND METABOLIC EQUILIBRIUM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ESTABILIZAR EL RITMO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y LA RESPUESTA CARD\\u00cdACA A LAS FLUCTUACIONES HORMONALES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR UN RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO HIPERACTIVO A MENUDO DESENCADENADO POR DESEQUILIBRIOS TIROIDEOS. LA TERAPIA PROMUEVE LA COHERENCIA SIST\\u00c9MICA, REDUCIENDO LAS MANIFESTACIONES F\\u00cdSICAS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S Y ASEGURANDO QUE EL SISTEMA GLANDULAR NO SOBREESTIMULE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N VASCULAR, RESTAURANDO AS\\u00cd EL EQUILIBRIO TANTO EMOCIONAL COMO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF PALPITATIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE [HEART \\/ HEART] (REF 355) AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT EMOTIONAL NEGATIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SIGNIFICANT WEIGHT OR ENERGY FLUCTUATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE TO REINFORCE GLANDULAR STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM COORDINATION AND TO SUPPORT THE INTEGRATION OF METABOLIC RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y EMOCIONAL: SI LAS PALPITACIONES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 355) PARA ABORDAR LA NEGATIVIDAD EMOCIONAL DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FLUCTUACIONES SIGNIFICATIVAS DE PESO O ENERG\\u00cdA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIDAD GLANDULAR. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA COORDINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO Y APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DEL REINICIO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/352','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:07:36','2026-04-27 21:07:36'),(4151,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',353,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WITCHCRAFT (BRUJER\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EXTERNAL ENERGY INTERFERENCE (INTERFERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA EXTERNA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEAVINESS IN THE FEET, CHRONIC FATIGUE, UNEXPLAINED PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT, AND PSYCHOLOGICAL OPPRESSION.\\n\\n(PESADEZ EN LOS PIES, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO INEXPLICABLE Y OPRESI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES BIOENERGETIC IMBALANCES TRADITIONALLY ASSOCIATED WITH EXTERNAL NEGATIVE INFLUENCES OR \\\"WITCHCRAFT\\\" (BRUJER\\u00cdA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE HEELS ARE CONSIDERED ANCHOR POINTS FOR THE BODY\'S ENERGY FIELD; DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN MANIFEST AS A SENSATION OF BEING \\\"GROUNDED\\\" IN NEGATIVITY OR STRUGGLING TO MOVE FORWARD IN LIFE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH IMBALANCES AT BOTH HEELS, THE RESET PURGES THE SYSTEM OF NON-RESONANT ENERGY FREQUENCIES, RESTORING THE INDIVIDUAL\'S NATURAL VIBRATIONAL SHIELD AND ENCOURAGING A RENEWED SENSE OF PHYSICAL AND EMOTIONAL LIGHTNESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA DESEQUILIBRIOS BIOENERG\\u00c9TICOS ASOCIADOS TRADICIONALMENTE CON INFLUENCIAS NEGATIVAS EXTERNAS O \\\"BRUJER\\u00cdA\\\". EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS TALONES SE CONSIDERAN PUNTOS DE ANCLAJE PARA EL CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CUERPO; LAS DISTORSIONES EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDEN MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ESTAR \\\"ANCLADO\\\" EN LA NEGATIVIDAD O DIFICULTAD PARA AVANZAR EN LA VIDA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE PH EN AMBOS TALONES, EL REINICIO PURGA EL SISTEMA DE FRECUENCIAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS NO RESONANTES, RESTAURANDO EL ESCUDO VIBRATORIO NATURAL DEL INDIVIDUO Y FOMENTANDO UNA RENOVADA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE LIGEREZA F\\u00cdSICA Y EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENERGY & GROUNDING CHECK: IF THE FEELING OF HEAVINESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO REINFORCE SYSTEMIC VITALITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEART \\/ HEART] (REF 355) RESONANCE TO CLEAR INTERNAL NEGATIVITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ PINEAL GLAND] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER BIOELECTRICAL ALIGNMENT AND PROTECTION AGAINST FURTHER VIBRATIONAL INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ENERG\\u00cdA Y ANCLAJE: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PESADEZ PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA REFORZAR LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN MALESTAR EMOCIONAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 355) PARA LIMPIAR LA NEGATIVIDAD INTERNA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ADECUADA Y PROTECCI\\u00d3N CONTRA M\\u00c1S INTERFERENCIAS VIBRATORIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/353','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:08:39','2026-04-27 21:08:39'),(4152,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',354,'{\"symptoms\":\"FATIGUE AND INSOMNIA. PSYCHOLOGICAL SYMPTOMS. (FATIGA E INSOMNIO. S\\u00cdNTOMAS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS)\",\"paths\":\"MONONUCLEOSIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE, INSOMNIA, PSYCHOLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, AND MALAISE.\\n\\n(FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, INSOMNIO, S\\u00cdNTOMAS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS Y MALESTAR GENERAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE EPSTEIN-BARR VIRUS (EBV) BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS OF THE HEELS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CLINICALLY LINKED TO INFECTIOUS MONONUCLEOSIS AND ITS PERSISTENT SYSTEMIC EFFECTS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH IMBALANCES IN THIS PAIR, THE RESET HELPS TO ALLEVIATE THE DEBILITATING FATIGUE AND COGNITIVE \\\"FOG\\\" OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THIS VIRAL LOAD. STABILIZING THIS AXIS SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING VIRAL REPLICATION, PROMOTING THE RESTORATION OF NATURAL SLEEP PATTERNS AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY BY REMOVING THE ENERGETIC STRESS THE VIRUS PLACES ON THE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE EPSTEIN-BARR (VEB) MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LOS TALONES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON LA MONONUCLEOSIS INFECCIOSA Y SUS EFECTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS PERSISTENTES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE PH EN ESTE PAR, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ALIVIAR LA FATIGA DEBILITANTE Y LA \\\"NEBLINA\\\" COGNITIVA QUE A MENUDO SE ASOCIAN CON ESTA CARGA VIRAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DE LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL, PROMOVIENDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS PATRONES NATURALES DE SUE\\u00d1O Y LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL AL ELIMINAR EL ESTR\\u00c9S ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE EL VIRUS EJERCE SOBRE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SORE THROAT OR GLANDULAR SWELLING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN FILTERING VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA FATIGA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ BAZO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES RESERVORIOS VIRALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR DE GARGANTA SEVERO O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ BAZO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A FILTRAR LAS TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/354','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:10:29','2026-04-27 21:10:29'),(4153,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',355,'{\"paths\":\"INFLAMMATION IN LYMPHATIC SYSTEM. RESPIRATORY DISEASE. TUMORS AND CANCER. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO. ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA. TUMORES Y C\\u00c1NCER)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH FALLOPIAN TUBE\\/FALLOPIAN TUBE;PARVOVIRUS. (ASOCIADO CON TROMPA DE FALOPIO\\/TROMPA DE FALOPIO; PARVOVIRUS)\"}','{\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF ADENOVIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS OF THE HEPATIC LIGAMENTS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR HALTING INFLAMMATION IN THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM AND PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF RESPIRATORY DISEASES THAT CAN LEAD TO MORE SERIOUS COMPLICATIONS, SUCH AS TUMORS OR ONCOLOGICAL STATES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS JUNCTION, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING VIRAL LOADS THAT AFFECT HEPATIC AND RESPIRATORY FUNCTION, RESTORING VITAL COHERENCE AND THE CAPACITY TO RESPOND TO SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS.(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL ADENOVIRUS AL ESTABILIZAR EL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LOS LIGAMENTOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA DETENER LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO Y PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE ENFERMEDADES RESPIRATORIAS QUE PUEDEN DERIVAR EN COMPLICACIONES M\\u00c1S GRAVES, COMO TUMORES O ESTADOS ONCOL\\u00d3GICOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA UNI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS VIRALES QUE AFECTAN LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RESPIRATORIA, RESTAURANDO LA COHERENCIA VITAL Y LA CAPACIDAD DE RESPUESTA ANTE INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GENITAL & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [FALLOPIAN TUBE \\/ FALLOPIAN TUBE] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CORRELATIONS WITH PARVOVIRUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LYMPHATIC CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE THE BODY CAN EFFICIENTLY PROCESS THE TOXIC LOAD RELEASED DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GENITAL Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TROMPA DE FALOPIO \\/ TROMPA DE FALOPIO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES CORRELACIONES CON EL PARVOVIRUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ BAZO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CUERPO PUEDA PROCESAR EFICIENTEMENTE LA CARGA T\\u00d3XICA LIBERADA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/355','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:13:12','2026-04-27 21:13:12'),(4154,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',356,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FALSE DIABETES (FALSA DIABETES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLUCOSE METABOLISM DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL METABOLISMO DE LA GLUCOSA)\",\"symptoms\":\"THIRST, FREQUENT URINATION, FATIGUE, AND SYMPTOMS MIMICKING DIABETES MELLITUS.\\n\\n(SED, MICCI\\u00d3N FRECUENTE, FATIGA Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE IMITAN LA DIABETES MELLITUS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CONDITION KNOWN AS \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" (FALSA DIABETES). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR DIFFERENTIATING BETWEEN INSULIN-DEPENDENT DIABETES AND METABOLIC DISTORTIONS CAUSED BY BIOELECTRICAL IMBALANCES IN THE LIVER\'S SUSPENSORY APPARATUS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE HEPATIC LIGAMENT AND THE COSTAL REGION, THE RESET RESTORES THE LIVER\'S CAPACITY TO REGULATE GLUCOSE LEVELS WITHOUT GLANDULAR PERMANENT DAMAGE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION ALIEVIATES SYSTEMIC SUGAR FLUCTUATIONS AND SUPPORTS THE REESTABLISHMENT OF PROPER HEPATIC FUNCTION, PREVENTING MISDIAGNOSIS AND UNNECESSARY CHRONIC TREATMENTS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA CONDICI\\u00d3N CONOCIDA COMO \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\". EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA DIFERENCIAR ENTRE LA DIABETES INSULINODEPENDIENTE Y LAS DISTORSIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS CAUSADAS POR DESEQUILIBRIOS BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICOS EN EL APARATO SUSPENSORIO DEL H\\u00cdGADO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL LIGAMENTO HEP\\u00c1TICO Y LA REGI\\u00d3N COSTAL, EL REINICIO RESTAURA LA CAPACIDAD DEL H\\u00cdGADO PARA REGULAR LOS NIVELES DE GLUCOSA SIN DA\\u00d1O GLANDULAR PERMANENTE. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ALIVIA LAS FLUCTUACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS DE AZ\\u00daCAR Y APOYA EL REESTABLECIMIENTO DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA ADECUADA, PREVINIENDO DIAGN\\u00d3STICOS ERR\\u00d3NEOS Y TRATAMIENTOS CR\\u00d3NICOS INNECESARIOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF SUGAR LEVELS REMAIN UNSTABLE, SCAN THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ TAIL OF PANCREAS] (REF 352) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS DIRECT PANCREATIC RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING HEPATIC CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY FROM GLUCOSE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR PERMANECEN INESTABLES, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 352) PARA ABORDAR RESERVORIOS PANCRE\\u00c1TICOS DIRECTOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE GLUCOSA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/356','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:14:26','2026-04-27 21:14:26'),(4155,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',357,'{\"symptoms\":\"FLU, COLD SYMPTOMS (S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GRIPE Y RESFRIADO)\",\"paths\":\"PNEUMONIA (NEUMON\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FLU, COLD SYMPTOMS, FEVER, AND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GRIPE Y RESFRIADO, FIEBRE Y DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE HEPATIC LIGAMENT AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS INTO SEVERE PNEUMONIA. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS JUNCTION, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING BACTERIAL LOADS THAT TARGET THE LUNGS AND UPPER RESPIRATORY TRACT. STABILIZING THIS AXIS RESTORES PROPER PULMONARY VENTILATION AND ENSURES THAT THE BODY CAN EFFECTIVELY MANAGE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, REDUCING THE RISK OF INFECTIOUS COMPLICATIONS IN THE BRONCHIAL TREE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL LIGAMENTO HEP\\u00c1TICO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS HACIA UNA NEUMON\\u00cdA GRAVE. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA UNI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE AFECTAN LOS PULMONES Y EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE RESTAURA LA VENTILACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR ADECUADA Y ASEGURA QUE EL CUERPO PUEDA MANEJAR EFICAZMENTE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE COMPLICACIONES INFECCIOSAS EN EL \\u00c1RBOL BRONQUIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PULMONARY & RENAL CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF PNEUMONIA OR SEVERE COLD PERSIST, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT PULMONARY CONGESTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING HIGH FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEPATIC LIGAMENT \\/ HEPATIC LIGAMENT] (REF 364) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL CO-INFECTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y RENAL: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE NEUMON\\u00cdA O RESFRIADO SEVERO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE ALTA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LIGAMENTO HEP\\u00c1TICO \\/ LIGAMENTO HEP\\u00c1TICO] (REF 364) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES VIRALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/357','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:15:26','2026-04-27 21:15:26'),(4156,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',358,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY BIRDS AND BATS. AFFECTS THE BLADDER AND THE LUNGS. (TRANSMITIDO POR AVES Y MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS. AFECTA LA VEJIGA Y LOS PULMONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, CHEST PAIN, FEVER, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, AND URINARY DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(TOS, DOLOR EN EL PECHO, FIEBRE, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR Y MALESTAR URINARIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS HISTOPLASMA CAPSULATUM, A FUNGUS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH BIRD OR BAT DROPPINGS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS A COMPLEX PATHOGENIC LOAD THAT SIMULTANEOUSLY AFFECTS THE RESPIRATORY AND URINARY SYSTEMS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HIATUS AND THE BLADDER, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING FUNGAL SPORES THAT CAN CAUSE PULMONARY INFLAMMATION AND BLADDER IRRITATION. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESOLVING PERSISTENT RESPIRATORY ISSUES THAT DO NOT RESPOND TO ANTIBIOTICS, ENSURING THE PATHOGEN DOES NOT SPREAD SYSTEMICALLY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL HISTOPLASMA CAPSULATUM, UN HONGO TRANSMITIDO T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR EL CONTACTO CON EXCREMENTOS DE AVES O MURCI\\u00c9LAGOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA UNA CARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA COMPLEJA QUE AFECTA SIMULT\\u00c1NEAMENTE LOS SISTEMAS RESPIRATORIO Y URINARIO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL HIATO Y LA VEJIGA, EL REINICIO APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS F\\u00daNGICAS QUE PUEDEN CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO ES ESENCIAL PARA RESOLVER PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTENTES QUE NO RESPONDEN A LOS ANTIBI\\u00d3TICOS, ASEGURANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO NO SE REPRODUZCA DE MANERA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & PULMONARY CHECK: IF LUNG CONGESTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT PULMONARY TISSUE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTRIC REFLUX OR DIAPHRAGMATIC TENSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HIATUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS OF THE FUNGAL LOAD DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y PULMONAR: SI LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR DIRECTAMENTE EL TEJIDO PULMONAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN REFLUJO G\\u00c1STRICO SEVERO O TENSI\\u00d3N DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [HIATO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/358','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:16:23','2026-04-27 21:16:23'),(4157,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',359,'{\"symptoms\":\"BAD BREATH, FLU SYMPTOMS, BRONCHITIS, PNEUMONIA, PHLEGM AND COUGH, ACID REFLUX, GASTRITIS, PAIN IN THE CHEST. (MAL ALIENTO, S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GRIPE, BRONQUITIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, FLEMA Y TOS, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO, GASTRITIS, DOLOR EN EL PECHO)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTACT WITH FECES AND ANIMALS OR PEOPLE. LUNG INFECTIONS AND SEVERE BREATHING PROBLEMS. GASTRO-ESOPHAGEAL REFLUX. (TRANSMITIDO POR CONTACTO CON HECES Y ANIMALES O PERSONAS. INFECCIONES PULMONARES Y PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS GRAVES. REFLUJO GASTROESOF\\u00c1GICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH THYMUS; IMMUNODEFICIENCY.   CHECK - HUMERUS. (ASOCIADO CON EL TIMO; INMUNODEFICIENCIA.\\nREVISAR - H\\u00daMERO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"BAD BREATH, FLU SYMPTOMS, BRONCHITIS, PNEUMONIA, PHLEGM AND COUGH, ACID REFLUX, GASTRITIS, AND CHEST PAIN.\\n\\n(MAL ALIENTO, S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GRIPE, BRONQUITIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, FLEMA Y TOS, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO, GASTRITIS Y DOLOR EN EL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF ENTEROBACTER PNEUMONIAE, A BACTERIA OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH INFECTED INDIVIDUALS, ANIMALS, OR CONTAMINATED FECAL MATTER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR TREATING SEVERE RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS AND GASTRO-ESOPHAGEAL ISSUES SIMULTANEOUSLY. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HIATUS AND THE ESOPHAGUS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN ELIMINATING BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CAUSE PULMONARY CONGESTION AND DIGESTIVE INFLAMMATION. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT RELIEVES THE DIAPHRAGMATIC TENSION RESPONSIBLE FOR REFLUUX AND SUPPORTS THE RECOVERY OF THE BRONCHIAL TREE, PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION TOWARD CHRONIC LUNG CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE ENTEROBACTER PNEUMONIAE, UNA BACTERIA TRANSMITIDA A MENUDO POR EL CONTACTO CON INDIVIDUOS INFECTADOS, ANIMALES O MATERIA FECAL CONTAMINADA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA TRATAR SIMULT\\u00c1NEAMENTE INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS GRAVES Y PROBLEMAS GASTROESOF\\u00c1GICOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL HIATO Y EL ES\\u00d3FAGO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE CAUSAN CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO ALIVIA LA TENSI\\u00d3N DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA RESPONSABLE DEL REFLUJO Y APOYA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL \\u00c1RBOL BRONQUIAL, PREVINIENDO LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N HACIA CONDICIONES PULMONARES CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE & RESPIRATORY CHECK: THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] AXIS, INDICATING A POTENTIAL IMMUNODEFICIENCY STATE; SCAN TO REINFORCE SYSTEMIC DEFENSES. IF BRONCHIAL SYMPTOMS OR CHEST PAIN PERSIST, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HUMERUS \\/ HUMERUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE TREATMENT OF GASTROINTESTINAL OR PULMONARY INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y RESPIRATORIA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL EJE [TIMO \\/ TIMO], LO QUE INDICA UN POSIBLE ESTADO DE INMUNODEFICIENCIA; ESCANEAR PARA REFORZAR LAS DEFENSAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS BRONQUIALES O EL DOLOR EN EL PECHO PERSISTEN, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00daMERO \\/ H\\u00daMERO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE INFECCIONES GASTROINTESTINALES O PULMONARES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/359','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:17:42','2026-04-27 21:17:42'),(4158,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',360,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ACIDITY (ACIDEZ)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GASTRIC HYPERACIDITY (HIPERACIDEZ G\\u00c1STRICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEARTBURN, BURNING SENSATION IN THE CHEST OR THROAT, REFLUX, AND DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ARDOR EN EL PECHO O LA GARGANTA, REFLUJO Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL DYSFUNCTION OF THE DIAPHRAGMATIC HIATUS BY STABILIZING THE VERTICAL AXIS OF THIS REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE PRODUCTION OF GASTRIC ACIDS AND IMPROVING THE TONE OF THE LOWER ESOPHAGEAL SPHINCTER. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS VERTICAL ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ALIEVIATES CHRONIC ACIDITY AND PREVENTS THE IRRITATION OF THE ESOPHAGEAL MUCOSA. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT PROMOTES PROPER DIGESTIVE FUNCTION AND RELIEVES THE DIAPHRAGMATIC TENSION OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH HIATAL HERNIAS OR PERSISTENT ACID REFLUX.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL HIATO DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE VERTICAL DE ESTA REGI\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDOS G\\u00c1STRICOS Y MEJORAR EL TONO DEL ESF\\u00cdNTER ESOF\\u00c1GICO INFERIOR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL, EL REINICIO ALIVIA LA ACIDEZ CR\\u00d3NICA Y PREVIENE LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA ESOF\\u00c1GICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO PROMUEVE UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA ADECUADA Y ALIVIA LA TENSI\\u00d3N DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA ASOCIADA A MENUDO CON HERNIAS HIATALES O REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO PERSISTENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF REFLUX PERSISTS ALONG WITH RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, SCAN THE [HIATUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] (REF 368) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTRIC INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ STOMACH] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT BILE REGULATION AND OVERALL DIGESTIVE BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y RESPIRATORIA: SI EL REFLUJO PERSISTE JUNTO CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [HIATO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO] (REF 368) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES CARGAS BACTERIANAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ EST\\u00d3MAGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA BILIS Y EL EQUILIBRIO DIGESTIVO GENERAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/360','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:18:42','2026-04-27 21:18:42'),(4159,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',361,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ASTHMA (ASMA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY DYNAMICS (DIN\\u00c1MICA RESPIRATORIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SHORTNESS OF BREATH, WHEEZING, CHEST TIGHTNESS, AND ASTHMATIC SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, SIBILANCIAS, OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASM\\u00c1TICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE MECHANICAL AND BIOELECTRICAL COMPONENTS OF ASTHMA BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE DIAPHRAGMATIC HIATUS AND THE ANTERIOR PORTION OF THE LUNGS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RELEASING SPASMS IN THE RESPIRATORY MUSCULATURE AND IMPROVING THE EXPANSION CAPACITY OF THE THORACIC CAGE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS TO ALLEVIATE THE CONSTRICTION OF THE AIRWAYS THAT CHARACTERIZES ASTHMATIC EPISODES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES BETTER OXYGENATION AND REDUCES THE HYPER-REACTIVITY OF THE BRONCHIAL TREE TO ENVIRONMENTAL STIMULI.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LOS COMPONENTES MEC\\u00c1NICOS Y BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICOS DEL ASMA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE EL HIATO DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICO Y LA PORCI\\u00d3N ANTERIOR DE LOS PULMONES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR ESPASMOS EN LA MUSCULATURA RESPIRATORIA Y MEJORAR LA CAPACIDAD DE EXPANSI\\u00d3N DE LA CAJA TOR\\u00c1CICA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ALIVIAR LA CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS QUE CARACTERIZA A LOS EPISODIOS ASM\\u00c1TICOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE UNA MEJOR OXIGENACI\\u00d3N Y REDUCE LA HIPERREACTIVIDAD DEL \\u00c1RBOL BRONQUIAL ANTE EST\\u00cdMULOS AMBIENTALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PULMONARY & DIAPHRAGMATIC CHECK: IF BREATHING DIFFICULTIES PERSIST, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT PULMONARY TISSUE INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING GASTRIC REFLUX THAT EXACERBATES ASTHMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HIATUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] (REF 368) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ PINEAL GLAND] CIRCUIT TO CALM THE NERVOUS SYSTEM\\u2019S RESPONSE TO RESPIRATORY STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA: SI LAS DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DIRECTA DEL TEJIDO PULMONAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN REFLUJO G\\u00c1STRICO QUE EXACERBE EL ASMA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [HIATO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO] (REF 368). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL] PARA CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO ANTE EL ESTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/361','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:19:58','2026-04-27 21:19:58'),(4160,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',362,'{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE GASTRITIS, HYPER ACIDITY, GASTRIC AND DUODENAL ULCERS. POOR DIGESTION, FOOD INTOLERANCE, COLITIS, BELCHING. (GASTRITIS SEVERA, HIPERACIDEZ, \\u00daLCERAS G\\u00c1STRICAS Y DUODENALES. MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, COLITIS, ERUCTOS)\",\"paths\":\"IT IS TRANSMITTED FROM PERSON TO PERSON. PEPTIC ACID DISEASE. DIAPHRAGMATIC HERNIAS. IT ALTERS THE PRODUCTION OF SPERM IN THE TESTES. (SE TRANSMITE DE PERSONA A PERSONA. ENFERMEDAD \\u00c1CIDO-P\\u00c9PTICA. HERNIAS DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICAS. ALTERA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE ESPERMA EN LOS TEST\\u00cdCULOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ESOPHAGUS (REVISAR - ES\\u00d3FAGO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE GASTRITIS, HYPERACIDITY, GASTRIC AND DUODENAL ULCERS, POOR DIGESTION, FOOD INTOLERANCE, COLITIS, AND BELCHING.\\n\\n(GASTRITIS SEVERA, HIPERACIDEZ, \\u00daLCERAS G\\u00c1STRICAS Y DUODENALES, MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, COLITIS Y ERUCTOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF HELICOBACTER PYLORI, A BACTERIUM FAMOUS FOR ITS ROLE IN PEPTIC ACID DISEASE AND ITS ABILITY TO SURVIVE IN THE STOMACH\'S ACIDIC ENVIRONMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS UNIQUE AS IT LINKS THE GASTRIC HIATUS WITH THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM. THE BACTERIA CAN ALTER THE BIOELECTRICAL FIELD OF THE TESTES, POTENTIALLY IMPACTING SPERM PRODUCTION, OR AFFECT VAGINAL PH. BY NEUTRALIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE BACTERIAL LOAD RESPONSIBLE FOR CHRONIC MUCOSAL INFLAMMATION AND DIAPHRAGMATIC HERNIAS, RESTORING BOTH DIGESTIVE COHERENCE AND REPRODUCTIVE VITALITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE HELICOBACTER PYLORI, UNA BACTERIA FAMOSA POR SU PAPEL EN LA ENFERMEDAD \\u00c1CIDO-P\\u00c9PTICA Y SU CAPACIDAD PARA SOBREVIVIR EN EL ENTORNO \\u00c1CIDO DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES \\u00daNICO YA QUE VINCULA EL HIATO G\\u00c1STRICO CON EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR. LA BACTERIA PUEDE ALTERAR EL CAMPO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LOS TEST\\u00cdCULOS, IMPACTANDO POTENCIALMENTE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE ESPERMA, O AFECTAR EL PH VAGINAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA RESPONSABLE DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DE LA MUCOSA Y LAS HERNIAS DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICAS, RESTAURANDO TANTO LA COHERENCIA DIGESTIVA COMO LA VITALIDAD REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & ESOPHAGEAL CHECK: IF GASTRIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [HIATUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] (REF 368) RESONANCE TO CLEAR RELATED BACTERIAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ULCERATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE BODY IN NEUTRALIZING THE TOXIC BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE TREATMENT OF THIS PERSISTENT BACTERIAL INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y ESOF\\u00c1GICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS G\\u00c1STRICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [HIATO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO] (REF 368) PARA LIMPIAR RESERVORIOS BACTERIANOS RELACIONADOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ULCERACI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [DUODENO \\/ DUODENO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR AL CUERPO EN LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS T\\u00d3XICOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA PERSISTENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/362','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:21:07','2026-04-27 21:21:07'),(4161,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',363,'{\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY EATING UNDERCOOKED PORK OR CONTAMINATED SAUSAGE. AFFECTS THE TONGUE. (TRANSMITIDO POR EL CONSUMO DE CARNE DE CERDO POCO COCIDA O SALCHICHAS CONTAMINADAS. AFECTA LA LENGUA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PYLORUS\\/TONGUE                CHECK - THYMUS\\/TONGUE (REVISAR - P\\u00cdLORO\\/LENGUA\\nREVISAR - TIMO\\/LENGUA)\"}','{\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF TRICHINELLA, A PARASITIC ROUNDWORM TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY CONSUMING UNDERCOOKED PORK OR CONTAMINATED SAUSAGE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS UNIQUE BECAUSE IT LINKS THE GASTRIC ENTRY POINT WITH THE TONGUE, WHERE THE PARASITE CAN CAUSE LOCALIZED SENSATIONS OR INFLAMMATION DURING ITS SYSTEMIC MIGRATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HIATUS AND THE TONGUE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE LARVAE AND REDUCING THE MUSCULAR AND DIGESTIVE STRESS CAUSED BY THE INFECTION. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESOLVING CHRONIC GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT AND PREVENTING THE PARASITE FROM LODGING DEEPER INTO THE MUSCULAR TISSUES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE TRICHINELLA, UN GUSANO REDONDO PAR\\u00c1SITO QUE SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR EL CONSUMO DE CARNE DE CERDO POCO COCIDA O SALCHICHAS CONTAMINADAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES \\u00daNICO PORQUE VINCULA EL PUNTO DE ENTRADA G\\u00c1STRICO CON LA LENGUA, DONDE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO PUEDE CAUSAR SENSACIONES LOCALIZADAS O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DURANTE SU MIGRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL HIATO Y LA LENGUA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LAS LARVAS Y A REDUCIR EL ESTR\\u00c9S MUSCULAR Y DIGESTIVO CAUSADO POR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO ES ESENCIAL PARA RESOLVER EL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL CR\\u00d3NICO Y EVITAR QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO SE ALOJE M\\u00c1S PROFUNDAMENTE EN LOS TEJIDOS MUSCULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLOSSAL & DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ TONGUE] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL PARASITIC RESERVOIRS IN THE LOWER GASTRIC EXIT. FOR CASES INVOLVING SIGNIFICANT IMMUNE FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ TONGUE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN FILTERING THE METABOLIC WASTE AND TOXINS RELEASED BY THE PARASITES DURING THE CLEARING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLOSAL Y DIGESTIVA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ LENGUA] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES RESERVORIOS PARASITARIOS EN LA SALIDA G\\u00c1STRICA INFERIOR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA FATIGA INMUNITARIA SIGNIFICATIVA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ LENGUA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A FILTRAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS POR LOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE DEPURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/363','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:22:57','2026-04-27 21:22:57'),(4162,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',364,'{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY PROBLEMS, FALSE ATYPICAL PNEUMONIA AND BRONCHITIS. FALSE CERVICAL CANCER, VAGINAL DISCHARGE AND BLEEDING. GASTROINTESTINAL BLEEDING, BLACK STOOLS, INFERTILITY, LOW BACK AND PAIN. (PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, FALSA NEUMON\\u00cdA AT\\u00cdPICA Y BRONQUITIS. FALSO C\\u00c1NCER CERVICAL, FLUJO VAGINAL Y SANGRADO. SANGRADO GASTROINTESTINAL, HECES NEGRAS, INFERTILIDAD, DOLOR LUMBAR Y DOLOR)\",\"paths\":\"ALTERS THE COAGULATION SYSTEM, AND CAUSES BLEEDING. PTERYGIUM AND CONJUNCTIVITIS. EPISTAXIS. (ALTERA EL SISTEMA DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N Y CAUSA SANGRADO. PTERIGI\\u00d3N Y CONJUNTIVITIS. EPISTAXIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY PROBLEMS, FALSE ATYPICAL PNEUMONIA, AND BRONCHITIS. FALSE CERVICAL CANCER, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, AND BLEEDING. GASTROINTESTINAL BLEEDING, BLACK STOOLS, INFERTILITY, AND LOW BACK PAIN.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, FALSA NEUMON\\u00cdA AT\\u00cdPICA Y BRONQUITIS. FALSO C\\u00c1NCER CERVICAL, FLUJO VAGINAL Y SANGRADO. SANGRADO GASTROINTESTINAL, HECES NEGRAS, INFERTILIDAD Y DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF CHLAMYDIA PNEUMONIAE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS OF THE HIPS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE BACTERIA ALTERS THE COAGULATION SYSTEM, LEADING TO VARIOUS FORMS OF INTERNAL BLEEDING AND SYMPTOMS THAT CAN MIMICK MORE SEVERE PATHOLOGIES, SUCH AS CERVICAL CANCER. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS REGION, THE RESET HELPS TO HALT VASCULAR IRREGULARITIES, RESOLVING ISSUES LIKE EPISTAXIS (NOSEBLEEDS) AND CONJUNCTIVITIS. STABILIZING THIS AXIS RESTORES PROPER BLOOD CLOTTING FUNCTIONS AND ALLEVIATES THE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT CAUSES BOTH RESPIRATORY DISTRESS AND CHRONIC PELVIC OR LOWER BACK PAIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE CHLAMYDIA PNEUMONIAE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LAS CADERAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA BACTERIA ALTERA EL SISTEMA DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N, LO QUE PROVOCA DIVERSAS FORMAS DE SANGRADO INTERNO Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE PUEDEN IMITAR PATOLOG\\u00cdAS M\\u00c1S GRAVES, COMO EL C\\u00c1NCER CERVICAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA REGI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DETENER LAS IRREGULARIDADES VASCULARES, RESOLVIENDO PROBLEMAS COMO LA EPISTAXIS (SANGRADO NASAL) Y LA CONJUNTIVITIS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE RESTAURA LAS FUNCIONES ADECUADAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA Y ALIVIA LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE CAUSA TANTO DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA COMO DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO O LUMBAR CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COAGULATION & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF GASTROINTESTINAL OR VAGINAL BLEEDING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES WITH SEVERE ATYPICAL PNEUMONIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE PRODUCTION OF CLOTTING FACTORS AND TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE METABOLIC TOXINS RELEASED BY THE BACTERIA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N Y RESPIRATORIA: SI EL SANGRADO GASTROINTESTINAL O VAGINAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DUODENO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES. PARA CASOS CON NEUMON\\u00cdA AT\\u00cdPICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N Y AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS METAB\\u00d3LICAS LIBERADAS POR LA BACTERIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/364','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:24:01','2026-04-27 21:24:01'),(4163,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',365,'{\"symptoms\":\"EPIGASTRIC PAIN, ANOREXIA, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, NAUSEA, VOMITING, DIARRHEA, MALNUTRITION AND MALABSORPTION. (DOLOR EPIG\\u00c1STRICO, ANOREXIA, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA, DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N Y MALABSORCI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD. IT IS A TINY PARASITE THAT EFFECTS THE PLEURA AND PERITONEUM. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS. ES UN PAR\\u00c1SITO PEQUE\\u00d1O QUE AFECTA LA PLEURA Y EL PERITONEO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EPIGASTRIC PAIN, ANOREXIA, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, NAUSEA, VOMITING, DIARRHEA, MALNUTRITION AND MALABSORPTION.(DOLOR EPIG\\u00c1STRICO, ANOREXIA, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA, DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N Y MALABSORCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS GIARDIA LAMBLIA, A MICROSCOPIC PARASITE TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS VERTICAL AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT AFFECT THE PLEURA AND THE PERITONEUM, OFTEN CAUSING SIGNIFICANT GASTROINTESTINAL DISRUPTION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS SPECIFIC ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE PARASITIC LOAD, THEREBY IMPROVING NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND REDUCING THE ABDOMINAL INFLAMMATION RESPONSIBLE FOR CHRONIC DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT AND MALNUTRITION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA GIARDIA LAMBLIA, UN PAR\\u00c1SITO MICROSC\\u00d3PICO TRANSMITIDO T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR AGUA O ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VERTICAL ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTAN LA PLEURA Y EL PERITONEO, CAUSANDO A MENUDO UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL SIGNIFICATIVA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESPEC\\u00cdFICA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, MEJORANDO AS\\u00cd LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL RESPONSABLE DEL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO CR\\u00d3NICO Y LA DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & NUTRITIONAL CHECK: IF MALABSORPTION OR DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL INTESTINAL DAMAGE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE NAUSEA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE TOXINS RELEASED BY THE PARASITE DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y NUTRICIONAL: SI LA MALABSORCI\\u00d3N O LA DIARREA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DUODENO \\/ DUODENO] PARA ABORDAR EL POSIBLE DA\\u00d1O INTESTINAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN N\\u00c1USEAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS POR EL PAR\\u00c1SITO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/365','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:25:03','2026-04-27 21:25:03'),(4164,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',366,'{\"paths\":\"INFECTIONS OF THE SKIN, MOUTH, ARMPITS, NAILS, VAGINAL. (INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, BOCA, AXILAS, U\\u00d1AS Y VAGINA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW CHECK - RING FINGER\\/RING FINGER (REVISAR - CODO\\/CODO\\nREVISAR - DEDO ANULAR\\/DEDO ANULAR)\"}','{\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF CANDIDA ROBUSTA, A FUNGUS THAT THRIVES IN MOIST, BIOELECTRICALLY IMBALANCED AREAS OF THE BODY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PERSISTENT FUNGAL INFECTIONS THAT AFFECT THE EPIDERMIS AND THE LINING OF MUCOUS MEMBRANES, OFTEN MANIFESTING IN THE MOUTH, ARMPITS, NAILS, OR VAGINAL AREA. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HUMERUS AND THE BRACHIAL VERTICAL POINT, THE RESET STRENGTHENS THE BODY\'S NATURAL BARRIERS, HALTING THE SPREAD OF THE FUNGUS AND REDUCING THE LOCALIZED IRRITATION, ITCHING, AND DISCHARGE ASSOCIATED WITH CANDIDIASIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE CANDIDA ROBUSTA, UN HONGO QUE PROLIFERA EN \\u00c1REAS H\\u00daMEDAS Y BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICAMENTE DESEQUILIBRADAS DEL CUERPO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS PERSISTENTES QUE AFECTAN LA EPIDERMIS Y EL REVESTIMIENTO DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO EN LA BOCA, AXILAS, U\\u00d1AS O EL \\u00c1REA VAGINAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL H\\u00daMERO Y EL PUNTO BRAQUIAL VERTICAL, EL REINICIO FORTALECE LAS BARRERAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO, DETENIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DEL HONGO Y REDUCIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA, EL PICOR Y EL FLUJO ASOCIADOS CON LA CANDIDIASIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMATOLOGICAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF SKIN OR MUCOSAL IRRITATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE LOCALIZED RESET. FOR INFECTIONS AFFECTING THE EXTREMITIES OR NAILS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RING FINGER \\/ RING FINGER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING FUNGAL TOXINS AND SUPPORTING OVERALL METABOLIC DETOXIFICATION DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA O DE LAS MUCOSAS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CODO \\/ CODO] PARA REFORZAR EL REINICIO LOCALIZADO. PARA INFECCIONES QUE AFECTAN LAS EXTREMIDADES O LAS U\\u00d1AS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA GENERAL DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/366','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:25:57','2026-04-27 21:25:57'),(4165,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',367,'{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE BREATHING PROBLEMS, SHOULDER AND ARM PAIN. FALSE PNEUMONIA AND FALSE AIDS. (PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS GRAVES, DOLOR EN EL HOMBRO Y EL BRAZO. FALSA NEUMON\\u00cdA Y FALSO SIDA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTACT WITH FECES OF ANIMALS OR PEOPLE. LUNG DAMAGE, PNEUMONITIS, HALITOSIS, OTITIS, LARYNGITIS, CYSTIC LUNG FIBROSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR CONTACTO CON HECES DE ANIMALES O PERSONAS. DA\\u00d1O PULMONAR, NEUMONITIS, HALITOSIS, OTITIS, LARINGITIS, FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA PULMONAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - HIATUS\\/ESOPHAGUS (REVISAR - HIATO\\/ES\\u00d3FAGO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE BREATHING PROBLEMS, SHOULDER AND ARM PAIN. FALSE PNEUMONIA AND FALSE AIDS.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS GRAVES, DOLOR EN EL HOMBRO Y EL BRAZO. FALSA NEUMON\\u00cdA Y FALSO SIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF ENTEROBACTER PNEUMONIAE, A BACTERIA OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH THE FECES OF ANIMALS OR INFECTED INDIVIDUALS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR TREATING DEEP RESPIRATORY DISTRESS AND TISSUE DAMAGE, AS THE BACTERIA CAN LEAD TO PNEUMONITIS, HALITOSIS, OTITIS, AND LARYNGITIS. IT IS ALSO CLINICALLY LINKED TO CYSTIC LUNG FIBROSIS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE HUMERUS REGION, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CAUSE SEVERE LUNG DAMAGE AND REFERRED PAIN IN THE UPPER EXTREMITIES, RESTORING RESPIRATORY FUNCTION AND REDUCING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE ENTEROBACTER PNEUMONIAE, UNA BACTERIA TRANSMITIDA A MENUDO POR EL CONTACTO CON HECES DE ANIMALES O PERSONAS INFECTADAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA TRATAR DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS GRAVES Y DA\\u00d1O TISULAR, YA QUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE PROVOCAR NEUMONITIS, HALITOSIS, OTITIS Y LARINGITIS. TAMBI\\u00c9N EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON LA FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA PULMONAR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00daMERO, EL REINICIO APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE CAUSAN DA\\u00d1O PULMONAR SEVERO Y DOLOR REFERIDO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES, RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y REDUCIENDO LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTRIC & RESPIRATORY CHECK: THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO DIGESTIVE RESERVOIRS; SCAN THE [HIATUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] (REF 368) AXIS TO ENSURE THE BACTERIA IS COMPLETELY CLEARED FROM THE GASTRO-ESOPHAGEAL TRACT. IF SHOULDER PAIN PERSISTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HUMERUS \\/ BRACHIAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN FILTERING BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RECOVERY FROM PULMONARY INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA Y RESPIRATORIA: ESTE PAR EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO FRECUENTEMENTE CON RESERVORIOS DIGESTIVOS; ESCANEAR EL EJE [HIATO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO] (REF 368) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA BACTERIA SE ELIMINE COMPLETAMENTE DEL TRACTO GASTROESOF\\u00c1GICO. SI EL DOLOR DE HOMBRO PERSISTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00daMERO \\/ BRAQUIAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A FILTRAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES PULMONARES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/367','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:26:58','2026-04-27 21:26:58'),(4166,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',368,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, JOINT PAIN, DIZZINESS, FAIGUE. (DOLORES DE CABEZA, DOLOR ARTICULAR, MAREO, FATIGA)\",\"paths\":\"DENGUE FEVER,  TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITOS. LYMPHATIC ENLARGEMENT. PARALYSIS. (FIEBRE DEL DENGUE, TRANSMITIDA POR MOSQUITOS. AGRANDAMIENTO LINF\\u00c1TICO. PAR\\u00c1LISIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, JOINT PAIN, DIZZINESS, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(DOLORES DE CABEZA, DOLOR ARTICULAR, MAREO Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE FLAVIVIRUS, COMMONLY ASSOCIATED WITH DENGUE FEVER AND TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITOES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE SYSTEMIC IMPACT OF THE VIRUS, WHICH CAN LEAD TO LYMPHATIC ENLARGEMENT AND, IN SEVERE CASES, TEMPORARY PARALYSIS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND) AND THE BLADDER, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE ENDOCRINE AND EXCRETORY SYSTEMS IN PROCESSING THE VIRAL LOAD. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT HELPS REGULATE THE BODY\'S IMMUNE RESPONSE, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE JOINTS AND RESTORING VITAL ENERGY LEVELS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL FLAVIVIRUS, ASOCIADO COM\\u00daNMENTE CON LA FIEBRE DEL DENGUE Y TRANSMITIDO POR MOSQUITOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR EL IMPACTO SIST\\u00c9MICO DEL VIRUS, QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR AGRANDAMIENTO LINF\\u00c1TICO Y, EN CASOS GRAVES, PAR\\u00c1LISIS TEMPORAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA) Y LA VEJIGA, EL REINICIO APOYA A LOS SISTEMAS ENDOCRINO Y EXCRETOR EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA CARGA VIRAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO AYUDA A REGULAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA DEL CUERPO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS ARTICULACIONES Y RESTAURANDO LOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC & ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF FATIGUE OR LYMPHATIC SWELLING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [APPENDICULAR \\/ THYMUS] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE IMMUNE RESPONSE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE JOINT PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HIP \\/ HIP] (REF 373) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN DETOXIFYING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND ENSURING PROPER METABOLIC FUNCTION THROUGHOUT THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y ENDOCRINA: SI LA FATIGA O LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [APENDICULAR \\/ TIMO] PARA REFORZAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CADERA \\/ CADERA] (REF 373). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A DESINTOXICAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y ASEGURAR UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA ADECUADA DURANTE TODO EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/368','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:28:05','2026-04-27 21:28:05'),(4167,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',369,'{\"symptoms\":\"HYPERACTIVE GLANDS (GL\\u00c1NDULAS HIPERACTIVAS)\",\"paths\":\"HORMONE DYSREGULATION. (DESREGULACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HYPERACTIVE GLANDS, UNEXPECTED MILK PRODUCTION UNRELATED TO CHILDBIRTH, AND POTENTIAL ENDOCRINE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(GL\\u00c1NDULAS HIPERACTIVAS, PRODUCCI\\u00d3N INESPERADA DE LECHE NO RELACIONADA CON EL PARTO Y POSIBLES DESEQUILIBRIOS ENDOCRINOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES HORMONE DYSREGULATION BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL VERTICAL AXIS OF THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE MASTER GLAND\'S CONTROL OVER SYSTEMIC HORMONAL OUTPUT, PARTICULARLY PROLACTIN LEVELS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS VERTICAL ALIGNMENT, THE RESET HELPS CORRECT GLANDULAR HYPERACTIVITY AND RESOLVE GALACTORRHEA. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT RESTORES ENDOCRINE COHERENCE, ENSURING THAT HORMONAL SIGNALS ARE PROPERLY CALIBRATED THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE GLANDULAR SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DESREGULACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO VERTICAL DE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR EL CONTROL DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA SOBRE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL SIST\\u00c9MICA, PARTICULARMENTE LOS NIVELES DE PROLACTINA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CORREGIR LA HIPERACTIVIDAD GLANDULAR Y A RESOLVER LA GALACTORREA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO RESTAURA LA COHERENCIA ENDOCRINA, ASEGURANDO QUE LAS SE\\u00d1ALES HORMONALES EST\\u00c9N CORRECTAMENTE CALIBRADAS EN TODO EL SISTEMA GLANDULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF HORMONAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ OVARY] OR [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ TESTICLE] AXIS TO ADDRESS PERIPHERAL GLANDULAR FEEDBACK. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING AND ELIMINATING EXCESS HORMONES DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS HORMONALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ OVARIO] O [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO] PARA ABORDAR LA RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR PERIF\\u00c9RICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR Y ELIMINAR EL EXCESO DE HORMONAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/369','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:29:07','2026-04-27 21:29:07'),(4168,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',370,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"METABOLIC DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL REGULATION OF THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE ENDOCRINE CONTROL CENTER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR BALANCING GLUCOSE LEVELS AND MANAGING METABOLIC DYSFUNCTIONS THAT CAUSE SUDDEN DROPS IN BLOOD SUGAR. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE HYPOPHYSIS AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE HINDBRAIN\'S ABILITY TO MANAGE VITAL FUNCTIONS, INCLUDING THE \\\"THIRST CENTER\\\" AND THE BODY\'S RESPONSE TO HYPOGLYCEMIA. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT RESTORES METABOLIC EQUILIBRIUM AND HELPS PREVENT THE SYSTEMIC FATIGUE ASSOCIATED WITH IRREGULAR GLUCOSE PROCESSING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO Y EL CENTRO DE CONTROL ENDOCRINO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EQUILIBRAR LOS NIVELES DE GLUCOSA Y MANEJAR LAS DISFUNCIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS QUE CAUSAN CA\\u00cdDAS REPENTINAS DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS Y LA M\\u00c9DULA OBLONGADA, EL REINICIO APOYA LA CAPACIDAD DEL ROMBENC\\u00c9FALO PARA MANEJAR FUNCIONES VITALES, INCLUYENDO EL \\\"CENTRO DE LA SED\\\" Y LA RESPUESTA DEL CUERPO A LA HIPOGLUCEMIA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO RESTAURA EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y AYUDA A PREVENIR LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA ASOCIADA CON EL PROCESAMIENTO IRREGULAR DE LA GLUCOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLUCOSE & ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF SUGAR LEVELS REMAIN UNSTABLE, SCAN THE [HEPATIC LIGAMENT \\/ COSTAL HEPATIC] (REF 365) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL \\\"FALSE DIABETES.\\\" FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE THIRST OR ADRENAL STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SUPRARENAL \\/ SUPRARENAL] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER GLYCOGEN STORAGE AND OVERALL METABOLIC STABILITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE GLUCOSA Y ENDOCRINA: SI LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR PERMANECEN INESTABLES, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [LIGAMENTO HEP\\u00c1TICO \\/ COSTAL HEP\\u00c1TICO] (REF 365) PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\". PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN SED SEVERA O ESTR\\u00c9S ADRENAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [SUPRARRENAL \\/ SUPRARRENAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR EL ALMACENAMIENTO ADECUADO DE GLUC\\u00d3GENO Y LA ESTABILIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA GENERAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/370','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:30:06','2026-04-27 21:30:06'),(4169,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',371,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"OVARY DISFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MENSTRUAL CRAMPS, EXCESSIVE BLEEDING, AND IRREGULAR PERIODS.\\n\\n(C\\u00d3LICOS MENSTRUALES, SANGRADO EXCESIVO Y PERIODOS IRREGULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE MASTER GLAND AND THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE ENDOCRINE FEEDBACK LOOP THAT GOVERNS THE MENSTRUAL CYCLE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE PITUITARY GLAND IN CALIBRATING THE RELEASE OF GONADOTROPINS, WHICH IN TURN NORMALIZES OVARIAN FUNCTION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION HELPS ALLEVIATE THE PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT OF DYSMENORRHEA AND REDUCES ABNORMAL UTERINE BLEEDING BY RESTORING HORMONAL BALANCE AND TISSUE COHERENCE WITHIN THE FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE AXIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA Y EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR EL CICLO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA QUE GOBIERNA EL CICLO MENSTRUAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO APOYA A LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA EN LA CALIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE GONADOTROPINAS, LO QUE A SU VEZ NORMALIZA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N AYUDA A ALIVIAR EL MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO DE LA DISMENORREA Y REDUCE EL SANGRADO UTERINO ANORMAL AL RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO HORMONAL Y LA COHERENCIA TISULAR DENTRO DEL EJE REPRODUCTOR FEMENINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & UTERINE CHECK: IF CRAMPING OR BLEEDING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [UTERUS \\/ UTERUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HORMONAL FLUCTUATIONS OR MOOD SWINGS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE THE BODY CAN EFFICIENTLY PROCESS AND ELIMINATE METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS OF ESTROGEN DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y UTERINA: SI LOS C\\u00d3LICOS O EL SANGRADO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ \\u00daTERO] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FLUCTUACIONES HORMONALES SEVERAS O CAMBIOS DE HUMOR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL CUERPO PUEDA PROCESAR Y ELIMINAR EFICIENTEMENTE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DEL ESTR\\u00d3GENO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/371','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:31:00','2026-04-27 21:31:00'),(4170,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',372,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SWEATING (SUDORACI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"THERMOREGULATORY DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N TERMORREGULADORA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE SWEATING, NIGHT SWEATS, AND SUDDEN CHANGES IN BODY TEMPERATURE.\\n\\n(SUDORACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA, SUDORES NOCTURNOS Y CAMBIOS REPENTINOS EN LA TEMPERATURA CORPORAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL COORDINATION BETWEEN THE TWO PRINCIPAL GLANDS OF THE BRAIN: THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY) AND THE PINEAL GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE BODY\'S INTERNAL THERMOSTAT AND CIRCADIAN RHYTHMS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS INTER-GLANDULAR CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS CORRECT THE AUTONOMIC SIGNALS RESPONSIBLE FOR ABNORMAL SWEATING (HYPERHIDROSIS). STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION RESTORES THE EQUILIBRIUM OF THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM, ENSURING THAT TEMPERATURE REGULATION AND SLEEP-WAKE CYCLES ARE PROPERLY SYNCHRONIZED.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE LAS DOS GL\\u00c1NDULAS PRINCIPALES DEL CEREBRO: LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (PITUITARIA) Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR EL TERMOSTATO INTERNO DEL CUERPO Y LOS RITMOS CIRCADIANOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO INTERGLANDULAR, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CORREGIR LAS SE\\u00d1ALES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS RESPONSABLES DE LA SUDORACI\\u00d3N ANORMAL (HIPERHIDROSIS). LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N RESTAURA EL EQUILIBRIO DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO, ASEGURANDO QUE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA TEMPERATURA Y LOS CICLOS DE SUE\\u00d1O-VIGILIA EST\\u00c9N CORRECTAMENTE SINCRONIZADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE & ADRENAL CHECK: IF SWEATING IS ACCOMPANIED BY ANXIETY OR PALPITATIONS, SCAN THE [SUPRARENAL \\/ SUPRARENAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS ADRENALINE FLUCTUATIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING MENOPAUSAL SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ OVARY] (REF 380) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER HORMONE METABOLISM AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC THERMAL BALANCE DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA Y ADRENAL: SI LA SUDORACI\\u00d3N SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE ANSIEDAD O PALPITACIONES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SUPRARRENAL \\/ SUPRARRENAL] PARA ABORDAR LAS FLUCTUACIONES DE ADRENALINA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS MENOP\\u00c1USICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ OVARIO] (REF 380). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR EL METABOLISMO HORMONAL ADECUADO Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO T\\u00c9RMICO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/372','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:32:03','2026-04-27 21:32:03'),(4171,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',373,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANGUISH (ANGUSTIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ANGUISH (ANGUSTIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP ANXIETY, FEELINGS OF OPPRESSION, EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, AND PERSISTENT WORRY.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD PROFUNDA, SENTIMIENTOS DE OPRESI\\u00d3N, MALESTAR EMOCIONAL Y PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL FREQUENCY OF ANGUISH BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND) AND THE SUPRA-CILIARY REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS EMOTIONAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RELEASING THE PSYCHOSOMATIC TENSION THAT MANIFESTS AS A SENSE OF DREAD OR CONSTANT UNEASE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM IN BALANCING NEUROTRANSMITTERS ASSOCIATED WITH STRESS AND CALM. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES MENTAL CLARITY AND EMOTIONAL RELEASE, HELPING THE INDIVIDUAL TO DISCONNECT FROM NEGATIVE THOUGHT PATTERNS AND RESTORE A SENSE OF INTERNAL PEACE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA FRECUENCIA EMOCIONAL DE LA ANGUSTIA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA) Y LA REGI\\u00d3N SUPRACILIAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR EMOCIONAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE TEMOR O INQUIETUD CONSTANTE. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO A EQUILIBRAR LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES ASOCIADOS CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S Y LA CALMA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE LA CLARIDAD MENTAL Y LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL, AYUDANDO AL INDIVIDUO A DESCONECTARSE DE PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO NEGATIVOS Y RESTAURAR UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PAZ INTERNA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF THE SENSATION OF ANGUISH IS ACCOMPANIED BY PHYSICAL TENSION IN THE CHEST, SCAN THE [HEART \\/ HEART] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC STRESS THAT IMPACTS SLEEP, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL GLAND \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE PROCESSING OF EMOTIONAL TOXICITY AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC EQUILIBRIUM THROUGHOUT THE EMOTIONAL RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y ENDOCRINA: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ANGUSTIA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA EN EL PECHO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO QUE AFECTE EL SUE\\u00d1O, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL Y ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE TODO EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/373','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:33:14','2026-04-27 21:33:14'),(4172,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',374,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, SINUS, PAIN IN THE THORACIC SPINE. (DOLORES DE CABEZA, SENOS PARANASALES, DOLOR EN LA COLUMNA TOR\\u00c1CICA)\",\"paths\":\"INSULIN DEFICIENCY. (DEFICIENCIA DE INSULINA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INSULIN DEFICIENCY (DEFICIENCIA DE INSULINA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, SINUS DISCOMFORT, PAIN IN THE THORACIC SPINE, AND POTENTIAL BLOOD SUGAR IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(DOLORES DE CABEZA, MOLESTIAS EN LOS SENOS PARANASALES, DOLOR EN LA COLUMNA TOR\\u00c1CICA Y POSIBLES DESEQUILIBRIOS DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL FEEDBACK LOOP BETWEEN THE MASTER GLAND AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE HPA (HYPOTHALAMIC-PITUITARY-ADRENAL) AXIS, WHICH REGULATES STRESS RESPONSES AND METABOLIC PROCESSES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CORRECTING INSULIN DEFICIENCIES AND REGULATING THE PRODUCTION OF CORTISOL. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESOLVING CHRONIC HEADACHES AND REFERRED PAIN IN THE UPPER BACK CAUSED BY ENDOCRINE STRESS, RESTORING OVERALL METABOLIC COHERENCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL CICLO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR EL EJE HPA (HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO-HIP\\u00d3FISIS-ADRENAL), QUE REGULA LAS RESPUESTAS AL ESTR\\u00c9S Y LOS PROCESOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A CORREGIR DEFICIENCIAS DE INSULINA Y A REGULAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE CORTISOL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA RESOLVER DOLORES DE CABEZA CR\\u00d3NICOS Y DOLOR REFERIDO EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR DE LA ESPALDA CAUSADO POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S ENDOCRINO, RESTAURANDO LA COHERENCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLUCOSE & ADRENAL CHECK: IF BLOOD SUGAR ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT INSULIN PRODUCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SINUSITIS OR FACIAL PRESSURE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT GLYCOGEN MANAGEMENT AND ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS OF HORMONAL IMBALANCES DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE GLUCOSA Y ADRENAL: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] PARA ABORDAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DIRECTA DE INSULINA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN SINUSITIS SEVERA O PRESI\\u00d3N FACIAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR EL MANEJO DEL GLUC\\u00d3GENO Y AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/374','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:34:22','2026-04-27 21:34:22'),(4173,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',375,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"REVENGE (VENGANZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"REVENGE (VENGANZA)\",\"symptoms\":\"PERSISTENT NEGATIVE THOUGHTS, EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY, FEELINGS OF RESENTMENT, AND HORMONAL FLUCTUATIONS RELATED TO STRESS.\\n\\n(PENSAMIENTOS NEGATIVOS PERSISTENTES, RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL, SENTIMIENTOS DE RESENTIMIENTO Y FLUCTUACIONES HORMONALES RELACIONADAS CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL FREQUENCY OF REVENGE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND) AND THE THYROID. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS EMOTIONAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RELEASING DEEP-SEATED ANGER AND THE DESIRE FOR RETRIBUTION, WHICH CAN BECOME STUCK WITHIN THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE GLANDULAR BALANCE NECESSARY TO LOWER CORTISOL LEVELS AND IMPROVE THE COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE BRAIN AND THE METABOLIC REGULATORS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES A STATE OF FORGIVENESS AND EMOTIONAL RELEASE, HELPING TO PREVENT PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS THAT STEM FROM PROLONGED BITTERNESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA FRECUENCIA EMOCIONAL DE LA VENGANZA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA) Y LA TIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR EMOCIONAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR LA IRA PROFUNDA Y EL DESEO DE RETRIBUCI\\u00d3N, QUE PUEDEN QUEDAR ATRAPADOS DENTRO DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO APOYA EL EQUILIBRIO GLANDULAR NECESARIO PARA DISMINUIR LOS NIVELES DE CORTISOL Y MEJORAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CEREBRO Y LOS REGULADORES METAB\\u00d3LICOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE UN ESTADO DE PERD\\u00d3N Y LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL, AYUDANDO A PREVENIR TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS QUE SURGEN DE LA AMARGURA PROLONGADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF FEELINGS OF RESENTMENT ARE ACCOMPANIED BY PHYSICAL METABOLIC CHANGES, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT GLANDULAR FUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY OR GRIEF, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ SUPRA-CILIARY] (REF 382) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE \\\"BIOCHEMICAL TOXICITY\\\" OF ANGER AND TO SUPPORT OVERALL EMOTIONAL DETOXIFICATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS SENTIMIENTOS DE RESENTIMIENTO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE CAMBIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS F\\u00cdSICOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA ABORDAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA O DUELO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ SUPRACILIAR] (REF 382). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LA \\\"TOXICIDAD BIOQU\\u00cdMICA\\\" DE LA IRA Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL GENERAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/375','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:35:25','2026-04-27 21:35:25'),(4174,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',376,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HOTFLASHES (SOFOCOS)\",\"paths\":\"MENOPAUSE (MENOPAUSIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MENOPAUSE (MENOPAUSIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HOT FLASHES, NIGHT SWEATS, MOOD SWINGS, AND HORMONAL IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(SOFOCOS, SUDORES NOCTURNOS, CAMBIOS DE HUMOR Y DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE TRANSITIONAL ENDOCRINE PHASE OF MENOPAUSE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND) AND THE UTERUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR MITIGATING THE SYSTEMIC EFFECTS OF DECREASING ESTROGEN LEVELS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE MASTER GLAND IN CALIBRATING THE RELEASE OF LUTEINIZING AND FOLLICLE-STIMULATING HORMONES, WHICH HELPS REGULATE THE VASCULAR RESPONSES RESPONSIBLE FOR HOT FLASHES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES A SMOOTHER PHYSIOLOGICAL TRANSITION, REDUCING THE INTENSITY OF CLIMACTERIC SYMPTOMS AND SUPPORTING UTERINE TISSUE HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA FASE ENDOCRINA DE TRANSICI\\u00d3N DE LA MENOPAUSIA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA) Y EL \\u00daTERO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MITIGAR LOS EFECTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS DE LA DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE LOS NIVELES DE ESTR\\u00d3GENO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA A CALIBRAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS HORMONAS LUTEINIZANTE Y FOL\\u00cdCULO-ESTIMULANTE, LO QUE AYUDA A REGULAR LAS RESPUESTAS VASCULARES RESPONSABLES DE LOS SOFOCOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE UNA TRANSICI\\u00d3N FISIOL\\u00d3GICA M\\u00c1S SUAVE, REDUCIENDO LA INTENSIDAD DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS CLIMAT\\u00c9RICOS Y APOYANDO LA SALUD DEL TEJIDO UTERINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & THERMAL CHECK: IF HOT FLASHES OR SWEATING PERSIST, SCAN THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ PINEAL] (REF 381) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS THERMOREGULATORY DYSFUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SIGNIFICANT VAGINAL DRYNESS OR IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ VAGINA] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE METABOLIC PROCESSING OF HORMONAL SHIFTS AND TO SUPPORT OVERALL SYSTEMIC BALANCE DURING THIS TRANSITION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y T\\u00c9RMICA: SI LOS SOFOCOS O LA SUDORACI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ PINEAL] (REF 381) PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N TERMORREGULADORA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN SEQUEDAD O IRRITACI\\u00d3N VAGINAL SIGNIFICATIVA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ VAGINA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO METAB\\u00d3LICO DE LOS CAMBIOS HORMONALES Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO GENERAL DURANTE ESTA TRANSICI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/376','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:36:37','2026-04-27 21:36:37'),(4175,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',378,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANXIETY (ANSIEDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ANXIETY (ANSIEDAD)\",\"symptoms\":\"RESTLESSNESS, TENSION, RACING THOUGHTS, AND DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT RELATED TO STRESS.\\n\\n(INQUIETUDE, TENS\\u00c3O, PENSAMENTOS ACELERADOS E DESCONFORTO DIGESTIVO RELACIONADO AO ESTRESSE \\/ INQUIETUD, TENSI\\u00d3N, PENSAMIENTOS ACELERADOS Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO RELACIONADO CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"paths\":\"ESTA RESSON\\u00c2NCIA ABORDA A FREQU\\u00caNCIA EMOCIONAL DA ANSIEDADE AO ESTABILIZAR O EIXO ENTRE O HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO \\u2014 O CENTRO DE COMANDO DO SISTEMA NERVOSO AUT\\u00d4NOMO \\u2014 E A VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR. NO BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR EMOCIONAL \\u00c9 CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR A TENS\\u00c3O ACUMULADA QUE SURGE DA PREOCUPA\\u00c7\\u00c3O PERSISTENTE OU DO MEDO DO FUTURO. AO NEUTRALIZAR AS DISTOR\\u00c7\\u00d5ES DE PH NESTE CIRCUITO, O REAJUSTE AJUDA A ACALMAR A RESPOSTA DE \\\"LUTA OU FUGA\\\", REDUZINDO A SOMATIZA\\u00c7\\u00c3O DO ESTRESSE NO SISTEMA DIGESTIVO. A ESTABILIZA\\u00c7\\u00c3O DESTA CONEX\\u00c3O PROMOVE O EQUIL\\u00cdBRIO DOS NEUROTRANSMISSORES E AUXILIA O CORPO A PROCESSAR EMO\\u00c7\\u00d5ES RETIDAS, RESULTANDO EM UMA SENSA\\u00c7\\u00c3O DE CALMA E CLAREZA MENTAL.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA FRECUENCIA EMOCIONAL DE LA ANSIEDAD AL ESTABILIZAR EL EJE ENTRE EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO \\u2014EL CENTRO DE MANDO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO\\u2014 Y LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR EMOCIONAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N ACUMULADA QUE SURGE DE LA PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE O EL MIEDO AL FUTURO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DE \\\"LUCHA O HUIDA\\\", REDUCIENDO LA SOMATIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EN EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE EL EQUILIBRIO DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES Y AYUDA AL CUERPO A PROCESAR EMOCIONES RETENIDAS, RESULTANDO EN UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA Y CLARIDAD MENTAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & DIGESTIVE CHECK: SE A SENSA\\u00c7\\u00c3O DE ANSIEDADE ESTIVER ACOMPANHADA DE IRRITABILIDADE OU RAIVA, ESCANEIE O EIXO [F\\u00cdGADO \\/ F\\u00cdGADO] PARA LIBERAR A SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL HEP\\u00c1TICA. PARA CASOS ENVOLVENDO INS\\u00d4NIA OU ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d4NICO, REALIZE UMA REFER\\u00caNCIA CRUZADA COM A RESSON\\u00c2NCIA [GL\\u00c2NDULA PINEAL \\/ HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO]. MONITORE SEMPRE O CIRCUITO DO [CORA\\u00c7\\u00c3O \\/ CORA\\u00c7\\u00c3O] PARA APOIAR A ESTABILIDADE EMOCIONAL E REDUZIR PALPITA\\u00c7\\u00d5ES LIGADAS AO ESTADO ANSIOSO.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y DIGESTIVA: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ANSIEDAD EST\\u00c1 ACOMPA\\u00d1ADA DE IRRITABILIDAD O IRA, ESCANEE EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA LIBERAR LA SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL HEP\\u00c1TICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INSOMNIO O ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL \\/ HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO]. MONITOREE SIEMPRE EL CIRCUITO DEL [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y REDUCIR PALPITACIONES LIGADAS AL ESTADO ANSIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/378','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:37:59','2026-04-27 21:37:59'),(4176,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',379,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SUPPRESSOR OF CANCER (SUPRESOR DE C\\u00c1NCER)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CANCER SUPPRESSOR (SUPRESOR DE C\\u00c1NCER)\",\"symptoms\":\"SYSTEMIC IMBALANCE, POTENTIAL FOR CELLULAR DEGENERATION, AND AUTONOMIC DYSREGULATION.\\n\\n(DESEQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO, POTENCIAL DE DEGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR Y DESREGULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE CENTRAL REGULATOR OF THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE ENDOCRINE CENTER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CONSIDERED A \\\"SPECIAL\\\" PAIR ACTING AS A VITAL CHECKPOINT FOR CELLULAR INTEGRITY. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE HYPOTHALAMUS, THE RESET SUPPORTS THE BODY\'S INNATE ABILITY TO REGULATE CELLULAR REPLICATION AND APOPTOSIS. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT RESTORES THE HOMEOSTATIC CONTROL NECESSARY TO SUPPRESS MALIGNANT PROCESSES AND REINFORCES THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT REQUIRED FOR SYSTEMIC REPAIR AND DEFENSE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL REGULADOR CENTRAL DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO Y AL CENTRO ENDOCRINO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE CONSIDERA UN PAR \\\"ESPECIAL\\\" QUE ACT\\u00daA COMO UN PUNTO DE CONTROL VITAL PARA LA INTEGRIDAD CELULAR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO, EL REINICIO APOYA LA CAPACIDAD INNATA DEL CUERPO PARA REGULAR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N CELULAR Y LA APOPTOSIS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO RESTAURA EL CONTROL HOMEOST\\u00c1TICO NECESARIO PARA SUPRIMIR PROCESOS MALIGNOS Y REFUERZA EL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO REQUERIDO PARA LA DEFENSA Y REPARACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & PROTECTIVE CHECK: IF CELLULAR STRESS OR SYSTEMIC FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE IMMUNE SURVEILLANCE SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HORMONAL IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] (REF 378) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN FILTERING METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS AND MAINTAINING THE PURITY OF THE INTERNAL ENVIRONMENT DURING THE STABILIZATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PROTECTORA: SI EL ESTR\\u00c9S CELULAR O LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ TIMO] PARA REFORZAR EL SISTEMA DE VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 378). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A FILTRAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y MANTENER LA PUREZA DEL ENTORNO INTERNO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/379','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:39:08','2026-04-27 21:39:08'),(4177,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',380,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CEREBRAL HEMORRAGE (HEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE, URETHRITIS, VAGINOSIS, AND POTENTIAL COMPLICATIONS DURING PREGNANCY. IN SOME CASES, IT MAY BE LINKED TO SEVERE VASCULAR OR NEUROLOGICAL STRESS.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA P\\u00c9LVICA, URETRITIS, VAGINOSIS Y POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES DURANTE EL EMBARAZO. EN ALGUNOS CASOS, PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A UN ESTR\\u00c9S VASCULAR O NEUROL\\u00d3GICO SEVERO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF MYCOPLASMA HOMINIS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE HYPOTHALAMUS AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE BACTERIA CAN IMPACT BOTH THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM AND THE CENTRAL REGULATORY CENTERS OF THE BRAIN. STABILIZING THIS AXIS IS CLINICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH PREVENTING OR ADDRESSING COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS CEREBRAL HEMORRHAGE BY REDUCING SYSTEMIC VASCULAR INFLAMMATION AND RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS LONGITUDINAL ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND PROTECTING VITAL TISSUES FROM DEGENERATIVE DAMAGE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE MYCOPLASMA HOMINIS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE IMPACTAR TANTO EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR COMO LOS CENTROS REGULADORES CENTRALES DEL CEREBRO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADA CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON LA PREVENCI\\u00d3N O EL TRATAMIENTO DE COMPLICACIONES COMO LA HEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL AL REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N LONGITUDINAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y A PROTEGER LOS TEJIDOS VITALES DEL DA\\u00d1O DEGENERATIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & VASCULAR CHECK: IF PELVIC DISCOMFORT OR VAGINOSIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] OR [TESTICLE \\/ TESTICLE] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEADACHES OR VASCULAR CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN FILTERING BACTERIAL TOXINS AND SUPPORTING OVERALL VASCULAR HEALTH DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y VASCULAR: SI EL MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO O LA VAGINOSIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] O [TEST\\u00cdCULO \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO] PARA ABORDAR LOS RESERVORIOS LOCALIZADOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS O PREOCUPACIONES VASCULARES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A FILTRAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA SALUD VASCULAR GENERAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/380','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:40:03','2026-04-27 21:40:03'),(4178,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',381,'{\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIC REACTIONS, BLEEDING, COLITIS, AND POOR DIGESTION. (REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS, SANGRADO, COLITIS Y MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N\",\"paths\":\"VAGINITIS, PRURITUS, DIGESTIVE DISORDER. (VAGINITIS, PRURITO, TRASTORNO DIGESTIVO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CECUM\\/CECUM; AUTISM (REVISAR - CIEGO\\/CIEGO; AUTISMO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIC REACTIONS, BLEEDING, COLITIS, AND POOR DIGESTION. (REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS, SANGRADO, COLITIS Y MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR FOR THE PARASITE TRICHOMONAS VAGINALIS, WHICH OFTEN LODGES IN THE AREA OF THE ILEOCECAL VALVE AND THE KIDNEYS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE PATHOGEN CAN CAUSE VAGINITIS, PRURITUS (ITCHING), AND SIGNIFICANT DIGESTIVE DISORDERS MANIFESTING AS COLITIS OR MALABSORPTION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ILEOCECAL VALVE AND THE KIDNEYS, THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE RESERVOIRS WHERE THE PARASITE HIDES, REDUCING SYSTEMIC ALLERGIC REACTIONS AND ASSOCIATED GASTROINTESTINAL INFLAMMATION. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT IS ESSENTIAL FOR HALTING LOCALIZED BLEEDING AND RESTORING NORMAL DIGESTIVE AND UROGENITAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA EL PAR\\u00c1SITO TRICHOMONAS VAGINALIS, QUE A MENUDO SE ALOJA EN EL \\u00c1REA DE LA V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE CAUSAR VAGINITIS, PRURITO (PICAZ\\u00d3N) Y TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS SIGNIFICATIVOS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO COLITIS O MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LOS RESERVORIOS DONDE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO SE OCULTA, REDUCIENDO LAS REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL ASOCIADA. ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO ES ESENCIAL PARA DETENER EL SANGRADO LOCALIZADO Y RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y UROGENITAL NORMAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [CECUM \\/ CECUM] AXIS TO ENSURE NO ADDITIONAL PARASITIC LOADS REMAIN. THIS PAIR SHOULD ALSO BE MONITORED IN CASES RELATED TO AUTISM SYMPTOMS, AS PARASITIC TOXICITY CAN IMPACT NEUROLOGICAL FUNCTION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE TOXINS AND METABOLIC WASTE RELEASED DURING THE RESERVOIR CLEARING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y CONDUCTUAL: SI LOS TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CIEGO \\/ CIEGO] PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA CARGAS PARASITARIAS ADICIONALES. ESTE PAR TAMBI\\u00c9N DEBE SER MONITOREADO EN CASOS RELACIONADOS CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE AUTISMO, YA QUE LA TOXICIDAD PARASITARIA PUEDE IMPACTAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO DEL [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS Y DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/381','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:41:48','2026-04-27 21:41:48'),(4179,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',382,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL AND RECTAL SYMPTOMS, HEAVY BLEEDING. SMELLY DISCHARGE, VAGINAL ITCHING, VULVOVAGINITIS AND URETHRITIS IN MEN. PAINFUL INTERCOURSE AND URINATION. DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, AND FALSE DIABETES. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS VAGINALES Y RECTALES, SANGRADO ABUNDANTE. FLUJO CON MAL OLOR, PICAZ\\u00d3N VAGINAL, VULVOVAGINITIS Y URETRITIS EN HOMBRES. RELACIONES SEXUALES Y MICCI\\u00d3N DOLOROSAS. TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, GASES Y FALSA DIABETES)\",\"paths\":\"INFECTED BY SEXUAL CONTACT. WOMEN MAYBE INFECTED BY TOILET SEATS WHEN SITTING. PELVIC INFLAMMATION. (INFECTADO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL. LAS MUJER)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THE PATIENTS PARTNER.                CHECK - CECUM\\/KIDNEY (R) (REVISAR - LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE\\nREVISAR - CIEGO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL AND RECTAL SYMPTOMS, HEAVY BLEEDING. SMELLY DISCHARGE, VAGINAL ITCHING, VULVOVAGINITIS AND URETHRITIS IN MEN. PAINFUL INTERCOURSE AND URINATION. DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, COLITIS, CONSTIPATION, GAS, AND FALSE DIABETES.(S\\u00cdNTOMAS VAGINALES Y RECTALES, SANGRADO ABUNDANTE. FLUJO CON MAL OLOR, PICAZ\\u00d3N VAGINAL, VULVOVAGINITIS Y URETRITIS EN HOMBRES. RELACIONES SEXUALES Y MICCI\\u00d3N DOLOROSAS. TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, GASES Y FALSA DIABETES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF TRICHOMONAS, A PARASITE OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH SEXUAL CONTACT OR CONTAMINATED SURFACES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING PELVIC INFLAMMATION AND UROGENITAL DISTRESS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ILEOCECAL VALVE AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD, THEREBY REDUCING IRRITATION, ABNORMAL DISCHARGE, AND DIGESTIVE IRREGULARITIES. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESOLVING CHRONIC PELVIC DISCOMFORT AND PREVENTING SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS LINKED TO PARASITIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE TRICHOMONAS, UN PAR\\u00c1SITO TRANSMITIDO A MENUDO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL O SUPERFICIES CONTAMINADAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y EL MALESTAR UROGENITAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, REDUCIENDO AS\\u00cd LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N, EL FLUJO ANORMAL Y LAS IRREGULARIDADES DIGESTIVAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO ES ESENCIAL PARA RESOLVER EL MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO CR\\u00d3NICO Y PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS VINCULADAS A LA TOXICIDAD PARASITARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARTNER & CECUM CHECK: IT IS STRONGLY RECOMMENDED TO CHECK THE PATIENT\'S PARTNER TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION. IF DIGESTIVE OR VAGINAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [CECUM \\/ KIDNEY (R)] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL DEEPER RESERVOIRS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE METABOLIC WASTE AND TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARING OF THE PARASITIC INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAREJA Y CIEGO: SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE REVISAR A LA PAREJA DEL PACIENTE PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DIGESTIVOS O VAGINALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CIEGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES RESERVORIOS M\\u00c1S PROFUNDOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/382','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:42:53','2026-04-27 21:42:53'),(4180,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',384,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANOREXIA, BIPOLAR, COMPULSIVENESS, MANIAS, PHOBIAS. (ANOREXIA, BIPOLARIDAD, COMPULSIVIDAD, MAN\\u00cdAS, FOBIAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC DYSREGULATION (DESREGULACI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANOREXIA, BIPOLAR DISORDER, COMPULSIVENESS, MANIAS, AND PHOBIAS.\\n\\n(ANOREXIA, BIPOLARIDAD, COMPULSIVIDAD, MAN\\u00cdAS Y FOBIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE COMPLEX INTERACTION BETWEEN THE ENTERIC NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE BRAIN\'S EMOTIONAL PROCESSING CENTERS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING PSYCHOSOMATIC CONDITIONS WHERE EMOTIONAL STRESS MANIFESTS AS DIGESTIVE OR EATING DISORDERS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ILEOCECAL VALVE AND THE STOMACH, THE RESET HELPS CALM THE \\\"SECOND BRAIN\\\" (THE GUT), REDUCING THE COMPULSIVE IMPULSES AND ANXIETY PATTERNS THAT UNDERLIE MANIAS AND PHOBIAS. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT SUPPORTS EMOTIONAL MODULATION, ASSISTING IN THE TREATMENT OF BIPOLAR FLUCTUATIONS AND RESTORING A HEALTHIER BIOELECTRICAL RELATIONSHIP WITH NOURISHMENT AND SELF-CONTROL.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA COMPLEJA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO ENT\\u00c9RICO Y LOS CENTROS DE PROCESAMIENTO EMOCIONAL DEL CEREBRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE CONDICIONES PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICAS DONDE EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL SE MANIFIESTA COMO TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS O ALIMENTARIOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORIONES DE PH ENTRE LA V\\u00c1LVULA ILEOCECAL Y EL EST\\u00d3MAGO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL \\\"SEGUNDO CEREBRO\\\" (EL INTESTINO), REDUCIENDO LOS IMPULSOS COMPULSIVOS Y LOS PATRONES DE ANSIEDAD QUE SUBYACEN A LAS MAN\\u00cdAS Y FOBIAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO APOYA LA MODULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL, AYUDANDO EN EL TRATAMIENTO DE LAS FLUCTUACIONES DE BIPOLARIDAD Y RESTAURANDO UNA RELACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA M\\u00c1S SALUDABLE CON LA NUTRICI\\u00d3N Y EL AUTOCONTROL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & METABOLIC CHECK: IF COMPULSIVE THOUGHTS OR ANXIETY PERSIST, SCAN THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ SUPRA-CILIARY] (REF 382) AXIS TO ADDRESS DEEPER ANGUISH. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS OR ANOREXIC TENDENCIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER NUTRIENT PROCESSING. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE TO HELP CALM THE BODY\'S OVERACTIVE FEAR RESPONSE LINKED TO PHOBIAS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LOS PENSAMIENTOS COMPULSIVOS O LA ANSIEDAD PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ SUPRACILIAR] (REF 382) PARA ABORDAR UNA ANGUSTIA M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO O TENDENCIAS ANOR\\u00c9XICAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR EL PROCESAMIENTO ADECUADO DE NUTRIENTES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA AYUDAR A CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DE MIEDO HIPERACTIVA DEL CUERPO VINCULADA A LAS FOBIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/384','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:44:11','2026-04-27 21:44:11'),(4181,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',385,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PNEUMONIA, SINUSITIS, OTITIS, MENINGITIS, PERICARDITIS, SEPSIS. (NEUMON\\u00cdA, SINUSITIS, OTITIS, MENINGITIS, PERICARDITIS, SEPSIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, AND INFLAMMATION OF THE LININGS OF ORGANS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS, DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS CAPAS QUE RECUBREN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE PAPILLOMA B BACTERIA BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE ANTERIOR ILIAC CREST AND THE LEFT FIBULA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING THE SPREAD OF BACTERIA THAT CAN LEAD TO SEVERE CONDITIONS SUCH AS PNEUMONIA, SINUSITIS, AND OTITIS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PROTECTING VITAL BARRIERS, THEREBY REDUCING THE RISK OF MENINGITIS, PERICARDITIS, AND SYSTEMIC SEPSIS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION REINFORCES THE BODY\'S DEFENSES AGAINST BACTERIAL INVASION OF THE RESPIRATORY AND NERVOUS SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE LA BACTERIA PAPILOMA B MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA ANTERIOR Y EL PERON\\u00c9 IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE BACTERIAS QUE PUEDEN CONDUCIR A CONDICIONES GRAVES COMO NEUMON\\u00cdA, SINUSITIS Y OTITIS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PROTEGER LAS BARRERAS VITALES, REDUCIENDO AS\\u00cd EL RIESGO DE MENINGITIS, PERICARDITIS Y SEPSIS SIST\\u00c9MICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N REFUERZA LAS DEFENSAS DEL CUERPO CONTRA LA INVASI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA DE LOS SISTEMAS RESPIRATORIO Y NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & PROTECTIVE CHECK: IF SINUSITIS OR RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE INFLAMMATION OF THE HEART LINING (PERICARDITIS), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN DETOXIFYING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT OVERALL RECOVERY DURING THE CLEARING OF THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y PROTECTORA: SI LA SINUSITIS O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DEL REVESTIMIENTO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N (PERICARDITIS), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A DESINTOXICAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/385','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:45:05','2026-04-27 21:45:05'),(4182,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',386,'{\"symptoms\":\"WEAKNESS, PAIN, CRAMPS, CONTRACTURES, AND LOSS OF STRENGTH. (DEBILIDAD, DOLOR, CALAMBRES, CONTRACTURAS Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE FUERZA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY ANIMALS. MYALGIA, MUSCLE DISFUNCTION AND SYMPTOMS OF LOEW LIMB WEAKNESS. PARALYSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR ANIMALES. MIALGIA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DEBILIDAD EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. PAR\\u00c1LISIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WEAKNESS, PAIN, CRAMPS, CONTRACTURES, AND LOSS OF STRENGTH.\\n\\n(DEBILIDAD, DOLOR, CALAMBRES, CONTRACTURAS Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE FUERZA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF TRYPANOSOMA GAMBIENSE, A PARASITE GENERALLY TRANSMITTED BY ANIMALS OR VECTORS (SUCH AS THE TSETSE FLY). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING MYALGIA AND MUSCULAR DYSFUNCTION THAT PRIMARY AFFECTS THE LOWER EXTREMITIES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ILIAC CRESTS, THE RESET HELPS REVERSE SYMPTOMS OF WEAKNESS AND THE RISK OF PARALYSIS. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING BIOELECTRICAL CONDUCTION IN THE MUSCLES, RELIEVING CRAMPS AND CONTRACTURES THAT COMPROMISE THE INDIVIDUAL\'S MOBILITY AND PHYSICAL STRENGTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL TRYPANOSOMA GAMBIENSE, UN PAR\\u00c1SITO GENERALMENTE TRANSMITIDO POR ANIMALES O VECTORES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA MIALGIA Y LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR QUE AFECTAN PRINCIPALMENTE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LAS CRESTAS IL\\u00cdACAS, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REVERTIR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DEBILIDAD Y EL RIESGO DE PAR\\u00c1LISIS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS, ALIVIANDO CALAMBRES Y CONTRACTURAS QUE COMPROMETEN LA MOVILIDAD Y LA FUERZA F\\u00cdSICA DEL INDIVIDUO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MUSCULAR & NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF LOSS OF STRENGTH PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] AXIS TO RULE OUT NERVE COMPRESSION. FOR CASES INVOLVING GENERALIZED MUSCLE PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RENAL CAPSULE \\/ RENAL CAPSULE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE DETOXIFICATION OF PARASITIC METABOLIC WASTE AND ASSIST IN THE RECOVERY OF VITAL ENERGY DURING THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE FUERZA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] PARA DESCARTAR COMPRESI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR MUSCULAR GENERALIZADO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO DEL [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DE RESIDUOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS PARASITARIOS Y AYUDAR EN LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/386','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:47:44','2026-04-27 21:47:44'),(4183,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',387,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FOOT AND MOUTH DISEASE.  (ENFERMEDAD DE MANO, PIE Y BOCA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, SORE THROAT, LOSS OF APPETITE, AND CHARACTERISTIC RASH OR BLISTERS ON THE HANDS, FEET, AND INSIDE THE MOUTH.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO Y ERUPCI\\u00d3N CARACTER\\u00cdSTICA O AMPOLLAS EN LAS MANOS, LOS PIES Y EL INTERIOR DE LA BOCA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR FOR THE COXSACKIE VIRUS, WHICH IS THE PRIMARY PATHOGEN BEHIND FOOT AND MOUTH DISEASE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR IDENTIFYING WHERE THE VIRUS MAY REMAIN LATENT OR ASYMPTOMATIC BEFORE TRIGGERING SYSTEMIC OUTBREAKS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ILIAC CREST AND THE NAVAL (UMBILICUS), THE RESET HELPS ELIMINATE THE VIRAL HIDEOUT, THEREBY REDUCING THE SEVERITY OF MUCOSAL INFLAMMATION AND SKIN ERUPTIONS. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN FULLY CLEARING THE VIRAL LOAD AND PREVENTING RECURRING INFECTIONS ASSOCIATED WITH THIS STRAIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA EL VIRUS COXSACKIE, QUE ES EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PRIMARIO DETR\\u00c1S DE LA ENFERMEDAD DE MANO, PIE Y BOCA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA IDENTIFICAR D\\u00d3NDE EL VIRUS PUEDE PERMANECER LATENTE O ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO ANTES DE DESENCADENAR BROTES SIST\\u00c9MICOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA Y EL OMBLIGO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR EL ESCONDITE VIRAL, REDUCIENDO AS\\u00cd LA GRAVEDAD DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MUCOSAS Y LAS ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO NA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LA CARGA VIRAL Y EN LA PREVENCI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES RECURRENTES ASOCIADAS CON ESTA CEPA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL & MUCOSAL CHECK: IF MOUTH ULCERS OR BLISTERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [COMMISSURE \\/ COMMISSURE] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED VIRAL ACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE UPSET OR ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NAVAL \\/ NAVAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND ENSURING A COMPLETE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL Y MUCOSA: SI LAS \\u00daLCERAS BUCALES O LAS AMPOLLAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COMISURA \\/ COMISURA] PARA ABORDAR LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL LOCALIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO O ABDOMINAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OMBLIGO \\/ OMBLIGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y ASEGURAR UNA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA COMPLETA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/387','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:48:47','2026-04-27 21:48:47'),(4184,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',388,'{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT GAIN OR OBESITY. CONSTIPATION. (AUMENTO DE PESO U OBESIDAD. ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS. (TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT GAIN OR OBESITY, CONSTIPATION, AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS.\\n\\n(AUMENTO DE PESO U OBESIDAD, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO Y TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF BARTONELLA BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE ILIAC CREST AND THE LEFT RENAL CAPSULE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THIS BACTERIA CAN INTERFERE WITH METABOLIC PROCESSES AND DIGESTIVE EFFICIENCY, OFTEN LEADING TO UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT GAIN AND CHRONIC GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN RESOLVING INTESTINAL STASIS AND SUPPORTING THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING PROPER DIGESTIVE MOTILITY AND REBALANCING THE BODY\'S WEIGHT REGULATION MECHANISMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE BARTONELLA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA Y LA C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL IZQUIERDA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE INTERFERIR CON LOS PROCESOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y LA EFICIENCIA DIGESTIVA, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A UN AUMENTO DE PESO INEXPLICABLE Y TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES CR\\u00d3NICOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A RESOLVER EL ESTASIS INTESTINAL Y A APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA MOTILIDAD DIGESTIVA ADECUADA Y REEQUILIBRAR LOS MECANISMOS DE REGULACI\\u00d3N DE PESO DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & RENAL CHECK: IF WEIGHT GAIN IS ACCOMPANIED BY FLUID RETENTION, SCAN THE [RENAL CAPSULE \\/ RENAL CAPSULE] AXIS TO SUPPORT DIRECT KIDNEY FUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CONSTIPATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ASCENDING COLON \\/ DESCENDING COLON] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION THROUGHOUT THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y RENAL: SI EL AUMENTO DE PESO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL] PARA APOYAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COL\\u00d3N ASCENDENTE \\/ COL\\u00d3N DESCENDENTE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y ASEGURAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE TODO EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/388','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:49:53','2026-04-27 21:49:53'),(4185,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',389,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL CONSTIPATION, INTESTINAL LAZINESS, HEADACHE, STIFF NECK, VARICOSE VEINS, PARASYMPATHETIC NERVOUS SYSTEM THIS ORDER. POOR DIGESTION OF FOOD. (ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO INTESTINAL, PEREZA INTESTINAL, DOLOR DE CABEZA, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, V\\u00c1RICES, TRASTORNO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO. MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N DE LOS ALIMENTOS)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THYROIDS (REVISAR - TIROIDES)\"}','{\"origins\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL CONSTIPATION, INTESTINAL LAZINESS, HEADACHE, STIFF NECK, VARICOSE VEINS, AND PARASYMPATHETIC NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS. POOR DIGESTION OF FOOD.\\n\\n(ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO INTESTINAL, PEREZA INTESTINAL, DOLOR DE CABEZA, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, V\\u00c1RICES, TRASTORNO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO. MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N DE LOS ALIMENTOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE ILIAC REGIONS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE PARASYMPATHETIC NERVOUS SYSTEM, WHICH OVERSEES DIGESTION AND WASTE ELIMINATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN OVERCOMING \\\"INTESTINAL LAZINESS,\\\" IMPROVING MOTILITY AND REDUCING THE TOXIC LOAD THAT OFTEN MANIFESTS AS SECONDARY HEADACHES OR VASCULAR ISSUES LIKE VARICOSE VEINS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES A BALANCED AUTONOMIC RESPONSE, FACILITATING BETTER NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND THE RELIEF OF MUSCULOSKELETAL TENSION IN THE NECK LINKED TO DIGESTIVE STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL SIST\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LAS REGIONES IL\\u00cdACAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO, QUE SUPERVISA LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A SUPERAR LA \\\"PEREZA INTESTINAL\\\", MEJORANDO LA MOTILIDAD Y REDUCIENDO LA CARGA T\\u00d3XICA QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLORES DE CABEZA SECUNDARIOS O PROBLEMAS VASCULARES COMO V\\u00c1RICES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE UNA RESPUESTA AUT\\u00d3NOMA EQUILIBRADA, FACILITANDO UNA MEJOR ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y EL ALIVIO DE LA TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICA EN EL CUELLO VINCULADA AL ESTR\\u00c9S DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF CONSTIPATION OR METABOLIC SLOWNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL GLANDULAR UNDERACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VASCULAR CONGESTION OR VARICOSE VEINS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ILIAC \\/ ILIAC] VASCULAR RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE DETOXIFICATION PROCESS AND ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BYPRODUCTS OF IMPROVED INTESTINAL TRANSIT DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y GLANDULAR: SI EL ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO O LA LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE HIPOACTIVIDAD GLANDULAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N VASCULAR SEVERA O V\\u00c1RICES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA VASCULAR [IL\\u00cdACO \\/ IL\\u00cdACO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR EL PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DE UN MEJOR TR\\u00c1NSITO INTESTINAL DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/389','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:51:03','2026-04-27 21:51:03'),(4186,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',390,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL MOTILITY (MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL DISORDERS, DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, ALTERED TRANSIT, AND ABDOMINAL BLOATING.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, TR\\u00c1NSITO ALTERADO E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES FUNCTIONAL DISORDERS OF THE INTESTINAL TRACT BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE ILION BONES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS DYSFUNCTION PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE PERISTALTIC MOVEMENT AND THE OVERALL ENVIRONMENT OF THE LOWER DIGESTIVE SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CORRECTING MECHANICAL INEFFICIENCIES WITHIN THE INTESTINES, PROMOTING PROPER WASTE ELIMINATION AND NUTRIENT PROCESSING. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESOLVING CHRONIC DIGESTIVE SLUGGISHNESS AND RESTORING THE NATURAL RHYTHM OF THE GASTROINTESTINAL SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LOS TRASTORNOS FUNCIONALES DEL TRACTO INTESTINAL MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LOS HUESOS ILION. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR EL MOVIMIENTO PERIST\\u00c1LTICO Y EL ENTORNO GENERAL DEL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO INFERIOR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A CORREGIR LAS INEFICIENCIAS MEC\\u00c1NICAS DENTRO DE LOS INTESTINOS, PROMOVIENDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE DESECHOS Y EL PROCESAMIENTO DE NUTRIENTES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA RESOLVER LA LENTITUD DIGESTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA Y RESTAURAR EL RITMO NATURAL DEL SISTEMA GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & NERVOUS CHECK: IF INTESTINAL DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ILIAC \\/ ILIAC] (REF 398) AXIS TO ADDRESS PARASYMPATHETIC REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE BLOATING OR GAS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ASCENDING COLON \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC EQUILIBRIUM DURING THE RESTORATION OF DIGESTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y NERVIOSA: SI LOS TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [IL\\u00cdACO \\/ IL\\u00cdACO] (REF 398) PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N PARASIMP\\u00c1TICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA O GASES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA SALUD DIGESTIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/390','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:52:15','2026-04-27 21:52:15'),(4187,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',391,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THYMUS\\/RECTUM (REVISAR - TIMO\\/RECTO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR ASYMPTOMATIC BACTERIAL HARBORING, URINARY TRACT DISCOMFORT, DIGESTIVE IRREGULARITIES, AND RECURRENT INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL DE ALOJAMIENTO BACTERIANO ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO, MALESTAR EN EL TRACTO URINARIO, IRREGULARIDADES DIGESTIVAS E INFECCIONES RECURRENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR FOR ESCHERICHIA COLI BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INDEX FINGERS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS RESERVOIR PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR IDENTIFYING WHERE THE BACTERIA MAY HIDE, PREVENTING IT FROM MIGRATING TO OTHER AREAS SUCH AS THE URINARY TRACT OR THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS PERIPHERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD THAT OFTEN CAUSES RECURRING INFLAMMATORY PROCESSES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING THE BODY OF LATENT INFECTIONS AND RESTORING OVERALL SYSTEMIC PURITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA ESCHERICHIA COLI MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LOS DEDOS \\u00cdNDICES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR RESERVORIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA IDENTIFICAR D\\u00d3NDE LA BACTERIA PUEDE ESCONDERSE, EVITANDO QUE MIGRE A OTRAS \\u00c1REAS COMO EL TRACTO URINARIO O EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO PERIF\\u00c9RICO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA QUE A MENUDO CAUSA PROCESOS INFLAMATORIOS RECURRENTES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA DEPURAR EL CUERPO DE INFECCIONES LATENTES Y RESTAURAR LA PUREZA SIST\\u00c9MICA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BACTERIAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF URINARY OR DIGESTIVE SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ RECTUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS ACTIVE E. COLI COLONIZATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIARRHEA OR ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ASCENDING COLON \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE CLEARING OF THE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS O DIGESTIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ RECTO] PARA ABORDAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N ACTIVA DE E. COLI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIARREA SEVERA O CALAMBRES ABDOMINALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/391','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 21:53:11','2026-04-27 21:53:11'),(4188,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',392,'{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG AND BREATHING PROBLEMS. PAIN IN SHOULDERS AND STABBING PAIN IN BACK. COUGHING AND FEVER. (PROBLEMAS DE PULMONES Y RESPIRACI\\u00d3N. DOLOR EN LOS HOMBROS Y DOLOR PUNZANTE EN LA ESPALDA. TOS Y FIEBRE)\",\"paths\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE PLEURA LINING OF THE LUNG. AGGRAVATED BY BREATHING, COUGHING AND MOVEMENT. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA PLEURA, REVESTIMIENTO DEL PULM\\u00d3N. AGRAVADA POR LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N, LA TOS Y EL MOVIMIENTO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - BOTH SIDES. (VERIFICAR - AMBOS LADOS.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG AND BREATHING PROBLEMS, PAIN IN SHOULDERS, AND STABBING PAIN IN THE BACK. COUGHING AND FEVER.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE PULMONES Y RESPIRACI\\u00d3N, DOLOR EN LOS HOMBROS Y DOLOR PUNZANTE EN LA ESPALDA. TOS Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE INFLAMMATION OF THE PLEURA, THE PROTECTIVE LINING OF THE LUNGS, BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INFRA-AXILLARY AND INTRA-AXILLARY REGIONS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR REDUCING THE FRICTION AND PAIN AGGRAVATED BY BREATHING, COUGHING, OR PHYSICAL MOVEMENT. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM IN CLEARING VIRAL LOADS THAT CAUSE PLEURITIC IRRITATION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES BETTER LUNG EXPANSION AND ALIEVIATES THE CHARACTERISTIC STABBING BACK PAIN ASSOCIATED WITH PLEURAL DISTRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA PLEURA, EL REVESTIMIENTO PROTECTOR DE LOS PULMONES, MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LAS REGIONES INFRAAXILAR E INTRAAXILAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REDUCIR LA FRICCI\\u00d3N Y EL DOLOR AGRAVADO POR LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N, LA TOS O EL MOVIMIENTO F\\u00cdSICO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO A ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE CAUSAN IRRITACI\\u00d3N PLEUR\\u00cdTICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE UNA MEJOR EXPANSI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y ALIVIA EL DOLOR PUNZANTE CARACTER\\u00cdSTICO DE LA ESPALDA ASOCIADO CON EL MALESTAR PLEURAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BILATERAL CHECK: IT IS RECOMMENDED TO CHECK BOTH SIDES (LEFT AND RIGHT) TO ENSURE FULL SYSTEMIC COVERAGE OF THE PLEURAL CAVITY. IF RESPIRATORY DISTRESS PERSISTS WITH PERSISTENT FEVER, SCAN THE [CARINA \\/ CARINA] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL RESERVOIRS IN THE BRONCHI. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND SUPPORTING OVERALL RECOVERY DURING THE CLEARING OF THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N BILATERAL: SE RECOMIENDA VERIFICAR AMBOS LADOS (IZQUIERDO Y DERECHO) PARA ASEGURAR UNA COBERTURA SIST\\u00c9MICA COMPLETA DE LA CAVIDAD PLEURAL. SI LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA PERSISTE CON FIEBRE PERSISTENTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CARINA \\/ CARINA] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES RESERVORIOS VIRALES EN LOS BRONQUIOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/392','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:10:12','2026-04-27 22:10:12'),(4189,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',393,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FATIGUE (FATIGA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR)\",\"symptoms\":\"SYSTEMIC FATIGUE, PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL HORMONAL DYSREGULATION.\\n\\n(FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO Y POSIBLE DESREGULACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC FATIGUE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INGUINAL LIGAMENT AND THE UTERUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR BALANCING THE ENERGY FLOW WITHIN THE PELVIC CAVITY, WHICH IS OFTEN LINKED TO VITALITY AND REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN OVERCOMING PERSISTENT EXHAUSTION THAT MAY BE CONNECTED TO UTERINE STRESS OR HORMONAL IMBALANCES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES IMPROVED ENERGY LEVELS AND SUPPORTS THE INTEGRITY OF THE FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE ENVIRONMENT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL LIGAMENTO INGUINAL Y EL \\u00daTERO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA DENTRO DE LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA, QUE A MENUDO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA VITALIDAD Y LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A SUPERAR EL AGOTAMIENTO PERSISTENTE QUE PUEDE ESTAR RELACIONADO CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S UTERINO O DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE MEJORES NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA Y APOYA LA INTEGRIDAD DEL ENTORNO REPRODUCTOR FEMENINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & PELVIC CHECK: IF FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO RULE OUT METABOLIC UNDERACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PELVIC PAIN OR MENSTRUAL IRREGULARITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OVARY \\/ OVARY] OR [UTERUS \\/ UTERUS] RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING HORMONAL BYPRODUCTS AND SUPPORTING OVERALL SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE STABILIZATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y P\\u00c9LVICA: SI LA FATIGA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA DESCARTAR UNA HIPOACTIVIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO SEVERO O IRREGULARIDADES MENSTRUALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS [OVARIO \\/ OVARIO] O [\\u00daTERO \\/ \\u00daTERO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS HORMONALES Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA GENERAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/393','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:11:16','2026-04-27 22:11:16'),(4190,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',394,'{\"symptoms\":\"ITCHING AND BURNING PROBLEMS IN THE VAGINAL, RECTUM AND URETHRAL AREA. LOW BACK PAIN, HIP AND GROINING PAIN. (PROBLEMAS DE PICAZ\\u00d3N Y ARDOR EN EL \\u00c1REA VAGINAL, RECTAL Y URETRAL. DOLOR EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA, CADERA Y  INGLE.)\",\"paths\":\"ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION, VAGINITIS, CYSTOCELE, PROSTATITIS. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL, VAGINITIS, CISTOCELE, PROSTATITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS; CAUSES FUNGAL INFECTIONS OF THE AREAS. (ASOCIADO CON UN HONGO; CAUSA INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS EN LAS \\u00c1REAS.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ITCHING AND BURNING PROBLEMS IN THE VAGINAL, RECTAL, AND URETHRAL AREA. LOW BACK PAIN, HIP, AND GROIN PAIN.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE PICAZ\\u00d3N Y ARDOR EN EL \\u00c1REA VAGINAL, RECTAL Y URETRAL. DOLOR EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA, CADERA E INGLE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE HTLV-2 VIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS OF THE INGUINAL NERVE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INFLAMMATORY CONDITIONS OF THE UROGENITAL AND REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEMS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS NERVE PATHWAY, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING LOCALIZED IRRITATION AND NERVE-RELATED PAIN. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CLINICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH IMPROVING SYMPTOMS OF ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION, VAGINITIS, CYSTOCELE, AND PROSTATITIS, RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE PELVIC NERVE TRANSMISSION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL VIRUS HTLV-2 MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DEL NERVIO INGUINAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA TRATAR CONDICIONES INFLAMATORIAS DE LOS SISTEMAS UROGENITAL Y REPRODUCTOR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA V\\u00cdA NERVIOSA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REDUCIR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA Y EL DOLOR RELACIONADO CON LOS NERVIOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADA CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON LA MEJOR\\u00cdA DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL, VAGINITIS, CISTOCELE Y PROSTATITIS, RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL & LOCALIZED CHECK: THIS VIRAL PAIR IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS; IF ITCHING OR BURNING PERSISTS, SCAN FOR FUNGAL RESONANCES IN THE PELVIC AREA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LOWER BACK PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL AND FUNGAL BYPRODUCTS, SUPPORTING A COMPLETE DETOXIFICATION OF THE REPRODUCTIVE AND URINARY TRACTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA Y LOCALIZADA: ESTE PAR VIRAL EST\\u00c1 FRECUENTEMENTE ASOCIADO CON UN HONGO; SI LA PICAZ\\u00d3N O EL ARDOR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR RESONANCIAS F\\u00daNGICAS EN EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00c9LVICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR SEVERO EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y F\\u00daNGICOS, APOYANDO UNA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LOS TRACTOS REPRODUCTOR Y URINARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/394','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:12:26','2026-04-27 22:12:26'),(4191,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',395,'{\"symptoms\":\"NEURO-DERMATITIS AND ATOPIC DERMATITIS, AROUND THE MOUTH AND IN THE FOLD OF THE ARMS AND FEET. SWOLLEN GLANDS AND LYMPH NODES IN THE NECK. FALSE HERPES. (NEURODERMATITIS Y DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, ALREDEDOR DE LA BOCA Y EN LOS PLIEGUES DE LOS BRAZOS Y LOS PIES. GL\\u00c1NDULAS Y GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS HINCHADOS EN EL CUELLO. FALSO HERPES.)\",\"paths\":\"ERUPTIVE ROSEOLA RASH. RASH FROM CHILDHOOD ILLNESS. HEPATITIS Q. (ERUPCI\\u00d3N DE ROS\\u00c9OLA ERUPTIVA. SARPULLIDO DE ENFERMEDAD INFANTIL. HEPATITIS Q)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH FUNGUS; ROSACEA. (ASOCIADO CON HONGOS; ROS\\u00c1CEA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"NEURO-DERMATITIS AND ATOPIC DERMATITIS, ESPECIALLY AROUND THE MOUTH AND IN THE FOLDS OF THE ARMS AND FEET. SWOLLEN GLANDS AND LYMPH NODES IN THE NECK. FALSE HERPES.\\n\\n(NEURODERMATITIS Y DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, ESPECIALMENTE ALREDEDOR DE LA BOCA Y EN LOS PLIEGUES DE LOS BRAZOS Y LOS PIES. GL\\u00c1NDULAS Y GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS HINCHADOS EN EL CUELLO. FALSO HERPES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIRAL ACTIVITY OF ROSEOLA, OFTEN CHARACTERIZED BY ERUPTIVE RASHES TYPICAL OF CHILDHOOD ILLNESSES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING DERMATOLOGICAL MANIFESTATIONS AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION OF THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE INGUINAL NERVE AND THE LIVER, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE VIRAL LOAD RESPONSIBLE FOR NEURO-DERMATITIS AND \\\"FALSE HERPES\\\" LESIONS. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT SUPPORTS HEPATIC FUNCTION IN FILTERING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS (HEPATITIS Q), REDUCING GLANDULAR SWELLING AND RESTORING SKIN INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL DE LA ROS\\u00c9OLA, A MENUDO CARACTERIZADA POR ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS T\\u00cdPICAS DE LAS ENFERMEDADES INFANTILES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LAS MANIFESTACIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL NERVIO INGUINAL Y EL H\\u00cdGADO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL RESPONSABLE DE LA NEURODERMATITIS Y LAS LESIONES DE \\\"FALSO HERPES\\\". LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO APOYA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES (HEPATITIS Q), REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA PIEL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL & DERMATOLOGICAL CHECK: ROSEOLA IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH FUNGAL INFECTIONS; IF SKIN IRRITATION OR ROSACEA PERSISTS, SCAN FOR COMPLEMENTARY FUNGAL RESONANCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LYMPHATIC CONGESTION IN THE NECK, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL TOXINS AND SUPPORTING THE RESOLUTION OF ATOPIC DERMATITIS DURING THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA Y DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA: LA ROS\\u00c9OLA EST\\u00c1 FRECUENTEMENTE ASOCIADA CON INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS; SI LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA O LA ROS\\u00c1CEA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR RESONANCIAS F\\u00daNGICAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA SEVERA EN EL CUELLO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TIMO \\/ TIMO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/395','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:13:30','2026-04-27 22:13:30'),(4192,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',396,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"RESTLESS LEG SYNDROME, VAGINAL INFECTIONS FOR SEVERAL DIFFERENT REASONS, SLEEP DISORDER, INSOMNIA. (S\\u00cdNDROME DE PIERNAS INQUIETAS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES POR VARIAS RAZONES, TRASTORNO DEL SUE\\u00d1O, INSOMNIO.)\",\"paths\":\"SLEEPWALKING (SONAMBULISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SLEEPWALKING (SONAMBULISMO)\",\"symptoms\":\"RESTLESS LEG SYNDROME, VAGINAL INFECTIONS FOR SEVERAL DIFFERENT REASONS, SLEEP DISORDER, AND INSOMNIA.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNDROME DE PIERNAS INQUIETAS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES POR VARIAS RAZONES, TRASTORNO DEL SUE\\u00d1O E INSOMNIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES DISRUPTIONS IN THE BODY\'S NEUROLOGICAL REST PATTERNS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INSTEPS OF THE FEET. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING SLEEPWALKING AND OTHER PARASOMNIAS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS PERIPHERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN TRANSITIONING SMOOTHLY THROUGH SLEEP CYCLES, REDUCING THE MOTOR HYPERACTIVITY ASSOCIATED WITH RESTLESS LEG SYNDROME and INSOMNIA. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS DEEPER REGENERATIVE SLEEP AND HAS BEEN CLINICALLY OBSERVED TO ASSIST IN BALANCING THE UROGENITAL ENVIRONMENT, POTENTIALLY REDUCING RECURRING VAGINAL INFECTIONS LINKED TO SYSTEMIC STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LAS INTERRUPCIONES EN LOS PATRONES DE DESCANSO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO DEL CUERPO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LOS EMPEINES DE LOS PIES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DEL SONAMBULISMO Y OTRAS PARASOMNIAS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO PERIF\\u00c9RICO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A TRANSICIONAR SUAVEMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS CICLOS DE SUE\\u00d1O, REDUCIENDO LA HIPERACTIVIDAD MOTORA ASOCIADA CON EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE PIERNAS INQUIETAS Y EL INSOMNIO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA UN SUE\\u00d1O REGENERATIVO M\\u00c1S PROFUNDO Y SE HA OBSERVADO CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE QUE AYUDA A EQUILIBRAR EL ENTORNO UROGENITAL, REDUCIENDO POTENCIALMENTE LAS INFECCIONES VAGINALES RECURRENTES VINCULADAS AL ESTR\\u00c9S SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF INSOMNIA OR SLEEP DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT MELATONIN REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT VAGINAL INFECTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED PATHOGENS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC WASTE AND SUPPORTING OVERALL RELAXATION OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL INSOMNIO O LOS TRASTORNOS DEL SUE\\u00d1O PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA MELATONINA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES VAGINALES PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS LOCALIZADOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA RELAJACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/396','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:14:37','2026-04-27 22:14:37'),(4193,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',397,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DOUBT (DUDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DOUBT (DUDA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INSECURITY, HESITATION IN DECISION-MAKING, LACK OF CLARITY, AND MENTAL FATIGUE.\\n\\n(INSEGURIDAD, VACILACI\\u00d3N EN LA TOMA DE DECISIONES, FALTA DE CLARIDAD Y FATIGA MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGE OF DOUBT BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INSTEPS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS EMOTIONAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RECONNECTING THE INDIVIDUAL WITH THEIR SENSE OF DIRECTION AND SELF-ASSURANCE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CLEARING THE MENTAL \\\"FOG\\\" THAT PREVENTS FIRM ACTION, SUPPORTING A STATE OF INNER CONFIDENCE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR OVERCOMING HESITATION AND RESTORING THE RESOLVE NECESSARY TO MOVE FORWARD WITH PERSONAL OR PROFESSIONAL PROJECTS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL BLOQUEO EMOCIONAL DE LA DUDA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LOS EMPEINES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR EMOCIONAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RECONECTAR AL INDIVIDUO CON SU SENTIDO DE DIRECCI\\u00d3N Y SEGURIDAD EN S\\u00cd MISMO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DESPEJAR LA \\\"NIEBLA\\\" MENTAL QUE IMPIDE LA ACCI\\u00d3N FIRME, APOYANDO UN ESTADO DE CONFIANZA INTERIOR. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA SUPERAR LA VACILACI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURAR LA DETERMINACI\\u00d3N NECESARIA PARA AVANZAR EN PROYECTOS PERSONALES O PROFESIONALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF MENTAL CONFUSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT NEUROLOGICAL CLARITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP-SEATED FEAR OR ANXIETY LINKED TO THE UNKNOWN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BIOCHEMICAL BYPRODUCTS OF EMOTIONAL STRESS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC EQUILIBRIUM DURING THE STRENGTHENING OF SELF-CONFIDENCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA Y EMOCIONAL: SI LA CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA CLARIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MIEDO PROFUNDO O ANSIEDAD VINCULADA A LO DESCONOCIDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE EL FORTALECIMIENTO DE LA SEGURIDAD EN S\\u00cd MISMO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/397','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:15:37','2026-04-27 22:15:37'),(4194,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',398,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CHARACTER (CAR\\u00c1CTER)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CHARACTER (CAR\\u00c1CTER)\",\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL RIGIDITY, IRRITABILITY, DIFFICULTY ADAPTING TO SOCIAL CHANGES, AND EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(RIGIDEZ CONDUCTUAL, IRRITABILIDAD, DIFICULTAD PARA ADAPTARSE A CAMBIOS SOCIALES E INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CORE ATTRIBUTES OF AN INDIVIDUAL\'S PERSONALITY BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INTERCILIARY POINT (THIRD EYE AREA) AND THE BRAINSTEM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MODULATING THE PRIMITIVE RESPONSES OF THE BRAINSTEM WITH THE COGNITIVE AND INTUITIVE PERCEPTION OF THE FRONTAL REGION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN SOFTENING HARSH CHARACTER TRAITS, REDUCING REACTIONARY BEHAVIOR, AND PROMOTING A MORE BALANCED EMOTIONAL DISPOSITION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN PROCESSING EXTERNAL STIMULI WITHOUT TRIGGERING AGGRESSION OR DEFENSIVENESS, FACILITATING A HARMONIOUS INTEGRATION OF TEMPERAMENT AND SOCIAL INTERACTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LOS ATRIBUTOS CENTRALES DE LA PERSONALIDAD DEL INDIVIDUO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL PUNTO INTERCILIAR Y EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MODULAR LAS RESPUESTAS PRIMITIVAS DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO CON LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA E INTUITIVA DE LA REGI\\u00d3N FRONTAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A SUAVIZAR LOS RASGOS FUERTES DEL CAR\\u00c1CTER, REDUCIENDO LA CONDUCTA REACCIONARIA Y PROMOVIENDO UNA DISPOSICI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL M\\u00c1S EQUILIBRADA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE EST\\u00cdMULOS EXTERNOS SIN DESENCADENAR AGRESIVIDAD O DEFENSIVIDAD, FACILITANDO UNA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ARMONIOSA DEL TEMPERAMENTO Y LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N SOCIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF IRRITABILITY OR RIGIDITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT OVERALL HORMONAL AND CIRCADIAN BALANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP EMOTIONAL TRAUMA AFFECTING CHARACTER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE TO CALM THE FEAR RESPONSE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BIOCHEMICAL BYPRODUCTS OF ANGER AND STRESS, SUPPORTING SYSTEMIC CALM DURING THE REBALANCING OF THE CHARACTER.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y CONDUCTUAL: SI LA IRRITABILIDAD O LA RIGIDEZ PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO HORMONAL Y CIRCADIANO GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TRAUMA EMOCIONAL PROFUNDO QUE AFECTE EL CAR\\u00c1CTER, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DE MIEDO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL ENOJO Y EL ESTR\\u00c9S, APOYANDO LA CALMA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL REEQUILIBRIO DEL CAR\\u00c1CTER.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/398','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:16:46','2026-04-27 22:16:46'),(4195,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',399,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"STRONG OR WEAK CHARACTER. (CAR\\u00c1CTER FUERTE O D\\u00c9BIL)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATES WITH; AUTISM (ASOCIADO CON; AUTISMO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"CHARACTER (CAR\\u00c1CTER)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXTREMES IN TEMPERAMENT (STRONG OR WEAK CHARACTER), EMOTIONAL VOLATILITY, AND SOCIAL ADAPTATION CHALLENGES.\\n\\n(CAR\\u00c1CTER FUERTE O D\\u00c9BIL, VOLATILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y DESAF\\u00cdOS DE ADAPTACI\\u00d3N SOCIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE FUNDAMENTAL REGULATION OF AN INDIVIDUAL\'S TEMPERAMENT BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INTERCILIARY POINT AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR BALANCING THE AUTONOMIC SURVIVAL RESPONSES OF THE MEDULLA WITH THE INTELLECTUAL AND INTUITIVE PERCEPTION OF THE FRONTAL CORTEX. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN HARMONIZING \\\"CHARACTER\\\" EXTREMES\\u2014WHETHER MANIFESTING AS OVERLY AGGRESSIVE\\/DOMINANT OR PASSIVE\\/VULNERABLE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN ACHIEVING A STATE OF POISE, REDUCING THE IMPACT OF EMOTIONAL TRIGGERS ON BEHAVIORAL RESPONSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N FUNDAMENTAL DEL TEMPERAMENTO DEL INDIVIDUO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL PUNTO INTERCILIAR Y LA M\\u00c9DULA OBLONGADA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EQUILIBRAR LAS RESPUESTAS AUT\\u00d3NOMAS DE SUPERVIVENCIA DE LA M\\u00c9DULA CON LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N INTELECTUAL E INTUITIVA DE LA CORTEZA FRONTAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARMONIZAR LOS EXTREMOS DEL \\\"CAR\\u00c1CTER\\\", YA SEA QUE SE MANIFIESTEN COMO EXCESIVAMENTE AGRESIVOS\\/DOMINANTES O PASIVOS\\/VULNERABLES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARA LOGRAR UN ESTADO DE EQUILIBRIO, REDUCIENDO EL IMPACTO DE LOS DESENCADENANTES EMOCIONALES EN LAS RESPUESTAS CONDUCTUALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-DEVELOPMENTAL CHECK: THIS RESONANCE IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH AUTISM SPECTRUM CONDITIONS; SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS DEEPER COGNITIVE INTEGRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING RIGIDITY OF THOUGHT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [INTERCILIARY \\/ BRAINSTEM] (REF 407) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BIOCHEMICAL BYPRODUCTS OF EMOTIONAL STRESS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC STABILITY DURING THE REFINEMENT OF CHARACTER TRAITS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURODESARROLLO: ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON CONDICIONES DEL ESPECTRO AUTISTA; ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA ABORDAR UNA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RIGIDEZ DE PENSAMIENTO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [INTERCILIAR \\/ TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO] (REF 407). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL REFINAMIENTO DE LOS RASGOS DEL CAR\\u00c1CTER.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/399','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:18:02','2026-04-27 22:18:02'),(4196,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',400,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SPEECH PROBLEMS, TRAUMA, AGGRESSIVE, EXCITED, EXPLOSIVE, DOMINANT, HYSTERIA, PHOBIAS EXCESSIVE BEHAVIORAL PROBLEMS. AFRAID, FEARFUL, TIMID, AND DEPRESSED DEFAULT BEHAVIORAL PROBLEMS.(PROBLEMAS DEL HABLA, TRAUMA, AGRESIVO, EXCITADO, EXPLOSIVO, DOMINANTE, HISTERIA, FOBIAS, PROBLEMAS DE CONDUCTA EXCESIVOS. MIEDOSO, TEMEROSO, T\\u00cdMIDO Y DEPRIMIDO, PROBLEMAS DE CONDUCTA POR DEFECTO)\",\"paths\":\"DWARFISM. CHARACTER RELATED TRAUMA . (ENANISMO. TRAUMA RELACIONADO CON EL CAR\\u00c1CTER.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CHARACTER-RELATED TRAUMA (TRAUMA RELACIONADO CON EL CAR\\u00c1CTER)\",\"symptoms\":\"SPEECH PROBLEMS, TRAUMA, AGGRESSIVE, EXCITED, EXPLOSIVE, DOMINANT, HYSTERIA, PHOBIAS, AND EXCESSIVE BEHAVIORAL PROBLEMS. ALSO ADDRESSES \\\"DEFAULT\\\" BEHAVIORAL PROBLEMS SUCH AS BEING AFRAID, FEARFUL, TIMID, AND DEPRESSED.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DEL HABLA, TRAUMA, AGRESIVO, EXCITADO, EXPLOSIVO, DOMINANTE, HISTERIA, FOBIAS Y PROBLEMAS DE CONDUCTA EXCESIVOS. TAMBI\\u00c9N ABORDA PROBLEMAS DE CONDUCTA \\\"POR DEFECTO\\\" COMO SENTIRSE MIEDOSO, TEMEROSO, T\\u00cdMIDO Y DEPRIMIDO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES DEEP-SEATED PSYCHOLOGICAL AND BEHAVIORAL PATTERNS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INTERCILIARY POINT AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR RELEASING TRAUMA THAT HAS CRYSTALLIZED INTO EXTREME CHARACTER TRAITS, WHETHER MANIFESTING AS EXPLOSIVE AGGRESSION OR DEBILITATING TIMIDITY. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN OVERCOMING PHOBIAS AND SPEECH DISORDERS LINKED TO EMOTIONAL STRESS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE REGULATION OF THE AUTONOMIC RESPONSES GOVERNED BY THE BULB, FACILITATING A TRANSITION FROM HYSTERIA AND FEAR TO A STATE OF MENTAL POISE AND EMOTIONAL CLARITY. IT IS ALSO CLINICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH SUPPORTING GROWTH PROCESSES RELATED TO DWARFISM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA PATRONES PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS Y CONDUCTUALES PROFUNDOS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL PUNTO INTERCILIAR Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO (M\\u00c9DULA OBLONGADA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR TRAUMAS QUE SE HAN CRISTALIZADO EN RASGOS DE CAR\\u00c1CTER EXTREMOS, YA SEA QUE SE MANIFIESTEN COMO AGRESI\\u00d3N EXPLOSIVA O TIMIDEZ DEBILITANTE. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A SUPERAR FOBIAS Y TRASTORNOS DEL HABLA VINCULADOS AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS RESPUESTAS AUT\\u00d3NOMAS REGIDAS POR EL BULBO, FACILITANDO UNA TRANSICI\\u00d3N DESDE LA HISTERIA Y EL MIEDO HACIA UN ESTADO DE EQUILIBRIO MENTAL Y CLARIDAD EMOCIONAL. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON EL APOYO A LOS PROCESOS DE CRECIMIENTO RELACIONADOS CON EL ENANISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL & COGNITIVE CHECK: IF AGGRESSION OR EXPLOSIVE BEHAVIOR PERSISTS, SCAN THE [INTERCILIARY \\/ BRAINSTEM] (REF 407) AXIS TO FURTHER MODULATE TEMPERAMENT. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SPEECH IMPAIRMENT OR STUTTERING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS AUDITORY AND ARTICULATION CENTERS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BIOCHEMICAL BYPRODUCTS OF EMOTIONAL TRAUMA AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC STABILITY DURING THE REBALANCING OF THE CHARACTER.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL Y COGNITIVA: SI LA AGRESI\\u00d3N O EL COMPORTAMIENTO EXPLOSIVO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [INTERCILIAR \\/ TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO] (REF 407) PARA MODULAR A\\u00daN M\\u00c1S EL TEMPERAMENTO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN DETERIORO SEVERO DEL HABLA O TARTAMUDEZ, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA ABORDAR LOS CENTROS DE AUDICI\\u00d3N Y ARTICULACI\\u00d3N. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL TRAUMA EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL REEQUILIBRIO DEL CAR\\u00c1CTER.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/400','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:19:29','2026-04-27 22:19:29'),(4197,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',401,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL PARASITES. (PAR\\u00c1SITOS INTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL PARASITOSIS (PARASITOSIS INTESTINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, ALTERED DIGESTION, BLOATING, AND POTENTIAL NUTRIENT MALABSORPTION.\\n\\n(MALESTAR ABDOMINAL, DIGESTI\\u00d3N ALTERADA, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y POSIBLE MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PRESENCE OF VARIOUS INTESTINAL PARASITES BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INTERILIAC POINTS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR DISRUPTING THE ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS PARASITIC ORGANISMS TO THRIVE WITHIN THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN ELIMINATING THESE PATHOGENS, THEREBY REDUCING INFLAMMATION OF THE INTESTINAL MUCOSA AND RESTORING PROPER PERISTALTIC FUNCTION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR IMPROVING DIGESTIVE EFFICIENCY AND RELIEVING THE CHRONIC ABDOMINAL DISOMFORT ASSOCIATED WITH PARASITIC INFESTATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA PRESENCIA DE DIVERSOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS INTESTINALES MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LOS PUNTOS INTERIL\\u00cdACOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA INTERRUMPIR EL ENTORNO QUE PERMITE QUE LOS ORGANISMOS PARASITARIOS PROLIFEREN DENTRO DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR ESTOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS, REDUCIENDO AS\\u00cd LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA INTESTINAL Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PERIST\\u00c1LTICA ADECUADA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA MEJORAR LA EFICIENCIA DIGESTIVA Y ALIVIAR EL MALESTAR ABDOMINAL CR\\u00d3NICO ASOCIADO CON LA INFESTACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARASITIC & DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL BLOATING OR PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [ISCHIUM \\/ ISCHIUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL LARVAL STAGES OR OTHER PARASITIC STRAINS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIARRHEA OR MALABSORPTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SMALL INTESTINE \\/ SMALL INTESTINE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BYPRODUCTS OF PARASITIC ELIMINATION AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA Y DIGESTIVA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N O EL DOLOR ABDOMINAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ISQUI\\u00d3N \\/ ISQUI\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES ETAPAS LARVARIAS U OTRAS CEPAS PARASITARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIARREA SEVERA O MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [INTESTINO DELGADO \\/ INTESTINO DELGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/401','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:20:38','2026-04-27 22:20:38'),(4198,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',402,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SPASMS, FEBRILE SEIZURES, ANXIETY, SEXUAL DISORDERS. (ESPASMOS, CONVULSIONES FEBRILES, ANSIEDAD, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES.)\",\"paths\":\"UROGENITAL DISORDERS, FIBROMYALGIA. (TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES, FIBROMIALGIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THYMUS\\/RECTUM                     CHECK - INDEX\\/INDEX (VERIFICAR - TIMO\\/RECTO                     VERIFICAR - \\u00cdNDICE\\/\\u00cdNDICE)\"}','{\"origins\":\"UROGENITAL DISORDERS & FIBROMYALGIA (TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES Y FIBROMIALGIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SPASMS, FEBRILE SEIZURES, ANXIETY, AND SEXUAL DISORDERS.\\n\\n(ESPASMOS, CONVULSIONES FEBRILES, ANSIEDAD Y TRASTORNOS SEXUALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES COMPLEX PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY AFFECTING BOTH THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM AND NEUROMUSCULAR INTEGRITY BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INTERILIAC REGION AND THE KIDNEYS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING SYMPTOMS OF FIBROMYALGIA, WHERE PH DISTORTIONS CONTRIBUTE TO CHRONIC PAIN AND MUSCULAR SPASMS. BY NEUTRALIZING THESE IMBALANCES, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING SYSTEMIC ANXIETY AND STABILIZING NEUROLOGICAL EXCITABILITY THAT CAN LEAD TO FEBRILE SEIZURES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING RENAL EFFICIENCY AND ADDRESSING SEXUAL DYSFUNCTIONS LINKED TO PELVIC BIOELECTRICAL DISRUPTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA COMPLEJA QUE AFECTA TANTO AL SISTEMA UROGENITAL COMO A LA INTEGRIDAD NEUROMUSCULAR MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N INTERIL\\u00cdACA Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA FIBROMIALGIA, DONDE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH CONTRIBUYEN AL DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO Y LOS ESPASMOS MUSCULARES. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTOS DESEQUILIBRIOS, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA ANSIEDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y A ESTABILIZAR LA EXCITABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A CONVULSIONES FEBRILES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA EFICIENCIA RENAL Y TRATAR LAS DISFUNCIONES SEXUALES VINCULADAS A LAS INTERRUPCIONES BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICAS P\\u00c9LVICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BACTERIAL & RESERVOIR CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF ANXIETY OR URINARY DISCOMFORT PERSIST, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ RECTUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS ACTIVE PATHOGENS. FOR CASES INVOLVING RECURRING INFECTIONS OR LATENT BACTERIAL LOADS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [INDEX FINGER \\/ INDEX FINGER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC WASTE AND SUPPORTING SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM FIBROMYALGIA AND UROGENITAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA Y DE RESERVORIO: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE ANSIEDAD O EL MALESTAR URINARIO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ RECTO] PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS ACTIVOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES RECURRENTES O CARGAS BACTERIANAS LATENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [DEDO \\u00cdNDICE \\/ DEDO \\u00cdNDICE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FIBROMIALGIA Y EL ESTR\\u00c9S UROGENITAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/402','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:34:04','2026-04-27 22:34:04'),(4199,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',403,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR ASYMPTOMATIC PARASITIC HARBORING, RECURRING ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, AND UNEXPLAINED FATIGUE.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL DE ALOJAMIENTO PARASITARIO ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO, MALESTAR ABDOMINAL RECURRENTE Y FATIGA INEXPLICABLE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR FOR VARIOUS PARASITES BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE INTERILIAC REGION AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS RESERVOIR PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR IDENTIFYING WHERE PARASITIC ORGANISMS MAY REMAIN LATENT, PREVENTING THEM FROM RECOLONIZING THE INTESTINAL TRACT OR MIGRATING TO OTHER AREAS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS SACRAL-PELVIC CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE HIDDEN PARASITIC LOAD THAT OFTEN CONTRIBUTES TO CHRONIC INFLAMMATION AND LOW ENERGY LEVELS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR ENSURING THE PERMANENT REMOVAL OF PATHOGENS THAT USE THESE STRUCTURES AS A PROTECTIVE REFUGE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA DIVERSOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N INTERIL\\u00cdACA Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR RESERVORIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA IDENTIFICAR D\\u00d3NDE LOS ORGANISMOS PARASITARIOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES, EVITANDO QUE RECOLONICEN EL TRACTO INTESTINAL O MIGREN A OTRAS \\u00c1REAS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO SACRO-P\\u00c9LVICO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA OCULTA QUE A MENUDO CONTRIBUYE A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA Y A LOS BAJOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N PERMANENTE DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE UTILIZAN ESTAS ESTRUCTURAS COMO REFUGIO PROTECTOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARASITIC & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF PELVIC DISCOMFORT OR DIGESTIVE SLUGGISHNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [INTERILIAC \\/ INTERILIAC] (REF 410) AXIS TO ADDRESS ACTIVE INTESTINAL PARASITOSIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING LOWER BACK PAIN OR SCIATIC IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BYPRODUCTS OF PARASITIC CLEARANCE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO O LA LENTITUD DIGESTIVA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [INTERIL\\u00cdACO \\/ INTERIL\\u00cdACO] (REF 410) PARA ABORDAR LA PARASITOSIS INTESTINAL ACTIVA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA O IRRITACI\\u00d3N CI\\u00c1TICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SACRO \\/ SACRO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/403','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:35:03','2026-04-27 22:35:03'),(4200,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',404,'{\"symptoms\":\"FLATULENCE, IRRITABLE BOWEL, DIVERTICULA, PERITONEAL IRRITATION, DIARRHEA. FALSE CANCER OF THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. (FLATULENCIA, S\\u00cdNDROME DE INTESTINO IRRITABLE, DIVERT\\u00cdCULOS, IRRITACI\\u00d3N PERITONEAL, DIARREA. FALSO C\\u00c1NCER DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY UNCOOKED EGG YOLKS. RESPIRATORY AND SKIN INFECTIONS. DIGESTIVE DISORDERS. (TRANSMITIDO POR YEMAS DE HUEVO CRUDAS. INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS Y DE LA PIEL. TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RETROAXILLA (VERIFICAR - RETROAXILA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FLATULENCE, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME (IBS), DIVERTICULA, PERITONEAL IRRITATION, AND DIARRHEA. FALSE CANCER OF THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(FLATULENCIA, S\\u00cdNDROME DE INTESTINO IRRITABLE, DIVERT\\u00cdCULOS, IRRITACI\\u00d3N PERITONEAL Y DIARREA. FALSO C\\u00c1NCER DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF STREPTOCOCCUS C BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE ISCHIAL RAMI. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING SEVERE INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION THAT CAN MIMIC THE SYMPTOMS OF GASTROINTESTINAL MALIGNANCIES (FALSE CANCER). BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS PELVIC ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN RESOLVING PERITONEAL IRRITATION AND REDUCING THE GAS PRODUCTION THAT LEADS TO FLATULENCE AND BLOATING. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY OF THE INTESTINAL WALLS, HELPING TO MITIGATE THE DISCOMFORT ASSOCIATED WITH DIVERTICULA AND IRRITABLE BOWEL FLARE-UPS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE STREPTOCOCCUS C MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LAS RAMAS ISQUI\\u00c1TICAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL SEVERA QUE PUEDE IMITAR LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE MALIGNIDADES GASTROINTESTINALES (FALSO C\\u00c1NCER). AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A RESOLVER LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N PERITONEAL Y A REDUCIR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GASES QUE CONDUCE A LA FLATULENCIA E HINCHAZ\\u00d3N. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA INTEGRIDAD ESTRUCTURAL DE LAS PAREDES INTESTINALES, AYUDANDO A MITIGAR EL MALESTAR ASOCIADO CON LOS DIVERT\\u00cdCULOS Y LOS BROTES DE COLON IRRITABLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & SKIN CHECK: SINCE THIS BACTERIA (TRANSMITTED VIA UNCOOKED EGG YOLKS) CAN ALSO IMPACT THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM AND SKIN, SCAN THE [RETROAXILLA \\/ RETROAXILLA] AXIS FOR COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL ACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC DIARRHEA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ISCHIUM \\/ ISCHIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y CUT\\u00c1NEA: DADO QUE ESTA BACTERIA (TRANSMITIDA POR YEMAS DE HUEVO CRUDAS) TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE AFECTAR EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO Y LA PIEL, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RETROAXILA \\/ RETROAXILA] PARA DETECTAR ACTIVIDAD BACTERIANA COMPLEMENTARIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ISQUI\\u00d3N \\/ ISQUI\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y ASEGURAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE TODO EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/404','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:36:03','2026-04-27 22:36:03'),(4201,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',405,'{\"origins\":\"ONCHOCERCIASIS\",\"symptoms\":\"RECTAL AND ANUS DISORDERS, BURNING, ITCHING, SWELLING AND SKIN NODULES. FLATULENCE, RECTAL BLEEDING, DIVERTICULA. (TRASTORNOS RECTALES Y DEL ANO, ARDOR, PICAZ\\u00d3N, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N Y N\\u00d3DULOS EN LA PIEL. FLATULENCIA, SANGRADO RECTAL, DIVERT\\u00cdCULOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY PORK, WATER, FRUITS, VEGETABLES AND UNCOOKED EGGS. CONJUNCTIVITIS, UVEITIS, SUBCUTANEOUS NODULES, BLINDNESS, RASH, PIGMENTATION CHANGES, OPTIC NERVE ATROPHY, CORNEAL DAMAGE, ERYTHEMA AND EDEMA. (TRANSMITIDO POR CERDO, AGUA, FRUTAS, VERDURAS Y HUEVOS CRUDOS. CONJUNTIVITIS, UVE\\u00cdTIS, N\\u00d3DULOS SUBCUT\\u00c1NEOS, CEGUERA, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, CAMBIOS EN LA PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N, ATROFIA DEL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO, DA\\u00d1O CORNEAL, ERITEMA Y EDEMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ONCHOCERCIASIS (ONCOCERCOSIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"RECTAL AND ANUS DISORDERS, BURNING, ITCHING, SWELLING, AND SKIN NODULES. FLATULENCE, RECTAL BLEEDING, AND DIVERTICULA.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS RECTALES Y DEL ANO, ARDOR, PICAZ\\u00d3N, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N Y N\\u00d3DULOS EN LA PIEL. FLATULENCIA, SANGRADO RECTAL Y DIVERT\\u00cdCULOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF ONCHOCERCA VOLVULUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE ISCHIUM BONES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING PARASITIC INFESTATIONS THAT OFTEN ORIGINATE FROM CONTAMINATED WATER, FOOD (SUCH AS PORK), OR UNCOOKED EGGS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS PELVIC ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN RESOLVING SEVERE RECTAL DISCOMFORT, ITCHING, AND SYSTEMIC DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES LIKE SUBCUTANEOUS NODULES AND RASHES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR PREVENTING THE MIGRATION OF MICROFILARIAE TO THE EYES, WHICH CAN LEAD TO COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS CONJUNCTIVITIS, UVEITIS, OR POTENTIAL VISION LOSS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE ONCHOCERCA VOLVULUS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LOS HUESOS ISQUI\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE INFESTACIONES PARASITARIAS QUE A MENUDO SE ORIGINAN POR AGUA CONTAMINADA, ALIMENTOS (COMO EL CERDO) O HUEVOS CRUDOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A RESOLVER EL MALESTAR RECTAL SEVERO, LA PICAZ\\u00d3N Y LOS PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMO N\\u00d3DULOS SUBCUT\\u00c1NEOS Y ERUPCIONES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA PREVENIR LA MIGRACI\\u00d3N DE MICROFILARIAS HACIA LOS OJOS, LO QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A COMPLICACIONES COMO CONJUNCTIVITIS, UVE\\u00cdTIS O POSIBLE P\\u00c9RDIDA DE LA VISI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"OPHTHALMIC & DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF VISION CHANGES OR EYE INFLAMMATION OCCUR, SCAN THE [EYE \\/ EYE] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED IRRITATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC DIVERTICULA OR RECTAL BLEEDING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ISCHIAL RAMUS \\/ ISCHIAL RAMUS] (REF 413) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT SYNERGISTIC BACTERIAL ACTIVITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE ELIMINATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N OFT\\u00c1LMICA Y DIGESTIVA: SI OCURREN CAMBIOS EN LA VISI\\u00d3N O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N OCULAR, ESCANEAR EL EJE [OJO \\/ OJO] PARA ABORDAR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIVERT\\u00cdCULOS CR\\u00d3NICOS O SANGRADO RECTAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RAMA ISQUI\\u00c1TICA \\/ RAMA ISQUI\\u00c1TICA] (REF 413) PARA DESCARTAR ACTIVIDAD BACTERIANA SIN\\u00c9RGICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS Y ASEGURAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/405','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:37:13','2026-04-27 22:37:13'),(4202,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',406,'{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE, GINGIVITIS, LOW BACK PAIN. (ACN\\u00c9, GINGIVITIS, DOLOR EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA.)\",\"paths\":\"SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED DISEASE. (ENFERMEDAD DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - LUMBAR 4\\/LUMBAR4; ARTHRITIS (VERIFICAR - LUMBAR 4\\/LUMBAR 4; ARTRITIS)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE, GINGIVITIS, AND LOW BACK PAIN. (SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED DISEASE).\\n\\n(ACN\\u00c9, GINGIVITIS Y DOLOR EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA. ENFERMEDAD DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE MAXILLARY AND MANDIBULAR STRUCTURES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THIS BACTERIA OFTEN MANIFESTS WITH LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION IN THE ORAL CAVITY, SUCH AS GINGIVITIS, OR DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES LIKE ACNE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE JAW REGION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD THAT CAN CAUSE SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS, INCLUDING CHARACTERISTIC RADIATING LOW BACK PAIN. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING THE INFECTION AND PREVENTING THE SPREAD OF THIS SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED PATHOGEN TO THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM OR JOINTS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LAS ESTRUCTURAS MAXILARES Y MANDIBULARES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTA BACTERIA A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA CON INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA EN LA CAVIDAD ORAL, COMO GINGIVITIS, O PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS COMO EL ACN\\u00c9. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA QUE PUEDE CAUSAR COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS, INCLUYENDO EL DOLOR CARACTER\\u00cdSTICO QUE IRRADIA HACIA LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL HACIA EL SISTEMA UROGENITAL O LAS ARTICULACIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF LOW BACK PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUMBAR 4 \\/ LUMBAR 4] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL STRUCTURAL DISTORTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING JOINT PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH ARTHRITIS-RELATED RESONANCES, AS THIS BACTERIA CAN MIGRATE TO THE SYNOVIAL FLUID. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM THIS INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL DOLOR EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LUMBAR 4 \\/ LUMBAR 4] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES DISTORSIONES ESTRUCTURALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON RESONANCIAS RELACIONADAS CON LA ARTRITIS, YA QUE ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE MIGRAR AL L\\u00cdQUIDO SINOVIAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y ASEGURAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/406','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:38:24','2026-04-27 22:38:24'),(4203,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',407,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, RESPIRATORY, GASTROINTESTINAL AND NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS. (FIEBRE, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, GASTROINTESTINALES Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"DISTEMPER (MOQUILLO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, GASTROINTESTINAL ISSUES, AND NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA, PROBLEMAS GASTROINTESTINALES Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIRAL ACTIVITY OF MORBILLIVIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE JAW AND THE TONGUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING CONDITIONS TRADITIONALLY ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"DISTEMPER\\\" (MOQUILLO), WHICH CAN IMPACT MULTIPLE SYSTEMS SIMULTANEOUSLY. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ORAL-CRANIAL ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT OFTEN LEADS TO FEVER AND RESPIRATORY CONGESTION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR PREVENTING THE VIRUS FROM AFFECTING NEUROLOGICAL INTEGRITY AND FOR RESTORING PROPER DIGESTIVE AND RESPIRATORY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL DE MORBILLIVIRUS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA Y LA LENGUA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE CONDICIONES ASOCIADAS TRADICIONALMENTE CON EL \\\"MOQUILLO\\\", QUE PUEDEN AFECTAR VARIOS SISTEMAS SIMULT\\u00c1NEAMENTE. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N ORAL-CRANEAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A FIEBRE Y CONGESTI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA EVITAR QUE EL VIRUS AFECTE LA INTEGRIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y PARA RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y RESPIRATORIA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS OR COUGHING PERSIST, SCAN THE [INFRA AXILLARY \\/ INTRA AXILLARY] (REF 401) AXIS TO ADDRESS PLEURAL INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING NEUROLOGICAL DISORIENTATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION THROUGHOUT THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS O LA TOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [INFRAAXILAR \\/ INTRAAXILAR] (REF 401) PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PLEURAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y ASEGURAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE TODO EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/407','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:39:23','2026-04-27 22:39:23'),(4204,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',408,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL DYSFUNCTIONS. (DISFUNCIONES INTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE IRREGULARITY, BLOATING, GAS, AND ALTERED NUTRIENT ABSORPTION.\\n\\n(IRREGULARIDAD DIGESTIVA, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N, GASES Y ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES ALTERADA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES PRIMARY INTESTINAL DYSFUNCTIONS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS OF THE JEJUNUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR OPTIMIZING THE ABSORPTION OF NUTRIENTS AND THE PROPER BREAKDOWN OF FOOD WITHIN THE SMALL INTESTINE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RESTORING ENZYMATIC BALANCE AND PERISTALTIC EFFICIENCY. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESOLUTION OF CHRONIC DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT AND PROMOTES THE INTEGRITY OF THE INTESTINAL MUCOSA, WHICH IS VITAL FOR OVERALL METABOLIC HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LAS DISFUNCIONES INTESTINALES PRIMARIAS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DEL YEYUNO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA OPTIMIZAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y LA DESCOMPOSICI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS ALIMENTOS DENTRO DEL INTESTINO DELGADO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO ENZIM\\u00c1TICO Y LA EFICIENCIA PERIST\\u00c1LTICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DEL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO CR\\u00d3NICO Y PROMUEVE LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA MUCOSA INTESTINAL, QUE ES VITAL PARA LA SALUD METAB\\u00d3LICA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & ABSORPTION CHECK: IF BLOATING OR MALABSORPTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT EARLY-STAGE DIGESTIVE BLOCKAGES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SMALL INTESTINE \\/ SMALL INTESTINE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC NUTRIENT DISTRIBUTION DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N O LA MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DUODENO \\/ DUODENO] PARA DESCARTAR BLOQUEOS DIGESTIVOS EN ETAPAS TEMPRANAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [INTESTINO DELGADO \\/ INTESTINO DELGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA DISTRIBUCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE NUTRIENTES DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/408','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:40:25','2026-04-27 22:40:25'),(4205,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',409,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA (DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY WATER AND FOODS, ESPECIALLY UNCOOKED CHICKEN. INTESTINAL INFECTION. (TRANSMITIDO POR AGUA Y ALIMENTOS, ESPECIALMENTE POLLO CRUDO. INFECCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, FEVER, AND POTENTIAL GASTROINTESTINAL INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(DIARREA SEVERA, CALAMBRES ABDOMINALES, FIEBRE Y POSIBLE INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF CAMPYLOBACTER JEJUNI BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE JEJUNUM AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING INFECTIONS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED WATER OR UNDERCOOKED POULTRY. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD RESPONSIBLE FOR ACUTE ENTERITIS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF PROPER INTESTINAL ABSORPTION AND PREVENTS SYSTEMIC DEHYDRATION ASSOCIATED WITH PERSISTENT DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE CAMPYLOBACTER JEJUNI MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL YEYUNO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE INFECCIONES TRANSMITIDAS T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR AGUA CONTAMINADA O POLLO POCO COCIDO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA RESPONSABLE DE LA ENTERITIS AGUDA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL ADECUADA Y PREVIENE LA DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA ASOCIADA CON LA DIARREA PERSISTENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & RENAL CHECK: IF DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [JEJUNUM \\/ JEJUNUM] (REF 417) AXIS TO ADDRESS GENERAL INTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y RENAL: SI LA DIARREA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [YEYUNO \\/ YEYUNO] (REF 417) PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ABDOMINAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/409','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:41:27','2026-04-27 22:41:27'),(4206,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',410,'{\"symptoms\":\"ACUTE PAIN AND INFLAMMATION IN THE HIPS, KNEES, WRIST, ANKLES, ELBOW, FINGERS AND SPINE. (DOLOR AGUDO E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS CADERAS, RODILLAS, MU\\u00d1ECAS, TOBILLOS, CODO, DEDOS Y COLUMNA.)\",\"paths\":\"RHEUMATISM (REUMATISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACUTE PAIN AND INFLAMMATION IN THE HIPS, KNEES, WRIST, ANKLES, ELBOW, FINGERS AND SPINE.\\n\\n(DOLOR AGUDO E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS CADERAS, RODILLAS, MU\\u00d1ECAS, TOBILLOS, CODO, DEDOS Y COLUMNA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES MONO-ARTICULAR RHEUMATISM BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE AFFECTED JOINTS AND THE RIGHT INGUINAL NERVE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS COMPLEX PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR DIFFERENTIATING MECHANICAL JOINT PAIN FROM ACTIVE RHEUMATIC PROCESSES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING THE LOCALIZED INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE AFFECTING SYNOVIAL TISSUES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES MOBILITY AND SUPPORTS THE RECOVERY OF JOINT INTEGRITY IN THE HIPS, EXTREMITIES, AND SPINE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL REUMATISMO MONOARTICULAR MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LAS ARTICULACIONES AFECTADAS Y EL NERVIO INGUINAL DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR COMPLEJO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA DIFERENCIAR EL DOLOR ARTICULAR MEC\\u00c1NICO DE LOS PROCESOS REUM\\u00c1TICOS ACTIVOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA LOCALIZADA QUE AFECTA LOS TEJIDOS SINOVIALES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE LA MOVILIDAD Y APOYA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD ARTICULAR EN CADERAS, EXTREMIDADES Y COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & NERVE CHECK: IF ACUTE PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [INGUINAL NERVE \\/ INGUINAL NERVE] (REF 403) AXIS TO RULE OUT VIRAL INTERFERENCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC SPINE INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS OF INFLAMMATION AND SUPPORT SYSTEMIC BALANCE DURING THE RHEUMATIC RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y NERVIOSA: SI EL DOLOR AGUDO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [NERVIO INGUINAL \\/ NERVIO INGUINAL] (REF 403) PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIAS VIRALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DE LA COLUMNA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N REUM\\u00c1TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/410','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:43:40','2026-04-27 22:43:40'),(4207,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',411,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"JOINT PAIN (DOLOR ARTICULAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PATHOGEN RESERVOIR (RESERVORIO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"JOINT PAIN, STIFFNESS, AND RECURRING INFLAMMATORY DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(DOLOR ARTICULAR, RIGIDEZ Y MALESTAR INFLAMATORIO RECURRENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR FOR VARIOUS PATHOGENS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE JOINTS AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS RESERVOIR PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR IDENTIFYING WHERE VIRAL, BACTERIAL, OR OTHER MICROBIAL LOADS MAY REMAIN LATENT, PREVENTING THEM FROM CAUSING PERSISTENT JOINT PAIN OR RECOLONIZING THE SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS GLANDULAR-ARTICULAR CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING HIDDEN LOADS THAT OFTEN EVADE DETECTION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING CHRONIC PAIN THAT DOES NOT RESPOND TO LOCAL TREATMENT, AS IT TARGETS THE CENTRAL COORDINATION BETWEEN THE PITUITARY REGULATION AND PERIPHERAL TISSUES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LAS ARTICULACIONES Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR RESERVORIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA IDENTIFICAR D\\u00d3NDE LAS CARGAS VIRALES, BACTERIANAS U OTRAS CARGAS MICROBIANAS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES, EVITANDO QUE CAUSEN DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTENTE O RECOLONICEN EL SISTEMA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO GLANDULAR-ARTICULAR, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR CARGAS OCULTAS QUE A MENUDO EVADEN LA DETECCI\\u00d3N. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA TRATAR EL DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO QUE NO RESPONDE AL TRATAMIENTO LOCAL, YA QUE SE DIRIGE A LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N CENTRAL ENTRE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N PITUITARIA Y LOS TEJIDOS PERIF\\u00c9RICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO RULE OUT METABOLIC FACTORS AFFECTING CONNECTIVE TISSUE. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [JOINT \\/ INGUINAL NERVE] (REF 419) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL RHEUMATIC FACTORS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BYPRODUCTS OF PATHOGEN CLEARANCE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA DESCARTAR FACTORES METAB\\u00d3LICOS QUE AFECTEN EL TEJIDO CONECTIVO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N AGUDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ARTICULACI\\u00d3N \\/ NERVIO INGUINAL] (REF 419) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES FACTORES REUM\\u00c1TICOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/411','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:44:46','2026-04-27 22:44:46'),(4208,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',412,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"NON INFECTIOUS MONO -ARTICULAR RHEUMATISM. (REUMATISMO MONOARTICULAR NO INFECCIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NON-INFECTIOUS RHEUMATISM (REUMATISMO NO INFECCIOSO)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES NON-INFECTIOUS MONO-ARTICULAR RHEUMATISM BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE JOINTS AND THE SCAPULA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING INFLAMMATORY CONDITIONS THAT ARE NOT DRIVEN BY ACTIVE PATHOGENS BUT RATHER BY MECHANICAL OR BIOELECTRICAL IMBALANCES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING MUSCULAR SPASMS AND REFERRED ABDOMINAL PAIN THAT OFTEN COINCIDE WITH UPPER BACK AND SHOULDER TENSION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF JOINT MOBILITY AND REDUCES THE IRRITATION OF THE SURROUNDING SOFT TISSUES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL REUMATISMO MONOARTICULAR NO INFECCIOSO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LAS ARTICULACIONES Y LA ESC\\u00c1PULA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE CONDICIONES INFLAMATORIAS QUE NO SON IMPULSADAS POR PAT\\u00d3GENOS ACTIVOS, SINO POR DESEQUILIBRIOS MEC\\u00c1NICOS O BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LOS ESPASMOS MUSCULARES Y EL DOLOR ABDOMINAL REFERIDO QUE A MENUDO COINCIDEN CON LA TENSI\\u00d3N EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR DE LA ESPALDA Y EL HOMBRO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA MOVILIDAD ARTICULAR Y REDUCE LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS BLANDOS CIRCUNDANTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & MUSCULAR CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL SPASMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED MUSCULAR TENSION OR BACTERIAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE JOINT INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [JOINT \\/ INGUINAL NERVE] (REF 419) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS OF INFLAMMATION AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE STABILIZATION OF RHEUMATIC SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y MUSCULAR: SI LOS ESPASMOS ABDOMINALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] PARA ABORDAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR LOCALIZADA O RESERVORIOS BACTERIANOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR AGUDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ARTICULACI\\u00d3N \\/ NERVIO INGUINAL] (REF 419). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS REUM\\u00c1TICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/412','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 22:45:47','2026-04-27 22:45:47'),(4209,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',413,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, HEADACHES, DIZZINESS, AND VASCULAR TENSION.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, DOLORES DE CABEZA, MAREOS Y TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES VASCULAR DYNAMICS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE JUGULAR VEIN AND THE TEMPORAL REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING HYPERTENSION BY MODULATING THE BLOOD FLOW AND PRESSURE REGULATION MECHANISMS WITHIN THE CRANIAL AND CERVICAL VESSELS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RELIEVING VASCULAR CONSTRICTION AND IMPROVING VENOUS DRAINAGE FROM THE BRAIN. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN MAINTAINING STABLE BLOOD PRESSURE LEVELS AND REDUCING THE PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT ASSOCIATED WITH HYPERTENSIVE EPISODES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DIN\\u00c1MICA VASCULAR MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA VENA YUGULAR Y LA REGI\\u00d3N TEMPORAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N AL MODULAR LOS MECANISMOS DE FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO Y REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N DENTRO DE LOS VASOS CRANEALES Y CERVICALES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ALIVIAR LA CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y MEJORAR EL DRENAJE VENOSO DEL CEREBRO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN EL MANTENIMIENTO DE NIVELES ESTABLES DE PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL Y EN LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DEL MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO ASOCIADO CON LOS EPISODIOS HIPERTENSIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR & CARDIAC CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [CAROTID \\/ CAROTID] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT ARTERIAL REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC HEADACHES OR CIRCULATORY ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN REGULATING FLUID BALANCE AND SUPPORTING SYSTEMIC BLOOD PRESSURE STABILITY DURING THE REBALANCING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y CARD\\u00cdACA: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ CAR\\u00d3TIDA] PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLORES DE CABEZA CR\\u00d3NICOS O PROBLEMAS CIRCULATORIOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A REGULAR EL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REEQUILIBRIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/413','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 23:52:14','2026-04-27 23:52:14'),(4210,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',414,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FEARS (MIEDOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FEAR \\/ MIEDO\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP-SEATED FEARS, ANXIETY, APPREHENSION, AND POTENTIAL VISUAL DISTURBANCES LINKED TO EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(MIEDOS PROFUNDOS, ANSIEDAD, APRENSI\\u00d3N Y POSIBLES ALTERACIONES VISUALES VINCULADAS AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL CORE OF FEAR BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LEFT KIDNEY AND THE EYE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE KIDNEYS ARE OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE VITAL ENERGY AND THE EMOTION OF FEAR; THIS SPECIFIC CIRCUIT LINKS THAT RENAL ENERGY WITH THE VISUAL PERCEPTION OF THE EXTERNAL WORLD. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELEASING REPRESSED FEARS AND REDUCING THE PSYCHOSOMATIC IMPACT ON OCULAR HEALTH. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN OVERCOMING PHOBIAS AND CONSTANT STATES OF VIGILANCE, PROMOTING A SENSE OF SAFETY AND CLEARER PERCEPTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL N\\u00daCLEO EMOCIONAL DEL MIEDO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO Y EL OJO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS RI\\u00d1ONES SE ASOCIAN FRECUENTEMENTE CON LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL Y LA EMOCI\\u00d3N DEL MIEDO; ESTE CIRCUITO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO VINCULA ESA ENERG\\u00cdA RENAL CON LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N VISUAL DEL MUNDO EXTERIOR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR MIEDOS REPRIMIDOS Y A REDUCIR EL IMPACTO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO EN LA SALUD OCULAR. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA AL INDIVIDUO A SUPERAR FOBIAS Y ESTADOS CONSTANTES DE VIGILANCIA, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SEGURIDAD Y UNA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S CLARA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF DEEP ANXIETY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO STRENGTHEN OVERALL RENAL ENERGY AND ADDRESS SYSTEMIC FEAR. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC STRESS AFFECTING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 365) RESONANCE TO ANCHOR THE ROOT CHAKRA CONNECTION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BIOCHEMICAL BYPRODUCTS OF ADRENALINE AND CORTISOL RELEASED DURING PROLONGED STATES OF FEAR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA ANSIEDAD PROFUNDA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA FORTALECER LA ENERG\\u00cdA RENAL GENERAL Y ABORDAR EL MIEDO SIST\\u00c9MICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO QUE AFECTE AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 365) PARA ANCLAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N CON EL CHAKRA RA\\u00cdZ. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DE LA ADRENALINA Y EL CORTISOL LIBERADOS DURANTE ESTADOS PROLONGADOS DE MIEDO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/414','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 23:53:33','2026-04-27 23:53:33'),(4211,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',415,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RENAL FUNCTION DISORDERS. (TRASTORNOS DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HIV - CAN HIDE IN THIS PAIR. (TRASTORNOS DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"RENAL DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"RENAL FUNCTION DISORDERS, ALTERED FILTRATION, AND POTENTIAL METABOLIC IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL, ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y POSIBLES DESEQUILIBRIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES PRIMARY DISORDERS OF RENAL FUNCTION BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS OF THE LEFT KIDNEY IN RELATION TO THE RENAL SYSTEM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RESTORING THE FILTRATION CAPACITY AND ELECTROLYTE BALANCE OF THE KIDNEYS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN OPTIMIZING URINARY OUTPUT AND REDUCING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR SUPPORTING THE KIDNEYS\' ABILITY TO REGULATE BLOOD PRESSURE AND MAINTAIN THE HOMEOSTASIS OF THE INTERNAL ENVIRONMENT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LOS TRASTORNOS PRIMARIOS DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DEL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON EL SISTEMA RENAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESTAURAR LA CAPACIDAD DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y EL EQUILIBRIO ELECTROL\\u00cdTICO DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A OPTIMIZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N URINARIA Y A REDUCIR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA APOYAR LA CAPACIDAD DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES PARA REGULAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL Y MANTENER LA HOMEOSTASIS DEL MEDIO INTERNO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN & SYSTEMIC CHECK: BE AWARE THAT HIV CAN FREQUENTLY HIDE IN THIS SPECIFIC PAIR; SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ RECTUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT ACTIVE VIRAL ACTIVITY. IF RENAL DISFUNCTION PERSISTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT OVERALL RENAL VITALITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC WASTE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE REBALANCING OF RENAL FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: TENGA EN CUENTA QUE EL VIH PUEDE ESCONDERSE CON FRECUENCIA EN ESTE PAR ESPEC\\u00cdFICO; ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ RECTO] PARA DESCARTAR ACTIVIDAD VIRAL ACTIVA. SI LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL PERSISTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA VITALIDAD RENAL GENERAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL REEQUILIBRIO DE LAS FUNCIONES RENALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/415','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 23:54:40','2026-04-27 23:54:40'),(4212,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',416,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FEARS (MIEDOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FEAR \\/ MIEDO\",\"symptoms\":\"APPREHENSION, EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGES, ANXIETY, AND METABOLIC FLUCTUATIONS LINKED TO STRESS.\\n\\n(APRENSI\\u00d3N, BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES, ANSIEDAD Y FLUCTUACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS VINCULADAS AL ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE INTERACTION BETWEEN ADRENAL VITALITY AND METABOLIC REGULATION BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LEFT KIDNEY AND THE THYROID GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR RELEASING REPRESSED FEARS THAT DIRECTLY IMPACT THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING THE PSYCHOSOMATIC LOAD THAT CAN DISRUPT THYROID FUNCTION, PROMOTING A STATE OF EMOTIONAL STABILITY AND CALM. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN PROCESSING EXTERNAL THREATS WITHOUT TRIGGERING A PROLONGED HORMONAL STRESS RESPONSE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA VITALIDAD ADRENAL Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR MIEDOS REPRIMIDOS QUE IMPACTAN DIRECTAMENTE EN EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA CARGA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA QUE PUEDE ALTERAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N TIROIDEA, PROMOVIENDO UN ESTADO DE ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y CALMA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE AMENAZAS EXTERNAS SIN DESENCADENAR UNA RESPUESTA DE ESTR\\u00c9S HORMONAL PROLONGADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF METABOLIC FATIGUE OR PERSISTENT ANXIETY CONTINUES, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO STRENGTHEN OVERALL RENAL ENERGY. FOR CASES INVOLVING COMMUNICATION DIFFICULTIES LINKED TO FEAR, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT THE THROAT CHAKRA. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BIOCHEMICAL BYPRODUCTS OF PROLONGED EMOTIONAL STRESS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC BALANCE DURING THE CLEARING OF REPRESSED FEARS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y GLANDULAR: SI LA FATIGA METAB\\u00d3LICA O LA ANSIEDAD PERSISTENTE CONTIN\\u00daAN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA FORTALECER LA ENERG\\u00cdA RENAL GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIFICULTADES DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N VINCULADAS AL MIEDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA APOYAR EL CHAKRA DE LA GARGANTA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL PROLONGADO Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE MIEDOS REPRIMIDOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/416','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 23:55:48','2026-04-27 23:55:48'),(4213,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',417,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RELIEVES FEVERS. (ALIVIA LAS FIEBRES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FEVER REDUCTION (REDUCCI\\u00d3N DE FIEBRE)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, THERMAL IMBALANCE, AND GENERAL DISCOMFORT ASSOCIATED WITH HIGH TEMPERATURES.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DESEQUILIBRIO T\\u00c9RMICO Y MALESTAR GENERAL ASOCIADO CON ALTAS TEMPERATURAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC THERMOREGULATION BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS WITHIN THE RENAL SYSTEM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RELIEVING FEVERS REGARDLESS OF THEIR ETIOLOGY, ACTING AS A NATURAL THERMOSTAT FOR THE BODY. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE KIDNEYS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN DISSIPATING EXCESS HEAT AND RESTORING THERMAL HOMEOSTASIS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR PROVIDING RELIEF DURING INFECTIOUS PROCESSES OR INFLAMMATORY CRISES WHERE THE TEMPERATURE REGULATION MECHANISM HAS BEEN OVERWHELMED.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA TERMORREGULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DENTRO DEL SISTEMA RENAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ALIVIAR LAS FIEBRES INDEPENDIENTEMENTE DE SU ETIOLOG\\u00cdA, ACTUANDO COMO UN TERMOSTATO NATURAL PARA EL CUERPO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A DISIPAR EL EXCESO DE CALOR Y A RESTAURAR LA HOMEOSTASIS T\\u00c9RMICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA BRINDAR ALIVIO DURANTE PROCESOS INFECCIOSOS O CRISIS INFLAMATORIAS DONDE EL MECANISMO DE REGULACI\\u00d3N DE TEMPERATURA SE HA VISTO SUPERADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF FEVER PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO RULE OUT DIRECT RENAL PATHOGENS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE INFECTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ RECTUM] RESONANCE TO ASSESS THE IMMUNE RESPONSE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS OF THE FEVER AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY PERIOD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA FIEBRE PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA DESCARTAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS RENALES DIRECTOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ RECTO] PARA EVALUAR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE LA FIEBRE Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL PERIODO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/417','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 23:56:55','2026-04-27 23:56:55'),(4214,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',418,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MALARIA\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"MALARIA (PALUDISMO), HIGH FEVER, CHILLS, SWEATING, HEADACHE, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(MALARIA (PALUDISMO), FIEBRE ALTA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, SUDORACI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF PLASMODIUM VIVAX BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE OPPOSITE KIDNEY AND THE PARANASAL CAVITY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE SYSTEMIC IMPACT OF MALARIA, AS THE PARASITE OFTEN USES THESE AREAS TO DISTORT THE BODY\'S THERMOREGULATION AND PH LEVELS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PROTOZOAN LOAD RESPONSIBLE FOR RECURRING FEVER SPIKES AND ANEMIA. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING THE INFECTION FROM THE BLOODSTREAM AND SUPPORTING THE RECOVERY OF RENAL AND RESPIRATORY INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE PLASMODIUM VIVAX MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N OPUESTO Y LA CAVIDAD PARANASAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DEL IMPACTO SIST\\u00c9MICO DE LA MALARIA, YA QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO A MENUDO UTILIZA ESTAS \\u00c1REAS PARA DISTORSIONAR LA TERMORREGULACI\\u00d3N Y LOS NIVELES DE PH DEL CUERPO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA DE PROTOZOARIOS RESPONSABLE DE LOS PICOS DE FIEBRE RECURRENTES Y LA ANEMIA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD RENAL Y RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & THERMIC CHECK: IF HIGH FEVERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [KIDNEY - NEG \\/ KIDNEY - NEG] (REF 426) AXIS TO ASSIST IN TEMPERATURE REDUCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANEMIA OR FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT RED BLOOD CELL RECOVERY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN FILTERING PATHOGENS FROM THE BLOOD AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC IMMUNE DEFENSE DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THE PARASITE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y T\\u00c9RMICA: SI LAS FIEBRES ALTAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - NEG \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - NEG] (REF 426) PARA AYUDAR EN LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DE LA TEMPERATURA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANEMIA SEVERA O FATIGA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [BAZO \\/ BAZO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A FILTRAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE LA SANGRE Y APOYAR LA DEFENSA INMUNITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/418','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 23:57:54','2026-04-27 23:57:54'),(4215,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',419,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HYPERGLYCEMIA,MALAISE, CONFUSION, INCREASED APPETITE, EXCESSIVE URINATION, THIRST AND WEIGHT LOSS. (HIPERGLUCEMIA, MALESTAR, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, AUMENTO DEL APETITO, ORINACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA, SED Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRUE DIABETES MELLITUS. (DIABETES MELLITUS VERDADERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION;THE DIABETIC PATIENT WHOM TAKES INSULIN, HAS TO BE VERY CAREFUL, IN THAT THE SESSION MAY VARY ONES NEED TO ADJUST THEIR DOSAGE AS NEEDED AFTER A SESSION. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N; EL PACIENTE DIAB\\u00c9TICO QUE TOMA INSULINA DEBE TENER MUCHO CUIDADO, YA QUE LA SESI\\u00d3N PUEDE VARIAR Y ES POSIBLE QUE NECESITE AJUSTAR SU DOSIS SEG\\u00daN SEA NECESARIO DESPU\\u00c9S DE UNA SESI\\u00d3N.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"DIABETES MELLITUS\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERGLYCEMIA, MALAISE, CONFUSION, INCREASED APPETITE, EXCESSIVE URINATION, THIRST, AND WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(HIPERGLUCEMIA, MALESTAR, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, AUMENTO DEL APETITO, MICCI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA, SED Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL IMBALANCE ASSOCIATED WITH TRUE DIABETES MELLITUS BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE RIGHT KIDNEY AND THE DUODENUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS COMPLEX PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING GLUCOSE METABOLISM AND SUPPORTING THE ENDOCRINE COHESION BETWEEN RENAL FILTRATION AND INTESTINAL ABSORPTION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN MANAGING BLOOD SUGAR LEVELS AND REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC STRAIN THAT LEADS TO CHARACTERISTIC SYMPTOMS LIKE POLYURIA AND POLYDIPSIA. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR PROMOTING METABOLIC STABILITY AND MITIGATING THE CHRONIC FATIGUE ASSOCIATED WITH INSULIN DYSREGULATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ASOCIADO CON LA DIABETES MELLITUS VERDADERA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO Y EL DUODENO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR COMPLEJO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR EL METABOLISMO DE LA GLUCOSA Y APOYAR LA COHESI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA ENTRE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A MANEJAR LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE Y A REDUCIR EL DESGASTE SIST\\u00c9MICO QUE CONDUCE A S\\u00cdNTOMAS CARACTER\\u00cdSTICOS COMO LA POLIURIA Y LA POLIDIPSIA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA PROMOVER LA ESTABILIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA Y MITIGAR LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA ASOCIADA CON LA DESREGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA INSULINA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: PATIENTS REQUIRING INSULIN MUST MONITOR THEIR LEVELS CLOSELY, AS MAGNET THERAPY SESSIONS MAY ALTER THE BODY\'S IMMEDIATE NEED FOR MEDICATION ADJUSTMENTS. IF HYPERGLYCEMIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT INSULIN PRODUCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING GLYCOGEN STORES AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC METABOLIC BALANCE DURING THE STABILIZATION OF BLOOD SUGAR LEVELS.\\n\\n(PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: LOS PACIENTES QUE REQUIEREN INSULINA DEBEN MONITOREAR SUS NIVELES DE CERCA, YA QUE LAS SESIONES DE TERAPIA CON IMANES PUEDEN ALTERAR LA NECESIDAD INMEDIATA DEL CUERPO DE AJUSTAR LA MEDICACI\\u00d3N. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE HIPERGLUCEMIA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] PARA ABORDAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DIRECTA DE INSULINA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [DUODENO \\/ DUODENO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS RESERVAS DE GLUC\\u00d3GENO Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/419','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-27 23:59:07','2026-04-27 23:59:07'),(4216,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',420,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE STIFFNESS, TREMORS, SPASMS, JERKING, TWITCHING, MENTAL CONFUSION, FEVER, WEAKNESS, COLD EXTREMITIES, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, ACUTE COLD, BACK PAIN, RAPID HEARTBEAT, RINGING IN THE EARS, URINE IN BLOOD. (CLOSTRIDIUM TETANI\\nRIGIDEZ MUSCULAR, TEMBLORES, ESPASMOS, SACUDIDAS, CONTRACCIONES, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FIEBRE, DEBILIDAD, EXTREMIDADES FR\\u00cdAS, INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, RESFRIADO AGUDO, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, LATIDO CARD\\u00cdACO R\\u00c1PIDO, ZUMBIDO EN LOS O\\u00cdDOS, SANGRE EN LA ORINA.)\",\"paths\":\"SPREAD BY OPEN WOUNDS FROM CONTAMINATED METAL OXIDES. TETANUS, EDEMA, KIDNEY DISEASE, AND NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. METASTASIS. (SE PROPAGA POR HERIDAS ABIERTAS A PARTIR DE \\u00d3XIDOS MET\\u00c1LICOS CONTAMINADOS. T\\u00c9TANOS, EDEMA, ENFERMEDAD RENAL Y S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. MET\\u00c1STASIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH A BITE; KIDNEY=ADRENAL=CEREBELLUM AT THE SAME TIME.     ASSOCIATED WITH SCAPULA; GANGRENE ASSOCIATED WITH URETER; STIMULATES A HERNIATED DISC. ASSOCIATED WITH CEREBELLUM; FALSE PARKINSON\'S AND EPILEPSY (ASOCIADO CON UNA MORDEDURA; RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N = SUPRARRENAL = CEREBELO AL MISMO TIEMPO. ASOCIADO CON LA ESC\\u00c1PULA; GANGRENA. ASOCIADO CON EL UR\\u00c9TER; ESTIMULA UNA HERNIA DISCAL. ASOCIADO CON EL CEREBELO; FALSO PARKINSON Y EPILEPSIA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE STIFFNESS, TREMORS, SPASMS, JERKING, TWITCHING, MENTAL CONFUSION, FEVER, WEAKNESS, COLD EXTREMITIES, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, ACUTE COLD, BACK PAIN, RAPID HEARTBEAT, RINGING IN THE EARS, AND URINE IN BLOOD.(RIGIDEZ MUSCULAR, TEMBLORES, ESPASMOS, SACUDIDAS, CONTRACCIONES, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FIEBRE, DEBILIDAD, EXTREMIDADES FR\\u00cdAS, INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, RESFRIADO AGUDO, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, LATIDO CARD\\u00cdACO R\\u00c1PIDO, ZUMBIDO EN LOS O\\u00cdDOS Y SANGRE EN LA ORINA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF CLOSTRIDIUM TETANI BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE RIGHT AND LEFT KIDNEYS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING INFECTIONS OFTEN SPREAD THROUGH OPEN WOUNDS CONTAMINATED BY METAL OXIDES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS RENAL ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD RESPONSIBLE FOR TETANUS, EDEMA, AND NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR PREVENTING THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF TOXINS THAT CAUSE SEVERE MUSCLE SPASMS AND NEUROLOGICAL CONFUSION, WHILE SUPPORTING OVERALL KIDNEY FILTRATION AND METASTASIS PREVENTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE CLOSTRIDIUM TETANI MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES DERECHO E IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE INFECCIONES A MENUDO PROPAGADAS POR HERIDAS ABIERTAS CONTAMINADAS CON \\u00d3XIDOS MET\\u00c1LICOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N RENAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA RESPONSABLE DEL T\\u00c9TANOS, EL EDEMA Y EL S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE TOXINAS QUE CAUSAN ESPASMOS MUSCULARES SEVEROS Y CONFUSI\\u00d3N NEUROLOGICA, MIENTRAS SE APOYA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL GENERAL Y LA PREVENCI\\u00d3N DE MET\\u00c1STASIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF FALSE PARKINSON\\u2019S OR EPILEPSY SYMPTOMS OCCUR, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ CEREBELLUM] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING GANGRENE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ SCAPULA] RESONANCE. IF SYMPTOMS MIMIC A HERNIATED DISC, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ URETER] ALIGNMENT. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM TETANUS-RELATED ACTIVITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI OCURREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE FALSO PARKINSON O EPILEPSIA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ CEREBELO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN GANGRENA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA]. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS IMITAN UNA HERNIA DISCAL, ESCANEAR LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ UR\\u00c9TER]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA ACTIVIDAD RELACIONADA CON EL T\\u00c9TANOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/420','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:00:20','2026-04-28 00:00:20'),(4217,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',421,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANGER, AGGRESSIVENESS, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS DUE TO LIVER PROBLEMS. GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS, UROGENITAL DISORDERS. HIV (IRA, AGRESIVIDAD, TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DEBIDO A PROBLEMAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS, TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES. VIH)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANGER, AGGRESSIVENESS, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS DUE TO LIVER PROBLEMS. GASTROINTESTINAL, RESPIRATORY, AND UROGENITAL DISORDERS. HIV.\\n\\n(IRA, AGRESIVIDAD, TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DEBIDO A PROBLEMAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES, RESPIRATORIOS Y UROGENITALES. VIH.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL AND PSYCHOSOMATIC AXIS OF THE RENAL SYSTEM BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL GRADIENT BETWEEN THE SUPERIOR AND INFERIOR POLES OF THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR MODULATING INTENSE EMOTIONAL STATES SUCH AS ANGER AND AGGRESSION, WHICH ARE OFTEN LINKED TO HEPATIC OVERLOAD OR RENAL STRESS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS INTRA-RENAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RESOLVING MULTISYSTEMIC DISORDERS THAT MANIFEST IN THE GASTROINTESTINAL, RESPIRATORY, AND UROGENITAL TRACTS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING EMOTIONAL EQUILIBRIUM AND SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM, PARTICULARLY IN CASES WHERE VIRAL LOADS LIKE HIV MAY BE EXACERBATING PSYCHOSOMATIC FRAGILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL EJE EMOCIONAL Y PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO DEL SISTEMA RENAL MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL GRADIENTE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LOS POLOS SUPERIOR E INFERIOR DEL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MODULAR ESTADOS EMOCIONALES INTENSOS COMO LA IRA Y LA AGRESIVIDAD, QUE A MENUDO EST\\u00c1N VINCULADOS A LA SOBRECARGA HEP\\u00c1TICA O AL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO INTRARRENAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESOLVER TRASTORNOS MULTISIST\\u00c9MICOS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN EN LOS TRACTOS GASTROINTESTINAL, RESPIRATORIO Y UROGENITAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO, PARTICULARMENTE EN CASOS DONDE LAS CARGAS VIRALES COMO EL VIH PUEDEN ESTAR EXACERBANDO LA FRAGILIDAD PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & HEPATIC CHECK: IF AGGRESSION OR ANGER PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE BIOLOGICAL SOURCE OF IRRITABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 439) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS THE PSYCHOSOMATIC LINK TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [THYMUS \\/ RECTUM] CIRCUIT IF VIRAL ACTIVITY IS SUSPECTED, TO ASSIST THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN MAINTAINING SYSTEMIC DEFENSE DURING THE CLEARING OF EMOTIONAL AND PATHOGENIC LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y HEP\\u00c1TICA: SI LA AGRESI\\u00d3N O LA IRA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR LA FUENTE BIOL\\u00d3GICA DE LA IRRITABILIDAD. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISFUNCI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 439) PARA TRATAR EL V\\u00cdNCULO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO CON EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [TIMO \\/ RECTO] SI SE SOSPECHA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL, PARA AYUDAR AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A MANTENER LA DEFENSA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS EMOCIONALES Y PATOG\\u00c9NICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/421','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:01:32','2026-04-28 00:01:32'),(4218,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',422,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH NIOSES, GAS, DISORDERS DUE TO KIDNEYS, INTESTINAL BLEEDING, PERSPIRATION. (RUIDOS ESTOMACALES, GASES, TRASTORNOS DEBIDOS A LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, SANGRADO INTESTINAL, SUDORACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"STOMACH NIOSES, GAS, DISORDERS DUE TO KIDNEYS, INTESTINAL BLEEDING, PERSPIRATION. (RUIDOS ESTOMACALES, GASES, TRASTORNOS DEBIDOS A LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, SANGRADO INTESTINAL, SUDORACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL & RENAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH NOISES, GAS, DISORDERS DUE TO KIDNEY DYSFUNCTION, INTESTINAL BLEEDING, AND EXCESSIVE PERSPIRATION.\\n\\n(RUIDOS ESTOMACALES, GASES, TRASTORNOS DEBIDOS A LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, SANGRADO INTESTINAL Y SUDORACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL COHESION BETWEEN THE RENAL SYSTEM AND THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN BOTH KIDNEYS AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL COMPLEX CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING SYMPTOMS THAT LINK RENAL STRESS WITH INTESTINAL DISORDERS, SUCH AS BORBORYGMUS (STOMACH NOISES) AND GAS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CONTROLLING INTESTINAL BLEEDING AND REGULATING ABNORMAL PERSPIRATION PATTERNS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN COORDINATING PROPER ELIMINATION AND REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC STRAIN CAUSED BY RENAL-DIGESTIVE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA COHESI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE EL SISTEMA RENAL Y EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE AMBOS RI\\u00d1ONES Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO COMPLEJO ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE VINCULAN EL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL CON TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, COMO LOS BORBORIGMOS (RUIDOS ESTOMACALES) Y GASES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A CONTROLAR EL SANGRADO INTESTINAL Y A REGULAR LOS PATRONES DE SUDORACI\\u00d3N ANORMAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO EN LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N DE UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA Y EN LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DEL DESGASTE SIST\\u00c9MICO CAUSADO POR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS RENAL-DIGESTIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INTESTINAL & RENAL CHECK: IF INTESTINAL BLEEDING OR SEVERE GAS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT SPECIFIC PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC PERSPIRATION ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC RENAL STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC WASTE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE STABILIZATION OF DIGESTIVE AND RENAL FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y RENAL: SI EL SANGRADO INTESTINAL O LOS GASES SEVEROS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS CR\\u00d3NICOS DE SUDORACI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA ABORDAR LA ESTABILIDAD RENAL SIST\\u00c9MICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES DIGESTIVAS Y RENALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/422','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:02:48','2026-04-28 00:02:48'),(4219,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',423,'{\"symptoms\":\"NIGHT SWEATS, NOCTURNAL FEVER, BODY ACHES, CHILLS, SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISORDER. (SUDORACIONES NOCTURNAS, FIEBRE NOCTURNA, DOLORES CORPORALES, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, TRASTORNO DIGESTIVO GRAVE.)\",\"paths\":\"MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, ARTHRITIS. (MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, ARTRITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/DESCENDING COLON                       CHECK - INFERIOR MAXILLARY\\/INFERIOR MAXILLARY               CHECK - APPENDIX\\/PLEURA                      CHECK - PERICARDIUM\\/PERICARDIUM              CHECK - SUBCLAVIAN\\/SUBCLAVIAN         CHECK - EYELID\\/EYELID                           CHECK - CERVICAL PLEXUS\\/POPLITEAL FOSSA (VERIFICAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/COLON DESCENDENTE                       VERIFICAR - MAXILAR INFERIOR\\/MAXILAR INFERIOR               VERIFICAR - AP\\u00c9NDICE\\/PLEURA                      VERIFICAR - PERICARDIO\\/PERICARDIO              VERIFICAR - SUBCLAVIO\\/SUBCLAVIO         VERIFICAR - P\\u00c1RPADO\\/P\\u00c1RPADO                           VERIFICAR - PLEXO CERVICAL\\/FOSA POPL\\u00cdTEA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"NIGHT SWEATS, NOCTURNAL FEVER, BODY ACHES, CHILLS, AND SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISORDER.\\n\\n(SUDORACIONES NOCTURNAS, FIEBRE NOCTURNA, DOLORES CORPORALES, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS Y TRASTORNO DIGESTIVO GRAVE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES the PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF PLASMODIUM VIVAX AND FALCIPORUM BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE OPPOSITE CHEEKBONE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE SYSTEMIC EFFECTS OF MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, AND ARTHRITIS, AS THESE PARASITES OFTEN DISTORT PH LEVELS IN BOTH THE RENAL AND CRANIOFACIAL SYSTEMS. BY NEUTRALIZING THESE DISTORTIONS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PROTOZOAN LOAD RESPONSIBLE FOR CHRONIC BODY PAIN AND RECURRING NOCTURNAL FEVERS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE BODY IN RESOLVING INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES THAT MIMIC AUTOIMMUNE CONDITIONS AND RESTORES PROPER METABOLIC AND DIGESTIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE PLASMODIUM VIVAX Y FALCIPORUM MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y EL P\\u00d3MULO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LOS EFECTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS DE LA MALARIA, LA FIBROMIALGIA Y LA ARTRITIS, YA QUE ESTOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS A MENUDO DISTORSIONAN LOS NIVELES DE PH TANTO EN EL SISTEMA RENAL COMO EN EL CRANEOFACIAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR ESTAS DISTORSIONES, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA DE PROTOZOARIOS RESPONSABLE DEL DOLOR CORPORAL CR\\u00d3NICO Y LAS FIEBRES NOCTURNAS RECURRENTES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA AL CUERPO EN LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS QUE IMITAN CONDICIONES AUTOINMUNES Y RESTAURA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y DIGESTIVA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC PATHOGEN CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [DESCENDING COLON \\/ DESCENDING COLON] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FACIAL OR DENTAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [INFERIOR MAXILLARY \\/ INFERIOR MAXILLARY] RESONANCE. MONITOR THE [APPENDIX \\/ PLEURA] AND [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] CIRCUITS TO RULE OUT ADDITIONAL PATHOGENIC LOADS. ALWAYS CHECK THE [SUBCLAVIAN \\/ SUBCLAVIAN], [EYELID \\/ EYELID], AND [CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ POPLITEAL FOSSA] ALIGNMENTS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC CLEARANCE DURING THE RECOVERY FROM PARASITIC INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR FACIAL O DENTAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MAXILAR INFERIOR \\/ MAXILAR INFERIOR]. MONITOREAR LOS CIRCUITOS [AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ PLEURA] Y [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO] PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS ADICIONALES. SIEMPRE VERIFICAR LAS ALINEACIONES [SUBCLAVIO \\/ SUBCLAVIO], [P\\u00c1RPADO \\/ P\\u00c1RPADO] Y [PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ FOSA POPL\\u00cdTEA] PARA ASEGURAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/423','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:03:52','2026-04-28 00:03:52'),(4220,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',424,'{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE, BOILS, MOTOR FUNCTION DISORDERS, SKIN DISORDERS. (ACN\\u00c9, FOR\\u00daNCULOS, TRASTORNOS DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA, TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITO. EPILEPTIC SEIZURES, ALOPECIA. (TRANSMITIDO POR MOSQUITOS. CONVULSIONES EPIL\\u00c9PTICAS, ALOPECIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE, BOILS, MOTOR FUNCTION DISORDERS, SKIN DISORDERS, EPILEPTIC SEIZURES, AND ALOPECIA.\\n\\n(ACN\\u00c9, FOR\\u00daNCULOS, TRASTORNOS DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA, TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL, CONVULSIONES EPIL\\u00c9PTICAS Y ALOPECIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF LEISHMANIA BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE DELTOID MUSCLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING PARASITIC INFECTIONS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITO BITES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PROTOZOAN LOAD RESPONSIBLE FOR CUTANEOUS LESIONS, SUCH AS BOILS AND SEVERE ACNE, AS WELL AS SYSTEMIC NEUROLOGICAL INTERFERENCES LIKE SEIZURES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF SKIN INTEGRITY AND PROPER MOTOR FUNCTION REGULATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE LEISHMANIA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y EL M\\u00daSCULO DELTOIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE INFECCIONES PARASITARIAS T\\u00cdPICAMENTE TRANSMITIDAS POR PICADURAS DE MOSQUITOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA DE PROTOZOARIOS RESPONSABLE DE LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, COMO FOR\\u00daNCULOS Y ACN\\u00c9 SEVERO, AS\\u00cd COMO INTERFERENCIAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMO CONVULSIONES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA PIEL Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMATOLOGICAL & NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF SKIN DISORDERS OR ALOPECIA PERSIST, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ CHEEKBONE] (REF 432) AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER PARASITIC LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING MOTOR DYSFUNCTION OR SEIZURES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 365) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS OF THE PARASITIC CLEARANCE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL O LA ALOPECIA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ P\\u00d3MULO] (REF 432) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CARGAS PARASITARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA O CONVULSIONES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 365). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/424','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:06:38','2026-04-28 00:06:38'),(4221,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',425,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"IMMUNE SYSTEM DEFICIENCY. (DEFICIENCIA DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNE SYSTEM DEFICIENCY, INCREASED SUSCEPTIBILITY TO INFECTIONS, AND LOW ENERGY LEVELS.\\n\\n(DEFICIENCIA DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO, MAYOR SUSCEPTIBILIDAD A INFECCIONES Y BAJOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE OPTIMIZATION OF THE IMMUNE RESPONSE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS OF THE KIDNEY IN A VERTICAL ALIGNMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR REBALANCING THE FILTRATION AND ENERGY REGULATION FUNCTIONS THAT SUPPORT THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS THROUGH THIS VERTICAL POLARITY, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN OVERCOMING STATES OF IMMUNE DEFICIENCY. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE VITALITY OF THE RENAL SYSTEM, WHICH IS ESSENTIAL FOR MAINTAINING THE INTEGRITY OF THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AND OVERALL SYSTEMIC RESILIENCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA OPTIMIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DEL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REEQUILIBRAR LAS FUNCIONES DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y REGULACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE SUSTENTAN LAS DEFENSAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH MEDIANTE ESTA POLARIDAD VERTICAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A SUPERAR ESTADOS DE DEFICIENCIA INMUNITARIA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA VITALIDAD DEL SISTEMA RENAL, QUE ES ESENCIAL PARA MANTENER LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA RESPUESTA INMUNE Y LA RESILIENCIA SIST\\u00c9MICA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE & RENAL CHECK: IF IMMUNE DEFICIENCY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT GLANDULAR REGULATION OF T-CELLS. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE INFECTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ RECTUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ENSURE OVERALL RENAL STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO CLEAR TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNE Y RENAL: SI LA DEFICIENCIA INMUNITARIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ TIMO] PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR DIRECTA DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS T. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES AGUDAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ RECTO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD RENAL GENERAL Y APOYAR LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA ELIMINAR TOXINAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/425','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:07:53','2026-04-28 00:07:53'),(4222,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',426,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RENAL DYSFUNCTIONS (DISFUNCIONES RENALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - THYMUS\\/RECTUM             CHECK - INDEX FINGERS (VERIFICAR - TIMO\\/RECTO             VERIFICAR - DEDOS \\u00cdNDICE)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RENAL DYSFUNCTION, POTENTIAL IMMUNE SYSTEM FRAGILITY, AND ASYMPTOMATIC PATHOGEN STORAGE.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL, POSIBLE FRAGILIDAD DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y ALMACENAMIENTO ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A SPECIFIC RESERVOIR FOR THE HIV VIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND ITS OWN RENAL CAPSULE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL BECAUSE PATHOGENS CAN REMAIN LATENT IN THE CAPSULAR TISSUE, EVADING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND CAUSING PERSISTENT RENAL DYSFUNCTIONS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS LOCALIZED AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN IDENTIFYING AND ELIMINATING VIRAL LOADS THAT MAY RECOLONIZE THE SYSTEM. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING THE RESERVOIR AND RESTORING THE FUNCTIONAL INTEGRITY OF THE RENAL FILTRATION SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA EL VIRUS DEL VIH MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y SU PROPIA C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES EN EL TEJIDO CAPSULAR, EVADIENDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y CAUSANDO DISFUNCIONES RENALES PERSISTENTES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA \\u00c1REA LOCALIZADA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A IDENTIFICAR Y ELIMINAR CARGAS VIRALES QUE PODR\\u00cdAN RECOLONIZAR EL SISTEMA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA DEPURAR EL RESERVORIO Y RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD FUNCIONAL DEL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF VIRAL ACTIVITY IS SUSPECTED, MANDATORY SCAN OF THE [THYMUS \\/ RECTUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE ACTIVE VIRAL LOAD. CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [INDEX FINGERS \\/ INDEX FINGERS] ALIGNMENT TO IDENTIFY OTHER POTENTIAL HIV RESERVOIRS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC IMMUNE DEFENSE DURING THE CLEARING OF THE RENAL RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI SE SOSPECHA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL, ESCANEO MANDATORIO DEL EJE [TIMO \\/ RECTO] PARA ABORDAR LA CARGA VIRAL ACTIVA. REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N [DEDOS \\u00cdNDICE \\/ DEDOS \\u00cdNDICE] PARA IDENTIFICAR OTROS POSIBLES RESERVORIOS DE VIH. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA DEFENSA INMUNITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DEL RESERVORIO RENAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/426','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:08:55','2026-04-28 00:08:55'),(4223,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',427,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL GAS AND NOISES. (GASES Y RUIDOS INTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL & RENAL DYNAMICS (DIN\\u00c1MICA INTESTINAL Y RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL GAS, STOMACH NOISES (BORBORYGMUS), AND DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(GASES INTESTINALES, RUIDOS ESTOMACALES (BORBORIGMOS) Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE RENAL FILTRATION SYSTEM AND THE LOWER GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE OPPOSITE SACRAL REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE AUTONOMIC SIGNALS THAT GOVERN INTESTINAL MOTILITY AND GAS ELIMINATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CROSS-BODY ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING EXCESSIVE FLATULENCE AND THE AUDIBLE \\\"RUMBLING\\\" OF THE ABDOMEN. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE PROPER BALANCE OF FLUIDS AND PRESSURE WITHIN THE PELVIC CAVITY, PROMOTING SMOOTHER DIGESTIVE TRANSIT AND REDUCING RENAL-INDUCED INTESTINAL STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL INFERIOR MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y LA REGI\\u00d3N SACRA OPUESTA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LAS SE\\u00d1ALES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS QUE GOBIERNAN LA MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL Y LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE GASES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N CRUZADA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA FLATULENCIA EXCESIVA Y EL \\\"RUIDO\\\" AUDIBLE DEL ABDOMEN. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA EL EQUILIBRIO ADECUADO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y PRESI\\u00d3N DENTRO DE LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA, PROMOVIENDO UN TR\\u00c1NSITO DIGESTIVO M\\u00c1S FLUIDO Y REDUCIENDO EL ESTR\\u00c9S INTESTINAL INDUCIDO POR LOS RI\\u00d1ONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & RENAL CHECK: IF INTESTINAL GAS PERSISTS ALONG WITH LOWER BACK DISCOMFORT, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ SACRUM] (REF 431) AXIS TO REINFORCE THE RENAL-INTESTINAL COHESION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GAS OR BLOATING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC GASES AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DIGESTIVE BALANCE DURING THE STABILIZATION OF RENAL FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y RENAL: SI LOS GASES INTESTINALES PERSISTEN JUNTO CON MALESTAR EN LA PARTE INFERIOR DE LA ESPALDA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ SACRO] (REF 431) PARA REFORZAR LA COHESI\\u00d3N RENAL-INTESTINAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN GASES SEVEROS O HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS GASES METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO DIGESTIVO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES RENALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/427','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:13:39','2026-04-28 00:13:39'),(4224,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',428,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL DISFUNCTION, INTESTINAL LAZINESS, SOUNDS, GAS DIARRHEA, CONSTIPATION. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL, PEREZA INTESTINAL, RUIDOS, GASES, DIARREA, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL & RENAL COHESION (COHESI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION, INTESTINAL LAZINESS, ABDOMINAL SOUNDS, GAS, DIARRHEA, AND CONSTIPATION.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL, PEREZA INTESTINAL, RUIDOS ABDOMINALES, GASES, DIARREA Y ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL REGULATION OF THE LOWER GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING \\\"INTESTINAL LAZINESS\\\" AND PERISTALTIC DYSFUNCTION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM IN COORDINATING PROPER DIGESTIVE TRANSIT, REDUCING EXCESSIVE GAS AND AUDIBLE STOMACH NOISES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR BALANCING THE ELIMINATION PROCESS, PROVIDING RELIEF FROM BOTH CHRONIC CONSTIPATION AND EPISODES OF DIARRHEA LINKED TO RENAL-INTESTINAL IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL INFERIOR MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR LA \\\"PEREZA INTESTINAL\\\" Y LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PERIST\\u00c1LTICA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO A COORDINAR EL TR\\u00c1NSITO DIGESTIVO ADECUADO, REDUCIENDO LOS GASES EXCESIVOS Y LOS RUIDOS ESTOMACALES AUDIBLES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA EQUILIBRAR EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N, BRINDANDO ALIVIO TANTO AL ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO CR\\u00d3NICO COMO A LOS EPISODIOS DE DIARREA VINCULADOS A DESEQUILIBRIOS RENAL-INTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INTESTINAL & PELVIC CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE IRREGULARITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT PATHOGENIC OVERGROWTH. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GAS OR PELVIC PRESSURE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ SACRAL - OPPOSITE] (REF 436) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN METABOLIC PROCESSING AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DIGESTIVE HEALTH DURING THE RESTORATION OF INTESTINAL MOTILITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y P\\u00c9LVICA: SI LA IRREGULARIDAD DIGESTIVA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR UN SOBRECRECIMIENTO PATOG\\u00c9NICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN GASES SEVEROS O PRESI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ SACRO - OPUESTO] (REF 436). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y APOYAR LA SALUD DIGESTIVA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/428','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:14:50','2026-04-28 00:14:50'),(4225,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',429,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TENNIS ELBOW (CODO DE TENISTA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"STRUCTURAL BIOMECHANICS (BIOMEC\\u00c1NICA ESTRUCTURAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"TENNIS ELBOW, PAIN IN THE ELBOW AND FOREARM, REDUCED GRIP STRENGTH, AND LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(CODO DE TENISTA, DOLOR EN EL CODO Y EL ANTEBRAZO, FUERZA DE AGARRE REDUCIDA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL CAUSE OF EPICONDYLITIS (TENNIS ELBOW) BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE SCAPULA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING REFERRED PAIN AND INFLAMMATION THAT MANIFESTS IN THE ELBOW BUT OFTEN ORIGINATES FROM TENSION OR IMBALANCES IN THE RENAL-SHOULDER CIRCUIT. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING STRESS ON THE EXTENSOR TENDONS AND RESTORING PROPER NERVE CONDUCTION TO THE UPPER LIMBS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR ACCELERATING THE HEALING OF OVERUSE INJURIES AND IMPROVING THE RANGE OF MOTION IN THE ARM AND SHOULDER.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA CAUSA BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DE LA EPICONDILITIS (CODO DE TENISTA) MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y LA ESC\\u00c1PULA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESOLVER EL DOLOR REFERIDO Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N QUE SE MANIFIESTA EN EL CODO, PERO QUE A MENUDO SE ORIGINA POR TENSI\\u00d3N O DESEQUILIBRIOS EN EL CIRCUITO RENAL-HOMBRO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR EL ESTR\\u00c9S EN LOS TENDONES EXTENSORES Y A RESTAURAR LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA ADECUADA A LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA ACELERAR LA CURACI\\u00d3N DE LESIONES POR SOBRECARGA Y MEJORAR EL RANGO DE MOVIMIENTO EN EL BRAZO Y EL HOMBRO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & NERVOUS CHECK: IF ELBOW PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [HUMERUS \\/ HUMERUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCAL BONE OR MUSCLE STRAIN. FOR CASES INVOLVING NUMBNESS IN THE HAND, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BRACHIAL PLEXUS \\/ BRACHIAL PLEXUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC RENAL STABILITY, AS RENAL STRESS CAN OFTEN MANIFEST AS REFERRED MUSCULOSKELETAL PAIN IN THE UPPER BACK AND ARMS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y NERVIOSA: SI EL DOLOR DE CODO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00daMERO \\/ H\\u00daMERO] PARA ABORDAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N LOCAL \\u00d3SEA O MUSCULAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ENTUMECIMIENTO EN LA MANO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PLEXO BRAQUIAL \\/ PLEXO BRAQUIAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD RENAL SIST\\u00c9MICA, YA QUE EL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL A MENUDO PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DOLOR MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICO REFERIDO EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR DE LA ESPALDA Y LOS BRAZOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/429','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:16:00','2026-04-28 00:16:00'),(4226,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',430,'{\"symptoms\":\"BRAIN FATIGUE, MIGRAINE, FACIAL EDEMA, MOLAR TOOTH ACHE. (FATIGA CEREBRAL, MIGRA\\u00d1A, EDEMA FACIAL, DOLOR DE MUELA MOLAR.)\",\"paths\":\"UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTION, PSYCHOSOMATIC OF THE KIDNEYS DISORDER. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL, TRASTORNO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BRAIN FATIGUE, MIGRAINE, FACIAL EDEMA, AND MOLAR TOOTH ACHE.\\n\\n(FATIGA CEREBRAL, MIGRA\\u00d1A, EDEMA FACIAL Y DOLOR DE MUELA MOLAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PSYCHOSOMATIC AXIS BETWEEN THE RENAL SYSTEM AND THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE TEMPORAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTIONS THAT ORIGINATE FROM OR ARE EXACERBATED BY EMOTIONAL STRESS AND COGNITIVE OVERLOAD. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RELIEVING VASCULAR HEADACHES AND FACIAL SWELLING LINKED TO RENAL IMBALANCE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING BRAIN FATIGUE AND RESTORING THE PSYCHOSOMATIC EQUILIBRIUM NECESSARY FOR PROPER URINARY AND NEUROLOGICAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL EJE PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO ENTRE EL SISTEMA RENAL Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESOLVER DISFUNCIONES UROGENITALES QUE SE ORIGINAN O SE EXACERBAN POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL Y LA SOBRECARGA COGNITIVA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ALIVIAR DOLORES DE CABEZA VASCULARES Y LA HINCHAZ\\u00d3N FACIAL VINCULADA AL DESEQUILIBRIO RENAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LA FATIGA CEREBRAL Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO NECESARIO PARA UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N URINARIA Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & RENAL CHECK: IF BRAIN FATIGUE OR MIGRAINES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 365) AXIS TO ADDRESS THE ANCHORING OF SENSORY INTEGRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FACIAL EDEMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ CHEEKBONE] (REF 432) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT PARASITIC INTERFERENCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE METABOLIC EFFECTS OF PSYCHOSOMATIC STRESS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE STABILIZATION OF RENAL AND CEREBRAL FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y RENAL: SI LA FATIGA CEREBRAL O LAS MIGRA\\u00d1AS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 365) PARA ABORDAR EL ANCLAJE DE LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN EDEMA FACIAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ P\\u00d3MULO] (REF 432) PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS EFECTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES RENALES Y CEREBRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/430','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:17:03','2026-04-28 00:17:03'),(4227,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',431,'{\"symptoms\":\"BRAIN FATIGUE, MIGRAINE, FACIAL EDEMA, MOLAR TOOTHACHE. (FATIGA CEREBRAL, MIGRA\\u00d1A, EDEMA FACIAL, DOLOR DE MUELA MOLAR.)\",\"paths\":\"UROGENITAL STSTEM DYSFUNCTION, MYOGELOSIS. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL, MIOGELOSIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BRAIN FATIGUE, MIGRAINE, FACIAL EDEMA, AND MOLAR TOOTH ACHE.\\n\\n(FATIGA CEREBRAL, MIGRA\\u00d1A, EDEMA FACIAL Y DOLOR DE MUELA MOLAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL DYSFUNCTION OF THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE OPPOSITE TEMPORAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR TREATING MYOGELOSIS\\u2014LOCALIZED MUSCLE HARDENING\\u2014AND ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC FLUID RETENTION THAT MANIFESTS AS FACIAL EDEMA. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CROSS-BODY ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CLEARING COGNITIVE OVERLOAD AND VASCULAR TENSION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING RENAL EFFICIENCY AND RELIEVING PSYCHOSOMATIC PAIN THAT RADIATES TO THE JAW AND TEMPORAL REGIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA TRATAR LA MIOGELOSIS (ENDURECIMIENTO MUSCULAR LOCALIZADO) Y ABORDAR LA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO EDEMA FACIAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N CRUZADA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LA SOBRECARGA COGNITIVA Y LA TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA EFICIENCIA RENAL Y ALIVIAR EL DOLOR PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO QUE SE IRRADIA A LAS REGIONES MANDIBULARES Y TEMPORALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & MUSCULAR CHECK: IF FACIAL EDEMA OR MIGRAINES PERSIST, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 439) AXIS TO REINFORCE IPSILATERAL SYNERGY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MYOGELOSIS OR MUSCLE STIFFNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) RESONANCE TO ASSESS OVERALL RENAL FILTRATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC WASTE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RELIEF DURING THE STABILIZATION OF THE UROGENITAL AXIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y MUSCULAR: SI EL EDEMA FACIAL O LAS MIGRA\\u00d1AS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 439) PARA REFORZAR LA SINERGIA IPSILATERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MIOGELOSIS SEVERA O RIGIDEZ MUSCULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA EVALUAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL GENERAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y APOYAR EL ALIVIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE UROGENITAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/431','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:18:10','2026-04-28 00:18:10'),(4228,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',432,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY URINARY CATHETERS. NOSOCOMIAL PATHOGEN IN URINARY TRACT. (PROVIDENCIA STUARTII\\nTRANSMITIDO POR CAT\\u00c9TERES URINARIOS. PAT\\u00d3GENO NOSOCOMIAL EN EL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, RENAL INFLAMMATION, AND DISCOMFORT DURING URINATION.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y MALESTAR AL ORINAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF PROVIDENCIA STUARTII BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE OPPOSITE URETER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING NOSOCOMIAL INFECTIONS, PARTICULARLY THOSE TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE USE OF URINARY CATHETERS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS UROGENITAL ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING BACTERIAL COLONIZATION THAT CAN LEAD TO CHRONIC CYSTITIS OR NEPHRITIS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE URINARY PATHWAY AND PREVENTING THE ASCENDING SPREAD OF PATHOGENS WITHIN THE RENAL SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE PROVIDENCIA STUARTII MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y EL UR\\u00c9TER OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE INFECCIONES NOSOCOMIALES, PARTICULARMENTE AQUELLAS TRANSMITIDAS POR EL USO DE CAT\\u00c9TERES URINARIOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA QUE PUEDE DERIVAR EN CISTITIS CR\\u00d3NICA O NEFRITIS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA V\\u00cdA URINARIA Y PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N ASCENDENTE DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS DENTRO DEL SISTEMA RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [URETER \\/ URETER] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED BACTERIAL LOADS (VARICELLA). FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RENAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE CLEARING OF THE URINARY TRACT INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER] PARA ABORDAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS LOCALIZADAS (VARICELA). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR RENAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/432','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:19:14','2026-04-28 00:19:14'),(4229,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',433,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"KIDNEY STONES, RENAL COLIC OF THE UTETER AND URNARY TRACT. (C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, C\\u00d3LICO RENAL DEL UR\\u00c9TER Y DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SUPRASPINATUS AND SCAPULA. (VERIFICAR - SUPRAESPINOSO Y ESC\\u00c1PULA)\"}','{\"origins\":\"RENAL LITHIASIS (LITIASIS RENAL)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE MECHANICAL AND BIOELECTRICAL DISTURBANCES CAUSED BY RENAL CALCULI (KIDNEY STONES) BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE URETER ON THE SAME SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING RENAL COLIC, AS STONES CAN TRIGGER SEVERE REFLEX SYMPTOMS SUCH AS NAUSEA, VOMITING, AND DIZZINESS THROUGH THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION WITHIN THE URINARY TRACT AND EASING THE PASSAGE OF CALCULI. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESOLUTION OF SPASMS AND THE REGULATION OF ABNORMAL PERSPIRATION PATTERNS ASSOCIATED WITH ACUTE RENAL STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LAS PERTURBACIONES MEC\\u00c1NICAS Y BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICAS CAUSADAS POR LOS C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y EL UR\\u00c9TER DEL MISMO LADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DEL C\\u00d3LICO RENAL, YA QUE LOS C\\u00c1LCULOS PUEDEN DESENCADENAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS REFLEJOS SEVEROS COMO N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS Y MAREO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL TRACTO URINARIO Y FACILITAR EL PASO DE LOS C\\u00c1LCULOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE ESPASMOS Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE PATRONES DE SUDORACI\\u00d3N ANORMALES ASOCIADOS CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL AGUDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RENAL & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF RENAL COLIC OR CRAMPS PERSIST, SCAN THE [SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY SYSTEMIC BALANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING REFERRED UPPER BACK PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [URETER \\/ URETER] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE THE ENTIRE URINARY PATHWAY IS CLEAR OF PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE DURING THE RECOVERY FROM CALCULI.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL C\\u00d3LICO RENAL O LOS CALAMBRES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO] PARA ABORDAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO COMPLEMENTARIO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR REFERIDO EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR DE LA ESPALDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER] PARA ASEGURAR QUE TODA LA V\\u00cdA URINARIA EST\\u00c9 LIBRE DE INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS C\\u00c1LCULOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/433','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:20:15','2026-04-28 00:20:15'),(4230,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',434,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DIALYSIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RENAL FILTRATION & DIALYSIS SUPPORT (SOPORTE DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y DI\\u00c1LISIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE RENAL INSUFFICIENCY, TOXIN ACCUMULATION, FLUID RETENTION, AND COMPLICATIONS RELATED TO DIALYSIS.\\n\\n(INSUFICIENCIA RENAL GRAVE, ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y COMPLICACIONES RELACIONADAS CON LA DI\\u00c1LISIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL OPTIMIZATION OF THE URINARY SYSTEM BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE KIDNEY AND THE URETHRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR SUPPORTING PATIENTS UNDERGOING DIALYSIS OR THOSE WITH SEVERE RENAL DYSFUNCTION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY AND MANAGING THE VASCULAR STRESS ASSOCIATED WITH MECHANICAL FILTRATION PROCESSES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE REMAINING RENAL FUNCTION AND HELPS THE SYSTEM ADAPT TO THE DEMANDS OF ARTIFICIAL PURIFICATION, PROMOTING BETTER FLUID BALANCE AND REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE URINARY TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA OPTIMIZACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL SISTEMA URINARIO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y LA URETRA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA APOYAR A PACIENTES EN DI\\u00c1LISIS O AQUELLOS CON DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL GRAVE. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y A MANEJAR EL ESTR\\u00c9S VASCULAR ASOCIADO CON LOS PROCESOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL REMANENTE Y AYUDA AL SISTEMA A ADAPTARSE A LAS EXIGENCIAS DE LA PURIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTIFICIAL, PROMOVIENDO UN MEJOR EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RENAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF RENAL STRESS OR FLUID RETENTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) AXIS TO ENSURE OVERALL FILTRATION STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC URINARY DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [URETER \\/ URETER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC WASTE AND TO PROVIDE COMPLEMENTARY DETOXIFICATION SUPPORT DURING THE STABILIZATION OF THE RENAL-URETHRAL PATHWAY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL O LA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DE LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR URINARIO CR\\u00d3NICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y BRINDAR APOYO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N COMPLEMENTARIO DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA V\\u00cdA RENAL-URETRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/434','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:21:32','2026-04-28 00:21:32'),(4231,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',435,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FEARS (MIEDOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"PARALYZING FEARS, KNEE WEAKNESS, INSECURITY IN MOVING FORWARD, AND EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGES.\\n\\n(MIEDOS PARALIZANTES, DEBILIDAD EN LAS RODILLAS, INSEGURIDAD PARA AVANZAR Y BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF SOMATIZED FEARS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS WITHIN THE KNEE BALL JOINTS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS EMOTIONAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RELEASING THE SYMBOLIC TENSION OF \\\"BEING PARALYZED BY FEAR\\\" OR THE INABILITY TO MOVE FORWARD IN LIFE DECISIONS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE ARTICULAR SPHERE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN DISSIPATING THE PHYSICAL MANIFESTATIONS OF DEEP-SEATED ANXIETY. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS EMOTIONAL RESILIENCE, RESTORING THE SENSE OF STRENGTH AND STABILITY NEEDED TO PROGRESS BOTH PHYSICALLY AND METAPHORICALLY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE MIEDOS SOMATIZADOS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DENTRO DE LAS ARTICULACIONES ESF\\u00c9RICAS DE LAS RODILLAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR EMOCIONAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N SIMB\\u00d3LICA DE \\\"QUEDARSE PARALIZADO POR EL MIEDO\\\" O LA INCAPACIDAD DE AVANZAR EN LAS DECISIONES DE VIDA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA ESFERA ARTICULAR, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A DISIPAR LAS MANIFESTACIONES F\\u00cdSICAS DE LA ANSIEDAD PROFUNDA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESILIENCIA EMOCIONAL, RESTAURANDO EL SENTIDO DE FORTALEZA Y ESTABILIDAD NECESARIO PARA PROGRESAR TANTO F\\u00cdSICA COMO METAF\\u00d3RICAMENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF THE FEELING OF INSECURITY OR FEAR PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) AXIS, AS RENAL STRESS IS OFTEN LINKED TO VITAL FEAR. FOR CASES INVOLVING PHYSICAL PAIN OR JOINT STIFFNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [POPLITEAL FOSSA \\/ POPLITEAL FOSSA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN CALMING THE EMOTIONAL RESPONSE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC BALANCE DURING THE RELEASE OF DEEP PSYCHOLOGICAL BLOCKAGES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE INSEGURIDAD O MIEDO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429), YA QUE EL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL A MENUDO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO AL MIEDO VITAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR F\\u00cdSICO O RIGIDEZ ARTICULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [FOSA POPL\\u00cdTEA \\/ FOSA POPL\\u00cdTEA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A CALMAR LA RESPUESTA EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE BLOQUEOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS PROFUNDOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/435','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:22:45','2026-04-28 00:22:45'),(4232,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',436,'{\"symptoms\":\"AFFECTS BONE MARROW AND PRODUCES ATROPHY. NERVE DISORDERS, BACK PAIN, INFERTILITY. (VIRUS DE LA POLIO\\nAFECTA LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA Y PRODUCE ATROFIA. TRASTORNOS NERVIOSOS, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"MAY BE DUE TO POLIO VACCINE. SCIATIC NEUROPATHY. PARALYSIS. AUTISM. (PUEDE DEBERSE A LA VACUNA CONTRA LA POLIO. NEUROPAT\\u00cdA CI\\u00c1TICA. PAR\\u00c1LISIS. AUTISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"AFFECTS BONE MARROW AND PRODUCES ATROPHY. NERVE DISORDERS, BACK PAIN, AND INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(AFECTA LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA Y PRODUCE ATROFIA. TRASTORNOS NERVIOSOS, DOLOR DE ESPALDA E INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE POLIO VIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS WITHIN THE KNEE PLEXUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS THAT MAY STEM FROM VIRAL LOADS OR REACTIONS TO THE POLIO VACCINE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS NERVE NETWORK, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN PREVENTING MUSCLE ATROPHY AND ADDRESSING SCIATIC NEUROPATHY OR PARALYSIS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE INTEGRITY OF THE BONE MARROW AND MAY BE RELEVANT IN CASES WHERE SYSTEMIC NERVE DYSFUNCTION MANIFESTS AS BACK PAIN OR COMPLICATIONS LINKED TO AUTISM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL VIRUS DE LA POLIO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DENTRO DEL PLEXO DE LA RODILLA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS QUE PUEDEN DERIVAR DE CARGAS VIRALES O REACCIONES A LA VACUNA CONTRA LA POLIO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA RED NERVIOSA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A PREVENIR LA ATROFIA MUSCULAR Y A ABORDAR LA NEUROPAT\\u00cdA CI\\u00c1TICA O LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA Y PUEDE SER RELEVANTE EN CASOS DONDE LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA SIST\\u00c9MICA SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLOR DE ESPALDA O COMPLICACIONES VINCULADAS AL AUTISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & VIRAL CHECK: IF SCIATIC PAIN OR NERVE DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [SCIATIC \\/ SCIATIC] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE BONE MARROW STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE STABILIZATION OF THE KNEE PLEXUS CIRCUIT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y VIRAL: SI EL DOLOR CI\\u00c1TICO O LOS TRASTORNOS NERVIOSOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CI\\u00c1TICO \\/ CI\\u00c1TICO] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S SEVERO EN LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL CIRCUITO DEL PLEXO DE LA RODILLA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/436','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:23:44','2026-04-28 00:23:44'),(4233,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',437,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RELIEVES KNEE PAIN. (ALIVIA EL DOLOR DE RODILLA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"LOCAL JOINT STABILIZATION (ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR LOCAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"LOCALIZED KNEE PAIN, INFLAMMATION, AND LIMITED MOBILITY.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE RODILLA LOCALIZADO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y MOVILIDAD LIMITADA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES LOCALIZED DISCOMFORT WITHIN THE KNEE COMPLEX BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE JOINT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR REDUCING INFLAMMATION AND ACCELERATING THE RECOVERY OF SOFT TISSUES, TENDONS, AND LIGAMENTS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS DIRECTLY AT THE SITE OF PAIN, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RELIEVING MECHANICAL STRESS AND IMPROVING CIRCULATION WITHIN THE ARTICULAR CAPSULE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF FLUID DYNAMICS AND STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY, PROVIDING DIRECT RELIEF FROM ACUTE OR CHRONIC KNEE PAIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL MALESTAR LOCALIZADO DENTRO DEL COMPLEJO DE LA RODILLA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y ACELERAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDOS BLANDOS, TENDONES Y LIGAMENTOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DIRECTAMENTE EN EL SITIO DEL DOLOR, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ALIVIAR EL ESTR\\u00c9S MEC\\u00c1NICO Y MEJORAR LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DE LA C\\u00c1PSULA ARTICULAR. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA DIN\\u00c1MICA DE FLUIDOS Y LA INTEGRIDAD ESTRUCTURAL, BRINDANDO ALIVIO DIRECTO AL DOLOR DE RODILLA AGUDO O CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & PATHOGEN CHECK: IF KNEE PAIN IS ACCOMPANIED BY NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, SCAN THE [KNEE PLEXUS \\/ KNEE PLEXUS] (REF 445) AXIS TO RULE OUT VIRAL INTERFERENCE (POLIO). FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP EMOTIONAL STRESS OR INSECURITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KNEE BALL JOINT \\/ KNEE BALL JOINT] (REF 444) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSURE SYSTEMIC FLUID BALANCE AND TO REDUCE REFERRED RENAL STRESS MANIFESTING IN THE JOINTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL DOLOR DE RODILLA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PLEXO DE LA RODILLA \\/ PLEXO DE LA RODILLA] (REF 445) PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA VIRAL (POLIO). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL PROFUNDO O INSEGURIDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ARTICULACI\\u00d3N ESF\\u00c9RICA DE LA RODILLA \\/ ARTICULACI\\u00d3N ESF\\u00c9RICA DE LA RODILLA] (REF 444). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS SIST\\u00c9MICO Y REDUCIR EL ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL REFERIDO QUE SE MANIFIESTA EN LAS ARTICULACIONES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/437','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 00:26:49','2026-04-28 00:26:49'),(4234,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',438,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EMOTIONAL BALANCING - OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. (EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL - DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL HARMONIZATION (ARMONIZACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, SENSORY DISTURBANCES, AND DYSFUNCTION OF THE CRANIAL NERVES.\\n\\n(INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, PERTURBACIONES SENSORIALES Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL INTEGRITY OF THE CRANIAL NERVE NETWORK BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE KNOT (NODULE) POINTS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR THE EMOTIONAL BALANCING OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES, WHICH GOVERN ESSENTIAL SENSORY AND MOTOR FUNCTIONS OF THE HEAD AND NECK. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN RELEASING SOMATIZED EMOTIONAL TENSION THAT MAY INTERFERE WITH FACIAL EXPRESSION, SIGHT, HEARING, OR EQUILIBRIUM. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS SYSTEMIC CALM AND NEUROLOGICAL COHERENCE, HELPING TO RESTORE THE PROPER FLOW OF INFORMATION BETWEEN THE BRAIN AND THE PERIPHERAL SENSORY ORGANS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA INTEGRIDAD BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DE LA RED DE NERVIOS CRANEALES MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE LOS PUNTOS DEL N\\u00d3DULO (KNOT). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPECIAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES, LOS CUALES GOBIERNAN FUNCIONES SENSORIALES Y MOTORAS ESENCIALES DE LA CABEZA Y EL CUELLO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A LIBERAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL SOMATIZADA QUE PUEDE INTERFERIR CON LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N FACIAL, LA VISTA, EL O\\u00cdDO O EL EQUILIBRIO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA CALMA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA COHERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR EL FLUJO ADECUADO DE INFORMACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CEREBRO Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS SENSORIALES PERIF\\u00c9RICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF SENSORY DISTURBANCES OR EMOTIONAL UNBALANCE PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 365) AXIS TO ADDRESS THE ANCHORING OF THE SENSORY SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING LOCALIZED CRANIAL TENSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT VASCULAR INTERFERENCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN REGULATING THE EMOTIONAL RESPONSE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC BALANCE DURING THE ARMONIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA RED DE NERVIOS CRANEALES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y EMOCIONAL: SI PERSISTEN LAS PERTURBACIONES SENSORIALES O EL DESEQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 365) PARA ABORDAR EL ANCLAJE DEL SISTEMA SENSORIAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TENSI\\u00d3N CRANEAL LOCALIZADA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA VASCULAR. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A REGULAR LA RESPUESTA EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA ARMONIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA RED DE NERVIOS CRANEALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/438','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:19:02','2026-04-28 01:19:02'),(4235,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',439,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUCUS DISCHARGE, FEVER, COUGH, HEADACHES, AND MUSCLE PAIN. (SECRECI\\u00d3N DE MOCO, FIEBRE, TOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA Y DOLOR MUSCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"EPISTAXIS, BRONCHITIS, PNEUMONIA, ALTERS CLOTTING FACTOR, OTITIS, LARYNGITIS, AND MENINGITIS. (EPISTAXIS, BRONQUITIS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, ALTERA EL FACTOR DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N, OTITIS, LARINGITIS Y MENINGITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH ANY FACIAL PAIRS; NASAL POLYPS AND CYSTS. (ASOCIADO CON CUALQUIER PAR FACIAL; P\\u00d3LIPOS Y QUISTES NASALES.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUCUS DISCHARGE, FEVER, COUGH, HEADACHES, AND MUSCLE PAIN.\\n\\n(SECRECI\\u00d3N DE MOCO, FIEBRE, TOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA Y DOLOR MUSCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE LACRIMAL GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING RESPIRATORY AND OCULAR MANIFESTATIONS, AS THIS BACTERIUM OFTEN CAUSES MUCUS DISCHARGE AND INFLAMMATION IN THE FACIAL CAVITIES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS EPISTAXIS (NOSEBLEEDS), BRONCHITIS, AND LARYNGITIS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR PROTECTING THE RESPIRATORY TRACT AND MITIGATING SYSTEMIC EFFECTS LIKE ALTERED CLOTTING FACTORS OR MENINGITIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE HAEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS LAGRIMALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE MANIFESTACIONES RESPIRATORIAS Y OCULARES, YA QUE ESTA BACTERIA A MENUDO CAUSA SECRECI\\u00d3N DE MOCO E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS CAVIDADES FACIALES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES COMO EPISTAXIS (SANGRADO NASAL), BRONQUITIS Y LARINGITIS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA PROTEGER EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO Y MITIGAR EFECTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMO LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N O LA MENINGITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FACIAL & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF MUCUS DISCHARGE OR FACIAL PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN ASSOCIATED FACIAL PAIRS TO RULE OUT NASAL POLYPS OR CYSTS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEADACHES OR COUGH, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LARYNX \\/ LARYNX] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE CLEARING OF THE HAEMOPHILUS INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N FACIAL Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LA SECRECI\\u00d3N DE MOCO O EL DOLOR FACIAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR PARES FACIALES ASOCIADOS PARA DESCARTAR P\\u00d3LIPOS NASALES O QUISTES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS O TOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LARINGE \\/ LARINGE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N POR HAEMOPHILUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/439','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:21:10','2026-04-28 01:21:10'),(4236,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',440,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"UNIVERSAL PATHOGEN SHELTER (REFUGIO UNIVERSAL DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"AS THE RADICAL IS A RESERVOIR, IT MAY REMAIN ASYMPTOMATIC OR PERMIT THE PERSISTENCE OF VARIOUS PATHOGENS THAT TRIGGER RECURRING INFECTIONS, MAMMARY DISCOMFORT, OR SYSTEMIC IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(DADO QUE EL RADICAL ES UN RESERVORIO, PUEDE PERMANECER ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO O PERMITIR LA PERSISTENCIA DE DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE DESENCADENAN INFECCIONES RECURRENTES, MALESTAR MAMARIO O DESEQUILIBRIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL STABILIZATION OF THE MAMMARY DUCTAL SYSTEM BY ACTING AS A RESERVOIR POINT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR IDENTIFYING AND NEUTRALIZING \\\"HIDING PLACES\\\" WHERE VIRUSES, BACTERIA, OR PARASITES MAY LURK WITHOUT TRIGGERING AN IMMEDIATE IMMUNE RESPONSE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE LACTIFEROUS DUCTS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN ELIMINATING LATENT PATHOGENIC LOADS THAT COULD LATER MIGRATE TO OTHER ORGANS OR SYSTEMS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE OVERALL PURITY OF THE GLANDULAR TISSUE AND IS ESSENTIAL FOR BREAKING CYCLES OF RECURRING ILLNESSES THAT DO NOT FULLY RESOLVE WITH STANDARD PROTOCOLS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL SISTEMA DUCTAL MAMARIO AL ACTUAR COMO UN PUNTO DE RESERVORIO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA IDENTIFICAR Y NEUTRALIZAR \\\"ESCONDITES\\\" DONDE VIRUS, BACTERIAS O PAR\\u00c1SITOS PUEDEN ACECHAR SIN DESENCADENAR UNA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA INMEDIATA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LOS CONDUCTOS LACT\\u00cdFEROS, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR CARGAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS LATENTES QUE PODR\\u00cdAN MIGRAR POSTERIORMENTE A OTROS \\u00d3RGANOS O SISTEMAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA PUREZA GENERAL DEL TEJIDO GLANDULAR Y ES ESENCIAL PARA ROMPER CICLOS DE ENFERMEDADES RECURRENTES QUE NO SE RESOLVER\\u00cdAN COMPLETAMENTE CON PROTOCOLOS EST\\u00c1NDAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST DESPITE TARGETED TREATMENT, SCAN THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] OR [URETHRA \\/ URETHRA] AXES TO RULE OUT OTHER COMMON RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING LOCALIZED MAMMARY TENSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NILE \\/ NILE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE RELEASED PATHOGENIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE CLEARING OF THE DUCTAL RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS PERSISTEN A PESAR DEL TRATAMIENTO DIRIGIDO, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] O [URETRA \\/ URETRA] PARA DESCARTAR OTROS RESERVORIOS COMUNES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TENSI\\u00d3N MAMARIA LOCALIZADA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [NILO \\/ NILO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PATOG\\u00c9NICOS LIBERADOS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DEL RESERVORIO DUCTAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/440','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:22:43','2026-04-28 01:22:43'),(4237,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',441,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (VERIFICAR - CODO\\/CODO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, INFLAMMATION OF THE UPPER AIRWAYS, AND POTENTIAL CUTANEOUS OR SYSTEMIC FUNGAL REACTIONS.\\n\\n(MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES Y POSIBLES REACCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS CUT\\u00c1NEAS O SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PROLIFERATION OF FUNGAL LOADS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE LARYNX AND THE DUODENUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING SYSTEMIC MYCOSIS THAT MANIFESTS SIMULTANEOUSLY IN THE RESPIRATORY AND DIGESTIVE TRACTS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING FUNGAL COLONIZATION THAT MAY CAUSE CHRONIC HOARSENESS OR INTESTINAL MALABSORPTION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF MUCOSAL INTEGRITY AND PREVENTS THE SPREAD OF OPPORTUNISTIC FUNGI THAT THRIVE IN ACIDIC ENVIRONMENTS CREATED BY RENAL OR GASTROINTESTINAL IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE CARGAS F\\u00daNGICAS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE LA LARINGE Y EL DUODENO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE MICOSIS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN SIMULT\\u00c1NEAMENTE EN LOS TRACTOS RESPIRATORIO Y DIGESTIVO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA QUE PUEDE CAUSAR RONQUERA CR\\u00d3NICA O MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD DE LAS MUCOSAS Y PREVIENE LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE HONGOS OPORTUNISTAS QUE PROSPERAN EN AMBIENTES ACIDIFICADOS CREADOS POR DESEQUILIBRIOS RENALES O GASTROINTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MYCOSIS & JOINT CHECK: IF FUNGAL SYMPTOMS OR DIGESTIVE ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] AXIS TO REINFORCE SYSTEMIC ANTIFUNGAL SYNERGY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE THROAT IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LARYNX \\/ LARYNX] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING FUNGAL TOXINS (MYCOTOXINS) AND TO SUPPORT LIVER DETOXIFICATION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THE MYCOTIC LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE MICOSIS Y ARTICULAR: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00daNGICOS O LOS PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CODO \\/ CODO] PARA REFORZAR LA SINERGIA ANTIF\\u00daNGICA SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE GARGANTA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LARINGE \\/ LARINGE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS (MICOTOXINAS) Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA MIC\\u00d3TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/441','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:23:49','2026-04-28 01:23:49'),(4238,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',442,'{\"symptoms\":\"BREATHING PROBLEMS, LARYNGEAL PROBLEMS, HOARSENESS, WHOOPING COUGH, CHRONIC AND DRY COUGH THAT CAUSES VOMITING. (PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, PROBLEMAS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, RONQUERA, TOS FERINA, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA Y SECA QUE PROVOCA V\\u00d3MITOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY COUGHING. CYANOSIS. IT FORMS A HARD TISSUE IN THE TRACHEA. (TRANSMITIDO POR LA TOS. CIANOSIS. FORMA UN TEJIDO DURO EN LA TR\\u00c1QUEA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - COUNTERCECUM (VERIFICAR - CONTRACIEGO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"WHOOPING COUGH, CHRONIC AND DRY COUGH THAT CAUSES VOMITING, LARYNGEAL PROBLEMS, HOARSENESS, AND BREATHING DIFFICULTIES.\\n\\n(TOS FERINA, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA Y SECA QUE PROVOCA V\\u00d3MITOS, PROBLEMAS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, RONQUERA Y DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF BACILLUS PERTUSSIS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE LARYNGEAL TISSUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE SEVERE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS ASSOCIATED WITH WHOOPING COUGH. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE LARYNX, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE FORMATION OF HARDENED TISSUE IN THE TRACHEA AND REDUCING EPISODES OF CYANOSIS (BLUISH SKIN TONE DUE TO LACK OF OXYGEN). STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING THE PERSISTENT, VIOLENT COUGHING FITS THAT OFTEN LEAD TO EXHAUSTION AND SECONDARY VOMITING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE BACILLUS PERTUSSIS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DEL TEJIDO LAR\\u00cdNGEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA GRAVE ASOCIADA CON LA TOS FERINA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA LARINGE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO ENDURECIDO EN LA TR\\u00c1QUEA Y REDUCIR LOS EPISODIOS DE CIANOSIS (TONO AZULADO DE LA PIEL POR FALTA DE OX\\u00cdGENO). LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LOS ATAQUES DE TOS PERSISTENTES Y VIOLENTOS QUE A MENUDO PROVOCAN AGOTAMIENTO Y V\\u00d3MITOS SECUNDARIOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & PATHOGEN CHECK: IF THE CHRONIC COUGH OR HOARSENESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COUNTERCECUM \\/ COUNTERCECUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE TRACHEAL INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LARYNX \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 450) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT FUNGAL COMPLICATIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE TREATMENT OF PERTUSSIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA TOS CR\\u00d3NICA O LA RONQUERA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CONTRACIEGO \\/ CONTRACIEGO] PARA ABORDAR RESERVORIOS BACTERIANOS COMPLEMENTARIOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N TRAQUEAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LARINGE \\/ DUODENO] (REF 450) PARA DESCARTAR COMPLICACIONES F\\u00daNGICAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE LA TOS FERINA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/442','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:24:53','2026-04-28 01:24:53'),(4239,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',443,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, FEVER, ABDOMINAL PAIN. (DIARREA, FIEBRE, DOLOR ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"LUNG PROBLEMS AND PNEUMONITIA. HALITOSIS. (PROBLEMAS PULMONARES Y NEUMON\\u00cdA. HALITOSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, FEVER, ABDOMINAL PAIN, LUNG PROBLEMS, AND PNEUMONITIA. HALITOSIS.\\n\\n(DIARREA, FIEBRE, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, PROBLEMAS PULMONARES Y NEUMON\\u00cdA. HALITOSIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF YERSINIA ENTEROCOLITICA BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE LATISSIMUS DORSI MUSCLE AREA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING GASTROINTESTINAL DISTURBANCES THAT OFTEN MIMIC APPENDICITIS, ALONG WITH RESPIRATORY COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS PNEUMONITIA. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS LARGE MUSCULAR REGION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING BACTERIAL COLONIZATION THAT CAN LEAD TO HALITOSIS AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING ABDOMINAL DISTRESS AND PREVENTING THE ASCENDING SPREAD OF THE BACTERIA TOWARD THE PULMONARY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE YERSINIA ENTEROCOLITICA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DEL \\u00c1REA DEL M\\u00daSCULO DORSAL ANCHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE PERTURBACIONES GASTROINTESTINALES QUE A MENUDO IMITAN UNA APENDICITIS, JUNTO CON COMPLICACIONES RESPIRATORIAS COMO LA NEUMONITIS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA GRAN REGI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA QUE PUEDE DERIVAR EN HALITOSIS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR EL MALESTAR ABDOMINAL Y PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N ASCENDENTE DE LA BACTERIA HACIA EL SISTEMA PULMONAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR ABDOMINAL PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [APPENDIX \\/ THYMUS] AXIS TO RULE OUT SIMILAR BACTERIAL MANIFESTATIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT LUNG CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE TREATMENT OF YERSINIA INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LA DIARREA O EL DOLOR ABDOMINAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ TIMO] PARA DESCARTAR MANIFESTACIONES BACTERIANAS SIMILARES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N POR YERSINIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/443','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:25:59','2026-04-28 01:25:59'),(4240,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',444,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FRUSTRATION (FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP FRUSTRATION, SENSE OF POWERLESSNESS, STIFFNESS IN THE HIPS, AND DIFFICULTY IN \\\"STEPPING FORWARD\\\" WITH CONFIDENCE.\\n\\n(FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE IMPOTENCIA, RIGIDEZ EN LAS CADERAS Y DIFICULTAD PARA \\\"DAR EL PASO\\\" CON CONFIANZA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF SOMATIZED FRUSTRATION BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS WITHIN THE LESSER TROCHANTERS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS EMOTIONAL PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RELEASING THE TENSION HELD IN THE DEEP HIP FLEXORS, WHICH OFTEN ACTS AS A PHYSICAL ANCHOR FOR REPRESSED FEELINGS OF INADEQUACY OR OBSTRUCTED PROGRESS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THESE POINTS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN DISSIPATING THE EMOTIONAL \\\"CLOGS\\\" THAT MANIFEST AS PHYSICAL RIGIDEZ OR RECURRING LEG WEAKNESS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS A RENEWED SENSE OF AGENCY AND THE FLUIDITY NEEDED TO NAVIGATE LIFE\'S CHALLENGES WITHOUT THE WEIGHT OF PAST FAILURES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N SOMATIZADA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DENTRO DE LOS TROC\\u00c1NTERES MENORES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR EMOCIONAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N RETENIDA EN LOS FLEXORES PROFUNDOS DE LA CADERA, QUE A MENUDO ACT\\u00daA COMO UN ANCLA F\\u00cdSICA PARA SENTIMIENTOS REPRIMIDOS DE INSUFICIENCIA O PROGRESO OBSTRUIDO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTOS PUNTOS, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A DISIPAR LOS \\\"BLOQUEOS\\\" EMOCIONALES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO RIGIDEZ F\\u00cdSICA O DEBILIDAD RECURRENTE EN LAS PIERNAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA UN SENTIDO RENOVADO DE CAPACIDAD Y LA FLUIDEZ NECESARIA PARA NAVEGAR LOS DESAF\\u00cdOS DE LA VIDA SIN EL PESO DE FRACASOS PASADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF THE FEELING OF FRUSTRATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KNEE BALL JOINT \\/ KNEE BALL JOINT] (REF 444) AXIS TO ADDRESS PARALYZING FEARS THAT MAY BE INTERTWINED. FOR CASES INVOLVING LOCALIZED HIP PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [GREATER TROCHANTER \\/ GREATER TROCHANTER] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL INTERFERENCE (SALMONELLA). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN REGULATING THE EMOTIONAL RELEASE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC HARMONY DURING THE CLEARING OF PSYCHOSOMATIC TENSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ARTICULACI\\u00d3N ESF\\u00c9RICA DE LA RODILLA \\/ ARTICULACI\\u00d3N ESF\\u00c9RICA DE LA RODILLA] (REF 444) PARA ABORDAR MIEDOS PARALIZANTES QUE PUEDAN ESTAR ENTRELAZADOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR DE CADERA LOCALIZADO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR \\/ TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR] PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA BACTERIANA (SALMONELLA). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A REGULAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA TENSI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/444','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:27:54','2026-04-28 01:27:54'),(4241,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',445,'{\"symptoms\":\"FALSE HIV. URETHRAL AND GENITAL ITCHING, VAGINAL BLEEDING, VAGINITIS, URETHRITIS IN MEN, ANUS AND VAGINAL DRYNESS, VAGINAL FUNGAL INFECTIONS, SWELLING, WEAKNESS, NUMBNESS IN BOTH HANDS. (HTLV-1\\nFALSO VIH. PICAZ\\u00d3N URETRAL Y GENITAL, SANGRADO VAGINAL, VAGINITIS, URETRITIS EN HOMBRES, SEQUEDAD ANAL Y VAGINAL, INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS VAGINALES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, DEBILIDAD, ENTUMECIMIENTO EN AMBAS MANOS.)\",\"paths\":\"IT IS TRANSMITTED THRU SEXUAL FLUIDS, INFECTED BLOOD, IN BATHROOMS. MANIFESTATION IN SEXUAL ORGANS. VAGINAL AND UROGENITAL INFECTIONS. , LEUKEMIA,\\nUVEITIS, AVEOLITIS, SJOGRENS SYNDROME. (SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE FLUIDOS SEXUALES, SANGRE INFECTADA, EN BA\\u00d1OS. MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N EN \\u00d3RGANOS SEXUALES. INFECCIONES VAGINALES Y UROGENITALES, LEUCEMIA, UVE\\u00cdTIS, ALVEOLITIS, S\\u00cdNDROME DE SJ\\u00d6GREN.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FALSE HIV. URETHRAL AND GENITAL ITCHING, VAGINAL BLEEDING, VAGINITIS, URETHRITIS IN MEN, ANUS AND VAGINAL DRYNESS, VAGINAL FUNGAL INFECTIONS, SWELLING, WEAKNESS, AND NUMBNESS IN BOTH HANDS.\\n\\n(FALSO VIH. PICAZ\\u00d3N URETRAL Y GENITAL, SANGRADO VAGINAL, VAGINITIS, URETRITIS EN HOMBRES, SEQUEDAD ANAL Y VAGINAL, INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS VAGINALES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, DEBILIDAD Y ENTUMECIMIENTO EN AMBAS MANOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE HTLV-1 VIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS IN THE LESSER TROCHANTERS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE VIRUS IS OFTEN CONFUSED WITH HIV (FALSE HIV) DUE TO ITS IMPACT ON THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. IT IS TRANSMITTED THROUGH SEXUAL FLUIDS, INFECTED BLOOD, OR CONTACT IN PUBLIC BATHROOMS, MANIFESTING PRIMARILY IN THE SEXUAL ORGANS AND UROGENITAL SYSTEM. NEUTRALIZING THE PH AT THIS POINT IS ESSENTIAL TO STOP THE PROGRESSION OF VAGINAL INFECTIONS, AS WELL AS TO PREVENT SERIOUS COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS LEUKEMIA, UVEITIS, ALVEOLITIS, AND SJ\\u00d6GREN\'S SYNDROME.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL VIRUS HTLV-1 MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO EN LOS TROC\\u00c1NTERES MENORES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL VIRUS A MENUDO SE CONFUNDE CON EL VIH (FALSO VIH) DEBIDO A SU IMPACTO EN EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE FLUIDOS SEXUALES, SANGRE INFECTADA O CONTACTO EN BA\\u00d1OS P\\u00daBLICOS, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE PRINCIPALMENTE EN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS SEXUALES Y EL SISTEMA UROGENITAL. LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL PH EN ESTE PUNTO ES ESENCIAL PARA DETENER LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES VAGINALES, AS\\u00cd COMO PARA PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES GRAVES COMO LA LEUCEMIA, UVE\\u00cdTIS, ALVEOLITIS Y EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE SJ\\u00d6GREN.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & VIRAL CHECK: IF GENITAL SYMPTOMS OR HAND NUMBNESS PERSIST, SCAN THE [GREATER TROCHANTER \\/ GREATER TROCHANTER] AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL INTERFERENCE (SALMONELLA). FOR CASES OF EXTREME DRYNESS (SJ\\u00d6GREN\'S), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PAROTID \\/ PAROTID] POINT. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL LOADS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC IMMUNE STABILITY DURING THE TREATMENT OF HTLV-1.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y VIRAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS GENITALES O EL ENTUMECIMIENTO EN LAS MANOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR \\/ TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR] PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA BACTERIANA (SALMONELLA). PARA CASOS DE SEQUEDAD EXTREMA (SJ\\u00d6GREN), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL PUNTO [PAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ PAR\\u00d3TIDA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD INMUNITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DEL HTLV-1.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/445','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:29:38','2026-04-28 01:29:38'),(4242,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',446,'{\"symptoms\":\"PAIN, RESTLESS, FATIGUE. (DOLOR, INQUIETUD, FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"INSOMNIA, JOINT DISORDERS. FETAL PREGNANCY PROBLEMS. (DOLOR, INQUIETUD, FATIGA.\\nINSOMNIO, TRASTORNOS ARTICULARES. PROBLEMAS DEL EMBARAZO FETAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PAIN, RESTLESSNESS, FATIGUE, AND INSOMNIA. JOINT DISORDERS AND POTENTIAL FETAL COMPLICATIONS DURING PREGNANCY.\\n\\n(DOLOR, INQUIETUD, FATIGA E INSOMNIO. TRASTORNOS ARTICULARES Y POSIBLES PROBLEMAS DURANTE EL EMBARAZO FETAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF STREPTOCOCCUS B AGALACTIAE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE LIPS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT MANIFESTS AS JOINT PAIN AND PERSISTENT FATIGUE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE BACTERIA FROM TRIGGERING NEUROLOGICAL RESTLESSNESS OR INSOMNIA. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS PARTICULARLY VITAL DURING PREGNANCY TO MITIGATE RISKS TO THE FETUS AND TO PROTECT THE INTEGRITY OF THE GASTROINTESTINAL AND GENITOURINARY TRACTS WHERE THIS BACTERIUM OFTEN COLONIZES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE STREPTOCOCCUS B AGALACTIAE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LOS LABIOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLOR ARTICULAR Y FATIGA PERSISTENTE. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A EVITAR QUE LA BACTERIA DESENCADENE INQUIETUD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA O INSOMNIO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES PARTICULARMENTE VITAL DURANTE EL EMBARAZO PARA MITIGAR LOS RIESGOS PARA EL FETO Y PROTEGER LA INTEGRIDAD DE LOS TRACTOS GASTROINTESTINAL Y GENITOURINARIO DONDE ESTA BACTERIA SUELE COLONIZAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLYCOLYTIC & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN OR FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SLEEP DISTURBANCES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT MELATONIN REGULATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO PROVIDE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE CLEARING OF THE STREPTOCOCCUS LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLICOL\\u00cdTICA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR O LA FATIGA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PERTURBACIONES DEL SUE\\u00d1O SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA MELATONINA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y BRINDAR DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA DE ESTREPTOCOCO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/446','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:30:40','2026-04-28 01:30:40'),(4243,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',447,'{\"symptoms\":\"UPPER RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, SORE THROAT, FEVER, SWOLLEN LYMPH GLANDS, EFFECTS THE ADENOIDS AND THE LYMPH NODES IN THE ARMS, NECK, AND GROIN. ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, INDIGESTION, DIARRHEA, HEMORRHAGIC CYSTITIS. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS SUPERIORES, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, FIEBRE, GL\\u00c1NDULAS LINF\\u00c1TICAS HINCHADAS, AFECTA LAS ADENOIDES Y LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS EN LOS BRAZOS, CUELLO E INGLE. DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, INDIGESTI\\u00d3N, DIARREA, CISTITIS HEMORR\\u00c1GICA.)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, PNEUMONIA AND FALSE HIV. (INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y FALSO VIH.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH SCAPULA; KIDNEY STONES           ASSOCIATED WITH CANTHUS; CONJUNCTIVITIS (INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y FALSO VIH.\\nASOCIADO CON LA ESC\\u00c1PULA; C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES           ASOCIADO CON EL CANTO; CONJUNTIVITIS)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"UPPER RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, SORE THROAT, FEVER, SWOLLEN LYMPH GLANDS. EFFECTS THE ADENOIDS AND THE LYMPH NODES IN THE ARMS, NECK, AND GROIN. ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, INDIGESTION, DIARRHEA, AND HEMORRHAGIC CYSTITIS.(S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS SUPERIORES, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, FIEBRE, GL\\u00c1NDULAS LINF\\u00c1TICAS HINCHADAS. AFECTA LAS ADENOIDES Y LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS EN LOS BRAZOS, CUELLO E INGLE. DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, INDIGESTI\\u00d3N, DIARREA Y CISTITIS HEMORR\\u00c1GICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE ADENOVIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER LIGAMENT AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING INFECTIONS THAT AFFECT BOTH THE RESPIRATORY AND GASTROINTESTINAL SYSTEMS, BEING A COMMON CAUSE OF PNEUMONIA AND GLANDULAR INFLAMMATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN STOPING VIRAL SPREAD TOWARD THE URINARY TRACT (CYSTITIS) AND THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RECOVERY OF ADENOIDS AND LYMPH NODES, MAKING IT A RELEVANT PAIR IN CASES WITH MULTISYSTEMIC IMPACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL ADENOVIRUS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL LIGAMENTO HEP\\u00c1TICO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR INFECCIONES QUE AFECTAN TANTO EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO COMO EL GASTROINTESTINAL, SIENDO UNA CAUSA COM\\u00daN DE NEUMON\\u00cdA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A DETENER LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N VIRAL HACIA LAS V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS (CISTITIS) Y EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ADENOIDES Y LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS, SIENDO UN PAR RELEVANTE EN CUADROS QUE PRESENTAN UN IMPACTO MULTISIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & RENAL CHECK: IF LUNG SYMPTOMS OR CONGESTION PERSIST, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AXIS TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC LUNG BALANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING KIDNEY STONES OR RENAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) RESONANCE. IN CASE OF OCULAR COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS CONJUNCTIVITIS, MONITOR THE [CANTHUS \\/ CANTHUS] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE THE VIRAL LOAD IS COMPLETELY CLEARED FROM THE FACIAL MUCOSA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y RENAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PULMONARES O LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] PARA ABORDAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO DE LOS PULMONES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES O DOLOR RENAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429). EN CASO DE COMPLICACIONES OCULARES COMO CONJUNTIVITIS, MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CANTO \\/ CANTO] PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA CARGA VIRAL SE ELIMINE COMPLETAMENTE DE LAS MUCOSAS FACIALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/447','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:32:54','2026-04-28 01:32:54'),(4244,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',448,'{\"paths\":\"LYME DISEASE, FIBROMYALGIA, CHRONIC FATIGUE SYNDROME, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, FIBROMIALGIA, S\\u00cdNDROME DE FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF BORRELIA BURGDORFERI BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE RIGHT COASTAL MARGIN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING LYME DISEASE AND ITS SYSTEMIC MANIFESTATIONS, WHICH OFTEN SIMULATE CHRONIC FATIGUE SYNDROME, FIBROMYALGIA, OR EVEN MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN COUNTERACTING THE BACTERIA TRANSMITTED BY TICK BITES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESOLUTION OF NEUROLOGICAL CONFUSION AND MUSCLE WEAKNESS, PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM ESTABLISHING DEEP RESERVOIRS IN THE CONNECTIVE TISSUES AND THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE BORRELIA BURGDORFERI MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL MARGEN COSTAL DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA ENFERMEDAD DE LYME Y SUS MANIFESTACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS, QUE A MENUDO SIMULAN EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, FIBROMIALGIA O INCLUSO ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A CONTRARRESTAR LA BACTERIA TRANSMITIDA POR PICADURAS DE GARRAPATA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA CONFUSI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y LA DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, EVITANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO ESTABLEZCA RESERVORIOS PROFUNDOS EN LOS TEJIDOS CONECTIVOS Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYME & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN OR DEBILITATING FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 365) RESONANCE TO STABILIZE SENSORY INTEGRITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE CLEARING OF THE BORRELIA LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LYME Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR O LA FATIGA DEBILITANTE PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 365) PARA ESTABILIZAR LA INTEGRIDAD SENSORIAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA DE BORRELIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/448','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:33:46','2026-04-28 01:33:46'),(4245,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',449,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"JAUNDICE (YELLOWISH SKIN), DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, FEVER, AND LIVER INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ICTERICIA (PIEL AMARILLENTA), TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, FIEBRE E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC INTERACTION BETWEEN PASTEURELLA AND THE HEPATITIS A VIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE DESCENDING COLON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING LIVER DYSFUNCTION AND PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF VIRAL HEPATITIS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING BACTERIAL LOADS THAT OFTEN EXACERBATE VIRAL INFECTIONS IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS PROPER BILE FLOW AND ASSISTS THE COLON IN THE EFFICIENT ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE, REDUCING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA ENTRE LA PASTEURELLA Y EL VIRUS DE LA HEPATITIS A MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL COLON DESCENDENTE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y PARA PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE LA HEPATITIS VIRAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS QUE A MENUDO EXACERBAN LAS INFECCIONES VIRALES EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA EL FLUJO ADECUADO DE BILIS Y AYUDA AL COLON EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EFICIENTE DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS, REDUCIENDO LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & COLONIC CHECK: IF LIVER INFLAMMATION OR JAUNDICE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT ORGAN STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DESCENDING COLON \\/ DESCENDING COLON] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED PARASITES OR BACTERIA. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE RELEASED TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM HEPATITIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y COL\\u00d3NICA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO O LA ICTERICIA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR LA ESTABILIDAD DIRECTA DEL \\u00d3RGANO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR PAR\\u00c1SITOS O BACTERIAS LOCALIZADAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA HEPATITIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/449','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:34:41','2026-04-28 01:34:41'),(4246,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',450,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANGER (IRA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTENSE ANGER, IRRITABILITY, EMOTIONAL OUTBURSTS, AND PHYSICAL TENSION IN THE CHEST OR UPPER ABDOMEN.\\n\\n(IRA INTENSA, IRRITABILIDAD, ARREBATOS EMOCIONALES Y TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA EN EL PECHO O LA PARTE SUPERIOR DEL ABDOMEN.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF REPRESSED OR ACTIVE ANGER BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE LIVER IS TRADITIONALLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE STORAGE OF ANGER AND FRUSTRATION, WHILE THE HEART REPRESENTS THE EMOTIONAL CENTER AND RHYTHM OF THE SYSTEM. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN DISSIPATING THE \\\"HEAT\\\" OF ANGER THAT CAN OVERWHELM CARDIAC COHERENCE AND HEPATIC FUNCTION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS EMOTIONAL FLUIDITY, HELPING TO PREVENT SOMATIZATION THAT MIGHT OTHERWISE MANIFEST AS HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE OR DIGESTIVE ACIDITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE IRA REPRIMIDA O ACTIVA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL H\\u00cdGADO SE ASOCIA TRADICIONALMENTE CON EL ALMACENAMIENTO DE LA RABIA Y LA FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N, MIENTRAS QUE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N REPRESENTA EL CENTRO EMOCIONAL Y EL RITMO DEL SISTEMA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A DISIPAR EL \\\"CALOR\\\" DE LA IRA QUE PUEDE ABRUMAR LA COHERENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA FLUIDEZ EMOCIONAL, AYUDANDO A PREVENIR LA SOMATIZACI\\u00d3N QUE DE OTRO MODO PODR\\u00cdA MANIFESTARSE COMO PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA O ACIDEZ DIGESTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & CARDIAC CHECK: IF IRRITABILITY OR CHEST TENSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ENSURE THE ORGAN ITSELF IS NOT UNDER PHYSICAL STRESS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP-SEATED RESENTMENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [GALLBLADDER \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN REGULATING THE EMOTIONAL RELEASE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC CALM DURING THE NEUTRALIZATION OF THE ANGER RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y CARD\\u00cdACA: SI LA IRRITABILIDAD O LA TENSI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL \\u00d3RGANO EN S\\u00cd NO EST\\u00c9 BAJO ESTR\\u00c9S F\\u00cdSICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RESENTIMIENTO PROFUNDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VES\\u00cdCULA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A REGULAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR LA CALMA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA RESPUESTA DE IRA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/450','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:35:47','2026-04-28 01:35:47'),(4247,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',451,'{\"symptoms\":\"PAIN IN LIVER AREA. INFLAMMATION IN THE ABDOMINAL AREA. HIGH FEVER, DIZZINESS, WEAKNESS, MALAISE. (DOLOR EN EL \\u00c1REA DEL H\\u00cdGADO. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL \\u00c1REA ABDOMINAL. FIEBRE ALTA, MAREO, DEBILIDAD, MALESTAR.)\",\"paths\":\"LIVER ABSCESS. FALSE DIABETES. ACNE. (ABSCESO HEP\\u00c1TICO. FALSA DIABETES. ACN\\u00c9.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PAIN IN THE LIVER AREA, ABDOMINAL INFLAMMATION, HIGH FEVER, DIZZINESS, WEAKNESS, AND GENERAL MALAISE.\\n\\n(DOLOR EN EL \\u00c1REA DEL H\\u00cdGADO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL \\u00c1REA ABDOMINAL, FIEBRE ALTA, MAREO, DEBILIDAD Y MALESTAR GENERAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE ENTAMOEBA PARASITE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING AND MANAGING LIVER ABSCESSES, AS THE PARASITE CAN MIGRATE FROM THE INTESTINES TO THE HEPATIC TISSUE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD THAT OFTEN CAUSES \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" BY INTERFERING WITH GLUCOSE METABOLISM. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION AND IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING SKIN CONDITIONS LIKE ACNE THAT ARE ROOTED IN HEPATIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL PAR\\u00c1SITO ENTAMOEBA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA PREVENIR Y MANEJAR ABSCESOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS, YA QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO PUEDE MIGRAR DESDE LOS INTESTINOS HACIA EL TEJIDO HEP\\u00c1TICO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA QUE A MENUDO CAUSA \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\" AL INTERFERIR CON EL METABOLISMO DE LA GLUCOSA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR CONDICIONES DE LA PIEL COMO EL ACN\\u00c9 QUE TIENEN SU ORIGEN EN LA TOXICIDAD HEP\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARASITIC & METABOLIC CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL INFLAMMATION OR \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT ORGAN STRENGTH. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIARRHEA OR INTESTINAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ISCHIUM \\/ ISCHIUM] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER PARASITIC LOADS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BYPRODUCTS OF THE PARASITIC CLEARING AND TO SUPPORT PROPER RENAL FILTRATION DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\" PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR LA FORTALEZA DIRECTA DEL \\u00d3RGANO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIARREA SEVERA O MALESTAR INTESTINAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ISQUI\\u00d3N \\/ ISQUI\\u00d3N] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CARGAS PARASITARIAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL ADECUADA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/451','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:36:55','2026-04-28 01:36:55'),(4248,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',452,'{\"symptoms\":\"UTI, ARTHRITIS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, ARTRITIS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DIARREA, N\\u00c1USEAS.)\",\"paths\":\"LIVER CIRRHOSIS, DESTRUCTION AND FAILURE OF THE LIVER ORGAN.ANOREXIA, BILE PUS AND INFECTION, SEPSIS. LYMES DISEASE. (CIRROSIS HEP\\u00c1TICA, DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N E INSUFICIENCIA DEL \\u00d3RGANO HEP\\u00c1TICO. ANOREXIA, PUS BILIAR E INFECCI\\u00d3N, SEPSIS. ENFERMEDAD DE LYME)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"UTI, ARTHRITIS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, DIARRHEA, AND NAUSEA.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, ARTRITIS, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DIARREA Y N\\u00c1USEAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF BORRELIA BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING SEVERE HEPATIC DEGENERATION, INCLUDING LIVER CIRRHOSIS AND ORGAN FAILURE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN COMBATING SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS SEPSIS, BILE INFECTION (PUS), AND THE COMPLEX MANIFESTATIONS OF LYME DISEASE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF LIVER FUNCTION AND HELPS MITIGATE ANOREXIA OR PROFOUND WEIGHT LOSS ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC BACTERIAL TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE BORRELIA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA PREVENIR LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA SEVERA, INCLUYENDO LA CIRROSIS HEP\\u00c1TICA Y LA INSUFICIENCIA DEL \\u00d3RGANO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A COMBATIR COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMO LA SEPSIS, LA INFECCI\\u00d3N BILIAR (PUS) Y LAS MANIFESTACIONES COMPLEJAS DE LA ENFERMEDAD DE LYME. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y AYUDA A MITIGAR LA ANOREXIA O LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO PROFUNDA ASOCIADA CON LA TOXICIDAD BACTERIANA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & RENAL CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE DISORDERS OR JOINT PAIN PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ COASTAL MARGIN - R] (REF 457) AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CLEARING OF BORRELIA BURGDORFERI. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) RESONANCE TO ENSURE RENAL STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO PREVENT THE PROGRESSION OF CIRRHOTIC TISSUE CHANGES DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RENAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS O EL DOLOR ARTICULAR, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ MARGEN COSTAL - DER.] (REF 457) PARA REFORZAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE BORRELIA BURGDORFERI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES SEVERAS DEL TRACTO URINARIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD RENAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE CAMBIOS TISULARES CIRR\\u00d3TICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/452','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:38:00','2026-04-28 01:38:00'),(4249,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',453,'{\"origins\":null,\"paths\":\"HEP C, GASTRITIS, CHOLESTEROL AND HIGH TRIGLYCERIDES. IT IS TOXIC, IT IS NEITHER A BACTERIA OR A VIRUS. INFECTED BY INDIGESTION OF FAT LIKE BUTTER, OILS,POORLY WASHED VEGETABLES, FRUITS, SEAFOOD AND INTOXICATION WITH DRUGS. (HEPATITIS C, GASTRITIS, COLESTEROL Y TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS ALTOS. ES T\\u00d3XICO, NO ES NI BACTERIA NI VIRUS. INFECTADO POR LA MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N DE GRASAS COMO MANTEQUILLA, ACEITES, VERDURAS MAL LAVADAS, FRUTAS, MARISCOS E INTOXICACI\\u00d3N CON F\\u00c1RMACOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"TOXIC OVERLOAD (SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES NON-BIOLOGICAL TOXICITY BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE LIVER IN A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING LIVER STRESS THAT IS NEITHER BACTERIAL NOR VIRAL IN ORIGIN, BUT RATHER STEMS FROM THE INGESTION OF OXIDIZED FATS (BUTTER, OILS), POORLY WASHED PRODUCE, CONTAMINATED SEAFOOD, OR DRUG INTOXICATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS PLANE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE ORGAN IN PROCESSING CHOLESTEROL AND HIGH TRIGLYCERIDES, SUPPORTING THE RESOLUTION OF TOXIC HEPATITIS (HEP C SYMPTOMS) AND GASTRITIS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING METABOLIC EFFICIENCY AND CLEARING THE SYSTEMIC FATIGUE CAUSED BY CHEMICAL OR DIETARY OVERLOAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA TOXICIDAD NO BIOL\\u00d3GICA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DEL H\\u00cdGADO EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DEL ESTR\\u00c9S HEP\\u00c1TICO QUE NO ES DE ORIGEN BACTERIANO NI VIRAL, SINO QUE DERIVA DE LA INGESTI\\u00d3N DE GRASAS OXIDADAS (MANTEQUILLA, ACEITES), VEGETALES MAL LAVADOS, MARISCOS CONTAMINADOS O INTOXICACI\\u00d3N POR F\\u00c1RMACOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE PLANO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL \\u00d3RGANO A PROCESAR EL COLESTEROL Y LOS TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS ALTOS, APOYANDO LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA HEPATITIS T\\u00d3XICA (S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE HEP C) Y LA GASTRITIS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA EFICIENCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA Y ELIMINAR LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA CAUSADA POR LA SOBRECARGA QU\\u00cdMICA O DIET\\u00c9TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TOXICITY & METABOLIC CHECK: IF FATIGUE OR MUSCLE PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [CERVICAL PLEXUS \\/ SACRUM] (REF 150) AXIS TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC METABOLIC REGULATION AND URIC ACID PROCESSING. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ DESCENDING COLON] (REF 458) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT VIRAL CO-INFECTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FINAL FILTRATION OF RELEASED TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE HEPATIC RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TOXICIDAD Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LA FATIGA O EL DOLOR MUSCULAR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PLEXO CERVICAL \\/ SACRO] (REF 150) PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y EL PROCESAMIENTO DEL \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] (REF 458) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES VIRALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N FINAL DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REGENERACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/453','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:39:24','2026-04-28 01:39:24'),(4250,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',454,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TOXIC X FATS. FROM FOODS. (T\\u00d3XICO POR GRASAS. DE LOS ALIMENTOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"TOXICITY DUE TO FATS FROM FOODS, LIVER INFLAMMATION, FATIGUE, AND DIGESTIVE DISORDERS.\\n\\n(TOXICIDAD POR GRASAS DE ALIMENTOS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO, FATIGA Y TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL STABILIZATION OF THE LIVER IN A VERTICAL AXIS TO MANAGE TOXICITY STEMMING FROM DIETARY FATS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR SUPPORTING THE LIVER IN ITS ROLE AS A METABOLIC FILTER, PARTICULARLY WHEN OVERWHELMED BY THE INGESTION OF OXIDIZED OR EXCESSIVE LIPIDS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS VERTICAL ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE ORGAN IN MITIGATING THE EFFECTS OF TOXIC HEPATITIS (OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH HEPATITIS C SYMPTOMATOLOGY) AND REDUCING LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF HEPATIC EFFICIENCY, HELPING TO CLEAR THE SYSTEMIC FATIGUE AND DIGESTIVE BURDEN CAUSED BY FATTY ACID ACCUMULATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL H\\u00cdGADO EN UN EJE VERTICAL PARA MANEJAR LA TOXICIDAD DERIVADA DE LAS GRASAS DIET\\u00c9TICAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA APOYAR AL H\\u00cdGADO EN SU FUNCI\\u00d3N DE FILTRO METAB\\u00d3LICO, PARTICULARMENTE CUANDO SE VE ABRUMADO POR LA INGESTI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdPIDOS OXIDADOS O EXCESIVOS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL \\u00d3RGANO A MITIGAR LOS EFECTOS DE LA HEPATITIS T\\u00d3XICA (A MENUDO ASOCIADA CON LA SINTOMATOLOG\\u00cdA DE LA HEPATITIS C) Y A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA EFICIENCIA HEP\\u00c1TICA, AYUDANDO A ELIMINAR LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA CARGA DIGESTIVA CAUSADA POR LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDOS GRASOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & TOXICITY CHECK: IF LIVER INFLAMMATION OR FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER - HORIZONTAL] (REF 462) AXIS TO ADDRESS BROADER CHEMICAL OR DRUG OVERLOAD. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ DESCENDING COLON] (REF 458) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT VIRAL CO-INFECTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FINAL FILTRATION OF RELEASED TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE TREATMENT OF HEPATIC TOXICITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y DE TOXICIDAD: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO O LA FATIGA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO - HORIZONTAL] (REF 462) PARA ABORDAR UNA SOBRECARGA QU\\u00cdMICA O FARMACOL\\u00d3GICA M\\u00c1S AMPLIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] (REF 458) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES VIRALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N FINAL DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE LA TOXICIDAD HEP\\u00c1TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/454','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:40:36','2026-04-28 01:40:36'),(4251,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',455,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"NAUSEA, VOMITING. (N\\u00c1USEA, V\\u00d3MITO.)\",\"paths\":\"POSTERIOR HEADACHES, VERTIGO. (DOLORES DE CABEZA POSTERIORES, V\\u00c9RTIGO.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"PATHOGEN STORAGE (ALMACENAMIENTO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"NAUSEA, VOMITING, POSTERIOR HEADACHES, AND VERTIGO.\\n\\n(N\\u00c1USEA, V\\u00d3MITO, DOLORES DE CABEZA POSTERIORES Y V\\u00c9RTIGO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A RESERVOIR POINT BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL CONNECTION BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE OCCIPITAL REGION OF THE SKULL. IN BIOMAGNETISM, RESERVOIRS ARE AREAS WHERE PATHOGENS CAN REMAIN LATENT, POTENTIALLY RE-INFECTING THE SYSTEM AFTER TREATMENT. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN DISLODGING HIDDEN VIRAL OR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO PERSISTENT VESTIBULAR ISSUES AND DIGESTIVE DISTRESS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING CHRONIC DIZZINESS AND RECURRING HEADACHES THAT ORIGINATE FROM SYSTEMIC TOXICITY OR LATENT HEPATIC STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN PUNTO DE RESERVORIO AL ESTABILIZAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA REGI\\u00d3N OCCIPITAL DEL CR\\u00c1NEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS RESERVORIOS SON \\u00c1REAS DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES, REINFECTANDO POTENCIALMENTE EL SISTEMA DESPU\\u00c9S DEL TRATAMIENTO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A DESALOJAR CARGAS VIRALES O BACTERIANAS OCULTAS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A PROBLEMAS VESTIBULARES PERSISTENTES Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR EL MAREO CR\\u00d3NICO Y LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA RECURRENTES QUE SE ORIGINAN POR TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA O ESTR\\u00c9S HEP\\u00c1TICO LATENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/455','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:41:41','2026-04-28 01:41:41'),(4252,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',455,'{\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"alternative_routes\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A RESERVOIR POINT BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL CONNECTION BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE OCCIPITAL REGION OF THE SKULL. IN BIOMAGNETISM, RESERVOIRS ARE AREAS WHERE PATHOGENS CAN REMAIN LATENT, POTENTIALLY RE-INFECTING THE SYSTEM AFTER TREATMENT. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN DISLODGING HIDDEN VIRAL OR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO PERSISTENT VESTIBULAR ISSUES AND DIGESTIVE DISTRESS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING CHRONIC DIZZINESS AND RECURRING HEADACHES THAT ORIGINATE FROM SYSTEMIC TOXICITY OR LATENT HEPATIC STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN PUNTO DE RESERVORIO AL ESTABILIZAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA REGI\\u00d3N OCCIPITAL DEL CR\\u00c1NEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS RESERVORIOS SON \\u00c1REAS DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES, REINFECTANDO POTENCIALMENTE EL SISTEMA DESPU\\u00c9S DEL TRATAMIENTO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A DESALOJAR CARGAS VIRALES O BACTERIANAS OCULTAS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A PROBLEMAS VESTIBULARES PERSISTENTES Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR EL MAREO CR\\u00d3NICO Y LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA RECURRENTES QUE SE ORIGINAN POR TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA O ESTR\\u00c9S HEP\\u00c1TICO LATENTE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/455','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:42:05','2026-04-28 01:42:05'),(4253,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',456,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FATIGUE (FATIGA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"PROFOUND FATIGUE, LACK OF MOTIVATION, EMOTIONAL EXHAUSTION, AND METABOLIC SLUGGISHNESS.\\n\\n(FATIGA PROFUNDA, FALTA DE MOTIVACI\\u00d3N, AGOTAMIENTO EMOCIONAL Y LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF EMOTIONAL STRESS THAT IMPACTS GLYCEMIC REGULATION BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR RELEASING THE PSYCHOSOMATIC BURDEN OFTEN DESCRIBED AS \\\"BITTERNESS\\\" OR REPRESSED ANGER THAT HAS BEGUN TO AFFECT THE DIGESTIVE AND ENDOCRINE SYSTEMS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN OVERCOMING PERSISTENT FATIGUE AND RESTORING THE VITAL ENERGY NECESSARY FOR METABOLIC BALANCE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESOLUTION OF EMOTIONAL BLOCKS THAT MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS LETHARGY OR A SENSE OF BEING OVERWHELMED.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL QUE IMPACTA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N GLUC\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LIBERAR LA CARGA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA A MENUDO DESCRITA COMO \\\"AMARGURA\\\" O IRA REPRIMIDA QUE HA COMENZADO A AFECTAR LOS SISTEMAS DIGESTIVO Y ENDOCRINO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A SUPERAR LA FATIGA PERSISTENTE Y A RESTAURAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL NECESARIA PARA EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO LETARGO O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE AGOBIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & METABOLIC CHECK: IF FATIGUE OR EMOTIONAL EXHAUSTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ HEART] (REF 459) AXIS TO ADDRESS THE ANGER-COHERENCE CONNECTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SPECIFIC GLUCOSE FLUCTUATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN REGULATING THE EMOTIONAL RELEASE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC HARMONY DURING THE CLEARING OF THE FATIGUE RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LA FATIGA O EL AGOTAMIENTO EMOCIONAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 459) PARA ABORDAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N IRA-COHERENCIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FLUCTUACIONES ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS DE GLUCOSA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] PARA DESCARTAR DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR LOCALIZADA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A REGULAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA RESPUESTA DE FATIGA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/456','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:43:15','2026-04-28 01:43:15'),(4254,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',457,'{\"symptoms\":\"DISRUPTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, MUSCLE PAINS, CRAMPS AND GAS, FEVER, AND FATIGUE. (ALTERA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DOLORES MUSCULARES, CALAMBRES Y GASES, FIEBRE Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"BOTULISM, POISONOUS TOXIN, MAY BE CAUSED FROM CANNED INFECTED FOODS. MAY METASTASIS INTO CANCER OR TUMORS. INTESTINAL DISORDERS. (BOTULISMO, TOXINA VENENOSA, PUEDE SER CAUSADO POR ALIMENTOS ENLATADOS INFECTADOS. PUEDE HACER MET\\u00c1STASIS EN C\\u00c1NCER O TUMORES. TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DISRUPTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, MUSCLE PAINS, CRAMPS AND GAS, FEVER, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(ALTERA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DOLORES MUSCULARES, CALAMBRES Y GASES, FIEBRE Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF CLOSTRIDIUM BOTULINUM BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE TAIL OF THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR NEUTRALIZING THE EXTREMELY POTENT TOXINS ASSOCIATED WITH BOTULISM, WHICH OFTEN ENTER THE SYSTEM THROUGH INFECTED OR IMPROPERLY CANNED FOODS. BY BALANCING THE PH IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING NEUROLOGICAL INTERFERENCE AND REDUCING THE RISK OF MALIGNANT TISSUE CHANGES (METASTASIS) OR TUMOR FORMATION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING INTESTINAL DISORDERS AND PROTECTING THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM FROM BACTERIAL POISONING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE CLOSTRIDIUM BOTULINUM MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA NEUTRALIZAR LAS TOXINAS EXTREMADAMENTE POTENTES ASOCIADAS CON EL BOTULISMO, QUE A MENUDO INGRESAN AL SISTEMA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS ENLATADOS INFECTADOS O MAL PROCESADOS. AL EQUILIBRAR EL PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR LA INTERFERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y A REDUCIR EL RIESGO DE CAMBIOS TISULARES MALIGNOS (MET\\u00c1STASIS) O FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TUMORES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LOS TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES Y PROTEGER EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DE LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TOXICITY & NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF MUSCLE CRAMPS OR CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISRUPTION PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER - HORIZONTAL] (REF 462) AXIS TO ADDRESS GENERAL TOXIC OVERLOAD. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL GAS AND INTESTINAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FINAL FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE TREATMENT OF BOTULINUM INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TOXICIDAD Y NEUROLOG\\u00cdCA: SI LOS CALAMBRES MUSCULARES O LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO - HORIZONTAL] (REF 462) PARA ABORDAR LA SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN GASES ABDOMINALES SEVEROS Y MALESTAR INTESTINAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N FINAL DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N POR BOTULISMO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/457','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:44:12','2026-04-28 01:44:12'),(4255,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',458,'{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHTLOSS, MUSCLE PAIN, FEVER, DIARRHEA. (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FIEBRE, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"OBESITY, INFECTION OF FETUS. (OBESIDAD, INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL FETO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT LOSS, MUSCLE PAIN, FEVER, AND DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, DOLOR MUSCULAR, FIEBRE Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF ADENOVIRUS 36 BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE TIP OF THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC VIRAL STRAIN IS SIGNIFICANT FOR ITS ROLE IN METABOLIC DISRUPTION, OFTEN LINKED TO UNEXPLAINED OBESITY OR SUDDEN WEIGHT FLUCTUATIONS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING VIRAL INTERFERENCE WITH ADIPOSE TISSUE AND PROTECTING THE FETUS FROM INFECTION DURING PREGNANCY. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CRITICAL FOR RESTORING PROPER GLUCOSE METABOLISM AND CLEARING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT MANIFESTS AS MUSCLE PAIN AND FEVER.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL ADENOVIRUS 36 MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA CEPA VIRAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICA ES SIGNIFICATIVA POR SU PAPEL EN LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA, A MENUDO VINCULADA A LA OBESIDAD INEXPLICABLE O FLUCTUACIONES REPENTINAS DE PESO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL CON EL TEJIDO ADIPOSO Y A PROTEGER AL FETO DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N DURANTE EL EMBARAZO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA RESTAURAR EL METABOLISMO ADECUADO DE LA GLUCOSA Y ELIMINAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLOR MUSCULAR Y FIEBRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & VIRAL CHECK: IF WEIGHT ISSUES OR MUSCLE PAIN PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ PANCREAS TAIL] (REF 466) AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIARRHEA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ DESCENDING COLON] (REF 458) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT HEPATITIS A. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE TREATMENT OF ADENOVIRUS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y VIRAL: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE PESO O EL DOLOR MUSCULAR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 466) PARA ABORDAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIARREA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] (REF 458) PARA DESCARTAR HEPATITIS A. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DEL ADENOVIRUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/458','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:45:11','2026-04-28 01:45:11'),(4256,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',459,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"LIVER TROPHY (TROFEO DEL H\\u00cdGADO)\",\"paths\":\"HEP C (HEPATITIS C)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEPATIC REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"LIVER ATROPHY, METABOLIC SLOWDOWN, CHRONIC FATIGUE, AND DIGESTIVE INEFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(TROFEO DEL H\\u00cdGADO \\/ ATROFIA, LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA E INEFICIENCIA DIGESTIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DYSFUNCTIONAL STATE OF THE LIVER BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE MAIN BODY OF THE LIVER AND ITS PARTIAL LEFT SEGMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR SUPPORTING ORGAN REGENERATION IN CASES OF LIVER ATROPHY OR REDUCED FUNCTIONAL CAPACITY (TROPHY). BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS SPECIFIC ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE TISSUE IN REGAINING METABOLIC VITALITY, IMPROVING THE FILTRATION OF TOXINS AND THE PRODUCTION OF ESSENTIAL ENZYMES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS OFTEN NECESSARY FOR USERS RECOVERING FROM LONG-TERM HEPATIC STRESS, SUCH AS CHRONIC HEPATITIS C OR TOXIC OVERLOAD, AS IT PROMOTES THE STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY OF THE HEPATIC LOBES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL ESTADO DISFUNCIONAL DEL H\\u00cdGADO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL CUERPO PRINCIPAL DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y SU SEGMENTO PARCIAL IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA APOYAR LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL \\u00d3RGANO EN CASOS DE ATROFIA HEP\\u00c1TICA O CAPACIDAD FUNCIONAL REDUCIDA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESPEC\\u00cdFICA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL TEJIDO A RECUPERAR LA VITALIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA, MEJORANDO LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE ENZIMAS ESENCIALES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N A MENUDO ES NECESARIA PARA USUARIOS QUE SE RECUPERAN DE UN ESTR\\u00c9S HEP\\u00c1TICO A LARGO PLAZO, COMO LA HEPATITIS C CR\\u00d3NICA O LA SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA, YA QUE PROMUEVE LA INTEGRIDAD ESTRUCTURAL DE LOS L\\u00d3BULOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF LIVER ATROPHY OR FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER - VERTICAL] (REF 463) AXIS TO ADDRESS LIPID METABOLISM ISSUES. FOR CASES INVOLVING VIRAL HISTORIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ DESCENDING COLON] (REF 458) RESONANCE TO ENSURE NO LATENT HEPATITIS A OR PASTEURELLA REMAINS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FINAL FILTRATION OF WASTE PRODUCTS AS THE LIVER REGAINS ITS REGENERATIVE CAPACITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI LA ATROFIA O LA FATIGA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO - VERTICAL] (REF 463) PARA ABORDAR PROBLEMAS DEL METABOLISMO DE L\\u00cdPIDOS. PARA CASOS CON ANTECEDENTES VIRALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] (REF 458) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO QUEDEN RESTOS LATENTES DE HEPATITIS A O PASTEURELLA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N FINAL DE PRODUCTOS DE DESECHO A MEDIDA QUE EL H\\u00cdGADO RECUPERA SU CAPACIDAD REGENERATIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/459','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:46:39','2026-04-28 01:46:39'),(4257,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',460,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY SEXUAL CONTACT AND FLUIDS. (TRANSMITIDO POR CONTACTO SEXUAL Y FLUIDOS DE.\\n)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK PARTNER. (REVISAR A LA PAREJA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"LIVER INFLAMMATION, FATIGUE, ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL FLUID ACCUMULATION. OFTEN ASYMPTOMATIC IN EARLY STAGES BUT CAN PROGRESS TO CHRONIC LIVER ISSUES.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO, FATIGA, MALESTAR ABDOMINAL Y POSIBLE ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS. A MENUDO ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO EN ETAPAS TEMPRANAS, PERO PUEDE PROGRESAR A PROBLEMAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS CR\\u00d3NICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE HEPATITIS B VIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE RIGHT PLEURA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS VIRUS IS RECOGNIZED AS BEING TRANSMITTED THROUGH SEXUAL CONTACT, BLOOD, AND OTHER BODILY FLUIDS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING VIRAL REPLICATION WITHIN THE HEPATIC CELLS AND PROTECTING THE PLEURAL LINING FROM RELATED INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING LONG-TERM HEPATIC DEGENERATION AND REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC TOXICITY ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC VIRAL LOADS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL VIRUS DE LA HEPATITIS B MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LA PLEURA DERECHA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, SE RECONOCE QUE ESTE VIRUS SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO SEXUAL, LA SANGRE Y OTROS FLUIDOS CORPORALES. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL DENTRO DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS HEP\\u00c1TICAS Y PROTEGE EL REVESTIMIENTO PLEURAL DE RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS RELACIONADAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA PREVENIR LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA A LARGO PLAZO Y REDUCIR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA ASOCIADA CON CARGAS VIRALES CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARTNER & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IT IS STRONGLY ADVISED TO SCAN THE PARTNER TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION, AS THIS VIRUS IS TRANSMITTED THROUGH FLUIDS. IF LIVER INFLAMMATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO REINFORCE ORGAN STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING RESPIRATORY DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION AND TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAREJA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE ESCANEAR A LA PAREJA PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N, YA QUE ESTE VIRUS SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE FLUIDOS. SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL \\u00d3RGANO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/460','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:47:37','2026-04-28 01:47:37'),(4258,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',461,'{\"symptoms\":\"PAIN IN JOINTS AND KNEES. RAISES TRIGLYCERIDES. JOINT PAINS. (LISTERIA\\nDOLOR EN ARTICULACIONES Y RODILLAS. ELEVA LOS TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS. DOLORES ARTICULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY PETS, FOOD. DIABETES MELLITUS, LIVER FAILURE. FALSE CIRRHOSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR MASCOTAS, ALIMENTOS. DIABETES MELLITUS, INSUFICIENCIA HEP\\u00c1TICA. CIRROSIS FALSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PAIN IN JOINTS AND KNEES. RAISES TRIGLYCERIDES. JOINT PAINS.\\n\\n(DOLOR EN ARTICULACIONES Y RODILLAS. ELEVA LOS TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS. DOLORES ARTICULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF LISTERIA BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE PYLORUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIUM IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH PETS OR CONTAMINATED FOOD AND IS A FREQUENT CAUSE OF LIVER FAILURE OR \\\"FALSE CIRRHOSIS.\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE BACTERIA FROM INTERFERING WITH HEPATIC FUNCTION AND INSULIN SENSITIVITY, WHICH CAN OTHERWISE LEAD TO DIABETES MELLITUS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE NORMALIZATION OF TRIGLYCERIDE LEVELS AND REDUCES SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT MANIFESTS AS PERSISTENT KNEE AND JOINT PAIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE LA LISTERIA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA BACTERIA SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE MASCOTAS O ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS Y ES UNA CAUSA FRECUENTE DE INSUFICIENCIA HEP\\u00c1TICA O \\\"CIRROSIS FALSA\\\". AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A EVITAR QUE LA BACTERIA INTERFIERA CON LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y LA SENSIBILIDAD A LA INSULINA, LO QUE DE OTRO MODO PODR\\u00cdA CONDUCIR A LA DIABETES MELLITUS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA NORMALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NIVELES DE TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS Y REDUCE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLOR PERSISTENTE EN RODILLAS Y ARTICULACIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & METABOLIC CHECK: IF TRIGLYCERIDES REMAIN ELEVATED OR JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER - HORIZONTAL] (REF 462) AXIS TO ADDRESS BROADER TOXIC OVERLOAD. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS OR SUSPECTED BACTERIAL LOADS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FINAL FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE TREATMENT OF LISTERIA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LOS TRIGLIC\\u00c9RIDOS PERMANECEN ELEVADOS O EL DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO - HORIZONTAL] (REF 462) PARA ABORDAR LA SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO O SOSPECHA DE CARGAS BACTERIANAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N FINAL DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE LA LISTERIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/461','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:48:41','2026-04-28 01:48:41'),(4259,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',462,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MIGRAINES. (FIEBRE, MIGRA\\u00d1AS.)\",\"paths\":\"LUNG INFECTIONS. FALSE LEUKEMIA. (INFECCIONES PULMONARES. LEUCEMIA FALSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PLEURA (L) (REVISAR - PLEURA (L))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, MIGRAINES, AND JOINT PAIN.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, MIGRA\\u00d1AS Y DOLOR ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF BRUCELLA BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIUM IS ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"FALSE LEUKEMIA\\\" BECAUSE IT CAN SIGNIFICANTLY ALTER WHITE BLOOD CELL COUNTS AND IMPACT THE BONE MARROW. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE BACTERIA FROM COLONIZING THE SPLEEN AND LIVER, WHICH OFTEN LEADS TO LUNG INFECTIONS AND PERSISTENT SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CRITICAL FOR RESOLVING CHRONIC FEVERS AND DEBILITATING MIGRAINES LINKED TO BACTERIAL TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE LA BRUCELLA MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA BACTERIA SE ASOCIA CON LA \\\"LEUCEMIA FALSA\\\" PORQUE PUEDE ALTERAR SIGNIFICATIVAMENTE EL CONTEO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS E IMPACTAR LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A EVITAR QUE LA BACTERIA COLONICE EL BAZO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A INFECCIONES PULMONARES E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA PERSISTENTE. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA RESOLVER FIEBRES CR\\u00d3NICAS Y MIGRA\\u00d1AS DEBILITANTES VINCULADAS A LA TOXICIDAD BACTERIANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & SPLENIC CHECK: IF MIGRAINES OR LUNG CONGESTION PERSIST, SCAN THE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE BLOOD COUNT ALTERATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING THE BYPRODUCTS OF THE BRUCELLA CLEARING AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y ESPL\\u00c9NICA: SI LAS MIGRA\\u00d1AS O LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES VIRALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ALTERACIONES SEVERAS EN EL CONTEO SANGU\\u00cdNEO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ BAZO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE BRUCELLA Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/462','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:49:48','2026-04-28 01:49:48'),(4260,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',463,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ABDOMINAL DISORDERS, \\nINFLAMMATION IN LYMPH SYTSTEM.  (FIEBRE, TRASTORNOS ABDOMINALES,\\nINFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY DISEASE, TUMORS, CANCER. (ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA, TUMORES, C\\u00c1NCER.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - FALLOPIAN TUBE\\/FALLOPIAN TUBE (ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA, TUMORES, C\\u00c1NCER.\\n\\nREVISAR - TROMPA DE FALOPIO\\/TROMPA DE FALOPIO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ABDOMINAL DISORDERS, AND INFLAMMATION IN THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, TRASTORNOS ABDOMINALES E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE ADENOVIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE SUPRARENAL (ADRENAL) GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE VIRAL IMPACT ON GLANDULAR AND RESPIRATORY SYSTEMS, AS WELL AS ITS POTENTIAL ROLE IN THE DEVELOPMENT OF TUMORS OR MALIGNANT GROWTHS (CANCER). BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE VIRUS FROM DISRUPTING CORTISOL PRODUCTION OR TRIGGERING SEVERE RESPIRATORY DISEASE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSE AGAINST LYMPHATIC CONGESTION AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL ADENOVIRUS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DEL IMPACTO VIRAL EN LOS SISTEMAS GLANDULAR Y RESPIRATORIO, AS\\u00cd COMO SU PAPEL POTENCIAL EN EL DESARROLLO DE TUMORES O CRECIMIENTOS MALIGNOS (C\\u00c1NCER). AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A EVITAR QUE EL VIRUS ALTERE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE CORTISOL O DESENCADENE UNA ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA GRAVE. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA DEFENSA NATURAL DEL CUERPO CONTRA LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF LYMPHATIC INFLAMMATION OR RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS PERSIST, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FALLOPIAN TUBE \\/ FALLOPIAN TUBE] RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL DISTRESS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO REINFORCE DIRECT ORGAN STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARING OF THE ADENOVIRUS LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTEN, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TROMPA DE FALOPIO \\/ TROMPA DE FALOPIO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR ABDOMINAL SEVERO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIDAD DIRECTA DEL \\u00d3RGANO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA DE ADENOVIRUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/463','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:50:52','2026-04-28 01:50:52'),(4261,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',464,'{\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH ACHES, DIARRHEA, HEADACHE, GAS, WEIGHT LOSS, VOMITING. (DOLORES DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, GASES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, V\\u00d3MITO.)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDER. (TRASTORNO GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH ACHES, DIARRHEA, HEADACHE, GAS, WEIGHT LOSS, AND VOMITING.\\n\\n(DOLORES DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, GASES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO Y V\\u00d3MITO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF VIBRIO CHOLERAE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE LIVER AND THE TRANSVERSE COLON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS CHARACTERIZED BY RAPID DEHYDRATION AND METABOLIC IMBALANCE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA THAT CAUSES CHOLERA, WHICH IS TYPICALLY CONTRACTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED WATER OR FOOD. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF PROPER FLUID ABSORPTION IN THE COLON AND PREVENTS THE HEPATIC STRESS ASSOCIATED WITH SYSTEMIC TOXICITY AND RAPID WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE VIBRIO CHOLERAE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE EL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL COLON TRANSVERSO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES SEVEROS CARACTERIZADOS POR UNA DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N R\\u00c1PIDA Y UN DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA QUE CAUSA EL C\\u00d3LERA, QUE GENERALMENTE SE CONTRAE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE AGUA O ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS EN EL COLON Y PREVIENE EL ESTR\\u00c9S HEP\\u00c1TICO ASOCIADO CON LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA P\\u00c9RDIDA R\\u00c1PIDA DE PESO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & HYDRATION CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR STOMACH ACHES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VOMITING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ OCCIPITAL] (REF 464) RESONANCE TO DISLODGE LATENT RESERVOIRS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN MAINTAINING ELECTROLYTE BALANCE AND TO SUPPORT RENAL FILTRATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM CHOLERA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL E HIDRATACI\\u00d3N: SI LA DIARREA O LOS DOLORES DE EST\\u00d3MAGO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN V\\u00d3MITO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ OCCIPITAL] (REF 464) PARA DESALOJAR RESERVORIOS LATENTES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO ELECTROL\\u00cdTICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL C\\u00d3LERA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/464','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:51:58','2026-04-28 01:51:58'),(4262,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',465,'{\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSIVE SYNDROME (S\\u00cdNDROME DEPRESIVO)\",\"paths\":\"PARKINSON\'S\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSIVE SYNDROME, ANXIETY, SLEEP DISORDERS, AND EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNDROME DEPRESIVO, ANSIEDAD, TRASTORNOS DEL SUE\\u00d1O E INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS ON THE REGULATION OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM BY STABILIZING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE LOCUS COERULEUS (LOCATED IN THE PONS OF THE BRAINSTEM) AND THE VAGUS NERVE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS ESSENTIAL FOR MODULATING THE STRESS RESPONSE AND THE PRODUCTION OF NOREPINEFRINE. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXITING A STATE OF \\\"PERMANENT ALERT,\\\" SERVING AS A KEY POINT IN THE COMPLEMENTARY MANAGEMENT OF CONDITIONS SUCH AS PARKINSON\'S DISEASE AND PROFOUND DEPRESSION. STABILIZING THIS PATHWAY PROMOTES COHERENCE BETWEEN THE BRAIN AND VISCERAL ORGANS, FACILITATING RELAXATION AND THE BALANCE OF NEUROTRANSMITTERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL AL ESTABILIZAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL LOCUS COERULEUS (SITUADO EN EL PUENTE DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO) Y EL NERVIO VAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES ESENCIAL PARA MODULAR LA RESPUESTA AL ESTR\\u00c9S Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE NOREPINEFRINA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A SALIR DE UN ESTADO DE \\\"ALERTA PERMANENTE\\\", SIENDO UN PUNTO CLAVE EN EL MANEJO COMPLEMENTARIO DE CONDICIONES COMO EL MAL DE PARKINSON Y LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA V\\u00cdA PROMUEVE LA COHERENCIA ENTRE EL CEREBRO Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VISCERALES, FACILITANDO LA RELAJACI\\u00d3N Y EL EQUILIBRIO DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF DEPRESSIVE SYNDROME PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO BALANCE MELATONIN AND SEROTONIN PRODUCTION. IN CASES OF TREMORS OR RIGID SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH PARKINSON\'S, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MEDULLA OBLONGATA \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HEART \\/ HEART] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE STABILIZATION OF THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM THROUGH THE VAGUS NERVE, ENSURING A SAFE AND GRADUAL EMOTIONAL RELEASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROEMOCIONAL: SI EL S\\u00cdNDROME DEPRESIVO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA EQUILIBRAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE MELATONINA Y SEROTONINA. EN CASOS DE TEMBLORES O S\\u00cdNTOMAS R\\u00cdGIDOS ASOCIADOS AL PARKINSON, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL NERVIO VAGO, GARANTIZANDO UNA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL SEGURA Y GRADUAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/465','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:54:46','2026-04-28 01:54:46'),(4263,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',466,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CEREBRAL HEMORRAGE (HEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR PELVIC INFLAMMATORY ISSUES, URINARY DISCOMFORT, AND IN SOME CASES, CONCERNS RELATED TO CEREBRAL VASCULAR INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL DE PROBLEMAS INFLAMATORIOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, MALESTAR URINARIO Y, EN ALGUNOS CASOS, PREOCUPACIONES RELACIONADAS CON LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR CEREBRAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF MYCOPLASMA HOMINIS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE FIRST LUMBAR VERTEBRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THIS BACTERIA, WHICH IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH UROGENITAL TRACT INFECTIONS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PROTECTING VASCULAR STRUCTURES, AS THIS PATHOGEN HAS BEEN LINKED TO COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS CEREBRAL HEMORRHAGE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS SPINAL INTEGRITY AND HELPS MITIGATE THE RISK OF SECONDARY INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES THROUGHOUT THE NERVOUS AND REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE MYCOPLASMA HOMINIS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LA PRIMERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE ESTA BACTERIA, QUE A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO UROGENITAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PROTEGER LAS ESTRUCTURAS VASCULARES, YA QUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE HA VINCULADO CON COMPLICACIONES COMO LA HEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA INTEGRIDAD ESPINAL Y AYUDA A MITIGAR EL RIESGO DE RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS SECUNDARIAS EN LOS SISTEMAS NERVIOSO Y REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR & GENITOURINARY CHECK: IF CONCERNS REGARDING CEREBRAL HEMORRHAGE OR VASCULAR STRESS PERSIST, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO ENSURE CRANIAL CIRCULATORY STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT PELVIC OR URINARY DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ L2] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARING OF MYCOPLASMA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y GENITOURINARIA: SI PERSISTEN LAS PREOCUPACIONES RESPECTO A LA HEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL O EL ESTR\\u00c9S VASCULAR, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD CIRCULATORIA CRANEAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO O URINARIO PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR \\/ L2]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE MYCOPLASMA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/466','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:55:45','2026-04-28 01:55:45'),(4264,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',467,'{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL FLORA IMBALANCE, DIARRHEA. (DESEQUILIBRIO DE LA FLORA INTESTINAL, DIARREA.\\n)\",\"paths\":\"MAY COME FROM OVERUSE OF ANTIBIOTICS. PANCREATIC DYSFUNCTION, DIABETES MELLITUS. (PUEDE PROVENIR DEL USO EXCESIVO DE ANTIBI\\u00d3TICOS. DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA, DIABETES MELLITUS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL FLORA IMBALANCE, SEVERE DIARRHEA, AND ABDOMINAL PAIN.\\n\\n(DESEQUILIBRIO DE LA FLORA INTESTINAL, DIARREA SEVERA Y DOLOR ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE SECOND LUMBAR VERTEBRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIUM IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE OVERUSE OF ANTIBIOTICS, WHICH DISRUPTS THE NATURAL MICROBIOME. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN MANAGING INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION AND PREVENTING SECONDARY METABOLIC COMPLICATIONS, SUCH AS PANCREATIC DYSFUNCTION OR SYMPTOMS RESEMBLING DIABETES MELLITUS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF HEALTHY GUT FLORA AND PROTECTS THE INTEGRITY OF THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LA SEGUNDA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA BACTERIA SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL USO EXCESIVO DE ANTIBI\\u00d3TICOS, QUE ALTERS EL MICROBIOMA NATURAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A MANEJAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS SECUNDARIAS, COMO LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA O S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE SE ASEMEJAN A LA DIABETES MELLITUS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA FLORA INTESTINAL SALUDABLE Y PROTEGE LA INTEGRIDAD DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INTESTINAL & METABOLIC CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR DIGESTIVE DISTRESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING BLOOD SUGAR IRREGULARITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE TO REINFORCE GLANDULAR STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN MAINTAINING HYDRATION AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARING OF THE BACTERIAL INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LA DIARREA O EL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] PARA ABORDAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRREGULARIDADES EN EL AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIDAD GLANDULAR. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A MANTENER LA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/467','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:56:49','2026-04-28 01:56:49'),(4265,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',468,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AFFECTS THE GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT. ABSCESSES. (AFECTA EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL. ABSCESOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT, FORMATION OF ABSCESSES, AND LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL, FORMACI\\u00d3N DE ABSCESOS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF ACTINOMYCES ISRAELII BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE THIRD LUMBAR VERTEBRA AND THE LEFT BICEPS FEMORIS MUSCLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIUM IS KNOWN FOR CAUSING SLOW-GROWING, LUMPY ABSCESSES (ACTINOMYCOSIS) THAT CAN PENETRATE SURROUNDING TISSUES, PARTICULARLY IN THE ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC REGIONS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CONTAINING THE INFECTION AND PREVENTING THE FORMATION OF SINUS TRACTS OR DEEP TISSUE LESIONS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR SUPPORTING GASTROINTESTINAL HEALTH AND REDUCING CHRONIC INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES ASSOCIATED WITH THIS SPECIFIC BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE ACTINOMYCES ISRAELII MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR Y EL M\\u00daSCULO B\\u00cdCEPS FEMORAL IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, SE CONOCE QUE ESTA BACTERIA CAUSA ABSCESOS DE CRECIMIENTO LENTO (ACTINOMICOSIS) QUE PUEDEN PENETRAR LOS TEJIDOS CIRCUNDANTES, PARTICULARMENTE EN LAS REGIONES ABDOMINAL Y P\\u00c9LVICA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A CONTENER LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y PREVENIR LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TRAYECTOS FISTULOSOS O LESIONES TISULARES PROFUNDAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA APOYAR LA SALUD GASTROINTESTINAL Y REDUCIR LAS RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS CR\\u00d3NICAS ASOCIADAS CON ESTA CARGA BACTERIANA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & TISSUE CHECK: IF ABSCESSES OR ABDOMINAL PAIN PERSIST, SCAN THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] AXIS TO REINFORCE SPINAL AND SYSTEMIC STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE INTESTINAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FINAL FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT RECOVERY DURING THE TREATMENT OF ACTINOMYCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y TISULAR: SI LOS ABSCESOS O EL DOLOR ABDOMINAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIDAD ESPINAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR INTESTINAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N FINAL DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE ACTINOMYCES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/468','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:57:48','2026-04-28 01:57:48'),(4266,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',469,'{\"symptoms\":\"UTI\'S (INFECCIONES URINARIAS)\",\"paths\":\"CYSTITIS, PROSTATITIS (CISTITIS, PROSTATITIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI\'S), PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND INFLAMMATION OF THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES URINARIAS (IUU), MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF UREAPLASMA UREALYTICUM BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE THIRD LUMBAR VERTEBRA AND THE RIGHT CHONDRAL REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIUM IS A COMMON CAUSE OF CYSTITIS AND PROSTATITIS, OFTEN TRANSMITTED SEXUALLY OR THROUGH IMBALANCES IN THE UROGENITAL FLORA. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE INFECTION AND REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE BLADDER AND PROSTATE. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CRITICAL FOR PREVENTING RECURRING URINARY INFECTIONS AND SUPPORTING THE STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY OF THE LOWER LUMBAR AND PELVIC TISSUES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE UREAPLASMA UREALYTICUM MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR Y LA REGI\\u00d3N CONDRAL DERECHA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA BACTERIA ES UNA CAUSA COM\\u00daN DE CISTITIS Y PROSTATITIS, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDA POR V\\u00cdA SEXUAL O POR DESEQUILIBRIOS EN LA FLORA UROGENITAL. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LA VEJIGA Y LA PR\\u00d3STATA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA PREVENIR INFECCIONES URINARIAS RECURRENTES Y APOYAR LA INTEGRIDAD ESTRUCTURAL DE LOS TEJIDOS LUMBARES INFERIORES Y P\\u00c9LVICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & PARTNER CHECK: BECAUSE THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED, IT IS STRONGLY ADVISED TO SCAN THE PARTNER TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION. IF CYSTITIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [URETER \\/ URETER] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PROSTATITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PROSTATE \\/ RECTUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FINAL FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL LOADS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y DE PAREJA: DEBIDO A QUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO POR V\\u00cdA SEXUAL, SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE ESCANEAR A LA PAREJA PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N. SI LA CISTITIS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROSTATITIS SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PR\\u00d3STATA \\/ RECTO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N FINAL DE LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/469','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:58:53','2026-04-28 01:58:53'),(4267,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',470,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS. (FIEBRE, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS.)\",\"paths\":\"INFLAMED LYMPH GLANDS. RESPIRATORY DISEASE, CANCER OR TUMORS. (GL\\u00c1NDULAS LINF\\u00c1TICAS INFLAMADAS. ENFERMEDAD RESPIRATORIA, C\\u00c1NCER O TUMORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - FALLOPIAN TUBE\\/FALLOPIAN TUBE (REVISAR - TROMPA DE FALOPIO\\/TROMPA DE FALOPIO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, AND RESPIRATORY DISORDERS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL Y TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF THE ADENOVIRUS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE THIRD LUMBAR VERTEBRA AND THE THIRD DORSAL (THORACIC) VERTEBRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING VIRAL INFECTIONS THAT TARGET THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM, OFTEN CAUSING GLANDULAR INFLAMMATION. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE VIRUS FROM CONTRIBUTING TO SEVERE RESPIRATORY DISEASES OR THE FORMATION OF ABNORMAL TISSUE GROWTHS (TUMORS\\/CANCER). STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE CLEARANCE OF ABDOMINAL CONGESTION AND RESTORES BALANCE TO THE BODY\'S LINFATIC DEFENSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DEL ADENOVIRUS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR Y LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL (TOR\\u00c1CICA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE INFECCIONES VIRALES QUE ATACAN EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO, CAUSANDO A MENUDO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A EVITAR QUE EL VIRUS CONTRIBUYA A ENFERMEDADES RESPIRATORIAS GRAVES O A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE CRECIMIENTOS TISULARES ANORMALES (TUMORES\\/C\\u00c1NCER). LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL Y RESTAURA EL EQUILIBRIO DE LAS DEFENSAS LINF\\u00c1TICAS DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF GLANDULAR INFLAMMATION OR RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS PERSIST, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FALLOPIAN TUBE \\/ FALLOPIAN TUBE] RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL DISTENTION, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO REINFORCE SYSTEMIC FILTRATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE CLEARING OF THE ADENOVIRUS LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTEN, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TROMPA DE FALOPIO \\/ TROMPA DE FALOPIO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL SEVERA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA REFORZAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA DE ADENOVIRUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/470','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 01:59:56','2026-04-28 01:59:56'),(4268,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',471,'{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT PAINS, RESTLESSNESS. (DOLORES ARTICULARES, INQUIETUD)\",\"paths\":\"INSOMNIA, JOINT, ABORTED FETUS, JOINT DESTRUCTION. (INSOMNIO, ARTICULACIONES, FETO ABORTADO, DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT PAINS, RESTLESSNESS, AND INSOMNIA.\\n\\n(DOLORES ARTICULARES, INQUIETUD E INSOMNIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF STREPTOCOCCUS B AGALACTIAE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE THIRD LUMBAR VERTEBRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIUM IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT DUE TO ITS POTENTIAL FOR AGGRESSIVE TISSUE IMPACT, INCLUDING JOINT DESTRUCTION AND COMPLICATIONS DURING PREGNANCY, SUCH AS RISK TO THE FETUS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE BACTERIA FROM COLONIZING THE SKELETAL SYSTEM OR CROSSING CRITICAL BIOLOGICAL BARRIERS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS ESSENTIAL FOR PROTECTING JOINT INTEGRITY AND RESOLVING THE DEBILITATING RESTLESSNESS AND SLEEP DISRUPTIONS ASSOCIATED WITH THIS SPECIFIC BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE STREPTOCOCCUS B AGALACTIAE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA BACTERIA ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVA DEBIDO A SU POTENCIAL DE IMPACTO AGRESIVO EN LOS TEJIDOS, INCLUYENDO LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y COMPLICACIONES DURANTE EL EMBARAZO, COMO RIESGOS PARA EL FETO. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A EVITAR QUE LA BACTERIA COLONICE EL SISTEMA ESQUEL\\u00c9TICO O CRUCE BARRERAS BIOL\\u00d3GICAS CR\\u00cdTICAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES ESENCIAL PARA PROTEGER LA INTEGRIDAD ARTICULAR Y RESOLVER LA INQUIETUD DEBILITANTE Y LAS ALTERACIONES DEL SUE\\u00d1O ASOCIADAS CON ESTA CARGA BACTERIANA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT & PREVENTATIVE CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN OR DESTRUCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] AXIS TO ENSURE TOTAL SPINAL STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING PREGNANCY OR HIGH VIRAL SUSCEPTIBILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ SUPRARENAL] (REF 472) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT ADENOVIRUS CO-INFECTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE FINAL FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC CLEARANCE DURING THE TREATMENT OF STREPTOCOCCUS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y PREVENTIVA: SI EL DOLOR O LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD ESPINAL TOTAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN EMBARAZO O ALTA SUSCEPTIBILIDAD VIRAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ SUPRARRENAL] (REF 472) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES POR ADENOVIRUS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N FINAL DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE STREPTOCOCCUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/471','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 02:00:53','2026-04-28 02:00:53'),(4269,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',472,'{\"symptoms\":\"ALKALINE URINE, FISHY URINE ODOR. (ORINA ALCALINA, OLOR A PESCADO EN LA ORINA.)\",\"paths\":\"KIDNEY STONES, RENAL FAILURE. (C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ALKALINE URINE, FISHY URINE ODOR, AND UROGENITAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ORINA ALCALINA, OLOR A PESCADO EN LA ORINA Y MALESTAR UROGENITAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF PROTEUS MIRABILIS BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE FOURTH LUMBAR VERTEBRA AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIUM IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT DUE TO ITS ABILITY TO PRODUCE UREASE, WHICH ALKALINIZES THE URINE AND LEADS TO THE FORMATION OF STRUVITE KIDNEY STONES. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING RENAL FAILURE AND PROTECTING THE LOWER URINARY TRACT FROM CHRONIC INFECTION. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CRITICAL FOR MAINTAINING PROPER RENAL FILTRATION AND REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC TOXICITY ASSOCIATED WITH PERSISTENT PROTEUS INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE PROTEUS MIRABILIS MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO ENTRE LA CUARTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA BACTERIA ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVA DEBIDO A SU CAPACIDAD PARA PRODUCIR UREASA, QUE ALCALINIZA LA ORINA Y CONDUCE A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES DE ESTRUVITA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR LA INSUFICIENCIA RENAL Y A PROTEGER EL TRACTO URINARIO INFERIOR DE INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA MANTENER UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL ADECUADA Y REDUCIR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA ASOCIADA CON INFECCIONES PERSISTENTES POR PROTEUS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RENAL & URINARY CHECK: IF KIDNEY STONES OR ALKALINE URINE PERSIST, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) AXIS TO REINFORCE DIRECT RENAL STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LOWER BACK PAIN OR SACRAL INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER BACTERIAL LOADS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [URETER \\/ URETER] CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN THE CLEARANCE OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO SUPPORT THE FLOW OF URINE DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y URINARIA: SI LOS C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES O LA ORINA ALCALINA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIDAD RENAL DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR LUMBAR SEVERO O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SACRA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SACRO \\/ SACRO] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER] PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y APOYAR EL FLUJO DE ORINA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/472','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:29:52','2026-04-28 06:29:52'),(4270,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',473,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MYELOID LEUKEMIA (LEUCEMIA MIELOIDE)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ANUS\\/ANUS (REVISAR - ANO\\/ANO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR SIGNIFICANT BLOOD DISORDERS, SEVERE FATIGUE, ANEMIA, AND BONE MARROW STRESS.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL DE TRASTORNOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS SIGNIFICATIVOS, FATIGA SEVERA, ANEMIA Y ESTR\\u00c9S EN LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES A COMPLEX BIOELECTRICAL IMBALANCE BETWEEN THE FOURTH LUMBAR VERTEBRA AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ASSOCIATED WITH MYELOID LEUKEMIA, A CONDITION CHARACTERIZED BY THE ABNORMAL PRODUCTION OF MYELOID CELLS IN THE BONE MARROW. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS ALIGNMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN REGULATING HEMATOLOGICAL FUNCTION AND MITIGATING THE ENERGY IMBALANCES THAT CONTRIBUTE TO MALIGNANT BLOOD CONDITIONS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION SUPPORTS THE BODY\'S EFFORTS TO MAINTAIN VASCULAR AND CELLULAR INTEGRITY, REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC STRAIN ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC DEGENERATIVE PROCESSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA UN DESEQUILIBRIO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO COMPLEJO ENTRE LA CUARTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE ASOCIA CON LA LEUCEMIA MIELOIDE, UNA CONDICI\\u00d3N CARACTERIZADA POR LA PRODU\\u00c7\\u00c3O ANORMAL DE C\\u00c9LULAS MIELOIDES EN LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA ALINEACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A REGULAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA Y MITIGAR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A CONDICIONES SANGU\\u00cdNEAS MALIGNAS. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N APOYA LOS ESFUERZOS DEL CUERPO PARA MANTENER LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR Y CELULAR, REDUCIENDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA ASOCIADA CON PROCESOS DEGENERATIVOS CR\\u00d3NICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEMATOLOGICAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IT IS CRITICAL TO MONITOR THE [ANUS \\/ ANUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL PATHOGENIC RESERVOIRS THAT COMPLICATE BLOOD HEALTH. IF ANEMIA OR FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT BLOOD FILTRATION AND IMMUNE RESPONSE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO ASSIST THE BODY IN SYSTEMIC PURIFICATION AND TO SUPPORT RENAL STABILITY DURING THE MANAGEMENT OF COMPLEX LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: ES CR\\u00cdTICO MONITOREAR EL EJE [ANO \\/ ANO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES RESERVORIOS PATOG\\u00c9NICOS QUE COMPLICAN LA SALUD SANGU\\u00cdNEA. SI LA ANEMIA O LA FATIGA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ BAZO] PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA Y LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO EN LA PURIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD RENAL DURANTE EL MANEJO DE CARGAS COMPLEJAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/473','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:31:13','2026-04-28 06:31:13'),(4271,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',474,'{\"symptoms\":\"BURNING URINATION, DISCHARGE FROM THE URETHRA, VAGINAL AND URETHRA ODOR AND DISCHARGE BABY, GASTRITIS, ACID REFLUX AND DIFFICULT SWALLOWING. (ARDOR AL ORINAR, SECRECI\\u00d3N DE LA URETRA, OLOR Y SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL Y DE LA URETRA EN EL BEB\\u00c9, GASTRITIS, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO Y DIFICULTAD PARA TRAGAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED SEXUALLY. PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE, GONERRHEA, ABSCESSES, PROSTATITIS, VAGINITIS, VULVITIS, SCLERODERMA. (TRANSMITIDO SEXUALMENTE. ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA P\\u00c9LVICA, GONORREA, ABSCESOS, PROSTATITIS, VAGINITIS, VULVITIS, ESCLERODERMIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH DORSAL 5\\/LUMBAR 2; ARTHRITIS         CHECK - MANDIBLE   CHECK - DORSAL\\/LUMBAR             CHECK - DELTOID     CHECK - QUADRATUS (ASOCIADO CON DORSAL 5\\/LUMBAR 2; ARTRITIS         REVISAR - MAND\\u00cdBULA   REVISAR - DORSAL\\/LUMBAR             REVISAR - DELTOIDES     REVISAR - CUADRADO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"BURNING URINATION, DISCHARGE FROM THE URETHRA, VAGINAL AND URETHRA ODOR, AND DISCHARGE IN BABIES. ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH GASTRITIS, ACID REFLUX, AND DIFFICULTY SWALLOWING.\\n\\n(ARDOR AL ORINAR, SECRECI\\u00d3N DE LA URETRA, OLOR Y SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL Y DE LA URETRA EN EL BEB\\u00c9, GASTRITIS, REFLUJO \\u00c1CIDO Y DIFICULTAD PARA TRAGAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY OF NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE BY STABILIZING THE BIOELECTRICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE FOURTH LUMBAR VERTEBRA IN A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIUM IS RECOGNIZED AS A SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED PATHOGEN THAT CAN LEAD TO PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE, PROSTATITIS, VAGINITIS, AND VULVITIS. BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING THE FORMATION OF ABSCESSES AND ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS SCLERODERMA. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION IS CRITICAL FOR CLEARING UROGENITAL INFECTIONS AND RELIEVING RELATED DIGESTIVE DISTRESS LIKE GASTRITIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA DE NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LA CUARTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, SE RECONOCE QUE ESTA BACTERIA ES UN PAT\\u00d3GENO DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA P\\u00c9LVICA, PROSTATITIS, VAGINITIS Y VULVITIS. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE ABSCESOS Y A ABORDAR COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMO LA ESCLERODERMIA. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA DEPURA LAS INFECCIONES UROGENITALES Y ALIVIAR EL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO RELACIONADO, COMO LA GASTRITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT & SYSTEMIC CHECK: THIS PAIR IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE [DORSAL 5 \\/ LUMBAR 2] AXIS. IF SYMPTOMS OF ARTHRITIS PERSIST, SCAN THE MANDIBLE, DORSAL\\/LUMBAR REGIONS, DELTOID, AND QUADRATUS MUSCLES. BECAUSE THIS PATHOGEN IS SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED, IT IS STRONGLY ADVISED TO SCAN THE PARTNER TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 429) CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARING OF THE BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON EL EJE [DORSAL 5 \\/ LUMBAR 2]. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE ARTRITIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA MAND\\u00cdBULA, LAS REGIONES DORSAL\\/LUMBAR, EL DELTOIDES Y EL CUADRADO LUMBAR. DEBIDO A QUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL, SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE ESCANEAR A LA PAREJA PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 429) PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/474','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:32:26','2026-04-28 06:32:26'),(4272,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',475,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER. (TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - POLO\\/POLO (REVISAR - POLO\\/POLO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"NERVOUS SYSTEM REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIFFICULTY SUSTAINING ATTENTION, HYPERACTIVITY, IMPULSIVITY, AND COGNITIVE FATIGUE.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD PARA MANTENER LA ATENCI\\u00d3N, HIPERACTIVIDAD, IMPULSIVIDAD Y FATIGA COGNITIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOELECTRICAL REGULATION OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM BY STABILIZING THE AXIS BETWEEN THE FIFTH LUMBAR VERTEBRA AND THE THIRD DORSAL (THORACIC) VERTEBRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CLASSIFIED AS SPECIAL BECAUSE IT IS PRIMARILY USED TO MANAGE ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER (ADD\\/ADHD). BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THIS SPINAL SEGMENT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE OVERSTIMULATION OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, HELPING TO IMPROVE FOCUS AND REDUCE THE MENTAL RESTLESSNESS ASSOCIATED WITH NEURODIVERGENT COGNITIVE PATTERNS. STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION PROMOTES BETTER COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE LOWER SPINAL NERVES AND THE UPPER THORACIC REGION, WHICH SUPPORTS OVERALL MENTAL CLARITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO MEDIANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENTRE LA QUINTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR Y LA TERCERA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL (TOR\\u00c1CICA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR SE CLASIFICA COMO ESPECIAL PORQUE SE UTILIZA PRINCIPALMENTE PARA MANEJAR EL TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N (TDA\\/TDAH). AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE ESTE SEGMENTO ESPINAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA SOBREESTIMULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, AYUDANDO A MEJORAR LA CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N Y REDUCIR LA INQUIETUD MENTAL ASOCIADA CON PATRONES COGNITIVOS NEURODIVERGENTES. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROMUEVE UNA MEJOR COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LOS NERVIOS ESPINALES INFERIORES Y LA REGI\\u00d3N TOR\\u00c1CICA SUPERIOR, LO QUE APOYA LA CLARIDAD MENTAL GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE & POLARITY CHECK: IT IS ADVISED TO CHECK THE POLO \\/ POLO (POLE \\/ POLE) AXIS TO REINFORCE BRAIN HEMISPHERE SYMMETRY AND BALANCE COGNITIVE FUNCTIONS. IF HYPERACTIVITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] AXIS TO ENSURE TOTAL SPINAL STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE NATURAL REGULATION OF NEUROTRANSMITTERS THAT GOVERN ATTENTION AND SLEEP CYCLES DURING THE MANAGEMENT OF ADD.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA Y DE POLARIDAD: SE RECOMIENDA REVISAR EL EJE POLO \\/ POLO PARA REFORZAR LA SIMETR\\u00cdA DE LOS HEMISFERIOS CEREBRALES Y EQUILIBRAR LAS FUNCIONES COGNITIVAS. SI LA HIPERACTIVIDAD PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD ESPINAL TOTAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N NATURAL DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES QUE RIGEN LA ATENCI\\u00d3N Y LOS CICLOS DE SUE\\u00d1O DURANTE EL MANEJO DEL TDA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/475','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:35:00','2026-04-28 06:35:00'),(4273,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',476,'{\"origins\":\"STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS\",\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND SOFT TISSUE INFECTIONS. (INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL Y TEJIDOS BLANDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY OPEN PUS WOUNDS. SEPTIC ARTHRITIS, ENDOCARDITIS INFECTION AND PNEUMONIA. (TRANSMITIDO POR HERIDAS ABIERTAS CON PUS. ARTRITIS S\\u00c9PTICA, ENDOCARDITIS E INFECCI\\u00d3N Y NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS (ESTAFILOCOCO \\u00c1UREO)\",\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND SOFT TISSUE INFECTIONS, SEPTIC ARTHRITIS, ENDOCARDITIS, AND PNEUMONIA.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL Y TEJIDOS BLANDOS, ARTRITIS S\\u00c9PTICA, ENDOCARDITIS Y NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE FIFTH LUMBAR VERTEBRA IN A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN ORIGINATE FROM OPEN PUS-FILLED WOUNDS AND CAN BECOME SYSTEMIC. BY STABILIZING THIS REGION, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ENVIRONMENT, HELPING TO PREVENT SEVERE COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS THE INFLAMMATION OF THE HEART LINING (ENDOCARDITIS) OR LUNG INFECTIONS (PNEUMONIA). RESTORING BALANCE TO THIS LUMBAR SEGMENT SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CONTAINING LOCALIZED SKIN INFECTIONS AND PREVENTING THEIR SPREAD TO JOINTS AND VITAL ORGANS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA QUINTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES QUE A MENUDO SE ORIGINAN EN HERIDAS ABIERTAS CON PUS Y PUEDEN VOLVERSE SIST\\u00c9MICAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA REGI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO BACTERIANO, AYUDANDO A PREVENIR COMPLICACIONES GRAVES COMO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL REVESTIMIENTO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N (ENDOCARDITIS) O INFECCIONES PULMONARES (NEUMON\\u00cdA). RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN ESTE SEGMENTO LUMBAR APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA CONTENER LAS INFECCIONES LOCALIZADAS EN LA PIEL Y EVITAR SU PROPAGACI\\u00d3N A LAS ARTICULACIONES Y \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & SOFT TISSUE CHECK: IF SKIN INFLAMMATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] AXIS TO REINFORCE SPINAL INTEGRITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING JOINT PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KNEE \\/ KNEE] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED ARTHRITIC SYNERGIES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM STAPH INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y DE TEJIDOS BLANDOS: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] PARA REFORZAR LA INTEGRIDAD ESPINAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RODILLA \\/ RODILLA] PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS ARTR\\u00cdTICAS LOCALIZADAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES POR ESTAFILOCOCO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/476','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:37:35','2026-04-28 06:37:35'),(4274,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',477,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, RECTAL BLEEDING, OBESITY, BLOATING, GAS, LOWER LIMB PAIN. WOUND INFECTIONS. (DIARREA, SANGRADO RECTAL, OBESIDAD, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, GASES, DOLOR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. INFECCIONES DE HERIDAS.)\",\"paths\":\"ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC INFECTIONS, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, ORAL INFECTIONS, SEPSIS, BLOOD POISONING, THE INFECTION OF THE LINING OF THE HEART. DIVERTICULITIS. (INFECCIONES ABDOMINALES Y P\\u00c9LVICAS, INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, INFECCIONES ORALES, SEPSIS, ENVENENAMIENTO DE LA SANGRE, INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL REVESTIMIENTO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N. DIVERTICULITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, RECTAL BLEEDING, OBESITY, BLOATING, GAS, LOWER LIMB PAIN, AND WOUND INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(DIARREA, SANGRADO RECTAL, OBESIDAD, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, GASES, DOLOR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES E INFECCIONES DE HERIDAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE ENTEROCOCCUS C BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE LUMBAR PLEXUS IN A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING DEEP-SEATED ABDOMINAL AND PELVIC INFECTIONS THAT CAN LEAD TO SEVERE COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS DIVERTICULITIS OR SEPSIS (BLOOD POISONING). BY STABILIZING THIS NEURAL AND VASCULAR HUB, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ENVIRONMENT, PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM SPREADING TO THE URINARY TRACT, ORAL CAVITY, OR THE LINING OF THE HEART (ENDOCARDITIS). RESTORING BALANCE TO THE LUMBAR PLEXUS SUPPORTS SYSTEMIC IMMUNITY AND PROTECTS VITAL ORGANS FROM BACTERIAL DISSEMINATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ENTEROCOCCUS C MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL PLEXO LUMBAR EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES ABDOMINALES Y P\\u00c9LVICAS PROFUNDAS QUE PUEDEN CONDUCIR A COMPLICACIONES GRAVES COMO DIVERTICULITIS O SEPSIS (ENVENENAMIENTO DE LA SANGRE). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE N\\u00daCLEO NEURAL Y VASCULAR, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO BACTERIANO, EVITANDO QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO SE EXTIENDA AL TRACTO URINARIO, LA CAVIDAD ORAL O EL REVESTIMIENTO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N (ENDOCARDITIS). RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN EL PLEXO LUMBAR APOYA LA INMUNIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PROTEGE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS VITALES DE LA DISEMINACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & CIRCULATORY CHECK: IF RECTAL BLEEDING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE INTESTINAL BARRIER. FOR CASES INVOLVING POTENTIAL SYSTEMIC INFECTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT BLOOD PURIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM ENTEROCOCCAL INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y CIRCULATORIA: SI EL SANGRADO RECTAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO PARA REFORZAR LA BARRERA INTESTINAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA POSIBLE INFECCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA PURIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES POR ENTEROCOCOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/477','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:38:38','2026-04-28 06:38:38'),(4275,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',478,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER. (TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC ATTENTION DISORDER (TRASTORNO DE ATENCI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER (ADD), DIFFICULTY CONCENTRATING, AND MENTAL DISORGANIZATION.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N (TDA), DIFICULTAD PARA CONCENTRARSE Y DESORGANIZACI\\u00d3N MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EMOTIONAL AND PSYCHOSOMATIC ROOTS OF COGNITIVE DISPERSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LUMBAR AND DORSAL REGIONS OF THE SPINE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO RESET THE FLOW OF ENERGY THAT GOVERNS CONCENTRATION AND MENTAL DISCIPLINE. BY STABILIZING THIS SPINAL SEGMENT, THE RESET HELPS TO GROUND THE INDIVIDUAL, REDUCING THE \\\"SCATTERED\\\" SENSATION OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER. IT SUPPORTS THE REESTABLISHMENT OF A STEADY FOCUS BY CALMING THE EMOTIONAL OVERSTIMULATION THAT CAN INTERFERE WITH EXECUTIVE BRAIN FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LAS RA\\u00cdCES EMOCIONALES Y PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICAS DE LA DISPERSI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LAS REGIONES LUMBAR Y DORSAL DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA REINICIAR EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA QUE RIGE LA CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N Y LA DISCIPLINA MENTAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE SEGMENTO ESPINAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARRAIGAR AL INDIVIDUO, REDUCIENDO LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE \\\"DISPERSI\\u00d3N\\\" QUE SUELE ASOCIARSE CON EL TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N. APOYA EL REESTABLECIMIENTO DE UN ENFOQUE CONSTANTE AL CALMAR LA SOBREESTIMULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL QUE PUEDE INTERFERIR CON LAS FUNCIONES CEREBRALES EJECUTIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE & SPINAL CHECK: IF MENTAL FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUMBAR 5 \\/ DORSAL 3] (REF 484) AXIS TO ADDRESS THE PHYSICAL REGULATION OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING HIGH ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER BALANCE OF NEUROTRANSMITTERS NECESSARY FOR SUSTAINED ATTENTION AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA Y ESPINAL: SI LA FATIGA MENTAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LUMBAR 5 \\/ DORSAL 3] (REF 484) PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD ELEVADA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO ADECUADO DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES NECESARIOS PARA LA ATENCI\\u00d3N SOSTENIDA Y LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/478','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:39:51','2026-04-28 06:39:51'),(4276,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',479,'{\"origins\":\"MENINGOCOCCUS\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SPINA BIFIDA (ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MENINGOCOCCUS (NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE BACK PAIN, STIFFNESS, POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL WEAKNESS, AND INFLAMMATION OF THE SPINAL MEMBRANES.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE ESPALDA SEVERO, RIGIDEZ, POSIBLE DEBILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MEMBRANAS ESPINALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE MENINGOCOCCUS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE LUMBAR REGION OF THE BACK. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL AS THE PATHOGEN CAN INFLUENCE THE STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY OF THE SPINAL COLUMN. THE RESET IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH ADDRESSING THE ENERGETIC COMPONENT OF CONDITIONS SUCH AS SPINA BIFIDA (ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA), WHERE THE BACTERIAL LOAD MAY AGGRAVATE SPINAL MALFORMATIONS OR NERVE COMPRESSION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE BODY IS SUPPORTED IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION OF THE MENINGES AND PREVENTING THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THE INFECTION TO THE BRAIN OR OTHER VITAL NEUROLOGICAL HUBS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA MENINGOCOCO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N LUMBAR DE LA ESPALDA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE INFLUIR EN LA INTEGRIDAD ESTRUCTURAL DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL. EL REINICIO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON EL ABORDAJE DEL COMPONENTE ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE CONDICIONES COMO LA ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA, DONDE LA CARGA BACTERIANA PUEDE AGRAVAR LAS MALFORMACIONES ESPINALES O LA COMPRESI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, SE APOYA AL CUERPO EN LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MENINGES Y EN LA PREVENCI\\u00d3N DE LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N HACIA EL CEREBRO U OTROS N\\u00daCLEOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS VITALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-SPINAL CHECK: IF SPINAL STIFFNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO RULE OUT MENINGEAL INFLAMMATION AT THE CRANIAL LEVEL. FOR CASES INVOLVING LOWER LIMB WEAKNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ ISCHIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM MENINGOCOCCAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-ESPINAL: SI LA RIGIDEZ ESPINAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA DESCARTAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N MEN\\u00cdNGEA A NIVEL CRANEAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEBILIDAD EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR \\/ ISQUION]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL ESTR\\u00c9S POR MENINGOCOCO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/479','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:41:11','2026-04-28 06:41:11'),(4277,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',480,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BED WETTING. (ENURESIS NOCTURNA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"URINARY SYSTEM REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA URINARIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"BED WETTING, INVOLUNTARY URINATION DURING SLEEP, AND PELVIC INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(ENURESIS NOCTURNA, MICCI\\u00d3N INVOLUNTARIA DURANTE EL SUE\\u00d1O E INESTABILIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE NEUROMUSCULAR CONTROL OF THE BLADDER BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE LOWER SPINAL JUNCTION BETWEEN THE LUMBAR VERTEBRAE AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR TREATING NOCTURNAL ENURESIS (BED WETTING), AS IT STIMULATES THE PROPER BIOELECTRICAL SIGNALING BETWEEN THE SPINAL CORD AND THE SPHINCTER MUSCLES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS REESTABLISH VOLUNTARY CONTROL OVER THE URINARY REFLEX DURING SLEEP AND ALLEVIATES ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES IN THE PELVIC REGION THAT MAY CONTRIBUTE TO INVOLUNTARY LEAKAGE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL CONTROL NEUROMUSCULAR DE LA VEJIGA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LA UNI\\u00d3N ESPINAL INFERIOR ENTRE LAS V\\u00c9RTEBRAS LUMBARES Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA TRATAR LA ENURESIS NOCTURNA, YA QUE ESTIMULA LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA CORRECTA ENTRE LA M\\u00c9DULA ESPINAL Y LOS M\\u00daSCULOS ESF\\u00cdNTERES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REESTABLECER EL CONTROL VOLUNTARIO SOBRE EL REFLEJO URINARIO DURANTE EL SUE\\u00d1O Y ALIVIA LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA QUE PUEDEN CONTRIBUIR A LAS FUGAS INVOLUNTARIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & NERVOUS CHECK: IF ENURESIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO DIRECTLY ADDRESS LOCALIZED MUSCLE TONE. FOR CASES LINKED TO EMOTIONAL STRESS OR ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ DORSAL] (REF 487) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE BALANCED FLUID PRODUCTION AND TO SUPPORT THE ENTIRE RENAL SYSTEM DURING THE CORRECTION OF URINARY DYSFUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y NERVIOSA: SI LA ENURESIS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA] PARA ABORDAR DIRECTAMENTE EL TONO MUSCULAR LOCALIZADO. PARA CASOS VINCULADOS AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL O ANSIEDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR \\/ DORSAL] (REF 487). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR UNA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS EQUILIBRADA Y APOYAR A TODO EL SISTEMA RENAL DURANTE LA CORRECCI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISFUNCIONES URINARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/480','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:42:19','2026-04-28 06:42:19'),(4278,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',481,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VARICOSE VEINS. (V\\u00c1RICES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"VARICOSE VEINS, LEG HEAVINESS, POOR CIRCULATION, AND LOWER LIMB DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(V\\u00c1RICES, PESADEZ EN LAS PIERNAS, MALA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N Y MALESTAR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON IMPROVING VENOUS RETURN AND VASCULAR INTEGRITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LUMBAR REGION AND THE SCIATIC NERVE PATHWAY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY UTILIZED TO ADDRESS VARICOSE VEINS (V\\u00c1RICES). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REDUCING THE CONGESTION OF BLOOD IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES, PROMOTING BETTER FLOW AND REDUCING THE PRESSURE ON THE VEIN WALLS. THIS PAIR SUPPORTS THE BODY IN ALLEVIATING THE SENSATION OF HEAVINESS AND SWELLING, RESTORING ENERGETIC BALANCE TO THE CIRCULATORY AND NERVOUS SYSTEMS OF THE LEGS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE ENFOCA EN MEJORAR EL RETORNO VENOSO Y LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N LUMBAR Y LA V\\u00cdA DEL NERVIO CI\\u00c1TICO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE PARA ABORDAR LAS V\\u00c1RICES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REDUCIR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N DE SANGRE EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, PROMOVIENDO UN MEJOR FLUJO Y REDUCIENDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N EN LAS PAREDES VENOSAS. ESTE PAR APOYA AL CUERPO PARA ALIVIAR LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PESADEZ E HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN LOS SISTEMAS CIRCULATORIO Y NERVIOSO DE LAS PIERNAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF LEG PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SCIATIC \\/ SCIATIC] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT NERVE INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CIRCULATORY STASIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ILIAC ARTERY \\/ ILIAC ARTERY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FLUID MANAGEMENT AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE IMPROVEMENT OF VENOUS FUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL DOLOR EN LAS PIERNAS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CI\\u00c1TICO \\/ CI\\u00c1TICO] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DIRECTA DEL NERVIO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA ESTASIS CIRCULATORIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ARTERIA IL\\u00cdACA \\/ ARTERIA IL\\u00cdACA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR UNA GESTI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA MEJOR\\u00cdA DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N VENOSA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/481','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:43:30','2026-04-28 06:43:30'),(4279,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',482,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SADNESS (TRISTEZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DEEP SADNESS (TRISTEZA PROFUNDA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEELINGS OF SADNESS, MELANCHOLY, A SENSATION OF WEIGHT OR TIGHTNESS IN THE CHEET, AND DISCOURAGEMENT.\\n\\n(SENTIMIENTOS DE TRISTEZA, MELANCOL\\u00cdA, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PESO EN EL PECHO Y DES\\u00c1NIMO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE SOMATIC IMPACT OF SADNESS ON THE BODY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT LUNG AND THE BRAINSTEM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE LUNGS ARE FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE STORAGE OF EMOTIONS RELATED TO LOSS AND GRIEF. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS RELEASE THE EMOTIONAL LOAD THAT MAY BE AFFECTING RESPIRATORY CAPACITY AND THE AUTOMATIC REGULATION OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT PROMOTES A SENSE OF EMOTIONAL RELIEF AND SUPPORTS THE BIOELECTRICAL BALANCE OF VITAL FUNCTIONS CONTROLLED BY THE BRAINSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL IMPACTO SOM\\u00c1TICO DE LA TRISTEZA EN EL CUERPO, NEUTRALIZANDO LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PULM\\u00d3N DERECHO Y EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO. EN EL BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS PULMONES SE ASOCIAN FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL ALMACENAMIENTO DE EMOCIONES RELACIONADAS CON LA P\\u00c9RDIDA Y EL DUELO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR LA CARGA EMOCIONAL QUE PUEDE ESTAR AFECTANDO LA CAPACIDAD RESPIRATORIA Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N AUTOM\\u00c1TICA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO PROMUEVE UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ALIVIO EMOCIONAL Y APOYA EL EQUILIBRIO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DE LAS FUNCIONES VITALES CONTROLADAS POR EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF THE TIGHTNESS IN THE CHEST PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO DIRECTLY ADDRESS PULMONARY CAPACITY. FOR CASES OF CHRONIC SADNESS AFFECTING SLEEP, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE ELIMINATION OF EMOTIONAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEM STABILITY DURING THE RELEASE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE APRIETO EN EL PECHO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR DIRECTAMENTE LA CAPACIDAD PULMONAR. PARA CASOS DE TRISTEZA CR\\u00d3NICA QUE AFECTAN EL SUE\\u00d1O, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS EMOCIONALES Y APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL SISTEMA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE LIBERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/482','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:45:00','2026-04-28 06:45:00'),(4280,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',483,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ALLERGIES. (FIEBRE, ALERGIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"ASTHMA, RHEUMATIC FEVER. (ASMA, FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY-ADRENAL SYNERGY (SINERGIA RESPIRATORIO-SUPRARRENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, ALLERGIES, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, AND CHRONIC FATIGUE.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, ALERGIAS, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR Y FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CRITICAL INTERACTION BETWEEN RESPIRATORY FUNCTION AND THE ENDOCRINE RESPONSE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE FRONT OF THE LUNG AND THE SUPRARENAL (ADRENAL) GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR TREATING ASTHMA AND RHEUMATIC FEVER, AS IT BALANCES THE BODY\'S INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS REGULATE CORTISOL LEVELS AND ADRENALINE, WHICH ARE VITAL FOR DILATING BRONCHIAL PASSAGES AND CALMING HYPERSENSITIVE IMMUNE REACTIONS. THIS PAIR SUPPORTS THE SYSTEM IN OVERCOMING CHRONIC ALLERGIC STATES AND RESTORING THERMAL BALANCE DURING FEBRILE EPISODES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA ABORDA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N CR\\u00cdTICA ENTRE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y LA RESPUESTA ENDOCRINA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORCIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PARTE ANTERIOR DEL PULM\\u00d3N Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA EL TRATAMIENTO DEL ASMA Y LA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, YA QUE EQUILIBRA LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA DEL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REGULAR LOS NIVELES DE CORTISOL Y ADRENALINA, QUE SON VITALES PARA DILATAR LOS PASAJES BRONQUIALES Y CALMAR LAS REACCIONES INMUNITARIAS HIPERSENSIBLES. ESTE PAR APOYA AL SISTEMA PARA SUPERAR ESTADOS AL\\u00c9RGICOS CR\\u00d3NICOS Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO T\\u00c9RMICO DURANTE EPISODIOS FEBRILES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE & ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF ALLERGIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT PULMONARY INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE JOINT PAIN ASSOCIATED WITH RHEUMATIC FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT TOXIN ELIMINATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE TOTAL ENDOCRINE STABILITY AND STRESS HORMONE REGULATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF RESPIRATORY DISTRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y ENDOCRINA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS AL\\u00c9RGICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO ASOCIADO CON LA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD ENDOCRINA TOTAL Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS HORMONAS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S DURANTE LA MEJOR\\u00cdA DE LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/483','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:46:12','2026-04-28 06:46:12'),(4281,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',484,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GUILT (CULPA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"GUILT, EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS, TIGHTNESS IN THE CHEST, AND ANXIETY.\\n\\n(CULPA, PESADEZ EMOCIONAL, OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO Y ANSIEDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PROFOUND EMOTIONAL INTERACTION BETWEEN THE RESPIRATORY AND CIRCULATORY CENTERS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LUNG AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY LINKED TO THE VIBRATION OF GUILT (CULPA). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELEASING THE ENERGETIC BURDEN THAT MANIFESTS AS PHYSICAL TIGHTNESS OR A \\\"HEAVY HEART.\\\" IT PROMOTES A SENSE OF EMOTIONAL LIBERATION AND FORGIVENESS, ALLOWING THE HEART TO RETURN TO ITS NATURAL RHYTHM AND THE LUNGS TO EXPAND WITHOUT THE RESTRICTION OF DEEP-SEATED EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA PROFUNDA INTERACCI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL ENTRE LOS CENTROS RESPIRATORIO Y CIRCULATORIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PULM\\u00d3N Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE A LA VIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LA CULPA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR LA CARGA ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO OPRESI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA O UN \\\"CORAZ\\u00d3N PESADO\\\". PROMUEVE UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y PERD\\u00d3N, PERMITIENDO QUE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N REGRESE A SU RITMO NATURAL Y QUE LOS PULMONES SE EXPANDAN SIN LA RESTRICCI\\u00d3N DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL PROFUNDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & CARDIAC CHECK: IF THE SENSATION OF OPRESSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG - R \\/ BRAINSTEM] (REF 491) AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY FEELINGS OF SADNESS. FOR CASES INVOLVING PALPITATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE BALANCING OF NEUROTRANSMITTERS THAT FACILITATE EMOTIONAL PROCESSING AND PEACE OF MIND.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y CARD\\u00cdACA: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE OPRESI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N - D \\/ TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO] (REF 491) PARA ABORDAR SENTIMIENTOS COMPLEMENTARIOS DE TRISTEZA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PALPITACIONES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES QUE FACILITAN EL PROCESO EMOCIONAL Y LA PAZ MENTAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/484','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:47:34','2026-04-28 06:47:34'),(4282,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',485,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SADNESS (TRISTEZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SADNESS (TRISTEZA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEELINGS OF MELANCHOLY, GRIEF, EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS, AND RESPIRATORY OPPRESSION.\\n\\n(SENTIMIENTOS DE MELANCOL\\u00cdA, DUELO, PESADEZ EMOCIONAL Y OPRESI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PROFOUND CONNECTION BETWEEN THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM AND THE HEART BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE CHEST CAVITY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE LUNGS ARE OFTEN RECOGNIZED AS THE PRIMARY STORAGE SITE FOR UNRESOLVED SADNESS AND GRIEF. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET HELPS TO DISSIPATE THE SOMATIC MANIFESTATIONS OF EMOTIONAL PAIN, SUCH AS THE FEELING OF A \\\"HEAVY HEART\\\" OR RESTRICTED BREATHING. RESTORING BALANCE TO THIS AREA ENCOURAGES EMOTIONAL RELEASE AND SUPPORTS THE CIRCULATORY AND RESPIRATORY SYSTEMS IN REGAINING THEIR NATURAL VITALITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA PROFUNDA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA CAVIDAD TOR\\u00c1CICA. EN EL BIOMAGNETISMO, SE RECONOCE A MENUDO QUE LOS PULMONES SON EL LUGAR DE ALMACENAMIENTO PRIMARIO DE LA TRISTEZA Y EL DUELO NO RESUELTOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DISIPAR LAS MANIFESTACIONES SOM\\u00c1TICAS DEL DOLOR EMOCIONAL, COMO LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE UN \\\"CORAZ\\u00d3N PESADO\\\" O LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N RESTRINGIDA. RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN ESTA \\u00c1REA FOMENTA LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y APOYA A LOS SISTEMAS CIRCULATORIO Y RESPIRATORIO PARA RECUPERAR SU VITALIDAD NATURAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & THORACIC CHECK: IF THE FEELING OF SADNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG - R \\/ BRAINSTEM] (REF 491) AXIS TO ADDRESS DEEPER NEURO-EMOTIONAL PATTERNS. FOR CASES INVOLVING ANXIETY OR GUILT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG \\/ HEART] (REF 493) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE PRODUCTION OF NEUROTRANSMITTERS THAT FACILITATE THE PROCESSING OF GRIEF AND THE RESTORATION OF INNER PEACE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y TOR\\u00c1CICA: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE TRISTEZA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N - D \\/ TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO] (REF 491) PARA ABORDAR PATRONES NEUROEMOCIONALES M\\u00c1S PROFUNDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD O CULPA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 493). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE NEUROTRANSMISORES QUE FACILITEN EL PROCESO DEL DUELO Y LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA PAZ INTERIOR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/485','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:48:52','2026-04-28 06:48:52'),(4283,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',486,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"LUNG DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR)\",\"paths\":\"CULPABILITY (CULPABILIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"LUNG DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"SHORTNESS OF BREATH, CHEST TIGHTNESS, RESPIRATORY FATIGUE, AND EMOTIONAL BURDEN.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, FATIGA RESPIRATORIA Y CARGA EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE BIOELECTRICAL IMBALANCE WITHIN THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN BOTH LUNGS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS DEEPLY CONNECTED TO THE VIBRATION OF CULPABILITY (CULPABILIDAD). WHEN THIS EMOTION IS RETAINED SOMATICALLY, IT OFTEN MANIFESTS AS A PHYSICAL WEIGHT UPON THE CHEST, RESTRICTING FULL BREATHING AND LEADING TO LUNG DYSFUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN THE RELEASE OF DEEP-SEATED GUILT, CLEARING THE ENERGETIC PATHWAYS OF THE THORACIC CAVITY AND SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF NATURAL RESPIRATORY VITALITY AND MENTAL PEACE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL SE DIRIGE AL DESEQUILIBRIO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DENTRO DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE AMBOS PULMONES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 PROFUNDAMENTE CONECTADO CON LA VIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LA CULPABILIDAD. CUANDO ESTA EMOCI\\u00d3N SE RETIENE SOM\\u00c1TICAMENTE, A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO UN PESO F\\u00cdSICO SOBRE EL PECHO, RESTRINGIENDO LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA Y CONDUCIENDO A UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE LA CULPA ARRAIGADA, LIMPIANDO LAS V\\u00cdAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DE LA CAVIDAD TOR\\u00c1CICA Y APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA VITALIDAD RESPIRATORIA NATURAL Y LA PAZ MENTAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF THE FEELING OF OPPRESSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ HEART] (REF 493) AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY EMOTIONAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC SADNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG - R \\/ BRAINSTEM] (REF 491) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE BALANCING OF NEUROTRANSMITTERS NECESSARY FOR PROCESSING COMPLEX EMOTIONS AND ACHIEVING INNER FORGIVENESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y RESPIRATORIA: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE OPRESI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 493) PARA ABORDAR SINERGIAS EMOCIONALES COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TRISTEZA CR\\u00d3NICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N - D \\/ TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO] (REF 491). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES NECESARIOS PARA PROCESAR EMOCIONES COMPLEJAS Y LOGRAR EL PERD\\u00d3N INTERIOR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/486','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:50:04','2026-04-28 06:50:04'),(4284,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',487,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PULMONARY DISFUNCTION. PAIR HELPS TO BRING OXYGEN TO THE PASSAGES. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR. EL PAR AYUDA A LLEVAR OX\\u00cdGENO A LAS V\\u00cdAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY EFFICIENCY (EFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SHORTNESS OF BREATH, LOW BLOOD OXYGEN LEVELS, RESPIRATORY FATIGUE, AND SHALLOW BREATHING.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, BAJOS NIVELES DE OX\\u00cdGENO EN SANGRE, FATIGA RESPIRATORIA Y RESPIRACI\\u00d3N SUPERFICIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES PHYSICAL PULMONARY DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE LUNGS IN A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC ORIENTATION IS USED TO OPTIMIZE THE MECHANICAL AND BIOELECTRICAL PASSAGES OF THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE LUNGS IN THEIR PRIMARY FUNCTION OF GAS EXCHANGE, HELPING TO INCREASE THE UPTAKE OF OXYGEN INTO THE BRONCHIAL PASSAGES AND SYSTEMIC CIRCULATION. THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING VITALITY TO INDIVIDUALS EXPERIENCING RESPIRATORY WEAKNESS OR RECOVERING FROM CONDITIONS THAT HAVE COMPROMISED LUNG CAPACITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR F\\u00cdSICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS PULMONES EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA ORIENTACI\\u00d3N ESPEC\\u00cdFICA SE UTILIZA PARA OPTIMIZAR LOS PASAJES MEC\\u00c1NICOS Y BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICOS DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LOS PULMONES EN SU FUNCI\\u00d3N PRIMARIA DE INTERCAMBIO GASEOSO, AYUDANDO A AUMENTAR LA CAPTACI\\u00d3N DE OX\\u00cdGENO EN LAS V\\u00cdAS BRONQUIALES Y LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD EN PERSONAS QUE EXPERIMENTAN DEBILIDAD RESPIRATORIA O QUE SE RECUPERAN DE CONDICIONES QUE HAN COMPROMETIDO LA CAPACIDAD PULMONAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & CIRCULATORY CHECK: IF OXYGEN SATURATION REMAINS LOW, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ HEART] (REF 494) AXIS TO SUPPORT CARDIO-PULMONARY SYNERGY. FOR CASES INVOLVING INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG - FRONT \\/ SUPRARENAL] (REF 492) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER BLOOD PH REGULATION, WHICH IS CRITICAL FOR EFFICIENT OXYGEN TRANSPORT DURING THE RECOVERY OF LUNG FUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y CIRCULATORIA: SI LA SATURACI\\u00d3N DE OX\\u00cdGENO SIGUE SIENDO BAJA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 494) PARA APOYAR LA SINERGIA CARDIOPULMONAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N - ANTERIOR \\/ SUPRARRENAL] (REF 492). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DEL PH SANGU\\u00cdNEO, QUE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL TRANSPORTE EFICIENTE DE OX\\u00cdGENO DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/487','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:51:22','2026-04-28 06:51:22'),(4285,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',488,'{\"symptoms\":\"HIGH FEVER, CHILLS, HEADACHES, CHEST PAIN, RAPID BREATHING, SEVERE SHORTNESS OF BREATH AND COUGH IT MIGHT BRING UP BLOOD. (FIEBRE ALTA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA, DOLOR EN EL PECHO, RESPIRACI\\u00d3N R\\u00c1PIDA, FALTA DE AIRE SEVERA Y TOS, PUEDE EXPULSAR SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RODENT FLEA. PULMONARY SYNDROME. BLACK PLAGUE. (TRANSMITIDO POR LA PULGA DE ROEDORES. S\\u00cdNDROME PULMONAR. PESTE NEGRA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG (PULM\\u00d3N) \\/ LUNG (PULM\\u00d3N) - VERTICAL\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE YERSINIA PESTIS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE LUNGS IN A VERTICAL ALIGNMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING THE PATHOGEN FAMOUSLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE BLACK PLAGUE (PESTE NEGRA). THE BACTERIA, OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY RODENT FLEAS, CAN LEAD TO A SEVERE PULMONARY SYNDROME. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET DISRUPTS THE BACTERIAL ENVIRONMENT, HELPING THE BODY MANAGE SEVERE INFLAMMATION OF THE RESPIRATORY TRACT AND SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING SYSTEMIC SPREAD THROUGH THE LYMPHATIC OR CIRCULATORY SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA YERSINIA PESTIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS PULMONES EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO FAMOSAMENTE ASOCIADO CON LA PESTE NEGRA. LA BACTERIA, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDA POR PULGAS DE ROEDORES, PUEDE PROVOCAR UN S\\u00cdNDROME PULMONAR SEVERO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO INTERRUMPE EL ENTORNO BACTERIANO, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A MANEJAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO Y APOYANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS SISTEMAS LINF\\u00c1TICO O CIRCULATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PULMONARY & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY DISTRESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] (HORIZONTAL - REF 496) AXIS TO REINFORCE GAS EXCHANGE EFFICIENCY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG - FRONT \\/ SUPRARENAL] (REF 492) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC RECOVERY DURING THE MANAGEMENT OF AGGRESSIVE PATHOGENIC LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] (HORIZONTAL - REF 496) PARA REFORZAR LA EFICIENCIA DEL INTERCAMBIO GASEOSO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N - ANTERIOR \\/ SUPRARRENAL] (REF 492). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL MANEJO DE CARGAS PAT\\u00d3GENAS AGRESIVAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/488','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:52:20','2026-04-28 06:52:20'),(4286,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',489,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SYPHILIS (S\\u00cdFILIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VARIED SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS, OFTEN ASYMPTOMATIC WHEN IN RESERVOIR STATE; MAY INCLUDE SKIN RASHES, JOINT PAIN, OR LATENT INFECTION SIGNS.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS VARIADOS, A MENUDO ASINTOM\\u00c1TICOS CUANDO EST\\u00c1N EN ESTADO DE RESERVORIO; PUEDE INCLUIR ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, DOLOR ARTICULAR O SIGNOS DE INFECCI\\u00d3N LATENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A BACTERIAL RESERVOIR, SPECIFICALLY TARGETING THE LATENT PRESENCE OF SYPHILIS (TREPONEMA PALLIDUM) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LUNG AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, A RESERVOIR IS A SPECIFIC AXIS WHERE PATHOGENS CAN HIDE WITHOUT PRODUCING ACTIVE SYMPTOMS, POTENTIALLY RE-INFECTING THE SYSTEM LATER. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ELIMINATES THE BACTERIAL HIDING SPOT WITHIN THE IMMUNE AND RESPIRATORY CENTERS, PREVENTING THE RECURRENCE OF SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS AND SUPPORTING THE TOTAL CLEARANCE OF THE PATHOGEN FROM THE BODY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO BACTERIANO, DIRIGI\\u00c9NDOSE ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE A LA PRESENCIA LATENTE DE LA S\\u00cdFILIS (TREPONEMA PALLIDUM) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PULM\\u00d3N Y EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, UN RESERVORIO ES UN EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN ESCONDERSE SIN PRODUCIR S\\u00cdNTOMAS ACTIVOS, REINFECTANDO POTENCIALMENTE EL SISTEMA M\\u00c1S TARDE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO ELIMINA EL ESCONDITE BACTERIANO DENTRO DE LOS CENTROS INMUNITARIO Y RESPIRATORIO, PREVINIENDO LA RECURRENCIA DE INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS Y APOYANDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N TOTAL DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC & IMMUNE CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [DELTOID \\/ DELTOID] AXIS TO RULE OUT ACTIVE SYPHILIS SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING LYMPHATIC CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF RELEASED BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT BLOOD PURIFICATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF PATHOGENIC RESERVOIRS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA E INMUNITARIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES] PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS ACTIVAS DE S\\u00cdFILIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ BAZO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS Y APOYAR LA PURIFICACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE LOS RESERVORIOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/489','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:53:16','2026-04-28 06:53:16'),(4287,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',490,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"COUGH (TOS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNO-RESPIRATORY REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNO-RESPIRATORIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"PERSISTENT COUGH, WEAK IMMUNE RESPONSE, AND CHEST DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(TOS PERSISTENTE, RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA D\\u00c9BIL Y MALESTAR EN EL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE SYNERGY BETWEEN THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM AND THE MASTER GLAND OF THE IMMUNE SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LUNG AND THE THYMUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS PRIMARILY USED TO CORRECT DYSFUNCTIONS MANIFESTING AS A PERSISTENT COUGH. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN OPTIMIZING THE MATURATION OF T-CELLS WITHIN THE THYMUS WHILE SIMULTANEOUSLY CALMING IRRITATION IN THE PULMONARY TISSUE. THIS PAIR SUPPORTS THE BODY IN STRENGTHENING ITS DEFENSES AGAINST RESPIRATORY PATHOGENS AND RESTORING THE NATURAL REFLEXES OF THE AIRWAYS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA SINERGIA ENTRE EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PULM\\u00d3N Y EL TIMO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PRINCIPALMENTE PARA CORREGIR DISFUNCIONES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO UNA TOS PERSISTENTE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A OPTIMIZAR LA MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS T DENTRO DEL TIMO, MIENTRAS CALMA SIMULT\\u00c1NEAMENTE LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N EN EL TEJIDO PULMONAR. ESTE PAR APOYA AL CUERPO PARA FORTALECER SUS DEFENSAS CONTRA LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS RESPIRATORIOS Y RESTAURAR LOS REFLEJOS NATURALES DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE & PULMONARY CHECK: IF THE COUGH PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] (HORIZONTAL - REF 496) AXIS TO REINFORCE DIRECT RESPIRATORY EFFICIENCY. FOR CASES INVOLVING FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG - FRONT \\/ SUPRARENAL] (REF 492) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] AXIS TO ENSURE TOTAL GLANDULAR BALANCE AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC IMMUNE SURVEILLANCE DURING THE RECOVERY FROM RESPIRATORY DISTRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y PULMONAR: SI LA TOS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] (HORIZONTAL - REF 496) PARA REFORZAR LA EFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N - ANTERIOR \\/ SUPRARRENAL] (REF 492). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ TIMO] PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO GLANDULAR TOTAL Y APOYAR LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/490','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:54:24','2026-04-28 06:54:24'),(4288,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',491,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, HEADACHE, DIZZINESS, NAUSEA, VOMITING. (DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MAREO, N\\u00c1USEA, V\\u00d3MITO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED WATER. CONFUSED WITH HIV. IMMUNODEFICIENCY. IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME. ANOSMIA. (TRANSMITIDO POR AGUA CONTAMINADA. CONFUNDIDO CON VIH. INMUNODEFICIENCIA. S\\u00cdNDROME DE INTESTINO IRRITABLE. ANOSMIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH EPSTEIN BAR, POLYOMA VIRUS OR VIRAL ENCEPHALITIS; MIGRAINES.      ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS;MYCOSIS (ASOCIADO CON EPSTEIN-BARR, POLIOMAVIRUS O ENCEFALITIS VIRAL; MIGRA\\u00d1AS.      ASOCIADO CON UN HONGO; MICOSIS)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, HEADACHE, DIZZINESS, NAUSEA, AND VOMITING.\\n\\n(DIARREA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MAREO, N\\u00c1USEA Y V\\u00d3MITO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE ENTEROVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE MALAR BONES (CHEEKBONES). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED WATER. THE PRESENCE OF THIS VIRUS CAN LEAD TO SIGNIFICANT IMMUNODEFICIENCY AND IS FREQUENTLY CONFUSED WITH HIV DUE TO THE SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS IT CAUSES. BY STABILIZING THIS FACIAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELIEVING GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS, SUCH AS IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME, AND NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS LIKE ANOSMIA (LOSS OF SMELL). RESTORING BALANCE TO THE MALAR REGION SUPPORTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE VIRAL LOAD AND RESOLVING CHRONIC DIGESTIVE AND COGNITIVE DISRUPTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL ENTEROVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS HUESOS MALARES (P\\u00d3MULOS). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE A MENUDO SE TRANSMITEN A TRAV\\u00c9S DE AGUA CONTAMINADA. LA PRESENCIA DE ESTE VIRUS PUEDE PROVOCAR UNA INMUNODEFICIENCIA SIGNIFICATIVA Y SE CONFUNDE CON FRECUENCIA CON EL VIH DEBIDO A LA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE CAUSA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO FACIAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ALIVIAR EL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL, COMO EL S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE, Y LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS COMO LA ANOSMIA (P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL OLFATO). RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN LA REGI\\u00d3N MALAR APOYA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL Y RESOLVER LA DISRUPCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y COGNITIVA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL & FUNGAL CHECK: IF MIGRAINES PERSIST, SCAN FOR ASSOCIATIONS WITH EPSTEIN-BARR, POLYOMA VIRUS, OR VIRAL ENCEPHALITIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT DIGESTIVE ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH POTENTIAL FUNGAL SYNERGIES (MYCOSIS). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF ENTEROVIRAL INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL Y F\\u00daNGICA: SI LAS MIGRA\\u00d1AS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR ASOCIACIONES CON EPSTEIN-BARR, POLIOMAVIRUS O ENCEFALITIS VIRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON POSIBLES SINERGIAS F\\u00daNGICAS (MICOSIS). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE LAS INFECCIONES POR ENTEROVIRUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/491','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:55:31','2026-04-28 06:55:31'),(4289,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',492,'{\"symptoms\":\"BURSITIS, FROZEN SHOULDER. (BURSITIS, HOMBRO CONGELADO)\",\"paths\":\"NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS, THORACIC NEOPLASIA, ABSCESSES. (TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, NEOPLASIA TOR\\u00c1CICA, ABSCESOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BURSITIS, FROZEN SHOULDER, AND JOINT STIFFNESS.\\n\\n(BURSITIS, HOMBRO CONGELADO Y RIGIDEZ ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE ACTINOMYCES BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE MEDIAL MALLEOLUS (THE INNER BONY PROMINENCE OF THE ANKLE). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT INFLUENCE CONNECTIVE TISSUE AND JOINT MOBILITY. THE RESET IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS, THORACIC NEOPLASIA, OR THE FORMATION OF ABSCESSES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE BODY IS SUPPORTED IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION WITHIN THE BURSAE AND RESTORING THE ENERGETIC INTEGRITY NECESSARY TO RESOLVE CHRONIC CONDITIONS LIKE FROZEN SHOULDER.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA ACTINOMYCES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL MAL\\u00c9OLO MEDIAL (LA PROMINENCIA \\u00d3SEA INTERNA DEL TOBILLO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE INFLUYEN EN EL TEJIDO CONECTIVO Y LA MOVILIDAD ARTICULAR. EL REINICIO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMO TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, NEOPLASIA TOR\\u00c1CICA O LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE ABSCESOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, SE APOYA AL CUERPO EN LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DE LAS BURSAS Y EN LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA NECESARIA PARA RESOLVER CONDICIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS COMO EL HOMBRO CONGELADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"JOINT & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF SHOULDER PAIN OR BURSITIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [HUMERUS \\/ HUMERUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS LOCALIZED BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF ACTINOMYCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EL DOLOR DE HOMBRO O LA BURSITIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00daMERO \\/ H\\u00daMERO] PARA ABORDAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS LOCALIZADAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE ACTINOMYCES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/492','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:56:40','2026-04-28 06:56:40'),(4290,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',493,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL AND PENIS DISCHARGE. LOOSE TEETH. (SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL Y DEL PENE. DIENTES FLOJOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED SEXUAL BODY FLUIDS. URETHRITIS, GINGIVITIS, PERIODONTITIS, HALITOSIS, AND GENERAL RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR FLUIDOS CORPORALES SEXUALES. URETRITIS, GINGIVITIS, PERIODONTITIS, HALITOSIS Y ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DORSAL\\/LUMBAR CHECK - DELTOID, LUMBAR 4. (REVISAR - DORSAL\\/LUMBAR REVISAR - DELTOIDES, LUMBAR 4.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL AND PENIS DISCHARGE, LOOSE TEETH, GINGIVITIS, AND HALITOSIS.\\n\\n(SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL Y DEL PENE, DIENTES FLOJOS, GINGIVITIS Y HALITOSIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE MANDIBLE (LOWER JAW). WHILE COMMONLY KNOWN AS A SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED PATHOGEN AFFECTING THE GENITOURINARY TRACT, IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REVEALS ITS IMPACT ON ORAL HEALTH AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. THE RESET IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PERIODONTITIS AND LOOSE TEETH, AS THE BACTERIA CAN WEAKEN THE ANCHORAGE OF THE DENTAL STRUCTURES. FURTHERMORE, THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN A HIDDEN FACTOR IN GENERAL RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS; BY STABILIZING THE MANDIBULAR CIRCUIT, THE BODY IS SUPPORTED IN REDUCING SYSTEMIC JOINT INFLAMMATION AND CLEARING THE BACTERIAL LOAD FROM BOTH ORAL AND REPRODUCTIVE MUCOSA.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA NEISSERIA GONORRHOEAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA. AUNQUE SE CONOCE COM\\u00daNMENTE COMO UN PAT\\u00d3GENO DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N SEXUAL QUE AFECTA EL TRACTO GENITOURINARIO, EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REVELA SU IMPACTO EN LA SALUD ORAL Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. EL REINICIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA PERIODONTITIS Y LOS DIENTES FLOJOS, YA QUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE DEBILITAR EL ANCLAJE DE LAS ESTRUCTURAS DENTALES. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SUELE SER UN FACTOR OCULTO EN LA ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE GENERAL; AL ESTABILIZAR EL CIRCUITO MANDIBULAR, SE APOYA AL CUERPO EN LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR SIST\\u00c9MICA Y NA LIMPIEZA DE LA CARGA BACTERIANA TANTO NA MUCOSA ORAL COMO NA REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL & ARTICULAR CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DORSAL \\/ LUMBAR] AXIS OR THE [DELTOID \\/ DELTOID] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC PELVIC DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR 4 \\/ LUMBAR 4] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF GONORRHEAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y ARTICULAR: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DORSAL \\/ LUMBAR] O LA RESONANCIA [DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES] PARA ABORDAR SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO CR\\u00d3NICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [LUMBAR 4 \\/ LUMBAR 4]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DEL ESTR\\u00c9S POR GONOCOCO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/493','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:57:46','2026-04-28 06:57:46'),(4291,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',494,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND MOUTH RASHES. GUM BLEEDING, BAD BREATH. (ERUPCIONES EN LA PIEL Y EN LA BOCA. SANGRADO DE ENC\\u00cdAS, MAL ALIENTO.)\",\"paths\":\"SKIN DISORDERS. MOUTH AND GUM DISORDERS. NOSOCOMIAL INFECTIONS. ACNE. IMPLANT INFECTIONS. (TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL. TRASTORNOS DE LA BOCA Y LAS ENC\\u00cdAS. INFECCIONES NOSOCOMIALES. ACN\\u00c9. INFECCIONES DE IMPLANTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - UPPER EYELID\\/UPPER EYELID (REVISAR - P\\u00c1RPADO SUPERIOR\\/P\\u00c1RPADO SUPERIOR)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND MOUTH RASHES, GUM BLEEDING, BAD BREATH, AND ACNE.\\n\\n(ERUPCIONES EN LA PIEL Y EN LA BOCA, SANGRADO DE ENC\\u00cdAS, MAL ALIENTO Y ACN\\u00c9.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS EPIDERMIDIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE MANDIBULAR RAMUS (THE VERTICAL PORTION OF THE LOWER JAW). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SKIN AND MUCOSA DISORDERS. WHILE THIS BACTERIA IS A NORMAL PART OF THE SKIN FLORA, AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN LEAD TO OPPORTUNISTIC INFECTIONS, MANIFESTING AS ACNE, MOUTH RASHES, OR GINGIVAL BLEEDING. THE RESET IS ALSO ESSENTIAL FOR PREVENTING OR ADDRESSING INFECTIONS RELATED TO DENTAL OR MEDICAL IMPLANTS (NOSOCOMIAL INFECTIONS). BY STABILIZING THE MANDIBULAR RAMUS, THE BODY IS SUPPORTED IN RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE ORAL AND DERMAL BARRIERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS EPIDERMIDIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LA RAMA MANDIBULAR (LA PORCI\\u00d3N VERTICAL DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA INFERIOR). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL Y LAS MUCOSAS. SI BIEN ESTA BACTERIA ES PARTE NORMAL DE LA FLORA CUT\\u00c1NEA, UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE PROVOCAR INFECCIONES OPORTUNISTAS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO ACN\\u00c9, ERUPCIONES BUCALES O SANGRADO GINGIVAL. EL REINICIO TAMBI\\u00c9N ES ESENCIAL PARA PREVENIR O ABORDAR INFECCIONES RELACIONADAS CON IMPLANTES DENTALES O M\\u00c9DICOS (INFECCIONES NOSOCOMIALES). AL ESTABILIZAR LA RAMA MANDIBULAR, SE APOYA AL CUERPO NA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD DE LAS BARRERAS ORALES Y D\\u00c9RMICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMAL & ORAL CHECK: IF SKIN RASHES OR ACNE PERSIST, SCAN THE [UPPER EYELID \\/ UPPER EYELID] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GUM INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE] (REF 502) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER TOXIN ELIMINATION AND SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF STAPHYLOCOCCAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N D\\u00c9RMICA Y ORAL: SI LAS ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O EL ACN\\u00c9 PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00c1RPADO SUPERIOR \\/ P\\u00c1RPADO SUPERIOR] PARA ABORDAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GINGIVAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA] (REF 502). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DEL ESTR\\u00c9S POR ESTAFILOCOCO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/494','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:58:47','2026-04-28 06:58:47'),(4292,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',495,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BIPOLAR\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL DYSREGULATION (DESREGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"MOOD SWINGS, IRRITABILITY, EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, AND COGNITIVE DISSONANCE.\\n\\n(CAMBIOS DE HUMOR, IRRITABILIDAD, INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y DISONANCIA COGNITIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC ROOTS OF BIPOLAR TENDENCIES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MANDIBLE AND THE MANDIBULAR RAMUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC FACIAL AXIS IS LINKED TO THE SOMATIC EXPRESSION OF PSYCHOLOGICAL DUALITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE EXTREME FLUCTUATIONS OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM THAT CHARACTERIZE BIPOLAR STATES. IT SUPPORTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN ACHIEVING GREATER EMOTIONAL EQUILIBRIUM, REDUCING THE INTENSITY OF RAPID MOOD SHIFTS AND PROMOTING A MORE STABLE CONNECTION BETWEEN THOUGHT PATTERNS AND EMOTIONAL RESPONSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LAS RA\\u00cdCES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DE LAS TENDENCIAS BIPOLARES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA Y LA RAMA MANDIBULAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE FACIAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N SOM\\u00c1TICA DE LA DUALIDAD PSICOL\\u00d3GICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LAS FLUCTUACIONES EXTREMAS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO QUE CARACTERIZAN LOS ESTADOS BIPOLARES. APOYA AL INDIVIDUO A LOGRAR UN MAYOR EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL, REDUCIENDO LA INTENSIDAD DE LOS CAMBIOS R\\u00c1PIDOS DE HUMOR Y PROMOVIENDO UNA CONEXI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S ESTABLE ENTRE LOS PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO Y LAS RESPUESTAS EMOCIONALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO ENSURE BALANCED MELATONIN AND SEROTONIN PRODUCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING HIGH ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ DORSAL] (REF 487) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE REGULATION OF THE LIMBIC SYSTEM DURING THE STABILIZATION OF BIPOLAR ENERGETIC PATTERNS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROEMOCIONAL: SI LA INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR UNA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N EQUILIBRADA DE MELATONINA Y SEROTONINA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD ELEVADA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR \\/ DORSAL] (REF 487). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO DURANTE LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS PATRONES ENERG\\u00c9TICOS BIPOLARES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/495','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 06:59:53','2026-04-28 06:59:53'),(4293,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',496,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE. (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, HEADACHES, DIZZINESS, AND CHEST TIGHTNESS.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MAREO Y OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC HYPERTENSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MANUBRIUM (THE UPPER SEGMENT OF THE STERNUM) AND THE DORSAL 7 VERTEBRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR STABILIZING BLOOD PRESSURE LEVELS WITHOUT NECESSARILY RELYING ON PATHOGENIC CLEARANCE. BY BALANCING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS MODULATE THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM\'S CONTROL OVER VASCULAR RESISTANCE AND HEART RATE. IT SUPPORTS THE BODY IN REDUCING THE PRESSURE EXERTED ON ARTERIAL WALLS, PROMOTING CARDIOVASCULAR STABILITY AND RELIEVING THE SECONDARY SYMPTOMS OF CHRONIC HYPERTENSION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL MANUBRIO (EL SEGMENTO SUPERIOR DEL ESTERN\\u00d3N) Y LA V\\u00c9RTEBRA DORSAL 7. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ESTABILIZAR LOS NIVELES DE PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL SIN DEPENDER NECESARIAMENTE DE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS. AL EQUILIBRAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A MODULAR EL CONTROL DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO SOBRE LA RESISTENCIA VASCULAR Y LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA. APOYA AL CUERPO EN LA REDUCCI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N EJERCIDA SOBRE LAS PAREDES ARTERIALES, PROMOVIENDO LA ESTABILIDAD CARDIOVASCULAR Y ALIVIANDO LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SECUNDARIOS DE LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIOPULMONARY CHECK: IF HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ HEART] (REF 493) AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY EMOTIONAL OR FUNCTIONAL STRESS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ DORSAL] (REF 487) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FLUID REGULATION AND SUPPORT THE RENIN-ANGIOTENSIN SYSTEM DURING THE CORRECTION OF VASCULAR TONE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARDIOPULMONAR: SI LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 493) PARA ABORDAR EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL O FUNCIONAL COMPLEMENTARIO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR \\/ DORSAL] (REF 487). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR UNA REGULACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y APOYAR EL SISTEMA RENINA-ANGIOTENSINA DURANTE LA CORRECCI\\u00d3N DEL TONO VASCULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/496','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:00:57','2026-04-28 07:00:57'),(4294,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',497,'{\"symptoms\":\"NOSE, THROAT EYES, EAR, LARYNX AND PARATHYROID SYMPTOMS. BRONCHIAL AIRWAY PROBLEMS. RASH. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS EN NARIZ, GARGANTA, OJOS, O\\u00cdDO, LARINGE Y PARATIROIDES. PROBLEMAS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS BRONQUIALES. ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA.)\",\"paths\":\"BRONCHITIS, PAIN AND CHEST TIGHTNESS, PERICARDITIS, CONJUNCTIVITIS, SINUTITIS, OTITIS. HUMAN MOUTH DISEASE. (BRONQUITIS, DOLOR Y OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, PERICARDITIS, CONJUNTIVITIS, SINUSITIS, OTITIS. ENFERMEDAD DE LA BOCA HUMANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH MEDIASTINUM; FALSE AIDS (ASOCIADO CON EL MEDIASTINO; SIDA FALSO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"NOSE, THROAT, EYES, EAR, LARYNX, AND PARATHYROID SYMPTOMS; BRONCHIAL AIRWAY PROBLEMS AND RASH.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNTOMAS EN NARIZ, GARGANTA, OJOS, O\\u00cdDO, LARINGE Y PARATIROIDES; PROBLEMAS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS BRONQUIALES Y ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE COXSACKIE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE MANUBRIUM (THE UPPER PART OF THE STERNUM) IN A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING A WIDE RANGE OF INFLAMMATORY CONDITIONS IN THE UPPER RESPIRATORY TRACT AND CHEST. THE VIRUS IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH BRONCHITIS, PERICARDITIS, AND \\\"HAND, FOOT, AND MOUTH DISEASE.\\\" BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING CHEST TIGHTNESS, CLEARING SINUS AND OTITIS CONGESTION, AND SOOTHING IRRITATION IN THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES OF THE THROAT AND EYES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS COXSACKIE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL MANUBRIO (LA PARTE SUPERIOR DEL ESTERN\\u00d3N) EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR UNA AMPLIA GAMA DE CONDICIONES INFLAMATORIAS EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR Y EL PECHO. EL VIRUS SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON BRONQUITIS, PERICARDITIS Y LA \\\"ENFERMEDAD DE MANOS, PIES Y BOCA\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, LIMPIAR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N DE SENOS PARANASALES Y OTITIS, Y ALIVIAR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS DE LA GARGANTA Y LOS OJOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MEDIASTINUM & IMMUNE CHECK: THIS PAIR IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE [MEDIASTINUM \\/ MEDIASTINUM] AXIS; SCAN BOTH TO ENSURE COMPLETE CLEARANCE OF THORACIC VIRAL LOADS. IN CASES MANIFESTING AS SEVERE IMMUNE WEAKNESS, THIS AXIS IS SOMETIMES REFERRED TO AS \\\"FALSE AIDS\\\" (SIDA FALSO) DUE TO THE SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS IT MIMICS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DEL MEDIASTINO E INMUNITARIA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON EL EJE [MEDIASTINO \\/ MEDIASTINO]; ESCANEAR AMBOS PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LAS CARGAS VIRALES TOR\\u00c1CICAS. EN CASOS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO UNA DEBILIDAD INMUNITARIA SEVERA, A ESTE EJE SE LE CONOCE A VECES COMO \\\"SIDA FALSO\\\" DEBIDO A LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS QUE IMITA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/497','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:01:59','2026-04-28 07:01:59'),(4295,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',498,'{\"symptoms\":\"TOOTH DECAY (CARIES DENTAL)\",\"paths\":\"CAVITIES, TOOTH DECAY, HEARTBURN. (CARIES, CARIES DENTAL, ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"TOOTH DECAY, CAVITIES, AND HEARTBURN.\\n\\n(CARIES, CARIES DENTAL Y ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE STREPTOCOCCUS MUTANS BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MANUBRIUM (THE UPPER PART OF THE STERNUM) AND THE RIGHT POPLITEUS (THE AREA BEHIND THE RIGHT KNEE). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SPECIFIC FOR ADDRESSING ORAL PATHOGENS THAT HAVE A SYSTEMIC IMPACT. WHILE STREPTOCOCCUS MUTANS IS THE PRIMARY CAUSE OF TOOTH DECAY AND CAVITIES, AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN ALSO BE LINKED TO DIGESTIVE UPSET SUCH AS HEARTBURN. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CONTROLLING BACTERIAL OVERGROWTH IN THE ORAL CAVITY AND MITIGATING THE ACIDIC ENVIRONMENT THAT CONTRIBUTES TO BOTH DENTAL EROSION AND GASTRIC DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIA STREPTOCOCCUS MUTANS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL MANUBRIO (LA PARTE SUPERIOR DEL ESTERN\\u00d3N) Y EL POPL\\u00cdTEO DERECHO (EL \\u00c1REA DETR\\u00c1S DE LA RODILLA DERECHA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS ORALES QUE TIENEN UN IMPACTO SIST\\u00c9MICO. SI BIEN EL STREPTOCOCCUS MUTANS ES LA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE LAS CARIES DENTALES, UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A MALESTARES DIGESTIVOS COMO LA ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A CONTROLAR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO BACTERIANO EN LA CAVIDAD ORAL Y A MITIGAR EL AMBIENTE \\u00c1CIDO QUE CONTRIBUYE TANTO A LA EROSI\\u00d3N DENTAL COMO AL MALESTAR G\\u00c1STRICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ORAL & DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF TOOTH SENSITIVITY OR DECAY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE] (REF 502) AXIS TO RULE OUT COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES OF SEVERE HEARTBURN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HIATUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER PH BALANCE AND SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE CLEARANCE OF STREPTOCOCCAL LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ORAL Y DIGESTIVA: SI LA SENSIBILIDAD DENTAL O LA CARIES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA] (REF 502) PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS DE ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [HIATO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO ADECUADO DEL PH Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE LAS CARGAS ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/498','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:03:20','2026-04-28 07:03:20'),(4296,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',499,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ARROGANCE (ARROGANCIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHO-EMOTIONAL BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO PSICOEMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ARROGANCE, RIGIDITY IN THINKING, PRIDE, AND DIFFICULTY IN CONNECTING WITH OTHERS.\\n\\n(ARROGANCIA, RIGIDEZ DE PENSAMIENTO, ORGULLO Y DIFICULTAD PARA CONECTAR CON LOS DEM\\u00c1S.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE ENERGY CENTER OF ARROGANCE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT MASTOID AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS LINKED TO THE PERCEPTION OF SELF-IMPORTANCE AND THE NEED FOR DOMINANCE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN SOFTENING RIGID EGO STRUCTURES AND BALANCING THE HORMONAL OUTPUT OF THE PITUITARY THAT CAN BE INFLUENCED BY STRESS AND EMOTIONAL SUPERIORITY. THIS PAIR PROMOTES HUMILITY, OPENNESS TO NEW PERSPECTIVES, AND THE RESTORATION OF EMOTIONAL HARMONY WITHIN THE SOCIAL AND PERSONAL SPHERES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL SE DIRIGE AL CENTRO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LA ARROGANCIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MASTOIDES IZQUIERDA Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DE AUTOIMPORTANCIA Y LA NECESIDAD DE DOMINIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A SUAVIZAR LAS ESTRUCTURAS R\\u00cdGIDAS DEL EGO Y A EQUILIBRAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL DE LA PITUITARIA QUE PUEDE VERSE INFLUENCIADA POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S Y LA SUPERIORIDAD EMOCIONAL. ESTE PAR PROMUEVE LA HUMILDAD, LA APERTURA A NUEVAS PERSPECTIVAS Y LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA ARMON\\u00cdA EMOCIONAL DENTRO DE LOS \\u00c1MBITOS SOCIAL Y PERSONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO ENSURE TOTAL GLANDULAR STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP-SEATED PRIDE THAT AFFECTS COMMUNICATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE CALMING OF THE LIMBIC SYSTEM DURING THE DISSOLUTION OF ARROGANT ENERGETIC PATTERNS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROENDOCRINA: SI LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD GLANDULAR TOTAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN ORGULLO ARRAIGADO QUE AFECTE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA APOYAR LA CALMA DEL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO DURANTE LA DISOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LOS PATRONES ENERG\\u00c9TICOS DE ARROGANCIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/499','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:04:26','2026-04-28 07:04:26'),(4297,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',500,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AGGRESSIVENESS (AGRESIVIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL AGGRESSION (AGRESI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"AGGRESSIVENESS, IRRITABILITY, IMPULSIVENESS, AND ANGER.\\n\\n(AGRESIVIDAD, IRRITABILIDAD, IMPULSIVIDAD Y ENOJO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC CIRCUIT OF AGGRESSIVENESS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT MASTOID AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS LINKED TO THE EXTERNALIZATION OF ANGER AND THE INABILITY TO REGULATE STRONG EMOTIONAL IMPULSES. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE CARDIOVASCULAR RESPONSE TO ANGER AND SOFTENING THE REACTIVE PATTERNS STORED IN THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. IT PROMOTES A SENSE OF INTERNAL CALM, EMOTIONAL SELF-CONTROL, AND THE RESTORATION OF HEART RHYTHM THAT MAY BE DISRUPTED BY CHRONIC AGGRESSIVE STATES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL CIRCUITO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LA AGRESIVIDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MASTOIDES DERECHA Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA EXTERNALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL ENOJO Y LA INCAPACIDAD DE REGULAR IMPULSOS EMOCIONALES FUERTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA RESPUESTA CARDIOVASCULAR AL ENOJO Y A SUAVIZAR LOS PATRONES REACTIVOS ALMACENADOS EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. PROMUEVE UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA INTERNA, AUTOCONTROL EMOCIONAL Y LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DEL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO QUE PUEDE VERSE ALTERADO POR ESTADOS AGRESIVOS CR\\u00d3NICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF AGGRESSIVE TENDENCIES PERSIST, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE REGULATION OF THE LIMBIC SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING RIGIDITY OR PRIDE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MASTOID - L \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] (REF 508) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE PRODUCTION OF NEUROTRANSMITTERS THAT FACILITATE PEACEFUL COMMUNICATION AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROEMOCIONAL: SI LAS TENDENCIAS AGRESIVAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RIGIDEZ O ORGULLO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MASTOIDES - I \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 508). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE NEUROTRANSMITTERS QUE FACILITEN LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N PAC\\u00cdFICA Y LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/500','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:05:34','2026-04-28 07:05:34'),(4298,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',501,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ABNORMAL NOISE (RUIDO ANORMAL)\",\"paths\":\"TINNITUS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"AUDITORY REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N AUDITIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ABNORMAL NOISE, RINGING IN THE EARS, AND DIZZINESS.\\n\\n(RUIDO ANORMAL, ZUMBIDO EN LOS O\\u00cdDOS Y MAREO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES TINNITUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT AND LEFT MASTOID BONES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BILATERAL MASTOID AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR STABILIZING THE AUDITORY SYSTEM AND THE VESTIBULAR APPARATUS, WHICH GOVERNS BALANCE. BY BALANCING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET HELPS REDUCE THE INTERNAL PERCEPTION OF ABNORMAL NOISE OR RINGING THAT IS NOT CAUSED BY AN EXTERNAL SOURCE. IT SUPPORTS THE BODY IN CALMING VASCULAR OR NERVOUS IRRITATION NEAR THE INNER EAR, PROMOTING CLEARER HEARING AND IMPROVED SPATIAL ORIENTATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL TINNITUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LOS HUESOS MASTOIDES DERECHO E IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE MASTOIDEO BILATERAL ES ESENCIAL PARA ESTABILIZAR EL SISTEMA AUDITIVO Y EL APARATO VESTIBULAR, QUE RIGE EL EQUILIBRIO. AL EQUILIBRAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REDUCIR LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N INTERNA DE RUIDO ANORMAL O ZUMBIDO QUE NO ES CAUSADO POR UNA FUENTE EXTERNA. APOYA AL CUERPO A CALMAR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR O NERVIOSA CERCA DEL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO, PROMOVIENDO UNA AUDICI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S CLARA Y UNA MEJOR ORIENTACI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"AUDITORY & CRANIAL CHECK: IF THE ABNORMAL NOISE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL NERVOUS SYSTEM OVERLOAD. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VERTIGO, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CRANIAL \\/ CRANIAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE, AS KIDNEY DYSFUNCTION IS OFTEN ENERGETICALLY LINKED TO AUDITORY ISSUES IN TRADITIONAL AND ALTERNATIVE THERAPIES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N AUDITIVA Y CRANEAL: SI EL RUIDO ANORMAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE SOBRECARGA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN V\\u00c9RTIGO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CRANEAL \\/ CRANEAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO, YA QUE LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL A MENUDO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE CON PROBLEMAS AUDITIVOS EN TERAPIAS TRADICIONALES Y ALTERNATIVAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/501','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:06:38','2026-04-28 07:06:38'),(4299,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',502,'{\"symptoms\":\"DANDRUFF, PUBIC AREA DANDRUFF. (CASPA, CASPA EN EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00daBICA)\",\"paths\":\"LIVER DYSFUNCTION, GLAUCOMA, DANDRUFF. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA, GLAUCOMA, CASPA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (REVISAR - CODO\\/CODO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DANDRUFF, PUBIC AREA DANDRUFF, AND SCALP IRRITATION.\\n\\n(CASPA, CASPA EN EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00daBICA E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERO CABELLUDO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE MALASSEZIA GLOBOSA FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MASTOID PROCESS AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING DERMATOLOGICAL CONDITIONS LINKED TO FUNGAL OVERGROWTH, PARTICULARLY DANDRUFF ON THE HEAD OR IN THE PUBIC REGION. BEYOND THE SKIN, THIS PAIR IS ASSOCIATED WITH DEEPER SYSTEMIC IMBALANCES SUCH AS LIVER DYSFUNCTION AND GLAUCOMA. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CONTROLLING THE FUNGAL LOAD, IMPROVING SCALP HEALTH, AND SUPPORTING THE ENERGETIC REGULATION OF HEPATIC AND OCULAR FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL HONGO MALASSEZIA GLOBOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA AP\\u00d3FISIS MASTOIDEA Y LA M\\u00c9DULA OBLONGADA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR CONDICIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS VINCULADAS AL SOBRECRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO, PARTICULARMENTE LA CASPA EN LA CABEZA O EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00daBICA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA PIEL, ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA CON DESEQUILIBRIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS M\\u00c1S PROFUNDOS, COMO LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y EL GLAUCOMA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A CONTROLAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, MEJORANDO LA SALUD DEL CUERPO CABELLUDO Y APOYANDO LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LAS FUNCIONES HEP\\u00c1TICAS Y OCULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL & HEPATIC CHECK: IF DANDRUFF PERSISTS, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CLEARANCE OF FUNGAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING PUBIC AREA SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MEDIAL KNEE LIGAMENT \\/ MALLEOLUS] (REF 520) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER METABOLIC FILTRATION AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF FUNGAL-RELATED DYSFUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA Y HEP\\u00c1TICA: SI LA CASPA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CODO \\/ CODO] PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SINERGIAS F\\u00daNGICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS EN EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00daBICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LIGAMENTO MEDIAL DE LA RODILLA \\/ MAL\\u00c9OLO] (REF 520). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA ADECUADA Y APOYAR AL CUERPO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE DISFUNCIONES RELACIONADAS CON HONGOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/502','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:08:01','2026-04-28 07:08:01'),(4300,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',503,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DEMENTIA AND SENILE (DEMENCIA Y SENIL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-COGNITIVE STABILITY (ESTABILIDAD NEUROCOGNITIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MEMORY LOSS, CONFUSION, DISORIENTATION, AND COGNITIVE DECLINE.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N Y DETERIORO COGNITIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC ROOTS OF DEMENTIA AND SENILITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MASTOID AND THE CLAVICLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS LINKED TO THE PRESERVATION OF COGNITIVE FUNCTIONS AND THE SOMATIC EXPRESSION OF MENTAL CLARITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN MITIGATING THE ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES THAT CONTRIBUTE TO SENILE DEGENERATION. IT SUPPORTS THE BRAIN IN MAINTAINING BETTER NEURAL CONNECTIVITY AND HELPS THE INDIVIDUAL RETAIN A STRONGER SENSE OF SELF AND ENVIRONMENTAL AWARENESS, SLOWING THE PROGRESSION OF SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH COGNITIVE AGING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LAS RA\\u00cdCES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DE LA DEMENCIA Y LA SENILIDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MASTOIDES Y LA CLAV\\u00cdCULA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA PRESERVACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES COGNITIVAS Y LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N SOM\\u00c1TICA DE LA CLARIDAD MENTAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A MITIGAR LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N SENIL. APOYA AL CEREBRO A MANTENER UNA MEJOR CONECTIVIDAD NEURONAL Y AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A CONSERVAR UN SENTIDO M\\u00c1S FUERTE DE S\\u00cd MISMO Y DE LA CONCIENCIA DEL ENTORNO, RALENTIZANDO LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON EL ENVEJECIMIENTO COGNITIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-VASCULAR CHECK: IF COGNITIVE CONFUSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [POLO \\/ POLO] AXIS TO REINFORCE CEREBRAL EQUILIBRIUM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MEMORY ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE PRODUCTION OF NEUROPROTECTIVE HORMONES AND ENSURE PROPER CIRCADIAN REGULATION, WHICH IS VITAL FOR MENTAL HEALTH IN SENILE STATES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROVASCULAR: SI LA CONFUSI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [POLO \\/ POLO] PARA REFORZAR EL EQUILIBRIO CEREBRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DE MEMORIA SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS NEUROPROTECTORAS Y ASEGURAR UNA REGULACI\\u00d3N CIRCADIANA ADECUADA, LA CUAL ES VITAL PARA LA SALUD MENTAL EN ESTADOS SENILES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/503','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:09:16','2026-04-28 07:09:16'),(4301,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',504,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OILSEED INTOLERANCE (INTOLERANCIA A SEMILLAS OLEAGINOSAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC TOLERANCE (TOLERANCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, BLOATING, GAS, AND FOOD SENSITIVITIES SPECIFIC TO FATS OR SEEDS.\\n\\n(MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, GASES Y SENSIBILIDADES ALIMENTARIAS ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS A LAS GRASAS O SEMILLAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES OILSEED INTOLERANCE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MASTOID AND THE DUODENUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MODULATING THE BODY\'S BIOCHEMICAL RESPONSE TO SPECIFIC FOOD GROUPS, PARTICULARLY SEEDS AND NUTS (OLEAGINOSAS). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE DUODENUM IN PROPERLY PROCESSING LIPIDS AND PROTEINS FOUND IN THESE FOODS, WHILE CALMING THE NEUROLOGICAL OVERREACTIVITY STORED IN THE MASTOID REGION. THIS PAIR SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF HEALTHY DIGESTION AND HELPS MITIGATE THE INFLAMMATORY OR ALLERGIC-LIKE RESPONSES TRIGGERED BY THE CONSUMPTION OF OILSEEDS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA INTOLERANCIA A LAS SEMILLAS OLEAGINOSAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MASTOIDES Y EL DUODENO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MODULAR LA RESPUESTA BIOQU\\u00cdMICA DEL CUERPO A GRUPOS ALIMENTICIOS ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS, PARTICULARMENTE SEMILLAS Y FRUTOS SECOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL DUODENO A PROCESAR ADECUADAMENTE LOS L\\u00cdPIDOS Y PROTE\\u00cdNAS QUE SE ENCUENTRAN EN ESTOS ALIMENTOS, MIENTRAS CALMA LA SOBRERREACTIVIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA ALMACENADA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N MASTOIDEA. ESTE PAR APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE UNA DIGESTI\\u00d3N SALUDABLE Y AYUDA A MITIGAR LAS RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS O DE TIPO AL\\u00c9RGICO DESENCADENADAS POR EL CONSUMO DE SEMILLAS OLEAGINOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & ENZYMATIC CHECK: IF FOOD INTOLERANCE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER DIGESTIVE ENZYME PRODUCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE BLOATING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT BILE PRODUCTION AND LIPID METABOLISM, WHICH IS ESSENTIAL FOR THE SUCCESSFUL CLEARANCE OF OILSEED SENSITIVITIES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y ENZIM\\u00c1TICA: SI LA INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] PARA ASEGURAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE ENZIMAS DIGESTIVAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [DUODENO \\/ DUODENO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE BILIS Y EL METABOLISMO DE L\\u00cdPIDOS, LO CUAL ES ESENCIAL PARA LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N EXITOSA DE LAS SENSIBILIDADES A LAS SEMILLAS OLEAGINOSAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/504','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:10:20','2026-04-28 07:10:20'),(4302,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',505,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DEPRESSION (DEPRESI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL VITALITY (VITALIDAD EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SADNESS, LOSS OF INTEREST, FATIGUE, FEELINGS OF WORTHLESSNESS, AND PERSISTENT LOW MOOD.\\n\\n(TRISTEZA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE INTER\\u00c9S, FATIGA, SENTIMIENTOS DE INUTILIDAD Y ESTADO DE \\u00c1NIMO BAJO PERSISTENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES DEPRESSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MASTOID AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE KIDNEYS ARE OFTEN LINKED TO DEEP-SEATED FEARS AND VITAL ENERGY, WHILE THE MASTOID REGION CONNECTS TO THE SOMATIC EXPRESSION OF PSYCHOLOGICAL STATES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELEASING ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES THAT CONTRIBUTE TO PERSISTENT SADNESS AND EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS. IT SUPPORTS THE RESTORATION OF VITALITY, HELPING THE INDIVIDUAL REGAIN MOTIVATION AND A MORE BALANCED EMOTIONAL PERSPECTIVE BY CLEARING THE BIOELECTRICAL \\\"FOG\\\" ASSOCIATED WITH DEPRESSIVE STATES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MASTOIDES Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS RI\\u00d1ONES A MENUDO EST\\u00c1N VINCULADOS A TEMORES PROFUNDOS Y A LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL, MIENTRAS QUE LA REGI\\u00d3N MASTOIDEA SE CONECTA CON LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N SOM\\u00c1TICA DE LOS ESTADOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A LA TRISTEZA PERSISTENTE Y LA PESADEZ EMOCIONAL. APOYA LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA VITALIDAD, AYUDANDO AL INDIVIDUO A RECUPERAR LA MOTIVACI\\u00d3N Y UNA PERSPECTIVA EMOCIONAL M\\u00c1S EQUILIBRADA AL LIMPIAR LA \\\"NIEBLA\\\" BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ASOCIADA CON LOS ESTADOS DEPRESIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO RULE OUT METABOLIC FACTORS AFFECTING MOOD. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY OR DUALITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MANDIBULAR \\/ RAMUS] (REF 504) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT THE NATURAL REGULATION OF SEROTONIN AND MELATONIN, WHICH ARE CRITICAL FOR MAINTAINING A STABLE AND POSITIVE MENTAL STATE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROEMOCIONAL: SI LA PESADEZ EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA DESCARTAR FACTORES METAB\\u00d3LICOS QUE AFECTEN EL ESTADO DE \\u00c1NIMO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA O DUALIDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MANDIBULAR \\/ RAMA] (REF 504). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N NATURAL DE LA SEROTONINA Y LA MELATONINA, QUE SON CR\\u00cdTICAS PARA MANTENER UN ESTADO MENTAL ESTABLE Y POSITIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/505','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:11:24','2026-04-28 07:11:24'),(4303,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',506,'{\"symptoms\":\"SWOLLEN TISSUES, BLOCKED LYMPH VESSELS. (TEJIDOS HINCHADOS, VASOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS BLOQUEADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED WATER AND INSECT BITES.. MENTAL DISORDERS, INTRACRANIAL TUMORS, FACIAL PARALYSIS, ELEPHANTIASIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR AGUA CONTAMINADA Y PICADURAS DE INSECTOS. TRASTORNOS MENTALES, TUMORES INTRACRANEALES, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, ELEFANTIASIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CARDIA\\/ADRENALS                 CHECK - THYROID (REVISAR - CARDIAS\\/GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES                 REVISAR - TIROIDES)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SWOLLEN TISSUES, BLOCKED LYMPH VESSELS, AND PERSISTENT EDEMA.\\n\\n(TEJIDOS HINCHADOS, VASOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS BLOQUEADOS Y EDEMA PERSISTENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS FILARIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE BILATERAL MASTOID BONES. FILARIA ARE MICROSCOPIC, THREAD-LIKE WORMS OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY INSECT BITES OR CONTAMINATED WATER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THESE PARASITES TEND TO LODGE IN THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM, CAUSING SIGNIFICANT BLOCKAGES THAT CAN LEAD TO EXTREME TISSUE SWELLING (ELEPHANTIASIS) OR FACIAL PARALYSIS. BEYOND PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS, THIS INFESTATION IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO MENTAL DISORDERS AND MAY EVEN BE A FACTOR IN THE DEVELOPMENT OF INTRACRANIAL TUMORS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITE AND RESTORING PROPER LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A LA FILARIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS HUESOS MASTOIDES BILATERALES. LAS FILARIAS SON GUSANOS MICROSC\\u00d3PICOS EN FORMA DE HILO QUE A MENUDO SE TRANSMITEN POR PICADURAS DE INSECTOS O AGUA CONTAMINADA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS TIENDEN A ALOJARSE EN EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO, CAUSANDO BLOQUEOS SIGNIFICATIVOS QUE PUEDEN PROVOCAR HINCHAZ\\u00d3N EXTREMA DE LOS TEJIDOS (ELEFANTIASIS) O PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS, ESTA INFESTACI\\u00d3N SE VINCULA FRECUENTEMENTE CON TRASTORNOS MENTALES Y PUEDE SER INCLUSO UN FACTOR EN EL DESARROLLO DE TUMORES INTRACRANEALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR EL PAR\\u00c1SITO Y RESTAURAR EL DRENAJE LINF\\u00c1TICO ADECUADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF TISSUE SWELLING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [CARDIA \\/ ADRENALS] AXIS TO REINFORCE SYSTEMIC FLUID REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING COGNITIVE OR METABOLIC SLOWDOWN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS DURING THE CLEARANCE OF FILARIAL LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y GLANDULAR: SI LA HINCHAZ\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CARDIAS \\/ SUPRARRENALES] PARA REFORZAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RALENTIZACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA O METAB\\u00d3LICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE LAS CARGAS DE FILARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/506','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:12:22','2026-04-28 07:12:22'),(4304,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',507,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL HEART BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY, PALPITATIONS, CHEST DISCOMFORT, AND FEELINGS OF INSECURITY.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD, PALPITACIONES, MALESTAR EN EL PECHO Y SENTIMIENTOS DE INSEGURIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC PROTECTION OF THE HEART BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MASTOID AND THE PERICARDIUM (THE SAC SURROUNDING THE HEART). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR BALANCING THE \\\"SHOCK ABSORBER\\\" OF THE HEART\'S ENERGETIC FIELD. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE PHYSICAL MANIFESTATIONS OF EMOTIONAL STRESS, SUCH AS NON-CLINICAL PALPITATIONS OR TIGHTNESS IN THE CHEST. IT SUPPORTS THE BODY IN RELEASING REPRESSED EMOTIONS AND PROTECTIVE LAYERS THAT MAY BE INTERFERING WITH BOTH CARDIAC RHYTHM AND THE INDIVIDUAL\'S ABILITY TO FEEL EMOTIONALLY SECURE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA PROTECCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MASTOIDES Y EL PERICARDIO (EL SACO QUE RODEA AL CORAZ\\u00d3N). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EQUILIBRAR EL \\\"AMORTIGUADOR\\\" DEL CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LAS MANIFESTACIONES F\\u00cdSICAS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL, COMO PALPITACIONES NO CL\\u00cdNICAS O OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO. APOYA AL CUERPO NA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE EMOCIONES REPRIMIDAS Y CAPAS PROTECTORAS QUE PUEDEN ESTAR INTERFIRIENDO TANTO CON EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO COMO CON LA CAPACIDAD DEL INDIVIDUO PARA SENTIRSE EMOCIONALMENTE SEGURO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIAC & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF CHEST TIGHTNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL OR BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUMBAR \\/ DORSAL] (REF 487) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [MASTOID - R \\/ HEART] (REF 509) CIRCUIT TO ENSURE THE DISSOLUTION OF AGGRESSIVE OR REACTIVE EMOTIONAL PATTERNS THAT MAY BE STRESSING THE PERICARDIUM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA Y EMOCIONAL: SI LA OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES CARGAS VIRALES O BACTERIANAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LUMBAR \\/ DORSAL] (REF 487). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [MASTOIDES - D \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 509) PARA ASEGURAR LA DISOLUCI\\u00d3N DE PATRONES EMOCIONALES AGRESIVOS O REACTIVOS QUE PUEDAN ESTAR ESTRESANDO EL PERICARDIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/507','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:13:45','2026-04-28 07:13:45'),(4305,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',508,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DANDRUFF (CASPA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - TIBIA (REVISAR - TIBIA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DANDRUFF, SCALP ITCHINESS, AND SKIN DISCOLORATION (PITYRIASIS VERSICOLOR).\\n\\n(CASPA, PICAZ\\u00d3N EN EL CUERO CABELLUDO Y DECOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL (PITIIRIASIS VERSICOLOR).)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE MALASSEZIA FURFUR FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MASTOID AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING DERMATOLOGICAL IMBALANCES CAUSED BY LIPID-DEPENDENT FUNGI. WHILE THIS FUNGUS IS A COMMON INHABITANT OF HUMAN SKIN, AN ACID-ALKALINE IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT ALLOWS IT TO PROLIFERATE, LEADING TO PERSISTENT DANDRUFF OR CHARACTERISTIC SKIN SPOTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REGULATING FUNGAL GROWTH AND RESTORING THE ENERGETIC HEALTH OF THE SCALP AND DERMAL LAYERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL HONGO MALASSEZIA FURFUR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MASTOIDES Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR DESEQUILIBRIOS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS CAUSADOS POR HONGOS DEPENDIENTES DE L\\u00cdPIDOS. SI BIEN ESTE HONGO ES UN HABITANTE COM\\u00daN DE LA PIEL HUMANA, UN DESEQUILIBRIO \\u00c1CIDO-ALCALINO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PERMITE SU PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N, LO QUE PROVOCA CASPA PERSISTENTE O MANCHAS CARACTER\\u00cdSTICAS EN LA PIEL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REGULAR EL CRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO Y A RESTAURAR LA SALUD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL CUERO CABELLUDO Y LAS CAPAS D\\u00c9RMICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL & DERMAL CHECK: IF DANDRUFF OR SKIN IRRITATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MASTOID PROCESS \\/ MEDULLA] (REF 511) AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY FUNGAL STRAINS. FOR CASES INVOLVING EXTENSIVE SKIN SPOTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TIBIA \\/ TIBIA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER SYSTEMIC FILTRATION AND SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF FUNGAL TOXINS DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA Y D\\u00c9RMICA: SI LA CASPA O LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AP\\u00d3FISIS MASTOIDEA \\/ M\\u00c9DULA] (REF 511) PARA ABORDAR CEPAS F\\u00daNGICAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MANCHAS EXTENSAS EN LA PIEL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIBIA \\/ TIBIA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA ADECUADA Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE LIMPIEZA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/508','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:14:52','2026-04-28 07:14:52'),(4306,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',509,'{\"origins\":\"KIEBSIELLA PNEUMONIAE LECTOTRICHIA BUCALLIS.\",\"symptoms\":\"UTI, SEPSIS, POOR DIGESTION. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, SEPSIS, MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"AUTISM, HEPATITIS B OR E, PNEUMONIA, DIABETES, COLITIS, LUNG DISORDERS. (AUTISMO, HEPATITIS B O E, NEUMON\\u00cdA, DIABETES, COLITIS, TRASTORNOS PULMONARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"KLEBSIELLA PNEUMONIAE \\/ LEPTOTRICHIA BUCCALIS\",\"symptoms\":\"UTI, SEPSIS, POOR DIGESTION, AND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, SEPSIS, MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS KLEBSIELLA PNEUMONIAE AND LEPTOTRICHIA BUCCALIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE MAXILLA (UPPER JAW). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT OFTEN ORIGINATE IN THE ORAL OR RESPIRATORY TRACT BUT HAVE SYSTEMIC REACH. IT IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH COMPLEX CONDITIONS SUCH AS PNEUMONIA, COLITIS, DIABETES, AND HEPATITIS B OR E. FURTHERMORE, THIS PAIR IS OFTEN SCANNED IN RELATION TO NEURODEVELOPMENTAL SYMPTOMS, INCLUDING THOSE ASSOCIATED WITH AUTISM, DUE TO THE BACTERIAL INFLUENCE ON GUT-BRAIN AXIS INTEGRITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING BACTERIAL LOADS FROM THE LUNGS, GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT, AND URINARY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE A KLEBSIELLA PNEUMONIAE Y LEPTOTRICHIA BUCCALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL MAXILAR (MAND\\u00cdBULA SUPERIOR). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE A MENUDO SE ORIGINAN EN EL TRACTO ORAL O RESPIRATORIO PERO TIENEN UN ALCANCE SIST\\u00c9MICO. SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON CONDICIONES COMPLEJAS COMO NEUMON\\u00cdA, COLITIS, DIABETES Y HEPATITIS B O E. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE PAR SE ESCANEA A MENUDO EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS DEL NEURODESARROLLO, INCLUIDOS LOS ASOCIADOS CON EL AUTISMO, DEBIDO A LA INFLUENCIA BACTERIANA EN LA INTEGRIDAD DEL EJE INTESTINO-CEREBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS BACTERIANAS DE LOS PULMONES, EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL Y EL SISTEMA URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF LUNG DISORDERS OR PNEUMONIA SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [EAR \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 247) AXIS TO RULE OUT PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS OR COLITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL ENDOTOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF KLEBSIELLA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS TRASTORNOS PULMONARES O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE NEUMON\\u00cdA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [O\\u00cdDO \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 247) PARA DESCARTAR PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO O COLITIS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COL\\u00d3N DESCENDENTE \\/ COL\\u00d3N DESCENDENTE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS ENDOTOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE KLEBSIELLA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/509','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:16:04','2026-04-28 07:16:04'),(4307,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',510,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DEPRESSION (DEPRESI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-GLANDULAR BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO NEUROGLANDULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, DEEP SADNESS, FATIGUE, AND EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS.\\n\\n(DEPRESI\\u00d3N, TRISTEZA PROFUNDA, FATIGA Y PESADEZ EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES DEPRESSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MAXILLA AND THE TAIL OF THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PANCREAS IS NOT ONLY A VITAL ORGAN FOR METABOLIC REGULATION BUT IS ALSO ENERGETICALLY LINKED TO THE PROCESSING OF \\\"SWEETNESS\\\" IN LIFE; AN IMBALANCE HERE, IN CONNECTION WITH THE MAXILLARY REGION, CAN MANIFEST AS DEEP EMOTIONAL DEPRESSION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELEASING REPRESSED SADNESS AND RESTORING THE ENERGETIC FLOW NECESSARY FOR MENTAL VITALITY. IT SUPPORTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN OVERCOMING FEELINGS OF HOPELESSNESS AND PROMOTES A MORE BALANCED BIOCHEMICAL ENVIRONMENT FOR EMOTIONAL RECOVERY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL MAXILAR Y LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL P\\u00c1NCREAS NO SOLO ES UN \\u00d3RGANO VITAL PARA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA, SINO QUE TAMBI\\u00c9N EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE AL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA \\\"DULZURA\\\" DE LA VIDA; UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd, EN CONEXI\\u00d3N CON LA REGI\\u00d3N MAXILAR, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA DEPRESI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL PROFUNDA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR LA TRISTEZA REPRIMIDA Y A RESTAURAR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO NECESARIO PARA LA VITALIDAD MENTAL. APOYA AL INDIVIDUO A SUPERAR SENTIMIENTOS DE DESESPERANZA Y PROMUEVE UN AMBIENTE BIOQU\\u00cdMICO M\\u00c1S EQUILIBRADO PARA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ LEFT KIDNEY] (REF 514) AXIS TO ADDRESS DEEPER DEPRESSIVE PATTERNS. FOR CASES INVOLVING BLOOD SUGAR FLUCTUATIONS THAT IMPACT MOOD, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER SEROTONIN REGULATION, WHICH IS ESSENTIAL FOR SUSTAINING A POSITIVE EMOTIONAL STATE DURING THE CLEARANCE OF DEPRESSIVE ENERGETIC LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y EMOCIONAL: SI LA PESADEZ EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [MASTOIDES \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO] (REF 514) PARA ABORDAR PATRONES DEPRESIVOS M\\u00c1S PROFUNDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FLUCTUACIONES EN EL AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE QUE AFECTEN EL \\u00c1NIMO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR UNA REGULACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LA SEROTONINA, LA CUAL ES ESENCIAL PARA MANTENER UN ESTADO EMOCIONAL POSITIVO DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE LAS CARGAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DEPRESIVAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/510','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:17:09','2026-04-28 07:17:09'),(4308,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',511,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DANDRUFF IN PUBIC AREA. (CASPA EN EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00daBICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RADIUS (REVISAR - RADIO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DANDRUFF IN PUBIC AREA.\\n\\n(CASPA EN EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00daBICA.)\",\"paths\":\"ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL HONGO MICROSPORUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LIGAMENTO MEDIAL DE LA RODILLA Y EL MAL\\u00c9OLO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA ABORDAR CIERTAS MANIFESTACIONES F\\u00daNGICAS QUE AFECTAN LA PIEL Y EL VELLO, PARTICULARMENTE CUANDO SE PRESENTA DESCAMACI\\u00d3N O CASPA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00daBICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REGULAR EL CRECIMIENTO DEL HONGO, ALIVIANDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N LOCAL Y RESTAURANDO LA SALUD DE LOS TEJIDOS D\\u00c9RMICOS EN LAS ZONAS AFECTADAS.\\n\\n(THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE MICROSPORUM FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDIAL KNEE LIGAMENT AND THE MALLEOLUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFIC FOR ADDRESSING CERTAIN FUNGAL MANIFESTATIONS AFFECTING THE SKIN AND HAIR, PARTICULARLY WHEN FLAKING OR DANDRUFF IS PRESENT IN THE PUBIC REGION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REGULATING FUNGAL GROWTH, RELIEVING LOCAL IRRITATION, AND RESTORING THE HEALTH OF THE DERMAL TISSUES IN THE AFFECTED AREAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA: SI LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N O LA CASPA PERSISTEN, SE RECOMIENDA REVISAR EL EJE [RADIO \\/ RADIO] PARA REFORZAR EL CONTROL DE SINERGIAS F\\u00daNGICAS. ADEM\\u00c1S, CONSIDERE REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL PAR [MASTOIDES \\/ M\\u00c9DULA] (REF 511) SI SE PRESENTAN S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES EN EL CUERO CABELLUDO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS.\\n\\n(FUNGAL CHECK: IF IRRITATION OR DANDRUFF PERSISTS, IT IS RECOMMENDED TO REVIEW THE [RADIUS \\/ RADIUS] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CONTROL OF FUNGAL SYNERGIES. ADDITIONALLY, CONSIDER CROSS-REFERENCING WITH THE [MASTOID \\/ MEDULLA] (REF 511) PAIR IF SIMILAR SYMPTOMS APPEAR ON THE SCALP. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER SYSTEMIC FILTRATION OF FUNGAL TOXINS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/511','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:18:19','2026-04-28 07:18:19'),(4309,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',512,'{\"symptoms\":\"UPPER AIRWAY , LARYNGEAL, LUNG, AND BRONCHIAL SYMPTOMS. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES, LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, PULMONARES Y BRONQUIALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY ANIMAL AND NOSOCOMIAL. MAIN CAUSE OF IMMUNODEFICIENCY WITH ESCHERICHIA BACTERIA. (TRANSMITIDO POR ANIMALES Y NOSOCOMIAL. PRINCIPAL CAUSA DE INMUNODEFICIENCIA CON BACTERIA ESCHERICHIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RENAL CAPSULE CHECK - COSTAL MARGIN CHECK - SACRUM            CHECK - FIBULA (REVISAR - C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL REVISAR - MARGEN COSTAL REVISAR - SACRO            REVISAR - PERON\\u00c9)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"UPPER AIRWAY, LARYNGEAL, LUNG, AND BRONCHIAL SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES, LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, PULMONARES Y BRONQUIALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS PROTEUS MIRABILIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE MEDIASTINUM (THE CENTRAL COMPARTMENT OF THE THORACIC CAVITY) IN A VERTICAL ALIGNMENT. PROTEUS MIRABILIS IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH ANIMAL CONTACT OR IN HOSPITAL SETTINGS (NOSOCOMIAL). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS A MAJOR CAUSE OF IMMUNODEFICIENCY, FREQUENTLY ACTING IN SYNERGY WITH ESCHERICHIA COLI. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE BRONCHIAL AND LARYNGEAL PASSAGES, STRENGTHENING THE IMMUNE RESPONSE, AND CLEARING RESPIRATORY DISTRESS CAUSED BY THIS OPPORTUNISTIC PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A PROTEUS MIRABILIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL MEDIASTINO (EL COMPARTIMIENTO CENTRAL DE LA CAVIDAD TOR\\u00c1CICA) EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL. PROTEUS MIRABILIS SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO CON ANIMALES O EN ENTORNOS HOSPITALARIOS (NOSOCOMIAL). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES UNA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE INMUNODEFICIENCIA, ACTUANDO FRECUENTEMENTE EN SINERGIA CON ESCHERICHIA COLI. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LOS PASAJES BRONQUIALES Y LAR\\u00cdNGEOS, FORTALECIENDO LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA Y ELIMINANDO EL MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO CAUSADO POR ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO OPORTUNISTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE & RENAL CHECK: GIVEN THE LINK TO IMMUNODEFICIENCY, IT IS CRITICAL TO SCAN THE [RENAL CAPSULE \\/ RENAL CAPSULE] AXIS. TO ENSURE COMPLETE CLEARANCE OF PROTEUS SYNERGIES, ALSO CHECK THE [COSTAL MARGIN \\/ COSTAL MARGIN], [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM], AND [FIBULA \\/ FIBULA] RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y RENAL: DADA LA VINCULACI\\u00d3N CON LA INMUNODEFICIENCIA, ES CR\\u00cdTICO ESCANEAR EL EJE [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL]. PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N COMPLETA DE LAS SINERGIAS DE PROTEUS, TAMBI\\u00c9N REVISAR LAS RESONANCIAS DE [MARGEN COSTAL \\/ MARGEN COSTAL], [SACRO \\/ SACRO] Y [PERON\\u00c9 \\/ PERON\\u00c9]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/512','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:30:01','2026-04-28 07:30:01'),(4310,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',513,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANXIETY (ANSIEDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-CARDIAC STABILITY (ESTABILIDAD NEUROCARD\\u00cdACA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY, NERVOUSNESS, FEAR, AND EMOTIONAL UNSETTLEDNESS.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD, NERVIOSISMO, MIEDO E INQUIETUD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ANXIETY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDIASTINUM AND THE CEREBELLUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE MEDIASTINUM IS A VITAL JUNCTION FOR THORACIC ENERGY AND AUTONOMIC REGULATION, WHILE THE CEREBELLUM GOVERNS NOT ONLY MOTOR COORDINATION BUT ALSO PLAYS A ROLE IN THE BRAIN\'S PROCESSING OF FEAR AND ANXIETY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE \\\"FIGHT OR FLIGHT\\\" RESPONSE, REDUCING THE FEELING OF CHEST TIGHTNESS ASSOCIATED WITH STRESS, AND PROMOTING A SENSE OF GROUNDED EQUILIBRIUM WITHIN THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA ANSIEDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL MEDIASTINO Y EL CEREBELO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL MEDIASTINO ES UNA UNI\\u00d3N VITAL PARA LA ENERG\\u00cdA TOR\\u00c1CICA Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA, MIENTRAS QUE EL CEREBELO RIGE NO SOLO LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA SINO QUE TAMBI\\u00c9N DESEMPE\\u00d1A UN PAPEL EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DEL MIEDO Y LA ANSIEDAD EN EL CEREBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DE \\\"LUCHA O HUIDA\\\", REDUCIENDO LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO ASOCIADA CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S Y PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE EQUILIBRIO FIRME DENTRO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF ANXIETY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO REGULATE THE LIMBIC SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PALPITATIONS OR CHEST PRESSURE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MEDIASTINUM \\/ MEDIASTINUM] (REF 521) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL SYNERGIES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT ADRENAL CALM AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROEMOCIONAL: SI LA ANSIEDAD PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PALPITACIONES SEVERAS O PRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MEDIASTINO \\/ MEDIASTINO] (REF 521) PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA CALMA ADRENAL Y ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/513','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:31:08','2026-04-28 07:31:08'),(4311,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',514,'{\"symptoms\":\"ALLERIES, EYE DISORDERS, PNEUMONIA, ASTHMA. (ALERGIAS, TRASTORNOS OCULARES, NEUMON\\u00cdA, ASMA)\",\"paths\":\"GLAUCOMA, LUNG DISORDERS, MYCOSIS ON SCALP. (GLAUCOMA, TRASTORNOS PULMONARES, MICOSIS EN EL CUERO CABELLUDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (REVISAR - CODO\\/CODO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES, EYE DISORDERS, PNEUMONIA, AND ASTHMA.\\n\\n(ALERGIAS, TRASTORNOS OCULARES, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y ASMA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE ASPERGILLUS FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDIASTINUM AND THE PERICARDIUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING FUNGAL INFECTIONS THAT IMPACT THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM AND CAN RADIATE TO THE EYES OR SCALP. ASPERGILLUS IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO CHRONIC CONDITIONS SUCH AS ASTHMA, PNEUMONIA, AND GLAUCOMA. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CONTROLLING FUNGAL PROLIFERATION, REDUCING THORACIC INFLAMMATION, AND MITIGATING THE MYCOSIS THAT MAY MANIFEST ON THE SCALP.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL HONGO ASPERGILLUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL MEDIASTINO Y EL PERICARDIO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS QUE IMPACTAN EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO Y PUEDEN RADIAR HACIA LOS OJOS O EL CUERO CABELLUDO. EL ASPERGILLUS SE VINCULA FRECUENTEMENTE CON CONDICIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS COMO ASMA, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y GLAUCOMA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A CONTROLAR LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N TOR\\u00c1CICA Y MITIGANDO LA MICOSIS QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE EN EL CUERO CABELLUDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL & IMMUNE CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY OR SCALP SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CLEARANCE OF FUNGAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EYE PRESSURE OR GLAUCOMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MASTOID PROCESS \\/ MEDULLA] (REF 511) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF FUNGAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA E INMUNITARIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS O DEL CUERO CABELLUDO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CODO \\/ CODO] PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SINERGIAS F\\u00daNGICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PRESI\\u00d3N OCULAR SEVERA O GLAUCOMA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AP\\u00d3FISIS MASTOIDEA \\/ M\\u00c9DULA] (REF 511). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS F\\u00daNGICOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/514','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:32:41','2026-04-28 07:32:41'),(4312,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',515,'{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG DISORDER, BRONCHIAL AIRWAY INFLAMMATION. (ENTEROBACTER PNEUMONIAE\\n\\nTRASTORNO PULMONAR, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS BRONQUIALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CAT AND DOGS. PNEUMONIA, HALITOSIS, OTITIS, AND LARYNGITIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR GATOS Y PERROS. NEUMON\\u00cdA, HALITOSIS, OTITIS Y LARINGITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - HUMERUS     CHECK - GLUTEUS\\/HIATUS (REVISAR - H\\u00daMERO     REVISAR - GL\\u00daTEO\\/HIATO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG DISORDER AND BRONCHIAL AIRWAY INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO PULMONAR E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS BRONQUIALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS ENTEROBACTER PNEUMONIAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDIASTINUM (THE CENTRAL CHEST CAVITY) AND THE SUPRARENAL GLANDS (LOCATED ABOVE THE KIDNEYS). THIS PATHOGEN IS FREQUENTLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH DOMESTIC ANIMALS SUCH AS CATS AND DOGS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS THAT MANIFEST AS PNEUMONIA, LARYNGITIS, OR OTITIS. ADDITIONALLY, IT IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH HALITOSIS (BAD BREATH) ORIGINATING FROM THE UPPER RESPIRATORY OR DIGESTIVE TRACT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING BRONCHIAL INFLAMMATION AND CLEARING THE BACTERIAL LOAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A ENTEROBACTER PNEUMONIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL MEDIASTINO (LA CAVIDAD CENTRAL DEL PECHO) Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES (UBICADAS SOBRE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES). ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE FRECUENTEMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO CON ANIMALES DOM\\u00c9STICOS COMO GATOS Y PERROS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO NEUMON\\u00cdA, LARINGITIS O OTITIS. ADEM\\u00c1S, SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON LA HALITOSIS (MAL ALIENTO) ORIGINADA EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR O DIGESTIVO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL Y A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF LUNG DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [HUMERUS \\/ HUMERUS] AXIS TO RULE OUT COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL OR RESPIRATORY REFLUX (HALITOSIS), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [GLUTEUS \\/ HIATUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT ADRENAL CALM AND ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS TRASTORNOS PULMONARES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00daMERO \\/ H\\u00daMERO] PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN REFLUJO GASTROINTESTINAL O RESPIRATORIO SEVERO (HALITOSIS), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00daTEO \\/ HIATO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA CALMA ADRENAL Y ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/515','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:33:57','2026-04-28 07:33:57'),(4313,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',516,'{\"symptoms\":\"HIGH FEVER, SWEATS, MUSCLE PAIN, JOINT PAIN, FATIGUE, DIZZINESS, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, PARALYSIS. (FIEBRE ALTA, SUDORACI\\u00d3N, DOLOR MUSCULAR, DOLOR ARTICULAR, FATIGA, MAREO, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, PAR\\u00c1LISIS.)\",\"paths\":\"DENGUE FEVER, TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITOS. (FIEBRE DEL DENGUE, TRANSMITIDA POR MOSQUITOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HIGH FEVER, SWEATS, MUSCLE PAIN, JOINT PAIN, FATIGUE, DIZZINESS, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, AND PARALYSIS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE ALTA, SUDORACI\\u00d3N, DOLOR MUSCULAR, DOLOR ARTICULAR, FATIGA, MAREO, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR Y PAR\\u00c1LISIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE VIRUS TRANSMITTED BY THE AEDES AEGYPTI MOSQUITO BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR ADDRESSING DENGUE FEVER. THE VIRUS IMPACTS THE CENTRAL AND PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, WHICH CAN MANIFEST NOT ONLY AS INTENSE BODY PAINS (\\\"BREAKBONE FEVER\\\") BUT ALSO AS ALTERATIONS IN NERVE CONDUCTION LEADING TO WEAKNESS OR TRANSIENT PARALYSIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE, RELIEVING JOINT PAIN, AND SUPPORTING THE RECOVERY OF MOTOR FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS TRANSMITIDO POR EL MOSQUITO AEDES AEGYPTI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA ABORDAR LA FIEBRE DEL DENGUE. EL VIRUS IMPACTA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y PERIF\\u00c9RICO, LO QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE NO SOLO COMO DOLORES CORPORALES INTENSOS (\\\"FIEBRE ROMPEHUESOS\\\"), SINO TAMBI\\u00c9N COMO ALTERACIONES EN LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA QUE PROVOCAN DEBILIDAD O PAR\\u00c1LISIS TRANSITORIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA SIST\\u00c9MICA, ALIVIAR EL DOLOR ARTICULAR Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & FEBRILE CHECK: IF HIGH FEVER PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE BODY\'S THERMAL REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MUSCLE WEAKNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NECK \\/ NECK] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE EFFECTIVE FILTRATION OF VIRAL TOXINS AND MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC HYDRATION DURING THE DENGUE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y FEBRIL: SI LA FIEBRE ALTA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N T\\u00c9RMICA DEL CUERPO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CUELLO \\/ CUELLO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N EFECTIVA DE LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y MANTENER LA HIDRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DEL DENGUE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/516','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:35:17','2026-04-28 07:35:17'),(4314,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',517,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, DEPRESSION, HEADACHES, AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR. (MAREO, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, DOLORES DE CABEZA, COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"PARKINSON\'S DISEASE, SCHIZOPHRENIA. (ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON, ESQUIZOFRENIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DUODENUM\\/SPLEEN (ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON, ESQUIZOFRENIA.\\n\\nREVISAR - DUODENO\\/BAZO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, DEPRESSION, HEADACHES, AND AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR.\\n\\n(MAREO, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, DOLORES DE CABEZA Y COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE NEWCASTLE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA AND THE CEREBELLUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL DUE TO ITS PROFOUND IMPACT ON THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. THE NEWCASTLE VIRUS IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL AND PSYCHOLOGICAL MANIFESTATIONS, INCLUDING CONDITIONS TRADITIONALLY CLASSIFIED AS PARKINSON\'S DISEASE OR SCHIZOPHRENIA. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN MITIGATING NEURO-INFLAMMATION, REDUCING AGGRESSIVE EMOTIONAL VOLATILITY, AND RESTORING BALANCE TO MOTOR AND COGNITIVE FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE NEWCASTLE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y EL CEREBELO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO DEBIDO A SU PROFUNDO IMPACTO EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. EL VIRUS DE NEWCASTLE SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON MANIFESTACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS Y PSICOL\\u00d3GICAS SEVERAS, INCLUYENDO CONDICIONES CLASIFICADAS TRADICIONALMENTE COMO ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON O ESQUIZOFRENIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A MITIGAR LA NEUROINFLAMACI\\u00d3N, REDUCIENDO LA VOLATILIDAD EMOCIONAL AGRESIVA Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO DE LAS FUNCIONES MOTORAS Y COGNITIVAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-DEGENERATIVE CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF PARKINSON\'S OR COGNITIVE DISORIENTATION PERSIST, IT IS ESSENTIAL TO SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY ENERGETIC IMBALANCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE AGGRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT NEUROTRANSMITTER BALANCE AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC STABILITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF VIRAL NEUROTOXICITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURODEGENERATIVA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE PARKINSON O DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA PERSISTEN, ES ESENCIAL ESCANEAR EL EJE [DUODENO \\/ BAZO] PARA ABORDAR DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS COMPLEMENTARIOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN AGRESI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES Y ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA NEUROTOXICIDAD VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/517','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:36:18','2026-04-28 07:36:18'),(4315,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',518,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SCHIZOPHRENIA (ESQUIZOFRENIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURAL INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD NEURAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"AUDITORY HALLUCINATIONS, DELUSIONS, DISORGANIZED THINKING, AND EMOTIONAL FLATNESS.\\n\\n(ALUCINACIONES AUDITIVAS, DELIRIOS, PENSAMIENTO DESORGANIZADO Y APAT\\u00cdA EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCES ASSOCIATED WITH SCHIZOPHRENIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA AND THE CEREBELLUM, SPECIFICALLY WHEN BOTH POINTS PRESENT A NEGATIVE POLARITY REQUIREMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT REPRESENTS A CRITICAL SYNCHRONIZATION POINT FOR BRAINSTEM AND CEREBRAL COMMUNICATION. A MALFUNCTION HERE INTERFERES WITH THE CORRECT PROCESSING OF SENSORY DATA AND REALITY PERCEPTION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING NEUROLOGICAL HYPER-REACTIVITY, SUPPORTING THE BRAIN IN RE-ESTABLISHING COHERENT THOUGHT PATTERNS AND MITIGATING THE SEVERITY OF PSYCHOTIC SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS ASOCIADOS CON LA ESQUIZOFRENIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y EL CEREBELO, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CUANDO AMBOS PUNTOS PRESENTAN UN REQUERIMIENTO DE POLARIDAD NEGATIVA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO REPRESENTA UN PUNTO DE SINCRONIZACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL TALLO CEREBRAL Y EL CEREBRO. UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N AQU\\u00cd INTERFIERE CON EL PROCESAMIENTO CORRECTO DE LOS DATOS SENSORIALES Y LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DE LA REALIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA HIPERREACTIVIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, APOYANDO AL CEREBRO EN EL REESTABLECIMIENTO DE PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO COHERENTES Y MITIGANDO LA GRAVEDAD DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PSIC\\u00d3TICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-PSYCHOLOGICAL CHECK: IF DISORGANIZED THINKING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MEDULLA OBLONGATA \\/ CEREBELLUM] (REF 526) AXIS TO RULE OUT VIRAL LOADS LIKE NEWCASTLE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HALLUCINATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO REGULATE THE LIMBIC SYSTEM. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER NEUROTRANSMITTER MODULATION, WHICH IS ESSENTIAL FOR MAINTAINING MENTAL CLARITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF DYSFUNCTIONAL NEURAL STATES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROPSICOL\\u00d3GICA: SI EL PENSAMIENTO DESORGANIZADO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ CEREBELO] (REF 526) PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS VIRALES COMO EL VIRUS DE NEWCASTLE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ALUCINACIONES SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR UNA MODULACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES, LA CUAL ES ESENCIAL PARA MANTENER LA CLARIDAD MENTAL DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE ESTADOS NEURALES DISFUNCIONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/518','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:37:28','2026-04-28 07:37:28'),(4316,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',519,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EYE INFECTIONS, MENINGITIS, GLAUCOMA. (INFECCIONES OCULARES, MENINGITIS, GLAUCOMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EYE INFECTIONS, MENINGITIS, AND GLAUCOMA.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES OCULARES, MENINGITIS Y GLAUCOMA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE TARGETS THE CRYPTOCOCCUS NEOFORMS FUNGUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA AND THE DESCENDING COLON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC FUNGAL INFECTIONS THAT HAVE A PREDILECTION FOR THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. IF LEFT UNCHECKED, THIS PATHOGEN CAN LEAD TO SERIOUS COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS MENINGITIS. ADDITIONALLY, THIS CIRCUIT IS STRONGLY ASSOCIATED WITH OCULAR HEALTH; IMBALANCES HERE ARE OFTEN LINKED TO GLAUCOMA AND OTHER SEVERE EYE INFECTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REGULATING THE FUNGAL LOAD, PROTECTING NEURAL INTEGRITY, AND SUPPORTING THE ENERGETIC DRAINAGE OF THE EYES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA SE DIRIGE AL HONGO CRYPTOCOCCUS NEOFORMS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y EL COLON DESCENDENTE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE TIENEN PREDILECCI\\u00d3N POR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. SI NO SE CONTROLA, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE PROVOCAR COMPLICACIONES GRAVES COMO LA MENINGITIS. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 FUERTEMENTE ASOCIADO CON LA SALUD OCULAR; LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS AQU\\u00cd SE VINCULAN A MENUDO CON EL GLAUCOMA Y OTRAS INFECCIONES OCULARES SEVERAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REGULAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD NEURAL Y APOYANDO EL DRENAJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LOS OJOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL & NEURAL CHECK: IF EYE PRESSURE OR GLAUCOMA SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [MASTOID PROCESS \\/ MEDULLA] (REF 511) AXIS TO ADDRESS MALASSEZIA SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEADACHES OR MENINGEAL IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF FUNGAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA Y NEURAL: SI LA PRESI\\u00d3N OCULAR O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GLAUCOMA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AP\\u00d3FISIS MASTOIDEA \\/ M\\u00c9DULA] (REF 511) PARA ABORDAR SINERGIAS DE MALASSEZIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS O IRRITACI\\u00d3N MEN\\u00cdNGEA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/519','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:38:34','2026-04-28 07:38:34');
INSERT INTO `audits` VALUES (4317,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',520,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, HEADACHE VENTILATORY INSUFFICIENCY. (MAREO, DOLOR DE CABEZA, INSUFICIENCIA VENTILATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"MENINGITIS, RHEUMATISM, SPINA BIFIDA, BLOOD BRAIN BARRIER TO FEYUS - SPINA-BIFIDA. AUTISM. (MENINGITIS, REUMATISMO, ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA, BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA AL FETO - ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA. AUTISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH - JAW\\/JAW; DEGENERATIVE ARTHRITIS. (ASOCIADO CON - MAND\\u00cdBULA\\/MAND\\u00cdBULA; ARTRITIS DEGENERATIVA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, HEADACHE, AND VENTILATORY INSUFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(MAREO, DOLOR DE CABEZA E INSUFICIENCIA VENTILATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS MENINGOCOCCUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA AND THE THYROID GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT CAN BREACH THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO CONDITIONS SUCH AS MENINGITIS. BEYOND ACUTE INFECTION, THIS RESONANCE IS ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC SYSTEMIC ISSUES INCLUDING RHEUMATISM AND DEGENERATIVE ARTHRITIS. IT IS ALSO MONITORED IN RELATION TO NEURODEVELOPMENTAL CONDITIONS SUCH AS AUTISM AND FETAL COMPLICATIONS LIKE SPINA BIFIDA, DUE TO THE BACTERIAL INFLUENCE ON NEURAL INTEGRITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND PROTECTING THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL MENINGOCOCO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE PUEDEN ATRAVESAR LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA, PROVOCANDO POTENCIALMENTE CONDICIONES COMO LA MENINGITIS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N AGUDA, ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA CON PROBLEMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS CR\\u00d3NICOS, INCLUYENDO REUMATISMO Y ARTRITIS DEGENERATIVA. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE MONITOREA EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON CONDICIONES DEL NEURODESARROLLO COMO EL AUTISMO Y COMPLICACIONES FETALES COMO LA ESPINA B\\u00cdFIDA, DEBIDO A LA INFLUENCIA BACTERIANA EN LA INTEGRIDAD NEURAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y PROTEGER EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & ARTICULAR CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN OR DEGENERATIVE ARTHRITIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [JAW \\/ JAW] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CLEARANCE OF COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING NEUROLOGICAL DISORIENTATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MEDULLA OBLONGATA \\/ CEREBELLUM] (REF 526) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER METABOLIC REGULATION AND SUPPORT THE BODY\'S DEFENSES DURING THE RESOLUTION OF MENINGOCOCCAL LOADS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ARTICULAR: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR O LA ARTRITIS DEGENERATIVA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA] PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ CEREBELO] (REF 526). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA ASEGURAR UNA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA ADECUADA Y APOYAR LAS DEFENSAS DEL CUERPO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LAS CARGAS DE MENINGOCOCO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/520','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:39:39','2026-04-28 07:39:39'),(4318,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',521,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TYPHOID FEVER (FIEBRE TIFOIDEA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, NAUSEA, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, N\\u00c1USEAS Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS BALANTIDIUM COLI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA AND THE TRAPEZIUS MUSCLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS STRONGLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE MANIFESTATIONS OF TYPHOID FEVER. ALTHOUGH TYPHOID IS BACTERIAL, THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC FIELD THAT ALLOWS PARASITIC AND BACTERIAL SYNERGIES TO CAUSE SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL AND SYSTEMIC DISTRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD, REDUCING INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION, AND MITIGATING THE HIGH FEVERS CHARACTERISTIC OF THIS CONDITION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A BALANTIDIUM COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y EL M\\u00daSCULO TRAPECIO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 FUERTEMENTE ASOCIADO CON LAS MANIFESTACIONES DE LA FIEBRE TIFOIDEA. AUNQUE LA TIFOIDEA ES BACTERIANA, ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA EL CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO QUE PERMITE QUE LAS SINERGIAS PARASITARIAS Y BACTERIANAS CAUSEN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICO SEVERO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y MITIGANDO LAS ALTAS FIEBRES CARACTER\\u00cdSTICAS DE ESTA CONDICI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL & FEBRILE CHECK: IF HIGH FEVER OR DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC FILTRATION AND HYDRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL CRAMPING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TROCHANTER MAJOR \\/ TROCHANTER MAJOR] RESONANCE (REF 362) TO RULE OUT SALMONELLA TYPHI. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO ENSURE PROPER THERMAL REGULATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF PARASITIC TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL Y FEBRIL: SI LA FIEBRE ALTA O LA DIARREA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR \\/ TROC\\u00c1NTER MAYOR] (REF 362) PARA DESCARTAR SALMONELLA TYPHI. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR UNA REGULACI\\u00d3N T\\u00c9RMICA ADECUADA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LAS TOXINAS PARASITARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/521','143.105.21.32','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:40:45','2026-04-28 07:40:45'),(4319,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',522,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AGGRESSIVENESS, ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER. (AGRESIVIDAD, TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURAL CONDUCTIVITY (CONDUCTIVIDAD NEURAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"AGGRESSIVENESS AND ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER (ADD\\/ADHD).\\n\\n(AGRESIVIDAD Y TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N (TDAH).)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES BEHAVIORAL AND COGNITIVE IMBALANCES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE AXIS CONNECTING THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA TO THE COCCYX. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS THE SUPERIOR AND INFERIOR TERMINATIONS OF THE SPINAL COLUMN AND CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. A DYSFUNCTION IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN INTERFERE WITH IMPULSE REGULATION AND THE ABILITY TO CONCENTRATE, MANIFESTING AS AGGRESSIVENESS OR DIFFICULTY MAINTAINING FOCUS. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, PROMOTING BETTER NEURAL COMMUNICATION AND SUPPORTING EMOTIONAL AND COGNITIVE BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA DESEQUILIBRIOS EN EL COMPORTAMIENTO Y LA COGNICI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL EJE QUE CONECTA EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO CON EL COXIS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA LA TERMINACI\\u00d3N SUPERIOR E INFERIOR DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE INTERFERIR CON LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS IMPULSOS Y LA CAPACIDAD DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO AGRESIVIDAD O DIFICULTAD PARA MANTENER EL ENFOQUE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, PROMOVIENDO UNA MEJOR COMUNICACI\\u00d3N NEURAL Y APOYANDO EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL Y COGNITIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL & COGNITIVE CHECK: IF AGGRESSIVENESS OR LACK OF FOCUS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO REGULATE THE LIMBIC SYSTEM. FOR CASES RELATED TO ADHD, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT EXECUTIVE FUNCTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS THAT MAY BE STRESSING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE BALANCING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL Y COGNITIVA: SI LA AGRESIVIDAD O LA FALTA DE ENFOQUE PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO. PARA CASOS RELACIONADOS CON EL TDAH, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] PARA APOYAR LAS FUNCIONES EJECUTIVAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS QUE PUEDAN ESTAR ESTRESANDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE EQUILIBRIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/522','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:43:22','2026-04-28 07:43:22'),(4320,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',523,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MALNUTRITION, PELVIC DISORDERS, HEMORRHOIDS, RENAL DISORDERS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS. (ROTAVIRUS\\n\\nDESNUTRICI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, HEMORROIDES, TRASTORNOS RENALES, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, MALNUTRITION, PELVIC DISORDERS, HEMORRHOIDS, AND RENAL DISORDERS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO DIGESTIVOS, DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, HEMORROIDES Y TRASTORNOS RENALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE ROTAVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE MESENTERIC GANGLIA (LOCATED IN THE FOLD OF MEMBRANE THAT ATTACHES THE INTESTINES TO THE ABDOMINAL WALL). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET, PARTICULARLY IN CASES OF MALABSORPTION AND MALNUTRITION. BEYOND DIGESTIVE ISSUES, THIS IMBALANCE IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO PELVIC AND RENAL DISORDERS, AS WELL AS THE ENERGETIC CAUSE OF HEMORRHOIDS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING THE PROPER ABSORPTION OF NUTRIENTS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL ROTAVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LOS GANGLIOS MESENT\\u00c9RICOS (UBICADOS EN EL PLIEGUE DE LA MEMBRANA QUE UNE LOS INTESTINOS A LA PARED ABDOMINAL). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR EL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SEVERO, PARTICULARMENTE EN CASOS DE MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N Y DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, ESTE DESEQUILIBRIO SE VINCULA FRECUENTEMENTE CON TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS Y RENALES, AS\\u00cd COMO CON LA CAUSA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LAS HEMORROIDES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y RESTAURANDO LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N CORRECTA DE NUTRIENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF DIARRHEA OR MALNUTRITION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PELVIC DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER RENAL FILTRATION AND SYSTEMIC HYDRATION DURING THE RECOVERY FROM ROTAVIRUS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA DIARREA O LA DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR SINERGIAS BACTERIANAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL ADECUADA Y LA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL ROTAVIRUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/523','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:44:36','2026-04-28 07:44:36'),(4321,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',524,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FLATFOOT(PIE PLANO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"STRUCTURAL ALIGNMENT (ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"FLAT FOOT, FOOT PAIN, AND ARCH COLLAPSE.\\n\\n(PIE PLANO, DOLOR EN EL PIE Y COLAPSO DEL ARCO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY OF THE FOOT BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE METATARSAL BONES (1 THROUGH 5). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR CORRECTING ENERGETIC IMBALANCES THAT CONTRIBUTE TO \\\"FLAT FOOT\\\" (PES PLANUS). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RESTORING THE NATURAL ARCH AND IMPROVING THE DISTRIBUTION OF WEIGHT ACROSS THE SOLE. IT SUPPORTS THE BIOMECHANICAL ALIGNMENT OF THE LOWER EXTREMITIES, REDUCING STRAIN ON THE ANKLES AND KNEES CAUSED BY IMPROPER FOOT POSTURE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA INTEGRIDAD ESTRUCTURAL DEL PIE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS HUESOS METATARSIANOS (DEL 1 AL 5). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA CORREGIR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE CONTRIBUYEN AL \\\"PIE PLANO\\\" (PES PLANUS). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESTAURAR EL ARCO NATURAL Y A MEJORAR LA DISTRIBUCI\\u00d3N DEL PESO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA PLANTA. APOYA LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N BIOMEC\\u00c1NICA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, REDUCIENDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N EN LOS TOBILLOS Y LAS RODILLAS CAUSADA POR UNA POSTURA INCORRECTA DEL PIE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF FOOT DISCOMFORT OR ALIGNMENT ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [CALCANEUS \\/ CALCANEUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS HEEL STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING ASCENDING PAIN IN THE LEGS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TIBIA \\/ TIBIA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE THAT MAY ACCUMULATE IN THE DISTAL JOINTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: SI EL MALESTAR EN EL PIE O LOS PROBLEMAS DE ALINEACI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CALC\\u00c1NEO \\/ CALC\\u00c1NEO] PARA ABORDAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL TAL\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ASCENDENTE EN LAS PIERNAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIBIA \\/ TIBIA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS QUE PUEDEN ACUMULARSE EN LAS ARTICULACIONES DISTALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/524','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:45:47','2026-04-28 07:45:47'),(4322,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',525,'{\"origins\":\"HANTAL\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RODENTS. CANCEROUS MOLES. (TRANSMITIDO POR ROEDORES. LUNARES CANCEROSOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SCAPULA (REVISAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA)\"}','{\"origins\":\"HANTAVIRUS (HANTAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SKIN LESIONS, POTENTIAL FOR CANCEROUS MOLES, AND RESPIRATORY OR RENAL DISTRESS.\\n\\n(LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, POTENCIAL DE LUNARES CANCEROSOS Y MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO O RENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS HANTAVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN A SPECIFIC MOLE (LUNAR) AND THE KIDNEY ON THE SAME SIDE OF THE BODY. HANTAVIRUS IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED TO HUMANS THROUGH CONTACT WITH RODENTS OR THEIR EXCRETA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MONITORING SKIN ALTERATIONS, AS THE VIRAL LOAD CAN TRIGGER MALIGNANT CHANGES IN NEVI (MOLES). BEYOND DERMATOLOGICAL CONCERNS, HANTAVIRUS CAN IMPACT PULMONARY AND RENAL FUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD AND PREVENTING THE PROLIFERATION OF ABNORMAL CELLULAR GROWTH WITHIN THE SKIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL HANTAVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE UN LUNAR ESPEC\\u00cdFICO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL MISMO LADO DEL CUERPO. EL HANTAVIRUS SE TRANSMITE NORMALMENTE A LOS HUMANOS A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO CON ROEDORES O SUS EXCREMENTOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MONITOREAR ALTERACIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, YA QUE LA CARGA VIRAL PUEDE DESENCADENAR CAMBIOS MALIGNOS EN LOS NEVOS (LUNARES). M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LAS PREOCUPACIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS, EL HANTAVIRUS PUEDE IMPACTAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y RENAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL Y A PREVENIR LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE CRECIMIENTO CELULAR ANORMAL DENTRO DE LA PIEL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMATOLOGICAL & VIRAL CHECK: IF SKIN LESIONS OR SUSPICIOUS MOLES ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CLEARANCE OF HANTAVIRUS SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING BONE DENSITY ISSUES OR MYCOSIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FEMUR \\/ FEMUR] (REF 290) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL TOXINS AND TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE DURING THE RESOLUTION OF THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA Y VIRAL: SI HAY LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O LUNARES SOSPECHOSOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LAS SINERGIAS DEL HANTAVIRUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DE DENSIDAD \\u00d3SEA O MICOSIS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [F\\u00c9MUR \\/ F\\u00c9MUR] (REF 290). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/525','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:47:02','2026-04-28 07:47:02'),(4323,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',526,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SINUSITIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY RESONANCE (RESONANCIA RESPIRATORIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SINUSITIS, NASAL CONGESTION, SNEEZING, AND FACIAL PRESSURE.\\n\\n(SINUSITIS, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL, ESTORNUDOS Y PRESI\\u00d3N FACIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SINUSITIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE NASAL CAVITIES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING VIRAL LOADS THAT CAUSE INFLAMMATION OF THE PARANASAL SINUSES, LEADING TO MUCUS ACCUMULATION AND FACIAL PAIN. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING THE SWELLING OF THE NASAL MUCOSA, FACILITATING PROPER DRAINAGE, AND RELIEVING THE PRESSURE ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC OR ACUTE SINUS INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL ABORDA LA SINUSITIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS CAVIDADES NASALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ELIMINAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE CAUSAN LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SENOS PARANASALES, LO QUE PROVOCA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE MUCOSIDAD Y DOLOR FACIAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA NASAL, FACILITANDO UN DRENAJE ADECUADO Y ALIVIANDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N ASOCIADA CON INFECCIONES SINUSALES CR\\u00d3NICAS O AGUDAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SINUS & IMMUNE CHECK: IF NASAL CONGESTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS FRONTAL SINUSITIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING A REDUCED WHITE BLOOD CELL COUNT OR GENERALIZED MALAISE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DORSAL 3 \\/ DORSAL 7] (REF 219) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SINUSAL E INMUNITARIA: SI LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] PARA ABORDAR LA SINUSITIS FRONTAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN RECUENTO DISMINUIDO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS O MALESTAR GENERALIZADO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [DORSAL 3 \\/ DORSAL 7] (REF 219). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/526','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:48:13','2026-04-28 07:48:13'),(4324,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',527,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC SINUSITIS, NASAL CONGESTION, AND POTENTIAL ASYMPTOMATIC BACTERIAL HARBORING.\\n\\n(SINUSITIS CR\\u00d3NICA, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL Y POTENCIAL ALOJAMIENTO BACTERIANO ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ACTS AS A RESERVOIR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE NASAL SINUS AND THE FRONTAL SINUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, A RESERVOIR IS A SPECIFIC POINT WHERE PATHOGENS CAN REMAIN LATENT OR REPLICATE WITHOUT TRIGGERING FULL SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS. THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE (LEPROSY). WHILE THE USER MAY NOT EXHIBIT ACTIVE SYMPTOMS OF THE DISEASE, THE BACTERIA CAN \\\"HIDE\\\" IN THESE CAVITIES, LEADING TO PERSISTENT SINUS ISSUES OR RECURRING INFECTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN EXPOSING THE HIDDEN VIRAL OR BACTERIAL LOAD, ALLOWING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO FINALLY CLEAR THE PATHOGEN FROM THE PARANASAL SINUSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ACT\\u00daA COMO UN RESERVORIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SENO NASAL Y EL SENO FRONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, UN RESERVORIO ES UN PUNTO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES O REPLICARSE SIN DESENCADENAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMPLETOS. ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE (LEPRA). SI BIEN EL USUARIO PUEDE NO PRESENTAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS ACTIVOS DE LA ENFERMEDAD, LA BACTERIA PUEDE \\\"ESCONDERSE\\\" EN ESTAS CAVIDADES, LO QUE PROVOCA PROBLEMAS SINUSALES PERSISTENTES O INFECCIONES RECURRENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A EXPONER LA CARGA VIRAL O BACTERIANA OCULTA, PERMITIENDO QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO FINALMENTE ELIMINE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO DE LOS SENOS PARANASALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CLEARANCE CHECK: IF SINUSITIS OR RESPIRATORY CONGESTION PERSISTS AFTER CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR, SCAN THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] (REF 225) AXIS TO RULE OUT THE PRIMARY RESONANCE FOR MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING FACIAL PRESSURE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NASAL CAVITY \\/ NASAL CAVITY] (REF 535) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF RELEASED TOXINS DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA SINUSITIS O LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA PERSISTEN DESPU\\u00c9S DE LIMPIAR ESTE RESERVORIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO] (REF 225) PARA DESCARTAR LA RESONANCIA PRIMARIA DE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PRESI\\u00d3N FACIAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CAVIDAD NASAL \\/ CAVIDAD NASAL] (REF 535). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/527','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:49:15','2026-04-28 07:49:15'),(4325,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',528,'{\"symptoms\":\"RUNNY NOSE, WATERY EYES, STUFFY NOSE, PAIN IN THE FOREHEAD, HEADACHE, SORE THROAT, CHILLS, AND LOW GRADE FEVER. (SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, OJOS LLOROSOS, NARIZ CONGESTIONADA, DOLOR EN LA FRENTE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS Y FIEBRE BAJA.)\",\"paths\":\"INFECTION OF THE UPPER AIRWAYS. RHINITIS. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES. RINITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - FRONTAL SINUS (REVISAR - SENO FRONTAL)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RUNNY NOSE, WATERY EYES, STUFFY NOSE, PAIN IN THE FOREHEAD, HEADACHE, SORE THROAT, CHILLS, AND LOW GRADE FEVER.(SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, OJOS LLOROSOS, NARIZ CONGESTIONADA, DOLOR EN LA FRENTE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS Y FIEBRE BAJA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS ACUTE INFECTIONS OF THE UPPER AIRWAYS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE NASAL SINUSES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING VIRAL RHINITIS AND COMMON COLD SYMPTOMS. THE VIRAL LOAD CAUSES INFLAMMATION OF THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES, LEADING TO CONGESTION AND THE CHARACTERISTIC \\\"HEAVY HEAD\\\" FEELING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CLEARING THE INFECTION, REDUCING MUCOSAL SWELLING, AND ALIEVIATING FACIAL PRESSURE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LAS INFECCIONES AGUDAS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LOS SENOS NASALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR LA RINITIS VIRAL Y LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DEL RESFRIADO COM\\u00daN. LA CARGA VIRAL CAUSA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, LO QUE PROVOCA CONGESTI\\u00d3N Y LA CARACTER\\u00cdSTICA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE \\\"CABEZA PESADA\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA Y ALIVIANDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N FACIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SINUS & SYNERGY CHECK: IF FOREHEAD PAIN OR CONGESTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [FRONTAL SINUS \\/ FRONTAL SINUS] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE COUGH OR LOWER RESPIRATORY INVOLVEMENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DORSAL 6 \\/ DORSAL 6] (REF 225) OR [DORSAL 9 \\/ DORSAL 9] (REF 228) RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL TOXINS AND TO MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SINUSAL Y DE SINERGIA: SI EL DOLOR EN LA FRENTE O LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SENO FRONTAL \\/ SENO FRONTAL]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TOS SEVERA O AFECTACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA INFERIOR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS [DORSAL 6 \\/ DORSAL 6] (REF 225) O [DORSAL 9 \\/ DORSAL 9] (REF 228). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y MANTENER LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/528','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:50:27','2026-04-28 07:50:27'),(4326,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',529,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CLOTTING PROBLEMS, BRUISES EASILY, (PROBLEMAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N, MORETONES F\\u00c1CILES\",\"paths\":\"THROMBOSIS (TROMBOSIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"CLOTTING PROBLEMS, BRUISES EASILY, AND VASCULAR FRAGILITY.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N, MORETONES F\\u00c1CILES Y FRAGILIDAD VASCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THROMBOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE NAVEL (UMBILICUS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS POINT IS A CENTRAL HUB FOR VASCULAR CIRCULATION AND ENERGETIC DISTRIBUTION. IMBALANCES HERE ARE ASSOCIATED WITH CLOTTING DISORDERS AND THE FORMATION OF THROMBI (BLOOD CLOTS), WHICH CAN LEAD TO MORE SEVERE CARDIOVASCULAR COMPLICATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REGULATING BLOOD VISCOSITY, IMPROVING SYSTEMIC CIRCULATION, AND REDUCING THE TENDENCY FOR EASY BRUISING OR SPONTANEOUS HEMORRHAGE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA TROMBOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL OMBLIGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PUNTO ES UN CENTRO VITAL PARA LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y LA DISTRIBUCI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA. LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS AQU\\u00cd SE ASOCIAN CON TRASTORNOS DE LA COAGULACI\\u00d3N Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TROMBOS (CO\\u00c1GULOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS), QUE PUEDEN PROVOCAR COMPLICACIONES CARDIOVASCULARES M\\u00c1S GRAVES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REGULAR LA VISCOSIDAD DE LA SANGRE, MEJORANDO LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y REDUCIENDO LA TENDENCIA A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N F\\u00c1CIL DE MORETONES O HEMORRAGIAS ESPONT\\u00c1NEAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR & CIRCULATORY CHECK: IF CLOTTING ISSUES OR EDEMA PERSIST, SCAN THE [ILIAC ARTERY \\/ ILIAC ARTERY] AXIS TO IMPROVE LOWER EXTREMITY CIRCULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VASCULAR CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT BLOOD FILTRATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS THAT MAY AFFECT BLOOD CHEMISTRY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y CIRCULATORIA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N O EL EDEMA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ARTERIA IL\\u00cdACA \\/ ARTERIA IL\\u00cdACA] PARA MEJORAR LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N VASCULAR SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS QUE PUEDAN AFECTAR LA QU\\u00cdMICA SANGU\\u00cdNEA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/529','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:51:34','2026-04-28 07:51:34'),(4327,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',530,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FATHER DEPENDENCY (DEPENDENCIA DEL PADRE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL INSECURITY, DIFFICULTY WITH DECISION-MAKING, AND LACK OF PERSONAL AUTONOMY.\\n\\n(INSEGURIDAD EMOCIONAL, DIFICULTAD PARA TOMAR DECISIONES Y FALTA DE AUTONOM\\u00cdA PERSONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC FIELD OF \\\"FATHER DEPENDENCY\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE NAVEL AND THE TESTICLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS LINKED TO THE UNRESOLVED EMOTIONAL BONDS OR PSYCHOLOGICAL ATTACHMENTS TO THE PATERNAL FIGURE. SUCH IMBALANCES CAN MANIFEST AS A SUBCONSCIOUS SEARCH FOR EXTERNAL VALIDATION OR A LACK OF \\\"VITAL DRIVE\\\" IN PURSUING INDEPENDENT GOALS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RECLAIMING PERSONAL POWER, STRENGTHENING SELF-RELIANCE, AND HARMONIZING THE ENERGETIC TRANSITION FROM DEPENDENCY TO MATURITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA ABORDA EL CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LA \\\"DEPENDENCIA DEL PADRE\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL OMBLIGO Y EL TEST\\u00cdCULO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LOS V\\u00cdNCULOS EMOCIONALES NO RESUELTOS O APEGOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS A LA FIGURA PATERNA. TALES DESEQUILIBRIOS PUEDEN MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA B\\u00daSQUEDA SUBCONSCIENTE DE VALIDACI\\u00d3N EXTERNA O UNA FALTA DE \\\"IMPULSO VITAL\\\" PARA PERSEGUIR METAS INDEPENDIENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A RECUPERAR EL PODER PERSONAL, FORTALECER LA AUTOSUFICIENCIA Y ARMONIZAR LA TRANSICI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA DEPENDENCIA A LA MADUREZ.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF FEELINGS OF INSECURITY PERSIST, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO REGULATE THE LIMBIC SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING PHYSICAL WEAKNESS IN THE LOWER ABDOMEN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NAVAL \\/ NAVAL] (REF 538) RESONANCE TO ENSURE VASCULAR STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE RELEASE OF FEARS ASSOCIATED WITH PERSONAL GROWTH DURING THE EMOTIONAL REBALANCING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS SENTIMIENTOS DE INSEGURIDAD PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEBILIDAD F\\u00cdSICA EN EL ABDOMEN INFERIOR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OMBLIGO \\/ OMBLIGO] (REF 538) PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD VASCULAR. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA APOYAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE MIEDOS ASOCIADOS CON EL CRECIMIENTO PERSONAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/530','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:52:49','2026-04-28 07:52:49'),(4328,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',532,'{\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES, DIARRHEA. (CONVULSIONES, DIARREA)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY DEFECATION. EPILEPSY, ULCERS, DERMATITIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR DEFECACI\\u00d3N. EPILEPSIA, \\u00daLCERAS, DERMATITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER PATHOGENS; HEART FAILURE AND BREAST CANCER.                    CHECK - DORSAL 1. (ASOCIADO CON OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS; INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y C\\u00c1NCER DE MAMA.                    REVISAR - DORSAL 1)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES, DIARRHEA, EPILEPSY, ULCERS, AND DERMATITIS.\\n\\n(CONVULSIONES, DIARREA, EPILEPSIA, \\u00daLCERAS Y DERMATITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE NECK REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THIS MICROORGANISM, OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER (FECAL-ORAL ROUTE), CAN TRIGGER SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL AND SYSTEMIC REACTIONS. BEYOND COMMON GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET LIKE DIARRHEA AND ULCERS, IT IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH SEIZURES AND EPILEPTIC-LIKE PHENOMENA DUE TO THE TOXINS RELEASED BY THE PARASITE AFFECTING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD, REDUCING SKIN INFLAMMATION (DERMATITIS), AND CALMING NEURAL HYPER-REACTIVITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CUELLO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTE MICROORGANISMO, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS O AGUA CONTAMINADOS (RUTA FECAL-ORAL), PUEDE DESENCADENAR REACCIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS Y SIST\\u00c9MICAS SEVERAS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL COM\\u00daN COMO LA DIARREA Y LAS \\u00daLCERAS, SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON CONVULSIONES Y FEN\\u00d3MENOS DE TIPO EPIL\\u00c9PTICO DEBIDO A LAS TOXINAS LIBERADAS POR EL PAR\\u00c1SITO QUE AFECTAN AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL (DERMATITIS) Y CALMANDO LA HIPERREACTIVIDAD NEURAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC SYNERGY CHECK: BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER PATHOGENS THAT CAN COMPROMISE VITAL FUNCTIONS; SCAN THE [DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL LINKS TO HEART FAILURE OR BREAST CANCER ENERGETICS. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT SEIZURES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO REGULATE THE LIMBIC SYSTEM. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE SINERGIA PAT\\u00d3GENA: BLASTOCYSTIS HOMINIS SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE PUEDEN COMPROMETER FUNCIONES VITALES; ESCANEAR EL EJE [DORSAL 1 \\/ DORSAL 1] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES V\\u00cdNCULOS CON LA INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA O LA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL C\\u00c1NCER DE MAMA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONVULSIONES PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/532','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:53:51','2026-04-28 07:53:51'),(4329,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',533,'{\"symptoms\":\"SNEEZING, BLEEDING, BLOODY NOSE, HEADACHE, DIARRHEA TIREDNESS. (ESTORNUDOS, SANGRADO, NARIZ SANGRANTE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DIARREA, CANSANCIO.)\",\"paths\":\"ALLERGIC RHINITIS, SINUSITIS. (RINITIS AL\\u00c9RGICA, SINUSITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SNEEZING, BLEEDING, BLOODY NOSE, HEADACHE, DIARRHEA, AND TIREDNESS.\\n\\n(ESTORNUDOS, SANGRADO, NARIZ SANGRANTE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DIARREA Y CANSANCIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE EFFECTS OF TOXOIDS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE NASAL STRUCTURE, SPECIFICALLY BETWEEN THE MAIN NOSE POINT AND THE MIDDLE SECTION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, TOXOIDS ARE OFTEN LINKED TO VACCINE-DERIVED OR BACTERIAL TOXINS THAT REMAIN IN THE SYSTEM, TRIGGERING CHRONIC INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES. THIS PAIR IS PRIMARILY ASSOCIATED WITH ALLERGIC RHINITIS AND SINUSITIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING MUCOSAL IRRITATION, STOPPING RECURRENT NASAL BLEEDING, AND MITIGATING THE SYSTEMIC FATIGUE OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC RESPIRATORY SENSITIVITIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA ABORDA LOS EFECTOS DE LOS TOXOIDES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA ESTRUCTURA NASAL, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE ENTRE EL PUNTO PRINCIPAL DE LA NARIZ Y LA SECCI\\u00d3N MEDIA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS TOXOIDES SE VINCULAN A MENUDO CON TOXINAS DERIVADAS DE VACUNAS O BACTERIAS QUE PERMANECEN EN EL SISTEMA, DESENCADENANDO RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS CR\\u00d3NICAS. ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA PRINCIPALMENTE CON LA RINITIS AL\\u00c9RGICA Y LA SINUSITIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA, DETENER EL SANGRADO NASAL RECURRENTE Y MITIGAR EL CANSANCIO SIST\\u00c9MICO QUE SUELE ACOMPA\\u00d1AR A LAS SENSIBILIDADES RESPIRATORIAS CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & ALLERGY CHECK: IF SNEEZING AND CONGESTION PERSIST, SCAN THE [NASAL CAVITY \\/ NASAL CAVITY] (REF 535) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL SYNERGIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEADACHES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXIC BYPRODUCTS AND TO MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC HYDRATION DURING THE RESOLUTION OF ALLERGIC STATES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y DE ALERGIAS: SI LOS ESTORNUDOS Y LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CAVIDAD NASAL \\/ CAVIDAD NASAL] (REF 535) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES SINERGIAS VIRALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS T\\u00d3XICOS Y MANTENER LA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE ESTADOS AL\\u00c9RGICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/533','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:54:56','2026-04-28 07:54:56'),(4330,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',534,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTOLERANCE TO OIL PLANT OLEAGINOUS. (INTOLERANCIA A PLANTAS OLEAGINOSAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DIETARY SENSITIVITY (SENSIBILIDAD DIET\\u00c9TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTOLERANCE TO OLEAGINOUS PLANTS (OILS\\/NUTS), DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, AND METABOLIC IRRITATION.\\n\\n(INTOLERANCIA A PLANTAS OLEAGINOSAS (ACEITES\\/NUECES), MALESTAR DIGESTIVO E IRRITACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PSYCHOSOMATIC REACTION TO FATTY ACIDS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE DUODENUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE VISUAL AND SENSORY PROCESSING CENTERS OF THE BRAIN WITH THE PRIMARY SITE OF CHEMICAL DIGESTION. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS A REJECTION OF OLEAGINOUS PLANTS (SUCH AS NUTS, SEEDS, AND CERTAIN VEGETABLE OILS), WHERE THE BODY TRIGGERS AN ADVERSE RESPONSE NOT NECESSARILY DUE TO A PATHOGEN, BUT DUE TO AN ENERGETIC MISALIGNMENT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN SOFTENING THE EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY ASSOCIATED WITH FOOD SENSITIVITIES AND SUPPORTS THE DUODENUM IN PROCESSING LIPIDS MORE EFFICIENTLY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA REACCI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA A LOS \\u00c1CIDOS GRASOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORTIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y EL DUODENO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA LOS CENTROS DE PROCESAMIENTO VISUAL Y SENSORIAL DEL CEREBRO CON EL SITIO PRIMARIO DE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N QU\\u00cdMICA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO UN RECHAZO A LAS PLANTAS OLEAGINOSAS (COMO NUECES, SEMILLAS Y CIERTOS ACEITES VEGETALES), DONDE EL CUERPO DESENCADENA UNA RESPUESTA ADVERSA NO NECESARIAMENTE DEBIDO A UN PAT\\u00d3GENO, SINO A UN DESAJUSTE ENERG\\u00c9TICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A SUAVIZAR LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL ASOCIADA CON LAS SENSIBILIDADES ALIMENTARIAS Y APOYA AL DUODENO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE L\\u00cdPIDOS DE MANERA M\\u00c1S EFICIENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & ENERGETIC CHECK: IF FOOD INTOLERANCES PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT BILE PRODUCTION AND LIPID BREAKDOWN. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE NAUSEA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE AND TO MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE DURING THE RESOLUTION OF DIETARY SENSITIVITIES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y ENERG\\u00c9TICA: SI LAS INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE BILIS Y LA DESCOMPOSICI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdPIDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN N\\u00c1USEAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LAS SENSIBILIDADES DIET\\u00c9TICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/534','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:56:02','2026-04-28 07:56:02'),(4331,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',535,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SCHIZAPHRENIC (ESQUIZOFR\\u00c9NICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-RENAL SYNCHRONIZATION (SINCRONIZACI\\u00d3N NEURO-RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"AUDITORY HALLUCINATIONS, DELUSIONS, COGNITIVE DISARRAY, AND EMOTIONAL WITHDRAWAL.\\n\\n(ALUCINACIONES AUDITIVAS, DELIRIOS, DESORDEN COGNITIVO Y RETRAIMIENTO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC FIELD ASSOCIATED WITH SCHIZOPHRENIC SYMPTOMS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR THE BALANCE BETWEEN THE VISUAL PROCESSING CENTER AND THE BODY\'S PRIMARY FILTRATION SYSTEM. A DISRUPTION IN THIS CIRCUIT INTERFERES WITH THE BRAIN\'S ABILITY TO DISTINGUISH BETWEEN INTERNAL THOUGHTS AND EXTERNAL SENSORY INPUTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN FILTERING \\\"PERCEPTUAL NOISE,\\\" REDUCING THE INTENSITY OF HALLUCINATIONS AND SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF COHERENT REALITY PROCESSING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA EL CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ASOCIADO CON LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS ESQUIZOFR\\u00c9NICOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL EQUILIBRIO ENTRE EL CENTRO DE PROCESAMIENTO VISUAL Y EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N PRIMARIO DEL CUERPO. UNA INTERRUPCI\\u00d3N EN ESTE CIRCUITO INTERFIERE CON LA CAPACIDAD DEL CEREBRO PARA DISTINGUIR ENTRE LOS PENSAMIENTOS INTERNOS Y LAS ENTRADAS SENSORIALES EXTERNAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A FILTRAR EL \\\"RUIDO PERCEPTIVO\\\", REDUCIENDO LA INTENSIDAD DE LAS ALUCINACIONES Y APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE UN PROCESAMIENTO COHERENTE DE LA REALIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-PSYCHOLOGICAL CHECK: IF COGNITIVE DISORIENTATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MEDULLA OBLONGATA \\/ CEREBELLUM - BOTH NEGATIVE] (REF 527) AXIS TO REINFORCE THE TREATMENT OF DYSFUNCTIONAL NEURAL STATES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ THYMUS] (REF 551) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS ANGUISH. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT NEUROTRANSMITTER MODULATION AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC STABILITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF PSYCHOSOMATIC IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROPSICOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ CEREBELO - AMBOS NEGATIVOS] (REF 527) PARA REFORZAR EL TRATAMIENTO DE ESTADOS NEURALES DISFUNCIONALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR EMOCIONAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OCCIPITAL \\/ TIMO] (REF 551) PARA ABORDAR LA ANGUSTIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA MODULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES Y ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE DESEQUILIBRIOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/535','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:57:08','2026-04-28 07:57:08'),(4332,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',536,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HYPERACTIVE (HIPERACTIVO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC HYPERACTIVITY (HIPERACTIVIDAD PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERACTIVITY, NERVOUS RESTLESSNESS, AND DIFFICULTY REMAINING STILL.\\n\\n(HIPERACTIVIDAD, INQUIETUD NERVIOSA Y DIFICULTAD PARA PERMANECER QUIETO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES HYPERACTIVITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE FIFTH LUMBAR VERTEBRA (L5). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE PRIMARY VISUAL PROCESSING CENTER WITH THE LOWER BASE OF THE SPINAL COLUMN, WHICH GOVERNS PHYSICAL STABILITY AND GROUNDING. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS A STATE OF CONSTANT ENERGETIC AGITATION OR \\\"HYPERACTIVE\\\" BEHAVIOR, WHERE THE INDIVIDUAL FEELS DRIVEN BY AN INTERNAL RESTLESSNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN LOWERING MOTOR EXCITABILITY, PROMOTING A SENSE OF CALM AND IMPROVING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN MENTAL FOCUS AND PHYSICAL STILLNESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA HIPERACTIVIDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y LA QUINTA V\\u00c9RTEBRA LUMBAR (L5). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA EL CENTRO DE PROCESAMIENTO VISUAL PRIMARIO CON LA BASE INFERIOR DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL, QUE RIGE LA ESTABILIDAD F\\u00cdSICA Y EL ARRAIGO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN ESTADO DE AGITACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA CONSTANTE O COMPORTAMIENTO \\\"HIPERACTIVO\\\", DONDE EL INDIVIDUO SE SIENTE IMPULSADO POR UNA INQUIETUD INTERNA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A DISMINUIR LA EXCITABILIDAD MOTORA, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA Y MEJORANDO LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL ENFOQUE MENTAL Y LA QUIETUD F\\u00cdSICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL & MOTOR CHECK: IF HYPERACTIVITY OR RESTLESSNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MEDULLA OBLONGATA \\/ COCCYX] (REF 531) AXIS TO REGULATE NEURAL CONDUCTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING LACK OF CONCENTRATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER SYSTEMIC BALANCE AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF STRESS-RELATED ADRENAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE REBALANCING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL Y MOTORA: SI LA HIPERACTIVIDAD O LA INQUIETUD PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ COXIS] (REF 531) PARA REGULAR LA CONDUCTIVIDAD NEURAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FALTA DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO ADECUADO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS ADRENALES RELACIONADOS CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S DURANTE EL PROCESO DE EQUILIBRIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/536','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:58:17','2026-04-28 07:58:17'),(4333,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',537,'{\"origins\":\"EPSTEIN BARR\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, HYPERACTIVITY, PARANOIA, DIZZINESS, HEADACHE, IRRITABILITY, MENTAL CONFUSION, FATIGUE, LACK OF APPETITE, FEVER. FEVER, ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT. (DEPRESI\\u00d3N, HIPERACTIVIDAD, PARANOIA, MAREO, DOLOR DE CABEZA, IRRITABILIDAD, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FATIGA, FALTA DE APETITO, FIEBRE. FIEBRE, MALESTAR ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"IS TRANSMITTED IN PERSON TO PERSON, ESPECIALLY FROM PARENTS TO CHILDREN. MAIN CAUSES OF SERIOUS PSYCHOTIC ILLNESSES AND BRAIN DISORDERS. MANIC DEPRESSION, OBSESSIONS, STRONG DEPRESSION, BIPOLAR, SCHIZOPHRENIA. MAY HELP REGENERATE PARKINSON\'S DISEASE. FALSE ALZHEIMER\'S. MONONUCLEOSIS. (SE TRANSMITE DE PERSONA A PERSONA, ESPECIALMENTE DE PADRES A HIJOS. PRINCIPALES CAUSAS DE ENFERMEDADES PSIC\\u00d3TICAS GRAVES Y TRASTORNOS CEREBRALES. DEPRESI\\u00d3N MAN\\u00cdACA, OBSESIONES, DEPRESI\\u00d3N FUERTE, BIPOLAR, ESQUIZOFRENIA. PUEDE AYUDAR A REGENERAR LA ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON. ALZHEIMER FALSO. MONONUCLEOSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH MONONUCLEOSIS, IT CAN CAUSE LYMPHATIC SWELLING, BURKITT\'S LYMPHOMA, POSTNASAL CARCINOMA, AND CANCER OF THE THROAT. (ASOCIADO CON LA MONONUCLEOSIS, PUEDE CAUSAR HINCHAZ\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA, LINFOMA DE BURKITT, CARCINOMA POSNASAL Y C\\u00c1NCER DE GARGANTA.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"EPSTEIN-BARR VIRUS (EBV)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, HYPERACTIVITY, PARANOIA, DIZZINESS, HEADACHE, IRRITABILITY, MENTAL CONFUSION, FATIGUE, LACK OF APPETITE, FEVER, AND ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(DEPRESI\\u00d3N, HIPERACTIVIDAD, PARANOIA, MAREO, DOLOR DE CABEZA, IRRITABILIDAD, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FATIGA, FALTA DE APETITO, FIEBRE Y MALESTAR ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE EPSTEIN-BARR VIRUS (EBV) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS BOTH SIDES OF THE OCCIPITAL LOBE. EBV IS A HIGHLY PREVALENT VIRUS TRANSMITTED THROUGH SALIVA AND PERSON-TO-PERSON CONTACT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CONSIDERED A PRIMARY CAUSE OF SERIOUS PSYCHOTIC ILLNESSES AND COGNITIVE DISORDERS, INCLUDING MANIC DEPRESSION, BIPOLAR DISORDER, AND SCHIZOPHRENIA. IT MAY ALSO MIMIC OR CONTRIBUTE TO CONDITIONS LIKE \\\"FALSE ALZHEIMER\'S\\\" OR THE ENERGETIC TERRAIN OF PARKINSON\'S DISEASE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD AND RESTORING MENTAL CLARITY AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE EPSTEIN-BARR (VEB) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN AMBOS LADOS DEL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL. EL VEB ES UN VIRUS ALTAMENTE PREVALENTE QUE SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA SALIVA Y EL CONTACTO DE PERSONA A PERSONA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE CONSIDERA UNA CAUSA PRIMARIA DE ENFERMEDADES PSIC\\u00d3TICAS GRAVES Y TRASTORNOS COGNITIVOS, INCLUYENDO LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N MAN\\u00cdACA, EL TRASTORNO BIPOLAR Y LA ESQUIZOFRENIA. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE IMITAR O CONTRIBUIR A CONDICIONES COMO EL \\\"ALZHEIMER FALSO\\\" O EL TERRENO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DE LA ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL Y A RESTAURAR LA CLARIDAD MENTAL Y LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC & SYSTEMIC CHECK: EPSTEIN-BARR IS STRONGLY ASSOCIATED WITH MONONUCLEOSIS; SCAN FOR LYMPHATIC SWELLING OR THROAT ISSUES. IF COGNITIVE SYMPTOMS PERSIST, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO REGULATE THE LIMBIC SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FATIGUE, MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER FILTRATION OF VIRAL TOXINS AND TO MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC HYDRATION DURING THE CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: EL EPSTEIN-BARR EST\\u00c1 FUERTEMENTE ASOCIADO CON LA MONONUCLEOSIS; ESCANEAR EN BUSCA DE HINCHAZ\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA O PROBLEMAS DE GARGANTA. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS COGNITIVOS PERSISTEN, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA SEVERA, MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS VIRALES Y MANTENER LA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/537','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 07:59:31','2026-04-28 07:59:31'),(4334,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',538,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANXIETY (ANSIEDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC TENSION (TENSI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY, NERVOUSNESS, AND MENTAL UNREST.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD, NERVIOSISMO E INQUIETUD MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ANXIETY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE OCCIPITAL LOBES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, WHILE THE OCCIPITAL\\/OCCIPITAL AXIS CAN BE VIRAL (EPSTEIN-BARR), THIS SPECIFIC EMOTIONAL MAPPING FOCUSES ON THE OVERSTIMULATION OF THE VISUAL AND SENSORY PROCESSING CENTERS. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS A PERSISTENT STATE OF WORRY OR \\\"ANTICIPATORY ANXIETY,\\\" WHERE THE MIND STRUGGLES TO DISCONNECT FROM EXTERNAL STIMULI. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN LOWERING CORTISOL LEVELS, CALMING THE MIND, AND RESTORING A SENSE OF INTERNAL PEACE AND EMOTIONAL CONTROL.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA ANSIEDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS L\\u00d3BULOS OCCIPITALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, SI BIEN EL EJE OCCIPITAL\\/OCCIPITAL PUEDE SER VIRAL (EPSTEIN-BARR), ESTE MAPEO EMOCIONAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICO SE CENTRA EN LA SOBREESTIMULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS CENTROS DE PROCESAMIENTO VISUAL Y SENSORIAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO UN ESTADO PERSISTENTE DE PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N O \\\"ANSIEDAD ANTICIPATORIA\\\", DONDE A LA MENTE LE CUESTA DESCONECTARSE DE LOS EST\\u00cdMULOS EXTERNOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A DISMINUIR LOS NIVELES DE CORTISOL, CALMANDO LA MENTE Y RESTAURANDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PAZ INTERNA Y CONTROL EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ANXIETY & CALMING CHECK: IF ANXIETY OR PANIC PERSISTS, SCAN THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE FEAR CENTER DIRECTLY. FOR CASES INVOLVING PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS OF STRESS (SUCH AS TIGHTNESS IN THE CHEST), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PROPER BALANCE OF ADRENAL FUNCTION DURING THE RESOLUTION OF EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ANSIEDAD Y CALMA: SI LA ANSIEDAD O EL P\\u00c1NICO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA ABORDAR DIRECTAMENTE EL CENTRO DEL MIEDO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS DE ESTR\\u00c9S (COMO OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO ADECUADO DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N ADRENAL DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/538','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:00:33','2026-04-28 08:00:33'),(4335,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',539,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CLAUSTROPHOBIA (CLAUSTROFOBIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPATIAL PERCEPTION (PERCEPCI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"CLAUSTROPHOBIA, ANXIETY IN CONFINED SPACES, AND PANIC SENSATIONS.\\n\\n(CLAUSTROFOBIA, ANSIEDAD EN ESPACIOS CERRADOS Y SENSACIONES DE P\\u00c1NICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES CLAUSTROPHOBIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE LEFT PAROTID GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE VISUAL PROCESSING CENTER (WHICH INTERPRETS PHYSICAL BOUNDARIES) WITH THE PAROTID GLAND, WHICH IS ENERGETICALLY SENSITIVE TO ENVIRONMENTAL STRESSORS. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT TRIGGERS AN OVERREACTION TO BEING IN ENCLOSED OR RESTRICTED SPACES, CAUSING THE BRAIN TO SIGNAL A \\\"TRAPPED\\\" RESPONSE. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RECALIBRATING THEIR SPATIAL AWARENESS, REDUCING THE PSYCHOSOMATIC URGENCY TO ESCAPE AND PROMOTING EMOTIONAL COMPOSURE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA CLAUSTROFOBIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PAR\\u00d3TIDA IZQUIERDA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA EL CENTRO DE PROCESAMIENTO VISUAL (QUE INTERPRETA LOS L\\u00cdMITES F\\u00cdSICOS) CON LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PAR\\u00d3TIDA, QUE ES ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE SENSIBLE A LOS ESTRESORES AMBIENTALES. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO DESENCADENA UNA REACCI\\u00d3N EXAGERADA AL ESTAR EN ESPACIOS CERRADOS O RESTRINGIDOS, HACIENDO QUE EL CEREBRO SE\\u00d1ALE UNA RESPUESTA DE \\\"ATRAPADO\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A RECALIBRAR SU CONCIENCIA ESPACIAL, REDUCIENDO LA URGENCIA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA DE ESCAPAR Y PROMOVIENDO LA COMPOSTURA EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SPATIAL & ANXIETY CHECK: IF CLAUSTROPHOBIA OR PANIC PERSISTS, SCAN THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] AXIS TO REGULATE THE FEAR RESPONSE SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYMPTOMS OF GENERALIZED ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] (REF 546) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER ADRENAL BALANCE AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY IN PROCESSING STRESS HORMONES DURING THE RESOLUTION OF EMOTIONAL TRIGGERS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL Y DE ANSIEDAD: SI LA CLAUSTROFOBIA O EL P\\u00c1NICO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA DE RESPUESTA AL MIEDO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE ANSIEDAD GENERALIZADA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] (REF 546). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO ADRENAL ADECUADO Y APOYAR AL CUERPO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LAS HORMONAS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LOS DESENCADENANTES EMOCIONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/539','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:02:01','2026-04-28 08:02:01'),(4336,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',540,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LANGUAGE DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL LENGUAJE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURAL INTEGRATION (INTEGRACI\\u00d3N NEURAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"LANGUAGE DYSFUNCTION, DIFFICULTY WITH SPEECH ARTICULATION, AND COMMUNICATION BARRIERS.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL LENGUAJE, DIFICULTAD CON LA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N DEL HABLA Y BARRERAS DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES LANGUAGE DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE VISUAL AND SENSORY PROCESSING CENTER WITH THE VITAL AUTONOMIC CONTROL CENTER OF THE BRAINSTEM. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN INTERFERE WITH THE BRAIN\'S ABILITY TO CONVERT INTERNAL THOUGHTS INTO VERBAL EXPRESSION, OFTEN MANIFESTING AS STUTTERING, SLURRED SPEECH, OR A GENERAL INABILITY TO COMMUNICATE CLEARLY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN HARMONIZING THE NEURAL PATHWAYS RESPONSIBLE FOR SPEECH PRODUCTION AND LINGUISTIC COHERENCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL LENGUAJE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA EL CENTRO DE PROCESAMIENTO VISUAL Y SENSORIAL CON EL CENTRO DE CONTROL AUT\\u00d3NOMO VITAL DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE INTERFERIR CON LA CAPACIDAD DEL CEREBRO PARA CONVERTIR LOS PENSAMIENTOS INTERNOS EN EXPRESI\\u00d3N VERBAL, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO COMO TARTAMUDEZ, HABLA ARRASTRADA O UNA INCAPACIDAD GENERAL PARA COMUNICARSE CON CLARIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARMONIZAR LAS V\\u00cdAS NEURALES RESPONSABLES DE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DEL HABLA Y LA COHERENCIA LING\\u00dc\\u00cdSTICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COMMUNICATION & NEURAL CHECK: IF SPEECH DIFFICULTIES PERSIST, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS AUDITORY PROCESSING AND BROCA\'S AREA SUPPORT. FOR CASES INVOLVING MOTOR SPEECH DELAYS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CEREBELLUM \\/ CEREBELLUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE AND TO SUPPORT THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RECALIBRATION OF LINGUISTIC FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N Y NEURAL: SI LAS DIFICULTADES DEL HABLA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA ABORDAR EL PROCESAMIENTO AUDITIVO Y EL APOYO AL \\u00c1REA DE BROCA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RETRASOS MOTORES DEL HABLA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CEREBELO \\/ CEREBELO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO ADECUADO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE LA RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES LING\\u00dc\\u00cdSTICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/540','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:03:10','2026-04-28 08:03:10'),(4337,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',541,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LANGUAGE DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL LENGUAJE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COGNITIVE COMMUNICATION (COMUNICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"LANGUAGE DYSFUNCTION, DIFFICULTY PROCESSING AUDITORY INFORMATION, AND VERBAL EXPRESSION BARRIERS.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL LENGUAJE, DIFICULTAD PARA PROCESAR INFORMACI\\u00d3N AUDITIVA Y BARRERAS EN LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N VERBAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES LANGUAGE DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE TEMPORAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS VITAL FOR INTEGRATING VISUAL STIMULI (OCCIPITAL) WITH AUDITORY PROCESSING AND SPEECH COMPREHENSION (TEMPORAL). AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN DISRUPT THE NEURAL BRIDGE BETWEEN SEEING, HEARING, AND SPEAKING, OFTEN RESULTING IN STRUGGLES TO FIND THE RIGHT WORDS OR UNDERSTAND COMPLEX VERBAL INSTRUCTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN HARMONIZING THE BRAIN\'S COMMUNICATION CENTERS, PROMOTING FLUENCY AND BETTER COGNITIVE INTEGRATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL LENGUAJE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES VITAL PARA INTEGRAR LOS EST\\u00cdMULOS VISUALES (OCCIPITAL) CON EL PROCESAMIENTO AUDITIVO Y LA COMPRENSI\\u00d3N DEL HABLA (TEMPORAL). UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE INTERRUMPIR EL PUENTE NEURAL ENTRE VER, O\\u00cdR Y HABLAR, LO QUE A MENUDO RESULTA EN DIFICULTADES PARA ENCONTRAR LAS PALABRAS ADECUADAS O COMPRENDER INSTRUCCIONES VERBALES COMPLEJAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARMONIZAR LOS CENTROS DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBRO, PROMOVIENDO LA FLUIDEZ Y UNA MEJOR INTEGRACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LINGUISTIC & SENSORY CHECK: IF SPEECH ARTICULATION ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ RACHIDIAN BULB] (REF 548) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING AUDITORY HALLUCINATIONS OR SEVERE PERCEPTUAL DISTORTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 543) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RECALIBRATION OF LINGUISTIC PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LING\\u00dc\\u00cdSTICA Y SENSORIAL: SI LAS DIFICULTADES EN LA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N DEL HABLA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [OCCIPITAL \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] (REF 548). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ALUCINACIONES AUDITIVAS O DISTORSIONES PERCEPTIVAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OCCIPITAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 543). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE LA RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS LING\\u00dc\\u00cdSTICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/541','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:04:26','2026-04-28 08:04:26'),(4338,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',542,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SPIRITUAL - EVIL (ESPIRITUAL - MALIGNO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPIRITUAL INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD ESPIRITUAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEEP PSYCHOLOGICAL DISTRESS, FEELINGS OF EXTERNAL INFLUENCE, AND ENERGETIC VULNERABILITY.\\n\\n(ANGUSTIA PSICOL\\u00d3GICA PROFUNDA, SENTIMIENTOS DE INFLUENCIA EXTERNA Y VULNERABILIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SPIRITUAL AND ENERGETIC DISTURBANCES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS (TESTICLE OR VAGINA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS TRADITIONALLY ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"SPIRITUAL - EVIL\\\" OR NEGATIVE ENERGETIC ATTACHMENTS THAT IMPACT THE PSYCHE. THE OCCIPITAL LOBE HANDLES SENSORY PERCEPTION, WHILE THE REPRODUCTIVE CENTERS ARE LINKED TO VITAL CREATIVE ENERGY. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS PERSISTENT NEGATIVE THOUGHT PATTERNS OR A SENSE OF BEING \\\"OPPRESSED\\\" BY FORCES BEYOND ONE\\u2019S CONTROL. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CLEARING THESE ENERGETIC DISRUPTIONS, RECLAIMING AUTONOMY, AND RESTORING A PROTECTIVE PSYCHOSOMATIC BOUNDARY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LAS PERTURBACIONES ESPIRITUALES Y ENERG\\u00c9TICAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES (TEST\\u00cdCULO O VAGINA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE ASOCIA TRADICIONALMENTE CON LO \\\"ESPIRITUAL - MALIGNO\\\" O APEGOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS NEGATIVOS QUE IMPACTAN LA PSIQUE. EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL MANEJA LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL, MIENTRAS QUE LOS CENTROS REPRODUCTIVOS EST\\u00c1N VINCULADOS A LA ENERG\\u00cdA CREATIVA VITAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO NEGATIVOS PERSISTENTES O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ESTAR \\\"OPRIMIDO\\\" POR FUERZAS FUERA DEL CONTROL DE UNO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR ESTAS INTERRUPCIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS, RECUPERAR LA AUTONOM\\u00cdA Y RESTAURAR UNA FRONTERA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA PROTECTORA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENERGETIC & NEURAL CHECK: IF DEEP PSYCHOLOGICAL DISTRESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO REGULATE THE LIMBIC SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PERCEPTUAL DISTORTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 543) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT ENERGETIC CLARITY AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC STABILITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF COMPLEX PSYCHOSOMATIC IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y NEURAL: SI LA ANGUSTIA PSICOL\\u00d3GICA PROFUNDA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA REGULAR EL SISTEMA L\\u00cdMBICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISTORSIONES PERCEPTIVAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OCCIPITAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 543). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA CLARIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE DESEQUILIBRIOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS COMPLEJOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/542','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:05:47','2026-04-28 08:05:47'),(4339,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',543,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANGUISH (ANGUSTIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANGUISH, DEEP SADNESS, OPPRESSION IN THE CHEST, AND EMOTIONAL SUFFERING.\\n\\n(ANGUSTIA, TRISTEZA PROFUNDA, OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO Y SUFRIMIENTO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ANGUISH BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OCCIPITAL LOBE AND THE THYMUS GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE SENSORY PROCESSING CENTER OF THE BRAIN WITH THE IMMUNE AND ENERGETIC HEART CENTER. AN IMBALANCE HERE MANIFESTS AS A PROFOUND SENSE OF OPPRESSION OR \\\"TIGHTNESS\\\" IN THE CHEST, OFTEN DESCRIBED AS ACUTE ANGUISH OR GRIEF. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RELEASING REPRESSED EMOTIONAL WEIGHT, PROMOTING A SENSE OF LIBERATION AND SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM BY REDUCING THE PHYSIOLOGICAL IMPACT OF CHRONIC SADNESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA ANGUSTIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIMO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA EL CENTRO DE PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL DEL CEREBRO CON EL CENTRO INMUNITARIO Y ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SE MANIFIESTA COMO UNA PROFUNDA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, A MENUDO DESCRITA COMO ANGUSTIA AGUDA O DUELO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A LIBERAR EL PESO EMOCIONAL REPRIMIDO, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE LIBERACI\\u00d3N Y APOYANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO AL REDUCIR EL IMPACTO FISIOL\\u00d3GICO DE LA TRISTEZA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & CARDIAC CHECK: IF ANGUISH OR CHEST PRESSURE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT EMOTIONAL DISTRESS IN THE HEART REGION. FOR CASES INVOLVING COGNITIVE DISARRAY OR PERCEPTUAL DISTORTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 543) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] CIRCUIT TO SUPPORT NEUROTRANSMITTER MODULATION AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC CALM DURING THE RESOLUTION OF PSYCHOSOMATIC SUFFERING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y CARD\\u00cdACA: SI LA ANGUSTIA O LA PRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO] PARA ABORDAR EL MALESTAR EMOCIONAL DIRECTO EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DESORDEN COGNITIVO O DISTORSIONES PERCEPTIVAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OCCIPITAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 543). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL CIRCUITO [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA MODULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES Y ASEGURAR LA CALMA SIST\\u00c9MICA DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DEL SUFRIMIENTO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/543','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:06:52','2026-04-28 08:06:52'),(4340,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',544,'{\"paths\":\"ACNE VULGARIS (ACN\\u00c9 VULGAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SCAPULA\\/ISCHIAL RAMUS; DIABETES MELLITUS (REVISAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA\\/RAMA ISQUI\\u00c1TICA; DIABETES MELLITUS)\"}','{\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS ALBUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE OMENTUM (THE FATTY LAYER HANGING OVER THE INTESTINES). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY LINKED TO ACNE VULGARIS. WHILE THE OMENTUM IS AN ABDOMINAL STRUCTURE, THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THIS BACTERIA OFTEN MANIFESTS AS PERSISTENT DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES, PARTICULARLY ON THE BACK AND CHEST. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, THEREBY REDUCING SKIN INFLAMMATION AND CLEARING CHRONIC ACNE BREAKOUTS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS ALBUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL OMENTO (LA CAPA DE GRASA QUE CUELGA SOBRE LOS INTESTINOS). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE AL ACN\\u00c9 VULGAR. SI BIEN EL OMENTO ES UNA ESTRUCTURA ABDOMINAL, LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE ESTA BACTERIA A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS PERSISTENTES, PARTICULARMENTE EN LA ESPALDA Y EL T\\u00d3RAX. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO AS\\u00cd LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y LIMPANDO LOS BROTES DE ACN\\u00c9 CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMATOLOGICAL & METABOLIC CHECK: IF ACNE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ ISCHIAL RAMUS] AXIS TO REINFORCE BACTERIAL CLEARANCE. IN CASES INVOLVING COMPLEX METABOLIC FACTORS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH DIABETES MELLITUS PROTOCOLS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS AND TO MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE DURING THE RESOLUTION OF THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI EL ACN\\u00c9 PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ RAMA ISQUI\\u00c1TICA] PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA. EN CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FACTORES METAB\\u00d3LICOS COMPLEJOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LOS PROTOCOLOS DE DIABETES MELLITUS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS Y MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/544','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:07:52','2026-04-28 08:07:52'),(4341,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',545,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DEPRESSION (DEPRESI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO NEURO-EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, DEEP SADNESS, DISCOURAGEMENT, AND MOOD ALTERATIONS.\\n\\n(DEPRESI\\u00d3N, TRISTEZA PROFUNDA, DES\\u00c1NIMO Y ALTERACIONES DEL ESTADO DE \\u00c1NIMO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES DEPRESSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ORBITAL FLOOR (THE BASE OF THE EYE) AND THE CEREBELLUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRUCIAL BECAUSE IT CONNECTS THE VISUAL SENSORY RECEPTION AREA WITH THE COORDINATION AND MOTOR CONTROL CENTER. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CONNECTION CAN MANIFEST AS AN ENERGETIC DROP THAT AFFECTS THE PERCEPTION OF REALITY, LEADING THE INDIVIDUAL TO STATES OF APATHY OR CHRONIC SADNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN RECALIBRATING THE EMOTIONAL RESPONSE, IMPROVING MOOD AND RESTORING A SENSE OF VITALITY AND FOCUS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SUELO ORBITARIO (LA BASE DEL OJO) Y EL CEREBELO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CRUCIAL PORQUE CONECTA EL \\u00c1REA DE RECEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL VISUAL CON EL CENTRO DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N Y CONTROL MOTOR. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA BAJA ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE AFECTA LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DE LA REALIDAD, LLEVANDO AL INDIVIDUO A ESTADOS DE APAT\\u00cdA O TRISTEZA CR\\u00d3NICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A RECALIBRAR LA RESPUESTA EMOCIONAL, MEJORANDO EL \\u00c1NIMO Y RESTAURANDO LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE VITALIDAD Y ENFOQUE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PSYCHOSOMATIC CHECK: IF DEPRESSION OR DISCOURAGEMENT PERSISTS, SCAN THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] (REF 546) AXIS TO ADDRESS ANXIETY OR THE EPSTEIN-BARR VIRUS THAT CAN MIMIC MOOD DISORDERS. FOR CASES INVOLVING A SENSE OF OPPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ THYMUS] (REF 551) RESONANCE TO RELEASE ANGUISH. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE AND SUPPORT THE BODY IN PROCESSING STRESS-RELATED HORMONES DURING EMOTIONAL RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA: SI LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N O EL DES\\u00c1NIMO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] (REF 546) PARA ABORDAR LA ANSIEDAD O EL VIRUS DE EPSTEIN-BARR QUE PUEDE IMITAR TRASTORNOS DEL \\u00c1NIMO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE OPRESI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OCCIPITAL \\/ TIMO] (REF 551) PARA LIBERAR LA ANGUSTIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL CUERPO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LAS HORMONAS RELACIONADAS CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/545','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:09:27','2026-04-28 08:09:27'),(4342,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',546,'{\"origins\":\"ORF\",\"symptoms\":\"EYE INFLAMMATION, PAIN IN THE EYES, DECREASED VISION, FEVER. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N OCULAR, DOLOR EN LOS OJOS, DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE LA VISI\\u00d3N, FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED PERSON-TO-PERSON AND IT\'S COMMON IN SHEEP AND GOATS. INFLAMMATION OF THE OPTIC NERVE, GLAUCOMA, PHOTOPHOBIA, BLINDNESS,PTERYGIUM, NEUROLOGICAL AND NERVOUS DISORDERS. NODULES AND REGIONAL LYMPHADENOPATHY. (TRANSMITIDO DE PERSONA A PERSONA Y ES COM\\u00daN EN OVEJAS Y CABRAS. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO, GLAUCOMA, FOTOFOTOBIA, CEGUERA, PTERIGI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS Y NERVIOSOS. N\\u00d3DULOS Y LINFADENOPAT\\u00cdA REGIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CANTHUS (REVISAR - CANTO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"ORF (ORFPV - PARAPOXVIRUS)\",\"symptoms\":\"EYE INFLAMMATION, PAIN IN THE EYES, OPTIC NERVE INVOLVEMENT, GLAUCOMA, PHOTOPHOBIA, PTERYGIUM, NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS, NODULES, AND REGIONAL LYMPHADENOPATHY.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N OCULAR, DOLOR EN LOS OJOS, AFECTACI\\u00d3N DEL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO, GLAUCOMA, FOTOFOBIA, PTERIGI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, N\\u00d3DULOS Y LINFADENOPAT\\u00cdA REGIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE ORF VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE ORBITAL FLOOR (THE BASE OF THE EYE SOCKET). ORF IS A ZOONOTIC PATHOGEN TRADITIONALLY TRANSMITTED FROM SHEEP AND GOATS TO HUMANS THROUGH DIRECT CONTACT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INFLAMMATORY CONDITIONS OF THE VISUAL APPARATUS, AS THE VIRUS CAN AFFECT THE OPTIC NERVE AND INCREASE INTRAOCULAR PRESSURE (GLAUCOMA). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING OCULAR PAIN, AND PREVENTING FURTHER NEUROLOGICAL OR VISUAL DETERIORATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS ORF MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL SUELO ORBITARIO (LA BASE DE LA CUENCA DEL OJO). EL ORF ES UN PAT\\u00d3GENO ZOON\\u00d3TICO TRANSMITIDO TRADICIONALMENTE DE OVEJAS Y CABRAS A HUMANOS POR CONTACTO DIRECTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR CONDICIONES INFLAMATORIAS DEL APARATO VISUAL, YA QUE EL VIRUS PUEDE AFECTAR EL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO E AUMENTAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N INTRAOCULAR (GLAUCOMA). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO EL DOLOR OCULAR Y PREVINIENDO UN MAYOR DETERIORO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO O VISUAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"OCULAR & SENSORY CHECK: IF EYE INFLAMMATION OR PHOTOPHOBIA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [CANTHUS \\/ CANTHUS] (REVISAR CANTO) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS ADDITIONAL VIRAL OR BACTERIAL FACTORS AFFECTING THE EYES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VISUAL DISTORTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RESOLUTION OF OCULAR SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N OCULAR Y SENSORIAL: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N OCULAR O LA FOTOFOBIA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [CANTO \\/ CANTO] (REVISAR CANTO) PARA ABORDAR FACTORES VIRALES O BACTERIANOS ADICIONALES QUE AFECTAN LOS OJOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISTORSI\\u00d3N VISUAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS OCULARES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/546','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:10:39','2026-04-28 08:10:39'),(4343,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',547,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES. STROKE, BRAIN INJURY. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES. ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR, LESI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - MASTOID       ASSOCIATED WITH PLASMODIUM VIVAX; FACIAL PARALYSIS. (REVISAR - MASTOIDES       ASOCIADO CON PLASMODIUM VIVAX; PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL)\"}','{\"origins\":\"CRANIAL NERVE INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD DE LOS PARES CRANEALES)\",\"symptoms\":\"DYSFUNCTION OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES, CONSEQUENCES OF STROKE, AND BRAIN INJURIES.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS 12 NERVIOS CRANEALES, SECUELAS DE ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR Y LESIONES CEREBRALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE COMPLEX NEUROLOGICAL NETWORK OF THE 12 CRANIAL NERVES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE OUTER EAR REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REHABILITATING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM AFTER SEVERE EVENTS SUCH AS A STROKE OR TRAUMATIC BRAIN INJURY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN IMPROVING NEURAL CONDUCTIVITY AND COORDINATION, SUPPORTING THE RECOVERY OF VITAL FUNCTIONS GOVERNED BY THE CRANIAL NERVES, INCLUDING SENSORY PERCEPTION, FACIAL MOVEMENT, AND AUTONOMIC REGULATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA COMPLEJA RED NEUROL\\u00d3GICA DE LOS 12 PARES CRANEALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N DEL O\\u00cdDO EXTERNO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA LA REHABILITACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO TRAS EVENTOS GRAVES COMO UN ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR O UNA LESI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL TRAUM\\u00c1TICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A MEJORAR LA CONDUCTIVIDAD Y COORDINACI\\u00d3N NEURAL, APOYANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE FUNCIONES VITALES REGIDAS POR LOS NERVIOS CRANEALES, INCLUYENDO LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL, EL MOVIMIENTO FACIAL Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & PATHOGENIC CHECK: IF FACIAL PARALYSIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL LINKS TO PLASMODIUM VIVAX. FOR COMPLEMENTARY NEUROMUSCULAR SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ESOPHAGEAL \\/ TONGUE] (REF 262) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE AND TO SUPPORT THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RECALIBRATION OF CRANIAL FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y PAT\\u00d3GENA: SI LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES V\\u00cdNCULOS CON PLASMODIUM VIVAX. PARA APOYO NEUROMUSCULAR COMPLEMENTARIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ LENGUA] (REF 262). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO ADECUADO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE LA RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES CRANEALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/547','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:11:52','2026-04-28 08:11:52'),(4344,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',548,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"REGULATES OVULATION (REGULA LA OVULACI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENDOCRINE REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MENSTRUAL IRREGULARITIES, OVULATORY DYSFUNCTION, AND HORMONAL IMBALANCE.\\n\\n(IRREGULARIDADES MENSTRUALES, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N OVULATORIA Y DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS DESIGNED TO REGULATE OVULATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OVARY AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR HARMONIZING THE COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE REPRODUCTIVE GLANDS AND THE BODY\'S PRIMARY FILTRATION AND ADRENAL SYSTEM. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO IRREGULAR CYCLES OR DIFFICULTIES IN THE OVULATORY PROCESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM IN BALANCING HORMONE PRODUCTION, SUPPORTING REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH, AND ENSURING THE PROPER ENERGETIC FLOW NECESSARY FOR A REGULAR MENSTRUAL CYCLE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA PARA REGULAR LA OVULACI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL OVARIO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ARMONIZAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS REPRODUCTIVAS Y EL SISTEMA ADRENAL Y DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N PRIMARIO DEL CUERPO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A CICLOS IRREGULARES O DIFICULTADES EN EL PROCESO OVULATORIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO A EQUILIBRAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL, APOYANDO LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA Y ASEGURANDO EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ADECUADO NECESARIO PARA UN CICLO MENSTRUAL REGULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HORMONAL & REPRODUCTIVE CHECK: IF MENSTRUAL ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PITUITARY \\/ OVARY] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE MASTER CONTROL OF THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING POTENTIAL PATHOGENS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OVARY \\/ OVARY] (REF 557) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT PROTEUS MIRABILIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER ELIMINATION OF HORMONAL BYPRODUCTS AND SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE REGULATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL Y REPRODUCTIVA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS MENSTRUALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ OVARIO] PARA ABORDAR EL CONTROL MAESTRO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN POSIBLES PAT\\u00d3GENOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OVARIO \\/ OVARIO] (REF 557) PARA DESCARTAR PROTEUS MIRABILIS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS HORMONALES Y LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REGULACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/548','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:12:53','2026-04-28 08:12:53'),(4345,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',549,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LOSS OF THE LIBIDO, AND FERTILITY PROBLEMS, HEAVY MENSTRUAL CYCLES. (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE LA LIBIDO Y PROBLEMAS DE FERTILIDAD, CICLOS MENSTRUALES ABUNDANTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - STERNUM\\/ADRENALS (REVISAR - ESTERN\\u00d3N\\/SUPRARRENALES)\"}','{\"origins\":\"PATHOGENIC POTENTIAL (POTENCIAL PAT\\u00d3GENO)\",\"symptoms\":\"LOSS OF LIBIDO, FERTILITY PROBLEMS, AND HEAVY MENSTRUAL CYCLES.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE LA LIBIDO Y PROBLEMAS DE FERTILIDAD, CICLOS MENSTRUALES ABUNDANTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE WITHIN THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE OVARIES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE PRESENCE OF PROTEUS MIRABILIS, A BACTERIUM THAT CAN DISRUPT LOCAL TISSUE HEALTH AND HORMONAL FLOW. BEYOND THE PATHOGENIC FACTOR, THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING VITAL CREATIVE ENERGY AND CORRECTING DYSFUNCTIONS THAT LEAD TO EXCESSIVE MENSTRUAL BLEEDING OR DECREASED SEXUAL DRIVE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REGAINING HORMONAL EQUILIBRIUM AND IMPROVING REPRODUCTIVE VITALITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DENTRO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS OVARIOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON LA PRESENCIA DE PROTEUS MIRABILIS, UNA BACTERIA QUE PUEDE ALTERAR LA SALUD DE LOS TEJIDOS LOCALES Y EL FLUJO HORMONAL. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL FACTOR PAT\\u00d3GENO, ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA CREATIVA VITAL Y CORREGIR DISFUNCIONES QUE CONDUCEN A UN SANGRADO MENSTRUAL EXCESIVO O UNA DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DEL DESEO SEXUAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RECUPERAR EL EQUILIBRIO HORMONAL Y MEJORAR LA VITALIDAD REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF FERTILITY PROBLEMS OR HEAVY CYCLES PERSIST, SCAN THE [STERNUM \\/ ADRENALS] AXIS TO REGULATE THE BODY\\u2019S BROADER RESPONSE TO INFLAMMATION AND STRESS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SPECIFIC OVULATORY DELAYS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OVARY \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 556) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING THE REGULATION OF REPRODUCTIVE FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE FERTILIDAD O LOS CICLOS ABUNDANTES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESTERN\\u00d3N \\/ SUPRARRENALES] PARA REGULAR LA RESPUESTA GENERAL DEL CUERPO A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y EL ESTR\\u00c9S. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RETRASOS OVULATORIOS ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OVARIO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 556). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES REPRODUCTIVAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/549','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:13:59','2026-04-28 08:13:59'),(4346,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',550,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ORGANISM THAT LIVES IN ONES WITH CHRONIC DISEASES AND WEAKENED IMMUNE SYSTEMS. (ORGANISMO QUE VIVE EN PERSONAS CON ENFERMEDADES CR\\u00d3NICAS Y SISTEMAS INMUNOL\\u00d3GICOS DEBILITADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE, RECURRENT INFECTIONS, AND VULNERABILITY DUE TO A WEAKENED IMMUNE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, INFECCIONES RECURRENTES Y VULNERABILIDAD DEBIDO A UN SISTEMA INMUNOL\\u00d3GICO DEBILITADO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS PROTEUS MIRABILIS VULGARIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OVARY AND THE SUPRARENAL (ADRENAL) GLANDS. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN FOUND IN INDIVIDUALS DEALING WITH CHRONIC DISEASES OR THOSE WHOSE IMMUNE RESPONSES HAVE BEEN SIGNIFICANTLY COMPROMISED. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE IT LINKS THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM WITH THE ADRENAL CENTER RESPONSIBLE FOR CORTISOL AND ADRENALINE PRODUCTION. AN IMBALANCE HERE ALLOWS THE BACTERIA TO PERPETUATE A STATE OF SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, RESTORING VITALITY, AND REINFORCING THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL PROTEUS MIRABILIS VULGARIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL OVARIO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE ENCUENTRA A MENUDO EN PERSONAS QUE ENFRENTAN ENFERMEDADES CR\\u00d3NICAS O CUYAS RESPUESTAS INMUNITARIAS SE HAN VISTO SIGNIFICATIVAMENTE COMPROMETIDAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE VINCULA EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR CON EL CENTRO ADRENAL RESPONSABLE DE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE CORTISOL Y ADRENALINA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PERMITE QUE LA BACTERIA PERPET\\u00daE UN ESTADO DE DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD Y REFORZAR LAS DEFENSAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF CHRONIC WEAKNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [OVARY \\/ OVARY] (REF 557) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL LOCALIZED PROTEUS MIRABILIS COLONIZATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ADRENAL FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STERNUM \\/ ADRENALS] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT ENDOCRINE RECOVERY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS AND TO MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE DURING THE STRENGTHENING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA DEBILIDAD CR\\u00d3NICA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [OVARIO \\/ OVARIO] (REF 557) PARA ABORDAR LA POSIBLE COLONIZACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA DE PROTEUS MIRABILIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA ADRENAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ESTERN\\u00d3N \\/ SUPRARRENALES] PARA APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS Y MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE FORTALECIMIENTO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/550','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:14:59','2026-04-28 08:14:59'),(4347,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',551,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INDICATES PREGNANCY. (INDICA EMBARAZO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION; CAN PRODUCE ABORTION. WHEN APPLIED TO ONE PREGNANT. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N; PUEDE PROVOCAR ABORTO CUANDO SE APLICA EN UNA PERSONA EMBARAZADA.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"GESTATIONAL DETECTION (DETECCI\\u00d3N GESTACIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"INDICATES PREGNANCY.\\n\\n(INDICA EMBARAZO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS TRADITIONALLY USED IN BIOMAGNETISM AS AN INDICATOR OF PREGNANCY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE OVARY AND THE UTERUS. IN THE BIOMAGNETIC PROTOCOL, THIS AXIS RESPONDS WHEN GESTATION IS PRESENT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE PRACTITIONER CAN CONFIRM THE ENERGETIC STATE OF THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM; HOWEVER, EXTREME CAUTION IS REQUIRED AS THE APPLICATION OF HIGH-GAUSS MAGNETS TO THIS SPECIFIC AXIS MAY INTERFERE WITH THE PREGNANCY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE UTILIZA TRADICIONALMENTE EN BIOMAGNETISMO COMO UN INDICADOR DE EMBARAZO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL OVARIO Y EL \\u00daTERO. EN EL PROTOCOLO BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICO, ESTE EJE RESPONDE CUANDO EXISTE GESTACI\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL TERAPEUTA PUEDE CONFIRMAR EL ESTADO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR; SIN EMBARGO, SE REQUIERE EXTREMA PRECAUCI\\u00d3N YA QUE LA APLICACI\\u00d3N DE IMANES DE ALTO GAUSS EN ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PUEDE INTERFERIR CON EL EMBARAZO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"> \\u26a0\\ufe0f CAUTION \\/ PRECAUCI\\u00d3N:\\nCAN PRODUCE ABORTION WHEN APPLIED TO A PREGNANT INDIVIDUAL. DO NOT APPLY MAGNETS TO THIS PAIR IF PREGNANCY IS SUSPECTED OR CONFIRMED UNLESS FOLLOWING SPECIFIC CLINICAL SAFETY GUIDELINES.\\n\\n(PUEDE PROVOCAR ABORTO CUANDO SE APLICA EN UNA PERSONA EMBARAZADA. NO APLICAR IMANES EN ESTE PAR SI SE SOSPECHA O CONFIRMA EMBARAZO, A MENOS QUE SE SIGAN GU\\u00cdAS ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS DE SEGURIDAD CL\\u00cdNICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/551','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:16:12','2026-04-28 08:16:12'),(4348,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',552,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CHRONIC INTOXICATION. ESPECIALLY FOOD INTOXICATION. (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA. ESPECIALMENTE INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DETOXIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA (SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC INTOXICATION, DISCOMFORT AFTER FOOD INTAKE, AND TOXIN OVERLOAD.\\n\\n(INTOXICACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA, MALESTAR TRAS LA INGESTA DE ALIMENTOS Y SOBRECARGA TOX\\u00cdNICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES CHRONIC INTOXICATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PALATINE GLAND AND THE KIDNEY ON THE SAME SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR TREATING THE AFTERMATH OF FOOD POISONING OR THE PROLONGED CONSUMPTION OF SUBSTANCES THAT OVERLOAD THE SYSTEM. THE PALATINE GLAND, LOCATED IN THE ROOF OF THE MOUTH, ACTS AS A FIRST SENSORY BARRIER AND SECRETES FLUIDS THAT BEGIN THE DIGESTIVE PROCESS, WHILE THE KIDNEY IS THE MASTER FILTER OF THE BLOOD. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN PROCESSING AND ELIMINATING ACCUMULATED TOXINS, RESTORING METABOLIC BALANCE AND RELIEVING THE BURDEN ON THE ELIMINATION ORGANS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PALATINA Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL MISMO LADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA TRATAR LAS SECUELAS DE LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA O EL CONSUMO PROLONGADO DE SUSTANCIAS QUE SOBRECARGAN EL SISTEMA. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PALATINA, SITUADA EN EL TECHO DE LA BOCA, ACT\\u00daA COMO UNA PRIMERA BARRERA SENSORIAL Y SECRETA L\\u00cdQUIDOS QUE INICIAN EL PROCESO DIGESTIVO, MIENTRAS QUE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N ES EL FILTRO MAESTRO DE LA SANGRE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A PROCESAR Y ELIMINAR LAS TOXINAS ACUMULADAS, RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y ALIVIANDO LA CARGA SOBRE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & EXCRETORY CHECK: IF THE SENSATION OF INTOXICATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ RIGHT KIDNEY] AXIS TO REINFORCE BLOOD PURIFICATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE GASTROINTESTINAL INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT HYDRATION DURING THE DETOXIFICATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y EXCRETORA: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE INTOXICACI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO] PARA REFORZAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N HEM\\u00c1TICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL AGUDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N DURANTE EL PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/552','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:17:46','2026-04-28 08:17:46'),(4349,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',553,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WITCHCRAFT (BRUJER\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENERGETIC INTERFERENCE (INTERFERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SENSE OF BEING ENERGETICALLY COMPROMISED, PSYCHOLOGICAL DISTRESS, AND UNEXPLAINED NEGATIVITY.\\n\\n(SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ESTAR COMPROMETIDO ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE, ANGUSTIA PSICOL\\u00d3GICA Y NEGATIVIDAD INEXPLICABLE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ENERGETIC DISTURBANCES TRADITIONALLY REFERRED TO AS \\\"WITCHCRAFT\\\" (BRUJER\\u00cdA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PALM OF THE HAND AND THE SOLE OF THE FOOT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE PRIMARY ENERGETIC EXIT AND ENTRY POINTS OF THE LIMBS. AN IMBALANCE HERE IS BELIEVED TO INDICATE AN EXTERNAL ENERGETIC INTERFERENCE THAT DISRUPTS THE INDIVIDUAL\'S VITAL FLOW. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CLEARING NEGATIVE INFLUENCES, RE-ESTABLISHING THE BODY\'S ENERGETIC BOUNDARIES, AND RESTORING A SENSE OF SPIRITUAL AND EMOTIONAL INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LAS PERTURBACIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS TRADICIONALMENTE CONOCIDAS COMO \\\"BRUJER\\u00cdA\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PALMA DE LA MANO Y LA PLANTA DEL PIE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA LOS PUNTOS PRIMARIOS DE ENTRADA Y SALIDA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES. SE CREE QUE UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd INDICA UNA INTERFERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA EXTERNA QUE ALTERA EL FLUJO VITAL DEL INDIVIDUO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LAS INFLUENCIAS NEGATIVAS, REESTABLECIENDO LAS FRONTERAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DEL CUERPO Y RESTAURANDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE INTEGRIDAD ESPIRITUAL Y EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENERGETIC & PROTECTIVE CHECK: IF THE SENSATION OF EXTERNAL INFLUENCE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ TESTICLE OR VAGINA] (REF 550) AXIS TO ADDRESS DEEPER SPIRITUAL ATTACHMENTS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PSYCHOLOGICAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT MENTAL CLARITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ENERGETIC CLEARANCE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y PROTECTORA: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE INFLUENCIA EXTERNA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [OCCIPITAL \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO O VAGINA] (REF 550) PARA ABORDAR APEGOS ESPIRITUALES M\\u00c1S PROFUNDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANGUSTIA PSICOL\\u00d3GICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA CLARIDAD MENTAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y APOYAR EL PROCESO DE LIMPIEZA ENERG\\u00c9TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/553','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:19:14','2026-04-28 08:19:14'),(4350,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',554,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BALANCER (EQUILIBRADOR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CENTRAL EQUILIBRIUM (EQUILIBRIO CENTRAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ENERGETIC INSTABILITY, FEELING \\\"OFF-BALANCE,\\\" AND EMOTIONAL DISCONNECT.\\n\\n(INESTABILIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE \\\"DESEQUILIBRIO\\\" Y DESCONEXI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ACTS AS A BALANCER (EQUILIBRADOR) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE PALMS OF BOTH HANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PALMS ARE PRIMARY ENERGETIC CONDUCTORS AND SENSORY INTERFACES WITH THE EXTERNAL WORLD. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS A GENERAL SENSE OF DISARRAY OR A LACK OF CENTEREDNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN HARMONIZING THE BODY\'S POLARITIES, PROMOTING A STATE OF CALM, AND RE-ESTABLISHING A STEADY ENERGETIC FLOW THROUGHOUT THE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ACT\\u00daA COMO UN EQUILIBRADOR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS PALMAS DE AMBAS MANOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LAS PALMAS SON CONDUCTORES ENERG\\u00c9TICOS PRIMARIOS E INTERFACES SENSORIALES CON EL MUNDO EXTERIOR. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DE DESORDEN O UNA FALTA DE CENTRALIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARMONIZAR LAS POLARIDADES DEL CUERPO, PROMOVIENDO UN ESTADO DE CALMA Y REESTABLECIENDO UN FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO CONSTANTE EN TODO EL SISTEMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GROUNDING & ALIGNMENT CHECK: IF THE FEELING OF INSTABILITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PALM \\/ FOOT SOLE] (REF 561) AXIS TO REINFORCE GROUNDING AND CLEAR EXTERNAL INTERFERENCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP MENTAL FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE INTEGRATION OF THIS ENERGETIC RECALIBRATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ARRAIGO Y ALINEACI\\u00d3N: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE INESTABILIDAD PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PALMA \\/ PLANTA DEL PIE] (REF 561) PARA REFORZAR EL ARRAIGO Y ELIMINAR INTERFERENCIAS EXTERNAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA MENTAL PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/554','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:20:19','2026-04-28 08:20:19'),(4351,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',555,'{\"symptoms\":\"MALAISE, FATIGUE, GENERALIZED MUSCLE PAIN, HEADACHE, REOCCURRING FEVERS, CHILLS, COLD FEET, VOMITING, SHOCK, ANEMIA, HYPOGLYCEMIA, JOINT PAIN. (MALESTAR, FATIGA, DOLOR MUSCULAR GENERALIZADO, DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRES RECURRENTES, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, PIES FR\\u00cdOS, V\\u00d3MITOS, CHOQUE, ANEMIA, HIPOGLUCEMIA, DOLOR ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY A FEMALE ANOPHELES MOSQUITO. MALARIA, FIBROMYALGIA, ACUTE DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, PULMONARY EDEMA AND ACIDITY. OSTEOARTHRITIS AND ARTHRITIS. FACE PARALYSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR UN MOSQUITO ANOPHELES HEMBRA. MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS AGUDOS, EDEMA PULMONAR Y ACIDEZ. OSTEOARTRITIS Y ARTRITIS. PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CHEEKBONE\\/KIDNEY -OPPOSITE. TRANSMITIDO POR UN MOSQUITO ANOPHELES HEMBRA. MALARIA, FIBROMIALGIA, PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS AGUDOS, EDEMA PULMONAR Y ACIDEZ. OSTEOARTRITIS Y ARTRITIS. PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL. (REVISAR - P\\u00d3MULO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (OPUESTO))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MALAISE, FATIGUE, GENERALIZED MUSCLE PAIN, HEADACHE, RECURRING FEVERS, CHILLS, COLD FEET, VOMITING, SHOCK, ANEMIA, HYPOGLYCEMIA, AND JOINT PAIN.\\n\\n(MALESTAR, FATIGA, DOLOR MUSCULAR GENERALIZADO, DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRES RECURRENTES, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, PIES FR\\u00cdOS, V\\u00d3MITOS, CHOQUE, ANEMIA, HIPOGLUCEMIA, Y DOLOR ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS PLASMODIUM VIVAX (THE PATHOGEN RESPONSIBLE FOR MALARIA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE PALMS OF BOTH HANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC ISSUES SUCH AS FIBROMYALGIA, ACUTE DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, AND PULMONARY EDEMA. THE PARASITE IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY THE FEMALE ANOPHELES MOSQUITO. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PROTOZOAN LOAD, REDUCING SYSTEMIC ACIDITY, AND MITIGATING THE NEUROLOGICAL AND INFLAMMATORY EFFECTS THAT CAN LEAD TO FACIAL PARALYSIS OR ARTHRITIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE AL PLASMODIUM VIVAX MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS PALMAS DE AMBAS MANOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR PROBLEMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMO LA FIBROMIALGIA, PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS AGUDOS Y EDEMA PULMONAR. EL PAR\\u00c1SITO ES TRANSMITIDO T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR EL MOSQUITO ANOPHELES HEMBRA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA DE PROTOZOOS, REDUCIENDO LA ACIDEZ SIST\\u00c9MICA Y MITIGANDO LOS EFECTOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS E INFLAMATORIOS QUE PUEDEN CONDUCIR A LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL O ARTRITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF FACIAL PARALYSIS OR JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [CHEEKBONE \\/ KIDNEY (OPPOSITE SIDE)] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE CLEARANCE OF PLASMODIUM VIVAX. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FATIGUE OR ANEMIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF TOXINS AND SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF THE PARASITIC INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL O EL DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00d3MULO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (LADO OPUESTO)] PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PLASMODIUM VIVAX. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA SEVERA O ANEMIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ BAZO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS Y LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/555','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:21:46','2026-04-28 08:21:46'),(4352,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',557,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBTAINED FROM PICKLE AND BOTTLED FOOD AND MILK PRODUCTS. INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, MUSCULAR PAIN, COLIC AND GAS. (OBTENIDO DE ENCURTIDOS Y ALIMENTOS ENLATADOS Y PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR MUSCULAR, C\\u00d3LICOS Y GASES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, MUSCULAR PAIN, COLIC, AND GAS.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR MUSCULAR, C\\u00d3LICOS Y GASES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CLOSTRIDIUM BOTULINUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TAIL OF THE PANCREAS AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ASSOCIATED WITH TOXINS TYPICALLY OBTAINED FROM PICKLED FOODS, BOTTLED PRODUCTS, AND CERTAIN MILK DERIVATIVES. THE BACTERIA CAN PRODUCE NEUROTOXINS THAT AFFECT MUSCLE CONTROL AND DIGESTIVE FUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, RELIEVING ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT AND SUPPORTING THE RECOVERY OF NORMAL MUSCULAR TONE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CLOSTRIDIUM BOTULINUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE ASOCIA CON TOXINAS OBTENIDAS T\\u00cdPICAMENTE DE ENCURTIDOS, ALIMENTOS ENLATADOS Y CIERTOS PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. LA BACTERIA PUEDE PRODUCIR NEUROTOXINAS QUE AFECTAN EL CONTROL MUSCULAR Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ALIVIANDO EL MALESTAR ABDOMINAL Y APOYANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL TONO MUSCULAR NORMAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & TOXICOLOGICAL CHECK: IF COLIC OR GAS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO REINFORCE HEPATIC DETOXIFICATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MUSCLE WEAKNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NECK \\/ NECK] RESONANCE TO MONITOR NERVOUS SYSTEM IMPACT. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RESOLUTION OF THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y TOXICOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS C\\u00d3LICOS O GASES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA REFORZAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CUELLO \\/ CUELLO] PARA MONITOREAR EL IMPACTO EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/557','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:22:56','2026-04-28 08:22:56'),(4353,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',558,'{\"symptoms\":\"RASH, HIVES, ALLERGIC REACTIONS, EDEMA, ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, NAUSEA, AND VOMITING. (ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, URTICARIA, REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS, EDEMA, C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES, N\\u00c1USEAS Y V\\u00d3MITOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RAW FISH. MAY LEAD TO ANAPHTLAXIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR PESCADO CRUDO. PUEDE PROVOCAR ANAFILAXIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RASH, HIVES, ALLERGIC REACTIONS, EDEMA, ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, NAUSEA, AND VOMITING.\\n\\n(ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, URTICARIA, REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS, EDEMA, C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES, N\\u00c1USEAS Y V\\u00d3MITOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS ANASAKIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PANCREAS AND THE DUODENUM. ANASAKIS IS A NEMATODE TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE CONSUMPTION OF RAW OR UNDERCOOKED FISH. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE PARASITE CAN TRIGGER SEVERE ALLERGIC RESPONSES AND LOCALIZED GASTROINTESTINAL INFLAMMATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE PARASITIC IMPACT, REDUCING ABDOMINAL PAIN, AND PREVENTING POTENTIALLY DANGEROUS SYSTEMIC REACTIONS SUCH AS ANAPHYLAXIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE AL ANASAKIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL DUODENO. EL ANASAKIS ES UN NEM\\u00c1TODO TRANSMITIDO T\\u00cdPICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONSUMO DE PESCADO CRUDO O POCO COCIDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO PUEDE DESENCADENAR RESPUESTAS AL\\u00c9RGICAS SEVERAS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL LOCALIZADA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR EL IMPACTO PARASITARIO, REDUCIENDO EL DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y PREVINIENDO REACCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS POTENCIALMENTE PELIGROSAS COMO LA ANAFILAXIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ALLERGIC & DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF RASHES OR HIVES PERSIST, SCAN THE [COLON ASCENDING \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC TOXICITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL CRAMPS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION OF ALLERGENS AND SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF THE PARASITIC INFESTATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N AL\\u00c9RGICA Y DIGESTIVA: SI LAS ERUPCIONES O LA URTICARIA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE AL\\u00c9RGENOS Y LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA INFESTACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/558','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:23:53','2026-04-28 08:23:53'),(4354,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',559,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE (FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA)\",\"paths\":\"MORBID OBESITY (OBESIDAD M\\u00d3RBIDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC FATIGUE AND SYSTEMIC LETHARGY.\\n\\n(FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA Y LETARGO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PANCREAS AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING MORBID OBESITY AND CHRONIC FATIGUE. THE PANCREAS REGULATES INSULIN AND ENZYME PRODUCTION, WHILE THE LIVER PROCESSES NUTRIENTS AND FILTERS TOXINS. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT DISRUPTS THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO CONVERT FOOD INTO ENERGY EFFICIENTLY, OFTEN LEADING TO EXCESSIVE WEIGHT GAIN AND PERSISTENT EXHAUSTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN OPTIMIZING GLUCOSE METABOLISM AND RESTORING VITAL ENERGY LEVELS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA OBESIDAD M\\u00d3RBIDA Y LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA. EL P\\u00c1NCREAS REGULA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA Y ENZIMAS, MIENTRAS QUE EL H\\u00cdGADO PROCESA NUTRIENTES Y FILTRA TOXINAS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO ALTERA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA CONVERTIR LOS ALIMENTOS EN ENERG\\u00cdA DE MANERA EFICIENTE, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A UN AUMENTO DE PESO EXCESIVO Y AGOTAMIENTO PERSISTENTE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A OPTIMIZAR EL METABOLISMO DE LA GLUCOSA Y RESTAURAR LOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & HEPATIC CHECK: IF FATIGUE OR WEIGHT ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO REINFORCE DETOXIFICATION PATHWAYS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE CRAMPS OR BACTERIAL TOXINS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS TAIL \\/ LIVER] (REF 565) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING THE RECALIBRATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y HEP\\u00c1TICA: SI LA FATIGA O LOS PROBLEMAS DE PESO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA REFORZAR LAS V\\u00cdAS DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN C\\u00d3LICOS DIGESTIVOS O TOXINAS BACTERIANAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 565). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/559','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:25:01','2026-04-28 08:25:01'),(4355,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',560,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PANCREAS DISORDERS, MORBID OBESITY, TRUE DIABETES. FALSE PANCREATITIS. (TRASTORNOS DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, OBESIDAD M\\u00d3RBIDA, DIABETES VERDADERA. PANCREATITIS FALSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PANCREAS DISORDERS, MORBID OBESITY, TRUE DIABETES, AND FALSE PANCREATITIS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, OBESIDAD M\\u00d3RBIDA, DIABETES VERDADERA Y PANCREATITIS FALSA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS ADENOVIRUS 36 BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS ADENOVIRUS 36 HAS BEEN CLINICALLY LINKED TO ADIPOGENESIS (THE FORMATION OF FAT CELLS) AND METABOLIC DISRUPTION, OFTEN LEADING TO MORBID OBESITY. THE VIRUS CAN ALSO ALTER INSULIN PRODUCTION OR RECEPTION, CAUSING SYMPTOMS THAT MIMIC PANCREATITIS OR RESULT IN \\\"TRUE DIABETES\\\" (PERMANENT GLANDULAR DAMAGE). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL IMPACT, SUPPORTING WEIGHT MANAGEMENT AND PROTECTING THE ENDOCRINE FUNCTION OF THE PANCREAS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL ADENOVIRUS 36 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE EL ADENOVIRUS 36 SE HA VINCULADO CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE CON LA ADIPOG\\u00c9NESIS (LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS GRASAS) Y LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA, QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A LA OBESIDAD M\\u00d3RBIDA. EL VIRUS TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE ALTERAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N O RECEPCI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA, CAUSANDO S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE IMITAN LA PANCREATITIS O RESULTAN EN \\\"DIABETES VERDADERA\\\" (DA\\u00d1O GLANDULAR PERMANENTE). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR EL IMPACTO VIRAL, APOYANDO EL CONTROL DE PESO Y PROTEGIENDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF OBESITY OR GLUCOSE ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PANCREAS \\/ LIVER] (REF 567) AXIS TO OPTIMIZE GENERAL METABOLISM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 566) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT PARASITIC FACTORS LIKE ANASAKIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE KIDNEYS IN PROCESSING METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY OF PANCREATIC FUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y GLANDULAR: SI LA OBESIDAD O LOS PROBLEMAS DE GLUCOSA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 567) PARA OPTIMIZAR EL METABOLISMO GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ DUODENO] (REF 566) PARA DESCARTAR FACTORES PARASITARIOS COMO EL ANASAKIS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LOS RI\\u00d1ONES EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/560','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:25:56','2026-04-28 08:25:56'),(4356,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',561,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TAPEWORM. A PARASITE THAT COMMONLY AFFECTS THE LIVER, LUNGS AND KIDNEYS. OCCURRING IN ANY ORGAN; SPLEEN, HEART, BREAST, PANCREAS, MUSCLES, PAROTID, THYROID AND MEDIASTINUM. (TENIA. UN PAR\\u00c1SITO QUE AFECTA COM\\u00daNMENTE AL H\\u00cdGADO, PULMONES Y RI\\u00d1ONES. PUEDE PRESENTARSE EN CUALQUIER \\u00d3RGANO; BAZO, CORAZ\\u00d3N, MAMA, P\\u00c1NCREAS, M\\u00daSCULOS, PAR\\u00d3TIDA, TIROIDES Y MEDIASTINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN, WEIGHT LOSS, COUGH, AND POTENTIAL CYST FORMATION IN VARIOUS ORGANS.\\n\\n(DOLOR ABDOMINAL, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, TOS Y POSIBLE FORMACI\\u00d3N DE QUISTES EN DIVERSOS \\u00d3RGANOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS ECHINOCOCCUS GRANULOSUS (A TYPE OF TAPEWORM) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PANCREAS AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THIS PARASITE IS KNOWN FOR FORMING HYDATID CYSTS THAT CAN AFFECT THE LIVER, LUNGS, KIDNEYS, AND VIRTUALLY ANY ORGAN, INCLUDING THE HEART, BREAST, MUSCLES, AND THYROID. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE PARASITIC LOAD, PREVENTING THE EXPANSION OF CYSTS AND PROTECTING THE INTEGRITY OF THE LYMPHATIC AND DIGESTIVE SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE AL ECHINOCOCCUS GRANULOSUS (UN TIPO DE TENIA) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO ES CONOCIDO POR FORMAR QUISTES HIDAT\\u00cdDICOS QUE PUEDEN AFECTAR EL H\\u00cdGADO, PULMONES, RI\\u00d1ONES Y VIRTUALMENTE CUALQUIER \\u00d3RGANO, INCLUYENDO EL CORAZ\\u00d3N, MAMA, M\\u00daSCULOS Y TIROIDES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, PREVINIENDO LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N DE QUISTES Y PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LOS SISTEMAS LINF\\u00c1TICO Y DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & ORGANIC CHECK: IF CYSTS ARE SUSPECTED IN OTHER AREAS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] OR [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXES TO ADDRESS COMMON COLONIZATION SITES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 566) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ORG\\u00c1NICA: SI SE SOSPECHA DE QUISTES EN OTRAS \\u00c1REAS, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] O [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LOS SITIOS COMUNES DE COLONIZACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ DUODENO] (REF 566). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/561','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:27:05','2026-04-28 08:27:05'),(4357,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',562,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"WEAKNESS, FATIGUE, DIARRHEA, AND VOMITING. (DEBILIDAD, FATIGA, DIARREA Y V\\u00d3MITOS.)\",\"paths\":\"DUE TO FOOD POISONING, SUCH AS SHELLFISH OR OTHER FOODS. ALLERGIC SKIN REACTIONS. (DEBIDO A INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA, COMO MARISCOS U OTROS ALIMENTOS. REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS EN LA PIEL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ALIMENTARY INTOXICATION (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"WEAKNESS, FATIGUE, DIARRHEA, VOMITING, AND ALLERGIC SKIN REACTIONS.\\n\\n(DEBILIDAD, FATIGA, DIARREA, V\\u00d3MITOS Y REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS EN LA PIEL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ACUTE INTOXICATION CAUSED BY THE INGESTION OF CONTAMINATED FOOD, PARTICULARLY SHELLFISH OR SPOILED INGREDIENTS, BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PANCREAS AND THE STOMACH. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR STABILIZING THE UPPER GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT DURING A TOXIC EVENT. THE PAIR HELPS TO MITIGATE THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE OF THE STOMACH LINING AND SUPPORTS THE PANCREAS IN ITS EXOCRINE FUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXPELING TOXINS MORE EFFICIENTLY, REDUCING NAUSEA AND PREVENTING SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS ASSOCIATED WITH FOOD POISONING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N AGUDA CAUSADA POR LA INGESTA DE ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS, PARTICULARMENTE MARISCOS O INGREDIENTES EN MAL ESTADO, MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL EST\\u00d3MAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ESTABILIZAR EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL SUPERIOR DURANTE UN EVENTO T\\u00d3XICO. EL PAR AYUDA A MITIGAR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA DEL REVESTIMIENTO ESTOMACAL Y APOYA AL P\\u00c1NCREAS EN SU FUNCI\\u00d3N EXOCRINA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EXPULSAR LAS TOXINAS DE MANERA M\\u00c1S EFICIENTE, REDUCIENDO LAS N\\u00c1USEAS Y PREVINIENDO LA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA ASOCIADA CON LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TOXICOLOGICAL & HEPATIC CHECK: IF VOMITING OR DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PALATINE GLAND \\/ KIDNEY (SAME SIDE)] (REF 560) AXIS TO REINFORCE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ALLERGIC REACTIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 566) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT PARASITIC INTERFERENCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER HYDRATION AND SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF THE INTOXICATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N TOXICOL\\u00d3GICA Y HEP\\u00c1TICA: SI LOS V\\u00d3MITOS O LA DIARREA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [GL\\u00c1NDULA PALATINA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (MISMO LADO)] (REF 560) PARA REFORZAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ DUODENO] (REF 566) PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA Y LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/562','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:28:10','2026-04-28 08:28:10'),(4358,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',563,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PANCREATITIS, PANCREAS INTOXICATION. OPENS THE CLOGS OF THE PANCREAS, THAT CAN CAUSE DIABETES. (PANCREATITIS, INTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. ABRE LAS OBSTRUCCIONES DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, QUE PUEDEN CAUSAR DIABETES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PLACEMENT; 4 MAGNETS TOGETHER IN HEAD, BODY, TAIL AND TIP OF PANCREAS. ALTERNATING POLARITY. N-P-N-P (COLOCACI\\u00d3N; 4 IMANES JUNTOS EN CABEZA, CUERPO, COLA Y PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. POLARIDAD ALTERNADA. N-P-N-P)\"}','{\"origins\":\"PANCREATIC DUCT INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD DEL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PANCREATITIS, PANCREAS INTOXICATION, AND POTENTIAL DIABETES DUE TO OBSTRUCTION.\\n\\n(PANCREATITIS, INTOXICACI\\u00d3N DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y POSIBLE DIABETES DEBIDO A OBSTRUCCIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES PANCREATITIS AND GLANDULAR INTOXICATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE ENTIRE PANCREATIC BAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR \\\"OPENING\\\" THE CLOGS OR OBSTRUCTIONS WITHIN THE PANCREAS THAT CAN LEAD TO SERIOUS METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION, INCLUDING DIABETES. BY STABILIZING THIS ENTIRE HORIZONTAL SECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE ORGAN IN RESTORING THE PROPER FLOW OF DIGESTIVE ENZYMES AND HORMONES, RELIEVING INFLAMMATION AND PREVENTING LONG-TERM DAMAGE TO THE PANCREATIC TISSUE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA PANCREATITIS Y LA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE TODA LA BANDA PANCRE\\u00c1TICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA \\\"ABRIR\\\" LAS OBSTRUCCIONES DENTRO DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS QUE PUEDEN CONDUCIR A UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA GRAVE, INCLUIDA LA DIABETES. AL ESTABILIZAR TODA ESTA SECCI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL \\u00d3RGANO A RESTAURAR EL FLUJO ADECUADO DE ENZIMAS DIGESTIVAS Y HORMONAS, ALIVIANDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y PREVINIENDO DA\\u00d1OS A LARGO PLAZO EN EL TEJIDO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PLACEMENT PROTOCOL: APPLY 4 MAGNETS TOGETHER ACROSS THE HEAD, BODY, TAIL, AND TIP OF THE PANCREAS. USE ALTERNATING POLARITY IN A NORTH-SOUTH-NORTH-SOUTH (N-P-N-P) PATTERN. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GLUCOSE IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] (REF 568) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL FACTORS LIKE ADENOVIRUS 36. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE DETOXIFICATION OF THE GLAND.\\n\\n(PROTOCOLO DE COLOCACI\\u00d3N: APLICAR 4 IMANES JUNTOS A LO LARGO DE LA CABEZA, EL CUERPO, LA COLA Y LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. UTILIZAR POLARIDAD ALTERNADA EN UN PATR\\u00d3N NORTE-SUR-NORTE-SUR (N-P-N-P). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN DESEQUILIBRIO GRAVE DE GLUCOSA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 568) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES FACTORES VIRALES COMO EL ADENOVIRUS 36. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/563','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:29:27','2026-04-28 08:29:27'),(4359,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',564,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, FEVER AND GAS. INTOLERANCE TO LACTOSE, MEAT, EGGS COMMENT ETC. (PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, FIEBRE Y GASES. INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA, CARNE, HUEVOS, ETC.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY THE BITE OF A TICK OR MITES. LIVER DISORDER, JAUNDICE, OBESITY, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME, INFLAMMATION OF THE PANCREAS DUCT AND POOR QUALITY OF BILE. (TRANSMITIDO POR LA PICADURA DE GARRAPATAS O \\u00c1CAROS. TRASTORNO HEP\\u00c1TICO, ICTERICIA, OBESIDAD, S\\u00cdNDROME DE INTESTINO IRRITABLE, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y MALA CALIDAD DE LA BILIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH KIDNEY; NEPHROTIC SYNDROME.            CHECK - BILE DUCT\\/KIDNEY (R)               CHECK - CLITORIS\\/PELVIS  CHECK - CLITORIS\\/SACRUM                         CHECK - URETHRA\\/SACRUM (ASOCIADO CON EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N; S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO.            REVISAR - CONDUCTO BILIAR\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)               REVISAR - CL\\u00cdTORIS\\/PELVIS  REVISAR - CL\\u00cdTORIS\\/SACRO                         REVISAR - URETRA\\/SACRO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, FEVER, AND GAS. INTOLERANCE TO LACTOSE, MEAT, AND EGGS.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, COLITIS, GASTRITIS, FIEBRE Y GASES. INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA, CARNE Y HUEVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS SPIROCHAETES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PANCREATIC DUCT AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. THESE PATHOGENS ARE COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE BITES OF TICKS OR MITES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE INFECTION CAN LEAD TO LIVER DISORDERS, JAUNDICE, AND IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN CAUSES INFLAMMATION OF THE PANCREATIC DUCT, WHICH DEGRADES THE QUALITY OF BILE AND INTERFERES WITH THE DIGESTION OF PROTEINS AND FATS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, IMPROVING BILE FLOW AND RELIEVING SYSTEMIC DIGESTIVE DISTRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LAS ESPIROQUETAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. ESTOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS SE TRANSMITEN COM\\u00daNMENTE POR PICADURAS DE GARRAPATAS O \\u00c1CAROS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PUEDE PROVOCAR TRASTORNOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS, ICTERICIA Y S\\u00cdNDROME DE INTESTINO IRRITABLE. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO CAUSA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO, LO QUE DEGRADA LA CALIDAD DE LA BILIS E INTERFIERE CON LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N DE PROTE\\u00cdNAS Y GRASAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, MEJORANDO EL FLUJO DE BILIS Y ALIVIANDO EL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RENAL & DIGESTIVE CHECK: THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH NEPHROTIC SYNDROME; IF RENAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS. FOR COMPLEMENTARY BILE REGULATION, SCAN THE [BILE DUCT \\/ RIGHT KIDNEY] RESONANCE. IN CASES INVOLVING UROGENITAL DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH [CLITORIS \\/ PELVIS], [CLITORIS \\/ SACRUM], OR [URETHRA \\/ SACRUM] TO ADDRESS REMAINING BACTERIAL FACTORS. ALWAYS ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY TO SUPPORT THE LIVER DURING THE DETOXIFICATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y DIGESTIVA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO; SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RENALES PERSISTEN, MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. PARA UNA REGULACI\\u00d3N COMPLEMENTARIA DE LA BILIS, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [CONDUCTO BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO]. EN CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR UROGENITAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON [CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ PELVIS], [CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ SACRO] O [URETRA \\/ SACRO] PARA ABORDAR FACTORES BACTERIANOS REMANENTES. SIEMPRE ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO PARA APOYAR AL H\\u00cdGADO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/564','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:30:28','2026-04-28 08:30:28'),(4360,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',565,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LEPROSY (LEPRA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GENERALIZED MALAISE, POTENTIAL SKIN LESIONS, AND SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(MALESTAR GENERALIZADO, POSIBLES LESIONES EN LA PIEL Y DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS A VARIATION OF THE LEPROSY COMPLEX (LEPROSY 11) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PANCREATIC DUCT AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS PART OF A SPECIALIZED PROTOCOL TO ADDRESS PATHOGENS THAT CAN AFFECT THE SKIN AND THE NERVOUS SYSTEM. THE PANCREATIC DUCT IS VITAL FOR ENZYME TRANSPORT, WHILE THE RIGHT KIDNEY SERVES AS A CRITICAL FILTRATION POINT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PREVENTING THE SPREAD OF SYSTEMIC TOXICITY AND SUPPORTING THE RECOVERY OF TISSUE INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A UNA VARIANTE DEL COMPLEJO DE LA LEPRA (LEPRA 11) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES PARTE DE UN PROTOCOLO ESPECIALIZADO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE PUEDEN AFECTAR LA PIEL Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. EL CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO ES VITAL PARA EL TRANSPORTE DE ENZIMAS, MIENTRAS QUE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO SIRVE COMO UN PUNTO DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00cdTICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y APOYANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD DE LOS TEJIDOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC & RENAL CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST OR IF THERE ARE OTHER SIGNS OF THE LEPROSY COMPLEX, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE TOTAL SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE ISSUES LINKED TO SPIROCHAETES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREATIC DUCT \\/ LEFT KIDNEY] (REF 572) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE BODY IN PROCESSING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RENAL: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN O SI HAY OTROS SIGNOS DEL COMPLEJO DE LA LEPRA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD TOTAL DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS VINCULADOS A ESPIROQUETAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO] (REF 572). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR AL CUERPO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/565','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:31:27','2026-04-28 08:31:27'),(4361,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',566,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, FEVER, MUSCLE ACHES, JOINT PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, LOSS OF APPETITE, DIZZINESS, NOSEBLEEDS. (DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR ARTICULAR, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO, MAREO, HEMORRAGIAS NASALES.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY UNPASTEURIZED MILK. YELLOW FEVER, JAUNDICE. (TRANSMITIDO POR LECHE NO PASTEURIZADA. FIEBRE AMARILLA, ICTERICIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/LIVER                 CHECK - DESCENDING COLON\\/KIDNEY (R) (REVISAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/H\\u00cdGADO                 REVISAR - COLON DESCENDENTE\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, FEVER, MUSCLE ACHES, JOINT PAIN, NAUSEA, VOMITING, LOSS OF APPETITE, DIZZINESS, AND NOSEBLEEDS.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR ARTICULAR, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO, MAREO Y HEMORRAGIAS NASALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS PASTEURELLA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PANCREATIC LIGAMENT AND THE DESCENDING COLON. THIS PATHOGEN IS FREQUENTLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE CONSUMPTION OF UNPASTEURIZED MILK OR DIRECT CONTACT WITH INFECTED ANIMALS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS THE BACTERIA CAN MANIFEST SYMPTOMS SIMILAR TO YELLOW FEVER, INCLUDING JAUNDICE AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING LIVER FUNCTION, AND RELIEVING THE ACUTE DIGESTIVE AND NEUROLOGICAL DISTRESS ASSOCIATED WITH THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA PASTEURELLA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LIGAMENTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y EL COLON DESCENDENTE. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE FRECUENTEMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONSUMO DE LECHE NO PASTEURIZADA O EL CONTACTO DIRECTO CON ANIMALES INFECTADOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE MANIFESTAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES A LA FIEBRE AMARILLA, INCLUYENDO ICTERICIA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y ALIVIANDO EL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICO AGUDO ASOCIADO CON LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & RENAL CHECK: IF JAUNDICE OR SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DESCENDING COLON \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO REINFORCE DETOXIFICATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FLUID IMBALANCE OR NOSEBLEEDS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DESCENDING COLON \\/ RIGHT KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RENAL: SI LA ICTERICIA O LA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA REFORZAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN DESEQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS SEVERO O HEMORRAGIAS NASALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/566','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:32:27','2026-04-28 08:32:27'),(4362,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',567,'{\"symptoms\":\"SORE THROAT, HALITOSIS, HEADACHE, DIZZINESS, FEVER, BODY ACHES, SKIN RASH AND SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES. (DOLOR DE GARGANTA, HALITOSIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MAREO, FIEBRE, DOLORES CORPORALES, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS HINCHADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY A FLY. LYMPHOCYTIC MENINGITIS, FALSE LEUKEMIA. EXACERBATES OR DISEASES AND SYMPTOMS, ESPECIALLY CANCER. AFFECTS THE CLOTTING FACTOR OF RED AND WHITE BLOOD CELLS. (TRANSMITIDO POR UNA MOSCA. MENINGITIS LINFOC\\u00cdTICA, LEUCEMIA FALSA. EXACERBA OTRAS ENFERMEDADES Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS, ESPECIALMENTE EL C\\u00c1NCER. AFECTA EL FACTOR DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS Y BLANCOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SORE THROAT, HALITOSIS, HEADACHE, DIZZINESS, FEVER, BODY ACHES, SKIN RASH, AND SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES.(DOLOR DE GARGANTA, HALITOSIS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MAREO, FIEBRE, DOLORES CORPORALES, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS HINCHADOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE WEST NILE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PANCREATIC LIGAMENT AND THE SPLEEN. TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY INSECTS (SUCH AS FLIES OR MOSQUITOES), THIS PATHOGEN CAN CAUSE LYMPHOCYTIC MENINGITIS OR \\\"FALSE LEUKEMIA\\\" BY DISRUPTING THE CLOTTING FACTORS OF BOTH RED AND WHITE BLOOD CELLS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT BECAUSE THE VIRUS TENDS TO EXACERBATE PRE-EXISTING CONDITIONS AND SYMPTOMS, PARTICULARLY IN CASES INVOLVING CANCER. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING BLOOD INTEGRITY, AND REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL NILO OCCIDENTAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LIGAMENTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO Y EL BAZO. TRANSMITIDO T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR INSECTOS (COMO MOSCAS O MOSQUITOS), ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE CAUSAR MENINGITIS LINFOC\\u00cdTICA O \\\"LEUCEMIA FALSA\\\" AL ALTERAR LOS FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS Y BLANCOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO PORQUE EL VIRUS TIENDE A EXACERBAR ENFERMEDADES Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS PREEXISTENTES, ESPECIALMENTE EN CASOS QUE INVOLUCRAN C\\u00c1NCER. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA SANGRE Y REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LYMPHATIC & HEMATIC CHECK: IF SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES OR BLOOD CLOTTING ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE BODY\'S FILTRATION AND IMMUNE RESPONSE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEADACHES OR MENINGEAL SIGNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA Y HEM\\u00c1TICA: SI LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS HINCHADOS O LOS PROBLEMAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ BAZO] PARA REFORZAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA DEL CUERPO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS O SIGNOS MEN\\u00cdNGEOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/567','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:33:32','2026-04-28 08:33:32'),(4363,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',568,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PAIN, NUMBNESS, TINGLING, BURNING SENSATIONS, WEAKNESS AND FALLS HERNIATED DISC. SPINAL DISORDERS. (DOLOR, ENTUMECIMIENTO, HORMIGUEO, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE QUEMAZ\\u00d3N, DEBILIDAD Y CA\\u00cdDAS. HERNIA DE DISCO. TRASTORNOS DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"paths\":\"RADICULOPATHY, NERVE COMPRESSION. FROM TRAUMA OR SPINAL DEFORMITIES. (RADICULOPAT\\u00cdA, COMPRESI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA. POR TRAUMA O DEFORMIDADES ESPINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPINAL DECOMPRESSION (DESCOMPRESI\\u00d3N ESPINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"PAIN, NUMBNESS, TINGLING, BURNING SENSATIONS, WEAKNESS, AND FALLS. HERNIATED DISC. SPINAL DISORDERS.(DOLOR, ENTUMECIMIENTO, HORMIGUEO, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE QUEMAZ\\u00d3N, DEBILIDAD Y CA\\u00cdDAS. HERNIA DE DISCO. TRASTORNOS DE LA COLUMNA VERTEBRAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES RADICULOPATHY AND NERVE COMPRESSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE PARAVERTEBRAL AREA DIRECTLY ABOVE THE SITE OF DISCOMFORT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE SEQUELAE OF TRAUMA OR SPINAL DEFORMITIES. BY STABILIZING THE ENERGY FLOW IN THE TISSUES ADJACENT TO THE AFFECTED VERTEBRAE, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION AROUND COMPRESSED NERVE ROOTS, RELIEVING NEUROPATHIC PAIN AND IMPROVING MOTOR CONTROL AND SENSATION IN THE EXTREMITIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA RADICULOPAT\\u00cdA Y LA COMPRESI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL \\u00c1REA PARAVERTEBRAL DIRECTAMENTE POR ENCIMA DEL SITIO DEL MALESTAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LAS SECUELAS DE TRAUMAS O DEFORMIDADES ESPINALES. AL ESTABILIZAR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN LOS TEJIDOS ADYACENTES A LAS V\\u00c9RTEBRAS AFECTADAS, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ALREDEDOR DE LAS RA\\u00cdCES NERVIOSAS COMPRIMIDAS, ALIVIANDO EL DOLOR NEUROP\\u00c1TICO Y MEJORANDO EL CONTROL MOTOR Y LA SENSIBILIDAD EN LAS EXTREMIDADES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & NERVOUS CHECK: IF PAIN PERSISTS ALONG THE LOWER LIMBS, SCAN THE [SCIATIC \\/ SCIATIC] AXIS TO ADDRESS PERIPHERAL NERVE INVOLVEMENT. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MUSCLE WEAKNESS OR CALCIUM METABOLISM ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARATHYROID \\/ PARATHYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RECOVERY OF MUSCULOSKELETAL TISSUE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y NERVIOSA: SI EL DOLOR PERSISTE A LO LARGO DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CI\\u00c1TICO \\/ CI\\u00c1TICO] PARA ABORDAR LA AFECTACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NERVIOS PERIF\\u00c9RICOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR SEVERA O PROBLEMAS EN EL METABOLISMO DEL CALCIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARATIROIDES \\/ PARATIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/568','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:34:53','2026-04-28 08:34:53'),(4364,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',569,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HATRED (ODIO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HATRED (ODIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTENSE EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, FEELINGS OF ANGER OR RESENTMENT, AND POTENTIAL CALCIUM METABOLISM IMBALANCE.\\n\\n(MALESTAR EMOCIONAL INTENSO, SENTIMIENTOS DE IRA O RESENTIMIENTO Y POSIBLE DESEQUILIBRIO EN EL METABOLISMO DEL CALCIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DEEP-SEATED EMOTION OF HATRED BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PARATHYROID GLAND AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PARATHYROID IS RESPONSIBLE FOR REGULATING CALCIUM LEVELS, WHICH IS ESSENTIAL FOR NERVOUS SYSTEM STABILITY, WHILE THE KIDNEYS ARE OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE PROCESSING OF FEAR AND INTENSE NEGATIVE EMOTIONS. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS TENSION OR STIFFNESS AND EMOTIONALLY AS A PERSISTENT SENSE OF ANIMOSITY. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELEASING TOXIC EMOTIONAL LOADS, PROMOTING A SENSE OF PEACE AND RESTORING BIOCHEMICAL HARMONY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA EMOCI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA DEL ODIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PARATIROIDES Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA PARATIROIDES SE ENCARGA DE REGULAR LOS NIVELES DE CALCIO, ESENCIAL PARA LA ESTABILIDAD DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, MIENTRAS QUE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES SE ASOCIAN A MENUDO CON EL PROCESAMIENTO DEL MIEDO Y EMOCIONES NEGATIVAS INTENSAS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE MANIFESTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO TENSI\\u00d3N O RIGIDEZ Y EMOCIONALMENTE COMO UN SENTIMIENTO PERSISTENTE DE ANIMOSIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR CARGAS EMOCIONALES T\\u00d3XICAS, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PAZ Y RESTAURANDO LA ARMON\\u00cdA BIOQU\\u00cdMICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & METABOLIC CHECK: IF FEELINGS OF RESENTMENT OR ANGER PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS STORED WRATH. FOR CASES INVOLVING PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS OF CALCIUM IMBALANCE (LIKE CRAMPS OR WEAKNESS), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARATHYROID \\/ PARATHYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE EMOTIONAL DETOXIFICATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LOS SENTIMIENTOS DE RESENTIMIENTO O IRA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR LA IRA ACUMULADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS DE DESEQUILIBRIO DE CALCIO (COMO CALAMBRES O DEBILIDAD), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARATIROIDES \\/ PARATIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/569','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:35:55','2026-04-28 08:35:55'),(4365,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',570,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, ANOREXIA, ARRHYTHMIA, HEART ATTACK. (DEPRESI\\u00d3N, ANOREXIA, ARRITMIA, INFARTO.)\",\"paths\":\"MAY BE DUE TO TRAUMA OR OTHER INFECTIOUS DISEASES. HYPOCALCEMIA SYNDROME, OSTEOPOROSIS (PUEDE DEBERSE A TRAUMA U OTRAS ENFERMEDADES INFECCIOSAS. S\\u00cdNDROME DE HIPOCALCEMIA, OSTEOPOROSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CALCIUM METABOLISM (METABOLISMO DEL CALCIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, ANOREXIA, ARRHYTHMIA, AND POTENTIAL HEART ATTACK.\\n\\n(DEPRESI\\u00d3N, ANOREXIA, ARRITMIA E INFARTO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES IMBALANCES WITHIN THE PARATHYROID GLANDS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GLAND AND ITS OPPOSITE SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR REGULATING CALCIUM LEVELS IN THE BLOOD. DISRUPTION HERE MAY BE DUE TO PHYSICAL TRAUMA OR PREVIOUS INFECTIOUS DISEASES, LEADING TO HYPOCALCEMIA SYNDROME OR OSTEOPOROSIS. BECAUSE CALCIUM IS CRITICAL FOR MUSCLE CONTRACTION AND NERVOUS SYSTEM CONDUCTIVITY, STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT ASSISTS IN PREVENTING CARDIAC IRREGULARITIES AND SUPPORTING EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DENTRO DE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS PARATIROIDES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA Y SU LADO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA REGULAR LOS NIVELES DE CALCIO EN LA SANGRE. LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N AQU\\u00cd PUEDE DEBERSE A UN TRAUMA F\\u00cdSICO O ENFERMEDADES INFECCIOSAS PREVIAS, LO QUE CONDUCE AL S\\u00cdNDROME DE HIPOCALCEMIA O OSTEOPOROSIS. DEBIDO A QUE EL CALCIO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LA CONTRACCI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR Y LA CONDUCTIVIDAD DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO AYUDA A PREVENIR IRREGULARIDADES CARD\\u00cdACAS Y A APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF OSTEOPOROSIS OR CALCIUM IMBALANCE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PARATHYROID \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 577) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL EMOTIONAL LOADS LIKE HATRED. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DEPRESSION OR ANOREXIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE TO ENSURE FULL ENDOCRINE HARMONY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN PROCESSING MINERALS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y EMOCIONAL: SI LA OSTEOPOROSIS O EL DESEQUILIBRIO DE CALCIO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARATIROIDES \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 577) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES CARGAS EMOCIONALES COMO EL ODIO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEPRESI\\u00d3N SEVERA O ANOREXIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA ASEGURAR UNA ARMON\\u00cdA ENDOCRINA COMPLETA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE MINERALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/570','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:37:09','2026-04-28 08:37:09'),(4366,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',571,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"APATHY (APAT\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"APATHY, LACK OF MOTIVATION, EMOTIONAL FLATNESS, AND DISCONNECTION FROM SURROUNDINGS.\\n\\n(APAT\\u00cdA, FALTA DE MOTIVACI\\u00d3N, APLANAMIENTO EMOCIONAL Y DESCONEXI\\u00d3N DEL ENTORNO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES APATHY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT AND RIGHT INFERIOR PARIETAL LOBES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PARIETAL REGION IS INVOLVED IN SENSORY INTEGRATION AND THE PERCEPTION OF ONE\'S SELF IN RELATION TO THE WORLD. AN IMBALANCE IN THE INFERIOR SEGMENTS CAN LEAD TO A \\\"FROZEN\\\" EMOTIONAL STATE WHERE THE INDIVIDUAL FEELS INDIFFERENT OR UNABLE TO ENGAGE WITH LIFE\'S EXPERIENCES. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REKINDLING EMOTIONAL VITALITY, IMPROVING FOCUS, AND CLEARING THE MENTAL FOG OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH PROLONGED EMOTIONAL EXHAUSTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA APAT\\u00cdA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORTIONES DE PH ENTRE LOS L\\u00d3BULOS PARIETALES INFERIORES IZQUIERDO Y DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA REGI\\u00d3N PARIETAL EST\\u00c1 INVOLUCRADA EN LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL Y LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DE UNO MISMO EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON EL MUNDO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN LOS SEGMENTOS INFERIORES PUEDE CONDUCIR A UN ESTADO EMOCIONAL \\\"CONGELADO\\\" DONDE EL INDIVIDUO SE SIENTE INDIFERENTE O INCAPAZ DE COMPROMETERSE CON LAS EXPERIENCIAS DE LA VIDA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REAVIVAR LA VITALIDAD EMOCIONAL, MEJORAR EL ENFOQUE Y ELIMINAR LA NIEBLA MENTAL ASOCIADA A MENUDO CON EL AGOTAMIENTO EMOCIONAL PROLONGADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF APATHY IS ACCOMPANIED BY DEEP SADNESS OR \\\"BRAIN FOG,\\\" SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) AXIS TO RULE OUT VIRAL FACTORS LIKE ENCEPHALITIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DISORIENTATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE INTEGRATION OF EMOTIONAL RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-EMOCIONAL: SI LA APAT\\u00cdA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE TRISTEZA PROFUNDA O \\\"NIEBLA MENTAL\\\", ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) PARA DESCARTAR FACTORES VIRALES COMO LA ENCEFALITIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/571','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:38:23','2026-04-28 08:38:23'),(4367,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',572,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBSTRUCTIVE BRONCHIAL (PULMONARY DISEASE. (ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR BRONQUIAL OBSTRUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"PULMONARY OBSTRUCTION (OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"SHORTNESS OF BREATH, WHEEZING, CHRONIC COUGH, AND CHEST TIGHTNESS.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, SIBILANCIAS, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA Y OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESONANCE ADDRESSES OBSTRUCTIVE BRONCHIAL PULMONARY DISEASE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT PARIETAL LOBE AND THE DIAPHRAGM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR IMPROVING RESPIRATORY EFFICIENCY. THE LEFT PARIETAL REGION RELATES TO SENSORY INTEGRATION AND NEUROLOGICAL CONTROL, WHILE THE DIAPHRAGM IS THE PRIMARY MUSCLE OF RESPIRATION. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO RESTRICTED AIRFLOW AND REDUCED LUNG CAPACITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELAXING THE DIAPHRAGM AND CLEARING BRONCHIAL PATHWAYS, SUPPORTING BETTER OXYGEN EXCHANGE AND RELIEVING CHRONIC PULMONARY DISTRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ABORDA LA ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR BRONQUIAL OBSTRUCTIVA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL IZQUIERDO Y EL DIAFRAGMA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MEJORAR LA EFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA. LA REGI\\u00d3N PARIETAL IZQUIERDA SE RELACIONA CON LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL Y EL CONTROL NEUROL\\u00d3GICO, MIENTRAS QUE EL DIAFRAGMA ES EL M\\u00daSCULO PRINCIPAL DE LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A UN FLUJO DE AIRE RESTRINGIDO Y UNA CAPACIDAD PULMONAR REDUCIDA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RELAJAR EL DIAFRAGMA Y DESPEJAR LAS V\\u00cdAS BRONQUIALES, APOYANDO UN MEJOR INTERCAMBIO DE OX\\u00cdGENO Y ALIVIANDO EL MALESTAR PULMONAR CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY & DIAPHRAGMATIC CHECK: IF BREATHING DIFFICULTIES PERSIST, SCAN THE [DIAPHRAGM \\/ DIAPHRAGM] AXIS TO REINFORCE MUSCULAR FUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS DIRECT TISSUE INFLAMMATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING RESPIRATORY RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA: SI LAS DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DIAFRAGMA \\/ DIAFRAGMA] PARA REFORZAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONGESTI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DIRECTA DEL TEJIDO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/572','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:39:46','2026-04-28 08:39:46'),(4368,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',573,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TELEPATHY (TELEPAT\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTERPERSONAL CONNECTION (CONEXI\\u00d3N INTERPERSONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIFFICULTY IN NON-VERBAL COMMUNICATION, BLOCKED INTUITION, AND LACK OF EMPATHY OR \\\"SENTIMENTAL\\\" CONNECTION WITH OTHERS.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD EN LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N NO VERBAL, BLOQUEO DE LA INTUICI\\u00d3N Y FALTA DE EMPAT\\u00cdA O CONEXI\\u00d3N \\\"SENTIMENTAL\\\" CON OTROS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES TELEPATHY AND THE CAPACITY FOR MENTAL\\/EMOTIONAL CONNECTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE POSTERIOR PARIETAL REGIONS OF BOTH HEMISPHERES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AREA IS LINKED TO COMPLEX SENSORY PROCESSING AND THE INTERPRETATION OF OTHERS\' INTENTIONS. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS A MENTAL BARRIER THAT PREVENTS THE RECEPTION OR TRANSMISSION OF INTUITIVE SIGNALS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RESTORING HARMONY IN HIGHER COGNITIVE FUNCTIONS, FOSTERING FLUID COMMUNICATION AND SHARPER INTUITIVE PERCEPTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA TELEPAT\\u00cdA Y LA CAPACIDAD DE CONEXI\\u00d3N MENTAL\\/EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS REGIONES PARIETALES POSTERIORES DE AMBOS HEMISFERIOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA \\u00c1REA EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA CON EL PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL COMPLEJO Y LA INTERPRETACI\\u00d3N DE INTENCIONES AJENAS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA BARRERA MENTAL QUE IMPIDE LA RECEPCI\\u00d3N O TRANSMISI\\u00d3N DE SE\\u00d1ALES INTUITIVAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REESTABLECER LA ARMON\\u00cdA EN LAS FUNCIONES COGNITIVAS SUPERIORES, FOMENTANDO UNA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S FLUIDA Y UNA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N INTUITIVA M\\u00c1S AGUDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF THE FEELING OF DISCONNECT PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO REINFORCE HIGHER GLANDULAR CONNECTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING MENTAL FATIGUE OR CREATIVE BLOCKS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE INTEGRATION OF ENERGETIC RECALIBRATION DURING THE EMOTIONAL OPENING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-EMOCIONAL: SI LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE DESCONEXI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA REFORZAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR SUPERIOR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA MENTAL O BLOQUEOS CREATIVOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE LA RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE APERTURA EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/573','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:41:19','2026-04-28 08:41:19'),(4369,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',574,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL RELEASE (LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"SENSE OF BEING OVERWHELMED, EMOTIONAL BLOCKAGES, AND DIFFICULTIES PROCESSING TRAUMATIC EXPERIENCES.\\n\\n(SENSACI\\u00d3N DE AGOBIO, BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES Y DIFICULTADES PARA PROCESAR EXPERIENCIAS TRAUM\\u00c1TICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE INTEGRATION BETWEEN THE PARIETAL LOBE AND THE BRAIN STEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS CRITICAL NEUROLOGICAL JUNCTION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR RELEASING DEEP-SEATED EMOTIONAL LOADS THAT HAVE BECOME \\\"LOCKED\\\" IN THE AUTONOMIC RESPONSES OF THE BODY. THE BRAIN STEM GOVERNS SURVIVAL INSTINCTS, WHILE THE PARIETAL LOBE PROCESSES SENSORY INFORMATION; DISRUPTION HERE CAN CAUSE A PERSISTENT STATE OF \\\"FIGHT OR FLIGHT.\\\" BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN DECOMPRESSING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, ALLOWING FOR A PROFOUND EMOTIONAL RELEASE AND RESTORING A SENSE OF INTERNAL CALM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL SE DIRIGE A LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTA UNI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA CR\\u00cdTICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA LIBERAR CARGAS EMOCIONALES PROFUNDAS QUE HAN QUEDADO \\\"BLOQUEADAS\\\" EN LAS RESPUESTAS AUT\\u00d3NOMAS DEL CUERPO. EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO GOBIERNA LOS INSTINTOS DE SUPERVIVENCIA, MIENTRAS QUE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL PROCESA LA INFORMACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL; UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CAUSAR UN ESTADO PERSISTENTE DE \\\"LUCHA O HUIDA\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DESCOMPRIMIR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, PERMITIENDO UNA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL PROFUNDA Y RESTAURANDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA INTERNA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO HARMONIZE THE ENDOCRINE RESPONSE TO STRESS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY OR PANIC, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS DURING THE RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL TOXICITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-EMOCIONAL: SI LA SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ARMONIZAR LA RESPUESTA ENDOCRINA AL ESTR\\u00c9S. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA O P\\u00c1NICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/574','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:42:31','2026-04-28 08:42:31'),(4370,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',575,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CORRECTS LOWER LIMBS (CORRIGE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES)\",\"paths\":\"CONDUCT (CONDUCTA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BEHAVIORAL CONDUCT (CONDUCTA)\",\"symptoms\":\"CORRECTS LOWER LIMBS ISSUES AND ADDRESSES SPECIFIC BEHAVIORAL PATTERNS.\\n\\n(CORRIGE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES Y ABORDA PATRONES ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS DE CONDUCTA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES BEHAVIORAL CONDUCT BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PARIETAL LOBE AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS UNIQUE AS IT LINKS THE SENSORY INTEGRATION CENTERS OF THE BRAIN WITH THE RENAL SYSTEM, WHICH IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE PROCESSING OF FEAR AND SURVIVAL INSTINCTS. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS DISCOMFORT OR ASYMMETRY IN THE LOWER LIMBS AND EMOTIONALLY AS PERSISTENT NEGATIVE BEHAVIORAL TRAITS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN HARMONIZING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN MENTAL PERCEPTION AND PHYSICAL STABILITY, PROMOTING A BALANCED CONDUCT AND SUPPORTING THE ALIGNMENT OF THE LOWER BODY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA CONDUCTA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES \\u00daNICO YA QUE VINCULA LOS CENTROS DE INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL DEL CEREBRO CON EL SISTEMA RENAL, QUE A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON EL PROCESAMIENTO DEL MIEDO Y LOS INSTINTOS DE SUPERVIVENCIA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO MALESTAR O ASIMETR\\u00cdA EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES Y EMOCIONALMENTE COMO RASGOS DE CONDUCTA NEGATIVOS PERSISTENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARMONIZAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N MENTAL Y LA ESTABILIDAD F\\u00cdSICA, PROMOVIENDO UNA CONDUCTA EQUILIBRADA Y APOYANDO LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N DEL TREN INFERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-RENAL CHECK: IF ISSUES WITH THE LOWER LIMBS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY (SAME SIDE)] AXIS TO REINFORCE UNILATERAL STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP EMOTIONAL BLOCKS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF EMOTIONAL TOXICITY THROUGH THE RENAL SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-RENAL: SI LOS PROBLEMAS EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (MISMO LADO)] PARA REFORZAR LA ESTABILIDAD UNILATERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES PROFUNDOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA RENAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/575','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:44:02','2026-04-28 08:44:02'),(4371,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',576,'{\"symptoms\":\"INITIAL SHORTENING OF THE LEG, DUE TO TRAUMA, PHYSICAL OR EMOTIONAL CONFLICT. RENAL CONGESTION, PULMONARY CONGESTION, CHRONIC COUGH, HEADACHE, MIGRAINE, TIREDNESS, DEAFNESS, BALANCE PROBLEMS, IMPAIRED MOBILITY. (ACORTAMIENTO INICIAL DE LA PIERNA, DEBIDO A TRAUMA, CONFLICTO F\\u00cdSICO O EMOCIONAL. CONGESTI\\u00d3N RENAL, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MIGRA\\u00d1A, CANSANCIO, SORDERA, PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO, MOVILIDAD REDUCIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT. Urinary track infection, bronchitis, Asthma, bronchial spasm, psycho emotional problems, insomnia, muscular skeletal problems, behavior disorders. (D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N. INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, BRONQUITIS, ASMA, ESPASMO BRONQUIAL, PROBLEMAS PSICOEMOCIONALES, INSOMNIO, PROBLEMAS MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICOS, TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"- ASSOCIATED WITH -DUODENUM\\/KIDNEY (L); KIDNEY FAILURE                 - BALANCING 1ST ROUTE ; KIDNEY (POSITIVE)\\/PARIETAL (NEGATIVE). OR SWITCHING THE POLARITY IF THIS 1ST PAIR DOES NOT WORK.     - BALANCING 2ND ROUTE; SCIATIC (POSITIVE)   SHORT LEG AND ADDUCTOR (NEGATIVE) SHORT LEG.                         - BALANCING 3RD ROUTE; PARIETAL\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE) - EAR\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE) - PAROTID\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE) - PARATHYROID\\/KIDNEY (OPPOSITE) PARATHYROID\\/KIDNEY; HYPOCALCEMIA AND MUSCLE WEAKNESS. (* ASOCIADO CON - DUODENO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO); INSUFICIENCIA RENAL\\n* EQUILIBRANDO 1\\u00aa RUTA; RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (POSITIVO)\\/PARIETAL (NEGATIVO). O CAMBIANDO LA POLARIDAD SI ESTE 1ER PAR NO FUNCIONA.\\n* EQUILIBRANDO 2\\u00aa RUTA; CI\\u00c1TICO (POSITIVO) PIERNA CORTA Y ADUCTOR (NEGATIVO) PIERNA CORTA.\\n* EQUILIBRANDO 3\\u00aa RUTA; PARIETAL\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (OPUESTO) - O\\u00cdDO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (OPUESTO) - PAR\\u00d3TIDA\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (OPUESTO) - PARATIROIDES\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (OPUESTO) PARATIROIDES\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N; HIPOCALCEMIA Y DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"INITIAL SHORTENING OF THE LEG DUE TO TRAUMA, PHYSICAL OR EMOTIONAL CONFLICT. RENAL CONGESTION, PULMONARY CONGESTION, CHRONIC COUGH, HEADACHE, MIGRAINE, TIREDNESS, DEAFNESS, BALANCE PROBLEMS, AND IMPAIRED MOBILITY.(ACORTAMIENTO INICIAL DE LA PIERNA DEBIDO A TRAUMA, CONFLICTO F\\u00cdSICO O EMOCIONAL. CONGESTI\\u00d3N RENAL, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, MIGRA\\u00d1A, CANSANCIO, SORDERA, PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO Y MOVILIDAD REDUCIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ATTENTION DEFICIT AND SYSTEMIC CONGESTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PARIETAL LOBE AND THE CONTRALATERAL (OPPOSITE) KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR RECTIFYING THE \\\"GOIZ SHORTENING,\\\" WHERE ONE LEG APPEARS PHYSICALLY SHORTER DUE TO A POLARITY IMBALANCE TRIGGERED BY TRAUMA. BEYOND STRUCTURAL ALIGNMENT, THIS CIRCUIT TARGETS SECONDARY EFFECTS SUCH AS URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, BRONCHITIS, ASTHMA, AND BRONCHIAL SPASMS. BY STABILIZING THIS DIAGONAL PATHWAY, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CLEARING PSYCHO-EMOTIONAL BLOCKS, RESOLVING INSOMNIA, AND SUPPORTING THE RECOVERY OF MUSCULOSKELETAL INTEGRITY AND BEHAVIORAL CONDUCT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N Y LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N CONTRALATERAL (OPUESTO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RECTIFICAR EL \\\"ACORTAMIENTO DE GOIZ\\\", DONDE UNA PIERNA PARECE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE M\\u00c1S CORTA DEBIDO A UN DESEQUILIBRIO DE POLARIDAD ACTIVADO POR UN TRAUMA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL, ESTE CIRCUITO SE DIRIGE A EFECTOS SECUNDARIOS COMO INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, BRONQUITIS, ASMA Y ESPASMOS BRONQUIALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RUTA DIAGONAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DESBLOQUEAR CARGAS PSICOEMOCIONALES, RESOLVER EL INSOMNIO Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA INTEGRIDAD MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICA Y LOS TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & RENAL CHECK: THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH [DUODENUM \\/ LEFT KIDNEY] FOR CASES OF KIDNEY FAILURE. IF THE INITIAL SCAN DOES NOT RESOLVE THE LEG SHORTENING, TRY BALANCING THE 1ST ROUTE BY PLACING THE POSITIVE MAGNET ON THE KIDNEY AND THE NEGATIVE ON THE PARIETAL, OR SWITCHING POLARITY. FOR PERIPHERAL NERVE INVOLVEMENT, SCAN THE [SCIATIC (POSITIVE) \\/ ADDUCTOR (NEGATIVE)] AXIS ON THE SHORT LEG. ALWAYS MONITOR THE COMPLEMENTARY \\\"OPPOSITE\\\" CIRCUITS: [EAR \\/ KIDNEY], [PAROTID \\/ KIDNEY], AND [PARATHYROID \\/ KIDNEY] TO ADDRESS HYPOCALCEMIA AND MUSCLE WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y RENAL: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON [DUODENO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO] PARA CASOS DE INSUFICIENCIA RENAL. SI EL ESCANEO INICIAL NO RESUELVE EL ACORTAMIENTO DE LA PIERNA, INTENTE EQUILIBRAR LA 1\\u00aa RUTA COLOCANDO EL IM\\u00c1N POSITIVO EN EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N Y EL NEGATIVO EN EL PARIETAL, O CAMBIANDO LA POLARIDAD. PARA LA AFECTACI\\u00d3N DE NERVIOS PERIF\\u00c9RICOS, ESCANEE EL EJE [CI\\u00c1TICO (POSITIVO) \\/ ADUCTOR (NEGATIVO)] EN LA PIERNA CORTA. SIEMPRE MONITOREE LOS CIRCUITOS \\\"OPUESTOS\\\" COMPLEMENTARIOS: [O\\u00cdDO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N], [PAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] Y [PARATIROIDES \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA HIPOCALCEMIA Y LA DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/576','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:45:14','2026-04-28 08:45:14'),(4372,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',577,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, SPASMS, ANXIETY, VERTIGO, SPEECH PROBLEMS. (DOLORES DE CABEZA, ESPASMOS, ANSIEDAD, V\\u00c9RTIGO, PROBLEMAS DEL HABLA.)\",\"paths\":\"EFFECTS ONES SENSE OF BALANCE, ATTENTION SPAN AND MEMORY. (AFECTA EL SENTIDO DEL EQUILIBRIO, LA CAPACIDAD DE ATENCI\\u00d3N Y LA MEMORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, SPASMS, ANXIETY, VERTIGO, AND SPEECH PROBLEMS.\\n\\n(DOLORES DE CABEZA, ESPASMOS, ANSIEDAD, V\\u00c9RTIGO Y PROBLEMAS DEL HABLA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE INTEGRATION BETWEEN THE PARIETAL LOBE AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS VITAL NEURAL AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS AND SENSORY PERCEPTION. AN IMBALANCE HERE DIRECTLY AFFECTS ONE\'S SENSE OF BALANCE, ATTENTION SPAN, AND MEMORY RETENTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, REDUCING INVOLUNTARY SPASMS, AND SUPPORTING COGNITIVE CLARITY AND COORDINATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL SE DIRIGE A LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE EJE NEURAL VITAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LAS FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS Y LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd AFECTA DIRECTAMENTE EL SENTIDO DEL EQUILIBRIO, LA CAPACIDAD DE ATENCI\\u00d3N Y LA MEMORIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, REDUCIENDO LOS ESPASMOS INVOLUNTARIOS Y APOYANDO LA CLARIDAD COGNITIVA Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & VESTIBULAR CHECK: IF VERTIGO OR BALANCE ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [CEREBELLUM \\/ CEREBELLUM] AXIS TO REINFORCE MOTOR COORDINATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY OR SPEECH DIFFICULTIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL INFLAMMATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RECALIBRATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y VESTIBULAR: SI EL V\\u00c9RTIGO O LOS PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CEREBELO \\/ CEREBELO] PARA REFORZAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA O DIFICULTADES EN EL HABLA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE INFLAMACI\\u00d3N VIRAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/577','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:46:43','2026-04-28 08:46:43'),(4373,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',578,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEADACHES (DOLORES DE CABEZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CORTICAL INTEGRATION (INTEGRACI\\u00d3N CORTICAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, VISUAL DISTURBANCES, AND SPATIAL DISORIENTATION.\\n\\n(DOLORES DE CABEZA, ALTERACIONES VISUALES Y DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE SYNERGY BETWEEN THE PARIETAL LOBE AND THE OCCIPITAL LOBE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THIS POSTERIOR NEURAL AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS ESSENTIAL FOR CORRECTING HEADACHES THAT ORIGINATE FROM SENSORY OVERLOAD OR DISRUPTIONS IN VISUAL PROCESSING. THE OCCIPITAL LOBE IS THE PRIMARY CENTER FOR VISION, WHILE THE PARIETAL LOBE PROCESSES SPATIAL SENSE AND NAVIGATION. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO MENTAL FATIGUE AND PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT DUE TO THE BRAIN\'S STRUGGLE TO INTEGRATE VISUAL DATA WITH PHYSICAL POSITIONING. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELIEVING PRESSURE, CLEARING VISUAL FOG, AND RESTORING NEUROLOGICAL HARMONY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABORDA LA SINERGIA ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE ESTE EJE NEURAL POSTERIOR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO ES ESENCIAL PARA CORREGIR LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA QUE SE ORIGINAN POR LA SOBRECARGA SENSORIAL O ALTERACIONES EN EL PROCESAMIENTO VISUAL. EL L\\u00d3BULO OCCIPITAL ES EL CENTRO PRIMARIO DE LA VISI\\u00d3N, MIENTRAS QUE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL PROCESA EL SENTIDO ESPACIAL Y LA NAVEGACI\\u00d3N. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A FATIGA MENTAL Y MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO DEBIDO A LA LUCHA DEL CEREBRO POR INTEGRAR LOS DATOS VISUALES CON LA POSICI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ALIVIAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N, ELIMINAR LA NIEBLA VISUAL Y RESTAURAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-VISUAL CHECK: IF HEADACHES ARE ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE EYE STRAIN, SCAN THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] AXIS TO REINFORCE THE VISUAL CORTEX. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIZZINESS OR LOSS OF BALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ CEREBELLUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN RECOVERING FROM SENSORY DISTORTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROVISUAL: SI LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE UNA FATIGA OCULAR SEVERA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] PARA REFORZAR LA CORTEZA VISUAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MAREOS O P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL EQUILIBRIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ CEREBELO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL EN LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES SENSORIALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/578','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:47:47','2026-04-28 08:47:47'),(4374,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',579,'{\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE BRAIN. MENTAL CONFUSION, STRANGE BEHAVIOR, SEVERE DEPRESSION, PANIC ATTACKS, IRRITABILITY, SPEECH PROBLEMS, SLEEPING SICKNESS, BRAIN FOG, HEADACHES, MIGRAINES, DIZZINESS, FACIAL PAIN, STIFF NECK, ANEURYSM, IMPAIRED VISION, NASAL CONGESTION, WATERY EYES. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBRO. CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, COMPORTAMIENTO EXTRA\\u00d1O, DEPRESI\\u00d3N SEVERA, ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO, IRRITABILIDAD, PROBLEMAS DEL HABLA, ENFERMEDAD DEL SUE\\u00d1O, NIEBLA MENTAL, DOLORES DE CABEZA, MIGRA\\u00d1AS, MAREOS, DOLOR FACIAL, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, ANEURISMA, VISI\\u00d3N DETERIORADA, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL, OJOS LLOROSOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM PERSON-TO-PERSON, BY DOGS OR CATS. CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, PSYCHOLOGICAL AND PSYCHIATRIC PROBLEMS. FALSE MULTIPLE CIRRHOSIS AND FALSE PARKINSON\'S. (TRANSMITIDO DE PERSONA A PERSONA, POR PERROS O GATOS. TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, PROBLEMAS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS Y PSIQUI\\u00c1TRICOS. FALSA CIRROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE Y FALSO P\\u00c1RKINSON.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE BRAIN. MENTAL CONFUSION, STRANGE BEHAVIOR, SEVERE DEPRESSION, PANIC ATTACKS, IRRITABILITY, SPEECH PROBLEMS, SLEEPING SICKNESS, BRAIN FOG, HEADACHES, MIGRAINES, DIZZINESS, FACIAL PAIN, STIFF NECK, ANEURYSM, IMPAIRED VISION, NASAL CONGESTION, AND WATERY EYES.(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBRO. CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, COMPORTAMIENTO EXTRA\\u00d1O, DEPRESI\\u00d3N SEVERA, ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO, IRRITABILIDAD, PROBLEMAS DEL HABLA, ENFERMEDAD DEL SUE\\u00d1O, NIEBLA MENTAL, DOLORES DE CABEZA, MIGRA\\u00d1AS, MAREOS, DOLOR FACIAL, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO, ANEURISMA, VISI\\u00d3N DETERIORADA, CONGESTI\\u00d3N NASAL Y OJOS\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS ENCEPHALITIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE BILATERAL PARIETAL LOBES. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED FROM PERSON-TO-PERSON OR VIA CONTACT WITH DOGS OR CATS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS IT CAN TRIGGER CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS AND VARIOUS PSYCHOLOGICAL OR PSYCHIATRIC MANIFESTATIONS. IT IS NOTED FOR CAUSING \\\"FALSE MULTIPLE CIRRHOSIS\\\" AND \\\"FALSE PARKINSON\'S\\\" BY MIMICKING THEIR NEUROLOGICAL DEGENERATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING CEREBRAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING COGNITIVE AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LA ENCEFALITIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LOS L\\u00d3BULOS PARIETALES BILATERALES. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO DE PERSONA A PERSONA O A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTACTO CON PERROS O GATOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE PUEDE DESENCADENAR TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y DIVERSAS MANIFESTACIONES PSICOL\\u00d3GICAS O PSIQUI\\u00c1TRICAS. ES CONOCIDO POR CAUSAR \\\"FALSA CIRROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE\\\" Y \\\"FALSO P\\u00c1RKINSON\\\" AL IMITAR SU DEGENERACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL Y RESTAURANDO LA ESTABILIDAD COGNITIVA Y EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL & PSYCHOLOGICAL CHECK: IF MENTAL CONFUSION OR MOTOR ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ MEDULLA OBLONGATA] (REF 585) AXIS TO REINFORCE AUTONOMIC REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DEPRESSION OR APATHY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [INFERIOR PARIETAL \\/ INFERIOR PARIETAL] (REF 579) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE CLEARING OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y PSICOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL O LOS PROBLEMAS MOTORES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] (REF 585) PARA REFORZAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEPRESI\\u00d3N SEVERA O APAT\\u00cdA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL INFERIOR \\/ PARIETAL INFERIOR] (REF 579). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/579','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:48:59','2026-04-28 08:48:59'),(4375,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',580,'{\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES, EPILEPSY, HEADACHE, LOSS OF BALANCE, BRAIN SWELLING, INTRACRANIAL ABSCESS, BRAIN TUMOR. PSYCHOLOGICAL PROBLEMS AND BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS. VOMITING, NAUSEA, DIARRHEA, WEIGHT LOSS, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, BLOATING, FEVER, CONSTIPATION. (CONVULSIONES, EPILEPSIA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N CEREBRAL, ABSCESO INTRACRANEAL, TUMOR CEREBRAL. PROBLEMAS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS Y TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA. V\\u00d3MITOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, DIARREA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, FIEBRE, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO.)\",\"paths\":\"SEIZURES, EPILEPSY, HEADACHE, LOSS OF BALANCE, BRAIN SWELLING, INTRACRANIAL ABSCESS, BRAIN TUMOR. PSYCHOLOGICAL PROBLEMS AND BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS. VOMITING, NAUSEA, DIARRHEA, WEIGHT LOSS, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, BLOATING, FEVER, CONSTIPATION. (CONVULSIONES, EPILEPSIA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N CEREBRAL, ABSCESO INTRACRANEAL, TUMOR CEREBRAL. PROBLEMAS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS Y TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA. V\\u00d3MITOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, DIARREA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, FIEBRE, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CRANIAL, SUBCLAVIAN, SUPRASPINOUS, PYLORUS\\/KIDNEY (L), GLUTEUS, INTRA-ILIAC\\/SACRUM (REVISAR - CRANEAL, SUBCLAVIO, SUPRAESPINOSO, P\\u00cdLORO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO), GL\\u00daTEO, INTRAIL\\u00cdACO\\/SACRO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEIZURES, EPILEPSY, HEADACHE, LOSS OF BALANCE, BRAIN SWELLING, INTRACRANIAL ABSCESS, AND BRAIN TUMORS. PSYCHOLOGICAL PROBLEMS AND BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS. VOMITING, NAUSEA, DIARRHEA, WEIGHT LOSS, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, BLOATING, FEVER, AND CONSTIPATION.(CONVULSIONES, EPILEPSIA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N CEREBRAL, ABSCESO INTRACRANEAL, TUMOR CEREBRAL. PROBLEMAS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS Y TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA. V\\u00d3MITOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, DIARREA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, FIEBRE, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PARIETAL LOBE AND THE TRANSVERSE COLON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT BECAUSE THIS PARTICULAR PARASITE HAS THE CAPACITY TO MIGRATE FROM THE DIGESTIVE TRACT TO THE BRAIN, WHERE IT CAN CAUSE SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS ABSCESSES OR TUMOR-LIKE GROWTHS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD BOTH INTESTINALLY AND NEUROLOGICALLY, REDUCING CEREBRAL INFLAMMATION AND RESTORING GASTROINTESTINAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A LA ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y EL COLON TRANSVERSO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO PORQUE ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO EN PARTICULAR TIENE LA CAPACIDAD DE MIGRAR DESDE EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO HACIA EL CEREBRO, DONDE PUEDE CAUSAR COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS SEVERAS COMO ABSCESOS O CRECIMIENTOS SIMILARES A TUMORES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA TANTO A NIVEL INTESTINAL COMO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-INTESTINAL CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [CRANIAL \\/ CRANIAL] AND [SUBCLAVIAN \\/ SUBCLAVIAN] AXES TO REINFORCE THE CLEARING OF PATHOGENS FROM THE UPPER REGIONS. FOR CHRONIC DIGESTIVE ISSUES OR ABDOMINAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ LEFT KIDNEY], [GLUTEUS \\/ GLUTEUS], AND [INTRA-ILIAC \\/ SACRUM] RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [SUPRASPINOUS \\/ SUPRASPINOUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC PARASITIC DISSEMINATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-INTESTINAL: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [CRANEAL \\/ CRANEAL] Y [SUBCLAVIO \\/ SUBCLAVIO] PARA REFORZAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE LAS REGIONES SUPERIORES. PARA PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS CR\\u00d3NICOS O DOLOR ABDOMINAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO], [GL\\u00daTEO \\/ GL\\u00daTEO] E [INTRAIL\\u00cdACO \\/ SACRO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO] PARA ABORDAR LA DISEMINACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/580','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:50:10','2026-04-28 08:50:10'),(4376,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',581,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL PROBLEMS (PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS)\",\"paths\":\"EPILEPSY (EPILEPSIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL PATHOGEN (PAT\\u00d3GENO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL PROBLEMS, CONVULSIONS, AND ALTERATIONS IN THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, CONVULSIONES Y ALTERACIONES EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS PATHOGENS AFFECTING THE VAGUS NERVE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PARIETAL LOBE AND THE VAGUS NERVE AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT IS LINKED TO EPILEPSY AND OTHER SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS. THE VAGUS NERVE IS THE MAIN COMPONENT OF THE PARASYMPATHETIC NERVOUS SYSTEM, OVERSEEING VITAL FUNCTIONS FROM THE BRAIN TO THE ABDOMEN. AN IMBALANCE HERE, OFTEN TRIGGERED BY PARASITIC INTERFERENCE, CAN DISRUPT ELECTRICAL SIGNALING IN THE BRAIN. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING NEURAL EXCITABILITY, REDUCING SEIZURE ACTIVITY, AND RESTORING BALANCE TO THE BODY\'S INVOLUNTARY FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTAN AL NERVIO VAGO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL Y EL EJE DEL NERVIO VAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA EPILEPSIA Y OTROS TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS GRAVES. EL NERVIO VAGO ES EL COMPONENTE PRINCIPAL DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO, SUPERVISANDO FUNCIONES VITALES DESDE EL CEREBRO HASTA EL ABDOMEN. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd, A MENUDO PROVOCADO POR INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA, PUEDE ALTERAR LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N EL\\u00c9CTRICA EN EL CEREBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA EXCITABILIDAD NEURAL, REDUCIENDO LA ACTIVIDAD CONVULSIVA Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO EN LAS FUNCIONES INVOLUNTARIAS DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-AUTONOMIC CHECK: IF CONVULSIONS OR NEUROLOGICAL INSTABILITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL ENCEPHALITIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE OR HEART RATE IRREGULARITIES LINKED TO THE VAGUS NERVE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [VAGUS NERVE \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-AUT\\u00d3NOMA: SI LAS CONVULSIONES O LA INESTABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE ENCEFALITIS VIRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRREGULARIDADES SEVERAS EN LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N O EN LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA VINCULADAS AL NERVIO VAGO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [NERVIO VAGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS PARASITARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/581','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:51:14','2026-04-28 08:51:14'),(4377,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',582,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"BODY WEIGHT DISORDERS, POOR APPETITE, ANOREXIA, BULIMIA, POOR DIGESTION, DRY MUCUS MEMBRANES IN THE MOUTH. MALE INFERTILITY. (TRASTORNOS DEL PESO CORPORAL, POCO APETITO, ANOREXIA, BULIMIA, MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS SECAS EN LA BOCA. INFERTILIDAD MASCULINA.)\",\"paths\":\"OSTEOPOROSIS, HORMONAL DISORDERS AND INSULIN INTAKE DISORDERS. (TRASTORNOS DEL PESO CORPORAL, POCO APETITO, ANOREXIA, BULIMIA, MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS SECAS EN LA BOCA. INFERTILIDAD MASCULINA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH PAROTID AND PUDENDAL; TRUE MUMPS. (ASOCIADO CON PAR\\u00d3TIDA Y PUDENDO; PAPERAS VERDADERAS.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"GLANDULAR BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO GLANDULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"BODY WEIGHT DISORDERS, POOR APPETITE, ANOREXIA, BULIMIA, POOR DIGESTION, AND DRY MUCUS MEMBRANES IN THE MOUTH. MALE INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL PESO CORPORAL, POCO APETITO, ANOREXIA, BULIMIA, MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS SECAS EN LA BOCA. INFERTILIDAD MASCULINA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES IMBALANCES IN THE PAROTID GLANDS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE SALIVARY TISSUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS VITAL FOR REGULATING METABOLIC PROCESSES, INCLUDING OSTEOPOROSIS, HORMONAL DISORDERS, AND INSULIN INTAKE EFFICIENCY. THE PAROTID GLANDS ARE NOT ONLY ESSENTIAL FOR DIGESTIVE ENZYME PRODUCTION BUT ALSO PLAY A ROLE IN THE ENDOCRINE FEEDBACK LOOP. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN NORMALIZING APPETITE SIGNALS, IMPROVING NUTRIENT ABSORPTION, AND SUPPORTING REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH, PARTICULARLY IN ADDRESSING ISSUES RELATED TO SPERM QUALITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS EN LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS PAR\\u00d3TIDAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL TEJIDO SALIVAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES VITAL PARA REGULAR LOS PROCESOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS, INCLUYENDO LA OSTEOPOROSIS, LOS TRASTORNOS HORMONALES Y LA EFICIENCIA EN LA CAPTACI\\u00d3N DE INSULINA. LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS PAR\\u00d3TIDAS NO SOLO SON ESENCIALES PARA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE ENZIMAS DIGESTIVAS, SINO QUE TAMBI\\u00c9N JUEGAN UN PAPEL EN EL CICLO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A NORMALIZAR LAS SE\\u00d1ALES DE APETITO, MEJORAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y APOYAR LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA, PARTICULARLY AL ABORDAR PROBLEMAS RELACIONADOS CON LA CALIDAD DEL ESPERMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR & METABOLIC CHECK: THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE [PUDENDAL \\/ PUDENDAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPREHENSIVE REPRODUCTIVE DYSFUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE SWELLING OR VIRAL SYMPTOMS, SCAN THE [PAROTID \\/ PUDENDAL] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT TRUE MUMPS (PAROTIDITIS). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM IN PROCESSING METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y METAB\\u00d3LICA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL EJE [PUDENDO \\/ PUDENDO] PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA INTEGRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N AGUDA O S\\u00cdNTOMAS VIRALES, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [PAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ PUDENDO] PARA DESCARTAR PAPERAS VERDADERAS (PAROTIDITIS). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/582','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:52:29','2026-04-28 08:52:29'),(4378,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',583,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AUTISM (AUTISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-DEVELOPMENTAL BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO NEURO-DESARROLLO)\",\"symptoms\":\"AUTISM, SENSORY OVERLOAD, SOCIAL COMMUNICATION CHALLENGES, AND REPETITIVE BEHAVIORS.\\n\\n(AUTISMO, SOBRECARGA SENSORIAL, DESAF\\u00cdOS EN LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N SOCIAL Y COMPORTAMIENTOS REPETITIVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH AUTISM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PAROTID GLAND AND THE PUDENDAL NERVE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS UNIQUE AS IT CONNECTS THE GLANDULAR SYSTEM (INVOLVED IN METABOLIC AND HORMONAL REGULATION) WITH THE PUDENDAL NERVE, WHICH GOVERNS SENSORY AND MOTOR FUNCTIONS IN THE PELVIC REGION. IMBALANCES ALONG THIS PATHWAY CAN INTERFERE WITH THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO PROCESS EXTERNAL STIMULI, LEADING TO THE SENSORY SENSITIVITIES OFTEN SEEN IN NEURODIVERGENT INDIVIDUALS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, IMPROVING EMOTIONAL REGULATION, AND SUPPORTING BETTER INTERACTION WITH THE SURROUNDING ENVIRONMENT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON EL AUTISMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PAR\\u00d3TIDA Y EL NERVIO PUDENDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES \\u00daNICO YA QUE CONECTA EL SISTEMA GLANDULAR (INVOLUCRADO EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y HORMONAL) CON EL NERVIO PUDENDO, QUE GOBIERNA LAS FUNCIONES SENSORIALES Y MOTORAS EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS A LO LARGO DE ESTA V\\u00cdA PUEDEN INTERFERIR CON LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA PROCESAR EST\\u00cdMULOS EXTERNOS, LO QUE PROVOCA LAS SENSIBILIDADES SENSORIALES QUE SE OBSERVAN CON FRECUENCIA EN PERSONAS NEURODIVERGENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, MEJORAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y APOYAR UNA MEJOR INTERACCI\\u00d3N CON EL ENTORNO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-GLANDULAR CHECK: IF SENSORY OVERLOAD PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PAROTID \\/ PAROTID] (REF 590) AXIS TO ENSURE METABOLIC HARMONY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE COMMUNICATION BARRIERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS AUDITORY AND SPEECH PROCESSING. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RECALIBRATION OF SENSORY INPUTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-GLANDULAR: SI LA SOBRECARGA SENSORIAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ PAR\\u00d3TIDA] (REF 590) PARA ASEGURAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA METAB\\u00d3LICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN BARRERAS DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA ABORDAR EL PROCESAMIENTO AUDITIVO Y DEL HABLA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO DURANTE LA RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ENTRADAS SENSORIALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/583','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:53:34','2026-04-28 08:53:34'),(4379,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',584,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL FORTITUDE (FORTALEZA EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEAR, KNEE PAIN, WEAKNESS IN THE LOWER LIMBS, AND LACK OF STABILITY.\\n\\n(MIEDO, DOLOR DE RODILLA, DEBILIDAD EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES Y FALTA DE ESTABILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL & EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF KNEE DISCOMFORT PERSISTS, SCAN THE [POPLITEAL \\/ POPLITEAL] AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCAL TISSUE INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FEAR THAT AFFECTS MOBILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO BALANCE THE RENAL SYSTEM\\u2019S RESPONSE TO ADRENALINE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 583) AXIS TO ENSURE BEHAVIORAL STABILITY AND PROPER ALIGNMENT OF THE LOWER LIMBS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL Y EMOCIONAL: SI EL MALESTAR EN LA RODILLA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [POPL\\u00cdTEO \\/ POPL\\u00cdTEO] PARA DESCARTAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL DEL TEJIDO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MIEDO SEVERO QUE AFECTE LA MOVILIDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA EQUILIBRAR LA RESPUESTA DEL SISTEMA RENAL A LA ADRENALINA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 583) PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DE LA CONDUCTA Y LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N CORRECTA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/584','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:54:37','2026-04-28 08:54:37'),(4380,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',585,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PNEUMONIA AND PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASES. (NEUMON\\u00cdA Y ENFERMEDADES INFLAMATORIAS P\\u00c9LVICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PNEUMONIA, PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASES, AND CHRONIC RESPIRATORY ISSUES.\\n\\n(NEUMON\\u00cdA, ENFERMEDADES INFLAMATORIAS P\\u00c9LVICAS Y PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PRESENCE OF MYCOPLASMA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PECTORAL MAJOR MUSCLE AND THE CONTRALATERAL (OPPOSITE) LUNG. IN BIOMAGNETISM, A RESERVOIR IS A LOCATION WHERE PATHOGENS CAN HIDE WITHOUT PRODUCING ACTIVE SYMPTOMS, ONLY TO LATER TRIGGER RECURRING INFECTIONS. MYCOPLASMA IS A UNIQUE PATHOGEN THAT LACKS A CELL WALL, MAKING IT RESISTANT TO MANY ANTIBIOTICS. BY STABILIZING THIS DIAGONAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN EXPOSING THE HIDDEN PATHOGEN TO THE IMMUNE SYSTEM, THEREBY SUPPORTING THE TREATMENT OF PERSISTENT PNEUMONIA AND PELVIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO ABORDA LA PRESENCIA DE MICOPLASMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL M\\u00daSCULO PECTORAL MAYOR Y EL PULM\\u00d3N CONTRALATERAL (OPUESTO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, UN RESERVORIO ES UN LUGAR DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN OCULTARSE SIN PRODUCIR S\\u00cdNTOMAS ACTIVOS, PARA LUEGO DESENCADENAR INFECCIONES RECURRENTES. EL MICOPLASMA ES UN PAT\\u00d3GENO \\u00daNICO QUE CARECE DE PARED CELULAR, LO QUE LO HACE RESISTENTE A MUCHOS ANTIBI\\u00d3TICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO DIAGONAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A EXPONER AL PAT\\u00d3GENO OCULTO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO, APOYANDO AS\\u00cd EL TRATAMIENTO DE LA NEUMON\\u00cdA PERSISTENTE Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS PERSIST AFTER CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING PELVIC DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ILAC \\/ ILIAC] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC CLEARANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS RELEASED FROM THE RESERVOIR DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTEN DESPU\\u00c9S DE LIMPIAR ESTE RESERVORIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [IL\\u00cdACO \\/ IL\\u00cdACO] PARA ASEGURAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS LIBERADAS DEL RESERVORIO DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/585','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:55:31','2026-04-28 08:55:31'),(4381,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',586,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL PROBLEMS. (PROBLEMAS GASTROINTESTINALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL PROBLEMS, BLOATING, AND DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS GASTROINTESTINALES, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES GASTROINTESTINAL DYSFUNCTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE PELVIC BONE AREA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PELVIC STRUCTURE PROVIDES NOT ONLY PHYSICAL SUPPORT BUT ALSO INFLUENCES THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS SLUGGISH DIGESTION OR VARIOUS INTESTINAL IRREGULARITIES. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT ON THE PELVIC BONES, THE RESET ASSISTS IN IMPROVING PERISTALTIC MOVEMENT, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE LOWER ABDOMEN, AND RESTORING OVERALL GASTROINTESTINAL HARMONY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LAS DISFUNCIONES GASTROINTESTINALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL \\u00c1REA DEL HUESO P\\u00c9LVICO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA ESTRUCTURA P\\u00c9LVICA NO SOLO PROPORCIONA SOPORTE F\\u00cdSICO, SINO QUE TAMBI\\u00c9N INFLUYE EN EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO HACIA EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA DIGESTI\\u00d3N LENTA O DIVERSAS IRREGULARIDADES INTESTINALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL EN LOS HUESOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, EL REINICIO AYUDA A MEJORAR EL MOVIMIENTO PERIST\\u00c1LTICO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL ABDOMEN INFERIOR Y RESTAURANDO LA ARMON\\u00cdA GASTROINTESTINAL GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE & STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF GASTROINTESTINAL ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ TRANSVERSE COLON] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT INTESTINAL DYSFUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING LOWER BACK OR PELVIC PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] RESONANCE TO ENSURE STRUCTURAL ALIGNMENT. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING DIGESTIVE RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y ESTRUCTURAL: SI LOS PROBLEMAS GASTROINTESTINALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ COLON TRANSVERSO] PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO O LUMBAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SACRO \\/ SACRO] PARA ASEGURAR LA ALINEACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/586','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:56:41','2026-04-28 08:56:41'),(4382,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',587,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AUTISM AND PARKINSON\'S DISEASE. (AUTISMO Y ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL HARMONY (ARMON\\u00cdA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH AUTISM AND PARKINSON\'S DISEASE. TREMORS, MOTOR RIGIDITY, AND SENSORY PROCESSING CHALLENGES.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON EL AUTISMO Y LA ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON. TREMBORES, RIGIDEZ MOTORA Y DESAF\\u00cdOS EN EL PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES COMPLEX NEUROLOGICAL CONDITIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE VERTICAL AXIS OF THE PENIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC PLACEMENT IS UTILIZED TO INFLUENCE THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND NEUROTRANSMITTER PATHWAYS. IT IS PARTICULARLY RELEVANT FOR ADDRESSING THE BIOELECTRICAL INTERRUPTIONS OBSERVED IN PARKINSON\'S DISEASE AND NEURODIVERGENT CONDITIONS LIKE AUTISM. BY STABILIZING THIS LOCAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING INVOLUNTARY MOTOR RESPONSES, REDUCING RIGIDITY, AND SUPPORTING THE INTEGRATION OF SENSORY INFORMATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA CONDICIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS COMPLEJAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL EJE VERTICAL DEL PENE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA COLOCACI\\u00d3N ESPEC\\u00cdFICA SE UTILIZA PARA INFLUIR EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y LAS V\\u00cdAS DE LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES. ES PARTICULARMENTE RELEVANTE PARA ABORDAR LAS INTERRUPCIONES BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICAS OBSERVADAS EN LA ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON Y CONDICIONES NEURODIVERGENTES COMO EL AUTISMO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO LOCAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LAS RESPUESTAS MOTORAS INVOLUNTARIAS, REDUCIENDO LA RIGIDEZ Y APOYANDO LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFORMACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF MOTOR RIGIDITY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) AXIS TO RULE OUT VIRAL INFLAMMATION THAT MAY MIMICK PARKINSON\'S (\\\"FALSE PARKINSON\'S\\\"). FOR SENSORY OVERLOAD OR COMMUNICATION BARRIERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PAROTID \\/ PUDENDAL NERVE] (REF 591) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RECALIBRATION OF NEURAL SIGNALS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA RIGIDEZ MOTORA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 587) PARA DESCARTAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N VIRAL QUE PUEDA IMITAR EL P\\u00c1RKINSON (\\\"FALSO P\\u00c1RKINSON\\\"). PARA LA SOBRECARGA SENSORIAL O LAS BARRERAS DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ NERVIO PUDENDO] (REF 591). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO DURANTE LA RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LAS SE\\u00d1ALES NEURALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/587','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:57:47','2026-04-28 08:57:47'),(4383,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',588,'{\"origins\":\"STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASE POSITIVE. (STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA POSITIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ARRHYTHMIAS, TACHYCARDIA, FIBRILLATION, SHORTNESS OF BREATH. (ARRITMIAS, TAQUICARDIA, FIBRILACI\\u00d3N, FALTA DE AIRE.)\",\"paths\":\"PERICARDITIS, HEART FAILURE AND INFARCT. IT CAN AFFECT THE FETUS AND CAUSE CONGENITAL HEART DISEASE. INITIAL SYMPTOMS APPEAR IN THE THROAT, LARYNX AND TRACHEA. (PERICARDITIS, INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA E INFARTO. PUEDE AFECTAR AL FETO Y CAUSAR ENFERMEDAD CARD\\u00cdACA CONG\\u00c9NITA. LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS INICIALES APARECEN EN LA GARGANTA, LARINGE Y TR\\u00c1QUEA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - APPENDIX\\/PLEURA                               CHECK - VAGINA\\/THROAT CHECK - APPENDIX (REVISAR - AP\\u00c9NDICE\\/PLEURA                               REVISAR - VAGINA\\/GARGANTA REVISAR - AP\\u00c9NDICE)\"}','{\"origins\":\"STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASE POSITIVE (STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA POSITIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ARRHYTHMIAS, TACHYCARDIA, FIBRILLATION, AND SHORTNESS OF BREATH. INITIAL SYMPTOMS MAY ALSO APPEAR IN THE THROAT, LARYNX, AND TRACHEA.\\n\\n(ARRITMIAS, TAQUICARDIA, FIBRILACI\\u00d3N Y FALTA DE AIRE. LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS INICIALES TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDEN APARECER EN LA GARGANTA, LARINGE Y TR\\u00c1QUEA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASE POSITIVE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE PERICARDIUM (THE SAC SURROUNDING THE HEART). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS IS A CRITICAL PATHOGEN AXIS AS IT CAN LEAD TO PERICARDITIS, HEART FAILURE, AND INFARCT. BEYOND IMMEDIATE CARDIAC DISTRESS, THIS BACTERIA HAS THE POTENTIAL TO AFFECT A FETUS DURING PREGNANCY, POSSIBLY CONTRIBUTING TO CONGENITAL HEART DISEASE. BY STABILIZING THE PERICARDIUM CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING INFLAMMATION AROUND THE HEART MUSCLE, AND RESTORING PROPER CARDIAC RHYTHM AND FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA POSITIVO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL PERICARDIO (EL SACO QUE RODEA EL CORAZ\\u00d3N). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE ES UN EJE PAT\\u00d3GENO CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR PERICARDITIS, INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA E INFARTO. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL MALESTAR CARD\\u00cdACO INMEDIATO, ESTA BACTERIA TIENE EL POTENCIAL DE AFECTAR AL FETO DURANTE EL EMBARAZO, CONTRIBUYENDO POSIBLEMENTE A UNA ENFERMEDAD CARD\\u00cdACA CONG\\u00c9NITA. AL ESTABILIZAR EL CIRCUITO DEL PERICARDIO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ALREDEDOR DEL M\\u00daSCULO CARD\\u00cdACO Y RESTAURANDO EL RITMO Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA ADECUADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC CHECK: IF CARDIAC IRREGULARITIES OR RESPIRATORY DISTRESS PERSIST, SCAN THE [APPENDIX \\/ PLEURA] AND [VAGINA \\/ THROAT] AXES TO RULE OUT SYNERGISTIC BACTERIAL ACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT INFECTION SIGNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [APPENDIX \\/ APPENDIX] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CIRCULATORY SYSTEM DURING THE NEUTRALIZATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA: SI LAS IRREGULARIDADES CARD\\u00cdACAS O EL DISTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ PLEURA] Y [VAGINA \\/ GARGANTA] PARA DESCARTAR ACTIVIDAD BACTERIANA SIN\\u00c9RGICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN SIGNOS DE INFECCI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ AP\\u00c9NDICE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA CIRCULATORIO DURANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/588','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 08:59:11','2026-04-28 08:59:11'),(4384,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',589,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MEMORY OF ILLNESS AND AUTISM. (MEMORIA DE ENFERMEDAD Y AUTISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COGNITIVE CLEARING (LIMPIEZA COGNITIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MEMORY OF ILLNESS, EMOTIONAL RESIDUE FROM PAST TRAUMA, AND SENSORY PROCESSING CHALLENGES ASSOCIATED WITH AUTISM.\\n\\n(MEMORIA DE ENFERMEDAD, RESIDUO EMOCIONAL DE TRAUMAS PASADOS Y DESAF\\u00cdOS DE PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL ASOCIADOS CON EL AUTISMO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE PERICARDIUM AND THE RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE TO NEUTRALIZE PH DISTORTIONS AFFECTING THE \\\"CELLULAR MEMORY\\\" OF ILLNESS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE PERICARDIUM ACTS AS AN EMOTIONAL SHIELD FOR THE HEART, WHILE THE RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE IS INVOLVED IN NON-VERBAL MEMORY AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN KEEP THE BODY IN A PERPETUAL STATE OF \\\"ALERT\\\" BY RETAINING THE ENERGETIC IMPRINT OF PAST PATHOLOGIES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CLEARING THESE LINGERING MEMORIES AND SUPPORTS NEUROLOGICAL STABILITY, PARTICULARLY IN FACILITATING BETTER SENSORY INTEGRATION FOR INDIVIDUALS ON THE AUTISM SPECTRUM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE DIRIGE A LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL PERICARDIO Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO PARA NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH QUE AFECTAN LA \\\"MEMORIA CELULAR\\\" DE LA ENFERMEDAD. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL PERICARDIO ACT\\u00daA COMO UN ESCUDO EMOCIONAL PARA EL CORAZ\\u00d3N, MIENTRAS QUE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO EST\\u00c1 INVOLUCRADO EN LA MEMORIA NO VERBAL Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANTENER AL CUERPO EN UN ESTADO PERPETUO DE \\\"ALERTA\\\" AL RETENER LA IMPRONTA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE PATOLOG\\u00cdAS PASADAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIMPIAR ESTOS RECUERDOS PERSISTENTES Y APOYA LA ESTABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, PARTICULARMENTE AL FACILITAR UNA MEJOR INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL PARA PERSONAS DENTRO DEL ESPECTRO AUTISTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-CARD\\u00cdAC CHECK: IF SENSORY OVERLOAD PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] (REF 596) AXIS TO RULE OUT ACTIVE BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING COMMUNICATION BARRIERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PAROTID \\/ PUDENDAL NERVE] (REF 591) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF EMOTIONAL AND PHYSICAL TOXINS DURING THE RECALIBRATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-CARD\\u00cdACA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE SOBRECARGA SENSORIAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO] (REF 596) PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS ACTIVAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN BARRERAS DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ NERVIO PUDENDO] (REF 591). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS EMOCIONALES Y F\\u00cdSICAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECALIBRACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/589','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 09:00:28','2026-04-28 09:00:28'),(4385,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',590,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CHRONIC BRONCHITIS, EMPHYSEMA. (BRONQUITIS CR\\u00d3NICA, ENFISEMA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY REHABILITATION (REHABILITACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC BRONCHITIS AND EMPHYSEMA. DIFFICULTY BREATHING, PERSISTENT COUGH, AND REDUCED LUNG CAPACITY.\\n\\n(BRONQUITIS CR\\u00d3NICA Y ENFISEMA. DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, TOS PERSISTENTE Y CAPACIDAD PULMONAR REDUCIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PERICLAVICULAR REGION (THE AREA SURROUNDING THE CLAVICLE) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS THAT AFFECT THE UPPER THORACIC INLET. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING DEGENERATIVE RESPIRATORY CONDITIONS SUCH AS EMPHYSEMA AND CHRONIC BRONCHITIS. BY STABILIZING THE PH IN THIS CRITICAL JUNCTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE BRONCHIAL TUBES AND SUPPORTING THE ELASTICITY OF LUNG TISSUE. THIS IMPROVES GAS EXCHANGE AND HELPS TO DECOMPRESS THE OVERBURDENED RESPIRATORY SYSTEM, PROMOTING BETTER OXYGENATION THROUGHOUT THE BODY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE DIRIGE A LA REGI\\u00d3N PERICLAVICULAR (EL \\u00c1REA QUE RODEA LA CLAV\\u00cdCULA) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH QUE AFECTAN LA ENTRADA TOR\\u00c1CICA SUPERIOR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR CONDICIONES RESPIRATORIAS DEGENERATIVAS COMO EL ENFISEMA Y LA BRONQUITIS CR\\u00d3NICA. AL ESTABILIZAR EL PH EN ESTA UNI\\u00d3N CR\\u00cdTICA, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LOS BRONQUIOS Y APOYA LA ELASTICIDAD DEL TEJIDO PULMONAR. ESTO MEJORA EL INTERCAMBIO DE GASES Y AYUDA A DESCOMPRIMIR EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO SOBRECARGADO, PROMOVIENDO UNA MEJOR OXIGENACI\\u00d3N EN TODO EL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF BRONCHIAL CONGESTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT PULMONARY INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING POTENTIAL BACTERIAL INFECTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PECTORAL MAJOR \\/ LUNG] (REF 593) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT MYCOPLASMA. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS, WHICH ASSIST IN THE BODY\'S ANTI-INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE DURING RESPIRATORY RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PULMONAR DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA POSIBLE INFECCI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PECTORAL MAYOR \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] (REF 593) PARA DESCARTAR MICOPLASMA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES, QUE AYUDAN EN LA RESPUESTA ANTIINFLAMATORIA DEL CUERPO DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/590','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 09:01:36','2026-04-28 09:01:36'),(4386,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',591,'{\"paths\":\"Transmitted by CONTAMINATED MEAT. SEVERE DIGESTIVE AND LIVER DISORDERS. TOTAL ANOREXIA. INFLAMMATION OF THE ASCENDING AND GALLBLADDER DISORDERS.FALSE BREAST CANCER. (TRANSMITIDO POR CARNE CONTAMINADA. TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS Y HEP\\u00c1TICOS SEVEROS. ANOREXIA TOTAL. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL COLON ASCENDENTE Y TRASTORNOS DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR. FALSO C\\u00c1NCER DE MAMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - LIVER\\/KIDNEY (R) (REVISAR - H\\u00cdGADO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO))\"}','{\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS MORGANELLA TYPHUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE PERIHEPATIC REGION (THE AREA SURROUNDING THE LIVER). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED MEAT AND CAN LEAD TO SEVERE DIGESTIVE AND HEPATIC DISORDERS, INCLUDING TOTAL ANOREXIA (LOSS OF APPETITE). IT IS KNOWN TO CAUSE INFLAMMATION IN THE ASCENDING COLON AND VARIOUS GALLBLADDER DISORDERS. CLINICALLY, IT IS NOTED FOR CAUSING \\\"FALSE BREAST CANCER\\\" SYMPTOMS DUE TO THE REFERRED INFLAMMATION AND TOXICITY IN THE THORACIC REGION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, DECOMPRESSING THE LIVER, AND RESTORING PROPER DIGESTIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA MORGANELLA TYPHUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N PERIHEP\\u00c1TICA (EL \\u00c1REA QUE RODEA EL H\\u00cdGADO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE CARNE CONTAMINADA Y PUEDE PROVOCAR TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS Y HEP\\u00c1TICOS SEVEROS, INCLUIDA LA ANOREXIA TOTAL (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO). ES CONOCIDO POR CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL COLON ASCENDENTE Y DIVERSOS TRASTORNOS DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR. CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE, ES DESTACADO POR CAUSAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE \\\"FALSO C\\u00c1NCER DE MAMA\\\" DEBIDO A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N REFERIDA Y LA TOXICIDAD EN LA REGI\\u00d3N TOR\\u00c1CICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, DESCOMPRIMIENDO EL H\\u00cdGADO Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC & RENAL CHECK: IF LIVER DISCOMFORT OR FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ RIGHT KIDNEY] AXIS TO REINFORCE SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE UPSET, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ASCENDING COLON \\/ ASCENDING COLON] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RENAL: SI EL MALESTAR HEP\\u00c1TICO O LA FATIGA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO] PARA REFORZAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ COLON ASCENDENTE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/591','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 09:02:33','2026-04-28 09:02:33'),(4387,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',592,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - AXILLA      CHECK - URETHRA SPHINCTER (REVISAR - AXILA      REVISAR - ESF\\u00cdNTER URETRAL)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ALTERATIONS IN THE PANCREATIC REGION, DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL OR GLANDULAR STRESS.\\n\\n(ALTERACIONES EN LA REGI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA, MALESTAR DIGESTIVO Y POSIBLE ESTR\\u00c9S NEUROL\\u00d3GICO O GLANDULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE RABIES 2 PATHOGEN BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE PERIPANCREATIC AREA (THE TISSUE SURROUNDING THE PANCREAS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SIGNIFICANT FOR ADDRESSING VIRAL LOADS THAT MAY INTERFERE WITH EXOCRINE OR ENDOCRINE FUNCTIONS. THE VERTICAL ORIENTATION OF THE MAGNETS ALLOWS FOR A DEEPER PENETRATION OF THE MAGNETIC FIELD THROUGH THE PERIPANCREATIC TISSUE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING LOCAL INFLAMMATION, AND SUPPORTING THE METABOLIC HARMONY OF THE MID-ABDOMINAL REGION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL PAT\\u00d3GENO RABIA 2 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL \\u00c1REA PERIPANCRE\\u00c1TICA (EL TEJIDO QUE RODEA AL P\\u00c1NCREAS). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES SIGNIFICATIVO PARA ABORDAR CARGAS VIRALES QUE PUEDEN INTERFERIR CON LAS FUNCIONES EXOCRINAS O ENDOCRINAS. LA ORIENTACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL DE LOS IMANES PERMITE UNA PENETRACI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S PROFUNDA DEL CAMPO MAGN\\u00c9TICO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL TEJIDO PERIPANCRE\\u00c1TICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL Y APOYANDO LA ARMON\\u00cdA METAB\\u00d3LICA DE LA REGI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL MEDIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL & GLANDULAR CHECK: IF METABOLIC OR NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [AXILLA \\/ AXILLA] AXIS TO RULE OUT ADDITIONAL VIRAL STRAINS. FOR CASES INVOLVING URINARY OR SPHINCTER IRREGULARITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [URETHRA SPHINCTER \\/ URETHRA SPHINCTER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL Y GLANDULAR: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS METAB\\u00d3LICOS O NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AXILA \\/ AXILA] PARA DESCARTAR CEPAS VIRALES ADICIONALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRREGULARIDADES URINARIAS O DEL ESF\\u00cdNTER, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ESF\\u00cdNTER URETRAL \\/ ESF\\u00cdNTER URETRAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/592','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 09:03:37','2026-04-28 09:03:37'),(4388,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',593,'{\"symptoms\":\"EYE PROBLEMS, FEVER, MALAISE, HEADACHE, EDEMA, SEIZURES. (PROBLEMAS OCULARES, FIEBRE, MALESTAR, DOLOR DE CABEZA, EDEMA, CONVULSIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"AFFECTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND BRAIN. GLAUCOMA. (AFECTA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y EL CEREBRO. GLAUCOMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EYE PROBLEMS, FEVER, MALAISE, HEADACHE, EDEMA, AND SEIZURES.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS OCULARES, FIEBRE, MALESTAR, DOLOR DE CABEZA, EDEMA Y CONVULSIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS CRYPTOCOCCUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL AS THIS PATHOGEN HAS A STRONG PREDILECTION FOR THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE BRAIN. IT IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE DEVELOPMENT OF GLAUCOMA DUE TO INCREASED INTRAOCULAR PRESSURE AND NEUROLOGICAL INTERFERENCE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE FUNGAL LOAD, REDUCING CEREBRAL AND OCULAR INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING PROPER NEUROLOGICAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE AL CRYPTOCOCCUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO TIENE UNA FUERTE PREDILECCI\\u00d3N POR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y EL CEREBRO. A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON EL DESARROLLO DE GLAUCOMA DEBIDO AL AUMENTO DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N INTRAOCULAR Y LA INTERFERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL Y OCULAR, Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-OCULAR CHECK: IF VISUAL DISTURBANCES OR HEADACHES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] (REF 586) AXIS TO SUPPORT CORTICAL INTEGRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SEIZURES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ VAGUS NERVE] (REF 589) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN CLEARING FUNGAL BYPRODUCTS DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-OCULAR: SI LAS ALTERACIONES VISUALES O LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] (REF 586) PARA APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N CORTICAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONVULSIONES SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 589). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS F\\u00daNGICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/593','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:47:37','2026-04-28 13:47:37'),(4389,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',594,'{\"symptoms\":\"PIMPLES, BOILS, URINARY TRACT SYMPTOMS. (GRANOS, FOR\\u00daNCULOS, S\\u00cdNTOMAS DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY ANIMALS, CATTLE AND UNPASTEURIZED MILK. RENAL FAILURE AND NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. (TRANSMITIDO POR ANIMALES, GANADO Y LECHE NO PASTEURIZADA. INSUFICIENCIA RENAL Y S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PIMPLES, BOILS, AND URINARY TRACT SYMPTOMS. POTENTIAL FOR RENAL FAILURE AND NEPHROTIC SYNDROME.\\n\\n(GRANOS, FOR\\u00daNCULOS Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS DEL TRACTO URINARIO. POTENCIAL DE INSUFICIENCIA RENAL Y S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS MYCOBACTERIUM BOVIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE PERIRENAL TISSUE (THE FATTY LAYER SURROUNDING THE KIDNEYS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS SIGNIFICANT AS IT IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED FROM ANIMALS, CATTLE, OR THE CONSUMPTION OF UNPASTEURIZED MILK. WHILE IT PRIMARILY AFFECTS THE RENAL SYSTEM, IT CAN MANIFEST EXTERNALLY THROUGH SKIN ERUPTIONS LIKE BOILS. IF LEFT UNADDRESSED, THE TOXICITY CAN LEAD TO DEGENERATIVE KIDNEY CONDITIONS OR SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING RENAL FILTRATION, AND CLEARING RELATED DERMATOLOGICAL SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL MYCOBACTERIUM BOVIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL TEJIDO PERIRRENAL (LA CAPA DE GRASA QUE RODEA LOS RI\\u00d1ONES). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE A MENUDO SE TRANSMITE DESDE ANIMALES, GANADO O POR EL CONSUMO DE LECHE NO PASTEURIZADA. SI BIEN AFECTA PRINCIPALMENTE AL SISTEMA RENAL, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE EXTERNAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS COMO FOR\\u00daNCULOS. SI NO SE ABORDA, LA TOXICIDAD PUEDE CONDUCIR A CONDICIONES RENALES DEGENERATIVAS O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y ELIMINANDO LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS RELACIONADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RENAL & DERMAL CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS OR RENAL DISTRESS PERSIST, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SKIN ERUPTIONS OR BOILS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER STAPHYLOCOCCAL ACTIVITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE BODY\\u2019S ADRENAL RESPONSE TO SYSTEMIC INFECTION AND TO PROMOTE TISSUE REPAIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y D\\u00c9RMICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS O EL MALESTAR RENAL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS SEVERAS O FOR\\u00daNCULOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL] PARA DESCARTAR OTRA ACTIVIDAD ESTAFILOC\\u00d3CICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL DEL CUERPO A LA INFECCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PROMOVER LA REPARACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/594','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:49:28','2026-04-28 13:49:28'),(4390,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',595,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL DISORDERS, FISHY SMELLING DISCHARGE. ITCHING AND SWELLING. (TRASTORNOS VAGINALES, SECRECI\\u00d3N CON OLOR A PESCADO. PICAZ\\u00d3N E HINCHAZ\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"CYSTITIS AND VAGINAL DISORDERS. (CISTITIS Y TRASTORNOS VAGINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL DISORDERS, FISHY-SMELLING DISCHARGE, ITCHING, AND SWELLING. MAY ALSO PRESENT AS CYSTITIS OR URETHRITIS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS VAGINALES, SECRECI\\u00d3N CON OLOR A PESCADO, PICAZ\\u00d3N E HINCHAZ\\u00d3N. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE PRESENTARSE COMO CISTITIS O URETRITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS GARDNERELLA VAGINALIS B BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PERITONEUM (THE SEROUS MEMBRANE LINING THE ABDOMINAL CAVITY) AND THE APPENDIX. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING BACTERIAL VAGINOSIS AND INFLAMMATION OF THE UROGENITAL TRACT. WHILE GARDNERELLA IS BACTERIAL IN NATURE, THIS SPECIFIC RESONANCE IS OFTEN CATEGORIZED UNDER VIRAL RADICALS IN CERTAIN BIOMAGNETIC PROTOCOLS DUE TO ITS BEHAVIOR WITHIN THE CAVITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PATHOGENIC LOAD, REDUCING VAGINAL IRRITATION, AND RESTORING THE NATURAL MICROFLORA BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LA GARDNERELLA VAGINALIS B MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PERITONEO (LA MEMBRANA SEROSA QUE RECUBRE LA CAVIDAD ABDOMINAL) Y EL AP\\u00c9NDICE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA VAGINOSIS BACTERIANA Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO UROGENITAL. SI BIEN LA GARDNERELLA ES DE NATURALEZA BACTERIANA, ESTA RESONANCIA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA A MENUDO SE CATEGORIZA BAJO RADICALES VIRALES EN CIERTOS PROTOCOLOS BIOMAGN\\u00c9TICOS DEBIDO A SU COMPORTAMIENTO DENTRO DE LA CAVIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PATOG\\u00c9NICA, REDUCIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N VAGINAL Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO DE LA MICROFLORA NATURAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL CHECK: IF VAGINAL DISCHARGE OR ITCHING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT LOCAL INFECTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE PELVIC PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [APPENDIX \\/ APPENDIX] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE GENITOURINARY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL: SI LA SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL O EL PRURITO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] PARA ABORDAR LA INFECCI\\u00d3N LOCAL DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO AGUDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ AP\\u00c9NDICE] PARA DESCARTAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA GENITOURINARIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/595','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:50:30','2026-04-28 13:50:30'),(4391,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',596,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PATHOGENIC HIDEOUT (REFUGIO PATOG\\u00c9NICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"VARIOUS ABDOMINAL DISORDERS, BLOATING, LACK OF ENERGY, AND PERSISTENT DIGESTIVE ISSUES THAT DO NOT CLEAR WITH STANDARD TREATMENT.\\n\\n(DIVERSOS TRASTORNOS ABDOMINALES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, FALTA DE ENERG\\u00cdA Y PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS PERSISTENTES QUE NO SE ELIMINAN CON EL TRATAMIENTO EST\\u00c1NDAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE ADDRESSES PATHOGENS THAT HIDE WITHIN THE PERITONEUM (THE SEROUS MEMBRANE LINING THE ABDOMINAL CAVITY) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE MEMBRANE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PERITONEUM ACTS AS A LARGE \\\"SPACE\\\" WHERE VIRUSES, BACTERIA, OR PARASITES CAN REMAIN DORMANT, EVADING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND CAUSING RECURRING INFECTIONS ELSEWHERE IN THE BODY. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN EXPOSING THESE HIDDEN PATHOGENS, ALLOWING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO FINALLY NEUTRALIZE THEM AND RESOLVING CHRONIC INFLAMMATION WITHIN THE ABDOMINAL CAVITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO ABORDA LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE SE OCULTAN DENTRO DEL PERITONEO (LA MEMBRANA SEROSA QUE RECUBRE LA CAVIDAD ABDOMINAL) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA MEMBRANA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL PERITONEO ACT\\u00daA COMO UN GRAN \\\"ESPACIO\\\" DONDE LOS VIRUS, BACTERIAS O PAR\\u00c1SITOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES, EVADIENDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y CAUSANDO INFECCIONES RECURRENTES EN OTRAS PARTES DEL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A EXPONER ESTOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS OCULTOS, PERMITIENDO QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO FINALMENTE LOS NEUTRALICE Y RESOLVIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DENTRO DE LA CAVIDAD ABDOMINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAVITY CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL INFLAMMATION PERSISTS AFTER CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR, SCAN THE [PERITONEUM \\/ APPENDIX] (REF 603) AXIS TO RULE OUT GARDNERELLA VAGINALIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP INTESTINAL DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [EPIGASTRIUM \\/ EPIGASTRIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE DETOXIFICATION PROCESS AS PATHOGENS ARE RELEASED FROM THE PERITONEAL RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE CAVIDAD: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL PERSISTE DESPU\\u00c9S DE LIMPIAR ESTE RESERVORIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PERITONEO \\/ AP\\u00c9NDICE] (REF 603) PARA DESCARTAR GARDNERELLA VAGINALIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR INTESTINAL PROFUNDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EPIGASTRIO \\/ EPIGASTRIO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N A MEDIDA QUE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS SE LIBERAN DEL RESERVORIO PERITONEAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/596','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:51:47','2026-04-28 13:51:47'),(4392,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',597,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CANCER OR TUMOR (C\\u00c1NCER O TUMOR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CELLULAR REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"SENSITIVITY TO GROWTHS, TUMOR-LIKE MANIFESTATIONS, OR COMPLEX SYSTEMIC IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(SENSIBILIDAD A CRECIMIENTOS, MANIFESTACIONES DE TIPO TUMORAL O DESEQUILIBRIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMPLEJOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC CONDITIONS ASSOCIATED WITH CANCER OR TUMORS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PERITONEUM (THE LINING OF THE ABDOMINAL CAVITY) AND THE LEFT TEMPLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS UNIQUE AS IT CONNECTS THE LARGE SEROUS MEMBRANE OF THE ABDOMEN WITH THE COGNITIVE AND NEUROLOGICAL PROCESSING CENTERS OF THE LEFT BRAIN. AN IMBALANCE HERE MAY REFLECT A SYSTEMIC VULNERABILITY TO CELLULAR MALFORMATION OR THE ENERGETIC \\\"ENCODING\\\" OF A TUMORAL STATE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RESTORING THE BODY\\u2019S BIOELECTRIC GOVERNANCE, SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN IDENTIFYING AND MANAGING IRREGULAR CELLULAR GROWTHS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LAS CONDICIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS ASOCIADAS CON EL C\\u00c1NCER O LOS TUMORES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PERITONEO (EL RECUBRIMIENTO DE LA CAVIDAD ABDOMINAL) Y EL TEMPLO IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES \\u00daNICO YA QUE CONECTA LA GRAN MEMBRANA SEROSA DEL ABDOMEN CON LOS CENTROS DE PROCESAMIENTO COGNITIVO Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICO DEL CEREBRO IZQUIERDO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE REFLEJAR UNA VULNERABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA A LA MALFORMACI\\u00d3N CELULAR O LA \\\"CODIFICACI\\u00d3N\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE UN ESTADO TUMORAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR EL MANDO BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICO DEL CUERPO, APOYANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN LA IDENTIFICACI\\u00d3N Y MANEJO DE CRECIMIENTOS CELULARES IRREGULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF TUMORAL CONCERNS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [PERITONEUM \\/ PERITONEUM] (REF 604) RESERVOIR TO ENSURE NO PATHOGENIC HIDEOUTS ARE SUSTAINING THE CONDITION. FOR CASES INVOLVING NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO BALANCE CEREBRAL PH. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE DETOXIFICATION CHANNELS DURING THE RESTRUCTURING OF CELLULAR MEMORY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EXISTEN PREOCUPACIONES TUMORALES, ESCANEAR EL RESERVORIO [PERITONEO \\/ PERITONEO] (REF 604) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO HAYA REFUGIOS PATOG\\u00c9NICOS QUE SUSTENTEN LA CONDICI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA EQUILIBRAR EL PH CEREBRAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LOS CANALES DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DURANTE LA REESTRUCTURACI\\u00d3N DE LA MEMORIA CELULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/597','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:53:00','2026-04-28 13:53:00'),(4393,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',598,'{\"symptoms\":\"TETANUS. FEVER, FATIGUE, HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, BRAIN DAMAGE. (T\\u00c9TANOS. FIEBRE, FATIGA, PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL.)\",\"paths\":\"RENAL DYSFUNCTION, SEIZURES. RELIEVES POISONOUS BITES. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL, CONVULSIONES. ALIVIA PICADURAS VENENOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"TETANUS, FEVER, FATIGUE, HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, AND BRAIN DAMAGE.\\n\\n(T\\u00c9TANOS, FIEBRE, FATIGA, PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA Y DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CLOSTRIDIUM TETANICUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN A PIERCING SITE AND THE IPSILATERAL (SAME SIDE) KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, PIERCINGS OR OTHER ARTIFICIAL PERFORATIONS CAN ACT AS ENTRY POINTS OR ENERGETIC INTERFERENCES THAT HARBOR TOXIC LOADS. THIS SPECIFIC AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING RENAL DYSFUNCTION AND NEUROLOGICAL INTERFERENCE, SUCH AS SEIZURES, OFTEN TRIGGERED BY TETANUS TOXINS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND IS ALSO NOTED FOR ITS UTILITY IN RELIEVING THE EFFECTS OF POISONOUS BITES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CLOSTRIDIUM TETANICUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LUGAR DE UNA PERFORACI\\u00d3N (PIERCING) Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IPSILATERAL (DEL MISMO LADO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LAS PERFORACIONES U OTRAS PERFORACIONES ARTIFICIALES PUEDEN ACTUAR COMO PUNTOS DE ENTRADA O INTERFERENCIAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE ALBERGAN CARGAS T\\u00d3XICAS. ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL Y LA INTERFERENCIA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, COMO LAS CONVULSIONES, A MENUDO DESENCADENADAS POR LAS TOXINAS DEL T\\u00c9TANOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y TAMBI\\u00c9N ES DESTACADO POR SU UTILIDAD PARA ALIVIAR LOS EFECTOS DE LAS PICADURAS VENENOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TOXICOLOGICAL CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS OR HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE PERSIST, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC FILTRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING MUSCLE RIGIDITY OR SPASMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT THE BODY\\u2019S ADAPTIVE RESPONSE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PARIETAL \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 583) AXIS TO ENSURE BEHAVIORAL STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE BRAIN FROM POTENTIAL TOXIC DAMAGE DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N TOXICOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RIGIDEZ MUSCULAR O ESPASMOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA RESPUESTA ADAPTATIVA DEL CUERPO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 583) PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DE LA CONDUCTA Y PROTEGER AL CEREBRO DE POSIBLES DA\\u00d1OS T\\u00d3XICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/598','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:53:56','2026-04-28 13:53:56'),(4394,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',599,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CATALYTIC RNA (ARN CATAL\\u00cdTICO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"CATALYTIC RNA (ARN CATAL\\u00cdTICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HORMONE IMBALANCE, CHRONIC FATIGUE, SLEEP DISRUPTION (INSOMNIA), AND EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, ALTERACI\\u00d3N DEL SUE\\u00d1O (INSOMNIO) E INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOCHEMICAL DIALOGUE BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS RELATED TO CATALYTIC RNA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR REGULATING THE CIRCADIAN RHYTHM AND THE BODY\'S RESPONSE TO STRESS. THE PINEAL GLAND (PRODUCER OF MELATONIN) AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS (PRODUCERS OF CORTISOL AND ADRENALINE) MUST WORK IN HARMONY TO MAINTAIN VITALITY. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN LEADS TO \\\"ADRENAL FATIGUE\\\" OR A DISRUPTION IN THE BODY\'S NATURAL REPAIR CYCLES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN OPTIMIZING GLANDULAR COMMUNICATION, PROMOTING DEEPER REST, AND CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL DI\\u00c1LOGO BIOQU\\u00cdMICO ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH RELACIONADAS CON EL ARN CATAL\\u00cdTICO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA REGULAR EL RITMO CIRCADIANO Y LA RESPUESTA DEL CUERPO AL ESTR\\u00c9S. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL (PRODUCTORA DE MELATONINA) Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES (PRODUCTORAS DE CORTISOL Y ADRENALINA) DEBEN TRABAJAR EN ARMON\\u00cdA PARA MANTENER LA VITALIDAD. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO CONDUCE A LA \\\"FATIGA SUPRARRENAL\\\" O UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N EN LOS CICLOS NATURALES DE REPARACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A OPTIMIZAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR, PROMOVIENDO UN DESCANSO M\\u00c1S PROFUNDO Y CALMANDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF FATIGUE OR INSOMNIA PERSIST, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PANCREAS] (REF 615) AXIS TO ADDRESS EMOTIONAL BLOCKS OR METABOLIC STRESS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO STABILIZE THE RENAL RESPONSE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO ENSURE THE MAIN REGULATOR OF THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM IS BALANCED AND FREE FROM PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA: SI LA FATIGA O EL INSOMNIO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 615) PARA ABORDAR BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES O ESTR\\u00c9S METAB\\u00d3LICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ESTABILIZAR LA RESPUESTA RENAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL REGULADOR PRINCIPAL DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO Y LIBRE DE INTERFERENCIA PATOG\\u00c9NICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/599','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:55:15','2026-04-28 13:55:15'),(4395,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',600,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HAIRLOSS (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO)\",\"paths\":\"ALOPECIA\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - TONGUE (REVISAR - LENGUA)\"}','{\"origins\":\"INTEGUMENTARY REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N INTEGUMENTARIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HAIR LOSS (ALOPECIA), SCALP DISORDERS, AND POTENTIAL COORDINATION OR BALANCE ISSUES.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO (ALOPECIA), TRASTORNOS DEL CUERO CABELLUDO Y POSIBLES PROBLEMAS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N O EQUILIBRIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ALOPECIA (HAIR LOSS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE CEREBELLUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PINEAL GLAND ACTS AS A MASTER REGULATOR OF THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM, WHILE THE CEREBELLUM GOES BEYOND MOTOR COORDINATION TO INFLUENCE VARIOUS AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS. AN IMBALANCE ALONG THIS AXIS CAN DISRUPT THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO THE HAIR FOLLICLES, OFTEN TRIGGERED BY STRESS OR HORMONAL SHIFTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE NEURO-ENDOCRINE STRESS RESPONSE, SUPPORTING THE VITALITY OF THE SCALP AND PROMOTING THE NATURAL REGENERATION OF HAIR.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA ALOPECIA (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL CEREBELO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL ACT\\u00daA COMO UN REGULADOR MAESTRO DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO, MIENTRAS QUE EL CEREBELO VA M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA PARA INFLUIR EN DIVERSAS FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO A LO LARGO DE ESTE EJE PUEDE INTERRUMPIR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO HACIA LOS FOL\\u00cdCULOS PILOSOS, A MENUDO DESENCADENADO POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S O CAMBIOS HORMONALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA RESPUESTA DE ESTR\\u00c9S NEUROENDOCRINO, APOYANDO LA VITALIDAD DEL CUERO CABELLUDO Y PROMOVIENDO LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N NATURAL DEL CABELLO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLOSSAL CHECK: IF HAIR LOSS IS ACCOMPANIED BY DIGESTIVE OR SYSTEMIC TOXICITY, SCAN THE [TONUE \\/ TONGUE] AXIS TO RULE OUT LINGUAL PATHOGENS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HORMONAL IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ ADRENAL GLAND] (REF 607) RESONANCE TO STABILIZE CORTISOL LEVELS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF TOXINS THAT MAY AFFECT SKIN AND HAIR HEALTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLOSAL: SI LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE TOXICIDAD DIGESTIVA O SIST\\u00c9MICA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LENGUA \\/ LENGUA] PARA DESCARTAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS LINGUALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL] (REF 607) PARA ESTABILIZAR LOS NIVELES DE CORTISOL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS QUE PUEDAN AFECTAR LA SALUD DE LA PIEL Y EL CABELLO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/600','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:56:31','2026-04-28 13:56:31'),(4396,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',601,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VITILIGO, SKIN DISCOLORATION. (VITILIGO, DESCOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VITILIGO, SKIN DISCOLORATION, AND DEPIGMENTATION.\\n\\n(VITILIGO, DESCOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL Y DESPIGMENTACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES VITILIGO BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE DUODENUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING MELANOCYTE FUNCTION\\u2014THE CELLS RESPONSIBLE FOR SKIN PIGMENTATION. THE PINEAL GLAND ACTS AS A MASTER HORMONE REGULATOR, WHILE THE DUODENUM IS A KEY SITE FOR NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND ENZYMATIC BALANCING. AN IMBALANCE HERE, OFTEN DRIVEN BY A VIRAL LOAD, CAN TRIGGER AN AUTOIMMUNE-LIKE RESPONSE WHERE THE BODY ATTACKS ITS OWN PIGMENT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRUS, SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF SKIN TONE AND PREVENTING FURTHER DISCOLORATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL ABORDA EL VIT\\u00cdLIGO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL DUODENO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS MELANOCITOS, LAS C\\u00c9LULAS RESPONSABLES DE LA PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL ACT\\u00daA COMO UN REGULADOR MAESTRO DE LAS HORMONAS, MIENTRAS QUE EL DUODENO ES UN SITIO CLAVE PARA LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y EL EQUILIBRIO ENZIM\\u00c1TICO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd, A MENUDO IMPULSADO POR UNA CARGA VIRAL, PUEDE DESENCADENAR UNA RESPUESTA DE TIPO AUTOINMUNE DONDE EL CUERPO ATACA SU PROPIO PIGMENTO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR EL VIRUS, APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DEL TONO DE LA PIEL Y PREVINIENDO UNA MAYOR DESCOLORACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMATOLOGICAL CHECK: IF SKIN DISCOLORATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ CEREBELLUM] (REF 608) AXIS TO ENSURE INTEGUMENTARY REGULATION IS OPTIMIZED. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DUODENUM \\/ DUODENUM] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS LOCAL INFLAMMATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS THAT MAY BE IMPACTING SKIN HEALTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA DESCOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ CEREBELO] (REF 608) PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N INTEGUMENTARIA EST\\u00c9 OPTIMIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S DIGESTIVO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [DUODENO \\/ DUODENO] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES QUE PUEDAN ESTAR AFECTANDO LA SALUD DE LA PIEL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/601','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 13:58:13','2026-04-28 13:58:13'),(4397,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',602,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DEPREESION (DEPRESI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":\"BIPOLAR, AND HORMONAL DYSFUNCTION. (TRASTORNO BIPOLAR Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENDOCRINE RESET (REINICIO ENDOCRINO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, BIPOLAR DISORDER, AND HORMONAL DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(DEPRESI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNO BIPOLAR Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE CRITICAL AXIS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE ENDOCRINE CONTROL CENTER OF THE BRAIN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CONSIDERED THE \\\"MASTER SWITCH\\\" FOR HORMONAL AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE. THE PINEAL GLAND REGULATES BIOLOGICAL RHYTHMS, WHILE THE HYPOPHYSIS COMMANDS THE MAJORITY OF THE BODY\'S GLANDULAR FUNCTIONS. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO SEVERE MOOD ALTERATIONS, SUCH AS BIPOLARITY OR DEEP DEPRESSION, AS WELL AS SYSTEMIC HORMONAL ERRORS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RE-ESTABLISHING PROPER GLANDULAR COMMUNICATION, BALANCING NEUROTRANSMITTERS, AND RESTORING EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SE DIRIGE AL EJE CR\\u00cdTICO ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL CENTRO DE CONTROL ENDOCRINO DEL CEREBRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE CONSIDERA EL \\\"INTERRUPTOR MAESTRO\\\" PARA EL EQUILIBRIO HORMONAL Y EMOCIONAL. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL REGULA LOS RITMOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS, MIENTRAS QUE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS DIRIGE LA MAYOR\\u00cdA DE LAS FUNCIONES GLANDULARES DEL CUERPO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A ALTERACIONES GRAVES DEL ESTADO DE \\u00c1NIMO, COMO LA BIPOLARIDAD O LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA, AS\\u00cd COMO A ERRORES HORMONALES SIST\\u00c9MICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REESTABLECER LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR ADECUADA, EQUILIBRAR LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES Y RESTAURAR LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL & ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF DEPRESSION OR MOOD SWINGS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO ENSURE THE PRIMARY REGULATOR IS BALANCED. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE METABOLIC SHIFTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE DURING THE REHABILITATION OF THE CENTRAL ENDOCRINE AXIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y ENDOCRINA: SI LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N O LOS CAMBIOS DE HUMOR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL REGULADOR PRIMARIO EST\\u00c9 EQUILIBRADO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CAMBIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE LA REHABILITACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE ENDOCRINO CENTRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/602','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:00:24','2026-04-28 14:00:24'),(4398,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',603,'{\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN BARRE (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 SYNDROME (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"WEAKNESS, TINGLING IN THE EXTREMITIES, POTENTIAL PARALYSIS, AND CHRONIC FATIGUE. OFTEN ACTS AS A HIDDEN SOURCE FOR RECURRING NEUROLOGICAL ISSUES.\\n\\n(DEBILIDAD, HORMIGUEO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, POSIBLE PAR\\u00c1LISIS Y FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA. A MENUDO ACT\\u00daA COMO UNA FUENTE OCULTA DE PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS RECURRENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE TARGETS THE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 SYNDROME PATHOGENS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE INSTEP (THE TOP OF THE FOOT). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE INSTEP ACTS AS A \\\"STORAGE POINT\\\" OR RESERVOIR WHERE VIRUSES OR BACTERIA ASSOCIATED WITH NERVE INFLAMMATION CAN REMAIN DORMANT. THE PINEAL GLAND, AS THE MASTER ENDOCRINE REGULATOR, IS OFTEN IMPACTED BY THESE LINGERING TOXINS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET EXPOSES THE PATHOGENS FROM THEIR HIDEOUT, ASSISTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PREVENTING FURTHER NERVE DAMAGE AND SUPPORTING THE REHABILITATION OF THE CENTRAL AND PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS DEL S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL EMPEINE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL EMPEINE ACT\\u00daA COMO UN \\\"PUNTO DE ALMACENAMIENTO\\\" O RESERVORIO DONDE LOS VIRUS O BACTERIAS ASOCIADOS CON LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NERVIOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL, COMO REGULADOR ENDOCRINO MAESTRO, A MENUDO SE VE AFECTADA POR ESTAS TOXINAS PERSISTENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO EXPONE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS DE SU REFUGIO, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A PREVENIR UN MAYOR DA\\u00d1O NERVIOSO Y APOYANDO LA REHABILITACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SISTEMAS NERVIOSOS CENTRAL Y PERIF\\u00c9RICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF NERVE WEAKNESS OR PARALYSIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ RACHIDIAN BULB] (REF 619) AXIS TO ADDRESS ACTIVE VIRAL DAMAGE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE COGNITIVE FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF RELEASED TOXINS DURING THE CLEARING OF THIS NEUROLOGICAL RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA DEBILIDAD NERVIOSA O LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] (REF 619) PARA ABORDAR EL DA\\u00d1O VIRAL ACTIVO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA COGNITIVA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA LIMPIEZA DE ESTE RESERVORIO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/603','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:01:35','2026-04-28 14:01:35'),(4399,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',604,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRAUMA, PSYCHOLOGICAL DISORDER AND STRESS. TRAUMA, TRASTORNO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO Y ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOLOGICAL DECOMPRESSION (DESCOMPRESI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"TRAUMA, PSYCHOLOGICAL DISORDERS, SEVERE STRESS, AND EMOTIONAL TOXICITY.\\n\\n(TRAUMA, TRASTORNOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS, ESTR\\u00c9S SEVERO Y TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE IMPACT OF PSYCHOLOGICAL TRAUMA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE LIVER IS OFTEN THE RECEPTACLE FOR ACCUMULATED ANGER AND STRESS, WHILE THE PINEAL GLAND GOVERNS THE HIGHER NEUROLOGICAL AND ENDOCRINE RESPONSES TO THESE EMOTIONS. AN IMBALANCE HERE SUGGESTS THAT THE BODY IS \\\"STORING\\\" PAST TRAUMA F\\u00cdSICALLY, WHICH CAN LEAD TO CHRONIC STRESS OR PSYCHOLOGICAL FATIGUE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELEASING THESE EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES, REDUCING THE TOXIC LOAD ON THE LIVER, AND RESTORING EMOTIONAL BALANCE AND MENTAL CLARITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL IMPACTO DEL TRAUMA PSICOL\\u00d3GICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL H\\u00cdGADO ES A MENUDO EL RECEPT\\u00c1CULO DE LA IRA Y EL ESTR\\u00c9S ACUMULADOS, MIENTRAS QUE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL DIRIGE LAS RESPUESTAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS Y ENDOCRINAS SUPERIORES A ESTAS EMOCIONES. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SUGIERE QUE EL CUERPO EST\\u00c1 \\\"ALMACENANDO\\\" TRAUMAS PASADOS F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, LO QUE PUEDE LLEVAR A ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO O FATIGA PSICOL\\u00d3GICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR ESTOS C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS, REDUCIENDO LA CARGA T\\u00d3XICA EN EL H\\u00cdGADO Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL Y LA CLARIDAD MENTAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF STRESS OR ANGER PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT HEPATIC INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP PSYCHOLOGICAL BLOCKS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] (REF 610) RESONANCE TO STABILIZE THE CENTRAL ENDOCRINE COMMAND. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS DURING THE RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICO-EMOCIONAL: SI EL ESTR\\u00c9S O LA IRA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN BLOQUEOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS PROFUNDOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 610) PARA ESTABILIZAR EL MANDO ENDOCRINO CENTRAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS EMOCIONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/604','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:02:53','2026-04-28 14:02:53'),(4400,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',605,'{\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN BARRE (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, MUSCLE WEAKNESS. (MAREOS, FATIGA, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"AGGRESSIVE AND CONTAGIOUS. SENSITIVITY DISORDERS, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS. (AGRESIVO Y CONTAGIOSO. TRASTORNOS DE LA SENSIBILIDAD, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, AND MUSCLE WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(MAREOS, FATIGA Y DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENS ASSOCIATED WITH GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 SYNDROME BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CONSIDERED AGGRESSIVE AND CONTAGIOUS, DIRECTLY IMPACTING THE BRAINSTEM WHERE VITAL AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS ARE CONTROLLED. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO SIGNIFICANT SENSITIVITY DISORDERS AND RESPIRATORY COMPLICATIONS AS THE VIRUS INTERFERES WITH NEUROLOGICAL SIGNALING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM FROM PROGRESSIVE WEAKNESS, AND RESTORING PROPER RESPIRATORY AND SENSORY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS ASOCIADOS CON EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE CONSIDERA AGRESIVO Y CONTAGIOSO, IMPACTANDO DIRECTAMENTE EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO DONDE SE CONTROLAN LAS FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS VITALES. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A TRASTORNOS SIGNIFICATIVOS DE LA SENSIBILIDAD Y COMPLICACIONES RESPIRATORIAS A MEDIDA QUE EL VIRUS INTERFIERE CON LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DE LA DEBILIDAD PROGRESIVA Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y SENSORIAL ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEURO-RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF MUSCLE WEAKNESS OR DIZZINESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ INSTEP] (REF 611) RESERVOIR TO ENSURE THE VIRUS IS NOT HIDING IN PERIPHERAL NERVE POINTS. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MEDULLA OBLONGATA \\/ MEDULLA OBLONGATA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN CLEARING VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF NEUROLOGICAL PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEURO-RESPIRATORIA: SI LA DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR O LOS MAREOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL RESERVORIO [PINEAL \\/ EMPEINE] (REF 611) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL VIRUS NO SE EST\\u00c9 OCULTANDO EN PUNTOS NERVIOSOS PERIF\\u00c9RICOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA AGUDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00cdAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/605','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:04:15','2026-04-28 14:04:15'),(4401,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',606,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"MERIDIANS UNBALANCE INDICATOR. (INDICADOR DE DESEQUILIBRIO DE MERIDIANOS)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":\"BALANCING THE MERIDIANS. (EQUILIBRANDO LOS MERIDIANOS)\"}','{\"origins\":\"BIOENERGETIC ALIGNMENT (ALINEACI\\u00d3N BIOENERG\\u00c9TICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MERIDIANS UNBALANCE INDICATOR, GENERAL MALAISE, SENSATION OF BEING \\\"OUT OF SYNC,\\\" AND ENERGETIC DISCONNECTION.\\n\\n(INDICADOR DE DESEQUILIBRIO DE MERIDIANOS, MALESTAR GENERAL, SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ESTAR \\\"FUERA DE SINTON\\u00cdA\\\" Y DESCONEXI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ACTS AS A DIAGNOSTIC AND CORRECTIVE INDICATOR FOR THE BODY\'S MERIDIAN SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE RIGHT PALM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS CONNECTS THE MASTER ENDOCRINE REGULATOR WITH THE REFLEX POINTS AND ENERGETIC TERMINALS FOUND IN THE HAND. AN IMBALANCE HERE SUGGESTS THAT THE FLOW OF VITAL ENERGY (CHI) THROUGH THE TRADITIONAL MERIDIAN PATHWAYS IS BLOCKED OR DISRUPTED. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN BALANCING THE MERIDIANS, RE-ESTABLISHING ENERGETIC SYMMETRY, AND ENSURING THAT THE BODY\'S BIOELECTRIC NETWORK IS CONDUCTING FREQUENCIES EFFICIENTLY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ACT\\u00daA COMO UN INDICADOR DIAGN\\u00d3STICO Y CORRECTIVO PARA EL SISTEMA DE MERIDIANOS DEL CUERPO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y LA PALMA DERECHA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE CONECTA EL REGULADOR ENDOCRINO MAESTRO CON LOS PUNTOS REFLEJOS Y LAS TERMINALES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE SE ENCUENTRAN EN LA MANO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SUGIERE QUE EL FLUJO DE ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL (CHI) A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS V\\u00cdAS TRADICIONALES DE LOS MERIDIANOS EST\\u00c1 BLOQUEADO O INTERRUMPIDO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A EQUILIBRAR LOS MERIDIANOS, REESTABLECIENDO LA SIMETR\\u00cdA ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y ASEGURANDO QUE LA RED BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL CUERPO CONDUZCA LAS FRECUENCIAS DE MANERA EFICIENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"MERIDIAN BALANCE: IF ENERGETIC IMBALANCE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] (REF 611) AXIS TO ENSURE THE PRIMARY REGULATOR IS STABLE. FOR CASES INVOLVING PHYSICAL FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC VITALITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CONDUCTIVITY OF THE BODY\'S ENERGETIC PATHWAYS DURING THE REALIGNMENT PROCESS.\\n\\n(EQUILIBRIO DE MERIDIANOS: SI EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] (REF 611) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL REGULADOR PRIMARIO EST\\u00c9 ESTABLE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA F\\u00cdSICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA CONDUCTIVIDAD DE LAS V\\u00cdAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DEL CUERPO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REALINEACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/606','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:05:27','2026-04-28 14:05:27'),(4402,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',607,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LUST (LUJURIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL ALIGNMENT (ALINEACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, METABOLIC DISRUPTION, AND DEEP-SEATED PSYCHOLOGICAL BLOCKS.\\n\\n(INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, ALTERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y BLOQUEOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS PROFUNDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE COMPLEX VIBRATION OF LUST (LUJURIA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE HIGHER ENDOCRINE CONTROLLER WITH THE GLAND RESPONSIBLE FOR DIGESTION AND BLOOD SUGAR REGULATION. BEYOND THE PHYSICAL, THIS PAIR IS USED TO CLEAR EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES RELATED TO INTENSE DESIRES OR EMOTIONAL EXCESSES THAT CAN \\\"CONSUME\\\" THE BODY\'S VITAL ENERGY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, RELEASING PSYCHOLOGICAL PRESSURE, AND RESTORING HARMONY TO BOTH THE METABOLIC AND EMOTIONAL BODIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA COMPLEJA VIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LA LUJURIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA EL CONTROLADOR ENDOCRINO SUPERIOR CON LA GL\\u00c1NDULA RESPONSABLE DE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LO F\\u00cdSICO, ESTE PAR SE UTILIZA PARA ELIMINAR C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS RELACIONADOS CON DESEOS INTENSOS O EXCESOS EMOCIONALES QUE PUEDEN \\\"CONSUMIR\\\" LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL DEL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, LIBERAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA Y RESTAURAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA TANTO EN EL CUERPO METAB\\u00d3LICO COMO EN EL EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL BLOCKS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ ADRENAL GLAND] (REF 607) AXIS TO ADDRESS SYSTEMIC STRESS. FOR CASES INVOLVING METABOLIC IMBALANCES OR DIGESTIVE STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE DURING THE RESTRUCTURING OF EMOTIONAL FREQUENCIES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINO-EMOCIONAL: SI LOS BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL] (REF 607) PARA ABORDAR EL ESTR\\u00c9S SIST\\u00c9MICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DESEQUILIBRIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS O ESTR\\u00c9S DIGESTIVO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE LA REESTRUCTURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FRECUENCIAS EMOCIONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/607','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:07:01','2026-04-28 14:07:01'),(4403,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',608,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PIGMENT DISCOLORING, SEXUAL AND ADRENALS DISFUNCTION. HYPOCHROMIA. (DESCOLORACI\\u00d3N DEL PIGMENTO, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL Y SUPRARRENAL. HIPOCROM\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MASTER ENDOCRINE BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO ENDOCRINO MAESTRO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PIGMENT DISCOLORING, SEXUAL AND ADRENALS DYSFUNCTION, AND HYPOCHROMIA.\\n\\n(DESCOLORACI\\u00d3N DEL PIGMENTO, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL Y SUPRARRENAL, E HIPOCROM\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PINEAL GLAND BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THIS VITAL SENSORY AND ENDOCRINE HUB. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BILATERAL RESET IS ESSENTIAL FOR CORRECTING SYSTEMIC PIGMENTATION ERRORS (HYPOCHROMIA) AND REGULATING THE BODY\'S MATURATION PROCESS. SINCE THE PINEAL GLAND INFLUENCES THE ADRENAL RESPONSE AND REPRODUCTIVE HORMONES, AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO ADRENAL EXHAUSTION OR SEXUAL DYSFUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN HARMONIZING HORMONE PRODUCTION, RESTORING PROPER SKIN PIGMENTATION, AND RE-ESTABLISHING THE NATURAL BIOLOGICAL RHYTHMS OF THE ENTIRE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SE DIRIGE A LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE ESTE CENTRO ENDOCRINO Y SENSORIAL VITAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE REINICIO BILATERAL ES ESENCIAL PARA CORREGIR ERRORES DE PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA (HIPOCROM\\u00cdA) Y REGULAR EL PROCESO DE MADURACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO. DADO QUE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL INFLUYE EN LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL Y EN LAS HORMONAS REPRODUCTIVAS, UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR AL AGOTAMIENTO SUPRARRENAL O A LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARMONIZAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL, RESTAURAR LA PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LA PIEL Y REESTABLECER LOS RITMOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS NATURALES DE TODO EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLOSSAL CHECK: IF PIGMENTATION ISSUES OR SYSTEMIC DYSFUNCTION PERSIST, SCAN THE [TONGUE \\/ TONGUE] AXIS TO RULE OUT LINGUAL PATHOGENS IMPACTING THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ADRENAL FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PINEAL \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] (REF 610) AXIS TO ENSURE THE CENTRAL COMMAND SYSTEM OF THE BRAIN IS FULLY ALIGNED AND BALANCED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLOSAL: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N O LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LENGUA \\/ LENGUA] PARA DESCARTAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS LINGUALES QUE AFECTEN EL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA SUPRARRENAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 610) PARA ASEGURAR QUE EL SISTEMA DE MANDO CENTRAL DEL CEREBRO EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE ALINEADO Y EQUILIBRADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/608','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:08:05','2026-04-28 14:08:05'),(4404,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',609,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VERTIGO (V\\u00c9RTIGO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VESTIBULAR STABILITY (ESTABILIDAD VESTIBULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"VERTIGO, DIZZINESS, LOSS OF BALANCE, AND POTENTIAL NAUSEA.\\n\\n(V\\u00c9RTIGO, MAREOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO Y POSIBLES N\\u00c1USEAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE ADDRESSES PATHOGENS THAT IMPACT THE VESTIBULAR SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE PONS (THE BRAINSTEM STRUCTURE THAT LINKS THE MEDULLA AND THALAMUS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS A FREQUENT HIDEOUT FOR VIRAL OR BACTERIAL LOADS THAT INTERFERE WITH THE BODY\'S ORIENTATION AND BALANCE SENSORS. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS CHRONIC VERTIGO OR THE SENSATION OF THE SURROUNDINGS SPINNING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET EXPOSES HIDDEN PATHOGENS, ASSISTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE SOURCE OF THE DIZZINESS AND RESTORING NEUROLOGICAL STABILITY TO THE HIND BRAIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO ABORDA LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTAN EL SISTEMA VESTIBULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL PUENTE (LA ESTRUCTURA DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO QUE CONECTA LA M\\u00c9DULA Y EL T\\u00c1LAMO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES UN REFUGIO FRECUENTE PARA CARGAS VIRALES O BACTERIANAS QUE INTERFIEREN CON LOS SENSORES DE ORIENTACI\\u00d3N Y EQUILIBRIO DEL CUERPO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO V\\u00c9RTIGO CR\\u00d3NICO O LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE QUE EL ENTORNO GIRA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO EXPONE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS OCULTOS, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA FUENTE DEL MAREO Y RESTAURANDO LA ESTABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA DEL CEREBRO POSTERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VESTIBULAR CHECK: IF VERTIGO OR DIZZINESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ MEDULLA OBLONGATA] (REF 613) AXIS TO RULE OUT ACTIVE VIRAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE NAUSEA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [POST-PINEAL \\/ POST-PINEAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS AS THEY ARE RELEASED FROM THE BRAINSTEM RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VESTIBULAR: SI EL V\\u00c9RTIGO O LOS MAREOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] (REF 613) PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS VIRALES ACTIVAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN N\\u00c1USEAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [POST-PINEAL \\/ POST-PINEAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS A MEDIDA QUE SE LIBERAN DEL RESERVORIO DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/609','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:09:24','2026-04-28 14:09:24'),(4405,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',610,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LUST (LUJURIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL PURIFICATION (PURIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM STRESS, EMOTIONAL PRESSURE, AND PSYCHOLOGICAL TENSION RELATED TO DESIRE.\\n\\n(ESTR\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR, PRESI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y TENSI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA RELACIONADA CON EL DESEO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC VIBRATION OF LUST (LUJURIA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE PROSTATE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE HIGHER ENDOCRINE CONTROLLER\\u2014RESPONSIBLE FOR SPIRITUAL AND BIOLOGICAL RHYTHMS\\u2014WITH THE PROSTATE, A KEY POINT IN THE MALE REPRODUCTIVE AND ENERGETIC SYSTEM. AN IMBALANCE HERE SUGGESTS AN OVERSTIMULATION OF THE LOWER ENERGETIC CENTERS OR A DISCONNECTION FROM HIGHER REGULATION, WHICH CAN MANIFEST AS BOTH PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT AND EMOTIONAL RESTLESSNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELEASING EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES, CALMING INTENSE PSYCHOLOGICAL DRIVES, AND RESTORING BALANCE TO THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA VIBRACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA LUJURIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y LA PR\\u00d3STATA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA EL CONTROLADOR ENDOCRINO SUPERIOR\\u2014RESPONSABLE DE LOS RITMOS ESPIRITUALES Y BIOL\\u00d3GICOS\\u2014CON LA PR\\u00d3STATA, UN PUNTO CLAVE EN EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR Y ENERG\\u00c9TICO MASCULINO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SUGIERE UNA SOBREESTIMULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS CENTROS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS INFERIORES O UNA DESCONEXI\\u00d3N DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N SUPERIOR, LO QUE PUEDE MANIFESTARSE TANTO COMO MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO COMO INQUIETUD EMOCIONAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS, CALMAR IMPULSOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS INTENSOS Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EN EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL TENSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PANCREAS] (REF 615) AXIS TO ADDRESS SHARED EMOTIONAL CODES. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIRECT PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PROSTATE \\/ PROSTATE] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT PATHOGENIC LOADS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ENERGETIC FILTRATION OF RELEASED EMOTIONAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINO-EMOCIONAL: SI LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 615) PARA ABORDAR C\\u00d3DIGOS EMOCIONALES COMPARTIDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO DIRECTO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PR\\u00d3STATA \\/ PR\\u00d3STATA] PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LAS TOXINAS EMOCIONALES LIBERADAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/610','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:10:29','2026-04-28 14:10:29'),(4406,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',611,'{\"origins\":\"GUILLIAN BARRE (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"DAMAGE TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, DEGENERATION OF THE PINEAL GLAND, DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, BLURRED VISION, DRY MOUTH, ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION. (DA\\u00d1O AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL, MAREOS, FATIGA, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA, BOCA SECA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL.)\",\"paths\":\"MENTAL IMBALANCE, HYSTERIA, PARALYSIS, QUADRIPLEGIA, RESPIRATORY FAILURE. (DESEQUILIBRIO MENTAL, HISTERIA, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, CUADRIPLEJ\\u00cdA, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PARIETAL      CHECK - PINEAL\\/INSTEP (REVISAR - PARIETAL      REVISAR - PINEAL\\/EMPEINE)\"}','{\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"DAMAGE TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, DEGENERATION OF THE PINEAL GLAND, DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, BLURRED VISION, DRY MOUTH, AND ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(DA\\u00d1O AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL, MAREOS, FATIGA, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA, BOCA SECA Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENS ASSOCIATED WITH GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL AS IT IMPACTS THE BRAINSTEM\'S GOVERNANCE OVER AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL COMPLICATIONS, INCLUDING MENTAL IMBALANCE, HYSTERIA, OR PROGRESSIVE PARALYSIS SUCH AS QUADRIPLEGIA. IN EXTREME CASES, THE VIRAL INTERFERENCE MAY TRIGGER RESPIRATORY FAILURE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING THE PINEAL GLAND FROM DEGENERATION, AND RESTORING VITAL NEUROLOGICAL SIGNALING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS ASOCIADOS CON GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE AFECTA EL MANDO DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO SOBRE LAS FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS GRAVES, INCLUYENDO DESEQUILIBRIO MENTAL, HISTERIA O PAR\\u00c1LISIS PROGRESIVA COMO LA CUADRIPLEJ\\u00cdA. EN CASOS EXTREMOS, LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL PUEDE DESENCADENAR UNA INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO A LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL DE LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURANDO LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA VITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF NERVE DAMAGE OR PARALYSIS SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS CEREBRAL PH BALANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC FATIGUE OR WEAKNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ INSTEP] (REF 611) RESERVOIR TO ENSURE NO PATHOGENIC HIDEOUTS REMAIN. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE BRAINSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DA\\u00d1O NERVIOSO O PAR\\u00c1LISIS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA ABORDAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH CEREBRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA O DEBILIDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL RESERVORIO [PINEAL \\/ EMPEINE] (REF 611) PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO QUEDEN REFUGIOS PATOG\\u00c9NICOS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/611','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:11:47','2026-04-28 14:11:47'),(4407,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',612,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"REGULATES THE HORMONAL SYSTEM. (REGULA EL SISTEMA HORMONAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HORMONE IMBALANCE, CHRONIC FATIGUE, SLEEP DISRUPTION, AND METABOLIC DYSREGULATION.\\n\\n(DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, ALTERACI\\u00d3N DEL SUE\\u00d1O Y DESREGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS RNA-BASED PATHOGENS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE SUPRARENAL (ADRENAL) GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REGULATING THE ENTIRE HORMONAL SYSTEM. THE PINEAL GLAND ACTS AS THE MASTER CONDUCTOR OF BIOLOGICAL RHYTHMS, WHILE THE SUPRARENAL GLANDS GOVERN THE STRESS RESPONSE AND METABOLIC VITALITY. AN IMBALANCE HERE, OFTEN DRIVEN BY VIRAL INTERFERENCE AT THE GENETIC LEVEL (RNA), CAN DISRUPT THE PRODUCTION OF MELATONIN AND CORTISOL. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RESTORING GLANDULAR SYNERGY, CALMING THE ADRENAL RESPONSE, AND RE-ESTABLISHING THE BODY\'S NATURAL HORMONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A PAT\\u00d3GENOS BASADOS EN ARN MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA REGULAR TODO EL SISTEMA HORMONAL. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL ACT\\u00daA COMO EL CONDUCTOR MAESTRO DE LOS RITMOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS, MIENTRAS QUE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DIRIGEN LA RESPUESTA AL ESTR\\u00c9S Y LA VITALIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd, A MENUDO IMPULSADO POR LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL A NIVEL GEN\\u00c9TICO (ARN), PUEDE ALTERAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE MELATONINA Y CORTISOL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR LA SINERGIA GLANDULAR, CALMAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL Y REESTABLECER EL EQUILIBRIO HORMONAL NATURAL DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF HORMONAL DYSREGULATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] (REF 610) AXIS TO ADDRESS THE CENTRAL COMMAND SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EXHAUSTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENAL GLAND \\/ ADRENAL GLAND] RESONANCE TO STABILIZE LOCAL GLANDULAR FUNCTION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA: SI LA DESREGULACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 610) PARA ABORDAR EL SISTEMA DE MANDO CENTRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN AGOTAMIENTO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL \\/ GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL] PARA ESTABILIZAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR LOCAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/612','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:12:47','2026-04-28 14:12:47'),(4408,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',613,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ALCOHOLISM (ALCOHOLISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENDOCRINE ALIGNMENT (ALINEACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ADDICTIVE TENDENCIES, METABOLIC FLUCTUATIONS, AND EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(TENDENCIAS ADICTIVAS, FLUCTUACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS E INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCES ASSOCIATED WITH ALCOHOLISM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE THYROID. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE BODY\'S CHEMICAL AND EMOTIONAL DEPENDENCIES. THE PINEAL GLAND GOVERNS THE RELEASE OF NEUROTRANSMITTERS AND BIOLOGICAL RHYTHMS, WHILE THE THYROID REGULATES METABOLIC SPEED AND VITAL ENERGY. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN REFLECTS A SEARCH FOR EXTERNAL \\\"STIMULANTS\\\" OR \\\"NUMBING AGENTS\\\" TO COMPENSATE FOR INTERNAL ENDOCRINE DEFICIENCIES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE COMPULSIVE DRIVE, BALANCING METABOLIC ENERGY, AND SUPPORTING THE RECLAMATION OF MENTAL CLARITY AND EMOTIONAL SOBRIETY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS ASOCIADOS CON EL ALCOHOLISMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y LA TIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LAS DEPENDENCIAS QU\\u00cdMICAS Y EMOCIONALES DEL CUERPO. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL DIRIGE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE NEUROTRANSMISORES Y LOS RITMOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS, MIENTRAS QUE LA TIROIDES REGULA LA VELOCIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA Y LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO REFLEJA UNA B\\u00daSQUEDA DE \\\"ESTIMULANTES\\\" O \\\"AGENTES ADORMECEDORES\\\" EXTERNOS PARA COMPENSAR LAS DEFICIENCIAS ENDOCRINAS INTERNAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL IMPULSO COMPULSIVO, EQUILIBRAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA METAB\\u00d3LICA Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA CLARIDAD MENTAL Y LA SOBRIEDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF ADDICTIVE TENDENCIES OR FATIGUE PERSIST, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO ENSURE LOCAL GLANDULAR STABILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] (REF 610) RESONANCE TO BALANCE THE BRAIN\'S CENTRAL COMMAND. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE DETOXIFICATION CHANNELS AND TO ADDRESS ANY ACCUMULATED HEPATIC TOXICITY RELATED TO SUBSTANCE USE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LAS TENDENCIAS ADICTIVAS O LA FATIGA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD GLANDULAR LOCAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANGUSTIA EMOCIONAL PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 610) PARA EQUILIBRAR EL MANDO CENTRAL DEL CEREBRO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LOS CANALES DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y ABORDAR CUALQUIER TOXICIDAD HEP\\u00c1TICA ACUMULADA RELACIONADA CON EL USO DE SUSTANCIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/613','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:21:54','2026-04-28 14:21:54'),(4409,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',614,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LUST (LUJURIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"REPRODUCTIVE ALIGNMENT (ALINEACI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL PRESSURE, REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM TENSION, AND PSYCHOLOGICAL IMBALANCE RELATED TO DESIRE.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL, TENSI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR Y DESEQUILIBRIO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO RELACIONADO CON EL DESEO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIBRATION OF LUST (LUJURIA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PINEAL GLAND AND THE UTERUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE HIGHER ENDOCRINE CENTERS (WHICH GOVERN SPIRITUAL AND BIOLOGICAL CYCLES) AND THE CREATIVE\\/REPRODUCTIVE CORE OF THE FEMALE BODY. AN IMBALANCE HERE SUGGESTS THAT EMOTIONAL OR PSYCHOLOGICAL DRIVES ARE DISCONNECTED FROM HIGHER REGULATION, POTENTIALY LEADING TO REPRODUCTIVE STRESS OR PERSISTENT MENTAL TENSION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELEASING EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES, CALMING INTENSE EMOTIONAL IMPULSES, AND RESTORING ENERGETIC HARMONY TO THE UTERUS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA VIBRACI\\u00d3N DE LA LUJURIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL Y EL \\u00daTERO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LOS CENTROS ENDOCRINOS SUPERIORES (QUE RIGEN LOS CICLOS ESPIRITUALES Y BIOL\\u00d3GICOS) Y EL N\\u00daCLEO CREATIVO\\/REPRODUCTOR DEL CUERPO FEMENINO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SUGIERE QUE LOS IMPULSOS EMOCIONALES O PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS EST\\u00c1N DESCONECTADOS DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N SUPERIOR, LO QUE PODR\\u00cdA LLEVAR A ESTR\\u00c9S REPRODUCTIVO O TENSI\\u00d3N MENTAL PERSISTENTE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LIBERAR C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS INCRUSTADOS, CALMAR IMPULSOS EMOCIONALES INTENSOS Y RESTAURAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA ENERG\\u00c9TICA EN EL \\u00daTERO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE-EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL TENSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PANCREAS] (REF 615) AXIS TO ADDRESS SHARED EMOTIONAL PATTERNS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIRECT PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [UTERUS \\/ UTERUS] RESONANCE TO RULE OUT PATHOGENIC LOADS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE DURING THE RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL TOXICITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINO-EMOCIONAL: SI LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 615) PARA ABORDAR PATRONES EMOCIONALES COMPARTIDOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO DIRECTO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [\\u00daTERO \\/ \\u00daTERO] PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/614','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:23:20','2026-04-28 14:23:20'),(4410,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',615,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"UNBALANCED HORMONES. (HORMONAS DESEQUILIBRADAS)\",\"paths\":\"OBESITY, HELPS TROUBLE CAUSED BY CORTICOSTEROIDS INJECTIONS. (HORMONAS DESEQUILIBRADAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CORTICOSTEROID REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DE CORTICOSTEROIDES)\",\"symptoms\":\"UNBALANCED HORMONES, OBESITY, AND SIDE EFFECTS FROM CORTICOSTEROID INJECTIONS.\\n\\n(HORMONAS DESEQUILIBRADAS, OBESIDAD Y EFECTOS SECUNDARIOS DE LAS INYECCIONES DE CORTICOSTEROIDES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON RESTORING THE FEEDBACK LOOP BETWEEN THE PITUITARY GLAND AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THIS VITAL ENDOCRINE AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR INDIVIDUALS WHO HAVE UNDERGONE MEDICAL TREATMENTS INVOLVING CORTICOSTEROIDS, AS THESE SYNTHETIC HORMONES CAN \\\"SHUT DOWN\\\" OR UNBALANCE THE BODY\'S NATURAL PRODUCTION. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN LEADS TO WEIGHT GAIN (OBESITY), WATER RETENTION, AND SYSTEMIC HORMONAL ERRORS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE PITUITARY IN RE-ESTABLISHING PROPER COMMUNICATION WITH THE ADRENALS, HELPING THE BODY RECOVER FROM EXOGENOUS HORMONE OVERLOAD AND RESTORING NATURAL METABOLIC BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN RESTAURAR EL BUCLE DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE ESTE EJE ENDOCRINO VITAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA PERSONAS QUE HAN SIDO SOMETIDAS A TRATAMIENTOS M\\u00c9DICOS QUE INVOLUCRAN CORTICOSTEROIDES, YA QUE ESTAS HORMONAS SINT\\u00c9TICAS PUEDEN \\\"APAGAR\\\" O DESEQUILIBRAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N NATURAL DEL CUERPO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO CONDUCE AL AUMENTO DE PESO (OBESIDAD), RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y ERRORES HORMONALES SIST\\u00c9MICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LA PITUITARIA A REESTABLECER UNA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA CON LAS SUPRARRENALES, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A RECUPERARSE DE LA SOBRECARGA DE HORMONAS EX\\u00d3GENAS Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO NATURAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC SYNERGY: IF WEIGHT ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO ENSURE METABOLIC SPEED IS REGULATED. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE STRESS OR ADRENAL EXHAUSTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ SUPRARENAL] (REF 620) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS AND EXCESS FLUIDS RELEASED DURING THE ENDOCRINE REBALANCING PROCESS.\\n\\n(SINERGIA METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE PESO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA VELOCIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA EST\\u00c9 REGULADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S SEVERO O AGOTAMIENTO SUPRARRENAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ SUPRARRENAL] (REF 620). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS Y EL EXCESO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS LIBERADOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REEQUILIBRIO ENDOCRINO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/615','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:24:29','2026-04-28 14:24:29'),(4411,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',616,'{\"symptoms\":\"NASAL MUCUS, NOSE BLEEDING, EYE PAIN, RASH, HIGH FEVER. (MUCOSIDAD NASAL, HEMORRAGIA NASAL, DOLOR OCULAR, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, FIEBRE ALTA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITOES. SINUSITIS, COLD, AND FLU. (TRANSMITIDO POR MOSQUITOS. SINUSITIS, RESFRIADO Y GRIPE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RACHIDIAN BULB\\/BLADDER (REVISAR - BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ VEJIGA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"NASAL MUCUS, NOSE BLEEDING, EYE PAIN, RASH, AND HIGH FEVER.\\n\\n(MUCOSIDAD NASAL, HEMORRAGIA NASAL, DOLOR OCULAR, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y FIEBRE ALTA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE COMMON DENGUE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PITUITARY GLAND AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITOES THAT CAUSE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS SYMPTOMS COMMONLY MISTAKEN FOR SEVERE SINUSITIS, COLD, OR FLU, BUT WITH THE DISTINGUISHING CHARACTERISTICS OF EYE PAIN AND POTENTIAL NASAL HEMORRHAGING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING FEBRILE RESPONSES, AND CLEARING THE RESPIRATORY AND SENSORY TRACTS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL DENGUE COM\\u00daN MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS TRANSMITIDOS POR MOSQUITOS QUE CAUSAN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE COM\\u00daNMENTE SE CONFUNDEN CON SINUSITIS SEVERA, RESFRIADO O GRIPE, PERO CON LAS CARACTER\\u00cdSTICAS DISTINTIVAS DE DOLOR OCULAR Y POSIBLES HEMORRAGIAS NASALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LAS RESPUESTAS FEBRILES Y LIMPANDO LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS Y SENSORIALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGENIC CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [RACHIDIAN BULB \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO RULE OUT AGGRESSIVE VIRAL HIDEOUTS IN THE BRAINSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SINUS PRESSURE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY FROM DENGUE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PATOG\\u00c9NICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ VEJIGA] PARA DESCARTAR REFUGIOS VIRALES AGRESIVOS EN EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PRESI\\u00d3N SINUSAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL DENGUE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/616','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:25:37','2026-04-28 14:25:37'),(4412,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',617,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HEAVY BLEEDING OR MISSED CYCLES. (SANGRADO ABUNDANTE O CICLOS AUSENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"OVARIAN DYSFUNCTION, FROM INSUFFICIENT STIMULATION OF THE PITUITARY GLAND. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA, POR ESTIMULACI\\u00d3N INSUFICIENTE DE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"OVARIAN STIMULATION (ESTIMULACI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEAVY BLEEDING, MISSED CYCLES (AMENORRHEA), AND IRREGULAR MENSTRUATION.\\n\\n(SANGRADO ABUNDANTE, CICLOS AUSENTES (AMENORREA) Y MENSTRUACI\\u00d3N IRREGULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES OVARIAN DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE COMMUNICATION AXIS BETWEEN THE PITUITARY GLAND AND THE OVARIES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR CORRECTING IMBALANCES STEMMING FROM INSUFFICIENT HORMONAL STIMULATION. THE PITUITARY GLAND ACTS AS THE \\\"COMMAND CENTER,\\\" RELEASING FOLLICLE-STIMULATING HORMONE (FSH) AND LUTEINIZING HORMONE (LH) TO REGULATE THE OVULATORY CYCLE. WHEN THIS SIGNALING IS WEAK OR DISRUPTED, IT CAN RESULT IN COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS HEAVY MENSTRUAL FLOW OR THE TOTAL ABSENCE OF A CYCLE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RE-ESTABLISHING THE NATURAL FEEDBACK LOOP, SUPPORTING REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH AND HORMONAL SYNERGY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH DENTRO DEL EJE DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA Y LOS OVARIOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA CORREGIR DESEQUILIBRIOS DERIVADOS DE UNA ESTIMULACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL INSUFICIENTE. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA ACT\\u00daA COMO EL \\\"CENTRO DE MANDO\\\", LIBERANDO LA HORMONA FOL\\u00cdCULO-ESTIMULANTE (FSH) Y LA HORMONA LUTEINIZANTE (LH) PARA REGULAR EL CICLO OVULATORIO. CUANDO ESTA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N ES D\\u00c9BIL O SE INTERRUMPE, PUEDE RESULTAR EN COMPLICACIONES COMO UN FLUJO MENSTRUAL ABUNDANTE O LA AUSENCIA TOTAL DEL CICLO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REESTABLECER EL BUCLE DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N NATURAL, APOYANDO LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA Y LA SINERGIA HORMONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"REPRODUCTIVE CHECK: IF IRREGULAR CYCLES PERSIST, SCAN THE [UTERUS \\/ UTERUS] AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCAL PATHOGENS OR INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EMOTIONAL STRESS IMPACTING THE CYCLE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ UTERUS] (REF 622) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS, WHICH ASSIST IN SECONDARY HORMONE PRODUCTION DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE PITUITARY-OVARIAN AXIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA: SI LOS CICLOS IRREGULARES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ \\u00daTERO] PARA DESCARTAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS LOCALES O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL SEVERO QUE AFECTE EL CICLO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ \\u00daTERO] (REF 622). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES, QUE AYUDAN EN LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N SECUNDARIA DE HORMONAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE PITUITARIO-OV\\u00c1RICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/617','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:26:48','2026-04-28 14:26:48'),(4413,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',618,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ABNORMAL PHYSICAL GROWTH AND SEXUAL DEVELOPMENT. (CRECIMIENTO F\\u00cdSICO ANORMAL Y DESARROLLO SEXUAL.)\",\"paths\":\"IT EFFECTS BLOOD PRESSURE, MUSCLE CONTRACTION, KIDNEY FUNCTION AND FERTILITY. DIRECTS THE FUNCTION OF THE THYROID, PARATHYROID, OVARIES AND TESTES TO BALANCE. (AFECTA LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL, LA CONTRACCI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR, LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL Y LA FERTILIDAD. DIRIGE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA TIROIDES, PARATIROIDES, OVARIOS Y TEST\\u00cdCULOS PARA MANTENER EL EQUILIBRIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GROWTH & FERTILITY REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DE CRECIMIENTO Y FERTILIDAD)\",\"symptoms\":\"ABNORMAL PHYSICAL GROWTH, SEXUAL DEVELOPMENT ISSUES, AND BLOOD PRESSURE FLUCTUATIONS.\\n\\n(CRECIMIENTO F\\u00cdSICO ANORMAL, PROBLEMAS DE DESARROLLO SEXUAL Y FLUCTUACIONES DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PITUITARY GLAND IN A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT TO NEUTRALIZE PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THIS CENTRAL ENDOCRINE HUB. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE \\\"MASTER GLAND\\\" FUNCTIONS THAT OVERSEE BLOOD PRESSURE, MUSCLE CONTRACTION, AND KIDNEY FUNCTION. BEYOND SYSTEMIC REGULATION, IT PLAYS A PIVOTAL ROLE IN FERTILITY BY DIRECTING THE BALANCE OF THE THYROID, PARATHYROID, OVARIES, AND TESTES. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO DISRUPTIONS IN PHYSICAL STATURE OR MATURATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN HARMONIZING GLANDULAR COMMUNICATION AND RESTORING THE NATURAL COORDINATION OF THE ENTIRE ENDOCRINE CASCADE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SE DIRIGE A LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL PARA NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE ESTE CENTRO ENDOCRINO CENTRAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR LAS FUNCIONES DE LA \\\"GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA\\\" QUE SUPERVISAN LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL, LA CONTRACCI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL. M\\u00c1S \\u00c1LLE DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, JUEGA UN PAPEL FUNDAMENTAL EN LA FERTILIDAD AL DIRIGIR EL EQUILIBRIO DE LA TIROIDES, PARATIROIDES, OVARIOS Y TEST\\u00cdCULOS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A ALTERACIONES EN LA ESTATURA F\\u00cdSICA O EN LA MADURACI\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARMONIZAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y A RESTAURAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N NATURAL DE TODA LA CASCADA ENDOCRINA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE SYNERGY: IF GROWTH OR FERTILITY ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PITUITARY \\/ OVARY] (REF 625) OR [PITUITARY \\/ TESTIS] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING METABOLIC SHIFTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL RESPONSE, AS THE PITUITARY DIRECTLY INFLUENCES WATER BALANCE AND BLOOD PRESSURE.\\n\\n(SINERGIA ENDOCRINA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE CRECIMIENTO O FERTILIDAD PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PITUITARIA \\/ OVARIO] (REF 625) O [PITUITARIA \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CAMBIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA RENAL, YA QUE LA PITUITARIA INFLUYE DIRECTAMENTE EN EL EQUILIBRIO H\\u00cdDRICO Y LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/618','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:27:58','2026-04-28 14:27:58'),(4414,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',619,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"LOW BLOOD GLUCOSE LEVELS. INTENSE THIRST. INCREASED APPETITE, WEAKNESS, WEIGHT LOSS, AND DEFICIENCY OF THE ANTIDIURETIC VASOPRESSIN HORMONE. (NIVELES BAJOS DE GLUCOSA EN SANGRE. SED INTENSA. AUMENTO DEL APETITO, DEBILIDAD, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO Y DEFICIENCIA DE LA HORMONA ANTIDIUR\\u00c9TICA VASOPRESINA.)\",\"paths\":\"MAYBE DUE TO A HEAD injury,Or after a brain surgery or a brain tumor. DIABETES INSIPIDUS. METABOLIC DIEASE. HYPERINSULINEMIA, SEVERE HYPOGLYCEMIA, POLYURIA. (PUEDE DEBERSE A UNA LESI\\u00d3N EN LA CABEZA, O DESPU\\u00c9S DE UNA CIRUG\\u00cdA CEREBRAL O UN TUMOR CEREBRAL. DIABETES INS\\u00cdPIDA. ENFERMEDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA. HIPERINSULINEMIA, HIPOGLUCEMIA SEVERA, POLIURIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC TRAUMA (TRAUMA METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"LOW BLOOD GLUCOSE LEVELS (HYPOGLYCEMIA), INTENSE THIRST (POLYDIPSIA), AND POTENTIAL METABOLIC DISRUPTION.\\n\\n(NIVELES BAJOS DE GLUCOSA EN SANGRE (HIPOGLUCEMIA), SED INTENSA (POLIDIPSIA) Y POSIBLE ALTERACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE ADDRESSES SEVERE METABOLIC AND NEUROLOGICAL IMBALANCES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PITUITARY GLAND AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH PHYSICAL TRAUMA, SUCH AS HEAD INJURIES, OR POST-OPERATIVE RECOVERY FROM BRAIN SURGERY. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN TRIGGER \\\"DIABETES INSIPIDUS,\\\" WHERE THE BODY CANNOT REGULATE FLUIDS CORRECTLY, LEADING TO INTENSE THIRST. ADDITIONALLY, IT IMPACTS GLUCOSE REGULATION, POTENTIALLY CAUSING HYPERINSULINEMIA OR SEVERE HYPOGLYCEMIA. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RESTORING THE CENTRAL COMMAND OVER METABOLIC FUNCTIONS AND REESTABLISHING THE PROPER REGULATION OF BLOOD SUGAR AND HYDRATION LEVELS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA ABORDA DESEQUILIBRIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS GRAVES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON TRAUMAS F\\u00cdSICOS, COMO LESIONES EN LA CABEZA, O LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N POSTOPERATORIA DE CIRUG\\u00cdA CEREBRAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE DESENCADENAR \\\"DIABETES INS\\u00cdPIDA\\\", DONDE EL CUERPO NO PUEDE REGULAR LOS L\\u00cdQUIDOS CORRECTAMENTE, LO QUE PROVOCA UNA SED INTENSA. ADEM\\u00c1S, AFECTA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA GLUCOSA, PUDIENDO CAUSAR HIPERINSULINEMIA O HIPOGLUCEMIA SEVERA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR EL MANDO CENTRAL SOBRE LAS FUNCIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS Y A REESTABLECER LA REGULACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE LOS NIVELES DE AZ\\u00daCAR EN SANGRE Y LA HIDRATACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF GLUCOSE FLUCTUATIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PITUITARY \\/ ADRENALS] (REF 623) AXIS TO ADDRESS CORTICOSTEROID BALANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE THIRST OR RENAL ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PONS] (REF 617) RESONANCE TO ENSURE BRAINSTEM STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS DURING THE RECOVERY OF CENTRAL METABOLIC REGULATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LAS FLUCTUACIONES DE GLUCOSA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PITUITARIA \\/ SUPRARRENALES] (REF 623) PARA ABORDAR EL EQUILIBRIO DE CORTICOSTEROIDES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN SED INTENSA O PROBLEMAS RENALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ PUENTE] (REF 617) PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA CENTRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/619','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:29:33','2026-04-28 14:29:33'),(4415,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',620,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBESITY AND WEIGHT LOSS. (OBESIDAD Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC GOVERNANCE (GOBERNANZA METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"OBESITY, UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT LOSS, AND METABOLIC DYSREGULATION.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO INEXPLICABLE Y DESREGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CRITICAL FEEDBACK LOOP BETWEEN THE PITUITARY GLAND AND THE THYROID BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THIS CENTRAL METABOLIC AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR MANAGING BODY WEIGHT ISSUES, AS THE PITUITARY RELEASES THYROID-STIMULATING HORMONE (TSH) TO CONTROL THE THYROID\'S PRODUCTION OF THYROXINE. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN CAUSE THE METABOLISM TO EITHER ACCELERATE OR SLOW DOWN DRASTICALLY, LEADING TO EXTREME WEIGHT FLUCTUATIONS REGARDLESS OF DIET. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN HARMONIZING THE BODY\'S ENERGY CONSUMPTION, CALMING GLANDULAR OVERACTIVITY OR UNDERACTIVITY, AND RESTORING BALANCE TO THE SYSTEMIC METABOLIC RATE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL BUCLE DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00cdTICO ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA Y LA TIROIDES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE ESTE EJE METAB\\u00d3LICO CENTRAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA MANEJAR PROBLEMAS DE PESO CORPORAL, YA QUE LA PITUITARIA LIBERA LA HORMONA ESTIMULANTE DE LA TIROIDES (TSH) PARA CONTROLAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE TIROXINA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CAUSAR QUE EL METABOLISMO SE ACELERE O SE DESACELERE DR\\u00c1STICAMENTE, LO QUE PROVOCA FLUCTUACIONES EXTREMAS DE PESO INDEPENDIENTEMENTE DE LA DIETA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ARMONIZAR EL CONSUMO DE ENERG\\u00cdA DEL CUERPO, CALMANDO LA HIPERACTIVIDAD O HIPOACTIVIDAD GLANDULAR Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO DE LA TASA METAB\\u00d3LICA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE SYNERGY: IF WEIGHT ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PITUITARY \\/ ADRENALS] (REF 623) AXIS TO ADDRESS CORTICOSTEROID AND STRESS-RELATED METABOLIC FACTORS. FOR CASES INVOLVING EMOTIONAL TRIGGERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ THYROID] (REF 621) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN MANAGING FLUID RETENTION OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THYROID DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(SINERGIA ENDOCRINA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE PESO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PITUITARIA \\/ SUPRARRENALES] (REF 623) PARA ABORDAR LOS CORTICOSTEROIDES Y LOS FACTORES METAB\\u00d3LICOS RELACIONADOS CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISPARADORES EMOCIONALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ TIROIDES] (REF 621). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN EL MANEJO DE LA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS A MENUDO ASOCIADA CON LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N TIROIDEA.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/620','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:30:50','2026-04-28 14:30:50'),(4416,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',621,'{\"symptoms\":\"TIRED, FATIGUE, DROWSINESS, SEXUAL AND LABOR APATHY, GASTRITIS. (CANSANCIO, FATIGA, SOMNOLENCIA, APAT\\u00cdA SEXUAL Y LABORAL, GASTRITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY SEX, BLOOD, KISSING, DRINKING FROM A CONTAMINATED GLASS ETC. HEPATITIS B. (TRANSMITIDO POR RELACIONES SEXUALES, SANGRE, BESOS, BEBER DE UN VASO CONTAMINADO, ETC. HEPATITIS B.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: CHANGE TOOTHBRUSH AND CHECK THE WHOLE FAMILY. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: CAMBIAR EL CEPILLO DE DIENTES Y REVISAR A TODA LA FAMILIA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE, DROWSINESS, SEXUAL AND LABOR APATHY, AND GASTRITIS.\\n\\n(CANSANCIO, FATIGA, SOMNOLENCIA, APAT\\u00cdA SEXUAL Y LABORAL, Y GASTRITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE HEPATITIS B VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT PLEURA AND THE LIVER. HEPATITIS B IS A SERIOUS LIVER INFECTION THAT CAN BECOME CHRONIC, INCREASING THE RISK OF LIVER FAILURE, LIVER CANCER, OR CIRRHOSIS. THIS RESET IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR ADDRESSING THE VIRAL LOAD WHICH CAN BE TRANSMITTED THROUGH SEXUAL CONTACT, BLOOD, KISSING, OR SHARING CONTAMINATED ITEMS SUCH AS GLASSES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE GOAL IS TO HALT VIRAL REPLICATION, DECREASE LIVER TISSUE INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORE SYSTEMIC VITALITY, HELPING THE BODY RECOVER FROM THE CHRONIC FATIGUE AND APATHY ASSOCIATED WITH THIS PATHOLOGY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA HEPATITIS B MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PLEURA DERECHA Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. LA HEPATITIS B ES UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA GRAVE QUE PUEDE VOLVERSE CR\\u00d3NICA, AUMENTANDO EL RIESGO DE FALLA HEP\\u00c1TICA, C\\u00c1NCER DE H\\u00cdGADO O CIRROSIS. ESTE REINICIO ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA ABORDAR LA CARGA VIRAL QUE PUEDE TRANSMITIRSE POR CONTACTO SEXUAL, SANGRE, BESOS O COMPARTIR OBJETOS CONTAMINADOS COMO VASOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL OBJETIVO ES DETENER LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL, DISMINUIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO HEP\\u00c1TICO Y RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA, AYUDANDO AL CUERPO A RECUPERARSE DE LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA Y LA APAT\\u00cdA ASOCIADAS CON ESTA PATOLOG\\u00cdA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CAUTION: IT IS STRONGLY RECOMMENDED TO CHANGE THE TOOTHBRUSH AND CHECK THE ENTIRE FAMILY TO PREVENT RE-INFECTION OR CONTAGION. IF FATIGUE OR LIVER DISTRESS PERSISTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING JOINT PAIN OR AUTOIMMUNE MANIFESTATIONS, SCAN THE [COSTAL MARGIN \\/ LIVER] (REF 182) AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS SUCH AS BORRELIA.\\n\\n(PRECAUCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE CAMBIAR EL CEPILLO DE DIENTES Y REVISAR A TODA LA FAMILIA PARA EVITAR LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N O EL CONTAGIO. SI LA FATIGA O EL MALESTAR HEP\\u00c1TICO PERSISTEN, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR O MANIFESTACIONES AUTOINMUNES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [MARGEN COSTAL \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 182) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS COMO LA BORRELIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/621','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:32:26','2026-04-28 14:32:26'),(4417,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',622,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GENERAL MALAISE, POTENTIAL ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, AND HIDDEN BACTERIAL LOADS.\\n\\n(MALESTAR GENERAL, POSIBLES MOLESTIAS ABDOMINALES Y CARGAS BACTERIANAS OCULTAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES A SPECIFIC HIDEOUT FOR BACTERIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT PLEURA AND THE PERITONEUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE SEROUS MEMBRANE SURROUNDING THE RIGHT LUNG WITH THE LINING OF THE ABDOMINAL CAVITY. AS A RESERVOIR, THIS PAIR DOES NOT NECESSARILY REPRESENT AN ACTIVE INFECTION WITH SPECIFIC SYMPTOMS, BUT RATHER A STORAGE POINT WHERE BACTERIAL PATHOGENS CAN REMAIN DORMANT OR \\\"HIDDEN\\\" FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET EXPOSES THESE HIDDEN LOADS, ASSISTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN IDENTIFYING AND NEUTRALIZING THEM BEFORE THEY CAN MIGRATE OR CAUSE A SYSTEMIC OUTBREAK.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA UN REFUGIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA BACTERIAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PLEURA DERECHA Y EL PERITONEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA LA MEMBRANA SEROSA QUE RODEA EL PULM\\u00d3N DERECHO CON EL REVESTIMIENTO DE LA CAVIDAD ABDOMINAL. COMO RESERVORIO, ESTE PAR NO REPRESENTA NECESARIAMENTE UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N ACTIVA CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS, SINO M\\u00c1S BIEN UN PUNTO DE ALMACENAMIENTO DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS BACTERIANOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES O \\\"OCULTOS\\\" PARA EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO EXPONE ESTAS CARGAS OCULTAS, AYUDANDO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A IDENTIFICARLAS Y NEUTRALIZARLAS ANTES DE QUE PUEDAN MIGRAR O CAUSAR UN BROTE SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BACTERIAL CHECK: IF BACTERIAL SYMPTOMS ARE SUSPECTED OR PERSIST AFTER CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR, SCAN THE [PERITONEUM \\/ PERITONEUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT ACTIVE LOCALIZED INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING RESPIRATORY TIGHTNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AS THEY ARE RELEASED FROM THE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA: SI SE SOSPECHAN S\\u00cdNTOMAS BACTERIANOS O ESTOS PERSISTEN DESPU\\u00c9S DE LIMP\\u00cdAR ESTE RESERVORIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PERITONEO \\/ PERITONEO] PARA DESCARTAR INFECCIONES LOCALIZADAS ACTIVAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN OPRESI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS A MEDIDA QUE SE LIBERAN DEL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/622','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:33:41','2026-04-28 14:33:41'),(4418,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',623,'{\"origins\":\"STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS CUAG\",\"symptoms\":\"FIBRIN CLOTS, ARRHYTHMIAS, DEPRESSION, ANXIETY. (CO\\u00c1GULOS DE FIBRINA, ARRITMIAS, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, ANSIEDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, BRONCHIAL AND PLEURA DISORDERS, APPENDICITIS, CARDIO DISORDERS. (ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, TRASTORNOS BRONQUIALES Y DE LA PLEURA, APENDICITIS, TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PERICARDIUM\\/PERICARDIUM (REVISAR - PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAG+ (STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS CUAG)\",\"symptoms\":\"FIBRIN CLOTS, ARRHYTHMIAS, DEPRESSION, ANXIETY, AND PANIC ATTACKS.\\n\\n(CO\\u00c1GULOS DE FIBRINA, ARRITMIAS, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, ANSIEDAD Y ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PLEURA AND THE APPENDIX. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS PARTICULARLY AGGRESSIVE AS IT CAN SECRETE COAGULASE, AN ENZYME THAT TRIGGER THE FORMATION OF FIBRIN CLOTS, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO CARDIOVASCULAR DISORDERS OR EMBOLISMS. BEYOND PHYSICAL IMPACTS LIKE APPENDICITIS OR BRONCHIAL DISORDERS, THIS BACTERIA IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO SEVERE EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, INCLUDING SUDDEN ANXIETY AND DEPRESSION. IN CHRONIC CASES, IT IS ASSOCIATED WITH DEGENERATIVE CONDITIONS SUCH AS MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PLEURA Y EL AP\\u00c9NDICE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES PARTICULARMENTE AGRESIVO YA QUE PUEDE SECRETAR COAGULASA, UNA ENZIMA QUE DESENCADENA LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE CO\\u00c1GULOS DE FIBRINA, LO QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A TRASTORNOS CARDIOVASCULARES O EMBOLIAS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS IMPACTOS F\\u00cdSICOS COMO LA APENDICITIS O LOS TRASTORNOS BRONQUIALES, ESTA BACTERIA SE VINCULA CON FRECUENCIA A UNA ANGUSTIA EMOCIONAL SEVERA, INCLUYENDO ANSIEDAD REPENTINA Y DEPRESI\\u00d3N. EN CASOS CR\\u00d3NICOS, SE ASOCIA CON CONDICIONES DEGENERATIVAS COMO LA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CARDIOVASCULAR CHECK: IF ARRHYTHMIAS OR CHEST DISCOMFORT PERSIST, SCAN THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT CARDIAC INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE TO BALANCE NEUROLOGICAL VOLTAGE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF TOXINS RELEASED BY THE STAPHYLOCOCCUS BACTERIA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CARDIOVASCULAR: SI PERSISTEN LAS ARRITMIAS O LAS MOLESTIAS EN EL PECHO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA DIRECTA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA EQUILIBRAR EL VOLTAJE NEUROL\\u00d3GICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS LIBERADAS POR LA BACTERIA STAPHYLOCOCCUS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/623','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:35:11','2026-04-28 14:35:11'),(4419,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',624,'{\"origins\":\"PLEURITIS\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMED LINING IN THE LUNG. THORACIC PAIN, FEVER, DRY COUGH. (REVESTIMIENTO INFLAMADO EN EL PULM\\u00d3N. DOLOR TOR\\u00c1CICO, FIEBRE, TOS SECA.)\",\"paths\":\"PLEURISY, ASTHMA, RHEUMATISM. IT CAN DAMAGE THE THYMUS AND AFFECT THE HEART. (PLEURES\\u00cdA, ASMA, REUMATISMO. PUEDE DA\\u00d1AR EL TIMO Y AFECTAR EL CORAZ\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER VIRUSES, IT CAN PRODUCE INFILTRATION AND OF THE PLEURA. (ASOCIADO CON OTROS VIRUS, PUEDE PRODUCIR INFILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LA PLEURA.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"PLEURITIS (PLEURES\\u00cdA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMED LINING IN THE LUNG, THORACIC PAIN, FEVER, AND DRY COUGH.\\n\\n(REVESTIMIENTO INFLAMADO EN EL PULM\\u00d3N, DOLOR TOR\\u00c1CICO, FIEBRE Y TOS SECA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES PLEURITIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE PLEURAL MEMBRANES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING INFLAMMATION OF THE LINING SURROUNDING THE LUNGS. AN IMBALANCE HERE IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH CONDITIONS SUCH AS ASTHMA AND RHEUMATISM. IF LEFT UNADDRESSED, THE VIRAL LOAD CAN CAUSE SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS, POTENTIALLY DAMAGING THE THYMUS GLAND AND AFFECTING HEART FUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE, EASING RESPIRATORY EFFORT, AND PROTECTING ADJACENT THORACIC ORGANS FROM SECONDARY STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL ABORDA LA PLEURES\\u00cdA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS MEMBRANAS PLEURALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL REVESTIMIENTO QUE RODEA LOS PULMONES. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON CONDICIONES COMO EL ASMA Y EL REUMATISMO. SI NO SE ABORDA, LA CARGA VIRAL PUEDE CAUSAR COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS, DA\\u00d1ANDO POTENCIALMENTE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIMO Y AFECTANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REDUCIR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA, FACILITAR EL ESFUERZO RESPIRATORIO Y PROTEGER LOS \\u00d3RGANOS TOR\\u00c1CICOS ADYACENTES DEL ESTR\\u00c9S SECUNDARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: THIS PAIR IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER VIRUSES; MONITOR FOR POTENTIAL INFILTRATION OF THE PLEURA. IF THORACIC PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT CARDIAC INVOLVEMENT. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC COUGH, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE RESPIRATORY LINING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON OTROS VIRUS; MONITOREAR UNA POSIBLE INFILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LA PLEURA. SI EL DOLOR TOR\\u00c1CICO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO] PARA DESCARTAR AFECTACI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL REVESTIMIENTO RESPIRATORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/624','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:36:20','2026-04-28 14:36:20'),(4420,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',625,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER AND CHILLS, BODY ACHES, LIGHTHEADEDNESS, RAPID PULSE AND BREATHING, NAUSEA AND VOMITING, DIARRHEA, DECREASED URINATION. (FIEBRE Y ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, DOLORES CORPORALES, MAREO, PULSO Y RESPIRACI\\u00d3N R\\u00c1PIDOS, N\\u00c1USEAS Y V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA, DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE LA ORINA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED IN HEALTHCARE SETTINGS, BY IMPROPER HYGIENE. SKIN INFECTION, PNEUMONIA, NEAR FATAL ASTHMA, UNCONSCIOUSNESS AND SUDDEN-DEATH AND CHILDREN. (TRANSMITIDO EN ENTORNOS SANITARIOS, POR HIGIENE INADECUADA. INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL, NEUMON\\u00cdA, ASMA CASI MORTAL, INCONSCIENCIA Y MUERTE S\\u00daBITA EN NI\\u00d1OS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RECTUM     CHECK - ADRENALS\\/LUNG (REVISAR - RECTO     REVISAR - SUPRARRENALES\\/PULM\\u00d3N)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER AND CHILLS, BODY ACHES, LIGHTHEADEDNESS, RAPID PULSE AND BREATHING, NAUSEA AND VOMITING, DIARRHEA, AND DECREASED URINATION.\\n\\n(FIEBRE Y ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, DOLORES CORPORALES, MAREO, PULSO Y RESPIRACI\\u00d3N R\\u00c1PIDOS, N\\u00c1USEAS Y V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA Y DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE LA ORINA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ON THE SAME SIDE OF THE PLEURAL CAVITY. OFTEN TRANSMITTED IN HEALTHCARE SETTINGS OR THROUGH IMPROPER HYGIENE, THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY OPPORTUNISTIC. IT CAN LEAD TO SEVERE CONDITIONS SUCH AS SKIN INFECTIONS, PNEUMONIA, AND NEAR-FATAL ASTHMA. IN EXTREME CASES, ESPECIALLY IN CHILDREN, IT IS ASSOCIATED WITH UNCONSCIOUSNESS AND SUDDEN DEATH. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PREVENTING SYSTEMIC SPREAD, AND PROTECTING RESPIRATORY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL MISMO LADO DE LA CAVIDAD PLEURAL. A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO EN ENTORNOS SANITARIOS O POR UNA HIGIENE INADECUADA, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE OPORTUNISTA. PUEDE CONDUCIR A CONDICIONES GRAVES COMO INFECCIONES DE LA PIEL, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y ASMA CASI MORTAL. EN CASOS EXTREMOS, ESPECIALMENTE EN NI\\u00d1OS, SE ASOCIA CON LA INCONSCIENCIA Y LA MUERTE S\\u00daBITA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PROTEGIENDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [RECTUM \\/ RECTUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT INTESTINAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENALS \\/ LUNG] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT CORTICOSTEROID REGULATION AND PULMONARY VITALITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RECTO \\/ RECTO] PARA DESCARTAR RESERVORIOS INTESTINALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SUPRARRENALES \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE CORTICOSTEROIDES Y LA VITALIDAD PULMONAR. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/625','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:37:23','2026-04-28 14:37:23'),(4421,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',626,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, STUTTERING AND DYSLEXIA. (MAREOS, TARTAMUDEO Y DISLEXIA.)\",\"paths\":\"VERTIGO\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EQUILIBRIUM RESET (REINICIO DE EQUILIBRIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, STUTTERING, DYSLEXIA, AND VERTIGO.\\n\\n(MAREOS, TARTAMUDEO, DISLEXIA Y V\\u00c9RTIGO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES NEUROLOGICAL AND SENSORY DISORIENTATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE VESTIBULAR AND BRAINSTEM SYSTEMS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR REESTABLISHING THE BODY\'S CENTER OF GRAVITY AND SPATIAL AWARENESS. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS VERTIGO OR DIZZINESS, AS THE BRAIN STRUGGLES TO PROCESS POSITIONAL DATA. ADDITIONALLY, THIS CIRCUIT IS LINKED TO COGNITIVE AND SPEECH COORDINATION; DISTORTIONS CAN INTERFERE WITH THE FLUIDITY OF LANGUAGE (STUTTERING) OR THE INTERPRETATION OF WRITTEN SYMBOLS (DYSLEXIA). BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING VESTIBULAR IRRITATION, ALIGNING NEUROLOGICAL SIGNALING, AND RESTORING BALANCE TO BOTH PHYSICAL MOVEMENT AND COGNITIVE PROCESSING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y SENSORIAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LOS SISTEMAS VESTIBULAR Y DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REESTABLECER EL CENTRO DE GRAVEDAD Y LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL DEL CUERPO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO V\\u00c9RTIGO O MAREOS, YA QUE EL CEREBRO TIENE DIFICULTADES PARA PROCESAR LOS DATOS POSICIONALES. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA Y DEL HABLA; LAS DISTORSIONES PUEDEN INTERFERIR CON LA FLUIDEZ DEL LENGUAJE (TARTAMUDEO) O LA INTERPRETACI\\u00d3N DE S\\u00cdMBOLOS ESCRITOS (DISLEXIA). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N VESTIBULAR, ALINEAR LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO TANTO EN EL MOVIMIENTO F\\u00cdSICO COMO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO COGNITIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VESTIBULAR CHECK: IF DIZZINESS OR VERTIGO PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS TO RULE OUT INNER EAR INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE COGNITIVE OR SPEECH CHALLENGES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT AUDITORY AND LANGUAGE CENTERS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE DURING THE CORRECTION OF NEUROLOGICAL VOLTAGE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VESTIBULAR: SI EL MAREO O EL V\\u00c9RTIGO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES] PARA DESCARTAR INFECCIONES DEL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DESAF\\u00cdOS COGNITIVOS O DEL HABLA SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA APOYAR LOS CENTROS AUDITIVOS Y DEL LENGUAJE. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE LA CORRECCI\\u00d3N DEL VOLTAJE NEUROL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/626','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:38:32','2026-04-28 14:38:32'),(4422,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',627,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUCUS MEMBRANE ULCERS AND IRRITATIONS. ALOPECIA. (MALASSEZIA GLOBOSA\\n\\n\\u00daLCERAS E IRRITACIONES DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS. ALOPECIA.)\",\"paths\":\"DANDRUFF, GLAUCOMA, LIVER DISFUNCTION. (CASPA, GLAUCOMA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW (CASPA, GLAUCOMA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA.\\n\\nREVISAR - CODO \\/ CODO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DANDRUFF, GLAUCOMA, LIVER DYSFUNCTION, AND MUCUS MEMBRANE ULCERS.\\n\\n(CASPA, GLAUCOMA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y \\u00daLCERAS EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS MALASSEZIA GLOBOSA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE POPLITEAL FOSSA (BEHIND THE KNEE) AND THE GLUTEUS ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS PRIMARILY KNOWN FOR CAUSING SCALP CONDITIONS LIKE SEVERE DANDRUFF, BUT ITS IMPACT EXTENDS SYSTEMICALLY. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN AFFECT OCULAR PRESSURE (CONTRIBUTING TO GLAUCOMA) AND INTERFERE WITH LIVER FUNCTION. ADDITIONALLY, THIS FUNGUS CAN CAUSE IRRITATION AND ULCERATION OF VARIOUS MUCUS MEMBRANES THROUGHOUT THE BODY. BY STABILIZING THIS DIAGONAL AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGAL LOAD, RESTORING DERMATOLOGICAL HEALTH, AND RELIEVING PRESSURE WITHIN THE VISUAL AND HEPATIC SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE A LA MALASSEZIA GLOBOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA FOSA POPL\\u00cdTEA (DETR\\u00c1S DE LA RODILLA) Y EL GL\\u00daTEO DEL LADO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES CONOCIDO PRINCIPALMENTE POR CAUSAR CONDICIONES DEL CUERO CABELLUDO COMO CASPA SEVERA, PERO SU IMPACTO SE EXTIENDE DE MANERA SIST\\u00c9MICA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE AFECTAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N OCULAR (CONTRIBUYENDO AL GLAUCOMA) E INTERFERIR CON LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE HONGO PUEDE CAUSAR IRRITACI\\u00d3N Y ULCERACI\\u00d3N DE DIVERSAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS EN TODO EL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE DIAGONAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, RESTAURAR LA SALUD DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA Y ALIVIAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N DENTRO DE LOS SISTEMAS VISUAL Y HEP\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL CHECK: IF DANDRUFF OR OCULAR PRESSURE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER FUNGAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SIGNIFICANT LIVER DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF FUNGAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA: SI LA CASPA O LA PRESI\\u00d3N OCULAR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CODO \\/ CODO] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS COINFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN MALESTAR HEP\\u00c1TICO SIGNIFICATIVO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/627','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:39:36','2026-04-28 14:39:36'),(4423,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',628,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HERPES 8\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LATENT VIRAL LOADS, POTENTIAL SKIN LESIONS, AND IMMUNE SYSTEM SUPPRESSION.\\n\\n(CARGAS VIRALES LATENTES, POSIBLES LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y SUPRESI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES A SPECIFIC HIDEOUT FOR THE HERPES 8 VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE POPLITEAL FOSSA (BEHIND THE KNEE) AND THE INGUINAL REGION ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS DIAGONAL AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR EXPOSING VIRUSES THAT \\\"HIDE\\\" FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM WITHIN THE LYMPHATIC AND SOFT TISSUE STRUCTURES. HERPES 8 IS COMMONLY ASSOCIATED WITH KAPOSI\'S SARCOMA AND OTHER VASCULAR PROLIFERATIONS. AS A RESERVOIR, THIS PAIR MAY NOT PRESENT ACTIVE SYMPTOMS BUT SERVES AS A STORAGE POINT THAT CAN TRIGGER OUTBREAKS UNDER STRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN IDENTIFYING AND NEUTRALIZING THE LATENT VIRAL LOAD BEFORE IT CAN MANIFEST CLINICALLY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA UN REFUGIO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA EL VIRUS HERPES 8 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA FOSA POPL\\u00cdTEA (DETR\\u00c1S DE LA RODILLA) Y LA REGI\\u00d3N INGUINAL DEL LADO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE DIAGONAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EXPONER VIRUS QUE SE \\\"ESCONDEN\\\" DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO DENTRO DE LAS ESTRUCTURAS LINF\\u00c1TICAS Y DE TEJIDOS BLANDOS. EL HERPES 8 SE ASOCIA COM\\u00daNMENTE CON EL SARCOMA DE KAPOSI Y OTRAS PROLIFERACIONES VASCULARES. COMO RESERVORIO, ES POSIBLE QUE ESTE PAR NO PRESENTE S\\u00cdNTOMAS ACTIVOS, SINO QUE SIRVA COMO UN PUNTO DE ALMACENAMIENTO QUE PUEDE DESENCADENAR BROTES BAJO ESTR\\u00c9S. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A IDENTIFICAR Y NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL LATENTE ANTES DE QUE PUEDA MANIFESTARSE CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: IF ACTIVE LESIONS OR SKIN ISSUES PERSIST AFTER CLEARING THIS RESERVOIR, SCAN THE [INGUINAL \\/ INGUINAL] AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED VIRAL ACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IMMUNE DEFICIENCY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS RELEASED DURING THE RESET.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: SI LAS LESIONES ACTIVAS O LOS PROBLEMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS PERSISTEN DESPU\\u00c9S DE LIMPIAR ESTE RESERVORIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [INGUINAL \\/ INGUINAL] PARA DESCARTAR ACTIVIDAD VIRAL LOCALIZADA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA INMUNODEFICIENCIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ TIMO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES LIBERADOS DURANTE EL REINICIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/628','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:40:39','2026-04-28 14:40:39'),(4424,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',629,'{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN AND BLOATING, CONSTIPATION, AND FEVER. (DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"PNEUMONIA (NEUMON\\u00cdA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN AND BLOATING, CONSTIPATION, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS PNEUMONIAE (PNEUMOCOCCUS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE POPLITEAL FOSSAE (BEHIND THE KNEES). WHILE COMMONLY ASSOCIATED WITH RESPIRATORY ISSUES LIKE PNEUMONIA, THIS PATHOGEN CAN ALSO IMPACT THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, LEADING TO SIGNIFICANT ABDOMINAL DISTENSION AND CONSTIPATION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BILATERAL AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL LOAD THAT CAUSES INFLAMMATION IN BOTH THE PULMONARY AND INTESTINAL LININGS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA, REDUCING FEBRILE RESPONSES, AND RESTORING NORMAL GASTROINTESTINAL MOTILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL STREPTOCOCCUS PNEUMONIAE (NEUMOCOCO) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS FOSAS POPL\\u00cdTEAS (DETR\\u00c1S DE LAS RODILLAS). SI BIEN SE ASOCIA COM\\u00daNMENTE CON PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS COMO LA NEUMON\\u00cdA, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE AFECTAR EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, PROVOCANDO UNA DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL SIGNIFICATIVA Y ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE BILATERAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REDUCIR LA CARGA BACTERIANA SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE CAUSA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N TANTO EN EL REVESTIMIENTO PULMONAR COMO EN EL INTESTINAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA, REDUCIENDO LAS RESPUESTAS FEBRILES Y RESTAURANDO LA MOTILIDAD GASTROINTESTINAL NORMAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF PULMONARY SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS TO ADDRESS DIRECT TISSUE INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL PRESSURE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ASCENDING COLON \\/ DESCENDING COLON] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY FROM PNEUMOCOCCAL INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS PULMONARES PRESENTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DIRECTA DEL TEJIDO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PRESI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N POR NEUMOCOCO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/629','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:41:39','2026-04-28 14:41:39'),(4425,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',630,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUCOSAL LINING INFECTION, THRUSH, VAGINAL INFECTIONS, CYSTITIS. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA, CANDIDIASIS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"CANDIDIASIS. HIV (CANDIDIASIS. VIH)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW CHECK - RING FINGER\\/RING FINGER \\n(REVISAR - CODO \\/ CODO\\nREVISAR - DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUCOSAL LINING INFECTION, THRUSH, VAGINAL INFECTIONS, AND CYSTITIS.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA, CANDIDIASIS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES Y CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS CANDIDA GLABRATA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PORTAL VEIN AND THE ACHILLES TENDON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC CANDIDIASIS, WHICH OFTEN FLOURISHES IN INDIVIDUALS WITH COMPROMISED IMMUNE SYSTEMS OR THOSE WITH CHRONIC VIRAL LOADS SUCH AS HIV. UNLIKE OTHER CANDIDA SPECIES, GLABRATA IS HIGHLY RESISTANT TO COMMON TREATMENTS AND CAN CAUSE PERSISTENT INFECTIONS IN THE MUCOAL LININGS OF THE MOUTH (THRUSH), VAGINAL TRACT, AND BLADDER (CYSTITIS). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN CONTROLLING FUNGAL OVERGROWTH AND RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE BODY\'S PROTECTIVE MUCOSAL BARRIERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE A LA CANDIDA GLABRATA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VENA PORTA Y EL TEND\\u00d3N DE AQUILES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA CANDIDIASIS SIST\\u00c9MICA, QUE A MENUDO FLORECE EN PERSONAS CON SISTEMAS INMUNITARIOS COMPROMETIDOS O AQUELLAS CON CARGAS VIRALES CR\\u00d3NICAS COMO EL VIH. A DIFERENCIA DE OTRAS ESPECIES DE CANDIDA, LA GLABRATA ES ALTAMENTE RESISTENTE A LOS TRATAMIENTOS COMUNES Y PUEDE CAUSAR INFECCIONES PERSISTENTES EN LOS REVESTIMIENTOS MUCOSOS DE LA BOCA (MUGET), EL TRACTO VAGINAL Y LA VEJIGA (CISTITIS). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A CONTROLAR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO Y A RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DE LAS BARRERAS MUCOSAS PROTECTORAS DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL CHECK: IF MUCOSAL SYMPTOMS OR CYSTITIS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] OR [RING FINGER \\/ RING FINGER] AXES TO RULE OUT OTHER FUNGAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IMMUNE SUPPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF FUNGAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS MUCOSOS O LA CISTITIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [CODO \\/ CODO] O [DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS COINFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA INMUNOSUPRESI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ TIMO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS LIBERADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/630','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:42:39','2026-04-28 14:42:39'),(4426,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',631,'{\"origins\":\"PAPILLOMA\",\"symptoms\":\"WARTS, GENITAL SORES. (VERRUGAS, \\u00daLCERAS GENITALES)\",\"paths\":\"HUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS (VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO (VPH))\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PAPILLOMA (PAPILOMA)\",\"symptoms\":\"WARTS, GENITAL SORES, AND POTENTIAL PELVIC DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(VERRUGAS, \\u00daLCERAS GENITALES Y POSIBLES MOLESTIAS P\\u00c9LVICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE HUMAN PAPILLOMAVIRUS (HPV) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PORTAL VEIN AND THE COLON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING VIRAL LOADS THAT MANIFEST AS WARTS OR EPITHELIAL LESIONS, PARTICULARLY IN THE GENITAL OR ANAL REGIONS. THE PORTAL VEIN, WHICH CARRIES BLOOD FROM THE GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT TO THE LIVER, ACTS AS A SYSTEMIC CONDUIT, WHILE THE COLON POINT ADDRESSES THE LOCALIZED VIRAL EXPRESSION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL REPLICATION AND SUPPORTING THE RESOLUTION OF SKIN AND MUCOSAL MANIFESTATIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO (VPH) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VENA PORTA Y EL COLON. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR CARGAS VIRALES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO VERRUGAS O LESIONES EPITELIALES, PARTICULARMENTE EN LAS REGIONES GENITAL O ANAL. LA VENA PORTA, QUE TRANSPORTA SANGRE DESDE EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL HASTA EL H\\u00cdGADO, ACT\\u00daA COMO UN CONDUCTO SIST\\u00c9MICO, MIENTRAS QUE EL PUNTO DEL COLON ABORDA LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N VIRAL LOCALIZADA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL Y A APOYAR LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LAS MANIFESTACIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y MUCOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL SYNERGY: IF GENITAL WARTS PERSIST, SCAN THE [URETER \\/ URETER] OR [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXES TO RULE OUT OTHER VIRAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PORTAL VEIN \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE TO ENSURE HEPATIC CLEARANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(SINERGIA VIRAL: SI LAS VERRUGAS GENITALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER] O [VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS COINFECCIONES VIRALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VENA PORTA \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/631','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:43:48','2026-04-28 14:43:48'),(4427,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',632,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUCOSAL LINING INFECTION, THRUSH, VAGINAL INFECTIONS, CYSTITIS. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA, CANDIDIASIS ORAL, INFECCIONES VAGINALES, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"CANDIDIASIS. HIV (CANDIDIASIS. VIH)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW CHECK - RING FINGER\\/RING FINGER (CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW CHECK - RING FINGER\\/RING FINGER)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUCOSAL LINING INFECTION, THRUSH, VAGINAL INFECTIONS, AND CYSTITIS.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA, CANDIDIASIS ORAL, INFECCIONES VAGINALES Y CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PAPILLOMA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PORTAL VEIN AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC VIRAL LOADS THAT WEAKEN THE IMMUNE SYSTEM, OFTEN CREATING AN ENVIRONMENT CONDUCIVE TO OPPORTUNISTIC INFECTIONS. A DISRUPTION IN THIS PATHWAY IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO CHRONIC CANDIDIASIS AND MAY BE OBSERVED IN CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IMMUNE SUPPRESSION OR HIV. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE LIVER IN ITS VITAL FILTRATION ROLE, CLEARING VIRAL DEBRIS FROM THE PORTAL CIRCULATION AND RESTORING THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO DEFEND ITS MUCOSAL BARRIERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VENA PORTA Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR CARGAS VIRALES SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE DEBILITAN EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO, A MENUDO CREANDO UN AMBIENTE PROPICIO PARA INFECCIONES OPORTUNISTAS. UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N EN ESTA V\\u00cdA SE VINCULA CON FRECUENCIA A LA CANDIDIASIS CR\\u00d3NICA Y PUEDE OBSERVARSE EN CASOS QUE INVOLUCRAN UNA INMUNOSUPRESI\\u00d3N SEVERA O VIH. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL H\\u00cdGADO EN SU FUNCI\\u00d3N VITAL DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N, ELIMINANDO LOS RESTOS VIRALES DE LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N PORTAL Y RESTAURANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA DEFENDER SUS BARRERAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL CHECK: IF MUCOSAL INFECTIONS OR THRUSH PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] OR [RING FINGER \\/ RING FINGER] AXES TO RULE OUT DEEP-SEATED FUNGAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT PELVIC DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PORTAL VEIN \\/ COLON] (REF 639) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA: SI LAS INFECCIONES DE LA MUCOSA O LA CANDIDIASIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [CODO \\/ CODO] O [DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR] PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS PROFUNDAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MOLESTIAS P\\u00c9LVICAS PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VENA PORTA \\/ COLON] (REF 639). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/632','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:44:52','2026-04-28 14:44:52'),(4428,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',633,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUCOSAL LINING INFECTION, THRUSH, VAGINAL INFECTIONS, CYSTITIS. (INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA, CANDIDIASIS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"CANDIDIASIS. HIV (CANDIDIASIS. VIH)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW CHECK - RING FINGER\\/RING FINGER (CHECK - ELBOW\\/ELBOW CHECK - RING FINGER\\/RING FINGER)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUCOSAL LINING INFECTION, THRUSH, VAGINAL INFECTIONS, AND CYSTITIS.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA MUCOSA, CANDIDIASIS, INFECCIONES VAGINALES Y CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PAPILLOMA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PORTAL VEIN AND THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS STRONGLY ASSOCIATED WITH SYSTEMIC CANDIDIASIS AND MAY BE LINKED TO CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IMMUNE SUPPRESSION OR HIV. THE DYSFUNCTION OF THIS CIRCUIT INTERFERES WITH THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO MANAGE OPPORTUNISTIC FUNGAL OVERGROWTH, LEADING TO PERSISTENT INFECTIONS OF THE MUCOSAL MEMBRANES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RESTORING IMMUNE VIGILANCE, CLEARING VIRAL INTERFERENCE FROM THE METABOLIC PATHWAY, AND SUPPORTING THE SYSTEMIC DEFENSE AGAINST FUNGAL COLONIZATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VENA PORTA Y EL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 FUERTEMENTE ASOCIADO CON LA CANDIDIASIS SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A CASOS QUE INVOLUCRAN UNA INMUNOSUPRESI\\u00d3N SEVERA O VIH. LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE ESTE CIRCUITO INTERFIERE CON LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA MANEJAR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO OPORTUNISTA, LO QUE CONDUCE A INFECCIONES PERSISTENTES DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA, ELIMINANDO LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL DE LA V\\u00cdA METAB\\u00d3LICA Y APOYANDO LA DEFENSA SIST\\u00c9MICA CONTRA LA COLONIZACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL CHECK: IF THRUSH OR MUCOSAL INFECTIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ELBOW \\/ ELBOW] OR [RING FINGER \\/ RING FINGER] AXES TO RULE OUT OTHER DEEP-SEATED FUNGAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR METABOLIC CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PORTAL VEIN \\/ LIVER] (REF 640) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL AND FUNGAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA: SI LA CANDIDIASIS O LAS INFECCIONES MUCOSAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [CODO \\/ CODO] O [DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS COINFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS PROFUNDAS. PARA PREOCUPACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VENA PORTA \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 640). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES Y F\\u00daNGICOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/633','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:45:54','2026-04-28 14:45:54'),(4429,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',634,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRUE PARKINSON\'S (P\\u00c1RKINSON VERDADERO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"NEURODEGENERATIVE DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N NEURODEGENERATIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"TREMORS, RIGIDITY, BRADYKINESIA (SLOW MOVEMENT), POSTURAL INSTABILITY, AND COORDINATION LOSS.\\n\\n(TEMBLORES, RIGIDEZ, BRADICINESIA (MOVIMIENTO LENTO), INESTABILIDAD POSTURAL Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES TRUE PARKINSON\'S DISEASE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE POST PINEAL AREA AND THE MEDULLA (MYELENCEPHALON). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REESTABLISHING THE PROPER DOPAMINERGIC SIGNALING WITHIN THE BASAL GANGLIA AND THE BRAINSTEM. AN IMBALANCE HERE INTERFERES WITH THE CENTRAL COMMAND OVER MOTOR FUNCTIONS, LEADING TO THE CHARACTERISTIC TREMORS AND MUSCLE RIGIDITY ASSOCIATED WITH PARKINSON\'S. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING NEUROLOGICAL INFLAMMATION, IMPROVING THE TRANSMISSION OF NERVE IMPULSES, AND RESTORING BALANCE TO THE MOTOR CONTROL CENTERS OF THE BRAIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL P\\u00c1RKINSON VERDADERO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00c1REA POST-PINEAL Y LA M\\u00c9DULA (MIELENC\\u00c9FALO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REESTABLECER LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N DOPAMIN\\u00c9RGICA ADECUADA DENTRO DE LOS GANGLIOS BASALES Y EL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd INTERFIERE CON EL MANDO CENTRAL SOBRE LAS FUNCIONES MOTORAS, LO QUE CONDUCE A LOS TEMBLORES CARACTER\\u00cdSTICOS Y LA RIGIDEZ MUSCULAR ASOCIADOS CON EL P\\u00c1RKINSON. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA, MEJORANDO LA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N DE LOS IMPULSOS NERVIOSOS Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO EN LOS CENTROS DE CONTROL MOTOR DEL CEREBRO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF TREMORS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS CORTICAL VOLTAGE. FOR CASES INVOLVING COORDINATION ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CEREBELLUM \\/ CEREBELLUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS DURING THE RECOVERY OF CENTRAL NEUROLOGICAL REGULATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS TEMBLORES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA ABORDAR EL VOLTAJE CORTICAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CEREBELO \\/ CEREBELO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA CENTRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/634','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:47:01','2026-04-28 14:47:01'),(4430,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',635,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"COMPULSIVE LIES (MENTIRAS COMPULSIVAS)\",\"paths\":\"MORAL INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD MORAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MORAL RECTITUDE (RECTITUD MORAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"COMPULSIVE LIES AND SKEWED PERCEPTION OF TRUTH.\\n\\n(MENTIRAS COMPULSIVAS Y PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DISTORSIONADA DE LA VERDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CONCEPT OF MORAL INTEGRITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE POST-PINEAL REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ASSOCIATED WITH THE PSYCHOLOGICAL AND ETHICAL RECTITUDE OF THE INDIVIDUAL. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS A TENDENCY TOWARD COMPULSIVE LYING OR A DISCONNECTION FROM ONE\'S MORAL COMPASS. BY STABILIZING THIS LOCAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CLEARING ENERGETIC INTERFERENCE THAT MAY CLOUD JUDGMENT, HELPING TO RESTORE A SENSE OF TRUTH, PERSONAL ACCOUNTABILITY, AND PSYCHOLOGICAL ALIGNMENT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL CONCEPTO DE INTEGRIDAD MORAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N POST-PINEAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE ASOCIA CON LA RECTITUD PSICOL\\u00d3GICA Y \\u00c9TICA DEL INDIVIDUO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA TENDENCIA A LA MENTIRA COMPULSIVA O UNA DESCONEXI\\u00d3N DE LA BR\\u00daJULA MORAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO LOCAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LA INTERFERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE PUEDE NUBLAR EL JUICIO, AYUDANDO A RESTAURAR EL SENTIDO DE LA VERDAD, LA RESPONSABILIDAD PERSONAL Y EL ALINEAMIENTO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PSYCHOLOGICAL CHECK: IF COMPULSIVE BEHAVIORS PERSIST, SCAN THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS EXECUTIVE FUNCTION AND IMPULSE CONTROL. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT OVERALL GLANDULAR HARMONY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE DURING THE REBALANCE OF NEURO-PSYCHOLOGICAL VOLTAGE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS COMPORTAMIENTOS COMPULSIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] PARA ABORDAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA Y EL CONTROL DE IMPULSOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA ANGUSTIA EMOCIONAL PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA GLANDULAR GENERAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE EL REEQUILIBRIO DEL VOLTAJE NEUROPSICOL\\u00d3GICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/635','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:48:05','2026-04-28 14:48:05'),(4431,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',636,'{\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL AND MOTOR SKILL PROBLEMS. (PROBLEMAS DE CONDUCTA Y HABILIDADES MOTORAS)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY FECES OF ANIMALS. INTRACRANIAL TUMORS AND DAMAGE TO THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. (TRANSMITIDO POR HECES DE ANIMALES. TUMORES INTRACRANEALES Y DA\\u00d1O AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL AND MOTOR SKILL PROBLEMS.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE CONDUCTA Y HABILIDADES MOTORAS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY FECES OF ANIMALS. INTRACRANIAL TUMORS AND DAMAGE TO THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. (TRANSMITIDO POR HECES DE ANIMALES. TUMORES INTRACRANEALES Y DA\\u00d1O AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS AEROBACTER AEROGENES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE POST-POLE REGIONS OF THE CRANIUM. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH ANIMAL FECES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE BACTERIA CAN CROSS THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER, POTENTIALLY CAUSING DAMAGE TO THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. IF LEFT UNADDRESSED, THE CHRONIC INFLAMMATION AND TOXIC BYPRODUCTS PRODUCED BY THIS BACTERIA ARE ASSOCIATED WITH THE DEVELOPMENT OF INTRACRANIAL TUMORS AND SIGNIFICANT DISRUPTIONS IN COGNITIVE BEHAVIOR AND PHYSICAL COORDINATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND PROTECTING VITAL NEUROLOGICAL STRUCTURES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL AEROBACTER AEROGENES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS REGIONES DEL POST-POLO DEL CR\\u00c1NEO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO POR EL CONTACTO CON HECES DE ANIMALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE ATRAVESAR LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA, CAUSANDO POTENCIALMENTE DA\\u00d1O AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. SI NO SE ABORDA, LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA Y LOS SUBPRODUCTOS T\\u00d3XICOS PRODUCIDOS POR ESTA BACTERIA SE ASOCIAN CON EL DESARROLLO DE TUMORES INTRACRANEALES Y ALTERACIONES SIGNIFICATIVAS EN EL COMPORTAMIENTO COGNITIVO Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y PROTEGER LAS ESTRUCTURAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS VITALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF MOTOR SKILL ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [CEREBELLUM \\/ CEREBELLUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS COORDINATION CENTERS. FOR CASES INVOLVING BEHAVIORAL CHANGES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE TO BALANCE CORTICAL VOLTAGE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS PROBLEMAS DE HABILIDADES MOTORAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CEREBELO \\/ CEREBELO] PARA ABORDAR LOS CENTROS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CAMBIOS DE CONDUCTA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA EQUILIBRAR EL VOLTAJE CORTICAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/636','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:49:15','2026-04-28 14:49:15'),(4432,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',637,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SKIN SYMPTOMS (S\\u00cdNTOMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS)\",\"paths\":\"FALSE PSORIASIS (FALSA PSORIASIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RETROHEPATIC (REVISAR - RETROHEP\\u00c1TICO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"FALSE PSORIASIS (FALSA PSORIASIS)\",\"symptoms\":\"SKIN SYMPTOMS, RASHES, ITCHING, AND DERMATOLOGICAL IRRITATION.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNTOMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS, ERUPCIONES, PICAZ\\u00d3N E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA.\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CONDITION KNOWN AS \\\"FALSE PSORIASIS\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE POSTERIOR LOBE OF THE LIVER AND THE RIGHT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE CERTAIN PARASITES OR THEIR TOXINS CAN INTERFERE WITH HEPATIC FILTRATION AND RENAL ELIMINATION, CAUSING THE BODY TO EXPELL TOXIC WASTE THROUGH THE SKIN. THIS OFTEN MANIFESTS AS SKIN LESIONS THAT MIMIC PSORIASIS BUT ARE ACTUALLY DRIVEN BY AN INTERNAL BIOLOGICAL IMBALANCE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE LIVER AND KIDNEYS IN THEIR DETOXIFICATION ROLES, CLEARING THE PARASITIC LOAD AND ALLOWING THE SKIN TO HEAL FROM THE INSIDE OUT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA ABORDA LA CONDICI\\u00d3N CONOCIDA COMO \\\"FALSA PSORIASIS\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LOBULO POSTERIOR DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE CIERTOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS O SUS TOXINAS PUEDEN INTERFERIR CON LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL, HACIENDO QUE EL CUERPO EXPULSE DESECHOS T\\u00d3XICOS A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA PIEL. ESTO A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS QUE IMITAN LA PSORIASIS PERO QUE EN REALIDAD SON IMPULSADAS POR UN DESEQUILIBRIO BIOL\\u00d3GICO INTERNO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL H\\u00cdGADO Y A LOS RI\\u00d1ONES EN SUS FUNCIONES DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N, ELIMINANDO LA CARGA PARASITARIA Y PERMITIENDO QUE LA PIEL SANE DESDE ADENTRO HACIA AFUERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RETROHEPATIC CHECK: IF SKIN SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [RETROHEPATIC \\/ RETROHEPATIC] AXIS TO RULE OUT DEEP LIVER PARASITOSIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ITCHING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ KIDNEY - L] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN PROCESSING PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS AS THEY ARE RELEASED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RETROHEP\\u00c1TICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RETROHEP\\u00c1TICO \\/ RETROHEP\\u00c1TICO] PARA DESCARTAR PARASITOSIS HEP\\u00c1TICA PROFUNDA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PICAZ\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - I]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS A MEDIDA QUE SE LIBERAN.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/637','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:50:30','2026-04-28 14:50:30'),(4433,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',638,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"IRRITABILITY, FEELINGS OF DEVASTATION. (IRRITABILIDAD, SENTIMIENTOS DE DEVASTACI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":\"ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER. BLINDNESS. (TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N. CEGUERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-PSYCHOLOGICAL DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROPSICOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"IRRITABILITY, FEELINGS OF DEVASTATION, AND EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY.\\n\\n(IRRITABILIDAD, SENTIMIENTOS DE DEVASTACI\\u00d3N E INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES COMPLEX COGNITIVE AND EMOTIONAL DISTORTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH IMBALANCES BETWEEN THE POSTERIOR LOBE OF THE LIVER AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE BIOLOGICAL UNDERPINNINGS OF ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER (ADD\\/ADHD) AND SEVERE EMOTIONAL CRISES. DISRUPTION HERE INTERFERES WITH THE METABOLIC CLEARANCE OF NEUROTOXINS, WHICH CAN LEAD TO A \\\"FOGGY\\\" BRAIN STATE, IRRITABILITY, OR A PROFOUND SENSE OF DEVASTATION. ADDITIONALLY, THIS CIRCUIT IS LINKED TO SENSORY PERCEPTION; IN EXTREME CASES, UNRESOLVED DISTORTIONS IN THIS PATHWAY HAVE BEEN ASSOCIATED WITH FUNCTIONAL BLINDNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, CLEARING COGNITIVE BLOCKAGES, AND RESTORING EMOTIONAL GROUNDING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA DISTORSIONES COGNITIVAS Y EMOCIONALES COMPLEJAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO POSTERIOR DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR LAS BASES BIOL\\u00d3GICAS DEL TRASTORNO POR D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N (TDA\\/TDAH) Y CRISIS EMOCIONALES SEVERAS. LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N AQU\\u00cd INTERFIERE CON LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA DE NEUROTOXINAS, LO QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A UN ESTADO DE \\\"NIEBLA\\\" MENTAL, IRRITABILIDAD O UN PROFUNDO SENTIMIENTO DE DEVASTACI\\u00d3N. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL; EN CASOS EXTREMOS, LAS DISTORSIONES NO RESUELTAS EN ESTA V\\u00cdA SE HAN ASOCIADO CON LA CEGUERA FUNCIONAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, ELIMINAR LOS BLOQUEOS COGNITIVOS Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE CHECK: IF ATTENTION DEFICIT SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS EXECUTIVE FUNCTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EMOTIONAL DEVASTATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ ADRENALS] RESONANCE TO BALANCE THE ENDOCRINE RESPONSE TO STRESS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL FILTRATION OF EMOTIONAL AND METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] PARA ABORDAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA DEVASTACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ SUPRARRENALES] PARA EQUILIBRAR LA RESPUESTA ENDOCRINA AL ESTR\\u00c9S. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS EMOCIONALES Y METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/638','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:51:47','2026-04-28 14:51:47'),(4434,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',639,'{\"symptoms\":\"URETHRAL, VAGINAL AND ANUS ITCHING. PELVIC INFLAMMATION. BACK PAIN, VOMITING, DIARRHEA. (PICAZ\\u00d3N URETRAL, VAGINAL Y ANAL. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. DOLOR DE ESPALDA, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"GASTROENTERITIS, OVARIAN CYSTS AND APPENDICITIS. (PICAZ\\u00d3N URETRAL, VAGINAL Y ANAL. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. DOLOR DE ESPALDA, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"URETHRAL, VAGINAL, AND ANAL ITCHING. PELVIC INFLAMMATION. BACK PAIN, VOMITING, AND DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(PICAZ\\u00d3N URETRAL, VAGINAL Y ANAL. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. DOLOR DE ESPALDA, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE NORWALK VIRUS (NOROVIRUS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE POUCH OF DOUGLAS (RECTOUTERINE POUCH) AND THE FEMORAL VEIN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING ACUTE VIRAL GASTROENTERITIS, CHARACTERIZED BY SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTURBANCES. BEYOND THE GASTROINTESTINAL IMPACT, THIS VIRAL LOAD IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH INFLAMMATORY PROCESSES IN THE PELVIC REGION, POTENTIALLY CONTRIBUTING TO THE DEVELOPMENT OF OVARIAN CYSTS AND SYMPTOMS THAT MIMIC APPENDICITIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRUS, REDUCING MUCOSAL IRRITATION, AND RESTORING THE FLUID AND STRUCTURAL BALANCE OF THE PELVIC AND ABDOMINAL CAVITIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS NORWALK MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL FONDO DE SACO DE DOUGLAS Y LA VENA FEMORAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR CUADROS AGUDOS DE GASTROENTERITIS VIRAL, CARACTERIZADOS POR DISTURBIOS DIGESTIVOS SEVEROS. ADEM\\u00c1S DEL IMPACTO GASTROINTESTINAL, ESTA CARGA VIRAL EST\\u00c1 FRECUENTEMENTE ASOCIADA A PROCESOS INFLAMATORIOS EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, PUDIENDO CONTRIBUIR AL DESARROLLO DE QUISTES OVARIANOS Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE MIMETIZAN LA APENDICITIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR EL VIRUS, REDUCIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MUCOSAS Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO FLUIDO Y ESTRUCTURAL DE LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA Y ABDOMINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PELVIC CHECK: IF INFLAMMATION OR ITCHING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] OR [PROSTATE \\/ PROSTATE] AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES OF SEVERE LOWER BACK PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [ADRENALS \\/ ADRENALS] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE DIGESTIVE AND PELVIC TRACT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N O LA PICAZ\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] O [PR\\u00d3STATA \\/ PR\\u00d3STATA] PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES LOCALES. PARA CASOS DE DOLOR LUMBAR SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [SUPRARRENALES \\/ SUPRARRENALES] PARA APOYAR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL TRATO DIGESTIVO Y P\\u00c9LVICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/639','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:53:09','2026-04-28 14:53:09'),(4435,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',640,'{\"paths\":\"MENINGITIS, CNS INFECTION, BRAIN ABSCESS. (MENINGITIS, INFECCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, ABSCESO CEREBRAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS CRYPTOCOCCUS NEOFORMANS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PREAURICULAR POINT (IN FRONT OF THE EAR) AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY CONCERNING AS IT IS AN OPPORTUNISTIC FUNGUS THAT TYPICALLY ENTERS THROUGH THE RESPIRATORY TRACT, CAUSING LUNG INFECTIONS. HOWEVER, ITS MOST DANGEROUS CHARACTERISTIC IS ITS ABILITY TO SPREAD TO THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, WHERE IT CAN LEAD TO MENINGITIS, BRAIN ABSCESSES, AND SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL COMPLICATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGAL LOAD, PREVENTING SYSTEMIC DISSEMINATION, AND PROTECTING THE INTEGRITY OF BOTH THE PULMONARY AND CEREBRAL SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE AL CRYPTOCOCCUS NEOFORMANS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PUNTO PREAURICULAR (FRENTE AL O\\u00cdDO) Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE PREOCUPANTE YA QUE ES UN HONGO OPORTUNISTA QUE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE INGRESA POR EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO, CAUSANDO INFECCIONES PULMONARES. SIN EMBARGO, SU CARACTER\\u00cdSTICA M\\u00c1S PELIGROSA ES SU CAPACIDAD DE PROPAGARSE AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DONDE PUEDE PROVOCAR MENINGITIS, ABSCESOS CEREBRALES Y COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS GRAVES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, PREVINIENDO LA DISEMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD TANTO DEL SISTEMA PULMONAR COMO DEL CEREBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF HEADACHES OR STIFF NECK PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] OR [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] AXES TO RULE OUT ACTIVE MENINGEAL INFLAMMATION. FOR PERSISTENT LUNG ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING FUNGAL BYPRODUCTS AS THEY ARE CLEARED FROM THE BLOODSTREAM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA O LA RIGIDEZ DE NUCA, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] O [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] PARA DESCARTAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N MEN\\u00cdNGEA ACTIVA. PARA PROBLEMAS PULMONARES PERSISTENTES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS F\\u00daNGICOS A MEDIDA QUE SE ELIMINAN DEL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/640','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:53:59','2026-04-28 14:53:59'),(4436,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',641,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN PROBLEMS, GUM PROBLEMS, EARACHES, INFLAMMATION AND DISCHARGE FROM THE MOUTH AND LARYNX. (PROBLEMAS DE LA PIEL, PROBLEMAS DE LAS ENC\\u00cdAS, DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y SECRECI\\u00d3N DE LA BOCA Y LA LARINGE.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY BIRDS. MANDIBULAR MUSCLE CHAIN, AFFECTING THE EAR AND JAW JOINT. FACIAL PARALYSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR AVES. CADENA MUSCULAR MANDIBULAR, AFECTANDO EL O\\u00cdDO Y LA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA. PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN PROBLEMS, GUM PROBLEMS, EARACHES, INFLAMMATION, AND DISCHARGE FROM THE MOUTH AND LARYNX.(PROBLEMAS DE LA PIEL, PROBLEMAS DE LAS ENC\\u00cdAS, DOLOR DE O\\u00cdDO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y SECRECI\\u00d3N DE LA BOCA Y LA LARINGE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS NOCARDIA AMERICANA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE PREAURICULAR REGIONS. THIS PATHOGEN IS FREQUENTLY TRANSMITTED BY BIRDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE IT AFFECTS THE MANDIBULAR MUSCLE CHAIN, WHICH CAN DIRECTLY IMPACT THE EAR AND THE JAW JOINT (TMJ). IF LEFT UNADDRESSED, THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE AND BACTERIAL LOAD CAN LEAD TO FACIAL PARALYSIS (BELL\'S PALSY) OR PERSISTENT STOMATITIS AND LARYNGITIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION OF THE FACIAL NERVES, AND RESTORING CRANIAL MUSCLE TONE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA NOCARDIA AMERICANA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS REGIONES PREAURICULARES. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE CON FRECUENCIA POR AVES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE AFECTA LA CADENA MUSCULAR MANDIBULAR, LO QUE PUEDE IMPACTAR DIRECTAMENTE EL O\\u00cdDO Y LA ARTICULACI\\u00d3N DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA (ATM). SI NO SE ABORDA, LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA Y LA CARGA BACTERIANA PUEDEN CONDUCIR A PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL (PAR\\u00c1LISIS DE BELL) O ESTOMATITIS Y LARINGITIS PERSISTENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE LOS NERVIOS FACIALES Y RESTAURANDO EL TONO MUSCULAR CRANEAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FACIAL CHECK: IF PARALYSIS OR JAW PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL INNER EAR OR NERVE INVOLVEMENT. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GUM OR MOUTH INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MANDIBLE \\/ MANDIBLE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF FACIAL AND MANDIBULAR STRUCTURES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N FACIAL: SI LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS O EL DOLOR DE MAND\\u00cdBULA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES] PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE AFECTACI\\u00d3N DEL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO O DEL NERVIO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DE LAS ENC\\u00cdAS O LA BOCA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MAND\\u00cdBULA \\/ MAND\\u00cdBULA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ESTRUCTURAS FACIALES Y MANDIBULARES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/641','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:55:15','2026-04-28 14:55:15'),(4437,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',642,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"POSITIVE MIND (MENTE POSITIVA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MENTAL ATTITUDE (ACTITUD MENTAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"NEGATIVE THOUGHT PATTERNS, PESSIMISM, OR EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY.\\n\\n(PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO NEGATIVO, PESIMISMO O RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE LEFT PREFRONTAL CORTEX BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THIS SPECIFIC REGION OF THE BRAIN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE LEFT PREFRONTAL CORTEX IS CLOSELY LINKED TO THE REGULATION OF POSITIVE AFFECT AND EXECUTIVE FUNCTION. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS LOCAL CIRCUIT CAN LEAD TO A PERSISTENT \\\"NEGATIVE MIND\\\" STATE, WHERE THE INDIVIDUAL STRUGGLES TO FIND OPTIMISM OR CLARITY. BY STABILIZING THIS AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REBALANCING NEURO-EMOTIONAL VOLTAGE, FOSTERING A \\\"POSITIVE MIND\\\" (MENTE POSITIVA), AND ENHANCING THE CAPACITY FOR EMOTIONAL RESILIENCE AND HOPE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL SE DIRIGE AL C\\u00d3RTEX PREFRONTAL IZQUIERDO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE ESTA REGI\\u00d3N ESPEC\\u00cdFICA DEL CEREBRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL C\\u00d3RTEX PREFRONTAL IZQUIERDO EST\\u00c1 ESTRECHAMENTE VINCULADO A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL AFECTO POSITIVO Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO LOCAL PUEDE CONDUCIR A UN ESTADO PERSISTENTE DE \\\"MENTE NEGATIVA\\\", DONDE EL INDIVIDUO TIENE DIFICULTADES PARA ENCONTRAR OPTIMISMO O CLARIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REEQUILIBRAR EL VOLTAJE NEUROEMOCIONAL, FOMENTANDO UNA \\\"MENTE POSITIVA\\\" Y MEJORANDO LA CAPACIDAD DE RESILIENCIA EMOCIONAL Y ESPERANZA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PSYCHOLOGICAL CHECK: IF NEGATIVE THOUGHTS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT OVERALL GLANDULAR HARMONY. FOR CASES INVOLVING IMPULSIVITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE TO EMOTIONAL STRESS DURING THE TRANSITION TO A MORE BALANCED MENTAL STATE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS PENSAMIENTOS NEGATIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA APOYAR LA ARMON\\u00cdA GLANDULAR GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IMPULSIVIDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [FRONTAL \\/ FRONTAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL DURANTE LA TRANSICI\\u00d3N A UN ESTADO MENTAL M\\u00c1S EQUILIBRADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/642','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:56:28','2026-04-28 14:56:28'),(4438,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',643,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"NEGATIVE MIND (MENTE NEGATIVA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-PSYCHOLOGICAL VOLTAGE (VOLTAJE NEUROPSICOL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"NEGATIVE MINDSET, ALTERED PERCEPTION, AND EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS.\\n\\n(MENTE NEGATIVA, PERCEPCI\\u00d3N ALTERADA Y PESADEZ EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE RIGHT PREFRONTAL CORTEX BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THIS SPECIFIC BRAIN REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE RIGHT PREFRONTAL CORTEX IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE PROCESSING OF VIGILANCE, AVOIDANCE BEHAVIORS, AND NEGATIVE AFFECT. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS LOCAL CIRCUIT CAN LOCK THE INDIVIDUAL INTO A \\\"NEGATIVE MIND\\\" (MENTE NEGATIVA) STATE, WHERE THOUGHTS BECOME REPETITIVELY PESSIMISTIC OR SKEWED TOWARD DISTRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS AREA, THE RESET ASSISTS IN DECREASING NEURO-EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD, CLEARING THE MENTAL \\\"FOG\\\" OF NEGATIVITY, AND RESTORING A MORE NEUTRAL AND BALANCED PERSPECTIVE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL SE DIRIGE AL C\\u00d3RTEX PREFRONTAL DERECHO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE ESTA REGI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL C\\u00d3RTEX PREFRONTAL DERECHO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA VIGILANCIA, LAS CONDUCTAS DE EVITACI\\u00d3N Y EL AFECTO NEGATIVO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO LOCAL PUEDE BLOQUEAR AL INDIVIDUO EN UN ESTADO DE \\\"MENTE NEGATIVA\\\", DONDE LOS PENSAMIENTOS SE VUELVEN REPETITIVAMENTE PESIMISTAS O SESGADOS HACIA LA ANGUSTIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA \\u00c1REA, EL REINICIO AYUDA A DISMINUIR LA SOBRECARGA NEUROEMOCIONAL, ELIMINANDO LA \\\"NIEBLA\\\" MENTAL DE LA NEGATIVIDAD Y RESTAURANDO UNA PERSPECTIVA M\\u00c1S NEUTRA Y EQUILIBRADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PSYCHOLOGICAL CHECK: IF NEGATIVE THOUGHT PATTERNS ARE PERSISTENT, SCAN THE [PREFRONTAL CORTEX - L \\/ PREFRONTAL CORTEX - L] (REF 650) AXIS TO PROMOTE THE \\\"POSITIVE MIND.\\\" FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN PROCESSING THE BIOCHEMICAL BYPRODUCTS OF EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO NEGATIVO SON PERSISTENTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [C\\u00d3RTEX PREFRONTAL - I \\/ C\\u00d3RTEX PREFRONTAL - I] (REF 650) PARA PROMOVER LA \\\"MENTE POSITIVA\\\". PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/643','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:57:35','2026-04-28 14:57:35'),(4439,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',644,'{\"symptoms\":\"EYE PROBLEMS, FEVER, MALAISE, HEADACHE,EDEMA, SEIZURES. (PROBLEMAS OCULARES, FIEBRE, MALESTAR, DOLOR DE CABEZA, EDEMA, CONVULSIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"IT AFFECTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND BRAIN. GLAUCOMA. (AFECTA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y EL CEREBRO. GLAUCOMA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EYE PROBLEMS, FEVER, MALAISE, HEADACHE, EDEMA, AND SEIZURES.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS OCULARES, FIEBRE, MALESTAR, DOLOR DE CABEZA, EDEMA Y CONVULSIONES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE CRYPTOCOCCUS PATHOGEN BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PREPINEAL REGION AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT BECAUSE THIS FUNGUS HAS A PREDILECTION FOR THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM AND THE BRAIN. IF LEFT UNCHECKED, IT CAN LEAD TO INCREASED INTRAOCULAR PRESSURE (GLAUCOMA) AND SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL DISRUPTIONS, INCLUDING SEIZURES AND CHRONIC HEADACHES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGAL LOAD FROM THE CEREBROSPINAL FLUID AND PROTECTING VITAL BRAIN STRUCTURES FROM INFLAMMATORY DAMAGE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE AL PAT\\u00d3GENO CRYPTOCOCCUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N PREPINEAL Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO PORQUE ESTE HONGO TIENE PREDILECCI\\u00d3N POR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y EL CEREBRO. SI NO SE CONTROLA, PUEDE CONDUCIR A UN AUMENTO DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N INTRAOCULAR (GLAUCOMA) Y ALTERACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS GRAVES, INCLUYENDO CONVULSIONES Y DOLORES DE CABEZA CR\\u00d3NICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA DEL L\\u00cdQUIDO CEFALORRAQU\\u00cdDEO Y A PROTEGER LAS ESTRUCTURAS CEREBRALES VITALES DEL DA\\u00d1O INFLAMATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF HEADACHES OR EYE PRESSURE PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS CORTICAL VOLTAGE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SYSTEMIC INFECTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PREAURICULAR \\/ BLADDER] (REF 648) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER CRYPTOCOCCAL STRAINS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING FUNGAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA O LA PRESI\\u00d3N OCULAR PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA ABORDAR EL VOLTAJE CORTICAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PREAURICULAR \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 648) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CEPAS DE CRIPTOCOCO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/644','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:58:29','2026-04-28 14:58:29'),(4440,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',645,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PARKINSON\'S DISEASE (ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURODEGENERATIVE DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N NEURODEGENERATIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"TREMORS, RIGIDITY, BRADYKINESIA (SLOW MOVEMENT), AND LOSS OF MOTOR CONTROL.\\n\\n(TEMBLORES, RIGIDEZ, BRADICINESIA (MOVIMIENTO LENTO) Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL CONTROL MOTOR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES PARKINSON\'S DISEASE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PREPINEAL REGION AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REBALANCING THE NEUROLOGICAL TRANSMISSION SIGNALS THAT REGULATE INVOLUNTARY AND VOLUNTARY MOTOR FUNCTIONS. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT INTERFERES WITH DOPAMINE REGULATION AND BRAINSTEM COMMUNICATION, LEADING TO THE CHARACTERISTIC PHYSICAL TREMORS AND MUSCULAR RIGIDITY SEEN IN PARKINSON\'S PATIENTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM INFLAMMATION, IMPROVING SIGNAL CLARITY, AND SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF COORDINATED BODY MOVEMENTS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N PREPINEAL Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REEQUILIBRAR LAS SE\\u00d1ALES DE TRANSMISI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA QUE REGULAN LAS FUNCIONES MOTORAS INVOLUNTARIAS Y VOLUNTARIAS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO INTERFIERE CON LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA DOPAMINA Y LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO, LO QUE CONDUCE A LOS TEMBLORES F\\u00cdSICOS CARACTER\\u00cdSTICOS Y LA RIGIDEZ MUSCULAR OBSERVADOS EN PACIENTES CON PARKINSON. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, MEJORANDO LA CLARIDAD DE LA SE\\u00d1AL Y APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS MOVIMIENTOS CORPORALES COORDINADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF TREMORS OR RIGIDITY PERSIST, SCAN THE [POST PINEAL \\/ MEDULLA] (REF 642) AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY NEUROLOGICAL VOLTAGE. FOR COORDINATION AND BALANCE ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CEREBELLUM \\/ CEREBELLUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE DURING THE RECOVERY OF MOTOR CONTROL CENTERS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS TEMBLORES O LA RIGIDEZ PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [POST-PINEAL \\/ M\\u00c9DULA] (REF 642) PARA ABORDAR EL VOLTAJE NEUROL\\u00d3GICO COMPLEMENTARIO. PARA PROBLEMAS DE COORDINACI\\u00d3N Y EQUILIBRIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CEREBELO \\/ CEREBELO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS CENTROS DE CONTROL MOTOR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/645','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 14:59:34','2026-04-28 14:59:34'),(4441,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',646,'{\"symptoms\":\"EYE INFECTIONS, GLAUCOMA. (INFECCIONES OCULARES, GLAUCOMA)\",\"paths\":\"AGGRESSIVE INFECTION. MENINGOENCEPHALITIS. (INFECCI\\u00d3N AGRESIVA. MENINGOENCEFALITIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EYE INFECTIONS, GLAUCOMA, AND VISION LOSS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES OCULARES, GLAUCOMA Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE VISI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS CRYPTOCOCCUS NEOFORMANS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE PREPINEAL REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS LOCAL AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THIS AGGRESSIVE PATHOGEN HAS A STRONG AFFINITY FOR THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. THE INFECTION OFTEN MANIFESTS CRITICALLY IN THE EYES, LEADING TO INCREASED INTRAOCULAR PRESSURE (GLAUCOMA) AND POTENTIAL DAMAGE TO THE OPTIC NERVE. IF THE FUNGAL LOAD IS NOT NEUTRALIZED, IT CAN PROGRESS TO MENINGOENCEPHALITIS, CAUSING SEVERE INFLAMMATION OF THE BRAIN LININGS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGUS FROM THE CRANIAL ENVIRONMENT, REDUCING OCULAR PRESSURE, AND PROTECTING NEUROLOGICAL INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE AL CRYPTOCOCCUS NEOFORMANS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N PREPINEAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE LOCAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO AGRESIVO TIENE UNA FUERTE AFINIDAD POR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. LA INFECCI\\u00d3N A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA DE MANERA CR\\u00cdTICA EN LOS OJOS, LO QUE CONDUCE A UN AUMENTO DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N INTRAOCULAR (GLAUCOMA) Y DA\\u00d1O POTENCIAL AL NERVIO \\u00d3PTICO. SI LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA NO SE NEUTRALIZA, PUEDE PROGRESAR A MENINGOENCEFALITIS, CAUSANDO UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DE LOS REVESTIMIENTOS CEREBRALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR EL HONGO DEL ENTORNO CRANEAL, REDUCIENDO LA PRESI\\u00d3N OCULAR Y PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF HEADACHES OR VISION DISTURBANCES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS CORTICAL VOLTAGE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SYSTEMIC INFECTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PREAURICULAR \\/ BLADDER] (REF 648) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT OTHER CRYPTOCOCCAL STRAINS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING FUNGAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA O LAS ALTERACIONES DE LA VISI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA ABORDAR EL VOLTAJE CORTICAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PREAURICULAR \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 648) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CEPAS DE CRIPTOCOCO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/646','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:02:07','2026-04-28 15:02:07'),(4442,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',647,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF ADENOMAS, SEXUAL DISORDERS. BURNING AND PAIN. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE ADENOMAS, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES. ARDOR Y DOLOR.)\",\"paths\":\"ACQUIRED BY TRAUMA, TOXINS OR INFECTION. PROSTATITIS, HYPERTROPHY, URINARY DISORDERS, NOCTURIA. (ADQUIRIDO POR TRAUMA, TOXINAS O INFECCI\\u00d3N. PROSTATITIS, HIPERTROFIA, TRASTORNOS URINARIOS, NICTURIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF ADENOMAS, SEXUAL DISORDERS, BURNING, AND PAIN.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE ADENOMAS, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES, ARDOR Y DOLOR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES IMBALANCES WITHIN THE PROSTATE GLAND BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE LOCAL TISSUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR MANAGING NON-SPECIFIC PROSTATITIS, BENIGN PROSTATIC HYPERTROPHY (BPH), AND VARIOUS URINARY DISORDERS SUCH AS NOCTURIA (EXCESSIVE NIGHTTIME URINATION). THESE ISSUES ARE OFTEN ACQUIRED THROUGH PHYSICAL TRAUMA, ACCUMULATED TOXINS, OR CHRONIC LOW-GRADE INFECTIONS THAT ALTER GLANDULAR FUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REDUCING TISSUE INFLAMMATION, IMPROVING URINARY FLOW, AND RESTORING PROPER SEXUAL AND REPRODUCTIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DENTRO DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PROST\\u00c1TICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL TEJIDO LOCAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA EL MANEJO DE LA PROSTATITIS NO ESPEC\\u00cdFICA, LA HIPERTROFIA PROST\\u00c1TICA BENIGNA (HPB) Y DIVERSOS TRASTORNOS URINARIOS COMO LA NICTURIA (MICCI\\u00d3N NOCTURNA EXCESIVA). ESTOS PROBLEMAS A MENUDO SE ADQUIEREN POR TRAUMA F\\u00cdSICO, TOXINAS ACUMULADAS O INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS DE BAJO GRADO QUE ALTERAN LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO, MEJORAR EL FLUJO URINARIO Y RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL Y REPRODUCTIVA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF PROSTATIC INFLAMMATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [RECTUM \\/ RECTUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT THE PRESENCE OF PROTEUS MIRABILIS. FOR URINARY TRACT CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [URETHRA \\/ URETHRA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE MALE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N PROST\\u00c1TICA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RECTO \\/ RECTO] PARA DESCARTAR LA PRESENCIA DE PROTEUS MIRABILIS. PARA PREOCUPACIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [URETRA \\/ URETRA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR MASCULINO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/647','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:03:15','2026-04-28 15:03:15'),(4443,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',656,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL PROBLEMS, FOOD ALLERGIES, CONSTIPATION. (PROBLEMAS GASTROINTESTINALES, ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO)\",\"paths\":\"INTOXICATION BY DRUGS. (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N POR MEDICAMENTOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC INTOXICATION (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL PROBLEMS, FOOD ALLERGIES, AND CONSTIPATION.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS GASTROINTESTINALES, ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS Y ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES IMBALANCES WITHIN THE PYLORIC SPHINCTER BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE LOCAL TISSUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING GASTROINTESTINAL STASIS AND SYSTEMIC TOXICITY OFTEN CAUSED BY THE PROLONGED USE OR ACCUMULATION OF PHARMACEUTICAL DRUGS (INTOXICATION BY DRUGS). WHEN THE PYLORUS DYSFUNCTIONS, IT INTERFERES WITH THE CORRECT PASSAGE OF CHYME FROM THE STOMACH TO THE DUODENUM, LEADING TO MALABSORPTION, FOOD INTOLERANCES, AND CHRONIC CONSTIPATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RESTORING THE PROPER OPENING AND CLOSING MECHANISM OF THE SPHINCTER, FACILITATING DETOXIFICATION AND IMPROVING OVERALL DIGESTIVE MOTILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DENTRO DEL ESF\\u00cdNTER PIL\\u00d3RICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL TEJIDO LOCAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA ESTASIS GASTROINTESTINAL Y LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA A MENUDO CAUSADA POR EL USO PROLONGADO O LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE MEDICAMENTOS (INTOXICACI\\u00d3N POR MEDICAMENTOS). CUANDO EL P\\u00cdLORO PRESENTA UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N, INTERFIERE CON EL PASO CORRECTO DEL QUIMO DESDE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO HACIA EL DUODENO, LO QUE PROVOCA MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N, INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS Y ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO CR\\u00d3NICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR EL MECANISMO ADECUADO DE APERTURA Y CIERRE DEL ESF\\u00cdNTER, FACILITANDO LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y MEJORANDO LA MOTILIDAD DIGESTIVA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TOXICITY CHECK: IF GASTROINTESTINAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST AFTER DRUG INTOXICATION, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT HEPATIC FILTRATION. FOR SEVERE FOOD ALLERGIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN CLEARING METABOLIC RESIDUES DURING THE RECOVERY OF DIGESTIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TOXICIDAD: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES PERSISTEN TRAS UNA INTOXICACI\\u00d3N POR MEDICAMENTOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. PARA ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE RESIDUOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/656','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:04:26','2026-04-28 15:04:26'),(4444,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',657,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SELF ESTEEM (AUTOESTIMA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SELF ESTEEM (AUTOESTIMA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEELINGS OF UNWORTHINESS, LACK OF SELF-CONFIDENCE, AND EMOTIONAL DIGESTIVE DISTRESS.\\n\\n(SENTIMIENTOS DE FALTA DE M\\u00c9RITO, FALTA DE CONFIANZA EN S\\u00cd MISMO Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CORE OF SELF-ESTEEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PYLORUS AND THE STOMACH. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS DEEPLY CONNECTED TO HOW WE \\\"DIGEST\\\" OUR PERCEPTION OF SELF. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY OR A COLLAPSE IN PERSONAL CONFIDENCE, OFTEN REFLECTED PHYSICALLY AS TIGHTNESS IN THE UPPER GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CLEARING THE ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES THAT PREVENT THE INDIVIDUAL FROM FEELING CENTERED AND WORTHY, PROMOTING A SENSE OF INNER STRENGTH AND EMOTIONAL HARMONY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL N\\u00daCLEO DE LA AUTOESTIMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00cdLORO Y EL EST\\u00d3MAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 PROFUNDAMENTE CONECTADO CON C\\u00d3MO \\\"DIGERIMOS\\\" NUESTRA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DE NOSOTROS MISMOS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL O UN COLAPSO EN LA CONFIANZA PERSONAL, A MENUDO REFLEJADO F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO TENSI\\u00d3N EN EL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL SUPERIOR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A ELIMINAR LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE IMPIDEN QUE EL INDIVIDUO SE SIENTA CENTRADO Y VALIOSO, PROMOVIENDO UN SENTIDO DE FORTALEZA INTERIOR Y ARMON\\u00cdA EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF LOW SELF-ESTEEM PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SOLAR PLEXUS \\/ SOLAR PLEXUS] CHAKRA TO REINFORCE PERSONAL POWER AND IDENTITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP-SEATED GRIEF, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEART \\/ HEART] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE TO EMOTIONAL STRESS DURING THE REBALANCING OF SELF-WORTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA BAJA AUTOESTIMA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL CHAKRA [PLEXO SOLAR \\/ PLEXO SOLAR] PARA REFORZAR EL PODER PERSONAL Y LA IDENTIDAD. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN DUELO PROFUNDO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL DURANTE EL REEQUILIBRIO DE LA VALORACI\\u00d3N PERSONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/657','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:05:38','2026-04-28 15:05:38'),(4445,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',658,'{\"symptoms\":\"Skin rashes and dermatitis. (ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y DERMATITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"Is transmitted by food, Mainly contaminated and undercooked pork. TRICHINELLOSIS. Neurological disorders, meningitis encephalitis and stroke. (SE TRANSMITE POR ALIMENTOS, PRINCIPALMENTE CARNE DE CERDO CONTAMINADA Y POCO COCIDA. TRIQUINELOSIS. TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, MENINGITIS, ENCEFALITIS Y ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - HIATUS\\/TONGUE CHECK - THYMUS\\/TONGUE (REVISAR - HIATO \\/ LENGUA\\nREVISAR - TIMO \\/ LENGUA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN RASHES AND DERMATITIS.\\n\\n(ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y DERMATITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PYLORUS AND THE TONGUE. THIS PARASITE IS PRIMARILY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE CONSUMPTION OF CONTAMINATED OR UNDERCOOKED PORK. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT BECAUSE THE LARVAE CAN MIGRATE BEYOND THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, POTENTIALLY CAUSING TRICHINELLOSIS. IF LEFT UNADDRESSED, THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD CAN LEAD TO SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS, INCLUDING MENINGITIS, ENCEPHALITIS, AND EVEN STROKE-LIKE SYMPTOMS DUE TO LARVAL ENCYSMENT IN SENSITIVE TISSUES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AND PROTECTING NEUROLOGICAL INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A LA TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00cdLORO Y LA LENGUA. ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO SE TRANSMITE PRINCIPALMENTE POR EL CONSUMO DE CARNE DE CERDO CONTAMINADA O POCO COCIDA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO PORQUE LAS LARVAS PUEDEN MIGRAR M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, CAUSANDO POTENCIALMENTE TRIQUINELOSIS. SI NO SE ABORDA, LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA PUEDE PROVOCAR TRASTORNOS NEUROLOG\\u00cdCOS GRAVES, INCLUYENDO MENINGITIS, ENCEFALITIS E INCLUSO S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES A UN ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR DEBIDO AL ENQUISTAMIENTO LARVARIO EN TEJIDOS SENSIBLES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARASITIC CHECK: IF DERMATITIS OR NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [HIATUS \\/ TONGUE] AXIS TO RULE OUT COMPLEMENTARY LARVAL PATHWAYS. FOR IMMUNE SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ TONGUE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN CLEARING PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA: SI PERSISTEN LA DERMATITIS O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [HIATO \\/ LENGUA] PARA DESCARTAR V\\u00cdAS LARVARIAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. PARA APOYO INMUNITARIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ LENGUA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/658','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:06:49','2026-04-28 15:06:49'),(4446,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',659,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"URGE TO OVER EAT. (IMPULSO DE COMER EN EXCESO.)\",\"paths\":\"POLYPHAGIA. (POLIFAGIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"POLIFAGIA (POLYPHAGIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"URGE TO OVEREAT, INSATIABLE HUNGER, AND FOOD-RELATED ANXIETY.\\n\\n(IMPULSO DE COMER EN EXCESO, HAMBRE INSACIABLE Y ANSIEDAD ALIMENTARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES POLYPHAGIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PYLORUS AND THE TRANSVERSE COLON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE IT INTERACTS WITH THE NEUROENDOCRINE SIGNALS THAT REGULATE SATIETY AND INTESTINAL TRANSIT. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN DISRUPT COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM AND THE BRAIN, LEADING TO AN UNCONTROLLABLE URGE TO EAT, EVEN WHEN NUTRITIONAL NEEDS HAVE BEEN MET. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE ENTERIC NERVOUS SYSTEM, REDUCING FOOD ANXIETY, AND RESTORING NATURAL APPETITE CONTROL MECHANISMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA POLIFAGIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00cdLORO Y EL COLON TRANSVERSO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE INTERACT\\u00daA CON LAS SE\\u00d1ALES NEUROENDOCRINAS QUE REGULAN LA SACIEDAD Y EL TR\\u00c1NSITO INTESTINAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE ALTERAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO Y EL CEREBRO, PROVOCANDO UN IMPULSO INCONTROLABLE DE COMER, INCLUSO CUANDO LAS NECESIDADES NUTRICIONALES HAN SIDO CUBIERTAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO ENT\\u00c9RICO, REDUCIENDO LA ANSIEDAD POR LA COMIDA Y RESTAURANDO LOS MECANISMOS NATURALES DE CONTROL DEL APETITO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF HUNGER PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] (REF 656) AXIS TO ADDRESS POSSIBLE DRUG INTOXICATION. FOR CASES RELATED TO EMOTIONAL STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ STOMACH] (REF 666) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT ELECTROLYTE BALANCE DURING THE REGULATION OF DIGESTIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI EL HAMBRE PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] (REF 656) PARA ABORDAR UNA POSIBLE INTOXICACI\\u00d3N MEDICAMENTOSA. PARA CASOS RELACIONADOS CON ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PYLORUS \\/ STOMACH] (REF 666). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO ELECTROL\\u00cdTICO DURANTE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/659','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:11:29','2026-04-28 15:11:29'),(4447,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',660,'{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL DISORDERS, COLIC, GAS, BLACK STOOLS, DIARRHEA, UNCONTROLLABLE MUCUS AND BLEEDING. (TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, C\\u00d3LICOS, GASES, HECES NEGRAS, DIARREA, MUCOSIDAD INCONTROLABLE Y SANGRADO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY SPORES THRU ANAL SEX. IT PREVENTS DIGESTION AND CAUSES INTESTINAL DISORDERS. DAMAGING THE INTESTINAL WALL AND CAUSING INTESTINAL BLEEDING. (TRANSMITIDO POR ESPORAS A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SEXO ANAL. IMPIDE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y CAUSA TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES. DA\\u00d1A LA PARED INTESTINAL Y PROVOCA SANGRADO INTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL DISORDERS, COLIC, GAS, BLACK STOOLS, DIARRHEA, UNCONTROLLABLE MUCUS, AND BLEEDING.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, C\\u00d3LICOS, GASES, HECES NEGRAS, DIARREA, MUCOSIDAD INCONTROLABLE Y SANGRADO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PRESENCE OF PATHOGENIC MYCELIUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE PYLORUS AND THE URETER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ASSOCIATED WITH INFECTIONS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH SPORES. THE PATHOGEN INTERFERES WITH THE NORMAL DIGESTIVE PROCESS BY DAMAGING THE INTESTINAL WALLS, WHICH CAN LEAD TO SEVERE MALABSORPTION AND INTERNAL BLEEDING (MANIFESTING AS BLACK STOOLS). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGAL OVERGROWTH, REDUCING INFLAMMATION OF THE INTESTINAL TRACT, AND STOPPING MUCOSAL BLEEDING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA ABORDA LA PRESENCIA DE MICELIO PAT\\u00d3GENO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00cdLORO Y EL UR\\u00c9TER. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO CON INFECCIONES A MENUDO TRANSMITIDAS A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ESPORAS. EL PAT\\u00d3GENO INTERFIERE CON EL PROCESO DIGESTIVO NORMAL AL DA\\u00d1AR LAS PAREDES INTESTINALES, LO QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR UNA MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N SEVERA Y SANGRADO INTERNO (MANIFESTADO COMO HECES NEGRAS). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR EL CRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO INTESTINAL Y DETENIENDO EL SANGRADO DE LAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INTESTINAL CHECK: IF BLEEDING OR DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ RECTUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER PARASITIC OR BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR SEVERE ABDOMINAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] (REF 656) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM AS IT FILTERS THE BYPRODUCTS OF THE FUNGAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL: SI EL SANGRADO O LA DIARREA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DUODENO \\/ RECTO] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS COINFECCIONES PARASITARIAS O BACTERIANAS. PARA DOLOR ABDOMINAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] (REF 656). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL MIENTRAS FILTRA LOS SUBPRODUCTOS DE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/660','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:12:38','2026-04-28 15:12:38'),(4448,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',661,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CANCER GENE SUPPRESSOR. (GEN SUPRESOR DE TUMORES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CELLULAR REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N CELULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"PREVENTIVE CARE, GENETIC STABILITY, AND TUMOR SUPPRESSION SUPPORT.\\n\\n(CUIDADO PREVENTIVO, ESTABILIDAD GEN\\u00c9TICA Y APOYO EN LA SUPRESI\\u00d3N DE TUMORES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ACTS AS A CANCER GENE SUPPRESSOR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT PORTAL VEIN AND THE ILIAC CREST. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR MAINTAINING THE INTEGRITY OF CELLULAR REPLICATION AND SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S NATURAL ABILITY TO INHIBIT ABNORMAL GROWTHS. THE PORTAL VEIN IS A VITAL CONDUIT FOR NUTRIENTS AND METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS FROM THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM TO THE LIVER, WHILE THE ILIAC CREST IS A KEY SITE FOR HEMATOPOIESIS (BLOOD CELL PRODUCTION). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN OPTIMIZING THE BIOLOGICAL ENVIRONMENT, REINFORCING GENETIC PROTECTIVE MECHANISMS, AND PROMOTING SYSTEMIC DETOXIFICATION TO PREVENT THE FORMATION OR DEVELOPMENT OF TUMORS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ACT\\u00daA COMO UN GEN SUPRESOR DE TUMORES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VENA PORTA DERECHA Y LA CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA MANTENER LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N CELULAR Y APOYAR LA CAPACIDAD NATURAL DEL CUERPO PARA INHIBIR CRECIMIENTOS ANORMALES. LA VENA PORTA ES UN CONDUCTO VITAL PARA LOS NUTRIENTES Y SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DESDE EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO HACIA EL H\\u00cdGADO, MIENTRAS QUE LA CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA ES UN SITIO CLAVE PARA LA HEMATOPOYESIS (PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS SANGU\\u00cdNEAS). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A OPTIMIZAR EL ENTORNO BIOL\\u00d3GICO, REFORZANDO LOS MECANISMOS DE PROTECCI\\u00d3N GEN\\u00c9TICA Y PROMOVIENDO LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA PARA PREVENIR LA FORMACI\\u00d3N O EL DESARROLLO DE TUMORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF THERE IS A CONCERN FOR TUMOR ACTIVITY, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AXIS TO ADDRESS MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE, WHICH IS OFTEN LINKED TO TUMOR GROWTH IN BIOMAGNETISM. FOR METABOLIC SUPPORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF TOXINS DURING CELLULAR REHABILITATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI EXISTE PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N POR ACTIVIDAD TUMORAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] PARA ABORDAR EL MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE, QUE A MENUDO SE VINCULA CON EL CRECIMIENTO TUMORAL EN BIOMAGNETISMO. PARA APOYO METAB\\u00d3LICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA REHABILITACI\\u00d3N CELULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/661','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:13:58','2026-04-28 15:13:58'),(4449,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',662,'{\"symptoms\":\"BACK PAIN, ARTHRITIS OF THE KNEE AND HIP. (DOLOR DE ESPALDA, ARTRITIS DE LA RODILLA Y LA CADERA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY VAGINAL OR URETHRAL DISCHARGE. CAN CROSS THE PLACENTAL BARRIER AND INFECT THE FETUS. HIP ARTHRITIS, RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS, OSTEOARTHRITIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL O URETRAL. PUEDE CRUZAR LA BARRERA PLACENTARIA E INFECTAR AL FETO. ARTRITIS DE CADERA, ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE, OSTEOARTRITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - DELTOID; HODGKIN\'S DISEASE AND FALSE DIABETES. (REVISAR - DELTOIDES; ENFERMEDAD DE HODGKIN Y FALSA DIABETES.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"BACK PAIN, ARTHRITIS OF THE KNEE AND HIP.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE ESPALDA, ARTRITIS DE LA RODILLA Y LA CADERA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS TREPONEMA PALLIDUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE QUADRATUS LUMBORUM MUSCLES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS IT IS THE CAUSATIVE AGENT OF SYPHILIS AND IS PRIMARILY TRANSMITTED THROUGH VAGINAL OR URETHRAL DISCHARGE. A CRITICAL CONCERN WITH THIS BACTERIA IS ITS ABILITY TO CROSS THE PLACENTAL BARRIER AND INFECT THE FETUS (CONGENITAL SYPHILIS). PHYSICALLY, IT FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS SEVERE LOWER BACK PAIN AND VARIOUS FORMS OF JOINT DEGENERATION, INCLUDING HIP ARTHRITIS, RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS, AND OSTEOARTHRITIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING JOINT INTEGRITY, AND PREVENTING SYSTEMIC OR GESTATIONAL SPREAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL TREPONEMA PALLIDUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS CUADRADOS LUMBARES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE ES EL AGENTE CAUSANTE DE LA S\\u00cdFILIS Y SE TRANSMITE PRINCIPALMENTE POR SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL O URETRAL. UNA PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00cdTICA CON ESTA BACTERIA ES SU CAPACIDAD PARA CRUZAR LA BARRERA PLACENTARIA E INFECTAR AL FETO (S\\u00cdFILIS CONG\\u00c9NITA). F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO DOLOR SEVERO EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA Y VARIAS FORMAS DE DEGENERACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR, INCLUYENDO ARTRITIS DE CADERA, ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE Y OSTEOARTRITIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LAS ARTICULACIONES Y PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA O GESTACIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN OR SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [DELTOID \\/ DELTOID] AXIS TO RULE OUT COMPLEMENTARY PATHWAYS. THIS PAIR SHOULD ALSO BE CROSS-REFERENCED IN CASES OF HODGKIN\'S DISEASE OR \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" (SYMPTOMS MIMICKING DIABETES WITHOUT THE GLYCEMIC MARKERS). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI PERSISTE EL DOLOR ARTICULAR O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DELTOIDES \\/ DELTOIDES] PARA DESCARTAR V\\u00cdAS COMPLEMENTARIAS. ESTE PAR TAMBI\\u00c9N DEBE SER CONTRASTADO EN CASOS DE ENFERMEDAD DE HODGKIN O \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\" (S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE IMITAN LA DIABETES SIN LOS MARCADORES GLUC\\u00c9MICOS). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/662','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:15:02','2026-04-28 15:15:02'),(4450,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',663,'{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN, WASTING AWAY, HIP AND PELVIS PAIN, WEAKNESS, CRAMPS, NAUSEA, ANOREXIA. POOR DIGESTION AND BLACK STOOLS. (DOLOR ABDOMINAL, EMACIACI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE CADERA Y PELVIS, DEBILIDAD, C\\u00d3LICOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, ANOREXIA. MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y HECES NEGRAS.)\",\"paths\":\"IMPAIRED BOWEL FUNCTION. DYSLEXIA. (FUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL ALTERADA. DISLEXIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - POLE\\nREGULATES: DYSLEXIA AND HYPERACTIVITY. (REVISAR - POLO\\nREGULA: DISLEXIA E HIPERACTIVIDAD.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL PAIN, WASTING AWAY, HIP AND PELVIS PAIN, WEAKNESS, CRAMPS, NAUSEA, AND ANOREXIA. POOR DIGESTION AND BLACK STOOLS.\\n\\n(DOLOR ABDOMINAL, EMACIACI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE CADERA Y PELVIS, DEBILIDAD, C\\u00d3LICOS, N\\u00c1USEAS, ANOREXIA. MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y HECES NEGRAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES BISMUTH TOXICITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE QUADRICEPS MUSCLE GROUP. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE SYSTEMIC EFFECTS OF HEAVY METAL ACCUMULATION, WHICH OFTEN MANIFESTS AS IMPAIRED BOWEL FUNCTION AND SEVERE METABOLIC WEAKNESS. BEYOND PHYSICAL DIGESTIVE ISSUES, AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO COGNITIVE AND BEHAVIORAL DISRUPTIONS, SPECIFICALLY DYSLEXIA AND HYPERACTIVITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN THE DETOXIFICATION OF METALLIC RESIDUES, CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, AND RESTORING NEUROLOGICAL CLARITY AND MUSCULAR VIGOR.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA TOXICIDAD POR BISMUTO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL GRUPO MUSCULAR DEL CU\\u00c1DRICEPS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR LOS EFECTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS DE LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE METALES PESADOS, QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL ALTERADA Y UNA DEBILIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA SEVERA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS F\\u00cdSICOS, UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO SE VINCULA FRECUENTEMENTE CON ALTERACIONES COGNITIVAS Y CONDUCTUALES, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE LA DISLEXIA Y LA HIPERACTIVIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA EN LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DE RESIDUOS MET\\u00c1LICOS, CALMANDO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y RESTAURANDO LA CLARIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y EL VIGOR MUSCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE CHECK: IF DYSLEXIA OR HYPERACTIVITY SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [POLE \\/ POLE] AXIS TO REGULATE CEREBRAL VOLTAGE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL DISTRESS OR BLACK STOOLS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ URETER] (REF 669) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT FUNGAL CO-INFECTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL FILTRATION OF HEAVY METALS DURING THE DETOXIFICATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DISLEXIA O HIPERACTIVIDAD, ESCANEAR EL EJE [POLO \\/ POLO] PARA REGULAR EL VOLTAJE CEREBRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR ABDOMINAL SEVERO O HECES NEGRAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ UR\\u00c9TER] (REF 669) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE METALES PESADOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/663','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:16:36','2026-04-28 15:16:36'),(4451,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',664,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DEPRESSION (DEPRESI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-EMOTIONAL IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO NEUROEMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, SADNESS, AND LOW VITAL ENERGY.\\n\\n(DEPRESI\\u00d3N, TRISTEZA Y BAJA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS DEPRESSIVE STATES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA) AND THE ARMPIT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE RACHIDIAN BULB IS A CRITICAL CONTROL CENTER FOR AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN LEAD TO A DEEP SENSE OF SADNESS OR \\\"EMOTIONAL WEIGHT\\\" THAT MANIFESTS AS SYSTEMIC DEPRESSION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REBALANCING THE NEUROTRANSMITTERS AND ENERGY FLOW NECESSARY TO LIFT THE EMOTIONAL STATE, PROMOTING A SENSE OF RELIEF AND RENEWED VITALITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LOS ESTADOS DEPRESIVOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y LA AXILA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO ES UN CENTRO DE CONTROL CR\\u00cdTICO PARA LAS FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE CONDUCIR A UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA DE TRISTEZA O \\\"PESO EMOCIONAL\\\" QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO DEPRESI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REEQUILIBRAR LOS NEUROTRANSMISORES Y EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO NECESARIOS PARA ELEVAR EL ESTADO EMOCIONAL, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ALIVIO Y VITALIDAD RENOVADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF DEPRESSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PREFRONTAL CORTEX - L \\/ PREFRONTAL CORTEX - L] (REF 650) AXIS TO PROMOTE A POSITIVE MINDSET. FOR CASES INVOLVING ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE TO EMOTIONAL STRESS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [C\\u00d3RTEX PREFRONTAL - I \\/ C\\u00d3RTEX PREFRONTAL - I] (REF 650) PARA PROMOVER UNA MENTALIDAD POSITIVA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ TIMO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/664','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:28:39','2026-04-28 15:28:39'),(4452,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',665,'{\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH SYMPTOMS, HIGH FEVER, HEADACHE, MUSCLE AND JOINT PAIN, RASH, BACK PAIN AND JOINT PAIN. DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, PARALYSIS, RESPIRATORY MUSCLE WEAKNESS, RESPIRATORY ARREST, BLEEDING, SHOCK, COLD AND EYE PAIN. (S\\u00cdNTOMAS G\\u00c1STRICOS, FIEBRE ALTA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MUSCULAR Y ARTICULAR, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, DOLOR DE ESPALDA Y DOLOR ARTICULAR. MAREOS, FATIGA, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, DEBILIDAD DE LOS M\\u00daSCULOS RESPIRATORIOS, PARO RESPIRATORIO, HEMORRAGIA, SHOCK, RESFRIADO Y DOLOR OCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITO BITES. LOW INTERFERON LEVELS. (TRANSMITIDO POR PICADURAS DE MOSQUITOS. NIVELES BAJOS DE INTERFER\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION; PATIENT IS LIKELY TO VOMIT AFTER BALANCING THE PAIR. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N; ES PROBABLE QUE EL PACIENTE VOMITE DESPU\\u00c9S DE EQUILIBRAR EL PAR.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HIGH FEVER, SEVERE HEADACHE, MUSCLE AND JOINT PAIN, RASH, AND BACK PAIN. POTENTIAL FOR DIZZINESS, FATIGUE, RESPIRATORY WEAKNESS, BLEEDING, AND SHOCK.\\n\\n(FIEBRE ALTA, DOLOR DE CABEZA SEVERO, DOLOR MUSCULAR Y ARTICULAR, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y DOLOR DE ESPALDA. POTENCIAL DE MAREOS, FATIGA, DEBILIDAD RESPIRATORIA, HEMORRAGIA Y SHOCK.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE HEMORRHAGIC DENGUE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA) AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE VIRUS DRAMATICALLY LOWERS INTERFERON LEVELS, WEAKENING THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AND AFFECTING VASCULAR PERMEABILITY. THE RACHIDIAN BULB REGULATES VITAL AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS, INCLUDING RESPIRATION AND CIRCULATION; THEREFORE, AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO RESPIRATORY ARREST OR CIRCULATORY SHOCK. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REGAINING CONTROL OVER VIRAL REPLICATION AND PROTECTING THE INTEGRITY OF THE BLOOD VESSELS AND NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL DENGUE HEMORR\\u00c1GICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL VIRUS DISMINUYE DR\\u00c1STICAMENTE LOS NIVELES DE INTERFER\\u00d3N, DEBILITANDO LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA Y AFECTANDO LA PERMEABILIDAD VASCULAR. EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO REGULA FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS VITALES, INCLUYENDO LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N Y LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N; POR LO TANTO, UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A UN PARO RESPIRATORIO O CHOQUE CIRCULATORIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RECUPERAR EL CONTROL SOBRE LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL Y A PROTEGER LA INTEGRIDAD DE LOS VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS Y DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: THE PATIENT IS LIKELY TO VOMIT IMMEDIATELY AFTER BALANCING THIS PAIR AS THE BODY BEGINS A RAPID DETOXIFICATION PROCESS. IF HEMORRHAGIC SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [DUODENUM \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ADDRESS COMPLEMENTARY VIRAL RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN PROCESSING VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE ACUTE PHASE.\\n\\n(PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: ES PROBABLE QUE EL PACIENTE VOMITE INMEDIATAMENTE DESPU\\u00c9S DE EQUILIBRAR ESTE PAR MIENTRAS EL CUERPO COMIENZA UN PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N R\\u00c1PIDA. SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS HEMORR\\u00c1GICOS PRESENTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DUODENO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ABORDAR RESONANCIAS VIRALES COMPLEMENTARIAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE AGUDA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/665','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:30:04','2026-04-28 15:30:04'),(4453,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',666,'{\"symptoms\":\"LOSS OF BALANCE, DIZZINESS, STAGGERING, AND INCOORDINATION OF MOVEMENTS. AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR, DEPRESSION, ALTERED EMOTIONAL STATE, SWEATING. (P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, MAREOS, TAMBaleo E INCOORDINACI\\u00d3N DE MOVIMIENTOS. COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, ESTADO EMOCIONAL ALTERADO, SUDORACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY EATING UNDERCOOKED CHICKEN AND RAW EGGS. BIRD FLU. PARALYSIS OF RESPIRATORY MUSCLES. APNEA, SCHIZOPHRENIA, BIPOLAR, FALSE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, FALSE ALZHEIMER\'S. (TRANSMITIDO POR CONSUMIR POLLO POCO COCIDO Y HUEVOS CRUDOS. GRIPE AVIAR. PAR\\u00c1LISIS DE LOS M\\u00daSCULOS RESPIRATORIOS. APNEA, ESQUIZOFRENIA, TRASTORNO BIPOLAR, FALSA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, FALSO ALZHEIMER.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LOSS OF BALANCE, DIZZINESS, STAGGERING, AND INCOORDINATION OF MOVEMENTS. AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR, DEPRESSION, ALTERED EMOTIONAL STATE, AND SWEATING.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, MAREOS, TAMBALEO E INCOORDINACI\\u00d3N DE MOVIMIENTOS. COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, ESTADO EMOCIONAL ALTERADO Y SUDORACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE NEWCASTLE VIRUS (BIRD FLU) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA) AND THE CEREBELLUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY CRITICAL AS THE VIRUS IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH UNDERCOOKED CHICKEN OR RAW EGGS. THE VIRUS HAS A STRONG AFFINITY FOR THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, WHERE IT CAN CAUSE SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL DISRUPTIONS. IF LEFT UNTREATED, IT MAY LEAD TO PARALYSIS OF THE RESPIRATORY MUSCLES (APNEA) AND CAN MIMIC SYMPTOMS OF PSYCHOLOGICAL OR DEGENERATIVE DISORDERS, SUCH AS SCHIZOPHRENIA, BIPOLAR DISORDER, ALZHEIMER\'S, OR MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD AND RESTORING PROPER MOTOR COORDINATION AND EMOTIONAL STABILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE NEWCASTLE (GRIPE AVIAR) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y EL CEREBELO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE EL VIRUS SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO POR EL CONSUMO DE POLLO POCO COCIDO O HUEVOS CRUDOS. EL VIRUS TIENE UNA FUERTE AFINIDAD POR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DONDE PUEDE CAUSAR ALTERACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS GRAVES. SI NO SE TRATA, PUEDE PROVOCAR PAR\\u00c1LISIS DE LOS M\\u00daSCULOS RESPIRATORIOS (APNEA) Y PUEDE IMITAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE TRASTORNOS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS O DEGENERATIVOS, COMO ESQUIZOFRENIA, TRASTORNO BIPOLAR, ALZHEIMER O ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL Y A RESTAURAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N MOTORA ADECUADA Y LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF BALANCE ISSUES OR DIZZINESS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PREPINEAL \\/ MEDULLA OBLONGATA] (REF 653) AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER NEURODEGENERATIVE FACTORS. FOR SEVERE EMOTIONAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RACHIDIAN BULB \\/ ARMPIT] (REF 673) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN PROCESSING VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO O LOS MAREOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PREPINEAL \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] (REF 653) PARA DESCARTAR OTROS FACTORES NEURODEGENERATIVOS. PARA MALESTAR EMOCIONAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ AXILA] (REF 673). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/666','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:31:12','2026-04-28 15:31:12'),(4454,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',667,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CRUELTY (CRUELDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CRUELTY (CRUELDAD)\",\"symptoms\":\"LACK OF EMPATHY, EMOTIONAL DETACHMENT, AND AGGRESSIVE IMPULSES.\\n\\n(FALTA DE EMPAT\\u00cdA, DESAPEGO EMOCIONAL E IMPULSOS AGRESIVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE COMPLEX DYNAMIC OF CRUELTY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA) AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS THE CONNECTION PRECISELY BETWEEN THE BRAIN\'S AUTONOMIC CONTROL CENTER AND THE EMOTIONAL CORE OF THE BODY. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO A \\\"SHORT CIRCUIT\\\" IN COMPASSION, WHERE THE INDIVIDUAL MAY EXHIBIT HARSH OR COLD BEHAVIORS TOWARD OTHERS OR THEMSELVES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN SOFTENING EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY, RE-ESTABLISHING THE VAGAL TONE THAT SUPPORTS SOCIAL BONDING, AND FOSTERING A MORE HARMONIOUS AND EMPATHETIC DISPOSITION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA COMPLEJA DIN\\u00c1MICA DE LA CRUELDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N PRECISA ENTRE EL CENTRO DE CONTROL AUT\\u00d3NOMO DEL CEREBRO Y EL N\\u00daCLEO EMOCIONAL DEL CUERPO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE PROVOCAR UN \\\"CORTOCIRCUITO\\\" EN LA COMPASI\\u00d3N, DONDE EL INDIVIDUO PUEDE MOSTRAR COMPORTAMIENTOS DUROS O FR\\u00cdOS HACIA LOS DEM\\u00c1S O HACIA S\\u00cd MISMO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A SUAVIZAR LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL, REESTABLECIENDO EL TONO VAGAL QUE APOYA EL V\\u00cdNCULO SOCIAL Y FOMENTANDO UNA DISPOSICI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S ARMONIOSA Y EMP\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF AGGRESSIVE PATTERNS PERSIST, SCAN THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] AXIS TO REGULATE THE FEAR AND AGGRESSION RESPONSE. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP GRIEF THAT MAY BE MANIFESTING AS COLDNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEART \\/ HEART] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL RESPONSE DURING THE REINTEGRATION OF EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS PATRONES AGRESIVOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA REGULAR LA RESPUESTA AL MIEDO Y LA AGRESI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN DUELO PROFUNDO QUE PUEDA ESTAR MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO FRIALDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RESPUESTA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE LA REINTEGRACI\\u00d3N DEL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/667','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:32:26','2026-04-28 15:32:26'),(4455,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',668,'{\"origins\":\"GUILLIAN BARRE (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"POLYRADICULAR (POLIRRADICULAR)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 SYNDROME (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"PARALYSIS, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, NUMBNESS, TINGLING, AND LOSS OF REFLEXES.\\n\\n(PAR\\u00c1LISIS, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, ENTUMECIMIENTO, HORMIGUEO Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE REFLEJOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 SYNDROME BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA) AND THE PINEAL GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE VIRAL LOAD CAUSES A POLYRADICULAR (POLYNEUROPATHY) INFLAMMATION, WHERE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM MISTAKENLY ATTACKS THE PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. THE RACHIDIAN BULB CONTROLS VITAL AUTONOMIC FUNCTIONS, AND THE PINEAL GLAND REGULATES BIOLOGICAL RHYTHMS; AN IMBALANCE HERE DISRUPTS THE CORTICAL VOLTAGE AND NERVE SIGNAL CONDUCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN HALTING THE ATTACK ON THE MYELIN SHEATH, REDUCING NERVE INFLAMMATION, AND SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF MUSCULAR CONTROL AND SENSORY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL ABORDA EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA CARGA VIRAL PROVOCA UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N POLIRRADICULAR (POLINEUROPAT\\u00cdA), DONDE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO ATACA POR ERROR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO. EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO CONTROLA FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS VITALES Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PINEAL REGULA LOS RITMOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS; UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd ALTERA EL VOLTAJE CORTICAL Y LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N DE LAS SE\\u00d1ALES NERVIOSAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A DETENER EL ATAQUE A LA VAINA DE MIELINA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DEL CONTROL MUSCULAR Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF PARALYSIS OR WEAKNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL VIRAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RACHIDIAN BULB \\/ BLADDER] (REF 674) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING THE BIOCHEMICAL BYPRODUCTS OF NERVE REPAIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS O LA DEBILIDAD PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES RESERVORIOS VIRALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 674). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BIOQU\\u00cdMICOS DE LA REPARACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/668','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:33:35','2026-04-28 15:33:35'),(4456,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',669,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TYPHOID (FIEBRE TIFOIDEA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"TYPHOID FEVER, SEVERE DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, AND GASTROINTESTINAL INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(FIEBRE TIFOIDEA, DIARREA SEVERA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS BALANTIDIUM COLI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA) AND THE TRAPEZIUS MUSCLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CLOSELY LINKED TO TYPHOID-LIKE SYMPTOMS (FIEBRE TIFOIDEA), AS THE PARASITE CAN CAUSE SIGNIFICANT ULCERATION IN THE COLON TISSUE. THE RACHIDIAN BULB REGULATES VITAL AUTONOMIC RESPONSES, WHILE THE TRAPEZIUS OFTEN HARBORS TENSION RELATED TO SYSTEMIC TOXICITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PROTOZOAN LOAD, REDUCING INTESTINAL IRRITATION, AND STABILIZING THE BODY\'S TEMPERATURE REGULATION MECHANISMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE AL BALANTIDIUM COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y EL M\\u00daSCULO TRAPECIO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 ESTRECHAMENTE VINCULADO A S\\u00cdNTOMAS TIPO TIFOIDEOS (FIEBRE TIFOIDEA), YA QUE EL PAR\\u00c1SITO PUEDE CAUSAR UNA ULCERACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA EN EL TEJIDO DEL COLON. EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO REGULA RESPUESTAS AUT\\u00d3NOMAS VITALES, MIENTRAS QUE EL TRAPECIO A MENUDO ACUMULA TENSI\\u00d3N RELACIONADA CON LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA DE PROTOZOOS, REDUCIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y ESTABILIZANDO LOS MECANISMOS DE REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA TEMPERATURA CORPORAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF GASTROINTESTINAL SYMPTOMS OR FEVER PERSIST, SCAN THE [TROCHANTER MINOR \\/ TROCHANTER MINOR] AXIS TO RULE OUT SALMONELLA TYPHI. FOR SEVERE MUSCULAR TENSION IN THE NECK AND SHOULDERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TRAPEZIUM \\/ TRAPEZIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES O LA FIEBRE PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TROC\\u00c1NTER MENOR \\/ TROC\\u00c1NTER MENOR] PARA DESCARTAR SALMONELLA TYPHI. PARA TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR SEVERA EN EL CUELLO Y LOS HOMBROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TRAPECIO \\/ TRAPECIO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE TOXINAS PARASITARIAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/669','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:34:40','2026-04-28 15:34:40'),(4457,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',670,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MENINGITIS, INSUFFICIENT VENTILATORY; MAY CAUSE DEATH. (MENINGITIS, VENTILACI\\u00d3N INSUFICIENTE; PUEDE CAUSAR LA MUERTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-RESPIRATORY VIRUS (VIRUS NEURO-RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"MENINGITIS, INSUFFICIENT VENTILATION, AND POTENTIAL FOR RESPIRATORY FAILURE. MAY CAUSE DEATH.\\n\\n(MENINGITIS, VENTILACI\\u00d3N INSUFICIENTE Y POTENCIAL DE INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA. PUEDE CAUSAR LA MUERTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS CRITICAL VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS PATHOGENS AFFECTING THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA) AND THE THYROID GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS EXTREMELY SIGNIFICANT AS IT INVOLVES THE BODY\'S PRIMARY RESPIRATORY CONTROL CENTER. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL INFLAMMATION (MENINGITIS) AND DISRUPT THE AUTOMATIC SIGNALING REQUIRED FOR BREATHING. IF VENTILATORY CAPACITY BECOMES INSUFFICIENT, IT POSES A DIRECT THREAT TO LIFE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING CEREBROSPINAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING VITAL AUTONOMIC CONTROL OVER THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL CR\\u00cdTICA SE DIRIGE A PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTAN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES EXTREMADAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE INVOLUCRA EL CENTRO DE CONTROL RESPIRATORIO PRIMARIO DEL CUERPO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA GRAVE (MENINGITIS) Y ALTERAR LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N AUTOM\\u00c1TICA NECESARIA PARA LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N. SI LA CAPACIDAD VENTILATORIA SE VUELVE INSUFICIENTE, REPRESENTA UNA AMENAZA DIRECTA PARA LA VIDA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CEREBROESPINAL Y RESTAURANDO EL CONTROL AUT\\u00d3NOMO VITAL SOBRE EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"URGENT CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY DISTRESS OR MENINGEAL SIGNS PERSIST, SCAN THE [RACHIDIAN BULB \\/ BLADDER] (REF 674) AXIS TO RULE OUT HEMORRHAGIC VIRAL STRAINS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FEVER OR STIFF NECK, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN CLEARING NEUROTOXINS DURING THE ACUTE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N URGENTE: SI LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA O LOS SIGNOS MEN\\u00cdNGEOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 674) PARA DESCARTAR CEPAS VIRALES HEMORR\\u00c1GICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE SEVERA O RIGIDEZ DE NUCA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE NEUROTOXINAS DURANTE LA FASE AGUDA DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/670','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:36:00','2026-04-28 15:36:00'),(4458,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',682,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, VOMITING, SKIN-HAIR-NAIL DISORDERS, (FIEBRE, V\\u00d3MITO, TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL, CABELLO Y U\\u00d1AS,)\",\"paths\":\"ALLERGIES (ALERGIAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE REACTIVITY (REACTIVIDAD INMUNITARIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, VOMITING, AND DISORDERS OF THE SKIN, HAIR, AND NAILS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, V\\u00d3MITO Y TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL, CABELLO Y U\\u00d1AS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC ALLERGIES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE RETROHEPATIC AREA (THE SPACE BEHIND THE LIVER). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR MANAGING HYPERSENSITIVITY REACTIONS THAT MANIFEST THROUGH THE BODY\'S EXTERNAL BARRIERS, SUCH AS DERMATITIS, HAIR LOSS, OR BRITTLE NAILS. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN TRIGGERS AN EXAGGERATED IMMUNE RESPONSE, LEADING TO ACUTE SYMPTOMS LIKE VOMITING AND FEVER AS THE BODY ATTEMPTS TO EXPEL PERCEIVED ALLERGENS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\'S OVERREACTION, PROMOTING THE HEALING OF INTEGUMENTARY TISSUES AND RESTORING METABOLIC TOLERANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LAS ALERGIAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH EN EL \\u00c1REA RETROHEP\\u00c1TICA (EL ESPACIO DETR\\u00c1S DEL H\\u00cdGADO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA EL MANEJO DE REACCIONES DE HIPERSENSIBILIDAD QUE SE MANIFIESTAN A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS BARRERAS EXTERNAS DEL CUERPO, COMO DERMATITIS, CA\\u00cdDA DEL CABELLO O U\\u00d1AS QUEBRADIZAS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO DESENCADENA UNA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA EXAGERADA, PROVOCANDO S\\u00cdNTOMAS AGUDOS COMO V\\u00d3MITO Y FIEBRE MIENTRAS EL CUERPO INTENTA EXPULSAR LOS AL\\u00c9RGENOS PERCIBIDOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA SOBRERREACCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO, PROMOVIENDO LA CURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS TEGUMENTARIOS Y RESTAURANDO LA TOLERANCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ALLERGY CHECK: IF SKIN DISORDERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER TOXIN FILTRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] (REF 656) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF HISTAMINES AND OTHER INFLAMMATORY BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ALERGIAS: SI LOS TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE TOXINAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] (REF 656). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE HISTAMINAS Y OTROS SUBPRODUCTOS INFLAMATORIOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/682','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:37:16','2026-04-28 15:37:16'),(4459,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',683,'{\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES, FEVER, VOMITING, SKIN DISORDERS, HAIR LOSS, BLINDNESS. (ALERGIAS, FIEBRE, V\\u00d3MITOS, TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO, CEGUERA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY HAIR OF ANIMALS. ALLERGIC ASTMA. LARYNGEAL OBSTRUCTIONS. CIRRHOSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR EL PELO DE LOS ANIMALES. ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA. OBSTRUCCIONES LAR\\u00cdNGEAS. CIRROSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - POSTERIOR LIVER LOBE\\/KIDNEY (R) (REVISAR - L\\u00d3BULO POSTERIOR DEL H\\u00cdGADO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D))\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES, FEVER, VOMITING, SKIN DISORDERS, HAIR LOSS, AND POTENTIAL BLINDNESS.\\n\\n(ALERGIAS, FIEBRE, V\\u00d3MITOS, TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO Y POSIBLE CEGUERA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS TOXOCARA (A GENUS OF NEMATODES OR ROUNDWORMS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RETROHEPATIC AREA AND THE HORIZONTAL RETROHEPATIC AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS IT IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH ANIMAL HAIR OR INFECTED SOIL. ONCE IN THE HUMAN BODY, THE LARVAE CAN MIGRATE THROUGH VARIOUS ORGANS (VISCERAL LARVA MIGRANS), POTENTIALLY CAUSING ALLERGIC ASTHMA, LARYNGEAL OBSTRUCTIONS, AND EVEN LIVER CIRRHOSIS. A CRITICAL RISK ASSOCIATED WITH THIS PARASITE IS ITS ABILITY TO REACH THE EYES (OCULAR LARVA MIGRANS), WHICH CAN LEAD TO PERMANENT BLINDNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE LARVAL LOAD, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE HEPATIC AND RESPIRATORY SYSTEMS, AND PROTECTING OCULAR HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A LA TOXOCARA (UN G\\u00c9NERO DE NEM\\u00c1TODOS O GUSANOS REDONDOS) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00c1REA RETROHEP\\u00c1TICA Y EL EJE RETROHEP\\u00c1TICO HORIZONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE POR EL CONTACTO CON EL PELO DE ANIMALES O TIERRA INFECTADA. UNA VEZ EN EL CUERPO HUMANO, LAS LARVAS PUEDEN MIGRAR A TRAV\\u00c9S DE VARIOS \\u00d3RGANOS (LARVA MIGRANS VISCERAL), CAUSANDO POTENCIALMENTE ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA, OBSTRUCCIONES LAR\\u00cdNGEAS E INCLUSO CIRROSIS HEP\\u00c1TICA. UN RIESGO CR\\u00cdTICO ASOCIADO CON ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO ES SU CAPACIDAD PARA LLEGAR A LOS OJOS (LARVA MIGRANS OCULAR), LO QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR CEGUERA PERMANENTE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA LARVARIA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LOS SISTEMAS HEP\\u00c1TICO Y RESPIRATORIO, Y PROTEGIENDO LA SALUD OCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HEPATIC OR OCULAR SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [POSTERIOR LIVER LOBE \\/ KIDNEY (R)] AXIS TO RULE OUT COMPLEMENTARY LARVAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ALLERGIC ASTHMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RETROHEPATIC \\/ RETROHEPATIC] (REF 681) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS GENERAL IMMUNE REACTIVITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS U OCULARES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [L\\u00d3BULO POSTERIOR DEL H\\u00cdGADO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)] PARA DESCARTAR RESERVORIOS LARVARIOS COMPLEMENTARIOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RETROHEP\\u00c1TICO \\/ RETROHEP\\u00c1TICO] (REF 681) PARA ABORDAR LA REACTIVIDAD INMUNITARIA GENERAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/683','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:38:40','2026-04-28 15:38:40'),(4460,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',684,'{\"symptoms\":\"NAIL FUNGUS, GENITAL FUNGUS, UNDER ARM FUNGUS.(HONGOS EN LAS U\\u00d1AS, HONGOS GENITALES, HONGOS EN LAS AXILAS.)\",\"paths\":\"ATHLETES FOOT. ALOPECIA. (PIE DE ATLETA. ALOPECIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CAVA        CHECK - BIG TOE (REVISAR - VENA CAVA        REVISAR - DEDO GORDO DEL PIE)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"NAIL FUNGUS, GENITAL FUNGUS, AND UNDERARM FUNGUS.\\n\\n(HONGOS EN LAS U\\u00d1AS, HONGOS GENITALES Y HONGOS EN LAS AXILAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS TRICHOPHYTON BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE FIRST RIBS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS A PRIMARY CIRCUIT FOR ADDRESSING DERMATOPHYTOSIS\\u2014FUNGAL INFECTIONS THAT FEED ON KERATIN. AN IMBALANCE HERE FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS ATHLETE\'S FOOT (TINEA PEDIS), RINGWORM, OR PERSISTENT INFECTIONS IN THE NAILS AND GENITAL AREAS. ADDITIONALLY, THIS RESONANCE IS OFTEN LINKED TO UNEXPLAINED HAIR LOSS (ALOPECIA) WHEN THE PATHOGEN AFFECTS THE SCALP. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGAL LOAD, REDUCING SKIN IRRITATION, AND SUPPORTING THE REGENERATION OF HEALTHY KERATIN TISSUES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE AL TRICHOPHYTON MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS PRIMERAS COSTILLAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES UN CIRCUITO PRIMARIO PARA ABORDAR LA DERMATOFITOSIS: INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS QUE SE ALIMENTAN DE QUERATINA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SE MANIFIESTA FRECUENTEMENTE COMO PIE DE ATLETA (TINEA PEDIS), TI\\u00d1A O INFECCIONES PERSISTENTES EN LAS U\\u00d1AS Y \\u00c1REAS GENITALES. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTA RESONANCIA SE VINCULA A MENUDO CON LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO INEXPLICABLE (ALOPECIA) CUANDO EL PAT\\u00d3GENO AFECTA EL CUERO CABELLUDO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, REDUCIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL Y APOYANDO LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS DE QUERATINA SALUDABLES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF FUNGAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST IN THE EXTREMITIES, SCAN THE [BIG TOE \\/ BIG TOE] AXIS TO RULE OUT LOCALIZED RESERVOIRS. FOR SYSTEMIC FUNGAL SPREAD, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CAVA \\/ CAVA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL ELIMINATION OF FUNGAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00daNGICOS PERSISTEN EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [DEDO GORDO DEL PIE \\/ DEDO GORDO DEL PIE] PARA DESCARTAR RESERVORIOS LOCALIZADOS. PARA LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VENA CAVA \\/ VENA CAVA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE SUBPRODUCTOS F\\u00daNGICOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/684','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:41:29','2026-04-28 15:41:29'),(4461,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',685,'{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE, FACIAL AND SKIN DISORDERS. (ACN\\u00c9, TRASTORNOS FACIALES Y DE LA PIEL.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ACNE, FACIAL ERUPTIONS, AND VARIOUS SKIN DISORDERS.\\n\\n(ACN\\u00c9, ERUPCIONES FACIALES Y DIVERSOS TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS EPIDERMIDIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE JAW\'S RIGHT ANGLE. ALTHOUGH THIS BACTERIA IS A NORMAL INHABITANT OF HEALTHY HUMAN SKIN, AN IMBALANCE IN THIS SPECIFIC MAGNETIC CIRCUIT CAN TRIGGER PATHOGENIC BEHAVIOR, LEADING TO PERSISTENT ACNE VULGARIS AND INFLAMMATORY SKIN CONDITIONS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR RESTORING THE DERMAL MICROBIOME\'S EQUILIBRIUM. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REGULATING BACTERIAL OVERGROWTH, REDUCING SEBACEOUS INFLAMMATION, AND PROMOTING THE CLEARING OF FACIAL ERUPTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS EPIDERMIDIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL \\u00c1NGULO DERECHO DE LA MAND\\u00cdBULA. AUNQUE ESTA BACTERIA ES UN HABITANTE NORMAL DE LA PIEL HUMANA SANA, UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO MAGN\\u00c9TICO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PUEDE DESENCADENAR UN COMPORTAMIENTO PAT\\u00d3GENO, LO QUE CONDUCE A ACN\\u00c9 VULGARIS PERSISTENTE Y AFECCIONES INFLAMATORIAS DE LA PIEL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL MICROBIOMA D\\u00c9RMICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REGULAR EL CRECIMIENTO BACTERIANO EXCESIVO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEB\\u00c1CEA Y PROMOVIENDO LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ERUPCIONES FACIALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMAL CHECK: IF ACNE OR SKIN IRRITATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [EPIPLOON \\/ EPIPLOON] AXIS TO RULE OUT STAPHYLOCOCCUS ALBUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BRACHIAL \\/ BRACHIAL] RESONANCE TO ADDRESS STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE SKIN\'S HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N D\\u00c9RMICA: SI EL ACN\\u00c9 O LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [EPIPL\\u00d3N \\/ EPIPL\\u00d3N] PARA DESCARTAR EL STAPHYLOCOCCUS ALBUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BRAQUIAL \\/ BRAQUIAL] PARA ABORDAR EL STAPHYLOCOCCUS\\u9810REUS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/685','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:43:57','2026-04-28 15:43:57'),(4462,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',686,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PRIDE (ORGULLO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL BLOCK (BLOQUEO EMOCIONAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ARROGANCE, LACK OF HUMILITY, AND RIGIDITY IN BELIEFS.\\n\\n(ARROGANCIA, FALTA DE HUMILDAD Y RIGIDEZ EN LAS CREENCIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PSYCHOLOGICAL TRAIT OF PRIDE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE ROLANDIC FISSURE (CENTRAL SULCUS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AREA IS CRITICAL AS IT SEPARATES THE MOTOR CORTEX FROM THE SENSORY CORTEX, ACTING AS A BRIDGE BETWEEN ACTION AND PERCEPTION. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS AN OVERINFLATED SENSE OF SELF OR \\\"PRIDE,\\\" WHICH DISTORTS HOW AN INDIVIDUAL INTERACTS WITH THEIR ENVIRONMENT AND OTHERS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN SOFTENING MENTAL RIGIDITY, PROMOTING SELF-REFLECTION, AND RESTORING EMOTIONAL BALANCE AND HUMILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL RASGO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO DEL ORGULLO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LA FISURA DE ROLANDO (SURCO CENTRAL). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA \\u00c1REA ES CR\\u00cdTICA YA QUE SEPARA LA CORTEZA MOTORA DE LA CORTEZA SENSORIAL, ACTUANDO COMO UN PUENTE ENTRE LA ACCI\\u00d3N Y LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN SENTIDO EXAGERADO DEL YO O \\\"ORGULLO\\\", QUE DISTORSIONA C\\u00d3MO EL INDIVIDUO INTERACT\\u00daA CON SU ENTORNO Y CON LOS DEM\\u00c1S. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A SUAVIZAR LA RIGIDEZ MENTAL, PROMOVIENDO LA AUTORREFLEXI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL Y LA HUMILDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF RIGIDITY OR ARROGANCE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] AXIS TO REGULATE DEFENSIVE EMOTIONAL RESPONSES. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP-SEATED ANGER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL SYSTEM DURING THE RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL TENSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA RIGIDEZ O LA ARROGANCIA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA REGULAR LAS RESPUESTAS EMOCIONALES DEFENSIVAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRA PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/686','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:45:09','2026-04-28 15:45:09'),(4463,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',687,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ENDOMETRIOSIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"UTERINE DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N UTERINA)\",\"symptoms\":\"PELVIC PAIN, HEAVY OR IRREGULAR MENSTRUAL BLEEDING, INFERTILITY ISSUES, AND CRAMPING.\\n\\n(DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO, SANGRADO MENSTRUAL ABUNDANTE O IRREGULAR, PROBLEMAS DE INFERTILIDAD Y C\\u00d3LICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE SPECIFICALLY ADDRESSES ENDOMETRIOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SACRUM AND THE UTERUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS VITAL FOR REGULATING THE ENERGETIC AND BIOLOGICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE PELVIC CAVITY. ENDOMETRIOSIS OCCURS WHEN TISSUE SIMILAR TO THE UTERINE LINING GROWS OUTSIDE THE UTERUS, OFTEN LEADING TO CHRONIC INFLAMMATION AND ADHESIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REDUCING THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE, BALANCING LOCAL TISSUE PH TO DISCOURAGE ABNORMAL GROWTH, AND RELIEVING THE MECHANICAL TENSION OFTEN HELD IN THE SACRAL REGION THAT EXACERBATES PELVIC DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE LA ENDOMETRIOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SACRO Y EL \\u00daTERO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES VITAL PARA REGULAR EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO Y BIOL\\u00d3GICO DE LA CAVIDAD P\\u00c9LVICA. LA ENDOMETRIOSIS OCURRE CUANDO TEJIDO SIMILAR AL REVESTIMIENTO UTERINO CRECE FUERA DEL \\u00daTERO, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA Y ADHERENCIAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REDUCIR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA, EQUILIBRANDO EL PH DEL TEJIDO LOCAL PARA DESALENTAR EL CRECIMIENTO ANORMAL Y ALIVIANDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA QUE A MENUDO SE ACUMULA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N SACRA Y EXACERBA EL MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR CHECK: IF HORMONAL IMBALANCES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PITUITARY \\/ OVARIES] AXIS TO REGULATE THE REPRODUCTIVE FEEDBACK LOOP. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ADHESIONS OR POTENTIAL PATHOGENIC COMPLICATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RECTUM \\/ RECTUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF INFLAMMATORY BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR: SI PERSISTEN LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS HORMONALES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ OVARIOS] PARA REGULAR EL CICLO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ADHERENCIAS SEVERAS O POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES PAT\\u00d3GENAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RECTO \\/ RECTO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS INFLAMATORIOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/687','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:46:16','2026-04-28 15:46:16'),(4464,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',688,'{\"symptoms\":\"BLADDER AND RENAL DISORDERS. (TRASTORNOS DE LA VEJIGA Y RENALES.)\",\"paths\":\"SCARLET FEVER. NOCTURIA, ENURESIS. (ESCARLATINA. NOCTURIA, ENURESIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BLADDER AND RENAL DISORDERS, NOCTURIA, ENURESIS, AND SCARLET FEVER.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DE LA VEJIGA Y RENALES, NOCTURIA, ENURESIS Y ESCARLATINA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS GROUP G BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SACRUM AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INFECTIONS THAT AFFECT THE LOWER URINARY TRACT AND THE RENAL SYSTEM. THE PATHOGEN IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH SCARLET FEVER AND CAN CAUSE SIGNIFICANT IRRITATION TO THE BLADDER LINING, LEADING TO SYMPTOMS SUCH AS ENURESIS (INVOLUNTARY URINATION) AND NOCTURIA (FREQUENT NIGHTTIME URINATION). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE URINARY ORGANS, AND RESTORING PROPER NEUROMUSCULAR CONTROL OVER BLADDER FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL STREPTOCOCCUS GRUPO G MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SACRO Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES QUE AFECTAN EL TRACTO URINARIO INFERIOR Y EL SISTEMA RENAL. EL PAT\\u00d3GENO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON LA ESCARLATINA Y PUEDE CAUSAR UNA IRRITACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA EN EL REVESTIMIENTO DE LA VEJIGA, LO QUE CONDUCE A S\\u00cdNTOMAS COMO ENURESIS (MICCI\\u00d3N INVOLUNTARIA) Y NOCTURIA (MICCI\\u00d3N NOCTURNA FRECUENTE). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS URINARIOS Y RESTAURANDO EL CONTROL NEUROMUSCULAR ADECUADO SOBRE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"URINARY CHECK: IF BLADDER IRRITATION PERSIST, SCAN THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] AXIS TO RULE OUT PROTEUS MIRABILIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RENAL DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PUDENDAL NERVE \\/ PUDENDAL NERVE] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE NERVOUS REGULATION OF THE PELVIC FLOOR DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N URINARIA: SI LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA VEJIGA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SACRO \\/ SACRO] PARA DESCARTAR EL PROTEUS MIRABILIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR RENAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [NERVIO PUDENDO \\/ NERVIO PUDENDO] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA DEL SUELO P\\u00c9LVICO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/688','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:47:21','2026-04-28 15:47:21'),(4465,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',689,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"URIC ACID AND GOUT. (\\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO Y GOTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"GOUT, JOINT PAIN, INFLAMMATION, AND ELEVATED URIC ACID LEVELS.\\n\\n(GOTA, DOLOR ARTICULAR, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y NIVELES ELEVADOS DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ACCUMULATION OF URIC ACID BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SACRUM AND THE CERVICAL PLEXUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE ELIMINATION OF NITROGENOUS WASTE AND PREVENTING THE CRYSTALLIZATION OF URATE IN THE JOINTS (GOUT). THE SACRUM IS A KEY CENTER FOR PELVIC AND AUTONOMIC SIGNALING, WHILE THE CERVICAL PLEXUS OVERSEES NEUROLOGICAL INPUTS FROM THE UPPER SPINE. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT DISRUPTS THE METABOLIC FEEDBACK LOOPS RESPONSIBLE FOR CHEMICAL BALANCE. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN PROCESSING PURINES MORE EFFICIENTLY, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AND ALLEVIATING THE ACUTE PAIN ASSOCIATED WITH GOUTY ARTHRITIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SACRO Y EL PLEXO CERVICAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS NITROGENADOS Y PREVENIR LA CRISTALIZACI\\u00d3N DE URATO EN LAS ARTICULACIONES (GOTA). EL SACRO ES UN CENTRO CLAVE PARA LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y AUT\\u00d3NOMA, MIENTRAS QUE EL PLEXO CERVICAL SUPERVISA LAS ENTRADAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS DESDE LA PARTE SUPERIOR DE LA COLUMNA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO ALTERA LOS CICLOS DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA RESPONSABLES DEL EQUILIBRIO QU\\u00cdMICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A PROCESAR LAS PURINAS DE MANERA M\\u00c1S EFICIENTE, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ALIVIANDO EL DOLOR AGUDO ASOCIADO CON LA ARTRITIS GOTOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF URIC ACID LEVELS REMAIN HIGH, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE OPTIMAL RENAL FILTRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE JOINT DEGENERATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE PROTEIN METABOLISM PROCESS AND TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE DETOXIFICATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LOS NIVELES DE \\u00c1CIDO \\u00daRICO SIGUEN SIENDO ALTOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL \\u00d3PTIMA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEGENERACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SACRO \\/ SACRO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR EL PROCESO DE METABOLISMO DE LAS PROTE\\u00cdNAS Y ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/689','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:49:09','2026-04-28 15:49:09'),(4466,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',690,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEMORRHOIDS AND VARICOSE VEINS. (HEMORROIDES Y V\\u00c1RICES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEMORRHOIDS, VARICOSE VEINS, AND PELVIC CONGESTION.\\n\\n(HEMORROIDES Y V\\u00c1RICES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES VASCULAR CIRCULATION ISSUES IN THE LOWER BODY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SACRUM AND THE COCCYX. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR RELIEVING PRESSURE WITHIN THE VENOUS SYSTEM OF THE PELVIS AND LOWER EXTREMITIES. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN LEADS TO THE FORMATION OF HEMORRHORDS OR VARICOSE VEINS DUE TO POOR BLOOD RETURN AND LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION. BY STABILIZING THIS TERMINAL SEGMENT OF THE SPINE, THE RESET ASSISTS IN IMPROVING VASCULAR TONE, REDUCING PELVIC CONGESTION, AND ALLEVIATING THE DISCOMFORT ASSOCIATED WITH SWOLLEN OR DISTENDED VEINS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA PROBLEMAS DE CIRCULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR EN LA PARTE INFERIOR DEL CUERPO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SACRO Y EL C\\u00d3CCIX. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ALIVIAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL SISTEMA VENOSO DE LA PELVIS Y LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO CONDUCE A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE HEMORROIDES O V\\u00c1RICES DEBIDO AL MAL RETORNO SANGU\\u00cdNEO Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE SEGMENTO TERMINAL DE LA COLUMNA, EL REINICIO AYUDA A MEJORAR EL TONO VASCULAR, REDUCIENDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y ALIVIANDO EL MALESTAR ASOCIADO CON LAS VENAS INFLAMADAS O DISTENDIDAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF VARICOSE VEINS ARE PERSISTENT IN THE LEGS, SCAN THE [ILIAC \\/ ILIAC] AXIS TO IMPROVE OVERALL BLOOD FLOW. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEMORRHOIDAL INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RECTUM \\/ RECTUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS THAT MAY BE CONTRIBUTING TO VASCULAR FRAGILITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI LAS V\\u00c1RICES SON PERSISTENTES EN LAS PIERNAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [IL\\u00cdACO \\/ IL\\u00cdACO] PARA MEJORAR EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N HEMORROIDAL SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RECTO \\/ RECTO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS QUE PUEDAN ESTAR CONTRIBUYENDO A LA FRAGILIDAD VASCULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/690','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:50:17','2026-04-28 15:50:17'),(4467,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',691,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTESTINAL DISORDER (TRASTORNO INTESTINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, GAS, AND DIGESTIVE IRREGULARITY.\\n\\n(DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, GASES E IRREGULARIDAD DIGESTIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES IMBALANCES IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SACRUM AND THE OPPOSITE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REGULATING THE ELIMINATION PROCESSES AND THE NERVOUS SIGNALING THAT GOVERNS THE INTESTINES. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS CHRONIC DIARRHEA OR GENERAL INTESTINAL DISCOMFORT, AS THE SACRAL NERVES DIRECTLY INFLUENCE PELVIC ORGAN FUNCTION WHILE THE KIDNEYS REGULATE SYSTEMIC FLUID BALANCE. BY STABILIZING THIS DIAGONAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING INTESTINAL IRRITATION, IMPROVING NUTRIENT ABSORPTION, AND RESTORING THE NATURAL RHYTHM OF THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SACRO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA REGULAR LOS PROCESOS DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N Y LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA QUE GOBIERNA LOS INTESTINOS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA O MALESTAR INTESTINAL GENERAL, YA QUE LOS NERVIOS SACROS INFLUYEN DIRECTAMENTE EN LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, MIENTRAS QUE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES REGULAN EL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO DIAGONAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL, MEJORAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y RESTAURAR EL RITMO NATURAL DEL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INTESTINAL CHECK: IF DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COLON ASCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT PATHOGENIC INTERFERENCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DEHYDRATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [PUDENDAL NERVE \\/ PUDENDAL NERVE] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE NEUROLOGICAL REGULATION OF THE LOWER GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL: SI LA DIARREA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COL\\u00d3N ASCENDENTE \\/ COL\\u00d3N DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR INTERFERENCIA PAT\\u00d3GENA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [NERVIO PUDENDO \\/ NERVIO PUDENDO] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA DEL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL INFERIOR DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/691','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:51:31','2026-04-28 15:51:31'),(4468,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',692,'{\"symptoms\":\"LOW BACK PAIN, HIP PAIN, LEG WEAKNESS, MUSCLE AND JOINT PAIN. (DOLOR DE ESPALDA BAJA, DOLOR DE CADERA, DEBILIDAD EN LAS PIERNAS, DOLOR MUSCULAR Y ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"IT IS TRANSMITTED BY ANIMALS AND HOSPITALS. PARALYSIS. URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS. PENILE ERECTION OR EXCITEMENT OF THE VAGINA. INFERTILITY. (SE TRANSMITE POR ANIMALES Y HOSPITALES. PAR\\u00c1LISIS. INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO. ERECCI\\u00d3N DEL PENE O EXCITACI\\u00d3N DE LA VAGINA. INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - RENAL CAPSULE                  CHECK - COSTAL              CHECK - MEDIASTINUM CHECK - FIBULA (REVISAR - C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL                  REVISAR - COSTAL              REVISAR - MEDIASTINO REVISAR - F\\u00cdBULA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"LOW BACK PAIN, HIP PAIN, LEG WEAKNESS, MUSCLE AND JOINT PAIN.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE ESPALDA BAJA, DOLOR DE CADERA, DEBILIDAD EN LAS PIERNAS, DOLOR MUSCULAR Y ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS PROTEUS MIRABILIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS THE BACTERIA IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH ANIMALS OR WITHIN HOSPITAL ENVIRONMENTS. PROTEUS MIRABILIS IS A FREQUENT CAUSE OF URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS AND CAN LEAD TO SERIOUS NEUROLOGICAL OR REPRODUCTIVE COMPLICATIONS, INCLUDING PARALYSIS, INFERTILITY, OR ABNORMAL STIMULATION (PENILE ERECTION OR VAGINAL EXCITEMENT). BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, RELIEVING PELVIC INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING PROPER NERVE SIGNALING TO THE LOWER EXTREMITIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL PROTEUS MIRABILIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE LA BACTERIA SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO POR CONTACTO CON ANIMALES O DENTRO DE ENTORNOS HOSPITALARIOS. EL PROTEUS MIRABILIS ES UNA CAUSA FRECUENTE DE INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO Y PUEDE CONDUCIR A COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS O REPRODUCTIVAS GRAVES, INCLUYENDO PAR\\u00c1LISIS, INFERTILIDAD O ESTIMULACI\\u00d3N ANORMAL (ERECCI\\u00d3N DEL PENE O EXCITACI\\u00d3N VAGINAL). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ALIVIANDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y RESTAURANDO LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA ADECUADA HACIA LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY OR BACK SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [RENAL CAPSULE \\/ RENAL CAPSULE] AXIS TO RULE OUT ADDITIONAL RESERVOIRS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [COSTAL \\/ COSTAL] OR [MEDIASTINUM \\/ MEDIASTINUM] RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [FIBULA \\/ FIBULA] AXIS TO SUPPORT NERVOUS CONDUCTION AND ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE RECOVERY PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS O DE ESPALDA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL] PARA DESCARTAR RESERVORIOS ADICIONALES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS [COSTAL \\/ COSTAL] O [MEDIASTINO \\/ MEDIASTINO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [F\\u00cdBULA \\/ F\\u00cdBULA] PARA APOYAR LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/692','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:52:31','2026-04-28 15:52:31'),(4469,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',693,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LEG CRAMPS (CALAMBRES EN LAS PIERNAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROMUSCULAR COMPRESSION (COMPRESI\\u00d3N NEUROMUSCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"LEG CRAMPS, TINGLING, NUMBNESS, AND SHARP PAIN RADIATING DOWN THE LEG.\\n\\n(CALAMBRES EN LAS PIERNAS, HORMIGUEO, ENTUMECIMIENTO Y DOLOR AGUDO QUE SE IRRADIA HACIA LA PIERNA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SCIATIC NERVE IRRITATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SACRUM AND THE SCIATIC NERVE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR RELIEVING MECHANICAL OR ENERGETIC COMPRESSION THAT LEADS TO \\\"SCIATICA.\\\" THE SACRUM SERVES AS THE ANCHOR FOR THE LOWER SPINE, WHERE THE NERVE ROOTS MERGE TO FORM THE SCIATIC NERVE\\u2014THE LARGEST NERVE IN THE HUMAN BODY. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT OFTEN RESULTS IN PAINFUL MUSCLE SPASMS OR CRAMPS AS THE NERVOUS SIGNALING BECOMES INTERRUPTED OR OVERSTIMULATED. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REDUCING LOCAL INFLAMMATION, RELEASING TENSION IN THE DEEP PELVIC MUSCLES, AND RESTORING SMOOTH NEUROLOGICAL CONDUCTION TO THE LOWER EXTREMITIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL NERVIO CI\\u00c1TICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SACRO Y EL NERVIO CI\\u00c1TICO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ALIVIAR LA COMPRESI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA O ENERG\\u00c9TICA QUE CONDUCE A LA \\\"CI\\u00c1TICA\\\". EL SACRO SIRVE COMO ANCLA PARA LA PARTE INFERIOR DE LA COLUMNA, DONDE LAS RA\\u00cdCES NERVIOSAS SE FUSIONAN PARA FORMAR EL NERVIO CI\\u00c1TICO, EL NERVIO M\\u00c1S GRANDE DEL CUERPO HUMANO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO A MENUDO RESULTA EN ESPASMOS MUSCULARES DOLOROSOS O CALAMBRES YA QUE LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA SE INTERRUMPE O SE ESTIMULA EN EXCESO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL, LIBERAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS P\\u00c9LVICOS PROFUNDOS Y RESTAURAR LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA FLUIDA HACIA LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF LEG CRAMPS PERSIST, SCAN THE [LUMBAR 5 \\/ LUMBAR 5] AXIS TO RULE OUT DISK-RELATED COMPRESSION. FOR CASES INVOLVING MUSCLE WEAKNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] (REF 691) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL BACTERIAL INTERFERENCE FROM PROTEUS MIRABILIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF LACTIC ACID OR TOXINS THAT MAY EXACERBATE MUSCULAR SPASMS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: SI LOS CALAMBRES EN LAS PIERNAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [LUMBAR 5 \\/ LUMBAR 5] PARA DESCARTAR COMPRESI\\u00d3N RELACIONADA CON LOS DISCOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SACRO \\/ SACRO] (REF 691) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLE INTERFERENCIA BACTERIANA POR PROTEUS MIRABILIS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDO L\\u00c1CTICO O TOXINAS QUE PUEDAN EXACERBAR LOS ESPASMOS MUSCULARES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/693','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:53:38','2026-04-28 15:53:38'),(4470,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',694,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ENDOMETRISIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENDOMETRIOSIS\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC PELVIC PAIN, DYSMENORRHEA (PAINFUL PERIODS), PAIN DURING INTERCOURSE, AND POTENTIAL INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO CR\\u00d3NICO, DISMENORREA (PERIODOS DOLOROSOS), DOLOR DURANTE EL COITO Y POSIBLE INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE COMPLEX CONDITION OF ENDOMETRIOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SACRUM AND THE UTERUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REGULATING THE BIOENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT OF THE FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM. ENDOMETRIOSIS INVOLVES THE GROWTH OF UTERINE-LIKE TISSUE OUTSIDE THE UTERINE CAVITY, CAUSING INFLAMMATION AND ADHESIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN MODULATING THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE, REDUCING PELVIC CONGESTION, AND REBALANCING THE LOCAL TISSUE PH TO DISCOURAGE THE PROLIFERATION OF ECTOPIC ENDOMETRIAL TISSUE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA COMPLEJA CONDICI\\u00d3N DE LA ENDOMETRIOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SACRO Y EL \\u00daTERO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA REGULAR EL ENTORNO BIOENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR FEMENINO. LA ENDOMETRIOSIS IMPLICA EL CRECIMIENTO DE TEJIDO SIMILAR AL UTERINO FUERA DE LA CAVIDAD UTERINA, LO QUE PROVOCA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y ADHERENCIAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A MODULAR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA, REDUCIENDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y REEQUILIBRANDO EL PH DEL TEJIDO LOCAL PARA DESALENTAR LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO ENDOMETRIAL ECT\\u00d3PICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GLANDULAR CHECK: IF HORMONAL FLUCTUATIONS EXACERBATE SYMPTOMS, SCAN THE [PITUITARY \\/ OVARY] AXIS TO HARMONIZE REPRODUCTIVE SIGNALS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SIGNIFICANT SCAR TISSUE OR ADHESIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] (REF 691) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY IN CLEARING INFLAMMATORY BYPRODUCTS DURING THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR: SI LAS FLUCTUACIONES HORMONALES EXACERBAN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ OVARIO] PARA ARMONIZAR LAS SE\\u00d1ALES REPRODUCTIVAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TEJIDO CICATRICIAL SIGNIFICATIVO O ADHERENCIAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SACRO \\/ SACRO] (REF 691). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL CUERPO EN ELIMINAR LOS SUBPRODUCTOS INFLAMATORIOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/694','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:54:50','2026-04-28 15:54:50'),(4471,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',695,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DYSFUNCTION OF THE NERVOUS SYSTEM AND PARASYMPATHETIC SYSTEM. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y DEL SISTEMA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NERVOUS SYSTEM REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO)\",\"symptoms\":\"AUTONOMIC IMBALANCE, SLEEP DISRUPTIONS, DIGESTIVE ISSUES, AND ALTERATIONS IN HEART RATE OR BLOOD PRESSURE.\\n\\n(DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO Y DEL SISTEMA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SACRUM AND THE CERVICAL SPINE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS THE TWO PRIMARY ANCHORS OF THE PARASYMPATHETIC DIVISION: THE CRANIAL (CERVICAL) AND SACRAL OUTFLOWS. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT DISRUPTS THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO \\\"REST AND DIGEST,\\\" OFTEN LEAVING THE INDIVIDUAL IN A STATE OF CHRONIC STRESS OR SYMPATHETIC DOMINANCE. BY STABILIZING THIS LONG-AXIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, IMPROVING PARASYMPATHETIC TONE, AND RESTORING BALANCE TO VITAL INVOLUNTARY FUNCTIONS SUCH AS DIGESTION, HEART RATE VARIABILITY, AND SLEEP CYCLES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SACRO Y LA COLUMNA CERVICAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA LAS DOS ANCLAS PRIMARIAS DE LA DIVISI\\u00d3N PARASIMP\\u00c1TICA: EL FLUJO CRANEAL (CERVICAL) Y EL SACRO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO ALTERA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA \\\"DESCANSAR Y DIGERIR\\\", DEJANDO A MENUDO AL INDIVIDUO EN UN ESTADO DE ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO O DOMINANCIA SIMP\\u00c1TICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N DE EJE LARGO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, MEJORANDO EL TONO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO DE FUNCIONES INVOLUNTARIAS VITALES COMO LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, LA VARIAVILIDAD DE LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y LOS C\\u00cdCLOS DE SUE\\u00d1O.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF AUTONOMIC DYSFUNCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] AXIS TO IMPROVE UPPER CERVICAL ALIGNMENT AND VAGUS NERVE SIGNALING. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [VAGUS \\/ VAGUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN MANAGING THE SYSTEMIC RESPONSE TO STRESS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] PARA MEJORAR EL ALINEAMIENTO CERVICAL SUPERIOR Y LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL NERVIO VAGO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VAGO \\/ VAGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL MANEJO DE LA RESPUESTA SIST\\u00c9MICA AL ESTR\\u00c9S DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/695','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:55:58','2026-04-28 15:55:58'),(4472,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',696,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ASTHMA (ASMA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ASTHMA, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, WHEEZING, AND CHEST TIGHTNESS.\\n\\n(ASMA, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, SIBILANCIAS Y OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ASTHMA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SCAPULA (SHOULDER BLADE) AND THE LUNG. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR RELIEVING BRONCHIAL CONSTRICTION AND INFLAMMATION THAT CHARACTERIZE ASTHMATIC CONDITIONS. THE SCAPULA REGION OFTEN HARBORS TENSION THAT CAN MECHANICALLY AND ENERGETICALLY RESTRICT THE EXPANSION OF THE POSTERIOR LUNG TISSUE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RELAXING THE SMOOTH MUSCLES OF THE AIRWAYS, IMPROVING OXYGEN EXCHANGE, AND REDUCING THE HYPER-RESPONSIVENESS OF THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM TO EXTERNAL TRIGGERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL ASMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA ESC\\u00c1PULA Y EL PULM\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ALIVIAR LA CONSTRICTI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N QUE CARACTERIZAN LAS CONDICIONES ASM\\u00c1TICAS. LA REGI\\u00d3N DE LA ESC\\u00c1PULA A MENUDO ACUMULA TENSI\\u00d3N QUE PUEDE RESTRINGIR MEC\\u00c1NICA Y ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO PULMONAR POSTERIOR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RELAJAR LOS M\\u00daSCULOS LISOS DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS, MEJORANDO EL INTERCAMBIO DE OX\\u00cdGENO Y REDUCIENDO LA HIPERREACTIVIDAD DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO ANTE LOS DESENCADENANTES EXTERNOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF WHEEZING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS] AXIS TO RULE OUT TUBERCULOSIS OR OTHER BACTERIAL PATHOGENS. FOR CASES INVOLVING ALLERGIC ASTHMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RETROHEPATIC \\/ RETROHEPATIC] (REF 681) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN REGULATING THE BODY\'S NATURALLY PRODUCED ANTI-INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE DURING AN ASTHMA FLARE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LAS SIBILANCIAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO] PARA DESCARTAR TUBERCULOSIS U OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS BACTERIANOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RETROHEP\\u00c1TICO \\/ RETROHEP\\u00c1TICO] (REF 681). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA RESPUESTA ANTIINFLAMATORIA NATURAL DEL CUERPO DURANTE UN BROTE DE ASMA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/696','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:57:10','2026-04-28 15:57:10'),(4473,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',697,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TUMOR SUPPRESSOR (SUPRESOR DE TUMORES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CELLULAR REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"GENERAL DEBILITY, IMMUNE SYSTEM WEAKNESS, AND TISSUE DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(DEBILIDAD GENERAL, DEBILIDAD DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N TISULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FUNCTIONS AS A TUMOR SUPPRESSOR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SCAPULA AND THE NAVEL (UMBILICUS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY VALUED FOR ITS ENERGETIC CAPACITY TO REGULATE CELLULAR GROWTH AND PREVENT THE PROLIFERATION OF ABNORMAL CELLS. THE NAVEL REPRESENTS THE BODY\'S ORIGINAL POINT OF NUTRITION AND VITALITY, WHILE THE SCAPULAR REGION IS OFTEN LINKED TO SYSTEMIC STABILITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSE MECHANISMS IN IDENTIFYING AND NEUTRALIZING PATHOLOGICAL CELLULAR CLUSTERS, SUPPORTING THE OVERALL INTEGRITY OF THE ORGANISM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL FUNCIONA COMO UN SUPRESOR DE TUMORES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA ESC\\u00c1PULA Y EL OMBLIGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE VALORADO POR SU CAPACIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA PARA REGULAR EL CRECIMIENTO CELULAR Y PREVENIR LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS ANORMALES. EL OMBLIGO REPRESENTA EL PUNTO ORIGINAL DE NUTRICI\\u00d3N Y VITALIDAD DEL CUERPO, MIENTRAS QUE LA REGI\\u00d3N ESCAPULAR SE VINCULA A MENUDO CON LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LOS MECANISMOS DE DEFENSA NATURALES DEL CUERPO A IDENTIFICAR Y NEUTRALIZAR GRUPOS CELULARES PATOL\\u00d3GICOS, APOYANDO LA INTEGRIDAD GENERAL DEL ORGANISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PREVENTIVE CHECK: IF CELLULAR CONCERNS PERSIST, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] (REF 695) AXIS TO RULE OUT MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IMMUNE SUPPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING METABOLIC WASTE DURING CELLULAR RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PREVENTIVA: SI LAS PREOCUPACIONES CELULARES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] (REF 695) PARA DESCARTAR EL MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA SUPRESI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ TIMO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/697','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:58:12','2026-04-28 15:58:12'),(4474,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',698,'{\"symptoms\":\"DISTRACTION OF THE SKIN. KIDNEY STONES, BLINDNESS, HEMORRHOIDS, VARICOSE VEINS, RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS AND NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS. ULCERS, HEMORRHOIDS, MY OMA\'S, VARICOSE VEINS, RESPIRATORY AND NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS. (DISTRACCI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL. C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, CEGUERA, HEMORROIDES, V\\u00c1RICES, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS Y TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO. \\u00daLCERAS, HEMORROIDES, MIOMAS, V\\u00c1RICES, TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS Y DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM PERSON-TO-PERSON BY CONTACT WITH SALIVA AND BY BREAST MILK FROM THE MOTHER TO THE INFANT. VERY AGGRESSIVE LEPROSY. FINGER DRUM, LIMB ATROPHY, RENAL STONES, BILIARY STONES, CATARACTS, BLINDNESS. AFFECTS THE SPLEEN. (TRANSMITIDO DE PERSONA A PERSONA POR CONTACTO CON LA SALIVA Y POR LECHE MATERNA DE LA MADRE AL INFANTE. LEPRA MUY AGRESIVA. DEDO EN BATUTA, ATROFIA DE EXTREMIDADES, C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, C\\u00c1LCULOS BILIARES, CATARATAS, CEGUERA. AFECTA EL BAZO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION; CHECK ALL LEPRAE RESERVOIRS. NASAL, SINUS\\/FRONTAL SINUS, BRACHIAL\\/ ELBOW, SCARTA\'S TRIANGLE, DUODENUM\\/ESOPHAGUS. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N; REVISAR TODOS LOS RESERVORIOS DE LEPRA. NASAL, SENOS PARANASALES\\/SENO FRONTAL, BRAQUIAL\\/CODO, TRI\\u00c1NGULO DE SCARPA, DUODENO\\/ES\\u00d3FAGO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN LESIONS OR DISCOLORATION, KIDNEY STONES, BLINDNESS, HEMORRHOIDS, VARICOSE VEINS, RESPIRATORY ISSUES, AND NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS.\\n\\n(DISTRACCI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL, C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, CEGUERA, HEMORROIDES, V\\u00c1RICES, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS Y TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SCAPULAR REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS IS CONSIDERED A HIGHLY AGGRESSIVE PAIR AS THE PATHOGEN CAN AFFECT MULTIPLE SYSTEMS, INCLUDING THE SPLEEN, EYES, AND PERIPHERAL NERVES. TRANSMITTED THROUGH SALIVA OR BREAST MILK, THIS BACTERIA CAN LEAD TO SEVERE CLINICAL MANIFESTATIONS SUCH AS LIMB ATROPHY, \\\"FINGER DRUM\\\" (CLUBBING), CATARACTS, AND ULCERATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PREVENTING FURTHER NERVE DAMAGE, AND REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC TOXICITY THAT CONTRIBUTES TO THE FORMATION OF RENAL AND BILIARY STONES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N ESCAPULAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE SE CONSIDERA UN PAR ALTAMENTE AGRESIVO YA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE AFECTAR M\\u00daLTIPLES SISTEMAS, INCLUYENDO EL BAZO, LOS OJOS Y LOS NERVIOS PERIF\\u00c9RICOS. TRANSMITIDA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA SALIVA O LA LECHE MATERNA, ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE CONDUCIR A MANIFESTACIONES CL\\u00cdNICAS GRAVES COMO ATROFIA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES, \\\"DEDO EN BATUTA\\\", CATARATAS Y ULCERACIONES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PREVINIENDO UN MAYOR DA\\u00d1O NERVIOSO Y REDUCIENDO LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE CONTRIBUYE A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES Y BILIARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"LEPRAE CHECK: GIVEN THE AGGRESSIVE NATURE OF THIS PATHOGEN, IT IS CRITICAL TO SCAN ALL KNOWN RESERVOIRS INCLUDING [NASAL \\/ NASAL], [FRONTEAL SINUS \\/ FRONTEAL SINUS], [BRACHIAL \\/ ELBOW], [SCARPA\'S TRIANGLE \\/ SCARPA\'S TRIANGLE], AND [DUODENUM \\/ ESOPHAGUS]. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN CLEARING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS AND TO MITIGATE THE RISK OF CALCULI FORMATION DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(REVISI\\u00d3N DE LEPRA: DADA LA NATURALEZA AGRESIVA DE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO, ES CR\\u00cdTICO ESCANEAR TODOS LOS RESERVORIOS CONOCIDOS, INCLUYENDO [NASAL \\/ NASAL], [SENO FRONTAL \\/ SENO FRONTAL], [BRAQUIAL \\/ CODO], [TRI\\u00c1NGULO DE SCARPA \\/ TRI\\u00c1NGULO DE SCARPA] Y [DUODENO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS Y MITIGAR EL RIESGO DE FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/698','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 15:59:11','2026-04-28 15:59:11'),(4475,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',699,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT MAY CAUSE CHRONIC PAIN, LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION, OR \\\"INTERFERENCE FIELDS\\\" THAT DISRUPT ENERGETIC FLOW.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE CAUSAR DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA O \\\"CAMPOS DE INTERFERENCIA\\\" QUE ALTERAN EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR RESONANCE TARGETS PATHOGENS THAT HIDE WITHIN SCAR TISSUE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE SITE OF A PREVIOUS INJURY OR INCISION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, SCARS (BOTH SURGICAL AND ACCIDENTAL) ARE CONSIDERED \\\"POTENTIAL RESERVOIRS\\\" WHERE VIRUSES, BACTERIA, OR PARASITES CAN REMAIN DORMANT AND PROTECTED FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. ADDITIONALLY, SCARS CAN ACT AS INTERFERENCE FIELDS (CAMPOS INTERFERENTES) THAT DISRUPT THE BODY\'S BIOELECTRIC SIGNALING. BY STABILIZING THE PH WITHIN THE CICATRIZAL TISSUE, THE RESET \\\"OPENS\\\" THE RESERVOIR, ALLOWING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO IDENTIFY AND ELIMINATE HIDDEN PATHOGENS WHILE RESTORING THE PROPER FLOW OF ENERGY ACROSS THE REPAIRED TISSUE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE SE OCULTAN DENTRO DEL TEJIDO CICATRICIAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL SITIO DE UNA LESI\\u00d3N O INCISI\\u00d3N PREVIA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LAS CICATRICES (TANTO QUIR\\u00daRGICAS COMO ACCIDENTALES) SE CONSIDERAN \\\"RESERVORIOS POTENCIALES\\\" DONDE LOS VIRUS, BACTERIAS O PAR\\u00c1SITOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES Y PROTEGIDOS DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. ADEM\\u00c1S, LAS CICATRICES PUEDEN ACTUAR COMO CAMPOS INTERFERENTES QUE ALTERAN LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA DEL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR EL PH DENTRO DEL TEJIDO CICATRICIAL, EL REINICIO \\\"ABRE\\\" EL RESERVORIO, PERMITIENDO QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO IDENTIFIQUE Y ELIMINE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS OCULTOS, MIENTRAS RESTAURA EL FLUJO ADECUADO DE ENERG\\u00cdA A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL TEJIDO REPARADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST DESPITE CLEARING OTHER PAIRS, SCAN ALL EXTERNAL AND INTERNAL SCARS. FOR SYSTEMIC RESERVOIRS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [VAGUS \\/ VAGUS] OR [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN PROCESSING ANY PATHOGENS RELEASED FROM THE SCAR TISSUE DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN A PESAR DE LIMPIAR OTROS PARES, ESCANEAR TODAS LAS CICATRICES EXTERNAS E INTERNAS. PARA RESERVORIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS [VAGO \\/ VAGO] O [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ BAZO] PARA APOYAR AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE CUALQUIER PAT\\u00d3GENO LIBERADO DEL TEJIDO CICATRICIAL DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/699','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 16:00:13','2026-04-28 16:00:13'),(4476,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',700,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT CAN BE LINKED TO CHRONIC SKIN ISSUES, NERVE DISORDERS, AND SYSTEMIC TOXICITY WHEN ACTIVE.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A PROBLEMAS CR\\u00d3NICOS DE LA PIEL, TRASTORNOS NERVIOSOS Y TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA CUANDO EST\\u00c1 ACTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE TARGETS MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SCARPA\'S TRIANGLE (FEMORAL TRIANGLE). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AREA IS A CRITICAL ANATOMICAL REGION IN THE UPPER INNER THIGH THAT CONTAINS THE FEMORAL NERVE, ARTERY, AND VEIN, ALONG WITH DEEP INGUINAL LYMPH NODES. BECAUSE OF ITS RICH VASCULAR AND LYMPHATIC ACCESS, IT SERVES AS A STRATEGIC HIDING PLACE FOR THIS AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET \\\"OPENS\\\" THE RESERVOIR, EXPOSING THE HIDDEN PATHOGEN TO THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND PREVENTING IT FROM RE-INFECTING OTHER AREAS SUCH AS THE EYES, SKIN, OR PERIPHERAL NERVES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO SE DIRIGE AL MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL TRI\\u00c1NGULO DE SCARPA (TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA \\u00c1REA ES UNA REGI\\u00d3N ANAT\\u00d3MICA CR\\u00cdTICA EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR INTERNA DEL MUSLO QUE CONTIENE EL NERVIO, LA ARTERIA Y LA VENA FEMORAL, JUNTO CON LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS INGUINALES PROFUNDOS. DEBIDO A SU RICO ACCESO VASCULAR Y LINF\\u00c1TICO, SIRVE COMO UN LUGAR DE ESCONDITE ESTRAT\\u00c9GICO PARA ESTA BACTERIA AGRESIVA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO \\\"ABRE\\\" EL RESERVORIO, EXPONIENDO AL PAT\\u00d3GENO OCULTO AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y EVITANDO QUE REINFECTE OTRAS \\u00c1REAS COMO LOS OJOS, LA PIEL O LOS NERVIOS PERIF\\u00c9RICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS OF LEPRAE PERSIST, IT IS ESSENTIAL TO SCAN OTHER PRIMARY LOCATIONS SUCH AS [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] (REF 697). FOR CASES INVOLVING NERVE DAMAGE IN THE ARMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BRACHIAL \\/ ELBOW] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED FROM THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI PERSISTEN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS DE LEPRA, ES ESENCIAL ESCANEAR OTRAS UBICACIONES PRIMARIAS COMO [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] (REF 697). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DA\\u00d1O NERVIOSO EN LOS BRAZOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BRAQUIAL \\/ CODO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DESDE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/700','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 16:01:06','2026-04-28 16:01:06'),(4477,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',701,'{\"symptoms\":\"VARIOUS PAIN IN THE LOWER LIMBS, KNEES, ANKLES, HIPS. LOW BACK PAIN ELECTRIC SHOCK AND NERVES, PAIN IN THE LOWER EXTREMITIES, SEVERE HEADACHES, SORE THROAT, MUSCLE ACHES, STIFF NECK. (DOLOR VARIADO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, RODILLAS, TOBILLOS, CADERAS. DOLOR LUMBAR TIPO DESCARGA EL\\u00c9CTRICA Y NERVIOSO, DOLOR EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, FUERTES DOLORES DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO.)\",\"paths\":\"ARTHRITIS, OSTEOARTHRITIS, RHEUMATISM, JOINT DISEASE, PARALYSIS OF THE LOWER LIMBS AND MUSCLE ATROPHY. SCIATICA, DIABETIC NEUROGLIA, MUSCULAR DYSTROPHY. (ARTRITIS, OSTEOARTRITIS, REUMATISMO, ENFERMEDAD ARTICULAR, PAR\\u00c1LISIS DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES Y ATROFIA MUSCULAR. CI\\u00c1TICA, NEUROGL\\u00cdA DIAB\\u00c9TICA, DISTROFIA MUSCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VARIOUS PAIN IN THE LOWER LIMBS, KNEES, ANKLES, HIPS. LOW BACK PAIN ELECTRIC SHOCK AND NERVES, SEVERE HEADACHES, SORE THROAT, MUSCLE ACHES, STIFF NECK.\\n\\n(DOLOR VARIADO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES, RODILLAS, TOBILLOS, CADERAS. DOLOR LUMBAR TIPO DESCARGA EL\\u00c9CTRICA Y NERVIOSO, FUERTES DOLORES DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE POLIOMYELITIS VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE SCIATIC NERVE PATHWAY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR ADDRESSING CHRONIC JOINT DISEASES SUCH AS ARTHRITIS, OSTEOARTHRITIS, AND RHEUMATISM, AS WELL AS NEUROLOGICAL COMPLICATIONS LIKE DIABETIC NEUROGLIA AND MUSCULAR DYSTROPHY. THE VIRUS ATTACKS THE MOTOR NEURONS OF THE SPINAL CORD, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO PARALYSIS OF THE LOWER LIMBS AND MUSCLE ATROPHY. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING NERVE INFLAMMATION, AND PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF DEGENERATIVE MUSCULAR AND ARTICULAR CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA POLIOMIELITIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LA TRAYECTORIA DEL NERVIO CI\\u00c1TICO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA ABORDAR ENFERMEDADES ARTICULARES CR\\u00d3NICAS COMO LA ARTRITIS, LA OSTEOARTRITIS Y EL REUMATISMO, AS\\u00cd COMO COMPLICACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS COMO LA NEUROGL\\u00cdA DIAB\\u00c9TICA Y LA DISTROFIA MUSCULAR. EL VIRUS ATACA LAS NEURONAS MOTORAS DE LA M\\u00c9DULA ESPINAL, LO QUE PUEDE PROVOCAR PAR\\u00c1LISIS DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES Y ATROFIA MUSCULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y PREVINIENDO LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE CONDICIONES DEGENERATIVAS MUSCULARES Y ARTICULARES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF SCIATIC PAIN OR WEAKNESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SACRUM \\/ SCIATIC] (REF 692) AXIS TO RULE OUT MECHANICAL COMPRESSION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MUSCLE ATROPHY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] (REF 691) RESONANCE TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI EL DOLOR CI\\u00c1TICO O LA DEBILIDAD PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SACRO \\/ CI\\u00c1TICO] (REF 692) PARA DESCARTAR COMPRESI\\u00d3N MEC\\u00c1NICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ATROFIA MUSCULAR SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SACRO \\/ SACRO] (REF 691) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/701','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 16:02:13','2026-04-28 16:02:13'),(4478,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',702,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ARROGANCE (ARROGANCIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOLOGICAL ATTRIBUTE (ATRIBUTO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ARROGANCE, PRIDE, AND OVERESTIMATION OF SELF-IMPORTANCE.\\n\\n(ARROGANCIA, ORGULLO Y SOBREESTIMACI\\u00d3N DE LA PROPIA IMPORTANCIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE COMPLEX PSYCHOLOGICAL STATE OF ARROGANCE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE MIDDLE FISSURE OF THE BRAIN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR BALANCING THE COGNITIVE PROCESSES THAT REGULATE SELF-PERCEPTION AND SOCIAL INTERACTION. ARROGANCE OFTEN STEMS FROM AN ENERGETIC IMBALANCE IN THE BRAIN\'S MIDLINE, WHICH CAN DISTORT AN INDIVIDUAL\'S ABILITY TO PRACTICE HUMILITY OR EMPATHY. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN SOFTENING RIGID EGO STRUCTURES, PROMOTING A MORE BALANCED VIEW OF THE SELF, AND FACILITATING EMOTIONAL OPENNESS TOWARD OTHERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL COMPLEJO ESTADO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO DE LA ARROGANCIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH DENTRO DE LA FISURA MEDIA DEL CEREBRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA EQUILIBRAR LOS PROCESOS COGNITIVOS QUE REGULAN LA AUTOPERCEPCI\\u00d3N Y LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N SOCIAL. LA ARROGANCIA A MENUDO SURGE DE UN DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN LA L\\u00cdNEA MEDIA DEL CEREBRO, QUE PUEDE DISTORSIONAR LA CAPACIDAD DE UN INDIVIDUO PARA PRACTICAR LA HUMILDAD O LA EMPAT\\u00cdA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA A SUAVIZAR LAS ESTRUCTURAS R\\u00cdGIDAS DEL EGO, PROMOVIENDO UNA VISI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S EQUILIBRADA DE UNO MISMO Y FACILITANDO LA APERTURA EMOCIONAL HACIA LOS DEM\\u00c1S.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF FEELINGS OF SUPERIORITY OR RIGIDITY PERSIST, SCAN THE [ROLANDIC FISSURE \\/ ROLANDIC FISSURE] (REF 685) AXIS TO FURTHER ADDRESS LACK OF HUMILITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEFENSIVE BEHAVIORS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL SYSTEM DURING THE PROCESS OF EMOTIONAL REBALANCING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI PERSISTEN LOS SENTIMIENTOS DE SUPERIORIDAD O RIGIDEZ, ESCANEAR EL EJE [FISURA DE ROLANDO \\/ FISURA DE ROLANDO] (REF 685) PARA ABORDAR M\\u00c1S A FONDO LA FALTA DE HUMILDAD. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN COMPORTAMIENTOS DEFENSIVOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REEQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/702','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:21:33','2026-04-28 17:21:33'),(4479,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',703,'{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT INFLAMMATION (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ARTICULACIONES)\",\"paths\":\"AUTISM, POLYARTICULAR ARTHRITIS, RHEUMATISM. (AUTISMO, ARTRITIS POLIARTICULAR, REUMATISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT INFLAMMATION, POLYARTICULAR ARTHRITIS, RHEUMATISM, AND POTENTIAL NEUROLOGICAL SEQUELLAE.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS ARTICULACIONES, ARTRITIS POLIARTICULAR, REUMATISMO Y POSIBLES SECUELAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS (MENINGOCOCCUS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SHIN BONE (TIBIA) AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN MANIFEST AS SEVERE JOINT INFLAMMATION OR RHEUMATIC SYMPTOMS. BEYOND ITS WELL-KNOWN ROLE IN MENINGITIS, THIS BACTERIA CAN COLONIZE THE URINARY TRACT AND TRIGGER INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES IN THE KNEES AND OTHER LARGE JOINTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING JOINT SWELLING, AND MITIGATING THE NEUROLOGICAL IMPACT OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH SYSTEMIC MENINGOCOCCAL SPREAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL NEISSERIA MENINGITIDIS (MENINGOCOCO) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH ENTRE LA TIBIA Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTAN COMO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR SEVERA O S\\u00cdNTOMAS REUM\\u00c1TICOS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE SU PAPEL CONOCIDO EN LA MENINGITIS, ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE COLONIZAR EL TRACTO URINARIO Y DESENCADENAR RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS EN LAS RODILLAS Y OTRAS ARTICULACIONES GRANDES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y MITIGANDO EL IMPACTO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO A MENUDO ASOCIADO CON LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL MENINGOCOCO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF HEADACHES OR STIFF NECK ACCOMPANY JOINT PAIN, SCAN THE [SHIN BONE \\/ SHIN BONE] AXIS TO RULE OUT DIRECT CEREBROSPINAL IMPACT. FOR CASES INVOLVING AUTISM SPECTRUM SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] AXIS TO SUPPORT THE NERVOUS REGULATION OF THE LOWER EXTREMITIES DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA O LA RIGIDEZ DE CUELLO ACOMPA\\u00d1AN AL DOLOR ARTICULAR, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIBIA \\/ TIBIA] PARA DESCARTAR UN IMPACTO CEREBROESPINAL DIRECTO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS DEL ESPECTRO AUTISTA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [LUMBAR \\/ LUMBAR] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/703','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:22:47','2026-04-28 17:22:47'),(4480,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',704,'{\"origins\":\"PYTIROSPORUM VERICOLOR\",\"symptoms\":\"SKIN DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PYTIROSPORUM VERICOLOR (MALASSEZIA FURFUR)\",\"symptoms\":\"SKIN DISORDERS, DISCOLORED PATCHES (WHITE, PINK, OR BROWN), ITCHING, AND SCALING.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL, MANCHAS DECOLORADAS (BLANCAS, ROSADAS O MARRONES), PICAZ\\u00d3N Y DESCAMACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS PYTIROSPORUM VERICOLOR (ALSO KNOWN AS MALASSEZIA FURFUR) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE TIBIAL AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING TINEA VERSICOLOR, A COMMON FUNGAL INFECTION THAT INTERFERES WITH THE NORMAL PIGMENTATION OF THE SKIN. WHILE THIS FUNGUS IS OFTEN PART OF THE NORMAL SKIN FLORA, AN ENERGETIC IMBALANCE IN THE TIBIAL CIRCUIT CAN TRIGGER OVERGROWTH, LEADING TO CHARACTERISTIC SPOTS ON THE TRUNK AND SHOULDERS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REGULATING THE FUNGAL LOAD, RESTORING SKIN INTEGRITY, AND PROMOTING THE GRADUAL RE-PIGMENTATION OF AFFECTED AREAS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE AL PYTIROSPORUM VERICOLOR (TAMBI\\u00c9N CONOCIDO COMO MALASSEZIA FURFUR) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL EJE TIBIAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR LA TI\\u00d1A VERSICOLOR, UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA COM\\u00daN QUE INTERFIERE CON LA PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N NORMAL DE LA PIEL. SI BIEN ESTE HONGO SUELE FORMAR PARTE DE LA FLORA NORMAL DE LA PIEL, UN DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN EL CIRCUITO TIBIAL PUEDE DESENCADENAR UN CRECIMIENTO EXCESIVO, DANDO LUGAR A LAS MANCHAS CARACTER\\u00cdSTICAS EN EL TRONCO Y LOS HOMBROS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REGULAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA PIEL Y PROMOVIENDO LA RE-PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N GRADUAL DE LAS \\u00c1REAS AFECTADAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMAL CHECK: IF SKIN DISCOLORATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SHIN BONE \\/ BLADDER] (REF 702) AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS LIKE MENINGOCOCCUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING WIDESPREAD FUNGAL ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [FIRST LUMBAR \\/ FIRST LUMBAR] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE DETOXIFICATION OF FUNGAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N D\\u00c9RMICA: SI LA DECOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIBIA \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 702) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS COMO EL MENINGOCOCO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS F\\u00daNGICOS GENERALIZADOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PRIMERA LUMBAR \\/ PRIMERA LUMBAR]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS F\\u00daNGICOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/704','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:24:08','2026-04-28 17:24:08'),(4481,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',705,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTION PROBLEMS, GAS, DIARRHEA, FEVER, HEADACHES, DEPRESSION. (SHIGELLA\\n\\nPROBLEMAS DE DIGESTI\\u00d3N, GASES, DIARREA, FIEBRE, DOLORES DE CABEZA, DEPRESI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"INABILITY TO FERMENT LACTOSE. EFFECTS THE MOBILITY OF THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. (INCAPACIDAD PARA FERMENTAR LA LACTOSA. AFECTA LA MOTILIDAD DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTION PROBLEMS, GAS, DIARRHEA, FEVER, HEADACHES, AND DEPRESSION.\\n\\n(SHIGELLA: PROBLEMAS DE DIGESTI\\u00d3N, GASES, DIARREA, FIEBRE, DOLORES DE CABEZA Y DEPRESI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS SHIGELLA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SIGMOID COLON AND THE LEFT INGUINAL LIGAMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING THE INABILITY TO FERMENT LACTOSE, WHICH OFTEN RESULTS IN SIGNIFICANT GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS. SHIGELLA DIRECTLY AFFECTS THE MOTILITY OF THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, LEADING TO RAPID ELIMINATION (DIARRHEA) AND THE ACCUMULATION OF GAS. BEYOND PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT, THIS PATHOGEN IS KNOWN TO INFLUENCE EMOTIONAL WELL-BEING, POTENTIALLY TRIGGERING SYMPTOMS OF DEPRESSION AS A RESULT OF SYSTEMIC TOXICITY AND GUT-BRAIN AXIS DISRUPTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA, RESTORING PROPER INTESTINAL MOTILITY, AND ALLEVIATING THE NEUROLOGICAL BYPRODUCTS OF THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA SHIGELLA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON SIGMOIDE Y EL LIGAMENTO INGUINAL IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA INCAPACIDAD DE FERMENTAR LA LACTOSA, QUE A MENUDO RESULTA EN UN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL SIGNIFICATIVO. LA SHIGELLA AFECTA DIRECTAMENTE LA MOTILIDAD DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, LO QUE PROVOCA UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N R\\u00c1PIDA (DIARREA) Y LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE GASES. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO, SE SABE QUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO INFLUYE EN EL BIENESTAR EMOCIONAL, DESENCADENANDO POTENCIALMENTE S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DEPRESI\\u00d3N COMO RESULTADO DE LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N DEL EJE INTESTINO-CEREBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA, RESTAURANDO LA MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL ADECUADA Y ALIVIANDO LOS SUBPRODUCTOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF DIARRHEA AND GAS PERSIST, SCAN THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER ENTEROBACTERIA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EMOTIONAL SHIFTS OR DEPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THALAMUS \\/ THALAMUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY IN ELIMINATING TOXINS PRODUCED BY THE BACTERIAL METABOLISM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI LA DIARREA Y LOS GASES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS ENTEROBACTERIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CAMBIOS EMOCIONALES SEVEROS O DEPRESI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [T\\u00c1LAMO \\/ T\\u00c1LAMO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL CUERPO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS PRODUCIDAS POR EL METABOLISMO BACTERIANO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/705','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:25:14','2026-04-28 17:25:14'),(4482,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',706,'{\"origins\":\"SV 40\",\"symptoms\":\"RECTUM AND VAGINAL SYMPTOMS. DIARRHEA, DISTENDED ABDOMEN, GAS, BLOATING, ITCHING, HEMORRHOIDS, RECTAL FISTULA, BLEEDING, URINARY DISORDERS. INDIGESTION, DIGESTIVE ABSORPTION PROBLEMS, SLEEP PROBLEMS, HEADACHE, SORE SHOULDERS. (SV40\\n\\nS\\u00cdNTOMAS RECTALES Y VAGINALES. DIARREA, ABDOMEN DISTENDIDO, GASES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, PICAZ\\u00d3N, HEMORROIDES, F\\u00cdSTULA RECTAL, SANGRADO, TRASTORNOS URINARIOS. INDIGESTI\\u00d3N, PROBLEMAS DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA, PROBLEMAS DE SUE\\u00d1O, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE HOMBROS.)\",\"paths\":\"MARKS ON THE SKIN AND BLISTERS. SEXUAL ORGAN DYSFUNCTION, HAIR LOSS. VERY CARCINOGENIC. (MARCAS EN LA PIEL Y AMPOLLAS. DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS SEXUALES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO. MUY CARCINOG\\u00c9NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SV 40 (SIMIAN VIRUS 40)\",\"symptoms\":\"RECTUM AND VAGINAL SYMPTOMS. DIARRHEA, DISTENDED ABDOMEN, GAS, BLOATING, ITCHING, HEMORRHOIDS, RECTAL FISTULA, BLEEDING, URINARY DISORDERS. INDIGESTION, DIGESTIVE ABSORPTION PROBLEMS, SLEEP PROBLEMS, HEADACHE, SORE SHOULDERS.(S\\u00cdNTOMAS RECTALES Y VAGINALES. DIARREA, ABDOMEN DISTENDIDO, GASES, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, PICAZ\\u00d3N, HEMORROIDES, F\\u00cdSTULA RECTAL, SANGRADO, TRASTORNOS URINARIOS. INDIGESTI\\u00d3N, PROBLEMAS DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA, PROBLEMAS DE SUE\\u00d1O, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR DE HOMBROS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE SV 40 VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SIGMOID COLON AND THE RECTUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT DUE TO THE VIRUS\'S POTENTIAL FOR CAUSING CHRONIC DEGENERATIVE CHANGES AND CELLULAR MALFORMATION. PHYSICALLY, IT MANIFESTS THROUGH SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL AND UROGENITAL DISRUPTIONS, INCLUDING TISSUE DAMAGE SUCH AS FISTULAS OR BLEEDING. THE VIRUS IS ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH EXTERNAL SIGNS LIKE SKIN MARKS, BLISTERS, HAIR LOSS, AND SEXUAL ORGAN DYSFUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING RECTAL INFLAMMATION, AND MITIGATING THE CARCINOGENIC RISKS ASSOCIATED WITH THIS SPECIFIC PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS SV 40 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON SIGMOIDE Y EL RECTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO DEBIDO AL POTENCIAL DEL VIRUS PARA CAUSAR CAMBIOS DEGENERATIVOS CR\\u00d3NICOS Y MALFORMACI\\u00d3N CELULAR. F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, SE MANIFIESTA A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALTERACIONES GASTROINTESTINALES Y UROGENITALES SEVERAS, INCLUYENDO DA\\u00d1O TISULAR COMO F\\u00cdSTULAS O SANGRADO. EL VIRUS TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA CON SIGNOS EXTERNOS COMO MARCAS EN LA PIEL, AMPOLLAS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS SEXUALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RECTAL Y MITIGANDO LOS RIESGOS CARCINOG\\u00c9NICOS ASOCIADOS CON ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: GIVEN THE AGGRESSIVE NATURE OF SV 40, SCAN THE [URETER \\/ URETER] AXIS TO RULE OUT VIRAL RESERVOIRS THAT MAY AFFECT THE URINARY SYSTEM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SKIN LESIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] (REF 697) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY\\u2019S CELLULAR REPAIR MECHANISMS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: DADA LA NATURALEZA AGRESIVA DEL SV 40, ESCANEAR EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER] PARA DESCARTAR RESERVORIOS VIRALES QUE PUEDAN AFECTAR EL SISTEMA URINARIO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS SEVERAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] (REF 697). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LOS MECANISMOS DE REPARACI\\u00d3N CELULAR DEL CUERPO DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/706','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:26:39','2026-04-28 17:26:39'),(4483,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',707,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, HEADACHES AND DEHYDRATION. (DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, DOLORES DE CABEZA Y DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"INTESTINAL INFECTIONS AND ACUTE DIARRHREA. (INFECCIONES INTESTINALES Y DIARREA AGUDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, HEADACHES, AND DEHYDRATION.\\n\\n(DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, DOLORES DE CABEZA Y DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CAMPYLOBACTER JEJUNI B BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SIGMOID COLON AND THE TESTICLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING ACUTE INTESTINAL INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN LEAD TO SEVERE DIARRHEA AND ABDOMINAL CRAMPING. THIS PATHOGEN IS ONE OF THE MOST COMMON CAUSES OF GASTROENTERITIS WORLDWIDE AND IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO THE CONSUMPTION OF CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER. BEYOND LOCALIZED DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, THE INFECTION CAN CAUSE SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS LIKE HEADACHES AND SIGNIFICANT DEHYDRATION DUE TO FLUID LOSS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING PROPER FLUID ABSORPTION WITHIN THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CAMPYLOBACTER JEJUNI B MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON SIGMOIDE Y EL TEST\\u00cdCULO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES INTESTINALES AGUDAS QUE A MENUDO CONDUCEN A DIARREA SEVERA Y CALAMBRES ABDOMINALES. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES UNA DE LAS CAUSAS M\\u00c1S COMUNES DE GASTROENTERITIS EN TODO EL MUNDO Y SE VINCULA CON FRECUENCIA AL CONSUMO DE ALIMENTOS O AGUA CONTAMINADOS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO LOCALIZADO, LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PUEDE CAUSAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMO DOLORES DE CABEZA Y DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA DEBIDO A LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y RESTAURANDO LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS DENTRO DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER ENTERIC PATHOGENS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE TESTICULAR DISCOMFORT OR LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TESTICLE \\/ TESTICLE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY\\u2019S REHYDRATION PROCESS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI LA DIARREA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS ENT\\u00c9RICOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MOLESTIAS TESTICULARES SEVERAS O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEST\\u00cdCULO \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL PROCESO DE REHIDRATACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/707','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:27:50','2026-04-28 17:27:50'),(4484,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',708,'{\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN BARRE (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 SYNDROME (S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9)\",\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT MAY BE LINKED TO MUSCLE WEAKNESS, TINGLING IN EXTREMITIES, LOSS OF REFLEXES, AND ASCENDING PARALYSIS WHEN ACTIVE.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, HORMIGUEO EN LAS EXTREMIDADES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE REFLEJOS Y PAR\\u00c1LISIS ASCENDENTE CUANDO EST\\u00c1 ACTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENS ASSOCIATED WITH GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 SYNDROME BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SOLES OF THE FEET. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE SOLES ARE CONSIDERED A CRITICAL \\\"TERMINAL\\\" RESERVOIR WHERE VIRUSES OR BACTERIA TRIGGERING AUTOIMMUNE DEMYELINATION CAN HIDE. GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 IS A CONDITION WHERE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM ATTACKS THE PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, OFTEN STARTING WITH SYMPTOMS IN THE FEET AND LEGS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET \\\"OPENS\\\" THE RESERVOIR, EXPOSING LATENT PATHOGENS TO THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND ASSISTING IN THE RESTORATION OF PROPER BIOELECTRIC CONDUCTION FROM THE GROUND UP.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS ASOCIADOS CON EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LAS PLANTAS DE LOS PIES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LAS PLANTAS SE CONSIDERAN UN RESERVORIO \\\"TERMINAL\\\" CR\\u00cdTICO DONDE PUEDEN OCULTARSE VIRUS O BACTERIAS QUE DESENCADENAN LA DESMIELINIZACI\\u00d3N AUTOINMUNE. EL GUILLAIN-BARR\\u00c9 ES UNA CONDICI\\u00d3N EN LA QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO ATACA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO, COMENZANDO A MENUDO CON S\\u00cdNTOMAS EN LOS PIES Y LAS PIERNAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO \\\"ABRE\\\" EL RESERVORIO, EXPONIENDO PAT\\u00d3GENOS LATENTES AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y AYUDANDO EN LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICA ADECUADA DESDE LA BASE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF NERVE CONDUCTION ISSUES OR ASCENDING WEAKNESS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ BULB RACHIDIAN] AXIS TO ADDRESS CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING VIRAL TRIGGERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [URIST \\/ URIST] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF NEUROTOXINS RELEASED FROM THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI PERSISTEN LOS PROBLEMAS DE CONDUCCI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA O LA DEBILIDAD ASCENDENTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DESENCADENANTES VIRALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [URIST \\/ URIST]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE NEUROTOXINAS LIBERADAS DESDE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/708','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:29:03','2026-04-28 17:29:03'),(4485,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',709,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED THROUGH ORAL SEX. ALTERATIONS OF THE SPERMATIC FLUID. CAN HAVE GENETIC DAMAGE THAT EFFECTS THE FETUS. (MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS\\n\\nTRANSMITIDO POR SEXO ORAL. ALTERACIONES DEL FLUIDO ESPERM\\u00c1TICO. PUEDE CAUSAR DA\\u00d1O GEN\\u00c9TICO QUE AFECTA AL FETO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SUPRASPINATUS         CHECK - CORPUS CALLOSUM (REVISAR - SUPRAESPINOSO         REVISAR - CUERPO CALLOSO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ALTERATIONS OF SPERMATIC FLUID, GENETIC DAMAGE TO THE FETUS, AND POTENTIAL ISSUES DURING PREGNANCY. TRANSMITTED THROUGH ORAL SEX.\\n\\n(ALTERACIONES DEL L\\u00cdQUIDO ESPERM\\u00c1TICO, DA\\u00d1O GEN\\u00c9TICO AL FETO Y POSIBLES PROBLEMAS DURANTE EL EMBARAZO. TRANSMITIDO POR SEXO ORAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS WITHIN THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE SPERMATIC CORDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SPECIFIC AS THE BACTERIA CAN COLONIZE THIS AREA FOLLOWING TRANSMISSION THROUGH ORAL SEX. UNLIKE THE PULMONARY FORM OF TUBERCULOSIS, THIS LOCALIZATION DIRECTLY IMPACTS SPERM QUALITY AND CAN CAUSE ENERGETIC DISTORTIONS CAPABLE OF INDUCING GENETIC DAMAGE OR PREGNANCY COMPLICATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD FROM THE UROGENITAL PATHWAYS, PROTECTING REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH AND REDUCING THE RISK OF TRANSMITTING THE PATHOGEN TO A PARTNER OR OFFSPRING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS DENTRO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS CORDONES ESPERM\\u00c1TICOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY ESPEC\\u00cdFICO YA QUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE COLONIZAR ESTA \\u00c1REA TRAS LA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N POR SEXO ORAL. A DIFERENCIA DE LA FORMA PULMONAR DE LA TUBERCULOSIS, ESTA LOCALIZACI\\u00d3N IMPACTA DIRECTAMENTE EN LA CALIDAD DEL ESPERMA Y PUEDE CAUSAR DISTORSIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS CAPACES DE INDUCIR DA\\u00d1O GEN\\u00c9TICO O COMPLICACIONES EN EL EMBARAZO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA DE LAS V\\u00cdAS UROGENITALES, PROTEGIENDO LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA Y REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE TRANSMITIR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO A LA PAREJA O A LA DESCENDENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF REPRODUCTIVE OR SYSTEMIC ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [SUPRASPINATUS \\/ SUPRASPINATUS] AXIS, WHICH IS THE PRIMARY RESONANCE FOR MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING NEUROLOGICAL OR COGNITIVE SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CORPUS CALLOSUM \\/ CORPUS CALLOSUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI PERSISTEN LOS PROBLEMAS REPRODUCTIVOS O SIST\\u00c9MICOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SUPRAESPINOSO \\/ SUPRAESPINOSO], QUE ES LA RESONANCIA PRIMARIA PARA EL MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O COGNITIVOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CUERPO CALLOSO \\/ CUERPO CALLOSO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/709','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:30:08','2026-04-28 17:30:08'),(4486,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',710,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN HIVES, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA, VOMITING, HEADACHES. (ENDOLIMAX NANA\\n\\nURTICARIA EN LA PIEL, DIARREA, NAUSEA, V\\u00d3MITOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA.)\",\"paths\":\"CHRONIC DIARRHEA (DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN HIVES, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA, VOMITING, AND HEADACHES.\\n\\n(URTICARIA EN LA PIEL, DIARREA, NAUSEA, V\\u00d3MITOS Y DOLORES DE CABEZA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS ENDOLIMAX NANA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC DIARRHEA. ALTHOUGH ENDOLIMAX NANA IS OFTEN CONSIDERED A NON-PATHOGENIC COMMENSAL AMOEBA IN CONVENTIONAL MEDICINE, ITS PRESENCE IN THIS SPECIFIC ENERGETIC CIRCUIT INDICATES A SYSTEMIC IMBALANCE THAT CAN TRIGGER GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET AND DERMATOLOGICAL REACTIONS LIKE URTICARIA (HIVES). BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\\u2014SUPPORTED BY THE SPLEEN\'S FILTRATION\\u2014IN REGULATING THE PARASITIC LOAD AND RESTORING PROPER INTESTINAL FUNCTION, THEREBY ELIMINATING RECURRENT NAUSEA AND ASSOCIATED HEADACHES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE AL ENDOLIMAX NANA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE ASOCIA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON LA DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA. AUNQUE EL ENDOLIMAX NANA A MENUDO SE CONSIDERA UNA AMBA COMENSAL NO PAT\\u00d3GENA EN LA MEDICINA CONVENCIONAL, SU PRESENCIA EN ESTE CIRCUITO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO INDICA UN DESEQUILIBRIO SIST\\u00c9MICO QUE PUEDE DESENCADENAR MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL Y REACCIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS COMO URTICARIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO \\u2014APOYADO POR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO\\u2014 A REGULAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA Y RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL ADECUADA, ELIMINANDO AS\\u00cd LAS N\\u00c1USEAS RECURRENTES Y LOS DOLORES DE CABEZA ASOCIADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL CHECK: IF DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR PERSISTENT SKIN HIVES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT HEPATIC DETOXIFICATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS THROUGH THE URINARY SYSTEM DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL: SI LA DIARREA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS. PARA URTICARIA PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA URINARIO DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/710','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:31:15','2026-04-28 17:31:15'),(4487,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',711,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, ANEMIA, FATIGUE, WEAKNESS, FEVER, BLEEDING GUMS, BRUISING, AND WEIGHT LOSS. (TOS, ANEMIA, FATIGA, DEBILIDAD, FIEBRE, ENC\\u00cdAS SANGRANTES, HEMATOMAS Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRUE LEUKEMIA. (LEUCEMIA VERDADERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEMATOLOGIC DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, ANEMIA, FATIGUE, WEAKNESS, FEVER, BLEEDING GUMS, BRUISING, AND WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(TOS, ANEMIA, FATIGA, DEBILIDAD, FIEBRE, ENC\\u00cdAS SANGRANTES, HEMATOMAS Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE ADDRESSES SEVERE HEMATOLOGIC IMBALANCES\\u2014OFTEN REFERRED TO IN BIOMAGNETISM AS \\\"TRUE LEUKEMIA\\\"\\u2014BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE DUODENUM. THE SPLEEN IS THE PRIMARY ORGAN FOR BLOOD FILTRATION AND IMMUNE SURVEILLANCE, WHILE THE DUODENUM IS THE GATEWAY FOR NUTRIENT ABSORPTION. AN ENERGETIC DISRUPTION IN THIS SPECIFIC CIRCUIT CAN LEAD TO THE MALFUNCTION OF BONE MARROW AND WHITE BLOOD CELL PRODUCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REGULATING THE PRODUCTION AND DESTRUCTION OF BLOOD CELLS, HELPING TO ALLEVIATE SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS, ANEMIA, AND SPONTANEOUS BLEEDING OR BRUISING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA ABORDA DESEQUILIBRIOS HEMATOL\\u00d3GICOS GRAVES \\u2014A MENUDO DENOMINADOS EN BIOMAGNETISMO COMO \\\"LEUCEMIA VERDADERA\\\"\\u2014 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y EL DUODENO. EL BAZO ES EL \\u00d3RGANO PRIMARIO PARA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE Y LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA, MIENTRAS QUE EL DUODENO ES LA PUERTA DE ENTRADA PARA LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES. UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA EN ESTE CIRCUITO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PUEDE PROVOCAR EL MAL FUNCIONAMIENTO DE LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REGULAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N Y DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS SANGU\\u00cdNEAS, AYUDANDO A ALIVIAR LA DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA, LA ANEMIA Y LOS SANGRADOS O HEMATOMAS ESPONT\\u00c1NEOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEMATOLOGIC CHECK: IF ANEMIA OR FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] (REF 697) AXIS TO RULE OUT AGGRESSIVE BACTERIAL LOADS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IMMUNE SUPPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN MANAGING METABOLIC WASTE DURING BLOOD TISSUE REGENERATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA ANEMIA O LA FATIGA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] (REF 697) PARA DESCARTAR CARGAS BACTERIANAS AGRESIVAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA SUPRESI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ TIMO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN EL MANEJO DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/711','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:32:35','2026-04-28 17:32:35'),(4488,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',712,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SLOTH (PEREZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOLOGICAL ATTRIBUTE (ATRIBUTO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"SLOTH, LACK OF MOTIVATION, PHYSICAL LETHARGY, AND EMOTIONAL APATHY.\\n\\n(PEREZA, FALTA DE MOTIVACI\\u00d3N, LETARGO F\\u00cdSICO Y APAT\\u00cdA EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE STATE OF SLOTH (PEREZA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE HYPOTHALAMUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE BODY\'S ENERGETIC RESERVES (SPLEEN) WITH THE CENTRAL COMMAND CENTER FOR METABOLIC AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION (HYPOTHALAMUS). SLOTH IS OFTEN MORE THAN A CHARACTER TRAIT; IT CAN BE AN ENERGETIC DEFICIT WHERE THE HYPOTHALAMUS FAILS TO TRIGGER THE NECESSARY VITALITY DUE TO SYSTEMIC STAGNATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RE-ENERGIZING THE ORGANISM, CLEARING THE \\\"HEAVINESS\\\" ASSOCIATED WITH LACK OF WILLPOWER, AND RESTORING THE NATURAL DRIVE TO PURSUE PHYSICAL AND MENTAL ACTIVITIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL ESTADO DE LA PEREZA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA LAS RESERVAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DEL CUERPO (BAZO) CON EL CENTRO DE MANDO CENTRAL PARA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y EMOCIONAL (HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO). LA PEREZA A MENUDO ES M\\u00c1S QUE UN RASGO DE CAR\\u00c1CTER; PUEDE SER UN D\\u00c9FICIT ENERG\\u00c9TICO DONDE EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO NO LOGRA ACTIVAR LA VITALIDAD NECESARIA DEBIDO AL ESTANCAMIENTO SIST\\u00c9MICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REENERGIZAR EL ORGANISMO, ELIMINANDO LA \\\"PESADEZ\\\" ASOCIADA CON LA FALTA DE VOLUNTAD Y RESTAURANDO EL IMPULSO NATURAL PARA REALIZAR ACTIVIDADES F\\u00cdSICAS Y MENTALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF LETHARGY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO RULE OUT METABOLIC UNDERACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP DEPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SIGMOID \\/ INGUINAL LIGAMENT - L] (REF 704) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN PROVIDING THE NECESSARY ENERGY FOR EMOTIONAL RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI EL LETARGO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA DESCARTAR UNA BAJA ACTIVIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEPRESI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SIGMOIDES \\/ LIGAMENTO INGUINAL (I)] (REF 704). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN LA PROPORCI\\u00d3N DE LA ENERG\\u00cdA NECESARIA PARA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/712','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:33:46','2026-04-28 17:33:46'),(4489,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',713,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LAZINESS (PEREZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOLOGICAL ATTRIBUTE (ATRIBUTO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"LAZINESS, LACK OF MOTIVATION, PHYSICAL LETHARGY, AND EMOTIONAL STAGNATION.\\n\\n(PEREZA, FALTA DE MOTIVACI\\u00d3N, LETARGO F\\u00cdSICO Y ESTANCAMIENTO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE STATE OF LAZINESS (PEREZA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE HYPOTHALAMUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE BODY\'S VITAL ENERGETIC RESERVOIR (SPLEEN) WITH THE CENTRAL REGULATORY HUB OF THE BRAIN (HYPOTHALAMUS). \\\"LAZINESS\\\" IN THIS CONTEXT IS OFTEN VIEWED NOT MERELY AS A CHARACTER TRAIT, BUT AS AN ENERGETIC BLOCK WHERE THE HYPOTHALAMUS IS UNABLE TO TRIGGER THE NECESSARY VITALITY DUE TO SYSTEMIC \\\"HEAVINESS\\\" OR STAGNATION IN THE SPLEEN. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN REINVIGORATING THE ORGANISM, CLEARING THE MENTAL FOG OF APATHY, AND RESTORING THE NATURAL IMPULSE TO ENGAGE IN PHYSICAL AND MENTAL ACTIVITIES.(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL ESTADO DE LA PEREZA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA EL RESERVORIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO VITAL DEL CUERPO (BAZO) CON EL CENTRO REGULADOR CENTRAL DEL CEREBRO (HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO). LA \\\"PEREZA\\\" EN ESTE CONTEXTO A MENUDO SE VE NO SIMPLEMENTE COMO UN RASGO DE CAR\\u00c1CTER, SINO COMO UN BLOQUEO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DONDE EL HIPOT\\u00c1LAMO ES INCAPAZ DE ACTIVAR LA VITALIDAD NECESARIA DEBIDO A UNA \\\"PESADEZ\\\" SIST\\u00c9MICA O ESTANCAMIENTO EN EL BAZO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A REINVIGORAR EL ORGANISMO, ELIMINANDO LA NIEBLA MENTAL DE LA APAT\\u00cdA Y RESTAURANDO EL IMPULSO NATURAL PARA PARTICIPAR EN ACTIVIDADES F\\u00cdSICAS Y MENTALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF LETHARGY PERSIST, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO RULE OUT METABOLIC UNDERACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP DEPRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SIGMOID \\/ INGUINAL LIGAMENT - L] (REF 704) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN PROVIDING THE NECESSARY ENERGY FOR EMOTIONAL RECOVERY.(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI EL LETARGO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA DESCARTAR UNA BAJA ACTIVIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEPRESI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SIGMOIDES \\/ LIGAMENTO INGUINAL (I)] (REF 704). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN LA PROPORCI\\u00d3N DE LA ENERG\\u00cdA NECESARIA PARA LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/713','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:35:09','2026-04-28 17:35:09'),(4490,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',714,'{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT GAIN, PELVIC INFLAMMATION, LUNG DISORDER, BLOOD DISORDERS. (BRUCELLA ABORTUS\\n\\nAUMENTO DE PESO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, TRASTORNOS PULMONARES, TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY DAIRY PRODUCTS. HEPATITIS L, ANEMIA. DETERIORATED PLATELETS TRAVEL THROUGH THE SPLEEN INTO WHITE BLOOD CELLS, INFERTILITY. (TRANSMITIDO POR PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. HEPATITIS L, ANEMIA. PLAQUETAS DETERIORADAS PASAN POR EL BAZO HACIA LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WEIGHT GAIN, PELVIC INFLAMMATION, LUNG DISORDERS, AND BLOOD DISORDERS.\\n\\n(AUMENTO DE PESO, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, TRASTORNOS PULMONARES Y TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS BRUCELLA ABORTUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE CONSUMPTION OF UNPASTEURIZED DAIRY PRODUCTS. THE INFECTION SIGNIFICANTLY IMPACTS THE HEMATOLOGIC SYSTEM; DETERIORATED PLATELETS TRAVEL THROUGH THE SPLEEN TOWARD WHITE BLOOD CELLS, OFTEN RESULTING IN ANEMIA OR \\\"HEPATITIS L.\\\" BEYOND BLOOD ALTERATIONS, THIS PAIR IS LINKED TO REPRODUCTIVE CHALLENGES SUCH AS INFERTILITY AND PELVIC INFLAMMATION, AS WELL AS UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT GAIN. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA, PROTECTING THE INTEGRITY OF BLOOD CELLS, AND RESTORING METABOLIC AND REPRODUCTIVE BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA BRUCELLA ABORTUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONSUMO DE PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS NO PASTEURIZADOS. LA INFECCI\\u00d3N IMPACTA SIGNIFICATIVAMENTE EL SISTEMA HEMATOL\\u00d3GICO; LAS PLAQUETAS DETERIORADAS VIAJAN A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL BAZO HACIA LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, RESULTANDO A MENUDO EN ANEMIA O \\\"HEPATITIS L\\\". M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LAS ALTERACIONES SANGU\\u00cdNEAS, ESTE PAR SE VINCULA CON DESAF\\u00cdOS REPRODUCTIVOS COMO LA INFERTILIDAD Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, AS\\u00cd COMO EL AUMENTO DE PESO INEXPLICABLE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS SANGU\\u00cdNEAS Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y REPRODUCTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF BLOOD DISORDERS OR FATIGUE PERSIST, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER SPLENIC DYSFUNCTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEPATIC SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [RIGHT KIDNEY \\/ LEFT KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN FILTERING BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI PERSISTEN LOS TRASTORNOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS O LA FATIGA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ BAZO] PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS DISFUNCIONES ESPL\\u00c9NICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS HEP\\u00c1TICOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DERECHO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/714','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:36:15','2026-04-28 17:36:15'),(4491,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',715,'{\"origins\":\"BRUCELLOSIS\",\"symptoms\":\"ASTHMA, FATIGUE, MUSCLE ACHES, JOINT PAIN, SACRAL AND HIP PAIN, ARTHRITIS, CHRONIC BACK PAIN, INSOMNIA, HEADACHES, HIGH FEVER, NIGHT SWEATS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, CONSTIPATION, COLITIS, SEXUAL AND LABOR APATHY. (ASMA, FATIGA, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR ARTICULAR, DOLOR SACRO Y DE CADERA, ARTRITIS, DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO DE ESPALDA, INSOMNIO, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE ALTA, SUDORACI\\u00d3N NOCTURNA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, COLITIS, APAT\\u00cdA SEXUAL Y LABORAL.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY CONTAMINATED MILK PRODUCTS. MALTA FEVER. AFFECTS THE SPLEEN. CHANGES IN BLOOD CELLS, LEUKOCYTOSIS. LYMPHOMAS. (TRANSMITIDO POR PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS. FIEBRE DE MALTA. AFECTA EL BAZO. CAMBIOS EN LAS C\\u00c9LULAS SANGU\\u00cdNEAS, LEUCOCITOSIS. LINFOMAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BRUCELLOSIS (FIEBRE DE MALTA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ASTHMA, FATIGUE, MUSCLE ACHES, JOINT PAIN, SACRAL AND HIP PAIN, ARTHRITIS, CHRONIC BACK PAIN, INSOMNIA, HEADACHES, HIGH FEVER, NIGHT SWEATS, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, CONSTIPATION, COLITIS, SEXUAL AND LABOR APATHY.(ASMA, FATIGA, DOLORES MUSCULARES, DOLOR ARTICULAR, DOLOR SACRO Y DE CADERA, ARTRITIS, DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO DE ESPALDA, INSOMNIO, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE ALTA, SUDORACI\\u00d3N NOCTURNA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, COLITIS, APAT\\u00cdA SEXUAL Y LABORAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS BRUCELLOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE LIVER. COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED MILK PRODUCTS, THIS PATHOGEN\\u2014ALSO KNOWN AS MALTA FEVER\\u2014PRIMARILY AFFECTS THE SPLEEN AND LIVER, OFTEN LEADING TO HEMATOLOGIC CHANGES SUCH AS LEUKOCYTOSIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT MANIFESTS AS CHRONIC JOINT AND SACRAL PAIN, AS WELL AS RESPIRATORY ISSUES LIKE ASTHMA. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PREVENTING POTENTIAL COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS LYMPHOMAS, AND RESTORING VITALITY BY ALLEVIATING THE PROFOUND APATHY AND FATIGUE ASSOCIATED WITH THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA BRUCELOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. TRANSMITIDO COM\\u00daNMENTE POR PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO \\u2014TAMBI\\u00c9N CONOCIDO COMO FIEBRE DE MALTA\\u2014 AFECTA PRINCIPALMENTE AL BAZO Y AL H\\u00cdGADO, RESULTANDO A MENUDO EN CAMBIOS HEMATOL\\u00d3GICOS COMO LA LEUCOCITOSIS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO DOLOR ARTICULAR Y SACRO CR\\u00d3NICO, AS\\u00cd PARA PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS COMO EL ASMA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PREVINIENDO POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES COMO LINFOMAS Y RESTAURANDO LA VITALIDAD AL ALIVIAR LA PROFUNDA APAT\\u00cdA Y FATIGA ASOCIADAS CON LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HEMATOLOGIC CHANGES OR PERSISTENT FEVERS CONTINUE, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ KIDNEY - L] (REF 713) AXIS TO FURTHER NEUTRALIZE BRUCELLA ABORTUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SACRAL OR BACK PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE LIVER AND SPLEEN IN FILTERING BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI CONTIN\\u00daAN LOS CAMBIOS HEMATOL\\u00d3GICOS O LAS FIEBRES PERSISTENTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO] (REF 713) PARA NEUTRALIZAR M\\u00c1S A FONDO LA BRUCELLA ABORTUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR SACRO O DE ESPALDA SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SACRO \\/ SACRO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL H\\u00cdGADO Y AL BAZO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/715','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:37:33','2026-04-28 17:37:33'),(4492,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',716,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT MAY BE LINKED TO RECURRENT RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, CHRONIC COUGH, AND IMMUNE SYSTEM FLUCTUATIONS WHEN ACTIVE.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS RECURRENTES, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA Y FLUCTUACIONES DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO CUANDO EST\\u00c1 ACTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE TARGETS LATENT BACTERIAL LOADS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE LUNG ON THE SAME SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS A STRATEGIC HIDING PLACE WHERE BACTERIA CAN REMAIN DORMANT, EVADING THE IMMUNE SURVEILLANCE OF THE SPLEEN WHILE POSITIONED CLOSE TO THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET \\\"OPENS\\\" THE RESERVOIR, EXPOSING THE HIDDEN PATHOGENS TO THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND PREVENTING THEM FROM TRIGGERING FUTURE PULMONARY OR SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. IT IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING THE BODY OF SUBTLE INFECTIONS THAT PREVENT FULL RESPIRATORY RECOVERY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO SE DIRIGE A CARGAS BACTERIANAS LATENTES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y EL PULM\\u00d3N DEL MISMO LADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES UN LUGAR DE ESCONDITE ESTRAT\\u00c9GICO DONDE LAS BACTERIAS PUEDEN PERMANECER INACTIVAS, EVADIENDO LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA DEL BAZO MIENTRAS SE POSICIONAN CERCA DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO \\\"ABRE\\\" EL RESERVORIO, EXPONIENDO LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS OCULTOS AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y EVITANDO QUE DESENCADENEN FUTURAS INFLAMACIONES PULMONARES O SIST\\u00c9MICAS. ES ESENCIAL PARA LIMPIAR EL CUERPO DE INFECCIONES SUTILES QUE IMPIDEN UNA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA COMPLETA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS PERSIST AFTER OPENING THIS RESERVOIR, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] (REF 714) AXIS TO RULE OUT BRUCELLOSIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC COUGH, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [POPLITEAL \\/ POPLITEAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS RELEASED FROM THIS RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTEN DESPU\\u00c9S DE ABRIR ESTE RESERVORIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 714) PARA DESCARTAR BRUCELOSIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [POPL\\u00cdTEO \\/ POPL\\u00cdTEO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LAS TOXINAS BACTERIANAS LIBERADAS DESDE ESTE RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/716','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:38:35','2026-04-28 17:38:35'),(4493,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',717,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WARTS (VERRUGAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"WARTS (VERRUGAS)\",\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC OR CHARACTERIZED BY THE APPEARANCE OF COMMON WARTS ON THE SKIN.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO O CARACTERIZADO POR LA APARICI\\u00d3N DE VERRUGAS COMUNES EN LA PIEL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE VIRUS RESPONSIBLE FOR WARTS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE TIP OF THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS LINKS THE IMMUNE FILTRATION SYSTEM (SPLEEN) WITH THE TAIL OR TIP OF THE PANCREAS, AN AREA SENSITIVE TO ENERGETIC IMBALANCES THAT CAN ALLOW VIRAL MANIFESTATIONS ON THE DERMIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN RECOGNIZING AND NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, THEREBY PREVENTING THE PROLIFERATION OF SKIN LESIONS AND SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSE AGAINST DERMATOLOGICAL VIRUSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS RESPONSABLE DE LAS VERRUGAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VINCULA EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA (BAZO) CON LA COLA O PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS, UNA ZONA SENSIBLE A DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE PUEDEN PERMITIR MANIFESTACIONES VIRALES EN LA DERMIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RECONOCER Y NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, EVITANDO AS\\u00cd LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y APOYANDO LA DEFENSA NATURAL DEL CUERPO CONTRA LOS VIRUS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF WARTS OR SKIN LESIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO RULE OUT THE HUMAN PAPILLOMA VIRUS (HPV). FOR CASES INVOLVING WIDESPREAD SKIN ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] (REF 714) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LAS VERRUGAS O LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA] PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO (VPH). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS GENERALIZADOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 714). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/717','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:40:04','2026-04-28 17:40:04'),(4494,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',718,'{\"symptoms\":\"COUGHING, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, AZOOSPERMIA, LOW BACK PAIN. (TOS, FLUJO VAGINAL, AZOOSPERMIA, DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS, COUGHING, AND ANIMALS SUCH AS RODENTS, DOGS AND FLEAS. CONTAGIOUS LARYNGEAL COUGHING AND BRONCHITIS. PELVIC DISORDERS, FALSE DIABETES, FALSE TESTICULAR TUBERCULOSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TOS Y ANIMALES COMO ROEDORES, PERROS Y PULGAS. TOS LAR\\u00cdNGEA CONTAGIOSA Y BRONQUITIS. TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, FALSA DIABETES, FALSA TUBERCULOSIS TESTICULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CKECK - TESTICLE CHECK - VAGINA (REVISAR - TEST\\u00cdCULO  REVISAR - VAGINA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"COUGHING, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, AZOOSPERMIA, AND LOW BACK PAIN.\\n\\n(TOS, FLUJO VAGINAL, AZOOSPERMIA Y DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS YERSINIA PESTIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SPLEEN IN A HORIZONTAL ALIGNMENT. TRANSMITTED THROUGH RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS, COUGHING, AND ANIMALS SUCH AS RODENTS, DOGS, AND FLEAS, THIS PATHOGEN CAN LEAD TO CONTAGIOUS LARYNGEAL COUGHING AND BRONCHITIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC HORIZONTAL PLACEMENT ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC COMPLICATIONS THAT MAY MIMIC OTHER CONDITIONS, SUCH AS \\\"FALSE DIABETES\\\" OR \\\"FALSE TESTICULAR TUBERCULOSIS.\\\" IT IS ALSO HIGHLY RELEVANT FOR PELVIC DISORDERS AND REPRODUCTIVE ALTERATIONS, INCLUDING AZOOSPERMIA. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA, CLEARING RESPIRATORY PATHWAYS, AND RESTORING UROGENITAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA YERSINIA PESTIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL BAZO EN UNA ALINEACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL. TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TOS Y ANIMALES COMO ROEDORES, PERROS Y PULGAS, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE PROVOCAR TOS LAR\\u00cdNGEA CONTAGIOSA Y BRONQUITIS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA COLOCACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICA ABORDA COMPLICACIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE PUEDEN IMITAR OTRAS CONDICIONES, COMO LA \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\" O LA \\\"FALSA TUBERCULOSIS TESTICULAR\\\". TAMBI\\u00c9N ES ALTAMENTE RELEVANTE PARA TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS Y ALTERACIONES REPRODUCTIVAS, INCLUYENDO LA AZOOSPERMIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA, LIMPIANDO LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO UROGENITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"REPRODUCTIVE CHECK: IF PELVIC DISORDERS OR AZOOSPERMIA PERSIST, SCAN THE [TESTICLE \\/ TESTICLE] AXIS IN MALES OR THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] AXIS IN FEMALES TO ENSURE NO LOCALIZED RESERVOIRS REMAIN. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LOW BACK PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] (REF 714) AXIS TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC IMMUNE SURVEILLANCE AND TO ENSURE PH STABILITY DURING THE ELIMINATION OF THIS AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA: SI PERSISTEN LOS TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS O LA AZOOSPERMIA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEST\\u00cdCULO \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO] EN HOMBRES O EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] EN MUJERES PARA ASEGURAR QUE NO QUEDEN RESERVORIOS LOCALIZADOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR LUMBAR SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 714) PARA APOYAR LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA BACTERIA AGRESIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/718','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:41:15','2026-04-28 17:41:15'),(4495,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',719,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"BLOOD DISORDERS, ABNORMAL BLOOD CLOTTING FACTORS. INFLAMMATION OF THE SPLEEN. ANEMIA AND POLYCYTHEMIA. (TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE, FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N ANORMALES. INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO. ANEMIA Y POLICITEMIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SPLENIC DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ESPL\\u00c9NICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"BLOOD DISORDERS, ABNORMAL BLOOD CLOTTING FACTORS, INFLAMMATION OF THE SPLEEN, ANEMIA, AND POLYCYTHEMIA.(TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE, FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N ANORMALES, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO, ANEMIA Y POLICITEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES IMBALANCES IN THE SPLEEN\\u2019S PRIMARY FILTRATION AND REGULATORY ROLES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE ORGAN USING A VERTICAL PLACEMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE SPLEEN IS THE \\\"QUALITY CONTROL\\\" CENTER FOR BLOOD; IT IS RESPONSIBLE FOR REMOVING OLD RED BLOOD CELLS AND MANAGING CLOTTING FACTORS. A VERTICAL ENERGETIC MISALIGNMENT HERE CAN LEAD TO SPLENOMEGALY (INFLAMMATION) OR THE OVERPRODUCTION\\/UNDERPRODUCTION OF ESSENTIAL BLOOD COMPONENTS, MANIFESTING AS ANEMIA OR POLYCYTHEMIA. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN NORMALIZING THE SPLEEN\'S FUNCTION, IMPROVING BLOOD VISCOSITY, AND RESTORING BALANCE TO THE BODY\\u2019S HEMATOLOGICAL DEFENSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS EN LAS FUNCIONES PRIMARIAS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL \\u00d3RGANO UTILIZANDO UNA COLOCACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL BAZO ES EL CENTRO DE \\\"CONTROL DE CALIDAD\\\" DE LA SANGRE; ES RESPONSABLE DE ELIMINAR LOS GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS VIEJOS Y GESTIONAR LOS FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N. UN DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO VERTICAL AQU\\u00cd PUEDE PROVOCAR ESPLENOMEGALIA (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N) O LA SOBREPRODUCCI\\u00d3N\\/SUBPRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE COMPONENTES SANGU\\u00cdNEOS ESENCIALES, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO ANEMIA O POLICITEMIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A NORMALIZAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO, MEJORANDO LA VISCOSIDAD DE LA SANGRE Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO DE LAS DEFENSAS HEMATOL\\u00d3GICAS DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEMATOLOGIC CHECK: IF ANEMIA OR CLOTTING ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 710) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL COMPLEX BLOOD DYSFUNCTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT HEPATIC FILTRATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE RENAL REGULATION OF BLOOD VOLUME DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA: SI PERSISTEN LA ANEMIA O LOS PROBLEMAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ DUODENO] (REF 710) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES DISFUNCIONES SANGU\\u00cdNEAS COMPLEJAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N RENAL DEL VOLUMEN SANGU\\u00cdNEO DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/719','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:42:27','2026-04-28 17:42:27'),(4496,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',720,'{\"symptoms\":\"PELVIC DISORDERS, RENAL AND SEXUAL DISORDERS. FEVER, DIARRHEA, HEMORRHOIDS. (ROTAVIRUS\\n\\nTRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, TRASTORNOS RENALES Y SEXUALES. FIEBRE, DIARREA, HEMORROIDES.)\",\"paths\":\"ABSORPTION OF NUTRIENTS ARE BLOCKED IN THE SMALL INTESTINE; KILLING THE EPITHELIAL CELLS NEEDED FOR MOTION AND NUTRIENTS. (SE BLOQUEA LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES EN EL INTESTINO DELGADO; SE DESTRUYEN LAS C\\u00c9LULAS EPITELIALES NECESARIAS PARA EL MOVIMIENTO Y LOS NUTRIENTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PELVIC DISORDERS, RENAL AND SEXUAL DISORDERS. FEVER, DIARRHEA, AND HEMORRHOIDS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, TRASTORNOS RENALES Y SEXUALES. FIEBRE, DIARREA Y HEMORROIDES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE ROTAVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE SUPRARENAL GLANDS. ROTAVIRUS IS A LEADING CAUSE OF SEVERE DIARRHEA, PARTICULARLY IMPACTING THE SMALL INTESTINE BY BLOCKING THE ABSORPTION OF NUTRIENTS. THE VIRUS ACTIVELY DESTROYS EPITHELIAL CELLS NECESSARY FOR INTESTINAL MOTILITY AND NUTRIENT UPTAKE. BEYOND GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS, THIS SPECIFIC ENERGETIC AXIS IS LINKED TO DYSFUNCTIONS IN THE PELVIC AND RENAL AREAS, POTENTIALLY AFFECTING SEXUAL HEALTH AND TRIGGERING FEVERS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING THE INTESTINAL LINING, AND RESTORING PROPER ABSORPTIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL ROTAVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EL ROTAVIRUS ES UNA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE DIARREA SEVERA, QUE AFECTA PARTICULARMENTE AL INTESTINO DELGADO AL BLOQUEAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES. EL VIRUS DESTRUYE ACTIVAMENTE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS EPITELIALES NECESARIAS PARA LA MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL Y LA CAPTACI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL, ESTE EJE ENERG\\u00c9TICO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A DISFUNCIONES EN LAS \\u00c1REAS P\\u00c9LVICA Y RENAL, AFECTANDO POTENCIALMENTE LA SALUD SEXUAL Y DESENCADENANDO FIEBRES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO EL REVESTIMIENTO INTESTINAL Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF DIARRHEA PERSISTS, SCAN THE [COLON DESCENDING \\/ COLON DESCENDING] AXIS TO RULE OUT BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RENAL DISCOMFORT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] (REF 714) AXIS TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC IMMUNE FILTRATION AND ENSURE PH STABILITY DURING THE RECOVERY FROM THIS VIRAL INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI LA DIARREA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON DESCENDENTE \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR RENAL SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 714) PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/720','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:43:37','2026-04-28 17:43:37'),(4497,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',721,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT MAY BE LINKED TO PERSISTENT RESPIRATORY ISSUES, DRY COUGH, SORE THROAT, AND FLUCTUATIONS IN THE IMMUNE RESPONSE WHEN ACTIVE.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTENTES, TOS SECA, DOLOR DE GARGANTA Y FLUCTUACIONES EN LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA CUANDO EST\\u00c1 ACTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE TARGETS HIDDEN BACTERIAL LOADS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SPLEEN AND THE TRACHEA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS A STRATEGIC REFUGE WHERE BACTERIAL PATHOGENS CAN EVADE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\'S FILTRATION SYSTEM (SPLEEN) BY NESTING IN THE CARTILAGINOUS TISSUE OF THE TRACHEA. WHILE IN THIS RESERVOIR STATE, THE BACTERIA DO NOT PRODUCE ACUTE ILLNESS BUT CAN PERPETUATE CHRONIC LOW-LEVEL INFLAMMATION IN THE UPPER RESPIRATORY TRACT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET \\\"OPENS\\\" THE RESERVOIR, RELEASING THE LATENT BACTERIA SO THEY CAN BE IDENTIFIED AND NEUTRALIZED BY THE BODY\'S DEFENSES, CLEARING THE PATH FOR COMPLETE RESPIRATORY REHABILITATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO SE DIRIGE A CARGAS BACTERIANAS OCULTAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL BAZO Y LA TR\\u00c1QUEA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES UN REFUGIO ESTRAT\\u00c9GICO DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS BACTERIANOS PUEDEN EVADIR EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO (BAZO) AL ANIDAR EN EL TEJIDO CARTILAGINOSO DE LA TR\\u00c1QUEA. MIENTRAS EST\\u00c1N EN ESTE ESTADO DE RESERVORIO, LAS BACTERIAS NO PRODUCEN UNA ENFERMEDAD AGUDA, PERO PUEDEN PERPETUAR UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DE BAJO NIVEL EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO \\\"ABRE\\\" EL RESERVORIO, LIBERANDO LAS BACTERIAS LATENTES PARA QUE PUEDAN SER IDENTIFICADAS Y NEUTRALIZADAS POR LAS DEFENSAS DEL CUERPO, DESPEJANDO EL CAMINO PARA UNA REHABILITACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA COMPLETA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF COUGHING OR THROAT IRRITATION PERSISTS AFTER OPENING THIS RESERVOIR, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] (REF 714) AXIS TO RULE OUT BRUCELLOSIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LARYNGEAL SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LARYNX \\/ LARYNX] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS RELEASED FROM THE TRACHEAL AREA.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LA TOS O LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE GARGANTA PERSISTEN DESPU\\u00c9S DE ABRIR ESTE RESERVORIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 714) PARA DESCARTAR BRUCELOSIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LARINGE \\/ LARINGE]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS LIBERADOS DEL \\u00c1REA TRAQUEAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/721','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:44:38','2026-04-28 17:44:38'),(4498,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',722,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRAUMATIC BRAIN INJURY. (TRAUMATISMO CEREBRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"TRAUMATIC BRAIN INJURY (TRAUMATISMO CEREBRAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"COGNITIVE IMPAIRMENT, MOTOR DYSFUNCTION, DIZZINESS, HEADACHES, MEMORY LOSS, AND SENSORY ALTERATIONS RESULTING FROM PHYSICAL TRAUMA.\\n\\n(DETERIORO COGNITIVO, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA, MAREOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA Y ALTERACIONES SENSORIALES DERIVADAS DE UN TRAUMA F\\u00cdSICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE AFTEREFFECTS OF PHYSICAL TRAUMA TO THE CRANIUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE PARIETAL STEM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REHABILITATING BRAIN TISSUE THAT HAS SUFFERED IMPACT, COMPRESSION, OR CONCUSSION. THE PARIETAL REGION IS HEAVILY INVOLVED IN PROCESSING SENSORY INFORMATION AND COORDINATING SPATIAL AWARENESS; TRAUMA HERE CAN DISRUPT THE BIOELECTRIC SIGNALS BETWEEN THE BRAIN AND THE REST OF THE BODY. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN RECOVERING ENERGETIC HOMEOSTASIS, REDUCING NEURO-INFLAMMATION, AND SUPPORTING THE RESTORATION OF COGNITIVE AND MOTOR FUNCTIONS AFFECTED BY THE INJURY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LAS SECUELAS DE UN TRAUMA F\\u00cdSICO EN EL CR\\u00c1NEO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL TRONCO PARIETAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA REHABILITAR EL TEJIDO CEREBRAL QUE HA SUFRIDO IMPACTO, COMPRESI\\u00d3N O CONMOCI\\u00d3N. LA REGI\\u00d3N PARIETAL EST\\u00c1 MUY INVOLUCRADA EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA INFORMACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N DE LA CONCIENCIA ESPACIAL; UN TRAUMA EN ESTA \\u00c1REA PUEDE INTERRUMPIR LAS SE\\u00d1ALES BIOEL\\u00c9CTRICAS ENTRE EL CEREBRO Y EL RESTO DEL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL A RECUPERAR LA HOMEOSTASIS ENERG\\u00c9TICA, REDUCIENDO LA NEUROINFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y APOYANDO LA RESTAURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS FUNCIONES COGNITIVAS Y MOTORAS AFECTADAS POR LA LESI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF MOTOR DYSFUNCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO ENSURE SYMMETRICAL PH BALANCE IN THE CEREBRAL CORTEX. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MEMORY LOSS OR EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY POST-INJURY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING THE BRAIN\'S REPAIR PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N MOTORA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA ASEGURAR EL EQUILIBRIO SIM\\u00c9TRICO DEL PH EN LA CORTEZA CEREBRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA SEVERA O INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL POSTERIOR A LA LESI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REPARACI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/722','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:45:54','2026-04-28 17:45:54'),(4499,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',723,'{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, EXTREME FATIGUE, ANXIETY, FEVER, BRAIN DAMAGE, IRRITABILITY. (EPSTEIN-BARR\\n\\nMAREOS, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FATIGA EXTREMA, ANSIEDAD, FIEBRE, DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL, IRRITABILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"INFECTIOUS MONONUCLEOSIS, CHRONIC FATIGUE, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, LYMPHADENOPATHY, IT CAN BE PASSED TO THE FETUS. (MONONUCLEOSIS INFECCIOSA, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, LINFADENOPAT\\u00cdA, PUEDE TRANSMITIRSE AL FETO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH CANCER. (ASOCIADO CON EL C\\u00c1NCER.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, EXTREME FATIGUE, ANXIETY, FEVER, BRAIN DAMAGE, AND IRRITABILITY.\\n\\n(MAREOS, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, FATIGA EXTREMA, ANSIEDAD, FIEBRE, DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL E IRRITABILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE EPSTEIN-BARR VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID PROCESS AND THE THYMUS. EPSTEIN-BARR IS A WIDESPREAD PATHOGEN RESPONSIBLE FOR INFECTIOUS MONONUCLEOSIS AND IS STRONGLY LINKED TO CHRONIC FATIGUE SYNDROME. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE VIRUS AFFECTS THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM AND THE IMMUNE RESPONSE REGULATED BY THE THYMUS. BEYOND SYSTEMIC FATIGUE, THE INFECTION CAN CAUSE NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS SUCH AS MENTAL CONFUSION (\\\"BRAIN FOG\\\") AND IRRITABILITY. IT IS ALSO NOTED FOR ITS POTENTIAL TO BE TRANSMITTED TO THE FETUS DURING PREGNANCY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING LYMPHADENOPATHY, AND ALLEVIATING THE PROFOUND EXHAUSTION ASSOCIATED WITH THE VIRUS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE EPSTEIN-BARR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL PROCESO ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO Y EL TIMO. EL EPSTEIN-BARR ES UN PAT\\u00d3GENO GENERALIZADO RESPONSABLE DE LA MONONUCLEOSIS INFECCIOSA Y EST\\u00c1 FUERTEMENTE VINCULADO AL S\\u00cdNDROME DE FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL VIRUS AFECTA EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO Y LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA REGULADA POR EL TIMO. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA, LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PUEDE CAUSAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS COMO CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL Y IRRITABILIDAD. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE DESTACA POR SU POTENCIAL DE SER TRANSMITIDO AL FETO DURANTE EL EMBARAZO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA LINFADENOPAT\\u00cdA Y ALIVIANDO EL AGOTAMIENTO PROFUNDO ASOCIADO CON EL VIRUS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: GIVEN THE AGGRESSIVE NATURE OF EPSTEIN-BARR, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO RULE OUT FURTHER IMMUNE SYSTEM SUPPRESSION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIZZINESS OR LOSS OF BALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY IN ELIMINATING VIRAL TOXINS PRODUCED DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE. THIS PAIR IS ALSO NOTED FOR ITS ASSOCIATION WITH CERTAIN ONCOLOGICAL RISKS; MONITORING CELLULAR STABILITY IS ADVISED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: DADA LA NATURALEZA AGRESIVA DEL EPSTEIN-BARR, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ BAZO] PARA DESCARTAR UNA MAYOR SUPRESI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MAREOS SEVEROS O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL CUERPO EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES PRODUCIDAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N. ESTE PAR TAMBI\\u00c9N SE DESTACA POR SU ASOCIACI\\u00d3N CON CIERTOS RIESGOS ONCOL\\u00d3GICOS; SE RECOMIENDA MONITOREAR LA ESTABILIDAD CELULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/723','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:47:25','2026-04-28 17:47:25'),(4500,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',724,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SLOTH OF AUTONOMOUS ORGANS. POOR CIRCULATION. PALPITATIONS, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME. (PEREZA DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS AUT\\u00d3NOMOS. MALA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N. PALPITACIONES, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE.)\",\"paths\":\"REGULATES THE INVOLUNTARY BODY AUTO FUNCTIONS. RAYNAULT SYNDROME. (REGULA LAS FUNCIONES AUTOM\\u00c1TICAS INVOLUNTARIAS DEL CUERPO. S\\u00cdNDROME DE RAYNAUD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO (AUTONOMOUS NERVOUS SYSTEM)\",\"symptoms\":\"SLOTH OF AUTONOMOUS ORGANS, POOR CIRCULATION, PALPITATIONS, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME, AND ALTERATIONS IN INVOLUNTARY BODY FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(PEREZA DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS AUT\\u00d3NOMOS, MALA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N, PALPITACIONES, S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE Y ALTERACIONES EN LAS FUNCIONES INVOLUNTARIAS DEL CUERPO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE REGULATES THE AUTONOMOUS NERVOUS SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID MUSCLES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BILATERAL AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR BALANCING INVOLUNTARY BODY FUNCTIONS, ACTING UPON WHAT IS TERMED \\\"SLOTH OF AUTONOMOUS ORGANS.\\\" WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS DISRUPTED, THE BODY MAY EXHIBIT VASCULAR REGULATION DEFICIENCIES, SUCH AS RAYNAUD\'S SYNDROME (WHERE EXTREMITIES BECOME COLD AND NUMB), OR SLUGGISH FUNCTIONING OF INTERNAL ORGANS LIKE THE HEART (PALPITATIONS) AND INTESTINES (IBS). BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET HELPS RESTORE NEUROVEGETATIVE CONTROL, IMPROVING CIRCULATORY RESPONSE AND THE OPERATIONAL EFFICIENCY OF SYSTEMS THAT FUNCTION WITHOUT VOLUNTARY CONTROL.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL REGULA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE BILATERAL ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA EQUILIBRAR LAS FUNCIONES INVOLUNTARIAS DEL CUERPO, ACTUANDO SOBRE LO QUE SE DENOMINA \\\"PEREZA DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS AUT\\u00d3NOMOS\\\". CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 ALTERADO, EL CUERPO PUEDE PRESENTAR DEFICIENCIAS EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR, COMO EN EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE RAYNAUD, O UN FUNCIONAMIENTO LENTO DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS INTERNOS COMO EL CORAZ\\u00d3N O LOS INTESTINOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTABLECER EL CONTROL NEUROVEGETATIVO, MEJORANDO LA RESPUESTA CIRCULATORIA Y LA EFICIENCIA OPERATIVA DE LOS SISTEMAS QUE FUNCIONAN SIN CONTROL VOLUNTARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CIRCULATORY CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS OF POOR CIRCULATION OR COLD EXTREMITIES PERSIST, SCAN THE [HEART \\/ RIGHT COSTAL] AXIS TO SUPPORT CARDIAC FUNCTION. FOR CASES OF BROADER NEUROLOGICAL DYSFUNCTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE (REF 722). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT BLOOD PRESSURE REGULATION DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CIRCULATORIA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE MALA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N O FR\\u00cdO EN EXTREMIDADES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CORAZ\\u00d3N \\/ COSTAL DERECHO] PARA APOYAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CARDIACA. PARA CASOS DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA M\\u00c1S AMPLIA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO \\/ TIMO] (REF 722). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/724','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:49:03','2026-04-28 17:49:03'),(4501,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',725,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEMATOLOGICAL DISORDERS. ALTERATIONS OF THE LEUKOCYTES. ANEMIA, POLYCYTHEMIA AND OTHER BLOOD DISORDERS. (TRASTORNOS HEMATOL\\u00d3GICOS. ALTERACIONES DE LOS LEUCOCITOS. ANEMIA, POLICITEMIA Y OTROS TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER PAIRS; EMPHYSEMA. (ASOCIADO CON OTROS PARES; ENFISEMA)\"}','{\"origins\":\"HEMATOLOGICAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANEMIA, POLYCYTHEMIA, ALTERATIONS IN WHITE BLOOD CELLS (LEUKOCYTES), AND GENERAL BLOOD DISORDERS.\\n\\n(ANEMIA, POLICITEMIA, ALTERACIONES EN LOS LEUCOCITOS Y OTROS TRASTORNOS DE LA SANGRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES COMPLEX HEMATOLOGICAL DISORDERS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STERNUM AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE STERNUM IS A VITAL SITE FOR BONE MARROW ACTIVITY AND THE PRODUCTION OF BLOOD CELLS. THE ADRENAL GLANDS PROVIDE THE ENDOCRINE SUPPORT NECESSARY FOR SYSTEMIC STABILITY. AN ENERGETIC IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN LEAD TO THE MALFUNCTION OF LEUKOCYTES (WHITE BLOOD CELLS) OR IMBALANCES IN RED BLOOD CELL COUNT, SUCH AS ANEMIA OR POLYCYTHEMIA. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN NORMALIZING BLOOD COMPOSITION AND ENHANCING THE QUALITY OF IMMUNE AND OXYGEN-CARRYING CELLS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA TRASTORNOS HEMATOL\\u00d3GICOS COMPLEJOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ESTERN\\u00d3N Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL ESTERN\\u00d3N ES UN SITIO VITAL PARA LA ACTIVIDAD DE LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS SANGU\\u00cdNEAS. LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES PROPORCIONAN EL APOYO ENDOCRINO NECESARIO PARA LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE PROVOCAR EL MAL FUNCIONAMIENTO DE LOS LEUCOCITOS O DESEQUILIBRIOS EN EL CONTEO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS, COMO ANEMIA O POLICITEMIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A NORMALIZAR LA COMPOSICI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE Y MEJORAR LA CALIDAD DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS INMUNITARIAS Y DE TRANSPORTE DE OX\\u00cdGENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH EMPHYSEMA; IF RESPIRATORY DIFFICULTIES ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS. FOR SEVERE ANEMIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 710) RESONANCE TO SUPPORT BLOOD FILTRATION AND NUTRIENT ABSORPTION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM IN MANAGING BLOOD VOLUME.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL ENFISEMA; SI HAY DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. PARA ANEMIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ DUODENO] (REF 710) PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SANGRE Y LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL EN EL MANEJO DEL VOLUMEN SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/725','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:50:19','2026-04-28 17:50:19'),(4502,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',726,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"BRUISING, BURST BLOOD VESSELS, HEMORRHAGES. (HEMATOMAS, RUPTURA DE VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS, HEMORRAGIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"ULCERS AND VARICOSE VIENS. (\\u00daLCERAS Y V\\u00c1RICES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"BRUISING, BURST BLOOD VESSELS, HEMORRHAGES, VARICOSE VEINS, AND ULCERS.\\n\\n(HEMATOMAS, RUPTURA DE VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS, HEMORRAGIAS, V\\u00c1RICES Y \\u00daLCERAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE INTEGRITY OF THE VASCULAR SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STERNUM AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE STERNUM IS A KEY SITE FOR HEMATOLOGIC PRODUCTION (BONE MARROW), WHILE THE LIVER REGULATES BLOOD FILTRATION AND CLOTTING FACTORS. A DISRUPTION IN THIS AXIS CAN LEAD TO FRAGILE CAPILLARIES AND POOR VENOUS RETURN, MANIFESTING CLINICALLY AS SPONTANEOUS BRUISING, VARICOSE VEINS, OR EVEN CHRONIC ULCERS DUE TO TISSUE MALNOURISHMENT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN STRENGTHENING VESSEL WALLS AND NORMALIZING THE COAGULATION AND FILTRATION PROCESSES NECESSARY TO PREVENT INTERNAL BLEEDING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LA INTEGRIDAD DEL SISTEMA VASCULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ESTERN\\u00d3N Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL ESTERN\\u00d3N ES UN SITIO CLAVE PARA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA (M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA), MIENTRAS QUE EL H\\u00cdGADO REGULA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LA SANGRE Y LOS FACTORES DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N. UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N EN ESTE EJE PUEDE PROVOCAR CAPILARES FR\\u00c1GILES Y UN MAL RETORNO VENOSO, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE CL\\u00cdNICAMENTE COMO HEMATOMAS ESPONT\\u00c1NEOS, V\\u00c1RICES O INCLUSO \\u00daLCERAS CR\\u00d3NICAS DEBIDO A LA MALA NUTRICI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A FORTALECER LAS PAREDES DE LOS VASOS Y NORMALIZAR LOS PROCESOS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N Y FILTRACI\\u00d3N NECESARIOS PARA PREVENIR HEMORRAGIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF VARICOSE VEINS OR ULCERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ILIAC \\/ ILIAC] AXIS TO IMPROVE LOWER EXTREMITY CIRCULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CLOTTING ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN (VERTICAL)] (REF 718) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING VASCULAR REPAIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI LAS V\\u00c1RICES O \\u00daLCERAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [IL\\u00cdACO \\/ IL\\u00cdACO] PARA MEJORAR LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DE COAGULACI\\u00d3N SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ BAZO (VERTICAL)] (REF 718). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA REPARACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/726','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:51:33','2026-04-28 17:51:33'),(4503,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',727,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EMPHYSEMA, ANEMIA, STOMACH PAIN, LUNG CONGESTION, VOMITING. (ENFISEMA, ANEMIA, DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR, V\\u00d3MITOS.)\",\"paths\":\"STOMACH DISORDERS, CARDIAC DISORDERS, LOW LEVELS OF OXYGEN IN THE BLOOD SUPPLY. (TRASTORNOS DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO, TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS, BAJOS NIVELES DE OX\\u00cdGENO EN LA SANGRE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEMATOLOGICAL & RESPIRATORY BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO HEMATOL\\u00d3GICO Y RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMPHYSEMA, ANEMIA, STOMACH PAIN, LUNG CONGESTION, AND VOMITING.\\n\\n(ENFISEMA, ANEMIA, DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y V\\u00d3MITOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES IMBALANCES IN OXYGENATION AND BLOOD QUALITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STERNUM AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING STOMACH AND CARDIAC DISORDERS STEMMING FROM LOW LEVELS OF OXYGEN IN THE BLOOD SUPPLY. THE STERNUM (BONE MARROW) AND SPLEEN (BLOOD FILTRATION) WORK TOGETHER TO MAINTAIN HEMATOLOGICAL HEALTH; WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS DISRUPTED, IT CAN MANIFEST AS LUNG CONGESTION OR EMPHYSEMA DUE TO THE BODY\'S INABILITY TO EFFICIENTLY TRANSPORT OXYGEN. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS IN RESTORING PROPER BLOOD CELL PRODUCTION AND FILTRATION, ALLEVIATING GASTRIC DISTRESS AND SUPPORTING PULMONARY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS EN LA OXIGENACI\\u00d3N Y LA CALIDAD DE LA SANGRE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORTIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ESTERN\\u00d3N Y EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE TRASTORNOS ESTOMACALES Y CARD\\u00cdACOS DERIVADOS DE BAJOS NIVELES DE OX\\u00cdGENO EN EL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO. EL ESTERN\\u00d3N Y EL BAZO TRABAJAN JUNTOS PARA MANTENER LA SALUD HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA; CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO SE ALTERA, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO CONGESTI\\u00d3N PULMONAR O ENFISEMA DEBIDO A LA INCAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA TRANSPORTAR OX\\u00cdGENO EFICIENTEMENTE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA A RESTAURAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N Y FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA DE C\\u00c9LULAS SANGU\\u00cdNEAS, ALIVIANDO EL MALESTAR G\\u00c1STRICO Y APOYANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF EMPHYSEMA OR CONGESTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [STERNUM \\/ ADRENALS] (REF 724) AXIS TO FURTHER REGULATE HEMATOLOGICAL FACTORS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ANEMIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ DUODENUM] (REF 710) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING THE RECOVERY OF BLOOD OXYGEN LEVELS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI EL ENFISEMA O LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESTERN\\u00d3N \\/ SUPRARRENALES] (REF 724) PARA REGULAR M\\u00c1S A FONDO LOS FACTORES HEMATOL\\u00d3GICOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANEMIA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ DUODENO] (REF 710). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS NIVELES DE OX\\u00cdGENO EN SANGRE.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/727','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:53:11','2026-04-28 17:53:11'),(4504,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',728,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"BLOOD CLOTS, ANEMIA (CO\\u00c1GULOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS, ANEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"LEUKEMIA, HORMONAL DISORDERS, EXCESSIVE OF RED BLOOD CELLS. NORMALIZES THE POLYGLOBULIA AND REGULATES THE HEMATOCRIT. (LEUCEMIA, TRASTORNOS HORMONALES, EXCESO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS. NORMALIZA LA POLIGLOBULIA Y REGULA EL HEMATOCRITO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH EMPHYSEMA        CHECK - NAVAL\\/NAVAL (ASOCIADO CON ENFISEMA        REVISAR - OMBlIGO\\/OMBLIGO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"HEMATOLOGICAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"BLOOD CLOTS, ANEMIA, HORMONAL DISORDERS, AND EXCESSIVE RED BLOOD CELLS.\\n\\n(CO\\u00c1GULOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS, ANEMIA, TRASTORNOS HORMONALES Y EXCESO DE GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SEVERE HEMATOLOGICAL IMBALANCES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STERNUM AND THE SUPRARENAL GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE PRODUCTION OF BLOOD COMPONENTS WITHIN THE BONE MARROW. IT IS SPECIFICALLY INDICATED FOR CONDITIONS INVOLVING AN OVERPRODUCTION OF RED BLOOD CELLS (POLYGLOBULIA) AND IS USED TO NORMALIZE HEMATOCRIT LEVELS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN PREVENTING THE FORMATION OF BLOOD CLOTS AND MANAGING COMPLEX DISORDERS OF THE BLOOD-FORMING ORGANS, WHILE ALSO BALANCING THE HORMONAL OUTPUT THAT INFLUENCES SYSTEMIC VITALITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA DESEQUILIBRIOS HEMATOL\\u00d3GICOS GRAVES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ESTERN\\u00d3N Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE COMPONENTES SANGU\\u00cdNEOS DENTRO DE LA M\\u00c9DULA \\u00d3SEA. EST\\u00c1 ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE INDICADO PARA CONDICIONES QUE INVOLUCRAN UNA SOBREPRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS (POLIGLOBULIA) Y SE UTILIZA PARA NORMALIZAR LOS NIVELES DE HEMATOCRITO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A PREVENIR LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE CO\\u00c1GULOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS Y A MANEJAR TRASTORNOS COMPLEJOS DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS HEMATOPOY\\u00c9TICOS, MIENTRAS TAMBI\\u00c9N EQUILIBRA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL QUE INFLUYE EN LA VITALIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH EMPHYSEMA; IF RESPIRATORY DIFFICULTIES ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT BLOOD CLOTS OR CIRCULATORY STAGNATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NAVAL \\/ NAVAL] (OMBLIGO \\/ OMBLIGO) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING THE NORMALIZATION OF BLOOD VISCOSITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: ESTE PAR SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL ENFISEMA; SI HAY DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CO\\u00c1GULOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS PERSISTENTES O ESTANCAMIENTO CIRCULATORIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OMBLIGO \\/ OMBLIGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA NORMALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA VISCOSIDAD SANGU\\u00cdNEA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/728','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:54:28','2026-04-28 17:54:28'),(4505,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',729,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"FEAR (MIEDO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FEAR (MIEDO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY, CHEST TIGHTNESS, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, PALPITATIONS, AND EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY TRIGGERED BY DEEP-SEATED FEAR.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD, OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, PALPITACIONES E INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL DESENCADENADA POR UN MIEDO PROFUNDO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC MANIFESTATION OF FEAR BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STERNUM AND THE THYMUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE THYMUS IS NOT ONLY A VITAL IMMUNE ORGAN BUT ALSO A CENTRAL HUB FOR EMOTIONAL REGULATION AND VITALITY. WHEN FEAR BECOMES EMBEDDED IN THIS AXIS, IT CAN SUPPRESS THE IMMUNE RESPONSE AND CREATE PHYSICAL SENSATIONS OF TIGHTNESS OR PANIC IN THE CHEST. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RELEASING STORED EMOTIONAL TRAUMA, RESTORING A SENSE OF SECURITY, AND REINVIGORATING THE THYMUS GLAND\'S ABILITY TO SUPPORT BOTH EMOTIONAL WELL-BEING AND IMMUNE SURVEILLANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL MIEDO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ESTERN\\u00d3N Y EL TIMO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL TIMO NO ES SOLO UN \\u00d3RGANO INMUNITARIO VITAL, SINO TAMBI\\u00c9N UN CENTRO NEURALGIA PARA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y LA VITALIDAD. CUANDO EL MIEDO SE ARRAIGA EN ESTE EJE, PUEDE SUPRIMIR LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA Y CREAR SENSACIONES F\\u00cdSICAS DE OPRESI\\u00d3N O P\\u00c1NICO EN EL PECHO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A LIBERAR EL TRAUMA EMOCIONAL ALMACENADO, RESTAURANDO UN SENTIDO DE SEGURIDAD Y REINVIGORANDO LA CAPACIDAD DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIMO PARA APOYAR TANTO EL BIENESTAR EMOCIONAL COMO LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF ANXIETY OR FEAR PERSISTS, SCAN THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] AXIS TO ADDRESS SURVIVAL INSTINCTS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CHEST TIGHTNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN PROCESSING STRESS HORMONES DURING THE EMOTIONAL RELEASE PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA ANSIEDAD O EL MIEDO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA ABORDAR LOS INSTINTOS DE SUPERVIVENCIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN OPRESI\\u00d3N TOR\\u00c1CICA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LAS HORMONAS DEL ESTR\\u00c9S DURANTE LA FASE DE LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/729','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:55:40','2026-04-28 17:55:40'),(4506,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',730,'{\"symptoms\":\"RED SWOLLEN ITCHY SPOTS. GASTROINTESTINAL BLEEDING, BLACK STOOLS, SEVERE GASTRITIS. (SARAMPI\\u00d3N\\n\\nMANCHAS ROJAS, HINCHADAS Y CON PICAZ\\u00d3N. SANGRADO GASTROINTESTINAL, HECES NEGRAS, GASTRITIS SEVERA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY AIRWAY. MEASLES. ATOPIC DERMATITIS, ULCERS, ARTHRITIS, PANIC ATTACKS, FALSE DIABETES. RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, MACULITIS, AND CONJUNCTIVITIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR V\\u00cdA A\\u00c9REA. SARAMPI\\u00d3N. DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, \\u00daLCERAS, ARTRITIS, ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO, FALSA DIABETES. RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, MACULITIS Y CONJUNTIVITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RED SWOLLEN ITCHY SPOTS, GASTROINTESTINAL BLEEDING, BLACK STOOLS, AND SEVERE GASTRITIS.\\n\\n(MANCHAS ROJAS, HINCHADAS Y CON PICAZ\\u00d3N. SANGRADO GASTROINTESTINAL, HECES NEGRAS Y GASTRITIS SEVERA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE MEASLES VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS. PRIMARILY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE AIRWAYS, THIS PATHOGEN CAN MANIFEST SYSTEMICALLY BEYOND TYPICAL SKIN RASHES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INTERNAL COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS SEVERE GASTRITIS AND ULCERS THAT MAY LEAD TO DIGESTIVE BLEEDING. THE VIRUS IS ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH VARIOUS SECONDARY CONDITIONS, INCLUDING ATOPIC DERMATITIS, ARTHRITIS, AND OCULAR ISSUES LIKE RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA OR CONJUNCTIVITIS. FURTHERMORE, IT CAN TRIGGER PSYCHOLOGICAL SYMPTOMS SUCH AS PANIC ATTACKS AND METABOLIC DISTURBANCES OFTEN REFERRED TO AS \\\"FALSE DIABETES.\\\" BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD AND RESTORING MUCOSAL INTEGRITY THROUGHOUT THE DIGESTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL SARAMPI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. TRANSMITIDO PRINCIPALMENTE POR V\\u00cdA A\\u00c9REA, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE MANIFESTARSE SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LAS T\\u00cdPICAS ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR COMPLICACIONES INTERNAS COMO GASTRITIS SEVERA Y \\u00daLCERAS QUE PUEDEN PROVOCAR SANGRADO DIGESTIVO. EL VIRUS TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA CON VARIAS CONDICIONES SECUNDARIAS, INCLUYENDO DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, ARTRITIS Y PROBLEMAS OCULARES COMO RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA O CONJUNTIVITIS. ADEM\\u00c1S, PUEDE DESENCADENAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS COMO ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO Y ALTERACIONES METAB\\u00d3LICAS A MENUDO DENOMINADAS \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL Y RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA MUCOSA EN TODO EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF GASTROINTESTINAL BLEEDING OR SEVERE GASTRITIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO RULE OUT HELICOBACTER PYLORI. FOR CASES INVOLVING PANIC ATTACKS OR EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENAL \\/ ADRENAL] RESONANCE TO BALANCE ADRENALINE LEVELS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL SANGRADO GASTROINTESTINAL O LA GASTRITIS SEVERA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA DESCARTAR HELICOBACTER PYLORI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ATAQUES DE P\\u00c1NICO O INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SUPRARRENAL \\/ SUPRARRENAL] PARA EQUILIBRAR LOS NIVELES DE ADRENALINA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/730','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:56:56','2026-04-28 17:56:56'),(4507,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',731,'{\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS, DIGESTION DISORDERS, HEADACHES, FEVER. BLOODY AND MUCUS IN STOOL. (ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA\\n\\nTRASTORNOS DEL COMPORTAMIENTO, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE. SANGRE Y MUCOSIDAD EN LAS HECES.)\",\"paths\":\"EPILEPSY, MAY CAUSE BRAIN TUMORS OR CANCER. (EPILEPSIA, PUEDE CAUSAR TUMORES CEREBRALES O C\\u00c1NCER.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS, DIGESTION DISORDERS, HEADACHES, FEVER, AND BLOODY OR MUCUS IN STOOL.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DEL COMPORTAMIENTO, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, SANGRE Y MUCOSIDAD EN LAS HECES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE BLADDER. THIS AMOEBA IS WELL-KNOWN FOR CAUSING INTESTINAL INFECTIONS BUT CAN BECOME EXTREMELY AGGRESSIVE IF IT MIGRATE TO OTHER ORGANS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS PARTICULARLY CRITICAL BECAUSE AN ADVANCED OR UNTREATED INFECTION MAY CAUSE SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL OR BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS AND, IN EXTREME CASES, HAS BEEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE FORMATION OF BRAIN TUMORS OR CANCEROUS PROCESSES. IT IS ALSO LINKED TO SYMPTOMS MIMICKING EPILEPSY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITE, REDUCING INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION, AND PREVENTING THE SYSTEMIC MIGRATION OF THE PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A LA ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y LA VEJIGA. ESTA AMBA ES BIEN CONOCIDA POR CAUSAR INFECCIONES INTESTINALES, PERO PUEDE VOLVERSE EXTREMADAMENTE AGRESIVA SI MIGRA A OTROS \\u00d3RGANOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES PARTICULARMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N AVANZADA O NO TRATADA PUEDE CAUSAR TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O DEL COMPORTAMIENTO SEVEROS Y, EN CASOS EXTREMOS, SE HA ASOCIADO CON LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TUMORES CEREBRALES O PROCESOS CANCER\\u00cdGENOS. TAMBI\\u00c9N EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE IMITAN LA EPILEPSIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR EL PAR\\u00c1SITO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y EVITANDO LA MIGRACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE DISORDERS WITH BLOODY STOOL PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO RULE OUT HEPATIC AMOEBIASIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEADACHES OR COGNITIVE ALTERATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS RELEASED DURING THE PARASITIC CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS CON HECES SANGUINOLENTAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA DESCARTAR AMIBIASIS HEP\\u00c1TICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS O ALTERACIONES COGNITIVAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS LIBERADAS DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/731','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 17:58:12','2026-04-28 17:58:12'),(4508,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',732,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT MAY BE LINKED TO RECURRENT OUTBREAKS OF HERPES LESIONS, DIGESTIVE SENSITIVITY, AND PERIODIC GASTRIC DISCOMFORT WHEN THE VIRAL LOAD IS ACTIVATED.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A BROTES RECURRENTES DE LESIONES DE HERPES, SENSIBILIDAD DIGESTIVA Y MALESTAR G\\u00c1STRICO PERI\\u00d3DICO CUANDO LA CARGA VIRAL SE ACTIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE TARGETS LATENT HERPES VIRUS LOADS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE DUODENUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS UPPER GASTROINTESTINAL JUNCTION ACTS AS A STRATEGIC HIDING PLACE WHERE THE VIRUS CAN REMAIN DORMANT, EVADING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\'S ACTIVE SURVEILLANCE. WHILE IN THIS RESERVOIR STATE, THE VIRUS DOES NOT PRODUCE ACUTE LESIONS BUT CAN BE THE SOURCE OF RECURRING INFECTIONS ELSEWHERE IN THE BODY OR CHRONIC IRRITATION OF THE MUCOSAL LINING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET \\\"OPENS\\\" THE RESERVOIR, RELEASING THE LATENT VIRAL LOAD SO IT CAN BE IDENTIFIED AND NEUTRALIZED BY THE BODY\'S DEFENSES, PREVENTING FUTURE REACTIVATIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO SE DIRIGE A LAS CARGAS LATENTES DEL VIRUS DEL HERPES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL DUODENO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA UNI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL SUPERIOR ACT\\u00daA COMO UN LUGAR DE ESCONDITE ESTRAT\\u00c9GICO DONDE EL VIRUS PUEDE PERMANECER INACTIVO, EVADIENDO LA VIGILANCIA ACTIVA DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. MIENTRAS EST\\u00c1 EN ESTE ESTADO DE RESERVORIO, EL VIRUS NO PRODUCE LESIONES AGUDAS, PERO PUEDE SER LA FUENTE DE INFECCIONES RECURRENTES EN OTRAS PARTES DEL CUERPO O IRRITACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DEL REVESTIMIENTO DE LA MUCOSA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO \\\"ABRE\\\" EL RESERVORIO, LIBERANDO LA CARGA VIRAL LATENTE PARA QUE PUEDA SER IDENTIFICADA Y NEUTRALIZADA POR LAS DEFENSAS DEL CUERPO, EVITANDO FUTURAS REACTIVACIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF ACTIVE HERPES LESIONS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [COLON ASCENDING \\/ COLON ASCENDING] AXIS TO ADDRESS HERPES 1 OR THE [NERVE INGUINAL \\/ NERVE INGUINAL] AXIS FOR HERPES 2. FOR PERSISTENT GASTRIC IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ ADRENALS] (REF 729) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS RELEASED FROM THE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY LESIONES DE HERPES ACTIVAS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLON ASCENDENTE \\/ COLON ASCENDENTE] PARA ABORDAR EL HERPES 1 O EL EJE [NERVIO INGUINAL \\/ NERVIO INGUINAL] PARA EL HERPES 2. PARA IRRITACI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ SUPRARRENALES] (REF 729). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES LIBERADOS DESDE EL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/732','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:08:27','2026-04-28 18:08:27'),(4509,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',733,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GLUTTONY (GULA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLUTTONY (GULA)\",\"symptoms\":\"COMPULSIVE EATING, LACK OF SATIETY, DIGESTIVE HEAVINESS, HEART PALPITATIONS AFTER MEALS, AND EMOTIONAL DEPENDENCY ON FOOD.\\n\\n(COMER COMPULSIVO, FALTA DE SACIEDAD, PESADEZ DIGESTIVA, PALPITACIONES CARD\\u00cdACAS DESPU\\u00c9S DE COMER Y DEPENDENCIA EMOCIONAL DE LA COMIDA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC ROOT OF GLUTTONY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS THE LINK BETWEEN PHYSICAL NOURISHMENT AND EMOTIONAL SATISFACTION. WHEN AN IMBALANCE OCCURS HERE, THE HEART \\\"SEEKS\\\" COMFORT THROUGH THE STOMACH, LEADING TO COMPULSIVE CONSUMPTION AND A DISTORTED SENSE OF FULLNESS. PHYSICALLY, THIS CAN CAUSE STRESS ON THE CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM AS THE BODY STRUGGLES TO PROCESS EXCESSIVE INTAKE, OFTEN RESULTING IN DIGESTIVE-INDUCED PALPITATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RECLAIMING CONTROL OVER APPETITE, DISCONNECTING EMOTIONAL VOIDS FROM DIETARY HABITS, AND RESTORING A BALANCED RELATIONSHIP WITH FOOD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA RA\\u00cdZ ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA GULA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA EL V\\u00cdNCULO ENTRE EL NUTRIENTO F\\u00cdSICO Y LA SATISFACCI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL. CUANDO OCURRE UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd, EL CORAZ\\u00d3N \\\"BUSCA\\\" CONSUELO A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO, LO QUE LLEVA A UN CONSUMO COMPULSIVO Y A UN SENTIDO DE SACIEDAD DISTORSIONADO. F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, ESTO PUEDE GENERAR ESTR\\u00c9S EN EL SISTEMA CARDIOVASCULAR MIENTRAS EL CUERPO LUCHA POR PROCESAR EL EXCESO DE INGESTA, RESULTANDO A MENUDO EN PALPITACIONES INDUCIDAS POR LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A RECUPERAR EL CONTROL SOBRE EL APETITO, DESCONECTANDO LOS VAC\\u00cdOS EMOCIONALES DE LOS H\\u00c1BITOS ALIMENTICIOS Y RESTAURANDO UNA RELACI\\u00d3N EQUILIBRADA CON LA COMIDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF COMPULSIVE EATING PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] AXIS TO ADDRESS BROADER EMOTIONAL REGULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ STOMACH] RESONANCE TO STABILIZE GASTRIC PH. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN MANAGING THE METABOLIC STRESS ASSOCIATED WITH OVEREATING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI EL COMER COMPULSIVO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ TIMO] PARA ABORDAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL GENERAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ EST\\u00d3MAGO] PARA ESTABILIZAR EL PH G\\u00c1STRICO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL MANEJO DEL ESTR\\u00c9S METAB\\u00d3LICO ASOCIADO CON EL EXCESO DE COMIDA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/733','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:09:42','2026-04-28 18:09:42'),(4510,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',734,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EXCESSIVE EATING (COMER EN EXCESO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE EATING, VORACIOUS APPETITE, AND LACK OF CONTROL OVER FOOD INTAKE.\\n\\n(COMER EN EXCESO, APETITO VORAZ Y FALTA DE CONTROL SOBRE LA INGESTA DE ALIMENTOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PHYSICAL IMPULSE OF EXCESSIVE EATING BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE HEART. WHILE THE PREVIOUS REFERENCE (732) FOCUSES ON THE EMOTIONAL ASPECT OF GLUTTONY, THIS AXIS TARGETS THE PHYSIOLOGICAL URGE AND THE METABOLIC DESIRE TO CONSUME MORE THAN THE BODY REQUIRES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS CIRCUIT HELPS REGULATE THE \\\"HUNGER SIGNALS\\\" SENT TO THE BRAIN, ENSURING THAT THE STOMACH\\u2019S PHYSICAL CAPACITY AND THE HEART\\u2019S ENERGETIC RHYTHM REMAIN IN SYNC. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RECOGNIZING GENUINE SATIETY AND PREVENTING THE OVERLOADING OF THE DIGESTIVE AND CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL IMPULSO F\\u00cdSICO DE COMER EN EXCESO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. MIENTRAS QUE LA REFERENCIA ANTERIOR (732) SE CENTRA EN EL ASPECTO EMOCIONAL DE LA GULA, ESTE EJE SE DIRIGE AL IMPULSO FISIOL\\u00d3GICO Y AL DESEO METAB\\u00d3LICO DE CONSUMIR M\\u00c1S DE LO QUE EL CUERPO REQUIERE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE CIRCUITO AYUDA A REGULAR LAS \\\"SE\\u00d1ALES DE HAMBRE\\\" ENVIADAS AL CEREBRO, ASEGURANDO QUE LA CAPACIDAD F\\u00cdSICA DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL RITMO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N PERMANEZCAN SINCRONIZADOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RECONOCER LA SACIEDAD REAL Y A EVITAR LA SOBRECARGA DE LOS SISTEMAS DIGESTIVO Y CARDIOVASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF THE VORACIOUS APPETITE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO RULE OUT HYPERMETABOLISM. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE FATIGUE AFTER OVEREATING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT INSULIN REGULATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING THE ADJUSTMENT OF DIETARY HABITS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI EL APETITO VORAZ PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA DESCARTAR HIPERMETABOLISMO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA DIGESTIVA DESPU\\u00c9S DE COMER EN EXCESO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] PARA APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA INSULINA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE EL AJUSTE DE LOS H\\u00c1BITOS ALIMENTICIOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/734','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:10:49','2026-04-28 18:10:49'),(4511,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',735,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBESITY (OBESIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"OBESITY, METABOLIC SLOWNESS, WEIGHT GAIN, AND DIGESTIVE DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD, LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA, AUMENTO DE PESO Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REGULATING HOW THE BODY PROCESSES NUTRIENTS AND MANAGES ENERGY STORAGE. THE STOMACH IS RESPONSIBLE FOR THE INITIAL BREAKDOWN OF FOOD, WHILE THE LIVER ACTS AS THE CENTRAL METABOLIC LABORATORY, FILTERING BLOOD AND REGULATING FAT METABOLISM. AN ENERGETIC IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO \\\"METABOLIC SLOTH,\\\" WHERE THE BODY TENDS TO STORE EXCESS FAT RATHER THAN CONVERTING IT INTO USABLE ENERGY, CONTRIBUTING TO OBESITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN OPTIMIZING DIGESTIVE ENZYMES AND HEPATIC FUNCTIONS, SUPPORTING HEALTHY WEIGHT MANAGEMENT AND METABOLIC EFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA REGULAR C\\u00d3MO EL CUERPO PROCESA LOS NUTRIENTES Y GESTIONA EL ALMACENAMIENTO DE ENERG\\u00cdA. EL EST\\u00d3MAGO ES RESPONSABLE DESGLOSE INICIAL DE LOS ALIMENTOS, MIENTRAS QUE EL H\\u00cdGADO ACT\\u00daA COMO EL LABORATORIO METAB\\u00d3LICO CENTRAL, FILTRANDO LA SANGRE Y REGULANDO EL METABOLISMO DE LAS GRASAS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE LLEVAR A UNA \\\"PEREZA METAB\\u00d3LICA\\\", DONDE EL CUERPO TIENDE A ALMACENAR EL EXCESO DE GRASA EN LUGAR DE CONVERTIRLA EN ENERG\\u00cdA UTILIZABLE, CONTRIBUYENDO A LA OBESIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A OPTIMIZAR LAS ENZIMAS DIGESTIVAS Y LAS FUNCIONES HEP\\u00c1TICAS, APOYANDO EL MANEJO SALUDABLE DEL PESO Y LA EFICIENCIA METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF WEIGHT GAIN IS ACCOMPANIED BY EXTREME FATIGUE, SCAN THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO RULE OUT HYPOTHYROIDISM. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FATTY LIVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING THE RESTRUCTURING OF METABOLIC PROCESSES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI EL AUMENTO DE PESO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE FATIGA EXTREMA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA DESCARTAR HIPOTIROIDISMO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN H\\u00cdGADO GRASO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA REESTRUCTURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS PROCESOS METAB\\u00d3LIC\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/735','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:11:59','2026-04-28 18:11:59'),(4512,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',736,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"STROKE (DERRAME CEREBRAL \\/ ICTUS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"ESPECIAL (SPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"NEUROVEGETATIVE REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N NEUROVEGETATIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, VERTIGO, SLEEP DISORDERS, RESPIRATORY ALTERATIONS, AND ENERGETIC IMBALANCE FOLLOWING A VASCULAR EVENT.\\n\\n(MAREOS, V\\u00c9RTIGO, TRASTORNOS DEL SUE\\u00d1O, ALTERACIONES RESPIRATORIAS Y DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO POSTERIOR A UN EVENTO VASCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ENERGETIC ALTERATIONS LINKED TO THE VITAL CONTROL CENTER BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRUCIAL FOR STABILIZING PATIENTS WHO HAVE SUFFERED A STROKE, AS THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA CONTROLS ESSENTIAL AUTONOMOUS FUNCTIONS SUCH AS BREATHING AND HEART RATE. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO SENSATIONS OF CONSTANT VERTIGO OR \\\"DIZZINESS IN THE HEAD.\\\" BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REGAINING SYNCHRONIZATION BETWEEN THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM AND THE BRAINSTEM\'S REGULATORY CENTERS, FACILITATING NEUROLOGICAL RECOVERY AND PHYSICAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LAS ALTERACIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS VINCULADAS AL CENTRO DE CONTROL VITAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CRUCIAL PARA ESTABILIZAR A PACIENTES QUE HAN SUFRIDO UN ICTUS O DERRAME CEREBRAL, YA QUE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO CONTROLA FUNCIONES AUT\\u00d3NOMAS ESENCIALES COMO LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N Y EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE PROVOCAR SENSACIONES DE V\\u00c9RTIGO CONSTANTE O \\\"MAREO EN LA CABEZA\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RECUPERAR LA SINCRONIZACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO Y LOS CENTROS REGULADORES DEL TALLO CEREBRAL, FACILITANDO LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y EL EQUILIBRIO F\\u00cdSICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF VERTIGO PERSISTS, SCAN THE [EAR \\/ EAR] AXIS TO RULE OUT INNER EAR BALANCE ISSUES. FOR POST-STROKE CASES WITH MOTOR SEQUELAE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STEM PARIETAL \\/ STEM PARIETAL] RESONANCE (REF 721). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE REHABILITATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI EL V\\u00c9RTIGO PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [O\\u00cdDO \\/ O\\u00cdDO] PARA DESCARTAR PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO EN EL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO. PARA CASOS POST-ICTUS CON SECUELAS MOTORAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TRONCO PARIETAL \\/ TRONCO PARIETAL] (REF 721). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REHABILITACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/736','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:13:47','2026-04-28 18:13:47'),(4513,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',737,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES (ALERGIAS)\",\"paths\":\"AUTISM. DETOX, REGULATION OF THE HISTAMINES. (AUTISMO. DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N, REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS HISTAMINAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"IMMUNOLOGICAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES, SENSITIVITIES, AND SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH AUTISM SPECTRUM DISORDER.\\n\\n(ALERGIAS, SENSIBILIDADES Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS ASOCIADOS CON EL TRASTORNO DEL ESPECTRO AUTISTA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON DETOXIFICATION AND THE REGULATION OF HISTAMINES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR MANAGING SYSTEMIC ALLERGIES AND FOOD SENSITIVITIES THAT TRIGGER INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES. FURTHERMORE, THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY UTILIZED IN PROTOCOLS FOR AUTISM, AS IT ASSISTS IN REDUCING NEURO-INFLAMMATION AND IMPROVING THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO ELIMINATE TOXINS THAT MAY AFFECT COGNITIVE AND BEHAVIORAL FUNCTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET PROMOTES A BALANCED HISTAMINE RESPONSE AND SUPPORTS THE PANCREAS IN ITS CRITICAL ROLE OF ENZYMATIC PRODUCTION AND METABOLIC REGULATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS HISTAMINAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA EL MANEJO DE ALERGIAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS Y SENSIBILIDADES ALIMENTARIAS QUE DESENCADENAN RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE PAR SE UTILIZA FRECUENTEMENTE EN PROTOCOLOS PARA EL AUTISMO, YA QUE AYUDA A REDUCIR LA NEUROINFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y MEJORA LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA ELIMINAR TOXINAS QUE PUEDEN AFECTAR LAS FUNCIONES COGNITIVAS Y COMPORTAMENTALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO PROMUEVE UNA RESPUESTA DE HISTAMINA EQUILIBRADA Y APOYA AL P\\u00c1NCREAS EN SU PAPEL CR\\u00cdTICO DE PRODUCCI\\u00d3N ENZIM\\u00c1TICA Y REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DETOX CHECK: IF ALLERGIC REACTIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO SUPPORT OVERALL BLOOD FILTRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE SENSITIVITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE TO ENSURE INSULIN AND ENZYME STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE RENAL CLEARANCE OF NEUTRALIZED TOXINS DURING THE DETOXIFICATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N: SI LAS REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DE LA SANGRE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA SENSIBILIDAD DIGESTIVA SEVERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DE LA INSULINA Y LAS ENZIMAS. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE LAS TOXINAS NEUTRALIZADAS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/737','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:16:25','2026-04-28 18:16:25'),(4514,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',738,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"FOOD INTOLERANCES, DIARRHEA, GASTRITIS. (INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS, DIARREA, GASTRITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"FOOD NEUTRALIZER, HEART DISORDERS, DYSNEA. (INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS, DIARREA, GASTRITIS.\\n\\nNEUTRALIZADOR DE ALIMENTOS, TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS, DISNEA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DIGESTIVE NEUTRALIZATION (NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FOOD INTOLERANCES, DIARRHEA, GASTRITIS, HEART DISORDERS, AND DYSPNEA (SHORTNESS OF BREATH).\\n\\n(INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS, DIARREA, GASTRITIS, TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS Y DISNEA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ACTS AS A \\\"FOOD NEUTRALIZER\\\" BY BALANCING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE TAIL OF THE PANCREAS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE PANCREAS TAIL IS CLOSELY LINKED TO THE REGULATION OF ENZYMES AND HORMONES THAT IMPACT BOTH DIGESTION AND SYSTEMIC ENERGY. WHEN THIS AXIS IS IMBALANCED, IT CAN MANIFEST AS ACUTE FOOD INTOLERANCES, GASTRITIS, OR CHRONIC DIARRHEA. BEYOND DIGESTION, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SECONDARY SYMPTOMS SUCH AS DYSPNEA (DIFFICULTY BREATHING) AND CARDIAC ALTERATIONS THAT ARE OFTEN REFLEXIVE OF GASTRIC DISTRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN PROPERLY PROCESSING NUTRIENTS AND ALLEVIATING PRESSURE ON THE THORACIC CAVITY CAUSED BY DIGESTIVE DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ACT\\u00daA COMO UN \\\"NEUTRALIZADOR DE ALIMENTOS\\\" MEDIANTE EL EQUILIBRIO DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS EST\\u00c1 ESTRECHAMENTE VINCULADA A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE ENZIMAS Y HORMONAS QUE IMPACTAN TANTO EN LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N COMO EN LA ENERG\\u00cdA SIST\\u00c9MICA. CUANDO ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 DESEQUILIBRADO, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS AGUDAS, GASTRITIS O DIARREA CR\\u00d3NICA. M\\u00c1S \\u00c1LLA DE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS SECUNDARIOS COMO LA DISNEA (DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR) Y ALTERACIONES CARD\\u00cdACAS QUE A MENUDO SON REFLEJAS DEL MALESTAR G\\u00c1STRICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A PROCESAR ADECUADAMENTE LOS NUTRIENTES Y ALIVIAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N EN LA CAVIDAD TOR\\u00c1CICA CAUSADA POR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"GASTRIC CHECK: IF GASTRITIS PERSISTS, SCAN THE [STOMACH \\/ STOMACH] AXIS TO STABILIZE LOCAL ACIDITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DYSPNEA OR CHEST TIGHTNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ HEART] (REF 733) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS RELATED TO FOOD INTOLERANCES DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N G\\u00c1STRICA: SI LA GASTRITIS PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ EST\\u00d3MAGO] PARA ESTABILIZAR LA ACIDEZ LOCAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISNEA SEVERA O OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 733). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS RELACIONADAS CON LAS INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/738','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:17:39','2026-04-28 18:17:39'),(4515,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',739,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GLUTTONY (GULA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLUTTONY (GULA)\",\"symptoms\":\"COMPULSIVE EATING, LACK OF SATIETY, DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, AND EMOTIONAL IMBALANCE RELATED TO EXCESSIVE CONSUMPTION.\\n\\n(COMER COMPULSIVO, FALTA DE SACIEDAD, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS Y DESEQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL RELACIONADO CON EL CONSUMO EXCESIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC ROOT OF GLUTTONY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS (PROSTATE OR VAGINA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS A DEEP CONNECTION BETWEEN BASIC INSTINCTS AND EMOTIONAL SATISFACTION. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO AN UNCONTROLLABLE URGE TO CONSUME FOOD AS A WAY TO FILL AN EMOTIONAL OR ENERGETIC VOID. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN REGAINING CONTROL OVER THEIR APPETITE, PROMOTING A SENSE OF GENUINE SATIETY AND DETACHING EMOTIONAL TRIGGERS FROM DIETARY HABITS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA RA\\u00cdZ ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA GULA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES (PR\\u00d3STATA O VAGINA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA UNA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA ENTRE LOS INSTINTOS B\\u00c1SICOS Y LA SATISFACCI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE LLEVAR A UN IMPULSO INCONTROLABLE DE CONSUMIR ALIMENTOS COMO UNA FORMA DE LLENAR UN VAC\\u00cdO EMOCIONAL O ENERG\\u00c9TICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A RECUPERAR EL CONTROL SOBRE SU APETITO, PROMOVIENDO UN SENTIDO DE SACIEDAD REAL Y DESACOPLANDO LOS DESENCADENANTES EMOCIONALES DE LOS H\\u00c1BITOS ALIMENTICIOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF COMPULSIVE BEHAVIORS PERSIST, SCAN THE [STOMACH \\/ HEART] (REF 732) AXIS TO ADDRESS THE AFFECTIVE COMPONENT OF GLUTTONY. FOR CASES INVOLVING HORMONAL IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ OVARY OR TESTICLE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN MANAGING STRESS DURING THE EMOTIONAL RELEASE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LOS COMPORTAMIENTOS COMPULSIVOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 732) PARA ABORDAR EL COMPONENTE AFECTIVO DE LA GULA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ OVARIO O TEST\\u00cdCULO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL MANEJO DEL ESTR\\u00c9S DURANTE EL PROCESO DE LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/739','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:18:58','2026-04-28 18:18:58'),(4516,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',740,'{\"symptoms\":\"VOMITING, ULCERS, GAS, DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, INTOLERANCE TO LACTOSE. (CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS BACILLUS\\n\\nV\\u00d3MITOS, \\u00daLCERAS, GASES, DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM CERTAIN FOODS, ESPECIALLY IN CONTAMINATED MILK AND OTHER MEAT THAT IS NOT WILL COOKED. MAJOR DISRUPTION OF DIGESTION. GASTRITIS, COLITIS, GASTROINTESTINAL DISRUPTION, DWARFISM. DISORDERS OF CHARACTER AND BEHAVIOR. CYSTIC FIBROSIS, STOMACH CANCER. (TRANSMITIDO POR CIERTOS ALIMENTOS, ESPECIALMENTE LECHE CONTAMINADA Y OTRAS CARNES MAL COCIDAS. ALTERACI\\u00d3N IMPORTANTE DE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N. GASTRITIS, COLITIS, ALTERACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL, ENANISMO. TRASTORNOS DEL CAR\\u00c1CTER Y DEL COMPORTAMIENTO. FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA, C\\u00c1NCER DE EST\\u00d3MAGO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VOMITING, ULCERS, GAS, DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, AND INTOLERANCE TO LACTOSE.\\n\\n(V\\u00d3MITOS, \\u00daLCERAS, GASES, DIARREA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL E INTOLERANCIA A LA LACTOSA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE PYLORUS. THIS PATHOGEN IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOODS, PARTICULARLY UNPASTEURIZED MILK OR UNDERCOOKED MEATS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL DISRUPTIONS, INCLUDING CHRONIC GASTRITIS AND COLITIS. THE PRESENCE OF THIS BACILLUS CAN LEAD TO STRUCTURAL ISSUES SUCH AS CYSTIC FIBROSIS OR EVEN STOMACH CANCER IF LEFT UNTREATED. ADDITIONALLY, IT IS ASSOCIATED WITH SYSTEMIC IMPACTS LIKE DWARFISM IN DEVELOPING INDIVIDUALS AND ALTERATIONS IN CHARACTER OR BEHAVIOR. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA, RESTORING DIGESTIVE FUNCTION, AND PROTECTING THE MUCOSAL LINING OF THE UPPER GASTROINTESTINAL TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL P\\u00cdLORO. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS, ESPECIALMENTE LECHE NO PASTEURIZADA O CARNES POCO COCIDAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR ALTERACIONES GASTROINTESTINALES GRAVES, INCLUYENDO GASTRITIS CR\\u00d3NICA Y COLITIS. LA PRESENCIA DE ESTE BACILO PUEDE DERIVAR EN PROBLEMAS ESTRUCTURALES COMO FIBROSIS QU\\u00cdSTICA O INCLUSO C\\u00c1NCER DE EST\\u00d3MAGO SI NO SE TRATA. ADEM\\u00c1S, SE ASOCIA CON IMPACTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMO EL ENANISMO EN INDIVIDUOS EN DESARROLLO Y ALTERACIONES EN EL CAR\\u00c1CTER O EL COMPORTAMIENTO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA, RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y PROTEGER EL REVESTIMIENTO DE LA MUCOSA DEL TRACTO GASTROINTESTINAL SUPERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF ULCERS OR GASTRITIS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO RULE OUT HELICOBACTER PYLORI. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIARRHEA OR GAS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LAS \\u00daLCERAS O LA GASTRITIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA DESCARTAR HELICOBACTER PYLORI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIARREA SEVERA O GASES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/740','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:20:04','2026-04-28 18:20:04'),(4517,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',741,'{\"radical\":\"ESPECIAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBESITY, STROKE (OBESIDAD, ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR (ACV).)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"METABOLIC & VASCULAR REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"OBESITY, RISK OF STROKE, METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION, AND BLOOD FILTRATION ISSUES.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD, ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR (ACV), DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y PROBLEMAS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N SANGU\\u00cdNEA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CRITICAL INTERPLAY BETWEEN DIGESTION AND BLOOD HEALTH BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR MANAGING METABOLIC DISORDERS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO OBESITY AND VASCULAR STRESS. THE STOMACH\\u2019S ROLE IN NUTRIENT PROCESSING COMBINED WITH THE SPLEEN\\u2019S FUNCTION IN FILTERING OLD RED BLOOD CELLS AND MANAGING IMMUNE RESPONSES CREATES A POWERFUL CIRCUIT FOR SYSTEMIC STABILITY. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO SLUGGISH METABOLISM AND INCREASED BLOOD VISCOSITY, WHICH ARE KEY RISK FACTORS FOR CEREBROVASCULAR EVENTS (STROKES). BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN OPTIMIZING ENERGY EXPENDITURE AND MAINTAINING HEALTHY BLOOD FLOW.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA INTERACCI\\u00d3N CR\\u00cdTICA ENTRE LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y LA SALUD SANGU\\u00cdNEA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA EL MANEJO DE TRASTORNOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A LA OBESIDAD Y AL ESTR\\u00c9S VASCULAR. EL PAPEL DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE NUTRIENTES, COMBINADO CON LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS ROJOS VIEJOS Y EL MANEJO DE LAS RESPUESTAS INMUNITARIAS, CREA UN CIRCUITO PODEROSO PARA LA ESTABILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE LLEVAR A UN METABOLISMO LENTO Y A UN AUMENTO DE LA VISCOSIDAD SANGU\\u00cdNEA, QUE SON FACTORES DE RIESGO CLAVE PARA EVENTOS CEREBROVASCULARES (ACV). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A OPTIMIZAR EL GASTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO Y MANTENER UN FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO SALUDABLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF THERE IS A HIGH RISK OR HISTORY OF STROKE, SCAN THE [MEDULLA OBLONGATA \\/ STOMACH] (REF 735) AXIS TO SUPPORT NEUROVEGETATIVE STABILITY. FOR METABOLIC OBESITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ LIVER] (REF 734) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE CLEARANCE OF METABOLIC WASTE DURING THE WEIGHT REGULATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI EXISTE UN ALTO RIESGO O ANTECEDENTES DE ACV, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO \\/ EST\\u00d3MAGO] (REF 735) PARA APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD NEUROVEGETATIVA. PARA LA OBESIDAD METAB\\u00d3LICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 734). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REGULACI\\u00d3N DE PESO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/741','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:21:30','2026-04-28 18:21:30'),(4518,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',742,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH CRAMPS, POOR DIGESTION, GAS, POOR APPETITE. (CALAMBRES ESTOMACALES, MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, GASES, POCO APETITO.)\",\"paths\":\"HEARTBURN AND DIGESTIVE DISORDER. GASTRITIS. (ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL Y TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS. GASTRITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GASTRIC BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO G\\u00c1STRICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH CRAMPS, POOR DIGESTION, GAS, POOR APPETITE, AND HEARTBURN.\\n\\n(CALAMBRES ESTOMACALES, MALA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, GASES, POCO APETITO Y ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES PRIMARY DIGESTIVE DISORDERS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE STOMACH ITSELF. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS VERTICAL OR HORIZONTAL PLACEMENT ON THE ORGAN IS ESSENTIAL FOR CORRECTING LOCAL GLANDULAR DYSFUNCTION AND ENZYMATIC IMBALANCES. IT IS THE PRINCIPAL PAIR FOR TREATING GASTRITIS AND HEARTBURN, AS IT HELPS REGULATE THE PRODUCTION OF HYDROCHLORIC ACID. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ALLEVIATES PHYSICAL DISCOMFORT SUCH AS CRAMPS AND BLOATING, RESTORING THE MUCOSAL INTEGRITY OF THE STOMACH LINING AND PROMOTING A HEALTHY APPETITE AND EFFICIENT DIGESTIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS PRIMARIOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL PROPIO EST\\u00d3MAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA COLOCACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL U HORIZONTAL SOBRE EL \\u00d3RGANO ES ESENCIAL PARA CORREGIR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR LOCAL Y LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ENZIM\\u00c1TICOS. ES EL PAR PRINCIPAL PARA TRATAR LA GASTRITIS Y LA ACIDEZ ESTOMACAL, YA QUE AYUDA A REGULAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE \\u00c1CIDO CLORH\\u00cdDRICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO ALIVIA LAS MOLESTIAS F\\u00cdSICAS COMO CALAMBRES E HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LA MUCOSA DEL REVESTIMIENTO ESTOMACAL Y PROMOVIENDO UN APETITO SALUDABLE Y UN PROCESO DIGESTIVO EFICIENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF GASTRITIS IS SEVERE OR PERSISTENT, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO RULE OUT HELICOBACTER PYLORI. FOR CASES INVOLVING EXCESSIVE GAS AND VOMITING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ PYLORUS] (REF 739) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN MANAGING THE METABOLIC STRESS CAUSED BY CHRONIC INDIGESTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA GASTRITIS ES SEVERA O PERSISTENTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA DESCARTAR HELICOBACTER PYLORI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN GASES EXCESIVOS Y V\\u00d3MITOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO] (REF 739). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL MANEJO DEL ESTR\\u00c9S METAB\\u00d3LICO CAUSADO POR LA INDIGESTI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/742','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:22:50','2026-04-28 18:22:50'),(4519,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',743,'{\"symptoms\":\"FOOD INTOLERANCE, FOOD POISONING, ULCERS, MALNUTRITION. (CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS\\n\\nINTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA, \\u00daLCERAS, DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"VERY AGGRESSIVE. AFFECTS THE ABSORPTIONS OF NUTRIENTS. METASTASIS. AUTISM. (MUY AGRESIVO. AFECTA LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES. MET\\u00c1STASIS. AUTISMO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FOOD INTOLERANCE, FOOD POISONING, ULCERS, AND MALNUTRITION.\\n\\n(INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA, \\u00daLCERAS Y DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS A VERY AGGRESSIVE STRAIN OF CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE RIGHT SUBCLAVIAN ARTERY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE PATHOGEN DIRECTLY INTERFERES WITH THE ABSORPTION OF NUTRIENTS IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, OFTEN LEADING TO SEVERE MALNUTRITION AND WEIGHT LOSS REGARDLESS OF CALORIC INTAKE. DUE TO ITS AGGRESSIVE NATURE, THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY MONITORED IN CASES INVOLVING METASTASIS PROCESSES AND IS ALSO A KEY RESONANCE IN PROTOCOLS FOR AUTISM. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA, RESTORING MUCOSAL ABSORPTION EFFICIENCY, AND PREVENTING THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THE PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A UNA CEPA MUY AGRESIVA DE CLOSTRIDIUM PERFRINGENS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y LA ARTERIA SUBCLAVIA DERECHA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO INTERFIERE DIRECTAMENTE CON LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A UNA DESNUTRICI\\u00d3N SEVERA Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO INDEPENDIENTEMENTE DE LA INGESTA CAL\\u00d3RICA. DEBIDO A SU NATURALEZA AGRESIVA, ESTE PAR SE MONITOREA FRECUENTEMENTE EN CASOS QUE INVOLUCRAN PROCESOS DE MET\\u00c1STASIS Y TAMBI\\u00c9N ES UNA RESONANCIA CLAVE EN LOS PROTOCOLOS PARA EL AUTISMO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA, RESTAURAR LA EFICIENCIA DE LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N MUCOSA Y PREVENIR LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF FOOD POISONING SYMPTOMS ARE ACUTE, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ PYLORUS] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING NEURODEVELOPMENTAL SYMPTOMS (AUTISM PROTOCOL), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STOMACH \\/ PANCREAS] (REF 736) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE INTOXICACI\\u00d3N ALIMENTARIA SON AGUDOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ P\\u00cdLORO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE DESARROLLO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO (PROTOCOLO DE AUTISMO), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] (REF 736). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/743','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:23:55','2026-04-28 18:23:55'),(4520,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',744,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"GASTRITIS AND FATIGUE. (GASTRITIS, FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"BLOOD GLUCOSE, FALSE DIABETES, ULCERS, ATOPIC DERMATITIS. (GASTRITIS, FATIGA\\n\\nGLUCOSA EN SANGRE, FALSA DIABETES, \\u00daLCERAS, DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SYSTEMIC VIRAL ACTIVITY (ACTIVIDAD VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"GASTRITIS, FATIGUE, BLOOD GLUCOSE FLUCTUATIONS, AND ATOPIC DERMATITIS.\\n\\n(GASTRITIS, FATIGA, FLUCTUACIONES DE GLUCOSA EN SANGRE Y DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PATHOGENIC LINKS BETWEEN DIGESTIVE FUNCTION AND ENDOCRINE RESPONSE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE SUPRARENAL (ADRENAL) GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING \\\"FALSE DIABETES,\\\" WHERE VIRAL INTERFERENCE CAUSES BLOOD GLUCOSE IMBALANCES THAT MIMIC DIABETIC SYMPTOMS WITHOUT THE PERMANENT PANCREATIC DYSFUNCTION. THE PRESENCE OF A VIRUS IN THIS CIRCUIT OFTEN MANIFESTS PHYSICALLY AS CHRONIC GASTRITIS AND PROFOUND FATIGUE DUE TO THE STRESS PLACED ON THE ADRENAL GLANDS. IT IS ALSO FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH SKIN CONDITIONS LIKE ATOPIC DERMATITIS AND THE FORMATION OF GASTRIC ULCERS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, BALANCING HORMONE PRODUCTION, AND RESTORING PROPER GLUCOSE METABOLISM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL ABORDA LOS V\\u00cdNCULOS PATOG\\u00c9NICOS ENTRE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA Y LA RESPUESTA ENDOCRINA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\", DONDE LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL CAUSA DESEQUILIBRIOS DE GLUCOSA EN SANGRE QUE IMITAN LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DIAB\\u00c9TICOS SIN LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N PANCRE\\u00c1TICA PERMANENTE. LA PRESENCIA DE UN VIRUS EN ESTE CIRCUITO A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO GASTRITIS CR\\u00d3NICA Y FATIGA PROFUNDA DEBIDO AL ESTR\\u00c9S IMPUESTO A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON CONDICIONES DE LA PIEL COMO DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00daLCERAS G\\u00c1STRICAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, EQUILIBRAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS Y RESTAURAR EL METABOLISMO ADECUADO DE LA GLUCOSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF GASTRITIS AND ULCERS PERSIST, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO RULE OUT HELICOBACTER PYLORI. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE FATIGUE AND GLUCOSE IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE TO SUPPORT ENDOCRINE STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA GASTRITIS Y LAS \\u00daLCERAS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA DESCARTAR HELICOBACTER PYLORI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA SEVERA Y DESEQUILIBRIO DE GLUCOSA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS] PARA APOYAR LA ESTABILIDAD ENDOCRINA. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/744','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:25:14','2026-04-28 18:25:14'),(4521,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',745,'{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT PAIN AND MUSCLE PAIN. (CLAMIDIA TUCANS\\n\\nDOLOR ARTICULAR Y DOLOR MUSCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"DIGESTIVE DISORDER AND MUSCULAR ATROPHY. MAYBE FATAL. (TRASTORNO DIGESTIVO Y ATROFIA MUSCULAR. PUEDE SER FATAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT PAIN, MUSCLE PAIN, DIGESTIVE DISORDER, AND MUSCULAR ATROPHY. MAY BE FATAL.\\n\\n(DOLOR ARTICULAR, DOLOR MUSCULAR, TRASTORNO DIGESTIVO Y ATROFIA MUSCULAR. PUEDE SER FATAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CHLAMYDIA TUCANS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE STOMACH AND THE TRANSVERSE COLON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS EXTREMELY CRITICAL DUE TO THE AGGRESSIVE NATURE OF THE PATHOGEN, WHICH IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY BIRDS (SUCH AS TOUCANS OR PARROTS). THE BACTERIA DIRECTLY ATTACKS THE MUSCULAR AND DIGESTIVE SYSTEMS, LEADING TO SEVERE MUSCULAR ATROPHY AND DEBILITATING JOINT PAIN THAT CAN MIMIC OTHER RHEUMATIC CONDITIONS. IF LEFT UNCHECKED, THE SYSTEMIC IMPACT ON DIGESTION AND MUSCLE INTEGRITY CAN BECOME FATAL. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIA, HALTING MUSCULAR DETERIORATION, AND RESTORING PROPER GASTROINTESTINAL TRANSIT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA CHLAMYDIA TUCANS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL EST\\u00d3MAGO Y EL COLON TRANSVERSO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES EXTREMADAMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO DEBIDO A LA NATURALEZA AGRESIVA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO, QUE A MENUDO ES TRANSMITIDO POR AVES (COMO TUCANES O LOROS). LA BACTERIA ATACA DIRECTAMENTE LOS SISTEMAS MUSCULAR Y DIGESTIVO, LO QUE PROVOCA UNA ATROFIA MUSCULAR SEVERA Y UN DOLOR ARTICULAR DEBILITANTE QUE PUEDE IMITAR OTRAS CONDICIONES REUM\\u00c1TICAS. SI NO SE CONTROLA, EL IMPACTO SIST\\u00c9MICO EN LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y LA INTEGRIDAD MUSCULAR PUEDE LLEGAR A SER FATAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA BACTERIA, DETENIENDO EL DETERIORO MUSCULAR Y RESTAURANDO EL TR\\u00c1NSITO GASTROINTESTINAL ADECUADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF MUSCULAR ATROPHY OR SEVERE WEAKNESS IS PRESENT, SCAN THE [STOMACH \\/ SUBCLAVIAN - R] (REF 742) AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER AGGRESSIVE STRAINS. FOR PERSISTENT JOINT PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ILIAC CREST \\/ ILIAC CREST] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO MUSCULAR INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY ATROFIA MUSCULAR O DEBILIDAD SEVERA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ SUBCLAVIA D] (REF 742) PARA DESCARTAR OTRAS CEPAS AGRESIVAS. PARA DOLOR ARTICULAR PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA \\/ CRESTA IL\\u00cdACA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/745','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:26:22','2026-04-28 18:26:22'),(4522,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',746,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT MAY CAUSE PHANTOM LIMB PAIN, RECURRENT INFECTIONS, OR PERSISTENT INFLAMMATORY RESPONSES IN THE AMPUTATED AREA.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE CAUSAR DOLOR DE MIEMBRO FANTASMA, INFECCIONES RECURRENTES O RESPUESTAS INFLAMATORIAS PERSISTENTES EN EL \\u00c1REA AMPUTADA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR RESONANCE ADDRESSES LATENT PATHOGENIC LOADS THAT ACCUMULATE IN THE REMAINING TISSUE OF AN AMPUTATED LIMB BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE STUMP. IN BIOMAGNETISM, SURGICAL SCARS AND STUMPS ACT AS ENERGETIC AND PHYSICAL \\\"DEAD ENDS\\\" WHERE VIRUSES, BACTERIA, OR PARASITES CAN HIDE FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. THIS ACCUMULATION OFTEN LEADS TO LOCALIZED PH DISTORTIONS THAT INTERFERE WITH NERVE REGENERATION AND CAN BE A HIDDEN CAUSE OF PHANTOM LIMB PAIN OR CHRONIC INFLAMMATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT ON THE SAME SIDE OF THE AMPUTATION, THE RESET RELEASES THESE LATENT LOADS, ALLOWING THE BODY TO NEUTRALIZE THEM SYSTEMICALLY AND PROMOTING PROPER ENERGETIC FLOW THROUGH THE NERVE ENDINGS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL ABORDA LAS CARGAS PATOG\\u00c9NICAS LATENTES QUE SE ACUMULAN EN EL TEJIDO REMANENTE DE UN MIEMBRO AMPUTADO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL MU\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LAS CICATRICES QUIR\\u00daRGICAS Y LOS MU\\u00d1ONES ACT\\u00daAN COMO \\\"CALLEJONES SIN SALIDA\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICOS Y F\\u00cdSICOS DONDE LOS VIRUS, BACTERIAS O PAR\\u00c1SITOS PUEDEN ESCONDERSE DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. ESTA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N A MENUDO CONDUCE A DISTORSIONES DE PH LOCALIZADAS QUE INTERFIEREN CON LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y PUEDEN SER UNA CAUSA OCULTA DEL DOLOR DEL MIEMBRO FANTASMA O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO EN EL MISMO LADO DE LA AMPUTACI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO LIBERA ESTAS CARGAS LATENTES, PERMITIENDO QUE EL CUERPO LAS NEUTRALICE SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE Y PROMOVIENDO UN FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ADECUADO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS TERMINACIONES NERVIOSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC PATHOGENS ARE DETECTED BUT NOT FULLY RESOLVED, SCAN THE [SCAR \\/ SCAR] AXIS TO ADDRESS OTHER SURGICAL INTERFERENCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE NERVE PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [NERVOUS SYSTEM \\/ NERVOUS SYSTEM] PROTOCOL. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF THE PATHOGENS RELEASED FROM THE STUMP RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO: SI SE DETECTAN PAT\\u00d3GENOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS QUE NO SE RESUELVEN POR COMPLETO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CICATRIZ \\/ CICATRIZ] PARA ABORDAR OTRAS INTERFERENCIAS QUIR\\u00daRGICAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR NERVIOSO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL PROTOCOLO DEL [SISTEMA NERVIOSO \\/ SISTEMA NERVIOSO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS LIBERADOS DESDE EL RESERVORIO DEL MU\\u00d1\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/746','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:29:08','2026-04-28 18:29:08'),(4523,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',747,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC AS A RESERVOIR, BUT MAY BE LINKED TO DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION, OR RECURRENT PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY.\\n\\n(ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO COMO RESERVORIO, PERO PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA O ACTIVIDAD PATOG\\u00c9NICA RECURRENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE SPECIFICALLY TARGETS CYSTICERCUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE SUB-DIAPHRAGMATIC AREA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE SPACE BENEATH THE DIAPHRAGM CAN ACT AS A HIDDEN COMPARTMENT WHERE LARVAL STAGES OF PARASITES, SUCH AS THE TAPEWORM (TAENIA SOLIUM), CAN REMAIN LATENT WITHOUT TRIGGERING AN IMMEDIATE IMMUNE RESPONSE. THIS RESERVOIR IS CRITICAL TO ADDRESS BECAUSE THESE LARVAE CAN MIGRATE TO OTHER TISSUES, INCLUDING THE MUSCLES OR CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, IF NOT NEUTRALIZED. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ELIMINATES THE LATENT VIRAL OR PARASITIC LOAD, PREVENTING RE-INFECTION AND ENSURING THE DIAPHRAGMATIC AREA REMAINS ENERGETICALLY CLEAR FOR PROPER RESPIRATORY AND DIGESTIVE FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO SE DIRIGE ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE AL CISTICERCO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL \\u00c1REA SUBDIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL ESPACIO DEBAJO DEL DIAFRAGMA PUEDE ACTUAR COMO UN COMPARTIMENTO OCULTO DONDE LAS ETAPAS LARVARIAS DE PAR\\u00c1SITOS, COMO LA SOLITARIA (TAENIA SOLIUM), PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES SIN DESENCADENAR UNA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA INMEDIATA. ES FUNDAMENTAL ABORDAR ESTE RESERVORIO PORQUE ESTAS LARVAS PUEDEN MIGRAR A OTROS TEJIDOS, INCLUYENDO LOS M\\u00daSCULOS O EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, SI NO SE NEUTRALIZAN. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO ELIMINA LA CARGA VIRAL O PARASITARIA LATENTE, PREVINIENDO LA REINFECCI\\u00d3N Y ASEGURANDO QUE EL \\u00c1REA DIAFRAGM\\u00c1TICA PERMANEZCA ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE LIMPIA PARA UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA Y DIGESTIVA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR CHECK: IF PARASITIC SYMPTOMS PERSIST IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, SCAN THE [GLUTEUS \\/ GLUTEUS] AXIS TO RULE OUT ADULT PARASITES. FOR CASES INVOLVING NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] RESONANCE TO SCAN FOR POTENTIAL MIGRATION TO THE BRAIN. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS RELEASED FROM THE SUB-DIAPHRAGM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PARASITARIOS PERSISTEN EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [GL\\u00daTEO \\/ GL\\u00daTEO] PARA DESCARTAR PAR\\u00c1SITOS ADULTOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA RASTREAR UNA POSIBLE MIGRACI\\u00d3N AL CEREBRO. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS LIBERADOS DESDE EL SUBDIAFRAGMA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/747','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:30:11','2026-04-28 18:30:11'),(4524,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',748,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS, ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL FEVER OR SYSTEMIC WEAKNESS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES, MALESTAR ABDOMINAL Y POSIBLE FIEBRE O DEBILIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STAPHYLOCOCCUS A PARATYPHOID BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SUBCLAVIAN ARTERY AND THE ESOPHAGUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SIGNIFICANT FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT CAUSE ACUTE GASTROINTESTINAL DISRUPTION. WHILE TYPICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH DIGESTIVE UPSET, THE RESONANCE AT THE SUBCLAVIAN LEVEL INDICATES A SYSTEMIC COMPONENT WHERE THE BACTERIA MAY IMPACT CIRCULATORY OR LYMPHATIC FLOW. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE UPPER DIGESTIVE TRACT, AND RESTORING PROPER METABOLIC AND GASTROINTESTINAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL STAPHYLOCOCCUS A PARATIFOIDEA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA ARTERIA SUBCLAVIA Y EL ES\\u00d3FAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES SIGNIFICATIVO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE CAUSAN ALTERACIONES GASTROINTESTINALES AGUDAS. AUNQUE NORMALMENTE SE ASOCIA CON MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, LA RESONANCIA A NIVEL DE LA SUBCLAVIA INDICA UN COMPONENTE SIST\\u00c9MICO DONDE LA BACTERIA PUEDE IMPACTAR EL FLUJO CIRCULATORIO O LINF\\u00c1TICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO SUPERIOR Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA Y GASTROINTESTINAL ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF GASTROINTESTINAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [STOMACH \\/ STOMACH] (REF 741) AXIS TO STABILIZE LOCAL GASTRIC PH. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ LIVER] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ EST\\u00d3MAGO] (REF 741) PARA ESTABILIZAR EL PH G\\u00c1STRICO LOCAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE LOS SUBPRODUCTOS BACTERIANOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/748','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:31:28','2026-04-28 18:31:28'),(4525,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',749,'{\"origins\":\"CORYNEBACTERIUM DIPHTHERIAE\",\"symptoms\":\"THICK MUCOUS AND PHLEGM. CHRONIC COUGH, THROAT INFECTIONS, DIARRHEA, GENERALIZED EDEMA, FLUID RETENTION, SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES, WEIGHT LOSS, ITCHING, FEVER, SWEATING, AND ANEMIA. (MUCOSIDAD ESPESA Y FLEMA. TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, INFECCIONES DE GARGANTA, DIARREA, EDEMA GENERALIZADO, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS, GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS INFLAMADOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, PICAZ\\u00d3N, FIEBRE, SUDORACI\\u00d3N Y ANEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY INGESTION OF DAIRY PRODUCTS. DIPHTHERIA, THYROID DEGENERATION, HODGKIN\'S DISEASE, ANOREXIA, CANCER. THIS CAN KILL THE PATIENT BY ASPHYXIATION. (TRANSMITIDO POR INGESTI\\u00d3N DE PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS. DIFTERIA, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA TIROIDES, ENFERMEDAD DE HODGKIN, ANOREXIA, C\\u00c1NCER. ESTO PUEDE MATAR AL PACIENTE POR ASFIXIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION; AVOID DAIRY PRODUCTS. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N; EVITAR PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"CORYNEBACTERIUM DIPHTHERIAE (KLEBS-L\\u00d6FFLER BACILLUS)\",\"symptoms\":\"THICK MUCOUS AND PHLEGM, CHRONIC COUGH, THROAT INFECTIONS, DIARRHEA, SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES, GENERALIZED EDEMA (FLUID RETENTION), WEIGHT LOSS, ITCHING, FEVER, SWEATING, AND ANEMIA.\\n\\n(MUCOSIDAD ESPESA Y FLEMA, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA, INFECCIONES DE GARGANTA, DIARREA, GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS INFLAMADOS, EDEMA GENERALIZADO (RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS), P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, PICAZ\\u00d3N, FIEBRE, SUDORACI\\u00d3N Y ANEMIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CORYNEBACTERIUM DIPHTHERIAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT AND RIGHT SUBCLAVIAN ARTERIES. THIS PATHOGEN IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE INGESTION OF CONTAMINATED DAIRY PRODUCTS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS EXTREMELY CRITICAL AS THE BACTERIA CAN LEAD TO DIPHTHERIA, CAUSING THE FORMATION OF A THICK PSEUDOMEMBRANE IN THE THROAT THAT POSES A SEVERE RISK OF ASPHYXIATION. BEYOND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, THIS PATHOGEN IS ASSOCIATED WITH THYROID DEGENERATION, ANOREXIA, AND SERIOUS SYSTEMIC CONDITIONS SUCH AS HODGKIN\'S DISEASE OR CANCER. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACILLUS, CLEARING AIRWAYS, AND REDUCING LYMPHATIC INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CORYNEBACTERIUM DIPHTHERIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LAS ARTERIAS SUBCLAVIAS IZQUIERDA Y DERECHA. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO POR LA INGESTI\\u00d3N DE PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS CONTAMINADOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES EXTREMADAMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE PROVOCAR DIFTERIA, CAUSANDO LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE UNA PSEUDOMEMBRANA ESPESA EN LA GARGANTA QUE REPRESENTA UN RIESGO GRAVE DE ASFIXIA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE ASOCIA CON LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA TIROIDES, ANOREXIA Y CONDICIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS GRAVES COMO LA ENFERMEDAD DE HODGKIN O EL C\\u00c1NCER. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR EL BACILO, LIMPIAR LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF THROAT INFECTIONS PERSIST, SCAN THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EDEMA OR LYMPHATIC BLOCKAGE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THORACIC DUCT \\/ LEFT SUBCLAVIAN] RESONANCE. CAUTION: IT IS STRONGLY ADVISED TO AVOID DAIRY PRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE TO PREVENT RE-EXPOSURE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LAS INFECCIONES DE GARGANTA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN EDEMA SEVERO O BLOQUEO LINF\\u00c1TICO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CONDUCTO TOR\\u00c1CICO \\/ SUBCLAVIA IZQUIERDA]. PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: SE RECOMIENDA ENCARECIDAMENTE EVITAR LOS PRODUCTOS L\\u00c1CTEOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N PARA EVITAR UNA NUEVA EXPOSICI\\u00d3N. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/749','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:33:01','2026-04-28 18:33:01'),(4526,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',750,'{\"radical\":\"ESPECIAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE SWEATING. (SUDORACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"BRING EMOTIONAL STABILITY AND IMPROVES SELF-ESTEEM IN CASES OF DEFORMITIES, LOSS OF LIMB OR ORGAN, TRAUMA, RATE, ABORTION, EMOTIONAL PROBLEMS. REGULATES THE GROWTH HARM OWN. DWARFISM. HELPS CHILDREN\'S GROWTH. (APORTA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y MEJORA LA AUTOESTIMA EN CASOS DE DEFORMIDADES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE UN MIEMBRO U \\u00d3RGANO, TRAUMA, VIOLACI\\u00d3N, ABORTO, PROBLEMAS EMOCIONALES. REGULA EL CRECIMIENTO ARMONIOSO. ENANISMO. AYUDA AL CRECIMIENTO INFANTIL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PAROTID CHECK - PARATHYROID CHECK - THYROID (REVISAR - PAR\\u00d3TIDA  REVISAR - PARATIROIDES  REVISAR - TIROIDES)\"}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL & GROWTH REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y DEL CRECIMIENTO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE SWEATING, EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, LOW SELF-ESTEEM, AND GROWTH DISORDERS.\\n\\n(SUDORACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA, INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, BAJA AUTOESTIMA Y TRASTORNOS DEL CRECIMIENTO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DEEP CONNECTION BETWEEN EMOTIONAL PERCEPTION AND THE VITAL CONTROL CENTERS OF THE BRAINSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SUPERCILLIARY ARCH (ABOVE THE EYEBROW) AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR RESTORING EMOTIONAL STABILITY AND IMPROVING SELF-ESTEEM, PARTICULARLY IN INDIVIDUALS DEALING WITH TRAUMA, LOSS OF A LIMB OR ORGAN, DEFORMITIES, OR SEVERE EMOTIONAL CRISES. BEYOND THE PSYCHOLOGICAL COMPONENT, THIS PAIR PLAYS A CRITICAL ROLE IN REGULATING HARMONIOUS GROWTH AND IS FREQUENTLY UTILIZED IN PROTOCOLS FOR DWARFISM OR TO SUPPORT CHILDREN\'S GROWTH. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN BALANCING GROWTH HORMONES AND NEUROVEGETATIVE RESPONSES, SUCH AS EXCESSIVE SWEATING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA ENTRE LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y LOS CENTROS DE CONTROL VITAL DEL TALLO CEREBRAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH ENTRE EL ARCO SUPERCILIAR (SOBRE LA CEJA) Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA RESTAURAR LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y MEJORAR LA AUTOESTIMA, PARTICULARMENTE EN INDIVIDUOS QUE SE ENFRENTAN A TRAUMAS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE UN MIEMBRO U \\u00d3RGANO, DEFORMIDADES O CRISIS EMOCIONALES GRAVES. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL COMPONENTE PSICOL\\u00d3GICO, ESTE PAR JUEGA UN PAPEL CR\\u00cdTICO EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL CRECIMIENTO ARMONIOSO Y SE UTILIZA FRECUENTEMENTE EN PROTOCOLOS PARA EL ENANISMO O PARA APOYAR EL CRECIMIENTO INFANTIL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EQUILIBRAR LAS HORMONAS DEL CRECIMIENTO Y LAS RESPUESTAS NEUROVEGETATIVAS, COMO LA SUDORACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ENDOCRINE CHECK: IF GROWTH OR METABOLIC ISSUES PERSIST, SCAN THE [PAROTID \\/ PAROTID], [PARATHYROID \\/ PARATHYROID], AND [THYROID \\/ THYROID] AXES TO ENSURE FULL GLANDULAR SYNERGY. FOR EMOTIONAL STABILITY CONCERNS LINKED TO FOCUS AND CONCENTRATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DORSAL 3 \\/ LUMBAR 5] (REF 220) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE EMOTIONAL INTEGRATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ENDOCRINA: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DE CRECIMIENTO O METAB\\u00d3LICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR LOS EJES [PAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ PAR\\u00d3TIDA], [PARATIROIDES \\/ PARATIROIDES] Y [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES] PARA ASEGURAR UNA SINERGIA GLANDULAR COMPLETA. PARA PROBLEMAS DE ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL VINCULADOS AL ENFOQUE Y LA CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [DORSAL 3 \\/ LUMBAR 5] (REF 220). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE INTEGRACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/750','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:34:31','2026-04-28 18:34:31'),(4527,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',751,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ANATOMICAL INTEGRITY.  (INTEGRIDAD ANAT\\u00d3MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ANATOMICAL INTEGRITY (INTEGRIDAD ANAT\\u00d3MICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"ALTERATIONS IN PHYSICAL PERCEPTION DUE TO LOSS OF ORGANS OR LIMBS, PHANTOM LIMB PAIN, AND PSYCHOLOGICAL ADAPTATION ISSUES.\\n\\n(ALTERACIONES EN LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA POR P\\u00c9RDIDA DE \\u00d3RGANOS O MIEMBROS, DOLOR DE MIEMBRO FANTASMA Y PROBLEMAS DE ADAPTACI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON ANATOMICAL INTEGRITY AND THE PERCEPTION OF THE \\\"BODY SCHEMA\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SUPRA-ILIAC AREA AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR INDIVIDUALS WHO HAVE UNDERGONE THE REMOVAL OF AN ORGAN (SUCH AS THE GALLBLADDER, UTERUS, OR APPENDIX) OR THE AMPUTATION OF A LIMB. THE BRAIN, THROUGH THE RACHIDIAN BULB, OFTEN CONTINUES TO SEND SIGNALS OR MAINTAIN AN ENERGETIC MEMORY OF THE MISSING ORGAN, WHICH CAN GENERATE PAIN, DISCOMFORT, OR AN IMBALANCE IN VITAL FLOW. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN RECOGNIZING AND ACCEPTING THE NEW PHYSICAL STATE, REDUCING PHANTOM PAIN AND PROMOTING BETTER PSYCHOLOGICAL AND ENERGETIC INTEGRATION OF THE LOSS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN LA INTEGRIDAD ANAT\\u00d3MICA Y LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N DEL \\\"ESQUEMA CORPORAL\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSI\\u00d3NES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00c1REA SUPRAIL\\u00cdACA Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA PERSONAS QUE HAN SUFRIDO LA EXTIRPACI\\u00d3N DE UN \\u00d3RGANO (COMO LA VES\\u00cdCULA, EL \\u00daTERO O EL AP\\u00c9NDICE) O LA AMPUTACI\\u00d3N DE UNA EXTREMIDAD. EL CEREBRO, A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO, A MENUDO CONTIN\\u00daA ENVIANDO SE\\u00d1ALES O MANTENIENDO UNA MEMORIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL \\u00d3RGANO AUSENTE, LO QUE PUEDE GENERAR DOLOR, INCOMODIDAD O UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN EL FLUJO VITAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A RECONOCER Y ACEPTAR EL NUEVO ESTADO F\\u00cdSICO, REDUCIENDO EL DOLOR FANTASMA Y PROMOVIENDO UNA MEJOR INTEGRACI\\u00d3N PSICOL\\u00d3GICA Y ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE LA P\\u00c9RDIDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"INTEGRITY CHECK: IF PAIN PERSIST AT THE SITE OF A SURGERY, SCAN THE [SCAR \\/ SCAR] AXIS TO RELEASE POTENTIAL ENERGETIC ADHESIONS. FOR RECENT AMPUTATION CASES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [STUMP \\/ STUMP] (REF 745) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE BODY\'S ADAPTATION PROCESS TO THE NEW ANATOMICAL CONFIGURATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE INTEGRIDAD: SI EL DOLOR PERSISTE EN EL LUGAR DE UNA CIRUG\\u00cdA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [CICATRIZ \\/ CICATRIZ] PARA LIBERAR POSIBLES ADHERENCIAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS. PARA CASOS DE AMPUTACI\\u00d3N RECIENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MU\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ MU\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 745). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DE ADAPTACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO A LA NUEVA CONFIGURACI\\u00d3N ANAT\\u00d3MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/751','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:36:25','2026-04-28 18:36:25'),(4528,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',752,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DEPRESSION, SCARED, ANGUISH, AND ANXIETY. (DEPRESI\\u00d3N, MIEDO, ANGUSTIA Y ANSIEDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PSYCHOLOGICAL STABILITY (ESTABILIDAD PSICOL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"DEPRESSION, FEAR (SCARED), ANGUISH, AND ANXIETY.\\n\\n(DEPRESI\\u00d3N, MIEDO, ANGUSTIA Y ANSIEDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES DEEP PSYCHOLOGICAL DISTRESS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SUPRA-SENSORIAL AREA (LOCATED AT THE CROWN CHAKRA POINT) AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR BALANCING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN HIGHER PERCEPTION AND THE MASTER ENDOCRINE GLAND. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS PERSISTENT FEELINGS OF ANGUISH, UNEXPLAINED FEAR, OR DEPRESSIVE STATES THAT INTERFERE WITH DAILY LIFE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN REGAINING EMOTIONAL CLARITY, REDUCING CORTISOL-DRIVEN ANXIETY RESPONSES, AND PROMOTING A SENSE OF SPIRITUAL AND MENTAL SERENITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL DISTR\\u00c9S PSICOL\\u00d3GICO PROFUNDO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00c1REA SUPRASENSORIAL (UBICADA EN EL PUNTO DEL CHAKRA CORONA) Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EQUILIBRAR LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SUPERIOR Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA ENDOCRINA MAESTRA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO SENTIMIENTOS PERSISTENTES DE ANGUSTIA, MIEDO INEXPLICABLE O ESTADOS DEPRESIVOS QUE INTERFIEREN CON LA VIDA DIARIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A RECUPERAR LA CLARIDAD EMOCIONAL, REDUCIENDO LAS RESPUESTAS DE ANSIEDAD IMPULSADAS POR EL CORTISOL Y PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE SERENIDAD ESPIRITUAL Y MENTAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF ANXIETY PERSISTS, SCAN THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] AXIS TO CALM THE BRAIN\'S FEAR CENTER. FOR DEPRESSION LINKED TO HORMONAL IMBALANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN MANAGING THE EMOTIONAL LOAD DURING THE CLEARING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA ANSIEDAD PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA CALMAR EL CENTRO DEL MIEDO DEL CEREBRO. PARA LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N VINCULADA AL DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL MANEJO DE LA CARGA EMOCIONAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE DEPURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/752','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:37:37','2026-04-28 18:37:37'),(4529,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',753,'{\"radical\":\"ESPECIAL\",\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTRACRANIAL TENSION (TENSI\\u00d3N INTRACRANEAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"ESPECIALSPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"NEUROVASCULAR REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N NEUROVASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTRACRANIAL TENSION, HEADACHES, DIZZINESS, AND SENSATIONS OF PRESSURE WITHIN THE SKULL.\\n\\n(TENSI\\u00d3N INTRACRANEAL, DOLORES DE CABEZA, MAREOS Y SENSACIONES DE PRESI\\u00d3N DENTRO DEL CR\\u00c1NEO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DYNAMICS OF INTRACRANIAL TENSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE SUPRAPECTORAL AREA (LOCATED ABOVE THE PECTORAL MUSCLE) AND THE PITUITARY GLAND (HYPOPHYSIS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REGULATING THE FLOW OF FLUIDS AND THE PRESSURE GRADIENTS THAT AFFECT THE BRAIN AND SURROUNDING TISSUES. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS IMBALANCED, IT CAN MANIFEST AS PERSISTENT HEADACHES OR A SENSE OF HEAVINESS IN THE HEAD CAUSED BY CONGESTION OR VASCULAR TENSION. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN NORMALIZING INTRACRANIAL PRESSURE, IMPROVING CIRCULATION TO THE BRAIN, AND RELIEVING THE MECHANICAL STRESS ON THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA DIN\\u00c1MICA DE LA TENSI\\u00d3N INTRACRANEAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00c1REA SUPRAPECTORAL (UBICADA SOBRE EL M\\u00daSCULO PECTORAL) Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA (HIP\\u00d3FISIS). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA REGULAR EL FLUJO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y LOS GRADIENTES DE PRESI\\u00d3N QUE AFECTAN AL CEREBRO Y LOS TEJIDOS CIRCUNDANTES. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 DESEQUILIBRADO, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO DOLORES DE CABEZA PERSISTENTES O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE PESADEZ EN LA CABEZA CAUSADA POR CONGESTI\\u00d3N O TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A NORMALIZAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N INTRACRANEAL, MEJORANDO LA CIRCULACI\\u00d3N HACIA EL CEREBRO Y ALIVIANDO EL ESTR\\u00c9S MEC\\u00c1NICO EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PRESSURE CHECK: IF INTRACRANIAL TENSION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] AXIS TO ADDRESS VASCULAR INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIZZINESS OR EQUILIBRIUM ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE REGULATION OF BODY FLUIDS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO PRESSURE BALANCING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PRESI\\u00d3N: SI LA TENSI\\u00d3N INTRACRANEAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] PARA ABORDAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MAREOS O PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LOS L\\u00cdQUIDOS CORPORALES QUE CONTRIBUYEN AL EQUILIBRIO DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/753','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:39:02','2026-04-28 18:39:02'),(4530,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',754,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE (DOLOR DE CABEZA)\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY FAILURE. FALSE HEPATITIS C. MAYBE INVOLVED IN RIGHT BREAST CANCER AND IN GANGRENE. METASTASIS, IN BONES. (INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA. FALSA HEPATITIS C. PUEDE ESTAR IMPLICADO EN EL C\\u00c1NCER DE MAMA DERECHO Y EN LA GANGRENA. MET\\u00c1STASIS EN LOS HUESOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - HEAD OF PANCREAS\\/PYLORUS (REVISAR - CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS\\/P\\u00cdLORO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, RESPIRATORY FAILURE, AND DIGESTIVE DISTRESS.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE CABEZA, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA Y MALESTAR DIGESTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SUPRAHEPATIC REGION (ABOVE THE LIVER). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY AGGRESSIVE AND IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"FALSE HEPATITIS C\\\" BECAUSE IT CAUSES SIGNIFICANT LIVER INFLAMMATION AND DYSFUNCTION WITHOUT THE PRESENCE OF THE ACTUAL HEPATITIS VIRUS. THE BACTERIA CAN LEAD TO SEVERE SYSTEMIC ISSUES, INCLUDING RESPIRATORY FAILURE AND GANGRENE, AND IS POTENTIALLY INVOLVED IN THE DEVELOPMENT OF RIGHT BREAST CANCER. FURTHERMORE, IT HAS BEEN LINKED TO METASTASIS PROCESSES, PARTICULARLY IN THE BONES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING LIVER INTEGRITY, AND PREVENTING THE SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF TOXINS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N SUPRAHEP\\u00c1TICA (SOBRE EL H\\u00cdGADO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES ALTAMENTE AGRESIVO Y A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON LA \\\"FALSA HEPATITIS C\\\" PORQUE CAUSA UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA SIGNIFICATIVA SIN LA PRESENCIA DEL VIRUS DE LA HEPATITIS REAL. LA BACTERIA PUEDE LLEVAR A PROBLEMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS GRAVES, INCLUYENDO INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA Y GANGRENA, Y EST\\u00c1 POTENCIALMENTE INVOLUCRADA EN EL DESARROLLO DEL C\\u00c1NCER DE MAMA DERECHO. ADEM\\u00c1S, SE HA VINCULADO CON PROCESOS DE MET\\u00c1STASIS, PARTICULARMENTE EN LOS HUESOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DE TOXINAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF LIVER INFLAMMATION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS TO RULE OUT VIRAL HEPATITIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [HEAD OF PANCREAS \\/ PYLORUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL ELIMINATION OF THE AGGRESSIVE TOXINS PRODUCED BY THIS BACTERIA DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA DESCARTAR HEPATITIS VIRAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CABEZA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00cdLORO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE LAS TOXINAS AGRESIVAS PRODUCIDAS POR ESTA BACTERIA DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/754','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:40:21','2026-04-28 18:40:21'),(4531,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',756,'{\"symptoms\":\"NODULES IN THE LYMPH TISSUE. SEVERE RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, BREATHLESSNESS, CHRONIC DRY AND REPETITIVE COUGH, PHLEGM WITH BLOOD, LOOSE TEETH. (N\\u00d3DULOS EN EL TEJIDO LINF\\u00c1TICO. S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS SEVEROS, FALTA DE AIRE, TOS CR\\u00d3NICA SECA Y REPETITIVA, FLEMA CON SANGRE, DIENTES FLOJOS.)\",\"paths\":\"TUBERCULOSIS. ASTHMA, BRONCHITIS, FALSE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, MENINGITIS. KIDNEY STONES AND GALLBLADDER STONE. (TUBERCULOSIS. ASMA, BRONQUITIS, FALSA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, MENINGITIS. C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES Y C\\u00c1LCULOS DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH CHEEKBONE; FACIAL PARALYSIS.                   CAUTION: THIS BACTERIA ALSO DETERMINES THE FACTOR OF MALIGNANCY AND TUMORS. (ASOCIADO CON EL P\\u00d3MULO; PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL. PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: ESTA BACTERIA TAMBI\\u00c9N DETERMINA EL FACTOR DE MALIGNIDAD Y TUMORES.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"NODULES IN THE LYMPH TISSUE, SEVERE TUBERCULOSIS, ASTHMA, BRONCHITIS, FALSE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, MENINGITIS, AND KIDNEY OR GALLBLADDER STONES.\\n\\n(N\\u00d3DULOS EN EL TEJIDO LINF\\u00c1TICO, TUBERCULOSIS SEVERA, ASMA, BRONQUITIS, FALSA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, MENINGITIS, C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES Y C\\u00c1LCULOS DE LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SUPRASPINOUS FOSSA (ABOVE THE SCAPULA SPINE). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS EXTREMELY CRITICAL AS IT ADDRESSES ONE OF THE MOST RESILIENT AND DESTRUCTIVE PATHOGENS. BEYOND PRIMARY PULMONARY SYMPTOMS LIKE ASTHMA AND BRONCHITIS, THIS BACTERIA CAN MIGRATE SYSTEMICALLY, TRIGGERING MENINGITIS OR MIMICKING NEUROLOGICAL DEGENERATION (FALSE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS). IT IS ALSO A KEY FACTOR IN THE FORMATION OF STONES IN THE GALLBLADDER AND KIDNEYS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACILLUS, PROTECTING THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM FROM NODULAR GROWTH, AND REDUCING THE RISK OF MALIGNANCY AND TUMOR DEVELOPMENT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL MYCOBACTERIUM TUBERCULOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA FOSA SUPRAESPINOSA (SOBRE LA ESPINA DE LA ESC\\u00c1PULA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES EXTREMADAMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE ABORDA UNO DE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS M\\u00c1S RESISTENTES Y DESTRUCTIVOS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PULMONARES PRIMARIOS COMO ASMA Y BRONQUITIS, ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE MIGRAR SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE, DESENCADENANDO MENINGITIS O IMITANDO UNA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA (FALSA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE). TAMBI\\u00c9N ES UN FACTOR CLAVE EN LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS EN LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR EL BACILO, PROTEGIENDO EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO DEL CRECIMIENTO NODULAR Y REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE MALIGNIDAD Y EL DESARROLLO DE TUMORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [POPLITEAL \\/ POPLITEAL] AXIS TO RULE OUT COMPLEMENTARY BACTERIAL ACTIVITY. FOR CASES INVOLVING FACIAL PARALYSIS OR CHEEKBONE PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ZYGOMATIC \\/ ZYGOMATIC] RESONANCE. CAUTION: THIS BACTERIA IS A KNOWN DETERMINANT IN THE MALIGNANCY FACTOR FOR TUMORS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL CLEARANCE OF TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [POPL\\u00cdTEO \\/ POPL\\u00cdTEO] PARA DESCARTAR ACTIVIDAD BACTERIANA COMPLEMENTARIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL O DOLOR EN EL P\\u00d3MULO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00d3MULO \\/ P\\u00d3MULO]. PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: ESTA BACTERIA ES UN DETERMINANTE CONOCIDO EN EL FACTOR DE MALIGNIDAD DE LOS TUMORES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/756','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:41:34','2026-04-28 18:41:34'),(4532,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',757,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INSPIRATION (INSPIRACI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INSPIRATION (INSPIRACI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"CREATIVE BLOCKS, LACK OF MOTIVATION, EMOTIONAL STAGNATION, AND DIFFICULTY IN MENTAL PROCESSING.\\n\\n(BLOQUEOS CREATIVOS, FALTA DE MOTIVACI\\u00d3N, ESTANCAMIENTO EMOCIONAL Y DIFICULTAD EN EL PROCESAMIENTO MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE COGNITIVE AND CREATIVE FLOW BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SYLVAIN FISSURE (LATERAL SULCUS) OF THE BRAIN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR UNLOCKING \\\"INSPIRATION\\\" AND ENHANCING THE COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE FRONTAL, PARIETAL, AND TEMPORAL LOBES. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS AREA CAN MANIFEST AS A FEELING OF BEING \\\"STUCK\\\" OR UNABLE TO CONCEIVE NEW IDEAS, OFTEN ACCOMPANIED BY MENTAL FATIGUE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BRAIN IN RESTORING NEURAL PLASTICITY AND COGNITIVE FLEXIBILITY, ALLOWING FOR A RENEWED SENSE OF CREATIVITY AND EMOTIONAL VITALITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL FLUJO COGNITIVO Y CREATIVO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA CISURA DE SILVIO (SURCO LATERAL) DEL CEREBRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA DESBLOQUEAR LA \\\"INSPIRACI\\u00d3N\\\" Y MEJORAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LOS L\\u00d3BULOS FRONTAL, PARIETAL Y TEMPORAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTA \\u00c1REA PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ESTAR \\\"ATRAPADO\\\" O INCAPAZ DE CONCEBIR NUEVAS IDEAS, A MENUDO ACOMPA\\u00d1ADO DE FATIGA MENTAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CEREBRO A RESTAURAR LA PLASTICIDAD NEURONAL Y LA FLEXIBILIDAD COGNITIVA, PERMITIENDO UN SENTIDO RENOVADO DE CREATIVIDAD Y VITALIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE CHECK: IF MENTAL FATIGUE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO IMPROVE SENSORY PROCESSING. FOR EMOTIONAL BLOCKS LINKED TO FEAR OR ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE INTEGRATION OF NEW CREATIVE AND EMOTIONAL STATES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA: SI LA FATIGA MENTAL PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA MEJORAR EL PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL. PARA BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES VINCULADOS AL MIEDO O LA ANSIEDAD, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE NUEVOS ESTADOS CREATIVOS Y EMOCIONALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/757','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:43:14','2026-04-28 18:43:14'),(4533,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',758,'{\"symptoms\":\"PROBLEMS IN THE PHARYNX AND TONGUE. BREATHING PROBLEMS, PARALYSIS OF THE DIAPHRAGM AND INTRA-COASTAL MUSCLE. MUSCLE PAIN, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, EPIGASTRIC PAIN, INTESTINAL DISORDERS, COLIC AND GAS, FEVER, DRY MOUTH, DECREASED SALIVA AND TEARS, AND URINARY RETENTION. (PROBLEMAS EN LA FARINGE Y LA LENGUA. PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS DEL DIAFRAGMA Y DEL M\\u00daSCULO INTERCOSTAL. DOLOR MUSCULAR, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR EPIG\\u00c1STRICO, TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, C\\u00d3LICOS Y GASES, FIEBRE, BOCA SECA, DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE SALIVA Y L\\u00c1GRIMAS, Y RETENCI\\u00d3N URINARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY IMPROPER FOOD STORAGE. BOTULISM. BRAIN DAMAGE, SEIZURES AND EVEN DEATH. HEPATITIS H, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS.METASTASES. IMPAIRED VISION AND BLINDNESS. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALMACENAMIENTO INADECUADO DE ALIMENTOS. BOTULISMO. DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL, CONVULSIONES E INCLUSO MUERTE. HEPATITIS H, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES. MET\\u00c1STASIS. VISI\\u00d3N DETERIORADA Y CEGUERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PROBLEMS IN THE PHARYNX AND TONGUE, BREATHING PROBLEMS, PARALYSIS OF THE DIAPHRAGM AND INTERCOSTAL MUSCLES, MUSCLE PAIN, INTESTINAL DISORDERS, COLIC AND GAS, FEVER, DRY MOUTH, DECREASED SALIVA AND TEARS, AND URINARY RETENTION.(PROBLEMAS EN LA FARINGE Y LA LENGUA, PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS DEL DIAFRAGMA Y DEL M\\u00daSCULO INTERCOSTAL, DOLOR MUSCULAR, TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, C\\u00d3LICOS Y GASES, FIEBRE, BOCA SECA, DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE SALIVA Y L\\u00c1GRIMAS, Y RETENCI\\u00d3N URINARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CLOSTRIDIUM BOTULINUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TAIL OF THE PANCREAS AND THE KIDNEYS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS EXTREMELY CRITICAL AS IT ADDRESSES THE CAUSE OF BOTULISM, A TOXIN-MEDIATED CONDITION OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY IMPROPERLY STORED FOOD. THE PATHOGEN IMPACTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO BRAIN DAMAGE, SEIZURES, IMPAIRED VISION, AND EVEN PARALYSIS OF VITAL RESPIRATORY MUSCLES. IT IS ALSO ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"HEPATITIS H\\\" AND HAS BEEN LINKED TO COMPLICATIONS IN METASTASIS PROCESSES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE TOXINS, RESTORING GLANDULAR SECRETIONS (SALIVA\\/TEARS), AND PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF NEUROMUSCULAR PARALYSIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CLOSTRIDIUM BOTULINUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES EXTREMADAMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE ABORDA LA CAUSA DEL BOTULISMO, UNA CONDICI\\u00d3N MEDIADA POR TOXINAS QUE A MENUDO SE TRANSMITE POR ALIMENTOS MAL ALMACENADOS. EL PAT\\u00d3GENO IMPACTA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, PUDIENDO PROVOCAR DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL, CONVULSIONES, VISI\\u00d3N DETERIORADA E INCLUSO PAR\\u00c1LISIS DE M\\u00daSCULOS RESPIRATORIOS VITALES. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE ASOCIA CON LA \\\"HEPATITIS H\\\" Y SE HA VINCULADO CON COMPLICACIONES EN PROCESOS DE MET\\u00c1STASIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LAS TOXINAS, RESTAURAR LAS SECRECIONES GLANDULARES (SALIVA\\/L\\u00c1GRIMAS) Y PREVENIR LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS NEUROMUSCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY PARALYSIS OR DIAPHRAGM ISSUES ARE ACUTE, SCAN THE [SUB DIAPHRAGM \\/ SUB DIAPHRAGM] (REF 746) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VISION LOSS OR BLINDNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL CLEARANCE OF THE AGGRESSIVE BOTULINUM TOXIN.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS RESPIRATORIA O LOS PROBLEMAS DEL DIAFRAGMA SON AGUDOS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SUBDIAFRAGMA \\/ SUBDIAFRAGMA] (REF 746). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN P\\u00c9RDIDA SEVERA DE VISI\\u00d3N O CEGUERA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [OCCIPITAL \\/ OCCIPITAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE LA AGRESIVA TOXINA BOTUL\\u00cdNICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/758','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:44:36','2026-04-28 18:44:36'),(4534,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',759,'{\"symptoms\":\"PROBLEMS IN THE PHARYNX AND TONGUE. BREATHING PROBLEMS, PARALYSIS OF THE DIAPHRAGM AND INTRA-COASTAL MUSCLE. MUSCLE PAIN, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, EPIGASTRIC PAIN, INTESTINAL DISORDERS, COLIC AND GAS, FEVER, DRY MOUTH, DECREASED SALIVA AND TEARS, AND URINARY RETENTION. (PROBLEMAS EN LA FARINGE Y LA LENGUA. PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS DEL DIAFRAGMA Y DEL M\\u00daSCULO INTERCOSTAL. DOLOR MUSCULAR, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, DOLOR EPIG\\u00c1STRICO, TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES, C\\u00d3LICOS Y GASES, FIEBRE, BOCA SECA, DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE SALIVA Y L\\u00c1GRIMAS, Y RETENCI\\u00d3N URINARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY IMPROPER FOOD STORAGE. BOTULISM. BRAIN DAMAGE, SEIZURES AND EVEN DEATH. HEPATITIS H, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS.METASTASES. IMPAIRED VISION AND BLINDNESS. (TRANSMITIDO POR ALMACENAMIENTO INADECUADO DE ALIMENTOS. BOTULISMO. DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL, CONVULSIONES E INCLUSO MUERTE. HEPATITIS H, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES. MET\\u00c1STASIS. VISI\\u00d3N DETERIORADA Y CEGUERA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PROBLEMS IN THE PHARYNX AND TONGUE, BREATHING PROBLEMS, PARALYSIS OF THE DIAPHRAGM AND INTERCOSTAL MUSCLES, BRAIN DAMAGE, SEIZURES, HEPATITIS H, INTESTINAL PROBLEMS, METASTASIS, IMPAIRED VISION, AND BLINDNESS.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS EN LA FARINGE Y LA LENGUA, PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS DEL DIAFRAGMA Y DEL M\\u00daSCULO INTERCOSTAL, DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL, CONVULSIONES, HEPATITIS H, PROBLEMAS INTESTINALES, MET\\u00c1STASIS, VISI\\u00d3N DETERIORADA Y CEGUERA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CLOSTRIDIUM BOTULINUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TAIL OF THE PANCREAS AND THE LIVER. THIS AXIS IS EXTREMELY CRITICAL AS IT ADDRESSES THE TOXIN-MEDIATED IMPACT OF BOTULISM, OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY IMPROPER FOOD STORAGE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC PAIR IS LINKED TO \\\"HEPATITIS H\\\" AND IS KNOWN TO INTERFERE WITH THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO SEIZURES, BRAIN DAMAGE, AND EVEN DEATH IF RESPIRATORY PARALYSIS OCCURS. IT IS ALSO MONITORED IN COMPLEX CASES INVOLVING METASTASIS AND SEVERE VISUAL DEGENERATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE TOXIC LOAD, PROTECTING LIVER FUNCTION, AND PREVENTING NEUROMUSCULAR DETERIORATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CLOSTRIDIUM BOTULINUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. ESTE EJE ES EXTREMADAMENTE CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE ABORDA EL IMPACTO MEDIADO POR TOXINAS DEL BOTULISMO, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO POR EL ALMACENAMIENTO INADECUADO DE ALIMENTOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ESPEC\\u00cdFICO EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO CON LA \\\"HEPATITIS H\\\" Y SE SABE QUE INTERFIERE CON EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, PUDIENDO PROVOCAR CONVULSIONES, DA\\u00d1O CEREBRAL E INCLUSO LA MUERTE SI SE PRODUCE PAR\\u00c1LISIS RESPIRATORIA. TAMBI\\u00c9N SE MONITOREA EN CASOS COMPLEJOS QUE INVOLUCRAN MET\\u00c1STASIS Y DEGENERACI\\u00d3N VISUAL SEVERA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA T\\u00d3XICA, PROTEGIENDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y PREVINIENDO EL DETERIORO NEUROMUSCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC TOXICITY IS HIGH, SCAN THE [TAIL OF PANCREAS \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 757) AXIS TO SUPPORT RENAL CLEARANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SUB DIAPHRAGM \\/ SUB DIAPHRAGM] (REF 746) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA ES ALTA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [COLA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 757) PARA APOYAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N RENAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SUBDIAFRAGMA \\/ SUBDIAFRAGMA] (REF 746). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/759','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:45:53','2026-04-28 18:45:53'),(4535,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',760,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"WARTS (VERRUGAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"WARTS (VERRUGAS)\",\"symptoms\":\"PRESENCE OF WARTS ON THE BODY, POSSIBLE SKIN ALTERATIONS, AND GLANDULAR IMBALANCE.\\n\\n(PRESENCIA DE VERRUGAS EN EL CUERPO, POSIBLES ALTERACIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y DESEQUILIBRIO GLANDULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE AGENTS RESPONSIBLE FOR THE FORMATION OF WARTS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE PANCREATIC STRUCTURE, SPECIFICALLY BETWEEN THE TAIL AND THE TIP. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING VIRAL LOADS THAT MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS VERRUCOUS GROWTHS ON THE SKIN. THE PANCREAS PLAYS A VITAL ROLE IN ENZYMATIC AND HORMONAL BALANCE; WHEN A VIRUS INTERFERES WITH THIS CIRCUIT, IT CAN DISRUPT THE BODY\\u2019S ABILITY TO MAINTAIN CLEAR DERMAL TISSUE. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL ACTIVITY, PROMOTING THE NATURAL REGRESSION OF WARTS AND RESTORING PANCREATIC SYNERGY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LOS AGENTES RESPONSABLES DE LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE VERRUGAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA ESTRUCTURA PANCRE\\u00c1TICA, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE ENTRE LA COLA Y LA PUNTA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LAS CARGAS VIRALES QUE SE MANIFIESTAN F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO CRECIMIENTOS VERRUGOSOS EN LA PIEL. EL P\\u00c1NCREAS JUEGA UN PAPEL VITAL EN EL EQUILIBRIO ENZIM\\u00c1TICO Y HORMONAL; CUANDO UN VIRUS INTERFIERE CON ESTE CIRCUITO, PUEDE ALTERAR LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA MANTENER EL TEJIDO DERMAL LIMPIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL, PROMOVIENDO LA REGRESI\\u00d3N NATURAL DE LAS VERRUGAS Y RESTAURANDO LA SINERGIA PANCRE\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: IF WARTS ARE PERSISTENT OR SPREADING, SCAN THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO RULE OUT PAPILLOMAVIRUS (HPV). FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE DYSFUNCTION OR GLUCOSE FLUCTUATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PANCREAS \\/ PANCREAS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: SI LAS VERRUGAS SON PERSISTENTES O SE EXTIENDEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA] PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA (VPH). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA O FLUCTUACIONES DE GLUCOSA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ P\\u00c1NCREAS]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/760','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:47:14','2026-04-28 18:47:14'),(4536,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',761,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DEMENTIA AND SENILE (DEMENCIA Y SENILIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DEMENTIA AND SENILITY (DEMENCIA Y SENILIDAD)\",\"symptoms\":\"MEMORY LOSS, CONFUSION, COGNITIVE DECLINE, DISORIENTATION, AND EMOTIONAL DETACHMENT.\\n\\n(P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, DETERIORO COGNITIVO, DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N Y DESAPEGO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE NEUROLOGICAL AND PSYCHOLOGICAL SYMPTOMS ASSOCIATED WITH AGING AND COGNITIVE DEGENERATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID MUSCLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING THE EMOTIONAL AND MENTAL \\\"FOG\\\" THAT OFTEN ACCOMPANIES DEMENTIA OR SENILITY. THE LEFT TEMPORAL AREA IS VITAL FOR LANGUAGE AND MEMORY PROCESSING, WHILE THE CONNECTION TO THE NECK MUSCLE REFLECTS THE PHYSICAL TENSION AND CIRCULATORY COMPROMISE OFTEN FOUND IN THOSE EXPERIENCING COGNITIVE DECLINE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BRAIN IN IMPROVING MENTAL CLARITY, ENHANCING RECALL, AND PROVIDING EMOTIONAL SUPPORT FOR THE FRUSTRATION AND FEAR ASSOCIATED WITH MEMORY LOSS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS Y PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS ASOCIADOS CON EL ENVEJECIMIENTO Y LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL IZQUIERDO Y EL M\\u00daSCULO ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR LA \\\"NIEBLA\\\" EMOCIONAL Y MENTAL QUE A MENUDO ACOMPA\\u00d1A A LA DEMENCIA O SENILIDAD. EL \\u00c1REA TEMPORAL IZQUIERDA ES VITAL PARA EL PROCESAMIENTO DEL LENGUAJE Y LA MEMORIA, MIENTRAS QUE LA CONEXI\\u00d3N CON EL M\\u00daSCULO DEL CUELLO REFLEJA LA TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA Y EL COMPROMISO CIRCULATORIO QUE SE ENCUENTRA FRECUENTEMENTE EN QUIENES EXPERIMENTAN DETERIORO COGNITIVO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CEREBRO A MEJORAR LA CLARIDAD MENTAL, FOMENTAR LA MEMORIA Y BRINDAR APOYO EMOCIONAL ANTE LA FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N Y EL MIEDO ASOCIADOS CON LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE CHECK: IF MEMORY LOSS IS PROGRESSIVE, SCAN THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS TO IMPROVE SENSORY INTEGRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CONFUSION OR AGGRESSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE TO BALANCE EMOTIONAL RESPONSES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE COGNITIVE STABILIZATION PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA: SI LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA ES PROGRESIVA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] PARA MEJORAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONFUSI\\u00d3N SEVERA O AGRESI\\u00d3N, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA EQUILIBRAR LAS RESPUESTAS EMOCIONALES. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DE ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/761','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:48:22','2026-04-28 18:48:22'),(4537,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',762,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD & CARDIAC RESONANCE (SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL Y RESONANCIA CARD\\u00cdACA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, PALPITATIONS LINKED TO STRESS, FEELINGS OF OPPRESSION, AND DIFFICULTY PROCESSING DEEP EMOTIONS.\\n\\n(INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, PALPITACIONES VINCULADAS AL ESTR\\u00c9S, SENTIMIENTOS DE OPRESI\\u00d3N Y DIFICULTAD PARA PROCESAR EMOCIONES PROFUNDAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE INTRICATE CONNECTION BETWEEN COGNITIVE INTERPRETATION AND EMOTIONAL RESPONSE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE RIGHT TEMPORAL AREA IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH NON-VERBAL PROCESSING AND EMOTIONAL INTUITION. WHEN LINKED TO THE HEART, THIS AXIS HELPS STABILIZE THE \\\"EMOTIONAL BRAIN,\\\" RELEASING TENSION ACCUMULATED FROM CHRONIC STRESS OR ACUTE EMOTIONAL SHOCKS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN HARMONIZING HEART RATE VARIABILITY AND CLEARING THE ENERGETIC PATHWAY BETWEEN THOUGHT AND FEELING, PROMOTING A DEEP SENSE OF PEACE AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA INTRINCADA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA INTERPRETACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA Y LA RESPUESTA EMOCIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL \\u00c1REA TEMPORAL DERECHA SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON EL PROCESAMIENTO NO VERBAL Y LA INTUICI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL. CUANDO SE VINCULA CON EL CORAZ\\u00d3N, ESTE EJE AYUDA A ESTABILIZAR EL \\\"CEREBRO EMOCIONAL\\\", LIBERANDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N ACUMULADA POR ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO O CHOQUES EMOCIONALES AGUDOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A ARMONIZAR LA VARIABILIDAD DE LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y A LIMPIAR LA V\\u00cdA ENERG\\u00c9TICA ENTRE EL PENSAMIENTO Y EL SENTIMIENTO, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N PROFUNDA DE PAZ Y EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF FEELINGS OF ANGUISH PERSIST, SCAN THE [SUPRA SENSOR \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] (REF 751) AXIS. FOR PHYSICAL HEART DISCOMFORT WITHOUT EMOTIONAL TRIGGERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN REGULATING THE BODY\'S RESPONSE TO EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LOS SENTIMIENTOS DE ANGUSTIA PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SUPRASENSORIAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 751). PARA MALESTAR F\\u00cdSICO EN EL CORAZ\\u00d3N SIN DETONANTES EMOCIONALES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA RESPUESTA DEL CUERPO AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/762','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:49:36','2026-04-28 18:49:36'),(4538,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',763,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GOATS VIRUS (VIRUS DE LAS CABRAS)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIZZINESS, TINNITUS (RINGING IN THE EARS), VERTIGO, HEARING LOSS, AND POTENTIAL COGNITIVE CONFUSION.\\n\\n(MAREOS, TINNITUS (ZUMBIDO EN LOS O\\u00cdDOS), V\\u00c9RTIGO, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE AUDICI\\u00d3N Y POSIBLE CONFUSI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE \\\"GOATS VIRUS\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TEMPLE (TEMPORAL LOBE) AND THE EAR. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS THAT IMPACT THE VESTIBULAR SYSTEM AND AUDITORY NERVE. THE TEMPORAL LOBE PROCESSES SENSORY INPUT, WHILE THE EAR HOUSES THE MECHANISMS FOR BOTH HEARING AND BALANCE. WHEN THIS VIRUS INTERFERES WITH THIS CIRCUIT, IT OFTEN MANIFESTS AS SIGNIFICANT DIZZINESS OR V\\u00c9RTIGO, SOMETIMES ACCOMPANIED BY PERSISTENT RINGING IN THE EARS. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, CLEARING THE AUDITORY PATHWAY, AND RESTORING EQUILIBRIUM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL \\\"VIRUS DE LAS CABRAS\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA SIEN (L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL) Y EL O\\u00cdDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE IMPACTAN EL SISTEMA VESTIBULAR Y EL NERVIO AUDITIVO. EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL PROCESA LA ENTRADA SENSORIAL, MIENTRAS QUE EL O\\u00cdDO ALBERGA LOS MECANISMOS TANTO PARA LA AUDICI\\u00d3N COMO PARA EL EQUILIBRIO. CUANDO ESTE VIRUS INTERFIERE CON ESTE CIRCUITO, A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO MAREOS SIGNIFICATIVOS O V\\u00c9RTIGO, A VECES ACOMPA\\u00d1ADOS POR UN ZUMBIDO PERSISTENTE EN LOS O\\u00cdDOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, LIMPIAR LA V\\u00cdA AUDITIVA Y RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: IF VERTIGO OR TINNITUS PERSIST, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS TO RULE OUT OTHER PATHOGENS AFFECTING THE INNER EAR. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MEMORY OR COGNITIVE ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPLE \\/ STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID] (REF 760) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: SI EL V\\u00c9RTIGO O EL TINNITUS PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES] PARA DESCARTAR OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTEN EL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS DE MEMORIA O COGNITIVOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO] (REF 760). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/763','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:50:53','2026-04-28 18:50:53'),(4539,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',764,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, HEADACHES, DIZZINESS, AND SENSATIONS OF FULLNESS IN THE HEAD.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, DOLORES DE CABEZA, MAREOS Y SENSACIONES DE PLENITUD EN LA CABEZA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE REGULATION OF BLOOD PRESSURE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TEMPLE (TEMPORAL LOBE) AND THE JUGULAR VEIN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING HYPERTENSION CAUSED BY VASCULAR IMBALANCE OR IMPROPER DRAINAGE. THE TEMPORAL AREA IS CLOSELY LINKED TO THE VASCULAR CENTERS OF THE BRAIN, WHILE THE JUGULAR VEIN IS THE PRIMARY PATHWAY FOR VENOUS DRAINAGE FROM THE SKULL. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS DYSFUNCTIONAL, IT CAN LEAD TO INCREASED INTRACRANIAL PRESSURE AND SYSTEMIC HYPERTENSION. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN NORMALIZING BLOOD FLOW, REDUCING VASCULAR TENSION, AND RESTORING PROPER CIRCULATORY BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL SE DIRIGE A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA SIEN (L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL) Y LA VENA YUGULAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N CAUSADA POR UN DESEQUILIBRIO VASCULAR O UN DRENAJE INADECUADO. EL \\u00c1REA TEMPORAL EST\\u00c1 ESTRECHAMENTE VINCULADA A LOS CENTROS VASCULARES DEL CEREBRO, MIENTRAS QUE LA VENA YUGULAR ES LA V\\u00cdA PRINCIPAL PARA EL DRENAJE VENOSO DEL CR\\u00c1NEO. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO ES DISFUNCIONAL, PUEDE PROVOCAR UN AUMENTO DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N INTRACRANEAL E HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A NORMALIZAR EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO, REDUCIENDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y RESTAURANDO UN EQUILIBRIO CIRCULATORIO ADECUADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE PERSISTS, SCAN THE [TEMPLE \\/ KIDNEY] (REF 764) AXIS TO ADDRESS RENAL-DRIVEN HYPERTENSION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HEADACHES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SUPRA PECTORAL \\/ PITUITARY] (REF 752) RESONANCE TO REGULATE INTRACRANIAL PRESSURE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE BODY\'S OVERALL FLUID AND PRESSURE REGULATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 764) PARA ABORDAR LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N DE ORIGEN RENAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [SUPRAPECTORAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 752) PARA REGULAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N INTRACRANEAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y PRESI\\u00d3N DEL CUERPO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/764','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:52:51','2026-04-28 18:52:51'),(4540,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',765,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RENAL-VASCULAR REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N RENAL-VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE), HEADACHES, AND POTENTIAL FLUID RETENTION.\\n\\n(HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA), DOLORES DE CABEZA Y POSIBLE RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE SPECIFICALLY TARGETS HYPERTENSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TEMPLE (TEMPORAL LOBE) AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING BLOOD PRESSURE ISSUES THAT HAVE A RENAL COMPONENT. THE TEMPORAL AREA CONTAINS VASCULAR REGULATION CENTERS, WHILE THE KIDNEYS ARE RESPONSIBLE FOR MANAGING BLOOD VOLUME AND FILTRATION. WHEN THE COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THESE TWO POINTS IS DISRUPTED, IT CAN RESULT IN SUSTAINED HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN BALANCING ARTERIAL TENSION, IMPROVING RENAL FILTRATION, AND RELIEVING THE SYSTEMIC STRESS ASSOCIATED WITH HYPERTENSION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE DIRIGE ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE A LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA SIEN (L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL) Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PROBLEMAS DE PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL QUE TIENEN UN COMPONENTE RENAL. EL \\u00c1REA TEMPORAL CONTIENE CENTROS DE REGULACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR, MIENTRAS QUE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES SON RESPONSABLES DE MANEJAR EL VOLUMEN SANGU\\u00cdNEO Y LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N. CUANDO LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE ESTOS DOS PUNTOS SE INTERRUMPE, PUEDE RESULTAR EN UNA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA SOSTENIDA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EQUILIBRAR LA TENSI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL, MEJORANDO LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y ALIVIANDO EL ESTR\\u00c9S SIST\\u00c9MICO ASOCIADO CON LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION PERSISTS WITHOUT A RENAL TRIGGER, SCAN THE [TEMPLE \\/ JUGULAR] (REF 763) AXIS TO ADDRESS POTENTIAL DRAINAGE ISSUES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EDEMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THORACIC DUCT \\/ LEFT SUBCLAVIAN] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE OVERALL REGULATION OF FLUIDS AND PRESSURE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N PERSISTE SIN UN DETONANTE RENAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ YUGULAR] (REF 763) PARA ABORDAR POSIBLES PROBLEMAS DE DRENAJE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN EDEMA SEVERO, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CONDUCTO TOR\\u00c1CICO \\/ SUBCLAVIA IZQUIERDA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y PRESI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/765','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:54:17','2026-04-28 18:54:17'),(4541,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',766,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEURO-VASCULAR HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N NEUROVASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, DIZZINESS, HEADACHE, AND POTENTIAL ALTERATION OF HEART OR RESPIRATORY RHYTHM.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, MAREOS, DOLOR DE CABEZA Y POSIBLE ALTERACI\\u00d3N DEL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO O RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON NEURO-VASCULAR REGULATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TEMPLE (TEMPORAL LOBE) AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS VITALLY IMPORTANT AS THE RACHIDIAN BULB CONTAINS THE AUTONOMIC CONTROL CENTERS FOR CARDIAC AND RESPIRATORY FUNCTION, AS WELL AS BLOOD PRESSURE REGULATION. WHEN THERE IS A DYSFUNCTION IN THIS COMMUNICATION, THE BODY MAY MAINTAIN HYPERTENSION LEVELS THAT DO NOT RESPOND TO OTHER TREATMENTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN NORMALIZING VASCULAR SIGNALS, REDUCING ARTERIAL TENSION, AND IMPROVING OVERALL HOMEOSTATIC STABILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N NEUROVASCULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA SIEN (L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL) Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES DE VITAL IMPORTANCIA YA QUE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO CONTIENE LOS CENTROS DE CONTROL AUT\\u00d3NOMO PARA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N CARD\\u00cdACA Y RESPIRATORIA, AS\\u00cd COMO LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL. CUANDO EXISTE UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N EN ESTA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N, EL CUERPO PUEDE MANTENER NIVELES DE HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N QUE NO RESPONDEN A OTROS TRATAMIENTOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL A NORMALIZAR LAS SE\\u00d1ALES VASCULARES, REDUCIENDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL Y MEJORANDO LA ESTABILIDAD HOMEOST\\u00c1TICA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION PERSISTS WITH A RENAL COMPONENT, SCAN THE TEMPLE \\/ KIDNEY (REF 764) AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE THE ORIGIN IS POOR DRAINAGE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPLE \\/ JUGULAR (REF 763) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT FLUID BALANCE DURING PRESSURE REGULATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N PERSISTE CON UN COMPONENTE RENAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 764). PARA CASOS DONDE EL ORIGEN SEA UN DRENAJE DEFICIENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ YUGULAR] (REF 763). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS DURANTE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/766','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:55:59','2026-04-28 18:55:59'),(4542,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',767,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ADRENAL-VASCULAR IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO ADRENAL-VASCULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE (HYPERTENSION).\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N).)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC HYPERTENSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TEMPLE (TEMPORAL LOBE) AND THE SUPRARENAL (ADRENAL) GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING BLOOD PRESSURE ISSUES DRIVEN BY AN OVERACTIVE OR MISREGULATED ADRENAL SYSTEM. THE TEMPORAL AREA REGULATES VASCULAR SIGNALS, WHILE THE SUPRARENAL GLANDS PRODUCE HORMONES LIKE ADRENALINE AND CORTISOL THAT DIRECTLY INFLUENCE ARTERIAL CONSTRICTION AND BLOOD VOLUME. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN LOWERING STRESS-INDUCED HYPERTENSION, BALANCING HORMONE OUTPUT, AND RESTORING CALM TO THE VASCULAR NETWORK.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA SIEN (L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL) Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MANEJAR PROBLEMAS DE PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL IMPULSADOS POR UN SISTEMA ADRENAL SOBREACTIVO O MAL REGULADO. EL \\u00c1REA TEMPORAL REGULA LAS SE\\u00d1ALES VASCULARES, MIENTRAS QUE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES PRODUCEN HORMONAS COMO LA ADRENALINA Y EL CORTISOL QUE INFLUYEN DIRECTAMENTE EN LA CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL Y EL VOLUMEN SANGU\\u00cdNEO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N INDUCIDA POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S, EQUILIBRAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL Y RESTAURAR LA CALMA EN LA RED VASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VASCULAR CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION IS LINKED TO RENAL FILTRATION ISSUES, SCAN THE TEMPLE \\/ KIDNEY (REF 764) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING AUTONOMIC DYSREGULATION OF THE HEART RATE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPLE \\/ RACHIDIAN BULB (REF 765) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN MANAGING SYSTEMIC FLUID BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A PROBLEMAS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 764). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISREULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA DE LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] (REF 765). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL MANEJO DEL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/767','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:57:24','2026-04-28 18:57:24'),(4543,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',768,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"LACK OF ATTENTION (FALTA DE ATENCI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":\"CEREBRAL MICROCIRCULATION, MIGRAINE SYNDROMES, PULMONARY TUBERCULOSIS, LUNG BROQUIOCTASIAS, EMPHYSEMA, HYPERTENSION. IMPROVES BLOODFLOW TO THE LUNG, BRAIN, MICROCIRCULATION, AND VASCULAR SYSTEM. (MICROCIRCULACI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL, S\\u00cdNDROMES MIGRA\\u00d1OSOS, TUBERCULOSIS PULMONAR, BRONQUIECTASIAS PULMONARES, ENFISEMA, HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N. MEJORA EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO A LOS PULMONES, CEREBRO, MICROCIRCULACI\\u00d3N Y SISTEMA VASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - KIDNEY    CHECK - SCAPULA   CHECK - RESERVOIRS OF LEPRAE. (CHECAR - RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N    CHECAR - ESC\\u00c1PULA    CHECAR - RESERVORIOS DE LEPRA.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"VASCULAR & CEREBRAL FLOW (FLUJO VASCULAR Y CEREBRAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"LACK OF ATTENTION, MIGRAINES, PULMONARY ISSUES (TUBERCULOSIS, EMPHYSEMA, BRONCHIECTASIS), AND HYPERTENSION.\\n\\n(FALTA DE ATENCI\\u00d3N, MIGRA\\u00d1AS, PROBLEMAS PULMONARES (TUBERCULOSIS, ENFISEMA, BRONQUIECTASIA) E HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON ENHANCING CEREBRAL MICROCIRCULATION AND SYSTEMIC VASCULAR FLOW BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN BOTH TEMPLES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR IMPROVING OXYGENATION AND BLOOD FLOW NOT ONLY TO THE BRAIN\\u2014WHICH HELPS RESOLVE LACK OF ATTENTION AND MIGRAINE SYNDROMES\\u2014BUT ALSO TO THE PULMONARY SYSTEM. IT IS HIGHLY EFFECTIVE IN SUPPORTING THE TREATMENT OF COMPLEX LUNG CONDITIONS SUCH AS EMPHYSEMA AND BRONCHIECTASIS BY OPTIMIZING THE VASCULAR RESPONSE. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN BALANCING ARTERIAL PRESSURE AND RESTORING COGNITIVE SHARPNESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN MEJORAR LA MICROCIRCULACI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL Y EL FLUJO VASCULAR SIST\\u00c9MICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE AMBAS SIENES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MEJORAR LA OXIGENACI\\u00d3N Y EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO NO SOLO AL CEREBRO \\u2014LO QUE AYUDA A RESOLVER LA FALTA DE ATENCI\\u00d3N Y LOS S\\u00cdNDROMES MIGRA\\u00d1OSOS\\u2014 SINO TAMBI\\u00c9N AL SISTEMA PULMONAR. ES ALTAMENTE EFICAZ PARA APOYAR EL TRATAMIENTO DE CONDICIONES PULMONARES COMPLEJAS COMO EL ENFISEMA Y LA BRONQUIECTASIA AL OPTIMIZAR LA RESPUESTA VASCULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EQUILIBRAR LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL Y RESTAURAR LA AGUDEZA COGNITIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF PULMONARY SYMPTOMS ARE SEVERE, SCAN THE [SCAPULA \\/ SCAPULA] AXIS TO RULE OUT MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE RESERVOIRS. FOR PERSISTENT HYPERTENSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE RENAL STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO SUPPORT SYSTEMIC PH BALANCE AND FACILITATE THE IMPROVEMENT OF MICROCIRCULATION THROUGHOUT THE VASCULAR SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PULMONARES SON SEVEROS, ESCANEAR EL EJE [ESC\\u00c1PULA \\/ ESC\\u00c1PULA] PARA DESCARTAR RESERVORIOS DE MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. PARA LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD RENAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA APOYAR EL EQUILIBRIO DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA MEJORA DE LA MICROCIRCULACI\\u00d3N EN TODO EL SISTEMA VASCULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/768','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 18:59:36','2026-04-28 18:59:36'),(4544,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',769,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND HAIRLOSS PROBLEMS, CENTAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, DEGENERATIVE DISEASE. (PROBLEMAS DE LA PIEL Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, ENFERMEDAD DEGENERATIVA)\",\"paths\":\"AQUIED FROM THE ACCUMULATION OF THE VACCINE RESIDUE. WANG PRION DISEASE. ALTERATION OF THE PRODUCTION OF CD3, CD4, CD8. (ADQUIRIDO POR LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE RESIDUOS DE VACUNAS. ENFERMEDAD DE PRI\\u00d3N DE WANG. ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE CD3, CD4, CD8.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMMUNE & DEGENERATIVE REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNE Y DEGENERATIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SKIN AND HAIR LOSS PROBLEMS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, AND DEGENERATIVE DISEASE.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE LA PIEL Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y ENFERMEDAD DEGENERATIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES COMPLEX DEGENERATIVE PROCESSES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE CARDIA (THE UPPER OPENING OF THE STOMACH). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS INCREASINGLY RECOGNIZED FOR ITS ROLE IN CLEARING SYSTEMIC IMBALANCES ACQUIRED FROM THE ACCUMULATION OF EXTERNAL RESIDUES, SUCH AS THOSE FROM VACCINES OR OTHER TOXIC LOADS. IT IS SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE WANG PRION DISEASE AND DISTURBANCES IN THE PRODUCTION OF ESSENTIAL IMMUNE CELLS, INCLUDING CD3, CD4, AND CD8 T-LYMPHOCYTES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RESTORING IMMUNE FUNCTION, PROTECTING THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM FROM DEGENERATION, AND PROMOTING THE REGENERATION OF DERMAL TISSUE AND HAIR.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA PROCESOS DEGENERATIVOS COMPLEJOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL IZQUIERDO Y EL CARDIAS (LA ENTRADA SUPERIOR DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CADA VEZ M\\u00c1S RECONOCIDO POR SU PAPEL EN LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE DESEQUILIBRIOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS ADQUIRIDOS POR LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE RESIDUOS EXTERNOS, COMO LOS DE LAS VACUNAS U OTRAS CARGAS T\\u00d3XICAS. EST\\u00c1 ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE ASOCIADO CON LA ENFERMEDAD DE PRI\\u00d3N DE WANG Y ALTERACIONES EN LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c9LULAS INMUNITARIAS ESENCIALES, INCLUYENDO LOS LINFOCITOS T CD3, CD4 Y CD8. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESTAURAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA, PROTEGIENDO AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DE LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N Y PROMOVIENDO LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO DERMAL Y EL CABELLO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE CHECK: IF IMMUNE DYSFUNCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] AXIS TO SUPPORT T-CELL MATURATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPLE \\/ STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID] (REF 760) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF ACCUMULATED TOXIC RESIDUES DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNE: SI LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA PERSISTE, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TIMO \\/ TIMO] PARA APOYAR LA MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS T. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS SEVEROS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO] (REF 760). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE RESIDUOS T\\u00d3XICOS ACUMULADOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/769','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:10:30','2026-04-28 19:10:30'),(4545,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',770,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EXCESSIVE, COHERENT (EXCESIVO, COHERENTE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COGNITIVE COHERENCE (COHERENCIA COGNITIVA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE THOUGHTS, LACK OF MENTAL CLARITY, DIFFICULTY IN DECISION-MAKING, AND RUMINATION.\\n\\n(PENSAMIENTOS EXCESIVOS, FALTA DE CLARIDAD MENTAL, DIFICULTAD EN LA TOMA DE DECISIONES Y RUMIACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES MENTAL OVERLOAD BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE FRONTAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR HARMONIZING THE BRAIN\'S COMMUNICATION BETWEEN SENSORY DATA PROCESSING (TEMPORAL) AND EXECUTIVE FUNCTION (FRONTAL). WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS IMBALANCED, THE INDIVIDUAL MAY EXPERIENCE AN \\\"EXCESSIVE, COHERENT\\\" INTERNAL DIALOGUE\\u2014A STATE WHERE THOUGHTS ARE LOGICAL BUT CONSTANT AND OVERWHELMING, LEADING TO MENTAL FATIGUE. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BRAIN IN ACHIEVING BETTER FOCUS, REDUCING UNNECESSARY COGNITIVE NOISE, AND RESTORING A SENSE OF MENTAL CALM AND COHERENCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA SOBRECARGA MENTAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL IZQUIERDO Y EL L\\u00d3BULO FRONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ARMONIZAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL ENTRE EL PROCESAMIENTO DE DATOS SENSORIALES (TEMPORAL) Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N EJECUTIVA (FRONTAL). CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 DESEQUILIBRADO, EL INDIVIDUO PUEDE EXPERIMENTAR UN DI\\u00c1LOGO INTERNO \\\"EXCESIVO Y COHERENTE\\\", UN ESTADO DONDE LOS PENSAMIENTOS SON L\\u00d3GICOS PERO CONSTANTES Y ABRUMADORES, LO QUE LLEVA A LA FATIGA MENTAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CEREBRO A LOGRAR UN MEJOR ENFOQUE, REDUCIENDO EL RUIDO COGNITIVO INNECESARIO Y RESTAURANDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA MENTAL Y COHERENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE CHECK: IF MENTAL OVERLOAD IS ACCOMPANIED BY ANXIETY, SCAN THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] AXIS TO CALM THE EMOTIONAL CENTER. FOR PERSISTENT LACK OF ATTENTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE BILATERAL [TEMPLE \\/ TEMPLE] (REF 767) RESONANCE TO ENHANCE CEREBRAL BLOOD FLOW. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN MANAGING COGNITIVE LOAD DURING THE REBALANCING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA: SI LA SOBRECARGA MENTAL SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE ANSIEDAD, ESCANEAR EL EJE [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] PARA CALMAR EL CENTRO EMOCIONAL. PARA LA FALTA DE ATENCI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA BILATERAL [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 767) PARA MEJORAR EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO CEREBRAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL EN EL MANEJO DE LA CARGA COGNITIVA DURANTE EL PROCESO DE REEQUILIBRIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/770','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:11:48','2026-04-28 19:11:48'),(4546,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',771,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AMNESIA\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MEMORY RECOVERY (RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA MEMORIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"AMNESIA, SHORT-TERM MEMORY LOSS, DISORIENTATION, AND DIFFICULTY FORMING NEW MEMORIES.\\n\\n(AMNESIA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA A CORTO PLAZO, DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N Y DIFICULTAD PARA FORMAR NUEVOS RECUERDOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES MEMORY DYSFUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE HIPPOCAMPUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE HIPPOCAMPUS IS THE PRIMARY ARCHITECT OF MEMORY CONSOLIDATION AND SPATIAL NAVIGATION, WHILE THE LEFT TEMPORAL LOBE IS INTEGRAL TO LANGUAGE AND SYMBOLIC RECOGNITION. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS INTERRUPTED BY EMOTIONAL TRAUMA OR BIOLOGICAL STRESS, IT CAN MANIFEST AS AMNESIA OR A \\\"LOST\\\" SENSATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BRAIN IN RE-ESTABLISHING THE PATHWAYS NECESSARY FOR RETRIEVING STORED INFORMATION AND PROCESSING NEW EXPERIENCES, HELPING THE INDIVIDUAL REGAIN COGNITIVE CONTINUITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA MEMORIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL IZQUIERDO Y EL HIPOCAMPO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL HIPOCAMPO ES EL ARQUITECTO PRINCIPAL DE LA CONSOLIDACI\\u00d3N DE LA MEMORIA Y LA NAVEGACI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL, MIENTRAS QUE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL IZQUIERDO ES INTEGRAL PARA EL LENGUAJE Y EL RECONOCIMIENTO SIMB\\u00d3LICO. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO SE INTERRUMPE POR TRAUMA EMOCIONAL O ESTR\\u00c9S BIOL\\u00d3GICO, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO AMNESIA O UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ESTAR \\\"PERDIDO\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CEREBRO A REESTABLECER LAS V\\u00cdAS NECESARIAS PARA RECUPERAR INFORMACI\\u00d3N ALMACENADA Y PROCESAR NUEVAS EXPERIENCIAS, AYUDANDO AL INDIVIDUO A RECUPERAR LA CONTINUIDAD COGNITIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE CHECK: IF MEMORY LOSS IS LINKED TO AGING OR SENILITY, SCAN THE [TEMPLE - L \\/ STERNOCLEIDOMASTOID] (REF 760) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CONFUSION OR MENTAL FOG, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL - L \\/ FRONTAL] (REF 769) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE INTEGRATION OF RECOVERED MEMORIES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA: SI LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE MEMORIA EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA AL ENVEJECIMIENTO O LA SENILIDAD, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL - IZQ \\/ ESTERNOCLEIDOMASTOIDEO] (REF 760). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONFUSI\\u00d3N SEVERA O NIEBLA MENTAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL - IZQ \\/ FRONTAL] (REF 769). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE LOS RECUERDOS RECUPERADOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/771','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:13:24','2026-04-28 19:13:24'),(4547,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',772,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OVER TALKS. (HABLA EN EXCESO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COMMUNICATION REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"OVER TALKS (LOGORRHEA), COMPULSIVE SPEECH, AND DIFFICULTY INHIBITING VERBAL OUTPUT.\\n\\n(HABLA EN EXCESO (LOGORREA), HABLA COMPULSIVA Y DIFICULTAD PARA INHIBIR LA SALIDA VERBAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES VERBAL COMPULSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE ROLANDO FISSURE (CENTRAL SULCUS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE \\\"URGE\\\" TO SPEAK WITHOUT FILTER OR RESTRAINT. THE LEFT TEMPORAL LOBE IS THE PRIMARY HUB FOR LANGUAGE PROCESSING AND SPEECH PRODUCTION, WHILE THE ROLANDO FISSURE SEPARATES THE MOTOR AND SENSORY CORTICES. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS OVERSTIMULATED, IT CAN LEAD TO \\\"LOGORRHEA\\\" OR OVER-TALKING, WHERE THE INDIVIDUAL FEELS AN UNCONTROLLABLE NEED TO COMMUNICATE CONSTANTLY. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BRAIN IN RESTORING VERBAL INHIBITION AND PROMOTING BALANCED, THOUGHTFUL COMMUNICATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA COMPULSI\\u00d3N VERBAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL IZQUIERDO Y LA CISURA DE ROLANDO (SURCO CENTRAL). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR EL \\\"IMPULSO\\\" DE HABLAR SIN FILTRO NI RESTRICCI\\u00d3N. EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL IZQUIERDO ES EL N\\u00daCLEO PRINCIPAL PARA EL PROCESAMIENTO DEL LENGUAJE Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DEL HABLA, MIENTRAS QUE LA CISURA DE ROLANDO SEPARA LAS CORTEZAS MOTORA Y SENSORIAL. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 SOBREESTIMULADO, PUEDE LLEVAR A LA \\\"LOGORREA\\\" O HABLA EXCESIVA, DONDE EL INDIVIDUO SIENTE UNA NECESIDAD INCONTROLABLE DE COMUNICARSE CONSTANTEMENTE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CEREBRO A RESTAURAR LA INHIBICI\\u00d3N VERBAL Y FOMENTAR UNA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N EQUILIBRADA Y REFLEXIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE CHECK: IF OVER-TALKING IS ACCOMPANIED BY EXCESSIVE OR RUMINATING THOUGHTS, SCAN THE [TEMPORAL - L \\/ FRONTAL] (REF 769) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIFFICULTY IN ARTICULATING WORDS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BROCA\'S AREA \\/ BROCA\'S AREA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE REBALANCING OF COMMUNICATIVE DRIVES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA: SI EL HABLA EXCESIVA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE PENSAMIENTOS EXCESIVOS O RUMIANTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL - IZQ \\/ FRONTAL] (REF 769). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIFICULTAD PARA ARTICULAR PALABRAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [\\u00c1REA DE BROCA \\/ \\u00c1REA DE BROCA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE EL REEQUILIBRIO DE LOS IMPULSOS COMUNICATIVOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/772','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:14:47','2026-04-28 19:14:47'),(4548,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',773,'{\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL AND PSYCHOLOGICAL PROBLEMS, NERVOUSNESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, DIZZINESS, FEVER, INSOMNIA, AGGRESSIVENESS. (PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS Y PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS, NERVIOSISMO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, MAREOS, FIEBRE, INSOMNIO, AGRESIVIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"CENTAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, BALANCE AND HEARING DISORDERS, VERTIGO. EATING DISORDERS, BULIMIA, ANOREXIA, OVER EATING. (TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, TRASTORNOS DEL EQUILIBRIO Y LA AUDICI\\u00d3N, V\\u00c9RTIGO. TRASTORNOS ALIMENTARIOS, BULIMIA, ANOREXIA, SOBREINGESTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL AND PSYCHOLOGICAL PROBLEMS, NERVOUSNESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, DIZZINESS, FEVER, INSOMNIA, AND AGGRESSIVENESS.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS Y PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS, NERVIOSISMO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, MAREOS, FIEBRE, INSOMNIO Y AGRESIVIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE POLYOMA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE LEFT TEMPORAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS UNILATERAL AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING DISORDERS OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM THAT MANIFEST AS BOTH COGNITIVE AND BEHAVIORAL TURMOIL. THE VIRAL IMPACT ON THIS AREA CAN LEAD TO SIGNIFICANT VERTIGO, BALANCE ISSUES, AND HEARING DISORDERS. FURTHERMORE, THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY MONITORED IN CASES INVOLVING EATING DISORDERS SUCH AS BULIMIA, ANOREXIA, OR COMPULSIVE OVER-EATING, AS THE VIRUS INTERFERES WITH THE BRAIN\'S REGULATORY SIGNALS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING NEUROLOGICAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING EMOTIONAL AND METABOLIC STABILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL POLIOMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE UNILATERAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO AGITACI\\u00d3N TANTO COGNITIVA COMO CONDUCTUAL. EL IMPACTO VIRAL EN ESTA \\u00c1REA PUEDE PROVOCAR V\\u00c9RTIGO SIGNIFICATIVO, PROBLEMAS DE EQUILIBRIO Y TRASTORNOS DE LA AUDICI\\u00d3N. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE PAR SE MONITOREA FRECUENTEMENTE EN CASOS QUE INVOLUCRAN TRASTORNOS ALIMENTARIOS COMO BULIMIA, ANOREXIA O SOBREINGESTA COMPULSIVA, YA QUE EL VIRUS INTERFIERE CON LAS SE\\u00d1ALES REGULADORAS DEL CEREBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y RESTAURANDO LA ESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL Y METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF BALANCE DISORDERS OR VERTIGO PERSIST, SCAN THE TEMPLE \\/ EAR (REF 762) AXIS TO RULE OUT THE GOATS VIRUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE AGGRESSIVENESS OR EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [AMYGDALA \\/ AMYGDALA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE NEUROLOGICAL RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS TRASTORNOS DEL EQUILIBRIO O EL V\\u00c9RTIGO PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ O\\u00cdDO] (REF 762) PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DE LAS CABRAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN AGRESIVIDAD SEVERA O INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/773','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:50:51','2026-04-28 19:50:51'),(4549,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',774,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SADNESS (TRISTEZA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SADNESS (TRISTEZA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEELINGS OF MELANCHOLY, DEEP SADNESS, EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS, AND POTENTIAL CHEST TIGHTNESS OR PALPITATIONS LINKED TO GRIEF.\\n\\n(SENTIMIENTOS DE MELANCOL\\u00cdA, TRISTEZA PROFUNDA, PESADEZ EMOCIONAL Y POSIBLE OPRESI\\u00d3N EN EL PECHO O PALPITACIONES VINCULADAS AL DUELO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PROFOUND STATE OF SADNESS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE RIGHT TEMPORAL AREA IS INVOLVED IN PROCESSING NON-VERBAL EMOTIONAL CUES AND INTUITIVE FEELINGS, WHILE THE HEART IS THE CENTER OF EMOTIONAL EXPRESSION AND VITALITY. WHEN THESE TWO POINTS ARE OUT OF SYNC, THE INDIVIDUAL MAY FEEL OVERWHELMED BY GRIEF OR LONG-TERM SADNESS THAT IMPACTS THEIR PHYSICAL WELL-BEING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RELEASING STORED EMOTIONAL WEIGHT, HARMONIZING CARDIAC RHYTHM IN RELATION TO EMOTIONAL STRESS, AND FOSTERING A SENSE OF EMOTIONAL RESILIENCE AND RENEWED HOPE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL ESTADO PROFUNDO DE TRISTEZA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL \\u00c1REA TEMPORAL DERECHA PARTICIPA EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE SE\\u00d1ALES EMOCIONALES NO VERBALES Y SENTIMIENTOS INTUITIVOS, MIENTRAS QUE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N ES EL CENTRO DE LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL Y LA VITALIDAD. CUANDO ESTOS DOS PUNTOS EST\\u00c1N DESEQUILIBRADOS, EL INDIVIDUO PUEDE SENTIRSE ABRUMADO POR EL DUELO O UNA TRISTEZA PROLONGADA QUE AFECTA SU BIENESTAR F\\u00cdSICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A LIBERAR EL PESO EMOCIONAL ACUMULADO, ARMONIZANDO EL RITMO CARD\\u00cdACO EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL Y FOMENTANDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE RESILIENCIA EMOCIONAL Y ESPERANZA RENOVADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF SADNESS IS ACCOMPANIED BY ANGUISH OR PANIC, SCAN THE [SUPRA SENSOR \\/ HYPOPHYSIS] (REF 751) AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL DISTRESS IMPACTS MENTAL CLARITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TEMPORAL - L \\/ HEART] (REF 761) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS IN MANAGING THE BODY\'S RESPONSE TO PROLONGED EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA TRISTEZA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE ANGUSTIA O P\\u00c1NICO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SUPRASENSORIAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 751). PARA CASOS DONDE EL MALESTAR EMOCIONAL AFECTE LA CLARIDAD MENTAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL - IZQ \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 761). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN EL MANEJO DE LA RESPUESTA DEL CUERPO AL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL PROLONGADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/774','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:53:56','2026-04-28 19:53:56'),(4550,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',775,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EXPANDED VIEW OF THE 3RD EYE. (VISTA EXPANDIDA DEL TERCER OJO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"EXPANDED PERCEPTION (PERCEPCI\\u00d3N EXPANDIDA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MENTAL BLOCKAGE, LIMITED PERSPECTIVE, DIFFICULTY WITH INTUITION, AND LACK OF SPIRITUAL OR EMOTIONAL CLARITY.\\n\\n(BLOQUEO MENTAL, PERSPECTIVA LIMITADA, DIFICULTAD CON LA INTUICI\\u00d3N Y FALTA DE CLARIDAD ESPIRITUAL O EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON THE ENHANCEMENT OF INTUITIVE AND COGNITIVE DEPTH BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS REFERRED TO AS THE \\\"EXPANDED VIEW OF THE 3RD EYE.\\\" THE RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE IS ASSOCIATED WITH NON-VERBAL, SPATIAL, AND INTUITIVE PROCESSING, WHILE THE HYPOPHYSIS ACTS AS THE MASTER REGULATOR OF THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM AND IS ENERGETICALLY LINKED TO HIGHER PERCEPTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN OPENING MENTAL PATHWAYS FOR GREATER INSIGHT, HARMONIZING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN LOGICAL THOUGHT AND INTUITIVE VISION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL SE CENTRA EN LA MEJORA DE LA PROFUNDIDAD INTUITIVA Y COGNITIVA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE CONOCE COMO LA \\\"VISTA EXPANDIDA DEL TERCER OJO\\\". EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO CON EL PROCESAMIENTO NO VERBAL, ESPACIAL E INTUITIVO, MIENTRAS QUE LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS ACT\\u00daA COMO EL REGULADOR MAESTRO DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO Y EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE CON LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SUPERIOR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A ABRIR V\\u00cdAS MENTALES PARA UNA MAYOR COMPRENSI\\u00d3N, ARMONIZANDO LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL PENSAMIENTO L\\u00d3GICO Y LA VISI\\u00d3N INTUITIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PERCEPTION CHECK: IF LACK OF CLARITY IS ACCOMPANIED BY ANXIETY, SCAN THE SUPRA SENSOR \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (REF 751) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP EMOTIONAL HEAVINESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPORAL - R \\/ HEART (REF 773) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM DURING THE EXPANSION OF COGNITIVE AND INTUITIVE STATES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PERCEPCI\\u00d3N: SI LA FALTA DE CLARIDAD SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE ANSIEDAD, ESCANEAR EL EJE [SUPRASENSORIAL \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 751). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA PESADEZ EMOCIONAL PROFUNDA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL - DER \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 773). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO DURANTE LA EXPANSI\\u00d3N DE LOS ESTADOS COGNITIVOS E INTUITIVOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/775','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:55:10','2026-04-28 19:55:10'),(4551,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',776,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, MIGRAINES, FEVER, IRRABILITY, NERVOUSNESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, DEPRESSION. (DOLOR DE CABEZA, MIGRA\\u00d1AS, FIEBRE, IRRITABILIDAD, NERVIOSISMO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, DEPRESI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"MAIN CAUSE OF INSOMNIA. NEUROLOGICAL AND PSYCHOLOGICAL DISORDERS. EATING DISORDER. (CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE INSOMNIO. TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS Y PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS. TRASTORNO ALIMENTARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, MIGRAINES, FEVER, IRRITABILITY, NERVOUSNESS, MENTAL CONFUSION, AND DEPRESSION.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE CABEZA, MIGRA\\u00d1AS, FIEBRE, IRRITABILIDAD, NERVIOSISMO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL Y DEPRESI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE TYPHUS EXANTEMATICO PATHOGEN BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE BILATERAL TEMPORAL AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS RECOGNIZED AS A PRIMARY CAUSE OF INSOMNIA AND SIGNIFICANT NEUROLOGICAL OR PSYCHOLOGICAL DISORDERS. THE BACTERIA IMPACTS THE CEREBRAL CORTEX, OFTEN LEADING TO ALTERED STATES OF CONSCIOUSNESS, IRRITABILITY, AND SEVERE HEADACHES. FURTHERMORE, THIS RESONANCE IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO EATING DISORDERS, AS THE PATHOGEN INTERFERES WITH THE BRAIN\'S REGULATORY CENTERS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING NEURO-INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING NORMAL SLEEP PATTERNS AND EMOTIONAL BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA ABORDA EL PAT\\u00d3GENO DEL TIFUS EXANTEM\\u00c1TICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE TEMPORAL BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES RECONOCIDO COMO UNA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE INSOMNIO Y TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS SIGNIFICATIVOS. LA BACTERIA IMPACTA LA CORTEZA CEREBRAL, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A ESTADOS ALTERADOS DE CONCIENCIA, IRRITABILIDAD Y DOLORES DE CABEZA SEVEROS. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTA RESONANCIA EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA FRECUENTEMENTE CON TRASTORNOS ALIMENTARIOS, YA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO INTERFIERE CON LOS CENTROS REGULADORES DEL CEREBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA NEUROINFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURANDO LOS PATRONES NORMALES DE SUE\\u00d1O Y EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL TURMOIL OR AGGRESSIVENESS PERSISTS, SCAN THE UNILATERAL TEMPORAL - L \\/ TEMPORAL - L (REF 772) AXIS TO RULE OUT THE POLYOMA VIRUS. FOR PERSISTENT INSOMNIA LINKED TO VASCULAR TENSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPLE \\/ TEMPLE (REF 767) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA AGITACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA O LA AGRESIVIDAD PERSISTEN, ESCANEAR EL EJE UNILATERAL [TEMPORAL - IZQ \\/ TEMPORAL - IZQ] (REF 772) PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DEL POLIOMA. PARA EL INSOMNIO PERSISTENTE VINCULADO A LA TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 767). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/776','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:56:29','2026-04-28 19:56:29'),(4552,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',777,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"REDUCES EXTREME AGGRESSIVENESS, SADISM, VIOLENT INTENTIONS, SELF DESTRUCTION, PSYCHIATRIC DISORDERS.  REGULATES MOTIONS OF HYPERKINETIC AND AGGRESSIVE CHILDREN. (REDUCE LA AGRESIVIDAD EXTREMA, EL SADISMO, LAS INTENCIONES VIOLENTAS, LA AUTODESTRUCCI\\u00d3N, LOS TRASTORNOS PSIQUI\\u00c1TRICOS. REGULA LOS MOVIMIENTOS DE NI\\u00d1OS HIPERCIN\\u00c9TICOS Y AGRESIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BEHAVIORAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXTREME AGGRESSIVENESS, SADISM, VIOLENT INTENTIONS, SELF-DESTRUCTIVE BEHAVIOR, PSYCHIATRIC DISORDERS, AND HYPERKINETIC MOVEMENTS IN CHILDREN.\\n\\n(AGRESIVIDAD EXTREMA, SADISMO, INTENCIONES VIOLENTAS, COMPORTAMIENTO AUTODESTRUCTIVO, TRASTORNOS PSIQUI\\u00c1TRICOS Y MOVIMIENTOS HIPERCIN\\u00c9TICOS EN NI\\u00d1OS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SEVERE BEHAVIORAL AND PSYCHOLOGICAL DYSREGULATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS UNILATERAL AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MODULATING INTENSE EMOTIONAL IMPULSES AND AGGRESSIVE DRIVES. THE RIGHT TEMPORAL AREA PLAYS A KEY ROLE IN SOCIAL COGNITION AND THE INTERPRETATION OF EMOTIONAL STIMULI; WHEN IMBALANCED, IT CAN LEAD TO LOSS OF IMPULSE CONTROL, VIOLENT TENDENCIES, OR PROFOUND PSYCHIATRIC TURMOIL. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BRAIN IN LOWERING HYPER-EXCITABILITY, REDUCING AGGRESSIVE OUTBURSTS, AND PROMOTING CALM IN BOTH ADULTS AND HYPERKINETIC CHILDREN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DISREGULACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL Y PSICOL\\u00d3GICA GRAVE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE UNILATERAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA MODULAR IMPULSOS EMOCIONALES INTENSOS Y CONDUCTAS AGRESIVAS. EL \\u00c1REA TEMPORAL DERECHA JUEGA UN PAPEL CLAVE EN LA COGNICI\\u00d3N SOCIAL Y LA INTERPRETACI\\u00d3N DE EST\\u00cdMULOS EMOCIONALES; CUANDO EST\\u00c1 DESEQUILIBRADA, PUEDE LLEVAR A LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL CONTROL DE IMPULSOS, TENDENCIAS VIOLENTAS O UNA PROFUNDA AGITACI\\u00d3N PSIQUI\\u00c1TRICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CEREBRO A DISMINUIR LA HIPEREXCITABILIDAD, REDUCIENDO LOS ARREBATOS AGRESIVOS Y PROMOVIENDO LA CALMA TANTO EN ADULTOS COMO EN NI\\u00d1OS HIPERCIN\\u00c9TICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF AGGRESSIVENESS IS LINKED TO VIRAL PATHOGENS, SCAN THE TEMPORAL - L \\/ TEMPORAL - L (REF 772) AXIS TO RULE OUT THE POLYOMA VIRUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP SADNESS OR GRIEF INSTEAD OF ANGER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPORAL - R \\/ HEART (REF 773) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN MANAGING INTENSE EMOTIONAL DISCHARGES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL: SI LA AGRESIVIDAD EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A PAT\\u00d3GENOS VIRALES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL - IZQ \\/ TEMPORAL - IZQ] (REF 772) PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DEL POLIOMA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TRISTEZA PROFUNDA O DUELO EN LUGAR DE IRA, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL - DER \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 773). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL EN EL MANEJO DE DESCARGAS EMOCIONALES INTENSAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/777','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:57:45','2026-04-28 19:57:45'),(4553,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',778,'{\"symptoms\":\"INTRACRANIAL TUMORS, DIZZINESS, HEADACHE, ALTERED CONSCIOUSNESS, COUGH, BRONCHITIS, HYPERACTIVITY, PLACENTA INFECTION. (TUMORES INTRACRANEALES, MAREOS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LA CONCIENCIA, TOS, BRONQUITIS, HIPERACTIVIDAD, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA PLACENTA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY BIRD FEATHERS AND DOWN COMFORTERS, PILLOWS AND ETC. TUBERCULOSIS. CEREBRAL BLEEDING TINNITUS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, RENAL DYSFUNCTION, DIABETES, ATYPICAL PNEUMONIA, BRONCHITIS, GENITAL TRACT DISORDERS,URETHRITIS, INFERTILITY, AND PLACENTA INFECTION. (TRANSMITIDO POR PLUMAS DE AVES Y EDREDONES, ALMOHADAS, ETC. TUBERCULOSIS. HEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL, TINNITUS, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL, DIABETES, NEUMON\\u00cdA AT\\u00cdPICA, BRONQUITIS, TRASTORNOS DEL TRACTO GENITAL, URETRITIS, INFERTILIDAD Y INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA PLACENTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: IF PASS TO THE FETUS CAN CAUSE AUTISM. CHECK - CHEST(PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: SI PASA AL FETO PUEDE CAUSAR AUTISMO. CHECAR - PECHO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTRACRANIAL TUMORS, DIZZINESS, HEADACHE, ALTERED CONSCIOUSNESS, COUGH, BRONCHITIS, HYPERACTIVITY, AND PLACENTA INFECTION.\\n\\n(TUMORES INTRACRANEALES, MAREOS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, ALTERACI\\u00d3N DE LA CONCIENCIA, TOS, BRONQUITIS, HIPERACTIVIDAD E INFECCI\\u00d3N DE LA PLACENTA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE MYCOPLASMA PATHOGEN BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE TEMPORAL-OCCIPITAL JUNCTION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT DUE TO ITS ASSOCIATION WITH COMPLEX NEUROLOGICAL AND RESPIRATORY ISSUES. THIS BACTERIA IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH BIRD FEATHERS (DOWN COMFORTERS, PILLOWS, ETC.) AND CAN LEAD TO SERIOUS CONDITIONS SUCH AS ATYPICAL PNEUMONIA, TUBERCULOSIS, AND CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, INCLUDING CEREBRAL BLEEDING OR TINNITUS. FURTHERMORE, IT MAY IMPACT THE GENITAL TRACT, POTENTIALLY CAUSING URETHRITIS OR INFERTILITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PATHOGEN, PROTECTING NEUROLOGICAL INTEGRITY, AND SUPPORTING RENAL AND RESPIRATORY HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL PAT\\u00d3GENO DEL MICOPLASMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA UNI\\u00d3N TEMPORO-OCCIPITAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO DEBIDO A SU ASOCIACI\\u00d3N CON PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS Y RESPIRATORIOS COMPLEJOS. ESTA BACTERIA A MENUDO SE TRANSMITE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LAS PLUMAS DE LAS AVES (EDREDONES, ALMOHADAS, ETC.) Y PUEDE CONDUCIR A CONDICIONES GRAVES COMO NEUMON\\u00cdA AT\\u00cdPICA, TUBERCULOSIS Y TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, INCLUYENDO HEMORRAGIA CEREBRAL O TINNITUS. ADEM\\u00c1S, PUEDE AFECTAR EL TRACTO GENITAL, CAUSANDO POTENCIALMENTE URETRITIS O INFERTILIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR EL PAT\\u00d3GENO, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y APOYANDO LA SALUD RENAL Y RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: IF THIS PATHOGEN IS PASSED TO A FETUS, IT IS ASSOCIATED WITH THE POTENTIAL DEVELOPMENT OF AUTISM. ALWAYS SCAN THE [CHEST \\/ CHEST] AREA AS A COMPLEMENTARY CHECK. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIABETES OR RENAL DYSFUNCTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: SI ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PASA AL FETO, SE ASOCIA CON EL DESARROLLO POTENCIAL DE AUTISMO. SIEMPRE ESCANEAR EL \\u00c1REA DEL [PECHO \\/ PECHO] COMO UNA VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COMPLEMENTARIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIABETES SEVERA O DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/778','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 19:58:54','2026-04-28 19:58:54'),(4554,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',779,'{\"origins\":\"CORONA\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CORONA (CORONAVIRUS)\",\"symptoms\":\"DRY COUGH, FEVER, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, SORE THROAT, FATIGUE, AND LOSS OF TASTE OR SMELL.\\n\\n(TOS SECA, FIEBRE, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, FATIGA Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL GUSTO O EL OLFATO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE CORONAVIRUS STRAIN BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE RACHIDIAN BULB HOUSES THE VITAL CENTERS FOR RESPIRATORY AND CARDIAC CONTROL. THE VIRAL PRESENCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN DIRECTLY INTERFERE WITH THE AUTONOMIC REGULATION OF BREATHING, LEADING TO THE CHARACTERISTIC RESPIRATORY DISTRESS ASSOCIATED WITH THIS PATHOGEN. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING THE BRAINSTEM\'S REGULATORY FUNCTIONS, AND CALMING THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE IN THE RESPIRATORY TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LA CEPA DEL CORONAVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO ALBERGA LOS CENTROS VITALES PARA EL CONTROL RESPIRATORIO Y CARD\\u00cdACO. LA PRESENCIA VIRAL EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE INTERFERIR DIRECTAMENTE CON LA REGULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA DE LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N, LO QUE LLEVA A LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA CARACTER\\u00cdSTICA ASOCIADA CON ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO LAS FUNCIONES REGULADORAS DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO Y CALMANDO LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY DISTRESS IS ACCOMPANIED BY A BACTERIAL COMPONENT, SCAN THE [URETER \\/ URETER] AXIS TO RULE OUT VARICELLA OR STREPTOCOCCUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE HYPERTENSION DURING THE VIRAL PHASE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPLE \\/ RACHIDIAN BULB (REF 765) SPECIAL RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA DIFICULTAD RESPIRATORIA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE UN COMPONENTE BACTERIANO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ UR\\u00c9TER] PARA DESCARTAR VARICELA O ESTREPTOCOCO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N SEVERA DURANTE LA FASE VIRAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL [TEMPORAL \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] (REF 765). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/779','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:00:02','2026-04-28 20:00:02'),(4555,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',780,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VESTIBULAR VIRAL LOAD (CARGA VIRAL VESTIBULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"VERTIGO, DIZZINESS, LOSS OF BALANCE, TINNITUS, AND POTENTIAL HEARING IMPAIRMENT.\\n\\n(V\\u00c9RTIGO, MAREOS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE EQUILIBRIO, TINNITUS Y POSIBLE DETERIORO AUDITIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS PATHOGENS AFFECTING THE AUDITORY AND VESTIBULAR SYSTEMS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TEMPORAL LOBE AND THE EAR. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING VIRAL INTERFERENCE THAT CAUSES INFLAMMATION IN THE INNER EAR OR THE VESTIBULAR NERVE. THE TEMPORAL LOBE IS RESPONSIBLE FOR AUDITORY PROCESSING, WHILE THE EAR STRUCTURES MAINTAIN EQUILIBRIUM. WHEN A VIRUS DISRUPTS THIS CONNECTION, IT OFTEN MANIFESTS AS SEVERE DIZZINESS OR THE SENSATION THAT THE ROOM IS SPINNING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD, RESTORING PROPER SENSORY DATA FLOW, AND RE-ESTABLISHING THE BODY\'S NATURAL SENSE OF BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTAN LOS SISTEMAS AUDITIVO Y VESTIBULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL Y EL O\\u00cdDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA DEPURAR LA INTERFERENCIA VIRAL QUE CAUSA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO O EL NERVIO VESTIBULAR. EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL ES RESPONSABLE DEL PROCESAMIENTO AUDITIVO, MIENTRAS QUE LAS ESTRUCTURAS DEL O\\u00cdDO MANTIENEN EL EQUILIBRIO. CUANDO UN VIRUS INTERRUMPE ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO MAREOS SEVEROS O LA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE QUE LA HABITACI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c1 GIRANDO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL, RESTAURANDO EL FLUJO ADECUADO DE DATOS SENSORIALES Y REESTABLECIENDO EL SENTIDO NATURAL DEL EQUILIBRIO DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: IF VERTIGO IS PERSISTENT AND ACCOMPANIED BY COGNITIVE CONFUSION, SCAN THE TEMPLE \\/ EAR (REF 762) AXIS TO RULE OUT THE GOATS VIRUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION OF THE MASTOID BONE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CLEARANCE OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: SI EL V\\u00c9RTIGO ES PERSISTENTE Y SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE CONFUSI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL \\/ O\\u00cdDO] (REF 762) PARA DESCARTAR EL VIRUS DE LAS CABRAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA DEL HUESO MASTOIDES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/780','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:01:12','2026-04-28 20:01:12'),(4556,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',781,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"IRRITABILITY, NERVOUSNESS, INSOMNIA, MENTAL CONFUSION. (IRRITABILIDAD, NERVIOSISMO, INSOMNIO, CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERACTIVITY (HIPERACTIVIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HYPERACTIVITY (HIPERACTIVIDAD)\",\"symptoms\":\"IRRITABILITY, NERVOUSNESS, INSOMNIA, AND MENTAL CONFUSION.\\n\\n(IRRITABILIDAD, NERVIOSISMO, INSOMNIO Y CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES NEUROLOGICAL HYPEREXCITABILITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE BILATERAL TEMPORAL AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR CALMING AN OVERACTIVE NERVOUS SYSTEM THAT MANIFESTS AS IRRITABILITY OR THE INABILITY TO REST. THE TEMPORAL LOBES ARE HEAVILY INVOLVED IN SENSORY PROCESSING AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION; WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS OVERSTIMULATED, IT CAN LEAD TO PERSISTENT NERVOUSNESS AND MENTAL CONFUSION, MAKING IT DIFFICULT FOR THE INDIVIDUAL TO FOCUS OR FALL ASLEEP. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BRAIN IN MODULATING ITS ELECTRICAL ACTIVITY, REDUCING HYPERACTIVE IMPULSES, AND RESTORING A STATE OF INNER QUIET AND COGNITIVE CLARITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA HIPEREXCITABILIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL EJE TEMPORAL BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA CALMAR UN SISTEMA NERVIOSO SOBREACTIVO QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO IRRITABILIDAD O INCAPACIDAD PARA DESCANSAR. LOS L\\u00d3BULOS TEMPORALES EST\\u00c1N PROFUNDAMENTE INVOLUCRADOS EN EL PROCESAMIENTO SENSORIAL Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL; CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 SOBREESTIMULADO, PUEDE CONDUCIR A UN NERVIOSISMO PERSISTENTE Y CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL, DIFICULTANDO QUE EL INDIVIDUO SE CONCENTRE O CONCILIE EL SUE\\u00d1O. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CEREBRO A MODULAR SU ACTIVIDAD EL\\u00c9CTRICA, REDUCIENDO LOS IMPULSOS HIPERACTIVOS Y RESTAURANDO UN ESTADO DE QUIETUD INTERNA Y CLARIDAD COGNITIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF HYPERACTIVITY IS ACCOMPANIED BY EXTREME AGGRESSIVENESS, SCAN THE UNILATERAL TEMPORAL - R \\/ TEMPORAL - R (REF 776) AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE INSOMNIA IS DRIVEN BY BACTERIAL TOXINS (TYPHUS), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPORAL - R \\/ TEMPORAL - L (REF 775) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN LOWERING SYSTEMIC TENSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL: SI LA HIPERACTIVIDAD SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE AGRESIVIDAD EXTREMA, ESCANEAR EL EJE UNILATERAL [TEMPORAL - DER \\/ TEMPORAL - DER] (REF 776). PARA CASOS DONDE EL INSOMNIO SEA IMPULSADO POR TOXINAS BACTERIANAS (TIFUS), REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL - DER \\/ TEMPORAL - IZQ] (REF 775). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL EN LA DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE LA TENSI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/781','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:02:30','2026-04-28 20:02:30'),(4557,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',782,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EXTREME AGGRESSION, INDIGO CHILDREN. (AGRESI\\u00d3N EXTREMA, NI\\u00d1OS \\u00cdNDIGO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INDIGO BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO \\u00cdNDIGO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXTREME AGGRESSION, IRRITABILITY, AND SENSORY OVERLOAD.\\n\\n(AGRESI\\u00d3N EXTREMA, IRRITABILIDAD Y SOBRECARGA SENSORIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES INTENSE BEHAVIORAL DISREGULATION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE GENERAL TEMPORAL AREA AND THE SPECIFIC RIGHT TEMPORAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS PARTICULARLY SIGNIFICANT FOR \\\"INDIGO CHILDREN\\\" OR INDIVIDUALS WITH HIGH SENSITIVITY WHO MAY EXPERIENCE EXTREME AGGRESSION AS A REACTION TO ENVIRONMENTAL OR EMOTIONAL OVERSTIMULATION. THE RIGHT TEMPORAL REGION IS DEEPLY LINKED TO HOW WE INTERPRET EMOTIONAL CUES; WHEN THIS AREA IS ELECTRICALLY OVERLOADED, IT CAN MANIFEST AS VIOLENT OUTBURSTS OR UNCONTROLLABLE ANGER. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS IN CALMING THE BRAIN\'S REACTIVITY, REDUCING AGGRESSIVE TENDENCIES, AND FOSTERING BETTER EMOTIONAL INTEGRATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DESREGULACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL INTENSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00c1REA TEMPORAL GENERAL Y EL L\\u00d3BULO TEMPORAL DERECHO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES PARTICULARMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO PARA LOS \\\"NI\\u00d1OS \\u00cdNDIGO\\\" O INDIVIDUOS CON ALTA SENSIBILIDAD QUE PUEDEN EXPERIMENTAR AGRESI\\u00d3N EXTREMA COMO UNA REACCI\\u00d3N A LA SOBREESTIMULACI\\u00d3N AMBIENTAL O EMOCIONAL. LA REGI\\u00d3N TEMPORAL DERECHA EST\\u00c1 PROFUNDAMENTE VINCULADA A C\\u00d3MO INTERPRETAMOS LAS SE\\u00d1ALES EMOCIONALES; CUANDO ESTA \\u00c1REA EST\\u00c1 SOBRECARGADA EL\\u00c9CTRICAMENTE, PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO ARREBATOS VIOLENTOS O IRA INCONTROLABLE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A CALMAR LA REACTIVIDAD DEL CEREBRO, REDUCIENDO LAS TENDENCIAS AGRESIVAS Y FOMENTANDO UNA MEJOR INTEGRACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF AGGRESSIVENESS PERSISTS WITHOUT SENSORY SENSITIVITY, SCAN THE UNILATERAL TEMPORAL - R \\/ TEMPORAL - R (REF 776) AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE THE BEHAVIOR IS ACCOMPANIED BY MENTAL CONFUSION OR FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPORAL - R \\/ TEMPORAL - L (REF 775) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN MANAGING INTENSE EMOTIONAL SURGES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL: SI LA AGRESIVIDAD PERSISTE SIN SENSIBILIDAD SENSORIAL, ESCANEAR EL EJE UNILATERAL [TEMPORAL - DER \\/ TEMPORAL - DER] (REF 776). PARA CASOS DONDE EL COMPORTAMIENTO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1E DE CONFUSI\\u00d3N MENTAL O FIEBRE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL - DER \\/ TEMPORAL - IZQ] (REF 775). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL EN EL MANEJO DE OLEADAS EMOCIONALES INTENSAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/782','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:04:10','2026-04-28 20:04:10'),(4558,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',783,'{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL DISCHARGE, VAGINAL ODOR, VAGINAL BLEEDING. VAGINAL ITCHING, EXCESS TESTOSTERONE, AND STOMACH ACHE. (SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL, OLOR VAGINAL, SANGRADO VAGINAL. PICAZ\\u00d3N VAGINAL, EXCESO DE TESTOSTERONA Y DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE URETHRA, PENIS OR VAGINA. VERY AGGRESSIVE. VAGINITIS, URETHRITIS, PROSTATITIS, PREMATURE DELIVERY OR ABORTION. INFLAMMATORY PELVIC DISEASE, ENDOMETRIOSIS, AND VARICOSE VEINS. (TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA URETRA, PENE O VAGINA. MUY AGRESIVO. VAGINITIS, URETRITIS, PROSTATITIS, PARTO PREMATURO O ABORTO. ENFERMEDAD P\\u00c9LVICA INFLAMATORIA, ENDOMETRIOSIS Y V\\u00c1RICES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL DISCHARGE, VAGINAL ODOR, VAGINITIS, URETHRITIS, PROSTATITIS, AND POTENTIAL RISK OF PREMATURE DELIVERY OR ABORTION. MAY ALSO CONTRIBUTE TO PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE, ENDOMETRIOSIS, AND VARICOSE VEINS.\\n\\n(FLUJO VAGINAL, OLOR VAGINAL, VAGINITIS, URETRITIS, PROSTATITIS Y RIESGO POTENCIAL DE PARTO PREMATURO O ABORTO. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CONTRIBUIR A LA ENFERMEDAD P\\u00c9LVICA INFLAMATORIA, ENDOMETRIOSIS Y V\\u00c1RICES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS GARDNERELLA VAGINALIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS IN THE TENSOR FASCIAE LATAE BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INFECTIONS OF THE GENITOURINARY TRACT. THE PATHOGEN IS HIGHLY AGGRESSIVE AND IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH THE URETHRA, PENIS, OR VAGINA. IT RESPONDS TO THE ACID-ALKALINE IMBALANCE IN THE PELVIC REGION, WHICH CAN LEAD TO CHRONIC INFLAMMATION, DISCOMFORT, AND VASCULAR ISSUES LIKE VARICOSE VEINS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING LOCAL INFLAMMATION, AND PROTECTING REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA GARDNERELLA VAGINALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL TENSOR DE LA FASCIA LATA DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO GENITOURINARIO. EL PAT\\u00d3GENO ES MUY AGRESIVO Y SE TRANSMITE NORMALMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA URETRRA, EL PENE O LA VAGINA. RESPONDE AL DESEQUILIBRIO \\u00c1CIDO-ALCALINO EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, LO QUE PUEDE LLEVAR A INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA, MALESTAR Y PROBLEMAS VASCULARES COMO V\\u00c1RICES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL Y PROTEGIENDO LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST IN THE URINARY TRACT, SCAN THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO RULE OUT STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VASCULAR ISSUES IN THE LEGS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ILIAC \\/ ILIAC] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN EN EL TRACTO URINARIO, ESCANEAR EL EJE [VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA] PARA DESCARTAR STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS VASCULARES SEVEROS EN LAS PIERNAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ILIACO \\/ ILIACO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/783','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:05:13','2026-04-28 20:05:13'),(4559,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',784,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"VERTICAL EQUILIBRUM (EQUILIBRIO VERTICAL)\",\"paths\":\"DYSLEXIA (DISLEXIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VERTICAL EQUILIBRIUM (EQUILIBRIO VERTICAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIFFICULTY WITH COORDINATION, SPATIAL DISORIENTATION, AND CHALLENGES IN MAINTAINING VERTICAL POSTURE OR BALANCE.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD CON LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N, DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL Y DESAF\\u00cdOS PARA MANTENER LA POSTURA VERTICAL O EL EQUILIBRIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES COGNITIVE AND PHYSICAL BALANCE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE TERMINAL POINTS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE CORRECTION OF DYSLEXIA AND OTHER LEARNING DISORDERS RELATED TO HOW THE BRAIN PROCESSES VERTICAL AND SPATIAL ORIENTATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN REORGANIZING SENSORY PERCEPTION, IMPROVING READING AND WRITING COHERENCE, AND RESTORING THE BODY\'S NATURAL SENSE OF VERTICAL EQUILIBRIUM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL EQUILIBRIO COGNITIVO Y F\\u00cdSICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS PUNTOS TERMINALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON LA CORRECCI\\u00d3N DE LA DISLEXIA Y OTROS TRASTORNOS DEL APRENDIZAJE RELACIONADOS CON LA FORMA EN QUE EL CEREBRO PROCESA LA ORIENTACI\\u00d3N VERTICAL Y ESPACIAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL A REORGANIZAR LA PERCEPCI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL, MEJORANDO LA COHERENCIA EN LA LECTURA Y ESCRITURA, Y RESTAURANDO EL SENTIDO NATURAL DE EQUILIBRIO VERTICAL DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"COGNITIVE CHECK: IF SPATIAL DISORIENTATION IS ACCOMPANIED BY MEMORY ISSUES, SCAN THE TEMPORAL - L \\/ HIPPO CAMPUS (REF 770) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VERTIGO OR BALANCE DISRUPTIONS OF VIRAL ORIGIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPORAL \\/ EAR (REF 779) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE INTEGRATION OF NEW NEUROLOGICAL PATHWAYS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA: SI LA DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N ESPACIAL SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE PROBLEMAS DE MEMORIA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [TEMPORAL - IZQ \\/ HIPOCAMPO] (REF 770). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN V\\u00c9RTIGO SEVERO O ALTERACIONES DEL EQUILIBRIO DE ORIGEN VIRAL, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ O\\u00cdDO] (REF 779). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N DE NUEVAS V\\u00cdAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/784','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:06:28','2026-04-28 20:06:28'),(4560,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',785,'{\"symptoms\":\"WARTS AND OPEN SORES ON PENIS AND SCROTUMS, VAGINA. (VERRUGAS Y LLAGAS ABIERTAS EN EL PENE Y EL ESCROTO, VAGINA.)\",\"paths\":\"HUMAN PAPILLOMA VIRUS, CYSTS. (VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO, QUISTES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WARTS AND OPEN SORES ON THE PENIS, SCROTUM, OR VAGINA; POTENTIAL FOR ANAL OR GENITAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(VERRUGAS Y LLAGAS ABIERTAS EN EL PENE, EL ESCROTO O LA VAGINA; POSIBLE MALESTAR ANAL O GENITAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE HUMAN PAPILLOMA VIRUS (HPV) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TESTICLE (OR VAGINAL AREA) AND THE RECTUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING THE UNDERLYING VIRAL LOAD THAT CAUSES EPITHELIAL LESIONS, WARTS, AND THE FORMATION OF CYSTS IN THE REPRODUCTIVE AND EXCRETORY TRACTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN RECOGNIZING AND NEUTRALIZING THE VIRUS, PREVENTING THE PROLIFERATION OF SORES AND REDUCING THE LONG-TERM RISK OF CELLULAR DEGENERATION IN THESE SENSITIVE TISSUES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO (VPH) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL TEST\\u00cdCULO (O EL \\u00c1REA VAGINAL) Y EL RECTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LA CARGA VIRAL SUBYACENTE QUE CAUSA LESIONES EPITELIALES, VERRUGAS Y LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE QUISTES EN LOS TRACTOS REPRODUCTIVO Y EXCRETOR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RECONOCER Y NEUTRALIZAR EL VIRUS, PREVINIENDO LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE LLAGAS Y REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO A LARGO PLAZO DE DEGENERACI\\u00d3N CELULAR EN ESTOS TEJIDOS SENSIBLES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"UROGENITAL CHECK: IF WARTS ARE PERSISTENT IN THE PELVIC REGION, SCAN THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS TO RULE OUT ASSOCIATED BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC PELVIC INFLAMMATORY ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TENSOR FASCIA \\/ TENSOR FASCIA (REF 782) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DETOXIFICATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE HEALING OF SKIN LESIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL: SI LAS VERRUGAS SON PERSISTENTES EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA] PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS ASOCIADAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS INFLAMATORIOS P\\u00c9LVICOS CR\\u00d3NICOS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TENSOR DE LA FASCIA \\/ TENSOR DE LA FASCIA] (REF 782). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA CURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/785','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:07:33','2026-04-28 20:07:33'),(4561,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',786,'{\"symptoms\":\"LARYNGEAL COUGHING, PELVIC DISORDERS, LOW BACK PAIN, PREMATURE EJACULATION. (LARYNGEAL COUGHING, PELVIC DISORDERS, LOW BACK PAIN, PREMATURE EJACULATION.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS AND RODENTS, DOGS AND FLEAS. BUBONIC PLAGUE. TESTICULAR TUBERCULOSIS,AZOOSPERMIA, ALTERS THE PRODUCTION OF TESTOSTERONE AND SPERMATOGENESIS. IMPOTENCE. (TRANSMITIDO POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS Y ROEDORES, PERROS Y PULGAS. PESTE BUB\\u00d3NICA. TUBERCULOSIS TESTICULAR, AZOOSPERMIA, ALTERA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE TESTOSTERONA Y LA ESPERMATOG\\u00c9NESIS. IMPOTENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SPLEEN    CHECK - VAGINA (CHECAR - BAZO    CHECAR - VAGINA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"LARYNGEAL COUGHING, PELVIC DISORDERS, LOW BACK PAIN, AND PREMATURE EJACULATION.\\n\\n(TOS LAR\\u00cdNGEA, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, DOLOR DE ESPALDA BAJA Y EYACULACI\\u00d3N PRECOZ.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS YERSINIA PESTIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE TESTICULAR TISSUE BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC AND LOCALIZED IMPACTS OF THE PATHOGEN RESPONSIBLE FOR THE BUBONIC PLAGUE, WHICH IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS OR VECTORS SUCH AS RODENTS AND FLEAS. BEYOND SYSTEMIC SYMPTOMS, THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR TREATING TESTICULAR TUBERCULOSIS AND AZOOSPERMIA. THE BACTERIA ALTERS THE HORMONE PRODUCTION OF TESTOSTERONE AND DISRUPTS SPERMATOGENESIS, WHICH CAN LEAD TO IMPOTENCE AND FERTILITY ISSUES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, RESTORING GLANDULAR FUNCTION, AND REGAINING METABOLIC AND REPRODUCTIVE BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA YERSINIA PESTIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL TEJIDO TESTICULAR DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR LOS IMPACTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS Y LOCALIZADOS DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO RESPONSABLE DE LA PESTE BUB\\u00d3NICA, QUE A MENUDO SE TRANSMITE POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS O VECTORES COMO ROEDORES Y PULGAS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIST\\u00c9MICOS, ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA TRATAR LA TUBERCULOSIS TESTICULAR Y LA AZOOSPERMIA. LA BACTERIA ALTERA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL DE TESTOSTERONA Y DESEQUILIBRA LA ESPERMATOG\\u00c9NESIS, LO QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA IMPOTENCIA Y PROBLEMAS DE FERTILIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR Y RECUPERANDO EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y REPRODUCTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"SYSTEMIC CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS PERSIST OR THE INFECTION IS SUSPECTED TO BE WIDESPREAD, SCAN THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO ADDRESS HEMATOLOGICAL REPLICATION. FOR FEMALE PATIENTS PRESENTING WITH SIMILAR PELVIC OR RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PERSISTEN O SE SOSPECHA QUE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c1 GENERALIZADA, ESCANEAR EL EJE [BAZO \\/ BAZO] PARA ABORDAR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA. PARA PACIENTES FEMENINAS QUE PRESENTEN MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO O RESPIRATORIO SIMILAR, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/786','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:08:56','2026-04-28 20:08:56'),(4562,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',787,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC CARRIER STATE, POTENTIAL FOR VIRAL RECURRENCE, AND PERSISTENT NEUROLOGICAL OR REPRODUCTIVE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(ESTADO DE PORTADOR ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO, POTENCIAL DE RECURRENCIA VIRAL Y DESEQUILIBRIOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O REPRODUCTIVOS PERSISTENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES THE TESTICLES AS A HIDDEN STORAGE SITE FOR VARIOUS VIRUSES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, RESERVOIRS ARE SPECIFIC ANATOMICAL POINTS WHERE PATHOGENS CAN REMAIN DORMANT, EVADING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND CAUSING RECURRING INFECTIONS OR CHRONIC DYSFUNCTIONS. THE TESTICULAR TISSUE, DUE TO ITS UNIQUE BIOLOGICAL ENVIRONMENT, CAN HARBOR VIRAL LOADS THAT AFFECT NOT ONLY REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH BUT ALSO SYSTEMIC ENERGY LEVELS AND NEUROLOGICAL CLARITY. BY NEUTRALIZING THE PH DISTORTIONS IN THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN \\\"FLUSHING\\\" THESE HIDDEN VIRUSES INTO THE BLOODSTREAM WHERE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM CAN FINALLY IDENTIFY AND ELIMINATE THEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA LOS TEST\\u00cdCULOS COMO UN SITIO DE ALMACENAMIENTO OCULTO PARA DIVERSOS VIRUS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS RESERVORIOS SON PUNTOS ANAT\\u00d3MICOS ESPEC\\u00cdFICOS DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES, EVADIENDO EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO Y CAUSANDO INFECCIONES RECURRENTES O DISFUNCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS. EL TEJIDO TESTICULAR, DEBIDO A SU ENTORNO BIOL\\u00d3GICO \\u00daNICO, PUEDE ALBERGAR CARGAS VIRALES QUE AFECTAN NO SOLO LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA, SINO TAMBI\\u00c9N LOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA CLARIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA. AL NEUTRALIZAR LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A \\\"EXPULSAR\\\" ESTOS VIRUS OCULTOS AL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO, DONDE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO FINALMENTE PUEDE IDENTIFICARLOS Y ELIMINARLOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESERVOIR CHECK: IF A VIRAL LOAD IS DETECTED HERE, SCAN THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] RESONANCE IN FEMALE PATIENTS OR THE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] AXIS FOR SYSTEMIC VIRAL STORAGE. FOR CASES WHERE THE VIRUS HAS MANIFESTED ACTIVELY IN THE SKIN OR MUCOSA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TESTICLE \\/ RECTUM (REF 784) RESONANCE (HPV). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF PATHOGENS RELEASED FROM THE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE RESERVORIO: SI SE DETECTA UNA CARGA VIRAL AQU\\u00cd, ESCANEAR LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] EN PACIENTES FEMENINAS O EL EJE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] PARA EL ALMACENAMIENTO VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICO. PARA CASOS DONDE EL VIRUS SE HAYA MANIFESTADO ACTIVAMENTE EN LA PIEL O MUCOSAS, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEST\\u00cdCULO \\/ RECTO] (REF 784) (VPH). SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS LIBERADOS DEL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/787','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:10:31','2026-04-28 20:10:31'),(4563,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',788,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEART DISORDERS. FATIGUE, SKIN DISORDERS. (TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdACOS. FATIGA, TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEART DISORDERS, FATIGUE, SKIN DISORDERS, AND POTENTIAL THROAT OR GENITAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS CARD\\u00cdCOS, FATIGA, TRASTORNOS DE LA PIEL Y POSIBLE MALESTAR EN LA GARGANTA O GENITALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TESTICLE AND THE TONSIL (AM\\u00cdGDALA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY RELEVANT BECAUSE STREPTOCOCCAL INFECTIONS CAN MIGRATE THROUGH THE SYSTEM, IMPACTING BOTH THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM IN THE THROAT AND THE REPRODUCTIVE GLANDS. IF LEFT UNTREATED, THIS BACTERIA CAN CONTRIBUTE TO RHEUMATIC FEVER OR CARDIAC COMPLICATIONS, MANIFESTING AS PERSISTENT FATIGUE AND SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING THE RISK OF HEART-RELATED DISORDERS AND CLEARING SKIN IRRITATIONS LINKED TO THE PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL TEST\\u00cdCULO Y LA AM\\u00cdGDALA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE RELEVANTE PORQUE LAS INFECCIONES ESTREPTOC\\u00d3CICAS PUEDEN MIGRAR A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL SISTEMA, AFECTANDO TANTO AL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO EN LA GARGANTA COMO A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS REPRODUCTORAS. SI NO SE TRATA, ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE CONTRIBUIR A LA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA O COMPLICACIONES CARD\\u00cdACAS, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO FATIGA PERSISTENTE E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE TRASTORNOS RELACIONADOS CON EL CORAZ\\u00d3N Y ELIMINANDO LAS IRRITACIONES DE LA PIEL VINCULADAS AL PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HEART SYMPTOMS ARE PREDOMINANT, SCAN THE [PERICARDIUM \\/ PERICARDIUM] AXIS. FOR PERSISTENT THROAT INFECTIONS ACCOMPANIED BY FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TONSIL \\/ TONSIL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE FILTRATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS CARD\\u00cdCOS SON PREDOMINANTES, ESCANEAR EL EJE [PERICARDIO \\/ PERICARDIO]. PARA INFECCIONES DE GARGANTA PERSISTENTES ACOMPA\\u00d1ADAS DE FIEBRE, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREAR EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/788','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:11:48','2026-04-28 20:11:48'),(4564,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',789,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"STRESSED (ESTRESADO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"STRESS (ESTR\\u00c9S)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH EMOTIONAL TENSION, ANXIETY, MENTAL FATIGUE, SLEEP DISRUPTIONS, AND EXAGGERATED RESPONSE TO EXTERNAL STIMULI.\\n\\n(ALTA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL, ANSIEDAD, FATIGA MENTAL, ALTERACIONES DEL SUE\\u00d1O Y RESPUESTA EXAGERADA A EST\\u00cdMULOS EXTERNOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE STATE OF ACUTE OR CHRONIC STRESS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THALAMUS AND THE ROLANDO FISSURE (CENTRAL SULCUS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE THALAMUS ACTS AS THE BRAIN\'S \\\"RELAY STATION,\\\" FILTERING AND PROCESSING ALMOST ALL INCOMING SENSORY INFORMATION, WHILE THE ROLANDO FISSURE SEPARATES MOTOR FUNCTIONS FROM SENSORY ONES. WHEN AN INDIVIDUAL IS \\\"STRESSED,\\\" THIS CIRCUIT BECOMES OVERLOADED, LEADING TO A STATE OF HYPER-VIGILANCE AND NERVOUS EXHAUSTION. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN LOWERING EMOTIONAL REACTIVITY, PROMOTING A SENSE OF CALM, AND IMPROVING THE BRAIN\'S ABILITY TO PRIORITIZE STIMULI IN A BALANCED MANNER.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL ESTADO DE ESTR\\u00c9S AGUDO O CR\\u00d3NICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL T\\u00c1LAMO Y LA CISURA DE ROLANDO (SURCO CENTRAL). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL T\\u00c1LAMO ACT\\u00daA COMO LA \\\"ESTACI\\u00d3N DE RELEVOS\\\" DEL CEREBRO, FILTRANDO Y PROCESANDO CASI TODA LA INFORMACI\\u00d3N SENSORIAL QUE LLEGA, MIENTRAS QUE LA CISURA DE ROLANDO SEPARA LAS FUNCIONES MOTORAS DE LAS SENSORIALES. CUANDO UN INDIVIDUO EST\\u00c1 \\\"ESTRESSADO\\\", ESTE CIRCUITO SE SOBRECARGA, LLEVANDO A UN ESTADO DE HIPERVIGILANCIA Y AGOTAMIENTO NERVIOSO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL A DISMINUIR LA REACTIVIDAD EMOCIONAL, PROMOVIENDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CALMA Y MEJORANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL CEREBRO PARA PRIORIZAR EST\\u00cdMULOS DE FORMA EQUILIBRADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRESS CHECK: IF STRESS IS LINKED TO A COMPULSIVE SPEECH URGE, SCAN THE TEMPORAL - L \\/ ROLANDO FISSURE (REF 771) AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE STRESS CAUSES INTUITION OR MENTAL BLOCKAGE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPORAL - R \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (REF 774) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS DURING RECOVERY FROM PROLONGED STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ESTR\\u00c9S: SI EL ESTR\\u00c9S EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A UN IMPULSO DE HABLA COMPULSIVA, ESCANEE EL EJE [TEMPORAL - IZQ \\/ CISURA DE ROLANDO] (REF 771). PARA CASOS DONDE EL ESTR\\u00c9S CAUSA BLOQUEO INTUITIVO O MENTAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL - DER \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 774). MONITORE SIEMPRE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL ESTR\\u00c9S PROLONGADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/789','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:13:54','2026-04-28 20:13:54'),(4565,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',790,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HYPERACTIVITY (HIPERACTIVIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NEUROLOGICAL REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HYPERACTIVITY, ATTENTION DEFICIT, IMPULSIVITY, SENSORY OVERLOAD, AND COGNITIVE DISORGANIZATION.\\n\\n(HIPERACTIVIDAD, D\\u00c9FICIT DE ATENCI\\u00d3N, IMPULSIVIDAD, SOBRECARGA SENSORIAL Y DESORGANIZACI\\u00d3N COGNITIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES HYPERACTIVITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE THALAMUS BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE THALAMUS IS THE BRAIN\'S CENTRAL INFORMATION HUB, RESPONSIBLE FOR FILTERING AND ROUTING SENSORY DATA TO THE CORTEX. WHEN THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT IS IMBALANCED, THE BRAIN STRUGGLES TO PRIORITIZE STIMULI, LEADING TO THE CHARACTERISTIC RESTLESSNESS AND LACK OF FOCUS ASSOCIATED WITH HYPERACTIVE DISORDERS. BY STABILIZING THIS CORE RELAY STATION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN MODULATING SENSORY INPUT, REDUCING IMPULSIVE DRIVES, AND RESTORING A STATE OF CALM CONCENTRATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA HIPERACTIVIDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL T\\u00c1LAMO DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL T\\u00c1LAMO ES EL CENTRO NEURAL DE INFORMACI\\u00d3N DEL CEREBRO, RESPONSABLE DE FILTRAR Y DIRIGIR LOS DATOS SENSORIALES A LA CORTEZA. CUANDO ESTE EJE BILATERAL EST\\u00c1 DESEQUILIBRADO, EL CEREBRO TIENE DIFICULTADES PARA PRIORIZAR LOS EST\\u00cdMULOS, LO QUE CONDUCE A LA INQUIETUD CARACTER\\u00cdSTICA Y LA FALTA DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N ASOCIADAS CON LOS TRASTORNOS HIPERACTIVOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA ESTACI\\u00d3N CENTRAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL A MODULAR LA ENTRADA SENSORIAL, REDUCIENDO LOS IMPULSOS IMPULSIVOS Y RESTAURANDO UN ESTADO DE CONCENTRACI\\u00d3N TRANQUILA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"BEHAVIORAL CHECK: IF HYPERACTIVITY IS ACCOMPANIED BY EXTREME EMOTIONAL TENSION OR ANXIETY, SCAN THE THALAMUS \\/ ROLANDO FISSURE (REF 788) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE IRRITABILITY OR INSOMNIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL (REF 780) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN MAINTAINING COGNITIVE BALANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N CONDUCTUAL: SI LA HIPERACTIVIDAD SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE UNA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL EXTREMA O ANSIEDAD, ESCANEE EL EJE [T\\u00c1LAMO \\/ CISURA DE ROLANDO] (REF 788). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITABILIDAD SEVERA O INSOMNIO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 780). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL EN EL MANTENIMIENTO DEL EQUILIBRIO COGNITIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/790','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:15:01','2026-04-28 20:15:01'),(4566,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',791,'{\"symptoms\":\"NAIL FUNGUS, ATHLETES FEET, INGROWN TOENAILS. (HONGOS EN LAS U\\u00d1AS, PIE DE ATLETA, U\\u00d1AS ENCARNADAS.)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"NAIL FUNGUS, ATHLETE\'S FOOT, AND INGROWN TOENAILS.\\n\\n(HONGOS EN LAS U\\u00d1AS, PIE DE ATLETA Y U\\u00d1AS ENCARNADAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES MYCOSIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE THUMB (OR BIG TOE) BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR CLEARING LOCALIZED FUNGAL INFECTIONS THAT AFFECT THE KERATIN OF THE NAILS AND THE SURROUNDING SKIN. THESE PATHOGENS THRIVE IN DAMP, ALKALINE ENVIRONMENTS, OFTEN LEADING TO DISCOLORATION, THICKENING OF THE NAILS, AND SECONDARY INFLAMMATION SUCH AS INGROWN NAILS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGAL LOAD, PROMOTING HEALTHY NAIL GROWTH, AND PREVENTING THE SPREAD OF DERMATOPHYTES TO OTHER AREAS OF THE FEET OR HANDS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA ABORDA LA MICOSIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL PULGAR (O PRIMER DEDO DEL PIE) DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA DEPURAR LAS INFECCIONES F\\u00daNGICAS LOCALIZADAS QUE AFECTAN A LA QUERATINA DE LAS U\\u00d1AS Y A LA PIEL CIRCUNDANTE. ESTOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PROSPERAN EN AMBIENTES H\\u00daMEDOS Y ALCALINOS, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A LA DECOLORACI\\u00d3N, EL ENGROSAMIENTO DE LAS U\\u00d1AS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SECUNDARIA COMO U\\u00d1AS ENCARNADAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, PROMOVIENDO EL CRECIMIENTO SALUDABLE DE LAS U\\u00d1AS Y PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE DERMATOFITOS A OTRAS \\u00c1REAS DE LOS PIES O LAS MANOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"FUNGAL CHECK: IF NAIL FUNGUS IS PERSISTENT AND WIDESPREAD ACROSS THE FEET, SCAN THE [FIRST TOE \\/ FIRST TOE] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC FUNGAL OVERGROWTH (CANDIDA), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [DIAPHRAGM \\/ DIAPHRAGM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF FUNGAL METABOLITES DURING THE HEALING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA: SI EL HONGO EN LAS U\\u00d1AS ES PERSISTENTE Y SE EXTIENDE POR TODO EL PIE, ESCANEE EL EJE [PRIMER DEDO \\/ PRIMER DEDO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN SOBRECRECIMIENTO F\\u00daNGICO SIST\\u00c9MICO (CANDIDA), REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [DIAFRAGMA \\/ DIAFRAGMA]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE METABOLITOS F\\u00daNGICOS DURANTE EL PROCESO DE CURACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/791','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:16:08','2026-04-28 20:16:08'),(4567,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',792,'{\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNOCOMPETENCE. IMPROVES THE PRODUCTION AND QUALITY OF WHITE BLOOD CELLS AND INCREASES LYMPHOCYTES AND HORMONAL COORDINATION\\n(INMUNOCOMPETENCIA. MEJORA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N Y CALIDAD DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS Y ELEVA LOS LINFOCITOS Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL)\",\"paths\":\"IMPROVES THE WHITE BLOOD CELL PRODUCTION. RAISING THE QUALITY OF LYMPHOCYTES. (MEJORA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS. ELEVA LA CALIDAD DE LOS LINFOCITOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNOCOMPETENCE. IMPROVES THE PRODUCTION AND QUALITY OF WHITE BLOOD CELLS AND INCREASES LYMPHOCYTES AND HORMONAL COORDINATION.(INMUNOCOMPETENCIA. MEJORA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N Y CALIDAD DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS Y ELEVA LOS LINFOCITOS Y LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE ENHANCES IMMUNE SYSTEM EFFICIENCY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE APPENDIX. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR STRENGTHENING THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSES. THE THYMUS IS THE PRIMARY SITE FOR T-LYMPHOCYTE MATURATION, WHILE THE APPENDIX ACTS AS A \\\"SAFE HOUSE\\\" FOR BENEFICIAL BACTERIA AND SUPPORTS LYMPHATIC FUNCTION IN THE GUT. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RAISING THE QUALITY AND PRODUCTION OF WHITE BLOOD CELLS, OPTIMIZING LYMPHOCYTE ACTIVITY, AND ENSURING BETTER HORMONAL COORDINATION TO PROTECT AGAINST SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL MEJORA LA EFICIENCIA DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL AP\\u00c9NDICE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA FORTALECER LAS DEFENSAS NATURALES DEL CUERPO. EL TIMO ES EL SITIO PRINCIPAL PARA LA MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS LINFOCITOS T, MIENTRAS QUE EL AP\\u00c9NDICE ACT\\u00daA COMO UN \\\"REFUGIO\\\" PARA LAS BACTERIAS BENEFICIOSAS Y APOYA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA EN EL INTESTINO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELEVAR LA CALIDAD Y PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE GL\\u00d3BULOS BLANCOS, OPTIMIZANDO LA ACTIVIDAD DE LOS LINFOCITOS Y ASEGURANDO UNA MEJOR COORDINACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL PARA PROTEGER CONTRA INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE CHECK: IF IMMUNODEFICIENCY IS SEVERE OR PERSISTENT, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS TO ENHANCE HEMATOLOGICAL FILTRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING LOCALIZED ABDOMINAL INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [APPENDIX \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING THE STRENGTHENING OF THE IMMUNE RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA: SI LA INMUNODEFICIENCIA ES SEVERE O PERSISTENTE, ESCANEE EL EJE [TIMO \\/ BAZO] PARA MEJORAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEMATOL\\u00d3GICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL LOCALIZADA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AP\\u00c9NDICE \\/ TIMO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE EL FORTALECIMIENTO DE LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/792','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:17:16','2026-04-28 20:17:16'),(4568,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',793,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ALLERGIES (ALERGIAS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ALLERGEN NEUTRALIZATION (NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE AL\\u00c9RGENOS)\",\"symptoms\":\"ALLERGIES, RHINITIS, ASTHMA, SKIN RASHES, SNEEZING, AND TEARY EYES.\\n\\n(ALERGIAS, RINITIS, ASMA, ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, ESTORNUDOS Y OJOS LLOROSOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ALLERGIC REACTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE ARMPIT (AXILLA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR MODULATING AN OVERACTIVE IMMUNE RESPONSE TO EXTERNAL AGENTS SUCH AS POLLEN, DUST, OR FOOD. THE THYMUS IS THE CENTER FOR T-CELL MATURATION AND IMMUNE REGULATION; WHEN IN RESONANCE WITH THE AXILLARY LYMPHATIC NODES, IT HELPS TO RECALIBRATE THE BODY\'S TOLERANCE LEVELS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN REDUCING HISTAMINE PRODUCTION, CALMING INFLAMMATION IN THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES, AND ALLEVIATING THE VARIED SYMPTOMS OF SEASONAL OR CHRONIC ALLERGIES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LAS REACCIONES AL\\u00c9RGICAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y LA AXILA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA MODULAR UNA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA SOBREACTIVA A AGENTES EXTERNOS COMO EL POLEN, EL POLVO O LOS ALIMENTOS. EL TIMO ES EL CENTRO DE MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS T Y LA REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA; CUANDO EST\\u00c1 EN RESONANCIA CON LOS GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS AXILARES, AYUDA A RECALIBRAR LOS NIVELES DE TOLERANCIA DEL CUERPO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A REDUCIR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HISTAMINA, CALMANDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS Y ALIVIANDO LOS DIVERSOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LAS ALERGIAS ESTACIONALES O CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ALLERGY CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS LIKE ASTHMA ARE DOMINANT, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ CHEST] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SKIN IRRITATION OR HIVES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYMUS \\/ THYMUS] RESONANCE TO STABILIZE THE OVERALL IMMUNE THRESHOLD. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF ALLERGENS AND METABOLIC WASTE DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE ALERGIAS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS COMO EL ASMA SON DOMINANTES, ESCANEE EL EJE [TIMO \\/ PECHO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA SEVERA O URTICARIA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ TIMO] PARA ESTABILIZAR EL UMBRAL INMUNITARIO GENERAL. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE AL\\u00c9RGENOS Y DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/793','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:18:38','2026-04-28 20:18:38'),(4569,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',794,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SPREAD BY CONTAMINATED AIR SUPPLIES. LUNG AND AIRWAY DISORDERS. HEART FAILURE. WEAKENS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. (SE PROPAGA POR SUMINISTROS DE AIRE CONTAMINADOS. TRASTORNOS PULMONARES Y DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS. INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA. DEBILITA EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO.(\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"LUNG AND AIRWAY DISORDERS, DRY COUGH, FEVER, HEART FAILURE, AND A WEAKENED IMMUNE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS PULMONARES Y DE LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS, TOS SECA, FIEBRE, INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y DEBILITAMIENTO DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS LEGIONELLA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE CARDIA (THE UPPER OPENING OF THE STOMACH). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY SPREAD THROUGH CONTAMINATED AIR SUPPLIES, AIR CONDITIONING SYSTEMS, OR WATER SOURCES. THE BACTERIA DIRECTLY IMPACTS THE RESPIRATORY TRACT, OFTEN CAUSING SEVERE PNEUMONIA-LIKE SYMPTOMS. FURTHERMORE, BECAUSE THE THYMUS IS THE CENTER OF IMMUNE REGULATION, THIS INFECTION CAN SIGNIFICANTLY DEBILITATE THE BODY\'S DEFENSES, POTENTIALLY LEADING TO CARDIAC COMPLICATIONS OR HEART FAILURE IF THE SYSTEMIC LOAD BECOMES OVERWHELMING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING LUNG FUNCTION, AND RESTORING VITAL ENERGY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA LEGIONELLA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL CARDIAS (LA ABERTURA SUPERIOR DEL EST\\u00d3MAGO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE PROPAGA T\\u00cdPICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE SUMINISTROS DE AIRE CONTAMINADOS, SISTEMAS DE AIRE ACONDICIONADO O FUENTES DE AGUA. LA BACTERIA IMPACTA DIRECTAMENTE EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO, CAUSANDO A MENUDO S\\u00cdNTOMAS GRAVES SIMILARES A LA NEUMON\\u00cdA. ADEM\\u00c1S, DEBIDO A QUE EL TIMO ES EL CENTRO DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA, ESTA INFECCI\\u00d3N PUEDE DEBILITAR SIGNIFICATIVAMENTE LAS DEFENSAS DEL CUERPO, PUDIENDO LLEVAR A COMPLICACIONES CARD\\u00cdACAS O INSUFICIENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA SI LA CARGA SIST\\u00c9MICA SE VUELVE ABRUMADORA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR Y RESTAURANDO LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF LUNG DISORDERS PERSIST WITH SEVERE INFLAMMATION, SCAN THE [THYMUS \\/ CHEST] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIGESTIVE REFLUX OR DISCOMFORT LINKED TO THE CARDIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CARDIA \\/ ADRENAL GLANDS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LOS TRASTORNOS PULMONARES PERSISTEN CON INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA, ESCANEE EL EJE [TIMO \\/ PECHO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN REFLUJO DIGESTIVO O MALESTAR VINCULADO AL CARDIAS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CARDIAS \\/ SUPRARRENALES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/794','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:19:46','2026-04-28 20:19:46'),(4570,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',795,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"EXTREME GREED FOR WEALTH. (CODICIA EXTREMA POR LA RIQUEZA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GREED (CODICIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXTREME GREED FOR WEALTH, MATERIAL ATTACHMENT, AND EMOTIONAL IMBALANCE LINKED TO FINANCIAL INSECURITY OR POSSESSIVENESS.\\n\\n(CODICIA EXTREMA POR LA RIQUEZA, APEGO MATERIAL Y DESEQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL VINCULADO A LA INSEGURIDAD FINANCIERA O POSESIVIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PSYCHOLOGICAL DRIVE OF EXTREME GREED BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE HYPOPHYSIS (PITUITARY GLAND). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS CONNECTS THE CENTER OF IMMUNE REGULATION AND \\\"UNCONDITIONAL LOVE\\\" (THYMUS) WITH THE MASTER GLAND OF THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM (HYPOPHYSIS). AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS AN OVERWHELMING ATTACHMENT TO MATERIAL WEALTH AND A FEAR-BASED NEED TO ACCUMULATE RESOURCES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RELEASING POSSESSIVE IMPULSES, FOSTERING A SENSE OF INNER ABUNDANCE, AND REALIGNING THE HORMONAL SYSTEM TO SUPPORT EMOTIONAL GENEROSITY AND BALANCE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL IMPULSO PSICOL\\u00d3GICO DE LA CODICIA EXTREMA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y LA HIP\\u00d3FISIS (GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE CONECTA EL CENTRO DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y EL \\\"AMOR INCONDICIONAL\\\" (TIMO) CON LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO (HIP\\u00d3FISIS). UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN APEGO ABRUMADOR A LA RIQUEZA MATERIAL Y UNA NECESIDAD BASADA EN EL MIEDO DE ACUMULAR RECURSOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A LIBERAR IMPULSOS POSESIVOS, FOMENTANDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ABUNDANCIA INTERIOR Y REALINEANDO EL SISTEMA HORMONAL PARA APOYAR LA GENEROSIDAD EMOCIONAL Y EL EQUILIBRIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF GREED IS ACCOMPANIED BY PERSISTENT ANXIETY OR STRESS, SCAN THE THALAMUS \\/ ROLANDO FISSURE (REF 788) AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL TENSION AFFECTS IMMUNE RESPONSE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ ARMPIT (REF 792) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN PROCESSING EMOTIONAL RELEASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA CODICIA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE ANSIEDAD O ESTR\\u00c9S PERSISTENTE, ESCANEE EL EJE [T\\u00c1LAMO \\/ CISURA DE ROLANDO] (REF 788). PARA CASOS DONDE LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL AFECTA LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ AXILA] (REF 792). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL EN EL PROCESAMIENTO DE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/795','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:21:06','2026-04-28 20:21:06'),(4571,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',796,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEPATITIS L, ABDOMINAL PAIN, DIARRHEA, FEVER, AND FATIGUE.\\n\\n(HEPATITIS L, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, DIARREA, FIEBRE Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS ESCHERICHIA COLI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH HEPATITIS L, A CONDITION WHERE THE E. COLI PATHOGEN IMPACTS HEPATIC FUNCTION. THE LIVER IS THE BODY\\u2019S PRIMARY DETOXIFICATION HUB, WHILE THE THYMUS REGULATES THE IMMUNE RESPONSE. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS COMPROMISED, THE BACTERIA CAN CAUSE INFLAMMATION OF THE LIVER TISSUE AND WEAKEN SYSTEMIC DEFENSES. BY STABILIZING THIS CONNECTION, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING LIVER INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING VITAL FILTRATION PROCESSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA ESCHERICHIA COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON LA HEPATITIS L, UNA CONDICI\\u00d3N DONDE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO E. COLI IMPACTA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA. EL H\\u00cdGADO ES EL CENTRO DE DESINTOXICACI\\u00d3N PRIMARIO DEL CUERPO, MIENTRAS QUE EL TIMO REGULA LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO SE VE COMPROMETIDO, LA BACTERIA PUEDE CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO HEP\\u00c1TICO Y DEBILITAR LAS DEFENSAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA CONEXI\\u00d3N, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y RESTAURANDO LOS PROCESOS VITALES DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"HEPATIC CHECK: IF LIVER INFLAMMATION PERSISTS WITH JUNDICE OR SEVERE FATIGUE, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS FOR TOXIC OVERLOAD. FOR CASES INVOLVING INTESTINAL DISTRESS ACCOMPANIED BY FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ CARDIA (REF 793) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF HEPATIC HEALTH.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO PERSISTE CON ICTERICIA O FATIGA SEVERA, ESCANEE EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA CARGA T\\u00d3XICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR INTESTINAL ACOMPA\\u00d1ADO DE FIEBRE, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ CARDIAS] (REF 793). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA SALUD HEP\\u00c1TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/796','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:22:08','2026-04-28 20:22:08'),(4572,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',797,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, MALAISE, SKIN RASHES, ALLERGIES, ECZEMA, MOTOR AND SPEECH PROBLEMS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, DISORIENTATION, SLEEP DISTURBANCES, INSOMNIA, DIZZINESS, HEADACHES, FEVER, SEVERE EYE PROBLEMS, CATARACTS, CONJUNCTIVITIS, MACULITIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, RETINAL DETACHMENT. (DOLOR DE CABEZA, MALESTAR, ERUPCIONES EN LA PIEL, ALERGIAS, ECCEMA, PROBLEMAS MOTORES Y DEL HABLA, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNOS DEL SUE\\u00d1O, INSOMNIO, MAREOS, DOLORES DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, PROBLEMAS OCULARES GRAVES, CATARATAS, CONJUNTIVITIS, MACULITIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, DESPRENDIMIENTO DE RETINA.)\",\"paths\":\"GERMAN MEASLES, CAN CAUSE FETAL DAMAGE, ABORTION AND CONGENITAL DEFORMITIES. (SARAMPI\\u00d3N ALEM\\u00c1N, PUEDE CAUSAR DA\\u00d1O FETAL, ABORTO Y MALFORMACIONES CONG\\u00c9NITAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH IT ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS, GLAUCOMA. (ASOCIADO CON ESTE, ASOCIADO CON UN HONGO; GLAUCOMA.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, MALAISE, SKIN RASHES, ALLERGIES, ECZEMA, MOTOR AND SPEECH PROBLEMS, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, DISORIENTATION, SLEEP DISTURBANCES, INSOMNIA, DIZZINESS, FEVER, AND SEVERE EYE PROBLEMS (CATARACTS, CONJUNCTIVITIS, MACULITIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, RETINAL DETACHMENT).(DOLOR DE CABEZA, MALESTAR, ERUPCIONES EN LA PIEL, ALERGIAS, ECCEMA, PROBLEMAS MOTORES Y DEL HABLA, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL, DESORIENTACI\\u00d3N, TRASTORNOS DEL SUE\\u00d1O, INSOMNIO, MAREOS, FIEBRE Y PROBLEMAS OCULARES GRAVES: CATARATAS, CONJUNTIVITIS, MACULITIS, RETINITIS PIGMENTOSA, DESPRENDIMIENTO DE RETINA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE RUBELLA VIRUS (GERMAN MEASLES) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE PARIETAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT DUE TO THE VIRUS\'S TENDENCY TO IMPACT BOTH THE IMMUNE SYSTEM AND THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. THE RUBELLA VIRUS CAN CAUSE NEUROLOGICAL ALTERATIONS, SPEECH IMPAIRMENTS, AND SEVERE OPHTHALMOLOGICAL COMPLICATIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING COGNITIVE AND MOTOR FUNCTIONS, AND REDUCING THE RISK OF CONGENITAL DAMAGE OR PREGNANCY COMPLICATIONS ASSOCIATED WITH THIS PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA RUB\\u00c9OLA (SARAMPI\\u00d3N ALEM\\u00c1N) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE SIGNIFICATIVO DEBIDO A LA TENDENCIA DEL VIRUS A IMPACTAR TANTO EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO COMO EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. EL VIRUS DE LA RUB\\u00c9OLA PUEDE CAUSAR ALTERACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS, DEFICIENCIAS EN EL HABLA Y COMPLICACIONES OFTALMOL\\u00d3GICAS GRAVES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO LAS FUNCIONES COGNITIVAS Y MOTORAS, Y REDUCIENDO EL RIESGO DE DA\\u00d1O CONG\\u00c9NITO O COMPLICACIONES DEL EMBARAZO ASOCIADAS CON ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF EYE PROBLEMS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY INCREASED INTRAOCULAR PRESSURE, SCAN FOR ASSOCIATED FUNGI AND CHECK FOR GLAUCOMA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SPEECH OR MOTOR DISORDERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL (REF 780) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS PROBLEMAS OCULARES SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE UN AUMENTO DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N INTRAOCULAR, ESCANEAR EN BUSCA DE HONGOS ASOCIADOS Y VERIFICAR GLAUCOMA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TRASTORNOS MOTORES O DEL HABLA GRAVES, REALIZAR UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TEMPORAL \\/ TEMPORAL] (REF 780). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/797','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:23:20','2026-04-28 20:23:20'),(4573,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',798,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"IMPOTENCE (IMPOTENCIA)\",\"paths\":\"HELPS IMPROVE ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION. (AYUDA A MEJORAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ATLAS       CHECK - PINEAL       CHECK - SACRUM (CHECAR - ATLAS       CHECAR - PINEAL       CHECAR - SACRO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"GLANDULAR COORDINATION (COORDINACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"IMPOTENCE, ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION, AND REDUCED LIBIDO.\\n\\n(IMPOTENCIA, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL Y DISMINUCI\\u00d3N DE LA LIBIDO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON RESTORING VITALITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE PENIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS HELPS IMPROVE ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION BY ADDRESSING THE BIOLOGICAL AND ENERGY-BASED BLOCKAGES THAT INTERFERE WITH MALE REPRODUCTIVE PERFORMANCE. THE THYMUS PLAYS A PIVOTAL ROLE IN SYSTEMIC REGULATION AND IMMUNE VIGILANCE, WHILE THE RESONANCE WITH THE PENILE TISSUE ENHANCES LOCAL BLOOD FLOW AND NERVE SIGNALING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN BALANCING THE GLANDULAR COORDINATION NECESSARY FOR HEALTHY SEXUAL FUNCTION AND STRENGTHENING THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN RESTAURAR LA VITALIDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL PENE. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE AYUDA A MEJORAR LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL AL ABORDAR LOS BLOQUEOS BIOL\\u00d3GICOS Y ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE INTERFIEREN CON EL RENDIMIENTO REPRODUCTIVO MASCULINO. EL TIMO JUEGA UN PAPEL FUNDAMENTAL EN LA REGULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA, MIENTRAS QUE LA RESONANCIA CON EL TEJIDO DEL PENE MEJORA EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO LOCAL Y LA SE\\u00d1ALIZACI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EQUILIBRAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR NECESARIA PARA UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL SALUDABLE Y EL FORTALECIMIENTO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"STRUCTURAL CHECK: IF ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION PERSISTS, SCAN THE [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] AXIS TO ENSURE PROPER NERVE CONDUCTION FROM THE CERVICAL SPINE. FOR HORMONAL OR PSYCHOLOGICAL FACTORS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] AXIS TO ADDRESS THE NERVE ROOTS GOVERNING THE PELVIC REGION AND THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N ESTRUCTURAL: SI LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL PERSISTE, ESCANEE EL EJE [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] PARA ASEGURAR UNA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA ADECUADA DESDE LA COLUMNA CERVICAL. PARA FACTORES HORMONALES O PSICOL\\u00d3GICOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PINEAL \\/ PINEAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [SACRO \\/ SACRO] PARA ABORDAR LAS RA\\u00cdCES NERVIOSAS QUE GOBIERNAN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/798','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:24:36','2026-04-28 20:24:36'),(4574,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',799,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AVARICE - EXTREME GREED FOR MONEY AND MATERIAL THINGS. (AVARICIA - CODICIA EXTREMA POR EL DINERO Y LAS COSAS MATERIALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"AVARICE (AVARICIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXTREME GREED FOR MONEY AND MATERIAL THINGS, POSSESSIVENESS, AND AN INABILITY TO SHARE OR FEEL MATERIAL SATISFACTION.\\n\\n(AVARICIA - CODICIA EXTREMA POR EL DINERO Y LAS COSAS MATERIALES, POSESIVIDAD E INCAPACIDAD PARA COMPARTIR O SENTIR SATISFACCI\\u00d3N MATERIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE FREQUENCY OF AVARICE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE PITUITARY GLAND (HYPOPHYSIS). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS LINKED TO THE OVER-PRIORITIZATION OF MATERIAL ACCUMULATION AT THE EXPENSE OF EMOTIONAL AND SPIRITUAL WELL-BEING. THE PITUITARY GLAND, AS THE MASTER COORDINATOR OF THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM, INFLUENCES OUR PERCEPTIONS AND DRIVES, WHILE THE THYMUS IS ASSOCIATED WITH THE HIGHER EMOTIONAL CENTERS OF COMPASSION AND OPENNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RELEASING THE CONSTRICTIVE ENERGY OF GREED, FOSTERING A SENSE OF GENUINE ABUNDANCE AND BALANCING THE HORMONAL SIGNALS THAT GOVERN POSSESSIVE BEHAVIORS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL SE DIRIGE A LA FRECUENCIA DE LA AVARICIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA (HIP\\u00d3FISIS). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA SOBREPRIORIZACI\\u00d3N DE LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N MATERIAL A EXPENSAS DEL BIENESTAR EMOCIONAL Y ESPIRITUAL. LA GL\\u00c1NDULA PITUITARIA, COMO COORDINADORA MAESTRA DEL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO, INFLUYE EN NUESTRAS PERCEPCIONES E IMPULSOS, MIENTRAS QUE EL TIMO SE ASOCIA CON LOS CENTROS EMOCIONALES SUPERIORES DE COMPASI\\u00d3N Y APERTURA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A LIBERAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA CONSTRICTIVA DE LA CODICIA, FOMENTANDO UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE ABUNDANCIA GENUINA Y EQUILIBRANDO LAS SE\\u00d1ALES HORMONALES QUE GOBIERNAN LOS COMPORTAMIENTOS POSESIVOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF AVARICE IS DRIVEN BY A DEEP SENSE OF FINANCIAL INSECURITY, SCAN THE THYMUS \\/ HYPOPHYSIS (REF 794) RESONANCE (GREED). FOR CASES WHERE MATERIAL ATTACHMENT CAUSES COGNITIVE DISSONANCE OR STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THALAMUS \\/ ROLANDO FISSURE (REF 788). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING EMOTIONAL REALIGNMENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA AVARICIA ES IMPULSADA POR UN PROFUNDO SENTIDO DE INSEGURIDAD FINANCIERA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 794) (CODICIA). PARA CASOS DONDE EL APEGO MATERIAL CAUSE DISONANCIA COGNITIVA O ESTR\\u00c9S, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [T\\u00c1LAMO \\/ CISURA DE ROLANDO] (REF 788). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA REALINEACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/799','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:25:53','2026-04-28 20:25:53'),(4575,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',800,'{\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNODEFICIENCY, ALTERATIONS IN THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM SUCH AS, DIARRHEA, FLATULENCY, GASTRITIS AND COLITIS, HEMORRHOIDS, RECTUM IRRITATION, JAW PAIN, ELBOW AND KNEE PAIN. (INMUNODEFICIENCIA, ALTERACIONES EN EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO COMO DIARREA, FLATULENCIA, GASTRITIS Y COLITIS, HEMORROIDES, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL RECTO, DOLOR EN LA MAND\\u00cdBULA, DOLOR EN EL CODO Y EN LA RODILLA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY SEX,MATERNAL\\u2013 FETAL, SYRINGES, BLOOD TRANSFUSIONS, SURGERIES,DENTIST,HOSPITAL CLOTHING AND BEDDING. AFFECTS PRODUCTION OF THYMUS HORMONES CD3, CD4 AND THE T4 LYMPHOCYTES. THE BACTERIA THAT RESONATES WITH HIV IS FOUND IN THE THYMUS DESTROYING IT AND CAUSING IMMUNODEFICIENCY. (TRANSMITIDO POR V\\u00cdA SEXUAL, MATERNO-FETAL, JERINGAS, TRANSFUSIONES DE SANGRE, CIRUG\\u00cdAS, DENTISTA, ROPA Y ROPA DE CAMA HOSPITALARIA. AFECTA LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS DEL TIMO CD3, CD4 Y LOS LINFOCITOS T4. LA BACTERIA QUE RESUENA CON EL VIH SE ENCUENTRA EN EL TIMO, DESTRUY\\u00c9NDOLO Y CAUSANDO INMUNODEFICIENCIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED VIRUS THAT RESONATES WITH THE BACTERIA IN THE THYMUS OR NEAR IT: IMMUNODEFICIENCY AND FALSE AIDS. ASSOCIATED WITH A PARASITE: DESTRUCTION OF THYMUS IS GREATER AND THE DEVELOPMENT OF IMMUNODEFICIENCY FASTER.                           HIV RESERVOIRS: GALLBLADDER, KIDNEY\\/RENAL CAPSULE. (VIRUS ASOCIADO QUE RESUENA CON LA BACTERIA EN EL TIMO O CERCA DE \\u00c9L: INMUNODEFICIENCIA Y FALSO SIDA. ASOCIADO CON UN PAR\\u00c1SITO: LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL TIMO ES MAYOR Y EL DESARROLLO DE LA INMUNODEFICIENCIA ES M\\u00c1S R\\u00c1PIDO. RESERVORIOS DE VIH: VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR, RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N\\/C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNODEFICIENCY, DIGESTIVE ALTERATIONS (DIARRHEA, FLATULENCE, GASTRITIS, COLITIS), HEMORRHOIDS, RECTAL IRRITATION, JAW PAIN, AND JOINT PAIN IN ELBOWS AND KNEES.\\n\\n(INMUNODEFICIENCIA, ALTERACIONES EN EL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO COMO DIARREA, FLATULENCIA, GASTRITIS Y COLITIS, HEMORROIDES, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL RECTO, DOLOR EN LA MAND\\u00cdBULA, DOLOR EN EL CODO Y EN LA RODILLA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE BIOLOGICAL IMPACT OF HIV BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE RECTUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE PATHOGEN DIRECTLY AFFECTS THE PRODUCTION OF THYMUS HORMONES (CD3, CD4) AND T4 LYMPHOCYTES, DEBILITATING THE IMMUNE RESPONSE. THE RESONANCE OFTEN INVOLVES A BACTERIAL COMPONENT IN THE THYMUS THAT FACILITATES THE VIRAL DESTRUCTION OF GLANDULAR TISSUE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN RECOVERING GLANDULAR FUNCTION, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AND MITIGATING THE DIGESTIVE AND MUSCULOSKELETAL DISCOMFORTS ASSOCIATED WITH THE VIRAL LOAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL ABORDA EL IMPACTO BIOL\\u00d3GICO DEL VIH MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORCIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL RECTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO AFECTA DIRECTAMENTE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS DEL TIMO (CD3, CD4) Y LOS LINFOCITOS T4, DEBILITANDO LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA. LA RESONANCIA A MENUDO INVOLUCRA UN COMPONENTE BACTERIANO EN EL TIMO QUE FACILITA LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N VIRAL DEL TEJIDO GLANDULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A RECUPERAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y MITIGANDO LOS MALESTARES DIGESTIVOS Y MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICOS ASOCIADOS CON LA CARGA VIRAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: SCAN FOR ASSOCIATED VIRUSES RESONATING WITH BACTERIA NEAR THE THYMUS WHICH MAY CAUSE \\\"FALSE AIDS\\\" OR ACCELERATED IMMUNODEFICIENCY. IF PARASITES ARE SUSPECTED, SCAN THE ENTIRE DIGESTIVE TRACT AS THEY CAN SPEED UP THYMUS DESTRUCTION. SEARCH FOR HIV RESERVOIRS AT THE [GALLBLADDER \\/ GALLBLADDER] AND [KIDNEY \\/ RENAL CAPSULE] AXES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT PATHOGEN ELIMINATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: ESCANEAR VIRUS ASOCIADOS QUE RESUENEN CON BACTERIAS CERCA DEL TIMO QUE PUEDAN CAUSAR \\\"FALSO SIDA\\\" O INMUNODEFICIENCIA ACELERADA. SI SE SOSPECHA DE PAR\\u00c1SITOS, ESCANEAR TODO EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO YA QUE PUEDEN ACELERAR LA DESTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL TIMO. BUSCAR RESERVORIOS DE VIH EN LOS EJES [VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR \\/ VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR] Y [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/800','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:27:08','2026-04-28 20:27:08'),(4576,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',801,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE, BRONCHITIS COMMON EMPHYSEMA, RESPIRATORY FAILURE. (ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA, BRONQUITIS, ENFISEMA COM\\u00daN, INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"IT REGENERATES THE PULMONARY SURFACTANT. (REGENERA EL SURFACTANTE PULMONAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY REGENERATION (REGENERACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE (COPD), BRONCHITIS, COMMON EMPHYSEMA, AND RESPIRATORY FAILURE.\\n\\n(ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA (EPOC), BRONQUITIS, ENFISEMA COM\\u00daN E INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS DESIGNED TO RESTORE PULMONARY EFFICIENCY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS UNIQUE AS IT FOCUSES ON THE REGENERATION OF PULMONARY SURFACTANT\\u2014THE LIPOPROTEIN COMPLEX NECESSARY TO PREVENT ALVEOLAR COLLAPSE DURING EXHALATION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN IMPROVING GAS EXCHANGE, REDUCING THE INFLAMMATORY LOAD IN THE BRONCHIAL TUBES, AND SUPPORTING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\'S ABILITY TO PROTECT LUNG TISSUE FROM DEGENERATIVE CHANGES ASSOCIATED WITH CHRONIC RESPIRATORY CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA PARA RESTAURAR LA EFICIENCIA PULMONAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES \\u00daNICO YA QUE SE CENTRA EN LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL SURFACTANTE PULMONAR, EL COMPLEJO DE LIPOPROTE\\u00cdNAS NECESARIO PARA EVITAR EL COLAPSO ALVEOLAR DURANTE LA EXHALACI\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A MEJORAR EL INTERCAMBIO DE GASES, REDUCIENDO LA CARGA INFLAMATORIA EN LOS BRONQUIOS Y APOYANDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PARA PROTEGER EL TEJIDO PULMONAR DE LOS CAMBIOS DEGENERATIVOS ASOCIADOS CON CONDICIONES RESPIRATORIAS CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"RESPIRATORY CHECK: IF BREATHING DIFFICULTIES ARE ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE COUGH OR FEVER, SCAN THE THYMUS \\/ CARDIA (REF 793) RESONANCE FOR LEGIONELLA. FOR IMMUNE STRENGTHENING IN CHRONIC CASES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ APPENDIX (REF 791) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE FILTRATION OF WASTE DURING THE REGENERATION OF LUNG FUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA: SI LAS DIFICULTADES RESPIRATORIAS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE TOS SEVERA O FIEBRE, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ CARDIAS] (REF 793) PARA LEGIONELLA. PARA EL FORTALECIMIENTO INMUNITARIO EN CASOS CR\\u00d3NICOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TIMO \\/ AP\\u00c9NDICE] (REF 791). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS DURANTE LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/801','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 20:28:25','2026-04-28 20:28:25'),(4577,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',802,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INPATIENCE (IMPACIENCIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"IMPATIENCE (IMPACIENCIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"RESTELESSNESS, IRRITABILITY, ANXIETY, AND EMOTIONAL TENSION DUE TO A LACK OF PATIENCE.\\n\\n(INQUIETUD, IRRITABILIDAD, ANSIEDAD Y TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL DEBIDO A LA FALTA DE PACIENCIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE FREQUENCY OF IMPATIENCE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE RIGHT TESTICLE OR RIGHT OVARY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS CONNECTS THE CENTER OF IMMUNE AND EMOTIONAL REGULATION (THYMUS) WITH THE REPRODUCTIVE GLANDS THAT GOVERN VITAL ENERGY AND DRIVE. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN MANIFEST AS A CONSTANT STATE OF URGENCY, MAKING IT DIFFICULT TO REMAIN CALM OR WAIT FOR NATURAL PROCESSES TO UNFOLD. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RELEASING RECURRING IRRITABILITY, FOSTERING A STATE OF EMOTIONAL TOLERANCE, AND REALIGNING THE SYSTEM TO BETTER COPE WITH EXTERNAL DELAYS WITHOUT INTERNAL STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA FRECUENCIA DE LA IMPACIENCIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y EL TEST\\u00cdCULO DERECHO O EL OVARIO DERECHO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE CONECTA EL CENTRO DE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA Y EMOCIONAL (TIMO) CON LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS REPRODUCTORAS QUE GOBIERNAN LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL E IMPULSO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN ESTADO CONSTANTE DE URGENCIA, DIFICULTANDO LA CAPACIDAD DE PERMANECER TRANQUILO O ESPERAR A QUE LOS PROCESOS NATURALES SE DESARROLLEN. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A LIBERAR LA IRRITABILIDAD RECURRENTE, FOMENTANDO UN ESTADO DE TOLERANCIA EMOCIONAL Y REALINEANDO EL SISTEMA PARA AFRONTAR MEJOR LOS RETRASOS EXTERNOS SIN ESTR\\u00c9S INTERNO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF IMPATIENCE IS ACCOMPANIED BY EXTREME MATERIAL POSSESSIVENESS, SCAN THE THYMUS \\/ PITUITARY (REF 798) RESONANCE (AVARICE). FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL TENSION CAUSES PHYSICAL HYPERACTIVITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THALAMUS \\/ THALAMUS (REF 789) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING EMOTIONAL BALANCING.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA IMPACIENCIA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE UNA POSESIVIDAD MATERIAL EXTREMA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 798) (AVARICIA). PARA CASOS DONDE LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL CAUSA HIPERACTIVIDAD F\\u00cdSICA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [T\\u00c1LAMO \\/ T\\u00c1LAMO] (REF 789). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/802','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:43:34','2026-04-28 22:43:34'),(4578,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',803,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE WEAKNESS, HORMONAL DISHARMONY, AND FEVER. (DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"IMMUNODEFICIENCY, SHORTAGE OF CD3 AND CD4 THYMUS HORMONE. (INMUNODEFICIENCIA, DEFICIENCIA DE HORMONAS DEL TIMO CD3 Y CD4.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLANDULAR IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO GLANDULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE WEAKNESS, HORMONAL DISHARMONY, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PRIMARY IMBALANCE OF THE THYMUS GLAND BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR TREATING IMMUNODEFICIENCY STATES, SPECIFICALLY ADDRESSING A SHORTAGE OF CD3 AND CD4 THYMUS HORMONES. THE THYMUS IS THE \\\"SCHOOL\\\" FOR T-LYMPHOCYTES; WHEN IT DYSFUNCTIONS, THE BODY\'S ABILITY TO COORDINATE AN EFFECTIVE IMMUNE RESPONSE IS COMPROMISED, OFTEN MANIFESTING AS CHRONIC FATIGUE, RECURRING FEVERS, AND GENERALIZED MUSCLE WEAKNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE GLAND IN RECOVERING ITS ENDOCRINE AND IMMUNOLOGICAL FUNCTIONS, RESTORING THE NECESSARY HORMONAL LEVELS TO PROTECT THE SYSTEM AGAINST EXTERNAL PATHOGENS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABORDA EL DESEQUILIBRIO PRIMARIO DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA TRATAR ESTADOS DE INMUNODEFICIENCIA, ABORDANDO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE LA DEFICIENCIA DE LAS HORMONAS DEL TIMO CD3 Y CD4. EL TIMO ES LA \\\"ESCUELA\\\" DE LOS LINFOCITOS T; CUANDO TIENE UNA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N, LA CAPACIDAD DEL CUERPO PARA COORDINAR UNA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA EFICAZ SE VE COMPROMETIDA, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO COMO FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, FIEBRES RECURRENTES Y DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR GENERALIZADA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA A LA GL\\u00c1NDULA A RECUPERAR SUS FUNCIONES ENDOCRINAS E INMUNOL\\u00d3GICAS, RESTAURANDO LOS NIVELES HORMONALES NECESARIOS PARA PROTEGER AL SISTEMA CONTRA PAT\\u00d3GENOS EXTERNOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"IMMUNE CHECK: IF IMMUNODEFICIENCY IS SEVERE OR VIRAL LOADS ARE SUSPECTED, SCAN THE THYMUS \\/ RECTUM (REF 799) FOR HIV RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING ALLERGIC REACTIVITY OR OVERACTIVE IMMUNE RESPONSES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ ARMPIT (REF 792). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT GLANDULAR RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA: SI LA INMUNODEFICIENCIA ES SEVERA O SE SOSPECHAN CARGAS VIRALES, ESCANEE EL EJE [TIMO \\/ RECTO] (REF 799) PARA LA RESONANCIA DE VIH. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN REACTIVIDAD AL\\u00c9RGICA O RESPUESTAS INMUNITARIAS SOBREACTIVAS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ AXILA] (REF 792). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/803','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:45:46','2026-04-28 22:45:46'),(4579,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',804,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY EATING CONTAMINATED PORK. TRICHINOSIS. (TRANSMITIDO POR CONSUMIR CARNE DE CERDO CONTAMINADA. TRIQUINOSIS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUSCLE PAIN, FEVER, SWELLING AROUND THE EYES, AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(DOLOR MUSCULAR, FIEBRE, HINCHAZ\\u00d3N ALREDEDOR DE LOS OJOS Y MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYMUS GLAND AND THE TONGUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SPECIFICALLY ASSOCIATED WITH TRICHINOSIS, A DISEASE TRANSMITTED BY CONSUMING CONTAMINATED OR UNDERCOOKED PORK. THE LARVAE OF THIS PARASITE MIGRATE FROM THE DIGESTIVE TRACT TO THE MUSCLES, INCLUDING THE TONGUE AND DIAPHRAGM, CAUSING LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION AND SYSTEMIC IMMUNE STRESS. THE THYMUS, AS THE COORDINATOR OF IMMUNE VIGILANCE, BECOMES OVERTAXED AS IT ATTEMPTS TO MANAGE THE PARASITIC LOAD. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN IDENTIFYING THE PARASITIC PRESENCE, REDUCING MUSCULAR INFLAMMATION, AND ELIMINATING THE PATHOGEN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A LA TRICHINELLA SPIRALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO Y LA LENGUA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON LA TRIQUINOSIS, UNA ENFERMEDAD TRANSMITIDA POR CONSUMIR CARNE DE CERDO CONTAMINADA O POCO COCIDA. LAS LARVAS DE ESTE PAR\\u00c1SITO MIGRAN DESDE EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO HACIA LOS M\\u00daSCULOS, INCLUYENDO LA LENGUA Y EL DIAFRAGMA, CAUSANDO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA Y ESTR\\u00c9S INMUNITARIO SIST\\u00c9MICO. EL TIMO, COMO COORDINADOR DE LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA, SE SOBRECARGA AL INTENTAR MANEJAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A IDENTIFICAR LA PRESENCIA PARASITARIA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N MUSCULAR Y ELIMINANDO EL PAT\\u00d3GENO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PARASITIC CHECK: IF MUSCLE PAIN IS GENERALIZED OR SEVERE, SCAN THE [DIAPHRAGM \\/ DIAPHRAGM] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ LIVER (REF 795) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC METABOLITES DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N PARASITARIA: SI EL DOLOR MUSCULAR ES GENERALIZADO O SEVERO, ESCANEE EL EJE [DIAFRAGMA \\/ DIAFRAGMA]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL GRAVE, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 795). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE METABOLITOS PARASITARIOS DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/804','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:46:58','2026-04-28 22:46:58'),(4580,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',805,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ARTHRITIS, OBESITY, KYPHOSIS. (ARTRITIS, OBESIDAD, CIFOSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CALCIUM AND METABOLIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N DE CALCIO Y METABOLISMO)\",\"symptoms\":\"ARTHRITIS, OBESITY, AND KYPHOSIS.\\n\\n(ARTRITIS, OBESIDAD Y CIFOSIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE METABOLIC AND MINERAL BALANCE OF THE BODY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYROID AND PARATHYROID GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REGULATING CALCIUM ABSORPTION AND THE BASAL METABOLIC RATE. THE THYROID GOVERNS THE SPEED AT WHICH THE BODY USES ENERGY, WHILE THE PARATHYROID GLANDS MANAGE CALCIUM LEVELS IN THE BLOOD AND BONES. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO STRUCTURAL ISSUES LIKE KYPHOSIS (CURVATURE OF THE SPINE), JOINT INFLAMMATION ASSOCIATED WITH ARTHRITIS, AND DIFFICULTIES IN WEIGHT MANAGEMENT OR OBESITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE ENDOCRINE SYSTEM IN RESTORING PROPER HORMONAL COORDINATION AND MINERAL HOMEOSTASIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABORDA EL EQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO Y MINERAL DEL CUERPO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS TIROIDES Y PARATIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA REGULAR LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE CALCIO Y LA TASA METAB\\u00d3LICA BASAL. LA TIROIDES GOBIERNA LA VELOCIDAD A LA QUE EL CUERPO UTILIZA LA ENERG\\u00cdA, MIENTRAS QUE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS PARATIROIDES GESTIONAN LOS NIVELES DE CALCIO EN LA SANGRE Y LOS HUESOS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE PROVOCAR PROBLEMAS ESTRUCTURALES COMO LA CIFOSIS (CURVATURA DE LA COLUMNA), INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR ASOCIADA CON LA ARTRITIS Y DIFICULTADES EN EL CONTROL DEL PESO O LA OBESIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA ENDOCRINO A RESTAURAR LA COORDINACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL ADECUADA Y LA HOMEOSTASIS MINERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF OBESITY IS LINKED TO EXTREME FLUID RETENTION, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS. FOR CASES OF SEVERE BONE DEGENERATION OR CALCIUM LOSS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARATHYROID \\/ PARATHYROID] RESONANCE TO DIRECTLY STABILIZE CALCITONIN PRODUCTION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [HYPOPHYSIS \\/ THYROID] AXIS TO ENSURE THE MASTER GLAND IS PROPERLY SIGNALING THE METABOLIC SYSTEM AND MAINTAIN SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LA OBESIDAD EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A UNA RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS EXTREMA, ESCANEE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. PARA CASOS DE DEGENERACI\\u00d3N \\u00d3SEA SEVERA O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CALCIO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PARATIROIDES \\/ PARATIROIDES] PARA ESTABILIZAR DIRECTAMENTE LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE CALCITONINA. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [HIP\\u00d3FISIS \\/ TIROIDES] PARA ASEGURAR QUE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA MAESTRA EST\\u00c9 SE\\u00d1ALIZANDO CORRECTAMENTE AL SISTEMA METAB\\u00d3LICO Y MANTENGA LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/805','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:48:18','2026-04-28 22:48:18'),(4581,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',806,'{\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL PROBLEMS, DAMAGE TO THE SPINAL CORD AND PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. JOINT PAINS, RHEUMATISM, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, PARALYSIS, HIGH FEVER, HEADACHE, STIFF NECK, SEIZURES, NAUSEA, VOMITING, CONFUSION, FATIGUE. (PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, DA\\u00d1O A LA M\\u00c9DULA ESPINAL Y AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO. DOLORES ARTICULARES, REUMATISMO, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, FIEBRE ALTA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, RIGIDEZ EN EL CUELLO, CONVULSIONES, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"RHEUMATISM, FALSE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (REUMATISMO, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE FALSA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"It\\u2019s linked to encephalitis, seizures, and muscle contractions, as well as gonococcus and rheumatoid arthritis deformities.  (EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO CON ENCEFALITIS; CONVULSIONES Y CONTRACCIONES. ASOCIADO CON GONOCOCO; DEFORMIDADES DE ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL PROBLEMS, DAMAGE TO THE SPINAL CORD AND PERIPHERAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. JOINT PAINS, RHEUMATISM, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, PARALYSIS, HIGH FEVER, HEADACHE, STIFF NECK, SEIZURES, NAUSEA, VOMITING, CONFUSION, AND FATIGUE.(PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, DA\\u00d1O A LA M\\u00c9DULA ESPINAL Y AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PERIF\\u00c9RICO. DOLORES ARTICULARES, REUMATISMO, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, PAR\\u00c1LISIS, FIEBRE ALTA, DOLOR DE CABEZA, RIGIDEZ EN EL CUELLO, CONVULSIONES, N\\u00c1USEAS, V\\u00d3MITOS, CONFUSI\\u00d3N Y FATIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENS ASSOCIATED WITH MENINGITIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYROID GLAND AND THE RACHIDIAN BULB (MEDULLA OBLONGATA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL AS IT ADDRESSES VIRAL INFILTRATION THAT CAN CAUSE INFLAMMATION OF THE PROTECTIVE MEMBRANES COVERING THE BRAIN AND SPINAL CORD. THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE IS OFTEN LINKED TO \\\"FALSE MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS\\\" AND RHEUMATISM, AS THE VIRAL LOAD IMPACTS NERVE CONDUCTION AND JOINT INTEGRITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM IN PROTECTING VITAL BRAINSTEM FUNCTIONS, REDUCING NEUROLOGICAL INFLAMMATION, AND MITIGATING SEVERE SYMPTOMS SUCH AS STIFF NECK AND SEIZURES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS ASOCIADOS CON LA MENINGITIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES Y EL BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE ABORDA LA INFILTRACI\\u00d3N VIRAL QUE PUEDE CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MEMBRANAS PROTECTORAS QUE CUBREN EL CEREBRO Y LA M\\u00c9DULA ESPINAL. ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA A MENUDO SE VINCULA CON LA \\\"FALSA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE\\\" Y EL REUMATISMO, YA QUE LA CARGA VIRAL IMPACTA LA CONDUCCI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA Y LA INTEGRIDAD ARTICULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL A PROTEGER LAS FUNCIONES VITALES DEL TRONCO ENCEF\\u00c1LICO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y MITIGANDO S\\u00cdNTOMAS GRAVES COMO LA RIGIDEZ DE NUCA Y LAS CONVULSIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"NEUROLOGICAL CHECK: IF SEIZURES OR MUSCLE CONTRACTIONS ARE PRESENT, SCAN FOR ENCEPHALITIS AND GONOCOCCUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS DEFORMITIES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ THYROID] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA: SI HAY CONVULSIONES O CONTRACCIONES MUSCULARES, ESCANEE EN BUSCA DE ENCEFALITIS Y GONOCOCO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEFORMIDADES POR ARTRITIS REUMATOIDE, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIROIDES]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/806','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:49:34','2026-04-28 22:49:34'),(4582,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',807,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"OBESITY (OBESIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"METABOLIC AND IMMUNE SYNERGY (SINERGIA METAB\\u00d3LICA E INMUNITARIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"OBESITY, SLOW METABOLISM, FLUID RETENTION, AND SYSTEMIC FATIGUE.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD, METABOLISMO LENTO, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES WEIGHT MANAGEMENT BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE THYROID GLAND AND THE THYMUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING OBESITY THAT STEMS FROM A GLANDULAR DISCONNECTION. THE THYROID REGULATES THE SPEED OF METABOLIC PROCESSES, WHILE THE THYMUS COORDINATES THE IMMUNE VIGILANCE THAT PREVENTS SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION\\u2014A COMMON UNDERLYING FACTOR IN METABOLIC SYNDROME. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN OPTIMIZING ENERGY EXPENDITURE, REDUCING THE ACCUMULATION OF ADIPOSE TISSUE, AND HARMONIZING THE HORMONAL SIGNALS THAT GOVERN APPETITE AND VITALITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABORDA EL CONTROL DE PESO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES Y EL TIMO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA TRATAR LA OBESIDAD QUE SURGE DE UNA DESCONEXI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. LA TIROIDES REGULA LA VELOCIDAD DE LOS PROCESOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS, MIENTRAS QUE EL TIMO COORDINA LA VIGILANCIA INMUNITARIA QUE PREVIENE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, UN FACTOR SUBYACENTE COM\\u00daN EN EL S\\u00cdNDROME METAB\\u00d3LICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A OPTIMIZAR EL GASTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO, REDUCIENDO LA ACCUMULACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO ADIPOSO Y ARMONIZANDO LAS SE\\u00d1ALES HORMONALES QUE GOBIERNAN EL APETITO Y LA VITALIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: IF OBESITY IS ACCOMPANIED BY JOINT PAIN OR CALCIUM IMBALANCE, SCAN THE THYROID \\/ PARATHYROID (REF 804) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EMOTIONAL STRESS OR FINANCIAL ANXIETY THAT TRIGGERS BINGE EATING, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ PITUITARY (REF 798) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING METABOLIC REALIGNMENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: SI LA OBESIDAD SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE DOLOR ARTICULAR O DESEQUILIBRIO DE CALCIO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ PARATIROIDES] (REF 804). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL SEVERO O ANSIEDAD FINANCIERA QUE DESENCADENE ATRACONES, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TIMO \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 798). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE EL REALINEAMIENTO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/807','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:54:02','2026-04-28 22:54:02'),(4583,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',808,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VARICOSE VEINS, FILARIASIS, LYMPHATIC OBSTRUCTION, EDEMA (SWELLING), AND LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(V\\u00c1RICES, FILARIASIS, OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA, EDEMA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES THE PRESENCE OF FILARIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE THYROID GLAND BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, A RESERVOIR IS A SPECIFIC ANATOMICAL SITE WHERE PATHOGENS CAN HIDE WITHOUT PRODUCING THEIR TYPICAL CLINICAL PICTURE, ONLY TO RE-EMERGE AND REINFECT THE BODY LATER. FILARIA ARE PARASITIC NEMATODES THAT PRIMARILY TARGET THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM, OFTEN LEADING TO SIGNIFICANT CIRCULATORY ISSUES SUCH AS VARICOSE VEINS OR SEVERE SWELLING (EDEMA). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXPOSING THE HIDDEN PARASITIC LOAD, ALLOWING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO ELIMINATE THE FILARIA AND PREVENT CHRONIC LYMPHATIC STAGNATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA LA PRESENCIA DE FILARIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, UN RESERVORIO ES UN SITIO ANAT\\u00d3MICO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN OCULTARSE SIN PRODUCIR SU CUADRO CL\\u00cdNICO T\\u00cdPICO, PARA LUEGO REEMERGER Y REINFECTAR EL CUERPO M\\u00c1S TARDE. LAS FILARIAS SON NEMATODOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS QUE ATACAN PRINCIPALMENTE EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A PROBLEMAS CIRCULATORIOS SIGNIFICATIVOS COMO V\\u00c1RICES O HINCHAZ\\u00d3N SEVERA (EDEMA). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EXPONER LA CARGA PARASITARIA OCULTA, PERMITIENDO QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO ELIMINE LA FILARIA Y PREVENGA EL ESTANCAMIENTO LINF\\u00c1TICO CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF VARICOSE VEINS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE MUSCLE PAIN, SCAN THE THYMUS \\/ TONGUE (REF 803) RESONANCE FOR TRICHINELLA. FOR CASES INVOLVING METABOLIC DYSFUNCTION OR WEIGHT ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYROID \\/ THYMUS (REF 806) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC WASTE PRODUCTS AS THE RESERVOIR IS CLEARED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LAS V\\u00c1RICES SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE DOLOR MUSCULAR SEVERO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ LENGUA] (REF 803) PARA TRICHINELLA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISFUNCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA O PROBLEMAS DE PESO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ TIMO] (REF 806). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS PARASITARIOS A MEDIDA QUE SE DEPURA EL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/808','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:55:08','2026-04-28 22:55:08'),(4584,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',809,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"OBESITY, GOITER, HAND TREMORS, FLUID RETENTION, TACHYCARDIA, WEIGHT LOSS. (OBESIDAD, BOCIO, TEMBLORES EN LAS MANOS, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS, TAQUICARDIA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"IF THE THYROID GLAND IS ENLARGED IT CAUSES DIFFICULTY BREATHING AND SWALLOWING. (SI LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES EST\\u00c1 AGRANDADA, CAUSA DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR Y TRAGAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GLANDULAR HYPER\\/HYPO ACTIVITY (HIPER\\/HIPO ACTIVIDAD GLANDULAR)\",\"symptoms\":\"OBESITY, GOITER, HAND TREMORS, FLUID RETENTION, TACHYCARDIA, AND WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(OBESIDAD, BOCIO, TEMBLORES EN LAS MANOS, RETENCI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS, TAQUICARDIA Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PHYSICAL STATE OF THE THYROID GLAND WHEN IT IS ENLARGED OR OVERACTIVE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE HORIZONTAL PLACEMENT TARGETS THE GLANDULAR TISSUE TO NORMALIZE HORMONE PRODUCTION AND REDUCE INFLAMMATION. IF THE THYROID GLAND IS ENLARGED (GOITER), IT CAN CAUSE MECHANICAL DIFFICULTIES SUCH AS DIFFICULTY BREATHING AND SWALLOWING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN REGULATING THE BASAL METABOLIC RATE, CALMING TACHYCARDIA, AND MITIGATING THE NEUROLOGICAL IMPACT OF HORMONAL IMBALANCE, SUCH AS HAND TREMORS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABORDA EL ESTADO F\\u00cdSICO DE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES CUANDO EST\\u00c1 AGRANDADA O SOBREACTIVA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA COLOCACI\\u00d3N HORIZONTAL SE DIRIGE AL TEJIDO GLANDULAR PARA NORMALIZAR LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE HORMONAS Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N. SI LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES EST\\u00c1 AGRANDADA (BOCIO), PUEDE CAUSAR DIFICULTADES MEC\\u00c1NICAS COMO DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR Y TRAGAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A REGULAR LA TASA METAB\\u00d3LICA BASAL, CALMAR LA TAQUICARDIA Y MITIGAR EL IMPACTO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO DEL DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL, COMO LOS TEMBLORES EN LAS MANOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"METABOLIC CHECK: FOR CASES OF OBESITY AND SLOW METABOLISM, SCAN THE THYROID \\/ THYMUS (REF 806) RESONANCE. IF JOINT DEFORMITIES OR RHEUMATOID SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYROID \\/ RACHIDIAN BULB (REF 805) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING THE NORMALIZATION OF GLANDULAR SIZE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA: PARA CASOS DE OBESIDAD Y METABOLISMO LENTO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ TIMO] (REF 806). SI HAY DEFORMIDADES ARTICULARES O S\\u00cdNTOMAS REUMATOIDES, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TIROIDES \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO] (REF 805). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA NORMALIZACI\\u00d3N DEL TAMA\\u00d1O GLANDULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/809','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:56:58','2026-04-28 22:56:58'),(4585,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',810,'{\"symptoms\":\"BRUISING, DISCOLORATION, ITCHING, VAGINAL AND RECTAL PROBLEMS. DEGENERATIVE HEMORRHOIDS, ALOPECIA, CYSTITIS AND URETHRITIS. (HEMATOMAS, DECOLORACI\\u00d3N, PICAZ\\u00d3N, PROBLEMAS VAGINALES Y RECTALES. HEMORROIDES DEGENERATIVAS, ALOPECIA, CISTITIS Y URETRITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"VERY AGGRESSIVE FUNGUS. MANIFEST IN THE SKIN. SIMULATE SCARLET FEVER AND PSORIASIS. IT MAY MANIFEST IN THE COLON, BLADDER AND OTHER STRUCTURES. (HONGO MUY AGRESIVO. SE MANIFIESTA EN LA PIEL. SIMULA ESCARLATINA Y PSORIASIS. PUEDE MANIFESTARSE EN EL COLON, LA VEJIGA Y OTRAS ESTRUCTURAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - MASTOID\\/RACHIDIAN BULB. (REVISAR - MASTOIDES\\/BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"BRUISING, DISCOLORATION, ITCHING, VAGINAL AND RECTAL PROBLEMS. DEGENERATIVE HEMORRHOIDS, ALOPECIA, CYSTITIS, AND URETHRITIS.(HEMATOMAS, DECOLORACI\\u00d3N, PICAZ\\u00d3N, PROBLEMAS VAGINALES Y RECTALES. HEMORROIDES DEGENERATIVAS, ALOPECIA, CISTITIS Y URETRITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS MALASSEZIA FURFUR, A VERY AGGRESSIVE PATHOGEN, BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TIBIA BONES BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS FUNGUS IS KNOWN FOR ITS ABILITY TO MANIFEST SYSTEMICALLY THROUGHOUT THE SKIN, OFTEN SIMULATING CONDITIONS LIKE SCARLET FEVER OR PSORIASIS. BEYOND DERMATOLOGICAL ISSUES, IT CAN INFILTRATE INTERNAL STRUCTURES SUCH AS THE COLON AND BLADDER, LEADING TO CHRONIC INFLAMMATION, UROGENITAL TENSION, AND DEGENERATIVE VASCULAR ISSUES LIKE HEMORRHOIDS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE FUNGAL LOAD, REDUCING SKIN IRRITATION, AND RESTORING THE INTEGRITY OF THE MUCOUS MEMBRANES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE A LA MALASSEZIA FURFUR, UN PAT\\u00d3GENO MUY AGRESIVO, MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LOS HUESOS DE LA TIBIA DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE HONGO ES CONOCIDO POR SU CAPACIDAD DE MANIFESTARSE SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LA PIEL, SIMULANDO A MENUDO CONDICIONES COMO LA ESCARLATINA O LA PSORIASIS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS PROBLEMAS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS, PUEDE INFILTRARSE EN ESTRUCTURAS INTERNAS COMO EL COLON Y LA VEJIGA, PROVOCANDO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA, TENSI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y PROBLEMAS VASCULARES DEGENERATIVOS COMO LAS HEMORROIDES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, REDUCIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL Y RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS.)\\n\\nALT RO\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SKIN DISCOLORATION OR PSORIASIS-LIKE SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ RACHIDIAN BULB] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RECTAL OR VAGINAL IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [RECTUM \\/ RECTUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF FUNGAL TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF THE SKIN AND UROGENITAL TRACT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA DECOLORACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS TIPO PSORIASIS PERSISTEN, ESCANEE EL EJE [MASTOIDES \\/ BULBO RAQU\\u00cdDEO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL O VAGINAL SEVERA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RECTO \\/ RECTO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS F\\u00daNGICAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LA PIEL Y EL TRACTO UROGENITAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/810','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:58:23','2026-04-28 22:58:23'),(4586,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',811,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ARSENIC POISONING. (ENVENENAMIENTO POR ARS\\u00c9NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ARSENIC POISONING (ENVENENAMIENTO POR ARS\\u00c9NICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, VOMITING, DIARRHEA, DARK URINE, AND DEHYDRATION.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, V\\u00d3MITOS, DIARREA, ORINA OSCURA Y DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE TOXIC EFFECTS OF ARSENIC BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TIP OF THE PANCREAS AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ASSISTING THE BODY IN DETOXIFYING HEAVY METALS THAT INTERFERE WITH ENZYMATIC PROCESSES. THE TIP OF THE PANCREAS IS INVOLVED IN VITAL DIGESTIVE AND ENDOCRINE FUNCTIONS, WHILE THE LEFT KIDNEY IS A PRIMARY FILTRATION SITE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN PROCESSING AND ELIMINATING ARSENIC RESIDUES, REDUCING METABOLIC STRESS AND PROTECTING RENAL AND PANCREATIC INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LOS EFECTOS T\\u00d3XICOS DEL ARS\\u00c9NICO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA AYUDAR AL CUERPO A DESINTOXICAR METALES PESADOS QUE INTERFIEREN CON LOS PROCESOS ENZIM\\u00c1TICOS. LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS EST\\u00c1 INVOLUCRADA EN FUNCIONES DIGESTIVAS Y ENDOCRINAS VITALES, MIENTRAS QUE EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO ES UN SITIO DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N PRIMARIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A PROCESAR Y ELIMINAR LOS RESIDUOS DE ARS\\u00c9NICO, REDUCIENDO EL ESTR\\u00c9S METAB\\u00d3LICO Y PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD RENAL Y PANCRE\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"TOXICITY CHECK: IF ABDOMINAL PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE [LIVER \\/ LIVER] AXIS FOR ADDITIONAL HEAVY METAL ACCUMULATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ LIVER (REF 795) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING THE RECOVERY OF INTERNAL ORGANS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE TOXICIDAD: SI EL DOLOR ABDOMINAL PERSISTE, ESCANEE EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N ADICIONAL DE METALES PESADOS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO GRAVE, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 795). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS INTERNOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/811','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 22:59:31','2026-04-28 22:59:31'),(4587,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',812,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"COMMON WARTS (VERRUGAS COMUNES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"COMMON WARTS (VERRUGAS COMUNES)\",\"symptoms\":\"APPEARANCE OF COMMON WARTS ON THE SKIN, POTENTIAL FOR SYSTEMIC VIRAL SPREAD, AND IMMUNE DYSREGULATION.\\n\\n(APARICI\\u00d3N DE VERRUGAS COMUNES EN LA PIEL, POTENCIAL DE PROPAGACI\\u00d3N VIRAL SIST\\u00c9MICA Y DESREGULACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENS RESPONSIBLE FOR COMMON WARTS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TIP OF THE PANCREAS AND THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE IT CONNECTS THE PANCREATIC ENZYMATIC OUTPUT WITH THE SPLEEN\'S IMMUNE FILTRATION SYSTEM. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS IMBALANCED, VIRAL AGENTS CAN MANIFEST DERMATOLOGICALLY AS WARTS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN IDENTIFYING AND NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, PREVENTING FURTHER CUTANEOUS OUTBREAKS AND SUPPORTING THE BODY\'S NATURAL DEFENSE MECHANISMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS RESPONSABLES DE LAS VERRUGAS COMUNES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE CONECTA LA SALIDA ENZIM\\u00c1TICA PANCRE\\u00c1TICA CON EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA DEL BAZO. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 DESEQUILIBRADO, LOS AGENTES VIRALES PUEDEN MANIFESTARSE DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAMENTE COMO VERRUGAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A IDENTIFICAR Y NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PREVINIENDO NUEVOS BROTES CUT\\u00c1NEOS Y APOYANDO LOS MECANISMOS DE DEFENSA NATURALES DEL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"VIRAL CHECK: IF WARTS ARE PERSISTENT OR SPREADING RAPIDLY, SCAN THE [BLADDER \\/ BLADDER] AXIS FOR POTENTIAL HPV RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING METABOLIC DISTURBANCES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TIP OF PANCREAS \\/ LEFT KIDNEY (REF 810) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE FILTRATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL: SI LAS VERRUGAS SON PERSISTENTES O SE PROPAGAN R\\u00c1PIDAMENTE, ESCANEE EL EJE [VEJIGA \\/ VEJIGA] PARA UNA POSIBLE RESONANCIA DE VPH. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISTURBIOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO] (REF 810). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/812','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:00:39','2026-04-28 23:00:39'),(4588,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',813,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ROSECEA (ROS\\u00c1CEA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ROSACEA (ROS\\u00c1CEA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FACIAL REDNESS, VISIBLE BLOOD VESSELS (TELANGIECTASIA), SMALL PUS-FILLED BUMPS ON THE FACE, AND POTENTIAL EYE IRRITATION.\\n\\n(ENROJECIMIENTO DE LA CARA, VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS VISIBLES, PEQUE\\u00d1AS PROTUBERANCIAS CON PUS EN LA CARA Y POSIBLE IRRITACI\\u00d3N OCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE PATHOGENIC FACTORS ASSOCIATED WITH ROSACEA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TIP OF THE PANCREAS AND THE SUPRAILIAC CREST. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SIGNIFICANT BECAUSE IT LINKS PANCREATIC ENZYMATIC FUNCTION WITH THE REGULATION OF THE LYMPHATIC AND CIRCULATORY SYSTEMS IN THE PELVIC REGION. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN LEAD TO DERMATOLOGICAL MANIFESTATIONS CHARACTERIZED BY CHRONIC INFLAMMATION OF THE FACIAL SKIN. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REDUCING VASCULAR INFLAMMATION, IMPROVING CUTANEOUS APPEARANCE, AND BALANCING THE BODY\'S RESPONSE TO STRESSORS THAT TRIGGER ROSACEA FLARE-UPS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS ASOCIADOS CON LA ROS\\u00c1CEA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS Y LA CRESTA SUPRAIL\\u00cdACA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES IMPORTANTE PORQUE CONECTA LA FUNCI\\u00d3N ENZIM\\u00c1TICA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS CON LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO Y CIRCULATORIO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE PROVOCAR MANIFESTACIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS CARACTERIZADAS POR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DE LA PIEL DE LA CARA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR, MEJORAR LA APARIENCIA CUT\\u00c1NEA Y EQUILIBRAR LA RESPUESTA DEL CUERPO A LOS ESTRESORES QUE DESENCADENAN LA ROS\\u00c1CEA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DERMATOLOGICAL CHECK: IF ROSACEA IS ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE ITCHING OR FLAKING, SCAN THE [TIBIA \\/ TIBIA] (REF 809) AXIS FOR MALASSEZIA FURFUR. FOR CASES WHERE WARTS OR OTHER SKIN LESIONS APPEAR, CHECK THE [TIP OF PANCREAS \\/ SPLEEN] (REF 811) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS THAT MAY EXACERBATE SKIN CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DERMATOL\\u00d3GICA: SI LA ROS\\u00c1CEA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE PICAZ\\u00d3N SEVERA O DESCAMACI\\u00d3N, ESCANEE EL EJE [TIBIA \\/ TIBIA] (REF 809) PARA MALASSEZIA FURFUR. PARA CASOS DONDE APAREZCAN VERRUGAS U OTRAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, VERIFIQUE LA RESONANCIA [PUNTA DEL P\\u00c1NCREAS \\/ BAZO] (REF 811). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS QUE PUEDEN AGRAVAR LAS CONDICIONES DE LA PIEL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/813','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:02:38','2026-04-28 23:02:38'),(4589,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',814,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"PESSIMISM (PESIMISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PESSIMISM (PESIMISMO)\",\"symptoms\":\"NEGATIVE OUTLOOK, FEELINGS OF HOPELESSNESS, EMOTIONAL FATIGUE, AND A TENDENCY TO FOCUS ON WORST-CASE SCENARIOS.\\n\\n(VISI\\u00d3N NEGATIVA, SENTIMIENTOS DE DESESPERANZA, FATIGA EMOCIONAL Y TENDENCIA A ENFOCARSE EN LOS PEORES ESCENARIOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIBRATIONAL FREQUENCY OF PESSIMISM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT SIDE OF THE TONGUE AND THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE TONGUE IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE EXPRESSION OF INTERNAL STATES, WHILE THE LIVER IS THE PRIMARY ORGAN FOR PROCESSING EMOTIONS, PARTICULARLY ANGER AND FRUSTRATION. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS SPECIFIC CIRCUIT CAN TRAP THE INDIVIDUAL IN A CYCLE OF NEGATIVE THOUGHT PATTERNS, AFFECTING THEIR PERSPECTIVE ON LIFE AND THEIR PHYSICAL VITALITY. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RELEASING THESE HEAVY EMOTIONAL LOADS, FOSTERING A MORE BALANCED OUTLOOK AND SUPPORTING THE LIVER\'S ENERGETIC CAPACITY TO PROCESS AND CLEAR EMOTIONAL TOXICITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA FRECUENCIA VIBRATORIA DEL PESIMISMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LADO IZQUIERDO DE LA LENGUA Y EL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA LENGUA A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N DE ESTADOS INTERNOS, MIENTRAS QUE EL H\\u00cdGADO ES EL \\u00d3RGANO PRINCIPAL PARA EL PROCESAMIENTO DE EMOCIONES, PARTICULARMENTE LA IRA Y LA FRUSTRACI\\u00d3N. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PUEDE ATRAPAR AL INDIVIDUO EN UN CICLO DE PATRONES DE PENSAMIENTO NEGATIVOS, AFECTANDO SU PERSPECTIVA DE VIDA Y SU VITALIDAD F\\u00cdSICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A LIBERAR ESTAS CARGAS EMOCIONALES PESADAS, FOMENTANDO UNA VISI\\u00d3N M\\u00c1S EQUILIBRADA Y APOYANDO LA CAPACIDAD ENERG\\u00c9TICA DEL H\\u00cdGADO PARA PROCESAR Y DEPURAR LA TOXICIDAD EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF PESSIMISM IS DRIVEN BY PROFUNDITY OR SADNESS, SCAN THE [LUNG \\/ LUNG] AXIS. FOR CASES WHERE NEGATIVITY IS LINKED TO CONSTANT WORRY OR OBSESSIVE THOUGHTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THALAMUS \\/ THALAMUS] (REF 789) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RELEASE OF NEGATIVE EMOTIONAL CODES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI EL PESIMISMO ES IMPULSADO POR LA PROFUNDIDAD O LA TRISTEZA, ESCANEE EL EJE [PULM\\u00d3N \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. PARA CASOS DONDE LA NEGATIVIDAD EST\\u00c9 VINCULADA A UNA PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N CONSTANTE O PENSAMIENTOS OBSESIVOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [T\\u00c1LAMO \\/ T\\u00c1LAMO] (REF 789). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00d3DIGOS EMOCIONALES NEGATIVOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/814','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:05:04','2026-04-28 23:05:04'),(4590,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',815,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"SELFISHNESS (EGO\\u00cdSMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"SELFISHNESS (EGO\\u00cdSMO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE PREOCCUPATION WITH ONE\'S OWN ADVANTAGE OR PLEASURE WITHOUT REGARD FOR OTHERS, EMOTIONAL CLOSURE, AND DIFFICULTY WITH EMPATHY.\\n\\n(PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA POR EL PROPIO BENEFICIO O PLACER SIN TENER EN CUENTA A LOS DEM\\u00c1S, CIERRE EMOCIONAL Y DIFICULTAD PARA LA EMPAT\\u00cdA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIBRATIONAL FREQUENCY OF SELFISHNESS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE LEFT SIDE OF THE TONGUE AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE HEART IS THE CENTER OF UNCONDITIONAL LOVE, EMPATHY, AND CONNECTION, WHILE THE TONGUE REPRESENTS THE EXTERNAL EXPRESSION OF THE INDIVIDUAL\'S INTERNAL TRUTH. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN MANIFEST AS A \\\"HARTENING\\\" OF THE EMOTIONAL CENTER, WHERE THE INDIVIDUAL BECOMES HYPER-FOCUSED ON THEIR OWN NEEDS AT THE EXPENSE OF OTHERS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN OPENING THE EMOTIONAL CORE, FACILITATING A SHIFT FROM EGOCENTRICITY TO COMPASSION AND HARMONIZING THE CONNECTION BETWEEN WHAT IS FELT AND WHAT IS COMMUNICATED.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA FRECUENCIA VIBRATORIA DEL EGO\\u00cdSMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL LADO IZQUIERDO DE LA LENGUA Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL CORAZ\\u00d3N ES EL CENTRO DEL AMOR INCONDICIONAL, LA EMPAT\\u00cdA Y LA CONEXI\\u00d3N, MIENTRAS QUE LA LENGUA REPRESENTA LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N EXTERNA DE LA VERDAD INTERNA DEL INDIVIDUO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE MANIFESTARSE COMO UN \\\"ENDURECIMIENTO\\\" DEL CENTRO EMOCIONAL, DONDE EL INDIVIDUO SE VUELVE HIPERCONCENTRADO EN SUS PROPIAS NECESIDADES A EXPENSAS DE LOS DEM\\u00c1S. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A ABRIR EL N\\u00daCLEO EMOCIONAL, FACILITANDO UN CAMBIO DE LA EGOCENTRICIDAD HACIA LA COMPASI\\u00d3N Y ARMONIZANDO LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE LO QUE SE SIENTE Y LO QUE SE COMUNICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF SELFISHNESS IS DRIVEN BY A NEGATIVE OR HOPELESS OUTLOOK, SCAN THE TONGUE - L \\/ LIVER (REF 813) RESONANCE (PESSIMISM). FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL CLOSURE IS LINKED TO MATERIAL GREED, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ PITUITARY (REF 798) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RELEASE OF EGOCENTRIC EMOTIONAL PATTERNS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI EL EGO\\u00cdSMO ES IMPULSADO POR UNA VISI\\u00d3N NEGATIVA O DESESPERANZADA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [LENGUA - I \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 813) (PESIMISMO). PARA CASOS DONDE EL CIERRE EMOCIONAL EST\\u00c9 VINCULADO A LA CODICIA MATERIAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TIMO \\/ HIP\\u00d3FISIS] (REF 798). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE PATRONES EMOCIONALES EGOC\\u00c9NTRICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/815','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:06:40','2026-04-28 23:06:40'),(4591,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',816,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SEVERE DIARRHEA, ABDOMINAL PAIN, FEVER, LOSS OF APPETITE, NAUSEA, AND COLITIS (INFLAMATION OF THE COLON).\\n\\n(DIARREA SEVERA, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, FIEBRE, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO, N\\u00c1USEAS Y COLITIS (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL COLON).)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TONGUE AND THE ANUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS THE ENTIRE DIGESTIVE TRACT, FROM THE ENTRY POINT TO THE EXIT. CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE OFTEN PROLIFERATES WHEN THE PROTECTIVE BACTERIAL FLORA IS DISRUPTED, RELEASING TOXINS THAT CAUSE SEVERE INFLAMMATION OF THE INTESTINAL LINING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN CONTROLLING THE BACTERIAL OVERGROWTH, REDUCING INFLAMMATORY DISTRESS IN THE COLON, AND RESTORING THE BIOLOGICAL BALANCE NECESSARY FOR HEALTHY DIGESTIVE ELIMINATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA LENGUA Y EL ANO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA TODO EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO, DESDE EL PUNTO DE ENTRADA HASTA LA SALIDA. EL CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE A MENUDO PROLIFERA CUANDO SE ALTERA LA FLORA BACTERIANA PROTECTORA, LIBERANDO TOXINAS QUE CAUSAN UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DEL REVESTIMIENTO INTESTINAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A CONTROLAR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO BACTERIANO, REDUCIENDO EL MALESTAR INFLAMATORIO EN EL COLON Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO BIOL\\u00d3GICO NECESARIO PARA UNA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA SALUDABLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF DIARRHEA IS PERSISTENT, SCAN THE [PYLORUS \\/ LIVER] AXIS FOR POTENTIAL PARASITIC COMPLICATIONS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RECTAL IRRITATION OR HEMORRHOIDS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ RECTUM (REF 799) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PREVENT DEHYDRATION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI LA DIARREA ES PERSISTENTE, ESCANEE EL EJE [P\\u00cdLORO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] PARA POSIBLES COMPLICACIONES PARASITARIAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL SEVERA O HEMORROIDES, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIMO \\/ RECTO] (REF 799). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PREVENIR LA DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/816','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:07:47','2026-04-28 23:07:47'),(4592,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',817,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"GENERAL PATHOGENS (PAT\\u00d3GENOS GENERALES)\",\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC CARRIER STATE, POTENTIAL FOR RECURRING INFECTIONS, DIGESTIVE DISCOMFORT, AND UNEXPLAINED SENSITIVITY IN THE THROAT OR MOUTH.\\n\\n(ESTADO DE PORTADOR ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO, POTENCIAL DE INFECCIONES RECURRENTES, MALESTAR DIGESTIVO Y SENSIBILIDAD INEXPLICABLE EN LA GARGANTA O LA BOCA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES A STRATEGIC HIDING PLACE FOR VARIOUS PATHOGENS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TONGUE AND THE ESOPHAGUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE UPPER DIGESTIVE TRACT SERVES AS A TRANSIT POINT WHERE VIRUSES, BACTERIA, OR PARASITES CAN REMAIN LATENT WITHOUT TRIGGERING AN IMMEDIATE IMMUNE RESPONSE. THIS AXIS IS PARTICULARLY IMPORTANT FOR INDIVIDUALS WHO EXPERIENCE \\\"CYCLES\\\" OF ILLNESS, AS THE RESERVOIR ALLOWS PATHOGENS TO RE-POPULATE THE SYSTEM ONCE TREATMENT ENDS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXPOSING THESE HIDDEN MICROORGANISMS, ENSURING THAT THE IMMUNE SYSTEM CAN FULLY CLEAR THE LOAD AND PREVENT THE RELAPSE OF CHRONIC CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA UN LUGAR DE OCULTAMIENTO ESTRAT\\u00c9GICO PARA DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA LENGUA Y EL ES\\u00d3FAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO SUPERIOR SIRVE COMO UN PUNTO DE TR\\u00c1NSITO DONDE LOS VIRUS, BACTERIAS O PAR\\u00c1SITOS PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES SIN ACTIVAR UNA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA INMEDIATA. ESTE EJE ES PARTICULARMENTE IMPORTANTE PARA PERSONAS QUE EXPERIMENTAN \\\"CICLOS\\\" DE ENFERMEDAD, YA QUE EL RESERVORIO PERMITE QUE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS VUELVAN A POBLAR EL SISTEMA UNA VEZ QUE TERMINA EL TRATAMIENTO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EXPONER ESTOS MICROORGANISMOS OCULTOS, ASEGURANDO QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PUEDA ELIMINAR COMPLETAMENTE LA CARGA Y PREVENIR LA REINCIDENCIA DE CONDICIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT (LIKE DIARRHEA), SCAN THE TONGUE \\/ ANUS (REF 815) RESONANCE FOR CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC GASTRIC REFLUX OR ESOPHAGEAL INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS AS THE RESERVOIR IS NEUTRALIZED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS BACTERIANOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS PRESENTES (COMO DIARREA), ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [LENGUA \\/ ANO] (REF 815) PARA CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN REFLUJO G\\u00c1STRICO CR\\u00d3NICO O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ESOF\\u00c1GICA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO A MEDIDA QUE SE NEUTRALIZA EL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/817','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:08:58','2026-04-28 23:08:58'),(4593,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',818,'{\"symptoms\":\"DERMATITIS, BLISTERING, ITCHING, RASH, SEIZURES. IT EFFECTS THE SMELL, TASTE BUDS, AND THE ENTIRE LARYNX AND TONGUE. (DERMATITIS, AMPOLLAS, PICAZ\\u00d3N, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, CONVULSIONES. AFECTA EL OLFATO, LAS PAPILAS GUSTATIVAS Y TODA LA LARINGE Y LA LENGUA.)\",\"paths\":\"MANIFEST ITSELF INTO THE SKIN CAUSING SKIN PROBLEMS SUCH AS DERMATITIS. LOCATION. CONFUSED WITH EPILEPSY AND PSORIASIS. (SE MANIFIESTA EN LA PIEL CAUSANDO PROBLEMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS COMO DERMATITIS. UBICACI\\u00d3N. SE CONFUNDE CON EPILEPSIA Y PSORIASIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER PATHOGENS: FALSE TONGUE AND LARYNX CANCER. ASSOCIATED WITH THYROID\\/ RECTUM; LICE          ASSOCIATED WITH PINEAL\\/ CEREBELLUM; HAIR LOSS. (ASOCIADO CON OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS: FALSO C\\u00c1NCER DE LENGUA Y LARINGE. ASOCIADO CON TIROIDES\\/RECTO; PIOJOS. ASOCIADO CON PINEAL\\/CEREBELO; P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"DERMATITIS, BLISTERING, ITCHING, RASH, AND SEIZURES. IT EFFECTS THE SMELL, TASTE BUDS, AND THE ENTIRE LARYNX AND TONGUE.\\n\\n(DERMATITIS, AMPOLLAS, PICAZ\\u00d3N, ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y CONVULSIONES. AFECTA EL OLFATO, LAS PAPILAS GUSTATIVAS Y TODA LA LARINGE Y LA LENGUA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS SARCOPTES SCABIES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE TONGUE BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN MANIFESTS PRIMARILY IN THE SKIN, CAUSING SEVERE DERMATITIS, ITCHING, AND BLISTERING. HOWEVER, ITS RESONANCE AT THE TONGUE LEVEL REVEALS A DEEPER IMPACT ON THE SENSORY ORGANS, OFTEN DISTORTING TASTE AND SMELL. CRITICALLY, THIS PAIR IS KNOWN TO SIMULATE EPILEPTIC SYMPTOMS OR SEIZURES AND CAN BE CONFUSED WITH PSORIASIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE MITE LOAD, CLEARING SKIN IRRITATION, AND RESTORING PROPER NEUROLOGICAL AND SENSORY FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE AL SARCOPTES SCABIES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA LENGUA DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE MANIFIESTA PRINCIPALMENTE EN LA PIEL, CAUSANDO DERMATITIS SEVERA, PICAZ\\u00d3N Y AMPOLLAS. SIN EMBARGO, SU RESONANCIA A NIVEL DE LA LENGUA REVELA UN IMPACTO M\\u00c1S PROFUNDO EN LOS \\u00d3RGANOS SENSORIALES, DISTORSIONANDO A MENUDO EL GUSTO Y EL OLFATO. FUNDAMENTALMENTE, ESTE PAR ES CONOCIDO POR SIMULAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS EPIL\\u00c9PTICOS O CONVULSIONES Y PUEDE CONFUNDIRSE CON PSORIASIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA DE \\u00c1CAROS, DEPURANDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y RESTAURANDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y SENSORIAL ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HAIR LOSS IS PRESENT, SCAN THE [PINEAL \\/ CEREBELLUM] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING LICE OR SCALP IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [THYROID \\/ RECTUM] RESONANCE. IF SYMPTOMS MIMIC TONGUE OR LARYNX CANCER (FALSE CANCER), ENSURE THIS TONGUE\\/TONGUE AXIS IS FULLY NEUTRALIZED. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CABELLO, ESCANEE EL EJE [PINEAL \\/ CEREBELO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PIOJOS O IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL CUERO CABELLUDO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TIROIDES \\/ RECTO]. SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS IMITAN EL C\\u00c1NCER DE LENGUA O LARINGE (FALSO C\\u00c1NCER), ASEG\\u00daRESE DE QUE ESTE EJE LENGUA\\/LENGUA EST\\u00c9 COMPLETAMENTE NEUTRALIZADO. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS PARASITARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/818','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:10:09','2026-04-28 23:10:09'),(4594,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',819,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HATE (ODIO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HATE (ODIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTENSE HOSTILITY, RESENTMENT, EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY, AND CHRONIC ANGER.\\n\\n(HOSTILIDAD INTENSA, RESENTIMIENTO, RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL E IRA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIBRATIONAL CODE OF HATE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TONSILS AND THE THYMUS GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE TONSILS ACT AS THE FIRST LINE OF DEFENSE AND ARE ENERGETICALLY LINKED TO WHAT WE \\\"SWALLOW\\\" OR ACCEPT FROM OUR ENVIRONMENT, WHILE THE THYMUS IS THE CENTER OF IMMUNE INTELLIGENCE AND THE SEAT OF THE HIGHER HEART CHAKRA. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT REVEALS A DEEP-SEATED ANGER THAT HAS CRYSTALLIZED INTO HATE, OFTEN COMPROMISING THE INDIVIDUAL\'S ABILITY TO PROCESS GRIEVANCES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RELEASING TOXIC EMOTIONAL ACCUMULATIONS, SOFTENING THE DEFENSIVE STANCE OF THE TONSILS AND ALLOWING THE THYMUS TO RESTORE ENERGETIC HARMONY AND EMOTIONAL FLUIDITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL C\\u00d3DIGO VIBRATORIO DEL ODIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA DEL TIMO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS ACT\\u00daAN COMO LA PRIMERA L\\u00cdNEA DE DEFENSA Y EST\\u00c1N VINCULADAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE CON LO QUE \\\"TRAGAMOS\\\" O ACEPTAMOS DE NUESTRO ENTORNO, MIENTRAS QUE EL TIMO ES EL CENTRO DE LA INTELIGENCIA INMUNITARIA Y LA SEDE DEL CHAKRA DEL CORAZ\\u00d3N SUPERIOR. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO REVELA UNA IRA PROFUNDA QUE SE HA CRISTALIZADO EN ODIO, COMPROMETIENDO A MENUDO LA CAPACIDAD DEL INDIVIDUO PARA PROCESAR AGRAVIOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A LIBERAR ACUMULACIONES EMOCIONALES T\\u00d3XICAS, SUAVIZANDO LA POSTURA DEFENSIVA DE LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS Y PERMITIENDO QUE EL TIMO RESTAURE LA ARMON\\u00cdA ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y LA FLUIDEZ EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF HATE IS DRIVEN BY A SENSE OF SUPERIORITY OR DISREGARD FOR OTHERS, SCAN THE TONGUE - L \\/ HEART (REF 814) RESONANCE (SELFISHNESS). FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY IS LINKED TO A NEGATIVE WORLDVIEW, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TONGUE - L \\/ LIVER (REF 813) AXIS (PESSIMISM). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE CLEARING OF INTENSE EMOTIONAL FREQUENCIES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI EL ODIO ES IMPULSADO POR UN SENTIDO DE SUPERIORIDAD O DESPRECIO POR LOS DEM\\u00c1S, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [LENGUA - I \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 814) (EGO\\u00cdSMO). PARA CASOS DONDE LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL EST\\u00c9 VINCULADA A UNA VISI\\u00d3N NEGATIVA DEL MUNDO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [LENGUA - I \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 813) (PESIMISMO). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE FRECUENCIAS EMOCIONALES INTENSAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/819','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:11:23','2026-04-28 23:11:23'),(4595,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',820,'{\"symptoms\":\"MOUTH ULCERS, THRUSH, STOMATITIS AND FACIAL PARALYSIS. (\\u00daLCERAS BUCALES, CANDIDIASIS, ESTOMATITIS Y PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"VESICLES THAT ULCERATE THE LARYNX, MOUTH, TRACHEA, AND THROAT. (\\u00daLCERAS BUCALES, CANDIDIASIS, ESTOMATITIS Y PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"MOUTH ULCERS, THRUSH, STOMATITIS, AND FACIAL PARALYSIS.\\n\\n(\\u00daLCERAS BUCALES, CANDIDIASIS, ESTOMATITIS Y PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE HERPES 2 VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE TONSILS BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REVEALS HOW THE VIRAL LOAD CAN MANIFEST THROUGH VESICLES AND ULCERATIONS THAT IMPACT THE LARYNX, MOUTH, TRACHEA, AND THROAT. WHILE HERPES 2 IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH OTHER REGIONS, ITS RESONANCE IN THE TONSILS CAN TRIGGER SIGNIFICANT LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION, LEADING TO STOMATITIS OR SECONDARY INFECTIONS LIKE THRUSH. CRITICALLY, THE VIRAL IMPACT ON NEARBY NERVE PATHWAYS MAY ALSO RESULT IN TEMPORARY FACIAL PARALYSIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL ACTIVITY, ACCELERATING THE HEALING OF MUCOUS MEMBRANES, AND RESTORING NEUROLOGICAL INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS HERPES 2 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REVELA C\\u00d3MO LA CARGA VIRAL PUEDE MANIFESTARSE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE VES\\u00cdCULAS Y ULCERACIONES QUE IMPACTAN LA LARINGE, LA BOCA, LA TR\\u00c1QUEA Y LA GARGANTA. SI BIEN EL HERPES 2 SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON OTRAS REGIONES, SU RESONANCIA EN LAS AM\\u00cdGDALAS PUEDE DESENCADENAR UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA SIGNIFICATIVA, PROVOCANDO ESTOMATITIS O INFECCIONES SECUNDARIAS COMO CANDIDIASIS. FUNDAMENTALMENTE, EL IMPACTO VIRAL EN LAS V\\u00cdAS NERVIOSAS CERCANAS TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE RESULTAR EN PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL TEMPORAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL, ACELERANDO LA CURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS Y RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF FACIAL PARALYSIS IS SEVERE OR PERSISTENT, SCAN THE [MASTOID \\/ MASTOID] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC MOUTH ULCERS OR WHITE SPOTS (THRUSH), CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TONGUE \\/ TONGUE] (REF 817) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL BYPRODUCTS DURING THE RECOVERY PHASE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL ES SEVERA O PERSISTENTE, ESCANEE EL EJE [MASTOIDES \\/ MASTOIDES]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN \\u00daLCERAS BUCALES CR\\u00d3NICAS O MANCHAS BLANCAS (CANDIDIASIS), REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [LENGUA \\/ LENGUA] (REF 817). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS VIRALES DURANTE LA FASE DE RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/820','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:12:28','2026-04-28 23:12:28'),(4596,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',821,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INTOLERANCE (INTOLERANCIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"INTOLERANCE (INTOLERANCIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"RIGIDITY OF THOUGHT, IRRITABILITY TOWARD OTHERS, DIFFICULTY ACCEPTING DIFFERENT PERSPECTIVES, AND EMOTIONAL TENSION IN THE CHEST OR THROAT.\\n\\n(RIGIDEZ DE PENSAMIENTO, IRRITABILIDAD HACIA LOS DEM\\u00c1S, DIFICULTAD PARA ACEPTAR DIFERENTES PERSPECTIVAS Y TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL EN EL PECHO O LA GARGANTA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIBRATIONAL FREQUENCY OF INTOLERANCE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TRACHEA AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE TRACHEA IS THE CONDUIT FOR BREATH AND COMMUNICATION, WHILE THE HEART REPRESENTS THE CENTER OF COMPASSION AND ACCEPTANCE. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT REVEALS A CONSTRICTION WHERE THE INDIVIDUAL MAY FEEL \\\"SUFFOCATED\\\" BY THE ACTIONS OR BELIEFS OF OTHERS, LEADING TO A REJECTION OF EXTERNAL INFLUENCES. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN SOFTENING EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY, PROMOTING A SENSE OF PATIENCE AND OPENNESS, AND HARMONIZING THE FLOW BETWEEN ONE\'S INTERNAL TRUTH AND THE DIVERSITY OF THE OUTSIDE WORLD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA FRECUENCIA VIBRATORIA DE LA INTOLERANCIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA TR\\u00c1QUEA Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LA TR\\u00c1QUEA ES EL CONDUCTO PARA LA RESPIRACI\\u00d3N Y LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N, MIENTRAS QUE EL CORAZ\\u00d3N REPRESENTA EL CENTRO DE LA COMPASI\\u00d3N Y LA ACEPTACI\\u00d3N. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO REVELA UNA CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N DONDE EL INDIVIDUO PUEDE SENTIRSE \\\"ASFIXIADO\\\" POR LAS ACCIONES O CREENCIAS DE LOS DEM\\u00c1S, LO QUE LLEVA A UN RECHAZO DE LAS INFLUENCIAS EXTERNAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A SUAVIZAR LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL, PROMOVIENDO UN SENTIDO DE PACIENCIA Y APERTURA, Y ARMONIZANDO EL FLUJO ENTRE LA VERDAD INTERNA Y LA DIVERSIDAD DEL MUNDO EXTERIOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF INTOLERANCE IS DRIVEN BY INTENSE HOSTILITY OR RESENTMENT, SCAN THE TONSIL \\/ THYMUS (REF 818) RESONANCE (HATE). FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL CLOSURE IS LINKED TO SELF-ABSORPTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TONGUE - L \\/ HEART (REF 814) AXIS (SELFISHNESS). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RELEASE OF RIGID EMOTIONAL PATTERNS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA INTOLERANCIA ES IMPULSADA POR UNA HOSTILIDAD INTENSA O RESENTIMIENTO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ TIMO] (REF 818) (ODIO). PARA CASOS DONDE EL CIERRE EMOCIONAL EST\\u00c9 VINCULADO AL ENSIMISMAMIENTO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [LENGUA - I \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 814) (EGO\\u00cdSMO). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE PATRONES EMOCIONALES R\\u00cdGIDOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/821','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:14:38','2026-04-28 23:14:38'),(4597,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',822,'{\"symptoms\":\"FLU, RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, NASAL DISORDERS, SINUSITIS, RHINITIS, CONJUNCTIVITIS, FEVER, HEADACHE, MUSCLE AND JOINT PAIN, MUCUS, SORE THROAT, MALAISE, DIARRHEA. (GRIPE, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, TRASTORNOS NASALES, SINUSITIS, RINITIS, CONJUNTIVITIS, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MUSCULAR Y ARTICULAR, MUCOSIDAD, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, MALESTAR, DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS. FALSE PNEUMONIA. (TRANSMITIDO POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS. FALSA NEUMON\\u00cdA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH A BACTERIA THAT EFFECTS THE THYMUS; IMMUNE DEFICIENCY AND FALSE AIDS.      ASSOCIATED WITH THE FOOT AND MOUTH VIRUS (CARINA) IS SERIOUS.           CHECK - CARINA AND LACHRYMAL (ASOCIADO CON UNA BACTERIA QUE AFECTA EL TIMO; INMUNODEFICIENCIA Y FALSO SIDA. ASOCIADO CON EL VIRUS DE LA FIEBRE AFTOSA (CARINA) ES GRAVE. REVISAR - CARINA Y LAGRIMAL)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FLU, RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, NASAL DISORDERS, SINUSITIS, RHINITIS, CONJUNCTIVITIS, FEVER, HEADACHE, MUSCLE AND JOINT PAIN, MUCUS, SORE THROAT, MALAISE, AND DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(GRIPE, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS, TRASTORNOS NASALES, SINUSITIS, RINITIS, CONJUNTIVITIS, FIEBRE, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DOLOR MUSCULAR Y ARTICULAR, MUCOSIDAD, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, MALESTAR Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE INFLUENZA VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE TRACHEA BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS TRANSMITTED BY RESPIRATORY SECRETIONS. THE INFLUENZA VIRUS CAN CAUSE SIGNIFICANT INFLAMMATION OF THE RESPIRATORY TRACT, OFTEN LEADING TO WHAT IS KNOWN AS \\\"FALSE PNEUMONIA\\\" DUE TO THE SEVERITY OF THE CONGESTION AND MALAISE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AND ALLEVIATING THE WIDE RANGE OF SYMPTOMS FROM HIGH FEVER TO DIGESTIVE UPSET.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA INFLUENZA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA TR\\u00c1QUEA DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS TRANSMITIDOS POR SECRECIONES RESPIRATORIAS. EL VIRUS DE LA INFLUENZA PUEDE CAUSAR UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA DEL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A LO QUE SE CONOCE COMO \\\"FALSA NEUMON\\u00cdA\\\" DEBIDO A LA GRAVEDAD DE LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N Y EL MALESTAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ALIVIANDO LA AMPLIA GAMA DE S\\u00cdNTOMAS, DESDE LA FIEBRE ALTA HASTA EL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF IMMUNE DEFICIENCY IS PRESENT, SCAN FOR BACTERIA AFFECTING THE THYMUS (FALSE AIDS). IF THE CASE IS SEVERE, CHECK THE [CARINA \\/ CARINA] AND [LACHRYMAL \\/ LACHRYMAL] AXES FOR ASSOCIATION WITH FOOT AND MOUTH VIRUS. FOR EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY OR IRRITABILITY LINKED TO RESPIRATORY TIGHTNESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRACHEA \\/ HEART (REF 820) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT TOXIN ELIMINATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY INMUNODEFICIENCIA, ESCANEE BACTERIAS QUE AFECTEN EL [TIMO] (FALSO SIDA). SI EL CASO ES GRAVE, REVISE LOS EJES [CARINA \\/ CARINA] Y [LAGRIMAL \\/ LAGRIMAL] POR ASOCIACI\\u00d3N CON EL VIRUS DE LA FIEBRE AFTOSA. PARA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL O IRRITABILIDAD VINCULADA A OPRESI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [TR\\u00c1QUEA \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 820). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/822','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:15:48','2026-04-28 23:15:48'),(4598,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',823,'{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS, STOMACH PAIN, DIARRHEA WITH MUCUS, FLATULENCY, FEVER, CRAMPS, VOMITING, DEHYDRATION, HEADACHE, CYSTITIS. (TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES, DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, DIARREA CON MUCOSIDAD, FLATULENCIA, FIEBRE, CALAMBRES, V\\u00d3MITOS, DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N, DOLOR DE CABEZA, CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD, FRUIT, VEGETABLES OR CONTAMINATED WATER AND NOT WASHING HANDS PROPERLY. CONTRIBUTES TO COLON CANCER. (TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS, FRUTAS, VERDURAS O AGUA CONTAMINADA Y POR NO LAVARSE LAS MANOS ADECUADAMENTE. CONTRIBUYE AL C\\u00c1NCER DE COLON.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: IF THE FIRST POLE THE PAIR IS ACTIVE, ASK THE PATIENT IF SHE MAYBE PREGNANT.                CHECK - TRANSVERSE COLON\\/LIVER (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: SI EL PRIMER POLO DEL PAR EST\\u00c1 ACTIVO, PREGUNTE A LA PACIENTE SI PODR\\u00cdA ESTAR EMBARAZADA. REVISAR - COLON TRANSVERSO\\/H\\u00cdGADO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS, STOMACH PAIN, SEVERE DIARRHEA, AND CYSTITIS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS GASTROINTESTINALES, DOLOR DE EST\\u00d3MAGO, DIARREA SEVERA Y CISTITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS VIBRIO CHOLERAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TRANSVERSE COLON AND THE BLADDER. VIBRIO CHOLERAE IS PRIMARILY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER AND CAUSES ACUTE INTESTINAL INFECTION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL BECAUSE THE BACTERIA CAN IMPACT BOTH THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT AND THE URINARY SYSTEM, OFTEN CONTRIBUTING TO CHRONIC INFLAMMATION THAT MAY LEAD TO COLON CANCER IF LEFT UNTREATED. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING ABDOMINAL DISTRESS, AND RESOLVING URINARY TRACT IRRITATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL VIBRIO CHOLERAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON TRANSVERSO Y LA VEJIGA. EL VIBRIO CHOLERAE SE TRANSMITE PRINCIPALMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS O AGUA CONTAMINADOS Y CAUSA UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL AGUDA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA BACTERIA PUEDE IMPACTAR TANTO EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR COMO EL SISTEMA URINARIO, CONTRIBUYENDO A MENUDO A UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA QUE PODR\\u00cdA DERIVAR EN C\\u00c1NCER DE COLON SI NO SE TRATA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO EL MALESTAR ABDOMINAL Y RESOLVIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: IF THE FIRST POLE OF THIS PAIR IS ACTIVE, ASK THE PATIENT IF SHE MAY BE PREGNANT. CHECK [TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ LIVER] AS AN ASSOCIATED AXIS. FOR PERSISTENT DIARRHEA, SCAN THE TONGUE \\/ ANUS (REF 815) RESONANCE FOR CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PREVENT DEHYDRATION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: SI EL PRIMER POLO DE ESTE PAR EST\\u00c1 ACTIVO, PREGUNTE A LA PACIENTE SI PODR\\u00cdA ESTAR EMBARAZADA. REVISAR EL EJE [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] COMO EJE ASOCIADO. PARA DIARREA PERSISTENTE, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [LENGUA \\/ ANO] (REF 815) PARA CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PREVENIR LA DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/823','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:17:12','2026-04-28 23:17:12'),(4599,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',824,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"NUTRITIONAL IMBALANCE. STRESS. (DESEQUILIBRIO NUTRICIONAL. ESTR\\u00c9S.)\",\"paths\":\"NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS, INTESTINAL OBSTRUCTIONS. (TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, OBSTRUCCIONES INTESTINALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"NUTRITIONAL IMBALANCE & STRESS (DESEQUILIBRIO NUTRICIONAL Y ESTR\\u00c9S)\",\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS, INTESTINAL OBSTRUCTIONS, AND DIGESTIVE IRREGULARITY.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, OBSTRUCCIONES INTESTINALES E IRREGULARIDAD DIGESTIVA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE FUNCTIONAL LINK BETWEEN THE TRANSVERSE AND DESCENDING SECTIONS OF THE COLON. IN BIOMAGNETISM, SPECIAL PAIRS OFTEN DEAL WITH DYSFUNCTIONS THAT ARE NOT NECESSARILY PATHOGENIC BUT ARE TRIGGERED BY LIFESTYLE FACTORS SUCH AS CHRONIC STRESS OR POOR NUTRITION. THIS SPECIFIC AXIS FOCUSES ON RESOLVING MECHANICAL AND NEUROLOGICAL INTERRUPTIONS IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. WHEN STRESS IMPACTS THE ENTERIC NERVOUS SYSTEM, IT CAN LEAD TO OBSTRUCTIONS OR SLOWED MOTILITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RESTORING PROPER PERISTALTIC MOVEMENT, CLEARING BLOCKAGES, AND CALMING THE NEUROLOGICAL SIGNALS THAT GOVERN GASTROINTESTINAL HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL V\\u00cdNCULO FUNCIONAL ENTRE LAS SECCIONES TRANSVERSA Y DESCENDENTE DEL COLON. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS PARES ESPECIALES A MENUDO TRATAN DISFUNCIONES QUE NO SON NECESARIAMENTE PATOG\\u00c9NICAS, SINO QUE SE DESENCADENAN POR FACTORES DEL ESTILO DE VIDA COMO EL ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO O UNA MALA NUTRICI\\u00d3N. ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO SE CENTRA EN RESOLVER LAS INTERRUPCIONES MEC\\u00c1NICAS Y NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. CUANDO EL ESTR\\u00c9S IMPACTA EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO ENT\\u00c9RICO, PUEDE PROVOCAR OBSTRUCCIONES O UNA MOTILIDAD LENTA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESTAURAR EL MOVIMIENTO PERIST\\u00c1LTICO ADECUADO, ELIMINANDO BLOQUEOS Y CALMANDO LAS SE\\u00d1ALES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS QUE GOBIERNAN LA SALUD GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF THE OBSTRUCTION IS ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE DIARRHEA OR INFECTION, SCAN THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ BLADDER (REF 822) RESONANCE FOR VIBRIO CHOLERAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE EMOTIONAL STRESS OR MENTAL FATIGUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRACHEA \\/ HEART (REF 820) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE REALIGNMENT OF DIGESTIVE FUNCTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI LA OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE DIARREA SEVERA O INFECCI\\u00d3N, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 822) PARA VIBRIO CHOLERAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL SEVERO O FATIGA MENTAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TR\\u00c1QUEA \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 820). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE EL REALINEAMIENTO DE LAS FUNCIONES DIGESTIVAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/824','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:18:25','2026-04-28 23:18:25'),(4600,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',825,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, SWEATING, CRAMPS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, HEARTBURN, WEIGH TLOSS, CONSTIPATION, DIARRHEA, (DOLOR DE CABEZA, SUDORACI\\u00d3N, CALAMBRES, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, ACIDEZ, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, DIARREA,)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSVERSE COLON DYSFUNCTION. (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL COLON TRANSVERSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"TRANSVERSE COLON DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DEL COLON TRANSVERSO)\",\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHE, SWEATING, CRAMPS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, HEARTBURN, WEIGHT LOSS, CONSTIPATION, AND DIARRHEA.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE CABEZA, SUDORACI\\u00d3N, CALAMBRES, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, ACIDEZ, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO Y DIARREA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ERRATIC BEHAVIOR OF THE TRANSVERSE COLON BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE COLON AND THE INGUINAL LIGAMENT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO RESET THE MECHANICAL AND ENZYMATIC FUNCTIONS OF THE LARGE INTESTINE. WHEN THIS AREA IS DYSFUNCTIONAL, THE INDIVIDUAL MAY EXPERIENCE FLUCTUATING DIGESTIVE ISSUES, OSCILLATING BETWEEN CONSTIPATION AND DIARRHEA. THE SYSTEMIC IMPACT OF THIS IMBALANCE OFTEN LEADS TO SECONDARY SYMPTOMS SUCH AS HEADACHES AND UNEXPLAINED SWEATING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REGULATING INTESTINAL MOTILITY, REDUCING ABDOMINAL CRAMPING, AND IMPROVING THE ABSORPTION PROCESS TO PREVENT UNINTENDED WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ABORDA EL COMPORTAMIENTO ERR\\u00c1TICO DEL COLON TRANSVERSO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON Y EL LIGAMENTO INGUINAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA REINICIAR LAS FUNCIONES MEC\\u00c1NICAS Y ENZIM\\u00c1TICAS DEL INTESTINO GRUESO. CUANDO ESTA \\u00c1REA ES DISFUNCIONAL, EL INDIVIDUO PUEDE EXPERIMENTAR PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS FLUCTUANTES, OSCILANDO ENTRE EL ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO Y LA DIARREA. EL IMPACTO SIST\\u00c9MICO DE ESTE DESEQUILIBRIO A MENUDO CONDUCE A S\\u00cdNTOMAS SECUNDARIOS COMO DOLORES DE CABEZA Y SUDORACI\\u00d3N INEXPLICABLE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REGULAR LA MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL, REDUCIENDO LOS CALAMBRES ABDOMINALES Y MEJORANDO EL PROCESO DE ABSORCI\\u00d3N PARA PREVENIR LA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO NO DESEADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF GASTROINTESTINAL IRREGULARITY IS LINKED TO NUTRITIONAL IMBALANCE OR STRESS, SCAN THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ DESCENDING COLON (REF 823) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE ABDOMINAL PAIN AND POTENTIAL INFECTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ BLADDER (REF 822) AXIS (VIBRIO CHOLERAE). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC WASTE PRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI LA IRREGULARIDAD GASTROINTESTINAL EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A UN DESEQUILIBRIO NUTRICIONAL O ESTR\\u00c9S, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ COLON DESCENDENTE] (REF 823). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ABDOMINAL SEVERO Y POSIBLE INFECCI\\u00d3N, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 822) (VIBRIO CHOLERAE). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE PRODUCTOS DE DESECHO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/825','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:19:48','2026-04-28 23:19:48'),(4601,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',826,'{\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINATION, INSOMNIA, DROWSINESS, DIARRHEA, VOMITING, MUSCLE SPASMS, ABDOMINAL PAIN AND CRAMPING, BLOATING, DEHYDRATION, FEVER, ANOREXIA. (CANSANCIO, FATIGA, GASTRITIS, PROCRASTINACI\\u00d3N, INSOMNIO, SOMNOLENCIA, DIARREA, V\\u00d3MITOS, ESPASMOS MUSCULARES, DOLOR ABDOMINAL Y CALAMBRES, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N, FIEBRE, ANOREXIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED THROUGH FOOD, FRUITS VEGETABLES AND CONTAMINATED WATER. HEPATITIS G. LIVER ABSCESS. INCREASE IN PLASMA DENSITY AND ACIDOSIS. (TRANSMITIDO A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS, FRUTAS, VERDURAS Y AGUA CONTAMINADA. HEPATITIS G. ABSCESO HEP\\u00c1TICO. AUMENTO DE LA DENSIDAD PLASM\\u00c1TICA Y ACIDOSIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - TRANSVERSE COLON\\/ BLADDER (REVISAR - COLON TRANSVERSO\\/VEJIGA)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"TIREDNESS, FATIGUE, GASTRITIS, HEPATITIS G, LIVER ABSCESS, INCREASE IN PLASMA DENSITY, AND ACIDOSIS.\\n\\n(CANSANCIO, FATIGA, GASTRITIS, HEPATITIS G, ABSCESO HEP\\u00c1TICO, AUMENTO DE LA DENSIDAD PLASM\\u00c1TICA Y ACIDOSIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS VIBRIO CHOLERAE, WHICH IS COMMONLY TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD, FRUITS, VEGETABLES, AND WATER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC AXIS BETWEEN THE TRANSVERSE COLON AND THE LIVER HIGHLIGHTS THE PATHOGEN\'S ABILITY TO IMPACT METABOLIC AND FILTRATION PROCESSES. BEYOND TYPICAL GASTROINTESTINAL UPSET, THIS RESONANCE IS ASSOCIATED WITH HEPATIC COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS HEPATITIS G AND LIVER ABSCESSES. THE RESULTING IMBALANCE OFTEN LEADS TO SYSTEMIC ACIDOSIS AND AN INCREASE IN PLASMA DENSITY, MANIFESTING AS DEEP FATIGUE AND CHRONIC TIREDNESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING LIVER INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING PROPER BLOOD CHEMISTRY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL VIBRIO CHOLERAE, QUE SE TRANSMITE COM\\u00daNMENTE A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ALIMENTOS, FRUTAS, VERDURAS Y AGUA CONTAMINADA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO ENTRE EL COLON TRANSVERSO Y EL H\\u00cdGADO RESALTA LA CAPACIDAD DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO PARA IMPACTAR LOS PROCESOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS Y DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL T\\u00cdPICO, ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA CON COMPLICACIONES HEP\\u00c1TICAS COMO LA HEPATITIS G Y ABSCESOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS. EL DESEQUILIBRIO RESULTANTE A MENUDO CONDUCE A ACIDOSIS SIST\\u00c9MICA Y UN AUMENTO EN LA DENSIDAD PLASM\\u00c1TICA, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO FATIGA PROFUNDA Y CANSANCIO CR\\u00d3NICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y RESTAURANDO LA QU\\u00cdMICA SANGU\\u00cdNEA ADECUADA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SEVERE DIARRHEA OR CYSTITIS IS PRESENT, SCAN THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ BLADDER (REF 822) RESONANCE FOR VIBRIO CHOLERAE AS WELL. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC GASTRITIS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE THYMUS \\/ LIVER (REF 795) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS DURING LIVER RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY DIARREA SEVERA O CISTITIS, ESCANEE TAMBI\\u00c9N LA RESONANCIA [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 822) PARA VIBRIO CHOLERAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN GASTRITIS CR\\u00d3NICA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TIMO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 795). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/826','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:21:00','2026-04-28 23:21:00'),(4602,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',827,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS, DIGESTION DISORDERS, HEADACHE, BLOODY AND MUCUS IN STOOLS. (TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, SANGRE Y MUCOSIDAD EN LAS HECES.)\",\"paths\":\"EPILEPSY, AFFECTS THE WHOLE BODY. (EPILEPSIA, AFECTA TODO EL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA \\/ UNIDENTIFIED PROTOZOA\",\"symptoms\":\"BEHAVIORAL DISORDERS, DIGESTION DISORDERS, HEADACHE, AND BLOODY OR MUCUS IN STOOLS.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DE CONDUCTA, TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DOLOR DE CABEZA, SANGRE Y MUCOSIDAD EN LAS HECES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE ADDRESSES PATHOGENS THAT IMPACT BOTH THE INTESTINAL TRACT AND NEUROLOGICAL FUNCTION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TRANSVERSE COLON AND THE PARIETAL LOBE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS IT LINKS THE \\\"SECOND BRAIN\\\" (THE GUT) WITH THE CEREBRAL CORTEX. CERTAIN PARASITES, SUCH AS AMOEBAS, CAN RELEASE TOXINS THAT CROSS THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER OR IRRITATE THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, TRIGGERING EPILEPTIC-LIKE SEIZURES OR SEVERE BEHAVIORAL CHANGES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD, REDUCING INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION (INDICATED BY MUCUS OR BLOOD IN STOOLS), AND CALMING THE NEUROLOGICAL DISRUPTIONS THAT AFFECT THE WHOLE BODY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA ABORDA LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE IMPACTAN TANTO EL TRACTO INTESTINAL COMO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON TRANSVERSO Y EL L\\u00d3BULO PARIETAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE VINCULA EL \\\"SEGUNDO CEREBRO\\\" (EL INTESTINO) CON LA CORTEZA CEREBRAL. CIERTOS PAR\\u00c1SITOS, COMO LAS AMIBAS, PUEDEN LIBERAR TOXINAS QUE ATRAVIESAN LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA O IRRITAN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, DESENCADENANDO CONVULSIONES DE TIPO EPIL\\u00c9PTICO O CAMBIOS DE CONDUCTA SEVEROS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL (INDICADA POR MUCOSIDAD O SANGRE EN LAS HECES) Y CALMANDO LAS ALTERACIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS QUE AFECTAN A TODO EL CUERPO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SEIZURES OR NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST, SCAN THE [TONGUE \\/ TONGUE] (REF 817) RESONANCE FOR SARCOPTES SCABIES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS WITHOUT NEUROLOGICAL IMPACT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ LIVER (REF 825) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF PARASITIC BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LAS CONVULSIONES O LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS PERSISTEN, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [LENGUA \\/ LENGUA] (REF 817) PARA SARCOPTES SCABIES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO SIN IMPACTO NEUROL\\u00d3GICO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 825). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS PARASITARIOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/827','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:22:26','2026-04-28 23:22:26'),(4603,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',828,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"STOMACH INFECTIONS (INFECCIONES ESTOMACALES)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"STOMACH INFECTIONS (INFECCIONES ESTOMACALES)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, ABDOMINAL PAIN, POTENTIAL NAUSEA, AND ALTERATIONS IN ELIMINATION ASSOCIATED WITH ACUTE OR CHRONIC INFECTIOUS PROCESSES.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, POSIBLES N\\u00c1USEAS Y ALTERACIONES EN LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N ASOCIADAS A PROCESOS INFECCIOSOS AGUDOS O CR\\u00d3NICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE IMPACT OF GASTROINTESTINAL INFECTIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TRANSVERSE COLON AND THE QUADRICEPS MUSCLE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS PARTICULARLY RELEVANT BECAUSE IT LINKS THE TRANSVERSE SEGMENT OF THE LARGE INTESTINE WITH THE MOTOR AND MUSCULAR RESPONSE OF THE LOWER EXTREMITIES. STOMACH INFECTIONS CAN TRIGGER A SYSTEMIC RESPONSE MANIFESTING AS WEAKNESS OR DISCOMFORT IN THE LONG MUSCLES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CONTROLLING PATHOGENIC ACTIVITY IN THE COLON, REDUCING INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING THE FUNCTIONAL INTEGRITY OF THE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM AND ITS ENERGETIC CONNECTION TO THE MUSCULATURE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL IMPACTO DE LAS INFECCIONES GASTROINTESTINALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON TRANSVERSO Y EL M\\u00daSCULO CU\\u00c1DRICEPS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES PARTICULARMENTE RELEVANTE PORQUE VINCULA EL SEGMENTO TRANSVERSAL DEL INTESTINO GRUESO CON LA RESPUESTA MOTORA Y MUSCULAR DE LAS EXTREMIDADES INFERIORES. LAS INFECCIONES ESTOMACALES PUEDEN PROVOCAR UNA RESPUESTA SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO DEBILIDAD O MOLESTIAS EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS LARGOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A CONTROLAR LA ACTIVIDAD PAT\\u00d3GENA EN EL COLON, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD FUNCIONAL DEL SISTEMA DIGESTIVO Y SU CONEXI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA CON LA MUSCULATURA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYMPTOMS INCLUDE BLOODY OR MUCUS STOOLS, SCAN THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ PARIETAL (REF 826) RESONANCE FOR ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA. FOR CASES INVOLVING HEPATITIS OR LIVER ABSCESSES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ LIVER (REF 825) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS RESULTING FROM THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS INCLUYEN DIARREA CON SANGRE O MUCOSIDAD, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 826) PARA ENTAMOEBA HISTOLYTICA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN HEPATITIS O ABSCESOS HEP\\u00c1TICOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 825). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS RESULTANTES DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/828','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:24:56','2026-04-28 23:24:56'),(4604,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',829,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MATERIALISM (MATERIALISMO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MATERIALISM (MATERIALISMO)\",\"symptoms\":\"EXCESSIVE ATTACHMENT TO PHYSICAL POSSESSIONS, PRIORITIZING MATERIAL WEALTH OVER SPIRITUAL OR EMOTIONAL GROWTH, AND ANXIETY LINKED TO FINANCIAL STATUS.\\n\\n(APEGO EXCESIVO A LAS POSESIONES F\\u00cdSICAS, PRIORIZAR LA RIQUEZA MATERIAL SOBRE EL CRECIMIENTO ESPIRITUAL O EMOCIONAL, Y ANSIEDAD VINCULADA AL ESTATUS FINANCIERO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIBRATIONAL FREQUENCY OF MATERIALISM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE TRANSVERSE COLON AND THE LEFT GONADS (TESTICLE OR VAGINA). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE TRANSVERSE COLON IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE \\\"STORAGE\\\" AND PROCESSING OF LIFE\'S EXPERIENCES, WHILE THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS REPRESENT OUR CREATIVE POWER AND VITAL ENERGY. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT REVEALS A DISTORTION WHERE THE INDIVIDUAL\\u2019S SENSE OF SECURITY AND IDENTITY BECOMES TIGHTLY BOUND TO EXTERNAL OBJECTS AND MATERIAL ACCUMULATION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN RELEASING THE DENSE ENERGETIC ATTACHMENT TO POSSESSIONS, ENCOURAGING A SHIFT TOWARD INNER VALUE AND HARMONIZING THE FLOW BETWEEN MATERIAL NEEDS AND EMOTIONAL WELL-BEING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA FRECUENCIA VIBRATORIA DEL MATERIALISMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL COLON TRANSVERSO Y LAS G\\u00d3NADAS IZQUIERDAS (TEST\\u00cdCULO O VAGINA). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL COLON TRANSVERSO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON EL \\\"ALMACENAMIENTO\\\" Y PROCESAMIENTO DE LAS EXPERIENCIAS DE VIDA, MIENTRAS QUE LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES REPRESENTAN NUESTRO PODER CREATIVO Y ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO REVELA UNA DISTORSI\\u00d3N DONDE EL SENTIDO DE SEGURIDAD E IDENTIDAD DEL INDIVIDUO SE VUELVE ESTRECHAMENTE LIGADO A OBJETOS EXTERNOS Y A LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N MATERIAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A LIBERAR EL DENSO APEGO ENERG\\u00c9TICO A LAS POSESIONES, FOMENTANDO UN CAMBIO HACIA EL VALOR INTERIOR Y ARMONIZANDO EL FLUJO ENTRE LAS NECESIDADES MATERIALES Y EL BIENESTAR EMOCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF MATERIALISM IS DRIVEN BY A SENSE OF SUPERIORITY OR DISREGARD FOR OTHERS, SCAN THE TONGUE - L \\/ HEART (REF 814) RESONANCE (SELFISHNESS). FOR CASES WHERE FINANCIAL ANXIETY LEADS TO HOSTILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TONSIL \\/ THYMUS (REF 818) AXIS (HATE). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE RELEASE OF MATERIALISTIC EMOTIONAL CODES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI EL MATERIALISMO ES IMPULSADO POR UN SENTIDO DE SUPERIORIDAD O DESPRECIO POR LOS DEM\\u00c1S, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [LENGUA - I \\/ CORAZ\\u00d3N] (REF 814) (EGO\\u00cdSMO). PARA CASOS DONDE LA ANSIEDAD FINANCIERA CONDUZCA A LA HOSTILIDAD, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ TIMO] (REF 818) (ODIO). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00d3DIGOS EMOCIONALES MATERIALISTAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/829','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:26:10','2026-04-28 23:26:10'),(4605,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',830,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"COLITIS, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME, DIARRHEA, CONSTIPATION, ABDOMINAL PAIN, HEADACHE, FEVER, NAUSEA, FATIGUE, DEPRESSION, LOSS OF APPETITE AND WEIGHT LOSS.\\n(COLITIS, INTESTINO IRRITABLE, DIARREA, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, N\\u00c1USEAS, FATIGA, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO Y PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"BOWEL DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"BOWEL DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"COLITIS, IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME, DIARRHEA, CONSTIPATION, ABDOMINAL PAIN, HEADACHE, FEVER, NAUSEA, FATIGUE, DEPRESSION, LOSS OF APPETITE, AND WEIGHT LOSS.(COLITIS, INTESTINO IRRITABLE, DIARREA, ESTRE\\u00d1IMIENTO, DOLOR ABDOMINAL, DOLOR DE CABEZA, FIEBRE, N\\u00c1USEAS, FATIGA, DEPRESI\\u00d3N, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO Y PESO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE MECHANICAL AND PHYSIOLOGICAL BALANCE OF THE ENTIRE TRANSVERSE SEGMENT OF THE COLON BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE ORGAN ITSELF. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING NON-PATHOGENIC IMBALANCES THAT LEAD TO CHRONIC CONDITIONS LIKE IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME (IBS). WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS DISRUPTED, THE SYSTEM CANNOT PROPERLY REGULATE PERISTALTIC MOVEMENT OR NUTRIENT ABSORPTION, OFTEN CAUSING A CASCADE OF SYMPTOMS THAT IMPACT BOTH PHYSICAL ENERGY AND EMOTIONAL WELL-BEING, SUCH AS FATIGUE AND DEPRESSION. BY STABILIZING THIS LOCALIZED AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CALMING INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION, REGULATING ELIMINATION CYCLES, AND RESTORING THE OVERALL INTEGRITY OF THE DIGESTIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SE DIRIGE AL EQUILIBRIO MEC\\u00c1NICO Y FISIOL\\u00d3GICO DE TODO EL SEGMENTO TRANSVERSAL DEL COLON MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL PROPIO \\u00d3RGANO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA ABORDAR DESEQUILIBRIOS NO PATOG\\u00c9NICOS QUE CONDUCEN A CONDICIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS COMO EL S\\u00cdNDROME DEL INTESTINO IRRITABLE (SII). CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO SE ALTERA, EL SISTEMA NO PUEDE REGULAR ADECUADAMENTE EL MOVIMIENTO PERIST\\u00c1LTICO O LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES, LO QUE A MENUDO PROVOCA UNA CASCADA DE S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE AFECTAN TANTO LA ENERG\\u00cdA F\\u00cdSICA COMO EL BIENESTAR EMOCIONAL, COMO LA FATIGA Y LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE LOCALIZADO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A CALMAR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL, REGULAR LOS CICLOS DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N Y RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD GENERAL DEL PROCESO DIGESTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"DIGESTIVE CHECK: IF THE DYSFUNCTION IS ACCOMPANIED BY FLUCTUATING WEIGHT LOSS AND CRAMPS, SCAN THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ INGUINAL LIGAMENT (REF 824) RESONANCE. FOR CASES WHERE COLITIS IS LINKED TO EMOTIONAL ATTACHMENTS OR MATERIAL ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ TESTICLE - L OR VAGINA - L (REF 828) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING THE REALIGNMENT OF BOWEL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DIGESTIVA: SI LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO FLUCTUANTE Y CALAMBRES, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ LIGAMENTO INGUINAL] (REF 824). PARA CASOS DONDE LA COLITIS EST\\u00c9 VINCULADA A APEGOS EMOCIONALES O ANSIEDAD MATERIAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO-I O VAGINA-I] (REF 828). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL DURANTE EL REALINEAMIENTO DE LA FUNCI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/830','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:27:23','2026-04-28 23:27:23'),(4606,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',831,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"PHYSICAL TRAUMA, JOINT PAIN, SPRAIN, FRACTURED, MUSCLE PAIN, ONCE AFFECTED BY A STROKE. TUMORS. (TRAUMA F\\u00cdSICO, DOLOR ARTICULAR, ESGUINCE, FRACTURA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, ANTECEDENTE DE ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR. TUMORES.)\",\"paths\":\"ANALGESIC AND ANTI-\\u2013 INFLAMMATORY EFFECT. (EFECTO ANALG\\u00c9SICO Y ANTIINFLAMATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: ALWAYS USE THE NEGATIVE POLE ON THE TUMOR.\\n(PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: SIEMPRE UTILIZAR EL POLO NEGATIVO EN EL TUMOR.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"PHYSICAL IMPACT (IMPACTO F\\u00cdSICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PHYSICAL TRAUMA, JOINT PAIN, SPRAINS, FRACTURES, MUSCLE PAIN, HISTORY OF STROKE, AND TUMORS.\\n\\n(TRAUMA F\\u00cdSICO, DOLOR ARTICULAR, ESGUINCE, FRACTURA, DOLOR MUSCULAR, ANTECEDENTE DE ACCIDENTE CEREBROVASCULAR Y TUMORES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS UTILIZED FOR ITS PROFOUND ANALGESIC AND ANTI-INFLAMMATORY EFFECTS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE SITE OF A SPECIFIC TRAUMA OR WITHIN THE KIDNEY SYSTEM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL FOR ACCELERATING THE RECOVERY OF TISSUES AFFECTED BY PHYSICAL INJURIES, SUCH AS BONE FRACTURES OR SEVERE MUSCLE STRAINS. BEYOND MUSCULOSKELETAL REPAIR, IT IS EMPLOYED TO ADDRESS THE SEQUELAE OF STROKES AND TO MANAGE THE ENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT AROUND TUMORS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING LOCALIZED EDEMA, ALLEVIATING CHRONIC PAIN, AND SUPPORTING THE RENAL SYSTEM\'S ROLE IN FILTERING METABOLIC WASTE PRODUCED DURING THE HEALING OF DAMAGED TISSUE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE UTILIZA POR SUS PROFUNDOS EFECTOS ANALG\\u00c9SICOS Y ANTIINFLAMATORIOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL SITIO DE UN TRAUMA ESPEC\\u00cdFICO O DENTRO DEL SISTEMA RENAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ACELERAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS AFECTADOS POR LESIONES F\\u00cdSICAS, COMO FRACTURAS \\u00d3SEAS O DISTENSIONES MUSCULARES SEVERAS. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA REPARACI\\u00d3N MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICA, SE EMPLEA PARA ABORDAR LAS SECUELAS DE ACCIDENTES CEREBROVASCULARES Y PARA MANEJAR EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ALREDEDOR DE LOS TUMORES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR EL EDEMA LOCALIZADO, ALIVIAR EL DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO Y APOYAR EL PAPEL DEL SISTEMA RENAL EN LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS PRODUCIDOS DURANTE LA CURACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO DA\\u00d1ADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: IF ADDRESSING A TUMOR, ALWAYS PLACE THE NEGATIVE POLE DIRECTLY ON THE TUMOR SITE. FOR CASES INVOLVING NEUROLOGICAL RECOVERY POST-STROKE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL] AXIS. IF THE TRAUMA IS ASSOCIATED WITH SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION OR BACTERIAL OVERGROWTH, SCAN THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ LIVER (REF 825) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING RECOVERY.\\n\\n(PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: SI SE TRATA UN TUMOR, COLOQUE SIEMPRE EL POLO NEGATIVO DIRECTAMENTE SOBRE EL SITIO DEL TUMOR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RECUPERACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA POST-ICTUS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [PARIETAL \\/ PARIETAL]. SI EL TRAUMA EST\\u00c1 ASOCIADO CON INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA O SOBRECRECIMIENTO BACTERIANO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ H\\u00cdGADO] (REF 825). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/831','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:28:32','2026-04-28 23:28:32'),(4607,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',832,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"LEPROSY (LEPRA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE\",\"symptoms\":\"POTENTIAL FOR RECURRING SKIN LESIONS, NERVE DAMAGE, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, AND ASYMPTOMATIC CARRIER STATE OF LEPROSY.\\n\\n(POTENCIAL DE LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS RECURRENTES, DA\\u00d1O NEUROL\\u00d3GICO, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR Y ESTADO DE PORTADOR ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO DE LA LEPRA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES A SPECIFIC HIDING PLACE FOR THE LEPROSY BACTERIA (MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE TRIANGLE OF SCARPA (FEMORAL TRIANGLE) BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS REGION\\u2014LOCATED IN THE UPPER INNER THIGH\\u2014SERVES AS A STRATEGIC DEPOT WHERE PATHOGENS CAN EVADE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM. WHEN THIS RESERVOIR IS ACTIVE, IT CAN PERPETUATE CHRONIC INFECTIONS OR CAUSE SUDDEN OUTBREAKS OF SKIN AND NERVE DISORDERS EVEN AFTER PREVIOUS TREATMENTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXPOSING THE HIDDEN BACTERIA, ALLOWING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO FULLY ADDRESS THE PATHOGENIC LOAD AND PREVENT THE PROGRESSION OR RECURRENCE OF LEPROSY-RELATED SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA UN LUGAR DE OCULTAMIENTO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA LA BACTERIA DE LA LEPRA (MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL TRI\\u00c1NGULO DE SCARPA (TRI\\u00c1NGULO FEMORAL) DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA REGI\\u00d3N \\u2014SITUADA EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR E INTERNA DEL MUSLO\\u2014 SIRVE COMO UN DEP\\u00d3SITO ESTRAT\\u00c9GICO DONDE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS PUEDEN EVADIR AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. CUANDO ESTE RESERVORIO EST\\u00c1 ACTIVO, PUEDE PERPETUAR INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS O CAUSAR BROTES REPENTINOS DE TRASTORNOS CUT\\u00c1NEOS Y NERVIOSOS INCLUSO DESPU\\u00c9S DE TRATAMIENTOS PREVIOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EXPONER LAS BACTERIAS OCULTAS, PERMITIENDO QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO ABORDE COMPLETAMENTE LA CARGA PAT\\u00d3GENA Y PREVENGA LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N O RECURRENCIA DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RELACIONADOS CON LA LEPRA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SKIN LESIONS OR NERVE THICKENING ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [ESOPHAGUS \\/ ESOPHAGUS] AXIS AS A CORRESPONDING POINT FOR MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MUSCLE WEAKNESS IN THE LEGS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ QUADRICEPS (REF 827) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS AS THE RESERVOIR IS NEUTRALIZED.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O ENGROSAMIENTO DE LOS NERVIOS, ESCANEE EL EJE [ES\\u00d3FAGO \\/ ES\\u00d3FAGO] COMO PUNTO CORRESPONDIENTE PARA EL MYCOBACTERIUM LEPRAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR SEVERA EN LAS PIERNAS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ CU\\u00c1DRICEPS] (REF 827). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO A MEDIDA QUE SE NEUTRALIZA EL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/832','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-28 23:59:28','2026-04-28 23:59:28'),(4608,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',833,'{\"symptoms\":\"MUCOSAL IRRITATION OF THE MOUTH, NOSE, PHARYNX, LARYNX, TRACHEA, BRONCHI, DIGESTIVE TRACT, EARS AND EYES. (IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MUCOSAS DE LA BOCA, NARIZ, FARINGE, LARINGE, TR\\u00c1QUEA, BRONQUIOS, TRACTO DIGESTIVO, O\\u00cdDOS Y OJOS.)\",\"paths\":\"SIMULATES ARTHRITIS AND RHEUMATISM ARTHRITIS. (SIMULA ARTRITIS Y ARTRITIS REUM\\u00c1TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"MUCOSAL IRRITATION OF THE MOUTH, NOSE, PHARYNX, LARYNX, TRACHEA, BRONCHI, DIGESTIVE TRACT, EARS, AND EYES.(IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MUCOSAS DE LA BOCA, NARIZ, FARINGE, LARINGE, TR\\u00c1QUEA, BRONQUIOS, TRACTO DIGESTIVO, O\\u00cdDOS Y OJOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE HERPES 3 VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE ULNA BONES BILATERALLY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS CHARACTERIZED BY ITS CAPACITY TO CAUSE EXTENSIVE IRRITATION ACROSS VARIOUS MUCOSAL LININGS THROUGHOUT THE BODY, FROM THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM TO THE DIGESTIVE TRACT. CRITICALLY, THIS VIRUS IS KNOWN TO \\\"MIMIC\\\" OTHER CONDITIONS; IT OFTEN SIMULATES THE SYMPTOMS OF ARTHRITIS AND RHEUMATISM, LEADING TO JOINT PAIN AND STIFFNESS THAT MAY BE MISDIAGNOSED. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL ACTIVITY, REDUCING MUCOSAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESOLVING THE PSEUDO-ARTHRITIC PAIN ASSOCIATED WITH THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS HERPES 3 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LOS HUESOS C\\u00daBITO DE FORMA BILATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE CARACTERIZA POR SU CAPACIDAD DE CAUSAR UNA IRRITACI\\u00d3N EXTENSA EN DIVERSOS REVESTIMIENTOS MUCOSOS DE TODO EL CUERPO, DESDE EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO HASTA EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO. FUNDAMENTALMENTE, ESTE VIRUS ES CONOCIDO POR \\\"IMITAR\\\" OTRAS CONDICIONES; A MENUDO SIMULA LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LA ARTRITIS Y EL REUMATISMO, PROVOCANDO DOLOR Y RIGIDEZ ARTICULAR QUE PUEDEN SER MAL DIAGNOSTICADOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MUCOSAS Y RESOLVIENDO EL DOLOR PSEUDO-ARTR\\u00cdTICO ASOCIADO CON LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC JOINT PAIN PERSISTS, SCAN THE TRAUMA \\/ KIDNEY - SAME (REF 830) AXIS TO ADDRESS PHYSICAL IMPACT OR INFLAMMATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE MUCOUS MEMBRANE ULCERATION IN THE MOUTH, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TONSIL \\/ TONSIL (REF 819) RESONANCE (HERPES 2). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE BODY DURING THE VIRAL CLEARING PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR SIST\\u00c9MICO PERSISTE, ESCANEE EL EJE [TRAUMA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - MISMO] (REF 830) PARA ABORDAR EL IMPACTO F\\u00cdSICO O LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ULCERACI\\u00d3N SEVERA DE LAS MUCOSAS EN LA BOCA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [AM\\u00cdGDALA \\/ AM\\u00cdGDALA] (REF 819) (HERPES 2). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL CUERPO DURANTE EL PROCESO DE DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/833','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:00:36','2026-04-29 00:00:36'),(4609,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',834,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"KIDNEY STONES (C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RENAL LITHIASIS (LITIASIS RENAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTENSE LOWER BACK OR ABDOMINAL PAIN, RENAL COLIC, DIFFICULT OR PAINFUL URINATION, AND POTENTIAL HEMATURIA (BLOOD IN URINE).\\n\\n(DOLOR INTENSO EN LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA O EL ABDOMEN, C\\u00d3LICO RENAL, MICCI\\u00d3N DIFICULTAD O DOLOROSA Y POSIBLE HEMATURIA (SANGRE EN LA ORINA).)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PRESENCE AND IMPACT OF KIDNEY STONES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE URETER AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR MANAGING THE MECHANICAL AND CHEMICAL IMBALANCES THAT LEAD TO THE FORMATION OF CALCIUM OR OXALATE CRYSTALS WITHIN THE URINARY TRACT. WHEN ACTIVE, THIS CIRCUIT REFLECTS AN OBSTRUCTION OR IRRITATION CAUSED BY THE DESCENT OF CALCULI FROM THE KIDNEYS. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING SPASMS AND INFLAMMATION IN THE URINARY PASSAGEWAYS, POTENTIALLY FACILITATING THE DISSOLUTION OR EASIER PASSAGE OF STONES WHILE ALLEVIATING THE ACUTE PAIN ASSOCIATED WITH RENAL COLIC.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA PRESENCIA E IMPACTO DE LOS C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL UR\\u00c9TER Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA MANEJAR LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS MEC\\u00c1NICOS Y QU\\u00cdMICOS QUE LLEVAN A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE CRISTALES DE CALCIO U OXALATO DENTRO DEL TRACTO URINARIO. CUANDO EST\\u00c1 ACTIVO, ESTE CIRCUITO REFLEJA UNA OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N O IRRITACI\\u00d3N CAUSADA POR EL DESCENSO DE C\\u00c1LCULOS DESDE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LOS ESPASMOS Y LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, FACILITANDO POTENCIALMENTE LA DISOLUCI\\u00d3N O EL PASO M\\u00c1S F\\u00c1CIL DE LOS C\\u00c1LCULOS MIENTRAS ALIVIA EL DOLOR AGUDO ASOCIADO CON EL C\\u00d3LICO RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS INCLUDE SEVERE IRRITATION OR CYSTITIS, SCAN THE TRANSVERSE COLON \\/ BLADDER (REF 822) RESONANCE FOR VIBRIO CHOLERAE. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC LOWER BACK PAIN WITHOUT URINARY STONES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE TRAUMA \\/ KIDNEY - SAME (REF 830) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE FILTRATION AND ELIMINATION PROCESSES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS INCLUYEN IRRITACI\\u00d3N SEVERA O CISTITIS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [COLON TRANSVERSO \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 822) PARA VIBRIO CHOLERAE. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR LUMBAR CR\\u00d3NICO SIN C\\u00c1LCULOS URINARIOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TRAUMA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - MISMO] (REF 830). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LOS PROCESOS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINACI\\u00d3N.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/834','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:01:59','2026-04-29 00:01:59'),(4610,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',835,'{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT DISORDERS, PROBLEMS IN PREGNANCY. INSOMNIA. (TRASTORNOS ARTICULARES, PROBLEMAS EN EL EMBARAZO, INSOMNIO)\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT DISORDERS, PROBLEMS IN PREGNANCY, INSOMNIA, VAGINITIS, AND INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS ARTICULARES, PROBLEMAS EN EL EMBARAZO, INSOMNIO, VAGINITIS E INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS B AGALACTIAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE URETER AND THE FALLOPIAN TUBE ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BACTERIA IS PARTICULARLY RELEVANT FOR ITS IMPACT ON THE FEMALE UROGENITAL SYSTEM, WHERE IT CAN CAUSE CHRONIC INFLAMMATION, RECURRENT URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, AND VAGINITIS. CRITICALLY, THIS PATHOGEN ALSO HAS AN AFFINITY FOR CONNECTIVE TISSUE, OFTEN LEADING TO JOINT DISORDERS AND SYSTEMIC DISCOMFORT THAT MAY DISRUPT SLEEP PATTERNS (INSOMNIA). BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH, AND ALLEVIATING JOINT PAIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL STREPTOCOCCUS B AGALACTIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL UR\\u00c9TER Y LA TROMPA DE FALOPIO DEL LADO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA BACTERIA ES PARTICULARMENTE RELEVANTE POR SU IMPACTO EN EL SISTEMA UROGENITAL FEMENINO, DONDE PUEDE CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA, INFECCIONES URINARIAS RECURRENTES Y VAGINITIS. FUNDAMENTALMENTE, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO TAMBI\\u00c9N TIENE UNA AFINIDAD POR EL TEJIDO CONECTIVO, LO QUE A MENUDO PROVOCA TRASTORNOS ARTICULARES Y MALESTAR SIST\\u00c9MICO QUE PUEDE ALTERAR LOS PATRONES DE SUE\\u00d1O (INSOMNIO). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA Y ALIVIANDO EL DOLOR ARTICULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY PROBLEMS PERSIST WITH SHARP PAIN, SCAN THE URETER \\/ BLADDER (REF 833) RESONANCE TO RULE OUT RENAL LITHIASIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE JOINT PAIN OR \\\"FALSE ARTHRITIS,\\\" CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE ULNA \\/ ULNA (REF 832) AXIS (HERPES 3). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND FACILITATE THE CLEARANCE OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS PROBLEMAS URINARIOS PERSISTEN CON DOLOR AGUDO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 833) PARA DESCARTAR LITIASIS RENAL. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO O \\\"FALSA ARTRITIS\\\", REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [C\\u00daBITO \\/ C\\u00daBITO] (REF 832) (HERPES 3). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/835','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:03:26','2026-04-29 00:03:26'),(4611,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',836,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"KIDNEY STONES, MENSTRUAL COLICS. (C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES, C\\u00d3LICOS MENSTRUALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"KIDNEY STONES (C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES)\",\"symptoms\":\"RENAL LITHIASIS, MENSTRUAL COLIC, SHARP BACK PAIN, AND URINARY DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(LITIASIS RENAL, C\\u00d3LICOS MENSTRUALES, DOLOR AGUDO DE ESPALDA Y MALESTAR URINARIO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE CHEMICAL AND MECHANICAL IMBALANCES THAT LEAD TO THE FORMATION OF KIDNEY STONES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE URETER AND THE CONTRALATERAL KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR DISSOLVING CALCIUM DEPOSITS AND REDUCING THE INFLAMMATION CAUSED BY THE PASSAGE OF CALCULI THROUGH THE URINARY TRACT. BEYOND RENAL ISSUES, THIS PAIR IS FREQUENTLY USED TO ALLEVIATE SEVERE MENSTRUAL COLICS, AS THE NERVOUS AND VASCULAR CONNECTIONS IN THE PELVIC REGION ARE CLOSELY INTERTWINED. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RELAXING SMOOTH MUSCLE SPASMS, IMPROVING FILTRATION, AND CLEARING THE ENERGETIC BLOCKAGES THAT CONTRIBUTE TO CHRONIC PELVIC OR RENAL PAIN.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS QU\\u00cdMICOS Y MEC\\u00c1NICOS QUE CONDUCEN A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL UR\\u00c9TER Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N CONTRALATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA DISOLVER LOS DEP\\u00d3SITOS DE CALCIO Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CAUSADA POR EL PASO DE C\\u00c1LCULOS A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL TRACTO URINARIO. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS PROBLEMAS RENALES, ESTE PAR SE UTILIZA CON FRECUENCIA PARA ALIVIAR C\\u00d3LICOS MENSTRUALES SEVEROS, YA QUE LAS CONEXIONES NERVIOSAS Y VASCULARES EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA EST\\u00c1N ESTRECHAMENTE ENTRELAZADAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RELAJAR LOS ESPASMOS DEL M\\u00daSCULO LISO, MEJORAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N Y ELIMINAR LOS BLOQUEOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE CONTRIBUYEN AL DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO O RENAL CR\\u00d3NICO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY RECURRENT VAGINITIS OR JOINT PAIN, SCAN THE URETER \\/ FALLOPIAN TUBE - OPPOSITE (REF 834) RESONANCE FOR STREPTOCOCCUS B. FOR ACUTE RENAL COLIC RADIATING TO THE BLADDER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETER \\/ BLADDER (REF 833) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE ELIMINATION OF SEDIMENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE VAGINITIS RECURRENTE O DOLOR ARTICULAR, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ TROMPA DE FALOPIO - OPUESTA] (REF 834) PARA STREPTOCOCCUS B. PARA C\\u00d3LICO RENAL AGUDO QUE SE IRRADIA A LA VEJIGA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 833). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SEDIMENTOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/836','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:04:43','2026-04-29 00:04:43'),(4612,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',837,'{\"origins\":\"HERPES 4\",\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HERPES 4 (EPSTEIN-BARR)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFECTIOUS MONONUCLEOSIS, CHRONIC FATIGUE, URINARY TRACT IRRITATION, SORE THROAT, SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES, AND SPLEEN INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(MONONUCLEOSIS INFECCIOSA, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DEL TRACTO URINARIO, DOLOR DE GARGANTA, GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS INFLAMADOS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL BAZO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS HERPES 4 (EPSTEIN-BARR VIRUS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE URETER AND THE CONTRALATERAL RENAL CALYX. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS VIRUS IS WELL-KNOWN FOR CAUSING INFECTIOUS MONONUCLEOSIS AND IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO CHRONIC FATIGUE SYNDROME. WHILE OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE RESPIRATORY AND LYMPHATIC SYSTEMS, THIS SPECIFIC AXIS HIGHLIGHTS THE VIRUS\'S POTENTIAL TO IRRITATE THE RENAL STRUCTURES AND THE URINARY PATHWAY. THE IMBALANCE CREATED BY THIS PATHOGEN CAN LEAD TO PERSISTENT TIREDNESS AND A GENERAL SENSE OF MALAISE THAT DOES NOT RESOLVE WITH REST. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL ACTIVITY, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING VITAL ENERGY LEVELS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL HERPES 4 (VIRUS DE EPSTEIN-BARR) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL UR\\u00c9TER Y EL C\\u00c1LIZ RENAL CONTRALATERAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE VIRUS ES MUY CONOCIDO POR CAUSAR MONONUCLEOSIS INFECCIOSA Y CON FRECUENCIA EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO AL S\\u00cdNDROME DE FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA. AUNQUE SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON LOS SISTEMAS RESPIRATORIO Y LINF\\u00c1TICO, ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO RESALTA EL POTENCIAL DEL VIRUS PARA IRRITAR LAS ESTRUCTURAS RENALES Y LA V\\u00cdA URINARIA. EL DESEQUILIBRIO CREADO POR ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE LLEVAR A UN CANSANCIO PERSISTENTE Y UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N GENERAL DE MALESTAR QUE NO SE RESUELVE CON EL DESCANSO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RESTAURANDO LOS NIVELES DE ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC JOINT PAIN OR MUCOSAL IRRITATION IS PRESENT, SCAN THE ULNA \\/ ULNA (REF 832) RESONANCE FOR HERPES 3. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE RENAL LITHIASIS OR SHARP BACK PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETER \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE (REF 835) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE RENAL FILTRATION SYSTEM DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY DOLOR ARTICULAR SIST\\u00c9MICO O IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MUCOSAS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00daBITO \\/ C\\u00daBITO] (REF 832) PARA HERPES 3. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN LITIASIS RENAL AGUDA O DOLOR LUMBAR AGUDO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - OPUESTO] (REF 835). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL SISTEMA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/837','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:06:41','2026-04-29 00:06:41'),(4613,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',838,'{\"symptoms\":\"URETHRAL IRRITATION AND BLEEDING, PELVIC DISORDERS, SKIN LESIONS, ULCERS. (IRRITACI\\u00d3N URETRAL Y SANGRADO, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, \\u00daLCERAS.)\",\"paths\":\"IMPOTENCE, TUMOR MANIFESTATIONS. (IMPOTENCIA, MANIFESTACIONES TUMORALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CLITORIS\\/PELVIS                          CHECK - CLITORIS\\/SACRUM                        CHECK - BILE DUCT\\/KIDNEY (R)              CHECK - PANCREATIC DUCT\\/KIDNEY (L) (REVISAR - CL\\u00cdTORIS\\/PELVIS REVISAR - CL\\u00cdTORIS\\/SACRO REVISAR - CONDUCTO BILIAR\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (DERECHO) REVISAR - CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO\\/RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (IZQUIERDO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"URETHRAL IRRITATION AND BLEEDING, PELVIC DISORDERS, SKIN LESIONS, AND ULCERS.\\n\\n(IRRITACI\\u00d3N URETRAL Y SANGRADO, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y \\u00daLCERAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS SPIROCHETES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE URETHRA AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN MANIFEST IN THE UROGENITAL AND PELVIC REGIONS. THE PRESENCE OF THIS PATHOGEN CAN LEAD TO SIGNIFICANT IRRITATION AND BLEEDING WITHIN THE URETHRA, AS WELL AS THE FORMATION OF ULCERS OR LESIONS ON THE SKIN. IF LEFT UNTREATED, THE CHRONIC INFLAMMATION ASSOCIATED WITH THIS CIRCUIT MAY CONTRIBUTE TO REPRODUCTIVE DYSFUNCTIONS SUCH AS IMPOTENCE OR THE DEVELOPMENT OF TUMOR MANIFESTATIONS IN THE PELVIC AREA. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND RESTORING TISSUE INTEGRITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LAS ESPIROQUETAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA URETRA Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTAN EN LAS REGIONES UROGENITAL Y P\\u00c9LVICA. LA PRESENCIA DE ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE PROVOCAR UNA IRRITACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA Y SANGRADO DENTRO DE LA URETRA, AS\\u00cd COMO LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE \\u00daLCERAS O LESIONES EN LA PIEL. SI NO SE TRATA, LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA ASOCIADA CON ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE CONTRIBUIR A DISFUNCIONES REPRODUCTIVAS COMO LA IMPOTENCIA O EL DESARROLLO DE MANIFESTACIONES TUMORALES EN EL \\u00c1REA P\\u00c9LVICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y RESTAURAR LA INTEGRIDAD DEL TEJIDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: FOR PELVIC OR GENITAL LESIONS, SCAN THE [CLITORIS \\/ PELVIS] OR [CLITORIS \\/ SACRUM] AXES AS CORRESPONDING POINTS. IF SYSTEMIC TOXICITY IS SUSPECTED, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [BILE DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (R)] OR [PANCREATIC DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (L)] RESONANCES TO ENSURE PROPER FILTRATION. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: PARA LESIONES P\\u00c9LVICAS O GENITALES, ESCANEE LOS EJES [CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ PELVIS] O [CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ SACRO] COMO PUNTOS CORRESPONDIENTES. SI SE SOSPECHA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LAS RESONANCIAS [CONDUCTO BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)] O [CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I)] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FILTRACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/838','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:07:45','2026-04-29 00:07:45'),(4614,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',839,'{\"symptoms\":\"ORAL THRUSH (CANDIDIASIS ORAL)\",\"paths\":\"VAGINAL INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, GASTRIC DISORDERS. (INFECCIONES VAGINALES, INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ORAL THRUSH (CANDIDIASIS ORAL), VAGINAL INFECTIONS, RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS, AND GASTRIC DISORDERS.\\n\\n(CANDIDIASIS ORAL, INFECCIONES VAGINALES, INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS Y TRASTORNOS G\\u00c1STRICOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE IMBALANCES ASSOCIATED WITH CANDIDA ALBICANS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE URETHRA AND THE URETERS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, ALTHOUGH CANDIDA IS BIOLOGICALLY A FUNGUS, THIS SPECIFIC AXIS ADDRESSES THE BACTERIAL-LIKE PROLIFERATION AND SYSTEMIC SPREAD OF THE PATHOGEN. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS DISRUPTED, IT CAN LEAD TO A VARIETY OF MANIFESTATIONS BEYOND THE URINARY TRACT, INCLUDING ORAL THRUSH, PERSISTENT VAGINAL INFECTIONS, AND IRRITATION WITHIN THE RESPIRATORY AND GASTRIC SYSTEMS. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN REGULATING THE OVERGROWTH, REDUCING MUCOSAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING THE NATURAL BALANCE OF THE UROGENITAL FLORA.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS ASOCIADOS CON CANDIDA ALBICANS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA URETRA Y LOS UR\\u00c9TERES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, AUNQUE LA CANDIDA ES BIOL\\u00d3GICAMENTE UN HONGO, ESTE EJE ESPEC\\u00cdFICO ABORDA LA PROLIFERACI\\u00d3N DE TIPO BACTERIANO Y LA DISEMINACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO SE ALTERA, PUEDE LLEVAR A UNA VARIEDAD DE MANIFESTACIONES M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DEL TRACTO URINARIO, INCLUYENDO CANDIDIASIS ORAL, INFECCIONES VAGINALES PERSISTENTES E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DENTRO DE LOS SISTEMAS RESPIRATORIO Y G\\u00c1STRICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A REGULAR EL SOBRECRECIMIENTO, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS MUCOSAS Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO NATURAL DE LA FLORA UROGENITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URETHRAL IRRITATION IS ACCOMPANIED BY BLEEDING OR SKIN LESIONS, SCAN THE URETHRA \\/ SACRUM (REF 837) RESONANCE FOR SPIROCHETES. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RENAL LITHIASIS OR BACK PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETER \\/ BLADDER (REF 833) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE ELIMINATION OF FUNGAL AND BACTERIAL BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N URETRAL SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE SANGRADO O LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [URETRA \\/ SACRO] (REF 837) PARA ESPIROQUETAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN LITIASIS RENAL SEVERA O DOLOR DE ESPALDA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 833). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS F\\u00daNGICOS Y BACTERIANOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/839','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:08:53','2026-04-29 00:08:53'),(4615,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',840,'{\"symptoms\":\"ITCHING, URETHRAL BLEEDING. (PICAZ\\u00d3N, SANGRADO URETRAL)\",\"paths\":\"INFERTILITY (INFERTILIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ITCHING AND URETHRAL BLEEDING.\\n\\n(PICAZ\\u00d3N Y SANGRADO URETRAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE CORONAVIRUS WITHIN THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS DIRECTLY WITHIN THE URETHRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, WHILE THIS VIRUS IS COMMONLY ASSOCIATED WITH RESPIRATORY ISSUES, THIS SPECIFIC LOCALIZED AXIS HIGHLIGHTS ITS CAPACITY TO IRRITATE THE URINARY TRACT. THE RESULTING IMBALANCE CAN LEAD TO LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION, MANIFESTING AS PERSISTENT ITCHING OR EVEN BLEEDING DURING URINATION. CRITICALLY, THE CHRONIC VIRAL PRESENCE IN THIS REGION IS LINKED TO INFERTILITY, AS THE PATHOGEN MAY DISRUPT THE REPRODUCTIVE ENVIRONMENT OR VITALITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, RESOLVING URETHRAL IRRITATION, AND PROTECTING REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL CORONAVIRUS DENTRO DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DIRECTAMENTE EN LA URETRA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, AUNQUE ESTE VIRUS SE ASOCIA COM\\u00daNMENTE CON PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS, ESTE EJE LOCALIZADO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO RESALTA SU CAPACIDAD PARA IRRITAR EL TRACTO URINARIO. EL DESEQUILIBRIO RESULTANTE PUEDE LLEVAR A UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO PICAZ\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE O INCLUSO SANGRADO AL ORINAR. FUNDAMENTALMENTE, LA PRESENCIA VIRAL CR\\u00d3NICA EN ESTA REGI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A LA INFERTILIDAD, YA QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE ALTERAR EL ENTORNO O LA VITALIDAD REPRODUCTIVA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, RESOLVIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N URETRAL Y PROTEGIENDO LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA.)\\n\\nALT\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URETHRAL BLEEDING IS ACCOMPANIED BY SKIN ULCERS OR PELVIC DISORDERS, SCAN THE URETHRA \\/ SACRUM (REF 837) RESONANCE FOR SPIROCHETES. FOR CASES INVOLVING VAGINAL OR RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS ALONGSIDE URINARY IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETHRA \\/ URETERS (REF 838) AXIS (CANDIDA). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE URINARY PATHWAY DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL SANGRADO URETRAL SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE \\u00daLCERAS CUT\\u00c1NEAS O TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [URETRA \\/ SACRO] (REF 837) PARA ESPIROQUETAS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES VAGINALES O RESPIRATORIAS JUNTO CON IRRITACI\\u00d3N URINARIA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [URETRA \\/ UR\\u00c9TERES] (REF 838) (CANDIDA). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LA V\\u00cdA URINARIA DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/840','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:09:54','2026-04-29 00:09:54'),(4616,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',841,'{\"symptoms\":\"URETHRITIS, CYSTITIS, URETHRAL BLEEDING, VAGINITIS,DYSURIA, DYSMENORRHEA, HOT FLASHES, FEMALE INFERTILITY, NEPHROTIC SYNDROME, RENAL FAILURE, DIARRHEA. HEMATURIA AND PROTEINURIA. (URETRITIS, CISTITIS, SANGRADO URETRAL, VAGINITIS, DISURIA, DISMENORREA, SOFOCOS, INFERTILIDAD FEMENINA, S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, DIARREA. HEMATURIA Y PROTEINURIA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED FROM RODENTS, RABBITS, CATS AND OTHER FELINES. (TRANSMITIDO POR ROEDORES, CONEJOS, GATOS Y OTROS FELINOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH A FUNGUS MALASSESIA FURFUR: SEVERE ACUTE RESPIRATORY SYNDROME. (ASOCIADO CON UN HONGO MALASSEZIA FURFUR: S\\u00cdNDROME RESPIRATORIO AGUDO GRAVE.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"URETHRITIS, CYSTITIS, URETHRAL BLEEDING, VAGINITIS, DYSURIA, DYSMENORRHEA, HOT FLASHES, FEMALE INFERTILITY, NEPHROTIC SYNDROME, RENAL FAILURE, DIARRHEA, HEMATURIA, AND PROTEINURIA.(URETRITIS, CISTITIS, SANGRADO URETRAL, VAGINITIS, DISURIA, DISMENORREA, SOFOCOS, INFERTILIDAD FEMENINA, S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, DIARREA, HEMATURIA Y PROTEINURIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES A SPECIFIC STRAIN OF CORONAVIRUS THAT EXHIBITS A STRONG TROPISM FOR THE RENAL AND UROGENITAL SYSTEMS. UNLIKE RESPIRATORY STRAINS, THIS VARIANT IS OFTEN TRANSMITTED THROUGH CONTACT WITH INFECTED ANIMALS SUCH AS RODENTS, RABBITS, AND FELINES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING SEVERE URINARY TRACT DYSFUNCTIONS, RANGING FROM SIMPLE URETHRITIS TO COMPLEX RENAL FAILURE AND NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. THE VIRUS IRRITATES THE MUCOSAL LININGS AND FILTRATION UNITS OF THE KIDNEYS, LEADING TO THE PRESENCE OF BLOOD (HEMATURIA) OR PROTEIN (PROTEINURIA) IN THE URINE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING KIDNEY FUNCTION, AND RESOLVING REPRODUCTIVE IMBALANCES SUCH AS DYSMENORRHEA AND INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL ABORDA UNA CEPA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA DE CORONAVIRUS QUE PRESENTA UN FUERTE TROPISMO POR LOS SISTEMAS RENAL Y UROGENITAL. A DIFERENCIA DE LAS CEPAS RESPIRATORIAS, ESTA VARIANTE SE TRANSMITE A MENUDO POR EL CONTACTO CON ANIMALES INFECTADOS COMO ROEDORES, CONEJOS Y FELINOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE DISFUNCIONES GRAVES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, QUE VAN DESDE UNA SIMPLE URETRITIS HASTA UNA INSUFICIENCIA RENAL COMPLEJA Y EL S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. EL VIRUS IRRITA LOS REVESTIMIENTOS MUCOSOS Y LAS UNIDADES DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, LO QUE PROVOCA LA PRESENCIA DE SANGRE (HEMATURIA) O PROTE\\u00cdNAS (PROTEINURIA) EN LA ORINA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL Y RESOLVIENDO DESEQUILIBRIOS REPRODUCTIVOS COMO LA DISMENORREA Y LA INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: THIS RESONANCE IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE FUNGUS MALASSEZIA FURFUR; IF SYMPTOMS INCLUDE SEVERE ACUTE RESPIRATORY ISSUES, SCAN FOR CORRESPONDING FUNGAL POINTS. FOR CASES INVOLVING URETHRAL ITCHING WITHOUT SYSTEMIC RENAL IMPACT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETHRA \\/ URETHRA (REF 839) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM DURING THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL HONGO MALASSEZIA FURFUR; SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS INCLUYEN PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS AGUDOS GRAVES, BUSQUE PUNTOS F\\u00daNGICOS CORRESPONDIENTES. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PICAZ\\u00d3N URETRAL SIN IMPACTO RENAL SIST\\u00c9MICO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [URETRA \\/ URETRA] (REF 839). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/841','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:11:06','2026-04-29 00:11:06'),(4617,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',842,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC CARRIER STATE, POTENTIAL FOR RECURRING URINARY OR REPRODUCTIVE INFECTIONS, AND PERSISTENT VIRAL LOAD.\\n\\n(ESTADO DE PORTADOR ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO, POTENCIAL DE INFECCIONES URINARIAS O REPRODUCTIVAS RECURRENTES Y CARGA VIRAL PERSISTENTE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES A SPECIFIC STORAGE POINT FOR VIRUSES WITHIN THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE VERTICAL AXIS OF THE URETHRA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, A VERTICAL RESERVOIR INDICATES THAT PATHOGENS ARE \\\"HIDING\\\" WITHIN THE STRUCTURE OF THE ORGAN ITSELF, OFTEN REMAINING DORMANT OR PROTECTED FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM\'S NORMAL SURVEILLANCE. WHILE THE INDIVIDUAL MAY NOT SHOW ACTIVE SYMPTOMS, THIS RESERVOIR CAN BE THE SOURCE OF RECURRING OUTBREAKS OR CHRONIC IMBALANCES THAT AFFECT URINARY HEALTH AND FERTILITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXPOSING THESE HIDDEN VIRUSES, ALLOWING THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO FULLY CLEAR THE PATHOGENIC LOAD AND PREVENT FUTURE RE-INFECTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA UN PUNTO DE ALMACENAMIENTO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA VIRUS DENTRO DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DEL EJE VERTICAL DE LA URETRA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, UN RESERVORIO VERTICAL INDICA QUE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS SE EST\\u00c1N \\\"OCULTANDO\\\" DENTRO DE LA ESTRUCTURA DEL PROPIO \\u00d3RGANO, A MENUDO PERMANECIENDO LATENTES O PROTEGIDOS DE LA VIGILANCIA NORMAL DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO. AUNQUE EL INDIVIDUO PUEDE NO MOSTRAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS ACTIVOS, ESTE RESERVORIO PUEDE SER LA FUENTE DE BROTES RECURRENTES O DESEQUILIBRIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS QUE AFECTAN LA SALUD URINARIA Y LA FERTILIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EXPONER ESTOS VIRUS OCULTOS, PERMITIENDO QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO DEPURE COMPLETAMENTE LA CARGA PAT\\u00d3GENA Y PREVENGA FUTURAS REINFECCIONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF ACTIVE URETHRAL IRRITATION OR BLEEDING IS PRESENT, SCAN THE URETHRA \\/ URETHRA (REF 839 OR REF 840) RESONANCES FOR CORONAVIRUS STRAINS. FOR CASES INVOLVING VAGINAL OR RESPIRATORY IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETHRA \\/ URETERS (REF 838) AXIS (CANDIDA). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL SYSTEM DURING THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY IRRITACI\\u00d3N URETRAL ACTIVA O SANGRADO, ESCANEE LAS RESONANCIAS [URETRA \\/ URETRA] (REF 839 O REF 840) PARA CEPAS DE CORONAVIRUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITACI\\u00d3N VAGINAL O RESPIRATORIA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [URETRA \\/ UR\\u00c9TERES] (REF 838) (CANDIDA). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA RENAL DURANTE EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/842','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:12:08','2026-04-29 00:12:08'),(4618,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',843,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"URINARY INCONTINENCE, WEAKNESS OF THE PELVIC FLOOR, SUDDEN URGE TO URINATE, AND POTENTIAL LOSS OF BLADDER CONTROL.\\n\\n(INCONTINENCIA URINARIA, DEBILIDAD DEL SUELO P\\u00c9LVICO, NECESIDAD REPENTINA DE ORINAR Y POSIBLE P\\u00c9RDIDA DEL CONTROL DE LA VEJIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE RABIES 3 VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS DIRECTLY WITHIN THE URETHRAL SPHINCTER MUSCLES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS SPECIFIC VIRAL STRAIN HAS A TROPISM FOR THE NERVES AND MUSCLES THAT REGULATE URINARY RETENTION. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT OFTEN MANIFESTS AS URINARY INCONTINENCE, AS THE VIRUS INTERFERES WITH THE SPHINCTER\'S ABILITY TO CONTRACT OR RELAX PROPERLY. UNLIKE THE NEUROLOGICAL AGGRESSION ASSOCIATED WITH CLASSIC RABIES, THIS VARIANT PRIMARILY IMPACTS THE AUTONOMIC CONTROL OF THE BLADDER EXIT. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, RESTORING TONE TO THE SPHINCTER MUSCLES, AND REGAINING VOLUNTARY CONTROL OVER URINATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA RABIA 3 MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DIRECTAMENTE EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS DEL ESF\\u00cdNTER URETRAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTA CEPA VIRAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICA TIENE TROPISMO POR LOS NERVIOS Y M\\u00daSCULOS QUE REGULAN LA RETENCI\\u00d3N URINARIA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO SE MANIFIESTA A MENUDO COMO INCONTINENCIA URINARIA, YA QUE EL VIRUS INTERFIERE CON LA CAPACIDAD DEL ESF\\u00cdNTER PARA CONTRAERSE O RELAJARSE ADECUADAMENTE. A DIFERENCIA DE LA AGRESI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA ASOCIADA CON LA RABIA CL\\u00c1SICA, ESTA VARIANTE IMPACTA PRINCIPALMENTE EL CONTROL AUT\\u00d3NOMO DE LA SALIDA DE LA VEJIGA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, RESTAURANDO EL TONO DE LOS M\\u00daSCULOS DEL ESF\\u00cdNTER Y RECUPERANDO EL CONTROL VOLUNTARIO SOBRE LA MICCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY INCONTINENCE IS ACCOMPANIED BY KIDNEY DYSFUNCTION OR PROTEINURIA, SCAN THE URETHRA \\/ URETHRA (REF 840) RESONANCE FOR CORONAVIRUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT ITCHING WITHOUT LOSS OF CONTROL, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETHRA \\/ URETHRA (REF 839) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE URINARY SYSTEM DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA INCONTINENCIA URINARIA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL O PROTEINURIA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [URETRA \\/ URETRA] (REF 840) PARA CORONAVIRUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PICAZ\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE SIN P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CONTROL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [URETRA \\/ URETRA] (REF 839). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA URINARIO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/843','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:13:27','2026-04-29 00:13:27'),(4619,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',844,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RAGE (IRA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RAGE (IRA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INTENSE ANGER, IRRITABILITY, OUTBURSTS OF TEMPER, AND EMOTIONAL TENSION MANIFESTING AS PHYSICAL RIGIDITY IN THE PELVIC REGION.\\n\\n(IRA INTENSA, IRRITABILIDAD, ARREBATOS DE TEMPERAMENTO Y TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL QUE SE MANIFIESTA COMO RIGIDEZ F\\u00cdSICA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE VIBRATIONAL CODE OF RAGE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS DIRECTLY WITHIN THE URETHRAL SPHINCTER MUSCLES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE SPHINCTERS ARE ORGANS OF RETENTION AND RELEASE; EMOTIONALLY, THEY CAN BECOME \\\"LOCKED\\\" OR OVERLY TIGHTENED DURING STATES OF INTENSE ANGER OR REPRESSED FURY. THIS IMBALANCE OFTEN REFLECTS A STRUGGLE TO CONTROL ONE\'S ENVIRONMENT OR EMOTIONS, LEADING TO A PSYCHOSOMATIC CONTRACTION IN THE LOWER PELVIS. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE SYSTEM IN RELEASING THE DENSE ENERGY OF RAGE, ENCOURAGING EMOTIONAL FLUIDITY AND RELAXING THE PHYSICAL TENSION HELD WITHIN THE UROGENITAL STRUCTURES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA EL C\\u00d3DIGO VIBRATORIO DE LA IRA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DIRECTAMENTE EN LOS M\\u00daSCULOS DEL ESF\\u00cdNTER URETRAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LOS ESF\\u00cdNTERES SON \\u00d3RGANOS DE RETENCI\\u00d3N Y LIBERACI\\u00d3N; EMOCIONALMENTE, PUEDEN \\\"BLOQUEARSE\\\" O TENSARSE EN EXCESO DURANTE ESTADOS DE IRA INTENSA O FURIA REPRIMIDA. ESTE DESEQUILIBRIO A MENUDO REFLEJA UNA LUCHA POR CONTROLAR EL ENTORNO O LAS PROPIAS EMOCIONES, LO QUE LLEVA A UNA CONTRACCI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA EN LA PELVIS INFERIOR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA A LIBERAR LA ENERG\\u00cdA DENSA DE LA IRA, FOMENTANDO LA FLUIDEZ EMOCIONAL Y RELAJANDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA RETENIDA EN LAS ESTRUCTURAS UROGENITALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"EMOTIONAL CHECK: IF RAGE IS ACCOMPANIED BY A SENSE OF VICTIMIZATION OR OVERWHELM, SCAN THE URETHRA \\/ SACRUM (REF 837) RESONANCE. FOR CASES WHERE EMOTIONAL TENSION CAUSES PHYSICAL INCONTINENCE OR LOSS OF CONTROL, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETHRAL SPHINCTER \\/ URETHRAL SPHINCTER (REF 842) AXIS (VIRAL RABIES 3). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL SYSTEM DURING THE RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL STRESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL: SI LA IRA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE UN SENTIDO DE VICTIMIZACI\\u00d3N O AGOBIO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [URETRA \\/ SACRO] (REF 837). PARA CASOS DONDE LA TENSI\\u00d3N EMOCIONAL CAUSE INCONTINENCIA F\\u00cdSICA O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE CONTROL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [ESF\\u00cdNTER URETRAL \\/ ESF\\u00cdNTER URETRAL] (REF 842) (VIRAL RABIA 3). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA ADRENAL DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DEL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/844','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:14:29','2026-04-29 00:14:29'),(4620,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',845,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VAGINAL INFECTIONS (INFECCIONES VAGINALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VAGINAL INFECTIONS (INFECCIONES VAGINALES)\",\"symptoms\":\"VAGINAL DISCHARGE, IRRITATION, PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL NERVOUS SYSTEM TENSION OR HEADACHES LINKED TO REPRODUCTIVE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(FLUJO VAGINAL, IRRITACI\\u00d3N, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO Y POSIBLE TENSI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO O DOLORES DE CABEZA VINCULADOS A DESEQUILIBRIOS REPRODUCTIVOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC AND PHYSIOLOGICAL BALANCE OF THE FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE UTERUS AND THE ATLAS VETERBRA (C1). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS PARTICULARLY RELEVANT FOR TREATING VAGINAL INFECTIONS THAT MAY BE PERPETUATED BY A LACK OF COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE PELVIC REGION AND THE UPPER NERVOUS SYSTEM. THE ATLAS SERVES AS THE GATEWAY FOR THE BRAIN-BODY CONNECTION, AND AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN AFFECT THE AUTONOMIC REGULATION OF THE UTERINE ENVIRONMENT. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN ELIMINATING PATHOGENS IN THE VAGINAL TRACT, REDUCING LOCAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING THE OVERALL INTEGRITY OF THE REPRODUCTIVE MUCOSA.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL EQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO Y FISIOL\\u00d3GICO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR FEMENINO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00daTERO Y LA V\\u00c9RTEBRA ATLAS (C1). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES PARTICULARMENTE RELEVANTE PARA TRATAR INFECCIONES VAGINALES QUE PUEDEN PERPETUARSE POR UNA FALTA DE COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO SUPERIOR. EL ATLAS SIRVE COMO PUERTA DE ENTRADA PARA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N CEREBRO-CUERPO, Y UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE AFECTAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA DEL ENTORNO UTERINO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS EN EL TRACTO VAGINAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL Y RESTAURANDO LA INTEGRIDAD GENERAL DE LA MUCOSA REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF VAGINAL INFECTIONS ARE PERSISTENT AND ACCOMPANIED BY URINARY IRRITATION, SCAN THE URETHRA \\/ URETERS (REF 838) RESONANCE FOR CANDIDA. FOR CASES INVOLVING JOINT PAIN OR INFERTILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETER \\/ FALLOPIAN TUBE - OPPOSITE (REF 834) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT DURING THE CLEARANCE OF INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LAS INFECCIONES VAGINALES SON PERSISTENTES Y SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE IRRITACI\\u00d3N URINARIA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [URETRA \\/ UR\\u00c9TERES] (REF 838) PARA CANDIDA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR O INFERTILIDAD, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ TROMPA DE FALOPIO - OPUESTA] (REF 834). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE INFECCIONES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/845','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:15:38','2026-04-29 00:15:38'),(4621,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',846,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY, SEXUAL DISORDERS. (ANSIEDAD, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES)\",\"paths\":\"ABSCESSES, POLYPS, UROGENITAL DISORDERS, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDER OF THE KIDNEYS, UTERINE CANCER. (ABSCESOS, P\\u00d3LIPOS, TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES, TRASTORNO PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, C\\u00c1NCER UTERINO)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"UROGENITAL DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES)\",\"symptoms\":\"ANXIETY, SEXUAL DISORDERS, PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND PSYCHOSOMATIC MANIFESTATIONS LINKED TO RENAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ANSIEDAD, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO Y MANIFESTACIONES PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICAS VINCULADAS A LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE INTEGRATION BETWEEN THE REPRODUCTIVE AND EXCRETORY SYSTEMS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE UTERUS AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING COMPLEX UROGENITAL IMBALANCES THAT MAY MANIFEST AS ABSCESSES, POLYPS, OR EVEN UTERINE CANCER. BEYOND PHYSICAL PATHOLOGY, THIS PAIR HIGHLIGHTS THE DEEP PSYCHOSOMATIC CONNECTION OF THE KIDNEYS, WHERE EMOTIONAL STRESS AND ANXIETY OFTEN DISTORT THE ENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT OF THE UTERUS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CLEARING ABNORMAL TISSUE GROWTHS, REGULATING SEXUAL VITALITY, AND HARMONIZING THE EMOTIONAL-PHYSICAL FLOW BETWEEN THESE TWO VITAL REGIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ENTRE LOS SISTEMAS REPRODUCTOR Y EXCRETOR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00daTERO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR DESEQUILIBRIOS UROGENITALES COMPLEJOS QUE PUEDEN MANIFESTARSE COMO ABSCESOS, P\\u00d3LIPOS O INCLUSO C\\u00c1NCER UTERINO. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA PATOLOG\\u00cdA F\\u00cdSICA, ESTE PAR RESALTA LA PROFUNDA CONEXI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, DONDE EL ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL Y LA ANSIEDAD A MENUDO DISTORSIONAN EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL \\u00daTERO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR CRECIMIENTOS TISULARES ANORMALES, REGULAR LA VITALIDAD SEXUAL Y ARMONIZAR EL FLUJO EMOCIONAL-F\\u00cdSICO ENTRE ESTAS DOS REGIONES VITALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF UROGENITAL DISORDERS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE RENAL LITHIASIS OR MENSTRUAL COLIC, SCAN THE URETER \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE (REF 835) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING VAGINAL INFECTIONS AND HEADACHES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ ATLAS (REF 844) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE TREATMENT OF UTERINE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS TRASTORNOS UROGENITALES SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE LITIASIS RENAL SEVERA O C\\u00d3LICO MENSTRUAL, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - OPUESTO] (REF 835). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES VAGINALES Y DOLORES DE CABEZA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ ATLAS] (REF 844). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE DESEQUILIBRIOS UTERINOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/846','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:16:53','2026-04-29 00:16:53'),(4622,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',847,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"INFERTILITY INCREASE (AUMENTO DE LA INFERTILIDAD)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"REPRODUCTIVE IMBALANCE (DESEQUILIBRIO REPRODUCTIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFERTILITY, HORMONAL DISRUPTIONS, PELVIC TENSION, AND IRREGULAR MENSTRUAL CYCLES.\\n\\n(INFERTILIDAD, ALTERACIONES HORMONALES, TENSI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y CICLOS MENSTRUALES IRREGULARES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC CONDITIONS THAT CONTRIBUTE TO AN INCREASE IN INFERTILITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE UTERUS AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE LEFT KIDNEY IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE VITAL RESERVES OF THE BODY AND THE EMOTIONAL PROCESSING OF FEAR AND SECURITY. WHEN THIS AXIS IS DISRUPTED, THE UTERINE ENVIRONMENT MAY BECOME LESS RECEPTIVE, IMPACTING CONCEPTION AND REPRODUCTIVE VITALITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN BALANCING THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO THE REPRODUCTIVE ORGANS, SUPPORTING FERTILITY AND HARMONIZING THE RENAL-UTERINE CONNECTION NECESSARY FOR HEALTHY GESTATIONAL PREPARATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LAS CONDICIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS QUE CONTRIBUYEN A UN AUMENTO DE LA INFERTILIDAD MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00daTERO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON LAS RESERVAS VITALES DEL CUERPO Y EL PROCESAMIENTO EMOCIONAL DEL MIEDO Y LA SEGURIDAD. CUANDO ESTE EJE SE ALTERA, EL ENTORNO UTERINO PUEDE VOLVERSE MENOS RECEPTIVO, AFECTANDO LA CONCEPCI\\u00d3N Y LA VITALIDAD REPRODUCTIVA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EQUILIBRAR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO HACIA LOS \\u00d3RGANOS REPRODUCTORES, APOYANDO LA FERTILIDAD Y ARMONIZANDO LA CONEXI\\u00d3N RENAL-UTERINA NECESARIA PARA UNA PREPARACI\\u00d3N GESTACIONAL SALUDABLE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF INFERTILITY IS ACCOMPANIED BY SYSTEMIC JOINT DISORDERS OR VAGINITIS, SCAN THE URETER \\/ FALLOPIAN TUBE - OPPOSITE (REF 834) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING UROGENITAL ABSCESSES OR POLYPS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ KIDNEY (REF 845) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE ENERGETIC REALIGNMENT.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA INFERTILIDAD SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE TRASTORNOS ARTICULARES SIST\\u00c9MICOS O VAGINITIS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ TROMPA DE FALOPIO - OPUESTA] (REF 834). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ABSCESOS UROGENITALES O P\\u00d3LIPOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 845). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL REALINEAMIENTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/847','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:18:00','2026-04-29 00:18:00'),(4623,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',848,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRUE PREGNANCY (EMBARAZO VERDADERO)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CAUTION: DO NOT DEPOLARIZE, THIS PAIR MAKE AN ABORTION. (PRECAUCI\\u00d3N: NO DESPOLARIZAR, ESTE PAR PROVOCA UN ABORTO.)\"}','{\"origins\":\"TRUE PREGNANCY (EMBARAZO VERDADERO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PHYSOLOGICAL CHANGES ASSOCIATED WITH GESTATION.\\n\\n(CAMBIOS FISIOL\\u00d3GICOS ASOCIADOS A LA GESTACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE IS SPECIFICALLY IDENTIFIED WITH THE STATE OF TRUE PREGNANCY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE UTERUS AND THE OVARY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS SERVES AS A BIO-INDICATOR OF THE GESTATIONAL PROCESS, REFLECTING THE ENERGETIC HARMONY REQUIRED FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF THE EMBRYO. UNLIKE PATHOGENIC PAIRS, THIS CIRCUIT MONITORS THE NATURAL PHYSIOLOGICAL LOAD OF PREGNANCY. STABILIZING THIS AXIS SUPPORTS THE VITAL COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE UTERINE ENVIRONMENT AND THE HORMONAL OUTPUT OF THE OVARIES, ENSURING A BALANCED ENERGETIC FIELD DURING THE EARLY STAGES OF LIFE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE IDENTIFICA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE CON EL ESTADO DE EMBARAZO VERDADERO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00daTERO Y EL OVARIO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SIRVE COMO UN BIOINDICADOR DEL PROCESO GESTACIONAL, REFLEJANDO LA ARMON\\u00cdA ENERG\\u00c9TICA REQUERIDA PARA EL DESARROLLO DEL EMBRI\\u00d3N. A DIFERENCIA DE LOS PARES PAT\\u00d3GENOS, ESTE CIRCUITO MONITOREA LA CARGA FISIOL\\u00d3GICA NATURAL DEL EMBARAZO. LA ESTABILIZACI\\u00d3N DE ESTE EJE APOYA LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N VITAL ENTRE EL ENTORNO UTERINO Y LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N HORMONAL DE LOS OVARIOS, ASEGURANDO UN CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EQUILIBRADO DURANTE LAS PRIMERAS ETAPAS DE LA VIDA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"[!CAUTION]\\nSTRICT WARNING: DO NOT DEPOLARIZE THIS PAIR IF PREGNANCY IS SUSPECTED OR CONFIRMED, AS DEPOLARIZATION MAY CAUSE AN ABORTION. ALWAYS VERIFY THE INTENT OF THE SCAN.\\n\\n(ADVERTENCIA ESTRICTA: NO DESPOLARIZAR ESTE PAR SI SE SOSPECHA O CONFIRMA EMBARAZO, YA QUE LA DESPOLARIZACI\\u00d3N PUEDE PROVOCAR UN ABORTO. SIEMPRE VERIFIQUE LA INTENCI\\u00d3N DEL ESCANEO.)FOR CASES INVOLVING INFERTILITY WITHOUT PREGNANCY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ KIDNEY - L (REF 846) AXIS. IF VAGINAL INFECTIONS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE UTERUS \\/ ATLAS (REF 844) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/848','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:19:31','2026-04-29 00:19:31');
INSERT INTO `audits` VALUES (4624,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',849,'{\"symptoms\":\"WARTS, FOOD INTOLERANCE, CYSTITIS, ABSCESSES. (VERRUGAS, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, CISTITIS, ABSCESOS)\",\"paths\":\"HUMAN PAPILLOMA VIRUS. UROGENITAL DISEASE, ABSCESSES OF THE CERVIX. (VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO. ENFERMEDAD UROGENITAL, ABSCESOS DEL CUELLO UTERINO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WARTS, FOOD INTOLERANCE, CYSTITIS, AND ABSCESSES.\\n\\n(VERRUGAS, INTOLERANCIA ALIMENTARIA, CISTITIS Y ABSCESOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE HUMAN PAPILLOMA VIRUS (HPV) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE UTERUS AND THE RECTUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR ADDRESSING UROGENITAL DISEASES AND COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS ABSCESSES OF THE CERVIX. THE VIRAL LOAD IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN MANIFEST PHYSICALLY AS WARTS OR GROWTHS AND MAY ALSO TRIGGER SYSTEMIC RESPONSES, INCLUDING SUDDEN FOOD INTOLERANCES OR RECURRENT BLADDER IRRITATION (CYSTITIS). BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL ACTIVITY, PREVENTING TISSUE DEGENERATION IN THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT, AND RESOLVING THE INFLAMMATORY PROCESSES THAT LEAD TO PELVIC ABSCESSES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO (VPH) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00daTERO Y EL RECTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA ABORDAR ENFERMEDADES UROGENITALES Y COMPLICACIONES COMO LOS ABSCESOS DEL CUELLO UTERINO. LA CARGA VIRAL EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE MANIFESTARSE F\\u00cdSICAMENTE COMO VERRUGAS O CRECIMIENTOS Y TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE DESENCADENAR RESPUESTAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS, INCLUYENDO INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS REPENTINAS O IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECURRENTE DE LA VEJIGA (CISTITIS). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL, PREVINIENDO LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N TISULAR EN EL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO Y RESOLVIENDO LOS PROCESOS INFLAMATORIOS QUE CONDUCEN A ABSCESOS P\\u00c9LVICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF UROGENITAL ABSCESSES OR POLYPS PERSIST, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ KIDNEY (REF 845) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING VAGINAL DISCHARGE AND NERVOUS TENSION, SCAN THE UTERUS \\/ ATLAS (REF 844) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE PELVIC ORGANS DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS ABSCESOS UROGENITALES O P\\u00d3LIPOS PERSISTEN, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 845). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FLUJO VAGINAL Y TENSI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [\\u00daTERO \\/ ATLAS] (REF 844). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LOS \\u00d3RGANOS P\\u00c9LVICOS DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/849','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:21:14','2026-04-29 00:21:14'),(4625,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',850,'{\"symptoms\":\"VOMITING (V\\u00d3MITO)\",\"paths\":\"BULIMIA, RESTORES MENSTRUATION. (BULIMIA, RESTAURA LA MENSTRUACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VOMITING, EMOTIONAL DISTURBANCES, AND MENSTRUAL IRREGULARITIES.\\n\\n(V\\u00d3MITO, TRASTORNOS EMOCIONALES E IRREGULARIDADES MENSTRUALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES A SPECIFIC STORAGE POINT FOR PARASITES WITHIN THE REPRODUCTIVE AND LOWER SPINAL AXIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE UTERUS AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT FOR ITS IMPACT ON BOTH PHYSICAL AND PSYCHOSOMATIC HEALTH. PHYSICALLY, THIS RESERVOIR IS OFTEN LINKED TO BULIMIA AND CHRONIC VOMITING, AS THE ENERGETIC IMBALANCE INTERFERES WITH THE GASTROINTESTINAL-REPRODUCTIVE FEEDBACK LOOP. ADDITIONALLY, IT IS A KEY POINT FOR RESTORING NORMAL MENSTRUATION IN CASES OF AMENORRHEA OR IRREGULAR CYCLES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN ELIMINATING HIDDEN PARASITIC LOADS, BALANCING THE PELVIC ENERGY FIELD, AND RESOLVING COMPLEX EATING DISORDERS TIED TO REPRODUCTIVE DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA UN PUNTO DE ALMACENAMIENTO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA PAR\\u00c1SITOS DENTRO DEL EJE REPRODUCTIVO Y DE LA COLUMNA INFERIOR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL \\u00daTERO Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO POR SU IMPACTO TANTO EN LA SALUD F\\u00cdSICA COMO EN LA PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA. F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, ESTE RESERVORIO SE VINCULA A MENUDO CON LA BULIMIA Y EL V\\u00d3MITO CR\\u00d3NICO, YA QUE EL DESEQUILIBRIO ENERG\\u00c9TICO INTERFIERE CON EL CIRCUITO DE RETROALIMENTACI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL-REPRODUCTIVO. ADEM\\u00c1S, ES UN PUNTO CLAVE PARA RESTAURAR LA MENSTRUACI\\u00d3N NORMAL EN CASOS DE AMENORREA O CICLOS IRREGULARES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR CARGAS PARASITARIAS OCULTAS, EQUILIBRAR EL CAMPO ENERG\\u00c9TICO P\\u00c9LVICO Y RESOLVER TRASTORNOS ALIMENTARIOS COMPLEJOS VINCULADOS A LA DISFUNCI\\u00d3N REPRODUCTIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF UROGENITAL WARTS OR ABSCESSES ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE UTERUS \\/ RECTUM (REF 848) RESONANCE FOR HPV. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE INFERTILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ KIDNEY - L (REF 846) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE PELVIC NERVE PLEXUS DURING THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY VERRUGAS UROGENITALES O ABSCESOS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [\\u00daTERO \\/ RECTO] (REF 848) PARA VPH. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFERTILIDAD SEVERA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - I] (REF 846). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL PLEXO NERVIOSO P\\u00c9LVICO DURANTE EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/850','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:22:19','2026-04-29 00:22:19'),(4626,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',851,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"VOMITING, INFERTILITY. (V\\u00d3MITO, INFERTILIDAD)\",\"paths\":\"FALSE PREGNANCY DUE FROM PARASITE. ANOREXIA OR BULIMIA. (FALSO EMBARAZO DEBIDO A PAR\\u00c1SITO. ANOREXIA O BULIMIA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"FALSE PREGNANCY (FALSO EMBARAZO)\",\"symptoms\":\"VOMITING, INFERTILITY, AND PSYCHOSOMATIC GESTATION SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(V\\u00d3MITO, INFERTILIDAD Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DE GESTACI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PHENOMENON OF \\\"FALSE PREGNANCY\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE UTERINE TISSUE ITSELF. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS IMBALANCE IS OFTEN TRIGGERED BY THE PRESENCE OF PARASITES THAT ALTER THE ENERGETIC AND HORMONAL ENVIRONMENT, LEADING THE BODY TO MIMIC GESTATIONAL SYMPTOMS SUCH AS VOMITING OR ABDOMINAL DISTENSION. ADDITIONALLY, THIS PAIR IS CRITICAL IN CASES OF EATING DISORDERS, SPECIFICALLY ANOREXIA AND BULIMIA, WHERE THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM BECOMES ENERGETICALLY DEPLETED OR DISTORTED. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CLEARING PARASITIC INTERFERENCE, RESOLVING PSYCHOSOMATIC PREGNANCY SYMPTOMS, AND RESTORING THE VITALITY NECESSARY TO OVERCOME INFERTILITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL FEN\\u00d3MENO DEL \\\"FALSO EMBARAZO\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL PROPIO TEJIDO UTERINO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE DESEQUILIBRIO A MENUDO ES DESENCADENADO POR LA PRESENCIA DE PAR\\u00c1SITOS QUE ALTERAN EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO Y HORMONAL, LLEVANDO AL CUERPO A IMITAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS GESTACIONALES COMO EL V\\u00d3MITO O LA DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL. ADEM\\u00c1S, ESTE PAR ES CR\\u00cdTICO EN CASOS DE TRASTORNOS ALIMENTARIOS, ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE ANOREXIA Y BULIMIA, DONDE EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR SE AGOTA ENERG\\u00c9TICAMENTE O SE DISTORSIONA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LA INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA, RESOLVIENDO LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DE EMBARAZO Y RESTAURANDO LA VITALIDAD NECESARIA PARA SUPERAR LA INFERTILIDAD.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF VOMITING AND EMOTIONAL DISTURBANCES ARE PERSISTENT, SCAN THE UTERUS \\/ SACRUM (REF 849) RESONANCE TO CLEAR THE PARASITIC RESERVOIR. FOR CASES INVOLVING TRUE GESTATION CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ OVARY (REF 847) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL SYSTEM DURING THE RESOLUTION OF PSYCHOSOMATIC TENSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL V\\u00d3MITO Y LOS TRASTORNOS EMOCIONALES SON PERSISTENTES, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [\\u00daTERO \\/ SACRO] (REF 849) PARA DEPURAR EL RESERVORIO PARASITARIO. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PREOCUPACIONES SOBRE UNA GESTACI\\u00d3N REAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ OVARIO] (REF 847). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR AL SISTEMA ADRENAL DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA TENSI\\u00d3N PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/851','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:23:29','2026-04-29 00:23:29'),(4627,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',852,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VIRUS\",\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC CARRIER STATE, POTENTIAL FOR RECURRING REPRODUCTIVE INFECTIONS, AND HIDDEN VIRAL LOAD.\\n\\n(ESTADO DE PORTADOR ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO, POTENCIAL DE INFECCIONES REPRODUCTIVAS RECURRENTES Y CARGA VIRAL OCULTA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES A SPECIFIC STORAGE POINT FOR VIRUSES WITHIN THE UTERINE TISSUE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS DIRECTLY ON THE ORGAN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, A LOCALIZED RESERVOIR IN THE UTERUS INDICATES THAT VIRAL PATHOGENS MAY REMAIN DORMANT OR \\\"HIDDEN\\\" FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM, OFTEN PROTECTED BY THE UNIQUE BIOCHEMICAL ENVIRONMENT OF THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT. WHILE THE INDIVIDUAL MAY NOT EXHIBIT ACTIVE SYMPTOMS AT THE TIME OF THE SCAN, THIS POINT CAN ACT AS A SOURCE FOR PERIODIC OUTBREAKS OR CHRONIC IMBALANCES THAT AFFECT FERTILITY AND MUCOSAL HEALTH. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXPOSING THESE HIDDEN VIRUSES, ALLOWING FOR A COMPLETE SYSTEMIC DEPURATION AND PREVENTING THE RE-COLONIZATION OF THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA UN PUNTO DE ALMACENAMIENTO ESPEC\\u00cdFICO PARA VIRUS DENTRO DEL TEJIDO UTERINO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DIRECTAMENTE EN EL \\u00d3RGANO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, UN RESERVORIO LOCALIZADO EN EL \\u00daTERO INDICA QUE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS VIRALES PUEDEN PERMANECER LATENTES U \\\"OCULTOS\\\" AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO, A MENUDO PROTEGIDOS POR EL ENTORNO BIOQU\\u00cdMICO \\u00daNICO DEL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO. AUNQUE EL INDIVIDUO PUEDE NO PRESENTAR S\\u00cdNTOMAS ACTIVOS EN EL MOMENTO DEL ESCANEO, ESTE PUNTO PUEDE ACTUAR COMO UNA FUENTE DE BROTES PERI\\u00d3DICOS O DESEQUILIBRIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS QUE AFECTAN LA FERTILIDAD Y LA SALUD DE LAS MUCOSAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EXPONER ESTOS VIRUS OCULTOS, PERMITIENDO UNA DEPURACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA COMPLETA Y PREVINIENDO LA RECOLONIZACI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF UROGENITAL WARTS OR ABSCESSES ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE UTERUS \\/ RECTUM (REF 848) RESONANCE FOR HPV. FOR CASES INVOLVING PSYCHOSOMATIC GESTATION SYMPTOMS OR PARASITIC INTERFERENCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ UTERUS (REF 850) SPECIAL PAIR. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE REPRODUCTIVE ENVIRONMENT DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY VERRUGAS UROGENITALES O ABSCESOS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [\\u00daTERO \\/ RECTO] (REF 848) PARA VPH. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DE GESTACI\\u00d3N O INTERFERENCIA PARASITARIA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL PAR ESPECIAL [\\u00daTERO \\/ \\u00daTERO] (REF 850). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL ENTORNO REPRODUCTIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/852','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:24:30','2026-04-29 00:24:30'),(4628,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',853,'{\"symptoms\":\"ECZEMA, ALLERGIES, INFERTILITY IN WOMEN, THIS ORDERS IN THE UTERUS AND KIDNEYS, CONSTRICTION OF BLOOD VESSELS AND URETERS, RENAL COLIC, NEPHRITIS, KIDNEY FAILURE, CYSTITIS, VAGINITIS, URETHRITIS, SALPINGITIS, OVARIAN CYST, DIGESTION PROBLEMS, AND LOWER BACK PAIN. (ECCEMA, ALERGIAS, INFERTILIDAD EN MUJERES, ESTO AFECTA EL \\u00daTERO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N DE LOS VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS Y UR\\u00c9TERES, C\\u00d3LICO RENAL, NEFRITIS, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, CISTITIS, VAGINITIS, URETRITIS, SALPINGITIS, QUISTE OV\\u00c1RICO, PROBLEMAS DE DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"CHICKENPOX. THE SECOND LEADING CAUSE OF INFERTILITY IN WOMEN. MAY CAUSE PROBLEMS WITH PREGNANCY AND POSTPARTUM. FALSE DIABETES, PSORIASIS, HERPES. (ECCEMA, ALERGIAS, INFERTILIDAD EN MUJERES, ESTO AFECTA EL \\u00daTERO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N DE LOS VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS Y UR\\u00c9TERES, C\\u00d3LICO RENAL, NEFRITIS, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, CISTITIS, VAGINITIS, URETRITIS, SALPINGITIS, QUISTE OV\\u00c1RICO, PROBLEMAS DE DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ECZEMA, ALLERGIES, INFERTILITY IN WOMEN, DISORDERS IN THE UTERUS AND KIDNEYS, CONSTRICTION OF BLOOD VESSELS AND URETERS, RENAL COLIC, NEPHRITIS, KIDNEY FAILURE, CYSTITIS, VAGINITIS, URETHRITIS, SALPINGITIS, OVARIAN CYSTS, DIGESTION PROBLEMS, AND LOWER BACK PAIN.(ECCEMA, ALERGIAS, INFERTILIDAD EN MUJERES, TRASTORNOS EN EL \\u00daTERO Y LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N DE LOS VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS Y UR\\u00c9TERES, C\\u00d3LICO RENAL, NEFRITIS, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, CISTITIS, VAGINITIS, URETRITIS, SALPINGITIS, QUISTE OV\\u00c1RICO, PROBLEMAS DE DIGESTI\\u00d3N Y DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE VARICELLA-ZOSTER VIRUS (CHICKENPOX) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE URETERS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS RECOGNIZED AS THE SECOND LEADING CAUSE OF INFERTILITY IN WOMEN, AS THE VIRAL ACTIVITY CAN CAUSE SIGNIFICANT CONSTRICTION OF THE URETERS AND SURROUNDING BLOOD VESSELS, ALTERING THE ENERGETIC AND PHYSICAL HEALTH OF THE UTERUS AND OVARIES. THE IMPACT OF THIS VIRUS OFTEN EXTENDS TO THE KIDNEYS, LEADING TO NEPHRITIS OR RENAL COLIC, AND MAY MANIFEST SYSTEMICALLY AS SEVERE ECZEMA, ALLERGIES, OR \\\"FALSE DIABETES.\\\" BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, RESOLVING UROGENITAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING FERTILITY AND RENAL FUNCTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA VARICELA-Z\\u00d3STER (VARICELA) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LOS UR\\u00c9TERES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES RECONOCIDO COMO LA SEGUNDA CAUSA PRINCIPAL DE INFERTILIDAD EN LAS MUJERES, YA QUE LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL PUEDE CAUSAR UNA CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA DE LOS UR\\u00c9TERES Y LOS VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS CIRCUNDANTES, ALTERANDO LA SALUD ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y F\\u00cdSICA DEL \\u00daTERO Y LOS OVARIOS. EL IMPACTO DE ESTE VIRUS A MENUDO SE EXTIENDE A LOS RI\\u00d1\\u00d3NES, PROVOCANDO NEFRITIS O C\\u00d3LICO RENAL, Y PUEDE MANIFESTARSE SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE COMO ECCEMA SEVERO, ALERGIAS O \\\"FALSA DIABETES\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, RESOLVIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL Y RESTAURANDO LA FERTILIDAD Y LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SKIN LESIONS OR NERVOUS TENSION PERSIST, SCAN THE ULNA \\/ ULNA (REF 832) RESONANCE FOR HERPES 3. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE RENAL LITHIASIS OR MENSTRUAL COLIC, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE URETER \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE (REF 835) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE CLEARANCE OF VIRAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LAS LESIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O LA TENSI\\u00d3N NERVIOSA PERSISTEN, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00daBITO \\/ C\\u00daBITO] (REF 832) PARA HERPES 3. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN LITIASIS RENAL AGUDA O C\\u00d3LICO MENSTRUAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [UR\\u00c9TER \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - OPUESTO] (REF 835). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/853','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:34:12','2026-04-29 00:34:12'),(4629,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',854,'{\"radical\":null,\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"radical\":\"SPECIAL (ESPECIAL)\",\"origins\":\"TOXICITY (TOXICIDAD)\",\"symptoms\":\"ADVERSE EFFECTS FROM VACCINES, SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AND IMMUNE DISRUPTION.\\n\\n(EFECTOS ADVERSOS DE LAS VACUNAS, INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y ALTERACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE TOXICITY AND SECONDARY EFFECTS POTENTIALLY TRIGGERED BY VACCINATIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VACCINATION SITE (VACCINE) AND THE INDEX FINGER ON THE SAME SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO \\\"CLEANSE\\\" THE ENERGETIC RESIDUE OR CHEMICAL ADJUVANTS THAT MAY CAUSE THE IMMUNE SYSTEM TO REMAIN IN A STATE OF HYPER-REACTIVITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN PROCESSING METALS OR OTHER SUBSTANCES, REDUCING LOCALIZED OR SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AND RESTORING THE NATURAL VIGILANCE OF THE IMMUNE SYSTEM WITHOUT THE INTERFERENCE OF VACCINE-RELATED STRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA TOXICIDAD Y LOS EFECTOS SECUNDARIOS POTENCIALMENTE DESENCADENADOS POR LAS VACUNACIONES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL SITIO DE VACUNACI\\u00d3N (VACUNA) Y EL DEDO \\u00cdNDICE DEL MISMO LADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA \\\"DEPURAR\\\" LOS RESIDUOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS O ADYUVANTES QU\\u00cdMICOS QUE PUEDEN PROVOCAR QUE EL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO PERMANEZCA EN UN ESTADO DE HIPERREACTIVIDAD. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A PROCESAR METALES U OTRAS SUSTANCIAS, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA O SIST\\u00c9MICA Y RESTAURANDO LA VIGILANCIA NATURAL DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO SIN LA INTERFERENCIA DEL ESTR\\u00c9S RELACIONADO CON LAS VACUNAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC TOXICITY IS ACCOMPANIED BY KIDNEY DYSFUNCTION, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO FACILITATE FILTRATION. FOR CASES INVOLVING NERVOUS SYSTEM TENSION POST-VACCINATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [BILE DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (R)] OR [PANCREATIC DUCT \\/ KIDNEY (L)] POINTS TO ENSURE THE DEPURATIVE PATHWAYS ARE OPEN AND FUNCTIONING DURING TOXIN ELIMINATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL, ESCANEE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA FACILITAR LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TENSI\\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO POST-VACUNACI\\u00d3N, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE LOS PUNTOS [CONDUCTO BILIAR \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (D)] O [CONDUCTO PANCRE\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (I)] PARA ASEGURAR QUE LAS V\\u00cdAS DEPURATIVAS EST\\u00c9N ABIERTAS Y FUNCIONANDO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/854','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:35:45','2026-04-29 00:35:45'),(4630,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',855,'{\"origins\":\"ESCHERICHIA COLI\",\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, INFECTIONS OF THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM, SEPSIS, WEIGHT LOSS. (DIARREA, INFECCIONES DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL, SEPSIS, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L OR M. INTESTINAL INFECTIONS, PNEUMONIA. MASTITIS. (HEPATITIS L O M. INFECCIONES INTESTINALES, NEUMON\\u00cdA. MASTITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ESCHERICHIA COLI (E. COLI)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, UROGENITAL SYSTEM INFECTIONS, SEPSIS, AND UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT LOSS.\\n\\n(DIARREA, INFECCIONES DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL, SEPSIS Y P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO INEXPLICABLE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS ESCHERICHIA COLI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VAGINA AND THE LEFT KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS E. COLI CAN MIGRATE FROM THE DIGESTIVE TRACT TO THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM, CAUSING PERSISTENT INFECTIONS. THE PATHOGEN\'S PRESENCE IN THIS CIRCUIT IS OFTEN LINKED TO COMPLICATIONS SUCH AS HEPATITIS (TYPES L OR M), INTESTINAL DISTURBANCES, AND EVEN PNEUMONIA OR MASTITIS. IF THE INFECTION BECOMES SYSTEMIC, IT MAY LEAD TO SEPSIS OR SIGNIFICANT WEIGHT LOSS DUE TO THE METABOLIC DRAIN. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING RENAL FILTRATION, AND RESTORING THE HEALTHY FLORA OF THE VAGINAL TRACT.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA ESCHERICHIA COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VAGINA Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N IZQUIERDO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE LA E. COLI PUEDE MIGRAR DEL TRACTO DIGESTIVO AL SISTEMA UROGENITAL, CAUSANDO INFECCIONES PERSISTENTES. LA PRESENCIA DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO EN ESTE CIRCUITO A MENUDO SE VINCULA CON COMPLICACIONES COMO HEPATITIS (TIPOS L O M), TRASTORNOS INTESTINALES E INCLUSO NEUMON\\u00cdA O MASTITIS. SI LA INFECCI\\u00d3N SE VUELVE SIST\\u00c9MICA, PUEDE PROVOCAR SEPSIS O UNA P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO SIGNIFICATIVA DEBIDO AL DESGASTE METAB\\u00d3LICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y RESTAURANDO LA FLORA SALUDABLE DEL TRACTO VAGINAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF UROGENITAL INFECTIONS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY VAGINAL DISCHARGE AND HEADACHES, SCAN THE UTERUS \\/ ATLAS (REF 844) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE INFERTILITY OR HORMONAL DISRUPTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ KIDNEY - L (REF 846) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LAS INFECCIONES UROGENITALES SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE FLUJO VAGINAL Y DOLORES DE CABEZA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [\\u00daTERO \\/ ATLAS] (REF 844). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFERTILIDAD SEVERA O ALTERACI\\u00d3N HORMONAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - I] (REF 846). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/855','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:37:03','2026-04-29 00:37:03'),(4631,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',856,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"CYST (QUISTE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"PELVIC DYSFUNCTION (DISFUNCI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA)\",\"symptoms\":\"CYSTS (QUISTES), PELVIC PAIN, HORMONAL IMBALANCE, AND DISCOMFORT IN THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT.\\n\\n(QUISTES, DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO, DESEQUILIBRIO HORMONAL Y MALESTAR EN EL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE FORMATION OF CYSTS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VAGINA AND THE OVARY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE ENERGETIC ENVIRONMENT OF THE FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM, PREVENTING THE ACCUMULATION OF FLUID OR TISSUE THAT LEADS TO CYSTIC GROWTHS. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS DISRUPTED, THE RESULTING IMBALANCE CAN INTERFERE WITH NORMAL OVARIAN FUNCTION AND CAUSE LOCALIZED PELVIC DISCOMFORT. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION, SUPPORTING THE NATURAL DISSOLUTION OF CYSTS, AND RESTORING HARMONY TO THE UROGENITAL AXIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE QUISTES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VAGINA Y EL OVARIO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR EL ENTORNO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DEL SISTEMA REPRODUCTOR FEMENINO, PREVINIENDO LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDO O TEJIDO QUE CONDUCE A CRECIMIENTOS QU\\u00cdSTICOS. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO SE ALTERA, EL DESEQUILIBRIO RESULTANTE PUEDE INTERFERIR CON LA FUNCI\\u00d3N OV\\u00c1RICA NORMAL Y CAUSAR MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO LOCALIZADO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N, APOYANDO LA DISOLUCI\\u00d3N NATURAL DE LOS QUISTES Y RESTAURANDO LA ARMON\\u00cdA EN EL EJE UROGENITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF PELVIC DISORDERS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY DIARRHEA OR UNEXPLAINED WEIGHT LOSS, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ KIDNEY - L (REF 854) RESONANCE FOR E. COLI. FOR CASES INVOLVING TRUE GESTATION CONCERNS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ OVARY (REF 847) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF METABOLIC BYPRODUCTS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE DIARREA O P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO INEXPLICABLE, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - I] (REF 854) PARA E. COLI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PREOCUPACIONES SOBRE UNA GESTACI\\u00d3N REAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ OVARIO] (REF 847). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/856','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:38:33','2026-04-29 00:38:33'),(4632,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',857,'{\"symptoms\":\"WARTS AND OPEN LESIONS. (VERRUGAS Y LESIONES ABIERTAS)\",\"paths\":\"TRUE HPV. TUMORS, CANCER. (VPH VERDADERO. TUMORES, C\\u00c1NCER.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"WARTS AND OPEN LESIONS.\\n\\n(VERRUGAS Y LESIONES ABIERTAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE \\\"TRUE\\\" HUMAN PAPILLOMA VIRUS (HPV) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VAGINA AND THE RECTUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CONSIDERED HIGH-PRIORITY DUE TO ITS ASSOCIATION WITH THE DEVELOPMENT OF TUMORS AND NEOPLASMS IN THE REPRODUCTIVE AND ANAL TRACTS. THE VIRAL ACTIVITY CAUSES TISSUE ALTERATIONS THAT CAN MANIFEST AS EXTERNAL WARTS OR INTERNAL OPEN LESIONS, WHICH, IF LEFT UNCHECKED, MAY PROGRESS TOWARD MALIGNANCY OR CANCER. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL REPLICATION, PROTECTING THE INTEGRITY OF THE MUCOSAL TISSUES, AND PREVENTING THE GROWTH OF ABNORMAL CELLULAR FORMATIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL PAPILOMA HUMANO (VPH) \\\"VERDADERO\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VAGINA Y EL RECTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE CONSIDERA DE ALTA PRIORIDAD DEBIDO A SU ASOCIACI\\u00d3N CON EL DESARROLLO DE TUMORES Y NEOPLASIAS EN LOS TRACTOS REPRODUCTIVO Y ANAL. LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL PROVOCA ALTERACIONES TISULARES QUE PUEDEN MANIFESTARSE COMO VERRUGAS EXTERNAS O LESIONES ABIERTAS INTERNAS, QUE, SI NO SE TRATAN, PUEDEN PROGRESAR HACIA LA MALIGNIDAD O EL C\\u00c1NCER. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA REPLICACI\\u00d3N VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD DE LOS TEJIDOS MUCOSOS Y PREVINIENDO EL CRECIMIENTO DE FORMACIONES CELULARES ANORMALES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF UROGENITAL ABSCESSES OR FOOD INTOLERANCES ARE PRESENT ALONGSIDE WARTS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE UTERUS \\/ RECTUM (REF 848) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PELVIC PAIN OR CYSTS, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ OVARY (REF 855) SPECIAL PAIR. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY ABSCESOS UROGENITALES O INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS JUNTO CON VERRUGAS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [\\u00daTERO \\/ RECTO] (REF 848). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR P\\u00c9LVICO SEVERO O QUISTES, ESCANEE EL PAR ESPECIAL [VAGINA \\/ OVARIO] (REF 855). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/857','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:39:47','2026-04-29 00:39:47'),(4633,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',858,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"VAGINITIS, THROAT IRRITATION, PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND POTENTIAL SKIN OR MUCOSAL INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(VAGINITIS, IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE GARGANTA, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO Y POSIBLES INFECCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS O DE LAS MUCOSAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VAGINA AND THE THROAT. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS A SIGNIFICANT CROSS-SYSTEM IMBALANCE WHERE THE PATHOGEN IMPACTS BOTH THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT AND THE UPPER RESPIRATORY\\/THROAT REGION. STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS IS KNOWN FOR ITS ABILITY TO CAUSE LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION AND SUPPURATIVE (PUS-FORMING) INFECTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, CLEARING VAGINAL IRRITATION, AND RESOLVING PERSISTENT THROAT DISCOMFORT LINKED TO SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL SPREAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA ABORDA EL STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS COAGULASA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VAGINA Y LA GARGANTA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA UN DESEQUILIBRIO INTERSIST\\u00c9MICO SIGNIFICATIVO DONDE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO IMPACTA TANTO EL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO COMO LA REGI\\u00d3N DE LA GARGANTA Y LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES. EL STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS ES CONOCIDO POR SU CAPACIDAD PARA CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA E INFECCIONES SUPURATIVAS (FORMACI\\u00d3N DE PUS). AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ELIMINANDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N VAGINAL Y RESOLVIENDO EL MALESTAR PERSISTENTE DE GARGANTA VINCULADO A LA DISPERSI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF VAGINAL IRRITATION IS ACCOMPANIED BY WARTS OR LESIONS, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ RECTUM (REF 856) RESONANCE FOR HPV. FOR CASES INVOLVING DIARRHEA OR RENAL IMPACT, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGINA \\/ KIDNEY - L (REF 854) AXIS (E. COLI). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE MUCOSAL LININGS DURING BACTERIAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N VAGINAL SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE VERRUGAS O LESIONES, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ RECTO] (REF 856) PARA VPH. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DIARREA O IMPACTO RENAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - I] (REF 854) (E. COLI). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LOS REVESTIMIENTOS MUCOSOS DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/858','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:40:51','2026-04-29 00:40:51'),(4634,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',859,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING (SANGRADO VAGINAL)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"VAGINAL BLEEDING (SANGRADO VAGINAL)\",\"symptoms\":\"ABNORMAL VAGINAL BLEEDING, METRORRHAGIA, PELVIC DISCOMFORT, AND IRREGULAR MENSTRUAL FLOW.\\n\\n(SANGRADO VAGINAL ANORMAL, METRORRAGIA, MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO Y FLUJO MENSTRUAL IRREGULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES NON-GESTATIONAL VAGINAL BLEEDING BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VAGINA AND THE UTERUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO REGULATE THE VASCULAR AND MUCOSAL INTEGRITY OF THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT. A DISRUPTION IN THIS CIRCUIT CAN LEAD TO SPOTTING OR HEAVY BLEEDING OUTSIDE OF THE NORMAL CYCLE, OFTEN LINKED TO LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION OR ENERGETIC IMBALANCES WITHIN THE UTERINE WALLS. BY STABILIZING THIS RESONANCE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CURBING ABNORMAL HEMORRHAGE, BALANCING THE TISSUE RESPONSE, AND RESTORING THE NATURAL CALM OF THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL SANGRADO VAGINAL NO GESTACIONAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA VAGINA Y EL \\u00daTERO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA REGULAR LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR Y MUCOSA DEL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO. UNA ALTERACI\\u00d3N EN ESTE CIRCUITO PUEDE PROVOCAR MANCHADO O SANGRADO INTENSO FUERA DEL CICLO NORMAL, A MENUDO VINCULADO A INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA O DESEQUILIBRIOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS EN LAS PAREDES UTERINAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A FRENAR LA HEMORRAGIA ANORMAL, EQUILIBRAR LA RESPUESTA TISULAR Y RESTAURAR LA CALMA NATURAL DEL SISTEMA UROGENITAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF BLEEDING IS ACCOMPANIED BY WARTS OR LESIONS, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ RECTUM (REF 856) RESONANCE FOR HPV. FOR CASES INVOLVING VAGINAL DISCHARGE AND THROAT IRRITATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGINA \\/ THROAT (REF 857) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT DURING THE REGULATION OF BLOOD FLOW.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL SANGRADO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE VERRUGAS O LESIONES, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ RECTO] (REF 856) PARA VPH. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FLUJO VAGINAL E IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE GARGANTA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ GARGANTA] (REF 857). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO DURANTE LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DEL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/859','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:41:59','2026-04-29 00:41:59'),(4635,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',860,'{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, LARYNGEAL COUGH, BRONCHITIS, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, VAGINITIS, PELVIS DISORDERS, LOW BACK PAIN. (TOS, TOS LAR\\u00cdNGEA, BRONQUITIS, SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL, VAGINITIS, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY BODY FLUIDS, RODENTS, DOGS AND FLEAS. (TRANSMITIDO POR FLUIDOS CORPORALES, ROEDORES, PERROS Y PULGAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - SPLEEN       CHECK - TESTICLE (REVISAR - BAZO       REVISAR - TEST\\u00cdCULO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, LARYNGEAL COUGH, BRONCHITIS, VAGINAL DISCHARGE, VAGINITIS, PELVIC DISORDERS, AND LOWER BACK PAIN.\\n\\n(TOS, TOS LAR\\u00cdNGEA, BRONQUITIS, SECRECI\\u00d3N VAGINAL, VAGINITIS, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, DOLOR LUMBAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS YERSINIA PESTIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE VAGINAL TISSUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS RECOGNIZED FOR ITS ABILITY TO MIGRATE SYSTEMICALLY, OFTEN MANIFESTING AS RESPIRATORY ISSUES SUCH AS PERSISTENT LARYNGEAL COUGH OR BRONCHITIS, DESPITE ITS PRIMARY RESONANCE POINT IN THE REPRODUCTIVE TRACT. LOCALLY, IT CAUSES SIGNIFICANT VAGINAL IRRITATION, DISCHARGE, AND PELVIC DISCOMFORT THAT MAY RADIATE TO THE LOWER BACK. THE BACTERIA IS TRADITIONALLY ASSOCIATED WITH TRANSMISSION VIA RODENTS, FLEAS, OR CONTACT WITH DOMESTIC ANIMALS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, RESOLVING BOTH THE UROGENITAL INFLAMMATION AND THE SECONDARY RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA YERSINIA PESTIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL TEJIDO VAGINAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES RECONOCIDO POR SU CAPACIDAD PARA MIGRAR SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO COMO PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS COMO TOS LAR\\u00cdNGEA PERSISTENTE O BRONQUITIS, A PESAR DE QUE SU PUNTO DE RESONANCIA PRIMARIO EST\\u00c1 EN EL TRACTO REPRODUCTIVO. LOCALMENTE, CAUSA IRRITACI\\u00d3N VAGINAL SIGNIFICATIVA, FLUJO Y MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO QUE PUEDE IRRADIARSE HACIA LA PARTE BAJA DE LA ESPALDA. LA BACTERIA SE ASOCIA TRADICIONALMENTE CON LA TRANSMISI\\u00d3N A TRAV\\u00c9S DE ROEDORES, PULGAS O EL CONTACTO CON ANIMALES DOM\\u00c9STICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, RESOLVIENDO TANTO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N UROGENITAL COMO LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS SECUNDARIOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST WITH ABDOMINAL DISTENSION, CHECK THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] RESONANCE. FOR MALE CLIENTS PRESENTING WITH SIMILAR PATHOGENIC MARKERS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [TESTICLE \\/ TESTICLE] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE ELIMINATION OF YERSINIA PESTIS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS BACTERIANOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS PERSISTEN CON DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, REVISE LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ BAZO]. PARA CLIENTES MASCULINOS QUE PRESENTEN MARCADORES PAT\\u00d3GENOS SIMILARES, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [TEST\\u00cdCULO \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE YERSINIA PESTIS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/860','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:42:58','2026-04-29 00:42:58'),(4636,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',861,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC CARRIER STATE, POTENTIAL FOR RECURRING VIRAL OUTBREAKS, AND LATENT REPRODUCTIVE IMBALANCES.\\n\\n(ESTADO DE PORTADOR ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO, POTENCIAL DE BROTES VIRALES RECURRENTES Y DESEQUILIBRIOS REPRODUCTIVOS LATENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE IDENTIFIES A SPECIFIC VIRAL STORAGE POINT LOCATED ON THE LATERAL WALLS OF THE VAGINAL TRACT BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE VAGINA-SIDE POSITION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR DETECTING VIRUSES THAT HAVE \\\"HIDDEN\\\" FROM THE IMMUNE SYSTEM BY LODGING WITHIN THE MUCOSAL FOLDS OR SIDES OF THE ORGAN. WHILE IT MAY NOT PRODUCE ACTIVE SYMPTOMS AT THE TIME OF THE SCAN, THIS RESERVOIR CAN SERVE AS A PERPETUAL SOURCE FOR RE-INFECTION OR THE SUDDEN REAPPEARANCE OF VIRAL PATHOGENS IN THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXPOSING THESE LATENT VIRAL LOADS, FACILITATING A COMPLETE DEPURATIVE ACTION AND ENSURING THE LONG-TERM STABILITY OF THE REPRODUCTIVE MICROBIOME.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO IDENTIFICA UN PUNTO DE ALMACENAMIENTO VIRAL ESPEC\\u00cdFICO SITUADO EN LAS PAREDES LATERALES DEL TRACTO VAGINAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA POSICI\\u00d3N DE LA VAGINA-LADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA DETECTAR VIRUS QUE SE HAN \\\"OCULTADO\\\" DEL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO AL ALOJARSE DENTRO DE LOS PLIEGUES MUCOSOS O LOS LADOS DEL \\u00d3RGANO. AUNQUE PUEDE NO PRODUCIR S\\u00cdNTOMAS ACTIVOS EN EL MOMENTO DEL ESCANEO, ESTE RESERVORIO PUEDE SERVIR COMO UNA FUENTE PERPETUA DE REINFECCI\\u00d3N O LA REAPARICI\\u00d3N REPENTINA DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS VIRALES EN EL SISTEMA UROGENITAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EXPONER ESTAS CARGAS VIRALES LATENTES, FACILITANDO UNA ACCI\\u00d3N DEPURATIVA COMPLETA Y ASEGURANDO LA ESTABILIDAD A LARGO PLAZO DEL MICROBIOMA REPRODUCTIVO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF ACTIVE BACTERIAL SYMPTOMS SUCH AS COUGH OR DISCHARGE ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ VAGINA (REF 859) RESONANCE FOR YERSINIA PESTIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING WARTS OR TUMORAL RISKS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGINA \\/ RECTUM (REF 856) AXIS (HPV). ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS BACTERIANOS ACTIVOS COMO TOS O FLUJO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] (REF 859) PARA YERSINIA PESTIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN VERRUGAS O RIESGOS TUMORALES, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ RECTO] (REF 856) (VPH). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/861','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:43:58','2026-04-29 00:43:58'),(4637,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',862,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MENTAL RETARDATION, AUTISM, CEREBRAL PALSY, DOWN SYNDROME, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS. (RETRASO MENTAL, AUTISMO, PAR\\u00c1LISIS CEREBRAL, S\\u00cdNDROME DE DOWN, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"MENTAL RETARDATION, AUTISM, CEREBRAL PALSY, DOWN SYNDROME, AND MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS.\\n\\n(RETRASO MENTAL, AUTISMO, PAR\\u00c1LISIS CEREBRAL, S\\u00cdNDROME DE DOWN, ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR RESONANCE IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING COMPLEX NEUROLOGICAL AND DEVELOPMENTAL CONDITIONS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VAGUS NERVE AND THE KIDNEY ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE VAGUS NERVE SERVES AS THE MAIN HIGHWAY FOR THE PARASYMPATHETIC NERVOUS SYSTEM, REGULATING INVOLUNTARY FUNCTIONS AND EMOTIONAL STATES. WHEN THIS AXIS IS DISRUPTED BY LATENT PATHOGENS OR ENERGETIC \\\"LEAKS\\\" TOWARD THE RENAL SYSTEM, IT CAN AGGRAVATE SYSTEMIC DISORDERS SUCH AS AUTISM, MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS, OR CEREBRAL PALSY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CLEARING DEEP-SEATED RESERVOIRS, SUPPORTING NEUROLOGICAL HARMONY AND IMPROVING THE ENERGETIC COMMUNICATION NECESSARY FOR MANAGING CHRONIC DEGENERATIVE CONDITIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA ABORDAR CONDICIONES NEUROL\\u00d3GICAS Y DEL DESARROLLO COMPLEJAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL NERVIO VAGO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL LADO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL NERVIO VAGO SIRVE COMO LA V\\u00cdA PRINCIPAL DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO, REGULANDO LAS FUNCIONES INVOLUNTARIAS Y LOS ESTADOS EMOCIONALES. CUANDO ESTE EJE SE ALTERA POR PAT\\u00d3GENOS LATENTES O \\\"FUGAS\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICAS HACIA EL SISTEMA RENAL, PUEDE AGRAVAR TRASTORNOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS COMO EL AUTISMO, LA ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE O LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS CEREBRAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A DEPURAR RESERVORIOS PROFUNDOS, APOYANDO LA ARMON\\u00cdA NEUROL\\u00d3GICA Y MEJORANDO LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA NECESARIA PARA MANEJAR CONDICIONES DEGENERATIVAS CR\\u00d3NICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE RENAL DYSFUNCTION, SCAN THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY OR DIGESTIVE ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] POINT TO ENSURE CRANIAL-SACRAL ALIGNMENT AND SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE TREATMENT OF DEVELOPMENTAL DISORDERS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL SEVERA, ESCANEE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL O PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL PUNTO [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] PARA ASEGURAR EL ALINEAMIENTO CR\\u00c1NEO-SACRAL Y LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE EL TRATAMIENTO DE TRASTORNOS DEL DESARROLLO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/862','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:45:02','2026-04-29 00:45:02'),(4638,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',863,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"NEUROLOGICAL AND DEVELOPMENTAL SYMPTOMS, POTENTIALLY INCLUDING AUTISM, CEREBRAL PALSY, AND EMOTIONAL DISRUPTION.\\n\\n(S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS Y DE DESARROLLO, INCLUYENDO POTENCIALMENTE EL AUTISME, LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS CEREBRAL Y ALTERACIONES EMOCIONALES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR IDENTIFIES A CRITICAL STORAGE POINT FOR PATHOGENS AFFECTING THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE VAGUS NERVE AND THE SUPRARENAL GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE VAGUS NERVE IS THE AXIS OF THE RELAXATION RESPONSE AND VISCERAL CONTROL, WHILE THE SUPRARENALS MANAGE THE STRESS RESPONSE AND ADRENALINE. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT BECOMES A RESERVOIR, AN ENERGETIC \\\"LEAK\\\" OR LATENT LOAD MAY BE OBSERVED, COMPLICATING THE TREATMENT OF CONDITIONS SUCH AS AUTISM OR EMOTIONAL DYSFUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RELEASING HIDDEN PATHOGENS AND RESTORING COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE BRAIN AND THE ENDOCRINE GLANDS, IMPROVING SYSTEMIC REGULATION CAPACITY.\\n\\n(ESTE RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL IDENTIFICA UN PUNTO CR\\u00cdTICO DE ALMACENAMIENTO DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS QUE AFECTAN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL NERVIO VAGO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL NERVIO VAGO ES EL EJE DE LA RESPUESTA DE RELAJACI\\u00d3N Y CONTROL VISCERAL, MIENTRAS QUE LAS SUPRARRENALES GESTIONAN LA RESPUESTA AL ESTR\\u00c9S Y LA ADRENALINA. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO SE CONVIERTE EN UN RESERVORIO, SE PUEDE OBSERVAR UNA \\\"FUGA\\\" ENERG\\u00c9TICA O UNA CARGA LATENTE QUE COMPLICA EL TRATAMIENTO DE CONDICIONES COMO EL AUTISMO O LA DISFUNCIONALIDAD EMOCIONAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A LIBERAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS OCULTOS Y A RESTAURAR LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ENTRE EL CEREBRO Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS ENDOCRINAS, MEJORANDO LA CAPACIDAD DE REGULACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SEVERE DEVELOPMENTAL DISORDERS OR MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE SIDE (REF 861) RESONANCE. FOR CASES OF ACUTE EMOTIONAL INSTABILITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] POINT TO ENSURE CRANIAL-SACRAL ALIGNMENT AND SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE CLEARANCE OF THE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI SE PRESENTAN TRASTORNOS DEL DESARROLLO SEVEROS O ESCLEROSIS M\\u00daLTIPLE, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [NERVIO VAGO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N (LADO OPUESTO)] (REF 861). PARA CASOS DE INESTABILIDAD EMOCIONAL AGUDA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL PUNTO [ATLAS \\/ ATLAS] PARA ASEGURAR EL ALINEAMIENTO CR\\u00c1NEO-SACRAL Y LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DEL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/863','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:46:21','2026-04-29 00:46:21'),(4639,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',864,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - CAROTID\\/CAROTID                   CHECK - TEMPLE\\/TEMPLE CHECK - CORONARY\\/LUNG (REVISAR - CAR\\u00d3TIDA\\/CAR\\u00d3TIDA                   REVISAR - SIEN\\/SIEN REVISAR - CORONARIA\\/PULM\\u00d3N)\"}','{\"origins\":\"AUTONOMIC REGULATION (REGULACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3NOMA)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, TACHYCARDIA, DIZZINESS, AND ANXIETY.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, TAQUICARDIA, MAREOS Y ANSIEDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON BALANCING THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE VAGUS NERVE PATHWAY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS FUNDAMENTAL FOR ADDRESSING HYPERTENSION (HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE) AS THE VAGUS NERVE IS THE PRIMARY MEDIATOR OF THE PARASYMPATHETIC SYSTEM, WHICH ACTS TO CALM THE HEART RATE AND DILATE BLOOD VESSELS. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS OVERSTIMULATED OR IMBALANCED, THE BODY MAY REMAIN IN A STATE OF SYMPATHETIC DOMINANCE (FLIGHT OR FIGHT), LEADING TO CHRONIC ELEVATIONS IN BLOOD PRESSURE. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL RESONANCE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN LOWERING VASCULAR RESISTANCE, PROMOTING CARDIAC STABILITY, AND REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC TENSION ASSOCIATED WITH HYPERTENSION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN EQUILIBRAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LA V\\u00cdA DEL NERVIO VAGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES FUNDAMENTAL PARA ABORDAR LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA), YA QUE EL NERVIO VAGO ES EL MEDIADOR PRINCIPAL DEL SISTEMA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO, QUE ACT\\u00daA PARA CALMAR LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y DILATAR LOS VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO EST\\u00c1 SOBREESTIMULADO O DESEQUILIBRADO, EL CUERPO PUEDE PERMANECER EN UN ESTADO DE DOMINANCIA SIMP\\u00c1TICA (LUCHA O HUIDA), LO QUE CONDUCE A ELEVACIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A DISMINUIR LA RESISTENCIA VASCULAR, PROMOVIENDO LA ESTABILIDAD CARD\\u00cdACA Y REDUCIENDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA ASOCIADA CON LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION PERSISTS WITH PERSISTENT HEADACHES, SCAN THE [TEMPLE \\/ TEMPLE] RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING VASCULAR CONSTRICTION OR HEART PALPITATIONS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CAROTID \\/ CAROTID] OR [CORONARY \\/ LUNG] AXES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT RENAL FUNCTION, WHICH IS CRITICAL FOR LONG-TERM BLOOD PRESSURE REGULATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N PERSISTE CON DOLORES DE CABEZA PERSISTENTES, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [SIEN \\/ SIEN]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N VASCULAR O PALPITACIONES CARD\\u00cdACAS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LOS EJES [CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ CAR\\u00d3TIDA] O [CORONARIA \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL, QUE ES CR\\u00cdTICA PARA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL A LARGO PLAZO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/864','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:47:38','2026-04-29 00:47:38'),(4640,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',865,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTROPHY (HIPERTROFIA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HYPERTROPHY (HIPERTROFIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION, HOARSENESS, LOSS OF VOICE, AND TISSUE THICKENING.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N, RONQUERA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE LA VOZ Y ENGROSAMIENTO DEL TEJIDO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE PHYSICAL ALTERATION OF THE LARYNGEAL TISSUES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS DIRECTLY ON THE VOCAL CORDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS ESSENTIAL FOR TREATING HYPERTROPHY\\u2014THE ABNORMAL ENLARGEMENT OR THICKENING OF THE CORDS\\u2014WHICH OFTEN RESULTS FROM CHRONIC OVERUSE, IRRITATION, OR PERSISTENT INFLAMMATORY PROCESSES. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING SWELLING, RESTORING THE ELASTICITY OF THE VOCAL FOLDS, AND IMPROVING PHONATION. IT IS PARTICULARLY EFFECTIVE FOR INDIVIDUALS SUFFERING FROM PERSISTENT HOARSENESS OR THOSE RECOVERING FROM STRAIN-INDUCED LARYNGITIS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA ALTERACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA DE LOS TEJIDOS LAR\\u00cdNGEOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DIRECTAMENTE EN LAS CUERDAS VOCALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR ES ESENCIAL PARA TRATAR LA HIPERTROFIA \\u2014EL ENGROSAMIENTO O AGRANDAMIENTO ANORMAL DE LAS CUERDAS\\u2014 QUE A MENUDO RESULTA DEL USO EXCESIVO CR\\u00d3NICO, LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N O PROCESOS INFLAMATORIOS PERSISTENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA HINCHAZ\\u00d3N, RESTAURAR LA ELASTICIDAD DE LOS PLIEGUES VOCALES Y MEJORAR LA FONACI\\u00d3N. ES PARTICULARMENTE EFICAZ PARA PERSONAS QUE SUFREN DE RONQUERA PERSISTENTE O AQUELLAS QUE SE RECUPERAN DE UNA LARINGITIS POR ESFUERZO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HOARSENESS IS ACCOMPANIED BY A PERSISTENT BARKING COUGH, SCAN THE [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] (REF 859) OR [TESTICLE \\/ TESTICLE] RESONANCE FOR YERSINIA PESTIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE THROAT IRRITATION AND BACTERIAL LOAD, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGINA \\/ THROAT (REF 857) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING TISSUE REPAIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA RONQUERA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE UNA TOS PERRUNA PERSISTENTE, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] (REF 859) O [TEST\\u00cdCULO \\/ TEST\\u00cdCULO] PARA YERSINIA PESTIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITACI\\u00d3N DE GARGANTA SEVERA Y CARGA BACTERIANA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ GARGANTA] (REF 857). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA REPARACI\\u00d3N TISULAR.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/865','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:48:51','2026-04-29 00:48:51'),(4641,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',866,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"DIGESTIVE DISORDERS (TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"DIGESTIVE BALANCE (EQUILIBRIO DIGESTIVO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIGESTIVE DISORDERS, BLOATING, SLUGGISH METABOLISM, AND ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS DIGESTIVOS, DISTENSI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL, METABOLISMO LENTO Y MALESTAR ABDOMINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES GENERAL DIGESTIVE IMBALANCES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AROUND THE WAISTLINE AXIS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PAIR IS USED TO RESTORE THE PROPER ENERGETIC FLOW TO THE GASTROINTESTINAL SYSTEM, PARTICULARLY WHEN THE ORGANS ARE NOT OPERATING AT PEAK EFFICIENCY DUE TO METABOLIC SLUGGISHNESS OR SYSTEMIC STRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REGULATING DIGESTIVE PROCESSES, REDUCING ABDOMINAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESOLVING DISORDERS THAT LEAD TO GAS, BLOATING, OR IRREGULAR ELIMINATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DIGESTIVOS GENERALES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ALREDEDOR DEL EJE DE LA CINTURA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAR SE UTILIZA PARA RESTAURAR EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO ADECUADO AL SISTEMA GASTROINTESTINAL, PARTICULARMENTE CUANDO LOS \\u00d3RGANOS NO EST\\u00c1N OPERANDO A SU M\\u00c1XIMA EFICIENCIA DEBIDO A LA LENTITUD METAB\\u00d3LICA O EL ESTR\\u00c9S SIST\\u00c9MICO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REGULAR LOS PROCESOS DIGESTIVOS, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ABDOMINAL Y RESOLVIENDO TRASTORNOS QUE CONDUCEN A GASES, DISTENSI\\u00d3N O ELIMINACI\\u00d3N IRREGULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF DIGESTIVE ISSUES ARE ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE DIARRHEA OR RENAL IMPACT, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ KIDNEY - L (REF 854) RESONANCE FOR E. COLI. FOR CASES INVOLVING EMOTIONAL STRESS TIED TO DIGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE DEPURATIVE PATHWAYS DURING METABOLIC CORRECTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS PROBLEMAS DIGESTIVOS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE DIARREA SEVERA O IMPACTO RENAL, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - I] (REF 854) PARA E. COLI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S EMOCIONAL VINCULADO A LA DIGESTI\\u00d3N, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LAS V\\u00cdAS DEPURATIVAS DURANTE LA CORRECCI\\u00d3N METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/866','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:50:02','2026-04-29 00:50:02'),(4642,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',867,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"TRUE ALLERGIC ASTHMA. (ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA VERDADERA)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"WHERE THE LEG SHORTENS IN THE FRONT; PLACE SEVERAL(NEGATIVE) MAGNETS IN THE (FRONT). \\/ ADRENAL (BACK) POSITIVE (DONDE LA PIERNA SE ACORTA EN LA PARTE FRONTAL; COLOCAR VARIOS IMANES (NEGATIVOS) EN LA PARTE FRONTAL.\\/ SUPRARRENAL (ESPALDA) POSITIVO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"TRUE ALLERGIC ASTHMA.\\n\\n(ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA VERDADERA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE IS SPECIFICALLY DESIGNED TO ADDRESS TRUE ALLERGIC ASTHMA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE ANTERIOR AND POSTERIOR AXIS OF THE TORSO. UNLIKE OTHER RESPIRATORY CONDITIONS, THIS PAIR TARGETS THE HYPER-REACTIVE IMMUNE RESPONSE THAT TRIGGERS BRONCHIAL CONSTRICTION. THE PLACEMENT INVOLVES THE ENTIRE FRONTAL ASPECT OF THE BODY IN RELATION TO THE ADRENAL GLANDS ON THE BACK. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN MODULATING THE RELEASE OF ADRENALINE AND CORTISOL, CALMING THE ALLERGIC RESPONSE IN THE LUNGS AND RESTORING NORMAL AIRFLOW WITHOUT THE INTERFERENCE OF CHRONIC INFLAMMATORY TRIGGERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA EST\\u00c1 DISE\\u00d1ADA ESPEC\\u00cdFICAMENTE PARA ABORDAR EL ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA VERDADERA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DEL EJE ANTERIOR Y POSTERIOR DEL TORSO. A DIFERENCIA DE OTRAS AFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS, ESTE PAR SE DIRIGE A LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA HIPERREACTIVA QUE DESENCADENA LA CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N BRONQUIAL. LA COLOCACI\\u00d3N INVOLUCRA TODA LA PARTE FRONTAL DEL CUERPO EN RELACI\\u00d3N CON LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES EN LA ESPALDA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A MODULAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE ADRENALINA Y CORTISOL, CALMANDO LA RESPUESTA AL\\u00c9RGICA EN LOS PULMONES Y RESTAURANDO EL FLUJO DE AIRE NORMAL SIN LA INTERFERENCIA DE DESENCADENANTES INFLAMATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PLACEMENT INSTRUCTION: IDENTIFY THE SIDE WHERE THE LEG SHORTENS IN THE FRONT; PLACE SEVERAL NEGATIVE (-) MAGNETS ACROSS THE FRONT REGION. PLACE THE POSITIVE (+) MAGNET ON THE ADRENAL GLANDS (BACK). FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC DIGESTIVE SLUGGISHNESS TIED TO SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE WAIST \\/ WAIST (REF 865) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY DURING THE RESOLUTION OF THE ALLERGIC LOAD.\\n\\n(INSTRUCCI\\u00d3N DE COLOCACI\\u00d3N: IDENTIFIQUE EL LADO DONDE LA PIERNA SE ACORTA EN LA PARTE FRONTAL; COLOQUE VARIOS IMANES NEGATIVOS (-) EN LA REGI\\u00d3N FRONTAL. COLOQUE EL IM\\u00c1N POSITIVO (+) EN LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES (ESPALDA). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN LENTITUD DIGESTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA VINCULADA A INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [CINTURA \\/ CINTURA] (REF 865). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO DURANTE LA RESOLUCI\\u00d3N DE LA CARGA AL\\u00c9RGICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/867','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:51:21','2026-04-29 00:51:21'),(4643,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',868,'{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, INSOMNIA, Irritability, FRAYED NERVES, ABNORMAL BEHAVIOR. CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS. EAR PROBLEMS. (DOLORES DE CABEZA, INSOMNIO, IRRITABILIDAD, NERVIOS ALTERADOS, COMPORTAMIENTO ANORMAL. TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. PROBLEMAS DEL O\\u00cdDO.)\",\"paths\":\"EYE DAMAGE, DEGENERATION OF THE MACULA AND PROGRESSIVE MYOPIA. (DA\\u00d1O OCULAR, DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA M\\u00c1CULA Y MIOP\\u00cdA PROGRESIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH FUNGUS ASPERGILLUS, CATARACTS. (ASOCIADO CON EL HONGO ASPERGILLUS, CATARATAS)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"HEADACHES, INSOMNIA, IRRITABILITY, FRAYED NERVES, ABNORMAL BEHAVIOR, CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISORDERS, AND EAR PROBLEMS.\\n\\n(DOLORES DE CABEZA, INSOMNIO, IRRITABILIDAD, NERVIOS ALTERADOS, COMPORTAMIENTO ANORMAL, TRASTORNOS DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL Y PROBLEMAS DEL O\\u00cdDO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE REOVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE CIRCLE OF WILLIS, THE CRITICAL ANASTOMOTIC CIRCLE OF ARTERIES AT THE BASE OF THE BRAIN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT DUE TO ITS DIRECT IMPACT ON CEREBRAL PERFUSION AND THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. VIRAL ACTIVITY HERE CAN LEAD TO STRUCTURAL EYE DAMAGE, INCLUDING DEGENERATION OF THE MACULA AND PROGRESSIVE MYOPIA. BEYOND PHYSICAL VISION, THIS IMBALANCE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS PSYCHOSOMATIC OR NEUROLOGICAL DISTURBANCES SUCH AS SEVERE IRRITABILITY, INSOMNIA, AND ALTERED BEHAVIORAL PATTERNS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING OCULAR HEALTH, AND RESTORING CALM TO THE NERVOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL REOVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORTIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS, EL C\\u00cdRCULO ANASTOM\\u00d3TICO CR\\u00cdTICO DE ARTERIAS EN LA BASE DEL CEREBRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO DEBIDO A SU IMPACTO DIRECTO EN LA PERFUSI\\u00d3N CEREBRAL Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. LA ACTIVIDAD VIRAL AQU\\u00cd PUEDE PROVOCAR DA\\u00d1O OCULAR ESTRUCTURAL, INCLUYENDO LA DEGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LA M\\u00c1CULA Y MIOP\\u00cdA PROGRESIVA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LA VISI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA, ESTE DESEQUILIBRIO A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS O NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS TALES COMO IRRITABILIDAD SEVERA, INSOMNIO Y PATRONES DE COMPORTAMIENTO ALTERADOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO LA SALUD OCULAR Y RESTAURANDO LA CALMA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF OCULAR SYMPTOMS LIKE CATARACTS ARE PRESENT, CROSS-REFERENCE FOR THE PRESENCE OF THE ASPERGILLUS FUNGUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE NERVOUS SYSTEM TENSION OR ANXIETY, SCAN THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING CEREBRAL VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI SE PRESENTAN S\\u00cdNTOMAS OCULARES COMO CATARATAS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA PARA LA PRESENCIA DEL HONGO ASPERGILLUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA TENSI\\u00d3N SEVERA DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO O ANSIEDAD, ESCANEE EL EJE [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL CEREBRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/868','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:52:23','2026-04-29 00:52:23'),(4644,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',869,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HEALING (CICATRIZACI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HEALING (CICATRIZACI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIFFICULTY HEALING, CHRONIC OPEN WOUNDS, AND SLOW TISSUE REGENERATION.\\n\\n(DIFICULTAD PARA CICATRIZAR, HERIDAS ABIERTAS CR\\u00d3NICAS Y REGENERACI\\u00d3N TISULAR LENTA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE FOCUSES ON ACCELERATING CELLULAR REPAIR PROCESSES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN A SPECIFIC WOUND (HERIDA) AND THE NAVAL. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THE NAVAL IS CONSIDERED A VITAL ENERGETIC POINT OF SYSTEMIC CONNECTION. BY ESTABLISHING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CHANNELING RESOURCES TO THE AFFECTED AREA, IMPROVING CLOTTING, NEW TISSUE FORMATION, AND THE CLOSING OF WOUNDS THAT HAVE SHOWN RESISTANCE TO CONVENTIONAL HEALING.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL SE CENTRA EN ACELERAR LOS PROCESOS DE REPARACI\\u00d3N CELULAR MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE UNA HERIDA ESPEC\\u00cdFICA (HERIDA) Y EL OMBLIGO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, EL OMBLIGO SE CONSIDERA UN PUNTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO VITAL DE CONEXI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABLECER ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A CANALIZAR RECURSOS HACIA EL \\u00c1REA AFECTADA, MEJORANDO LA COAGULACI\\u00d3N, LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE TEJIDO NUEVO Y LA CIERRE DE HERIDAS QUE HAN MOSTRADO RESISTENCIA A LA CURACI\\u00d3N CONVENCIONAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF THE WOUND SHOWS SIGNS OF ACTIVE INFECTION OR PUS, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ THROAT (REF 857) AXIS FOR STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS. FOR CASES OF WOUNDS THAT DO NOT CLOSE DUE TO CIRCULATORY ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE TOXIN ELIMINATION DURING TISSUE REGENERATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA HERIDA PRESENTA SIGNOS DE INFECCI\\u00d3N ACTIVA O PUS, ESCANEE EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ GARGANTA] (REF 857) PARA STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS. PARA CASOS DE HERIDAS QUE NO CIERRAN DEBIDO A PROBLEMAS CIRCULATORIOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DURANTE LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/869','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:53:59','2026-04-29 00:53:59'),(4645,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',870,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTERSI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, DIZZINESS, AND VASCULAR TENSION.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, MAREOS Y TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE REGULATION OF BLOOD PRESSURE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE WRIST AND THE KIDNEY ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR MANAGING HYPERTENSION, AS IT CONNECTS THE DISTAL VASCULAR POINTS OF THE EXTREMITIES WITH THE RENAL SYSTEM, WHICH GOVERNS FLUID BALANCE AND ARTERIAL PRESSURE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING SYSTEMIC VASCULAR RESISTANCE, SUPPORTING KIDNEY FILTRATION, AND LOWERING CHRONICALLY ELEVATED BLOOD PRESSURE LEVELS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MU\\u00d1ECA Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL LADO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA EL MANEJO DE LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, YA QUE CONECTA LOS PUNTOS VASCULARES DISTALES DE LAS EXTREMIDADES CON EL SISTEMA RENAL, QUE GOBIERNA EL EQUILIBRIO DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS Y LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA RESISTENCIA VASCULAR SIST\\u00c9MICA, APOYANDO LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL Y DISMINUYENDO LOS NIVELES DE PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL CR\\u00d3NICAMENTE ELEVADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION IS ACCOMPANIED BY ANXIETY OR TACHYCARDIA, SCAN THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) SPECIAL PAIR. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RENAL STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [CAROTID \\/ CAROTID] RESONANCE TO ENSURE OPTIMAL CIRCULATORY FLOW DURING THE CORRECTION OF ARTERIAL TENSION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE ANSIEDAD O TAQUICARDIA, ESCANEE EL PAR ESPECIAL [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL SEVERO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE LA RESONANCIA [CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ CAR\\u00d3TIDA] PARA ASEGURAR UN FLUJO CIRCULATORIO \\u00d3PTIMO DURANTE LA CORRECCI\\u00d3N DE LA TENSI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/870','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:55:02','2026-04-29 00:55:02'),(4646,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',871,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"ENURESIS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ENURESIS (INVOLUNTARY URINATION), BEDWETTING, AND LACK OF BLADDER CONTROL.\\n\\n(ENURESIS (MICCI\\u00d3N INVOLUNTARIA), MOJAR LA CAMA Y FALTA DE CONTROL DE LA VEJIGA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES ENURESIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE WRIST AND THE KNEE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO REGULATE THE NEUROMUSCULAR CONTROL OF THE BLADDER, PARTICULARLY IN CHILDREN OR ADULTS SUFFERING FROM INVOLUNTARY URINATION DURING SLEEP. THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THESE DISTAL JOINTS HELPS TO STABILIZE THE ENERGETIC REFLEXES THAT GOVERN THE SPHINCTER AND DETRUSOR MUSCLES. BY BALANCING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE NERVOUS SYSTEM IN MAINTAINING PROPER COMMUNICATION WITH THE URINARY TRACT, REDUCING THE INCIDENCE OF BEDWETTING AND RESTORING VOLUNTARY CONTROL.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA ENURESIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MU\\u00d1ECA Y LA RODILLA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA REGULAR EL CONTROL NEUROMUSCULAR DE LA VEJIGA, PARTICULARMENTE EN NI\\u00d1OS O ADULTOS QUE SUFREN DE MICCI\\u00d3N INVOLUNTARIA DURANTE EL SUE\\u00d1O. LA CONEXI\\u00d3N ENTRE ESTAS ARTICULACIONES DISTALES AYUDA A ESTABILIZAR LOS REFLEJOS ENERG\\u00c9TICOS QUE GOBIERNAN EL ESF\\u00cdNTER Y LOS M\\u00daSCULOS DETRUSORES. AL EQUILIBRAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA NERVIOSO A MANTENER UNA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA CON EL TRACTO URINARIO, REDUCIENDO LA INCIDENCIA DE MOJAR LA CAMA Y RESTAURANDO EL CONTROL VOLUNTARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF ENURESIS IS ACCOMPANIED BY FREQUENT URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ KIDNEY - L (REF 854) RESONANCE FOR E. COLI. FOR CASES INVOLVING HIGH SYSTEMIC TENSION OR ANXIETY CONTRIBUTING TO BLADDER ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE OPTIMAL RENAL FUNCTION AND FLUID REGULATION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA ENURESIS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE INFECCIONES FRECUENTES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - I] (REF 854) PARA E. COLI. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA ALTA TENSI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA O ANSIEDAD QUE CONTRIBUYA A LOS PROBLEMAS DE LA VEJIGA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). SIEMPRE MONITOREE LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL Y REGULACI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS \\u00d3PTIMAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/871','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:56:14','2026-04-29 00:56:14'),(4647,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',872,'{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS. (TOS, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS)\",\"paths\":\"LUNG DISEASES, VASCULAR DISORDERS. (ENFERMEDADES PULMONARES, TRASTORNOS VASCULARES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"COUGH, RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, AND SHORTNESS OF BREATH.\\n\\n(TOS, S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS Y DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES RESPIRATORY IMBALANCES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE WRIST AND THE SHIN BONE (TIBIA) ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO REGULATE VASCULAR DISORDERS THAT DIRECTLY IMPACT LUNG FUNCTION. WHEN THIS CIRCUIT IS DISRUPTED, THE LUNGS MAY STRUGGLE WITH PROPER OXYGENATION OR PERSISTENT IRRITATION, MANIFESTING AS A CHRONIC COUGH OR OTHER RESPIRATORY DISTRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS DIAGONAL RESONANCE, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CLEARING VASCULAR CONGESTION, SUPPORTING LUNG TISSUE HEALTH, AND RESTORING EFFICIENT RESPIRATORY FLOW.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS RESPIRATORIOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MU\\u00d1ECA Y LA TIBIA DEL LADO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA REGULAR LOS TRASTORNOS VASCULARES QUE IMPACTAN DIRECTAMENTE EN LA FUNCI\\u00d3N PULMONAR. CUANDO ESTE CIRCUITO SE ALTERA, LOS PULMONES PUEDEN TENER DIFICULTADES PARA UNA OXIGENACI\\u00d3N ADECUADA O PRESENTAR IRRITACI\\u00d3N PERSISTENTE, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO TOS CR\\u00d3NICA U OTRO DISTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA RESONANCIA DIAGONAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A ELIMINAR LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N VASCULAR, APOYANDO LA SALUD DEL TEJIDO PULMONAR Y RESTAURANDO UN FLUJO RESPIRATORIO EFICIENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY A BARKING COUGH OR LARYNGEAL IRRITATION, SCAN THE VAGINA \\/ VAGINA (REF 859) RESONANCE FOR YERSINIA PESTIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING ALLERGIC ASTHMA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE WHOLE FRONT \\/ ADRENALS (REF 866) COMPLEX AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE CLEARANCE OF METABOLIC WASTE FROM THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE UNA TOS PERRUNA O IRRITACI\\u00d3N LAR\\u00cdNGEA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [VAGINA \\/ VAGINA] (REF 859) PARA YERSINIA PESTIS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ASMA AL\\u00c9RGICA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE COMPLEJO [PARTE FRONTAL COMPLETA \\/ SUPRARRENALES] (REF 866). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS DEL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/872','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:57:12','2026-04-29 00:57:12'),(4648,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',873,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE. (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA)\",\"paths\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, VASCULAR TENSION, AND METABOLIC IMBALANCE.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR Y DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE TARGETS HYPERTENSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE WRIST AND THE THYROID GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS UNIQUE AS IT BRIDGES THE PERIPHERAL VASCULAR SYSTEM WITH THE MASTER REGULATOR OF METABOLISM. THE THYROID INFLUENCES HEART RATE AND BLOOD PRESSURE THROUGH HORMONAL CONTROL; WHEN THIS COMMUNICATION WITH THE DISTAL POINTS (WRIST) IS DISRUPTED, SYSTEMIC VASCULAR RESISTANCE CAN INCREASE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN LOWERING ARTERIAL TENSION, BALANCING THE METABOLIC TRIGGERS OF HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, AND PROMOTING VASCULAR RELAXATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA MU\\u00d1ECA Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES \\u00daNICO YA QUE CONECTA EL SISTEMA VASCULAR PERIF\\u00c9RICO CON EL REGULADOR MAESTRO DEL METABOLISMO. LA TIROIDES INFLUYE EN LA FRECUENCIA CARD\\u00cdACA Y LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL A TRAV\\u00c9S DEL CONTROL HORMONAL; CUANDO ESTA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N CON LOS PUNTOS DISTALES (MU\\u00d1ECA) SE ALTERA, LA RESISTENCIA VASCULAR SIST\\u00c9MICA PUEDE AUMENTAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A DISMINUIR LA TENSI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL, EQUILIBRAR LOS DESENCADENANTES METAB\\u00d3LICOS DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA Y PROMOVER LA RELAJACI\\u00d3N VASCULAR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION IS ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE RENAL STRESS, SCAN THE WRIST \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE (REF 870) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE ANXIETY OR TACHYCARDIA, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE RENAL REGULATION OF BLOOD PRESSURE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL SEVERO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [MU\\u00d1ECA \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - OPUESTO] (REF 870). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD AGUDA O TAQUICARDIA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/873','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 00:59:23','2026-04-29 00:59:23'),(4649,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',874,'{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT PAIN, ARM AND NECK PAIN, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, STIFFNESS. SWELLING IN WRIST, SHOULDER, AND ELBOW. (DOLOR ARTICULAR, DOLOR EN BRAZO Y CUELLO, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR, RIGIDEZ. HINCHAZ\\u00d3N EN MU\\u00d1ECA, HOMBRO Y CODO.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY LICE AND FLEAS. DYSFUNCTION OF THE SHOULDER GIRDLE AND UPPER LIMBS. (TRANSMITIDO POR PIOJOS Y PULGAS. DISFUNCI\\u00d3N DE LA CINTURA ESCAPULAR Y DE LOS MIEMBROS SUPERIORES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH WRIST AND CALCANEUS, TRUE ALZHEIMER SYNDROME. CHECK - CALCANEUS. (ASOCIADO CON LA MU\\u00d1ECA Y EL CALC\\u00c1NEO, S\\u00cdNDROME DE ALZHEIMER VERDADERO. REVISAR - CALC\\u00c1NEO.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"JOINT PAIN, ARM AND NECK PAIN, MUSCLE WEAKNESS, AND STIFFNESS. SWELLING IN THE WRIST, SHOULDER, AND ELBOW.\\n\\n(DOLOR ARTICULAR, DOLOR EN BRAZO Y CUELLO, DEBILIDAD MUSCULAR Y RIGIDEZ. HINCHAZ\\u00d3N EN LA MU\\u00d1ECA, EL HOMBRO Y EL CODO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS RICKETTSIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE WRIST JOINTS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN\\u2014OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY LICE, FLEAS, OR TICKS\\u2014TENDS TO IMPACT THE MUSCULOSKELETAL SYSTEM, PARTICULARLY CAUSING DYSFUNCTION IN THE SHOULDER GIRDLE AND UPPER LIMBS. THE INFECTION CAN LEAD TO SIGNIFICANT INFLAMMATION, MANIFESTING AS STIFFNESS AND SWELLING THAT TRAVELS FROM THE WRIST UP TO THE ELBOW AND SHOULDER. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, RELIEVING JOINT CONGESTION, AND RESTORING MOBILITY TO THE ARMS AND NECK.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA RICKETTSIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS ARTICULACIONES DE LA MU\\u00d1ECA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO \\u2014A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO POR PIOJOS, PULGAS O GARRAPATAS\\u2014 TIENDE A IMPACTAR EL SISTEMA MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICO, CAUSANDO PARTICULARMENTE DISFUNCI\\u00d3N EN LA CINTURA ESCAPULAR Y LOS MIEMBROS SUPERIORES. LA INFECCI\\u00d3N PUEDE PROVOCAR UNA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO RIGIDEZ E HINCHAZ\\u00d3N QUE VIAJA DESDE LA MU\\u00d1ECA HASTA EL CODO Y EL HOMBRO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ALIVIANDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR Y RESTAURANDO LA MOVILIDAD EN LOS BRAZOS Y EL CUELLO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: THIS RESONANCE IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH THE WRIST AND CALCANEUS AXIS IN CASES OF TRUE ALZHEIMER SYNDROME; IF COGNITIVE SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE [CALCANEUS \\/ CALCANEUS] POINT. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VASCULAR TENSION OR HYPERTENSION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE WRIST \\/ THYROID (REF 873) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE JOINTS DURING BACTERIAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON EL EJE DE LA MU\\u00d1ECA Y EL CALC\\u00c1NEO EN CASOS DE S\\u00cdNDROME DE ALZHEIMER VERDADERO; SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS COGNITIVOS PRESENTES, ESCANEE EL PUNTO [CALC\\u00c1NEO \\/ CALC\\u00c1NEO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR SEVERA O HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [MU\\u00d1ECA \\/ TIROIDES] (REF 873). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LAS ARTICULACIONES DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/874','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:00:28','2026-04-29 01:00:28'),(4650,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',875,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"RINGWORM (TI\\u00d1A)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN LESIONS, ITCHING, CIRCULAR RASHES, AND DERMATOLOGICAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(LESIONES EN LA PIEL, PICAZ\\u00d3N, ERUPCIONES CIRCULARES Y MALESTAR DERMATOL\\u00d3GICO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE RINGWORM FUNGUS (TINEA) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE XIPHOID PROCESS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS USED TO ADDRESS DERMATOLOGICAL INFECTIONS THAT CAUSE CHARACTERISTIC CIRCULAR, ITCHY RASHES ON THE SKIN. WHILE THE PHYSICAL MANIFESTATION OF RINGWORM IS OFTEN EXTERNAL, THE RESONANCE AT THE BASE OF THE STERNUM (XIPHOID) HELPS TO STABILIZE THE INTERNAL ENVIRONMENT THAT ALLOWS THE FUNGUS TO PERSIST. BY BALANCING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGAL LOAD, REDUCING SKIN INFLAMMATION, AND PROMOTING THE HEALING OF INFECTED TISSUES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE AL HONGO DE LA TI\\u00d1A (TINEA) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL AP\\u00c9NDICE XIFOIDES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE SE UTILIZA PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS QUE CAUSAN ERUPCIONES CIRCULARES Y PRURIGINOSAS CARACTER\\u00cdSTICAS EN LA PIEL. AUNQUE LA MANIFESTACI\\u00d3N F\\u00cdSICA DE LA TI\\u00d1A SUELE SER EXTERNA, LA RESONANCIA EN LA BASE DEL ESTERN\\u00d3N (XIFOIDES) AYUDA A ESTABILIZAR EL AMBIENTE INTERNO QUE PERMITE QUE EL HONGO PERSISTA. AL EQUILIBRAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA Y PROMOVIENDO LA CURACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS INFECTADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SKIN SYMPTOMS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY PERSISTENT WOUNDS THAT REFUSE TO CLOSE, SCAN THE WOUND \\/ NAVEL (REF 869) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL LOADS AFFECTING THE SKIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGINA \\/ THROAT (REF 857) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING FUNGAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS CUT\\u00c1NEOS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE HERIDAS PERSISTENTES QUE SE NIEGAN A CERRAR, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [HERIDA \\/ OMBLIGO] (REF 869). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CARGAS BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE AFECTEN LA PIEL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [VAGINA \\/ GARGANTA] (REF 857). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/875','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:01:24','2026-04-29 01:01:24'),(4651,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',876,'{\"symptoms\":\"EAR, PULMONARY, AND RESPIRATORY INFECTIONS. (INFECCIONES DEL O\\u00cdDO, PULMONARES Y RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"COPD, EMPHYSEMA. (EPOC, ENFISEMA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EAR, PULMONARY, AND RESPIRATORY ISSUES. COPD, EMPHYSEMA.\\n\\n(PROBLEMAS DE O\\u00cdDO, PULMONARES Y RESPIRATORIOS. EPOC, ENFISEMA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE ZYGOMATIC ARCHES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS SIGNIFICANT FOR ITS IMPACT ON BOTH THE UPPER AND LOWER RESPIRATORY TRACTS. WHILE IT OFTEN CAUSES OTITIS (EAR INFECTIONS) AND SINUSITIS, ITS PRESENCE IS PARTICULARLY CRITICAL IN PATIENTS WITH CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE (COPD) OR EMPHYSEMA, AS IT CAN TRIGGER SEVERE EXACERBATIONS AND INFLAMMATION OF THE BRONCHIAL TISSUES. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT ON THE CHEEKBONES, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING MUCOUS PRODUCTION, AND IMPROVING OVERALL RESPIRATORY CAPACITY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA MORAXELLA CATARRHALIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LOS ARCOS CIGOM\\u00c1TICOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES SIGNIFICATIVO POR SU IMPACTO TANTO EN EL TRACTO RESPIRATORIO SUPERIOR COMO EN EL INFERIOR. AUNQUE A MENUDO CAUSA OTITIS (INFECCIONES DE O\\u00cdDO) Y SINUSITIS, SU PRESENCIA ES PARTICULARMENTE CR\\u00cdTICA EN PACIENTES CON ENFERMEDAD PULMONAR OBSTRUCTIVA CR\\u00d3NICA (EPOC) O ENFISEMA, YA QUE PUEDE DESENCADENAR EXACERBACIONES SEVERAS E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS BRONQUIALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL EN LOS P\\u00d3MULOS, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA PRODUCCI\\u00d3N DE MUCOSIDAD Y MEJORANDO LA CAPACIDAD RESPIRATORIA GENERAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE ALLERGIC BRONCHOCONSTRICTION, SCAN THE WHOLE FRONT \\/ ADRENALS (REF 866) COMPLEX. FOR CASES INVOLVING PERSISTENT COUGH AND VASCULAR CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE WRIST \\/ SHIN BONE - OPPOSITE (REF 872) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE BRONCOCONSTRICCI\\u00d3N AL\\u00c9RGICA SEVERA, ESCANEE EL COMPLEJO [PARTE FRONTAL COMPLETA \\/ SUPRARRENALES] (REF 866). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TOS PERSISTENTE Y CONGESTI\\u00d3N VASCULAR, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [MU\\u00d1ECA \\/ TIBIA - OPUESTO] (REF 872). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/876','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:02:30','2026-04-29 01:02:30'),(4652,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',877,'{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, SWEATS, NAUSEA, FATIGUE, ANGER, AGGRESSIVENESS. (FIEBRE, SUDORACI\\u00d3N, N\\u00c1USEAS, FATIGA, IRA, AGRESIVIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"FIBROMYALGIA, EARS, NOSE AND THROAT DISEASE, PSYCHOSOMATIC DISORDERS OF THE KIDNEYS. (FIBROMIALGIA, ENFERMEDAD DE O\\u00cdDOS, NARIZ Y GARGANTA, TRASTORNOS PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICOS DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, SWEATS, NAUSEA, FATIGUE, ANGER, AND JOINT PAIN.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, SUDORACI\\u00d3N, N\\u00c1USEAS, FATIGA, IRA Y DOLOR ARTICULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE ENERGY DISTORTIONS ASSOCIATED WITH MALARIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH IMBALANCES BETWEEN THE ZYGOMATIC BONE (CHEEKBONE) AND THE KIDNEY ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC INFECTIONS THAT MANIFEST AS PERIODIC FEVERS AND SEVERE FATIGUE. BEYOND THE PHYSICAL SYMPTOMS, THIS PAIR IS NOTED FOR ITS IMPACT ON EMOTIONAL STATES, PARTICULARLY UNEXPLAINED ANGER OR IRRITABILITY. BY STABILIZING THIS DIAGONAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE PATHOGENIC LOAD, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE JOINTS, AND RESTORING EMOTIONAL AND METABOLIC CALM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE A LAS DISTORSIONES ENERG\\u00c9TICAS ASOCIADAS CON LA MALARIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE PH ENTRE EL HUESO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO (P\\u00d3MULO) Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N DEL LADO OPUESTO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE SE MANIFIESTAN COMO FIEBRES PERI\\u00d3DICAS Y FATIGA SEVERA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS F\\u00cdSICOS, ESTE PAR ES CONOCIDO POR SU IMPACTO EN LOS ESTADOS EMOCIONALES, PARTICULARMENTE LA IRA O IRRITABILIDAD INEXPLICABLE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO DIAGONAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA PAT\\u00d3GENA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LAS ARTICULACIONES Y RESTAURANDO LA CALMA EMOCIONAL Y METAB\\u00d3LICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF FIBROMYALGIA-LIKE SYMPTOMS OR CHRONIC PAIN IN THE EARS, NOSE, OR THROAT PERSIST, SCAN THE ZYGOMATIC ARCH \\/ ZYGOMATIC ARCH (REF 876) AXIS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VASCULAR TENSION OR HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE WRIST \\/ THYROID (REF 873) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE CLEARANCE OF VIRAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI PERSISTEN S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES A LA FIBROMIALGIA O DOLOR CR\\u00d3NICO EN O\\u00cdDOS, NARIZ O GARGANTA, ESCANEE EL EJE [ARCO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO \\/ ARCO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO] (REF 876). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR SEVERA O PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [MU\\u00d1ECA \\/ TIROIDES] (REF 873). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS VIRALES.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/877','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:03:34','2026-04-29 01:03:34'),(4653,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',878,'{\"paths\":\"CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM DISEASE. MENINGITIS, ENCEPHALITIS, AND MENINGOENCEPHALITIS. (ENFERMEDAD DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. MENINGITIS, ENCEFALITIS Y MENINGOENCEFALITIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ZYGOMATIC BONE (CHEEKBONE) AND THE PARIETAL BONE OF THE SKULL. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL BECAUSE LISTERIA HAS A PREDILECTION FOR THE CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM. WHILE INITIAL SYMPTOMS MAY RESEMBLE A SEVERE GASTROINTESTINAL INFECTION OR FLU, THE PATHOGEN CAN CROSS THE BLOOD-BRAIN BARRIER, LEADING TO SERIOUS CONDITIONS SUCH AS MENINGITIS, ENCEPHALITIS, OR MENINGOENCEPHALITIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING CEREBRAL INTEGRITY, AND PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION OF NEUROLOGICAL INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA LISTERIA MONOCYTOGENES MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL HUESO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO (P\\u00d3MULO) Y EL HUESO PARIETAL DEL CR\\u00c1NEO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE LA LISTERIA TIENE PREDILECCI\\u00d3N POR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. AUNQUE LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS INICIALES PUEDEN PARECERSE A UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N GASTROINTESTINAL SEVERA O GRIPE, EL PAT\\u00d3GENO PUEDE ATRAVESAR LA BARRERA HEMATOENCEF\\u00c1LICA, LO QUE CONDUCE A CONDICIONES GRAVES COMO MENINGITIS, ENCEFALITIS O MENINGOENCEFALITIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD CEREBRAL Y PREVINIENDO LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N DE LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N NEUROL\\u00d3GICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST WITH SEVERE IRRITABILITY OR INSOMNIA, SCAN THE WILLIS CIRCLE \\/ WILLIS CIRCLE (REF 867) RESONANCE FOR REOVIRUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC FEVER AND JOINT PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE ZYGOMATIC BONE \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE SIDE (REF 877) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE CLEARANCE OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS PERSISTEN CON IRRITABILIDAD SEVERA O INSOMNIO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS \\/ C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS] (REF 867) PARA REOVIRUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FIEBRE SIST\\u00c9MICA Y DOLOR ARTICULAR, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [HUESO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - LADO OPUESTO] (REF 877). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/878','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:04:21','2026-04-29 01:04:21'),(4654,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',879,'{\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE SMALL INTESTINES. HEADACHE, DIARRHEA, DIZZINESS. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL INTESTINO DELGADO. DOLOR DE CABEZA, DIARREA, MAREO.)\",\"paths\":\"HYPOPHYSEAL ADENOMA. (ADENOMA HIPOFISARIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE SMALL INTESTINES, HEADACHE, DIARRHEA, AND DIZZINESS.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL INTESTINO DELGADO, DOLOR DE CABEZA, DIARREA Y MAREO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS ENTEROVIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE ZYGOMATIC BONES (CHEEKBONES). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS IT CAN BE ASSOCIATED WITH THE DEVELOPMENT OF A HYPOPHYSEAL ADENOMA (PITUITARY ADENOMA). WHILE THE VIRUS TYPICALLY CAUSES GASTROINTESTINAL DISTRESS SUCH AS DIARRHEA AND INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION, ITS ENERGETIC IMPACT ON THIS CRANIAL AXIS CAN AFFECT GLANDULAR FUNCTION. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION, AND MITIGATING THE NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS LIKE HEADACHES AND DIZZINESS ASSOCIATED WITH THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL ENTEROVIRUS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS HUESOS CIGOM\\u00c1TICOS (P\\u00d3MULOS). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO YA que PUEDE ESTAR ASOCIADO CON EL DESARROLLO DE UN ADENOMA HIPOFISARIO (ADENOMA DE LA PITUITARIA). SI BIEN EL VIRUS SUELE CAUSAR MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL COMO DIARREA E INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL, SU IMPACTO ENERG\\u00c9TICO EN ESTE EJE CRANEAL PUEDE AFECTAR LA FUNCI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y MITIGANDO LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS COMO DOLORES DE CABEZA Y MAREOS ASOCIADOS CON LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS PERSIST WITH SEVERE MUSCLE PAIN OR FEVER, SCAN THE ZYGOMATIC BONE \\/ PARIETAL (REF 878) RESONANCE FOR LISTERIA. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC RESPIRATORY ISSUES OR COPD, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE ZYGOMATIC ARCH \\/ ZYGOMATIC ARCH (REF 876) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT GLANDULAR HEALTH DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS PERSISTEN CON DOLOR MUSCULAR SEVERO O FIEBRE, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [HUESO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO \\/ PARIETAL] (REF 878) PARA LISTERIA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN PROBLEMAS RESPIRATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS O EPOC, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [ARCO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO \\/ ARCO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO] (REF 876). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LA SALUD GLANDULAR DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/879','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:05:18','2026-04-29 01:05:18'),(4655,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',671,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE. (PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"HYPERTENSION (HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N)\",\"symptoms\":\"HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, PALPITATIONS, AND VASCULAR TENSION.\\n\\n(PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, PALPITACIONES Y TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE REGULATION OF ARTERIAL TENSION BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE RADIAL ARTERIES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BILATERAL AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR ADDRESSING HYPERTENSION, AS THE RADIAL ARTERY IS A PRIMARY PERIPHERAL ACCESS POINT FOR MONITORING CIRCULATORY FORCE. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN REFLECTS SYSTEMIC VASCULAR RESISTANCE OR AN OVERACTIVE SYMPATHETIC RESPONSE. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RELAXING THE ARTERIAL WALLS, IMPROVING BLOOD FLOW TO THE EXTREMITIES, AND NATURALLY LOWERING ELEVATED BLOOD PRESSURE LEVELS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LA TENSI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LAS ARTERIAS RADIALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE BILATERAL ES ESENCIAL PARA TRATAR LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N, YA QUE LA ARTERIA RADIAL ES UN PUNTO DE ACCESO PERIF\\u00c9RICO PRIMARIO PARA MONITOREAR LA FUERZA CIRCULATORIA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO REFLEJA UNA RESISTENCIA VASCULAR SIST\\u00c9MICA O UNA RESPUESTA SIMP\\u00c1TICA SOBREACTIVADA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RELAJAR LAS PAREDES ARTERIALES, MEJORANDO EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO A LAS EXTREMIDADES Y DISMINUYENDO DE FORMA NATURAL LOS NIVELES DE PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ELEVADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF HYPERTENSION IS LINKED TO METABOLIC IMBALANCE, SCAN THE WRIST \\/ THYROID (REF 873) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE VASCULAR CONSTRICTION OR CARDIAC STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [CAROTID \\/ CAROTID] OR VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) AXES. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT RENAL REGULATION OF FLUID PRESSURE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA HIPERTENSI\\u00d3N EST\\u00c1 VINCULADA A UN DESEQUILIBRIO METAB\\u00d3LICO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [MU\\u00d1ECA \\/ TIROIDES] (REF 873). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N VASCULAR SEVERA O ESTR\\u00c9S CARD\\u00cdACO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LOS EJES [CAR\\u00d3TIDA \\/ CAR\\u00d3TIDA] O [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA REGULACI\\u00d3N RENAL DE LA PRESI\\u00d3N DE L\\u00cdQUIDOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/671','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:06:29','2026-04-29 01:06:29'),(4656,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',672,'{\"symptoms\":\"FUNGAL INFECTION IN THE ARMPITS, MOUTH, EAR, FEET, GROIN, FINGER HEAD AND LARYNX. (INFECCI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA EN LAS AXILAS, BOCA, O\\u00cdDO, PIES, INGLE, PUNTA DE LOS DEDOS Y LARINGE.)\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY SPORES. MANIFEST ITSELF IN THE UPPER AIRWAYS. DANDRUFF AND RINGWORM. (TRANSMITIDO POR ESPORAS. SE MANIFIESTA EN LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES. CASPA Y TI\\u00d1A.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH VIRUS, GLAUCOMA.                        CHECK - MEDIAL KNEE LIGAMENT\\/MALLEOUS. (ASOCIADO CON VIRUS, GLAUCOMA.                        REVISAR - LIGAMENTO MEDIAL DE LA RODILLA\\/MARTILLO)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"FUNGAL INFECTION IN THE ARMPITS, MOUTH, EAR, FEET, GROIN, FINGER HEADS, AND LARYNX. DANDRUFF AND RINGWORM.\\n\\n(INFECCI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA EN LAS AXILAS, BOCA, O\\u00cdDO, PIES, INGLE, PUNTA DE LOS DEDOS Y LARINGE. CASPA Y TI\\u00d1A.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS FUNGAL RESONANCE TARGETS MICROSPORUM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ALONG THE RADIUS BONES OF THE FOREARMS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS PRIMARILY TRANSMITTED BY SPORES AND FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS IN THE UPPER AIRWAYS OR AS DERMATOLOGICAL CONDITIONS. IT IS A COMMON CAUSE OF TINEA (RINGWORM) AND PERSISTENT DANDRUFF. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE FUNGAL LOAD, REDUCING SKIN IRRITATION IN SENSITIVE AREAS LIKE THE GROIN AND ARMPITS, AND CLEARING RESPIRATORY DISCOMFORT LINKED TO SPORE INHALATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA F\\u00daNGICA SE DIRIGE AL MICROSPORUM MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DE LOS HUESOS RADIO DE LOS ANTEBRAZOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE PRINCIPALMENTE POR ESPORAS Y SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA EN LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS SUPERIORES O COMO AFECCIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS. ES UNA CAUSA COM\\u00daN DE TI\\u00d1A Y CASPA PERSISTENTE. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA F\\u00daNGICA, REDUCIENDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA EN \\u00c1REAS SENSIBLES COMO LA INGLE Y LAS AXILAS, Y ELIMINANDO EL MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO VINCULADO A LA INHALACI\\u00d3N DE ESPORAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: THIS RESONANCE IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH VIRUSES AND MAY BE LINKED TO GLAUCOMA; IF OCULAR PRESSURE IS AN ISSUE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE WILLIS CIRCLE \\/ WILLIS CIRCLE (REF 867) AXIS. ALSO, CHECK THE [MEDIAL KNEE LIGAMENT \\/ MALLEOLUS] RESONANCE FOR COMPLEMENTARY STABILITY. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING FUNGAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON VIRUS Y PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADA AL GLAUCOMA; SI LA PRESI\\u00d3N OCULAR ES UN PROBLEMA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS \\/ C\\u00cdRCULO DE WILLIS] (REF 867). TAMBI\\u00c9N, REVISE LA RESONANCIA [LIGAMENTO MEDIAL DE LA RODILLA \\/ MAL\\u00c9OLO] PARA UNA ESTABILIDAD COMPLEMENTARIA. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N F\\u00daNGICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/672','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:08:41','2026-04-29 01:08:41'),(4657,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',673,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"ENERGY FLOW (FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"PHYSICAL EXHAUSTION, EMOTIONAL FATIGUE, AND LACK OF VITALITY.\\n\\n(AGOTAMIENTO F\\u00cdSICO, FATIGA EMOCIONAL Y FALTA DE VITALIDAD.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE STAGNATION OF VITAL ENERGY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE RING FINGERS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS BILATERAL AXIS IS LINKED TO THE REGULATION OF THE BODY\\u2019S ENERGETIC RESERVES. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS A PROFOUND SENSE OF TIREDNESS THAT IS NOT RELIEVED BY REST, FREQUENTLY TIED TO PROLONGED STRESS OR EMOTIONAL OVERLOAD. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RESTORING THE NATURAL FLOW OF ENERGY, RECHARGING THE VITAL SYSTEMS, AND PROMOTING A SENSE OF OVERALL WELL-BEING and RENEWED VIGOR.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA EL ESTANCAMIENTO DE LA ENERG\\u00cdA VITAL MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A TRAV\\u00c9S DE LOS DEDOS ANULARES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE BILATERAL EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO A LA REGULACI\\u00d3N DE LAS RESERVAS ENERG\\u00c9TICAS DEL CUERPO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SE MANIFIESTA COMO UNA PROFUNDA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE CANSANCIO QUE NO SE ALIVIA CON EL DESCANSO, FRECUENTEMENTE VINCULADA AL ESTR\\u00c9S PROLONGADO O LA SOBRECARGA EMOCIONAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RESTAURAR EL FLUJO NATURAL DE ENERG\\u00cdA, RECARGAR LOS SISTEMAS VITALES Y PROMOVER UNA SENSACI\\u00d3N DE BIENESTAR GENERAL Y VIGOR RENOVADO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF EXHAUSTION IS ACCOMPANIED BY SYSTEMIC VASCULAR TENSION OR HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE, SCAN THE RADIAL ARTERY \\/ RADIAL ARTERY (REF 880) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP NERVOUS SYSTEM STRESS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS DURING ENERGETIC RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL AGOTAMIENTO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE TENSI\\u00d3N VASCULAR SIST\\u00c9MICA O PRESI\\u00d3N ARTERIAL ALTA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [ARTERIA RADIAL \\/ ARTERIA RADIAL] (REF 880). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UN ESTR\\u00c9S PROFUNDO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/673','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:10:15','2026-04-29 01:10:15'),(4658,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',674,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN RASHES, HEMORRHOIDS. (ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, HEMORROIDES)\",\"paths\":\"HOSPITAL ACQUIRED INFECTIONS. METASTASES. (INFECCIONES ADQUIRIDAS EN HOSPITALES. MET\\u00c1STASIS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - PLEURA (SAME SIDE) CHECK - ADRENALS\\/LUNG (REVISAR - PLEURA (MISMO LADO)                       REVISAR - SUPRARRENALES\\/PULM\\u00d3N)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN RASHES, HEMORRHOIDS, AND GASTROINTESTINAL DISCOMFORT.\\n\\n(ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, HEMORROIDES Y MALESTAR GASTROINTESTINAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE RECTAL TISSUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS SIGNIFICANT AS IT IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH HOSPITAL-ACQUIRED INFECTIONS AND CAN BE LINKED TO COMPLEX METASTASIS PROCESSES. PHYSICALLY, THE IMBALANCE FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS IRRITATION IN THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT, LEADING TO HEMORRHOIDS AND PERSISTENT SKIN RASHES. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING LOCAL INFLAMMATION, AND ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY OFTEN FOUND IN CHRONIC DEGENERATIVE CASES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DEL TEJIDO RECTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO ES SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE A MENUDO SE ASOCIA CON INFECCIONES ADQUIRIDAS EN HOSPITALES Y PUEDE ESTAR VINCULADO A PROCESOS COMPLEJOS DE MET\\u00c1STASIS. F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, EL DESEQUILIBRIO SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO IRRITACI\\u00d3N EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR, LO QUE PROVOCA HEMORROIDES Y ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS PERSISTENTES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCAL Y ABORDANDO LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE SUELE ENCONTRARSE EN CASOS DEGENERATIVOS CR\\u00d3NICOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC INFECTION IS SUSPECTED, SCAN THE [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] (SAME SIDE) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING RESPIRATORY COMPLICATIONS OR ADRENAL FATIGUE DURING BACTERIAL CLEARANCE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [ADRENALS \\/ LUNG] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE ELIMINATION OF PSEUDOMONAS TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI SE SOSPECHA UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [PLEURA \\/ PLEURA] (MISMO LADO). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN COMPLICACIONES RESPIRATORIAS O FATIGA SUPRARRENAL DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [SUPRARRENALES \\/ PULM\\u00d3N]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS DE PSEUDOMONAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/674','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:11:12','2026-04-29 01:11:12'),(4659,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',675,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"AIDS (SIDA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"IMMUNODEFICIENCY, CHRONIC FATIGUE, WEIGHT LOSS, AND RECURRENT INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(INMUNODEFICIENCIA, FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE PESO E INFECCIONES RECURRENTES.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE HIV VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RECTUM AND THE THYMUS GLAND. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS IT ADDRESSES THE SYSTEMIC COLLAPSE OF THE IMMUNE RESPONSE, OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH AIDS (SIDA). THE THYMUS IS THE PRIMARY SITE FOR T-CELL MATURATION, WHILE THE RECTUM CAN ACT AS A VIRAL RESERVOIR. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN RECOGNIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, SUPPORTING THE REGENERATION OF IMMUNE DEFENSES, AND PROTECTING THE LYMPHATIC SYSTEM FROM PROGRESSIVE DEGRADATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DEL VIH MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL RECTO Y LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIMO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE ABORDA EL COLAPSO SIST\\u00c9MICO DE LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA, A MENUDO ASOCIADO CON EL SIDA. EL TIMO ES EL SITIO PRINCIPAL PARA LA MADURACI\\u00d3N DE LAS C\\u00c9LULAS T, MIENTRAS QUE EL RECTO PUEDE ACTUAR COMO UN RESERVORIO VIRAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A RECONOCER LA CARGA VIRAL, APOYANDO LA REGENERACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DEFENSAS INMUNITARIAS Y PROTEGIENDO EL SISTEMA LINF\\u00c1TICO DE LA DEGRADACI\\u00d3N PROGRESIVA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL INFECTION IS SUSPECTED, SCAN THE RECTUM \\/ RECTUM (REF 883) RESONANCE FOR PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE LYMPHATIC CONGESTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN] AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI SE SOSPECHA UNA INFECCI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA SIST\\u00c9MICA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [RECTO \\/ RECTO] (REF 883) PARA PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA CONGESTI\\u00d3N LINF\\u00c1TICA SEVERA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [BAZO \\/ BAZO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/675','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:12:03','2026-04-29 01:12:03'),(4660,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',676,'{\"origins\":\"HERPES 5\",\"symptoms\":\"PELVIC MANIFESTATIONS AND SYMPTOMOLOGY IN THE URINARY TRACT. KIDNEY PAIN. (MANIFESTACIONES P\\u00c9LVICAS Y SINTOMATOLOG\\u00cdA EN LAS V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS. DOLOR RENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"URETHRITIS, VAGINITIS, CYSTITIS. NEPHROTIC SYNDROME TO KIDNEY FAILURE. (URETRITIS, VAGINITIS, CISTITIS. S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO HASTA INSUFICIENCIA RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - STOMACH\\/DUODENUM (REVISAR - EST\\u00d3MAGO\\/DUODENO)\"}','{\"origins\":\"HERPES 5 (CITOMEGALOVIRUS)\",\"symptoms\":\"PELVIC MANIFESTATIONS, URETHRITIS, VAGINITIS, CYSTITIS, AND NEPHROTIC SYNDROME. MAY LEAD TO RENAL INSUFFICIENCY.\\n\\n(MANIFESTACIONES P\\u00c9LVICAS, URETRITIS, VAGINITIS, CISTITIS Y S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO. PUEDE CONDUCIR A INSUFICIENCIA RENAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS HERPES 5 (CYTOMEGALOVIRUS) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RENAL CALYX AND THE URETER ON THE SAME SIDE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INFECTIONS THAT AFFECT THE URINARY TRACT AND KIDNEY FILTRATION STRUCTURES. THE VIRUS CAN CAUSE CHRONIC INFLAMMATION IN THE PELVIC REGION, MANIFESTING AS PERSISTENT URINARY DISCOMFORT OR VAGINAL IRRITATION. BY STABILIZING THIS LOCALIZED CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, PROTECTING THE NEPHRONS, AND PREVENTING THE PROGRESSION TOWARD RENAL FAILURE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL HERPES 5 (CITOMEGALOVIRUS) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL C\\u00c1LIZ RENAL Y EL UR\\u00c9TER DEL MISMO LADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES QUE AFECTAN EL TRACTO URINARIO Y LAS ESTRUCTURAS DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EL VIRUS PUEDE CAUSAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA EN LA REGI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, MANIFEST\\u00c1NDOSE COMO MALESTAR URINARIO PERSISTENTE O IRRITACI\\u00d3N VAGINAL. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO LOCALIZADO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, PROTEGIENDO LAS NEFRONAS Y PREVINIENDO LA PROGRESI\\u00d3N HACIA LA INSUFICIENCIA RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY DIGESTIVE UPSET, SCAN THE [STOMACH \\/ DUODENUM] RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SYSTEMIC IMMUNODEFICIENCY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RECTUM \\/ THYMUS (REF 884) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE ELIMINATION OF VIRAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [EST\\u00d3MAGO \\/ DUODENO]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA INMUNODEFICIENCIA SIST\\u00c9MICA SEVERA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [RECTO \\/ TIMO] (REF 884). SIEMPRE MONITOREE LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/676','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:13:10','2026-04-29 01:13:10'),(4661,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',677,'{\"symptoms\":\"RENAL DISORDERS, STOMACH DISORDERS, SEXUAL DISORDERS, ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION. (TRASTORNOS RENALES, TRASTORNOS ESTOMACALES, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES, DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL.)\",\"paths\":\"INFERTILITY, SEXUAL DYSFUNCTIONS. (INFERTILIDAD, DISFUNCIONES SEXUALES)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"RENAL DISORDERS, STOMACH DISORDERS, SEXUAL DISORDERS, AND ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION.\\n\\n(TRASTORNOS RENALES, TRASTORNOS ESTOMACALES, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N ER\\u00c9CTIL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES SYSTEMIC TOXICITY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RENAL CAPSULE AND THE BLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR CLEARING ACCUMULATED TOXINS THAT INTERFERE WITH THE UROGENITAL SYSTEM. AN IMBALANCE HERE FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS DYSFUNCTIONS IN REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH, INCLUDING INFERTILITY AND SEXUAL DYSFUNCTION, AS THE ACCUMULATION OF RADICALS OR METABOLIC WASTE IN THE RENAL PROTECTIVE LAYER AFFECTS THE ENERGETIC FLOW TO THE PELVIC ORGANS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN PURIFYING THE RENAL SYSTEM, RESTORING SEXUAL VITALITY, AND BALANCING STOMACH-RELATED REFLEXES TIED TO TOXIC OVERLOAD.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL Y LA VEJIGA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ELIMINAR LAS TOXINAS ACUMULADAS QUE INTERFIEREN CON EL SISTEMA UROGENITAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO DISFUNCIONES EN LA SALUD REPRODUCTIVA, INCLUYENDO INFERTILIDAD Y DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL, YA QUE LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE RADICALES O DESECHOS METAB\\u00d3LICOS EN LA CAPA PROTECTORA RENAL AFECTA EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO HACIA LOS \\u00d3RGANOS P\\u00c9LVICOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A PURIFICAR EL SISTEMA RENAL, RESTAURANDO LA VITALIDAD SEXUAL Y EQUILIBRANDO LOS REFLEJOS ESTOMACALES VINCULADOS A LA SOBRECARGA T\\u00d3XICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY DISCOMFORT IS ACCOMPANIED BY PELVIC INFLAMMATION, SCAN THE RENAL CALYX \\/ URETER - SAME SIDE (REF 885) RESONANCE FOR CYTOMEGALOVIRUS. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE CHRONIC FATIGUE OR IMMUNE COLLAPSE, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RECTUM \\/ THYMUS (REF 884) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE ELIMINATION OF TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL MALESTAR URINARIO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00c1LIZ RENAL \\/ UR\\u00c9TER - MISMO LADO] (REF 885) PARA CITOMEGALOVIRUS. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA SEVERA O COLAPSO INMUNITARIO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [RECTO \\/ TIMO] (REF 884). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/677','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:14:08','2026-04-29 01:14:08'),(4662,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',678,'{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL INFECTIONS, DIARRHEA, UTI, PNEUMONIA, SEPSIS. (INFECCIONES INTESTINALES, DIARREA, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA, SEPSIS)\",\"paths\":\"HEPATITIS L, HEPATITIS M. (HEPATITIS L, HEPATITIS M)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"INTESTINAL INFECTIONS, DIARRHEA, URINARY TRACT INFECTION (UTI), PNEUMONIA, AND SEPSIS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES INTESTINALES, DIARREA, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, NEUMON\\u00cdA Y SEPSIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS ESCHERICHIA COLI BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE RENAL CAPSULE AND THE GALLBLADDER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SIGNIFICANT AS IT CONNECTS THE PROTECTIVE LAYER OF THE KIDNEYS WITH THE BILE STORAGE SYSTEM. AN IMBALANCE HERE CAN LEAD TO COMPLICATED GASTROINTESTINAL AND URINARY SYMPTOMS, AND IN SOME CASES, IT IS ASSOCIATED WITH HEPATITIS L AND HEPATITIS M. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE DIGESTIVE TRACT, AND PREVENTING THE SPREAD OF THE INFECTION TO THE PULMONARY OR CIRCULATORY SYSTEMS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA ESCHERICHIA COLI MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL Y LA VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY SIGNIFICATIVO YA QUE CONECTA LA CAPA PROTECTORA DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES CON EL SISTEMA DE ALMACENAMIENTO DE BILIS. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd PUEDE CONDUCIR A S\\u00cdNTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES Y URINARIOS COMPLICADOS, Y EN ALGUNOS CASOS, SE ASOCIA CON HEPATITIS L Y HEPATITIS M. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO Y PREVINIENDO LA PROPAGACI\\u00d3N DE LA INFECCI\\u00d3N HACIA LOS SISTEMAS PULMONAR O CIRCULATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS ARE PERSISTENT WITHOUT DIGESTIVE UPSET, SCAN THE RENAL CAPSULE \\/ BLADDER (REF 886) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE PELVIC INFLAMMATION OR REPRODUCTIVE ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RENAL CALYX \\/ URETER - SAME SIDE (REF 885) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT RENAL FILTRATION DURING BACTERIAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS SON PERSISTENTES SIN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 886). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA SEVERA O PROBLEMAS REPRODUCTIVOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [C\\u00c1LIZ RENAL \\/ UR\\u00c9TER - MISMO LADO] (REF 885). SIEMPRE MONITOREE LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/678','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:15:02','2026-04-29 01:15:02'),(4663,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',531,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":\"MOTHER DEPENDENCY (DEPENDENCIA MATERNA)\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"EMOTIONAL ATTACHMENT, ANXIETY RELATED TO MATERNAL BONDS, AND PELVIC CONGESTION.\\n\\n(APEGO EMOCIONAL, ANSIEDAD RELACIONADA CON V\\u00cdNCULOS MATERNOS Y CONGESTI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS COMPLEX RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE ENERGETIC AND EMOTIONAL THERAPY OF MOTHER DEPENDENCY BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE NAVAL AND THE UTERUS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY SYMBOLIC, REPRESENTING THE PRIMARY CONNECTION CREATED DURING GESTATION. AN IMBALANCE HERE FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS AN INABILITY TO ESTABLISH EMOTIONAL INDEPENDENCE OR PERSISTENT PSYCHOSOMATIC DISCOMFORT IN THE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM LINKED TO MATERNAL RELATIONSHIPS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN RELEASING EMBEDDED NEGATIVE MEMORIES OR CODES ASSOCIATED WITH THE UMBILICAL BOND, PROMOTING EMOTIONAL MATURITY AND ENERGETIC AUTONOMY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA COMPLEJA ABORDA LA TERAPIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA Y EMOCIONAL DE LA DEPENDENCIA MATERNA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL OMBLIGO Y EL \\u00daTERO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ALTAMENTE SIMB\\u00d3LICO, YA QUE REPRESENTA LA CONEXI\\u00d3N PRIMARIA CREADA DURANTE LA GESTACI\\u00d3N. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO UNA INCAPACIDAD PARA ESTABLECER UNA INDEPENDENCIA EMOCIONAL O MALESTAR PSICOSOM\\u00c1TICO PERSISTENTE EN EL SISTEMA REPRODUCTIVO VINCULADO A LAS RELACIONES MATERNAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A LIBERAR MEMORIAS O C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS ENQUISTADOS ASOCIADOS CON EL V\\u00cdNCULO UMBILICAL, PROMOVIENDO LA MADUREZ EMOCIONAL Y LA AUTONOM\\u00cdA ENERG\\u00c9TICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF PELVIC DISCOMFORT IS ACCOMPANIED BY URINARY ISSUES, SCAN THE RENAL CAPSULE \\/ BLADDER (REF 886) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP EMOTIONAL CRISIS OR SYSTEMIC ANXIETY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE VAGUS NERVE \\/ VAGUS NERVE (REF 863) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE ENERGETIC FLOW DURING THE RELEASE OF EMOTIONAL BLOCKS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL MALESTAR P\\u00c9LVICO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE PROBLEMAS URINARIOS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 886). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN UNA CRISIS EMOCIONAL PROFUNDA O ANSIEDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [NERVIO VAGO \\/ NERVIO VAGO] (REF 863). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL FLUJO ENERG\\u00c9TICO DURANTE LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE BLOQUEOS EMOCIONALES.)\\n\\n!\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/531','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:16:10','2026-04-29 01:16:10'),(4664,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',679,'{\"symptoms\":\"BUTTERFLY LIKE PIGMENTATION ON THE FACE. CHEST PAIN, CHILLS, FEVER, COUGH, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, HEADACHE, CONFUSION, ARRHYTHMIA, MUSCLE ACHES, PAINFUL URINATION. (PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N EN FORMA DE MARIPOSA EN LA CARA. DOLOR EN EL PECHO, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, FIEBRE, TOS, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, DOLOR DE CABEZA, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, ARRITMIA, DOLORES MUSCULARES, MICCI\\u00d3N DOLOROSA.)\",\"paths\":\"TRUE SYSTEMIC LUPUS ERYTHEMATOUS. RENAL DYSFUNCTION, PROTEINURIA, NEPHROTIC SYNDROME, RENAL FAILURE. (LUPUS ERITEMATOSO SIST\\u00c9MICO VERDADERO. DISFUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL, PROTEINURIA, S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - COSTAL              CHECK - MEDIASTINUM CHECK - SACRUM      CHECK - FIBULA (REVISAR - COSTAL              REVISAR - MEDIASTINO REVISAR - SACRO      REVISAR - PERON\\u00c9)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"BUTTERFLY-LIKE PIGMENTATION ON THE FACE. CHEST PAIN, CHILLS, FEVER, COUGH, SHORTNESS OF BREATH, HEADACHE, CONFUSION, ARRHYTHMIA, MUSCLE ACHES, AND PAINFUL URINATION.\\n\\n(PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N EN FORMA DE MARIPOSA EN LA CARA. DOLOR EN EL PECHO, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS, FIEBRE, TOS, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, DOLOR DE CABEZA, CONFUSI\\u00d3N, ARRITMIA, DOLORES MUSCULARES Y MICCI\\u00d3N DOLOROSA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS PROTEUS MIRABILIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE RENAL CAPSULES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL AS IT IS ASSOCIATED WITH \\\"TRUE\\\" SYSTEMIC LUPUS ERYTHEMATOSUS (SLE). THE PATHOGEN IMPACTS RENAL FILTRATION, OFTEN LEADING TO PROTEINURIA, NEPHROTIC SYNDROME, AND POTENTIAL RENAL FAILURE. BEYOND THE KIDNEYS, THE INFECTION MANIFESTS SYSTEMICALLY, CHARACTERIZED BY THE CLASSIC MALAR RASH (BUTTERFLY RASH) AND RESPIRATORY OR CARDIAC DISTRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING RENAL INTEGRITY, AND MITIGATING THE AUTOIMMUNE-LIKE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL PROTEUS MIRABILIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LAS C\\u00c1PSULAS RENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO YA QUE SE ASOCIA CON EL LUPUS ERITEMATOSO SIST\\u00c9MICO (LES) \\\"VERDADERO\\\". EL PAT\\u00d3GENO IMPACTA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL, LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A PROTEINURIA, S\\u00cdNDROME NEFR\\u00d3TICO Y POSIBLE INSUFICIENCIA RENAL. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS RI\\u00d1ONES, LA INFECCI\\u00d3N SE MANIFIESTA SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE, CARACTERIZADA POR LA CL\\u00c1SICA ERUPCI\\u00d3N MALAR (ERUPCI\\u00d3N EN MARIPOSA) Y DISTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO O CARD\\u00cdACO. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO LA INTEGRIDAD RENAL Y MITIGANDO LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA DE TIPO AUTOINMUNE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC LUPUS SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, ALSO CHECK THE [COSTAL \\/ COSTAL], [MEDIASTINUM \\/ MEDIASTINUM], [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM], AND [FIBULA \\/ FIBULA] RESONANCES. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE URINARY INFECTIONS WITHOUT SKIN PIGMENTATION, SCAN THE RENAL CAPSULE \\/ GALLBLADDER (REF 887) AXIS FOR E. COLI. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE OPTIMAL RENAL FUNCTION DURING THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LUPUS SIST\\u00c9MICO PRESENTES, TAMBI\\u00c9N REVISE LAS RESONANCIAS [COSTAL \\/ COSTAL], [MEDIASTINO \\/ MEDIASTINO], [SACRO \\/ SACRO] Y [PERON\\u00c9 \\/ PERON\\u00c9]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFECCIONES URINARIAS AGUDAS SIN PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, ESCANEE EL EJE [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR] (REF 887) PARA E. COLI. SIEMPRE MONITOREE LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR UNA FUNCI\\u00d3N RENAL \\u00d3PTIMA DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/679','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:17:11','2026-04-29 01:17:11'),(4665,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',680,'{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY AND SKIN INFECTIONS. (INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS Y CUT\\u00c1NEAS.)\",\"paths\":\"INFLAMMATION AND OBSTRUCTION OF THE COLON. VARICOSE VEINS. (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL COLON. V\\u00c1RICES.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK - ISCHIAL RAMUS (INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL COLON. V\\u00c1RICES.)\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"RESPIRATORY AND SKIN INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(INFECCIONES RESPIRATORIAS Y CUT\\u00c1NEAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS C BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE RETROAXILLARY REGION. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SIGNIFICANT FOR ITS SYSTEMIC EFFECTS ON BOTH THE VASCULAR AND DIGESTIVE SYSTEMS. AN IMBALANCE HERE FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS INFLAMMATION AND OBSTRUCTION OF THE COLON, INTERFERING WITH PROPER ELIMINATION. ADDITIONALLY, THE PATHOGEN\'S IMPACT ON VASCULAR INTEGRITY CAN LEAD TO THE DEVELOPMENT OF VARICOSE VEINS. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, RELIEVING INTESTINAL CONGESTION, AND SUPPORTING THE HEALTH OF THE VENOUS SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO C MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA REGI\\u00d3N RETROAXILAR. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES SIGNIFICATIVO POR SUS EFECTOS SIST\\u00c9MICOS TANTO EN EL SISTEMA VASCULAR COMO EN EL DIGESTIVO. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO INFLAMACI\\u00d3N Y OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N DEL COLON, INTERFIRIENDO CON EL PROCESO DE ELIMINACI\\u00d3N. ADEM\\u00c1S, EL IMPACTO DEL PAT\\u00d3GENO EN LA INTEGRIDAD VASCULAR PUEDE CONDUCIR AL DESARROLLO DE V\\u00c1RICES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ALIVIANDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y APOYANDO LA SALUD DEL SISTEMA VENOSO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF COLONIC INFLAMMATION PERSISTS WITH SEVERE ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT, SCAN THE [ISCHIAL RAMUS \\/ ISCHIAL RAMUS] RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC RESPIRATORY SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE ZYGOMATIC ARCH \\/ ZYGOMATIC ARCH (REF 876) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE CLEARANCE OF BACTERIAL TOXINS FROM THE CIRCULATORY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DEL COLON PERSISTE CON MALESTAR ABDOMINAL SEVERO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [RAMA ISQUI\\u00c1TICA \\/ RAMA ISQUI\\u00c1TICA]. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN S\\u00cdNTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS CR\\u00d3NICOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [ARCO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO \\/ ARCO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO] (REF 876). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DEL SISTEMA CIRCULATORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/680','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:18:08','2026-04-29 01:18:08'),(4666,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1267,'{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL CRAMPING, SEVERE DIARRHEA, GAS, LOSS OF APPETITE, VOMITING, FATIGUE FEVER.\",\"paths\":\"URINARY TRACT DISEASE, BLOODY DIARRHEA, GRAM NEGATIVE ROD SHAPED BACTERIUM, INTESTINAL INFECTIONS, KIDNEY FAILURE, RESPIRATORY ILNESS, PNEUMONIA, MENINGITIS. CAUSED BY CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH: CECUM\\/SIGMIOD\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"ABDOMINAL CRAMPING, SEVERE DIARRHEA (SOMETIMES BLOODY), GAS, LOSS OF APPETITE, VOMITING, FATIGUE, AND FEVER.\\n\\n(C\\u00d3LICOS ABDOMINALES, DIARREA SEVERA (A VECES SANGUINOLENTA), GASES, P\\u00c9RDIDA DE APETITO, V\\u00d3MITOS, FATIGA Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS BACTERIUM COLI (E. COLI) BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE HORIZONTAL AXIS OF THE LIVER. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN\\u2014OFTEN CONTRACTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED FOOD OR WATER\\u2014IS A GRAM-NEGATIVE ROD THAT PRIMARILY IMPACTS THE INTESTINAL TRACT BUT CAN SPREAD SYSTEMICALLY. THE DISTORTION IN THE LIVER\'S MAGNETIC FIELD CAN LEAD TO COMPLICATIONS BEYOND DIGESTIVE UPSET, INCLUDING URINARY TRACT DISEASES, RESPIRATORY ILLNESSES LIKE PNEUMONIA, AND IN SEVERE CASES, KIDNEY FAILURE OR MENINGITIS. BY STABILIZING THIS HORIZONTAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD AND PREVENTING THE PATHOGEN FROM COMPROMISING HEPATIC AND RENAL FILTRATION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA BACTERIUM COLI (E. COLI) MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH A LO LARGO DEL EJE HORIZONTAL DEL H\\u00cdGADO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO \\u2014A MENUDO CONTRA\\u00cdDO POR AGUA O ALIMENTOS CONTAMINADOS\\u2014 ES UN BACILO GRAMNEGATIVO QUE IMPACTA PRINCIPALMENTE EL TRACTO INTESTINAL PERO PUEDE PROPAGARSE SIST\\u00c9MICAMENTE. LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N EN EL CAMPO MAGN\\u00c9TICO DEL H\\u00cdGADO PUEDE CONDUCIR A COMPLICACIONES M\\u00c1S \\u00c1LLE DEL MALESTAR DIGESTIVO, INCLUYENDO ENFERMEDADES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, ENFERMEDADES RESPIRATORIAS COMO NEUMON\\u00cdA Y, EN CASOS GRAVES, INSUFICIENCIA RENAL O MENINGITIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO HORIZONTAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA Y EVITAR QUE EL PAT\\u00d3GENO COMPROMETA LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N HEP\\u00c1TICA Y RENAL.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: THIS RESONANCE IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE [CECUM \\/ SIGMOID] AXIS; IF INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION IS SEVERE, SCAN THIS PAIR. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE RENAL STRESS OR TOXICITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RENAL CAPSULE \\/ GALLBLADDER (REF 887) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL ENDOTOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL EJE [CIEGO \\/ SIGMOIDES]; SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL ES SEVERA, ESCANEE ESTE PAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S RENAL AGUDO O TOXICIDAD, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ VES\\u00cdCULA BILIAR] (REF 887). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE ENDOTOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1267','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:20:29','2026-04-29 01:20:29'),(4667,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1268,'{\"symptoms\":\"GREASY STOOL, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA, STOMACH CRAMPS, GAS, DEHYDRATION.\",\"paths\":\"CAUSED BY CONTAMINATED WATER, FOOD, SOIL, BLOOD, SEXUAL CONTACT AND INSECTS. DIGESTIVE PROBLEMS, CHRONIC FATIGUE, ACNE, RASH, ANEMIA, SLEEP PROBLEM, MUSCLE CRAMPS, ALLERGIES AND HEADACHES.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"ASSOCIATED WITH: LIVER R\\/LIVER L - HORIZONTAL\"}','{\"symptoms\":\"GREASY STOOL, DIARRHEA, NAUSEA, STOMACH CRAMPS, GAS, AND DEHYDRATION. MAY ALSO CAUSE CHRONIC FATIGUE, ACNE, RASHES, ANEMIA, SLEEP PROBLEMS, MUSCLE CRAMPS, ALLERGIES, AND HEADACHES.\\n\\n(HECES GRASIENTAS, DIARREA, N\\u00c1USEAS, C\\u00d3LICOS ESTOMACALES, GASES Y DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N. TAMBI\\u00c9N PUEDE CAUSAR FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA, ACN\\u00c9, ERUPCIONES, ANEMIA, PROBLEMAS DE SUE\\u00d1O, CALAMBRES MUSCULARES, ALERGIAS Y DOLORES DE CABEZA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS PROTOZOANS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CECUM (THE BEGINNING OF THE LARGE INTESTINE) AND THE SIGMOID COLON (THE FINAL SECTION BEFORE THE RECTUM). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING INFECTIONS OFTEN CONTRACTED THROUGH CONTAMINATED WATER, FOOD, SOIL, OR BLOOD. THESE MICROORGANISMS DISRUPT NUTRIENT ABSORPTION AND WASTE ELIMINATION, LEADING TO THE CHARACTERISTIC \\\"GREASY\\\" STOOL AND SYSTEMIC TOXICITY. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN ELIMINATING THE PARASITIC LOAD, REDUCING INTESTINAL INFLAMMATION, AND RESOLVING SECONDARY SYMPTOMS LIKE SKIN RASHES AND MUSCLE CRAMPS LINKED TO MALABSORPTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE A LOS PROTOZOOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CIEGO (EL COMIENZO DEL INTESTINO GRUESO) Y EL COLON SIGMOIDES (LA SECCI\\u00d3N FINAL ANTES DEL RECTO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES A MENUDO CONTRA\\u00cdDAS A TRAV\\u00c9S DE AGUA, ALIMENTOS, SUELO O SANGRE CONTAMINADOS. ESTOS MICROORGANISMOS ALTERAN LA ABSORCI\\u00d3N DE NUTRIENTES Y LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE DESECHOS, LO QUE CONDUCE A LAS CARACTER\\u00cdSTICAS HECES \\\"GRASIENTAS\\\" Y A LA TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A ELIMINAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N INTESTINAL Y RESOLVIENDO S\\u00cdNTOMAS SECUNDARIOS COMO ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS Y CALAMBRES MUSCULARES VINCULADOS A LA MALA ABSORCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: THIS RESONANCE IS FREQUENTLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE LIVER R \\/ LIVER L - HORIZONTAL (REF 899) AXIS; IF HEPATIC STRESS OR SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS IS PRESENT, SCAN THIS PAIR. FOR CASES INVOLVING ACUTE RECTAL IRRITATION OR HEMORRHOIDS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RECTUM \\/ RECTUM (REF 883) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PREVENT DEHYDRATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF PARASITIC TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: ESTA RESONANCIA SE ASOCIA FRECUENTEMENTE CON EL EJE [H\\u00cdGADO R \\/ H\\u00cdGADO L - HORIZONTAL] (REF 899); SI HAY ESTR\\u00c9S HEP\\u00c1TICO O MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO, ESCANEE ESTE PAR. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN IRRITACI\\u00d3N RECTAL AGUDA O HEMORROIDES, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [RECTO \\/ RECTO] (REF 883). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PREVENIR LA DESHIDRATACI\\u00d3N DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS PARASITARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1268','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:21:36','2026-04-29 01:21:36'),(4668,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1269,'{\"origins\":\"CORYNEBACTERIUM\",\"symptoms\":\"SPREAD BY AIRBORNE DROPLETS, CONTAMINATED PERSONAL ITEMS OR TOUCHING AN INFECTED WOUND. SORE THROAT, HOARSENESS, SWOLLEN GLANDS IN NECK, DIFFICULT BREATHING, NASAL DISCHARGE, FEVER, CHILLS, MALAISE.\",\"paths\":\"DIPHTHERIA, BREATHING PROBLEMS, OBSTRUCTED BREATHING, HEART DAMAGE, NERVE DAMAGE PRODUCED FROM THE TOXIN, PARALYZED.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"CORYNEBACTERIUM (DIPHTHERIA)\",\"symptoms\":\"SORE THROAT, HOARSENESS, SWOLLEN GLANDS IN THE NECK, DIFFICULTY BREATHING, NASAL DISCHARGE, FEVER, CHILLS, AND MALAISE.\\n\\n(DOLOR DE GARGANTA, RONQUERA, GL\\u00c1NDULAS INFLAMADAS EN EL CUELLO, DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR, SECRECI\\u00d3N NASAL, FIEBRE, ESCALOFR\\u00cdOS Y MALESTAR GENERAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS CORYNEBACTERIUM DIPHTHERIAE BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE SPLEEN. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS VERTICAL AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR ADDRESSING PATHOGENS SPREAD THROUGH AIRBORNE DROPLETS OR CONTAMINATED ITEMS. THE TOXIN PRODUCED BY THIS BACTERIA CAN LEAD TO OBSTRUCTED BREATHING DUE TO THE FORMATION OF A THICK GRAY COATING IN THE THROAT. BEYOND RESPIRATORY DISTRESS, THE PATHOGEN POSES A SEVERE RISK TO THE VASCULAR AND NERVOUS SYSTEMS, POTENTIALLY CAUSING HEART DAMAGE, NERVE DAMAGE, AND PARALYSIS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING CARDIAC TISSUE, AND CLEARING RESPIRATORY OBSTRUCTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL CORYNEBACTERIUM DIPHTHERIAE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL BAZO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE VERTICAL ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA ABORDAR PAT\\u00d3GENOS PROPAGADOS A TRAV\\u00c9S DE GOTITAS EN EL AIRE O ART\\u00cdCULOS CONTAMINADOS. LA TOXINA PRODUCIDA POR ESTA BACTERIA PUEDE PROVOCAR UNA OBSTRUCCI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA DEBIDO A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE UNA CAPA GRIS ESPESA EN LA GARGANTA. M\\u00c1S \\u00c1LLE DEL MALESTAR RESPIRATORIO, EL PAT\\u00d3GENO REPRESENTA UN RIESGO GRAVE PARA LOS SISTEMAS VASCULAR Y NERVIOSO, CAUSANDO POTENCIALMENTE DA\\u00d1O CARD\\u00cdACO, DA\\u00d1O NERVIOSO Y PAR\\u00c1LISIS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO EL TEJIDO CARD\\u00cdACO Y ELIMINANDO LAS OBSTRUCCIONES RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC FEVER IS ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE JOINT PAIN OR MALARIA-LIKE SYMPTOMS, SCAN THE ZYGOMATIC BONE \\/ KIDNEY - OPPOSITE SIDE (REF 877) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE RESPIRATORY INFLAMMATION OR COPD, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE ZYGOMATIC ARCH \\/ ZYGOMATIC ARCH (REF 876) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS FROM THE BLOODSTREAM.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA FIEBRE SIST\\u00c9MICA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO O S\\u00cdNTOMAS SIMILARES A LA MALARIA, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [HUESO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N - LADO OPUESTO] (REF 877). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA SEVERA O EPOC, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [ARCO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO \\/ ARCO CIGOM\\u00c1TICO] (REF 876). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS DEL TORRENTE SANGU\\u00cdNEO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1269','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 01:22:55','2026-04-29 01:22:55'),(4669,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1271,'{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN RASH, FEVER, SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES, BLURRED VISION, EYE IRRUPTION, BONE PAIN, PAIN IN SOLES OF FEET, HEAD ACHES.\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY INSECT BITES, CHRONIC INFECTION, SMALL BLOOD VESSEL DISEASE, DEPRESSION, NEUROLOGICAL PROBLEMS, UNEXPLAINED COUGHING, ENDOCARDITIS, UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTIONS, A COMMON LYME DISEASE COINFECTION.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"SKIN RASH, FEVER, SWOLLEN LYMPH NODES, BLURRED VISION, EYE IRRUPTION, BONE PAIN, PAIN IN SOLES OF FEET, AND HEADACHES.\\n\\n(ERUPCI\\u00d3N CUT\\u00c1NEA, FIEBRE, GANGLIOS LINF\\u00c1TICOS INFLAMADOS, VISI\\u00d3N BORROSA, IRRITACI\\u00d3N OCULAR, DOLOR \\u00d3SEO, DOLOR EN LAS PLANTAS DE LOS PIES Y DOLORES DE CABEZA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS BARTONELLA VINSONII BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE SITE OF SCARS OR PREVIOUS TISSUE INJURIES. IN BIOMAGNETISM, SCARS CAN ACT AS ENERGETIC INTERFERENCE FIELDS OR RESERVOIRS FOR CHRONIC INFECTIONS. THIS PATHOGEN, OFTEN TRANSMITTED BY INSECT BITES, IS A COMMON CO-INFECTION OF LYME DISEASE AND CAN LEAD TO SMALL BLOOD VESSEL DISEASE, ENDOCARDITIS, AND NEUROLOGICAL ISSUES SUCH AS DEPRESSION. BY STABILIZING THE MAGNETIC FIELD AT THESE POINTS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, CLEARING UNEXPLAINED COUGHING, AND RESOLVING UROGENITAL DYSFUNCTIONS ASSOCIATED WITH THE INFECTION.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA BARTONELLA VINSONII MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL SITIO DE LAS CICATRICES O LESIONES TISULARES PREVIAS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, LAS CICATRICES PUEDEN ACTUAR COMO CAMPOS DE INTERFERENCIA ENERG\\u00c9TICA O RESERVORIOS PARA INFECCIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS. ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO, A MENUDO TRANSMITIDO POR PICADURAS DE INSECTOS, ES UNA COINFECCI\\u00d3N COM\\u00daN DE LA ENFERMEDAD DE LYME Y PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA ENFERMEDAD DE LOS VASOS SANGU\\u00cdNEOS PEQUE\\u00d1OS, ENDOCARDITIS Y PROBLEMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS COMO LA DEPRESI\\u00d3N. AL ESTABILIZAR EL CAMPO MAGN\\u00c9TICO EN ESTOS PUNTOS, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ELIMINANDO LA TOS INEXPLICABLE Y RESOLVIENDO LAS DISFUNCIONES UROGENITALES ASOCIADAS CON LA INFECCI\\u00d3N.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS OR CHRONIC FATIGUE PERSIST, SCAN THE SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN (VERTICAL) (REF 901) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SKIN MANIFESTATIONS OR RINGWORM-LIKE RASHES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RADIUS \\/ RADIUS (REF 881) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING THE CLEARANCE OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS O LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA PERSISTEN, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [BAZO \\/ BAZO (VERTICAL)] (REF 901). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MANIFESTACIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS SEVERAS O ERUPCIONES TIPO TI\\u00d1A, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [RADIO \\/ RADIO] (REF 881). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1271','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 03:55:12','2026-04-29 03:55:12'),(4670,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1273,'{\"symptoms\":\"PRIDE\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PRIDE, ARROGANCE, AND EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY.\\n\\n(ORGULLO, ARROGANCIA Y RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS EMOTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES THE DISTORTION OF \\\"PRIDE\\\" BY NEUTRALIZING PH IMBALANCES BETWEEN THE THYROID GLAND AND THE HEART. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS REPRESENTS THE BRIDGE BETWEEN COMMUNICATION (THYROID) AND FEELING (HEART). AN IMBALANCE HERE FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS AN OVERBEARING ATTITUDE, ARROGANCE, OR A PROTECTIVE SHIELD OF PRIDE THAT MASKS DEEPER VULNERABILITIES. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE INDIVIDUAL IN DISSOLVING EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY, PROMOTING HUMILITY, AND ALIGNING VERBAL EXPRESSION WITH GENUINE EMOTIONAL TRUTH. IT HELPS SOFTEN THE \\\"EMOTIONAL ARMOR\\\" THAT OFTEN LEADS TO SOCIAL ISOLATION OR STREINED RELATIONSHIPS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA EMOCIONAL ABORDA LA DISTORSI\\u00d3N DEL \\\"ORGULLO\\\" MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA TIROIDES Y EL CORAZ\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE REPRESENTA EL PUENTE ENTRE LA COMUNICACI\\u00d3N (TIROIDES) Y EL SENTIMIENTO (CORAZ\\u00d3N). UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO UNA ACTITUD DOMINANTE, ARROGANCIA O UN ESCUDO PROTECTOR DE ORGULLO QUE ENMASCARA VULNERABILIDADES M\\u00c1S PROFUNDAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL INDIVIDUO A DISOLVER LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL, PROMOVIENDO LA HUMILDAD Y ALINEANDO LA EXPRESI\\u00d3N VERBAL CON LA VERDAD EMOCIONAL GENUINA. AYUDA A SUAVIZAR LA \\\"ARMADURA EMOCIONAL\\\" QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE AL AISLAMIENTO SOCIAL O A RELACIONES TENSAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF EMOTIONAL RIGIDITY IS ACCOMPANIED BY PHYSICAL EXHAUSTION, SCAN THE RING FINGER \\/ RING FINGER (REF 882) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP-SEATED ANXIETY OR MATERNAL BOND ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE NAVAL \\/ UTERUS (REF 888) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ENERGETIC RELEASE OF EMBEDDED NEGATIVE CODES.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA RIGIDEZ EMOCIONAL SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE AGOTAMIENTO F\\u00cdSICO, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [DEDO ANULAR \\/ DEDO ANULAR] (REF 882). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ANSIEDAD PROFUNDA O PROBLEMAS DE V\\u00cdNCULO MATERNO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [OMBLIGO \\/ \\u00daTERO] (REF 888). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA LIBERACI\\u00d3N ENERG\\u00c9TICA DE C\\u00d3DIGOS NEGATIVOS ENQUISTADOS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1273','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 03:57:39','2026-04-29 03:57:39'),(4671,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1275,'{\"origins\":null,\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE BRONCHI TISSUES WITH RELEASE OF INFLAMMATORY REACTION IN THE AIRWAY.\",\"paths\":\"RESPIRATORY DISTRESS\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"origins\":\"RESPIRATORY SYSTEM (SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLAMMATION OF THE BRONCHI TISSUES WITH RELEASE OF INFLAMMATORY REACTION IN THE AIRWAY.\\n\\n(INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LOS TEJIDOS BRONQUIALES CON LIBERACI\\u00d3N DE REACCI\\u00d3N INFLAMATORIA EN LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES RESPIRATORY DISTRESS BY NEUTRALIZING PH IMBALANCES BETWEEN THE ADRENAL GLANDS AND THE FRONT TORSO. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE BODY\'S INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE, PARTICULARLY WITHIN THE BRONCHIAL TREE. AN IMBALANCE HERE OFTEN MANIFESTS AS AN OVERACTIVE IMMUNE REACTION IN THE AIRWAYS, LEADING TO CONSTRICTION AND DIFFICULTY BREATHING. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN MODULATING CORTISOL LEVELS AND REDUCING THE LOCALIZED INFLAMMATION OF BRONCHIAL TISSUES, THEREBY RESTORING PROPER AIRFLOW AND CALMING THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA EL DISTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS DE PH ENTRE LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES Y EL TORSO FRONTAL. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA DEL CUERPO, PARTICULARMENTE DENTRO DEL \\u00c1RBOL BRONQUIAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO UNA REACCI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA EXCESIVA EN LAS V\\u00cdAS RESPIRATORIAS, LO QUE PROVOCA CONSTRICCI\\u00d3N Y DIFICULTAD PARA RESPIRAR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A MODULAR LOS NIVELES DE CORTISOL Y REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N LOCALIZADA DE LOS TEJIDOS BRONQUIALES, RESTAURANDO AS\\u00cd EL FLUJO DE AIRE ADECUADO Y CALMANDO EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY INFLAMMATION IS ACCOMPANIED BY SEVERE COUGHING OR SKIN RASHES, SCAN THE SCAR \\/ SCAR (REF 902) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING CHRONIC HOARSENESS OR GLANDULAR SWELLING IN THE NECK, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE SPLEEN \\/ SPLEEN (VERTICAL) (REF 901) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO SUPPORT THE ADRENAL GLANDS DURING THE MODULATION OF THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE TOS SEVERA O ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [CICATRIZ \\/ CICATRIZ] (REF 902). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN RONQUERA CR\\u00d3NICA O INFLAMACI\\u00d3N GLANDULAR EN EL CUELLO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [BAZO \\/ BAZO (VERTICAL)] (REF 901). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DURANTE LA MODULACI\\u00d3N DE LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1275','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 03:59:03','2026-04-29 03:59:03'),(4672,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1276,'{\"symptoms\":null,\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"ASYMPTOMATIC CARRIER STATE, POTENTIAL FOR RECURRING INFECTIONS, AND GENERAL IMMUNE FLUCTUATION.\\n\\n(ESTADO DE PORTADOR ASINTOM\\u00c1TICO, POTENCIAL DE INFECCIONES RECURRENTES Y FLUCTUACI\\u00d3N INMUNITARIA GENERAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS RESERVOIR RESONANCE TARGETS THE ACCUMULATION OF VARIOUS PATHOGENS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE ADRENAL GLAND AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, A \\\"UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR\\\" IS A CRITICAL SCANNING POINT BECAUSE IT CAN HOUSE BACTERIA, VIRUSES, PARASITES, OR FUNGI THAT ARE NOT CURRENTLY ACTIVE BUT HAVE THE POTENTIAL TO TRIGGER A RE-INFECTION OR PREVENT THE TOTAL CLEARANCE OF OTHER PATHOGENS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN EXPOSING THESE \\\"HIDDEN\\\" MICROORGANISMS TO THE IMMUNE SYSTEM, ENSURING THAT ONGOING TREATMENTS ARE MORE EFFECTIVE AND PREVENTING THE PATHOGENS FROM MIGRATING TO OTHER WEAKENED ORGANS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DE RESERVORIO SE DIRIGE A LA ACUMULACI\\u00d3N DE DIVERSOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA GL\\u00c1NDULA SUPRARRENAL Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, UN \\\"RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL\\\" ES UN PUNTO DE ESCANEO CR\\u00cdTICO PORQUE PUEDE ALBERGAR BACTERIAS, VIRUS, PAR\\u00c1SITOS O HONGOS QUE NO EST\\u00c1N ACTIVOS EN ESE MOMENTO PERO QUE TIENEN EL POTENCIAL DE DESENCADENAR UNA REINFECCI\\u00d3N O EVITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N TOTAL DE OTROS PAT\\u00d3GENOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A EXPONER ESTOS MICROORGANISMOS \\\"OCULTOS\\\" AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO, ASEGURANDO QUE LOS TRATAMIENTOS EN CURSO SEAN M\\u00c1S EFECTIVOS Y EVITANDO QUE LOS PAT\\u00d3GENOS MIGRAN A OTROS \\u00d3RGANOS DEBILITADOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY INFLAMMATION IS THE PRIMARY CONCERN, SCAN THE ADRENAL \\/ FRONT TORSO (REF 904) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SYSTEMIC TOXICITY OR SEXUAL DYSFUNCTION, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RENAL CAPSULE \\/ BLADDER (REF 886) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE PRIMARY FILTRATION PATHWAY WHILE CLEARING THE RESERVOIR.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA ES LA PREOCUPACI\\u00d3N PRINCIPAL, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [SUPRARRENAL \\/ TORSO FRONTAL] (REF 904). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN TOXICIDAD SIST\\u00c9MICA O DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 886). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LA V\\u00cdA DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N PRIMARIA MIENTRAS SE DEPURA EL RESERVORIO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1276','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:00:01','2026-04-29 04:00:01'),(4673,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1277,'{\"name\":\"APPENDIX\\/TONGUE\",\"origins\":\"SMALLPOX\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, RASH AND FATIGUE.\\nVERY CONTAGIOUS.\",\"paths\":\"ATOPIC DERMATITIS, ACNE, COLD SORES, APPENDICITIS.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"APPENDIX (AP\\u00c9NDICE) \\/ TONGUE (LENGUA)\",\"origins\":\"SMALLPOX (VIRUELA)\",\"symptoms\":\"FEVER, RASH, AND FATIGUE. VERY CONTAGIOUS.\\n\\n(FIEBRE, ERUPCI\\u00d3N Y FATIGA. MUY CONTAGIOSO.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE SMALLPOX VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE APPENDIX AND THE TONGUE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY RELEVANT FOR ADDRESSING DERMATOLOGICAL MANIFESTATIONS SUCH AS ATOPIC DERMATITIS, ACNE, AND COLD SORES. THE IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT IS OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH APPENDICITIS, AS THE VIRAL LOAD CAN TRIGGER INFLAMMATION IN THE LOWER DIGESTIVE TRACT. BY STABILIZING THIS PATHWAY, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL IMPACT ON THE SKIN AND MUCOUS MEMBRANES, REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION AND MITIGATING THE RISK OF ACUTE APPENDICULAR DISTRESS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE LA VIRUELA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL AP\\u00c9NDICE Y LA LENGUA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY RELEVANTE PARA ABORDAR MANIFESTACIONES DERMATOL\\u00d3GICAS COMO DERMATITIS AT\\u00d3PICA, ACN\\u00c9 Y HERPES LABIAL. EL DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO SE ASOCIA A MENUDO CON LA APENDICITIS, YA QUE LA CARGA VIRAL PUEDE DESENCADENAR INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN EL TRACTO DIGESTIVO INFERIOR. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTA V\\u00cdA, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A NEUTRALIZAR EL IMPACTO VIRAL EN LA PIEL Y LAS MEMBRANAS MUCOSAS, REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA Y MITIGANDO EL RIESGO DE MALESTAR APENDICULAR AGUDO.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF THROAT SYMPTOMS OR FEVER PERSIST, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL 3 \\/ CERVICAL 3 (REF 138) AXIS TO RULE OUT AGGRESSIVE BACTERIAL CO-INFECTIONS LIKE STREPTOCOCCUS B. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE SKIN RASHES OR RINGWORM-LIKE IRRITATION, SCAN THE RADIUS \\/ RADIUS (REF 881) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE GARGANTA O LA FIEBRE PERSISTEN, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [CERVICAL 3 \\/ CERVICAL 3] (REF 138) PARA DESCARTAR COINFECCIONES BACTERIANAS AGRESIVAS COMO ESTREPTOCOCO B. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS SEVERAS O IRRITACI\\u00d3N TIPO TI\\u00d1A, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [RADIO \\/ RADIO] (REF 881). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1277','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:01:55','2026-04-29 04:01:55'),(4674,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1278,'{\"name\":\"BACK OF HAND\\/BACK OFHAND (OPP)\",\"symptoms\":\"RED PIGMENTATIONS ON THE FACE (BUTTERFLY SHAPED), URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS, HIGH LEVELS OF UREASE IN URINE. CHRONIC FATIGUE.\",\"paths\":\"SYSTEMIC LUPUS, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS. MAYBE TRANSMITTED SEXUAL CONTACT.\",\"alternative_routes\":\"CHECK: COCCYX\\/COCCYX\\nIF ASSOCIATED WITH: SACRUM - CHRONIC UTI\'S\\nMEDIASTINUM - MEDIASTINITIS AND PULMONARY INSUFFICIENCY.\\nCOMBINED WITH OTHER VIRUS: FAKE HIV-SIDA\"}','{\"name\":\"BACK OF HAND (DORSO DE LA MANO) \\/ BACK OF HAND - OPPOSITE (DORSO DE LA MANO - OPUESTO\",\"symptoms\":\"RED PIGMENTATION ON THE FACE (BUTTERFLY SHAPE), URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTIs), HIGH LEVELS OF UREASE IN URINE, AND CHRONIC FATIGUE.\\n\\n(PIGMENTACI\\u00d3N ROJA EN LA CARA (EN FORMA DE MARIPOSA), INFECCIONES DEL TRACTO URINARIO, NIVELES ALTOS DE UREASA EN LA ORINA Y FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS PROTEUS MIRABILIS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS ACROSS THE BACKS OF THE HANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS STRONGLY ASSOCIATED WITH SYSTEMIC LUPUS ERYTHEMATOSUS (SLE), CHARACTERIZED BY THE CLASSIC MALAR OR \\\"BUTTERFLY\\\" RASH ON THE FACE. BEYOND DERMATOLOGICAL SIGNS, IT FREQUENTLY CAUSES PERSISTENT URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS DUE TO ITS ABILITY TO PRODUCE UREASE, WHICH CAN LEAD TO THE FORMATION OF KIDNEY STONES. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING THE URINARY SYSTEM, AND MITIGATING THE INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE THAT CONTRIBUTES TO CHRONIC FATIGUE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL PROTEUS MIRABILIS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN EL DORSO DE LAS MANOS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO EST\\u00c1 FUERTEMENTE ASOCIADO CON EL LUPUS ERITEMATOSO SIST\\u00c9MICO (LES), CARACTERIZADO POR LA CL\\u00c1SICA ERUPCI\\u00d3N MALAR O EN \\\"MARIPOSA\\\" EN LA CARA. M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE LOS SIGNOS DERMATOL\\u00d3GICOS, CON FRECUENCIA CAUSA INFECCIONES PERSISTENTES DEL TRACTO URINARIO DEBIDO A SU CAPACIDAD PARA PRODUCIR UREASA, LO QUE PUEDE CONDUCIR A LA FORMACI\\u00d3N DE C\\u00c1LCULOS RENALES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO EL SISTEMA URINARIO Y MITIGANDO LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA QUE CONTRIBUYE A LA FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC LUPUS SYMPTOMS ARE PRESENT, ALSO CHECK THE RENAL CAPSULE \\/ RENAL CAPSULE (REF 889) RESONANCE. FOR CHRONIC UTIs, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE [SACRUM \\/ SACRUM] OR [COCCYX \\/ COCCYX] AXES. IF PULMONARY INSUFFICIENCY OR MEDIASTINITIS IS SUSPECTED, SCAN THE [MEDIASTINUM \\/ MEDIASTINUM] RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND SUPPORT THE ELIMINATION OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LUPUS SIST\\u00c9MICO PRESENTES, TAMBI\\u00c9N REVISE LA RESONANCIA [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL] (REF 889). PARA ITUs CR\\u00d3NICAS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LOS EJES [SACRO \\/ SACRO] O [COCCIX \\/ COCCIX]. SI SE SOSPECHA INSUFICIENCIA PULMONAR O MEDIASTINITIS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [MEDIASTINO \\/ MEDIASTINO]. SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y APOYAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1278','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:03:16','2026-04-29 04:03:16'),(4675,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1279,'{\"name\":\"CEREBELLUM\\/MEDULLA\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLUENZA AND CONJUNCTIVITIS, DIZZINESS, AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR, RESPIRATORY DISORDERS.\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY BIRDS.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"CEREBELLUM (CEREBELO) \\/ MEDULLA (M\\u00c9DULA)\",\"symptoms\":\"INFLUENZA, CONJUNCTIVITIS, DIZZINESS, AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR, AND RESPIRATORY DISORDERS.\\n\\n(INFLUENZA, CONJUNTIVITIS, MAREOS, COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO Y TRASTORNOS RESPIRATORIOS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS VIRAL RESONANCE TARGETS THE NEWCASTLE VIRUS BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CEREBELLUM AND THE MEDULLA OBLONGATA. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN IS TYPICALLY TRANSMITTED BY BIRDS AND CAN HAVE A PROFOUND IMPACT ON BOTH THE RESPIRATORY AND CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEMS. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CRITICAL HINDBRAIN AXIS FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS, INCLUDING DIZZINESS AND UNCHARACTERISTIC AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR, ALONGSIDE FLU-LIKE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE VIRAL LOAD, CLEARING OCULAR IRRITATION (CONJUNCTIVITIS), AND RESTORING BALANCE TO THE AUTONOMIC AND MOTOR CONTROL CENTERS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA VIRAL SE DIRIGE AL VIRUS DE NEWCASTLE MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CEREBELO Y LA M\\u00c9DULA OBLONGADA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO SE TRANSMITE T\\u00cdPICAMENTE POR AVES Y PUEDE TENER UN IMPACTO PROFUNDO TANTO EN EL SISTEMA RESPIRATORIO COMO EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO CENTRAL. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE EJE CR\\u00cdTICO DEL ROMBENC\\u00c9FALO SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS, INCLUYENDO MAREOS Y COMPORTAMIENTO AGRESIVO INUSUAL, JUNTO CON DISTR\\u00c9S RESPIRATORIO TIPO INFLUENZA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA VIRAL, ELIMINANDO LA IRRITACI\\u00d3N OCULAR (CONJUNTIVITIS) Y RESTAURANDO EL EQUILIBRIO EN LOS CENTROS DE CONTROL AUT\\u00d3NOMO Y MOTOR.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF RESPIRATORY INFLAMMATION IS THE DOMINANT SYMPTOM, SCAN THE ADRENAL \\/ FRONT TORSO (REF 904) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIZZINESS TIED TO INNER EAR ISSUES, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RADIUS \\/ RADIUS (REF 881) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE NERVOUS SYSTEM DURING VIRAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N RESPIRATORIA ES EL S\\u00cdNTOMA DOMINANTE, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [SUPRARRENAL \\/ TORSO FRONTAL] (REF 904). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MAREOS SEVEROS VINCULADOS A PROBLEMAS DEL O\\u00cdDO INTERNO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [RADIO \\/ RADIO] (REF 881). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N VIRAL.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1279','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:04:33','2026-04-29 04:04:33'),(4676,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1281,'{\"name\":\"CERVICAL 7\\/THORACIC 1\",\"symptoms\":\"TENNIS ELBOW, EPICONDILITIS, NECK PAIN, BURSITIS,\",\"paths\":\"CAUSED BY REPETITION\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"CERVICAL 7 \\/ THORACIC 1 (CERVICAL 7 \\/ TOR\\u00c1CICA 1)\",\"symptoms\":\"TENNIS ELBOW, EPICONDYLITIS, NECK PAIN, AND BURSITIS.\\n\\n(CODO DE TENISTA, EPICONDILITIS, DOLOR DE CUELLO Y BURSITIS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS SPECIAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES MUSCULOSKELETAL INFLAMMATION CAUSED BY REPETITIVE STRAIN BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS AT THE JUNCTION OF THE CERVICAL AND THORACIC SPINE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS CRITICAL FOR REGULATING THE NERVE IMPULSES AND BLOOD FLOW EXTENDING TO THE UPPER EXTREMITIES. AN IMBALANCE HERE FREQUENTLY MANIFESTS AS LOCALIZED PAIN IN THE ELBOW OR SHOULDER, OFTEN RESULTING FROM OVERUSE OR POOR POSTURE THAT COMPRESSES THE CERVICOTHORACIC TRANSITION. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN REDUCING INFLAMMATION IN THE TENDONS AND BURSAE, RELIEVING CHRONIC NECK TENSION, AND RESTORING MOBILITY TO THE ARMS AND HANDS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA ESPECIAL ABORDA LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICA CAUSADA POR EL ESFUERZO REPETITIVO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH EN LA UNI\\u00d3N DE LA COLUMNA CERVICAL Y TOR\\u00c1CICA. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES CR\\u00cdTICO PARA REGULAR LOS IMPULSOS NERVIOSOS Y EL FLUJO SANGU\\u00cdNEO QUE SE EXTIENDE HACIA LAS EXTREMIDADES SUPERIORES. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd SE MANIFIESTA CON FRECUENCIA COMO DOLOR LOCALIZADO EN EL CODO O EL HOMBRO, A MENUDO RESULTADO DEL USO EXCESIVO O UNA MALA POSTURA QUE COMPRIME LA TRANSICI\\u00d3N CERVICOTOR\\u00c1CICA. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A REDUCIR LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N EN LOS TENDONES Y BOLSAS SINOVIALES, ALIVIANDO LA TENSI\\u00d3N CR\\u00d3NICA DEL CUELLO Y RESTAURANDO LA MOVILIDAD EN LOS BRAZOS Y LAS MANOS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF JOINT PAIN IS ACCOMPANIED BY SYSTEMIC FEVER OR SKIN RASHES, SCAN THE SCAR \\/ SCAR (REF 902) RESONANCE FOR BARTONELLA. FOR CASES INVOLVING DEEP NERVOUS SYSTEM STRESS TIED TO PHYSICAL PAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CEREBELLUM \\/ MEDULLA (REF 908) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE ELIMINATION OF INFLAMMATORY BYPRODUCTS DURING TISSUE RECOVERY.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI EL DOLOR ARTICULAR SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE FIEBRE SIST\\u00c9MICA O ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [CICATRIZ \\/ CICATRIZ] (REF 902) PARA BARTONELLA. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN ESTR\\u00c9S PROFUNDO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO VINCULADO AL DOLOR F\\u00cdSICO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [CEREBELO \\/ M\\u00c9DULA] (REF 908). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE SUBPRODUCTOS INFLAMATORIOS DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL TEJIDO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1281','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:05:52','2026-04-29 04:05:52'),(4677,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1282,'{\"symptoms\":\"PARASYMPATHIC DISORDER, IRRITABLE BOWEL, EXCESSIVE SWEATING, FATIGUE, AND DEPRESSION.\",\"paths\":\"STRESS, TOXINS, OVER WORKED, LACK OF SLEEP.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"symptoms\":\"PARASYMPATHETIC DISORDER, IRRITABLE BOWEL, EXCESSIVE SWEATING, FATIGUE, AND DEPRESSION.\\n\\n(TRASTORNO PARASIMP\\u00c1TICO, COLON IRRITABLE, SUDORACI\\u00d3N EXCESIVA, FATIGA Y DEPRESI\\u00d3N.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS DYSFUNCTIONAL RESONANCE ADDRESSES IMBALANCES IN THE AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CERVICAL SPINE AND THE SACRUM. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS ESSENTIAL FOR REGULATING THE PARASYMPATHETIC RESPONSE, WHICH GOVERNS THE \\\"REST AND DIGEST\\\" FUNCTIONS OF THE BODY. DISTORTIONS HERE ARE OFTEN TRIGGERED BY CHRONIC STRESS, ACCUMULATED TOXINS, OVERWORK, AND A LACK OF SLEEP. PHYSICALLY, THIS MANIFESTS AS DIGESTIVE IRREGULARITIES (IRRITABLE BOWEL) AND ABNORMAL SWEATING, WHILE EMOTIONALLY IT CAN LEAD TO PERSISTENT FATIGUE AND DEPRESSIVE STATES. BY STABILIZING THIS LONG-AXIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE BODY IN CALMING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM, RESTORING EMOTIONAL BALANCE, AND IMPROVING SYSTEMIC RECOVERY.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA DISFUNCIONAL ABORDA LOS DESEQUILIBRIOS EN EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO AUT\\u00d3NOMO MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE LA COLUMNA CERVICAL Y EL SACRO. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES ESENCIAL PARA REGULAR LA RESPUESTA PARASIMP\\u00c1TICA, QUE GOBIERNA LAS FUNCIONES DE \\\"DESCANSO Y DIGESTI\\u00d3N\\\" DEL CUERPO. LAS DISTORSIONES AQU\\u00cd A MENUDO SON DESENCADENADAS POR EL ESTR\\u00c9S CR\\u00d3NICO, LAS TOXINAS ACUMULADAS, EL EXCESO DE TRABAJO Y LA FALTA DE SUE\\u00d1O. F\\u00cdSICAMENTE, ESTO SE MANIFIESTA COMO IRREGULARIDADES DIGESTIVAS (COLON IRRITABLE) Y SUDORACI\\u00d3N ANORMAL, MIENTRAS QUE EMOCIONALMENTE PUEDE CONDUCIR A FATIGA PERSISTENTE Y ESTADOS DEPRESIVOS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO DE EJE LARGO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL CUERPO A CALMAR EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, RESTAURAR EL EQUILIBRIO EMOCIONAL Y MEJORAR LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF MUSCULOSKELETAL TENSION IS LOCALIZED IN THE UPPER BACK OR ELBOWS, SCAN THE CERVICAL 7 \\/ THORACIC 1 (REF 910) RESONANCE. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE DIGESTIVE DISTRESS OR PARASITIC SYMPTOMS, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CECUM \\/ SIGMOID (REF 900) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE ADRENAL GLANDS DURING THE RECOVERY FROM NERVOUS SYSTEM EXHAUSTION.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA TENSI\\u00d3N MUSCULOESQUEL\\u00c9TICA SE LOCALIZA EN LA PARTE SUPERIOR DE LA ESPALDA O LOS CODOS, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [CERVICAL 7 \\/ TOR\\u00c1CICA 1] (REF 910). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN MALESTAR DIGESTIVO SEVERO O S\\u00cdNTOMAS PARASITARIOS, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [CIEGO \\/ SIGMOIDES] (REF 900). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER A LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES DURANTE LA RECUPERACI\\u00d3N DEL AGOTAMIENTO DEL SISTEMA NERVIOSO.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1282','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:07:06','2026-04-29 04:07:06'),(4678,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1283,'{\"name\":\"CARDIAC\\/ADRENAL\",\"origins\":\"STREPTOCOCCUS B\",\"symptoms\":\"RHEUMATIC FEVER, UTI\",\"paths\":null,\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"CARDIAC (CARDIA) \\/ ADRENAL (SUPRARRENAL)\",\"origins\":\"STREPTOCOCCUS B (ESTREPTOCOCO B)\",\"symptoms\":\"RHEUMATIC FEVER, URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS (UTI), JOINT PAIN, AND POTENTIAL CARDIAC VALVE INFLAMMATION.\\n\\n(FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, INFECCI\\u00d3N DE V\\u00cdAS URINARIAS, DOLOR ARTICULAR Y POTENCIAL INFLAMACI\\u00d3N DE LAS V\\u00c1LVULAS CARD\\u00cdACAS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS STREPTOCOCCUS B BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CARDIAC SPHINCTER (CARDIA) AND THE ADRENAL GLANDS. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS SIGNIFICANT FOR ADDRESSING SYSTEMIC BACTERIAL INFECTIONS THAT OFTEN ORIGINATE IN THE DIGESTIVE OR REPRODUCTIVE TRACTS BUT CAN MIGRATE TO THE HEART OR JOINTS. AN IMBALANCE HERE IS STRONGLY ASSOCIATED WITH RHEUMATIC FEVER, WHERE THE IMMUNE RESPONSE TO THE BACTERIA ACCIDENTALLY ATTACKS THE BODY\'S OWN TISSUES, PARTICULARLY THE HEART VALVES AND LARGE JOINTS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PROTECTING THE ENDOCARDIUM, AND REDUCING SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATORY REACTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE AL ESTREPTOCOCO B MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL ESF\\u00cdNTER CARDIA Y LAS GL\\u00c1NDULAS SUPRARRENALES. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES SIGNIFICATIVO PARA ABORDAR INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS QUE A MENUDO SE ORIGINAN EN LOS TRACTOS DIGESTIVO O REPRODUCTIVO, PERO QUE PUEDEN MIGRAR HACIA EL CORAZ\\u00d3N O LAS ARTICULACIONES. UN DESEQUILIBRIO AQU\\u00cd EST\\u00c1 FUERTEMENTE ASOCIADO CON LA FIEBRE REUM\\u00c1TICA, DONDE LA RESPUESTA INMUNITARIA A LA BACTERIA ATACA ACCIDENTALMENTE LOS PROPIOS TEJIDOS DEL CUERPO, PARTICULARMENTE LAS V\\u00c1LVULAS CARD\\u00cdACAS Y LAS GRANDES ARTICULACIONES. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PROTEGIENDO EL ENDOCARDIO Y REDUCIENDO LAS REACCIONES INFLAMATORIAS SIST\\u00c9MICAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF URINARY SYMPTOMS ARE PERSISTENT WITH LOWER BACK PAIN, SCAN THE ADRENAL \\/ KIDNEY (REF 905) UNIVERSAL RESERVOIR. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE JOINT INFLAMMATION OR REPETITIVE STRAIN, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL 7 \\/ THORACIC 1 (REF 910) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO FACILITATE THE DEPURATIVE PROCESS DURING BACTERIAL CLEARANCE.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS URINARIOS SON PERSISTENTES CON DOLOR DE ESPALDA BAJA, ESCANEE EL RESERVORIO UNIVERSAL [SUPRARRENAL \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 905). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN INFLAMACI\\u00d3N ARTICULAR SEVERA O ESFUERZO REPETITIVO, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [CERVICAL 7 \\/ TOR\\u00c1CICA 1] (REF 910). SIEMPRE MONITOREE LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y FACILITAR EL PROCESO DEPURATIVO DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N BACTERIANA.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1283','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:08:42','2026-04-29 04:08:42'),(4679,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1284,'{\"name\":\"CHEEKBONE\\/KIDNEY\",\"radical\":\"PARASITE\",\"symptoms\":\"FATIGUE, FEVER, ARTICULAR PAIN, FAKE LUPUS.\",\"paths\":\"TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITOS.\\nMAIN CAUSE OF MALARIA, AND FIBROMYALGIA.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"CHEEKBONE (P\\u00d3MULO) \\/ KIDNEY (RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N)\",\"radical\":\"PARASITE (PAR\\u00c1SITO)\",\"symptoms\":\"FATIGUE, FEVER, ARTICULAR PAIN, AND \\\"FAKE\\\" LUPUS.\\n\\n(FATIGA, FIEBRE, DOLOR ARTICULAR Y \\\"FALSO\\\" LUPUS.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS PARASITIC RESONANCE TARGETS PLASMODIUM VIVAX BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CHEEKBONE AND THE KIDNEY. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS PATHOGEN\\u2014TRANSMITTED BY MOSQUITOES\\u2014IS IDENTIFIED AS A PRIMARY CAUSE OF MALARIA AND IS FREQUENTLY LINKED TO FIBROMYALGIA. AN IMBALANCE IN THIS CIRCUIT OFTEN PRODUCES SYMPTOMS THAT MIMIC SYSTEMIC LUPUS ERYTHEMATOSUS (LUPUS), SUCH AS JOINT PAIN AND FACIAL RASHES, WHICH IS WHY IT IS REFERRED TO AS \\\"FAKE LUPUS.\\\" BY STABILIZING THIS AXIS, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE PARASITIC LOAD, ALLEVIATING CHRONIC MUSCLE PAIN, AND REDUCING THE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATION THAT CAUSES PERSISTENT FATIGUE.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA PARASITARIA SE DIRIGE AL PLASMODIUM VIVAX MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL P\\u00d3MULO Y EL RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE PAT\\u00d3GENO \\u2014TRANSMITIDO POR MOSQUITOS\\u2014 SE IDENTIFICA COMO UNA CAUSA PRIMARIA DE MALARIA Y EST\\u00c1 VINCULADO FRECUENTEMENTE CON LA FIBROMIALGIA. UN DESEQUILIBRIO EN ESTE CIRCUITO A MENUDO PRODUCE S\\u00cdNTOMAS QUE IMITAN EL LUPUS ERITEMATOSO SIST\\u00c9MICO, COMO DOLOR ARTICULAR Y ERUPCIONES FACIALES, POR LO QUE SE LE DENOMINA \\\"FALSO LUPUS\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE EJE, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA PARASITARIA, ALIVIANDO EL DOLOR MUSCULAR CR\\u00d3NICO Y REDUCIENDO LA INFLAMACI\\u00d3N SIST\\u00c9MICA QUE CAUSA FATIGA PERSISTENTE.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC LUPUS SYMPTOMS ARE ACCOMPANIED BY THE CLASSIC BUTTERFLY RASH AND ACUTE URINARY DISTRESS, SCAN THE RENAL CAPSULE \\/ RENAL CAPSULE (REF 889) AXIS FOR \\\"TRUE\\\" LUPUS (PROTEUS MIRABILIS). FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE JOINT PAIN WITHOUT FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CERVICAL 7 \\/ THORACIC 1 (REF 910) RESONANCE. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT RENAL FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF PARASITIC TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LOS S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE LUPUS SIST\\u00c9MICO SE ACOMPA\\u00d1AN DE LA CL\\u00c1SICA ERUPCI\\u00d3N EN MARIPOSA Y MALESTAR URINARIO AGUDO, ESCANEE EL EJE [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL] (REF 889) PARA EL LUPUS \\\"VERDADERO\\\" (PROTEUS MIRABILIS). PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO SIN FIEBRE, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON LA RESONANCIA [CERVICAL 7 \\/ TOR\\u00c1CICA 1] (REF 910). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS PARASITARIAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1284','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:10:02','2026-04-29 04:10:02'),(4680,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1285,'{\"name\":\"CLITORIS\\/PUBIC BONE\",\"origins\":\"SPIROCHAETE\",\"symptoms\":\"MIGRAINES, FACIAL PARALYSIS, BACK PAIN, PELVIC DISORDERS, SEXUAL DISORDERS, RECTAL DISORDERS AND BLEEDING.\",\"paths\":\"FIBROMYALGIA, CHRONIC FATIGUE. MAYBE SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED AND UTERINE TO FETUS.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"CLITORIS \\/ PUBIC BONE (CL\\u00cdTORIS \\/ PUBIS)\",\"origins\":\"SPIROCHAETE (ESPIROQUETA)\",\"symptoms\":\"MIGRAINES, FACIAL PARALYSIS, BACK PAIN, PELVIC DISORDERS, SEXUAL DISORDERS, RECTAL DISORDERS, AND RECTAL BLEEDING.\\n\\n(MIGRA\\u00d1AS, PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL, DOLOR DE ESPALDA, TRASTORNOS P\\u00c9LVICOS, TRASTORNOS SEXUALES, TRASTORNOS RECTALES Y SANGRADO RECTAL.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS SPIROCHAETES BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS BETWEEN THE CLITORIS AND THE PUBIC BONE. IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS HIGHLY RELEVANT FOR ADDRESSING CHRONIC CONDITIONS SUCH AS FIBROMYALGIA AND CHRONIC FATIGUE SYNDROME. SPIROCHAETES ARE AGGRESSIVE BACTERIA THAT CAN BE SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED OR PASSED FROM MOTHER TO FETUS (UTERINE TRANSMISSION), OFTEN LEADING TO COMPLEX SYSTEMIC DYSFUNCTIONS. BY STABILIZING THIS CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, RELIEVING PELVIC CONGESTION, AND MITIGATING NEUROLOGICAL SYMPTOMS LIKE FACIAL PARALYSIS AND SEVERE HEADACHES.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LAS ESPIROQUETAS MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH ENTRE EL CL\\u00cdTORIS Y EL PUBIS. EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES MUY RELEVANTE PARA ABORDAR CONDICIONES CR\\u00d3NICAS COMO LA FIBROMIALGIA Y EL S\\u00cdNDROME DE FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA. LAS ESPIROQUETAS SON BACTERIAS AGRESIVAS QUE PUEDEN TRANSMITIRSE SEXUALMENTE O DE MADRE A FETO (TRANSMISI\\u00d3N UTERINA), LO QUE A MENUDO CONDUCE A DYSFUNCIONES SIST\\u00c9MICAS COMPLEJAS. AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, ALIVIANDO LA CONGESTI\\u00d3N P\\u00c9LVICA Y MITIGANDO S\\u00cdNTOMAS NEUROL\\u00d3GICOS COMO LA PAR\\u00c1LISIS FACIAL Y LAS MIGRA\\u00d1AS SEVERAS.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF SYSTEMIC FATIGUE IS ACCOMPANIED BY MUSCLE PAIN AND \\\"FAKE LUPUS\\\" SYMPTOMS, SCAN THE CHEEKBONE \\/ KIDNEY (REF 913) RESONANCE FOR PLASMODIUM VIVAX. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEXUAL DYSFUNCTION OR REPRODUCTIVE ISSUES TIED TO TOXICITY, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE RENAL CAPSULE \\/ BLADDER (REF 886) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] RESONANCE TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT RENAL FILTRATION DURING THE CLEARANCE OF BACTERIAL TOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI LA FATIGA SIST\\u00c9MICA SE ACOMPA\\u00d1A DE DOLOR MUSCULAR Y S\\u00cdNTOMAS DE \\\"FALSO LUPUS\\\", ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [P\\u00d3MULO \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] (REF 913) PARA PLASMODIUM VIVAX. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DISFUNCI\\u00d3N SEXUAL O PROBLEMAS REPRODUCTIVOS VINCULADOS A LA TOXICIDAD, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [C\\u00c1PSULA RENAL \\/ VEJIGA] (REF 886). SIEMPRE MONITOREE LA RESONANCIA [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LA FILTRACI\\u00d3N RENAL DURANTE LA DEPURACI\\u00d3N DE TOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1285','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:11:34','2026-04-29 04:11:34'),(4681,'App\\Models\\User',1,'updated','App\\Models\\Pair',1286,'{\"name\":\"COSTOHEPATIC\\/COSTOHEPATIC\",\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, TISSUE NECROSIS, BULLS EYE RASH, FEVER.\",\"paths\":\"INSECTS (TICKS) CARRY  FROM ANIMALS TO HUMANS. ALSO KNOWN FOR LYME\'S DISEASE.\",\"alternative_routes\":null}','{\"name\":\"COSTOHEPATIC (COSTOHEP\\u00c1TICO) \\/ COSTOHEPATIC (COSTOHEP\\u00c1TICO)\",\"symptoms\":\"DIARRHEA, TISSUE NECROSIS, BULL\'S EYE RASH (ERYTHEMA MIGRANS), AND FEVER.\\n\\n(DIARREA, NECROSIS TISULAR, ERUPCI\\u00d3N EN FORMA DE DIANA (ERITEMA MIGRANTE) Y FIEBRE.)\",\"paths\":\"THIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS BORRELIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE COSTOHEPATIC REGION (THE AREA WHERE THE RIBS MEET THE LIVER). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS THE PRIMARY POINT FOR ADDRESSING LYME DISEASE, A COMPLEX MULTI-SYSTEMIC CONDITION TRANSMITTED BY TICKS FROM ANIMALS TO HUMANS. THE PATHOGEN IMPACTS THE LIVER\'S FILTRATION CAPACITY AND CAN SPREAD TO THE SKIN, JOINTS, AND NERVOUS SYSTEM, OFTEN CHARACTERIZED BY THE ICONIC \\\"BULL\'S EYE\\\" RASH. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PREVENTING TISSUE NECROSIS, AND MITIGATING THE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE TYPICAL OF LYME INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA BORRELIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N COSTOHEP\\u00c1TICA (EL \\u00c1REA DONDE LAS COSTILLAS SE ENCUENTRAN CON EL H\\u00cdGADO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES EL PUNTO PRIMARIO PARA ABORDAR LA ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, UNA CONDICI\\u00d3N MULTISIST\\u00c9MICA COMPLEJA TRANSMITIDA POR GARRAPATAS DE ANIMALES A HUMANOS. EL PAT\\u00d3GENO IMPACTA LA CAPACIDAD DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y PUEDE PROPAGARSE A LA PIEL, LAS ARTICULACIONES Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, CARACTERIZ\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO POR LA IC\\u00d3NICA ERUPCI\\u00d3N EN \\\"DIANA\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PREVINIENDO LA NECROSIS TISULAR Y MITIGANDO LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA SIST\\u00c9MICA T\\u00cdPICA DE LAS INFECCIONES POR LYME.)\\n\\nTHIS BACTERIAL RESONANCE TARGETS BORRELIA BY NEUTRALIZING PH DISTORTIONS WITHIN THE COSTOHEPATIC REGION (THE AREA WHERE THE RIBS MEET THE LIVER). IN BIOMAGNETISM, THIS AXIS IS THE PRIMARY POINT FOR ADDRESSING LYME DISEASE, A COMPLEX MULTI-SYSTEMIC CONDITION TRANSMITTED BY TICKS FROM ANIMALS TO HUMANS. THE PATHOGEN IMPACTS THE LIVER\'S FILTRATION CAPACITY AND CAN SPREAD TO THE SKIN, JOINTS, AND NERVOUS SYSTEM, OFTEN CHARACTERIZED BY THE ICONIC \\\"BULL\'S EYE\\\" RASH. BY STABILIZING THIS BILATERAL CIRCUIT, THE RESET ASSISTS THE IMMUNE SYSTEM IN NEUTRALIZING THE BACTERIAL LOAD, PREVENTING TISSUE NECROSIS, AND MITIGATING THE SYSTEMIC INFLAMMATORY RESPONSE TYPICAL OF LYME INFECTIONS.\\n\\n(ESTA RESONANCIA BACTERIANA SE DIRIGE A LA BORRELIA MEDIANTE LA NEUTRALIZACI\\u00d3N DE LAS DISTORSIONES DE PH DENTRO DE LA REGI\\u00d3N COSTOHEP\\u00c1TICA (EL \\u00c1REA DONDE LAS COSTILLAS SE ENCUENTRAN CON EL H\\u00cdGADO). EN BIOMAGNETISMO, ESTE EJE ES EL PUNTO PRIMARIO PARA ABORDAR LA ENFERMEDAD DE LYME, UNA CONDICI\\u00d3N MULTISIST\\u00c9MICA COMPLEJA TRANSMITIDA POR GARRAPATAS DE ANIMALES A HUMANOS. EL PAT\\u00d3GENO IMPACTA LA CAPACIDAD DE FILTRACI\\u00d3N DEL H\\u00cdGADO Y PUEDE PROPAGARSE A LA PIEL, LAS ARTICULACIONES Y EL SISTEMA NERVIOSO, CARACTERIZ\\u00c1NDOSE A MENUDO POR LA IC\\u00d3NICA ERUPCI\\u00d3N EN \\\"DIANA\\\". AL ESTABILIZAR ESTE CIRCUITO BILATERAL, EL REINICIO AYUDA AL SISTEMA INMUNITARIO A NEUTRALIZAR LA CARGA BACTERIANA, PREVINIENDO LA NECROSIS TISULAR Y MITIGANDO LA RESPUESTA INFLAMATORIA SIST\\u00c9MICA T\\u00cdPICA DE LAS INFECCIONES POR LYME.)\",\"alternative_routes\":\"PATHOGEN CHECK: IF CHRONIC FATIGUE OR PERSISTENT SKIN RASHES ARE PRESENT, SCAN THE SCAR \\/ SCAR (REF 902) RESONANCE FOR BARTONELLA, A COMMON LYME CO-INFECTION. FOR CASES INVOLVING SEVERE JOINT PAIN OR FEVER, CROSS-REFERENCE WITH THE CARDIAC \\/ ADRENAL (REF 912) AXIS. ALWAYS MONITOR THE [KIDNEY \\/ KIDNEY] AXIS TO ENSURE SYSTEMIC PH STABILITY AND TO PROTECT THE BODY\'S DEPURATIVE PATHWAYS DURING THE CLEARANCE OF BACTERIAL ENDOTOXINS.\\n\\n(VERIFICACI\\u00d3N DE PAT\\u00d3GENOS: SI HAY FATIGA CR\\u00d3NICA O ERUPCIONES CUT\\u00c1NEAS PERSISTENTES, ESCANEE LA RESONANCIA [CICATRIZ \\/ CICATRIZ] (REF 902) PARA BARTONELLA, UNA COINFECCI\\u00d3N COM\\u00daN DE LYME. PARA CASOS QUE INVOLUCREN DOLOR ARTICULAR SEVERO O FIEBRE, REALICE UNA REFERENCIA CRUZADA CON EL EJE [CARDIA \\/ SUPRARRENAL] (REF 912). SIEMPRE MONITOREE EL EJE [RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N \\/ RI\\u00d1\\u00d3N] PARA ASEGURAR LA ESTABILIDAD DEL PH SIST\\u00c9MICO Y PROTEGER LAS V\\u00cdAS DEPURATIVAS DEL CUERPO DURANTE LA ELIMINACI\\u00d3N DE ENDOTOXINAS BACTERIANAS.)\"}','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/pairs/1286','143.105.21.178','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 04:13:08','2026-04-29 04:13:08'),(4682,'App\\Models\\User',1,'deleted','App\\Models\\User\\Friend',21,'{\"id\":21,\"user_id\":6,\"friend_id\":27,\"accepted\":0}','[]','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/users/6','135.129.119.21','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 22:56:30','2026-04-29 22:56:30'),(4683,'App\\Models\\User',1,'deleted','App\\Models\\User\\Friend',22,'{\"id\":22,\"user_id\":6,\"friend_id\":22,\"accepted\":0}','[]','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/users/6','135.129.119.21','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 22:56:30','2026-04-29 22:56:30'),(4684,'App\\Models\\User',1,'deleted','App\\Models\\User\\Friend',23,'{\"id\":23,\"user_id\":6,\"friend_id\":43,\"accepted\":0}','[]','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/users/6','135.129.119.21','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 22:56:30','2026-04-29 22:56:30'),(4685,'App\\Models\\User',1,'deleted','App\\Models\\User\\Friend',38,'{\"id\":38,\"user_id\":73,\"friend_id\":6,\"accepted\":0}','[]','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/users/6','135.129.119.21','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-29 22:56:30','2026-04-29 22:56:30'),(4686,'App\\Models\\User',1,'deleted','App\\Models\\User\\Friend',2,'{\"id\":2,\"user_id\":1,\"friend_id\":6,\"accepted\":1}','[]','https://api.biomagnetism.app/v1/users/6','135.129.119.21','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NU